// Generated by scripts/build_data.py on 2026-10-04. Do not edit by hand.
// Source: Taiwan Security Monitor PRC official-statement corpora (TSM local):
//   TSM_MFA_Repository / TSM_MND_Repository / TSM_TAO_Repository (2026-07 build) and
//   june_july_2026_intake (MFA, MND three channels, TAO), and TSM's Jul-Sep 2026 intake
//   (scripts/intake/, fetched from the official sites), filtered to Taiwan-related Q&A.
//   Duplicates removed: TAO wyly releases restating a same-day transcript answer, and MND
