export const STREAMS = ["MFA archive (TSM translation)", "MFA intake (official English)", "MFA press-conference Q&A", "MND archive (one channel)", "MND intake (three channels)", "TAO April 2026 (TSM translation)", "TAO intake (Chinese + Claude machine translation)", "TAO intake (Chinese + machine translation)"];
export const STATEMENTS = [[0,"2022-07-04","Zhao Lijian","ATV reporter","According to reports, on the 1st, a representative of Palau said at the closing ceremony of the United Nations Ocean Conference that representatives from the Palau delegation holding \"Taiwanese passports\" were refused to participate in the conference, which was a violation of Palau's sovereignty. The United Nations should not exclude the 23 million people of Taiwan. The representative of the United States said…","This is the third time I have responded to this question. The Taiwan authorities have repeatedly violated the law. Isn't it a very honorable thing to \"take part in a meeting\"?\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. According to the one-China principle, Taiwan has no right to participate alone in the activities of the United Nations and its specialized agencies and intergovernmental international organizations that are limited to sovereign states. The above-mentioned principles and consensus will not change just because a certain country speaks for or supports the Taiwan authorities. It is inevitable that the Taiwan authorities will fail. This kind of self-degradation and self-humiliation has also been ridiculed by the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347316.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-06","Zhao Lijian","Phoenix TV reporter","The spokesperson just mentioned that the foreign ministers of China and the United States will meet. Will the Taiwan issue and Xinjiang-related issues be discussed at this meeting?","The Taiwan issue concerns China's core interests and has always been the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. The one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques are the political foundation of Sino-US relations. Successive US governments have made clear commitments to this. President Biden's \"four no's, one unintentional\" statement also includes not supporting \"Taiwan independence.\" The United States should abide by the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, stop reversing history, stop hollowing out the one-China principle, stop condoning support for \"Taiwan independence,\" and take concrete actions to safeguard the political foundation of Sino-U.S. relations.\nXinjiang-related issues are a major concern for China. The so-called existence of \"forced labor\" in Xinjiang is completely a lie concocted by the US to discredit and contain China. The U.S.'s implementation of the \"Uyghur Forced Labor Prevention Act\" is a continuation of the above lies and an escalation of \"using Xinjiang to contain China.\" The international community sees this clearly: It is not China that is engaging in \"forced labor,\" but the United States that is engaging in \"forced unemployment,\" forcibly depriving hundreds of thousands of workers in various industries in Xinjiang of their most basic work rights; it is not China that is \"oppressing human rights,\" but the United States that is \"forcing people back into poverty.\" \", destroying the livelihoods of people of all ethnic groups in Xinjiang who have finally escaped poverty, and even Xinjiang's poverty alleviation projects are not spared; it is not China that is violating international rules, but the United States' \"forced decoupling and chain breaking\", wantonly destroying international economic and trade rules, and damaging the stability of international industrial and supply chains.\nWe urge the US to stop concocting lies about \"forced labor\", stop implementing the \"Uyghur Forced Labor Prevention Act\", and take concrete actions to create favorable conditions for cooperation between the two countries in all fields instead of creating new obstacles.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-08","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","The Chinese People's Liberation Army recently held a drill near Taiwan. The Taiwan authorities stated that the People's Liberation Army military aircraft flew across Taiwan's \"central line of the Strait\" and called the move \"provocative.\" What is your comment on this?","China's position on the so-called \"central line of the strait\" is clear and consistent. The Taiwan authorities will not succeed in using this for political manipulation.\nRecently, the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army organized a multi-service joint combat readiness patrol and actual combat drill in the sea and airspace surrounding Taiwan Island. The spokesman for the Eastern Theater Command has released relevant news. The People's Liberation Army conducted this exercise to target external interference and \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their activities. We will resolutely safeguard national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity, and resolutely crush any \"Taiwan independence\" plot.\n****************************************************","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-12","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","On the 11th, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi delivered a speech at the ASEAN Secretariat, advocating upholding peace, development, independence, and inclusiveness, and resolutely practicing open regionalism. Can the spokesperson further introduce the relevant situation?","Yesterday, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi visited the ASEAN Secretariat and delivered a speech, putting forward a series of proposals and suggestions on further deepening China-ASEAN relations and promoting regional peace and prosperity, which triggered a warm response from ASEAN Secretariat officials and participating guests.\nIn his speech, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi systematically reviewed the extraordinary journey of China-ASEAN dialogue relations over the past 30 years. Especially in the past ten years, under the strategic guidance and personal promotion of President Xi Jinping and leaders of ASEAN countries, China-ASEAN relations have always taken the lead. The two sides have worked together to fight the epidemic and overcome difficulties, economic and trade cooperation has flourished, and security cooperation has made steady progress. , the most exciting and gratifying cooperation results and highlights, pointing out that this year is the first year of building the China-ASEAN comprehensive strategic partnership. China will continue to support ASEAN’s central position, continue to promote the Asian way to resolve differences and conflicts, continue to firmly pursue an open development strategy, continue to firmly promote scientific and technological innovation cooperation, continue to promote Asian values, and jointly write a new chapter of regional cooperation and Asian rejuvenation.\nState Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that currently, two completely different trends are emerging regarding the future of Asia. One is to adhere to open regionalism, safeguard true multilateralism, adhere to development priority, commit to mutually beneficial cooperation, and promote regional countries to overcome the epidemic as soon as possible and achieve comprehensive development. The other is to return to the old Cold War mentality, engage in closed group politics, classify regional countries according to values, transform regional economies into blocs, and even transform Asia-Pacific security into NATO. China's choice is to work with other countries in the region, including ASEAN, to uphold the concepts of peace, development, independence, and inclusiveness, unswervingly practice open regionalism, and at the same time draw experience and wisdom from Asian civilizations and practices to continuously inject new era connotations into open regionalism. We must always adhere to the concept of peaceful coexistence, the goal of development and revitalization, the principle of independence, and the spirit of openness and inclusiveness, and work together to build a common home of peace, tranquility, prosperity, beauty, and friendship.\nAfter the speech, State Councilor Wang Yi also answered reporters' questions, emphasizing that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is part of China's territory. Although the two sides of the Taiwan Strait have long been in political opposition, China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. This is the real status quo of the Taiwan Strait issue. The key to stability in the Taiwan Strait is the one-China principle. The one-China principle formed an integral part of the post-World War II international order. The clearer the attitude towards safeguarding the one-China principle and the more effective the measures to contain separatist forces, the more likely it will be for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and the more guaranteed regional peace and prosperity will be.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-12","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Taiwan's \"Vice President\" Lai Ching-te went to Japan to attend the funeral of former Prime Minister Shinzo Abe. This is the highest-level Taiwanese official to visit Japan in decades. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","First of all, I want to correct you. Taiwan is part of China, and there is no so-called \"vice president.\" After the sudden and unfortunate death of former Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe, the Taiwan authorities took the opportunity to engage in political manipulation and make political fuss. Their political intentions are unlikely to succeed. China has lodged stern representations with Japan in Beijing and Tokyo, clearly stating our position.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-12","Wang Wenbin","AFP","Japan's Foreign Minister said that Lai Ching-te participated in relevant activities in a private capacity and Japan's basic policy towards Taiwan has not changed. What is China’s comment on this?","I have just stated China’s position.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-18","Wang Wenbin","After the meeting, a reporter asked","According to reports, on July 15, the US Defense Security Cooperation Agency issued a statement stating that the US State Department had approved the sale of military technical assistance totaling US$108 million to the Taipei Cultural Affairs Office in the United States. What is China’s comment on this?","The United States' sales of arms to China's Taiwan region seriously violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17\" communiqué. It seriously damages China's sovereignty and security interests, seriously damages Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China firmly opposes and strongly condemns this, and has lodged stern representations with the United States in this regard.\nChina urges the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, cancel the above-mentioned arms sales plan to Taiwan, stop arms sales to Taiwan and U.S.-Taiwan military ties, and stop creating tension in the Taiwan Strait. China will continue to take resolute and powerful measures to firmly defend its sovereignty and security interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347326.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-19","Zhao Lijian","Reuters","According to the Financial Times, Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi plans to visit Taiwan next month. What is China’s comment on this?","China has stated its solemn position on this many times. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan. The U.S. Congress is an integral part of the U.S. government and should strictly abide by the one-China policy pursued by the United States. If Speaker Pelosi visits Taiwan, it will seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, seriously damage China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, severely impact the political foundation of China-US relations, and send a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes this.\nChina requires the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, not arrange for Speaker Pelosi to visit Taiwan, stop official exchanges between the U.S. and Taiwan, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and take practical actions to fulfill the U.S. commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence.\" If the United States insists on going its own way, China will take resolute and powerful measures to resolutely defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The United States must be solely responsible for all consequences resulting therefrom.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347327.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-19","Zhao Lijian","Xinhua News Agency","According to reports, US State Department spokesperson Price said in response to inquiries that according to the Taiwan Relations Act, the United States is obliged to provide Taiwan with necessary defense supplies and services to enable Taiwan to maintain sufficient self-defense capabilities. This is fully in line with the US one-China policy. What is China’s comment on this?","Yesterday we stated our solemn position on the U.S.’s new round of arms sales to Taiwan. I would like to reiterate that China firmly opposes and strongly condemns this. We have made solemn representations to the US.\nThe so-called \"Taiwan Relations Act\" is a domestic law unilaterally concocted by the United States. It seriously violates universally recognized international law and basic norms of international relations. It runs counter to the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués. China has never recognized it and has always opposed it. The United States is simply not qualified to use such a domestic law to interfere in China's internal affairs and sell weapons to Taiwan.\nWhether it is the one-China principle or the one-China policy, the core is one China. Recognizing that Taiwan is part of China is a solemn commitment made by the United States in the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques. The United States insists on selling weapons to Taiwan, which seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, fuels the arrogance of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and raises tensions across the Taiwan Strait. The United States should immediately stop arms sales to Taiwan and military ties with Taiwan, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and implement the US government's statement that it does not support \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347327.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-19","Zhao Lijian","NHK reporter","The former US Secretary of Defense visited Taiwan and met with Tsai Ing-wen. He said that the one-China policy is useless and called on the Biden administration to re-examine the \"strategic ambiguity\" on Taiwan Strait security issues. What is China’s comment on this?","The one-China principle is the political foundation of China-US relations and is also the general consensus of the international community. China firmly opposes any attempt by anyone or any force to play the \"Taiwan card\", interfere in China's internal affairs, and harm China's core interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347327.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-19","Zhao Lijian","AFP","Vice President of the European Parliament Bell is visiting Taiwan this week. Bell said today that Europe must stand firmly with Taiwan and cannot turn a blind eye to the threat posed by mainland China to Taiwan. What is China’s response to this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and the political foundation of China-EU relations. As an official institution of the EU, the European Parliament and its senior officials should abide by the one-China principle.\nIn the past two years, the European Parliament has issued multiple Taiwan-related resolutions to support \"Taiwan independence\" forces. This seriously violates the one-China principle and poisons the atmosphere of China-EU relations. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the EU and Taiwan, and urges the EU to abide by the one-China principle and be cautious in its words and deeds on Taiwan-related issues to avoid serious interference in China-EU relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347327.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-20","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Kyodo News","According to reports, the Vice President of the European Parliament said when meeting with leaders of the Taiwan region in Taipei that the EU asked China to stop its \"threats\" to Taiwan and expressed its support for Taiwan. What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and the political foundation of China-EU relations. As an official institution of the EU, the European Parliament and its senior officials should abide by the one-China principle.\nIn the past two years, the European Parliament has issued multiple Taiwan-related resolutions to support \"Taiwan independence\" forces. This seriously violates the one-China principle and poisons the atmosphere of China-EU relations. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the EU and Taiwan. We urge the EU to abide by the one-China principle and be cautious in its words and deeds on Taiwan-related issues to avoid serious interference in China-EU relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347328.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-21","Wang Wenbin","ATV reporter","Regarding Pelosi's possible visit to Taiwan, the US White House press secretary said in response to a question that the visit has not yet been finalized. What is China’s comment on this?","China has repeatedly stated its solemn position of firmly opposing House Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan. The U.S. Congress is an integral part of the U.S. government and should strictly abide by the U.S. commitments on the Taiwan issue. If Speaker Pelosi visits Taiwan, it will seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, seriously damage China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, severely impact the political foundation of Sino-US relations, and send a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. If the United States insists on going its own way, China will take effective measures to resolutely respond and counterattack. We do what we say.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347329.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-21","Wang Wenbin","AFP","US CIA Director William Burns said at a security forum yesterday that Sri Lanka's decision to accept investment from China, which has a heavy debt burden, is one of the factors causing Sri Lanka's economic problems. Burns also said that Russia's experience in Ukraine has made China reconsider the timing and method of resolving the Taiwan issue. What is China’s response to this?","China and Sri Lanka are traditional friendly neighbors. They have always respected, trusted and supported each other. They have established a strategic partnership of sincere mutual assistance and lasting friendship, and have carried out all-round and multi-field mutually beneficial cooperation. China will, as always, adhere to its friendly policy towards Sri Lanka, and is willing to provide support and assistance within its capacity to the efforts of the Sri Lankan government and people to stabilize the situation and revive the economy, so as to promote the continuous advancement of bilateral relations.\nAs for the groundless slander and slanderous remarks by relevant US officials you mentioned about China, I think this cannot blind the bright eyes of the Sri Lankan people and the people of the international community, nor can it stop the further deepening of China-Sri Lanka friendly cooperation.\nOn the Ukrainian issue, we advise the United States to face up to its responsibilities as the initiator of the crisis and make active efforts to promote dialogue and resolution and stop confrontation between the camps, instead of adding fuel to the fire. The Ukraine issue is fundamentally different from the Taiwan issue. We urge the United States to abide by the one-China principle and not interfere in China's internal affairs.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347329.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-22","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Japan Broadcasting Association","The Japanese government released the 2022 \"Defense White Paper\" and proposed that China has become an important security concern for the regional and international community. What is China's comment on this?","Japan's new \"Defense White Paper\" accuses China of discrediting China's defense policy, normal military development and legitimate maritime activities, exaggerating the so-called \"China threat\", and interfering in China's internal affairs on the Taiwan issue. China expresses strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this, and has lodged stern representations with Japan.\nChina adheres to the path of peaceful development and pursues a defensive national defense policy. China's national defense construction aims to safeguard its sovereignty, security and development interests, which is legitimate, reasonable and beyond reproach. China's joint patrols and other military cooperation with relevant countries are in compliance with international law and practice and are not targeted at any specific country. The Diaoyu Islands and their affiliated islands have been China’s inherent territory since ancient times. China’s maritime activities in the waters around the Diaoyu Islands are a legitimate exercise of sovereign rights. Taiwan is a sacred and indivisible part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs and does not allow for any interference from external forces.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that due to Japan's militaristic history of foreign aggression in modern times, Japan's military and security trends have always attracted great attention from its Asian neighbors, including China, and the international community. This time, Japan has publicly stated in the white paper that it will revise its defense documents before the end of the year, further increase its defense budget, and develop so-called \"counterattack capabilities.\" This raises concerns that Japan is going further and further away from pacifism and exclusive defense. We urge Japan to immediately stop the wrong practice of exaggerating peripheral security threats and looking for excuses for its military expansion, listen carefully to the voice of the international community, deeply reflect on its history of aggression, adhere to the path of peaceful development, and win the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community with practical actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347330.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-25","Zhao Lijian","Reuters","According to the Financial Times, China has stepped up its warnings to the United States regarding the possible visit of Speaker of the House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi to Taiwan. These warnings or threats are stronger than in the past. The newspaper’s sources also said that China may respond militarily. Is this report accurate? If China may respond militarily, what kind of response will it be?","China has recently expressed its serious concerns and solemn position to the United States on many occasions that it firmly opposes Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan. We are ready. If the United States insists on going its own way, China will take firm and powerful measures to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The United States will be responsible for all serious consequences caused by this.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347331.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-25","Zhao Lijian","Xinhua News Agency","According to reports, German Foreign Minister Berberk said in an interview on the 22nd that China no longer accepts \"one country, two systems\" and that Germany must take China's declaration of \"attacking Taiwan\" as seriously as the United States. Therefore, Germany and the United States jointly formulated a NATO strategy; Germany must work with partner countries to reduce its economic dependence on China. What is…","This German official’s remarks are typical of prejudice against China. I want to emphasize four points:\nFirst, China has always advocated respecting the sovereignty and territorial integrity of all countries and always adheres to the path of peaceful development. When it comes to peace and security issues, China is the major country with the best record. We have never initiated a war, never invaded an inch of other country's territory, and do not pose a threat to any country.\nSecond, the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and no external force is allowed to interfere. China adheres to the policy of \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\". No one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, firm will, and strong ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Anyone who dares to challenge the Chinese people's bottom line will surely be beaten to death.\nThird, Asia-Pacific security and stability do not need NATO to disrupt it. The 21st century is a multi-polar world, and it is no longer an era in which a few Western countries determine everything.\nFourth, economic globalization and trade liberalization are the trend of the times. China is the largest trading partner of more than 120 countries and regions in the world. This is the result of the combined effect of market rules and corporate choices. So-called \"democracy\" and \"values\" cannot violate the laws of free market economics.\nI would like to remind individual Western politicians that the old path of adhering to the Cold War mentality and being keen on confrontation between camps will not work. They will only fall into the trap they have dug themselves. Only by adhering to the norms of international relations, drawing lessons from history and reality, and correcting our understanding of China based on objective facts can we accurately grasp the main tone of mutual benefit and win-win bilateral relations and jointly safeguard world peace and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347331.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-25","Zhao Lijian","Bloomberg","You just said that China is preparing for Pelosi's possible visit to Taiwan. Can you provide more details? Will China respond militarily, diplomatically, or in other ways?","I have just made China’s position very clear. If the United States insists on going its own way, China will take effective measures to resolutely respond and counterattack.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347331.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-26","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","Today, Taiwan’s “President” Tsai Ing-wen boarded a naval warship. This is the second time she has boarded a warship in her six years in office. While inspecting annual naval and air exercises, she praised Taiwan's military for its determination to defend the island. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","First of all, I want to tell you that there is no \"president\" in Taiwan. Please pay attention to your wording when you ask questions in the future. I would also like to take this opportunity to tell the Taiwan authorities that taking the path of \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end. Taiwan's delusional attempt to confront the mainland militarily is like mantis trying to use its arm as a chariot, and will eventually fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347332.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-26","Zhao Lijian","China News Service reporter","Today is the 77th anniversary of the Potsdam Declaration. How does China evaluate the positive role of the Potsdam Declaration?","On this day 77 years ago, the Potsdam Declaration issued by China, the United States and the United Kingdom, together with the Cairo Declaration and other international legal documents issued by the three countries in 1943, jointly built an important legal cornerstone of the post-war international order and played an important and positive role in consolidating the victory of the World Anti-Fascist War and safeguarding world peace.\nThe Cairo Declaration clearly stipulates that the Chinese territories stolen by Japan, including Taiwan and the Penghu Islands, will be returned to China. This was reiterated in the Potsdam Declaration. In 1945, the surrender document signed by Japan clearly promised to accept the relevant conditions of the Potsdam Declaration.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle is the fundamental principle confirmed by the United Nations General Assembly Resolution 2758. It is the basis for the establishment of diplomatic relations between the People's Republic of China and 181 countries around the world. It is also the general consensus and recognized basic norm of international relations in the international community. However, there are now individuals who are openly challenging the legal validity of the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Proclamation, and even blatantly reneging on their commitments, constantly challenging China's bottom line on the Taiwan issue. This tramples on historical facts and justice, is a provocation to the post-war international order, undermines the international rule of law, and desecrates the fruits of the victory of the World Anti-Fascist War.\nThe one-China principle is the anchor of peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. When the one-China principle is fully recognized and followed seriously, the Taiwan Strait will remain calm; otherwise, there will be clouds and even violent storms. Revisiting this period of history published in the \"Potsdam Declaration\" can remind the world that forgetting history means betrayal.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347332.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-26","Zhao Lijian","ATV reporter","According to reports, former US Secretary of State Kissinger said in a recent interview that when dealing with Sino-US relations, the United States and its allies must maintain their strength, but must also respect China's role as a participant in the international order; \"cooling down\" the rhetoric of China and the United States on the Taiwan issue will ease tensions, reduce the possibility of conflict, and…","We appreciate Mr. Kissinger’s relevant remarks. As the world's two largest economies and permanent members of the United Nations Security Council, China and the United States can only improve their relations and cannot ruin them. We urge the U.S. to view China and Sino-U.S. relations objectively and implement the \"four nos, one no intentions\" commitment repeatedly reiterated by President Biden and the positive statements made by Secretary of State Blinken. In particular, the U.S. must abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, work with China halfway, and find the right way for China and the U.S. to get along with each other under the new situation of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347332.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-27","Zhao Lijian","AFP","Some US officials said that if House Speaker Nancy Pelosi visits Taiwan, the US military will increase military activities in the Asia-Pacific region, including deploying fighter jets. What is China’s response to this?","I’m afraid you haven’t been here these days. We have repeatedly stated our firm position against Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan. If the United States insists on going its own way and challenges China's bottom line, it will be resolutely countered, and all consequences will be borne entirely by the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347333.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-28","Zhao Lijian","ATV reporter","On July 25, former US House of Representatives Speaker Gingrich, who had visited Taiwan, said that Pelosi should definitely visit Taiwan now to let China understand that the United States is not a \"paper tiger.\" During the tense situation in the Taiwan Strait from 1996 to 1997, he and former President Clinton sent very strong signals to China, including deploying US aircraft carriers to the Taiwan Strait. What is…","Gingrich once performed badly on Taiwan-related issues. His extremely irresponsible remarks are not worth mentioning. This once again proves that some U.S. politicians have sinister intentions out of their own selfish interests, lest Sino-U.S. relations become less tense, lest there is no turmoil in the Taiwan Strait, and lest there be no chaos in the world.\nChina has recently expressed its solemn position to the United States on many occasions that it firmly opposes Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan. In addition to the spokesperson of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Chinese Ministry of National Defense and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council also issued statements. A spokesman for the Chinese Ministry of National Defense said that if the United States insists on its own way, the Chinese military will never sit idly by and will take strong measures to thwart any external interference and separatist attempts for \"Taiwan independence.\" The Chinese do what they say.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347334.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2022-07-28","","Reporter","This year marks the 95th anniversary of the founding of the Chinese People's Liberation Army (PLA), and also the 10th year of the decade in which the PLA has been engaged in the cause of building a strong military. Please share with us the historic achievements and shifts in national defense and military development since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPC).","Since the 18th CPC National Congress, socialism with Chinese characteristics has entered a new era, and so has the development of China's national defense and the armed forces. Standing at the strategic height of coordinating the overall strategy of realizing the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation and the great changes unseen in a century in the world, President Xi Jinping has set the Party's goal of building a strong military and devised the military strategic guideline for a new era and the new three-step roadmap for modernizing China's national defense and the armed forces, that is, achieving the military's centenary goal by 2027; basically completing the modernization of national defense and the armed forces by 2035; and fully transforming the armed forces into world-class forces by the mid-21st century, leading the people's military stride forward on the path of building a strong military with Chinese characteristics. Following Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, the military will thoroughly implement Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and the military strategic guideline for a new era, gain a better understanding of the decisive significance of establishing Comrade Xi Jinping's core position on the Party Central Committee and in the Party as a whole and establishing the guiding role of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era; strengthen our consciousness of the need to maintain political integrity, think in big-picture terms, follow the leadership core, and keep in alignment with the central Party leadership; stay confident in the path, theory, system, and culture of socialism with Chinese characteristics; and uphold Comrade Xi Jinping's core position on the Party Central Committee and in the Party as a whole, and uphold the Central Committee's authority and its centralized, unified leadership. The military will implement the CMC chairman responsibility system, continued to reinforce the political loyalty of the military, strengthen it through reform, technology and talent development, and run it in accordance with the law. We will comprehensively strengthen military training and combat readiness, fulfill missions and tasks in the new era to defend national sovereignty, security, and development interests with a tenacious fighting spirit and concrete actions, and provide strategic support for realizing the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.\nFirst, reinforcing political loyalty of the military. President Xi made arrangements for enhancing political loyalty of the military at the Gutian Military Political Work Conference, with a view to restoring and carrying forward the glorious tradition and fine work style of the Party and the PLA, promoting political education in the spirit of rectification, strengthening Party leadership and Party building, improving Party conduct, upholding integrity, and combating corruption. As a result, the political ecosystem of the people's military is much healthier. The military is deepening study of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, especially Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military, following the fundamental principle and system of the Party's absolute leadership over the military, ensuring the highest leadership and command of the military resides in the CPC Central Committee and the CMC, and fully implementing the CMC chairman responsibility system. We will continue to cultivate revolutionary officers and soldiers of a new era with faith, ability, courage, and integrity, and build troops with ironclad faith, conviction, discipline, and commitment to ensure the military is wholesome, reliable and absolute loyal.\nSecond, strengthening the military through reform. Focusing on designing and shaping the future of the Chinese military, President Xi has proposed the strategy of strengthening the military through reform, and led the most extensive and profound national defense and military reform since the founding of the PRC. The reform is included in the overall process of comprehensively deepening reform, with major issues concerning the fundamental direction and of overall importance elucidated. We have reformed the leadership and command system, the modern military force structure, and military policies and institutions. The number of active-duty service members was reduced by 300,000. A new structure has been put into place with the CMC exercising overall leadership, the theater commands responsible for military operations, and the services focusing on developing capabilities. We have built a military force structure dominated by elite combat forces and established the basic framework of the socialist military policies and institutions with Chinese characteristics. The PLA as of now features a new system, a new structure, a new pattern, and a new appearance.\nThird, strengthening the military through technology. Focusing on seizing the strategic commanding heights in military competitions, President Xi pointed out that technology is a core combat capability. He ordered to build an innovative people's military and required to prioritize innovation in military development. We have implemented the strategy of strengthening the military through technology, made great efforts to build an innovative people's military, and improved the capability of independent innovation in defense technology. We will continue to develop the military and generate combat power through technology and innovation, promote efficiency-centered military management reform, advance the reform in the quality, efficiency and driving force of military development, and achieve a new leap in national defense and military development.\nFourth, strengthening the military through talent. President Xi has led the armed forces to implement the strategy of strengthening the military through talent, maintain the correct political direction of talent development, prioritize combat readiness and preparedness in cultivating talent, optimize the layout in achieving military personnel modernization, deepen the reform of policies and institutions concerning military human resources, and make talent development more open and inclusive. Historic achievements have been made in this regard. The people's military will continue to promote the comprehensive transformation and upgrading of military personnel in terms of ability and quality, structural layout, development and management, while adhering to the standards of good cadres in the armed forces; build the three-pronged system for cultivating new types of military personnel through academic studies, field training and professional education, giving full play to talent development in guiding and supporting the building of a strong military.\nFifth, running of the military in accordance with the law. President Xi pointed out that effective and strict implementation of law-based governance underpins the effort to build a strong military. It is an important policy of the CPC in building and governing the military. He has led the armed forces to implement the strategy of governing the military in accordance with the law, build a military legal system with Chinese characteristics, accelerate the fundamental transformation in our way of running the military, strengthen the belief and awareness of service members in law-based governance, emphasize stricter discipline across the military, pushing the modernization process to a higher level. The people's military will continue to improve the system of military laws and regulations and the enforcement, supervision and support systems of law-based governance, establish a pattern in which all Party committees, executive branches, military units and service members act in compliance with laws and established rules, and improve law-based governance in national defense and military development.\nSixth, strengthening training and combat readiness. President Xi has required the military to put its focus back on combat readiness and preparedness, follow the military strategic thinking and the military strategic guideline for a new era, and fulfill its responsibility of promoting training and being combat-ready. The people's military has taken combat effectiveness as the sole and fundamental criterion, aimed at the goal of being able to fight and win, strengthened our strategic forces and new combat forces in new domains, and enhanced the joint operations command system and capacity building. We have vigorously promoted the integration of combat and training, systematic training, and technology-based training to push forward the transformation and upgrading of military training. We have emphasized military preparedness, cultivated fighting spirit, advanced high-quality development of modern logistic support, and made leapfrog progress and historic achievements in developing weapons and equipment. The deterrence and combat power of the Chinese military have been significantly improved.\nSeventh, fulfilling the missions and tasks in the new era. President Xi has clearly set the missions and tasks of the military in the new era. The people's military stays committed to serving the Party's historical missions. To meet the strategic needs of national security in the new era, the armed forces have resolutely fulfilled missions and tasks in the new era, made efforts to build strong and modern border defense, coastal defense and air defense, carried out operations in a firm but flexible manner, effectively responded to external military provocations, and deterred \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts. We have carried out major tasks such as border defense, maritime rights protection, anti-terrorism and stability maintenance, disaster rescue and relief, fighting against epidemics, peacekeeping and maritime escort, humanitarian rescue, and international military cooperation. The armed forces have defended China's sovereignty, security and development interests with a tenacious fighting spirit and tangible actions. Meanwhile, as the military of a major country, the PLA has made great contributions to world and regional peace and stability.\nSince the 18th CPC National Congress, we have made historic achievements and shifts in national defense and military development, which attributes to the strong leadership of the CPC Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, and the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, especially Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military. On the new journey, the people's military will unite more closely around the CPC Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, thoroughly study and implement Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, especially Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military, promote the modernization of national defense and armed forces, comprehensively improve the strategic capabilities in defending national sovereignty, security and development interests, and make unremitting efforts to realize the Party's goal of building a strong and world-class military, the second centenary goal and the Chinese Dream of national rejuvenation.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-07-28","","Reporter","General Li Zuocheng, member of the Central Military Commission (CMC) and Chief of the Joint Staff Department of the CMC, recently had a video talk with General Mark Milley, US Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff. According to an official of the US Department of Defense, General Milley instructed the US military to collect all the interactions between the two militaries during the past five years, so as to…","Lately, General Li Zuocheng, member of the CMC and Chief of the Joint Staff Department of the CMC, had a video talk with General Mark Milley, US Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff. The two sides had an in-depth exchange of views on international and regional situations, China-US relations and mil-mil relationship, the Taiwan question, and aerial and maritime military security. They reached an important consensus on maintaining a stable mil-to-mil relationship and avoiding conflicts and confrontations. It was a candid, in-depth and constructive strategic communication.\nChina-US mil-to-mil relationship is an important part of the relations between the two countries. China values the mil-to-mil relationship. However, we have a principle in developing this relationship. China's sovereignty, dignity and core interests are inviolable. For some comments made by the US side, the Chinese side will not only listen to what they say but also look at what they do. Some people on the US side stick to their misconceptions about China and insist on containing and suppressing China in an all-around way. China will not stand idly by and will surely make firm responses.\nAs for aerial and maritime military security issues you mentioned, the fundamental cause lies in the long-term, extensive and intensive close-in reconnaissance and highly targeted military exercises conducted by the US side in the vicinity of China. China is firmly opposed to this and has made reasonable and effective responses in a safe and professional manner. We demand the US side stop provocations in violation of China's sovereignty, strictly discipline troops on the ground, and prevent any accident from happening.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-07-28","","Reporter","The US House of Representatives recently passed the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2023, which reaffirmed the so-called \"US support for Taiwan's defense\" and claimed that the US military had the right to conduct joint exercises with Taiwan and invite Taiwan to participate in the Rim of the Pacific exercise. The US government recently approved a new round of arms sales to Taiwan. What's your…","Taiwan is China's Taiwan. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no interfere from the US. For some time, the US side has not been matching its actions with its words. Though the US claims its one-China policy remains unchanged and does not support \"Taiwan independence\", it has strengthened military and political ties with the Taiwan region, and put forward plans to sell arms to it. This act of playing with fire is very dangerous. It will seriously impact the relations between the two countries and two militaries, threaten peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and exacerbate the risk of military confrontation between the two countries.\nIt is the sacred mission of the PLA to realize national reunification and deter separatist attempts. We will, as always, have zero tolerance for \"Taiwan independence\", never hesitate to crack down on it, and resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-07-28","","Reporter","A few days ago, Taiwan authorities' defense department claimed that PLA fighters crossed the so-called \"median line of the Taiwan Strait\" many times, seriously undermining regional peace and stability. They claimed that a PLA warship recently appeared off the coast of Hualien county. Taiwan sources said that in view of US Senator Rick Scott 's visit to Taiwan, the PLA \"obviously released a provocative message\".…","Taiwan is an integral part of China, and there is no such thing as a median line of the Taiwan Strait. At present, the root cause of the tensions and instability across the Taiwan Strait lies in the collusion between the \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and external forces. Who is undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait? It is the Democratic Progressive Party authorities who pursues \"independence\" with constant provocative actions and the external forces who attempt to use Taiwan to contain China.\nThe PLA will never tolerate separatist actions for \"Taiwan independence\" and interference from external forces. We will resolutely respond to these acts. Action is the most powerful language. Relevant parties should learn to adapt, reflect, and more importantly, learn to pull back before it is too late.\nIn a few days, it will be the 95th anniversary of the founding of the PLA. Over the past 95 years, the PLA has devoted itself to the Party and fought under the absolute leadership of the Party. Over the past 95 years, the PLA has defended national sovereignty, security, and development interests like an iron great wall. Over the past 95 years, the PLA has served the people wholeheartedly and been the people’s military, like a head-bowed willing ox.\nLoyally upholding the core and striving to strengthen itself, the military will rally more closely around the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, adhere to the guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and thoroughly implement Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military. Following the direction pointed out and the blueprint drawn by President Xi, the military will forge ahead on a new journey and make greater achievements in the new era, and set the stage for the 20th CPC National Congress through concrete actions.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2022-07-29","Zhao Lijian","Reporter from Press Trust of India","Yesterday, after President Biden and President Xi Jinping had a phone call, we saw that both China and the United States issued detailed press releases. What results does China think this call has achieved? Especially on the Taiwan issue?","Regarding the phone call between the Chinese and US presidents, China has issued a press release as soon as possible.\nRegarding the Taiwan issue, President Xi Jinping focused on expounding China's principled position on the Taiwan issue during the phone call. China's position against official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan is clear and consistent, and China's position and attitude have been clearly stated many times recently. As President Xi Jinping emphasized, the three joint communiques between China and the United States are the political commitments of both parties, and the one-China principle is the political foundation of China-US relations. We firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, and will never leave any space for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" forces. The position of the Chinese government and the Chinese people on the Taiwan issue is consistent. It is the firm will of the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people to resolutely safeguard China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Public opinion cannot be violated, if you play with fire you will burn yourself. We hope that the United States will see this clearly. The United States should adhere to the one-China principle in words and deeds and implement the three Sino-US joint communiqués.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347335.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-29","Zhao Lijian","Reporter from Kyodo News","In yesterday's phone call between the heads of state of China and the United States, China expressed its position on the Taiwan issue, and China and the United States also agreed to maintain contact. However, if Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi visits Taiwan, does China believe that the atmosphere for continued high-level dialogue between China and the United States will no longer exist?","Yesterday, the heads of state of China and the United States had a phone call. The two sides had frank and in-depth communication and exchanges on China-US relations and issues of mutual concern. China has recently expressed its serious concerns and solemn position to the United States on many occasions that it firmly opposes Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan. If the United States challenges China's bottom line, it will be resolutely countered, and all consequences will be borne entirely by the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347335.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-29","Zhao Lijian","Bloomberg","Did the Chinese and US presidents talk about U.S. House Speaker Pelosi’s possible visit to Taiwan during their phone call yesterday?","I have just introduced the relevant situation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347335.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-07-29","Zhao Lijian","Press Trust of India","Did the Chinese and US presidents discuss other issues other than Taiwan during their phone call yesterday? Especially issues related to the Indo-Pacific? What results were achieved?","It was late at night in China when the call ended last night. We have issued relevant news releases as soon as possible.\nDuring the phone call, the two heads of state had candid communication and exchanges on Sino-US relations and issues of mutual concern. President Xi Jinping focused on elaborating China's principled position on the Taiwan issue. President Xi Jinping emphasized that the two sides should maintain communication at all levels, make good use of existing communication channels, and promote bilateral cooperation. The two heads of state also exchanged views on the global economic situation. Both sides believe that China and the United States should maintain communication on major issues such as macroeconomic policy coordination, maintaining the stability of global industrial and supply chains, and ensuring global energy and food security. President Xi Jinping also emphasized that going against the rules and engaging in decoupling and disconnection will not help boost the U.S. economy and will also make the world economy more fragile. Both sides should promote the de-escalation of regional hot-spot issues, help the world get rid of the COVID-19 epidemic as soon as possible, get out of the plight of economic stagflation and the risk of recession, and safeguard the international system with the United Nations at its core and the international order based on international law. The two heads of state also exchanged views on the Ukraine crisis and other issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347335.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-01","Zhao Lijian","Reuters","Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi plans to visit Southeast Asian and East Asian countries this week, and her itinerary does not include Taiwan. What is China’s comment?","China has recently expressed its serious concerns and solemn position to the United States on many occasions that it firmly opposes Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan, emphasizing that her visit to Taiwan will lead to serious consequences. During a recent phone call with President Biden, President Xi Jinping emphasized that the position of the Chinese government and the Chinese people on the Taiwan issue is consistent and that resolutely safeguarding China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity is the firm will of the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people. Public opinion cannot be violated, if you play with fire you will burn yourself. We believe that the United States has fully understood the strong and clear message sent by China.\nWe are paying close attention to Speaker Pelosi's schedule. If she visits Taiwan, it will be a gross interference in China's internal affairs, seriously damage China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, willfully trample on the one-China principle, seriously threaten peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, seriously damage Sino-US relations, and lead to very serious situations and consequences.\nWe would like to warn the United States once again that China is standing ready. The Chinese People's Liberation Army will never sit idly by and will take resolute responses and powerful countermeasures to defend its sovereignty and territorial integrity. What the U.S. should do is abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, fulfill President Biden's promise not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" and not arrange for Speaker of the House Pelosi to visit Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347336.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-01","Zhao Lijian","NBC reporter","First, Pelosi's official schedule shows that she will visit Singapore, Malaysia, South Korea, Japan, etc., and Taiwan is obviously not mentioned. What is China’s comment on this? Are you optimistic about this? Second, you mentioned that \"the Chinese military will never sit idly by.\" Can you elaborate on what this refers to? What might happen if Pelosi visits Taiwan?","Regarding your first question, we have seen relevant statements issued by House Speaker Pelosi’s office, as well as her own tweets and relevant reports. I have just stated the Chinese government's position very clearly.\nRegarding your second question, as the third most powerful person in the US government, Pelosi’s status determines that her visit to Taiwan must be highly sensitive. No matter when or how she goes to Taiwan, she will seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, severely damage Sino-US relations, and will definitely have a negative political impact. If Speaker Pelosi visits Taiwan, China will take firm responses and powerful countermeasures to defend its sovereignty and territorial integrity. As for what measures it will take, if she dares to go, let us wait and see.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347336.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-01","Zhao Lijian","Phoenix TV reporter","Kirby, the strategic communications coordinator of the National Security Council of the White House, said that the United States has seen no concrete signs of China strengthening its military deployment towards Taiwan. Regardless of whether Pelosi visits Taiwan or not, the United States' one-China policy will not change. There is no reason for the United States and China to go to the extent of taking action or…","We have stated on many occasions our serious concerns and solemn stance against Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan, and we will take firm and powerful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. What I want to emphasize is that the one-China principle is the anchor of peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. It is the United States that continues to distort and hollow out the one-China policy, make irresponsible remarks, and create tension on the Taiwan issue. The United States has recently begun to emphasize the need to safeguard the sovereignty and territorial integrity of every country. We hope that the United States will first match its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue and not engage in double standards.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347336.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-01","Zhao Lijian","ATV reporter","Japanese Foreign Minister Hayashi Masaru gave a speech at a US think tank on the 29th, saying that it is necessary to maintain high-level candid dialogue with China and cooperate with China on issues such as climate change and the North Korean nuclear issue. He also expressed so-called concerns on China-Russia relations, the South China Sea, the East China Sea, the Taiwan Strait and other issues. What is China’s…","Japan has repeatedly made remarks to discredit China's normal military and maritime activities, interfered in China's internal affairs, and provoked regional division and confrontation. This approach is not constructive in any way.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that China adheres to the path of peaceful development and firmly pursues the nuclear strategy of self-defense. China-Russia military cooperation complies with international law and practice and is not targeted at any specific country. Taiwan is a sacred and indivisible part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not allow any interference from external forces. On the other hand, Japan has allowed the right wing to cause trouble in the East China Sea, solicited foreign intervention, and collaborated with the United States to show off its power in the South China Sea. This is the real threat to regional peace and stability. Japan has long regarded itself as a victim of nuclear weapons and enjoys the protection of the US \"nuclear umbrella\". However, it opposes and obstructs the United States from giving up its first-use nuclear weapons policy, and even falsely claims to share nuclear weapons with the United States. This position is hypocritical and contradictory.\nChina and Japan are close neighbors to each other and both are important countries in the region. Maintaining and developing friendly cooperative relations between China and Japan is in the fundamental interests of the two countries and their peoples. We urge the Japanese side to view China's development objectively and rationally, abide by the principles established in the four political documents between China and Japan, and stop creating troubles and stirring up disputes in the Asia-Pacific region for its own selfish interests. Japan should take concrete actions to promote the healthy and stable development of China-Japan relations along the right track.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347336.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-02","Hua Chunying","Bloomberg","Since the end of yesterday’s press conference, there has been more news about Pelosi’s trip to Asia. At present, it seems more and more likely that she will visit Taiwan, arrive in Taiwan tonight, and hold talks with Taiwanese leaders. What does the Ministry of Foreign Affairs think about this? This visit looks like it will take place in a few hours at the earliest. Does China think it will be too late for Pelosi…","Everyone is paying close attention to Speaker Pelosi’s trip to Asia. The question you asked is more suitable to ask the US side or herself. China has clearly stated its principled position on many occasions and made stern representations to the United States on many occasions. We are paying close attention to Pelosi's schedule. If the United States insists on going its own way, China will take resolute and effective measures to safeguard China's sovereignty and security interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347337.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-02","Hua Chunying","Phoenix TV reporter","Yesterday, US Secretary of State Antony Blinken said at the United Nations Non-Proliferation Treaty Review Conference that the United States will be an independent and equal government agency. There is a precedent for the US Speaker of the House of Representatives visiting Taiwan. If Pelosi decides to visit Taiwan and China attempts to create some kind of crisis or otherwise escalate tensions, the responsibility…","The whole world can see very clearly that it was the United States that took provocative actions that escalated tensions across the Taiwan Strait. The United States should and must bear full responsibility for this. Secretary Blinken’s remarks confuse right and wrong and once again deeply reflect the hegemonic mentality and gangster logic of some people in the United States. That is: I can provoke you arbitrarily, but you cannot object or defend yourself.\nRecently, China has repeatedly stated through various channels and levels in Beijing and Washington its solemn position against the US Speaker of the House of Representatives' planned visit to Taiwan. I would like to take this opportunity to reiterate a few points:\nFirst, all agencies of the U.S. government, including the executive, legislative, and judicial departments, should implement the foreign policies recognized and committed to by the U.S. government. In 1979, the U.S. government made a clear commitment in the Communique on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and the United States that \"the United States of America recognizes the government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China. Within this scope, the American people will maintain cultural, commercial and other unofficial relations with the people of Taiwan.\" As an integral part of the U.S. government, the U.S. Congress should strictly abide by the foreign policies recognized and committed by the U.S. government. As the third-ranking figure in the U.S. government, the speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives flew a U.S. military aircraft to visit Taiwan. This was by no means an unofficial act.\nSecond, the past wrong actions of individual US politicians should not set a precedent, let alone an excuse for the US to make more mistakes on the Taiwan issue.\nThird, the one-China principle is a recognized basic norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. It is on the basis of the one-China principle that China has established diplomatic relations with 181 countries, including the United States. The United States made solemn commitments to China on the one-China principle in the three Sino-US joint communiques.\nIn recent years, the United States has verbally claimed to adhere to the one-China policy, but it has continuously retreated in action, and has even blurred and hollowed out the one-China principle. It has not only inserted the so-called \"Taiwan Relations Act\" and \"Six Assurances towards Taiwan\" that it has unilaterally concocted and that China has never recognized and is firmly opposed to, into its one-China policy statement. It has also violated its commitment to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan, continuously raised the level of U.S.-Taiwan contact, and continued to increase arms sales to Taiwan.\nMany insightful people in the United States and abroad see this very clearly, and have repeatedly pointed out the dangers of the relevant actions of the United States. At this year's World Economic Forum in Davos, former U.S. Secretary of State Kissinger clearly stated, \"What I understand is that the agreement reached when China and the United States established diplomatic relations is that the United States will pursue the one-China principle. Adhering to the one-China principle is very critical. The United States should not use deceptive means or incremental methods to promote the 'two Chinas' solution.\" After the recent news that the Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives plans to leave Taiwan, many people, including many mainstream media, think tanks, and former politicians from some U.S. ally countries, have publicly stated that Pelosi's trip to Taiwan for any reason will be stupid, dangerous and unnecessary.\nFourth, out of the strategy of \"using Taiwan to contain China\", the United States supports and condones the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, continues to deliberately provoke China on the Taiwan issue, and presses China's red lines and bottom lines step by step. The United States and Taiwan are colluding and provoking first, and China's legitimate defense comes second. Faced with the fact that the United States ignores China's repeated solemn representations and acts arbitrarily, any countermeasures taken by China will be legitimate and necessary. This is also the right that any independent sovereign country should have. What's more, China is a big country with a history of more than 5,000 years and a population of more than 1.4 billion. We hope that the United States will have a clear understanding of this.\nFifth, the historical latitude and longitude of the Taiwan issue is clear, and the fact and current situation that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China are clear. We firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, and will never leave any space for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" forces. The position of the Chinese government and the Chinese people on the Taiwan issue is consistent. It is the firm will of the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people to resolutely safeguard China's sovereignty, security and territorial integrity. It is the common aspiration of all Chinese people to realize the complete reunification of the motherland. The United States should give up any attempt to play the \"Taiwan card\", match its words with deeds, abide by the one-China principle to the letter, and implement the three Sino-US joint communiques. If the United States insists on going its own way, it will be responsible for all serious consequences.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347337.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-02","Hua Chunying","Bloomberg","Regarding countermeasures, China has repeatedly mentioned that if Pelosi insists on visiting Taiwan, China has the right to take countermeasures. Can you elaborate on the nature and scope of this countermeasure? For example, does it include measures in the military, economic, and diplomatic fields?","What I can tell you is that the United States will definitely bear responsibility and pay the price for its damage to China's sovereignty, security and interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347337.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","CGTN reporter","On the evening of August 2, Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi issued a statement saying that the U.S. House of Representatives delegation’s visit to Taiwan demonstrates the U.S.’s firm support for Taiwan’s democracy. Today's world is facing a choice between authoritarianism and democracy, and the unity of the 23 million people in the United States and Taiwan is even more important. What is…","The essence of Pelosi's visit to Taiwan is not a democratic issue, but an issue related to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. What Pelosi did was by no means a defense of democracy, but a provocation and violation of China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nAs many people have pointedly pointed out, Pelosi's dangerous and provocative behavior is purely to gain personal political capital, and is a completely ugly political farce. In this ugly farce, democracy is nothing more than a cheap tool and cover used by the United States. It is Pelosi who is sensationalizing, but it is the relations between the two countries and regional peace and stability that are suffering.\nThe democracy Pelosi talks about is nothing more than a robe covered with lice. It looks gorgeous at first, but becomes unbearable up close. We have seen the hypocrisy and callousness of democracy in Pelosi's words from the \"Capitol Hill storming incident\", the death of Floyd, the Robb shooting, and the more than 1 million Americans who have died from the COVID-19 epidemic. We have also seen the commitment and so-called \"power\" of democracy from what the US military has done in Iraq and Syria and the retreat from Kabul.\nAs the third-ranking figure in the U.S. government, Pelosi spends taxpayers' money and flies on U.S. military planes to show off in the face of persistent domestic democratic problems, violating international law and basic norms of international relations, and damaging other countries' internal affairs and sovereign territorial integrity. This can only make the world more aware of the hypocrisy and ugliness of the U.S. and further bankrupt the U.S.'s national credibility. Even U.S. Republican Congresswoman Marjorie Green said, \"Pelosi has not stayed at home to solve the problems that plague the American people. She has held power for decades, while the entire country is collapsing. Enough of this fake 'courage' to defend democracy.\"\nI also want to remind Pelosi that she is facing China, which accounts for 1/5 of the population of mankind, and she is provoking more than 1.4 billion Chinese people. Public opinion cannot be bullied and public opinion cannot be violated. I believe history will give a fair answer to whether Pelosi will be famous or infamous for this \"show\".","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","AFP","State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said today: \"Those who offend China will be punished.\" Can you tell us what further punitive measures China plans to take?","China will take all necessary measures to resolutely defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces will be responsible for all consequences arising therefrom. We do what we say. Please have more patience and confidence.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","Bloomberg","Can you give us more details on the countermeasures China may take? Do they include sanctions on Taiwan or Pelosi personally and other US officials?","Pelosi ignored China's strong opposition and solemn representations and insisted on visiting the Taiwan region of China. This seriously violated the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués. It seriously affected the political foundation of Sino-US relations, seriously violated China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, seriously undermined peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sent a serious wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the National People's Congress, the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, and the Ministry of National Defense all issued statements or conversations immediately last night to condemn the incident. Vice Foreign Minister Xie Feng immediately summoned U.S. Ambassador to China Burns and Chinese Ambassador to the U.S. Qin Gang immediately lodged solemn representations with the National Security Council of the White House and the State Department respectively. This morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi made a statement in this regard.\nChina will take all necessary measures to resolutely defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces will be responsible for all consequences arising therefrom. We do what we say. As for the specific countermeasures you are concerned about, what I can tell you is that they will be all there are, and the relevant measures will be resolute, powerful and effective. The United States and \"Taiwan independence\" forces will continue to feel this.\nI also want to emphasize that looking back at every provocation the United States has provoked against China, the result is always self-humiliation and self-resultation. The latest example is that Pelosi and others once incited the violent forces in Hong Kong and advocated the so-called \"beautiful scenery\", but this exactly accelerated Hong Kong's transition from chaos to governance, from governance to prosperity, and made the Pearl of the Orient shine again. This time is no exception. Pelosi and others are trying to collude with \"Taiwan independence\" forces to \"use Taiwan to contain China\" and infringe on China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. This is a mantis mantis acting as a chariot. It is impossible to stop and will only accelerate the historical process of China's reunification.\nAs State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out, the United States has betrayed its trust on the Taiwan issue, blatantly played with fire, and made enemies of the 1.4 billion Chinese people. It will never end well.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","Reuters","The Chinese military said it will conduct targeted military exercises in several areas around Taiwan. Some of the areas are in Taiwan's \"internal waters\". Taiwan claims that this is not allowed by the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, endangering its \"security\" and hindering the freedom of navigation protected by international law. What is your comment on this?","Regarding the recent actions taken by the Chinese military, I believe you have seen the statements issued by the spokespersons of the Chinese Ministry of National Defense and the Eastern Theater Command. The relevant actions of the Chinese military are legitimate and necessary to deter the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nWe have never seen any issues regarding freedom of navigation in the waters. I think we should pay more attention to why American warships and military aircraft have traveled thousands of miles to come to China's doorstep to show off their force. In addition, it is best not to mention the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea. If so, first ask the United States to join this convention immediately. As a part of China, Taiwan has no right to claim \"internal waters\".","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","AFP reporter","Regarding China’s military exercises around Taiwan, Japan said the area involved includes Japan’s exclusive economic zone. Considering that the military exercise is very close to Taiwan, including the eastern part of Taiwan, if there is a gunfire or a close-range encounter between ships and aircraft, is China prepared to deal with the escalation of the situation?","The Chinese military's military training activities in the waters near China's Taiwan Island are necessary and legitimate measures to counter major provocations by the United States and \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Relevant Chinese departments have issued safety reminders and navigation warnings in advance. China and Japan have not yet demarcated the relevant sea areas, and China does not accept the so-called \"Japan's exclusive economic zone\". China urges Japan to abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and be cautious in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","Some Chinese netizens are disappointed after China failed to take more measures to prevent Pelosi from visiting Taiwan. Should China take more measures to guide them to view the development of Sino-US relations more rationally?","China has made its solemn position clear with statements and actions. Once again, we have seen that individual politicians in the United States are putting on a personal \"show\" for their own selfish interests, regardless of regional peace and stability and the overall situation of China-US relations. China not only firmly and vigorously safeguards its own sovereignty, security and interests, but also safeguards regional peace and stability.\nChina's determination and will to safeguard the sovereignty, security and territorial integrity of the motherland are unswerving, and its strong capabilities cannot be questioned. China's countermeasures will be powerful, effective and resolute. The United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces will gradually and continuously feel this.\nThe Chinese people are rational and patriotic. We have full confidence in our country and our government to firmly and vigorously safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. I suggest you carefully study the century-old history of the Communist Party of China. What storms have we not experienced? But we have made it all the way to this point and have achieved achievements that have attracted worldwide attention. We are confident about the future!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","AFP reporter","China's General Administration of Customs said today that it will suspend the import of certain products from Taiwan for health and safety reasons. Earlier this week, several other types of Taiwanese products with required certification materials were also banned. Can you explain whether these measures are intended to punish Taiwan for Pelosi's visit to Taiwan?","Please refer to the relevant competent authorities for specific questions. But one thing is certain, the United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces must take responsibility and pay the price for the mistakes they have made.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-03","Hua Chunying","TASS reporter","According to reports, the German Foreign Minister said at the United Nations meeting that if China takes action against Taiwan, Germany will provide support to Taiwan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this statement?","What you are referring to is the statement made by German Foreign Minister Berberk during the Review Conference of the Treaty on the Non-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons. She insinuated that China was \"undermining international law\" and \"invading its weak neighbors\". This lacks historical common sense and is not consistent with the facts.\nThe historical latitude and legal facts of the Taiwan issue are clear and clear, and cannot be denied or distorted by anyone or any force. Let’s not go too far, let’s just say that at the end of World War II, China’s rights and interests over Taiwan were very clear in the 1943 Cairo Declaration and the 1945 Potsdam Proclamation, that is, Japan must return all territories stolen from China, including Taiwan and the Penghu Islands. In 1971, UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 stipulated that all rights of the People's Republic of China should be restored and the one-China principle should be reaffirmed.\nThe Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. Some people compare the Ukrainian issue to the Taiwan issue, deliberately distorting concepts and confusing the public. This is interference in China's internal affairs, and we will never accept it.\nThe one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and the political foundation and fundamental premise of China's relations with other countries. Violating the one-China principle will definitely undermine the overall development of bilateral relations. We hope that Germany can understand the Taiwan issue objectively and accurately, stop following the United States, abide by its commitment to the one-China policy with practical actions, and be cautious in its words and deeds on Taiwan-related issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347338.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","CCTV reporter","On the 3rd, the foreign ministers of the Group of Seven and the high representative of the European Union issued a joint statement saying that they were concerned about the threatening actions announced by China, which may lead to unnecessary escalation. There is no reason to use Pelosi's visit to Taiwan as an excuse for aggressive military actions or coercion. The statement also said that international travel by…","This statement makes people feel confused about time and space. The foreign ministers of these countries obviously thought they were living in the era of the Eight-Nation Alliance more than 120 years ago. Today's world is no longer a world where imperialist powers can show off their power and do whatever they want on Chinese soil. Today's China is not the old China that was bullied and slaughtered by others more than 100 years ago. It's time for them to wake up from their dream of being a great power.\nI want to emphasize a few points:\nFirst, China has the right to safeguard sovereignty and territorial integrity. The fundamental reason for the current tensions in the Taiwan Strait is that the United States ignored China's strong opposition and solemn representations and allowed the government's No. 3 figure to fly to Taiwan on a military plane. This is a major event that escalates the substantive relationship between the United States and Taiwan. It seriously damages the one-China principle and seriously damages China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China has repeatedly made clear its solemn position of resolute opposition and emphasized that China firmly opposes Taiwan independence, separatism and interference from external forces, and will never leave any space for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" forces. If the United States insists on going its own way, the United States will be fully responsible for all consequences. Don't say it was unforeseen. The US's malicious provocation comes first, and China's legitimate defense comes second. In the face of malicious provocations that blatantly violate China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, China's countermeasures are legitimate and necessary, and must be resolute and powerful. The world sees this very clearly. Hundreds of countries have made fair voices immediately, emphasizing that they should adhere to the one-China principle and support China in safeguarding its sovereignty and territorial integrity. If these countries sincerely care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, they should have dissuaded the United States from taking dangerous, reckless, and irresponsible provocations against China as soon as possible. Before Pelosi's visit to Taiwan, they pretended to be deaf and silent, but now they have jumped out to accuse China of taking just actions. Their hypocrisy and ugly face have been exposed.\nSecond, the one-China principle is an important political basis for the establishment of diplomatic relations between the seven countries and China. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan. The heads of the legislative bodies of the seven governments are expected to abide by the foreign policies recognized and committed to by their governments. If the government of the relevant country does nothing and lets its parliament act in violation of its foreign policy, it will only prove its political incompetence, ineffective governance, and betrayal of trust in the international community. On this serious issue, it makes no sense and will not have any effect to play word games or try to change the situation.\nThird, there is only one version and one meaning of the one-China principle, which is that there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. This is clearly stipulated in Resolution 2758 adopted by the 26th session of the United Nations General Assembly in 1971. It is the basic norm of international relations and the political basis for 181 countries, including the Group of Seven, to establish and develop diplomatic relations with China. No private presuppositions or suffixes are allowed, nor is any distortion of interpretation allowed.\nFourth, regardless of history or reality, the members of the Group of Seven led by the United States are the image spokespersons of \"aggression\" and \"coercion.\" When it comes to \"invasion\" or \"coercion,\" let the G7 countries wear this label themselves.\nThe seven countries should not forget that they cannot represent the international community. Their views are a tiny minority. As Singaporean scholar Mahbubani Mahbubani recently pointed out, “The Group of Seven countries is engaged in authoritarianism and dictatorship in the world.” This is also fully reflected in this statement.\nI would like to remind the foreign ministers of these seven countries again that we are now in the third decade of the 21st century. If our minds are still stuck in the mind of more than 100 years ago, there will be problems.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Bloomberg reporter","China often complains that many people in the West agree with the \"China threat theory.\" What do you say to some people who claim that the Chinese military's military exercises and live missile firing today are evidence of the threat posed by China?","The perspective of the question you raised is typical of the thinking of individual Westerners. There is a fundamental issue of right and wrong and principle here, because it involves China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nChina has repeatedly expressed its firm opposition to Pelosi's attempt to seek Taiwan, and pointed out that if the trip takes place, it will seriously violate the one-China principle and seriously infringe on China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China will take resolute and powerful measures to deal with it, and the United States will bear all consequences. Don't say you didn't predict what you said.\nTaiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Chinese military's military training activities in the waters near China's Taiwan Island are necessary and legitimate measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and to counter \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and interference from external forces. Relevant Chinese authorities have issued safety reminders and navigation warnings in advance. China's relevant practices are in line with international law and international practice. If someone tries to use this incident to prove that China poses a threat, it only shows that their hearts are very dark. Because they view this issue selectively and ignore a basic fact, that is, the situation in the Taiwan Strait has reached today because Pelosi ignored China's repeated and solemn representations and ignored the repeated advice of all parties and insisted on going her own way.\nThis morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi further clarified China's position on the provocative behavior of the United States that violated China's sovereignty during the series of Foreign Ministers' Meetings on East Asia Cooperation in Phnom Penh.\nState Councilor Wang Yi said that Pelosi's performance is another bankruptcy of American politics, American diplomacy and American credibility. It proves that the United States is the biggest destroyer of peace in the Taiwan Strait and the biggest troublemaker of regional stability. It proves that the United States' \"Indo-Pacific Strategy\" is extremely confrontational and harmful, and proves that the United States is hypocritical and has double standards for international rules. If China does not resolutely resist this manic, irresponsible and extremely irrational behavior of the United States, the principle of international relations of respecting sovereignty and territorial integrity will become a dead letter, various separatists and extremist forces will intensify, and the hard-won peace and stability in the region will be seriously damaged.\nState Councilor Wang Yi emphasized that this incident was planned and provoked by the United States. The causes and consequences are clear, and the right and wrong are clear at a glance. In order to avoid this crisis imposed on China, China has made the greatest diplomatic efforts. However, at the same time, we will never allow it to jeopardize China's core interests and national rejuvenation process. We will never sit back and watch the United States play the \"Taiwan card\" to serve the selfish desires of domestic politics and politicians. We will never tolerate creating tension, provoking confrontation and instigating division in the region. The comprehensive measures China is taking now and in the future are necessary and timely defensive countermeasures. They have been carefully considered and carefully evaluated and are designed to safeguard national sovereignty and security. They are in compliance with international and domestic laws. They are a warning to provocateurs and a safeguard for regional stability and peace across the Taiwan Strait. All parties should recognize the cause and essence of the current crisis, jointly oppose the US's adventures and provocations, continue to support China's legitimate stance and measures, and jointly safeguard peace in the region and across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Kyodo News reporter","I just heard that today’s scheduled meeting between State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi and the Japanese Foreign Minister has been cancelled. Can China confirm this news? Was the cancellation initiated by China or due to Japan? If the reason is China, is it related to the G7 statement you just responded to?","Let me answer your three questions together. China has made it clear that it will no longer arrange a meeting between the foreign ministers of China and Japan in Phnom Penh. Japan, together with the G7 countries and the EU, issued a joint statement that unreasonably accused China, confusing right and wrong, and justifying the US's violation of China's sovereignty. The Chinese people are extremely dissatisfied. For this reason, China will no longer arrange a meeting between the Chinese and Japanese foreign ministers in Phnom Penh.\nJapan bears historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue and has no qualifications to make irresponsible remarks on Taiwan-related issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","Has the increasingly tense relationship between China and the United States over the Taiwan issue now spread to other G7 members?","China has always hoped to develop friendly and cooperative relations with all countries, including members of the G7, based on the principles of mutual respect, equality, mutual benefit, and win-win cooperation. I believe this is the common expectation of the people of all countries and is in the common interests of all parties. At the same time, China has no room for compromise on issues involving China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. All countries that maintain and develop diplomatic relations with China must abide by the one-China principle.\nAs for the impact that the tension between China and the United States over the Taiwan issue will have on China's relations with other G7 members, I think it depends on what they think and do. If they follow the United States, admit that their foreign policies are not independent, do not care about the interests of their respective countries and peoples, and are willing to tie their countries to the United States and be willing to follow the United States, I think the people of their respective countries may not agree.\nIf they have independence, they should proceed from the fundamental interests of their country and their people and adhere to the one-China principle. Because this is the most important political premise and foundation for China's relations with other countries. Relevant countries should realize this. Responsible governments will independently make choices that best serve their interests based on their country's long-term and fundamental interests and the expectations of the people.\nThe foreign ministers of the G7 countries will not win any respect or dignity by issuing this statement. The G7 is only a very small minority. Even if all people in the G7 countries support this foreign minister's statement, they only account for less than 10% of the world's total population and cannot represent the international community at all. What's more, as far as the United States is concerned, 85% of the people in the United States disapprove of U.S. policies and believe that the United States is moving in the wrong direction. So how many people can this foreign minister’s statement represent? What's the point?","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","You just said that China has canceled its meeting with the Japanese Foreign Minister because Japan participated in the G7 statement. Does this mean that China is now unwilling to meet with any G7 foreign minister? When will this change?","I just made it very clear that the Chinese people are very dissatisfied because Japan, together with the Group of Seven and the European Union, issued a joint statement that unreasonably accused China, confusing right and wrong, and justifying the United States' violation of China's sovereignty. Japan bears historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue and has no qualifications to make irresponsible remarks on Taiwan-related issues.\nAs for other G7 members, if they do not change their wrong approach on the Taiwan issue, we may have to reconsider the meaning of meetings and dialogues. Meetings and dialogues should be aimed at enhancing trust and cooperation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","Does China think holding military exercises is beneficial or detrimental to winning over the will and hearts of the Taiwanese people?","Have you asked the Taiwan authorities, who insist on inviting Pelosi to escape to Taiwan, and whether they have asked the Taiwanese people about their wishes and aspirations? After Pelosi arrived in Taiwan, many Taiwanese people protested. Have the Taiwan authorities taken the expectations, aspirations, welfare and interests of the Taiwanese people into consideration in their actions?\nI have just made it clear that China's relevant actions are just, necessary and resolute. They are aimed at safeguarding China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity. They are a warning to provocateurs and are aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external interference forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Bloomberg reporter","Regarding Japan’s issue, do you mean it is only targeted at Japan, or does this treatment also extend to other members of the G7?","I have made it very clear. Japan, together with the Group of Seven, issued the so-called statement that unreasonably accused China. It completely confuses right and wrong and does not distinguish between right and wrong. What's more, Japan bears historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue, and the Chinese people are certainly very unhappy. Under such circumstances, we will no longer arrange a meeting between the foreign ministers of China and Japan in Phnom Penh.\nIn today's world, global challenges such as the COVID-19 epidemic, the Ukraine crisis, the economy, energy, and food crises, as well as regional hotspot issues, require better cooperation between G7 member countries and China. If the G7 disrespects or even harms China's core interests on the issue of China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, such a mistake will inevitably affect the G7's relations with China and its cooperation on important issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Kyodo News reporter","First, the international conference to be held in Phnom Penh is scheduled for tomorrow. Is it still possible for China to meet with the Japanese Foreign Minister? What kind of atmosphere should there be between the two countries so that there is an opportunity for dialogue? Second, you said yesterday that China and Japan have not yet demarcated the relevant sea areas, and China does not accept the so-called…","Regarding your first question, China will no longer arrange a meeting between the foreign ministers of China and Japan in Phnom Penh. The reason is very clear. If we want to solve the problem, the most realistic solution is for Japan to recognize this serious mistake and take practical actions to correct it. Japan bears historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue and has no right to make irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan issue, let alone follow the United States blindly and infringe on China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. It is also not in the interests of the Japanese people to do this.\nRegarding your second question, China and Japan have not yet demarcated the relevant sea areas, so there is no argument that China’s military operations are located in or enter Japan’s exclusive economic zone. Relevant Chinese departments have issued announcements and the relevant military actions are fully in compliance with international law and international practice.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","You just hinted that if the seven countries do not respect China's core interests on issues involving China's sovereignty, China's relations with the seven countries may be affected. How will China’s relations with the G7 be affected? How long will the impact last?","It is very unwise for the G7 to say inappropriate words and do inappropriate things on issues involving China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. This very easily reminds the Chinese people of the era of the Eight-Nation Allied Forces more than 100 years ago. That memory is a pain in the hearts of all Chinese people.\nAs I said just now, the world today is no longer a world where imperialist powers can show off their power and do evil on Chinese soil. Today's China is no longer the old China that was bullied and slaughtered by others more than 100 years ago. Therefore, those countries that have invaded China and committed war crimes against China in history should be more sensitive and conscious on issues involving China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, respect China's sovereignty and territorial integrity more, and not offend the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people on this issue.\nThese countries can think about it for themselves, how did the United States maintain national unity at all costs during the Civil War? The United Kingdom has a Scottish problem, Canada has a Quebec problem, and some states in the United States also want independence. Therefore, when it comes to issues involving sovereignty and territorial integrity, we hope that these countries will be self-aware and be cautious in their words and deeds.\nAs for how their wrong behavior on the Taiwan issue will affect relations with China and how long it will take to recover, it all depends on what they do and whether they can quickly recognize their mistakes and take concrete actions to correct them as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reporter from Press Trust of India","Just now you elaborated on the current status of the Taiwan issue. There was a long article in the Global Times today saying that Pelosi's visit to Taiwan changed the status quo in the Taiwan Strait. For a long period of time, the Taiwan Strait has maintained overall peace, and the current situation in the Taiwan Strait may be understood in this way. So, will China's military exercises become the new normal in…","I have just introduced the current situation of the Taiwan issue in detail. Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. This is the true status quo of the Taiwan issue. China's sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. For some time, the United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces have been colluding with each other, continuously elevating the substantive relationship between the United States and Taiwan, and increasing arms sales to Taiwan, violating the one-China principle and the commitments made to the Chinese government. In particular, Pelosi insists on going her own way and braving the world's disapproval to visit Taiwan. This is a serious provocation to upgrade the substantive relationship between the United States and Taiwan.\nWe have issued warnings many times before. Based on the summary of past experience and lessons, we can no longer allow the United States to use this \"salami-slicing\" method to press China's bottom line and red line step by step. Therefore, in response to provocative behaviors that seriously endanger China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, we have to take resolute actions to show our determination and ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nWhether this will become the new normal depends on what the United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces do. As long as they stop trying to split China, China will not stop resolutely defending its sovereignty and territorial integrity and will not stop demonstrating its determination, will and ability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters reporter","Tang Feng, head of the Taiwan authorities' information department, said that cyber attacks on Taiwan's official departments exceeded 15,000 gigabits (Gb) on Tuesday, 23 times higher than the previous daily record. What is China’s comment on this? Did the Chinese government launch these attacks?","I don’t understand what you’re talking about.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","AFP reporter","Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan has ended. How does China think the United States and the Taiwan authorities should make up for their actions?","Although Pelosi’s personal show ended soon, the serious damage and negative impact it caused will continue. They should be very clear that their only way out is to abide by the one-China principle to the letter and in words and deeds, and not to do anything that harms China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-04","Hua Chunying","Reuters","Taiwan authorities say they have suffered a large number of cyber attacks in recent days. Is this a concern for China? What is China’s view on the claims that China is the mastermind behind these cyber attacks?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347339.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-05","Hua Chunying","Shenzhen TV reporter","It is understood that at the East Asia Summit Foreign Ministers’ Meeting on the 5th, China had a fierce confrontation with the foreign ministers of the United States and Japan on the Taiwan issue. What is your comment on this?","At the East Asia Summit Foreign Ministers' Meeting held on the 5th, some countries made unreasonable accusations against China's legitimate rights protection measures. However, most countries did not agree and understood China's position.\nState Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi comprehensively and forcefully refuted the false information and untruths spread by individual countries on the spot, clarifying the facts, safeguarding sovereignty, and upholding justice.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-05","Hua Chunying","Phoenix TV reporter","The United States decided to postpone the test launch of the Minuteman 3 intercontinental ballistic missile, saying it was showing a responsible attitude and reducing the risk of instability. What is China’s response to this?","The word \"responsible\" sounds a bit awkward coming from the US.\nIf the United States was truly responsible, it should have stopped Pelosi's serious provocation by escaping to Taiwan, and should have withdrawn the large number of military aircraft and warships deployed in the Asia-Pacific region and at China's doorstep.\nIf the United States is truly responsible, it must immediately stop interfering in China's internal affairs for any reason or excuse, must immediately stop cannibalizing and hollowing out the one-China principle in a \"salami-slicing\" manner, must immediately stop escalating substantive relations between the United States and Taiwan, and must immediately stop arms sales to Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-05","Hua Chunying","Reuters","Japan said yesterday that five ballistic missiles launched by China fell into Japan's exclusive economic zone. Can China confirm that? What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The Chinese military is conducting military exercises in the waters near Taiwan Island, and relevant departments have issued safety reminders and navigation warnings in advance. China's relevant practices are in line with international law and international practice.\nAs for the \"Japan's exclusive economic zone\" you mentioned, China and Japan have not yet demarcated the relevant sea areas, and there is no such thing as \"Japan's exclusive economic zone.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-05","Hua Chunying","Reporter from Kyodo News","According to reports, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi and the Russian Foreign Minister left the scene when the Japanese Foreign Minister gave a speech at the East Asia Summit Foreign Ministers’ Meeting today. Can China introduce the relevant situation and have any comments on this?","I don’t understand what you’re talking about. But I would like to take this opportunity to remind Japan that Japanese leaders have performed very poorly on the Taiwan issue recently, and the Chinese people are very dissatisfied.\nWe have already said that Japan bears serious historical responsibilities on the Taiwan issue and is not qualified to make irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan issue. Today, the Prime Minister of Japan made unreasonable accusations against China when he met with Nancy Pelosi. During the series of Foreign Ministers’ Meetings on East Asia Cooperation, the Japanese Foreign Minister followed the US Secretary of State in spreading false information about China and made unreasonable accusations against China. China firmly opposes this.\nChina has repeatedly reiterated its principled position on the Taiwan issue. The current situation across the Taiwan Strait is caused by Pelosi's insistence on going her own way, despite China's firm opposition and repeated advice from all parties. Japan is selectively blind to the U.S.'s violation of China's sovereignty, but it jumps out to accuse rights defenders and blatantly defends the infringers. It is completely confusing right and wrong and confusing right and wrong. Provoking troubles on the Taiwan issue in an attempt to delay China's development and undermine China's peaceful reunification and rise will be in vain.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-05","Hua Chunying","Reuters","Japan reported that China launched four missiles over Taipei during military exercises. Can you confirm that? If the news is true, what is China’s comment?","Regarding military exercises, China has released information. Pelosi's move to Taiwan has triggered the current tense situation, and all countermeasures taken by China are legitimate, necessary and appropriate. We hope that Japan will have a correct understanding of this issue.\n***********************\nIf there are no other questions, I would like to take this opportunity to recommend an article to everyone, especially journalists from Reuters, Bloomberg and other European and American media. In response to Pelosi's article \"Why I led a congressional delegation to visit Taiwan\" published on August 2, China's Ambassador to the United States Qin Gang published an article in the \"Washington Post\" on August 4 titled \"Why China opposes Speaker Pelosi's visit to Taiwan.\" This article explains the origin of the Taiwan issue very concisely and clearly, and it is very well written. I believe that after reading it, everyone will have a deeper understanding of the Taiwan issue, and will also have a deeper and more correct understanding of why China opposes Pelosi’s attempt to seek Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Xinhua News Agency","State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi just attended a series of foreign ministers’ meetings on East Asia cooperation. What did the speaker say about the outcome of the meeting?","From August 4 to 5, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended the China-ASEAN (10+1) Foreign Ministers' Meeting, the ASEAN and China, Japan and South Korea (10+3) Foreign Ministers' Meeting, the East Asia Summit Foreign Ministers' Meeting and the ASEAN Regional Forum Foreign Ministers' Meeting. This is the first time that a series of foreign ministers’ meetings on East Asia cooperation have been held offline since the outbreak of the new coronavirus. During the meeting, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi elaborated on China’s propositions on China-ASEAN cooperation, East Asia cooperation and regional security cooperation, and had an in-depth exchange of views with participating countries on strengthening solidarity and coordination, jointly seeking Asian security, and jointly promoting recovery and development.\nThe first is to maintain ASEAN's central status and practice open regionalism. State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that it is necessary to maintain the correct direction of East Asia cooperation, uphold openness and inclusiveness, adhere to the Asian way, consolidate the ASEAN-centered regional cooperation architecture, make the ASEAN-centered cooperation platform bigger and stronger, and oppose ideological drawing, the introduction of camp confrontation, and the impact of exclusive small circles on the regional structure. China also circulated documents including China’s support for ASEAN’s central status and its support for cooperation in the four priority areas of the “ASEAN Indo-Pacific Outlook”. The foreign ministers of all participating countries unanimously appreciated China's consistent support for ASEAN's central status.\nThe second is to deepen cooperation in post-epidemic recovery. State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi advocated that regional cooperation should continue to adhere to \"priority to development and people's livelihood\" and increase investment in poverty reduction and other fields to better solve development problems and achieve common development. China supports ASEAN in building a regional vaccine production and distribution center and strengthening public health capacity building; it implements food security cooperation initiatives, jointly promotes energy security and accessibility, and ensures stable energy supply; it supports trade and investment liberalization and facilitation, maintains the stability of industrial and supply chains, and builds the Asia-Pacific Free Trade Area and the Asia-Pacific Economic Community. China is willing to set up a special donation for economic and technical cooperation under the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement under the framework of the China-ASEAN Cooperation Fund; support the construction of the 10+3 emergency medical supplies reserve center and increase financial support for the 10+3 rice emergency reserve mechanism; expand exchanges and cooperation in digital infrastructure, e-commerce, digital logistics, smart cities and other fields; and promote the establishment of a 10+3 low-carbon partnership.\nAll parties participating in the meeting unanimously agreed to accelerate regional economic integration, fully implement the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement, deepen cooperation in public health, digital economy, green development and other fields, achieve low-carbon and sustainable development, and better benefit people of all countries.\nThe third is to maintain regional peace and stability. State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that regional cooperation should promote common security, value and respect the legitimate security concerns of other countries, and jointly maintain regional peace and stability. Countries must earnestly abide by the UN Charter and international law, jointly safeguard the international system with the UN as the core, and adhere to the international order based on international law, instead of imposing the so-called \"rules\" of one country or group of countries on others and coercing other countries to choose sides. China opposes the blind promotion of unilateralism by some major countries, let alone the illegal behavior of sanctions and suppression.\nChina has played a constructive role in further promoting the healthy and in-depth development of East Asia cooperation and demonstrated its responsibility as a responsible major country.\nDuring the meeting, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi further elaborated on his solemn position on the provocative behavior of the United States that violates China's sovereignty. State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that the one-China principle is the anchor for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and the real \"guardrails\" for peaceful coexistence between China and the United States are the three joint communiques. \"Relying on the United States and seeking independence\" is a dead end, and \"using Taiwan to control China\" is doomed to failure. Faced with the fact that Speaker of the House of Representatives Pelosi of the United States insisted on venturing to Taiwan regardless of China's serious concerns and firm opposition, China naturally had to make a resolute response. China's position is just, reasonable, and legal; China's measures are firm, powerful, and appropriate; China's military exercises and training are open, transparent, and professional, and comply with domestic law, international law, and international practice. China is not only resolutely safeguarding China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, but also safeguarding international law and the basic norms of international relations, especially the most important international law of non-interference in internal affairs stipulated in the United Nations Charter. For this reason, more than 100 countries have publicly stood up and reiterated their firm commitment to the one-China policy and their understanding and support for China's legitimate position.\nThe foreign ministers of many participating countries expressed their adherence to the one-China principle and their understanding and support for China's necessary measures to safeguard sovereignty and territorial integrity. ASEAN foreign ministers also issued a statement on the cross-strait situation, reiterating their adherence to the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Hong Kong China Review News","Recently, Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida stated that Japan strongly condemns the missile launched by China during a military exercise falling into Japan's \"exclusive economic zone\", and noted that China does not recognize this. Kishida said that this is related to the security of Japan's country and citizens, and has a serious impact on the peace and stability of the international community. What is…","We firmly oppose Japan’s erroneous remarks and unreasonable accusations. From a legal, political and moral perspective, Japan is not qualified or has the right to make irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan issue.\nA few days ago, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi sternly refuted Japan's remarks at the series of foreign ministers' meetings on East Asia cooperation. Japan illegally occupied and implemented colonial rule in Taiwan for half a century. It killed more than 600,000 Taiwanese compatriots, plundered a large amount of local resources, and forced labor from many countries, including Southeast Asian countries. Many people were tortured to death. In 1943, the Cairo Declaration issued by China, the United States and the United Kingdom clearly stipulated that the Chinese territories stolen by Japan, including Taiwan and the Penghu Islands, should be returned to China. Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration issued in 1945 states that the Cairo Declaration will be implemented. Afterwards, Japan accepted the Potsdam Declaration and announced its unconditional surrender. In 1972, the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement signed when China and Japan normalized diplomatic relations clearly stipulated that the Japanese government fully understands and respects the Chinese government’s position that Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory, and insists on abiding by Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration. Japan should not forget this kind of history and needs to reflect on it from time to time.\nJapan has been so high-profile on the Taiwan issue recently. Has it forgotten the commitment it made when it signed the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement? Is it trying to subvert the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations? Do you have the ambition to get involved in Taiwan, China again? Does Japan want to take this opportunity to expand its armaments, abandon its \"peace constitution\", and no longer follow the path of peaceful development? Japan should give the international community a responsible explanation on these issues.\nAs for Japan’s claim that China’s military training activities involve the so-called Japan’s exclusive economic zone, China and Japan have not yet demarcated the relevant sea areas, so why is there such a thing as Japan’s exclusive economic zone? Taiwan is China’s territory, and China conducts normal military training activities in the waters surrounding its territory. They are open, transparent, professional, and comply with domestic laws, international laws, and international practices. They are not only a warning to provocateurs, but also a legitimate move to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nChina urges Japan to seriously reflect on its history of aggression, recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments made so far, stop following the trend and echoing the negative words and deeds of the United States related to Taiwan, stop following the wrong behavior of cooperating with the United States in \"using Taiwan to contain China\", and avoid causing further serious damage to the relations between the two countries.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Has China’s military exercise in the waters around Taiwan ended as scheduled? Can you tell us more about the ongoing military exercises?","The Chinese military has issued relevant announcements, which you can check.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The Chinese military said today that it will continue to conduct military exercises in the waters surrounding Taiwan. What is the reason for this? Is this also a countermeasure against Pelosi's visit to Taiwan? If so, why does China believe that last week's military exercise was still not enough to achieve the purpose of countermeasures?","U.S. House Speaker Pelosi ignored China's firm opposition and repeated representations, and with the connivance and arrangement of the U.S. government, brazenly visited the Taiwan region of China. This perverse act seriously violated China's sovereignty, seriously interfered in China's internal affairs, seriously violated the commitments made by the U.S., and seriously jeopardized peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. As State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out, China's position is legitimate, reasonable, and legal, and our measures are firm, powerful, and appropriate. China's military exercises and training are open, transparent, and professional, in compliance with domestic law, international law, and international practice. They are designed to warn the perpetrators and punish \"Taiwan independence\" forces. We will resolutely safeguard China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, resolutely block the United States' attempts to \"use Taiwan to contain China,\" and resolutely smash the Taiwan authorities' illusions of \"relying on the United States and seeking independence.\" At the same time, China is also upholding international law and the basic norms of international relations, especially the most important international law of non-interference in internal affairs stipulated in the United Nations Charter.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Türkiye's Anadolu News Agency","The navigation warning previously announced by China expired at noon yesterday (August 7). Continuing military exercises does not seem to be in line with international practice. Regarding the new military training, will China issue separate safety reminders for civil aircraft and ships?","Taiwan is China’s territory. China carries out normal military training activities in the waters surrounding its territory, which are open, transparent and professional. Relevant Chinese departments have also issued timely announcements. This is in line with domestic law, international law and international practice. This is not only a warning to provocateurs, but also a legitimate move to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","On the 5th, U.S. Secretary of State Blinken, Australian Foreign Minister Huang Yingxian, and Japanese Foreign Minister Hayashi Masaru issued a joint statement after holding a trilateral strategic dialogue, reaffirming that the three countries' respective one-China policy and basic stance toward Taiwan have not changed. At the same time, a bracket was added after the \"one-China policy\" to indicate \"where…","The one-China principle is a general consensus of the international community and a recognized basic norm of international relations. It forms an integral part of the post-World War II international order and is confirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758. It is also the political basis for the establishment and development of diplomatic relations between China and relevant countries. The official legal opinion of the United Nations Secretariat clearly states that \"Taiwan has no independent status as a province of China.\" It is illegal and invalid for individual countries to add various prefixes and suffixes to the one-China principle in an attempt to distort, blur, and hollow out the one-China principle. China firmly opposes this.\nThe meaning of the one-China principle is clear and unambiguous, that is, there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The application of the one-China principle is universal, unconditional and unquestionable. All countries that have established diplomatic relations with China and all UN member states should unconditionally abide by the one-China principle and UN General Assembly Resolution 2758. The actions of individual countries are actually a misinterpretation of the one-China principle. They are essentially challenging the basic principles of international law and the basic norms of international relations, as well as the post-World War II international order.\nIf people have no faith, they will not stand, and if a country has no faith, it will decline. We advise individual countries to read history carefully, abide by the solemn commitments made in black and white, and have a deep understanding of the dangers and harms of betrayal and promoting \"Taiwan independence\" forces. Any attempt to challenge the one-China principle, the international rule of law and the international order will inevitably be opposed by the international community and will never succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","We have noticed that the foreign ministers of Australia, the United States, and Japan issued a so-called joint statement on the situation in the Taiwan Strait and the Taiwan issue after the trilateral strategic dialogue. How does China view Australia's actions in the current atmosphere of China-Australia relations?","I just clarified China’s position on the so-called statement by the United States, Australia and Japan. Australia ignores objective facts and baselessly accuses China of legitimate, reasonable and lawful measures to safeguard sovereignty and territorial integrity, violates the purposes and principles of the United Nations Charter, grossly interferes in China's internal affairs, and undermines regional peace and stability. China firmly opposes this.\nIn recent years, China-Australia relations have encountered serious difficulties due to Australia's reasons, and the rights and wrongs are very clear. China's position on developing China-Australia relations is consistent and clear. The healthy and stable development of China-Australia relations is in line with the fundamental interests and common aspirations of the two peoples. We urge Australia to recognize the situation clearly, distinguish right from wrong, respect China's core interests and major concerns, abide by the one-China principle, abide by the basic norms of international relations, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, stop erroneous words and deeds that undermine regional peace and stability, not endorse or cooperate with individual countries' erroneous strategy of \"using Taiwan to contain China\", and not to create new obstacles to the development of China-Australia relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Secretary of State Blinken said ASEAN supports the US position on the Taiwan issue. Can you clarify whether ASEAN supports China's recent actions against Taiwan?","I would be happy to introduce you to some relevant information.\nASEAN foreign ministers issued a statement on the cross-strait situation, reiterating their adherence to the one-China principle.\nThe spokesperson of the Lao Ministry of Foreign Affairs issued a statement reiterating its consistent policy of supporting the one-China principle, believing that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China, opposing any attempts and actions to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\", and firmly supporting the Chinese government in peacefully achieving national reunification.\nCambodian Foreign Minister Prak Sokhon said that the recent actions of the United States have violated China's sovereignty, violated its commitments, aggravated tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and fully exposed its hegemonic behavior that is inconsistent with its words and deeds. Cambodia supports China in safeguarding its legitimate rights and interests and supports China in resolutely responding to the provocations of the United States.\nDuring the talks with State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi during the series of Foreign Ministers' Meetings on East Asia Cooperation, Singaporean Foreign Minister Vivian Balakrishnan said that Singapore has always clearly adhered to the one-China policy and opposed \"Taiwan independence\" and any unilateral actions to change the status quo.\nThe Malaysian Prime Minister's special envoy to China, Teo Hing Sin, issued a statement saying that he hopes that Western countries will not adopt double standards in viewing the Taiwan issue and the Ukraine issue. On the one hand, they condemn and contain Russia, and on the other hand, they interfere in other countries' internal affairs in the Taiwan Strait. This series of measures to interfere and infringe on the sovereignty of other countries in the name of \"defending democracy\" violates the basic principles of international law and has become a negative example.\nIn fact, not only ASEAN countries, but more than 170 countries in the international community have expressed their firm support for China's position on Taiwan-related issues in different ways. This is an overwhelming advantage compared with the United States and the few countries that support the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","The Prime Minister of St. Vincent and the Grenadines said in Taipei today that China's military exercises will not prevent him from visiting friends. What is your comment on this?","I have just made it clear that China's military exercises are open, transparent and professional, comply with domestic laws, international laws and international practices, and are designed to warn the perpetrators and punish \"Taiwan independence\" forces. The vast majority of countries in the international community generally understand and support this.\nAs for the remarks of relevant people you mentioned, I want to emphasize that there is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. No matter who plays what tricks in what name, this fact cannot be changed. Adhering to the one-China principle is an international imperative, the aspiration of the people, and the general trend. We believe that sooner or later the relevant countries will recognize the international trend and make decisions that are in line with the trend of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-08","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","On Friday, China announced the cancellation or suspension of communication and cooperation with the United States in multiple areas. In what areas do China and the United States continue to keep communication channels open?","Dialogue and communication require sincerity. China will continue to lodge stern representations with the United States regarding Pelosi's move to Taiwan, and urge the United States to seriously reflect on its mistakes, immediately correct its mistakes, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and stop playing the \"Taiwan card\" to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\" At present, it is especially necessary to stop confusing right and wrong, making accusations against others, escalating the situation and expanding the crisis, and abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués with practical actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347341.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-09","Wang Wenbin","Dragon TV reporter","State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi was invited to visit Mongolia on the 8th. Could the spokesperson introduce the details of this visit?","State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi has just concluded a successful visit to Mongolia. During the visit, State Councilor Wang Yi met with Mongolian President Khürelsukh, Prime Minister Oyun Erden and Chairman of the State Great Hural Zanden Shater respectively, and held talks with Mongolian Foreign Minister Battsege. The two sides conducted strategic communication and reached broad consensus on bilateral relations, practical cooperation, and international and regional issues of common concern.\nBoth sides believe that in the face of the current complex and ever-changing international and regional situation, China and Mongolia share a common destiny and an interconnected future. The two sides are willing to promote the in-depth integration of the \"One Belt, One Road\" initiative and Mongolia's \"Steppe Road\", the global development initiative and Mongolia's \"New Revitalization Policy\", and China's \"two-step\" development strategic goals and Mongolia's long-term development vision, so as to create three major engines for the development of bilateral relations. The two sides reaffirmed their respect for each other's independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity, and continued to firmly support each other on issues involving each other's core interests. China supports Mongolia in maintaining stability, focusing on development, and exploring a development path that suits its national conditions. China appreciates Mongolia's reaffirmation of its firm commitment to the one-China principle and its opposition to interference in China's internal affairs in Taiwan, Tibet, Xinjiang, Hong Kong and other affairs. The two sides agreed to strengthen border cooperation, promote the opening of ports as much as possible, connect railways and highways as much as possible, and ensure the stability and smoothness of industrial and supply chains. The signing of a memorandum of understanding on the cross-border railway connection plan at Ganqimaodu Port by the two sides will play an important role in helping Mongolia expand its opening up and achieve strong growth. The two sides agreed to promote cooperation in the fields of economy, trade, investment, mining energy, science and technology, agriculture and animal husbandry, build major demonstration projects such as infrastructure and energy, and strive to achieve coordinated development and common prosperity between the two countries. The two sides agreed to coordinate and promote the Erdenburen Hydropower Station project and speed up the solution to the electricity problem of people in western Mongolia. Support the implementation of livelihood projects such as shanty town renovation, sewage treatment plants, and meat product processing plants as soon as possible to better benefit the Mongolian people. The two sides will strengthen cooperation in the fields of afforestation and combating desertification. China appreciates Mongolia's \"Planting a Billion Trees\" plan. China has also proposed to plant 70 billion trees within ten years. China is willing to support each other, green our common home, and protect the green land and blue sky. Both sides agreed to continue anti-epidemic cooperation to protect people's lives and safety. Increase direct flights between the two countries to facilitate personnel exchanges. Support Mongolian students studying in China to return to China and resume classes as soon as possible. Strengthen youth exchanges and local cooperation to consolidate public opinion on China-Mongolia friendship. The two sides agreed to strengthen coordination in international and regional affairs, adhere to true multilateralism and open regionalism, promote the implementation of global development initiatives and global security initiatives, safeguard the common interests of developing countries, work together to promote the development and prosperity of Asia, and jointly build a community with a shared future for mankind.\nChina and Mongolia are good neighbors, good brothers who share weal and woe, and good partners who share weal and woe. China is willing to take this visit as an opportunity to work with Mongolia to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, jointly promote mutually beneficial and friendly cooperation, and better achieve common development and common prosperity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347342.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-09","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Taiwan’s Joseph Wu said that China used Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan as an excuse to carry out “aggressive military exercises.” What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this? In addition, the Chinese military announced today that it will continue to conduct military exercises in the waters around Taiwan. How long will the new military exercises last? Will this become the new normal?","China's countermeasures against Pelosi's visit to Taiwan are completely legitimate, reasonable, and legal. They serve as a warning to provocateurs and a punishment to \"Taiwan independence\" forces.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. This is the real fact and current situation in the Taiwan Strait. The Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities and \"Taiwan independence\" die-hards have confused right and wrong and confused the public, once again exposing their separatist nature of seeking \"independence\".\nWhat I want to emphasize is that realizing the complete reunification of the motherland is the common will of all Chinese people and is an unstoppable historical trend. No matter whether the DPP authorities and the \"Taiwan independence\" forces play the \"America card\" or any other card, they will not be able to save the \"Taiwan independence\" forces from their fate of failure. Their lies and provocations are like worms shaking a tree and will only accelerate their own destruction.\nAs for the relevant situation of China's military training you mentioned, I explained it yesterday. I would like to reiterate once again that China carries out normal military training activities in the waters surrounding its own territory, which are open, transparent and professional, and relevant departments have issued announcements in a timely manner. This is in line with domestic law, international law, and international practice. It is not only a warning to provocateurs, but also a legitimate move to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. As for whether this will become the new normal that you are concerned about, please check with the Chinese competent authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347342.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-09","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","First question, Taiwan carried out artillery drills today and Thursday. Does China plan to take more countermeasures in response? Second question, does China believe that the negotiations on the resumption of compliance with the Iranian nuclear issue held in Vienna will soon achieve a breakthrough?","The current tensions across the Taiwan Strait are caused by the fact that the Democratic Progressive Party authorities, in collusion with external forces, continue to pursue \"independence\" provocations, refuse to agree with the one-China principle, and attempt to change the status quo that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. We are telling the Taiwan authorities that any attempt to go against the historical trend and \"reject reunification by force\" will be opposed by the entire Chinese people. It is doomed to be a mantis trying to control the chariot and will only end in failure.\nRegarding your second question, with the joint efforts of all parties, negotiations on the resumption of compliance with the Comprehensive Plan of Action on the Iranian Nuclear Issue were recently restarted in Vienna. Although the negotiations failed to achieve a breakthrough, all parties clearly expressed their willingness to reach an agreement, which is of great significance for ensuring that the Iranian nuclear issue develops along the right track of dialogue and negotiation. China appreciates the EU's efforts in promoting negotiations and encourages the EU to continue to carry out diplomatic mediation.\nAt present, all parties have reached consensus on most of the arrangements for the resumption of performance of the comprehensive agreement, and only individual issues require further negotiation and resolution. We call on all parties to adhere to the general direction of dialogue and negotiation, increase diplomatic efforts, and actively seek solutions to outstanding issues. As the initiator of the Iranian nuclear crisis, the United States should recognize the situation clearly, make political decisions as soon as possible, actively respond to Iran's reasonable concerns, and promote early results in negotiations. All parties should be careful in their words and deeds to create a good atmosphere for negotiations.\nChina will continue to actively participate in negotiations and contribute to bringing the comprehensive agreement back on track. At the same time, we will also firmly safeguard our legitimate rights and interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347342.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-10","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Recently, US Secretary of State Blinken and Presidential Special Envoy for Climate Issues John Kerry respectively stated that China’s decision to suspend Sino-US climate change negotiations is not to punish the United States, but to punish the world. What is China’s comment on this?","China has noted the relevant stance of the United States. I would like to emphasize three points here:\nFirst, China’s relevant measures are legitimate and reasonable countermeasures against Pelosi’s attempt to infiltrate Taiwan. For some time, China has repeatedly emphasized to the United States that the one-China principle is the political basis for China to develop bilateral relations with other countries. Speaker Pelosi ignored China's strong opposition and insisted on visiting Taiwan, seriously infringing on China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. This actually happened with the connivance and support of the US government. It has damaged the political foundation of China-US relations and is bound to cause major disruption to exchanges and cooperation between the two sides. The United States should not be surprised if China puts its word first and does what it says.\nSecond, due to the serious impact of Pelosi's move to Taiwan, China has suspended bilateral climate change negotiations between China and the United States. All consequences must be borne by the United States. As a responsible major country, China will, as always, actively participate in international and multilateral cooperation to address climate change. China has always been an activist and practitioner in global climate governance. We have solemnly announced that we will strive to achieve carbon peak before 2030 and achieve carbon neutrality before 2060. We are working hard to build and implement a dual-carbon \"1+N\" policy system to promote low-carbon development and green transformation. China will continue to unswervingly advance its carbon peak and carbon neutrality goal, actively participate in negotiations on major channels for climate change, provide support and assistance to developing countries to the best of its ability, and make its own contribution to addressing the global challenge of climate change.\nThird, the United States should earnestly shoulder its historical responsibilities and obligations in the field of climate change. China has always maintained that addressing climate change cannot be a matter of “just slogans but no efforts.” The U.S. Supreme Court recently passed a ruling limiting the EPA's power to regulate greenhouse gas emissions. The United States also uses the so-called Xinjiang-related issues as an excuse to sanction and suppress Chinese photovoltaic companies, which directly damages the atmosphere of Sino-US climate cooperation and directly damages the efforts of China and other countries to deal with climate change. This contradictory approach has made the outside world question the United States' ability and determination to deal with climate change. The United States should conscientiously fulfill its historical responsibilities and obligations in addressing climate change and stop looking for excuses for its inaction.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347343.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-10","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Are the Chinese military’s military exercises in the sea and airspace around Taiwan still ongoing or have they ended?","We have clearly stated that China’s military exercises in the waters surrounding its territory are legitimate, reasonable and legal. They serve as a warning to provocateurs and a punishment to \"Taiwan independence\" forces. As for the specific issues you are concerned about, please ask the Chinese military.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347343.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-10","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Hong Kong China Review News","According to reports, US House Speaker Pelosi said in an interview that she did not understand why the visit of US congressmen to Taiwan a few months ago had no impact, but her visit has attracted great attention from China. The United States should not allow China to isolate Taiwan. What is China’s comment on this?","We have always opposed visits by U.S. congressmen to Taiwan. Pelosi is the third-ranked politician in the United States. She flew to Taiwan on a U.S. military plane. During her trip to Taiwan, she kept talking about representing the United States, claiming that it was an official visit. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities even promoted Pelosi's trip to Taiwan as a major breakthrough in Taiwan-U.S. relations. All these fully demonstrate that seeking to cross Taiwan is a major political provocation to escalate U.S.-Taiwan exchanges. It violates the U.S. commitment in the \"Communique on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and the United States\" to only \"maintain unofficial relations with Taiwan.\" It violates the one-China principle widely recognized by the international community and confirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, and violates the international law of non-interference in internal affairs established by the United Nations Charter.\nMore than four months ago, China had repeatedly expressed its solemn position to the United States through various channels and at all levels to firmly oppose Pelosi's attempt to infiltrate Taiwan. However, the United States ignored China's dissuasion and warnings and persisted in going its own way. It was the United States that violated its commitments, not China. It was the United States that violated China's sovereignty, not China's violation of U.S. sovereignty. It was the United States that condoned and supported \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, rather than China that condoned and supported the United States' separatist activities. The US provokes trouble first, and China takes legitimate countermeasures later, which are reasonable, legal, necessary and appropriate.\nThe United States has gone further and further on the road of hollowing out, hollowing out, and distorting the one-China principle, but it accuses China of changing the status quo. The United States conducts hundreds of military exercises in waters surrounding China every year, but it accuses China of overreacting. China will not accept this gangster logic, nor will the international community recognize it.\nAs for the serious provocation of the United States that violates China's sovereignty and interferes in China's internal affairs, as long as the United States does it once, China will resolutely fight against it and will never allow China's sovereignty and territorial integrity to be wantonly trampled on and destroyed.\nIf the United States really wants to abide by international law and safeguard the sovereignty and territorial integrity of all countries as it says, it should return to the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués. It should not act rashly or go all the way. It should give up the idea of ​​\"using Taiwan to contain China\" as soon as possible and do more serious and practical things for the stable development of China-U.S. relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347343.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-11","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","According to reports, Lithuania’s Deputy Minister of Transport and Communications Vaichukeviciut led a delegation to Taiwan on August 7 for a five-day visit. What is China’s comment on this?","We strongly condemn the Lithuanian anti-China forces’ deliberate infringement of China’s sovereignty and gross interference in China’s internal affairs. The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the political basis for the development of bilateral relations between China and all countries, including Lithuania. The joint communiqué on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Lithuania clearly stated: The Lithuanian government recognizes the government of the People's Republic of China as the only legitimate government of China, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Lithuanian government has promised not to establish official relations or conduct official exchanges with Taiwan. But Li Fang has repeatedly broken its promises, which is a blatant breach of trust.\nChina will resolutely fight back against the egregious provocations made by relevant people from the Lithuanian side that challenge the one-China principle and undermine China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. We urge relevant personnel from the Cubic side not to continue to act as pawns for \"Taiwan independence\" and anti-China forces, let alone go further down the wrong path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347344.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-11","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Yesterday morning, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and the State Council Information Office released a white paper on the \"Taiwan Issue and the Cause of China's Reunification in the New Era.\" What is the spokesperson of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Yesterday morning, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and the Information Office of the State Council jointly released a white paper on the \"Taiwan Issue and the Cause of China's Reunification in the New Era.\" The white paper comprehensively and systematically expounds the policies and propositions of the Communist Party of China and the Chinese government in promoting the reunification of the motherland in the new era. It fully demonstrates the firm will and determination of the Communist Party of China and the Chinese people to pursue the reunification of the motherland. It is believed to help people from all walks of life at home and abroad fully and accurately understand the Chinese government's position on the Taiwan issue. Here, I would like to emphasize the following points:\nFirst, Taiwan is a part of China that cannot be doubted or changed. There is only one China in the world. Taiwan has belonged to China since ancient times. In 1895, Japan forced the Qing government to cede Taiwan through its war of aggression against China. The 1943 Cairo Declaration clearly stipulated that Taiwan and other Chinese territories stolen by Japan should be returned to China. The 1945 Potsdam Proclamation reiterated that the conditions of the Cairo Declaration will be implemented. On October 25, 1945, the Chinese government announced that it would \"restore the exercise of sovereignty over Taiwan\" and China recovered Taiwan legally and de facto. In 1949, the People's Republic of China was established, replacing the government of the Republic of China and becoming the only legal government representing all of China. This is a regime change without any change in China, the subject of international law, and China's sovereignty and inherent territorial boundaries have not changed. Although the two sides of the Taiwan Strait have fallen into a special state of long-term political confrontation, China's sovereignty and territory have never been divided and will never be allowed to be divided. Taiwan's status as part of China's territory has never been changed and will never be allowed to be changed. This effectively counters the fallacy of the so-called \"Taiwan's status is uncertain\" and effectively refutes various \"Taiwan independence\" historical views and lies.\nSecond, the Communist Party of China and the Chinese government remain consistent in their stance of firmly promoting the complete reunification of the motherland. Solving the Taiwan issue and realizing the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese people and an unswerving historical mission of the Communist Party of China. \"Peaceful reunification, one country, two systems\" is our basic policy for solving the Taiwan issue. Achieving the reunification of the motherland through peaceful means best serves the overall interests of the Chinese nation, including Taiwan compatriots, and is the first choice of the Communist Party of China and the Chinese government to resolve the Taiwan issue. We are willing to create broad space for peaceful reunification, but we will never leave any room for various forms of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. We are willing to continue to strive for peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and our best efforts. If \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces or external interference forces provoke and coerce us, or even break the red line, we will have to take drastic measures. This clearly answers the international community's questions about what is the basic policy of the Taiwan issue, and shatters any illusions of \"Taiwan independence\" forces and external intervention forces trying to split China.\nThird, the one-China principle does not tolerate any distortion or challenge. The meaning of the one-China principle is clear and unambiguous, that is, there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a recognized basic norm of international relations. It was confirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 in 1971 and is the political basis for China's interactions with all countries. 181 countries in the world have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle, which fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is an international imperative, the aspiration of the people, and the general trend. Recently, in response to Speaker of the House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi's visit to Taiwan, more than 170 countries and multiple international organizations reaffirmed their firm adherence to the one-China principle, once again making a common voice for justice from the international community.\nFourth, the historical process of complete reunification of the motherland is unstoppable. National reunification is a historical necessity for the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. Achieving peaceful cross-Strait reunification is not only a blessing for the Chinese nation and people, but also a blessing for the international community and people around the world. We call on the international community to correctly understand the Taiwan issue, support China's reunification cause, more firmly safeguard the one-China principle, and unequivocally oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" The root cause of the current tense situation across the Taiwan Strait is that the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are trying to \"rely on the United States to seek independence,\" while some forces in the United States are trying to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\" This kind of behavior is very dangerous and is playing with fire. Those who play with fire will burn themselves. We urge relevant countries to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, properly handle Taiwan-related issues, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, stop saying one thing and doing another, and fulfill their commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence\" with concrete actions. There is no way out for \"coercing foreign countries to seek independence\", and \"using Taiwan to control China\" is doomed to failure. Anyone or any force who attempts to interfere in China's internal affairs and obstruct China's great cause of reunification will surely be beaten to death in front of the Great Wall of Steel built with the flesh and blood of more than 1.4 billion Chinese people!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347344.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-11","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The Taiwan authorities responded to the white paper \"Taiwan Issue and China's Unification in the New Era\" published by the mainland, saying that China is trying its best to create a new normal that \"terrorizes the people of Taiwan.\" In addition, Taiwan held a live-fire exercise today. What's your response to that?","Tsai Ing-wen and the Democratic Progressive Party authorities confuse right and wrong and confuse the public, which once again exposed their separatist nature of seeking \"independence\". What I want to emphasize is that realizing the complete reunification of the motherland is the common will of all Chinese people and is an unstoppable historical trend. We are willing to create broad space for peaceful reunification, but we will never leave any room for various forms of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.\nWe are telling the Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities that colluding with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations will ultimately only accelerate their own destruction and push Taiwan into the abyss of disaster. It is absolutely impossible to pursue \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and betraying the interests of the country and the nation will result in complete failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347344.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-11","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","U.S. Commerce Secretary Raimondo said in an interview with Bloomberg that President Biden is taking a very cautious approach to the U.S. tariffs imposed on China during the Trump administration and is weighing various options. The issue has become more complicated due to the visit of U.S. House Speaker Nancy Pelosi to Taiwan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","We have pointed out many times that there is no winner in a trade war. The U.S.'s unilateral increase in tariffs is not good for the United States, not good for China, and not good for the world. It is good for the United States, good for China, and good for the world to cancel all additional tariffs on China as soon as possible.\nThe causes and consequences of the current tensions across the Taiwan Strait are clear, the rights and wrongs are clear, and the United States is the active provocateur and crisis creator. The United States should truly recognize the egregious nature of Pelosi's attempt to infiltrate Taiwan, deeply reflect on the serious consequences caused by this, and immediately correct its mistakes. The United States should not expect China to trade its core interests, but should honestly return to the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347344.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-11","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, British Foreign Secretary Truss said on the 10th that the UK and its partners have expressed the strongest condemnation of China’s escalating actions in the Taiwan Strait through the G7 foreign ministers’ statement and other forms. China's words and deeds threaten regional peace and stability. The UK urges China to resolve differences peacefully and avoid threats, use of force and coercion.…","The British side ignores the facts, confuses right and wrong, and makes irresponsible remarks on China's legitimate, necessary and legal actions to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China is strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to this, and has lodged stern representations with the British side.\nEverything has a cause and effect. The United States is the active provocateur and crisis creator, while the Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities \"rely on the United States and seek independence.\" China's safeguarding of territorial integrity and opposition to national separatism are legitimate, lawful and justified. The UK turns a blind eye to the provocations and infringements of the United States, but accuses China of counterattacking to safeguard justice. This is a typical double standard and fully exposes the hypocrisy of the British old imperialism. If the UK really cares about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, it should condemn the United States and \"Taiwan independence\" forces and prevent them from provoking \"playing with fire.\" I would like to ask if internal and external collusion and territorial division occur in Scotland, UK, can the UK remain calm and restrained and allow the \"status quo\" to deteriorate?\nThere is right and wrong in everything. Justice should be upheld and justice should be upheld. If black and white can be reversed, why do we want to create a \"global Britain\"? The United Kingdom follows its own example and colludes with a small group of countries to help. Its credibility as an independent country has long been bankrupt and collapsed, and its so-called \"diplomatic ambitions\" are out of the question. Compared with more than 170 countries and multiple international organizations that have publicly expressed support for China's legitimate rights protection measures, the statement by the UK and the foreign ministers of the G7 has been completely drowned out.\nThe Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs, and cross-strait reunification is a historical trend that will surely be realized in the process of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. No force can stop China's reunification, and any words or deeds that support \"Taiwan independence\" forces will be destined to be swept into the garbage dump of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347344.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-12","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives Nancy Pelosi and other U.S. congressmen participating in their trip to Asia held a press conference a few days ago. Pei said that Taiwan is one of the freest \"countries\" in the world. This visit is related to Taiwan's democracy, is in line with the US government's one-China policy, and does not seek to change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. What is China’s…","Pelosi’s remarks further prove that her visit to China’s Taiwan region is connivance and support for the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. Pelosi's blatant reference to Taiwan as a \"country\" is a serious political provocation that violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities are pursuing \"de-Chinaization\" and \"gradual Taiwan independence\" on the island, and are doing their best to create \"two Chinas\" and \"one China, one Taiwan\" internationally. Under such circumstances, Pelosi went to Taiwan and made a high-profile claim to represent the United States. It was obviously an official visit, aimed at provoking cross-strait confrontation and interfering in China's internal affairs. It was of extremely bad nature. Starting from safeguarding its own sovereignty and territorial integrity, from safeguarding the basic norm of international relations of non-interference in internal affairs, and from truly safeguarding peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, China has every right and necessity to resolutely counterattack the US provocation.\nIt is completely in vain for Pelosi to use the so-called democracy as a cover to make excuses for her visit to Taiwan. Pelosi's move to Taiwan has nothing to do with democracy, but a political show that goes against the will of more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots, and challenges the one-China principle recognized by the international community. It is a trampling on democracy and a manifestation of the United States' selfish interests above international justice. If Pelosi really cares about democracy and human rights, she should visit Afghanistan, Iraq, Syria, and Libya, express repentance to the hundreds of thousands of innocent people who died under US military fire, and vow to never let the United States' wanton violations of the United Nations Charter and international relations norms be repeated again.\nChina will work with friends from all countries who love peace and uphold justice to resolutely oppose all words and deeds that interfere in other countries' internal affairs, resolutely resist all adventurous moves that undermine regional peace, jointly defend the purposes and principles of the United Nations Charter, and jointly maintain regional stability and world peace.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347345.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-12","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","Recently, Gupta, director of the White House Office of National Drug Control Policy, tweeted about China’s countermeasures against Pelosi’s attempt to sneak into Taiwan, saying that drug overdose causes 100,000 lives lost in the United States every year, and it is “unacceptable” for China to suspend Sino-US anti-drug cooperation. What is China’s comment on this?","Pelosi ignored China's solemn warnings and repeated representations and insisted on visiting Taiwan, which seriously affected the political foundation of China-US relations. China's announcement of eight countermeasures, including the suspension of Sino-US anti-drug cooperation, is a resolute and forceful response to the provocation of the United States and Taiwan. It is completely reasonable, appropriate and proportionate. Regarding the problem of fentanyl abuse in the United States, I would like to emphasize three points:\nFirst of all, the root cause of the fentanyl abuse crisis in the United States lies in the United States itself. The international community, including China, has increasingly tightened controls on fentanyl-like substances. However, the abuse of fentanyl-like synthetic opioids in the United States continues to worsen, and the number of overdose deaths has increased instead of falling. The reasons for this are worth pondering by the United States. According to statistics from the International Narcotics Control Board, the United States is the world's largest producer and consumer of fentanyl drugs. Americans, who account for 5% of the world's population, consume 80% of the world's opioids. The U.S. government has lost control of prescription drugs, has not adequately publicized the dangers of drugs, has failed to take measures to reduce drug demand, and has had poor anti-drug effects. The United States must face up to its own problems and cannot hide its problems and avoid medical treatment.\nSecond, China has made tremendous efforts to help the United States solve the fentanyl issue. The problem of fentanyl is not prominent in China, and it has never been abused on a large scale. China has always adopted a humanitarian and responsible attitude to help the United States solve the fentanyl abuse crisis and work with other countries in the world to deal with new challenges on the drug issue. There are 27 fentanyl-like substances controlled in the United Nations Convention on Drug Control. China is the first in the world to implement full category control of fentanyl-like substances, and the controlled varieties far exceed the scope of the United Nations Convention. However, as the country with the most prominent fentanyl problem in the world, the United States has yet to officially list all fentanyl substances. China has shown sufficient goodwill and sincerity to carry out extraordinary cooperation with the United States, which is unprecedented in China's routine practice of drug control. It has not only played an important role in preventing the illegal production, trafficking and abuse of fentanyl-like substances, but also set a model for international anti-drug cooperation and has been fully recognized by the international community.\nThird, the responsibility for undermining Sino-US anti-drug cooperation lies entirely with the United States. Citing the so-called human rights issues in Xinjiang, the United States has included the Physical Evidence Identification Center of the Ministry of Public Security, the National Drug Laboratory and other scientific research institutions responsible for the detection and control of fentanyl-like substances on the \"Entity List\" for more than two years, and it has not yet been lifted. The United States continues to publicly make negative and false remarks, repeatedly stir up old cases, use fentanyl as a reason to sanction Chinese companies, and offers high rewards for the arrest of Chinese citizens. It misleads the public, places blame on others, and deflects responsibility for the poor domestic drug abuse control. China has made representations to the U.S. on many occasions, but the U.S. has yet to provide feedback. The consequences of damaging relations between the two countries and undermining Sino-US anti-drug cooperation should be borne entirely by the United States.\nChina's stance on strict drug control is firm. Against the background of the continued spread of the global drug situation, China's drug control has achieved remarkable results. As a responsible major country, China will, as always, actively participate in international and multilateral anti-drug cooperation and contribute Chinese wisdom and strength to global drug governance. We also sincerely hope that the United States will effectively resolve the fentanyl abuse crisis as soon as possible and that the American people will be free from the harm of drugs as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347345.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-15","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","Today is \"8·15\", the day Japan was defeated in the war, and it is also a special day in China-Japan relations. Today Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida offered incense money to the Yasukuni Shrine. In the past two days, some cabinet members also visited the Yasukuni Shrine. What is China’s comment on this?","The Yasukuni Shrine is the spiritual tool and symbol of Japanese militarism’s war of aggression against foreign countries. It enshrines Class A war criminals of World War II. The negative movements of Japanese politicians involving the Yasukuni Shrine once again reflect Japan's wrong attitude towards historical issues. China has made solemn representations to Japan through diplomatic channels and expressed its solemn position.\nToday is the 77th anniversary of Japan's defeat and announcement of unconditional surrender. 77 years ago, the Chinese people, together with the people of the world, defeated the Japanese militarist invaders and fascism, and achieved great victory over justice over evil, light over darkness, and progress over reaction. This great victory will forever be engraved in the annals of the just cause of the Chinese nation and mankind.\nFacing history and introspecting deeply are necessary prerequisites for Japan to resume and develop normal relations with its Asian neighbors after the war. For some time, some Japanese politicians have frequently distorted and glorified the history of aggression in various ways, openly violating important legal documents such as the Cairo Declaration, which clearly stipulates the return of Taiwan to China. This is a serious provocation to the victory of the World Anti-Fascist War and the post-war international order, and all peace-loving and justice-minded people will not agree to it. Those who reverse history will surely go astray again. Only by adhering to the path of peaceful development can Japan find its correct position. China urges Japan to conscientiously learn lessons from history, completely break away from militarism, and avoid further breaking trust with its Asian neighbors and the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347346.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-15","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","US Senator Markey arrived in Taipei for a visit on Sunday, led by a delegation of congressmen. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","US Senator Markey and his delegation ignored China's solemn representations and firm opposition and insisted on visiting the Taiwan region of China. They blatantly violated the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, violated China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sent a serious wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nThe one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is also the political basis for the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the United States and the development of bilateral relations. The realization of China's reunification is an unstoppable historical trend and an indestructible common will of the Chinese people.\nChina once again urges the United States to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, and stop going further down the wrong path of hollowing out, hollowing out, and distorting the one-China principle, so as to avoid further damage to China-U.S. relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute and powerful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. A small number of politicians in the United States collude with the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and attempt to challenge the one-China principle. They overestimate their own capabilities and are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347346.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-16","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","Taiwan Air Force officials said on Monday that the video released by China's Eastern Theater Command showing Chinese military aircraft approaching the Penghu Islands was too exaggerated. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Regarding the specific issues you mentioned, I suggest you check with the Ministry of National Defense of China. What I want to tell you is that the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces will feel the firm measures we have taken to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347347.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-16","Wang Wenbin","\"People's Daily\" reporter","According to reports, on August 15, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi met by video with envoys from developing countries in Asia and Africa stationed in Geneva who were visiting China. Can the spokesperson give more information?","At the invitation of China, the permanent diplomatic missions of developing countries in Asia and Africa, including Sierra Leone, Lesotho, Eritrea, Cote d'Ivoire, Zimbabwe, Iraq, Gambia, Somalia, Cameroon and Laos, will visit China in Geneva in the near future and will also visit Guangdong and Xinjiang. Yesterday, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi held a video meeting with them.\nState Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said that President Xi Jinping made a special trip to the United Nations Headquarters in Geneva in 2017 and delivered a historic speech, comprehensively expounding the goals and connotations of building a community with a shared future for mankind, and pointing out the direction of joint efforts for the progress of human civilization and world peace and development. China is willing to uphold the concept of a community with a shared future for mankind and work together with developing countries to achieve common development and common prosperity.\nState Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi introduced China's achievements in the development of human rights, saying that China is willing to carry out human rights exchanges and cooperation with other countries on the basis of equality and mutual respect and with an open attitude, so as to learn from each other and make progress together. State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi put forward four suggestions on strengthening global human rights governance and improving the work of multilateral human rights institutions. First, insist on mutual respect and oppose imposition on others. Countries have different national conditions, histories and cultures. They must proceed from their own realities and explore human rights development paths that meet the needs of their people. They must not impose their will and standards on other countries. The second is to insist on systematic advancement and oppose selection and neglect. For developing countries, the rights to survival and development are the most urgent needs of the people. Multilateral human rights institutions should pay attention to the reasonable demands of developing countries and further increase their attention and investment in economic, social and cultural rights and the right to development. The third is to adhere to openness and inclusiveness and oppose interference in internal affairs. Claiming that \"human rights are higher than sovereignty\" is essentially an attempt to interfere in other countries' internal affairs; pursuing so-called \"values ​​diplomacy\" is actually forcing countries to choose sides under the guise of human rights; forcing so-called \"democratic transformation\" has resulted in turmoil, conflicts and humanitarian disasters. Multilateral human rights institutions should become a platform for constructive exchanges and cooperation among all parties, rather than a battlefield for political confrontation. The fourth is to uphold fairness and justice and oppose double standards. Some Western countries are keen to be human rights \"judges\", using their flashlights to shine a light on others but not themselves. They point fingers at the human rights situation in developing countries and turn a blind eye to the human rights misdeeds of their own countries and their allies. We must jointly reject this double standard and resist this practice of selective blindness.\nIn the video meeting, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi elaborated on the historical merits of the Taiwan issue and China's solemn stance, emphasizing that China must make necessary and legitimate responses to every blatant provocation launched by the United States. This is exercising its legitimate rights to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and upholding the principle of non-interference in internal affairs, the \"golden rule\" for state-to-state relations and the \"magic weapon\" for developing countries to live in peace and contentment.\nEnvoys from developing countries in Asia and Africa stated that the one-China principle established in UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is the consensus of the international community and is also the political basis for countries to develop bilateral relations with China. Taiwan and Xinjiang are both parts of China. China's internal affairs must not be interfered with, and human rights issues should not be politicized. China's legitimate rights protection measures deserve firm support from the international community. The envoys fully affirmed China's achievements and leadership, looked forward to extensive exchanges with various departments in China, and were willing to maintain bilateral friendly relations with China, strengthen multilateral cooperation, and enhance the welfare of all mankind.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347347.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-17","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","On the 16th, Putin attended the 10th Moscow International Security Conference and delivered a speech, criticizing Pelosi’s move to Taiwan not just as a reckless act by an irresponsible politician, but as a well-planned provocation. This is part of the U.S. strategy of deliberately undermining regional and world stability and seeking to create chaos. It is an arrogant manifestation of the U.S. not respecting the…","China speaks highly of President Putin’s remarks. Since Pelosi, the Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives, came to Taiwan, more than 170 countries have made voices of justice, reaffirming their adherence to the one-China principle and supporting China in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. President Putin's latest statement you mentioned is a reflection of the high-level strategic coordination between China and Russia, as well as the two countries' consistent and firm support for each other on issues involving each other's core interests. China is willing to continue to work with the international community to jointly defend the purposes and principles of the United Nations Charter and jointly safeguard regional and world peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347348.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-18","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Regarding the Hong Kong and Taiwanese missing and imprisoned in Myanmar. According to TVBS, more than 6,000 Taiwanese people were deceived in Myanmar, and more than 2,000 of them are still imprisoned. The Hong Kong SAR government recently stated that five Hong Kong people were also caught in a similar scam in Myanmar and their current whereabouts are unknown. What is China’s comment on this? Have relevant…","The Chinese government attaches great importance to consular protection and makes every effort to safeguard the safety and legitimate rights and interests of overseas Chinese citizens, including Hong Kong compatriots and Taiwan compatriots. Chinese embassies and consulates in relevant countries are maintaining close communication with the governments of the host countries and actively searching for and rescuing relevant personnel.\nAt the same time, we once again remind Chinese citizens to be wary of false recruitment information on overseas networks, strictly abide by laws and regulations, ensure personal safety, and promptly report fraud and gambling-related information. In case of emergency, please report to the local police in time and contact the Chinese embassy or consulate in the local area.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347349.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-18","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","The Office of the United States Trade Representative issued a statement saying that the United States and Taiwan will launch formal negotiations on economic and trade initiatives, and the first round of talks is expected to be held early this fall. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on the US-Taiwan economic and trade initiative?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory, and the government of the People’s Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The one-China principle is the prerequisite for China's Taiwan region to participate in foreign economic cooperation. China has always opposed any country's negotiation and signing of any economic and trade agreement with sovereign connotations and official nature with the Taiwan region of China. We require the U.S. side to take concrete actions to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, stop any form of official exchanges between the U.S. and Taiwan, refrain from negotiating with China's Taiwan region on agreements with sovereign connotations and official nature, refrain from sending any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in the name of economic and trade, and refrain from making the same mistakes again and again. China will take resolute measures to defend its sovereignty and territorial integrity and advises the United States not to misjudge.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347349.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-18","Wang Wenbin","Shenzhen TV reporter","According to media reports, during the ninth high-level political dialogue between China and Japan held yesterday, Japan stated its position on the situation in the Taiwan Strait. Japan said that China’s military exercises involved Japan’s “exclusive economic zone” and emphasized the importance of peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory. The Taiwan issue concerns China's core interests and is entirely China's internal affairs. Its historical latitude and longitude are clear, and the fact and current situation that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China are clear. The Chinese government has officially released the white paper \"The Taiwan Question and the Cause of China's Reunification in the New Era\", which comprehensively explains the historical merits and policy propositions of the Taiwan question, and demonstrates the firm will and determination of the Communist Party of China and the Chinese people to pursue the reunification of the motherland.\nFor some time now, Japan has frequently made negative moves related to Taiwan. Some people in Japan have clamored that \"if something happens to Taiwan, something happens to Japan.\" This misunderstanding undoubtedly sends a very dangerous and wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" forces. After Pelosi visited Taiwan, more than 170 countries and many international organizations have issued righteous voices, reaffirming their adherence to the one-China principle and supporting China in resolutely safeguarding its sovereignty and territorial integrity. However, Japan confuses right and wrong, supports the wrong actions of the United States, makes unreasonable accusations and discredits China, and grossly interferes in China's internal affairs. China has stated its solemn position to Japan on many occasions.\nThe Taiwan issue is related to the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries. It cannot be wavered in the slightest ambiguity, let alone any provocation to cross the line. Japan has made serious political commitments to China on many occasions. \"If the foundation is not strong, the ground will be shaken.\" Japan should be aware of the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue and deeply understand the dangers and harms of promoting \"Taiwan independence\" forces. We urge Japan to learn lessons from history and abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments made so far.\nChina and Japan have not yet demarcated boundaries in the waters east of Taiwan, and China does not accept the so-called \"Japan's exclusive economic zone.\" The Chinese military has carried out a series of military training activities in the waters near Taiwan Island, which are necessary and legitimate measures to counter the major provocations of the United States and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China has issued safety reminders and navigation warnings in advance, and the relevant practices are fully in line with international law and international practice. We hope that the Japanese side will truly abide by the one-China principle to the letter and be consistent in its words and deeds, and do more things that are conducive to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347349.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-19","Wang Wenbin","The Paper","We noticed that the coordinators’ meeting for the implementation of the outcomes of the 8th Ministerial Conference of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation was successfully held via video yesterday. Can you introduce the meeting and the results achieved?","Yesterday, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi chaired the Coordinators’ Meeting for the Implementation of the Outcomes of the Eighth Ministerial Conference of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation via video link in Beijing. The meeting was attended by Foreign Minister Aishata of Senegal, the African co-chair of the Forum, as well as previous African chairs of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation, representatives of various African sub-regions, representatives of the African Union Commission, and envoys of African countries stationed in China. This meeting was held under the changing international situation and at a time when global challenges are emerging one after another. Following the Eighth Ministerial Conference of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation in November last year, China and Africa once again joined hands to send a strong message of the times to the international community to strengthen unity and cooperation, focus on win-win development, and safeguard fairness and justice.\nThe atmosphere of this meeting was friendly, pragmatic and efficient. The two sides fully exchanged views and reached important consensus on fully implementing the outcomes of the Eighth Ministerial Conference of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation and further promoting China-Africa friendly cooperation. At the meeting, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi put forward five suggestions for China and Africa to unite more closely and truly build a China-Africa community with a shared future in the new era: adhere to authenticity, affinity and good faith, and strengthen unity and mutual assistance; adhere to down-to-earth and commit to common development; adhere to independence and self-reliance to jointly promote regional peace; persist in inheriting friendship and promoting people-to-people connectivity; adhere to openness and win-win and promote the healthy development of international cooperation with Africa. China's active efforts to promote the implementation of the outcomes of the conference and the important progress it has made have been highly praised by African representatives and African envoys in China. African representatives such as Senegalese Foreign Minister Aishata, Angolan Foreign Minister Antonio, Congolese Industry Minister Paluku, Egyptian Foreign Minister Shoukry, Ethiopian Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Demeke, Libyan Deputy Foreign Minister Kaiti, South African Deputy Foreign Minister Dlamini, African Union Commission Vice Chairman Monique and other African representatives highly appreciated President Xi Jinping’s proposal of building a new era of China. The African Community of a Shared Future Initiative and the \"Nine Projects\" for cooperation with Africa, thank China for its important role in helping African countries cope with the food crisis, energy crisis and COVID-19 epidemic. We look forward to working with China to continue to strengthen the construction of the forum mechanism, deeply align the development strategies of African countries with the \"Belt and Road\" initiative, and promote the continuous improvement and upgrading of Africa-China cooperation.\nThe Joint Statement adopted at the meeting embodies the consensus between China and Africa on adhering to the purposes and principles of the United Nations Charter, opposing external interference, unilateral sanctions, racial discrimination, and adhering to unity to fight the epidemic. It reflects the firm support of China and Africa on issues involving each other's concerns and core interests, and demonstrates the firm determination of China and Africa to work together to build a community with a shared future for China and Africa in the new era. Africa reiterated its commitment to the one-China principle, its support for China's great cause of reunification, and its efforts to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China highly appreciates this.\nIn the next stage, the two sides will focus on the important consensus reached at the meeting, strengthen strategic alignment and solidarity and cooperation, continue to solidly advance the \"Nine Projects\", work together to accelerate the construction of a China-Africa community with a shared future in the new era, work to strengthen unity and cooperation among developing countries, and continue to polish the \"golden sign\" of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation. They will make unremitting efforts to promote the continued development of China-Africa comprehensive strategic partnership in depth and make greater contributions to the cause of world peace and development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347350.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-19","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Recently, U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for Asia-Pacific Affairs Conda said that China overreacted to Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan and used coercion and provocation to increase pressure on Taiwan. The United States will act responsibly and resolutely. What is China’s comment on this?","The facts of House Speaker Pelosi’s visit to Taiwan are clear, and the right and wrong are clear at a glance. It is the United States that violates its commitment to \"One China\" and damages China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. It is not China that violates its commitment and damages the sovereignty and territorial integrity of the United States. It was the U.S. leader who went to Taiwan to support the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, rather than China going to the United States to support Alaska's \"independence.\"\nChina's resolute response to the U.S. provocation is reasonable, legal and justified, and has received wide understanding and support from the international community. If the United States wants to solve the problem, there is only one way out, which is to return to the three Sino-US joint communiqués and the one-China principle, instead of shirking responsibility and making false accusations, let alone act rashly in an attempt to create a greater crisis. China is unswervingly determined to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity and advises the United States not to misjudge.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347350.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-19","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","In response to China's sanctions against Lithuania's deputy minister of transport and communications, Lithuania's Ministry of Foreign Affairs said in a statement that it had sent a formal protest to China, calling for the lifting of these restrictions. What is China’s comment on this?","The high-ranking official of the Lithuanian government has fled to Taiwan, which is a clear violation of Lithuania’s political commitment to adhere to the one-China principle. It also violates the general consensus of the international community and the basic norms of international relations. China's necessary response to Li Fang's wrong actions is completely legitimate, reasonable and legal. We urge the Lithuanian side to recognize right from wrong, correct its mistakes immediately, and stop eroding the political foundation of neutral bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347350.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2022-08-25","","Reporter","Recently, some officials from the US and Japan have made groundless accusations against the exercises carried out by the Chinese military near the Taiwan Island. What’s your comments on this?","The remarks made by some officials of relevant countries have distorted facts. The aim is to shift blames on China. China has made clear its firm opposition to these remarks on multiple occasions. The context, cause and course of the current tensions in the Taiwan Strait are crystal clear. The recent military exercises conducted by the PLA near China’s Taiwan Island were open, transparent, professional and appropriate. It is a warning and a response to those who provoked and stirred up troubles. It is a legitimate and justified act to resolutely defend China’s sovereignty and territorial integrity. The US, who started the crisis, should and must bear full responsibility for the current tensions. The US side should truly abide by the one-China principle and take immediate measures to correct its mistakes, instead of further escalating tensions in the Taiwan Strait.\nRecently, the Japanese side has echoed the negative words and deeds of the US side regarding Taiwan and hyped up the so-called “China military threat”. It is extremely irresponsible. For some time, Japan has been increasing its defense budget and strengthening military posture. Regional countries and the international community are highly vigilant of these actions. We urge the Japanese side to honestly reflect on its history of aggression, stop spreading rumors against and smearing the Chinese side, and do more things that are conducive to enhancing mutual trust with its neighbors and maintaining regional peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-08-25","","Reporter","The Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities recently hyped up on multiple occasions that the military exercises organized by the mainland around Taiwan were “irresponsible” and “provocative” actions. According to Taiwan media reports, the troops in Taiwan recently carried out heavy artillery firing training, test-fired surface-to-surface missile with “infinite” trajectory altitude, and conducted an…","The Taiwan Question and China’s Reunification in the New Era, a white paper published recently, gives a comprehensive and systematic explanation on the historical context and legal basis of the fact that Taiwan has belonged to China since ancient times, and China’s position, principle and policy for promoting reunification in the new era. The DPP authorities and the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces have, for their personal interests, turned against the overall interests of the Chinese nation and colluded with external forces to carry out “pro-independence” provocations. This is the root cause of the rising tensions across the Taiwan Strait.\nThe recent military operations organized by the PLA are punitive deterrence against the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces and the interference of external forces. Pursuing “Taiwan independence” will only plunge Taiwan into the abyss and bring nothing but disaster to Taiwan compatriots. We sternly warn the DPP authorities and the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces that if they insist on courting foreign support for “independence” and making provocations, the Chinese military will continue to speak with actions and take resolute countermeasures.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2022-08-29","Zhao Lijian","Reporter from China News Service","We have noticed that many incidents involving Taiwanese people being tricked into working in Cambodia and being imprisoned and beaten have been exposed recently, which has aroused widespread concern from all walks of life. Does the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia provide consular protection to these Taiwan compatriots? What specific work was done?","The Chinese government attaches great importance to and makes every effort to safeguard the safety and legitimate rights and interests of overseas Chinese citizens, including Taiwan compatriots. The Chinese Embassy in Cambodia is maintaining close communication with the Cambodian government and actively searching for and rescuing relevant personnel. At present, the embassy has received messages from more than 20 Taiwanese compatriots asking for help, and has assisted Cambodia in successfully rescuing some people. We will continue to closely follow up on the handling of the case. Taiwanese compatriots and their families who are trapped can contact the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia for help in a timely manner.\nAt the same time, we once again remind Chinese citizens to be wary of false recruitment information on overseas networks, strictly abide by laws and regulations, ensure personal safety, and promptly report fraud and gambling-related information. In case of emergency, please report to the local police in time and contact the Chinese embassy or consulate in the local area.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347351.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-29","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","Last Sunday, two US warships passed through the \"international waters\" of the Taiwan Strait. On the same day, a US White House official said that this was \"very consistent\" with the US one-China policy and the policy of pursuing a free and open Indo-Pacific region. What is China’s comment on this?","The spokesperson of the Eastern Theater Command has responded to this. Regarding the passage of U.S. warships, the Eastern Theater Command tracked and monitored the entire process and had everything under control.\nU.S. warships frequently show off their force under the guise of \"freedom of navigation.\" This is not a commitment to freedom and openness, but a provocation seeking \"freedom of freedom\" and a deliberate destruction of regional peace and stability.\nChina once again urges the United States to stop vacillating, hollowing out, and distorting the one-China principle, abide by the basic norms of international relations of respecting the sovereignty and territorial integrity of other countries and non-interference in internal affairs, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, and not be a troublemaker for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347351.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-29","Zhao Lijian","AFP reporter","In addition to Taiwanese people trapped in Southeast Asian countries such as Cambodia and engaged in telecommunications fraud, we have seen reports that people from mainland China and Hong Kong are also trapped. Has China received requests for help from these citizens? What specific measures has China taken to help them?","I have just introduced the relevant situation. I can reveal it to you again. I once found an account on the Weibo platform called \"A Child Who Wants to Go Home.\" This account sent help messages to my personal Weibo many times, and I forwarded the relevant information to the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia. With the full cooperation of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia and the Cambodian police, the Chinese citizen was finally rescued and has returned to China. Journalists are requested to pay more attention to such cases. If you have relevant circumstances, you can seek help from the Consular Protection Center of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs or directly to the Chinese embassy or consulate in Cambodia and other countries.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347351.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-29","Zhao Lijian","Phoenix TV reporter","EU High Representative for Foreign Affairs and Security Policy Borrell previously said that \"Taiwan is a small country.\" However, the EU Spokesperson's Office said that this was a translation issue and that he had not said that before. What is China’s comment on this?","China has noted relevant reports.\nI would like to emphasize that the meaning of the one-China principle is clear and unambiguous. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing the whole of China. There is no room for ambiguity on this big issue of right and wrong.\nChina hopes that the EU will continue to abide by the one-China principle, earnestly respect China's core interests and major concerns, abide by its commitments with practical actions on Taiwan-related issues, and avoid affecting China-EU relations and mutual trust between the two sides.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347351.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-29","Zhao Lijian","Reporter from Tokyo Broadcasting Corporation","Recently, a video of a Chinese private drone flying to Kinmen Island to take pictures has been circulated on the Internet. What is China’s comment on this?","I also saw the relevant video. A Chinese drone flying over Chinese territory is nothing to be surprised about.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347351.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-30","Zhao Lijian","Phoenix TV reporter","U.S. White House official Kirby said that China's military actions have escalated the situation in the Taiwan Strait. China is trying to establish a \"new normal\" in the Taiwan Strait, and the United States will not accept it. We have also seen that the US White House Press Secretary stated that in response to China's provocative actions, the US will conduct exercises in the future to promote stabilization of the…","It is the United States and Taiwan separatist forces that are trying to change the status quo in the Taiwan Strait, not China. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The \"Taiwan independence\" forces rely on foreign countries to respect themselves and \"rely on the United States to seek independence\". This is the root cause of the current tension in the Taiwan Strait.\nUnder the guise of stability in the Western Pacific region, the United States is nakedly trying to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\" How can this have nothing to do with China or Sino-US relations? If the United States really seeks to stabilize the situation, it should immediately return to the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347352.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-30","Zhao Lijian","Reuters","When Guatemala’s Foreign Minister Bucaro met with Tsai Ing-wen in Taipei today, he said that Guatemala will always support Taiwan because we firmly believe in the principles of peace, sovereignty, and territorial integrity. What is China’s comment on this?","The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. The Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities use certain so-called \"diplomatic countries\" to engage in political manipulation. This is nothing but a trick to deceive themselves and others. It cannot stop the historical trend of China's inevitable reunification. At the same time, we also advise Guatemala not to act as a coward, to recognize the international trend as soon as possible, and to make decisions in line with the historical trend as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347352.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-31","Zhao Lijian","Phoenix TV reporter","In response to a reporter's question about the situation in the Taiwan Strait, the chief deputy spokesperson of the US State Department said that China overreacted and engaged in provocation, while the US response was \"measured and responsible.\" What is the spokesperson's response to this?","The causes and consequences of the current tensions in the Taiwan Strait are clear. The rights and wrongs are clear at a glance. The US provokes troubles first, and China legitimately counterattacks later. It is reasonable, legal, necessary and appropriate. The United States violated its commitment to \"One China\" and undermined China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, but it accused China of overreacting. U.S. warships frequently show off their force in waters surrounding China under the guise of \"freedom of navigation,\" but accuse China of provocations. China will not accept this kind of confusing right and wrong, and the international community will not recognize it either.\nWhat the US should do is to stop blurring, hollowing out and distorting the one-China principle, abide by the basic norms of international relations of respecting the sovereignty and territorial integrity of other countries and non-interference in internal affairs, and return to the three Sino-US joint communiqués and the one-China principle, instead of blindly shirking responsibilities, criticizing others, or even trying to create a greater crisis.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347353.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-08-31","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of Defense\" officials said at a press conference that the \"national military\" will exercise the right of self-defense without exception and take countermeasures against any aircraft or ship that enters Taiwan's \"territorial waters\" and \"airspace.\" The same applies to countering Chinese drones, the official said. What is China’s comment on this?","First of all, what I want to tell you is that Taiwan is a province of China and there is no \"Ministry of Defense\". It makes no sense for the Taiwan authorities to exaggerate tension.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347353.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-01","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Yesterday, Russian Foreign Ministry spokesperson Zakharova said that the US Navy's transit of the Taiwan Strait was a provocative act and made the regional situation more complex and unpredictable. Resolving the situation across the Taiwan Strait is purely China's internal affairs, and China has the right to take necessary measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. What is China’s…","We appreciate Russia’s stance. More than 170 countries around the world have stated that they adhere to the one-China principle and support China in safeguarding its sovereignty and territorial integrity. This reflects the general aspiration of the international community. The provocative actions of the United States are unpopular and doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347354.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-01","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on August 31, the Japanese Ministry of Defense stated in its annual budget request that China continues to threaten to use force to unilaterally change the status quo, exerts pressure around Taiwan through military exercises, and will seek funding to develop and mass-produce cruise missiles, high-speed ballistic missiles, and hypersonic warheads. According to reports, the plan clearly…","China has stated its position on this issue many times.\nFor some time, Japan has repeatedly hyped up the \"China threat\" and continued to develop missile programs and so-called \"counterattack capabilities.\" This is to create an excuse to build offensive military power. Behind it is the ambition to break through the constraints of the pacifist constitution and return to the old path of military expansion. This sends a dangerous signal to the world, that is, Japan's attempt to subvert the international order established after World War II, which should arouse high vigilance of the international community.\nAs a country that bears heavy historical responsibilities against its Asian neighbors, Japan should seriously reflect on its history of aggression, respect the security concerns of its Asian neighbors, and immediately stop the wrong practice of exaggerating the so-called peripheral security threats and finding excuses for its own military expansion.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347354.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-01","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Japan's Kyodo News","According to reports, the governor of Arizona held talks with Tsai Ing-wen this morning and agreed to bilateral semiconductor industry cooperation. What is China’s comment on this?","The formation and development of global industrial and supply chains are the result of the joint action of market laws and enterprise choices. The \"Taiwan independence\" forces attempt to enhance their existence, gain attention, and politicize economic and trade issues by manipulating the concept of so-called \"democracy chips\". Their attempts to fake democracy and seek independence will not succeed.\nReporter from Brazilian newspaper \"Globo\": A think tank in Washington said that China, Russia, and Iran will participate in military exercises held in Venezuela. Can you confirm?\nWang Wenbin: On August 15, the \"International Military Games-2022\" \"Border Sniper\" competition was held in Venezuela. Teams from 13 countries including Russia, China, Indonesia, Cuba, and Belarus participated and observed. This event provides an important platform for militaries from various countries to exchange experiences. China has previously released relevant information.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347354.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-05","Mao Ning","NHK reporter","The US government has approved a new round of arms sales to Taiwan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The United States blatantly violated the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17\" communiqué, by selling weapons to the Taiwan region of China, seriously damaging China's sovereignty and security interests, seriously damaging Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sending a serious wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes and strongly condemns this, and will take resolute and powerful measures to firmly defend its sovereignty and security interests.\nFor some time, the United States has repeatedly trampled on international law and basic norms governing international relations, violated the political commitment made by its leaders to \"not support 'Taiwan independence,'\" constantly distorted, blurred, and hollowed out the one-China principle, deliberately provoked the Taiwan issue, supported and condoned \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and bears unshirkable responsibility for the increasing tension in the Taiwan Strait. China urges the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, stop arms sales to Taiwan and U.S.-Taiwan military ties, stop creating new tensions in the Taiwan Strait, stop using Taiwan-related issues for political manipulation, stop \"using Taiwan to contain China,\" and not go further down the wrong and dangerous path.\nI would like to tell the United States once again that Taiwan belongs to China. The Taiwan issue does not tolerate any external interference. No one or any force can stop China's historical trend of achieving complete reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347356.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-07","Mao Ning","The Paper","US State Department Deputy Spokesperson Patel said at a press conference on the 6th that the latest US arms sales to Taiwan are for defense purposes and China has no reason to respond. What is China’s comment on this?","China’s position against U.S.-Taiwan military ties and U.S. arms sales to Taiwan is consistent and clear. Taiwan is a province of China, so why is it called \"defense\"? The U.S.'s arms sales to Taiwan violate its political commitments made in the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17 Communiqué\". It supports and condones \"Taiwan independence\" and creates new tensions in the Taiwan Strait. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and stop engaging in \"using Taiwan to contain China.\" China will resolutely fight back against actions that undermine China's sovereignty and security and interfere in China's internal affairs.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347358.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-08","Mao Ning","Reuters","Taiwan said on Thursday that it would send representatives to attend the state funeral of former Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ response to this? Also, will China send representatives to attend the funeral? If so, can you reveal the specific candidates?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Taiwan issue is related to the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations and the basic trust between the two countries. Japan has made serious political commitments to China on many occasions. The Japanese side should abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, handle relevant matters strictly in accordance with the one-China principle, and must not provide a stage for \"Taiwan independence\" forces to take the opportunity to engage in political manipulation.\nThe Taiwan authorities take this opportunity to engage in political manipulation and make political fuss, but their political agenda is unlikely to succeed.\nAs for whether China will send representatives to attend the meeting you mentioned, I already answered this question yesterday. I have no information to post.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347359.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-08","Mao Ning","Bloomberg","An eight-member U.S. cross-party group of congressmen led by Congressman Murphy of Florida arrived in Taiwan on Wednesday. Some members of the delegation met with Tsai Ing-wen today. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Relevant members of the U.S. Congress visited the Taiwan region of China, seriously violating the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, and violating the U.S. commitment to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan. China is strongly dissatisfied with and firmly opposed to this.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. China is unwavering in its determination to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference. We urge relevant US politicians to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiques, immediately stop any form of official exchanges with Taiwan, and immediately stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China will continue to take effective measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347359.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-14","Mao Ning","Bloomberg","According to Taiwan media reports, Chinese Ambassador to the United States Qin Gang told U.S. Deputy Secretary of State Sherman last month that if the U.S. allows the passage of the 2022 Taiwan Policy Act, Sino-U.S. relations will face a \"rupture.\" Are the above-mentioned reports accurate in quoting Ambassador Qin’s remarks?","I don’t understand what Ambassador Qin said specifically. I think he was emphasizing the importance of adhering to the one-China principle for Sino-US relations. China has repeatedly stated its firm opposition to the \"Taiwan Policy Act of 2022\". The one-China principle is the political foundation of Sino-US relations and the core content of the three Sino-US joint communiques. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiques and stop promoting relevant Taiwan-related bills. Only by carefully and properly handling Taiwan-related issues can China-US relations be prevented from being further damaged.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347362.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-14","Mao Ning","Reuters","Reuters reported yesterday that sources said the United States was considering a package of sanctions to deter China, and the EU was also under diplomatic pressure from Taipei to impose sanctions on China. These are responses to rising concerns over escalating military tensions across the Taiwan Strait. What is China’s response to this?","The root cause of the current tensions across the Taiwan Strait is that the one-China principle has been challenged and the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are seeking \"Taiwan independence\" and separatism. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs and no foreign country has the right to interfere. I would also like to emphasize that no country or person should underestimate the strong determination and firm will of the Chinese government and people to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity and achieve the reunification of the motherland.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347362.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-14","Mao Ning","Reuters","Reuters reported yesterday that Taiwan’s representative in the United States held a meeting with lawmakers from many countries in Washington on Tuesday to discuss imposing sanctions on China if it continues to conduct military exercises around Taiwan. What is China’s comment on this?","The one-China principle is the political basis for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with other countries in the world. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan. Recently, more than 170 countries and multiple international organizations around the world have issued righteous voices, reaffirming their adherence to the one-China principle and supporting China in resolutely safeguarding its sovereignty and territorial integrity. This once again shows that the one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community.\nChina opposes all external interference and will never accept any threats. It is a dead end for the DPP authorities to collude with external forces and pursue \"Taiwan independence\" and separatism. Only by returning to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\" can peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait be effectively guaranteed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347362.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-15","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Yesterday, President Xi Jinping paid a state visit to Kazakhstan. Can the spokesperson give more details about the visit?","At the invitation of President Tokayev of the Republic of Kazakhstan, President Xi Jinping paid a state visit to Kazakhstan on September 14. President Tokayev personally went to the airport to greet him and held a grand welcome ceremony for President Xi Jinping. The two heads of state jointly visited the \"Kazakhstan-China Millennium Dialogue\" art exhibition. President Xi Jinping held formal talks with President Tokayev, attended the welcome banquet, and accepted the \"Golden Eagle\" Order, Kazakhstan's highest honor, awarded by President Tokayev.\nPresident Xi Jinping's visit is rich in content and fruitful in results. The two heads of state signed and issued the \"Joint Statement on the 30th Anniversary of the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between the People's Republic of China and the Republic of Kazakhstan\", announcing that China and Kazakhstan are willing to work towards the goal and vision of building a community with a shared future featuring ever-lasting friendship, a high degree of mutual trust, and sharing weal and woe. Relevant departments of the two countries signed a number of cooperation documents in the fields of economy and trade, connectivity, finance, water conservancy, news media and other fields. The two sides also decided to establish consulates general in each other's Xi'an and Aktobe.\nLooking into the future, China and Kazakhstan will continue to support each other on issues involving core interests such as national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity. Kazakhstan will continue to firmly support the one-China principle and oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence.\"\nThe two sides will give full play to the important strategic leading role of heads of state diplomacy and conduct regular strategic communication on major issues of common concern.\nThe two sides will continue to jointly build the \"Belt and Road\" with high quality and promote the integration of the \"Belt and Road\" initiative with Kazakhstan's \"Bright Road\" new economic policy.\nThe two sides will actively practice the new security concept of common, comprehensive, cooperative and sustainable, jointly combat the \"three evil forces\" and maintain political security and regime security.\nThe two sides will firmly abide by the United Nations Charter and the principles of international law, practice true multilateralism, expand cooperation within the United Nations, the Shanghai Cooperation Organization and other multilateral frameworks, implement global development initiatives and global security initiatives, jointly build a community with a shared future for mankind, and make \"China-Kazakhstan contributions\" to building a more fair and reasonable global governance system.\nChina looks forward to working with Kazakhstan to promote China-Kazakhstan relations into the next \"golden 30 years\", guided by the important consensus reached by the two heads of state during this visit, and upholding the spirit of mutual respect, good neighborliness, mutual help, and mutual benefit.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347364.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-15","Mao Ning","The Paper","According to reports, on September 14, local time, the U.S. Senate Foreign Affairs Committee reviewed and approved the \"Taiwan Policy Act of 2022\". The case will next be submitted to the Senate plenary session for review. What is China’s comment on this?","The relevant bill seriously violates the commitment made by the United States to China on the Taiwan issue, violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, interferes in China's internal affairs, violates international law and basic norms of international relations, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes this and has lodged stern representations with the United States.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. China will unswervingly promote the complete reunification of the country. No country, no force, no one should misestimate the Chinese government and people's strong determination, firm will and strong ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity and achieve national reunification and national rejuvenation.\nThe one-China principle is the political foundation of Sino-US relations and the core content of the three Sino-US joint communiques. If this case continues to be reviewed and advanced or even passed into law, it will greatly shake the political foundation of Sino-US relations and have extremely serious consequences for Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nWe strongly urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, earnestly implement the commitment made by U.S. leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence\", stop playing the \"Taiwan card\" to \"use Taiwan to contain China\", and stop advancing the review of relevant bills. China will take all necessary measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity depending on the progress and final outcome of the case.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347364.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-16","Mao Ning","ATV reporter","According to reports, a spokesman for the Taiwan authorities said on the 15th that Taiwan will designate three people to attend the state funeral of former Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe. What is China’s comment on this? Will China still send personnel to attend Abe’s state funeral?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. China urges Japan to abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan and the serious political commitments made previously, handle relevant matters strictly in accordance with the one-China principle, and not provide any stage or opportunity for \"Taiwan independence\" elements to take advantage of the opportunity to engage in political manipulation.\nJapan has invited China to attend the state funeral of former Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe. China and Japan have communicated on this. I have no information to provide at the moment.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347365.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-16","Mao Ning","RIA Novosti","A delegation from the Czech Republic will visit Taiwan on Sunday. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","There is only one China in the world. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing the whole of China. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs, involves China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and is China's core interest. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan, and firmly opposes external forces interfering in China's internal affairs under the pretext of the Taiwan issue. The Chinese government and the Chinese people have unwavering determination and belief in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We urge relevant Czech politicians to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and refrain from further damaging the political foundation for the development of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347365.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-19","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan’s representative in the UK was invited to sign the Queen’s condolence book. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities use condolence activities to engage in political hype and make political articles, which is disgusting. This does not change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, and the Taiwan authorities' political agenda cannot succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347366.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-20","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on the 19th local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi held discussions and exchanges with representatives of the National Committee on U.S.-China Relations, the National Committee on U.S.-China Business Council, and the American Chamber of Commerce in New York, and met with former U.S. Secretary of State Kissinger. Can the spokesperson introduce the relevant situation?","On September 19, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi held discussions and exchanges with representatives of the National Committee on U.S.-China Relations, the National Committee on U.S.-China Business Council, and the American Chamber of Commerce in New York.\nWang Yi pointed out that this year marks the 50th anniversary of President Nixon's visit to China and the issuance of the Sino-US \"Shanghai Communique\". It is an important year worthy of summing up experience, repacking and starting again. In response to the fact that there are fewer and fewer certainties and more and more uncertainties in the current prospects of Sino-US relations, Wang Yi elaborated on China’s five “certainties”:\nFirst, China’s own development prospects are certain. The upcoming 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China will formulate a blueprint and goals for China's next development. China's modernization and the advancement of more than 1.4 billion people toward common prosperity will provide more markets and development opportunities for countries around the world, including the United States.\nSecond, China’s determination to reform and open up is certain. China will continue to deepen reform, expand opening up, build a new system with a higher level of openness, build an open world economy, and continue to promote economic globalization.\nThird, China’s policy toward the United States is determined. President Xi Jinping proposed the three principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation between China and the United States. President Biden has repeatedly emphasized the \"four non-intentions\". The key is that the United States should return to a rational and pragmatic China policy as soon as possible.\nFourth, China is determined to continue strengthening economic and trade cooperation between the two countries. China welcomes US companies to develop in China and will continue to provide a market-oriented, legal and international business environment. Sino-US economic and trade should be more about additions rather than subtractions, holding hands rather than letting go, and tearing down walls rather than building them. Regarding each other's concerns, there should be dialogue rather than confrontation, consultation rather than coercion.\nFifth, China’s willingness to carry out multilateral coordination with the United States is confirmed. History has and will continue to prove that Sino-US cooperation can achieve many major events that are beneficial to both countries and the world. To this end, we must maintain the political foundation of Sino-US relations, especially the one-China principle.\nWang Yi emphasized that Sino-US relations are related to the future and destiny of both countries and world peace and stability. Both sides should work together to find a way for two major countries with different social systems and different histories and cultures to coexist peacefully.\nWhen meeting with former US Secretary of State Kissinger, Wang Yi said that this year marks the 50th anniversary of President Nixon’s visit to China and the issuance of the \"Shanghai Communique\". China and the United States should carefully summarize the beneficial experience of 50 years of exchanges. China's policy toward the United States maintains continuity and stability. Out of a wrong understanding of China, the United States insists on viewing China as its main rival and long-term challenge. Some people even paint the story of successful Sino-US exchanges as a narrative of failure. This neither respects history nor itself. The United States should return to a rational and pragmatic China policy, return to the right track of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and safeguard the political foundation of Sino-US relations.\nWang Yi stressed that the top priority is to properly manage the Taiwan issue, otherwise it will have a subversive impact on Sino-US relations. There is an old saying in China: It is better to lose a thousand troops than an inch of territory. This is the will and determination of the Chinese people. If the Anti-Secession Law is violated, China will take resolute actions in accordance with the law to defend the country's sovereignty and territorial integrity. To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, the United States should conscientiously return to the original meaning of one China and clearly oppose and stop \"Taiwan independence.\"\nThe United States stated that as the world's top two interdependent economies, the United States and China can manage bilateral relations well, reduce obstacles and negative factors, and jointly respond to climate change, public health, food and energy security challenges, which will bring more benefits to the people of both countries and the world. Both sides should work in the spirit of cooperation, work in the right direction, continue to carry out constructive, multi-level and fruitful dialogues, accumulate small steps into big achievements, enhance mutual trust, and contribute to world peace, stability and prosperity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347367.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-21","Wang Wenbin","Associated Press reporter","After China signed a bilateral security agreement with the Solomon Islands at the beginning of this year, the United States declared that it would increase contacts with the South Pacific island countries. U.S. Vice President Harris said the United States will open embassies in Tonga and Kiribati. Australia has also stated that it will increase contacts with South Pacific island countries. What is the Ministry of…","Regarding the first question, first of all, what I want to say is that Pacific island countries are independent sovereign countries and have the right and freedom to develop friendly cooperation with other countries. This right should not be subject to any restrictions or deprivation.\nSecond, what I want to tell you is that China develops friendly and cooperative relations with Pacific island countries without attaching any political conditions, does not seek the so-called \"sphere of influence\", and does not target any third party. Yesterday, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with Solomon Islands Foreign Minister Manele in New York. State Councilor Wang Yi pointed out that developing countries also have the right to development, and their people should also live a happy life. China's cooperation with island countries aims to promote common development and enhance people's well-being, and is sincerely welcomed by the people of island countries.\nRegarding the second question, the spokesperson of the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has made a statement on this. The Chinese military has been closely monitored throughout the incident, remains on high alert at all times, resolutely counters all threats and provocations, and resolutely defends national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThe current situation in the Taiwan Strait is complex and sensitive. U.S. ships have recently used the banner of \"freedom of navigation\" to show off force, cause trouble and provocation in the Taiwan Strait. They have also formed gangs, exerted pressure and intimidation. This is exacerbating the situation and jeopardizing regional peace and stability.\nWe urge the United States to change its course, correct its mistakes, and stop being a troublemaker for regional peace and stability. We also urge other countries to exercise caution and not to take advantage of the fire.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347368.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-22","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","The U.S. House of Representatives Financial Services Committee held a hearing on Wednesday. Republican Congressman Brian Luckmeyer asked the CEOs of major U.S. banks how they would respond to the hypothetical question of \"China's 'invasion' of Taiwan.\" The CEOs all said that if the U.S. government requires them to reduce or stop business in China, they will comply. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment…","The Taiwan issue has always been the core and most sensitive issue in Sino-US relations. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, earnestly implement the U.S. leader's statement that he does not support \"Taiwan independence,\" and stop manipulating Taiwan-related issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347369.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-22","Zhao Lijian","AFP","US President Biden stated at the UN General Assembly yesterday that he is unwilling to engage in a \"cold war\" or conflict with China. He also mentioned China many times in his speech, including the Xinjiang-related report issued by the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights. What is China’s response to this?","China's policy toward the United States maintains continuity and stability. President Xi Jinping proposed that China and the United States should respect each other, coexist peacefully, and cooperate for win-win results. This is not only the accumulation of experience in the 50-year history of Sino-US relations, but also the basic principle that should be followed in the next development. President Biden has repeatedly made the promise of \"four no's and one no intention\". We hope that the U.S. will implement the statements made by U.S. leaders, view China and Sino-U.S. relations correctly, return to the origins of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, and safeguard the political foundation of Sino-U.S. relations.\nIt is hoped that the United States will work with China to find a way for the two major countries with different social systems and different histories and cultures to coexist peacefully and cooperate for win-win results, which will not only benefit the people of China and the United States, but also contribute to world peace, stability, and development.\nRegarding Xinjiang-related issues, the so-called Xinjiang-related human rights assessment report of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights was planned and manufactured by the United States and some Western forces. It is completely illegal and invalid. The report is a hodgepodge of false information and a political tool serving the US and Western strategy of using Xinjiang to contain China.\nIn recent years, nearly a hundred countries, including Muslim countries, have made public statements in the Human Rights Council, the Third Committee of the United Nations General Assembly and other occasions to support China's legitimate position on Xinjiang-related issues and oppose interference in China's internal affairs through so-called Xinjiang-related issues. These are the mainstream voices in the international community. The sinister political plot of the United States and the West to wreak havoc on Xinjiang and use Xinjiang to control China is unjust, unpopular, and doomed to failure!\nThe United States should face up to and improve its own human rights issues such as racial discrimination, gun violence, violations of indigenous rights, violations of immigrant rights, human trafficking, dissemination of false information, and indiscriminate imposition of unilateral sanctions, and give a responsible account to the international community and the victims.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347369.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-22","Zhao Lijian","Kyodo News reporter","Today Tsai Ing-wen met with a delegation of Czech senators, and both sides agreed to deepen relations. What is China’s comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs, involves China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and is China's core interest. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan, and firmly opposes external forces interfering in China's internal affairs under the pretext of the Taiwan issue. The Chinese government and the Chinese people have unwavering determination and belief in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We urge relevant Czech politicians to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and refrain from further damaging the political foundation for the development of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347369.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-23","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on the 22nd, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi delivered a speech at the Asia Society headquarters in New York. Can you introduce the relevant situation?","On September 22, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi delivered a speech at the Asia Society headquarters in New York. State Councilor Wang Yi pointed out that in the past few years, Sino-US relations have hovered at the lowest point since the establishment of diplomatic relations, which has brought huge changes to the future of the two peoples and the world. Fundamentally speaking, the crux is that the United States has a deviated understanding of China, the world, and itself. Whether it is provoking \"all-out confrontation\" or advocating \"strategic competition,\" it has deviated from the correct track of Sino-US relations. Regarding the correct way for China and the United States to get along, President Xi Jinping has given a clear answer, which is mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation. These three principles are important conclusions drawn from examining the ups and downs of Sino-US relations for more than half a century. They are also the correct way for major countries to interact with each other in today's era.\nState Councilor Wang Yi said that mutual respect is an important experience accumulated in China-US exchanges and is also the basic prerequisite for bilateral relations to get back on track. We respect the development path chosen by the American people and are happy to see the United States open, confident, and develop and progress. The United States should also respect the development path chosen by the Chinese people, which is socialism with Chinese characteristics. We will unswervingly move forward along the path and direction of our own choosing, and move forward more steadily and better. We are also willing to continue to learn from all beneficial international experiences and achievements of human civilization, always embrace the world with open arms, and open the door wider and wider.\nState Councilor Wang Yi pointed out that whether we are partners or rivals, cooperation or confrontation, these are the fundamental issues in China-US relations, and we cannot make subversive mistakes. China's choice is peace, it insists on peaceful development, and its most basic expectation for China-US relations is peaceful coexistence. The Chinese do not have the gene for expansion, coercion, or seeking hegemony. Today's China is the inheritance and development of historical China. We have written our insistence on peaceful development into the constitution of the ruling party, and we are the only major country in the world that has written peaceful development into its constitution. Some people in the United States hope to suppress China by imitating the containment of the Soviet Union, and hope to contain China through geopolitical games such as the \"Indo-Pacific Strategy\". This is doomed to be in vain.\nState Councilor Wang Yi said that win-win cooperation is not only possible, but also necessary. This is the true narrative of Sino-US relations over the past half century, and it is also the common goal that both sides should continue to strive for. As the largest developing country and the largest developed country, China and the United States are highly complementary. There is extensive room for cooperation in many fields such as economy and trade, energy, science and technology, education, and humanities. China and the United States shoulder major responsibilities on global issues such as fighting the epidemic, restoring the economy, responding to climate change, counter-terrorism, non-proliferation, and resolving regional hot spots. Cooperation will benefit both sides, while confrontation will hurt both. This is an unbreakable truth in China-US relations. Cooperation is always the best choice for China and the United States. China does not deny the existence of competition between China and the United States in the fields of economy and trade, nor is it afraid of competition. However, we do not agree to simply define Sino-US relations by competition, because this is by no means the entirety and mainstream of Sino-US relations. At the same time, competition must have boundaries and be fair. We need to engage in healthy competition rather than vicious competition, and we need to chase each other rather than fight to the death.\nState Councilor Wang Yi emphasized that the one-China principle is the foundation of the political basis of Sino-US relations, and the three joint communiqués are the most important \"guardrails\" for Sino-US relations. Currently, the Taiwan issue has increasingly become the biggest risk to Sino-US relations. If it is not handled well, it is likely to have a subversive and damaging impact on the relationship between the two countries. Just as the United States will not allow Hawaii to be separated, since Taiwan is part of China, China has the right to safeguard the country's unity; since the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China, the Taiwan authorities should not be allowed to join any international organization with sovereignty implications; since the one-China principle is recognized, official exchanges with Taiwan should not be carried out. This is a very clear truth. The Taiwan issue arose due to the weakness and chaos of the Chinese nation, and will surely be resolved with the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. This is the general trend of history and the aspiration of the people. The United States should stand on the right side of history.\nWe hope that China and the United States can seek practical enlightenment from historical experience, gather strength to move forward, jointly explore and build a new era of Sino-US relations, and jointly create a bright future for China and the United States!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347370.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-23","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, German Foreign Minister Berber issued a statement on the 22nd, saying that the foreign ministers of the G7 and the EU High Representative for Foreign Affairs and Security Policy held talks and expressed that all parties opposed unilateral changes in the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The basic position of the G7 members on the Taiwan issue has not changed, including the stated \"one…","Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, Taiwan is part of China, and China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. This is the current situation across the Taiwan Strait, and its core essence is one China. It is not China that is trying to change the status quo, but the Democratic Progressive Party authorities and the external interference forces that are fueling the separatist arrogance of \"Taiwan independence.\" The one-China principle is the anchor of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The clearer and stronger the attitude of adhering to the one-China principle, the more secure peace across the Taiwan Strait will be. We hope that Germany and other G7 members will not only make a clear commitment to adhere to the one-China principle, but also take concrete actions to implement the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347370.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-26","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","24th\n, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi delivered a speech when attending the general debate of the 77th United Nations General Assembly in New York. Can the spokesperson further introduce the relevant situation?","On September 24, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended the general debate of the 77th United Nations General Assembly at the United Nations Headquarters in New York and delivered a speech. He put forward a series of propositions on the current international situation and jointly building a community with a shared future for mankind, which can be summarized as \"six musts and six don'ts\":\nFirst, we want peace, not war. We insist on handling differences through peaceful means and resolving disputes through dialogue and consultation.\nThe second is to develop, not to live in poverty. We should insist on putting development at the center of the international agenda, so that the results of development can benefit every country and everyone more and more equitably.\nThe third is to be open, not closed. We advocate openness and inclusiveness, safeguard the multilateral trading system with the World Trade Organization as its core, and promote the construction of an open world economy.\nThe fourth is to cooperate, not to confront. Replace conflict with dialogue, replace coercion with negotiation, replace zero-sum with win-win, jointly resist group politics, and jointly oppose camp confrontation.\nFifth, we must unite and not divide. Abandon ideological lines, unite to build the greatest common denominator and draw the largest concentric circles to promote world peace and development.\nSixth, be fair and don’t bully. Advocate and practice true multilateralism, promote equal rights, equal rules, and equal opportunities for all countries, and build a new type of international relations featuring mutual respect, fairness, justice, and win-win cooperation.\nState Councilor Wang Yi said that in the face of various current challenges, President Xi Jinping proposed global development initiatives, sounded the \"assembly call\" to refocus on development, and called for the building of a global development community. President Xi Jinping has also proposed global security initiatives, contributing Chinese wisdom to make up for the peace deficit, and proposing Chinese solutions to address international security challenges.\nState Councilor Wang Yi emphasized that the one-China principle has become a basic norm for international relations and a general consensus of the international community. China is willing to continue to use the greatest sincerity and make its greatest efforts to achieve the peaceful reunification of both sides of the Taiwan Strait. To achieve this goal, we must crack down on \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities with the firmest determination and take the most powerful measures to exclude interference from external forces. Only by resolutely stopping separatism in accordance with the law can peaceful cross-Strait reunification have a realistic basis; only when the country achieves complete reunification can the Taiwan Strait usher in lasting peace. Any attempt to interfere in China's internal affairs will be unanimously opposed by the Chinese people, and any attempt to block China's great cause of reunification will be crushed by the wheels of history.\nState Councilor Wang Yi pointed out that China, which accounts for one-fifth of the world's population, has made great strides towards modernization, which has important and far-reaching global significance. The upcoming 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China will uphold the will of all the Chinese people, scientifically plan the goals and tasks of national development in the next five years and beyond, and comprehensively draw a grand blueprint for China's future development. Standing at a new historical starting point, China will realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation with Chinese-style modernization, and work with other countries in the world to strive for peaceful development, take responsibility for unity and progress, join hands to build a community with a shared future for mankind, and jointly create a better world.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-26","Wang Wenbin","Xinhua News Agency","On the 23rd, Solomon Islands Prime Minister Sogavare said at the general debate of the 77th session of the United Nations General Assembly that since Solomon Islands normalized relations with China, it has been criticized by some media for baseless and completely wrong reasons. Countries should not incite tensions in the Taiwan Strait and surrounding areas. Any miscalculation will threaten international peace and…","Prime Minister Sogavare’s relevant remarks were resounding. They effectively responded to the unfounded criticism and false accusations of China-Society relations, defended the legitimate rights of China and Sogavare to carry out normal exchanges and cooperation, and made a just voice on the situation in the Taiwan Strait and the international and regional situation. We highly appreciate this.\nDuring the general debate of the 77th session of the United Nations General Assembly, many countries reiterated their adherence to the one-China principle, once again demonstrating that the one-China principle is the universal consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations.\nChina has always developed friendly cooperative relations with the Solomon Islands based on the principles of mutual respect, equal treatment, mutual benefit, openness and inclusiveness. China will always be a trustworthy good friend and good partner of the Solomon Islands, and will continue to support the Solomon Islands in pursuing an independent development path that is consistent with its own national conditions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-26","Wang Wenbin","ANSA","Italy held parliamentary elections last weekend. The Italian center-right alliance will win the majority of votes, and Giorgia Meloni, the leader of the brother parties, is expected to become the next Italian Prime Minister. She has previously criticized China's policy on the Taiwan issue. Considering that the new Italian government is about to take office, what are China's expectations for the next direction of…","We have noticed the situation related to the Italian parliamentary election. China and Italy are comprehensive strategic partners, and the healthy and stable development of China-Italy relations serves the common interests of both parties. We hope that the new Italian government will continue to adhere to a positive and pragmatic policy towards China, work with China, uphold the spirit of mutual respect, mutual trust, and mutual benefit, continue to deepen bilateral cooperation in various fields and people-to-people exchanges, and benefit the two countries and peoples.\nThe Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not allow any interference from external forces. The one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is the political premise and foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with all countries, including Italy. China urges relevant people in Italy to fully understand the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, earnestly abide by the one-China principle, and avoid sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-27","Wang Wenbin","China Daily reporter","It has been reported that U.S. Vice President Harris met with Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida in Tokyo, discussing China's recent aggressive and irresponsible provocations in the Taiwan Strait and reiterating the importance of maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. What is China's comment on this?","The US Speaker of the House, disregarding China's repeated warnings over the past four months, visited Taiwan and referred to Taiwan as a \"country.\" This action by the US seriously infringes upon China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, severely damages China-US relations, and seriously undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China's corresponding countermeasures are reasonable, legal, appropriate, and necessary.\nI want to emphasize that the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the DPP authorities' provocations aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and the indulgence and support from external forces. The one-China principle is the cornerstone for maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The clearer and more forceful the stance on adhering to the one-China principle, the more secure peace will be across the Taiwan Strait. We urge the US to return to the three Sino-US joint communiqués and the one-China principle in their entirety, to reiterate the one-China policy cleanly and clearly, and to unequivocally state its opposition to all forms of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347372.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-09-28","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","U.S. Vice President Harris stated in a speech today that the United States will continue to deepen its unofficial relationship with Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","I noticed that during her visit to Japan, US Vice President Harris also mentioned that China is undermining the rules-based international order.\nI want to emphasize first and foremost that the US Speaker of the House, disregarding China's repeated warnings over the past four months, visited Taiwan and referred to Taiwan as a \"country.\" This action by the US seriously infringes upon China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, severely damages China-US relations, and seriously undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nThe one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a fundamental norm of international relations, as well as the political foundation for the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the United States and the development of bilateral relations. From the 1972 Shanghai Communiqué to the 1978 Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and the United States, and then to the 1982 August 17 Communiqué, the United States has consistently and explicitly acknowledged that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is a part of China, and that the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government of China. The United States has also explicitly pledged that it has no intention of infringing upon China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, no intention of interfering in China's internal affairs, and no intention of implementing a \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" policy.\nKeeping one's word is the most basic rule. If the US doesn't even abide by its own commitments, what right does it have to talk about rules and order? It can only become a destroyer of international rules. We urge the US to earnestly fulfill its commitments, return to the three Sino-US joint communiqués and the one-China principle in their entirety, reiterate the one-China policy cleanly and clearly, and explicitly state its opposition to all forms of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347373.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-08","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Tesla founder Elon Musk said in an interview with the Financial Times that an acceptable solution to the tensions across the Taiwan Strait would be for China to establish a \"special administrative region\" in Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. China's position on resolving the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear. We will continue to adhere to the basic policy of \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems,\" and strive with the utmost sincerity and effort to achieve peaceful reunification across the Taiwan Strait. At the same time, we will resolutely crush any attempts at \"Taiwan independence,\" resolutely curb interference from external forces, and resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347376.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-09","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Elon Musk's remarks about Taiwan yesterday have attracted widespread attention. The spokesperson also introduced China's position. Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council stated that Musk's remarks were unacceptable. Does the spokesperson have any further comments?","Yesterday I introduced China's principled position on the Taiwan issue. Currently, the root cause of the tension and instability in the Taiwan Strait is the DPP authorities' collusion with external forces to seek \"independence\" and their provocations. Only by resolutely curbing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and opposing external interference can we safeguard peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.\nI would like to emphasize that \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\" is our fundamental policy for resolving the Taiwan issue and the best way to achieve national reunification. Under the premise of ensuring national sovereignty, security, and development interests, Taiwan can exercise a high degree of autonomy as a special administrative region. The social system and way of life of our Taiwan compatriots will be fully respected, and their legitimate rights and interests will be fully guaranteed. China's reunification will not harm the legitimate interests of any country; it will only bring more development opportunities to all countries and inject more positive energy into the prosperity of the Asia-Pacific region and the world. We hope and are pleased to see more and more people understand and support \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems.\"\nAs for the remarks made by the DPP authorities that you mentioned, they are not worth refuting at all. No matter what the DPP authorities say, they cannot change the basic fact that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347377.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-18","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","US Secretary of State Blinken said that China's decision to reunify Taiwan will come sooner than previously expected. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","I have noted Secretary Blinken's remarks. What I want to say is that the United States has made a clear commitment on the \"One China\" principle, acknowledging that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is part of China, and that the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing China. These commitments are clearly reflected in the three Sino-US joint communiqués. However, the US has repeatedly broken its promises.\nThe US has pledged to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan, but in recent years it has significantly relaxed official exchanges between the US and Taiwan. The Speaker of the US House of Representatives even visited Taiwan despite strong opposition from China.\nThe US has pledged to gradually reduce arms sales to Taiwan and to eventually resolve the issue over time. However, since the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the US, the scale and quality of US arms sales to Taiwan have been continuously increasing, with the total amount exceeding $70 billion.\nSecretary Blinken also linked the U.S. \"One China\" policy to China's commitment to peacefully resolve the Taiwan issue, and even made it the core of the U.S. \"One China\" policy. I want to emphasize that this is not a reaffirmation of the commitment, but a distortion of it.\nAchieving national reunification peacefully best serves the overall interests of the Chinese nation, including our compatriots in Taiwan, and is most conducive to China's long-term stability and development. It is the first choice for the Communist Party of China and the Chinese government in resolving the Taiwan issue. The Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and must be decided by the Chinese people. We are willing to create ample space for peaceful reunification, but we will never leave any room for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. A peaceful resolution to the Taiwan issue is incompatible with \"Taiwan independence\" separatism. The more rampant \"Taiwan independence\" activities become, the less likely a peaceful resolution will be. To truly safeguard peace across the Taiwan Strait, we must explicitly oppose and stop any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.\nThe US should earnestly fulfill its commitments, return to the original meaning of \"one China,\" and put its statement of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into practice.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347384.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-21","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The US Chief of Naval Operations stated that the US military must be prepared for a possible \"invasion\" of Taiwan this year. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The US should fully recognize the extreme importance and high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, earnestly implement its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" and refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nIt must be emphasized that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. We firmly oppose the US's manipulation of the Taiwan issue and its provocative words and deeds in the region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347387.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-25","Wang Wenbin","CCTV Reporter","51 years ago today, the United Nations General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758, affirming that the Government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing all of China, including Taiwan, in the international arena. For some time now, certain forces in the United States have been spreading the fallacy that UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 has not resolved the status of Taiwan,…","On October 25, 1971, the 26th UN General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority. This resolution not only explicitly stated the restoration of all rights of the People's Republic of China and the recognition of the representatives of her government as the sole legitimate representatives of China in the United Nations, but also demanded the expulsion of the \"representatives\" of the Taiwan authorities from their illegally occupied seat. After the resolution's adoption, the so-called \"dual representation\" proposal put forward by the United States and a few other countries to retain Taiwan's seat in the United Nations became worthless. UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 not only thoroughly resolved the issue of representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations and international organizations politically, legally, and procedurally, but also clarified that China has only one seat in the United Nations. The one-China principle has become a universal consensus and a universally recognized basic norm of international relations, completely blocking any attempt by any person, country, or force to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan.\" Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the United Nations or other international organizations that only sovereign states can participate in.\nOver the past 51 years, based on adherence to the one-China principle, the number of countries with which China has established diplomatic relations has increased from more than 60 to 181. This fully demonstrates that upholding the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend of the times.\nIn recent years, some forces in the United States have maliciously misinterpreted UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, spreading the fallacy that \"Resolution 2758 has not resolved the status of Taiwan,\" and hyping up the so-called \"Taiwan's participation in the UN system.\" They have attempted to undermine and hollow out the one-China principle, and have condoned and supported \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, causing serious negative impacts on peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. This act of turning back the clock of history is destined to be universally resisted and opposed by the international community, and is also destined to fail in the face of the Chinese people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nMore than half a century of history has proven that UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is not to be challenged and the one-China principle is unshakeable. The historical wheels of national reunification and rejuvenation are rolling forward, and the complete reunification of China will surely be achieved!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347389.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-25","Wang Wenbin","NHK reporter","Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen said in her speech today that Taiwan has faced growing \"military threats\" and \"economic coercion\" from mainland China in recent years. What is China’s comment on this?","The DPP authorities confuse right and wrong and confuse the public, which will only repeatedly expose its separatist nature of seeking \"independence\". What I want to emphasize is that Taiwan has no other way out except reunification with the mainland. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly pursue the separatist proposition of \"Taiwan independence\" and are destined to fail miserably.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347389.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-26","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that recently, the National Taiwan University research vessel \"New Ocean Research No. 1\" was hailed and interfered with by a Japan Coast Guard patrol vessel while operating in waters east of Taiwan. The vessel claimed that scientific research could not be conducted in Japan's \"exclusive economic zone\" without Japan's consent. What is China's comment on this?","The sea area you mentioned where the incident occurred is only about 60 nautical miles from Taiwan. Chinese research institutions, including those in Taiwan, have every right to conduct scientific research activities in that area, and foreign countries should not interfere. China and Japan have not yet demarcated their maritime boundaries in the waters east of Taiwan. China does not accept the so-called \"Japanese Exclusive Economic Zone\" claim or the so-called exercise of \"jurisdiction.\" China has lodged representations with Japan, demanding that Japan refrain from interfering with the scientific research activities of Chinese vessels, including those from Taiwan, in that sea area.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347390.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-27","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","In an interview with Bloomberg, US Secretary of State Antony Blinken stated that mainland China is attempting to accelerate its \"takeover\" of Taiwan. Blinken claimed that the change is that China has decided to no longer accept the status quo in cross-strait relations and hopes to expedite the unification process. What is China's response to this?","First of all, the status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides of the Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is a part of China. It is not the Chinese side that is trying to change the status quo, but the DPP authorities' pro-independence separatist activities and the US's distortion and distortion of the one-China principle.\nThe one-China principle is the most important political premise and foundation for the establishment and development of diplomatic relations between China and the United States, and it is the basic consensus between China and the United States on the Taiwan issue. How the Taiwan issue is resolved is entirely China's internal affair. We are willing to create broad space for peaceful reunification, but we will never leave any room for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347391.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2022-10-27","","Reporter","The White House recently released the US National Security Strategy 2022, claiming that China is the only competitor with both the intent to reshape the international order and the power to advance that objective , posing the most serious geopolitical challenge to the US. What is your comment on this?","The report published by the US side is full of cold war and zero-sum thinking. It deliberately exaggerates the so-called \"China challenge\", geopolitical conflicts and “great power competition”, maliciously creates bloc confrontation along ideological lines, and questions China's normal military development. This is a misjudgment of China-US relations and a misreading of China's development. It runs counter to the theme of our times for peaceful development and the common expectation of the international community.\nAs a founding member of the United Nations and a permanent member of the UN Security Council, China stays committed to the path of peaceful development. We actively participate in the reform and construction of the global governance system, and remain a staunch defender of the international system with the United Nations at its core and the international order based on international law. This has long been a consensus of the international community, and cannot be smeared by a report from one country. This report shows that the US side is still following its old path of creating enemies, ganging up allies and expanding military strength. It is promoting \"integrated military deterrence\", accelerating build-up of nuclear triad, making excuses for seeking and consolidating its hegemony and dominance, and prioritizing its own interests over international justice. This is in fact a major threat and a serious challenge to the international system and world order.\nChina and the US stand to gain from cooperation and lose from confrontation. We urge the US side to take an objective and rational view of China and China’s military development, and put into practice President Joe Biden's statement that the US does not seek a new Cold War or to change China's system, the revitalization of US alliance is not anti-China, the US does not support Taiwan independence, and it has no intention to have a conflict with China. The US side should work together with the Chinese side to bring the China-US relations back to the track of healthy and stable development.\nSenior Colonel Tan Kefei, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers reporters' questions at a regular press conference on October 27, 2022.(Photo/mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-10-27","","Reporter","According to Japan’s Kyodo News Agency, the Japanese government is considering revising its National Security Strategy by the end of 2022. The new strategy may include policies such as “‘no unilateral change of the status quo by force will be tolerated’ over Taiwan ”, “a free and open Indo-Pacific\" and “the ‘Quad’ mechanism among Australia, India, Japan and the US. What is your comment on that?","We have noticed relevant reports. For some time, the Japanese side has deliberately hyped up China-related issues like the Taiwan question. These actions grossly interfered in China's internal affairs and the so-called “China military threat”. They are out of ulterior motives and irresponsible.\nBoth sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is a part of China. The Japanese side made solemn commitments in the China-Japan Joint Declaration fifty years ago. The Government of Japan recognizes that Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal Government of China . The Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this stand of the Government of the People's Republic of China, and it firmly maintains its stand under Article 8 of the Postsdam Proclamation . Japan should abide by the basic norms of international relations and fulfill its political commitments to China, instead of interfering in the Taiwan question. It must be noted that in recent years, Japan has been keen on following up another country’s policy of containing China, and has built targeted “small groups” in the name of freedom and openness. These moves are against the common expectations of regional countries for peace, development and cooperation .\nThis year marks the 50th anniversary of the normalization of China-Japan diplomatic relations. The Japanese side should review its original aspiration and work with the Chinese side to implement the important consensus of “being each other’s cooperative partners, not a threat”, so as to promote bilateral relations along the right track. We urge the Japanese side to take history as a mirror and speak and act cautiously in the field of military security, and refrain from interfering in China's internal affairs, undermining China’s security interests, or undermining regional security and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-10-27","","Reporter","It is reported that the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2023 under discussion by the US Senate may include part of the “Taiwan Policy Act of 2022” adopted by the US Senate Foreign Relations Committee in September. What is your comment, please?","Recently, the US side has been making up many Taiwan-related policy bills that undermine China's sovereignty, and has intensified its efforts to use Taiwan as a pawn to contain China. In particular, some terms are intended to strengthen Taiwan’s military ties with the US and support the so-called self-defense of Taiwan. Such acts have seriously interfered in China’s internal affairs, seriously violated the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués , and seriously violated its serious political commitment to China on the Taiwan question. A country that is well aware that “a house divided against itself cannot stand” and has used force to maintain its own unity is now repeatedly breaking its promise and taking reckless actions on matters involving others’ sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity. This is typical double standards. We firmly oppose this and have made solemn representations to the US side.\nTaiwan is China’s Taiwan. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese, a matter that must be resolved by the Chinese. We urge the US side to stop playing with fire on the Taiwan question. The PLA remains the linchpin for safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Any attempt to thwart China’s complete reunification will be doomed to failure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-10-27","","Reporter","Taiwan media reported that the 21st US-Taiwan Defense Industry Conference recently wrapped up. Sources in Taiwan revealed that the US might announce multiple arms sales to Taiwan by the end of the year. What is your comment on that?","For quite some time, the US side has repeatedly breached its political commitment of not supporting “Taiwan independence” and used the “Taiwan card” to interfere in China’s internal affairs, even sending the wrong message of helping Taiwan resist reunification by force. These bad actions have seriously harmed China’s sovereignty and security, gravely threatened peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, posed great strategic risk to the China-US bilateral and mil-to-mil relations, and sent very wrong signals to the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. China is severely concerned and strongly opposed to that.\nThis year marks the 40th anniversary of the China-US Joint Communiqué on August 17, 1982. In the communiqué, the US side clearly recognized that there is but one China, Taiwan is a part of China, and the Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government of China. The US made a clear commitment that it does not seek to carry out a long-term policy of arms sales to Taiwan, and intends to gradually reduce its arms sales to Taiwan, leading to a final resolution . Yet despite these unmistakable, unambiguous statements in the communiqué, the US has in fact broken its commitment over and over again. What’s more, in recent years, the US has hollowed out the one-China principle, conducted multiple arms sales to Taiwan, and created obstacles to China’s peaceful reunification\nAt the end of the day, the security of Taiwan depends on a peaceful cross-Strait relationship. America’s arms sales to Taiwan will only escalate tensions and increase risks of conflicts and confrontation in the Taiwan Strait. We urge the US side to stop arms sales to and military ties with Taiwan and refrain from making further mistakes. The PLA is closely watching the situation and will continue to take effective measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and security interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-10-27","","Reporter","The leader of the Taiwan region Tsai Ing-wen said in the so-called October 10speech that the island would speed up its efforts to enhance military capacity and develop asymmetric combat power. It is also reported that Taiwan region’s defense authority will soon propose the budget report for 2023, which will see a massive increase in defense spending. What’s your comment, please?","We’ve noticed relevant reports. The Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities have long been promoting false narratives such as “defending democracy and freedom” and “responding to threats from the mainland” to fool the people in Taiwan and mislead international public opinion for their political expediency. They are most “generous” when treating the security of Taiwan compatriots as stakes for gamble, which reflects their true intention of seeking “Taiwan independence” by force and splitting the country . These attempts and actions will never succeed because they are against the historical momentum and overall interests of the Chinese nation. They will only bring grave disasters to the Taiwan compatriots. These obstacles to peaceful reunification must be uprooted. “Taiwan independence” is a dead end while reunification is the only right path forward. The Chinese PLA will stay on high alert and take concrete actions to resolutely fulfill its sacred mission of defending national sovereignty, unity, and territorial integrity.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2022-10-28","Wang Wenbin","RIA Novosti reporter","Yesterday, Russian President Vladimir Putin stated that the United States' actions to undermine relations with China on the Taiwan issue are wrong. Putin also stated that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","We highly appreciate President Putin's statement. I would like to emphasize that the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a universally recognized basic norm of international relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347392.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-10-31","Zhao Lijian","Global Times reporter","It has been reported that US Secretary of State Blinken stated in an interview that China's increasing \"aggression\" against the outside world, including Taiwan, in recent years has caused concern in the US. He added that a crisis in the Taiwan Strait would be detrimental to the world. The US needs to maintain security in the region and resolve issues peacefully. What is China's comment on this?","Taiwan is China's Taiwan. The resolution of the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, and it should be decided by the Chinese people. We insist on striving for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and the greatest effort, but we will never promise to renounce the use of force and reserve the option to take all necessary measures. This is aimed at external interference and the very few \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities.\nThe real root cause of the current tensions across the Taiwan Strait is the DPP authorities' \"relying on the US to seek independence\" and the attempts by some in the US to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\" US officials' statements on Taiwan distort the truth, placing Taiwan in China's \"outside world\" and claiming that China \"infringes\" on Taiwan. This not only violates the basic fact that Taiwan is part of China but also seriously contravenes the political commitments made by the US to China on the Taiwan issue. China firmly opposes this. If the US truly does not want a crisis in the Taiwan Strait, it should put its statement of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into practice, immediately cease its irresponsible words and actions, and work with China to oppose and contain \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347393.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-02","Zhao Lijian","CGTN reporter","Pakistani Prime Minister Shahbaz has begun an official visit to China. Could the spokesperson provide further details about Prime Minister Shahbaz's visit?","On the morning of November 2, President Xi Jinping met with Pakistani Prime Minister Shahbaz, who was on an official visit to China, at the Great Hall of the People.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that he welcomed your visit to China and thanked you for sending a congratulatory letter at the first opportunity to celebrate the convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China. China and Pakistan are good friends, good partners, and good brothers. In recent years, the two countries have supported each other and forged ahead amidst global changes and turmoil, demonstrating the \"ironclad\" friendship between China and Pakistan. China has always viewed China-Pakistan relations from a strategic and long-term perspective, and has always placed Pakistan as a priority in its neighborhood diplomacy. China is willing to work with Pakistan to elevate the level of all-round strategic cooperation, accelerate the building of a closer China-Pakistan community with a shared future in the new era, and inject new impetus into the all-weather strategic cooperative partnership between China and Pakistan.\nPresident Xi Jinping emphasized that China appreciates Pakistan's firm commitment to friendly cooperation with China and thanks Pakistan for its support on issues concerning China's core and major concerns. China will firmly support Pakistan in safeguarding its national sovereignty and territorial integrity, development interests, and national dignity, and firmly support Pakistan in achieving stability, unity, development, and prosperity. China expresses its deep sympathy for the people of Pakistan suffering from the devastating floods and will provide additional emergency assistance to help Pakistan rebuild after the disaster, support Pakistan in restoring agricultural production after the disaster, and strengthen cooperation in disaster prevention and mitigation and climate change response.\nPresident Xi Jinping introduced the important achievements of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China. He pointed out that China will continue to adhere to its fundamental national policy of opening up to the outside world and continuously provide new opportunities for countries around the world, including Pakistan, through its new development. China is willing to deepen the alignment of development strategies with Pakistan. Both sides should make good use of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor (CPEC) Joint Cooperation Committee mechanism to promote the construction of the CPEC with higher efficiency and make it a model project for high-quality development under the Belt and Road Initiative. They should accelerate the construction of supporting infrastructure for Gwadar Port and leverage the port's radiating and driving role in regional connectivity and development. Both sides should work together to create conditions for the early implementation of the No. 1 railway trunk line upgrade project and the Karachi Ring Railway project. China welcomes Pakistan's expansion of high-quality agricultural exports to China and is willing to expand cooperation with Pakistan in the digital economy, e-commerce, photovoltaic and other new energy fields, and solidly promote cooperation in agriculture, science and technology, and people's livelihood. China will continue to provide support to Pakistan to stabilize its financial situation to the best of its ability. China supports pairing up industrial provinces in China with Pakistan to promote industrial cooperation and hopes that Pakistan will provide a favorable business environment. I am highly concerned about the safety of Chinese citizens in Pakistan and hope that Pakistan will provide a reliable and safe environment for Chinese institutions and personnel conducting cooperation in Pakistan.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that the world, the times, and history are undergoing unprecedented changes. Faced with a highly uncertain world, both sides should stand on the right side of history, maintain high-level cooperation within international multilateral mechanisms, closely coordinate on major international and regional issues, uphold genuine multilateralism, safeguard international fairness and justice, protect the common interests of developing countries, and provide certainty and positive energy to the world. China is willing to work with Pakistan to promote the implementation of global development and global security initiatives, push the global economic governance system towards a more just, equitable, and mutually beneficial direction, build a community with a shared future for mankind, provide strong guarantees for the development of both countries, and make greater contributions to world peace, stability, and common prosperity.\nPrime Minister Shebaz stated, \"I am deeply honored to be among the first foreign leaders invited to visit China following the landmark 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, which fully demonstrates the profound and unwavering friendship between Pakistan and China. On behalf of the government and people of Pakistan, I would like to once again warmly congratulate President Xi Jinping on his re-election as General Secretary of the CPC Central Committee. Over the past decade, under the wise leadership of President Xi Jinping, China has achieved remarkable development achievements that can be described as a miracle of our times. Internationally, China has upheld multilateralism, promoted unity and cooperation, and made significant contributions to maintaining world peace and development, fully demonstrating its role as a responsible major power. The world cannot do without China, and no force can isolate or contain China's development. I believe that President Xi Jinping's vision and wisdom will not only continue to lead China to create even more brilliant achievements but will also guide the world towards a brighter future.\"\nPrime Minister Sheikh Shahbaz stated that deepening the all-weather strategic cooperative partnership between Pakistan and China is the cornerstone of Pakistan's foreign policy and a consensus reached by all sectors of society. He expressed his heartfelt gratitude to the Chinese government and people for their valuable assistance in Pakistan's fight against the COVID-19 pandemic and for their generous aid after Pakistan suffered severe flooding. No country has offered such sincere help to Pakistan and other developing countries as China. Pakistan firmly adheres to the one-China policy and firmly supports China's position on core interests issues such as Taiwan, Tibet, and Hong Kong. Pakistan hopes to learn from China's successful experience in governance, uphold self-reliance, and deepen cooperation with China in various fields to better achieve its own development. This is Pakistan's future direction and only choice. The China-Pakistan Economic Corridor has had a profound impact on Pakistan's economic and social development. Pakistan is willing to work with China to continuously promote high-quality Belt and Road cooperation and hopes that China will strongly support the upgrading and reconstruction of the No. 1 railway line and the construction of important infrastructure projects such as the Karachi Ring Railway. Pakistan will further strengthen security measures and do its utmost to protect the safety of Chinese institutions and personnel in Pakistan. Pakistan fully supports the global development and global security initiatives proposed by President Xi Jinping, and is willing to strengthen communication and cooperation with China in international and regional affairs to make positive contributions to maintaining world peace and development. The friendship between Pakistan and China is unbreakable, and Pakistan will always stand firmly with China.\nFollowing the talks, President Xi Jinping hosted a welcoming banquet for Prime Minister Schabaz in the Golden Hall of the Great Hall of the People.\nWang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee, State Councilor and Foreign Minister, and He Lifeng, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Minister of the National Development and Reform Commission, participated in the above activities.\nLater today, Prime Minister Schabaz will also meet with other Chinese leaders, and we will release information in due course.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347395.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-03","Zhao Lijian","A reporter from the Dutch Broadcasting Association asked","Dutch parliamentarians, including Johann Scheltzma, from the ruling Democratic Party of Six Six, are visiting Taiwan and will meet with President Tsai Ing-wen today. Scheltzma stated that Europe should impose sanctions on China in response to the possibility of a Chinese military takeover of Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The politicians you mentioned have always maliciously hyped up China-related issues and spread lies and rumors about China. They have absolutely no credibility, so don't take them too seriously. This small group of lawmakers' clumsy political hype will not amount to anything; it will only bring shame upon themselves. We also solemnly warn the DPP authorities that their attempt to collude with external forces to seek \"independence\" is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347396.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-07","Zhao Lijian","TASS reporter","Recently, the G7 foreign ministers issued a joint statement in Münster, Germany, stating that the group's member states seek constructive cooperation with China in areas that may align with the G7's interests. Furthermore, the G7 foreign ministers reminded China to adhere to the principles of the UN Charter concerning the peaceful settlement of disputes and the avoidance of the use of threats and violence. The…","China's position on issues related to Hong Kong, Xinjiang, and Taiwan is consistent and clear. This so-called joint statement from the G7 foreign ministers' meeting ignores China's solemn position and objective facts, grossly interferes in China's internal affairs, and maliciously smears and slanders China. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nChina is a model of upholding the UN Charter and practicing genuine multilateralism. China has consistently been committed to promoting joint international efforts to address global challenges and to building a community with a shared future for mankind. We urge the G7 to abandon its Cold War mentality and ideological biases, stop interfering in other countries' internal affairs, stop repeating lies and fallacies, and stop instigating regional conflicts and creating bloc confrontation, so as to create favorable conditions for global cooperation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347398.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-08","Zhao Lijian","Bloomberg reporter","Lithuania opened its \"Economic and Trade Office in Taiwan\" this Monday. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of the People's Republic of China. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, firmly opposes any actions that infringe upon China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and firmly opposes any actions that deviate from the universal consensus of the international community and the basic norms of international relations. We urge Lithuania to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently, and earnestly safeguard the political foundation of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347399.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-08","Zhao Lijian","Bloomberg reporter","I have a question about Taiwan. The Chinese air force has intensified its \"intrusions\" into sensitive areas near Taiwan, reaching the highest level since U.S. House Speaker Nancy Pelosi visited Taiwan three months ago. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","What you mentioned is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347399.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-10","Zhao Lijian","Reuters reporter","The US said on Wednesday that the Chinese and US leaders will meet next week to discuss issues such as the US's \"red lines\" on several issues, and that the US will not make any fundamental concessions. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The leaders of China and the United States maintain regular contact through various means. China attaches importance to the US suggestion that the two leaders meet in Bali, and the two sides are currently in communication on this matter.\nChina's policy stance toward the United States is consistent and clear. We are committed to achieving mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation with the United States, while firmly safeguarding our own sovereignty, security, and development interests.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the one-China principle is the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the three joint communiqués are the most important \"guardian\" of China-US relations. What the US should do is stop diluting, undermining, and distorting the one-China principle, adhere to the basic norms of international relationsrespecting the sovereignty and territorial integrity of other countries and non-interference in their internal affairsand return to the three China-US joint communiqués and the one-China principle. The essence of China-US economic and trade relations is mutual benefit and win-win. The US should stop politicizing, instrumentalizing, and ideologizing economic and trade issues, and take concrete actions to uphold market economy rules and the international trading system. The development of relations between countries is not a zero-sum game. China has consistently advocated developing inclusive partnerships that are not directed against any third party and opposes forcing other countries to take sides.\nChina has always viewed and developed China-US relations in accordance with the three principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping, and advocates building a new path for China-US relations in the new era. The US should work with China in the same direction, properly manage differences, promote mutually beneficial cooperation, avoid misunderstandings and misjudgments, and push China-US relations back onto the right track of healthy and stable development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347401.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-11","Zhao Lijian","Reporter from Australia Asia Satellite Television","US National Security Advisor Sullivan stated that the US will brief Taiwan on the meeting between the Chinese and US leaders, and believes Taiwan will feel \"safe and comfortable\" with the US's support for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. He added that the US will abide by the Taiwan Relations Act and provide support for Taiwan's defense. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The current tensions across the Taiwan Strait stem from the Taiwan authorities' repeated attempts to \"seek independence by relying on the US,\" while some people in the US are intentionally trying to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\" Such actions are what undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nOfficial exchanges between the US and Taiwan violate the US commitment to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan. The claim that the US will brief Taiwan on the meeting between the Chinese and US leaders is a serious violation of the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and is extremely egregious in nature. China firmly opposes this.\nThe so-called \"Taiwan Relations Act,\" unilaterally concocted by the US, runs counter to the principles of the three Sino-US joint communiqués and the basic norms of international relations, and China has firmly opposed it from the outset. The US has no right to place its domestic law above international law, let alone use it to interfere in China's internal affairs. On the Taiwan issue, the US should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, not the so-called \"Taiwan Relations Act.\"\nChina urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, cease official exchanges and military contacts with Taiwan, stop arms sales to Taiwan, and take concrete actions to fulfill its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" and not to lead China-US relations into a dangerous situation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347402.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-14","Mao Ning","Yonhap News Agency reporter","It is reported that on the 13th, the leaders of South Korea, the United States, and Japan held talks in Cambodia and issued a joint statement. The statement opposed unilateral attempts to change the status quo in the Indo-Pacific and reaffirmed the commitment to maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. What is China's comment on this?","Exchanges and cooperation between countries should contribute to enhancing mutual understanding and trust among countries in the region and to maintaining world and regional peace and stability. They should not be targeted at or harm the interests of any third party. If relevant countries genuinely wish to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, they should adhere to the one-China principle and work with China to explicitly oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a fertile ground for cooperation and development, not a \"chessboard\" for great power rivalry. Relevant countries should follow the trend of the times, abandon Cold War thinking, stop forming small cliques, and prevent actions that could undermine peace and stability in the Asia-Pacific region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347403.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-11-28","Zhao Lijian","AFP reporter","My first question is that the Vatican stated that China's appointment of the Auxiliary Bishop of Jiangxi violated relevant Vatican-China agreements. What is China's response to this? My second question is that Canada recently released a new version of its \"Indo-Pacific Strategy\" to address the risks posed by China. The Canadian Foreign Minister stated in an interview that China lacks respect for international…","Regarding your first question, I am not aware of the specific situation you mentioned. I would like to point out that in recent years, China and the Vatican have maintained contact and reached a series of important consensuses. The continuous improvement of China-Vatican relations has also promoted the harmonious development of Catholicism in China. China is willing to work with the Vatican to continuously expand friendly consensus and jointly uphold the spirit of the provisional agreement.\nRegarding the second question, the content of Canada's strategy concerning China is riddled with ideological bias, hypes up the so-called \"China threat,\" and makes unfounded accusations and attacks against China. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn representation with Canada.\nChina has always adhered to peaceful development, advocated openness and inclusiveness, and practiced win-win cooperation. It has consistently been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order. China's development is an opportunity for the world and a growth force for world peace. No matter how developed China becomes, it will never seek hegemony or engage in expansion. The international community clearly sees who is truly upholding world peace and promoting common development, and who is inciting Cold War thinking and fueling camp confrontation.\nThe principle of non-interference in internal affairs is the \"golden rule\" of relations between countries. The affairs of Taiwan, Xinjiang, and Hong Kong are purely China's internal affairs, and brook no interference from external forces. China's determination to safeguard its national sovereignty, security, and development interests is unwavering. Canada has repeatedly stated that it values ??its relations with China and is willing to work towards improving and developing relations with China with a forward-looking attitude. Canada should be consistent in its words and deeds, demonstrate sincerity and goodwill, uphold the spirit of seeking common ground while reserving differences, pursue a rational and pragmatic policy towards China, and put its commitments into action.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347413.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-05","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","The Financial Times reports that Canada plans to send more warships through the Taiwan Strait to reiterate China's claim that the waters are international waters. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China has repeatedly stated that it enjoys sovereignty, sovereign rights, and jurisdiction over the Taiwan Strait. China has always respected the right of navigation enjoyed by all countries in accordance with international law, but firmly opposes any country using freedom of navigation as a pretext to provoke or threaten China's sovereignty and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347418.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-06","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Several Australian parliamentarians have arrived in Taiwan for a five-day visit. What is China's response to this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a prerequisite and political foundation for China to develop friendly relations with all countries. Australia should earnestly abide by the one-China principle, cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347419.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-08","Mao Ning","China Daily reporter","It has been reported that the U.S. Defense Security Agency issued a statement on December 6th stating that the U.S. State Department has approved two arms sales to Taiwan, including standard aircraft parts and related equipment. Taiwan's defense department stated that these arms sales will help Taiwan's air force operations. What is China's comment on this?","The United States has blatantly violated the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, by selling weapons to Taiwan, thereby harming China's sovereignty and security interests, damaging peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sending a wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and will take forceful measures to resolutely safeguard its sovereignty and security interests.\nChina urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, earnestly implement the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop selling weapons to Taiwan and cease US-Taiwan military contacts, stop creating new tensions in the Taiwan Strait, stop using Taiwan to contain China, and not go further down the wrong and dangerous path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347421.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-09","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The U.S. House of Representatives passed the National Defense Authorization Act, which includes military loans to Taiwan totaling up to $10 billion over the next five years. What is the spokesperson's response to this?","We firmly oppose the United States using the \"National Defense Authorization Act\" to smuggle in negative content related to China.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair. The US should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, delete the negative content concerning China in the bill, stop playing the \"Taiwan card\" to contain China, and cease US-Taiwan military contacts, so as to avoid further damaging Sino-US relations. China will take all necessary measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty and security interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347422.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-12","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","Following the meeting between President Xi Jinping and President Biden on the sidelines of the G20 Bali Summit, the US recently sent a delegation to China. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs provide more information about the delegation's visit? What topics will be discussed?","From December 11 to 12, Vice Foreign Minister Xie Feng held talks in Langfang, Hebei Province, with visiting U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs John Konda and White House National Security Council Senior Director for China Affairs Robert Rosenberg.\nBoth sides conducted in-depth communication on implementing the consensus reached at the Bali meeting between the Chinese and US heads of state, advancing consultations on guiding principles for China-US relations, properly handling important and sensitive issues in bilateral relations such as Taiwan, strengthening exchanges at all levels, and carrying out cooperation in related fields. They also exchanged views extensively on international and regional issues of common concern.\nBoth sides agreed that the talks were frank, in-depth, and constructive, and agreed to continue communication.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347423.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-13","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from China National Radio","Yesterday, China released news of Vice Foreign Minister Xie Feng's meeting with U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs John Konda and White House National Security Council Senior Director for China Affairs Robert Rosenberg in Langfang, Hebei Province, which has attracted widespread attention. Could the spokesperson provide further details? Was the Taiwan issue discussed during the…","As we mentioned yesterday, from December 11th to 12th, Vice Foreign Minister Xie Feng held talks in Langfang, Hebei Province, with visiting U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs John Konda and White House National Security Council Senior Director for China Affairs Robert Rosenberg. The two sides conducted in-depth communication on implementing the consensus reached at the Bali meeting between the Chinese and U.S. heads of state, advancing consultations on guiding principles for China-U.S. relations, properly handling important and sensitive issues in bilateral relations such as Taiwan, strengthening exchanges at all levels, and carrying out cooperation in related fields. They also exchanged views extensively on international and regional issues of common concern.\nDuring the talks, the Chinese side stated that both sides should take the implementation of the important consensus reached at the Bali meeting between the two heads of state as the main axis and thread for stabilizing and developing China-US relations in the next stage. They should unswervingly adhere to the strategic guidance of head-of-state diplomacy, implement the consensus reached at the meeting without compromise, relentlessly promote the whole-process management of bilateral relations, and unambiguously send the right signals to the outside world. With a high degree of responsibility to both countries, the world, and history, they should strengthen communication and dialogue, carry out mutually beneficial cooperation, properly manage differences, and push China-US relations back onto a healthy and stable track. The zero-sum Cold War mentality must be abandoned, ideological confrontation and bloc antagonism must be opposed, and erroneous practices such as decoupling, supply disruptions, and technological suppression must be stopped.\nChina emphasizes that its constructive attitude towards developing China-US relations based on the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation has remained consistent, and its determination to safeguard its sovereignty, security, and development interests is unwavering. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. China reiterates its solemn position on the erroneous actions of the US and Taiwan regarding high-level exchanges, US arms sales to Taiwan, and Taiwan-related legislation, urging the US to take concrete actions to uphold the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués.\nChina points out that it neither avoids nor fears competition, but opposes defining the entire China-US relationship through competition, and opposes using competition as a pretext for containment and suppression. The United States has its values, and China has its values; these should be respected, not imposed on others, and certainly not interfered in other countries' internal affairs. China firmly upholds the international system with the United Nations at its core, the international order based on international law, and the basic norms of international relations based on the purposes and principles of the UN Charter, and does not accept the so-called \"rules\" concocted by a few individuals or a small number of countries. China handles the individual cases of relevant personnel in accordance with the law; the US should respect the facts and respect China's rule of law.\nOn issues such as Ukraine and the North Korean nuclear issue, Vice Minister Xie Feng reiterated China's clear and consistent position.\nBoth sides agreed that the talks were candid, in-depth, and constructive, and agreed to maintain communication and work together to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347424.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-16","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","Japan will define China as an \"unprecedented strategic challenge\" in its new National Security Strategy, clearly because Japan views China as a greater threat than ever before. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China has always been committed to maintaining peace and stability in the Asia-Pacific region and the world, and is a partner and opportunity for the development of all countries. The defense policy document issued by Japan disregards the facts, deviates from Japan's commitment to bilateral relations and the consensus reached between China and Japan, and makes unwarranted smears against China's national defense construction and normal military activities. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a solemn representation with Japan through diplomatic channels.\nThe Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. Japan, in particular, should exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan issue, abide by its commitments, and refrain from sending wrong signals to the outside world. China's position on maritime issues is consistent and clear. Japan's allowing right-wing forces to stir up trouble in the East China Sea and its collusion with relevant countries to escalate or even artificially create tension in the South China Sea poses the greatest challenge to regional peace and stability. Japan should stop instigating, provoking, and creating incidents on maritime issues for its own geopolitical interests.\nChina and Japan are close neighbors and important countries in the region. Maintaining and developing friendly and cooperative relations between China and Japan is in the fundamental interests of both countries and their people. We once again urge Japan to abide by the principles outlined in the four political documents between China and Japan, and to earnestly translate the political consensus of \"being partners and not posing a threat to each other\" into policy and action. Attempts to use the \"China threat\" narrative as a pretext for its own military buildup are doomed to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347428.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-20","Mao Ning","TASS reporter","Guatemala's new \"ambassador\" to Taiwan announced on Monday that Guatemala plans to host a \"high-level summit of pro-Taiwan countries\" next March and hopes that the leader of the Taiwan region will attend. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. The DPP authorities' attempts to manipulate the issue politically using so-called \"diplomatic allies\" are doomed to failure. Relevant countries should recognize the international situation and make decisions that conform to the historical trend.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347430.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-20","Mao Ning","Kyodo News reporter","According to reports, Taiwan leaders held talks with relevant personnel from the European Parliament who visited Taiwan today. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and the political basis of China-EU relations. As an official institution of the EU, the European Parliament should abide by the one-China principle.\nChina firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the EU and Taiwan, and urges the EU to abide by the one-China principle, be cautious in its words and deeds on Taiwan-related issues, and avoid interfering with the overall situation of China-EU relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347430.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2022-12-28","Wang Wenbin","Kyodo News reporter","Today, Japanese Liberal Democratic Party lawmaker Hiroshige Seko met with Tsai Ing-wen in Taiwan, and Tsai welcomed Japan's three security treaties. What is China's comment on this?","Certain Japanese politicians, seeking their own political gain, have repeatedly staged grand performances by visiting Taiwan and advocating for \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a strong protest with Japan.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. Japan, which colonized Taiwan for half a century, bears historical responsibility to the Chinese people and should be especially cautious in its words and actions. We urge Japan to abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We also solemnly warn the DPP authorities that their attempts to go against the tide of history and seek \"independence\" by relying on foreign powers will end in failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347436.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2022-12-29","","Reporter","According to the PLA Daily, in 2022, the Chinese military acted on the vision of building a community with a shared future for mankind, made efforts to fulfill the international responsibilities as the military of a major country, actively carried out international military cooperation and achieved fruitful results. Please share with us more on this.","The year 2022 is of great significance in the history of the CPC and China. The 20th CPC National Congress was held successfully, and China has embarked on a new journey toward building a modern socialist country in all respects. Under the guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, the Chinese military has promoted international military cooperation in line with Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and Xi Jinping Thought on Diplomacy, comprehend the decisive significance of establishing Comrade Xi Jinping’s core position on the Party Central Committee and in the Party as a whole and defining the guiding role of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and implement the CMC chairman responsibility system. To achieve the Party’s goal of building a strong military for the new era, the Chinese military focused on improving combat readiness and made pioneering efforts in international military cooperation, which made a positive contribution to defending China’s national sovereignty, security and development interests, safeguarding world peace and stability, and serving the building of a community with a shared future for mankind.\nFirst, international military cooperation serves the overall political and diplomatic interests of China. Since early 2022, under the strategic guidance of President Xi Jinping's head-of-state diplomacy, other CMC leaders have held meetings, talks or video calls with defense and military leaders of Russia, the United States, Cambodia, Pakistan, Saudi Arabia and other countries to put into practice the achievements of head-of-state diplomacy in the military field. The Chinese military hosted the reception for the 95th anniversary of the founding of the People's Liberation Army, the second China-Africa Peace and Security Forum Ministerial Meeting, and the Fifth China-Latin American and the Caribbean States Defense Forum. During these events, the Chinese side actively introduced the spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress, and major initiatives proposed by President Xi Jinping such as the Global Security Initiative and a community with a shared future for mankind. These efforts have enhanced understanding of other countries on China's policies and positions.\nSecond, it serves to safeguard national sovereignty, dignity and core interests. In response to the provocative actions or rhetoric made by the United States and other countries on issues concerning China's core interests and major concerns including Taiwan and the South China Sea, in addition to having resolute military operations to safeguard national sovereignty and security, the Chinese military also made solemn representations, performed countermeasures and punishments, and issued timely spokesperson remarks to make clear our attitudes and positions.\nThird, it focuses on the military’s main responsibility of improving combat readiness. The Chinese military organized or participated in various joint exercises and training, international military games and joint patrols including Vostok-2022 , China-Russia joint strategic air patrol, Joint Sea-2022 , Falcon Strike-2022 , and International Army Games-2022, which helped the Chinese military to deepen mutual trust and cooperation with the militaries of relevant countries, and played a positive role in improving realistic training.\nFourth, it serves to effectively maintain overall strategic stability. Over the past year, the Chinese military has faithfully implemented the Global Security Initiative, continued to deepen practical exchanges and cooperation between the militaries of China and Russia, and maintained the strategic cooperation between the two militaries at a high level. We have maintained the overall stability of the military relations between China and the United States, urged the US side to walk towards a same goal, implement the consensus of the heads of state, maintain smooth communication channels, properly handle disagreements and differences, and strengthen crisis management and control. We have maintained strategic communications between the defense departments and militaries of China and the EU. We have continuously deepened practical cooperation with neighboring countries in various fields, which played a positive role in promoting the building of a community of shared future with neighboring countries. We have strengthened defense and security cooperation with developing countries in Africa, Latin America and South Pacific. The Chinese military has also actively carried out cooperation in international arms control, and resolutely safeguarded China’s national strategic interests and global strategic stability.\nFifth, the Chinese military actively participated in global security governance. We participated in various institutional meetings including the Defense Ministers' Meeting of the Member States of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, the ADMM-Plus, and the China-ASEAN Defense Ministers' Informal Meeting. We sent a senior military delegation to the Shangri-La Dialogue, attended the Moscow International Security Conference and other multilateral dialogue and cooperation mechanisms. We held the first \"Shared Vision\" international peacekeeping forum, and Beijing Xiangshan Forum Webinar, which helped strengthen the voice and influence of the Chinese military in the world.\nSixth, it serves to build a community with a shared future for mankind. The PLA Navy's hospital ship Ark Peace visited Indonesia to carry out Mission Harmony-2022 in November and provided medical service to local people. PLA Air Force Y-20 transport aircraft carried out humanitarian relief missions in Tonga, Afghanistan and Pakistan. The Chinese military also actively participated in UN peacekeeping operations and vessel protection operations in the Gulf of Aden, providing public security goods to the international community.\nThe Chinese military is embracing the world for peace. In the face of historic changes of our world and times, the Chinese military will, guided by Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era and aimed at realizing the military’s centenary goal, continue to expand and deepen relations with foreign militaries and strengthen practical exchanges and cooperation, so as to make new and greater contributions to world peace and common development.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-12-29","","Reporter","It is reported that during a meeting between US and Chinese defense chiefs, the US defense secretary talked about the importance of resuming military dialogues between China and the US. A US deputy assistant secretary of defense said recently at a seminar that China's suspension of military dialogues due to Nancy Pelosi's visit to Taiwan is not conducive to timely communication between the two militaries to…","We have noted the relevant reports. Right and wrong should not be confused. China's cancellation of three exchanges between the two militaries was a necessary countermeasure against the deliberate action by the US side to created a major crisis and gravely harm China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. The cause and effect are clear, and the US side knows that. The US side has issued a number of negative policy documents and legislation concerning China, kept playing up great-power competition and the so-called \"China threat\", and grossly interfered in China's internal affairs. These acts further damaged the foundation and atmosphere for communication and exchanges between the two militaries.\nIt should be noted that the Chinese side attaches great importance to the China-US military relations, and communications between the two militaries at the working level are not stopped. However, the US cannot expect China to resume dialogues and exchanges when it keeps harming China's interests. Moreover, the US side should not mislead the public on the cause and try to blame China for the cancellation of some military exchanges. It is simply not fair. If the US side truly wants to have positive and constructive dialogues with the Chinese side, it needs to show sincerity with real actions, respect China's core interests and major concerns, and create conditions and atmosphere for the military relations to return to the right track.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-12-29","","Reporter","It is reported that Japan has recently revised the National Security Strategy (NSS), the National Defense Strategy (NDS) and the Defense Buildup Program (DBP). The three security documents labeled China as an “unprecedented and the greatest strategic challenge”. The documents say that Japan will possess “counterstrike capability” to strike missile launch sites on opponent’s territory, increase defense spending…","The China-related contents in these documents released by the Japanese government are fraught with distortions and biases. They deliberately exaggerate the so-called “China threat” and smear China’s defense and military development and normal military activities. They constitute a grave interference in China’s internal affairs and create regional tensions. China strongly opposes these contents.\nFacts have proven that China is a partner and an opportunity to the development of other countries, and the Chinese military is a staunch force for world peace that has never challenged or threatened anyone. Japan, in contrast, has seriously violated its own pacificist constitution and “exclusively defense-oriented” policy in recent years. On the pretext of so-called external threats, it has massively increased defense spending, stepped up military technology research and development in such areas as space, missile defense and hypersonic weapons, and enhanced military cooperation with the US. It is seeking the so-called “counterstrike capability”, clamoring about “nuclear sharing” with the US, and following certain countries to build small group alliances targeting at others. Japan has become a real challenge to regional peace, security and stability.\nTaiwan is China’s Taiwan, and the Taiwan question is China’s internal affair. In the past, Japan waged an aggressive war against China, which inflicted untold sufferings to the Chinese people, including the compatriots in Taiwan. These agonies and pains are still fresh in our memory. Japan recognized in the four political documents between China and Japan that the government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government of China, and that it fully understands and respects the Chinese government’s stance that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the Chinese territory. The Taiwan question brooks no interference by Japan. What it should do is to remember history, reflect on its crimes, keep its commitments, and watch its words and deeds.\nThe next year will mark the 45th anniversary of the Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship. History has told us that only when Japan sticks to peaceful development and truly respects other countries’ security concerns can it gain the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community. We urge the Japanese side to learn lessons from history, refrain from muddying the waters and pursuing selfish gains on Taiwan, do not walk the old beggar-thy-neighbor path that turns oneself into enemy of neighbors, and do more to preserve regional peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2022-12-29","","Reporter","It is reported that the head of Taiwan’s foreign affairs department recently said that “military threats” from the mainland had become “unprecedentedly serious” as the number of military aircraft “trespassing into” Taiwan’s “air defense identification zone” has increased by five times since 2020. He said the mainland would find more excuses to rehearse attacks on Taiwan. What’s your comment on that?","The military operations conducted by the PLA are targeted at “Taiwan independence” separatist forces and external interference. The aim is defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Such military operations will happen where there are people who betray their motherland and seek to split the country. Instead of counting how frequently or how many times PLA aircraft fly, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities had better face up to history and reality and recognize the overwhelming trend of national reunification and what the people wish for. They should reflect on what they have done wrong to court foreign support, seek “Taiwan independence” by force, heighten cross-Strait confrontation and damage the cross-Strait relations.\nIt is a sacred duty of the PLA to safeguard national sovereignty and deter “Taiwan independence” separatists. Always bearing in mind its missions, the PLA will continue to improve military preparedness, be ready to smash any form of “Taiwan independence” schemes and interference by external forces, and resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nAs the year 2023 is just around the corner, I would like to wish you all a very happy New Year. Thank you for following China’s defense and military development in the past year, and for your trust and support for the press release of the Ministry of National Defense.\nIn the past year, China successfully held the 20th CPC National Congress, which made strategic arrangements for achieving the military’s centenary goal and defense and military modernization. The people’s military has strengthened training and enhanced military preparedness across the board and improved its strategic capabilities for defending China’s sovereignty, security and development interests. We have taken an active part in international peacekeeping operations, and maritime vessel protection and humanitarian assistance missions, making our efforts to promote a community of shared future for mankind and demonstrating the “warm power” of the military of a responsible major country.\nIn the past year, the MND Information Office has released important information, clarified policy positions and answered media queries through regular press conferences, and spokesperson’s statements and remarks to deliver the PLA’s voice in a comprehensive, timely and accurate manner. As a spokesperson for the MND and a messenger for the PLA, I’m fully aware of my responsibility in this position and feel proud of my mission of speaking on behalf of the country and the military. But this is not a solo that I stage and command on my own – the powerful forces behind me are the true source of our strength.\nRight at this moment, my colleagues in the military are still on duty at their respective posts. They are on high mountains and in remote borders, missing their families far away. They may encounter freezing winters and life-and-death moments but they smile in all the harsh conditions. They believe as firmly as I do that the minute we put on the uniform and pick up the gun, we must always be ready for the call of duty. Though they are serving across the country, be it rivers or mountains or coasts, they are at home. Today, let’s take some time to hear their voices.\nThe year 2023 will be the first year of comprehensively implementing the spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress. In the coming year, the people’s military will keep forging ahead with enterprise and fortitude, strive to achieve the military’s centenary goal, grow faster to become a world-class military, and achieve greater glories and victories on the new journey.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2022-12-30","Wang Wenbin","China Daily reporter","It has been reported that the U.S. State Department has approved the sale of approximately $180 million worth of Volcano anti-tank mine-laying systems to Taiwan. What is China's comment on this?","We have always firmly opposed the United States selling weapons to Taiwan.\nChina urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, earnestly implement the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" cease arms sales to Taiwan and military contacts with Taiwan, and stop creating new tensions in the Taiwan Strait. China will take forceful measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty and security interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347438.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-04","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Former NATO Secretary General Rasmussen met with Tsai Ing-wen today, stating that democracy must unite to resist \"dictatorship.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is not a democratic issue, but a matter of China's territorial integrity and national reunification. I want to emphasize that any attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" on the international stage is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347440.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-09","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","A high-level delegation from the German Federal Parliament arrived in Taipei today to visit Taiwan. Will China take countermeasures against these parliamentarians?","The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, and the one-China principle is the political foundation for China to develop bilateral relations with all countries that have established diplomatic ties with China, including Germany. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. We urge relevant German politicians to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, immediately cease their collusion and interactions with \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and immediately stop sending any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China will take necessary measures to firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nWe must point out that the root cause of the Taiwan issue lies precisely in the rampant \"law of the jungle,\" hegemonism, colonialism, and militarism that plagued the world in the past, from which China suffered greatly. Germany has a profound and painful historical lesson in this regard. For more than a century and a half, the Chinese people have been committed to the struggle against imperialism, hegemony, and colonialism, and have firmly safeguarded national sovereignty, territorial integrity, and national dignity. We will never allow certain forces to attempt to turn the Asia-Pacific region into an \"arena\" for geopolitical games again in order to maintain their own hegemony.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347443.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-11","Wang Wenbin","A reporter from the Japanese newspaper *Tokyo Shimbun* asked","\"A Lithuanian member of parliament who is currently visiting Taiwan will meet with Tsai Ing-wen. What is China's comment on this?\"","We have repeatedly pointed out that Lithuania has violated the commitments made when China established diplomatic relations with Lithuania and has openly created a \"one China, one Taiwan\" situation internationally, which violates the basic norms of international relations. We urge Lithuania to abide by the commitments made when China established diplomatic relations with Lithuania and return to the track of the one-China principle as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347445.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-12","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Yesterday, the United States and Japan announced a significant strengthening of their military relationship, with Japan agreeing to the deployment of U.S. Marines to Okinawa, near Taiwan. What is China's comment on this?","We have noted the relevant reports. Bilateral military cooperation between the US and Japan should ensure that it does not harm the interests of third parties or undermine regional peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347446.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-13","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that the US and Japan issued a joint statement after the \"2+2\" meeting of their foreign and defense ministers on the 11th, calling China the biggest strategic challenge in the Indo-Pacific region and other areas, and criticizing China on issues related to Taiwan, Hong Kong, Xinjiang, and the sea. What is China's comment on this?","The US-Japan \"2+2\" joint statement you mentioned is full of Cold War zero-sum thinking and unwarranted smears and attacks against China. We firmly oppose it.\nWhile the US and Japan claim to promote regional peace and security, they are actually using this as an excuse to expand their military and engage in militarism. They claim to uphold a free and open Indo-Pacific region, but in reality, they are weaving various closed and exclusive cliques, creating division and confrontation. They claim to uphold a rules-based international order, but in reality, they are wantonly trampling on international law and the basic norms of international relations, and grossly interfering in the internal affairs of other countries. These actions have become a real challenge to regional peace, security, and stability.\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a haven for peace and development, not an arena for geopolitical struggle. Asia-Pacific countries support justice and oppose hegemony, aspire to cooperation and oppose confrontation, pursue genuine multilateralism and oppose \"small circles\" that incite confrontation. We urge the US and Japan to abandon their Cold War mentality and ideological biases, stop creating \"imaginary enemies,\" stop introducing \"new Cold War\" thinking into the Asia-Pacific region, and refrain from becoming a disruptive force that destabilizes the region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347447.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-13","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, the United States and Japan issued a joint statement after the \"2+2\" meeting between foreign ministers and defense ministers held on the 11th, calling China the biggest strategic challenge in the Indo-Pacific region and other regions, and accusing China on Taiwan-related, Hong Kong-related, Xinjiang-related, maritime-related issues and other issues. What is China’s comment on this?","The US-Japan \"2+2\" joint statement you mentioned is full of Cold War zero-sum mentality and groundless smear attacks against China. We are firmly opposed to this.\nThe United States and Japan say they want to promote regional peace and security, but in fact they are looking for excuses for their military deployment and militarization. They say they want to maintain a free and open \"Indo-Pacific\" region, but in fact they weave various closed and exclusive \"small circles\" to create division and confrontation. They say they want to maintain a rules-based international order, but in fact they wantonly trample on international law and basic norms of international relations and grossly interfere in other countries' internal affairs. These actions have become a real challenge to regional peace, security and stability.\nThe Asia-Pacific is a highland for peaceful development, not a geopolitical arena. Asia-Pacific countries support justice and oppose hegemony. They look forward to cooperation and oppose confrontation. They pursue true multilateralism and oppose \"small circles\" that incite confrontation between camps. We urge the United States and Japan to abandon the Cold War mentality and ideological prejudice, stop creating \"imaginary enemies\", stop introducing the \"new Cold War\" mentality into the Asia-Pacific region, and stop being a countercurrent that disrupts stability in the Asia-Pacific.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347447.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-16","Wang Wenbin","Shenzhen TV reporter","We noticed that Foreign Minister Qin Gang also visited Egypt and the Arab League headquarters during his trip to Africa. Could the spokesperson please provide some details?","Not long ago, President Xi Jinping attended the first China-Arab States Summit, leading China-Arab relations into a new era of comprehensive and in-depth development. On January 15, Foreign Minister Qin Gang visited Egypt and the headquarters of the Arab League. This is an important measure to implement the outcomes of the China-Arab States Summit and demonstrates China's firm determination to work with the Arab world to build a China-Arab community with a shared future for a new era.\nDuring his visit, Egyptian President Abdel Fattah al-Sisi met with Foreign Minister Qin Gang. Foreign Minister Qin also held talks with Egyptian Foreign Minister Shoukry. The two sides exchanged in-depth views on implementing the important consensus reached by the two heads of state and reached broad consensus on bilateral relations and regional and international issues of common concern.\nBoth sides agreed that China and Egypt enjoy solid strategic mutual trust and should continue to firmly support each other on issues involving their core interests and major concerns. China appreciates Egypt's valuable support on issues concerning Taiwan and Xinjiang, which involve China's core interests, and firmly supports Egypt in pursuing a development path suited to its national conditions, as well as in safeguarding Egypt's national sovereignty and security and achieving development and revitalization.\nBoth sides agreed that the joint construction of the Belt and Road Initiative between China and Egypt has yielded fruitful results and has enormous potential. China is willing to further align its development strategies with Egypt's and jointly implement global development initiatives; China is also willing to cooperate with Egypt to advance the construction of major projects, import more high-quality Egyptian products, and encourage more Chinese enterprises to invest and do business in Egypt, so as to achieve a higher level of mutual benefit and win-win results.\nBoth sides agreed that China and Egypt have profound civilizations and should continue to expand people-to-people exchanges, actively promoting exchanges between think tanks, youth, and media outlets to achieve deeper mutual understanding. Egypt welcomes Chinese tourists, a sentiment appreciated by China, which believes that in the near future, the number of Chinese tourists and flights to Egypt will recover to or even exceed pre-pandemic levels.\nBoth sides agreed that China and Egypt share similar views and positions on regional and international affairs, and should cooperate more closely to jointly promote the political settlement of regional hotspots, jointly uphold the basic norms of international relations, defend the principle of non-interference in internal affairs, and safeguard the common interests of developing countries.\nDuring his visit to Egypt, Foreign Minister Qin also held talks with Arab League Secretary-General Ahmed Aboul Gheit. Both sides agreed to implement the outcomes of the China-Arab States Summit, accelerate the \"Eight Joint Actions,\" and better benefit the people of both China and the Arab world. Foreign Minister Qin stated that China firmly supports Arab countries in uniting and cooperating to resolve regional security issues, supports the Arab people in independently exploring their own development paths, and supports the Arab League in playing a greater role in promoting peace and stability in the Middle East.\nSecretary-General Gheit thanked China for its long-standing commitment to upholding justice internationally, supporting the development of Arab countries and the unity of the Arab League, and providing valuable assistance to the Arab world in its successful fight against the pandemic. He expressed his hope to further deepen cooperation between China and the Arab world in various fields and stated that the Arab world welcomes more Chinese citizens to travel to Egypt and other Arab countries and to conduct economic and trade cooperation.\nDuring his visit, Foreign Minister Qin also pointed out that the Palestinian issue is the core of the Middle East problem and concerns peace and stability in the region. The fundamental reason for the recurring escalation of the Israeli-Palestinian situation lies in the stagnation of Israeli-Palestinian peace talks and the failure to implement the \"two-state solution.\" The international community should enhance its sense of urgency, prioritize the Palestinian issue on the international agenda, promote the resumption of Israeli-Palestinian peace talks, properly address the final status issues such as Jerusalem, and facilitate an early, just, and lasting solution to the Palestinian issue based on the \"two-state solution.\" Influential major powers should shoulder their responsibilities in this regard.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347448.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-16","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on the 13th, US President Biden and Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida held talks in Washington and issued a joint statement, saying that China violated the rules-based international order, leading to rising challenges in the Asia-Pacific region. The two sides are committed to strengthening the US-Japan alliance and defense against Japan, and accused China on issues such as the East China…","Japan and the United States conspire to stage a farce that slanders China's image, interferes in China's internal affairs, and suppresses China's development. This is both very hypocritical and very dangerous. China firmly opposes this and has lodged stern representations.\nJapan once went astray by militarism, launched aggressive wars, committed serious crimes against humanity, and brought serious disasters to the region and the world. However, instead of serious reflection, Japan once again showed a dangerous trend of strengthening its military and expanding its armed forces. Japan's defense budget has increased significantly for 11 consecutive years. It has continuously adjusted its security policies and vigorously pursued military breakthroughs. It has also exaggerated regional tensions in a confusing way to make excuses for its own military consolidation and economic development. It has even sought to introduce NATO into the Asia-Pacific region. What Japan has done cannot help but raise doubts. Japan is deviating from the track of post-war peaceful development, and the danger of repeating the same mistakes of history is accumulating. We are warning Japan that any attempt to disrupt security and stability in the Asia-Pacific will be met with widespread opposition and strong countermeasures from countries in the region.\nThe United States repeatedly talks about rules and order to other countries, but it is the number one disruptor of international rules and order. From wanton aggression against other countries to indiscriminate imposition of unilateral sanctions, from major arrears of United Nations dues to malicious obstruction of the selection of judges of the WTO Appellate Body, from arbitrary \"coercive diplomacy\" against other countries to cobbling together a closed and exclusive \"small circle\" , from deploying a large number of warships and aircraft to show off their power in the Asia-Pacific region to opening the \"Pandora's Box\" of nuclear proliferation, facts have repeatedly proved that the United States never cares about rules or order. The only thing the United States really cares about is the stability of its hegemony. As long as it is not in line with the interests of the United States, the United States will ignore, modify or even overturn existing rules, even if the relevant rules are proposed by the United States itself.\nIt must be pointed out that China will unswervingly follow the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics. China's peaceful development cannot be stopped by any country or force. China will take necessary measures to resolutely defend its sovereignty, security and development interests.\nWe urge the United States and Japan to abandon the Cold War mentality, get rid of the inner demons of containing and suppressing China, stop the dangerous behavior of militarization and causing trouble to the world, and return to the right path of peace, friendship, and cooperation in the world.\n**********************************\nThe opening ceremony of the 14th \"Love Knows No Borders - Warm Road to Growth\" international charity sale will be held online in Beijing on the afternoon of January 17. Foreign Minister Qin Gang, special guests Ms. Qian Wei, wife of Comrade Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and State Councilor, and others attended the event. This event will continue to hold online charity sales and live broadcast sales. Regarding the cloud charity sale, you can search for \"Shuxiang Treasure Flagship Store\" through the Alibaba Taobao APP to enter the special web page. It will be officially launched on January 17 and will last until February 8. A live broadcast will be held around the evening of the 8th to bring goods.\nSince 2009, the \"Love Knows No Borders\" international charity sale has been successfully held for 13 consecutive times, implementing a number of poverty alleviation and assistance projects, involving infrastructure, health, livelihood medical care, children's care and other fields. Over the past 13 years, the \"Love Knows No Borders\" international charity sale has focused on serving poverty alleviation and rural revitalization, gathering love from home and abroad, and achieved fruitful results.\nThe theme of this charity sale is \"Warm Road to Growth\", and the donated funds will be used to implement the \"Warm Project\" to build and renovate hot bath facilities for local primary and secondary schools in Jinping County and Malipo County, Yunnan Province.\nWe will continue to publish a series of short videos on the official account of the new media platform \"Love Without Borders\" on WeChat video account, Douyin, Kuaishou, and Bilibili. Envoys from various countries and representatives of international organizations in China will share their feelings and stories about participating in the charity sale, and promote their country's culture and charity products.\nFriends are welcome to continue to pay attention to \"Love Without Borders\", actively participate, and contribute love.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347448.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-30","Mao Ning","China Daily reporter","Recently, the spokesperson for the U.S. State Department has repeatedly mentioned U.S. Secretary of State Blinken's visit to China, stating that the trip will involve discussions with China on how to responsibly manage competition, strengthen cooperation in addressing transnational challenges, and express concerns to China on issues such as Taiwan, fentanyl, Ukraine, and the North Korean nuclear issue. What is…","I would like to emphasize that China has always developed China-US relations in accordance with the three principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping. At the same time, we are determined to safeguard our own sovereignty, security and development interests.\nChina neither avoids nor fears competition, but opposes defining the entire China-US relationship by competition, and opposes using competition as a pretext for containment and suppression. China is willing to conduct communication and cooperation with the US in bilateral and multilateral fields on the basis of mutual respect, equality and mutual benefit. However, it must be pointed out that the US cannot seek communication and cooperation while interfering in China's internal affairs and harming China's interests.\nThe Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, the political foundation of China-US relations, and the first red line that cannot be crossed in China-US relations. The US should never attempt to cross this red line.\nIn the international field of drug control, China was the first country in the world to formally list fentanyl-related substances under complete control. We have been actively carrying out international drug enforcement cooperation within the framework of the UN Convention on Drug Control. On the contrary, the US sanctions against relevant Chinese agencies have seriously affected and restricted China's drug control capabilities, and China firmly opposes this. The US should also deeply reflect on its own ineffective drug control efforts, instead of simply shifting blame and shirking responsibility.\nOn issues such as Ukraine and the North Korean nuclear issue, China has always been committed to political solutions and promoting peace talks, and opposes any words or actions that \"add fuel to the fire\" or escalate tensions. China's policies and positions can withstand the test of facts and history.\nA healthy and stable China-US relationship is crucial to the interests of the people of both countries and the future of the entire world. We hope the US will work with China in the same direction, adhere to the principle of dialogue rather than confrontation, and win-win rather than zero-sum, and take concrete actions to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, so as to push China-US relations back onto a healthy and stable development track.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347453.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-01-31","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Czech President-elect Pawel recently spoke with Tsai Ing-wen and expressed his desire to meet her in person. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Czech President-elect Pavel disregarded China's repeated dissuasion and representations, insisting on speaking with Tsai Ing-wen by phone and engaging in official exchanges with the Taiwan authorities. This constitutes serious interference in China's internal affairs, a blatant violation of the Czech Republic's political commitment to upholding the one-China principle, and sends a wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn representation with the Czech side.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question concerns China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, is China's core interest, and is also the political foundation for China to develop relations with countries that have established diplomatic ties with China. China urges the Czech side to immediately take effective measures to correct its mistakes, eliminate the negative impact of this incident, and uphold the one-China principle with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347454.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-02","Mao Ning","CGTN reporter","NATO Secretary General Jens Stoltenberg has concluded his visit to South Korea and Japan. During his visit, Stoltenberg mentioned China on several occasions, calling it an \"authoritarian counterattack\" against the rules-based, open, and democratic international order. He stated that China has developed military capabilities capable of reaching NATO countries and is threatening Taiwan. NATO must remain united and…","In the past few days, we have stated our position on NATO-related issues on multiple occasions. The NATO Secretary General visited South Korea and Japan, yet he repeatedly mentioned China, deliberately exaggerating the so-called \"China threat,\" drawing ideological lines, and sowing discord among regional countries. His intentions are alarming.\nChina is committed to maintaining world peace and stability, refrains from geopolitical competition, and has no intention of challenging or threatening any country. The peaceful, cooperative, stable, and prosperous situation in the Asia-Pacific region is a result of the joint efforts of the region's countries. The Asia-Pacific region does not welcome Cold War mentality or bloc confrontation. NATO should deeply reflect on its actual role in European security and refrain from destabilizing Europe while attempting to destabilize the Asia-Pacific and the world.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347456.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-03","Mao Ning","CNN reporter","Another related question is that the U.S. military has stated that this is not the first time high-altitude reconnaissance balloons from China have appeared in U.S. airspace. They have repeatedly tried to maintain communication with China through various channels. However, after Pelosi's visit to Taiwan, China severed exchanges and communication between the two militaries. Does this incident highlight the…","China is a responsible country that consistently and strictly abides by international law and has no intention of violating the territory or airspace of any sovereign state. As I just mentioned, we are currently investigating and verifying the situation, and we hope that both sides will handle this matter calmly and prudently.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347457.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-13","Wang Wenbin","China News Service reporter","Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Sen successfully concluded his visit to China on February 11. How does China evaluate this visit?","Prime Minister Hun Sen is a familiar old friend of the Chinese people, and he is the first foreign leader received by China after the Lunar New Year. This is also his first visit in three years since his \"reverse\" visit to China in early 2020 when the COVID-19 epidemic broke out. It also coincides with the 65th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Cambodia and the \"China-Cambodia Friendship Year\". Both sides attach great importance to this visit.\nOn February 10, President Xi Jinping met with Prime Minister Hun Sen, and the two sides held a long and in-depth exchange, outlining a grand blueprint for the future development of China-Cambodia relations. Premier Li Keqiang and Chairman Li Zhanshu also held talks and meetings with Prime Minister Hun Sen. The two sides issued a comprehensive joint statement, held the launching ceremony of the \"China-Cambodia Friendship Year\" and the China-Cambodia Economic, Trade, Investment and Tourism Forum, and signed 12 cooperation documents in the fields of diplomacy, trade, development cooperation, agricultural products, and infrastructure.\nBoth sides agreed that no matter how the international situation changes, China and Cambodia will steadfastly deepen their close and unwavering friendship and work together to build a high-quality, high-level, and high-standard China-Cambodia community with a shared future in the new era. China firmly supports the Cambodian people in independently choosing a development path suited to their national conditions, firmly supports Cambodia in safeguarding its national sovereignty and security, firmly supports Cambodia in smoothly advancing its major domestic political agenda and economic and social development, and resolutely opposes external interference in Cambodia's internal affairs. The Cambodian side expressed its hope that this visit would convey the clear message that the Cambodian people always stand firmly with the Chinese people. Cambodia opposes any attempt to use the Taiwan issue to interfere in China's internal affairs or to contain and suppress China, and firmly supports all efforts made by the Chinese government to achieve national reunification.\nBoth sides agreed to focus on building a China-Cambodia \"Diamond Hexagonal\" cooperation framework, addressing cooperation in six key areas: politics, production capacity, agriculture, energy, security, and people-to-people exchanges. Both sides also agreed to uphold genuine multilateralism, jointly defend international fairness and justice, oppose hegemonism and power politics, and oppose the formation of blocs and exclusive cliques targeting specific countries. Both sides called for the continued full and effective implementation of the Declaration on the Conduct of Parties in the South China Sea (DOC) and for the early conclusion of a substantive and effective Code of Conduct in the South China Sea (COC), emphasizing that any attempt to use the South China Sea issue to undermine regional peace and mutual trust is doomed to failure.\nIt is believed that under the strategic guidance of the two countries' leaders, China-Cambodia relations will reach new heights, the \"ironclad\" friendship between China and Cambodia will become even more unbreakable, bringing more benefits to the people of both countries and contributing more positive energy to regional peace, stability and development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347463.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-17","Wang Wenbin","BBC reporter","Former British Prime Minister Truss delivered a speech in Japan this afternoon criticizing China's human rights record and offering suggestions on how to \"control\" China. For example, she suggested that NATO and Pacific nations strengthen defense cooperation, called for the establishment of an \"economic NATO\" in the region to counter Chinese influence through trade and other measures, and urged regional countries…","I haven't seen the specific content of the speech you mentioned, but we have always opposed distorting facts and smearing China.\nWe would like to remind relevant British politicians of the following fact: authoritative international polls show that the Chinese government enjoys a satisfaction rate of over 93% among its citizens, which is a strong rebuttal to your related remarks.\nWe must also emphasize that China has always been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order. China's development is an opportunity for the world; the better China develops, the more conducive it is to world peace, stability, and common development. Claims that China threatens the security of other countries or engages in \"economic coercion\" are completely unfounded. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, and no country has the right to interfere under any pretext.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347467.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-20","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","We noticed that the US side stated that the meeting between the US and China during the Munich Security Conference was very important. Could the spokesperson provide more details?","At the request of the U.S. side, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and director of the Office of the Central Foreign Affairs Commission, had an informal contact with U.S. Secretary of State Antony Blinken during the Munich Security Conference.\nWang Yi clearly stated China's solemn position on the so-called airship incident, pointing out that the US actions were a typical abuse of force, a clear violation of international norms and civil aviation conventions, and that China expressed strong dissatisfaction and lodged a solemn protest. The US is the world's largest surveillance and reconnaissance nation, with its high-altitude balloons repeatedly and illegally flying over Chinese airspace; it has no right to smear and defame China. What the US should do is show sincerity, face up to and resolve the damage caused to China-US relations by its abuse of force. If the US insists on using this as a pretext to escalate and expand the situation, China will fight to the end, and the US will bear all the consequences.\nWang Yi emphasized that on the Ukraine issue, China has adhered to principles, promoted peace talks, and consistently played a constructive role. The China-Russia comprehensive strategic partnership of coordination is based on non-alignment, non-confrontation, and is not directed against any third party; it is a matter within the sovereign rights of two independent countries. We have never accepted the United States' interference in China-Russia relations, nor its coercion or pressure. As a major power, the United States should promote a political solution to the crisis, rather than fueling it or seeking personal gain.\nWang Yi pointed out that to maintain stability across the Taiwan Strait, it is imperative to firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and truly adhere to the one-China principle. The US must respect historical facts, honor its political commitments, and put its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into practice on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347468.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-21","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"President\" Tsai Ing-wen stated that Taiwan will cooperate more actively with the United States to counter the so-called expansion of authoritarianism. What is your comment on this?","We have corrected this erroneous statement multiple times at press conferences, and I will correct it again today. Taiwan is part of China, and there is no \"president\" there. What you are referring to is merely a local leader of China.\nWe must emphasize that the one-China principle is the political foundation of China-US relations and a universal consensus of the international community. China has consistently and firmly opposed US-Taiwan military contacts and US arms sales to Taiwan. The DPP authorities' provocations aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, cannot shake the international community's general adherence to the one-China principle, and cannot change the inevitable trend of China's reunification. Any attempts and actions by the DPP authorities to rely on foreign powers and undermine cross-strait relations will only backfire and will never succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347469.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-22","Wang Wenbin","China News Service reporter","The Ministry of Foreign Affairs' release of the \"Concept Paper on Global Security Initiative\" has attracted widespread attention from Chinese and foreign media. We also noted that Foreign Minister Qin Gang stated that the release of the \"Concept Paper\" demonstrates China's responsibility for maintaining world peace and its firm determination to safeguard global security. Could the spokesperson provide further…","Yesterday, China held the Blue Hall Forum on Global Security Initiative: Chinas Solution to the Security Dilemma. Foreign Minister Qin Gang attended the opening ceremony and delivered a keynote speech.\nQin Gang stated that China's official release of the \"Global Security Initiative Concept Paper\" elucidates the initiative's core concepts and principles, clarifies key areas of cooperation and platform mechanisms, and demonstrates China's responsibility for maintaining world peace and its firm resolve to safeguard global security. Security is the right of all countries, not the exclusive privilege of a few, and certainly not something that should be dictated by a single nation. The Global Security Initiative serves the interests of all people worldwide and safeguards global peace and security; it requires international solidarity and cooperation to advance.\nQin Gang pointed out that the global security initiative is rooted in the fine traditional Chinese culture of valuing peace and originates from China's independent foreign policy and practice of peace. China will always be committed to the path of peaceful development. No matter how developed it becomes in the future, China will never seek hegemony, expansion, or spheres of influence, nor will it engage in an arms race. It will always remain a guardian of world peace.\nQin Gang stated that China has always been committed to resolving hotspot issues with Chinese characteristics, adhering to the principles of promoting peace talks, emphasizing both short-term and long-term solutions, advocating for mutual understanding and pursuing fairness and justice. On the Iranian nuclear issue, China actively promotes the restoration of the Joint Comprehensive Plan of Action (JCPOA), safeguards the legitimate rights and interests of relevant countries, and upholds the international nuclear non-proliferation regime. On the Korean Peninsula issue, China insists on advancing the peace mechanism and denuclearization process on the peninsula in parallel, addressing the legitimate concerns of all parties in a balanced manner, and maintaining peace and stability on the Korean Peninsula. On the Middle East issue, China welcomes and supports security dialogue among regional countries, including Saudi Arabia and Iran, and independently builds a Middle East security architecture that conforms to regional realities and takes into account the interests of all parties. On the Ukraine issue, China has always based its actions on facts, adhered to objectivity and fairness, and played a responsible and constructive role in easing tensions and resolving the crisis. China will continue to promote peace talks, provide Chinese wisdom for a political solution to the Ukraine crisis, and work with the international community to jointly promote dialogue and consultation, address the concerns of all parties, and seek common security. China urges relevant countries to immediately stop fueling the flames, stop shifting blame to China, and stop advocating \"Today Ukraine, tomorrow Taiwan.\"\nQin Gang pointed out that China's development cannot be separated from a secure international environment. Similarly, without China's security, there is no world security. Currently, external suppression and containment of China are escalating and intensifying, posing a serious threat to China's sovereignty and security. We resolutely oppose all forms of hegemonism and power politics, resolutely oppose Cold War mentality and bloc confrontation, resolutely oppose any external interference in China's internal affairs, and resolutely safeguard national sovereignty, security, development interests, and international fairness and justice.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347470.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-02-23","","Reporter","The director of the US Central Intelligence Agency &nbsp;recently claimed that the PLA has been ordered to get ready for attacking Taiwan before 2027. In contrast, the US Assistant Secretary of Defense for Indo-Pacific Security Affairs &nbsp;said at a Congress hearing that he was confident that the Chinese mainland won’t make any major “aggression” against Taiwan before 2030. Meanwhile, US Air Force Chief of…","We’ve noticed that the US side often makes such self-contradictory remarks. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is part of China and resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people and should be decided by the Chinese people. It brooks no foreign interference. No matter what the US side says, it won’t change the course of China’s reunification, nor will it shake our resolve and will to safeguard national reunification and territorial integrity.\nThe people living on the two sides of the Taiwan Strait are brothers and sisters of one big family. This bond is stronger than any other relations. We will strive for a peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort. This being said, if the Democratic Progressive Party &nbsp;authorities insists on going down the wrong path of colluding with foreign forces, making provocations for “Taiwan independence”, and heightening cross-strait confrontation, or even endangering the well-being of Taiwan compatriots, the PLA will speak with actions and take necessary measures to defeat any “Taiwan independence” secessionist moves and foreign interference, and safeguard the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation and the immediate interests of people living across the Strait.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-02-24","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from the Chinese Global Center of China Media Group","We saw that American talk show host Garland Nixon tweeted last week that President Biden had warned that the United States had \"plans to destroy Taiwan.\" What is China's comment on this?","I would also like to know what the \"plan to destroy Taiwan\" means. The US should give a clear explanation.\nTaiwan is part of China, and we will resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347472.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-27","Mao Ning","China News Service reporter","US Secretary of State Blinken stated that China has been providing non-lethal assistance to Russia through its companies, but is now considering providing lethal assistance. US National Security Advisor Sullivan stated that if China decides to aid Russia, it will pay a substantial price. What is China's response to this?","On the Ukraine issue, China has consistently and actively promoted peace talks and a political solution to the crisis. The US has no right to interfere in China-Russia relations, and we will never accept coercion or pressure from the US.\nThe US has not only been supplying lethal weapons to the Ukrainian battlefield, but has also violated the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués by continuously selling advanced weapons to Taiwan. What exactly is the US trying to do? It should give an explanation to the world.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347473.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-02-28","Mao Ning","The Paper reporter","US Secretary of State Antony Blinken recently stated that one reason the world is so concerned about the Taiwan Strait crisis is that it is not an internal affair as China claims it to be based on its sovereignty, but rather a matter of global concern. He added that if Taiwan faces a crisis due to China's \"aggression,\" it would have disastrous consequences for countries and economies worldwide. What is China's…","Secretary Blinken's remarks are extremely irresponsible and absurd, and China firmly opposes them. On the Taiwan issue, Secretary Blinken needs to seriously learn a lesson in history. Taiwan has been an inseparable part of China's territory since ancient times. The one-China principle is a universally recognized basic norm of international relations and an important political prerequisite and foundation for China to establish diplomatic relations with other countries.\nIn the 1972 Shanghai Communiqué, the United States clearly stated: \"The United States recognizes that all Chinese on both sides of the Taiwan Strait consider there to be only one China and that Taiwan is part of China. The United States government does not object to this position.\"\nIn 1978, the United States clearly stated in the Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations: \"The United States of America recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China and acknowledges China's position that there is only one China and that Taiwan is a part of China.\"\nIn the 1982 August 17 Communiqué, the United States clearly stated: \"The United States of America recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China and acknowledges China's position that there is only one China and that Taiwan is a part of China. The United States government has no intention of infringing upon China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, no intention of interfering in China's internal affairs, and no intention of implementing the 'two Chinas' or 'one China, one Taiwan' policy.\"\nOn the Taiwan issue, the political commitments made by the US to China are clearly stated in black and white.\nFor some time now, the US has deliberately ignored and distorted historical facts, sending the wrong signals on the Taiwan issue, significantly relaxing restrictions on official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, strengthening US-Taiwan military ties, and inciting the narrative of \"Today Ukraine, tomorrow Taiwan.\" Some media outlets have even reported that the US government has formulated a plan to \"destroy Taiwan.\" One cannot help but ask: what exactly is the US trying to achieve?!\nI want to reiterate that the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, the core of China's core interests, the political foundation of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. China will never allow any external forces to interfere in China's internal affairs. We urge the US to pull back from the brink, stop its protracted, salami-slicing, and disruptive tactics on the Taiwan issue, and stop its attempts to confuse the public and make irresponsible statements. If the US persists in its course of action, it will inevitably lead to serious consequences, and the US will pay a heavy price for it.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347474.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-02","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that US Secretary of State Blinken stated on the 1st that if China truly adhered to the first principle in the document \"China's Position on the Political Settlement of the Ukraine Crisis\"\"respect for the sovereignty of all countries\"it should have supported Ukraine's full restoration of sovereignty over the past year. However, China has consistently acted in the opposite direction,…","On the Ukraine issue, China has always adhered to an objective and impartial stance, committed to promoting peace talks and pushing for a political solution to the crisis. We have always stood on the side of peace and on the side of dialogue.\nThe United States has been supplying lethal weapons to the battlefield in Ukraine and has been stirring up trouble and spreading disinformation, which China firmly opposes.\nThe United States claims to respect territorial sovereignty, yet it pushes the boundaries and seeks breakthroughs on the Taiwan issue, violating its own political commitments by selling advanced weapons to Taiwan. The United States says it wants peace, yet it launches wars and incites confrontation around the world. The United States emphasizes respecting and maintaining the international order, yet it imposes illegal unilateral sanctions and places its domestic law above international law. The United States says it wants fair competition, yet it abuses its national power to unreasonably suppress companies from other countries and tramples on international trade rules.\nWhat the United States should do is reflect on its own actions, stop confusing the public, stop making irresponsible remarks, and stop judging others by its own standards. It should earnestly shoulder its own responsibilities and do things that promote the easing of the situation and encourage peace talks, instead of pointing fingers at other countries, making irresponsible remarks, and slandering them.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347476.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-06","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"Defense Minister\" stated that given the escalating tensions across the Taiwan Strait, Taiwan should be wary of Chinese troops \"intruding\" into areas near Taiwan. What is China's response to this?","First of all, I want to tell you that Taiwan is part of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Minister of National Defense.\" Both sides of the Taiwan Strait are Chinese territory. China will take firm measures to defend its sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347478.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-08","Mao Ning","Kyodo News reporter","Recently, some media outlets reported that Taiwanese leader Tsai Ing-wen will transit through the United States in April and meet with U.S. House Speaker McCarthy in California. The reports claim that Tsai persuaded McCarthy to meet in California instead of Taiwan to avoid angering mainland China. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","China is seriously concerned about the relevant information and has lodged a strong protest with the US, demanding that the US provide clarification.\nForeign Minister Qin Gang specifically pointed out at a press conference during the \"Two Sessions\" yesterday that Taiwan is an integral part of the sacred territory of the People's Republic of China. Completing the great cause of reunifying the motherland is the sacred duty of all Chinese people, including our compatriots in Taiwan. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. \"Taiwan independence\" separatism is irreconcilable with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The real threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces; the stabilizing force is the one-China principle; and the true safeguard is the three China-US joint communiqués.\nI want to emphasize that China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes leaders of \"Taiwan independence\" separatists visiting the US under any name or for any reason, and firmly opposes the US violating the one-China principle by engaging in any form of contact with \"Taiwan independence\" separatists.\nWe urge the US to abide by the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly implement the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas,\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, and stop undermining the one-China principle. No one should underestimate the Chinese government and people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347479.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-08","Mao Ning","Reporter from Kyodo News","Recently, some media reported that Taiwanese leader Tsai Ing-wen will transit the United States in April and meet with Speaker of the U.S. House of Representatives McCarthy in California. According to reports, Tsai Ing-wen persuaded McCarthy to meet in California instead of Taiwan to avoid angering mainland China. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","China is seriously concerned about the relevant news and has lodged stern representations with the United States, requesting clarification from the United States.\nForeign Minister Qin Gang specifically pointed out at the \"Two Sessions\" press conference yesterday that Taiwan is part of the sacred territory of the People's Republic of China. Completing the great cause of reunifying the motherland is the sacred duty of all Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political foundation of Sino-US relations, and the first red line that cannot be crossed in Sino-US relations. \"Taiwan independence\" separatism is incompatible with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The real threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The one-China principle is the anchor of the sea, and the real guardrails are the three China-US joint communiqués.\nI want to emphasize that China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, firmly opposes the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist leaders seeking to seek refuge in the United States in any name and for any reason, and firmly opposes the United States' violation of the one-China principle and any form of contact with \"Taiwan independence\" separatists.\nWe urge the U.S. to abide by the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, earnestly implement the commitments made by U.S. leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" stop any form of official exchanges between the U.S. and Taiwan, stop escalating substantive U.S.-Taiwan relations, and stop hollowing out the one-China principle. No one should underestimate the strong determination, firm will and strong ability of the Chinese government and people to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347479.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-10","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Outgoing Micronesian President Panuelo stated that he met with Taiwanese officials in February, and that Taiwan agreed to provide $50 million in exchange for Micronesia establishing diplomatic relations with Taiwan. What is China's response to this?","I have noted the relevant reports. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the one-China principle is a universally recognized basic norm of international relations, as well as the political premise and foundation for China to establish diplomatic relations with all countries in the world, including the Federated States of Micronesia. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and the Taiwan authorities in violation of the one-China principle. China is willing to promote friendly cooperation with Micronesia on the basis of the one-China principle, upholding the principles of mutual respect, equality and mutual benefit.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347481.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-16","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","I have two questions. First, Taiwan's \"Ministry of Foreign Affairs\" warned Honduras not to be tempted by the \"poison pill\" of Chinese financial aid, even if it means taking on a large debt. What is China's comment on this? Second, a TikTok spokesperson told Reuters that the Biden administration has demanded ByteDance sell TikTok or face a US ban. What is China's response to this?","Regarding the first question, Taiwan does not have a \"Ministry of Foreign Affairs,\" only a department responsible for foreign affairs in Taiwan Province. The one-China principle is the political foundation and prerequisite for China to establish diplomatic relations with all countries in the world. In recent years, after Panama, El Salvador, the Dominican Republic, Nicaragua, and other countries established or resumed diplomatic relations with China, bilateral pragmatic cooperation has developed rapidly, effectively promoting the economic and social development of the relevant countries and bringing tangible benefits to their people. China is willing to develop friendly and cooperative relations with all countries in the world, including Honduras, on the basis of the one-China principle, and believes that this will create more opportunities for Honduras' economic development and the well-being of its people.\nRegarding your comments concerning the DPP authorities in Taiwan, we would like to point out that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China. The DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to their separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" will only end in failure.\nRegarding the second question, we have noted the relevant reports. China has consistently maintained that data security should not be used as a tool for individual countries to generalize the concept of national security and abuse state power to unreasonably suppress companies from other countries.\nThe US has so far failed to provide evidence that TikTok threatens US national security. The US should stop spreading disinformation on data security issues, stop its unreasonable suppression of relevant companies, and provide an open, fair, just, and non-discriminatory business environment for companies from all countries to invest and operate in the US.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347484.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-20","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Former Taiwan leader Ma Ying-jeou plans to visit the mainland from March 27 to April 7. The main content of the visit will be student exchanges and ancestor worship. He is also willing to meet with mainland Chinese leaders. Are senior Chinese officials willing to meet with him?","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has made relevant statements, which you can check.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347486.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-21","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that on the 20th local time, Honduran Foreign Minister Reina stated after meeting with US officials that the US indicated that establishing diplomatic relations with China was a sovereign decision by the Honduran government, and that the US would respect it. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. Upholding the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. Every sovereign state has the right to independently choose how to develop diplomatic relations with other countries. We welcome Honduras to recognize the international situation as soon as possible and make the correct decision in line with the historical trend.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347487.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-21","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","Taiwanese leader Tsai Ing-wen will visit Guatemala and Belize from March 29 to April 7, stopping in New York and Los Angeles on the way. Sources say she may meet with U.S. House Speaker McCarthy. What is China’s comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, firmly opposes the leaders of the Taiwan authorities seeking to infiltrate the United States in any name and for any reason, and firmly opposes the United States violating the one-China principle and engaging in any form of contact with the Taiwan authorities. China has made solemn representations to the United States in this regard. It is false for the leaders of the Taiwan authorities to \"transit\", but it is true to seek \"breakthroughs\" and promote \"Taiwan independence\".\nWe urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiques, earnestly implement the commitment made by U.S. leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" stop any form of official exchanges between the U.S. and Taiwan, stop escalating substantive U.S.-Taiwan relations, and stop hollowing out the one-China principle. We once again warn the Taiwan authorities that there is no way out for \"Taiwan independence\" and any attempt to collude with external forces for \"independence\" provocation is doomed to fail. China will firmly defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347487.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-21","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on the 20th local time, Honduras Foreign Minister Reina said after meeting with US officials that the US stated that establishing diplomatic relations with China is the sovereign decision of the Honduran government and the US will respect it. What is China’s comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory, and the government of the People’s Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. Adhering to the one-China principle is an international imperative, the aspiration of the people, and the general trend. Any sovereign country has the right to independently choose to develop diplomatic relations with other countries. We welcome Honduras to recognize the international trend as soon as possible and make correct decisions that are in line with the trend of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347487.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-22","Wang Wenbin","Xinhua News Agency reporter","President Xi Jinping's recent state visit to Russia has drawn widespread attention from the international community. Could the spokesperson provide an update on the visit?","On March 21, President Xi Jinping held small-group and large-group talks with Russian President Vladimir Putin in Moscow, and jointly met with Russian Prime Minister Mikhail Mishustin. The two heads of state reached many new and important consensuses, and both sides agreed to promote exchanges and cooperation in various fields based on the principles of good-neighborliness, friendship, and win-win cooperation, and to deepen the China-Russia comprehensive strategic partnership of coordination for a new era.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that China and Russia are each other's largest neighbors. Consolidating and developing long-term good-neighborly and friendly relations with Russia is in line with historical logic and is China's strategic choice, which will not change due to temporary events. The potential and space for China-Russia cooperation are vast, possessing strategic, reliable, and stable characteristics. No matter how the international situation changes, China will continue to be committed to advancing the China-Russia comprehensive strategic partnership of coordination for a new era. My state visit to Russia is a journey of friendship, cooperation, and peace. China is willing to work with Russia to build on past achievements and forge ahead into the future, enriching the connotation of the China-Russia comprehensive strategic partnership of coordination for a new era, creating more benefits for the people of both countries, and making greater contributions to the cause of human progress.\nPresident Putin stated that current Russia-China relations are developing very well, with significant progress made in cooperation across various fields. Russia firmly supports China in safeguarding its legitimate interests on issues related to Taiwan, Hong Kong, and Xinjiang. He congratulated China on the historic achievement of facilitating the Beijing dialogue between Saudi Arabia and Iran. Russia appreciates China's consistent objective and impartial stance in international affairs, supports China's global security initiatives, global development initiatives, and global civilization initiatives, and is willing to further strengthen international cooperation with China.\nThe two heads of state believe that the visits were fruitful and comprehensive, with in-depth exchanges that have injected new impetus into the development of the China-Russia comprehensive strategic partnership of coordination for a new era. China-Russia relations extend far beyond the bilateral scope, playing a vital role in the global landscape and the future of humanity. Under the new historical conditions, both sides will view and manage China-Russia relations with a broad vision and long-term perspective, making greater contributions to the cause of human progress.\nThe two heads of state reached a consensus that both sides should strengthen overall planning and top-level design, expand trade in energy, resources, and electromechanical products, enhance the resilience of their respective industrial and supply chains, expand cooperation in information technology, the digital economy, agriculture, and service trade, promote complementary and synchronized development of traditional trade and emerging cooperation, and further facilitate cross-border logistics and transportation. Both sides should continue to solidify the foundation for people-to-people exchanges, promote expanded exchanges between sister provinces/states and sister cities, successfully hold the China-Russia Year of Sports Exchanges, and create favorable conditions for promoting personnel exchanges between the two countries.\nThe two heads of state pointed out that, as permanent members of the UN Security Council, China and Russia will continue to work with the international community to firmly uphold the basic norms of international relations based on the purposes and principles of the UN Charter. They will strengthen cooperation within international multilateral frameworks such as the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation, BRICS, and the G20, practice genuine multilateralism, promote post-pandemic economic recovery, and strengthen their constructive role in building a multipolar world order and improving the global governance system. They will also make greater contributions to maintaining global food security, energy security, and the stability of industrial and supply chains, and jointly promote the building of a community with a shared future for mankind.\nThe two heads of state agreed to continue to maintain close communication through various means and jointly guide China-Russia relations toward a steady and long-term future.\nFollowing the talks, the two heads of state jointly signed the \"Joint Statement of the People's Republic of China and the Russian Federation on Deepening the Comprehensive Strategic Partnership of Coordination for a New Era\" and the \"Joint Statement of the President of the People's Republic of China and the President of the Russian Federation on the Development Plan of Key Directions for China-Russia Economic Cooperation up to 2030,\" outlining plans and arrangements for the next stage of bilateral relations and cooperation in various fields. During the visit, the two sides also signed several bilateral cooperation documents in the fields of agriculture, forestry, basic scientific research, market regulation, and media.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347488.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-23","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Sources say that the day before the Honduran president tweeted that he was seeking diplomatic relations with China, Honduras privately requested $2.5 billion in aid from Taiwan. Taiwanese authorities suspect that China was behind the scenes instructing Honduras to request this aid. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The claims are utterly absurd and completely fabricated. Recently, Honduran Foreign Minister Reina stated in an interview that President Castro's decision to develop relations with China is in line with the global trend and is also a decision made based on Honduras's own actual situation. We want to reiterate that adhering to the one-China principle is an irresistible trend and the will of the people. China welcomes the Honduran government's positive statements regarding developing relations with China and is willing to establish and develop bilateral relations with Honduras on the basis of equality and mutual respect.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347489.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-24","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","It has been reported that Honduras will announce the establishment of diplomatic relations with China and the severing of ties with Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","My colleague already answered this question yesterday. As we have said before, adhering to the one-China principle is the general principle of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. China welcomes the Honduran government's positive statement on developing relations with China and is willing to establish and develop bilateral relations with Honduras on the basis of equality and mutual respect.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347490.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-27","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","China and Honduras have established diplomatic relations. Honduras previously requested $2.5 billion in aid from Taiwan. Will China provide Honduras with an equivalent amount of aid?","Honduras' decision to establish diplomatic relations with China is a political decision made on the basis of the one-China principle, without any preconditions, which China highly appreciates. The establishment of diplomatic relations is not a bargaining chip. In recent years, Panama, the Dominican Republic, El Salvador, Nicaragua, and other countries have successively established or resumed diplomatic relations with China without attaching any preconditions. The same applies to the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Honduras.\nFollowing the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Honduras, China will, on the basis of the one-China principle and in the spirit of mutual respect, equality, mutual benefit, and common development, actively promote mutually beneficial cooperation with Honduras in various fields, contribute to Honduras' economic and social development, and bring benefits to the local people.\nThe Taiwan authorities are accustomed to employing \"money diplomacy.\" We must solemnly warn the Taiwan authorities that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, \"money diplomacy\" leads nowhere, and any attempt to go against the tide of history is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347491.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-28","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwanese officials announced today that Fiji has renamed its \"Taipei Commercial Office in Fiji\" to \"Republic of China (Taiwan) Commercial Mission in Fiji.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on Fiji's decision?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. We oppose any attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and such attempts will not succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347492.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-29","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","A senior U.S. official said today that China has absolutely no reason to overreact to Tsai Ing-wen's visit to the U.S. The official also stated that Tsai's visit is entirely in line with decades of precedent. What is China's comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes Taiwan authorities' leaders visiting the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US violating the one-China principle by engaging in any form of contact with the Taiwan authorities. China has repeatedly lodged solemn representations with the US regarding Tsai Ing-wen's \"transit\" visit to the US. Past mistakes cannot excuse today's mistakes, and the accumulation of errors cannot provide any legitimacy. The Taiwan authorities' leader's \"transit\" visit to the US is a pretext; seeking a \"breakthrough\" and promoting \"Taiwan independence\" is the real purpose. This is not an overreaction by China, but rather the US's unwavering indulgence and support of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, which is of a heinous nature.\nIt is not China that is creating problems and provoking incidents, but the US and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, earnestly implement the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas,\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, stop undermining the one-China principle, and stop its dangerous actions of claiming to build \"barriers\" for Sino-US relations while simultaneously undermining the political foundation of bilateral relations. China will closely monitor developments and resolutely and forcefully safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347493.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-30","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen transited through the United States and met with Taiwanese Americans, where she also delivered a speech. What is China's comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes any visit by Taiwan's leader to the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes any form of official contact between the US government and Taiwan. China lodges a strong protest and condemns the US for arranging Tsai Ing-wen's \"transit\" visit to the US despite China's solemn representations and repeated warnings.\nThe collusion between the US and Taiwan, using \"transit\" as a pretext to arrange for Tsai Ing-wen to engage in political activities in the US, is an attempt to elevate official exchanges and substantive relations between the two countries. This seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, severely undermines China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. This also proves once again that the fundamental reason for the current new round of tensions in the Taiwan Strait is the Taiwan authorities' repeated attempts to \"seek independence by relying on the US,\" while some in the US are intentionally pushing for \"using Taiwan to contain China.\"\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, to translate its commitments not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" not to support \"two Chinas,\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" into action, to cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, to stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, and to stop undermining the one-China principle. China will continue to closely monitor developments and resolutely and forcefully safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347494.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-03-31","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen said yesterday that relations between Taiwan and the United States are closer than ever before, and that Taiwan will work hand in hand with all its democratic partners. What is your response to this?","Regarding Tsai Ing-wen's \"transit\" trip to the US, we have stated our position on this matter many times. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes the Taiwan authorities' leader's visit to the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US violating the one-China principle by engaging in any form of contact with the Taiwan authorities. Facts have once again proven that the Taiwan authorities' leader's \"transit\" trip to the US is a pretense; her true intention is to seek a \"breakthrough\" and promote \"Taiwan independence.\" I want to emphasize that no matter what the Taiwan authorities say or do, it cannot change the fact that Taiwan is a part of China. No one and no force can stop China from achieving reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347495.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-03","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Last week, China announced that it would take countermeasures if US House Speaker McCarthy met with Taiwanese leader Tsai Ing-wen during her planned transit through the US. Could you elaborate on what these countermeasures would be? Would they include military exercises?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China. China has repeatedly emphasized that we firmly oppose any form of official exchanges or contacts between the US and the Taiwan authorities. Relevant US lawmakers should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and refrain from sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" forces, so as to avoid damaging Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute measures to safeguard its sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347496.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-04","Mao Ning","Reuters","Speaker of the House of Representatives McCarthy and Tsai Ing-wen will meet on Wednesday. Will China hold military training again?","China firmly opposes the U.S. arrangement for Tsai Ing-wen to \"transit\" to the United States, and firmly opposes McCarthy, the third most powerful figure in the U.S. government and Speaker of the House of Representatives, to meet with Tsai Ing-wen, because this seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, and seriously damages China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nWe urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, not allow Tsai Ing-wen to \"transit\" to the United States, and not arrange for U.S. politicians and officials to meet or have contact with Tsai Ing-wen. China will closely follow the development of the situation and resolutely and forcefully defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347497.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-06","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Can you confirm that the Shandong aircraft carrier is currently conducting exercises off the east coast of Taiwan? If so, is this the first time the ship has conducted exercises in the Pacific?","I suggest you contact the relevant Chinese authorities for clarification on this issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347498.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-07","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","According to the Taiwan authorities, following the meeting between the Taiwan leader and the US House Speaker, China has sent warships and military aircraft to the vicinity of Taiwan Island for the second consecutive day today. Can you confirm this and provide specific details?","China will take firm measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. For specific questions, I suggest you contact the Chinese Ministry of National Defense.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347499.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-10","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","China wants to project itself as a global force for peace, yet simultaneously threatens Taiwan with military exercises in the Taiwan Strait. How can China gain the trust of the international community while conducting these exercises?","I don't understand the logic behind your question. I think your question is absurd.\nA spokesperson for the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army (PLA) recently stated that from April 8th to 10th, the PLA Eastern Theater Command organized combat readiness patrols around Taiwan and held the \"Joint Sword\" exercise. This is a serious warning to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external forces for their provocations, and a necessary action to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Regarding your question, I would also like to tell you that adhering to the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a universally recognized basic norm of international relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347500.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-11","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Recently, French President Macron's remarks that Europe cannot follow the US and China on the Taiwan issue have drawn criticism in Europe. The director of the Polish Institute of International Studies stated that \"brain death\" has already occurred in some places. What is China's comment on these controversies?","We have already clarified China's position on related issues. I would like to reiterate that the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, and the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. The greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait at present is \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and the indulgence and support of external forces. We hope all parties will recognize the true nature of the Taiwan question, continue to adhere to the one-China principle, and resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347501.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-11","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Recently, French President Macron’s remarks that Europe cannot follow China and the United States on the Taiwan issue have attracted some criticism in Europe. The director of the Polish Institute of International Studies said \"brain death\" is already happening in some places. What is China’s comment on the above dispute?","We have previously stated China’s position on relevant issues. I would like to reiterate that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs, and the one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. The biggest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait currently is \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and the connivance and support of external forces. We hope that all parties will recognize the essence of the Taiwan issue, continue to abide by the one-China principle, and resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347501.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-12","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","My first question is about reports that China plans to establish a no-fly zone over northern Taiwan between April 16 and 18. Can you confirm this? My second question is about Taiwan's accusations that mainland fishermen have repeatedly cut undersea cables connecting the island to Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","I am not aware of the situation you mentioned.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347502.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-12","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","French President Macron continues to be criticized for saying that Europe should not follow China and the United States on the Taiwan issue. Former US President Trump yesterday accused Macron of catering to China. You have previously stated China's position on the Taiwan issue. Can you comment specifically on President Macron's remarks and the controversy they caused?","As a reporter from AFP, it is understandable that you pay special attention to President Macron’s visit to China. Not long ago, French President Macron successfully visited China, and the two sides reached an important consensus, injecting new impetus into deepening China-France and China-EU cooperation.\nWe have noticed that President Macron’s view that Europe should maintain strategic autonomy and avoid being involved in bloc confrontation has attracted some criticism, especially from the United States. We're not surprised by this. What we want to tell you is that some countries do not want to see other countries become independent and always want to coerce other countries to obey their will. However, insisting on strategic independence will win more respect and friends, while engaging in coercion and pressure will only encounter more resistance and opposition.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347502.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-13","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Taiwan says the mainland will establish a no-fly zone over northern Taiwan on Sunday, affecting 33 flights. Has China notified neighboring countries and advised international flights and ships to avoid the area?","Please contact the relevant authorities for clarification on this issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347503.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-14","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","German Foreign Minister Berbürk is currently on an official visit to China. In a previous media interview, she stated that China is Germany's competitor, partner, and also a systemic adversary. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this statement? Will this affect the development of Sino-German relations? Regarding the Taiwan issue, the German Foreign Minister's position is clear. However, after the People's…","China's position on the issues of China-Germany, China-EU, and Taiwan is consistent and clear. I would like to take this opportunity to brief you on the relevant situation regarding German Foreign Minister Berböck's visit to China.\nThis morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang, after concluding his overseas trip, rushed to Tianjin and visited local German companies with Foreign Minister Berböck. The two then traveled together by high-speed train to Beijing. This is Foreign Minister Berböck's first official visit to China, and it is believed that through his visit to Tianjin with State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang, Foreign Minister Berböck gained a more direct and vivid understanding of China's development and mutually beneficial cooperation between China and Germany.\nThis morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang and Foreign Minister Berböck co-chaired the sixth round of the China-Germany Strategic Dialogue on Diplomacy and Security, conducting frank and in-depth strategic communication on China-Germany relations and international and regional hotspots. Both sides agreed that China and Germany should conduct all-round exchanges, enhance strategic mutual trust, avoid strategic miscalculations, and uphold a correct understanding of each other; promote cooperation in various fields, and promote mutual benefit and win-win results in a pragmatic and open spirit; adhere to the principles of mutual respect and trust, equality, and seeking common ground while reserving differences, and respect each other's core interests; strengthen communication and coordination on international affairs, and work together to address the risks and challenges facing all of humanity. China also systematically explained its position on the Taiwan issue to the German side. Regarding the Ukraine issue, China emphasized that the only way to resolve the Ukraine crisis is to promote peace talks. China is willing to continue its efforts for peace and hopes that all relevant parties will remain objective and calm, and work together to resolve the crisis through negotiations.\nThis year marks a year of significant exchanges and cooperation between China and Germany. Both sides will take this visit as an opportunity to strengthen dialogue and communication, deepen mutually beneficial cooperation, and promote the healthy and stable development of the all-round strategic partnership between China and Germany, injecting stability and new impetus into world peace and development.\nWe will release further information regarding Foreign Minister Berkeley's visit to China in a timely manner, so please stay tuned.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347504.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-17","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The US Navy says a US warship transited the Taiwan Strait yesterday under the guise of \"freedom of navigation\" in accordance with international law. What is China's comment on the US warship's transit?","The spokesperson for the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has already stated China's position on this matter. The US sending warships to the Taiwan Strait to flex its military muscle endangers China's sovereignty and security and undermines regional peace and stability. China urges the US to immediately cease such infringing and provocative actions and refrain from being a troublemaker for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347505.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-17","Wang Wenbin","AFP","The US Navy said that yesterday a US warship passed through the Taiwan Strait in the name of \"freedom of navigation\" in accordance with international law. What is China’s comment on the passage of US warships?","The spokesperson of the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has stated his position on this. The United States sends warships to the Taiwan Strait to show off its force, endangering China's sovereignty and security and undermining regional peace and stability. China urges the United States to immediately stop such infringing and provocative acts and not to cause trouble for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347505.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-18","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that the G7 foreign ministers held a meeting in Japan and issued a joint statement, reaffirming the importance of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, expressing concern over issues concerning the East China Sea, the South China Sea, Xinjiang, and Tibet, and urging China to ensure a transparent, predictable, and fair business environment. What is China's comment on this?","The G7 Foreign Ministers' Meeting disregarded China's solemn position and objective facts, grossly interfered in China's internal affairs, and maliciously smeared and defamed China. The relevant statement is filled with arrogance, prejudice, and sinister intentions to contain and suppress China. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn protest with the host country, Japan.\nTaiwan is an inalienable part of China's sacred territory. The one-China principle is the cornerstone for maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. To truly safeguard peace, it is essential to explicitly oppose and stop any \"Taiwan independence\" activities. The affairs of Hong Kong, Xinjiang, and Tibet are purely China's internal affairs, and no external force is allowed to interfere in any way or under any pretext. Currently, the situation in the East China Sea and the South China Sea remains generally stable. Relevant countries should genuinely respect the efforts of regional countries to maintain peace and stability and stop sowing discord and creating confrontation among regional countries. As one of the world's most dynamic and promising markets, China is committed to creating a stable, fair, transparent, and predictable investment and business environment for foreign investors. Some G7 members disregard the principles of market economy and fair competition, generalize and abuse the concept of national security, and unreasonably suppress companies from other countries. They have no right to criticize China.\nAs a responsible major country, China firmly upholds the UN Charter and the basic principles of international law, and is committed to building a community with a shared future for mankind. We once again urge the G7 to reflect on its own problems, abandon Cold War mentality and ideological bias, not ignore the general trend of the world and the times, stop condescendingly pointing fingers at other countries, stop grossly interfering in other countries' internal affairs, and stop artificially creating confrontation and division in the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347506.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-19","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","This morning, Liu Jinsong, Director-General of the Department of Asian Affairs of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, met with a senior Japanese diplomat to express China's concerns and dissatisfaction with the G7 foreign ministers' meeting statement. Could you elaborate on which specific points of the statement China is concerned about?","Regarding the negative moves concerning China at the G7 foreign ministers' meeting hosted by Japan, China already stated its solemn position yesterday.\nI want to emphasize that there is only one order and one set of rules in the world today: the international order based on international law and the basic norms of international relations based on the purposes and principles of the UN Charter. If the G7 truly opposes hegemonism and coercion, it should reflect on its own actions, resolutely resist the recurrence of invasions of Afghanistan, Iraq, and Syria, resolutely oppose extraterritorial jurisdiction and unilateral sanctions, and firmly say no to policies that prioritize certain countries.\nSo-called \"unity\" at the cost of a divided world is dangerous. The world today does not need a \"G1\" dictated by one country, nor does it need any \"alliance of values.\" What the world needs is mutual respect among countries with different ideologies, values, and levels of development, to unite and cooperate on the basis of the UN Charter and international law, and to jointly promote the building of a community with a shared future for mankind.\nI would also like to point out that the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China, Taiwan is part of Chinese territory, and China's sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. Claiming to adhere to the one-China policy while portraying China's opposition to \"Taiwan independence\" as changing the status quo across the Taiwan Strait is essentially condoning \"Taiwan independence\" provocations, hindering China's reunification, creating peaceful division, and completely deviating from the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347507.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-19","Wang Wenbin","AFP","The President of Guatemala announced that he will \"visit\" Taiwan this weekend. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","The fact that China has established diplomatic relations with 182 countries proves that adhering to the one-China principle is international justice, the aspiration of the people, and the general trend. The Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities’ attempt to expand “international space” has reached its end and is nothing but a trick to deceive itself and others. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. \"Taiwan independence\" has no way out. Any move that ignores world trends and international justice and stubbornly adheres to a wrong stance is doomed to failure. We also advise the Jamaat government not to help evildoers, pursue their own selfish interests, and go against the general trend of the world and the aspirations of the Guatemalan people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347507.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-20","Wang Wenbin","Yonhap News Agency reporter","Recently, South Korean President Yoon Seok-yue said in an interview with Reuters on the Taiwan Strait issue that we, together with the international community, are firmly opposed to using strength to change the status quo. What is China’s comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and is the core of China's core interests. Solving the Taiwan issue is the Chinese people's own business and does not allow others to comment. In recent years, the fundamental reason for the tension across the Taiwan Strait is that \"Taiwan independence\" elements on the island have carried out separatist activities with the connivance and support of foreign forces. \"Taiwan independence\" actions are incompatible with peace and stability. To maintain peace and tranquility across the Taiwan Strait and the region, we must take a clear-cut stand against \"Taiwan independence\" and oppose external interference. North and South Korea are both sovereign states that have joined the United Nations. It is a well-known fact that the Korean Peninsula issue and the Taiwan issue are completely different in nature and latitude and longitude, and are not comparable at all. We hope that South Korea will earnestly abide by the spirit of the joint communique on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and South Korea, adhere to the one-China principle, and handle the Taiwan issue prudently.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347508.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-21","Wang Wenbin","Yonhap News Agency reporter","The South Korean government considers the remarks made by the Chinese Foreign Ministry at yesterday's regular press conference regarding South Korea to be \"diplomatically disrespectful\" and has \"summoned\" the Chinese ambassador to South Korea to lodge a protest. What is China's comment on this?","In response to the erroneous remarks made by the South Korean side on the Taiwan issue, China has lodged solemn representations with the South Korean side in Beijing and Seoul respectively, comprehensively expounding China's position, emphasizing that the one-China principle is the political foundation of China-South Korea relations, and demanding that the South Korean side abide by the spirit of the joint communiqué on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the South Korea, and exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan issue. China's safeguarding of its sovereignty and territorial integrity is legitimate, reasonable, and unwavering. We hope that the South Korean side will earnestly abide by the one-China principle and work with China to safeguard the healthy and stable development of China-South Korea relations with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347509.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-24","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The President of Guatemala arrived in Taiwan today to strengthen bilateral \"diplomatic relations.\" What is China's position on this? Is there anything China would like to say to the President of Guatemala?","We have noticed that recently, some Guatemalan politicians have publicly stated in interviews that the vast majority of countries in the world recognize Taiwan as part of China, and that it is unreasonable for Guatemala to have no diplomatic relations with China. These statements by insightful individuals fully demonstrate that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. China is Guatemala's second-largest source of imports and fifth-largest export destination. Recognizing the one-China principle and developing relations with China is in Guatemala's fundamental interests and reflects the aspirations of its people. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities go against the tide of history and are nothing more than a self-deceiving trick by the DPP authorities; they cannot stop the inevitable historical trend of China's reunification. As Barnoa, president of the Guatemalan-Chinese Friendship Association, said: \"Chinese history tells everyone that there is only one China in the world. History also tells us that attempts to split China will not end well.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347510.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-25","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","The Guatemalan president today expressed firm support for the so-called \"Republic of Taiwan.\" What is China's comment on this?","The fact that China has established diplomatic relations with 182 countries proves that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. The DPP authorities in Taiwan's attempts to expand their \"international space\" have reached a dead end and are nothing but self-deceptive tricks. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. \"Taiwan independence\" has no future, and any actions that disregard the trend of the world and international justice and stubbornly adhere to an erroneous position are doomed to failure. We also advise the Jamat government not to aid and abet evil, and not to go against the international trend and the voice of the Guatemalan people for its own selfish interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347511.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-26","Mao Ning","CRI reporter","It was reported that on the 25th, British Foreign Secretary Cliveley, in his regular foreign policy speech, stated that launching a \"new Cold War\" against China and isolating China is not in Britain's national interest. The current British government will engage with China in a strong and constructive manner, while firmly defending British national security and values. He mentioned that China should fulfill its…","The world today is deeply intertwined, with multiple challenges overlapping, requiring international cooperation to address them. Bloc politics and Cold War mentality go against the historical trend and are not in the interests of all parties, including the UK. China has always developed its relations with the UK in the spirit of equality and mutual respect, but the UK clings to outdated ideas, playing an outdated script and reciting old lines, ultimately only drifting further and further away from the progress of the times.\nRegarding the Hong Kong issue, all the clauses in the Sino-British Joint Declaration concerning the British side have been fully implemented. The British side has no sovereignty, no right to govern, and no right to supervise Hong Kong; there are no so-called \"rights\" or \"responsibilities\" involved. Xinjiang's economic development, social stability, religious harmony, cultural prosperity, and the people's peaceful and happy lives are undeniable facts. The British side, however, turns a deaf ear and a blind eye to these facts, insisting on slandering and smearing themthis is purely out of ulterior motives. The status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China. The greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait at present is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. If the British side wishes to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, it should strictly adhere to the one-China principle and firmly oppose separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence.\"\nI would like to reiterate that the issues of Taiwan, Hong Kong, and Xinjiang are purely China's internal affairs and brook no external interference. China urges the UK to exercise caution in its words and actions, cease its unfounded accusations against China and interference in China's internal affairs, and do more to promote the development of China-UK relations and contribute to world peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347512.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-04-27","Mao Ning","Yonhap News Agency reporter","The leaders of South Korea and the United States also issued a joint statement, which emphasized the importance of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. What is China's response to this?","China has noted the Taiwan-related content of the US-ROK joint statement and the remarks made by the ROK leader in an interview. I want to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and is the core of China's core interests. Resolving the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, and no external forces are allowed to interfere. The true status quo of the Taiwan issue is that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is a part of China. China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. The \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces attempting to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" in the international community, and the external interference forces constantly undermining and hollowing out the one-China principle, are the real culprits disrupting the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. We urge the US and ROK to recognize the essence of the Taiwan issue, adhere to the one-China principle, exercise caution in their words and actions on the Taiwan issue, and not go further down the wrong and dangerous path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347513.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-04-27","","Reporter","According to reports, a group of US defense companies will visit Taiwan in early May to discuss issues such as joint production of drones and ammunition. What’s your comment on this?","We have noticed relevant reports and are seriously concerned about this. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. These American military-industrial complexes have always been zealous to peddle weapons and export conflicts and chaos around the world to reap staggering profits. The Democratic Progressive Party's act of inviting wolves into the house is rather contemptible, which would only bring untold disaster to the Taiwan compatriots.\nWhat needs to be emphasized is that no individualor force can shake our determination and will to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, nor can they hold back the historical and inevitable trend of China's reunification. We strongly urge the US to fully recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan question as well as the complexity and severity of the current situation across the Taiwan Strait, adhere to the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, prudently and properly handle Taiwan-related issues, stop interfering in the Taiwan question, stop arms sales to the Taiwan region as well as its military contact with the island. The PLA troops always follow closely the situation across the Taiwan Strait , stay on high alert all the time, and will take necessary measures in accordance with the law to resolutely counter any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities as well as external interference, and firmly safeguard China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-05-05","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","On the 3rd, a delegation from the US defense industry attended the \"US-Taiwan Defense Industry Cooperation Forum.\" The delegation leader, former commander of the US Pacific Marine Corps, General Rudel, stated in his address that US defense companies are willing to participate in Taiwan's independent defense program to enhance Taiwan's deterrence and prevent conflict at its source. What is China's comment on this?","The US arms sales to Taiwan seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué. China has always firmly opposed them.\nThe recent escalation of military collusion between the US and Taiwan, exemplified by the visit of 25 US arms dealers to Taiwan and the so-called \"defense forum\" held with the DPP authorities, once again demonstrates that the US is turning Taiwan into a \"powder keg,\" with the vast majority of Taiwanese compatriots suffering the consequences. The Taiwanese people's attitude towards this is very clear. Near the forum's venue, representatives from various sectors and groups in Taiwan chanted slogans protesting against \"warmongers selling war,\" opposing \"relying on the US for independence and inviting wolves into the house,\" dissuading \"Taiwanese youth from going to the battlefield,\" and calling for \"one China across the Taiwan Strait and peace in the Taiwan Strait.\" The DPP authorities should seriously listen to the voices of the Taiwanese people and immediately stop selling out their fundamental interests for their own selfish gain.\nWe once again urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, cease arms sales to Taiwan and US-Taiwan military contacts, and stop creating tensions across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute and forceful measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty and security interests. Any external forces that interfere in China's internal affairs and undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait will bear responsibility and pay the price for their erroneous actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347516.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-08","Wang Wenbin","China News Service reporter","Recently, a Swiss government report on Taiwan stated that Switzerland adheres to the one-China policy but considers Taiwan to have \"national characteristics,\" leaving the decision of whether to recognize Taiwan as a country to each nation's discretion. The Swiss Federal Parliament's National Council also passed a motion concerning Taiwan, calling for strengthened cooperation with Taiwan's so-called \"Legislative…","We express our strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to the Swiss side's erroneous remarks and actions concerning Taiwan.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community, a universally recognized basic norm of international relations, and an integral part of the post-World War II international order; it cannot be arbitrarily distorted or misinterpreted. Switzerland was among the first countries to recognize and establish diplomatic relations with the People's Republic of China, and the one-China principle is the most important political foundation for the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Switzerland and the smooth development of bilateral exchanges and cooperation in various fields over the past 70 years.\nWe urge Switzerland to uphold its political commitment to the one-China principle, stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" forces, refrain from condoning or supporting any \"Taiwan independence\" activities, and work with China to maintain the positive momentum of China-Switzerland relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347517.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-08","Wang Wenbin","AFP","When State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang met with U.S. Ambassador to China Burns this morning, he said that a series of wrong words and deeds by the U.S. side have undermined the hard-won positive momentum of China-U.S. relations. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs explain specifically what wrong words and deeds State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang was referring to?","Regarding Qin Gang’s State Council meeting with Ambassador Burns, China has issued a press release. The issues you mentioned are also clearly stated in the press release. I would like to take this opportunity to introduce you again.\nState Councilor Qin Gang said that the United States should correct its understanding of China, return to rationality, fasten the first button of Sino-US relations, and achieve mutual success in the better development of each country. We cannot talk about communication on the one hand and continue to suppress and contain China on the other. You cannot say one thing and do another. We must respect China's bottom line and red line, stop undermining China's sovereignty, security, and development interests. In particular, we must correctly handle the Taiwan issue, stop continuing to hollow out the one-China principle, and stop supporting and condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We must persist in handling unexpected incidents in the relations between the two countries in a calm, professional and pragmatic manner to avoid further impact on Sino-US relations. Dialogue and cooperation should be promoted on the basis of mutual respect, reciprocity and reciprocity. I hope Ambassador Burns will have more contacts, exchanges and thinking in China and serve as a bridge between China and the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347517.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-10","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Yesterday, German Foreign Minister Berbürk urged China to explicitly oppose Russia's invasion of Ukraine. On the same day, an AFP reporter was tragically killed by a rocket attack in Donetsk. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","You mentioned the relevant statements made by the German Foreign Minister during State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang's visit to Germany. Here, I would like to first introduce the relevant situation of State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang's visit to Germany.\nOn May 9 local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang held talks with German Foreign Minister Berböck in Berlin and jointly met with reporters. The main purpose of the visit was to prepare for the upcoming seventh round of Sino-German intergovernmental consultations.\nState Councilor Qin Gang stated that both China and Germany are major powers with global influence, and in today's complex and volatile international situation, they should strengthen dialogue and cooperation. Both sides should jointly prepare for the seventh round of China-Germany intergovernmental consultations, making comprehensive plans for pragmatic cooperation in various fields in the future. China and Germany should adhere to the right path, jointly oppose a \"new Cold War\" and \"decoupling,\" and inject confidence and momentum into world peace and prosperity. China is a key partner for Europe in addressing risks and challenges, and welcomes Europe to continue sharing the opportunities and development dividends of the Chinese market, achieving common development of Chinese-style modernization and European integration.\nState Councilor Qin Gang pointed out that China appreciates the statements from Germany and the EU that they will not decouple from China, but expresses concern about the EU's claim of \"risk reduction.\" China exports opportunities, not crises; cooperation, not confrontation; stability, not turmoil; and insurance, not risk. If \"risk reduction\" is used as a pretext for decoupling from China, then it is tantamount to eliminating opportunities, cooperation, stability, and development. Both China and Germany, and China and the EU, should abide by international trade rules and the spirit of contracts, maintain mutual openness, refrain from politicizing normal economic and trade investment cooperation, and avoid artificially interfering with market behavior.\nState Councilor Qin Gang emphasized that Taiwan's return to China is an integral part of the post-World War II international order. Any party that genuinely desires peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and is truly committed to upholding the international order should earnestly adhere to the one-China principle and resolutely oppose all acts of \"Taiwan independence.\"\nBoth China and Germany agreed to make every effort to prepare for the seventh round of Sino-German intergovernmental consultations, and to make comprehensive plans for practical cooperation between the two countries in various fields in the future. Both sides agreed to increase coordination in multilateral areas and strengthen cooperation in areas such as the 28th Conference of the Parties to the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (COP28) and biodiversity.\nChina's position on the Ukraine issue is consistent and clear. During his visit to Germany, State Councilor Qin Gang clearly stated that the Ukraine issue is highly complex, and simplistic or emotional approaches are not solutions. Only by maintaining calm and rationality and creating conditions for a political solution can the way forward be achieved. China is neither a conflict instigator nor a participant in the conflict, but rather an advocate for peace and a promoter of peace talks. We hope that Germany will play a leading role and propose concrete solutions for building a balanced, effective, and sustainable European security framework.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347519.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-10","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Hong Kong China Review News Agency","US Secretary of State Blinken issued a statement on the 9th saying that the United States strongly encourages the WHO to invite Taiwan to participate in this year’s World Health Organization as an observer. Taiwan has participated in previous WHO conferences as an observer. The United States will continue to push Taiwan to regain its status as an observer at the World Health Assembly and participate in the United…","We firmly oppose the relevant statement issued by the US.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. Taiwan's participation in the activities of international organizations, including the WHO, must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. This is also an important principle confirmed by the United Nations General Assembly Resolution 2758 and the World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1. Because the Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle, they undermine the political basis for cross-strait consultations, resulting in the political basis for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly no longer existing. The relevant statement by the US is to confuse the public, and in essence is condoning and supporting the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.\nThe Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. We once again urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiques, abide by international law and basic norms governing international relations, implement into action the commitment made by U.S. leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and stop using the WHO to hype Taiwan-related issues. The one-China principle is universally supported by the international community. It is the aspiration of the people and the general trend. It cannot be denied and is unstoppable. Any attempt to play the \"Taiwan card\" and \"use Taiwan to contain China\" will be firmly opposed by the international community and is destined to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347519.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-11","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","We noticed that State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang visited the site of the Potsdam Conference during his visit to Germany. What were the considerations behind this move?","On May 10 local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang visited the site of the Potsdam Conference in Berlin, Germany, and delivered a speech.\nState Councilor Qin Gang stated that the Potsdam Conference held in 1945 played a crucial role in laying the foundation for the post-World War II international order and holds special historical significance for the Chinese people. The Potsdam Declaration, issued after the conference, reaffirmed the provisions of the Cairo Declaration, including the return of Chinese territories, including Taiwan, stolen by Japan. This was a major achievement of the World Anti-Fascist War. It was won with the lives and blood of 35 million Chinese soldiers and civilians.\nToday, the United States claims to uphold the rules-based international order, yet it has abandoned the Potsdam Declaration, which it drafted years ago, and supports and condones \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, undermining the post-war international order and damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. The Chinese people will never allow this.\nYou asked about State Councilor Qin Gang's considerations in visiting the site of the Potsdam Conference. I think it's to tell the world that we must remember the warnings history has given us: the post-war international order must be upheld! International fairness and justice must be upheld! Pursuing \"Taiwan independence\" and separatism, challenging international principles and order, and going against the tide of history is destined to lead to a dead end. China's national reunification must be achieved!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347520.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-12","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","According to official reports, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and director of the Office of the Central Foreign Affairs Commission, met with US National Security Advisor Sullivan for more than eight hours this week, but only two brief statements were issued. I have two questions: First, does this indicate that the two sides failed to reach an agreement on any key issues?…","Regarding the meeting between Director Wang Yi and U.S. National Security Advisor Sullivan, China has already released a press release. From May 10th to 11th local time, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Director of the Office of the Central Foreign Affairs Commission, met with U.S. National Security Advisor Sullivan in Vienna, Austria. The two sides held frank, in-depth, substantive, and constructive discussions on removing obstacles and stabilizing China-U.S. relations. Wang Yi comprehensively elaborated on China's solemn position on the Taiwan issue. The two sides also exchanged views on the Asia-Pacific situation, Ukraine, and other international and regional issues of common concern. Both sides agreed to continue to make good use of this strategic communication channel.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347521.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-16","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Taiwan National Broadcasting Corporation","According to reports, Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida named China and Russia in an interview on the 15th, saying that unilateral changes in the status quo will not be allowed to rely on strength. The G7 Hiroshima Summit will send a strong signal to the international community in this regard. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","As the host of this G7 summit, Japan is obsessed with provoking and creating confrontation between camps and harming regional interests. China is firmly opposed to this.\nJapan has repeated its old tune and spared no effort to discredit its neighboring countries, often using this to cover up its own attempts to unilaterally change the status quo. International legal documents such as the Potsdam Declaration and the Cairo Declaration form the international legal basis of the post-war international order, stating that Taiwan's return to China is an integral part of the post-World War II international order. However, for some time, some forces in Japan have tried their best to beautify the history of aggression, \"invoke the soul\" and \"overturn the verdict\" of militarism, and even clamored that \"whatever happens to Taiwan means something happens to Japan.\" Isn't this an attempt to change the status quo?\nIf Japan really opposes unilateral changes to the status quo, it should take a clear stand to stop these domestic forces that are trying to reverse the course of history. It should seriously reflect on its history of militaristic aggression. It should clearly reaffirm its compliance with the post-World War II international order. It should abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347523.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-17","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Former British Prime Minister Truss begins her \"visit\" to Taiwan today. She previously stated that she would use this visit to urge the Sunak government to view China as a strategic threat. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this visit?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China's position on the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear. Certain washed-up British politicians are using the Taiwan issue to boost their own political standing, merely for personal gain. I have noticed a flood of negative comments from various sectors in the UK regarding Truss's actions, calling the trip \"theatrical\" and stating that \"this consistently irresponsible Norfolk Southwest MP is inflicting another kind of harm on her country.\" The DPP authorities in Taiwan are spending Taiwanese taxpayers' money to curry favor with this \"shortest-serving prime minister\" in British history; this is not an act of love for Taiwan, but rather an act of selling out Taiwan. Such attempts to collude with external forces to seek \"independence\" and provoke conflict are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347524.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-18","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","In the interview, Kissinger also stated that the United States and China are the main threats to world peace and human survival because the two countries have embarked on a path of mutual conflict. He said that both sides should try to use more cautious rhetoric to ease tensions in the Taiwan region and establish an advisory group to lay the foundation for regular meetings between the leaders of China and the…","China has always developed China-US relations in accordance with the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation put forward by President Xi Jinping. We hope the US will correct its perception of China, stop harming China's sovereignty, security, and development interests, and work with China to push China-US relations back onto the track of healthy and stable development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347525.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-19","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Registration for the 76th World Health Assembly closes this week, and Taiwan has still not received an invitation to participate. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China's position on Taiwan's participation in international organizations, including the World Health Organization, is consistent and clear: it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. This is also the fundamental principle affirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1.\nFrom 2009 to 2016, Taiwan participated in the World Health Assembly for eight consecutive years under the name \"Chinese Taipei\" and as an observer. This was a special arrangement made through cross-strait consultations based on the \"1992 Consensus,\" which embodies the one-China principle. The one-China principle is the political foundation for the peaceful development of cross-strait relations and also the political foundation for China's special arrangements for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly. Since coming to power in 2016, the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) has placed its political ambitions above the well-being of the people of Taiwan, stubbornly adhering to its \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, resulting in the loss of the political foundation for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly. In order to uphold the one-China principle and defend the seriousness and authority of the relevant resolutions of the UN General Assembly and the World Health Assembly, China has decided not to agree to Taiwan's participation in this year's World Health Assembly.\nThe Taiwan authorities' claim that excluding Taiwan from the World Health Assembly would create a \"gap\" in the international pandemic prevention system is nothing but a lie and pretext for their attempt to participate in the assembly. The Chinese central government has always attached great importance to the health and well-being of Taiwan compatriots and, under the one-China principle, has made appropriate arrangements for Taiwan's participation in global health affairs. According to the arrangements reached between China and the WHO, and in accordance with the one-China principle, medical and health experts from Taiwan can participate in relevant WHO technical meetings. In the past year alone, 24 groups totaling 26 medical experts from Taiwan have participated in WHO technical activities. Taiwan can promptly obtain information on global public health emergencies released by the WHO, and information on public health emergencies occurring in Taiwan can be promptly reported to the WHO. To date, the Chinese central government has notified Taiwan of more than 500 COVID-19 outbreaks, including information on Taiwanese residents diagnosed on the mainland. These arrangements ensure that Taiwan can respond promptly and effectively to public health emergencies, whether domestically or internationally. The DPP authorities' use of participation in the World Health Assembly is not for pandemic prevention needs, but to expand the international space for \"Taiwan independence.\"\nChina's decision not to allow Taiwan to participate in this year's World Health Assembly has received widespread understanding and support from the international community. For some time now, nearly 140 countries have expressed their adherence to the one-China principle and their opposition to Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly, and nearly 100 countries have sent letters to the WHO Director-General or issued public statements on this matter. This once again proves that the one-China principle is the will of the people and the trend of the times in the international community, and it also fully reflects the correct and just stance of the vast majority of countries on the Taiwan-related issues at the World Health Assembly. The eyes of the world are discerning; any attempt to play the \"Taiwan card\" or use Taiwan to contain China will inevitably be met with resolute opposition from the vast majority of the international community and is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347526.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-25","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Outgoing Paraguayan president said yesterday that Paraguay is open to trade with China, but will not change its \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's response to this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. The fact that 182 countries have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. Relevant countries should recognize this trend, choose to stand on the right side of history and on the side of the vast majority of countries, and make the correct decision as soon as possible that conforms to their own fundamental and long-term interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347530.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-26","Mao Ning","Shenzhen TV reporter","According to reports, Taiwan’s defense officials said on the 25th that the U.S. government’s arms assistance package to Taiwan through the presidential nomination channel has recently begun to be implemented, and the first batch of delivered “Stinger” anti-aircraft missiles arrived in Taiwan on the 24th. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The United States' supply of weapons to Taiwan seriously violates the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17th\" communique, interferes in China's internal affairs, harms China's sovereignty and security interests, and undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. This is an extremely wrong and dangerous move. China is strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to this, and has lodged stern representations with the United States.\nFrom US politicians openly advocating \"destroying TSMC\" to accelerating the armedization of Taiwan into a \"Porcupine Island\", the US's intention to \"destroy Taiwan\" in order to \"use Taiwan to contain China\" is clearly revealed. More than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots, will never agree!\nWe urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, stop US-Taiwan military ties and arm Taiwan, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces \"seeking independence through force.\" We once again warn the Democratic Progressive Party authorities that any attempt to \"seek independence by coercing foreign countries\" and \"reject reunification with force\" will only end in failure. China will pay close attention to developments and firmly safeguard national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347531.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-05-30","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","Taiwan's Vice President Lai Ching-te said that the person he most wants to have dinner with is the Chinese leader. If given the opportunity, he would advise the Chinese leader to \"relax a little, don't be so stressed,\" and that \"the people's well-being is the most important thing, and peace is good for everyone.\" What is your comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China, and there is no \"vice president\" there. This is not a diplomatic issue, so I will not comment. If the DPP authorities truly care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, the key lies in adhering to the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347533.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-01","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwanese authorities have stated that Taiwan and the United States will sign a trade agreement on Thursday and hope to reach a comprehensive free trade agreement in the future. What is China's comment on this?","China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, including the signing of any agreements with sovereign implications and official nature. The relevant actions of the US side seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and also violate the US side's own commitment to maintain only non-official relations with Taiwan. China has lodged solemn representations with the US side on this matter on multiple occasions.\nThe US should cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, refrain from signing any agreements with Taiwan that imply sovereignty or are of an official nature, and avoid sending any wrong signals to pro-independence separatist forces under the guise of trade and economic cooperation. The DPP authorities' attempt to seek independence by relying on the US under the pretense of trade and economic cooperation is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347535.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-02","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that on the evening of June 1, the US and Taiwan signed the first phase of the \"21st Century Trade Initiative\" agreement in Washington. What is the Chinese Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, including the signing of any agreements with sovereign implications and official nature. The US government's insistence on advancing negotiations on the so-called \"21st Century Trade Initiative\" with the DPP authorities in Taiwan and its insistence on signing related agreements seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and seriously contravenes the US commitment to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction with this and has lodged a solemn representation with the US.\nThe so-called \"initiative\" is nothing more than a tool used by the US under the guise of economic and trade cooperation to exploit and extract resources from Taiwan. It is a pledge of allegiance from the DPP authorities in Taiwan, who are willing to betray the vital interests of Taiwanese compatriots and businesses in their pursuit of \"independence,\" harming and selling out Taiwan. It is the latest example of the US hollowing out and undermining the one-China principle. We once again urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, immediately change course, cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, stop advancing and immediately withdraw from the so-called \"initiative\" and agreements, and stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. Otherwise, the US must bear full responsibility for the consequences.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347536.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-05","Wang Wenbin","AFP","The US military said that a Chinese naval vessel sailed in an \"unsafe\" manner near a US warship in the Taiwan Strait last Saturday. Reports said that the two ships were once less than 140 meters apart. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The spokesperson of the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has responded to this, and you can check it out.\nThe truth is that the United States is the first to cause trouble and provocation, and China is the last to deal with it in accordance with laws and regulations. China has always respected the freedom of navigation and overflight enjoyed by all countries in accordance with international law. The actions taken by the Chinese military are necessary measures to respond to provocations by relevant countries. They are completely reasonable, legal, safe and professional. China firmly opposes relevant countries causing trouble in the Taiwan Strait region and resolutely defends national sovereignty, security and regional peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347537.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-05","Wang Wenbin","NBC","In view of the close encounter between Chinese and American warships in the Taiwan Strait last weekend, and the close encounter between Chinese and American warships over the South China Sea last week, will foreign warships and aircraft also trigger similar reactions from Chinese warships and aircraft when they sail or fly over these places? Does China think this response has become standard operating procedure…","Regarding the relevant issues you mentioned, I have just stated China’s principled position. Here I would also like to quote the responses made by the Chinese delegation attending the Shangri-La Dialogue on relevant issues. The Chinese representative raised a question, which is why the so-called \"unsafe and unprofessional\" incidents mentioned by these US officials all occurred near China's airspace and territorial waters, rather than near the airspace and territorial waters of other countries. I think this issue is worthy of everyone’s deep thought.\nI would also like to emphasize that China has always respected the navigation and overflight rights of all countries in accordance with international law. The Chinese military has carried out on-site sea and air responses in accordance with laws and regulations. The relevant measures are professional, reasonable and completely legal.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347537.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-05","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","A video released by the U.S. Navy showed that a Chinese warship passed in front of a U.S. destroyer in the Taiwan Strait last weekend. The U.S. called it an \"unsafe interaction.\" Does the Ministry of Foreign Affairs have any further comment on this?","As I just said, the US is the first to cause trouble and provocation, while China is the last to deal with it in accordance with laws and regulations. The measures taken by the Chinese military are completely reasonable, legal, professional and safe. It is the US that should conduct a profound review and correct its mistakes.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347537.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-06","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","US Republican presidential candidate Ramaswamy recently suggested that every Taiwanese family should own and be trained in using AR-15 rifles to defend against a possible military attack on Taiwan by mainland China. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on his remarks? How do you view the recent tough rhetoric against China by several US presidential candidates?","The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. We urge relevant U.S. personnel to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and not to use the people of Taiwan as cannon fodder.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347538.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-06","Wang Wenbin","Kyodo News reporter","On June 5, U.S. Assistant Secretary of State Conda and Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu held a meeting. The Ministry of Foreign Affairs has released relevant information. Do you have any more information to provide?","China has issued a press release regarding the talks and meetings between Chinese and American diplomats in Beijing. Yesterday, the U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for Asia-Pacific Affairs Conda and the White House National Security Council Senior Director for China Affairs Bethalan visited China. Chinese Vice Minister of Foreign Affairs Ma Zhaoxu and Director of the Department of United States and Oceania Yang Tao held meetings and talks with them respectively. The two sides conducted candid, constructive and fruitful communication on promoting the improvement of Sino-US relations and properly managing differences in accordance with the consensus reached by the two heads of state at their meeting in Bali last November. China has stated its solemn position on Taiwan and other major principled issues. Both parties agreed to continue communication.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347538.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-07","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The EU has agreed on a new trade instrument that allows for tariffs on countries it deems to be engaging in \"economic blackmail.\" This comes after China imposed trade restrictions on Lithuania following its strengthening of relations with Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on the EU's decision?","First of all, I want to say that China has repeatedly stated its position on Lithuania's erroneous actions on the Taiwan issue. We urge Lithuania to correct its mistakes as soon as possible and return to the correct track of adhering to the one-China principle.\nBoth China and the EU are victims of US economic coercion. The US has openly coerced the EU and other countries to restrict exports of semiconductor manufacturing equipment to China. This act of technological bullying severely impacts the development of the semiconductor industry, harming not only the interests of China and the EU but also undermining multilateral trade rules and seriously disrupting the global economic order. We hope that the EU and the international community will join forces to oppose US economic coercion.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347539.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-07","Wang Wenbin","CCTV","Campbell, the coordinator for Indo-Pacific affairs of the White House National Security Council, said on the 6th that the dangerous navigation of Chinese destroyers in the Taiwan Strait shows that it is necessary to take measures to prevent accidents from causing dire consequences. U.S. Democratic Senator Ben Cardin said that China's actions against U.S. warships \"violated international law\" and firmly opposed…","When it comes to bullying and intimidation, the United States is more skilled than any other country. According to reports, in 2022 alone, large U.S. reconnaissance aircraft conducted more than 800 close reconnaissance missions towards China. In 2022, the US military also sent aircraft carrier strike groups into the South China Sea and surrounding areas many times. This kind of behavior that relies on military superiority to show off its power and infringe on the sovereignty of other countries is an act of bullying and intimidation. It is also the root cause of maritime and air security risks and undermining regional peace and stability.\nIn response to the U.S. military provocation, China has conducted sea and air responses in accordance with the law and regulations, which is reasonable and lawful and has nothing to do with the so-called \"bullying\". When it comes to safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity, China has no room for compromise. There is no \"bullying\" or \"intimidation\" here, there are only principles and bottom lines that China adheres to.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347539.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-08","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Today, 37 Chinese mainland military aircraft entered Taiwan's \"air defense identification zone,\" prompting Taiwan to activate its air defense system. Why did China send military aircraft into Taiwan's \"air defense identification zone\" in the same week that China and Russia conducted joint strategic air patrols? What is the connection between the two events?","I am not aware of the situation you mentioned, and this is not a diplomatic issue. Taiwan is part of China, and China's determination and will to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity are unwavering.\nRegarding the joint strategic air patrols between China and Russia, I have already stated China's position.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347540.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-09","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","According to reports, Taiwan’s “Foreign Minister” will visit Europe next week. He is expected to visit Brussels and attend an event with the Czech president. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this visit?","First of all, let me correct you. Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory. There is no Taiwan “foreign minister”, only the heads of local foreign affairs departments in China.\nThe one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. It is also the prerequisite and political foundation for China to develop friendly relations with other countries in the world. We urge the European side to recognize the essence of the Taiwan issue, abide by its solemn commitments to China on the one-China principle, not to stand up to \"Taiwan independence\" forces, and not to have official exchanges with the Taiwan region in any name. China is unwavering in its determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We also warn the Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party authorities that any separatist actions and attempts to \"steal over foreign countries to gain self-respect\" are doomed to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347541.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-09","Wang Wenbin","After the meeting, a reporter asked","When Chinese Ambassador to South Korea Xing Haiming met with Lee Jae-myung, leader of South Korea's largest opposition Democratic Party, on the 8th, he expressed his views on China-South Korea relations, emphasizing that the current China-South Korea relations are encountering considerable difficulties and that the responsibility does not lie with China. Ambassador Xing Haiming's relevant remarks have aroused the…","China-ROK relations are currently facing difficulties and challenges, and the responsibility does not lie with China. Ambassador Xing Haiming has extensive contacts with the Korean government, political parties and all sectors of society, exchanges views on bilateral relations and issues of common concern, and introduces China's position and concerns, which is his duty. We hope that relevant parties in South Korea will view it correctly and focus on how to face up to the problem and achieve the stability and development of China-South Korea relations.\nAccording to reports, officials from the South Korean Presidential Office clarified on the 7th that there were recent reports that Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs officials briefed the \"Four Impossibles\" policy during their visit to South Korea, saying that the relevant reports were completely untrue, and that there was no relevant dialogue between South Korea and China, and no relevant dialogue had ever taken place. The South Korean government can continue to negotiate with China on the North Korean issue. China has never made the \"THAAD\" issue or national security issues a condition for dialogue with South Korea. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?\nWang Wenbin: China-ROK relations are currently facing difficulties and challenges, and the responsibility does not lie with China. In the department-level diplomatic consultations between China and South Korea held not long ago, China clearly stated its position and concerns, and South Korea is aware of this. South Korea should have a deep understanding of the problem, take it seriously, work with China halfway, and jointly make active efforts to promote the healthy and stable development of China-South Korea relations.\nAccording to reports, Chinese officials warned South Korean officials that if Seoul crosses Beijing's red line on the Taiwan issue and engages in military coordination with Tokyo and Washington, high-level diplomatic exchanges will be suspended and policy cooperation with North Korea will be cancelled. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?\nWang Wenbin: The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs and is the core of China's core interests. Solving the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and must be decided by the Chinese people. The 1992 Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and South Korea clearly stated that “the Government of the Republic of Korea recognizes the Government of the People’s Republic of China as the sole legal government of China and respects China’s position that there is only one China and that Taiwan is part of China.” South Korea should earnestly abide by the spirit of the Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and South Korea, adhere to the one-China principle, and handle Taiwan-related issues prudently.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347541.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-12","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that the head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department recently stated in an interview with the BBC that he was grateful to the United States for providing weapons and assisting in training the Taiwanese military. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","For some time now, American politicians have been advocating that \"every family in Taiwan should own an AR-15 rifle\" and supplying Taiwan with Stinger anti-aircraft missiles to arm Taiwan like a \"porcupine.\" At the same time, they have been openly clamoring to \"bomb TSMC\" and formulating a \"plan to destroy Taiwan.\" No matter how the US expresses its \"support for Taiwan,\" what it really wants is only how to use or even sacrifice Taiwan to protect its own interests.\nThe DPP authorities' awarding of honors to American politicians who advocate \"destroying Taiwan\" demonstrates their willingness to act as pawns and cannon fodder in the US's strategy of \"using Taiwan to contain China,\" which will only bring profound harm to Taiwan and push the Taiwanese people into an abyss of disaster.\nWe believe that the vast majority of our compatriots in Taiwan will recognize the United States' ambition to harm Taiwan and the DPP authorities' true nature of selling out Taiwan, and will firmly stand on the side of national righteousness and historical justice. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's sacred territory, and we will resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and resolutely counter all acts that harm or sell out Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347542.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-14","Wang Wenbin","Anadolu Agency reporter","This morning, US Secretary of State Blinken spoke with State Councilor Qin Gang. Can the spokesperson provide more information? US media reports that Blinken will visit China on June 18. Can the spokesperson confirm this? What are the specific plans for this visit?","This morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang spoke by phone with US Secretary of State Antony Blinken at the latter's request. Qin Gang pointed out that since the beginning of the year, China-US relations have encountered new difficulties and challenges, and the responsibilities are clear. China has always adhered to the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping in viewing and handling China-US relations.\nQin Gang clarified China's solemn position on the Taiwan issue and other core concerns, emphasizing that the US should respect these concerns, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop undermining China's sovereignty, security, and development interests under the guise of competition. He expressed hope that the US would take concrete actions to implement the important consensus reached at the Bali meeting between the two heads of state and the relevant commitments made by the US, work with China to effectively manage differences, promote exchanges and cooperation, and push China-US relations to stabilize and return to a healthy and stable development track.\nRegarding the visit you mentioned, I have no information to provide at this time. We will release information as soon as we have it.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347544.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-14","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Türkiye's Anadolu Agency","This morning, US Secretary of State Blinken had a phone call with State Councilor Qin Gang. Can the spokesperson provide more information? US media reported that Blinken will visit China on June 18. Can the spokesperson confirm this? Are there any specific plans for the visit?","This morning, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Qin Gang had a phone call with US Secretary of State Blinken at request. Qin Gang pointed out that since the beginning of the year, Sino-US relations have encountered new difficulties and challenges, and the responsibilities are clear. China has always viewed and handled Sino-US relations in accordance with the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping.\nQin Gang stated his solemn position on China's core concerns such as the Taiwan issue, stressing that the United States should respect it, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop undermining China's sovereignty, security and development interests in the name of competition. It is hoped that the U.S. will take practical actions to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state in Bali and relevant U.S. commitments, work with China halfway, effectively manage differences, promote exchanges and cooperation, and promote Sino-U.S. relations to stop falling and stabilize, and return to the track of healthy and stable development.\nRegarding the visit you mentioned, I have no information to provide at this time. If there is any news, we will release it in time.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347544.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-16","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","Former US Secretary of State Henry Kissinger stated that he believes a military conflict between mainland China and Taiwan is highly likely if current tensions continue to escalate. However, he also expressed hope for de-escalation through dialogue. How does China view Kissinger's remarks? Is it possible for tensions between China and the US to ease?","China-US relations are of great significance to both countries and the world. China has always adhered to the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping in viewing and handling China-US relations. The US should respect China's core concerns, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop undermining China's sovereignty, security, and development interests under the guise of competition. We hope the US will take concrete actions to implement the important consensus reached at the Bali meeting between the two heads of state and the relevant commitments made by the US, work with China in the same direction, effectively manage differences, promote exchanges and cooperation, and push China-US relations to stabilize and return to a healthy and stable development track.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347546.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-16","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg","Former US Secretary of State Kissinger said he believes that if the current tensions continue to develop, a military conflict is likely to break out between China and Taiwan. But he also expressed hope that the situation could be eased through dialogue. How does China view Kissinger's remarks? Is it possible for tensions between China and the United States to be eased?","Sino-US relations are of great significance to both China and the United States and the world. China has always viewed and handled Sino-US relations in accordance with the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping. The United States should respect China's core concerns, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop undermining China's sovereignty, security and development interests in the name of competition. It is hoped that the U.S. will take practical actions to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state in Bali and relevant U.S. commitments, work with China halfway, effectively manage differences, promote exchanges and cooperation, and promote Sino-U.S. relations to stop falling and stabilize, and return to the track of healthy and stable development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347546.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-26","Mao Ning","CNR reporter","It has been reported that the Taiwan authorities issued a statement saying that the Fijian government recently decided to correct the name of the Taiwan representative office in Fiji to \"Taipei Trade Office in Fiji\" and revoke its \"diplomatic privileges.\" What is China's comment on this?","The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations, as well as the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with all countries in the world. The Fijian government's adherence to the one-China principle, its decision to correct the erroneous name of the Taiwan representative office in Fiji, and its cancellation of its so-called \"diplomatic privileges\" are welcomed by China. This reflects the unshakeable international consensus on the one-China principle and once again demonstrates that any attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" will not succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347550.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-28","Mao Ning","Reporter from Taiwan National Broadcasting Corporation","According to reports, Guatemala’s presidential candidate Arevalo said in an interview on the 27th that Guatemala should independently formulate foreign policies based on its own national interests. He said that if he wins the presidential election, he will seek to develop friendly relations with China and Taiwan on the basis of mutual respect. What is China’s comment on this?","There is only one China in the world. The government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing China. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is an international principle, aspiration of the people and the general trend of the times. We believe that more countries will choose to stand on the right side of history and make correct decisions that are in line with the fundamental and long-term interests of their country and people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347552.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-29","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","It has been reported that the Taiwanese authorities recently rejected applications from officials from nine Chinese provinces to participate in the Taipei travel fair. What is China's response?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347553.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-06-29","","Reporter","The committees on armed services in the US Senate and House of Representatives have separately passed the 2024 National Defense Authorization Act (NDAA) which calls to further advance military cooperation with Taiwan. US Secretary of State Anthony Blinken recently said Washington does not support \"Taiwan independence\", but opposes any unilateral change to the status quo by either side. Please comment on that.","The Taiwan question is at the very core of China's core interests, and is the most important issue and the biggest risk in China-US relations. We urge the US side to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, and fulfill its commitment to not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", rather than saying one thing and doing another.\nIt must be emphasized that there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China, and China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been and will never be divided. That is the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. For some time, some external forces have tried all means to \"contain China with Taiwan\" and the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities have been obsessed with \"seeking independence with American support\". Their actions have changed the status quo and escalated tensions across the Taiwan Strait. China must be and will be reunified. How to resolve the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people, which allows no foreign interference. No one should act against the historical trend and those playing with fire will get themselves burned. The PLA has the ability and confidence to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and to firmly smash \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and external interfering attempts.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-06-30","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Two questions about New Zealand. First, how does China evaluate China-New Zealand relations? Second, New Zealand has expressed concerns on several occasions about the situation of the Uighurs in Xinjiang, the \"democracy protests\" in Hong Kong, and the situation in the Taiwan Strait. What is China's response to this?","China and New Zealand are each other's important partners. The healthy and stable development of relations between the two countries is in the interests of China and New Zealand, and is also conducive to regional peace, stability, development and prosperity.\nChina is willing to engage in dialogue and exchanges with all parties on the basis of equality and mutual respect, but is opposed to interfering in China's internal affairs through relevant issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347554.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-06-30","Mao Ning","Reuters","The U.S. Department of Defense said that the U.S. State Department has approved two arms sales agreements to Taiwan, involving up to US$440 million in ammunition and logistical supply support. What is China’s comment on this?","China’s firm opposition to U.S.-Taiwan military ties and U.S. arms sales to Taiwan is consistent and clear. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiques, stop selling weapons to Taiwan, stop creating new tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and stop jeopardizing peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347554.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-03","Wang Wenbin","Global Times reporter","It was reported that on June 30, Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff General Mark Milley stated at an event at the National Press Club that China hopes to become the dominant power in Asia within the next decade and surpass the United States militarily by the middle of this century. He also stated that the People's Liberation Army is developing its military capabilities and plans to reunify Taiwan by 2027.…","Some people in the US have ulterior motives and are confusing right and wrong by repeatedly hyping up the \"China military threat theory.\" In reality, they are looking for excuses for their own military expansion, maintenance of military hegemony, and undermining of regional peace and stability, and creating a pretext for provoking tensions in the Taiwan Strait and advancing the \"using Taiwan to contain China\" strategy.\nI want to point out that China has always pursued a defensive national defense policy and is firmly committed to the path of peaceful development. The growth of China's military strength is a growth of world peace forces and helps maintain peace and stability in the Asia-Pacific region and the world. Achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters, and we are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and the greatest effort. At the same time, we will never allow anyone or any force to separate Taiwan from the motherland.\nWe urge the US to stop smearing China, stop its militaristic activities, stop manipulating the Taiwan issue, abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, and take concrete actions to safeguard regional peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347555.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-04","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Recent public opinion polls in China and South Korea show that people in Pacific coastal countries are opposed to the discharge of nuclear-contaminated water into the sea. South Korea held large-scale rallies, and people from various countries held protests in front of Japanese embassies and consulates in the Philippines, New York, Sydney and other places, demanding that Japan stop its plan to discharge…","I have noticed relevant reports. The Japanese government has forced the discharge of contaminated water from the Fukushima nuclear power plant into the sea, triggering widespread international concern and worry. The Global Times launched a public opinion poll in 11 countries including China, South Korea, Japan, the Philippines, and New Zealand. Among more than 11,000 respondents, nearly 90% of the respondents expressed concern, fear and anger about the discharge of nuclear contaminated water into the sea, and more than 90% of the respondents supported their country's measures to intervene in Japan's discharge of water into the sea.\nRegrettably, the Japanese government insists on going its own way and is still forcibly advancing the sea discharge plan. It is also deliberately trying to create the illusion that sea discharge is justified and innocent. The International Atomic Energy Agency will release a relevant assessment report today. I would like to point out that the agency was invited by Japan to conduct the relevant assessment and review, and the scope of its authorization was limited to the assessment of the sea discharge plan. The report is not a \"pass\" for Japan to discharge into the sea, nor can it prove that discharge into the sea is the only, safest and most reliable option for disposing of nuclear-contaminated water.\nChina once again urges Japan to act with a responsible attitude toward all mankind and future generations, stop forcibly discharging nuclear-contaminated water into the sea, fully study and demonstrate disposal options other than discharge into the sea, effectively dispose of nuclear-contaminated water in a scientific, safe and transparent manner, and accept strict international supervision.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347556.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-05","Wang Wenbin","Global Times reporter","It has been reported that on July 4, the first batch of Honduran students received by China left Taiwan and arrived on the mainland to begin their studies. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","After the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Honduras, China pledged to accept all Honduran students studying in Taiwan to study on the mainland. More than three months after the establishment of diplomatic ties, thanks to efficient coordination between China and Honduras, the first batch of 26 Honduran students departed Taiwan yesterday and successfully arrived in Beijing, Tianjin, Xi'an, and other cities to begin their new studies. China warmly welcomes them. The Honduran students are full of anticipation for their studies on the mainland, expressing their determination to study diligently, gain a deeper understanding of Chinese culture, and contribute to the development and progress of Honduras and the friendly exchanges between China and Honduras. China welcomes more Honduran students to study on the mainland and is willing to expand exchanges and cooperation with Honduras in the cultural field, paving the way for friendship and building bridges of understanding between the two peoples.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347557.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-07","Wang Wenbin","Dragon TV reporter","According to reports, Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Matsuno Hiroshi said yesterday that nuclear power plants in China and South Korea have discharged liquid effluents with high tritium concentrations into the sea. Japan’s concentration standards for tritium emissions are far stricter than those of all other countries, including China and South Korea. Japan will explain to China its plan to discharge Fukushima…","Japan confuses the contaminated water from the Fukushima nuclear accident with the normal operation of nuclear power plants around the world. This is a sneaky change of concept and misleading public opinion.\nEven if you are not an expert, it is not difficult for ordinary people to imagine that the nuclear-contaminated water that came into direct contact with the melted reactor core in the Fukushima nuclear accident is fundamentally different from the normal operation drainage of a nuclear power plant that is not in direct contact with the reactor core. The two sources are different, contain different types of radionuclides, and have different processing difficulties. They are not comparable at all. In particular, the International Atomic Energy Agency has not evaluated the effectiveness and long-term reliability of Japan's nuclear-contaminated water purification equipment, and cannot guarantee that all nuclear-contaminated water can be treated to meet standards in the next 30 years. The Japanese side is citing the normal operation of the nuclear power plant as an issue and trying to \"whitewash\" its wrong decision to discharge nuclear-contaminated water into the sea. This is misleading the international community under the guise of science.\nWe have also noticed that Japan has gone to great lengths to beautify nuclear-contaminated water, including designing the radioactive element tritium into a harmless \"mascot\" and inventing pseudo-scientific terms such as \"treated water.\" Japan has only one purpose, and that is to dilute the harm of nuclear-contaminated water. But no matter how Japan \"washes its name\", it will never be able to get away with it in front of the international community. Nuclear contaminated water is nuclear contaminated water. No matter what the Japanese side says, it cannot turn contaminated water into normal water, and cannot shirk the consequences and responsibilities of forcibly discharging contaminated water into the sea.\nIt is difficult to collect the overflowing water, and the disaster will be endless. We urge the Japanese side to stop trying to shirk responsibility, honestly respond to the legitimate concerns of the international community, stop promoting plans to discharge nuclear-contaminated water into the sea, and properly dispose of nuclear-contaminated water in a scientific, safe, transparent and negotiated manner.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347559.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-10","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Paraguayan President-elect Santiago Peña plans to visit Taiwan this week to strengthen Paraguay's friendship with Taipei. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. Upholding the one-China principle is in accordance with international justice, the will of the people, and the trend of the times. We believe that relevant countries will sooner or later recognize the international trend and make decisions that conform to the historical trend.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-11","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","According to Taiwanese media reports, the United States has urged the Taiwanese military to establish a new biosafety level 4 laboratory to secretly develop virus research capabilities. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","China's position against military collusion between the US and Taiwan is consistent and clear. If the reports you mentioned are true, they only further expose the US's ambition to harm Taiwan and the DPP authorities' nature of selling out Taiwan.\nTaiwan is an inalienable part of China's sacred territory. We will firmly defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity and resolutely counter all acts that \"harm Taiwan\" or \"sell out Taiwan.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347561.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-13","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","In the past few days, mainland China has conducted military exercises around Taiwan, coinciding with the NATO summit in Lithuania. Is China sending a message to NATO not to interfere in the Taiwan issue?","Regarding the issues you mentioned, I suggest you inquire with the relevant authorities.\nWe must emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Chinese people's determination and will to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity are unwavering.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347563.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-17","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","It has been reported that Taiwan's Lai Ching-te will stop in the United States next month on his way to Paraguay. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes \"Taiwan independence\" separatists visiting the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form. We have lodged a solemn protest with the US.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly fulfill the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" cease official exchanges with Taiwan, stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China will closely monitor developments and take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347565.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-19","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's Lai Ching-te will be transiting through the United States in August. In response to this \"visit,\" does China plan to conduct military exercises or take similar measures in the Taiwan Strait region?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes \"Taiwan independence\" separatists visiting the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly fulfill the commitments made by US leaders to not support \"Taiwan independence,\" cease official exchanges with Taiwan, stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China will closely monitor developments and take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347567.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-24","Mao Ning","Yonhap News Agency reporter","Recently, several locations in South Korea have received suspicious international packages. Taiwanese authorities stated that the packages were originally sent from mainland China, transited through Taiwan, and then arrived in South Korea. The South Korean Ministry of Foreign Affairs stated that it has requested China to confirm the incident. Has China launched an investigation into this matter?","China has received South Korea's request for assistance in the investigation and is currently conducting the relevant investigation. We will maintain communication with South Korea.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347570.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-07-25","Mao Ning","China News Service reporter","According to reports, Japanese Vice Defense Minister Toshiro Ino recently claimed in an interview with British media that if mainland China were to use force against Taiwan, Japan would very likely provide some form of support to Taiwan, though it is unclear whether this would be defense equipment or logistical support. What is China's comment on this?","Taiwan is Chinese territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no interference from any external forces. Current senior officials in Japan's defense ministry have disregarded basic norms of international relations and the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, grossly interfering in China's internal affairs and damaging the political foundation of China-Japan relations. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn protest with Japan.\nJapan, having colonized Taiwan for half a century, committed countless crimes and bears grave historical responsibility towards the Chinese people. It should be especially cautious in its words and actions and reflect upon its own actions. What right do they have to make irresponsible remarks about the Taiwan issue? I want to emphasize that the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters and an unstoppable historical trend. No one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. I urge Japan to stop playing with fire on the Taiwan issue; those who play with fire will get burned.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347571.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-07-27","","Reporter","It is reported that the US House of Representatives passed the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2024 not long ago, which included accelerating the provision of asymmetric weapons to Taiwan and inviting the island to participate in the Exercise Rim of the Pacific (RIMPAC). Besides, the US reached an agreement with Taiwan on selling its ground-to-air missile systems to the region at their…","The US side acknowledged in the August 17th China-US Joint Communiqué &nbsp;that \"there is but one China and Taiwan is part of China\", \"the United States of America recognized the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal Government of China\", and \"the United States Government does not seek to carry out a long-term policy of arms sales to Taiwan, and that it intends gradually to reduce its sale of arms to Taiwan, leading, over a period of time, to a final resolution.\" However, the US side has gone back on its own words over and over again by frequently selling arms to Taiwan and strengthening its military ties with the region. These outrageous actions seriously harm China's national sovereignty and security, severely threaten peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and expose the relations between the two countries and the two militaries to major strategic risks. The Chinese side is gravely concerned and strongly opposed to this.\nThe Taiwan question is China's internal affair and allows no foreign interference. Taiwan's security depends on the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and \"Taiwan independence\" and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. Any words or deeds advocating stronger US military ties with and arms sales to Taiwan will only aggravate tensions across the Strait and the risks of conflict and confrontation, and is essentially seeking to harm Taiwan's interest and even destroy Taiwan. We urge the US side to stop its arms sales to and military ties with Taiwan and refrain from repeating its mistakes on the Taiwan question. The Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities attempt to \"solicit US support for Taiwan independence\" and collude with foreign forces to turn Taiwan into an island of landmines and arsenals. Facts have proved that \"Taiwan independence\" and foreign interference pose the greatest threat to cross-Strait peace and stability, and to the interests and wellbeing of the Taiwan people. The PLA will keep a close eye on the situation across the Taiwan Strait, and continue to take resolute and strong measures to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nClosing remarks: In a couple of days, we are going to celebrate the 96th anniversary of the founding of the PLA. Here I would like to extend my greetings to all service members. The Chinese military will brave winds to march forward with confidence and strengthen itself to defend our motherland. The past 96 years have witnessed changes in our military uniforms, but what remains unchanged and will never change is the shining red star. The heroic people's military will always resolutely obey the Party's command, carry forward the revolutionary tradition, and temper strong and capable troops. They have made indelible accomplishments in fighting for national independence, people's liberation, and national prosperity, and have grown into a staunch force defending national sovereignty, security and development interests as well as world peace and stability.\nThe military marches wherever the banner of the Party goes. The PLA will rally more closely around the CPC Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, follow Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era as the fundamental guidance, implement Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and pool strength to forge ahead with fortitude and perseverance on the new journey with glories and dreams, and make unremitting efforts to achieve the Party's goal of building a strong military in the new era and transform the people's military into a world-class one.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-07-28","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that Japan's Ministry of Defense released its 2023 Defense White Paper on the 28th, hyping up the Chinese military threat, expressing concern about China's military development and naval and air activities, and stating that it will further increase its defense budget and strengthen its defense capabilities. The white paper also exaggerates tensions across the Taiwan Strait, claiming that the…","Japan's new Defense White Paper grossly interferes in China's internal affairs, wantonly smears China's normal national defense development and military activities at sea and in the air, deliberately exaggerates the so-called \"China threat,\" and creates tension in the region. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn protest with Japan.\nChina adheres to the path of peaceful development and pursues a defensive national defense policy. China's national defense construction and military activities are legitimate and reasonable, and its military cooperation with relevant countries, such as joint patrols, is in accordance with international law and practice. Taiwan is Chinese territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no interference from any external forces. The so-called military balance between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait is a completely false proposition. Japan bears serious historical responsibility for its actions and should be especially cautious in its words and deeds and reflect on its own conduct regarding the Taiwan issue.\nI want to emphasize that due to Japan's history of militaristic aggression in modern times, its military and security trends have always been a major concern for its Asian neighbors and the international community. In recent years, Japan's continuous increases in defense budgets, revisions to defense policies, and pursuit of breakthrough military development have raised strong concerns about whether it will continue to adhere to the path of peaceful development. We urge Japan to genuinely respect the security concerns of its neighbors, deeply reflect on its history of aggression, stop exaggerating regional security threats and using them as excuses for its military buildup, and instead take concrete actions to gain the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347574.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-14","Wang Wenbin","The Paper reporter","According to reports, Guatemalan political scientists recently analyzed that Arévalo, the candidate of the Movement of Seeds party in Guatemala, is likely to win the second round of the Guatemalan general election. They believe that if elected, Arévalo will recognize the One China principle and establish diplomatic relations with China. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a common consensus of the international community. The fact that 182 countries have established diplomatic relations with China fully demonstrates that establishing diplomatic relations with China is the correct choice in line with the general trend of historical development and the progress of the times.\nChina is Guatemala's second-largest source of imports and fifth-largest export destination. Recognizing the one-China principle and developing relations with China is in the fundamental interests of Guatemala and its people. We hope Guatemala will choose to stand on the right side of history and make the correct decision that aligns with its own fundamental and long-term interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347575.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-15","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Does China plan to launch a large-scale military exercise immediately after Lai Ching-te returns to Taiwan on Friday?","Lai Ching-te stubbornly adheres to his separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and is a complete \"troublemaker.\" The collusion between the US and Taiwan, using \"transit\" as a pretext to arrange for Lai Ching-te to engage in political activities in the US, seriously violates the one-China principle and severely undermines China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. Facts once again prove that the fundamental reason for the continued tension in the Taiwan Strait is the Taiwan authorities' attempt to \"seek independence by relying on the US,\" and the US's insistence on \"using Taiwan to contain China.\"\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, fulfill its commitments not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" not to support \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their separatist activities, and stop undermining the one-China principle. China is closely monitoring developments and will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347576.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-15","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","Does China plan to launch large-scale military exercises immediately after Lai Qingde returns to Taiwan on Friday?","Lai Qingde stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and is an outright \"troublemaker.\" The United States and Taiwan colluded to arrange for Lai Qingde to engage in political activities in the United States under the guise of \"transit\", which seriously violated the one-China principle and seriously damaged China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. Facts have once again proven that the root cause of the ongoing tension across the Taiwan Strait is the Taiwan authorities' attempt to \"rely on the United States to seek independence\" and the United States is determined to \"use Taiwan to contain China.\"\nThe Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of Sino-US relations, and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. China urges the United States to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, fulfill its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" stop any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their separatist activities, and stop hollowing out the one-China principle. China is closely following the development of the situation and will take resolute and effective measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347576.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-15","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","According to reports, members of Congress who visited Taiwan together with Taro Aso, Vice President of Japan’s Liberal Democratic Party and former Prime Minister, said that Aso’s remarks about “deterrence” and “combat” in Taiwan had been discussed with the Japanese government in advance and were in line with Japan’s official position. What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. The Taiwan issue is purely China’s internal affairs and does not allow interference from external forces. China has previously lodged stern representations with Japan regarding certain Japanese politicians' false statements made by escaping to Taiwan.\nJapan illegally occupied and implemented colonial rule in Taiwan for half a century, and committed countless crimes. In 1943, China, the United States and Britain issued the Cairo Declaration, which clearly stipulated that Taiwan and other Chinese territories stolen by Japan would be returned to China. This was reiterated in Article 8 of the 1945 Potsdam Declaration. The surrender document signed by Japan in 1945 clearly promised to accept the Potsdam Declaration. The Sino-Japanese Joint Statement signed when China and Japan normalized diplomatic relations in 1972 clearly stipulates that the Japanese government fully understands and respects the Chinese government’s position that Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory and insists on abiding by Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration. In 1978, the two countries concluded the Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship, confirming the principles of the joint declaration in legal form. The third and fourth political documents in 1998 and 2008 both reaffirmed the stance of the Joint Statement on the Taiwan issue. Japan has also made solemn commitments to China on the Taiwan issue on many occasions, including not pursuing \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\", not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", and only maintaining non-governmental and regional exchanges with Taiwan. This is the historical latitude and longitude, and it is the position and principle that Japan must follow.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that the Taiwan issue involves China's core interests, the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries. Japan should abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and take practical actions to reflect its political commitments and relevant statements so far. China will take all necessary measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347576.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-18","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that Lai Ching-te, the vice leader of Taiwan, made a transit visit to New York and San Francisco from August 12 to 18. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The US's insistence on arranging for Lai Ching-te to transit through the US twice seriously violates the one-China principle, severely undermines China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes and strongly condemns this.\nThe one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. It is also the premise and foundation for the establishment and development of diplomatic relations between China and the United States. The US has explicitly pledged in the three Sino-US joint communiqués to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan. Lai Ching-te, as the Vice President of Taiwan, who touts himself as a \"pragmatic worker for Taiwan independence,\" has once again proven through his words and actions during his visit to the US that he is a thoroughgoing separatist advocating for Taiwan independence. The US's insistence on allowing Lai Ching-te to travel to the US to engage in political activities and promote separatist claims for Taiwan independence, thereby enhancing official exchanges and substantive relations between the US and Taiwan, once again exposes the US's hypocrisy, its stubborn adherence to the strategy of \"using Taiwan to contain China,\" and its continuous efforts to hollow out and undermine the one-China principle.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, the foundation of the political basis of China-US relations, and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with cross-strait peace and stability and is a dead end. Tolerating and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" will ultimately backfire, leading to self-destruction.\nChina once again urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, fulfill its commitments not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" not to support \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" cease all forms of official exchanges with Taiwan, stop escalating substantive relations with Taiwan, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their separatist activities, and stop undermining the one-China principle. China must be unified, and will inevitably be unified; any attempt to obstruct China's reunification process is doomed to failure. China will take resolute measures to firmly safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347579.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-21","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","Last weekend, Japan, South Korea, and the United States issued a joint statement criticizing \"China's recent dangerous and assertive actions in the South China Sea to support its illegal maritime claims,\" and emphasizing that peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait are indispensable elements for the security and prosperity of the international community. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","The Camp David meeting between the leaders of the United States, Japan, and South Korea smeared and attacked China on issues such as Taiwan and maritime matters, grossly interfered in China's internal affairs, deliberately sowed discord between China and its neighboring countries, and seriously violated the basic norms of international relations. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition and has lodged solemn representations with the relevant parties. We also noted the US statement that the US-Japan-South Korea partnership is not directed against any country. China urges the US to match its words with deeds, put into practice its statement that it \"does not seek to strengthen alliances against China,\" stop smearing China's image and harming China's interests, and stop creating division and confrontation and undermining regional peace and stability.\nCurrently, two trends are emerging in the Asia-Pacific region. One is the effort by regional countries to strengthen unity and cooperation and promote regional economic integration, exemplified by the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership (RCEP) and the Comprehensive and Progressive Agreement for Trans-Pacific Partnership (CPTPP). The other is the incitement of division and confrontation, and attempts to revive Cold War thinking, represented by various closed and exclusive \"small circles\" such as the US, UK, Australia; the US, Japan, and South Korea; and the US, Japan, India, and Australia. Regrettably, the former lacks the presence of the United States, while the latter are all centered around Washington.\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a high ground for peaceful development, and should not become a boxing ring for great power rivalry, much less a battlefield for cold or hot wars. Any attempt to instigate a \"new Cold War\" in the Asia-Pacific will be resolutely resisted by the countries and people of the region, and any attempt to establish or maintain hegemony in the Asia-Pacific is doomed to failure. We urge relevant countries not to go against the tide, not to try to replicate the bloc confrontation model in the Asia-Pacific, and not to pursue their own selfish interests at the expense of the strategic security interests of other countries and the well-being of the people of the Asia-Pacific.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, and resolving it is China's own business. China is committed to striving for the prospect of peaceful reunification across the Taiwan Strait with the utmost sincerity and effort, but will never accept interference in China's internal affairs by any individual or force under the guise of peace. Currently, the greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the indulgence and support of external forces. If relevant countries truly care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, they should adhere to the one-China principle, cease their indulgence and support of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their separatist activities, and take concrete actions to safeguard regional peace and stability. No one should underestimate the Chinese people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nI would also like to point out that China has indisputable sovereignty over the islands in the South China Sea and their adjacent waters. China's construction activities on its own territory and the law enforcement activities conducted by Chinese coast guard vessels in waters under its jurisdiction are reasonable, legal, and beyond reproach. As a signatory to the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, China has consistently and faithfully fulfilled its obligations under international law, including the Convention, and does not accept or recognize the illegal ruling in the South China Sea arbitration case. In recent years, the United States has made great efforts to interfere in the South China Sea issue, instigating and supporting maritime infringements by certain countries, and sowing discord among regional countries. It is a disruptor and destroyer of regional order. The United States has also rallied its allies to frequently conduct military exercises and close-in reconnaissance in waters surrounding China, including the South China Sea, flexing its military muscle and exacerbating regional tensions. It has become the greatest threat and challenge to regional peace and stability. China will continue to firmly safeguard its sovereignty and security interests, and, together with ASEAN countries, fully and effectively implement the Declaration on the Conduct of Parties in the South China Sea, actively promote consultations on the Code of Conduct in the South China Sea, carry out pragmatic cooperation on maritime matters, firmly safeguard regional peace and stability, and strive to promote regional prosperity and development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347580.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-22","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","On August 21 local time, the Central American Parliament plenary session passed a resolution to revoke the so-called \"permanent observer\" status of Taiwan's \"Legislative Yuan\" and accept the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer. What is China's comment on this? Is China considering becoming a permanent observer of the parliament?","China welcomes and highly appreciates the resolution passed by the Central American Parliament to revoke the so-called \"permanent observer\" status of Taiwan's \"Legislative Yuan\" and accept the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer. This once again fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is an unstoppable trend of the times, the will of the people, and an irresistible force. China is willing to develop friendly and cooperative relations with the Central American Parliament on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347581.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-24","Wang Wenbin","Global Times reporter","It was reported that on August 23, the U.S. Defense Security Cooperation Agency stated that the U.S. State Department had approved the sale of F-16 fighter jet infrared search and track systems and other equipment to Taiwan, worth approximately $500 million. What is China's comment on this?","The United States' arms sales to Taiwan seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué. They also seriously violate international law and the basic norms governing international relations, undermine China's sovereignty and security interests, endanger peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and send a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, immediately cancel its arms sales plan to Taiwan, cease arms sales to Taiwan and US-Taiwan military contacts, stop the dangerous trend of arming Taiwan, and stop endangering peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347583.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-30","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","The Foreign Affairs Committee of the British House of Commons released a document stating that Taiwan is an \"independent country.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is a recognized norm of international relations and the political foundation of China-UK relations. The relevant report of the British Parliament blatantly refers to Taiwan as an \"independent country\", confusing right and wrong and confusing right and wrong. China urges relevant parties in the British Parliament to abide by the one-China principle, abide by international law and norms of international relations, earnestly respect China's core interests, stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, fulfill the political commitments made by the British side on the Taiwan issue with practical actions, and promote the healthy and stable development of China-UK relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347587.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-31","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","China's latest 2023 version of the standard map marks a \"ten-dash line\" in the South China Sea, including the southeastern and eastern sections of Taiwan. However, the map China submitted to the United Nations in 2009 only had a \"nine-dash line.\" Malaysia, India and the Philippines protested against the new map. Why are the two maps inconsistent?","China’s position on the South China Sea issue is consistent and clear. The Chinese competent authorities routinely release various types of standard maps every year, aiming to provide standard map services to all sectors of society and increase public awareness of standardized map use. We hope relevant parties will view it objectively and rationally.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347588.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-31","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","For the first time, US President Biden approved direct military assistance to Taiwan through a project aimed at providing assistance to foreign governments. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The United States has provided weapons to the Taiwan region of China through the so-called \"foreign military financing plan\" applicable to sovereign countries. It seriously violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the provisions of the \"August 17\" communiqué. It seriously violates international law and basic norms of international relations, damages China's sovereignty and security interests, jeopardizes peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sends a serious wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China is strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to this.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not allow any interference from external forces. We urge the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiques, stop strengthening US-Taiwan military ties and arming Taiwan in any name and by any means, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces \"seeking independence through force.\" No one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, firm will, and strong ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347588.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-08-31","Wang Wenbin","Pakistan News Agency reporter","According to reports, three Indian\nbefore\nThe Chief of Staff of the Army, Navy and Air Force visited Taiwan on August 8 and attended a security dialogue organized by the Taiwan authorities. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with the Taiwan authorities. This position is consistent and clear. We hope that relevant countries will abide by the one-China principle, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, and refrain from any form of military and security cooperation with Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347588.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-01","Wang Wenbin","The Paper","We have noticed that since this year, when reporting on Sino-US relations, the US media has paid much more attention to competition than cooperation, with more than 70% of reports talking about competition. At the same time, rational voices from the political, business and academic circles in the United States continue to call for strengthening cooperation with China. They hope that China and the United States…","Currently, when the United States talks about Sino-US relations, they always mention competition, as if competition has become the biggest theme or even the entire issue in Sino-US relations.\nChina's attitude and position are clear. Competition should be conducive to mutual promotion and common improvement, and should be in line with the common interests and expectations of both parties and the international community. Competition should not use any means to hinder the other side or use any means to try to bring the other side down. The United States keeps talking about competition, but what the international community sees is that in order to gain an advantage, the United States uses state machinery in the name of competition to suppress and contain China across the entire government, in all aspects, and in all fields, and engages in tariff wars, trade wars, technology wars, chip wars, and rules wars. These actions by the United States are not competition at all, but a naked zero-sum Cold War mentality. In essence, they are depriving the Chinese people of their right to choose their own development path, their right to pursue a better life, their right to legitimate development, and their right to achieve national reunification. China firmly opposes containment, containment and suppression in the name of competition. The US approach will only push China and the United States into confrontation and conflict, and push the world into a \"new cold war\" of division and turmoil.\nWe do not shy away from competition, nor are we afraid of competition, but competition should be fair and reasonable, benign and regulated, with red lines and restricted areas. We cannot ignore the rules of the market economy and the basic norms of international relations, let alone use issues of core interests as a tool of competition or a means of provocation. As two major countries, China and the United States should look at their common interests and the future and destiny of mankind to see who can govern the country better and allow their people to live and work in peace and contentment; who can provide greater momentum for global post-epidemic recovery and growth; who can provide more public goods to address climate change; who can provide better solutions to regional hot-spot issues; and who can make the planet where both sides and the world's 8 billion people live together safer, more peaceful, and more prosperous.\nCompetition is not the entirety of Sino-U.S. relations. We oppose using competition to define all Sino-U.S. relations. In fact, the economies of China and the United States are far more complementary than competitive, and the essence of Sino-US economic and trade cooperation is mutual benefit and win-win results. Last year, China-U.S. trade volume reached nearly 760 billion U.S. dollars, a record high. With such a large scale, it is normal for there to be some disagreements and frictions. The correct solution is to seek a win-win solution through equal consultation. China and the United States have different systems, but this does not prevent the two sides from cooperating based on their common interests, nor should it become a reason for confrontation between China and the United States. Under the current situation, the common interests between China and the United States have not decreased, but have increased. Non-conflict, non-confrontation, and peaceful coexistence are the most basic common interests of the two countries. The two countries' economies are deeply integrated and face new development tasks, and they need to benefit from each other's development. This is also a common interest. Global post-epidemic recovery, response to climate change, and resolution of regional hot spots cannot be separated from Sino-US coordination and cooperation, which is also a common interest.\nExaggerating competition has many disadvantages but no advantages, and seeking cooperation is a necessity rather than an option. Facts have repeatedly proven that China and the United States both benefit from cooperation and lose from confrontation. Cooperation between China and the United States can accomplish many major things that are beneficial to both countries and the world. Confrontation between China and the United States will be a disaster for both countries and the world. We must break away from the logic of competition and confrontation, take care of each other's interests and concerns, seek the greatest common denominator for exchanges and cooperation, draw the largest concentric circles of win-win cooperation, and jointly contribute the wisdom and strength of major powers to the respective development and common prosperity of China and the United States, as well as to peace and development around the world.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347589.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-05","Mao Ning","The Paper reporter","Recently, the Taiwan authorities held a press conference, outlining \"four demands for participation in the United Nations\" and stating that they will join forces with their \"diplomatic allies\" to send a letter to the UN Secretary-General urging the UN to correct its \"erroneous interpretation\" of Resolution 2758. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities disregard the fact and legal basis that Taiwan is part of China, and have been distorting UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 in various ways, openly challenging the international communitys one-China principle, and fabricating lies to seek so-called Taiwan independence. This is a very dangerous provocation to seek independence.\nOn October 25, 1971, the 26th United Nations General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority. It explicitly restored all rights of the People's Republic of China, recognized the representative of the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legitimate representative of China in the United Nations, and demanded the expulsion of the \"representative\" of the Taiwan authorities from their illegally occupied seat. After the resolution was adopted, the so-called \"dual representation\" proposal put forward by the United States and a few other countries to retain Taiwan's seat in the United Nations became worthless. UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 not only thoroughly resolved the issue of the representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations politically, legally, and procedurally, but also clarified that China has only one seat in the United Nations, and that there is no issue of \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan.\"\nSince the adoption of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, the United Nations, its specialized agencies, and other international and regional organizations have adhered to its provisions. 182 countries have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle, which has long been a recognized norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. Any question concerning Taiwan's participation in international organizations must be resolved under the one-China principle. Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the United Nations or other international organizations that only sovereign states can join.\nBoth sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is an integral part of Chinese territory. Although the two sides have long been politically opposed, China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity have never been divided. This is the true status quo of the Taiwan issue. The DPP authorities' clamor for \"participation in the United Nations\" is essentially an attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" challenging the international order based on the United Nations and international law. Those who attempt to disrupt the status quo across the Taiwan Strait and endanger peace and stability are the DPP authorities, who are constantly promoting \"gradual Taiwan independence\" and engaging in \"de-Sinicization,\" and external forces that are constantly undermining and hollowing out the one-China principle and condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. They are the real culprits disrupting the status quo across the Taiwan Strait.\nI want to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, and resolving it is a matter for the 1.4 billion Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities' attempt to seek external support to embolden their separatist \"Taiwan independence\" activities is doomed to failure. UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is not to be challenged, and the one-China principle is unshakeable. The wheels of history are rolling forward, and China's complete reunification will surely be achieved!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347592.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-06","Mao Ning","AFP","The new version of the map released by the Chinese government classifies what Japan calls the \"Senkaku Islands\" and what China calls the Diaoyu Islands as Chinese territory. Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Matsuno Hiroshi criticized this, saying that Japan has protested to China through diplomatic channels and asked China to withdraw the map. What is China’s response to this?","Diaoyu Island and its affiliated islands are China’s inherent territory. It is natural that Chinese maps mark the Diaoyu Islands as Chinese territory. China does not accept Japan's so-called protest.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347593.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-08","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","According to our report, a senior Indian official stated that India is studying how to respond to a potential war in Taiwan. India's top military commander commissioned a study six weeks ago to investigate the broader implications of a war in Taiwan and how India would respond. It is said that India issued this order after the US raised related questions on multiple occasions. What is the Foreign Ministry's…","Taiwan is part of China. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no external interference.\nThe United States' attempts to hype up the Taiwan issue on various occasions, creating tension and provoking confrontation in an attempt to internationalize the Taiwan issue, are extremely dangerous. The most effective way to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is to adhere to the one-China principle and unequivocally oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347595.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-11","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","During his visit to Vietnam, US President Biden stated that he does not believe China would invade Taiwan, given that China's capabilities may be weakened due to economic challenges. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this? The US and Vietnam have upgraded their bilateral relations and signed cooperation agreements on semiconductors and minerals. What is China's comment on this?","Regarding your first question, Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. The resolution of the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, and it must be decided by the Chinese people; no external interference is allowed.\nRegarding the second question, Vietnam has repeatedly emphasized that developing the comprehensive strategic cooperative partnership with China is a priority in Vietnamese diplomacy and a top priority in its foreign relations. China believes that bilateral relations between countries should not be directed against any third party, nor should they undermine regional peace, stability, development, and prosperity.\nWe urge the US to respect the shared aspirations of regional countries for stability, cooperation, and development when dealing with their relations with Asian countries, to abide by the basic norms of international relations, and to abandon hegemonic and Cold War mentality.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347596.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-13","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Last week, US and Canadian warships transited the Taiwan Strait. Recent reports indicate that China is conducting large-scale military exercises in the waters near Taiwan. Could the Ministry of Foreign Affairs provide further details?","Regarding the transit of US and Canadian warships through the Taiwan Strait, the spokesperson for the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has already issued a statement, which you can refer to.\nI want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and China's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering. Relevant parties should immediately cease such provocative actions and refrain from becoming troublemakers for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347598.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-13","Mao Ning","AFP","Last week, US and Canadian warships passed through the Taiwan Strait. There have been reports recently that China is conducting large-scale military exercises in the waters near Taiwan Island. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs further introduce the relevant situation?","Regarding the passage of US and Canadian warships through the Taiwan Strait, the spokesperson of the Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has made a statement. You can check it out.\nI want to stress that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and China is unwavering in its determination to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Relevant parties should immediately stop such provocative actions and stop causing trouble for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347598.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-15","Mao Ning","China Daily reporter","Recently, the United States has provided advanced weapons to Taiwan through arms sales, military aid, and loans. A spokesperson for the Chinese Foreign Ministry previously stated that China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Does the spokesperson have any further information?","The US government, disregarding Chinas firm opposition, insisted on providing weapons to Taiwan, which seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, seriously contravenes international law and the basic norms of international relations, and seriously damages Chinas sovereignty and security interests. It is going further and further down the wrong and dangerous path of arming Taiwan.\nLockheed Martin's St. Louis, Missouri branch, as the prime contractor, was directly involved in the August 24th US arms sale to Taiwan. Northrop Grumman has also participated in multiple US arms sales to Taiwan. In accordance with the Anti-Foreign Sanctions Law of the People's Republic of China, China has decided to impose sanctions on these two US defense contractors.\nI want to emphasize that the Chinese government's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering. We urge the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, cease arms sales to Taiwan, stop military collusion with Taiwan, and stop arming Taiwan; otherwise, it will inevitably face a resolute and forceful response from China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347600.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-18","Mao Ning","China Daily reporter","It has been reported that the Speaker of the Central American Parliament, Cerroud, will lead a delegation to China in the near future. Can you confirm this?","At the invitation of Zhao Leji, Chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress, Speaker of the Central American Parliament, Cérúd, will lead a delegation to China from September 19 to 23. On August 22 this year, the Central American Parliament passed a resolution to revoke the so-called \"permanent observer\" status of Taiwan's \"Legislative Yuan\" and accept the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer. China welcomes and highly appreciates this. This once again fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is an unstoppable trend of the times, the will of the people, and an irresistible force. China is willing to establish and develop friendly and cooperative relations with the Central American Parliament on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347601.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-26","Wang Wenbin","Dragon TV reporter","It has been reported that on the 26th, the plenary session of the Central American Parliament approved a special agreement on the accession of the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer to the Central American Parliament. What is China's comment on this?","On September 26, the Central American Parliament plenary session overwhelmingly approved the special agreement on the accession of the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer to the parliament, and also overwhelmingly passed the minutes of the August plenary session, which included a resolution on revoking the so-called \"permanent observer\" status of Taiwan's \"Legislative Yuan\" and accepting the National People's Congress of China as a permanent observer. China highly appreciates this. This demonstrates the Central American Parliament's firm determination to develop relations with China and once again shows that the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and an unstoppable trend of the times. China is willing to continuously develop and consolidate friendly and cooperative relations with the Central American Parliament and Central American countries on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347607.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-09-28","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","Taiwan's defense ministry has conducted its first test sea trial of the \"Haikun\" diesel-electric submarine, one of eight vessels built by Taiwan at a cost of billions of dollars to enhance its maritime defense capabilities. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","This is not a diplomatic issue. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the reunification of the two sides is inevitable. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, squander the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people, and create confrontation and antagonism across the Taiwan Strait, which will only undermine peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347609.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","I have two questions. First, many countries, including the US, Japan, Australia and Canada, intended to participate in joint patrols in the South China Sea. The Philippine military is considering the proposal. There are also reports that the US and the Philippines have started a discussion on expanding the US military deployment on the eastern coast of the Philippines in response to the so-called China's…","For the first question, we have noted the relevant reports. It needs to be emphasized that defense and security cooperation between countries should not harm the interests of third parties or regional peace and stability. China firmly opposes the interference of non-regional countries in the South China Sea issue and their actions under the guise of \"freedom of navigation\" to provoke disputes and create tensions in the region. The Chinese military will always take resolute measures to safeguardour national sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and maintain peace and stability in the South China Sea.\nRegarding the second question, Taiwan's military authorities want to use it as the whistle in the dark to prove that it is well-informed. As for whether it will work or not,we will wait and see. We would like to warn the DPP authorities that any attempt to engage in military confrontation and \"seek independence by force\" is overestimating their own capabilities and will lead to a dead end.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","The PLA recently conducted large-scale exercises and training in the sea and airspace around Taiwan, and according to Taiwan statistics, the number of PLA ships and aircraft involved has set a new record. The head of Taiwan's military authorities stated that the military operations of PLA vessels and aircraft around Taiwan have become increasingly frequent, raising the risk of accidental conflicts. What is your…","Regarding your first question, the recent joint live exercises and training organized by the PLA in the sea and airspace around Taiwan Island are routine arrangements within our annual plan. The exercises are aimed at testing the outcomes of joint training and enhancing the joint combat capabilities of multiple services and arms. The PLA will organize such drills on a regular basis, strengthen front-line military training, and firmly defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nAs for your second question, it is just an act of holding back the tide with a broom, and will eventually lead to self-destruction. As for your mention of preventing the PLA from entering the Pacific, it's a pipe dream. No matter how many weapons the DPP authorities build or purchase, they cannot stop the overwhelming trend of national reunification, nor can they shake the PLA's strong determination, firm will, and formidable capabilities in defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","According to reports, Taiwan's military authorities recently released the “2023 National Defense Report”, stating that it will adhere to a military strategic thinking of “resolute defense and multi-domain deterrence\". The report states that “the PRC has been completing the construction of airfields along the coastline of its Eastern and Southern Theater Commands, and “the military development of the PRC” poses a…","Taiwan is a part of China, so how would Taiwan possibly have its own “national defense” report? We have repeatedly pointed out that “Taiwan independence” is a dead end, and soliciting foreign support leads nowhere. The so-called “resolute defense” and “deterrence” won't work in front of the strong PLA. As for “seeking independence with foreign support,” it's nothing more than a self-deceiving day dream. Chinese don't fight Chinese, but if some people on the island don't want to be Chinese, we won't sit idly by.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers media queries concerning the military on the afternoon of September 28, 2023. (Photo/mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","According to foreign media reports, the US plans to expand the scale of military training for troops of the Taiwan region. Sources say this is part of the US strategy to strengthen deterrence against the Chinese mainland by deepening cooperation with the island. What is your comment on this?","For some time, the DPP authorities have been stepping up its military collusion with the US by strengthening official exchanges and military contacts, in an attempt to rely on external forces to “seek independence by force”. Such moves seriously undermined peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. China will never stand idly by in the face of such actions.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. We warn the US to immediately cease any form of official exchanges and military contacts with Taiwan. The PLA will, as always, resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and firmly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","American entrepreneur Elon Musk recently stated that Taiwan is an integral part of China, and that it is the US that \"is attempting to prevent reunification\". What is your comment on this?","The one-China principle is a common consensus of the international community. The true calculations of the DPP authorities to “seek independence by force” and the US to “use Taiwan to contain China” have been seen clearly by more and more people with insights. Any actions that distort facts and deny or challenge the one-China principle will end in failure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","Recent statements by the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the US military indicated that the US intelligence community assessed that the balloons from China earlier this year did not engage in intelligence-gathering activities and did not transmit any data back to China. What is your comment on this? Additionally, the US Assistant Secretary of Defense for Indo-Pacific Affairs stated that if the Chinese…","In response to the first question, the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs has already stated China's position on this issue multiple times. We urge the US not to be overly suspicious to the point of paranoia.\nRegarding the second question, the Taiwan region is part of China, and resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people to decide. It brooks no foreign interference. China is committed to seeking peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort, but we accept no interference in China's internal affairs by any people or any force under the guise of “peace.” No one should underestimate the strong determination, firm will, and strong capabilities of the Chinese government and the Chinese people in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nChina must and will be reunified. Statements like those from the US sent wrong signals to the “Taiwan Independence” separatist forces, which were highly irresponsible and dangerous. The PLA is fully prepared and stays highly vigilant, and will continuously improve its combat readiness. We will take resolute measures to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, as well as peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","","Reporter","Recently, a fleet led by the aircraft carrier Shandong conducted exercises in waters near Taiwan, and some analysts have called it the closest exercise to Taiwan. What is your comment on this?","That was a training within the annual plan, which was aimed at enhancing the troops' combat readiness.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-09-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","Recently, the PLA deployed more than 100 military aircraft near the Taiwan Strait. Some experts believe that the purpose is to exert more military pressure on Taiwan. What is your comment? Is there a possibility of accidental conflict if tensions in the Taiwan Strait reach a critical point?","As I mentioned earlier, we will strive for a peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort. However, we will leave absolutely no room for separatist activities seeking “Taiwan independence.” The real harm to the people of Taiwan comes from the separatist forces advocating “Taiwan independence” and external interference. The PLA will, as always, deter “Taiwan independence” separatist forces and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nSpokesperson\nWu Qian: I would like to say a few words before we conclude. Tomorrow is the traditional Chinese festival, the Mid-Autumn Festival. Chinese people often say, “As the bright moon shines over the sea, from far away you share this moment with me.” On this occasion, I wish people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait a happy festival and a reunion soon. In two days, we will celebrate the 74th anniversary of the founding of the People’s Republic of China. All officers and soldiers of the military will celebrate the birthday of our great motherland at their posts to protect the people and defend the country. May our country enjoy prosperity and our people live in harmony!\nHere concludes Today’s press conference. Thank you all!\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers media queries concerning the military on the afternoon of September 28, 2023. (Photo/mod.gov.cn)\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-10-10","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Tsai Ing-wen delivered a speech today. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory; this is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The greatest threat to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait at present is the DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and their collusion with external forces to seek \"independence\" and provoke conflict. To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must unequivocally uphold the one-China principle, oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and oppose external interference. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, nor can they change the inevitable trend of China's reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347611.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-10-23","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Yesterday, Chinese media reported that relevant Chinese authorities have launched an investigation into Foxconn, the world's largest manufacturer of Apple iPhones. Taiwanese politician Cheng Wen-tsan stated that Taiwanese businesses should not be subject to \"political censorship.\" Could the spokesperson explain the reasons for China's initiation of this investigation?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347619.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-10-24","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's Vice President Lai Ching-te criticized China's tax investigation into Foxconn, stating that the mainland should cherish the contributions Taiwanese companies make to economic development and refrain from pressuring these companies during Taiwan's elections. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has not commented on Lai's remarks. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","Taiwan does not have a \"vice president,\" and this is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347620.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-10-26","","Reporter","According to reports, in the most-recent China Military Power Report, the US Department of Defense listed six scenarios that the Chinese mainland may take military actions against Taiwan, for example, Taiwan announces formal independence. Do you have any comment?","The Taiwan question is China's internal affair and brooks no foreign interference. We will strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with utmost sincerity and efforts. However, we make no promise to renounce the use of force, and we reserve the option of taking all necessary means. This is targeted at interference of foreign forces and a few \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their secessionist activities. This is by no means targeted at compatriots in Taiwan. Should \"Taiwan independence\" separatists or foreign interference forces provoke us, or even cross the red line, we will be compelled to take resolute measures.\nCurrently, some forces in the US are using Taiwan to contain China and playing the \"Taiwan card\" to encourage the \"Taiwan independence\" separatists to take adventurous and provocative actions. It not only damages China's sovereignty and security interests, endangers peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, but also disturbs sound and stable development of China-US relations. We urge the US side to abide by the One-China principle, stop saying one thing and doing the opposite, and honor with concrete actions its commitment of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-10-26","","Reporter","I have three questions. First, a report from the budget center of Taiwan's legislative body indicates that Taiwan's military plans to procure a total of 3,221 units of 5 types of commercial drones for military use next year, requiring a budget of over 5.687 billion New Taiwan dollars. Additionally, they plan to purchase 26 sets of anti-drone systems. What is your comment on this? Second, the head of Taiwan's…","Regarding the first question, the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities in Taiwan disregard the safety and well-being of the Taiwan compatriots. They recklessly squander the hard-earned money of taxpayers, spending exorbitant amounts to purchase weapons to bolster their \"separatist\" agenda. This behavior is pushing Taiwan toward a dangerous situation of war. We want to warn the DPP authorities that the path of \"resisting reunification by force\" leads to a dead end, and their attempts to \"rely on US support for independence\" are bound to fail. The Chinese People's Liberation Army will continue to strengthen combat readiness, resolutely defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity and steadfastly maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nRegarding the second question, I noticed that you mentioned that the statement from the leadership of the Philippine Defense Department has made clear the possibility is zero. I believe this already clarifies the situation. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair. We firmly oppose any country engaging in official exchanges and military contacts with the Taiwan region of China in any form. This position is consistent and clear. China is unwavering in its determination to protect national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nRegarding the third question, we often say that national defense is like sunshine and air, which is hardly noticed when we are benefiting from it, but none of us can survive without it. National defense is not just a matter for the military; it is a matter for all Chinese. The future of national defense relies on the youth. Students from prestigious universities like Tsinghua University have a proud tradition of serving the country. Dear students, you are invited to attend the press conference of the Ministry of National Defense with the hope that you can feel, understand, care for, and love our national defense. Today, you are our guests; tomorrow, I expect you to be our comrades in arms.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-10-26","","Reporter","According to reports, the US government is planning to request substantial military assistance for Taiwan from the Congress. Additionally, the DPP authorities have recently used contingency funds to support joint military training with the US. What is your comment on this?","For some time, the situation across the Taiwan Strait has been complex and challenging. The root cause lies in the DPP authorities' attempt to seek independence by leaning on foreign support and the US's playing the \"Taiwan card\", trying to use Taiwan to contain China. Whether it's military aid or contingency funds, they are squandering the hard-earned money of the people, which will only push Taiwan into a dangerous situation. The PLA is rock-solid in its resolve and growing ever stronger in its capacities to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-10-30","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi recently stated that preparations for a meeting between President Xi Jinping and President Biden cannot rely on \"autopilot.\" What conditions need to be met for this meeting to be confirmed?","Thank you for your question. I would like to take this opportunity to introduce the relevant situation of Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, visiting the United States at the invitation of the US government. During his visit, Wang Yi met with US President Biden and National Security Advisor Sullivan, held two rounds of talks with US Secretary of State Blinken, and held separate symposiums with representatives from the US strategic community, business community, and other sectors.\nWang Yi stated that the purpose of this visit was to communicate with the US side, earnestly implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, and, building on the return to Bali, move towards San Francisco to stabilize China-US relations and bring them back to a healthy and stable development track as soon as possible. The one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués are the most important political foundation of bilateral relations and must be resolutely upheld, free from interference. China values ??the US's desire to stabilize and improve relations with China. Both China and the US should act responsibly towards the world, history, and their people, and follow the three principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping to truly stabilize and improve China-US relations. This not only serves the fundamental interests of both countries and their people but is also the common expectation of the international community.\nWang Yi pointed out that looking back at the tortuous course of China-US relations this year, the experiences are worth summarizing and the lessons need to be learned. The most crucial thing is to adhere to the \"five musts\": We must abide by the consensus reached by the two heads of state; we must stabilize China-US bilateral relations; we must maintain open communication channels; we must manage differences, contradictions, and frictions; and we must promote mutually beneficial cooperation. To achieve a stable and positive China-US relationship, both sides should objectively understand each other's strategic intentions, correctly view the competitive factors in China-US exchanges, and clarify the concept of national security.\nWang Yi emphasized that the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is \"Taiwan independence,\" and the greatest challenge to China-US relations is also \"Taiwan independence,\" which must be resolutely opposed and reflected in concrete policies and actions. Wang Yi also elaborated on China's solemn position on the South China Sea issue. The two sides also exchanged views on the Israeli-Palestinian conflict, Ukraine, and the North Korean nuclear issue.\nThe U.S. side stated that the U.S. government values ??its relationship with China. Recently, the U.S. and China have maintained exchanges and interactions, conducting frank and constructive communication, achieving positive results. The U.S. hopes for a stable and sustainable relationship between the two countries and is willing to strengthen communication with China to prevent miscalculations, explore cooperation in areas where it is needed, prepare for the next phase of high-level exchanges, and jointly address global challenges.\nDuring this visit, China and the United States, based on equality and mutual respect, conducted in-depth, constructive, and substantive strategic communication on a number of issues of common concern, jointly sending a positive signal for stabilizing and improving China-US relations. Both sides believe that maintaining dialogue between the two major powers is beneficial and necessary. Both sides hope that China-US relations will stabilize as soon as possible and strive for improvement. Both sides agreed to work together towards realizing the summit in San Francisco. Regarding the issues you just mentioned, it needs to be emphasized that the \"road to San Francisco\" will not be smooth sailing and cannot be achieved through \"autopilot.\" Therefore, both sides must earnestly \"return to Bali,\" truly implement the consensus reached by the two heads of state, eliminate interference, overcome obstacles, enhance consensus, and accumulate achievements.\nChina and the United States have agreed to hold consultations in the near future on maritime affairs, arms control and non-proliferation, foreign policy, and disability affairs, and to explore the signing of a memorandum of understanding on cooperation in disability affairs. Both sides also agreed to further increase direct passenger flights.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347624.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-08","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","The Chinese ambassador to Estonia told an Estonian member of parliament that he might leave Estonia if Taiwan opens a \"representative office\" there. Can you confirm this? Do you have any further information?","There is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between any country that has diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, and opposes any actions that support \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We urge Ireland to abide by its solemn commitment to the one-China principle, refrain from allowing Taiwan to establish any official institutions, and earnestly safeguard the political foundation of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347631.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-10","Wang Wenbin","Global Times reporter","On the 8th, the G7 foreign ministers issued a statement emphasizing the importance of frank engagement and expressing concerns directly to China. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The G7 foreign ministers' meeting proposed establishing a constructive and stable relationship with China, without hindering China's economic progress and development. We hope that G7 member states will truly put this statement into practice and genuinely promote the healthy development of bilateral relations with China on the basis of mutual respect, equality, and mutual benefit.\nWe firmly reject the G7's unreasonable accusations that China is distorting the global economy and engaging in economic coercion. It is precisely the G7 member states that have placed over 10,000 entities and individuals worldwide on sanctions lists, used state power to comprehensively suppress specific companies, politicized and weaponized trade and economic issues, and disrupted the stability of international supply chains. The G7 should reflect on its own actions.\nWe firmly oppose the G7's erroneous actions that undermine China's sovereignty and interfere in China's internal affairs.\nThe South China Sea arbitration case initiated by the Philippines is essentially a matter of territorial sovereignty and maritime delimitation, and does not fall within the scope of the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea. The ruling is illegal, invalid, and has no binding force. The G7's use of the South China Sea arbitration case to incite confrontation and conflict runs counter to the desire of regional countries to maintain regional peace and stability.\nThe key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait lies in adhering to the one-China principle. The greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait currently comes from the DPP authorities' stubborn insistence on their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and the indulgence and support from external forces. Since the G7 countries have all pledged to uphold the one-China policy, they should keep their word and faithfully implement their commitment to the \"one-China\" principle.\nIssues concerning Xinjiang, Tibet, and Hong Kong are all China's internal affairs and brook no interference from the outside world. The people of each country have the most say in the true state of democracy and human rights, and the eyes of the world are discerning. We urge the G7 to abide by the purposes and principles of the UN Charter and the basic norms of international relations, mind their own business, and cease interfering in the internal affairs of other countries under any pretext or name.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-13","Mao Ning","People's Daily reporter","We have noticed that both China and the US have released information about the summit meeting. An unnamed senior official from the US White House National Security Council stated on the 10th that the goal of the meeting was to manage competition, prevent conflict risks, and ensure open communication channels. The official added that the US's efforts over the past few decades to shape or change China have failed,…","Regarding President Xi Jinping's invitation to the United States for a meeting between the Chinese and US heads of state, China has already released information. The two heads of state will have in-depth discussions on strategic, overall, and directional issues concerning China-US relations, as well as major issues concerning world peace and development.\nChina has always viewed and handled China-US relations in accordance with the three principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping. Great power competition is out of step with the trend of the times and cannot solve America's own problems or the challenges facing the world. China is not afraid of competition, but opposes defining China-US relations by competition. Regarding concerns, the US should genuinely respect China's legitimate concerns and right to development, instead of only emphasizing its own concerns and harming China's interests. Attempting to shape another country according to its own will and model is wishful thinking from the outset, a typical form of hegemonism, and will not succeed. China does not seek to change the US, and the US should not seek to shape or change China. We hope the US will put into practice its commitments not to seek a \"new Cold War\" and not to have any conflict with China, and jointly promote the return of China-US relations to a healthy and stable development track.\nThe status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China. What truly changes this status quo is the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) in Taiwan and the external forces that support and condone its pursuit of \"Taiwan independence.\" The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair; resolving it is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no external interference. Successive US administrations have made clear commitments on the Taiwan issue. During the Bali meeting, the US clearly stated that the US government does not support \"Taiwan independence.\" The US should earnestly uphold its commitment to the one-China principle and oppose \"Taiwan independence\" with concrete actions.\nChina has repeatedly and clearly stated the essence of the South China Sea issue and its relevant principled position. We will not take an inch of territory that is not China's, and we will not relinquish an inch of China's territory. China is committed to resolving relevant disputes with relevant countries through negotiations and consultations, while its will and determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity are unwavering. The US should stop creating pretexts to interfere in territorial and maritime disputes between China and relevant countries, and even more so, should not use this issue to contain or encircle China.\nThe world is currently paying close attention to the Israeli-Palestinian conflict. China has always stood on the side of fairness and justice, maintained close communication with all relevant parties, and is committed to de-escalating the situation and protecting civilians. We hope the United States will uphold an objective and impartial stance and play a constructive role in promoting an early ceasefire and ending the conflict.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347634.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-16","Mao Ning","Anadolu Agency reporter","Following the meeting between the Chinese and US leaders in San Francisco, the two countries announced the resumption of the military-to-military communication mechanism, which had been suspended after Pelosi's visit to Taiwan last year. What prompted both sides to make this decision? Has the US made any assurances to China regarding its Taiwan policy?","China has always attached great importance to exchanges between the Chinese and US militaries. During the San Francisco meeting, the two heads of state agreed to promote and strengthen dialogue and cooperation between China and the US in various fields, including resuming high-level communication between the two militaries on the basis of equality and respect, working meetings between the Chinese and US defense ministries, meetings of the China-US maritime military security consultation mechanism, and conducting phone calls between the leaders of the two military theater commands.\nRegarding the Taiwan issue, President Xi Jinping clarified China's solemn position. The Taiwan issue has always been the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. The US should translate its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into concrete actions, cease arming Taiwan, and support China's peaceful reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347637.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-16","Mao Ning","Reporter from Turkey's Anadolu Agency","After the meeting between the Chinese and American presidents in San Francisco, China and the United States announced the resumption of the communication mechanism between the two militaries that was suspended after Pelosi came to power last year. What prompted the two sides to make this decision? Has the US made any guarantee to China on its Taiwan policy?","China always attaches great importance to the exchanges between the Chinese and American militaries. At this meeting in San Francisco, the two heads of state agreed to promote and strengthen dialogue and cooperation between China and the United States in various fields, including resuming high-level communication between the two militaries on the basis of equality and respect, the China-US Ministry of National Defense working meeting, the China-US Maritime Military Security Consultation Mechanism meeting, and conducting calls between the leaders of the theaters of China and the United States.\nRegarding the Taiwan issue, President Xi Jinping stated China's solemn position. The Taiwan issue has always been the most important and sensitive issue in Sino-US relations. The United States should embody its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" in concrete actions, stop arming Taiwan, and support China's peaceful reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347637.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-17","Mao Ning","TASS reporter","During an online press conference, Kirby, the White House National Security Council's Strategic Communications Coordinator, stated that President Biden indicated the US would continue to guarantee Taiwan's self-defense capabilities. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue has always been the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. The US should translate its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into concrete actions, stop arming Taiwan, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and support China's peaceful reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347638.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-20","Mao Ning","Xinhua News Agency reporter","South Korean President Yun Seok-youl stated in an interview on the 20th that China plays an important role in promoting freedom, peace, and prosperity in East Asia. China's pursuit of trilateral cooperation with North Korea and Russia, which blatantly violate the UN Charter, Security Council resolutions, and other international norms, is detrimental to its international reputation and standing. China plays a…","I have noted the relevant reports. I want to emphasize that as a responsible major power, China has always played an important and constructive role in international and regional affairs. China is clear about its responsibilities and interests, and we do and do not need others to tell us what to do or not to do. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, and no external interference is allowed. Regarding the South China Sea issue, China and ASEAN countries have the capability, confidence, and wisdom to handle this issue well. South Korea is not a party to the South China Sea issue and has no need to meddle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347639.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-20","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"presidential election\" candidate Lai Ching-te announced Taiwan's former \"representative to the United States\" Hsiao Meiqin as his \"vice president\" candidate. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this? If Xiao becomes Taiwan's \"Vice President\", does China plan to announce more sanctions against her?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347639.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-24","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Australia confirmed today that the Australian frigate HMAS Toowoomba transited the Taiwan Strait. Taiwanese officials stated that the Taiwanese military monitored the entire transit but provided no further details. What is China's comment on the Australian warship's transit of the Taiwan Strait?","China's position on the relevant issues is consistent and clear. We urge relevant parties not to take provocative actions and not to create trouble for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347643.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-11-30","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"President\" Tsai Ing-wen, in an interview with The New York Times, stated that the Chinese leadership is busy dealing with internal problems and is not considering an \"invasion of Taiwan.\" She argued that due to China's domestic economic, financial, and political challenges, and given that the international community has clearly stated that war is not an option, now is not the time to consider a major…","First, let me correct a misconception of yours. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and there is no \"president\" there. What you're referring to is not a diplomatic issue either.\nI want to emphasize that there is only one China in the world, and the Taiwan question is China's internal affair. Adherence to the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community. To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must unequivocally uphold the one-China principle, oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and oppose external interference. The DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and their continuous attempts to seek \"independence\" will only result in shameful defeat.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347647.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-11-30","","Reporter","It is reported that the US-China Economic and Security Review Commission under the US Congress recently released its annual report, proposing to review the measures in strengthening the defense of Taiwan and enhancing the US denial capabilities against the mainland’s attack on Taiwan. What's your comment on this?","China firmly opposes US military contact with and arms sale to Taiwan. In the meeting between the two heads of state on November 14, US President Joe Biden reiterated that the US does not support \"Taiwan independence,\" does not support \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and has no intention to have a conflict with China. We hope that the US side can honor this policy statement, and abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, so as not to further harm the common interests of both sides.\nIt needs to be emphasized that Taiwan belongs to China, and is an inalienable part of China's territory. Any attempt to strengthen US-Taiwan military contact is wrong and interferes in China's internal affairs and violates the commitment of the US side. Any attempt to contain the Chinese mainland by arming Taiwan is just a pipe dream, bound to get badly battered before the steel-willed PLA.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-11-30","","Reporter","The head of Taiwan's defense authority recently said that if there would be a war in the Taiwan Strait, Taiwan would fight to the end and has confidence to win. Recently, a video about the encounter between the PLANS Xiamen and Taiwan’s warship Ma Kong has drawn public attention on the Internet. In the video, Ma Kong made some unreasonable remarks, and PLANS Xiamen responded by saying that the so-called 24…","I want to give PLANS Xiamen a thumb-up for its response. The so-called baseline or other demarcation lines unilaterally set up by Taiwan are illegal and invalid. Neither will they change the fact that Taiwan belongs to China, nor can they stop the PLA from defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nAs for the clamor of some officials of the Democratic Progressive Party authorities, I would like to warn them that if anyone dares to split Taiwan from China, the PLA will take resolute measures to crush them.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2023-12-04","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","The Philippine government recently stated that more than 130 Chinese vessels are currently gathered around Oxbow Reef, a situation that has caused deep concern in the Philippines. Furthermore, French Foreign Minister Collonne recently said that France is very concerned about the recent actions of Chinese warships towards Australian vessels, and stated that the Taiwan Strait must remain stable, and the world does…","Regarding your first question, Oxbow Reef is part of China's Nansha Islands. The relevant waters in the South China Sea, including Oxbow Reef and its surrounding waters, have always been important operating areas and shelter spots for Chinese fishing vessels. It is reasonable and legal for Chinese fishing vessels to operate and seek shelter in these waters, and the Philippines should not interfere.\nRegarding your second question, China has already responded, which you can refer to. I want to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. The one-China principle is the cornerstone of maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We hope that relevant parties will adhere to the one-China principle and work with China to firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347649.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-05","Wang Wenbin","Phoenix TV reporter","Recently, Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen stated at a DPP campaign rally that \"we don't want Hong Kong-style peace; we want peace with dignity. The 2024 election is not a choice between war and peace; it's the Taiwanese people choosing peace with dignity.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","You are not asking a diplomatic question. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. Elections in Taiwan are purely China's internal affairs.\nI want to emphasize that \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. \"Taiwan independence\" means war, a dead end. No matter how the DPP authorities try to change their rhetoric, they cannot conceal their intention to bind the people of the island to the \"Taiwan independence\" war chariot, nor can they change the inevitable failure of \"Taiwan independence\" elements, nor can they stop the inevitable trend of China's reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347650.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-07","Wang Wenbin","Beijing Daily reporter","Recently, the National Institute for Defense Studies of Japan released its \"China Security Strategy Report 2024.\" The report states that China is strengthening its military, including its nuclear forces, and deepening strategic cooperation with Russia, which will intensify future confrontation between China and Russia and the United States. The report argues that Japan needs to strengthen its defense capabilities…","China adheres to the path of peaceful development and pursues a defensive national defense policy. China's development is a growth force for world peace. Taiwan is part of China, and the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no external interference. The reports from relevant Japanese think tanks that make unwarranted comments on China's internal affairs, the modernization of its military, and China's relations with other countries are irresponsible and untenable.\nDue to historical reasons, Japan's military and security trends have always been a focus of attention for its Asian neighbors and the international community. In recent years, Japan has significantly increased its military spending and sought to develop offensive weapons, causing strong concerns among neighboring countries and the international community. We urge Japan to earnestly respect the security concerns of its neighbors, deeply reflect on its history of aggression, stop using the \"China threat\" narrative as an excuse for its military buildup, and take concrete actions to gain the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347652.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-08","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" stated today that a Chinese weather balloon crossed the median line of the Taiwan Strait on Thursday. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs provide information regarding the balloon's location or purpose? Furthermore, Taiwan's \"Ministry of Foreign Affairs\" stated today that China has not fulfilled its commitments to Latin American countries that are ending relations with…","First, I want to correct a misconception you made. Taiwan is part of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Ministry of National Defense\" or \"Ministry of Foreign Affairs.\" Regarding your first question, I am not aware of the relevant information, and this is not a diplomatic issue. Regarding your second question, I would like to say that the normal and friendly relations between China and Latin American countries are continuously deepening, and relevant mutually beneficial cooperation is being actively promoted. No matter what the DPP authorities in Taiwan say or do, they cannot change this positive momentum.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347653.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-12-14","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, China recently criticized the USS Gabrielle Giffords littoral combat ship for illegally intruding into waters adjacent to Ren'ai Reef. The US side stated it will continue to operate in international waters including the South China Sea and the Taiwan Strait in accordance with international law. On December 6, a US Navy anti-submarine patrol aircraft transited the Taiwan Strait. Do you have…","China has indisputable sovereignty over Nansha Qundao, including Ren'ai Reef, and its adjacent waters. The US warship, without authorization from the Chinese government, illegally intruded into waters adjacent to Ren'ai Reef, seriously damaging China's sovereignty and security, violating international law and basic norms of international relations, and undermining regional peace and stability. China has consistently respected the rights of all countries to navigate and fly in the South China Sea in accordance with international law, but firmly opposes any actions that use freedom of navigation and overflight as a pretext to harm China's sovereignty and security. The US should stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, stop using so-called freedom of navigation as a pretext to provoke China in the South China Sea and Taiwan Strait, and speak and act with prudence on the Taiwan and South China Sea issues.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2023-12-18","Wang Wenbin","The Paper reporter","It has been reported that on December 16, the U.S. Defense Security Cooperation Agency stated that the U.S. State Department had approved the sale of command, control, communications, and computer lifecycle support equipment, as well as related equipment, to Taiwan, worth approximately $300 million. What is China's comment on this?","The US has blatantly violated the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, by once again announcing the sale of weapons to Taiwan, which seriously undermines China's sovereignty and security interests, severely endangers peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn protest with the US.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. No matter how many weapons the US provides to Taiwan, it cannot stop the historical process of China's reunification, nor can it shake the Chinese people's firm will to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China urges the US to put its commitments to the one-China policy and its opposition to \"Taiwan independence\" into practice, to cease the dangerous trend of arming Taiwan, to stop creating tensions across the Taiwan Strait, and to stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces' attempts to seek independence through force. China will eventually be unified, and it will surely be unified. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and we will take countermeasures against relevant companies involved in arms sales to Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347659.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-21","Wang Wenbin","Bloomberg reporter","Reports indicate that Chinese leaders have stated they will reunify Taiwan, but the specific timing has not yet been determined. What is the spokesperson's response to this?","In November of this year, during his meeting with US President Biden in San Francisco, President Xi Jinping elaborated on China's principled stance on the Taiwan issue, pointing out that the Taiwan issue has always been the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. China attaches importance to the positive statements made by the US side during the Bali meeting. The US side should translate its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into concrete actions, stop arming Taiwan, and support China's peaceful reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347662.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-22","Wang Wenbin","NBC News reporter","It has been reported that Chinese leaders have stated that China will reunify with Taiwan. While this is a well-known policy stance, does the fact that the highest levels have raised the Taiwan issue with the US in such a direct manner, especially before the Taiwan elections, signify a change in China's attitude or resolve on the Taiwan issue?","In November of this year, during his meeting with US President Biden in San Francisco, President Xi Jinping elaborated on China's principled position on the Taiwan issue. The relevant press release has been issued in a timely manner and is available for review. President Xi Jinping pointed out that the Taiwan issue has always been the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. China attaches importance to the positive statements made by the US side during the Bali meeting. The US side should translate its stance of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\" into concrete actions, cease arming Taiwan, and support China's peaceful reunification.\nIt must be pointed out that resolving the Taiwan issue and achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters. Our stance on advancing the great cause of national reunification has been consistent, as firm as a rock, and unshakable. China will eventually be unified, and it is inevitable that it will be unified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347663.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2023-12-26","Mao Ning","Reporter from Hong Kong China Review News","On December 22, local time, US President Biden signed the \"National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2024\" into law. The bill contains negative provisions related to China. What is China’s comment on this?","The United States insists on passing and signing the \"National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2024\" that contains negative content related to China. China expresses strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has made solemn representations to the United States.\nThis bill interferes in China's internal affairs, incites US military support for Taiwan, and violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués. We urge the US to earnestly implement the US leader's commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence\", stop manipulating the Taiwan issue, and stop jeopardizing peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nThis bill exaggerates the China threat, suppresses Chinese companies, and restricts normal economic and trade exchanges and cultural exchanges between China and the United States. It is not in the interest of either party. The United States should abandon the Cold War mentality and ideological prejudice and create a good environment for Sino-US cooperation in economic and trade and other fields.\nWe urge the U.S. to work with China halfway, implement the important results and consensus reached at the San Francisco meeting between the heads of state of China and the U.S., and refrain from implementing the negative China-related provisions of the above-mentioned bill. If the United States insists on its own course, China will take resolute and effective measures to firmly defend its sovereignty, security and development interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347666.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2023-12-28","","Reporter","The leadership election in the Taiwan region will be held in January next year. According to Taiwan's militaryauthorities, the military troops in Taiwanwill remain highly alert during the election, closely monitor the PLA's movesand prepare to respond with prudence. What is your comment on that?","The Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities are deliberately hyping up the so-called \"mainland's military threat\" and playing up the tension to seek electoral benefits. The PLA is well aware of the movesof Taiwan's military, and will, as always, take all necessary measures to firmly safeguard China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-12-28","","Reporter","I have two questions. First, US President Joe Biden recently signed the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2024, which authorized higher military spending and included measures to enhance the US deterrence in the Indo-Pacific region, counter Chinese military activities in the Indo-Pacific region, and assist Taiwan in strengthening its defense. What's your response for that? The second question is…","The US Act makes groundless hypes about the so-called \"China military threat\", grossly interferes in China's internal affairs, and severely harms China's national sovereignty, security and development interests. The Chinese military strongly deplores and firmly opposes to that.\nThe US military expenditure tops the world and is larger than those of the next nine countries combined, accounting for 40% of the total global military expenditure. On the one hand, the US is accelerating its military development, intensifying military deployment in the Asia-Pacific, strengthening bilateral military alliances, and piecing together AUKUS and QUAD. On the other hand, it is making an issue of China, hyping up the so-called \"China military threat\" out of thin air. Such manipulations intensify block confrontation and arms race and cause a severe impact on the current international security system and global governance system. We urge the US to abandon the out-dated security vision and zero-sum cold war mentality, view China and China's military development in an objective and rational light, instead of being obsessed with the pursuit for hegemony.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. We firmly oppose any country to have official and military contact with Taiwan in any form. The US is manipulating the Taiwan question in various forms, which is a very dangerous gamble. We urge the US to fully realize the severe harm of the China-related content in the NDAA, stop arming Taiwan under any excuses and by any means, stop its provocations by using Taiwan to contain China, and take concrete actions to maintain regional peace and stability.\nAs for the second question, a spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense has already made responses recently. I want to emphasize two things here. First, \"using Taiwan to contain China\" is doomed to fail. Second, \"seeking Taiwan independence by force\" is a dead end.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), releases news at a regular press conference on the afternoon of December 28, 2023. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Zhang Zhicheng)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-12-28","","Reporter","The US media recently reported that Taiwan is planning to send about 600 military personnel to the US to receive training on weapons that Taiwan has purchased but not yet received. What's your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China, which brooks no external interference. The development of military ties between the US and China's Taiwan region has severely violated the one-China principle and the stipulations of three China-US joint communiqués. This move has also seriously undermined China's sovereignty and security interests, harmed peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sent a wrong message to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We urge the US to pull back before it is too late, stop its dangerous moves of arming Taiwan, and take concrete actions to honor its commitment of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\". Those who play with fire will get themselves burned. We sternly warn the DPP authorities that soliciting foreign support to seek \"Taiwan independence\" by force is doomed to failure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-12-28","","Reporter","Taiwan's military authorities recently claimed that since December this year, a number of sounding balloons from the mainland have crossed the so-called \"median line of the Taiwan Strait\". Happening prior to the leadership election of the Taiwan region, this sparked some speculation. What's your comment on this?","As for the balloon issue, you may refer to the competent department. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China and there is no so-called \"median line of the Taiwan Strait\". Hyping up the so-called \"mainland intervention in Taiwan's election\" is nothing but the DPP authorities' old electoral trick to provoke confrontation and swindle votes. More and more people in Taiwan have seen through it.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2023-12-28","","Reporter","The media noticed that there have been many highlights and remarkable achievements in China's military diplomacy in 2023. Can you give us more details, please?","The year 2023 marks the first year for fully implementing the guiding principles laid down at the 20th CPC National Congress. On military diplomacy, we acted on Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and Xi Jinping Thought on Diplomacy, followed the guidance of head-of-state diplomacy, took high-level exchanges as important means, focused on practical cooperation and gave emphasis to multilateral platforms. We have broken new ground, forged ahead with enterprise and fortitude, enhanced the quality and efficiency of international military cooperation and achieve high-quality development.\nFirst, military diplomacy served the overall political and diplomatic objectives of China. Under the strategic guidance of head-of-state diplomacy, leaders of the Central Military Commission (CMC) had strategic communication with defense and military leaders of Russia, the United States, Vietnam, Cambodia, Pakistan, South Africa, etc., and deepened bilateral strategic cooperation. The Chinese military enhanced consultation and dialogue and expanded practical cooperation with relevant militaries to put into practice the achievements of head-of-state diplomacy.\nSecond, military diplomacy resolutely safeguarded national sovereignty,security and development interests. In response to the negative and wrong rhetoric and infringements and provocations made by certain countries on the Taiwan question and the South China Sea issue, while taking actions to protect our rights in accordance with laws and regulations, the Chinese military also made diplomatic representations, and timely refuted, warned and exposed the wrongdoings and negative moves of relevant countries, and made clear China's positions through MND spokesperson and the media.\nThirdly, we have expanded foreign-related military operations. The PLA organized and conducted 34 joint training, exercises and international military games including the China-Russia \"Beibu Unity-2023\" joint exercise, the \"Aman youyi-2023\" joint exercise with southeast Asian countries, the China-Cambodia \"Golden Dragon 2023\" joint exercise, the China-Laos \"Friendship Shield-2023\" joint exercise. Through expanded bilateral and multilateral exercises and training, the PLA has deepened mutual trust and cooperation with the militaries of relevant countries, and played a positive role in maintaining regional stability.\nFourthly, we have made innovative efforts in multilateral diplomacy. The tenth Beijing Xiangshan Forum and the third China-Africa Peace and Security Forum hosted by China were widely attended and welcomed. We attended multilateral events including the Shangri-La dialogue, the Defense Ministers' Meeting of the Member States of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, the ASEAN Defense Ministers Meeting Plus (ADMM+), and actively introduced major initiatives such as the Global Security Initiative and promoted international consensus for peace and cooperation.\nFifthly, we have contributed to building a community with a shared future for mankind. The PLAN Ark Peace hospital ship visited Kiribati, Tonga, Vanuatu, Solomon Islands, and Timor-Leste. The Chinese military medical expert teams continued to work in Zambia, Cambodia and Laos, and provided medical service to the local people. PLA Air Force Y-20 transport aircraft carried out humanitarian relief missions to Afghanistan and Nepal. PLA Navy vessels rushed to Sudan to evacuate Chinese nationals. The Chinese military also actively participated in UN peacekeeping and vessel protection operations, consistently providing public security goods to the international community.\nEmbracing the world for peace, the Chinese military will always follow the guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and stay committed to expanding and deepening relations with foreign militaries, strengthening practical exchanges and cooperation, and making due contributions to world peace and common development.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-01-08","Mao Ning","China News Service reporter","On June 6, the U.S. State Department issued a joint statement from the U.S., Japan, and South Korea on the Indo-Pacific Dialogue, expressing concern over China's claims in the South China Sea and its escalating actions, and stating that it will continue trilateral maritime security and law enforcement cooperation in accordance with international law. The three countries reaffirmed that peace and stability in the…","China has noted the dialogue held by the US, Japan, and South Korea and the joint document they issued, and expresses serious concern over the inappropriate content concerning China contained therein. China firmly opposes certain countries using cooperation as a pretext to form exclusive \"small circles,\" grossly interfering in China's internal affairs, attacking and smearing China, and inciting confrontation and antagonism.\nThe situation in the South China Sea is generally stable. China remains steadfast in safeguarding its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights, while committed to properly handling differences with relevant parties through dialogue and consultation. The actions of certain countries outside the region in flexing their military muscle and provoking confrontation in the South China Sea are detrimental to peace and stability in the region.\nI want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no interference from any external forces. The key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait lies in adhering to the one-China principle and resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism.\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a haven for peace and development, not a chessboard for great power rivalry. We urge all parties concerned to genuinely respect the efforts of regional countries to maintain peace and stability, abandon Cold War thinking, and stop creating bloc confrontation and escalating regional tensions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347674.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-09","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan will hold elections this Saturday. Candidate Lai Ching-te just said that mainland China is using all means to interfere with the election. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the elections in Taiwan are China's internal affairs. This is not a diplomatic issue; please inquire with the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347675.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-10","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Yesterday, China successfully launched the Einstein Probe satellite, which entered its intended orbit smoothly. The Taiwan authorities issued an alert, sparking public concern in Taiwan. Did the mainland know beforehand that the satellite launch would trigger Taiwan's alert? Was this a deliberate arrangement at the last minute before the Taiwan elections?","This is not a diplomatic issue. I think everyone is very clear about the purpose of the DPP authorities in misleading the public and creating panic.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347676.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-11","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council stated that candidate Lai Qingde brings extreme danger to cross-strait relations, but the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council did not make similar remarks against other candidates. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council also asked Taiwanese voters to \"make the right choice.\" Which candidate does mainland China hope to win the Taiwan election? Do…","This is not a diplomatic issue. Please ask the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347677.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-11","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","I have two questions about Taiwan’s elections. First, yesterday, relevant US officials said that after the Taiwan election, the White House will send an informal delegation to visit Taiwan. What is China’s comment on this? Second, the United States also said yesterday that it needs to oppose any interference in Taiwan's elections. There are reports that this is a warning to China. What is the Ministry of Foreign…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan. The United States should earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, stop official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and shall not interfere in Taiwan's elections in any form to avoid causing serious damage to China-U.S. relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nAs for your second question, the Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs, and the Taiwan region's elections are China's local affairs that do not tolerate any external interference. The United States is blatantly making irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan region's elections. China expresses strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition. What I want to emphasize is that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. We urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, take concrete actions to honor the commitments made by U.S. leaders, stop intervening in Taiwan elections in any way, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347677.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-11","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","The Financial Times article mentioned that the spokesperson of the White House National Security Council said that there is a clear precedent for the United States to send former senior officials to Taiwan after the Taiwan election. This does not violate the United States’ one-China policy and the current status quo across the Taiwan Strait. Since the visit took place after the Taiwan election, this means that…","China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan. We require the United States to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-U.S. joint communiques, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, and refrain from intervening in Taiwan elections in any form or sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any form.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347677.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-12","Mao Ning","CRI reporter","Recently, the White House National Security Council held a special media briefing on the Taiwan elections. An unnamed White House official stated that the U.S. adheres to the one-China policy, does not support \"Taiwan independence,\" and supports cross-strait dialogue. As long as cross-strait differences are resolved peacefully, the U.S. does not take a position on a final solution. What is the spokesperson's…","We have noted the relevant statements from the US side. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and the political foundation of China-US relations. \"Taiwan independence\" is the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and a path of no return destined to fail.\nUS leaders have repeatedly stated their adherence to the one-China policy, their opposition to \"Taiwan independence,\" their opposition to \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and their refusal to use the Taiwan issue as a tool to contain China. We hope the US will honor its commitments, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, cease official exchanges with Taiwan, stop sending any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and refrain from interfering in Taiwan's elections in any form. If the US truly wishes to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, it should explicitly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and support China's peaceful reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347678.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-12","Mao Ning","Reporter from Nippon TV Network","Regarding the election to be held tomorrow in Taiwan, China has repeatedly emphasized that it is China's internal affairs. How will the election results affect the relationship between mainland China and Taiwan?","Taiwan’s elections are China’s internal affairs. No matter what the election results are, it cannot change the basic fact that Taiwan is part of China and there is only one China in the world.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347678.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-15","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","A senior U.S. delegation met with Lai Ching-te and Tsai Ing-wen in Taiwan today. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Elections in Taiwan are a local affair of China. China has consistently and firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and firmly opposes the US interfering in Taiwan affairs in any way or under any pretext. We urge the US to recognize the extreme complexity and sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and put into practice the commitments repeatedly reiterated by US leaders that they do not support \"Taiwan independence,\" do not support \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and do not seek to use the Taiwan issue as a tool to contain China. The US should handle Taiwan-related issues with utmost caution, refrain from undermining or hollowing out the one-China principle in any form, and avoid sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347679.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-16","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","In recent days, numerous countries have publicly expressed their support for the one-China principle, respect for China's territorial integrity, and opposition to interference in China's internal affairs. Could the spokesperson provide some details on this?","Since January 13, many countries and international organizations have publicly reiterated their adherence to the one-China principle, firmly supporting China in safeguarding its national sovereignty and territorial integrity, opposing any form of \"Taiwan independence,\" and supporting China's reunification cause. I already briefed on this yesterday. In addition to those mentioned yesterday, a large number of countries, including Pakistan, Maldives, Myanmar, Iran, Syria, Tunisia, Palestine, Turkmenistan, Kyrgyzstan, Armenia, Azerbaijan, Central African Republic, Niger, Equatorial Guinea, Comoros, Lesotho, Somalia, Djibouti, Mali, Burundi, Gambia, Vanuatu, Tonga, Kiribati, Dominica, Nicaragua, and Bolivia, as well as the African Union, have clearly expressed their support for the one-China principle and their opposition to \"Taiwan independence.\" We appreciate and thank these countries and organizations for their just stance.\nWe believe that the international community will continue to support the Chinese people's just cause of opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and striving for national reunification, in accordance with the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347680.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-17","Mao Ning","CGTN reporter","Taiwanese media, citing \"informed sources,\" claim that Nauru's sudden severing of diplomatic ties was orchestrated by a former Nauru president, who alleged that mainland China \"seized the opportunity\" while Taiwan was assessing and negotiating Nauru's request for economic aid. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The Nauruan government's recognition of the one-China principle, its severing of diplomatic ties with Taiwan, and its willingness to resume diplomatic relations with China are a collective decision of the Nauruan cabinet and a correct choice made independently by Nauru as a sovereign state. We note that the Nauruan parliament unanimously passed a resolution yesterday supporting, endorsing, and confirming the Nauruan government's decision to resume diplomatic relations with China, and will dedicate itself to developing Nauru-China diplomatic relations and carrying out friendly cooperation between the two sovereign states. This once again fully demonstrates that the one-China principle is the will of the people and an irresistible trend.\nThe remarks of so-called \"insiders\" are a complete misjudgment of others. Those who are accustomed to engaging in \"dollar diplomacy\" should know that some things in this world cannot be bought with money. The one-China principle is a fundamental and non-tradable principle, and a universal consensus of the international community.\nChina is the world's second-largest economy. The prospects for resuming and developing diplomatic relations with China and carrying out pragmatic cooperation in various fields are very broad, and will undoubtedly bring unprecedented development opportunities to Nauru.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347681.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-18","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","The Philippine Defense Minister said on Wednesday that the Chinese Foreign Ministry made offensive and vulgar remarks about Philippine President Marcos at its regular press conference this week. What is China's response to this?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, affecting the feelings of 1.4 billion Chinese people. The Philippines' remarks seriously violate the one-China principle and the joint communiqué on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the Philippines, severely contravene the political commitments made by the Philippines to China, and grossly interfere in China's internal affairs. China's statement of its solemn position is entirely legitimate and necessary. The one-China principle is both a red line and a bottom line. China will never accept any provocation on the Taiwan issue and will resolutely retaliate.\nWe urge the Philippines to earnestly abide by the spirit of the joint communiqué on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and the Philippines, adhere to the one-China principle, and cease its erroneous words and deeds on Taiwan-related issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347682.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-24","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Following the resumption of diplomatic relations between China and Nauru, does China plan to strengthen investment and trade ties with Nauru, and provide financial assistance to the Pacific island nation? Could you please elaborate on the types of investment or trade and the amount of financial assistance?","Today, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, and Nauru's Foreign Minister Angmin, who is visiting China at the invitation of the Chinese government, signed the \"Joint Communiqué between the People's Republic of China and the Republic of Nauru on the Resumption of Diplomatic Relations\" in Beijing. The two countries decided to resume diplomatic relations at the ambassadorial level, effective immediately. Nauru becomes China's 183rd country to establish diplomatic relations with China.\nThe resumption of diplomatic relations between China and Nauru reaffirms that there is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is an undeniable objective fact, a universal consensus of the international community, and a universally recognized basic principle of international relations. China's sovereignty and territorial integrity are inviolable, UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 cannot be distorted, the historical trend of China's reunification is unstoppable, and the international community that adheres to the one-China principle cannot be absent.\nChina's relations with Pacific Island countries are developing steadily and deeply. The resumption of diplomatic relations between China and Nauru is a widely anticipated event by all sectors of society in Nauru and other Pacific Island countries, and it aligns with the fundamental and long-term interests of both sides. A new chapter has begun in China-Nauru relations, and the two countries have opened the door to friendly cooperation and common development. China will uphold the policy of \"four full respects\" and, on the basis of equality, mutual respect, win-win cooperation, and openness and inclusiveness, conduct exchanges and cooperation with Nauru in various fields to benefit the people of both countries and future generations.\nCurrently, a very small number of countries maintain so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan. We urge these countries to recognize the historical trend, seize the historic opportunity, and stand with the international community, with international justice, and with the right side of history. Friendship knows no order of precedence, and China is willing to turn a new page in its relations with these countries on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347686.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-25","Wang Wenbin","Beijing Daily reporter","The State Intellectual Property Office recently announced that by the end of last year, China (excluding Hong Kong, Macao, and Taiwan) had 4.015 million invention patents, making it a veritable intellectual property powerhouse. How does the spokesperson view the impact of China's achievements in innovation and intellectual property protection on the world?","The number of invention patents is an important indicator for measuring a country's scientific and technological development and economic level. Since China officially implemented its first Patent Law in 1985, it took 31 years for the number of valid domestic invention patents in China to exceed the first million, while it only took one and a half years to exceed the fourth million. China has become the first country in the world to surpass 4 million valid domestic invention patents. China's innovation momentum and development vitality are constantly improving and leaping forward.\nThe World Intellectual Property Organization's 2023 Global Innovation Index, released last year, shows that China ranked 12th, making it the highest-ranked middle-income economy globally, and for the first time, it ranked first in the number of the world's top 100 science and technology clusters. This represents the international community's high recognition of China's innovation capabilities.\nChina's strengthened intellectual property protection has brought new opportunities for expanding mutually beneficial cooperation between China and other countries. In recent years, China has continuously improved its international cooperation mechanisms on intellectual property, establishing cooperative relationships with more than 80 countries and regions and international organizations. It has actively responded to and addressed the concerns and demands of foreign-invested enterprises regarding intellectual property, strictly protecting their intellectual property rights in accordance with the law, and is committed to creating a first-class business environment that is market-oriented, rule-of-law based, and internationalized. Foreign-invested enterprises' satisfaction with China's intellectual property protection has steadily increased, and more and more foreign companies are investing and doing business in China, sharing in the dividends of China's development and the opportunities of its massive market.\nChina's enhanced technological innovation capabilities are also injecting new momentum into the world's green and sustainable development. China fully leverages the important role of patents in promoting technological innovation and the development of new industries and sectors, supporting the rapid development of green and low-carbon industries represented by electric vehicles, lithium batteries, and solar cells. The top ten Chinese companies in terms of new energy vehicle sales have over 100,000 valid patents globally, showing rapid growth. The growth rate of global patent applications for solid-state batteries and solar cells are among the highest in the world, effectively promoting the development of global green and low-carbon technologies and future industries.\nChina's achievements in intellectual property development have become a distinctive symbol of China's high-quality development and Chinese-style modernization. Looking ahead, it is believed that China's innovative development potential will continue to be unleashed, laying the foundation for promoting high-quality development and building a new development pattern, and making a greater contribution to global innovation development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347687.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","I have two questions. First, Taiwan's foreign affairs authorities said that the comments made by the mainland concerning elections in Taiwan are not consistent with the international understanding and the status quo of the cross-Strait relations and called on the mainland to respect the result. What's your comment? The second question, recent surveys by US and Taiwan think tanks believed that the mainland is more…","On your first questions, the elections of the Taiwan region belong to the affairs of a region in China. The outcome of the two elections shows that the DPP does not represent the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan. No matter how the situation changes in Taiwan, the basic fact that there is only one China in the world and Taiwan is part of China will not change, the prevailing consensus of the international community on the one-China principle will not change and the historical trend towards China's reunification will not change.\nAbout 80 years ago, China, the US and the UK issued the Cairo Declaration which clearly stipulates that \"all the territories Japan has stolen from China, such as Taiwan, shall be restored to China.\" Article 8 of the 1945 Potsdam Proclamation jointly signed by China, the US, the UK and the Soviet Union says that \"the terms of the Cairo Declaration shall be carried out\". In 1971, the 26th UN General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 which clarifies that there is only one China in the world and there is no such thing as \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\". These international instruments are legally binding and provide historical and jurisprudential basis for the fact that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory.\nIt needs to be emphasized that the sovereignty and territory of China has never been severed and the legal status and fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory have never changed. This is the real status quo. Taiwan will never be a country. \"Taiwan independence\" and the attempts by foreign forces to split China will never succeed. China's reunification requires Taiwan's return. The PLA will speak with actions and always be a great wall of steel defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nOn your second question. Taiwan is a sacred and inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is at the core of China's core interests. We seek the prospect of peaceful reunification with greatest sincerity and utmost efforts. However, if the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces provoke and even cross our red lines, we will have to take decisive measures to defend our national sovereignty and territorial integrity. This is the firm will of over 1.4 billion Chinese people and the sacred mission of the PLA.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers recent media queries concerning the military on the afternoon of January 25, 2024. (Photo/mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","I have two questions. First, the US DOD recently released its first National Defense Industrial Strategy (NDIS) which calls to build strong defense industrial base and productivity together with Indo-Pacific nations to prepare for potential conflict in the region. US Assistant Secretary of Defense for Industrial Base Policy noted China's increasing threat to upend existing international order and underscored the…","On your first question, the document you just mentioned named China and hyped-up the non-existent \"China threat\". We are firmly opposed to that. Facts have proven time and again that the growth of the Chinese military contributes to the growth of the force for peace in the world. This is recognized by the international community. The accusations and smears by the US side are not true. At the same time, I have to say that China firmly opposes US acts to invigorate small-group alliances and promote bloc confrontation in the Asia-Pacific.\nOn your second question, my colleague, Senior Colonel Shi Yi, spokesperson for the PLA Eastern Theater Command, already made a statement on it yesterday. What I want to emphasize is that whether it is \"using Taiwan to contain China\" or \"relying on the US support to seek independence\", such attempts are bound to fail.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","Taiwan's military authorities recently claimed that the PLA has conducted joint maritime and aerial readiness patrols around the island. What's the purpose of this military operation, please?","Recently, the PLA Eastern Theater Command organized routine joint readiness patrols by naval and air forces around the Taiwan Island, in a bid to further improve realistic training and strengthen combat capabilities in defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThe PLA will continue to strengthen military training to enhance combat readiness, and organize relevant military operations on a regular basis.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","According to media reports, Taiwan's military has signed a contract with the American Institute in Taiwan worth 770 million New Taiwan dollars (about 24 million US dollars). Under the contract, the US will provide technological support on missile systems to Taiwan from this year to 2027. In addition, Taiwan's military plans to purchase the T-11 parachute for its special forces. What's your comment?","The Taiwan question is an internal affair of China and brooks no foreign interference. The DPP authorities are squandering Taiwan people's hard-earned money on purchasing US weapons for their own interests. This is nothing but drinking a poison for thirsty and will only push Taiwan closer to the brink of war.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a deadly poison and a dead end. A few pieces of US weapons cannot buy Taiwan security. To defend China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity, the PLA will always be resolute to fight and win.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","Recently, Taiwan's \"Defense Department\" has spotted some balloons from the mainland approaching or overflying Taiwan, which is a matter of great concern to the people in Taiwan. Could you further explain which units released these balloons and what is the purpose?","I want to first correct one mistake in your question. Taiwan is a part of China, so there is no so-called “Defense Department” in Taiwan. Regarding your question about the balloons, please inquire with the competent authorities. I want to say that the DPP authorities are used to hyping up this kind of issue to instigate confrontation across the Strait, and this approach is meaningless and will not succeed.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","I have two questions. First, a blogger recently shared travel tips including photos showing how to sneak into a military restricted area on her social media account. What's your comment on that? Second, it is reported that the Democratic People's Republic of Korea (DPRK) tested its underwater nuclear weapon system in the waters off its eastern coast on January 19th. Before the test, the DPRK announced that it…","On your first question, we can't violate rules and laws when sharing travel tips or recommendations and national security is not a game. It is the responsibility and obligation of all organizations and citizens to protect the security of military facilities and safeguard national interests. We expect everyone to strictly abide by laws and regulations on the protection of military facilities and jointly build a solid foundation for national security.\nAs for your second question, recently, tensions are high on the Korean Peninsula with intensified antagonism and confrontation. As a close neighbor, China advocates maintaining peace and stability on the Peninsula and resolving the Peninsula issue through dialogue and consultation. We expect all relevant parties to remain calm and exercise restraint, and do not take any action that may heighten tensions, so as to avoid further escalation and create favorable conditions for resuming meaningful dialogues.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","I have three questions. First, on January 5, the ROK, Japan and the US had the first trilateral Indo-Pacific Dialogue, and China was mentioned directly and indirectly multiple times in a joint statement released after the dialogue. On the South China Sea issue, the three parties strongly reiterated their firm commitment to international law, including the freedom of navigation and overflight. They opposed any…","On your first question, we have noticed the dialogue held by the ROK, Japan and the US as well as the relevant statement, and expressed strong dissatisfaction with its inappropriate content related to China. The Chinese side is firmly against some countries building small exclusive blocs to grossly interfere in China's internal affairs, slander China and instigate confrontation. On the South China Sea issue, China will firmly safeguard its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests. At the same time, we are committed to properly resolving disputes with countries concerned through dialogue and consultation. Certain non-regional countries are flexing muscles and instigating confrontation in the South China Sea, which undermines peace and stability in the South China Sea. Taiwan is China's territory. The Taiwan question is China’s internal affair and brooks no foreign interference.\nOn your second question, we are highly concerned about the military exercise to be held by NATO. We also noticed that NATO secretary general made some inappropriate comments on China recently. As a regional military organization, NATO has launched and fought many wars around the world since its establishment. In recent years, NATO has been inching closer to the Asia Pacific and using the non-existent \"China threat\" as an excuse to advance bloc confrontation, which poses a threat to regional security. It's fair to say that NATO is like a walking \"war machine\", wherever it goes, it brings instability and chaos.\nWe urge NATO to stop telling lies and stop any dangerous move that may disrupt the Asia Pacific, take an objective and rational view of the growth of China and the Chinese military and do more things that are conducive to world peace.\nRegarding the third question, we believe that the Philippines, in developing alliance with relevant countries, should not undermine China's legitimate rights and interests in the South China Sea. At the same time, we are firmly opposed to the US interfering in the South China Sea issue, and encouraging and supporting the Philippine side to harass and violate China's sovereignty. These acts have intensified maritime tensions. As for maritime disputes, China is committed to peaceful settlement through negotiation and consultation. At the same time, we will resolutely safeguard our territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-01-25","","Reporter","I have three questions. First, we noticed that the Chinese and US militaries had communication at various levels and in different areas after the meeting between the two heads of state in San Francisco. Please further introduce the 2024 mil-mil exchange plan between China and the US. Second, you have just introduced that the 19th biennial meeting of the Western Pacific Naval Symposium would be held in Qingdao…","For your first question, I have just introduced relevant information, especially the MMCA meeting between China and the US. I want to emphasize that to carry out mil-to-mil communication, the two militaries should first have a correct strategic judgment on each other, and the communication should be based on equality and respect. This year marks the 45th anniversary of China-US diplomatic ties. We hope the US side can truly respect China's core interests, take a rational view of the growth of China and the Chinese military, work together with the Chinese side to follow through the consensus of the two heads of state and promote a sound, stable and sustained mil-to-mil relationship.\nRegarding the second question, the United States is a member state of the WPNS. According to the requirement of the business chapter of the WPNS, China has already sent invitations to all member states and observer states. We look forward to deepening exchanges and cooperation with all countries and making positive contributions to building a maritime community with a shared future.\nAs for the third question, the PLA Eastern Theater Command has already made a statement on this matter. Our position concerning the Taiwan question is consistent and clear. In general, it can be summed up as \"Three Nevers\": Taiwan will never be a country, \"Taiwan independence\" will never succeed, and the attempts by foreign forces to split China will never work.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-01-26","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Taiwanese officials claim that mainland China is attempting to seize Taiwan's diplomatic allies, and in fact, they do not rule out the possibility that mainland China is maliciously manipulating issues and influencing specific candidates during the Tuvalu election. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","The resumption of diplomatic relations between China and Nauru once again demonstrates to the world that upholding the one-China principle is the will of the people and an irresistible trend. The international community adhering to the one-China principle will continue to grow stronger, and this will not be swayed by the will of \"Taiwan independence\" forces and their backers, nor will it be changed by the DPP authorities' meddling. We urge the very few countries that still maintain so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan to follow the trend of the times and return to the international community that adheres to the one-China principle as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347688.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-01-30","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","From January 26 to 29, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, visited Thailand. Could the spokesperson please provide details on the highlights of Foreign Minister Wang Yi's visit to Thailand, as well as the outcomes and consensus reached during the meetings?","From January 26 to 29, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Minister of Foreign Affairs, visited Thailand at the invitation of the Thai government.\nDuring his visit to Thailand, Foreign Minister Wang Yi met separately with Princess Sirindhorn and Prime Minister Settha, held annual consultations with Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Bambi, and jointly met with reporters.\nThailand expressed its high regard for the comprehensive strategic cooperative partnership between Thailand and China, and for strengthening friendly cooperation with China. Thailand firmly adheres to the one-China principle and will not conduct any official exchanges with Taiwan. Thailand congratulated China on the successful holding of the Central Conference on Foreign Affairs, and agreed with President Xi Jinping's further advocacy of an equitable and orderly multipolar world and inclusive economic globalization. Thailand is willing to work with China to build a China-Thailand community with a shared future, strengthen coordination on international and regional issues, conduct substantive cooperation on implementing the three major global initiatives, jointly build the Belt and Road Initiative, uphold multilateralism, oppose decoupling and supply chain disruptions, and maintain the stability and smooth flow of production and supply chains.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that China and Thailand are like one family, good neighbors, good friends, and good partners. Next year will mark the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Thailand. China is willing to strengthen pragmatic cooperation in various fields, with the goal of building a more stable, prosperous, and sustainable China-Thailand community with a shared future, and continuously enrich the bilateral relationship with new contemporary significance. As comprehensive strategic partners, strengthened friendship and mutual trust between China and Thailand will provide greater assurance for peace in Asia; close mutually beneficial cooperation between China and Thailand will provide greater impetus for regional development; and the accelerated building of a China-Thailand community with a shared future will bring greater brightness to the future of humanity.\nDuring the visit, the two sides reached a series of consensuses:\nFirst, we will strengthen high-level exchanges. Both sides will work together to implement the important consensus reached by the leaders of the two countries, deepen strategic guidance, continue to support each other on issues involving each other's core interests and major concerns, and jointly plan a series of celebrations for the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations next year.\nSecond, we will focus on mutually beneficial cooperation. Both sides will actively promote high-quality Belt and Road cooperation, accelerate the construction of the China-Thailand railway, fully implement the China-Laos-Thailand connectivity development concept, expedite the opening of the central line of the Pan-Asian Railway, and strengthen cooperation in areas such as agricultural trade, new energy vehicles, digital economy, and green development, so that the people of both countries can share the benefits of building a China-Thailand community with a shared future.\nThird, the two sides will expand people-to-people exchanges. A major highlight of this visit was the signing of an agreement on mutual visa exemption for holders of ordinary passports, ushering in a \"visa-free era\" for China and Thailand. Both sides will jointly solidify the public opinion foundation for the China-Thailand community of shared future, and people-to-people exchanges between the two countries will reach a new high. The two sides will also strengthen law enforcement and security cooperation, jointly combating transnational crimes such as online gambling, telecom fraud, and drug trafficking, providing a safe and comfortable environment for exchanges and cooperation between the two countries.\nFourth, we will strengthen multilateral coordination. Both sides will adhere to the Five Principles of Peaceful Coexistence, resolutely oppose zero-sum games and zero-sum games, practice genuine multilateralism and open regionalism, strengthen the building of the China-ASEAN \"Five Homes\" community, accelerate consultations on the \"Code of Conduct in the South China Sea,\" and jointly safeguard ASEAN's central role. China supports Thailand in fulfilling its role as co-chair of the Lancang-Mekong Cooperation and in building a Lancang-Mekong community with a shared future for peace and prosperity.\nThe two sides also signed cooperation documents, including a protocol on the export of Thai agricultural products to China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347690.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-02","Wang Wenbin","A New York Times reporter asked","The Washington Post reports that Russia has imported over $20 million worth of high-tech precision tools from Taiwan that can be used to produce advanced drones. What is the Foreign Ministry's position on this?","I am not aware of the situation you mentioned. But what I do know is that Russia adheres to the one-China principle and firmly opposes \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347693.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-06","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Guatemala's Foreign Minister told Reuters on Monday that Guatemala plans to engage with China to develop formal trade relations, although it still intends to maintain its existing relations with Taiwan. Does China accept Guatemala's approach?","There is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. It is the fundamental premise and political foundation for China's cooperation with all countries, including Guatemala.\nThe fact that 183 countries worldwide have established diplomatic relations with China fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. It is hoped that the new Guatemalan government will follow the historical trend and the tide of the times, and make the correct decision as soon as possible that conforms to the fundamental and long-term interests of Guatemala and its people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347695.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-07","Wang Wenbin","Kyodo News reporter","Tokyo Governor Yuriko Koike is visiting Taiwan today and will meet with Tsai Ing-wen and Lai Ching-te. What is China's response to this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question concerns the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan. Regarding the issue you mentioned, we have expressed our concerns to Japan. We hope that relevant parties will remain vigilant and maintain distance to avoid being politically exploited by \"Taiwan independence\" forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347696.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-08","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","The Philippine Defense Secretary has ordered the military to increase troop deployments and infrastructure construction on the Batan Islands, which are less than 200 kilometers from Taiwan, in order to enhance the Philippines' territorial defense capabilities. What is China's comment on this?","China and the Philippines are neighboring countries separated by the sea, and friendly exchanges have been the mainstream of the history of China-Philippines relations. A close neighbor is worse than a distant relative; good neighborliness, mutual respect for sovereignty and territorial integrity, and non-interference in each other's internal affairs should be the way for neighbors to get along.\nI want to reiterate that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, and it is an inviolable red line and bottom line. The relevant Philippine authorities should have a clear understanding of this and act with caution, refraining from playing with fire on the Taiwan issue to avoid being exploited and harming themselves.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347697.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-20","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Following the incident involving mainland Chinese vessels and Taiwan's Coast Guard, the Taiwan authorities called on the mainland to remain rational and stated that they would firmly defend \"their own\" waters. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","This is not a diplomatic issue. I suggest you consult the relevant Chinese authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347699.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-22","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Today, during their visit to Taiwan, US lawmakers including Gallagher emphasized that the US will continue to support Taiwan regardless of who is elected the next US president. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the US and the Taiwan authorities, and firmly opposes the US interfering in Taiwan affairs in any way or under any pretext. We urge the US to recognize the extreme complexity and sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, cease official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347701.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-22","Mao Ning","Reporter from Japan's Fuji TV","The international community is very concerned about the accidents in the Taiwan Strait, and all parties do not want the situation to escalate. For the sake of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, what does China think is the most appropriate measure?","First of all, the issues between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait are not diplomatic issues. You can find out from the Chinese competent authorities.\nThe key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is to adhere to the one-China principle and resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347701.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-02-26","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","According to Taiwanese officials, Tuvalu's new prime minister stated that Tuvalu's relationship with Taiwan is \"strong and permanent.\" I have two questions about this: What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on the election results in Tuvalu? How does the Ministry of Foreign Affairs view the relationship between Tuvalu and Taiwan?","Adhering to the one-China principle is the will of the people and an irresistible trend. 183 countries worldwide have already established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle. The very few countries that still maintain so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan should choose to stand on the right side of history and make the correct decisions that truly conform to their own fundamental and long-term interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347703.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-08","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","The head of Lithuanian intelligence said yesterday that because of Lithuania's support for Taiwan, the possibility of Chinese interference in the Lithuanian elections should not be ruled out. What is China's comment on this?","China has always adhered to the principle of non-interference in the internal affairs of other countries. We have no interest in, and will not interfere in, Lithuania's internal affairs and elections. We hope that relevant Lithuanian personnel will stop making irresponsible remarks about China and stop creating trouble and difficulties for bilateral relations; otherwise, it will ultimately harm Lithuania's own interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347711.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-12","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","CIA Director Burns stated in his testimony before the Senate that the United States will continue to support Ukraine, which would both support the Kyiv government and indirectly contain China, sending a signal to China regarding the Taiwan and South China Sea issues. What is China's comment on this?","The relevant remarks by the US side show that what the US is really concerned about is not Ukraine, but to use the Ukraine crisis to achieve its own geostrategic goals.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. Anyone who attempts to interfere in the Taiwan issue under any pretext will end in failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347713.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-13","Wang Wenbin","Associated Press reporter","Hsiao Bi-khim is visiting Washington this week. What is China's comment on this? Recently, a deepfake video created by artificial intelligence circulated widely on the Taiwanese internet. In the video, US Congresswoman Whitman promised that the US would provide military support to Taiwan if the DPP candidate wins the January 13th Taiwan election. Whitman has previously claimed that mainland China is attempting to…","Regarding the first question, China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and is closely monitoring the situation.\nRegarding the second question, since it's a fake video, we will not comment. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and elections in Taiwan are a local affair of China, in which no foreign country has the right to interfere. The US should fully recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and put into action the commitment of US leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347714.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-14","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","Taiwan sent a coast guard ship to the waters off Kinmen Island today to rescue a capsized fishing boat from the mainland. Can China verify this news and provide more details?","This is not a diplomatic issue. You can find out from the competent authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347715.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-03-15","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","According to reports, the US government broke out Taiwan for the first time in its Fiscal Year 2025 Budget, which authorized to tap US stockpiles to assist Taiwan in strengthening the so-called “deterrence”. Advisors from the US Special Forces Green Berets have been sent to Taiwan for long-term stationing to train Taiwan’s amphibious special forces. What’s your comment on this?","Taiwan is China’s Taiwan. The Taiwan question is at the core of China’s core interests, and the first red line that must not be crossed in China-US relations. Recently, the US side obscured, distorted and hollowed out the one-China principle through military aid and arms sales to Taiwan, and sending personnel to assist Taiwan in training its troops. These moves sent a seriously wrong signal to the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces and severely undermined peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\n“Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace and stability are as incompatible as water and fire. Those who connive at and support “Taiwan independence” separatist forces will get burned for playing with fire and taste the bitter fruit of their own doing. We urge the US side to immediately end any form of official exchanges and military contact with Taiwan, stop arming Taiwan, and fulfill its commitment of not supporting “Taiwan independence” with concrete actions. The PLA will stay on high alert, firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and resolutely smash “Taiwan independence” separatist activities and external interfering attempts.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-03-18","Lin Jian","A reporter from South Korea's Shinil News Agency asked","\"A 'Democracy Summit' is being held in South Korea starting today, and it's said that representatives from Taiwan are also attending. What is China's comment on this?\" Another question: \"This morning, North Korea launched a ballistic missile again after a month's hiatus. What is China's comment on this?\"","Regarding your first question, China firmly opposes South Korea's invitation to the Taiwan authorities to participate in the so-called \"Leadership Democracy Summit.\" There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. Any external interference in China's internal affairs, or condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence,\" is doomed to failure. China has solemnly urged South Korea to abide by the one-China principle and stop providing a platform for \"Taiwan independence\" forces and supporting them. The DPP authorities' attempts and practices to expand the space for \"Taiwan independence\" activities under the banner of \"democracy\" and \"human rights\" cannot deceive the world; they will only bring shame upon themselves and are destined to fail.\nRegarding your second question, China has noted the relevant reports and the joint military exercises previously conducted by South Korea and the United States targeting North Korea. China believes that maintaining peace and stability on the Korean Peninsula is in the common interest of all parties.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347717.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-19","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Hsiao Bi-khim, Taiwan's newly elected vice president, arrived in the Czech Republic today and will deliver a speech at a think tank. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and the Taiwan region. This position is consistent and clear.\nAdhering to the one-China policy, respecting China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and recognizing Taiwan as an inseparable part of China's territory are solemn commitments made by the Czech government in multiple official documents, including the joint statement and joint communiqué between the Chinese and Czech governments. China urges the Czech side to honor its commitments, strictly restrain certain politicians, immediately cease its egregious actions that damage the Czech Republic's national reputation and undermine China-Czech relations, and take effective measures to eliminate the negative impact of these events. At the same time, we solemnly warn \"Taiwan independence\" elements that pursuing \"Taiwan independence\" will inevitably face historical reckoning, and attempting to establish a \"one China, one Taiwan\" relationship internationally will only backfire and bring bitter consequences upon themselves.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347718.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-21","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","On Wednesday, U.S. Indo-Pacific Command Commander Admiral Aquilino testified before the House Armed Services Committee that China is expanding its military and nuclear arsenal on an unprecedented scale since World War II. All indications suggest that China is committed to preparing for an \"invasion\" of Taiwan by 2027. What is your comment on Aquilino's remarks?","The Asia-Pacific region is a high ground for peace and development, not an arena for geopolitical games. It is the US, not China, that is stirring up confrontation and creating division in the Asia-Pacific.\nI would also like to solemnly remind the US that Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan question is China's internal affair. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no external interference. Our policy is very clear: we will continue to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity. Our bottom line is very clear: we will never allow Taiwan to be separated from the motherland. Some people in the US are attempting to hype up the \"China threat theory,\" escalate tensions across the Taiwan Strait, and provoke confrontation; we firmly oppose this. To safeguard peace across the Taiwan Strait, we must unequivocally adhere to the one-China principle and oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" At the same time, no one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347721.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-22","Lin Jian","Shenzhen TV reporter","Recently, Eswatini Prime Minister Russell Dlamini visited Taiwan, meeting with Tsai Ing-wen, Lai Ching-te, and Premier Chen Chien-jen. He attended a welcome dinner hosted by Taiwan's Foreign Minister Wu Chao-hsieh, visited Taiwanese businesses and universities, and held an investment briefing. What is China's comment on this?","We have noted that Sri Lankan Prime Minister Russell Dlamini recently visited Taiwan, which is a serious provocation against the one-China principle and China's sovereignty. China firmly opposes this.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is a universal consensus of the international community and cannot be challenged. Regarding the Sri Lankan Prime Minister's visit to Taiwan, I would like to emphasize two points.\nFirst, in the 56 years of so-called \"diplomatic relations\" between Sri Lanka and Taiwan, the Sri Lankan people have not gained much benefit, and Sri Lanka's national development has not achieved much. I believe the Sri Lankan people know the truth. The Taiwanese authorities are using the hard-earned money of the island's people to support a small number of Sri Lankan elites to maintain the so-called \"diplomatic relations,\" which are of no value to the people of both sides.\nSecond, following this year's elections in Taiwan, over 180 countries and international organizations reaffirmed the one-China principle. Recently, Nauru resumed diplomatic relations with China, leaving Taiwan with only 12 so-called \"diplomatic allies.\" These irrefutable facts once again demonstrate that the one-China principle is the will of the people and an irresistible trend. The actions of a few powerful figures in Nauru, going against this trend and maintaining so-called \"diplomatic\" relations with Taiwan, are unpopular and doomed to failure.\nWe believe the people of Eswatini will see through the true face of \"Taiwan independence\" and recognize the harm of Eswatini's distorted \"money diplomacy.\" We urge the few in power in Eswatini to face up to the general consensus of the international community, stop deceiving themselves and others, stop deliberately undermining the one-China principle, a fundamental norm of international relations, and turn back from their misguided path as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347722.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-25","Lin Jian","Shenzhen TV reporter","It was reported that on the 23rd, Paraguayan President Peña Nieto posted on social media that the diplomatic relations between Paraguay and Taiwan have been deep and friendly for 66 years, but this has not hindered trade relations between Paraguay and China, and Paraguay continues to export soybeans to China. Paraguay and Taiwan face the common situation of being surrounded by major powers. What is China's…","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a common consensus of the international community. Adhering to the one-China principle is in line with international justice, popular will, and the general trend of the times.\nChina is the world's largest importer of soybeans. According to official Chinese statistics, China has imported zero soybeans from Paraguay in recent years. If the Paraguayan government truly wants to promote national development and improve the well-being of its people, it should recognize the prevailing trend and choose to stand on the right side of history, rather than focusing on petty tricks or exploiting loopholes.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347723.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-03-28","Lin Jian","Global Times reporter","On March 27, the U.S. State Department spokesperson's office released a press release regarding the phone call between Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu and U.S. Deputy Secretary of State Campbell, stating that the call was part of ongoing efforts to maintain open channels of communication between the U.S. and China and to responsibly manage the competitive aspects of their bilateral relationship. Campbell…","On March 27, Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu spoke by telephone with U.S. Deputy Secretary of State Kurt Campbell at the latter's request. The two sides exchanged views on current China-U.S. relations and international and regional issues of common concern.\nVice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu stated that the successful meeting between the two heads of state in San Francisco opened up the \"San Francisco Vision.\" Both sides should implement the important consensus and outcomes of the meeting to promote the stable, healthy, and sustainable development of China-US relations.\nVice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu focused on clarifying China's solemn position on issues such as Taiwan, trade and technology, Hong Kong, and the South China Sea, demanding that the US earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, respect China's core interests, stop politicizing and securitizing trade and technology issues, stop making unwarranted comments on Hong Kong issues, and play a constructive role in maintaining peace and stability in the South China Sea, rather than the opposite.\nVice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu also stated China's principled position on the Korean Peninsula and the Ukraine crisis.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347726.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. First, the situation in waters between Xiamen and Kinmen remains tense since February 14th. Taiwan's troops plan to conduct live-fire exercises in areas including Kinmen Island in April, and the surrounding waters will be restricted during the training. They claimed that it's a routine training exercise with no specific target. Will the Ministry of National Defense take any measure in…","On your first question, the PLA is well aware of any movement of the Taiwan troops. All the provocations by the DPP authorities are doomed to failure.\nRegarding your second question, relevant exercises and training are routine arrangements according to our annual plan. They aim at enhancing the PLA's ability to safeguard our sovereignty and territorial integrity. Relevant parties do not need to make a fuss about it. The PLA will continue to carry out similar exercises and training according to our plan.\nWe are firmly opposed to the irresponsible remarks made by some US military personnel. Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people. It brooks no foreign interference. We are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost efforts, but we will never allow Taiwan to be separated from the motherland.\nThe PLA is ready for operations at all times. We will stay in a combat-ready posture, thwart any foreign interference and smash any separatist attempts for \"Taiwan independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","Recently, satellite imagery shared on social media platform shows a bombing range in Inner Mongolia has a similar layout to Taipei Bo'ai Special District. In addition, a building in the Gaolishan Tactical Training Center in Jiangsu Province looks similar to a taekwondo gym in Taoyuan City, Taiwan. Many people think these are very targeted measures. What's your comment?","Only people with malicious motives will feel like they are targeted. There is no need to be anxious if one has no attempt to seek \"Taiwan independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","The cross-Strait military situation continues to be tense. Taiwan's \"defense minister\" Chiu Kuo-cheng told the legislative Yuan on March 7th that after the then US House Speaker Nancy Pelosi visited Taiwan, he explicitly revised his rights and responsibilities and redefined \"first strike\": as long as the mainland's military aircraft crossed the boundary, Taiwan's troops would regard it as a \"first strike\" and…","Taiwan is part of China's territory. How is it possible for Taiwan to have its own \"defense minister\"? We warn the DPP authorities not to take reckless actions, otherwise it will court destruction.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","It's reported that not long ago, China Coast Guard ships entered, for the first time, what Taiwan calls \"prohibited\", \"restricted\" waters around the Kinmen Islands to conduct law enforcement activities. Is this a countermeasure against the February 14th egregious incident of boat collision?","Taiwan is China's Taiwan. There is no such a thing as the so-called \"prohibited, restricted waters\" between Xiamen and Kinmen. The regular law enforcement and patrol operations carried out by the China Coast Guard help to maintain order in relevant waters and protect lives and property of mainland and Taiwan fishermen. When handling the February 14th egregious incident of boat collision, the DPP authorities showed no respect for human life and no intention to take responsibilities. This has triggered outrage among compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and the DPP authorities must offer a proper and clear explanation to the public. The PLA is closely following the situation at sea, and will be well prepared to respond to emergencies and resolutely safeguard cross-Strait peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","It is reported that China and NATO held the 8th Security Policy Talk not long ago. Could you please give us more details?","In mid-March, the Office for International Military Cooperation of the Central Military Commission (CMC) and Cooperative Security Division of NATO International Military Staff exchanged views on issues of mutual interest including international and regional situations and bilateral defense exchanges. The Chinese side expressed its concerns and clarified its positions on questions including the NATO's attempt to make eastward inroads into the Asia-Pacific and the Taiwan question. In addition, the Chinese side also held Security and Defense Consultation with the EU and Cooperation Talks with Germany.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","A US congressional delegation is currently visiting Taiwan, and they met with Taiwan \"president\" Tsai Ing-wen today. The US Congress recently approved more military aid for Taiwan, and Tsai thanked the visiting delegation for the support for Taiwan's self-defense. The congressmen pledged continued support for Taiwan. Do you have any comment on that?","I'd like to first correct a mistake in your question. It should be \"leader of the Taiwan region\", not \"president\", because Taiwan is part of China. It is known to all that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China. The Chinese side firmly opposes the US official interaction and military contact with China's Taiwan region in any form. We are firmly opposed to the US arms sales to China's Taiwan region. We strongly urge the US side to abide by the one-China principle, refrain from undermining China's sovereignty and security interests and interfering in China's internal affairs.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","This year's Report on the Work of the Government emphasized that \"we will be firm in advancing the cause of China's reunification\", and omitted the term \"peaceful reunification\" when talking about the Taiwan question. Some analysts said that the terms for the Taiwan question in the report are more concise than before, but this does not mean that the mainland will scale down operations targeting Taiwan. Instead,…","Peaceful reunification and One Country, Two Systems are our basic principles for resolving the Taiwan question and the best approach to realizing national reunification. We are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with greatest sincerity and utmost efforts, but we will never allow Taiwan to be separated from the motherland. I want to emphasize that the 1992 consensus which embodies the one-China principle is what underpins peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. Achieving the complete reunification of China is the right thing to do. It represents the prevailing trend of the world and has the overwhelming support of the international community.\nThe PLA always speaks with actions and remains resolute and professional in fighting against \"Taiwan Independence\" forces and pursuing reunification. We warn the DPP authorities that the more rampant \"Taiwan Independence\" separatist activities, the smaller possibilities of peaceful reunification. The PLA will continue to strengthen military training and enhance combat readiness, and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity with rock-solid resolve and strong capability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. First. The spokesperson said this January that the Chinese and US militaries were in communication and coordination on the Military Maritime Consultative Agreement (MMCA) meeting. How is it going so far? What other activities will the two militaries hold this year? Second, on March 27, the US and Philippine defense secretaries had a phone call and the US Defense Secretary Austin said that…","On your first question. To implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state in San Francisco, this year, the Chinese and US militaries have made concerted efforts to steadily resume dialogues and consultations on the basis of equality and respect. The 17th China-US Defense Policy Coordination Talks was held in Washington D.C. from January 8th to 9th, during which the two sides had an in-depth exchange of views on the development of military-to-military relations and on questions of mutual concern including those related to Taiwan, the South China Sea, and maritime and air security. From January 5th to 19th, the Chinese side assisted the US side in visiting Guangxi and Hunan to conduct site surveys in search of the remains of missing US military personnel in China during WWII. The preparations for the China-US Military Maritime Consultative Agreement meeting are well underway. We will release relevant information in due course. The two sides are also in coordination on communication and exchanges in other areas.\nThis year marks the 45th anniversary of diplomatic relations between China and the US. We hope the US side will earnestly respect China's core interests and work with the Chinese side towards the same direction to deliver on the important consensus between the two heads of state, so as to jointly promote the sound, stable and sustainable development of military-to-military relations.\nOn your second question, just now I have elaborated on China's policies on the South China Sea issue. As for how the Chinese side perceives the US-Philippine joint operations in the South China Sea, I'd like to summarize our opinions into two \"should nots\". First, they should not undermine China's sovereignty, security, and maritime rights and interests. Second, they should not disrupt peace and stability in the South China Sea.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. First, recently, the UK and Australia signed a new bilateral defense agreement. Under this document, the UK will send an aircraft carrier combat group to patrol in the Indo-Pacific next year, which will dock at a Australian base, and soldiers of Australia will be trained on the aircraft carrier. Just now you mentioned several times that soliciting foreign support cannot last. Some analysts…","On your first question. Regarding the AUKUS, the Chinese side has already expressed our position of strong opposition to that multiple times. By setting up the so-called AUKUS, the US, the UK and Australia are in nature inciting military confrontation through military cooperation. It increased the risk of nuclear proliferation, exacerbated arms race in the Asia-Pacific and undermined peace and stability in the region. Such partnership is a highly targeted and harmful product of the Cold War mentality. It challenges rules and finds no support.\nOn your second question, I'd like to answer it from two perspectives. From the specific perspective, as I said before, the PLA stays in a combat-ready posture to fight against \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and pursue national reunification. From the general perspective, the PLA has sufficient strategic resolve. Despite external changes and turbulence, we will be a staunch force for stability, and deal with everything with ease.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-03-28","Wu Qian","Reporter","According to reports, the Center for Strategic and International Studies (CSIS) in Washington recently published a research report, saying that if the US steps into the conflict across the Taiwan Strait, it will expend all of its key munitions within a week. The shortage of ammunition will decrease the US deterrence and increase the possibility of further conflicts in the Taiwan Strait. What is your comment on this?","There are always many different reports published by US think tanks from different perspectives. But my answer to all of them is the same, that is, the Taiwan question is China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-03-29","Lin Jian","Reuters","According to sources, the head of the Taiwan Navy will visit the United States next week to attend a military ceremony and discuss naval cooperation between the two sides. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","We have noticed relevant reports. China firmly opposes military collusion between the United States and Taiwan.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The one-China principle is the political foundation of Sino-US relations. China urges the United States to fully recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue and the serious harm of related issues, implement the commitments it has made, abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, immediately stop official exchanges and military contacts between the United States and Taiwan, and not send any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347727.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-03","Wang Wenbin","AFP","President Xi Jinping had a phone call with US President Biden last night. President Xi said that if the US insists on suppressing China's high-tech development, China will not sit idly by. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs clarify the phrase \"sit back and do nothing\"?","First of all, I would like to take this opportunity to introduce to you the situation related to the phone call between the presidents of China and the United States.\nLast night, President Xi Jinping had a phone call with US President Biden at request. The two heads of state had a candid and in-depth exchange of views on Sino-US relations and issues of common concern to both sides.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that last November, Mr. President and I met in San Francisco and launched the \"San Francisco Vision\" for the future. In the past few months, teams from both sides have conscientiously implemented the consensus we reached, and Sino-US relations have stabilized, which has been welcomed by all walks of life in both countries and the international community. On the other hand, negative factors in the relations between the two countries have also increased, which require the attention of both parties.\nPresident Xi Jinping emphasized that the issue of strategic cognition has always been the \"first button\" that must be fastened in Sino-US relations. As two major countries, China and the United States cannot live without exchanges or dealings, let alone conflict or confrontation. They should respect each other, coexist peacefully, and cooperate for win-win results. They should continue to move forward along a stable, healthy and sustainable path, and should not go back.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that China-US relations this year must adhere to several major principles. The first is to value peace, stick to the bottom line of no conflict and no confrontation, and constantly raise positive expectations for Sino-US relations. The second is to focus on stability, not to make troubles, not to stir up troubles, not to cross boundaries, and to maintain the overall stability of Sino-US relations. The third is to be based on trust, fulfill their respective commitments with actions, and turn the \"Vision of San Francisco\" into \"real reality.\" Both sides should strengthen dialogue with mutual respect, manage differences with a prudent attitude, promote cooperation in a spirit of mutual benefit, and strengthen international coordination with responsibility.\nPresident Xi Jinping emphasized that the Taiwan issue is the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. We will not let the separatist activities and external connivance and support of the \"Taiwan independence\" forces go unchecked. We hope that the U.S. will implement Mr. President’s positive statement of not supporting “Taiwan independence” into action. The United States has launched an endless stream of measures to suppress China's economy, trade, science and technology, and the list of sanctions against Chinese companies is getting longer and longer. This is not \"risk removal\" but creation of risk. If the United States is willing to carry out mutually beneficial cooperation and share the dividends of China's development, China's door will always be open. If the United States insists on suppressing China's high-tech development and depriving China of its legitimate right to development, we will not sit idly by.\nPresident Xi Jinping elaborated on China’s position on Hong Kong-related, human rights, South China Sea and other issues.\nPresident Biden said that the U.S.-China relationship is the most far-reaching bilateral relationship in the world. The progress in U.S.-China relations since the San Francisco meeting shows that both sides can actively advance cooperation while responsibly managing differences. President Biden reiterated that the United States does not seek a \"new Cold War,\" does not seek to change China's system, does not seek to strengthen alliances against China, does not support \"Taiwan independence,\" and has no intention of conflict with China. The United States pursues the one-China policy. China's development is beneficial to the world. The United States does not seek to contain China's development or \"decouple\" from China. We are willing to arrange for Treasury Secretary Yellen and Secretary of State Blinken to visit China in the near future to strengthen dialogue and communication with China, avoid miscalculations, promote cooperation, promote the stable development of bilateral relations, and jointly respond to global challenges.\nThe two heads of state also exchanged views on the Ukraine crisis and the situation on the Korean Peninsula.\nThe two heads of state believed that the phone call was candid and constructive. The two sides agreed to continue to maintain communication and tasked the working teams of both sides to implement the \"San Francisco Vision\", promote consultation mechanisms in the fields of diplomacy, economy, finance, commerce and other fields as well as communication between the two militaries, carry out dialogue and cooperation in areas such as counter-drugs, artificial intelligence, and response to climate change, take further measures to expand people-to-people and cultural exchanges between the two countries, and strengthen communication on international and regional issues. China welcomes Treasury Secretary Yellen and Secretary of State Blinken’s recent visit to China.\nYou are concerned about China's position on China-US economic and trade relations. We have pointed out many times that in recent years, China's exports of electric vehicles, lithium batteries, photovoltaic products and other products have increased. This is the result of international division of labor and market demand, and is conducive to promoting green development in the world. It is clear to everyone whether the US is worried about \"overcapacity\". As for who is engaging in non-market operations, the facts are here. The U.S.’s economic, trade and technological suppression measures against China are emerging one after another. They are not “removing risks” but creating risks. This is a typical non-market behavior. Everyone is aware of China's relevant position. We will firmly safeguard our legitimate rights and interests and the multilateral trading system.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347730.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-03","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","This morning, a 7.5-magnitude earthquake occurred off the coast of Taiwan, causing many casualties. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council stated that relevant parties in the mainland are paying close attention to the disaster and are willing to provide disaster relief assistance to the people of Taiwan. So far, has the relevant Taiwan authorities responded to this?","I suggest you check with the competent authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347730.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-09","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Recently, US Deputy Secretary of State Campbell stated in an interview that the \"US-UK-Australia trilateral security partnership\" submarine program has a significant impact on the situation in the Taiwan Strait. Relevant countries unanimously agree that a clear message should be sent regarding maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and the South China Sea. Countries in the Indo-Pacific region hope…","The remarks disregard the facts, distort the truth, incite trouble, and are malicious in nature. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to them.\nI want to emphasize that the so-called \"trilateral security partnership\" established by the US, UK, and Australia is essentially a tactic to incite division and military confrontation within a small circle through military cooperation. It reflects typical Cold War thinking, increases the risk of nuclear proliferation, exacerbates the arms race in the Asia-Pacific region, and undermines regional peace and stability. China and many other countries in the region have expressed serious concern and opposition to this.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, in which no external force has the right to interfere. What is the US's intention in linking its so-called \"trilateral security partnership\" submarine program with the Taiwan issue? China's will to safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering, and no one should underestimate or misjudge this.\nThe US, UK, and Australia are not direct parties to the South China Sea issue and should not interfere with the efforts of the relevant parties to resolve disputes through negotiation and consultation. The recent tensions in the South China Sea and the escalation of regional confrontation are inextricably linked to the US's actions in courting its allies.\nChina is neither the creator nor a party to the Ukraine crisis, and has played and will continue to play a constructive role in the political resolution of the issue. China urges the US to reflect on its own actions, stop fueling the fire, stop attacking and smearing the normal state relations between China and Russia, and stop shifting blame to China.\nChina is a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order. On issues of peace and security, China has the best record among major powers, a fact long acknowledged by the international community. The United States has no right to criticize China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347732.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-11","Mao Ning","NBC News reporter","Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida is currently visiting the United States, where both sides are focusing on expanding security relations to counter China, including upgrading missile systems and the possibility of Japan joining the US-UK-Australia trilateral security partnership. President Biden has also invited Philippine President Marcos to attend the US-Japan-Philippines summit. What is China's view on…","The US and Japan, disregarding China's serious concerns, have smeared and attacked China on issues such as Taiwan and maritime matters, grossly interfering in China's internal affairs and seriously violating the basic norms of international relations. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged solemn representations with the relevant parties.\nThe relationship between the United States and Japan should not be directed against or harm the interests of other countries, nor should it undermine regional peace and stability. China firmly opposes Cold War mentality and clique politics, and firmly opposes any words or actions that create or exacerbate conflicts or harm the strategic security and interests of other countries.\nI want to emphasize that the one-China principle is a historical fact and an international consensus. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. Both the US and Japanese governments have made solemn commitments to China on the Taiwan issue. Japan, in particular, bears serious historical responsibility for its aggression and colonial rule over Taiwan and should especially honor its commitments and exercise caution in its words and actions. We urge the US to translate President Biden's commitment that the US does not support \"Taiwan independence\" into concrete actions.\nChina's activities in the East China Sea and the South China Sea are entirely in accordance with international law and beyond reproach. The Diaoyu Islands and their affiliated islands have been China's inherent territory since ancient times, and China will resolutely respond to any illegal acts that infringe upon China's sovereignty. China possesses indisputable sovereignty over the islands in the South China Sea and their adjacent waters, and China is willing to continue to properly handle maritime issues with relevant parties through dialogue and consultation, jointly maintaining peace and stability in the South China Sea. At the same time, China's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights are inviolable, and China's determination to safeguard its legitimate rights is unwavering.\nThe US and Japan's distortion of facts and truth, serious damage to China's territorial sovereignty, and serious violation of international law and basic norms of international relations are the real threats to regional peace and stability.\nFinally, I want to emphasize that China has always been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order. China will never allow any country to interfere in China's internal affairs, harm China's interests, or smear China's image. China will resolutely defend its sovereignty, security, and development interests and is committed to maintaining peace, stability, and lasting prosperity in the Asia-Pacific region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347734.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-12","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","The leaders of the United States, Japan, and the Philippines held their first trilateral summit in Washington on April 11, and subsequently issued the \"Joint Vision Statement of the Leaders of Japan, the Philippines, and the United States.\" We noted that the US had previously publicly stated that this summit and US-Japan-Philippines cooperation were \"not directed against China,\" but the statement still heavily…","We have taken note of the relevant situation. I would like to make a few comments:\nFirst, China firmly opposes the manipulation of bloc politics by relevant countries, resolutely opposes any actions that provoke or exacerbate conflicts, harm the strategic security and interests of other countries, and resolutely opposes the formation of closed and exclusive \"small circles\" in the region. Japan and the Philippines can certainly develop normal relations with other countries, but they should not introduce bloc confrontation into the region, much less engage in trilateral cooperation at the expense of other countries' interests. Whether the US-Japan-Philippines summit and trilateral cooperation are \"targeted at China\" can be clearly seen in the joint statement issued by the three parties; it is written in black and white. What else could this be but a wanton smear and attack against China?\nSecond, the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. Resolving the Taiwan issue is China's own business, and no one else has the right to interfere. Currently, the greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait is separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and the indulgence and support of external forces. If relevant countries truly care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and genuinely value international security and prosperity, they should adhere to the one-China principle, unequivocally oppose separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence,\" and support China's national reunification. This is the right path to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. No one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThird, China possesses indisputable sovereignty over the Diaoyu Islands and their affiliated islands, as well as the islands in the South China Sea. China's activities in the East China Sea and the South China Sea are legitimate, lawful, and beyond reproach. China will never accept the unfounded accusations and malicious smears against China by relevant countries on the East China Sea and South China Sea issues, and will never accept the illegal ruling of the South China Sea arbitration case or any unilateral actions based on that ruling. Currently, the situation in the East China Sea and the South China Sea is generally stable. However, some countries, emboldened by the support of countries outside the region, have continued to take provocative and infringing actions at sea, escalating the situation. The instigation and confrontation by certain countries outside the region are outrageous. I would like to reiterate that China is determined to safeguard its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and insists on properly handling bilateral maritime issues through dialogue and consultation with the directly involved countries, while resolutely opposing the interference, instigation, and escalation of the situation by countries outside the region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347735.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-04-12","Wu Qian","Question","It is reported that Taiwan’s Naval Chief recently visited the headquarters of US Indo-Pacific Command in Hawaii and attended relevant events of the US military. Some sources said that this visit is part of the US efforts to implement the “Joint Island Defense Concept”. Its aim is to coordinate with the Taiwan authorities to counter China’s armed forces within the “first island chain”. Could you please comment on…","The Chinese side is firmly opposed to any form of official exchanges and military contacts between the US and China’s Taiwan region. Our position is clear-cut. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. To solve the Taiwan question is purely China’s internal affair and brooks no foreign interference.\nThe so-called “first island chain” is a product of the Cold War geopolitics. Any attempt to block and contain China is nothing but wishful thinking. We urge the US side to truly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US Joint Communiqués, fulfill its commitment to not supporting “Taiwan independence”, and immediately stop its military collusion and official contact with Taiwan. We warn the DPP authorities that the “chess piece” in other’s power game will ultimately be abandoned; and “seeking independence by force” will get nowhere but a dead end. The PLA will take resolute actions against any form of separatist actions seeking “Taiwan independence”.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-04-16","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","U.S. Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs, John Konda, met with officials from the Chinese Foreign Ministry and Taiwan Affairs Office this week. The State Department stated that the two sides discussed developments in the Middle East, the South China Sea, and the Taiwan issue, but did not provide further details. Foreign Minister Wang Yi spoke by phone this week with the Iranian Foreign…","On April 15, Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu met with U.S. Ambassador to China Burns, Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs Konda, and Senior Director for China Affairs at the White House National Security Council, Besarlan. We have already released information regarding this meeting , which you can refer to.\nDuring the meeting, both sides, in accordance with the important consensus reached at the San Francisco meeting and recent phone call between the two heads of state, had a frank, in-depth and constructive exchange on promoting dialogue and cooperation between China and the United States in various fields and properly managing differences. They also exchanged views on international and regional hotspots such as the Middle East, Ukraine, and the North Korean nuclear issue, and agreed to continue to implement the \"San Francisco Vision,\" maintain exchanges at all levels, and further stabilize and develop China-US relations.\nYou just mentioned the phone calls between Foreign Minister Wang Yi and the foreign ministers of Saudi Arabia and Iran. I would like to briefly introduce the relevant principles and positions of China as stated by Foreign Minister Wang Yi. Foreign Minister Wang Yi stated that China firmly opposes the attack on the Iranian embassy in Syria, a serious violation of international law. At the same time, we note that Iran has stated that its retaliation is not directed against any neighboring country and that it is willing to continue to pursue a policy of good-neighborliness and friendship.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that this round of escalation is the latest manifestation of the spillover effects of the Gaza conflict. The urgent task is to strictly implement UN Security Council Resolution 2728, immediately achieve an unconditional and lasting ceasefire, effectively protect civilians, and ensure humanitarian assistance. The Palestinian people have never been able to realize their legitimate national rights, which is the longest-lasting injustice of our time, the root cause of the Israeli-Palestinian conflict, and the core of the Middle East issue. The direction for resolving the problem is to implement the \"two-state solution\" as soon as possible, establish an independent Palestinian state, restore the legitimate national rights of the Palestinian people, and achieve peaceful coexistence between Israel and Palestine. The international community should take more active action, support Palestine's bid for full membership in the United Nations, and promote a larger-scale, more authoritative, and more effective international peace conference to formulate a timetable and roadmap for implementing the \"two-state solution.\" China is also willing to strengthen communication and coordination with all parties and make joint efforts in this regard.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347737.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-17","Lin Jian","Hubei Radio and Television Reporter","Suriname President Santokhi has just concluded his state visit to China. How does China evaluate this visit?","From April 11 to 17, President Santokhi was invited to pay a state visit to China. He was the first head of state from Latin America and the Caribbean to visit China this year. This visit coincides with the fifth anniversary of the establishment of strategic cooperative partnership between China and Suriname and the fifth anniversary of the two countries signing the cooperation plan for jointly building the \"Belt and Road\". During the visit, President Xi Jinping held a meeting with President Santokhi talks, Prime Minister Li Qiang and Chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People’s Political Consultative Conference Wang Huning respectively met with them, the leaders of the two countries had an in-depth exchange of views on China-Suriname relations and issues of common concern and reached broad consensus.\nThe talks between President Xi Jinping and President Santokhi were fruitful. The two heads of state agreed to consolidate political mutual trust, strengthen economic and trade cooperation, expand people-to-people and cultural exchanges, and intensify international collaboration. The two sides reiterated their mutual understanding and support on issues involving each other's core interests and major concerns. Suriname firmly adheres to the one-China principle, opposes any form of \"Taiwan independence\" and supports the Chinese government's efforts to achieve national reunification. President Xi Jinping pointed out that China is willing to deepen cooperation with Suriname in jointly building the \"Belt and Road\" and strengthen the docking of development strategies. China welcomes Suriname to participate in multilateral cooperation within the framework of the Global Development Initiative, Global Security Initiative, and Global Civilization Initiative. China is willing to work with the vast number of developing countries, including Suriname, to promote the building of a community with a shared future for mankind. President Santokhi spoke highly of President Xi Jinping's outstanding global leadership, praised China for comprehensively promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation with Chinese-style modernization, and highly appreciated President Xi Jinping's joint construction of the \"Belt and Road\" initiative and the \"three major global initiatives\".\nWitnessed by the two heads of state, the two sides signed 11 cooperation documents, covering the fields of economy and trade, investment, education, media, green development, and digital economy. The two sides also issued a joint press release and expressed that they will strengthen cooperation in the fields of blue economy, energy and mining, infrastructure, energy, agriculture, finance, science and technology, culture, sports, poverty alleviation and other fields, promote overall cooperation between China and Latin American and Caribbean countries, successfully host the 4th China-Caribbean Economic and Trade Cooperation Forum, and continue to work together to advocate the response to climate change and promote sustainable development.\nPresident Santokhi’s visit was a complete success. China is willing to take this visit as an opportunity to work with the Surinamese side to fully implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, promote the stability and long-term development of the China-Suriname strategic cooperative partnership, and write a new chapter in China-Suriname friendship.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347738.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-22","Wang Wenbin","TASS reporter","Last Friday, the G7 foreign ministers issued a statement after their meeting in Italy, expressing concern over China's actions in the East China Sea and the South China Sea, and emphasizing that there should be no attempt to unilaterally change the status quo. The statement also mentioned issues such as Tibet, Hong Kong, and Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The G7 foreign ministers' meeting insisted on manipulating China-related issues, disregarding facts, distorting the truth, and wantonly interfering in China's internal affairs. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nChina's position on relevant issues is consistent and clear. The most effective way to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is to adhere to the one-China principle and oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" With the joint efforts of China and ASEAN countries, the South China Sea maintains a generally peaceful and stable situation, and freedom of navigation in the South China Sea is fundamentally not an issue. China adheres to a people-centered approach and follows the principle that development benefits all Chinese people. Currently, Hong Kong is accelerating its transition from governance to prosperity, and Xinjiang and Tibet enjoy social harmony, prosperity, and stability, with people of all ethnic groups living and working in peace and contentment. Polls by authoritative international institutions show that the Chinese people's satisfaction with the government has remained above 90% for consecutive years.\nAs the largest developing country, China focuses on its own development while committed to promoting common development among all countries. According to World Bank statistics, China's contribution to global economic growth has long exceeded the combined contribution of the G7 countries. China advocates an equal and orderly multipolar world and inclusive economic globalization, firmly upholds the purposes and principles of the UN Charter, and adheres to open cooperation and mutual benefit. In contrast, the G7 clings to Cold War thinking, forms exclusive cliques, exacerbates regional tensions and conflicts, and engages in trade protectionism under the guise of \"risk reduction\" and \"dependency reduction,\" undermining the international economic order. We urge the G7 to abandon its old habit of shirking responsibility and immediately cease its erroneous actions of interfering in other countries' internal affairs and harming their development, and work with the international community to maintain peace, promote cooperation, and advance development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347742.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-24","Wang Wenbin","CNN reporter","The U.S. Congress passed bills on Taiwan and TikTok. I have two questions. First, during Secretary Blinken’s visit to China, what message will China send on this? Second, does the Chinese government think ByteDance should challenge this bill or completely leave the U.S. market?","Regarding issues related to TikTok, we have clearly stated China's principled position. I have no additional information to add today.\nRegarding Secretary Blinken’s visit to China, we have stated China’s position many times in the past two days, and the head of the Department of United States and Oceania of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs also gave a background briefing, which you can check.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347744.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-25","Wang Wenbin","New York Times reporter","Will the timing of the passage of the relevant bill in the U.S. Senate affect the talks between China and Secretary of State Blinken in the coming days? What is China's comment on the part of the bill that provides $8 billion in funding to Taiwan and the Indo-Pacific region?","We have already provided a full explanation regarding Secretary Blinken's visit to China, which you can refer to.\nI want to emphasize that strengthening military ties between the US and Taiwan will not bring security to Taiwan, nor will it save \"Taiwan independence\" from its inevitable failure. It will only escalate tensions and the risk of conflict in the Taiwan Strait, ultimately backfiring on the US. The US should abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, put into practice the commitments made by US leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop arming Taiwan, stop creating new factors of tension in the Taiwan Strait, and stop jeopardizing peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. China will closely monitor the developments of relevant legislation and take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard its sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347745.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-26","Wang Wenbin","Shanghai Dragon TV reporter","This morning, Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with US Secretary of State Antony Blinken. Could the spokesperson provide further details?","This morning, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, held talks with US Secretary of State Antony Blinken in Beijing.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that while China-US relations have generally stabilized, negative factors are still accumulating. China's attitude, position, and demands regarding China-US relations have remained consistent. China has always viewed and developed China-US relations from the perspective of building a community with a shared future for mankind, consistently adhered to the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping, and consistently advocated respect for each other's core interests.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that President Xi Jinping and President Biden's successful meeting in San Francisco last November outlined the \"San Francisco Vision\" for the stable, healthy, and sustainable development of China-US relations, which both sides should implement without fail. In the current complex and volatile international situation, the next step for China-US relations must first answer a fundamental question: should China and the US be partners or adversaries? This is the first crucial step towards stable development in China-US relations. If the US continues to treat China as its primary adversary, China-US relations will only face constant troubles and numerous problems.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that the Taiwan question is the first and inviolable red line in China-US relations. China demands that the US strictly adhere to the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, earnestly fulfill President Biden's commitments not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" not to support \"two Chinas,\" not to \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and not to use Taiwan as a tool to contain China, cease arming Taiwan, and support China's peaceful reunification.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that the Chinese people's right to development is inalienable. The United States has introduced a series of trade, economic, and technological suppression measures against China. This is not fair competition, but containment and encirclement; it is not risk mitigation, but risk creation. The US should put into practice its statements that it does not seek to contain China's economic development, does not seek to \"decouple\" from China, and has no intention of hindering China's technological progress. It should stop hyping up the false narrative of \"China's overcapacity,\" withdraw its illegal sanctions against Chinese companies, and stop imposing the Section 301 tariffs that violate WTO rules.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that the Asia-Pacific region should not become an arena for great power rivalry. He hoped the US would make the right choice, meet China halfway, achieve positive interaction in the Asia-Pacific, abandon its exclusionary cliques, refrain from coercing regional countries to take sides, cease deploying land-based intermediate-range missiles, stop harming China's strategic security interests, and stop undermining the hard-won peace and stability of the region.\nSecretary of State Blinken stated that the U.S.-China relationship is the most important bilateral relationship in the world, and managing it responsibly is a shared responsibility of both sides. The U.S. continues to adhere to the one-China policy and does not support \"Taiwan independence.\" The U.S. does not seek to change China's system, has no intention of conflict with China, does not seek decoupling from China, and does not seek to contain China's development. A developing and successful China is good for the world. The U.S. is willing to work with China to move forward on the basis of the consensus reached by the two heads of state in San Francisco, strengthen dialogue and communication, effectively manage differences, avoid misunderstandings and misjudgments, and promote the stable development of U.S.-China relations.\nThe two sides also exchanged views on the Ukraine issue, the Israeli-Palestinian conflict, and issues such as North Korea and Myanmar.\nBoth sides agreed that the talks were candid, substantive, and constructive, and agreed to continue to work to stabilize and develop China-US relations in accordance with the guidance of the two heads of state. Both sides affirmed the positive progress made in dialogue and cooperation between China and the US in various fields since the San Francisco meeting, and agreed to accelerate the implementation of the important consensus reached by the two heads of state in San Francisco, maintain high-level exchanges and contacts at all levels, continue exchanges between the two militaries and consultations in various fields, further promote China-US cooperation on drug control, climate change, and artificial intelligence, and take measures to expand people-to-people exchanges between the two countries. Both sides are willing to strengthen communication on international and regional hotspots.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347746.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-29","Lin Jian","China Daily reporter","On April 24 local time, US President Biden signed a package of foreign military aid bills into law, which includes negative clauses concerning China. What is China's comment on this?","The US insisted on passing and signing a package of foreign military aid legislation that includes negative content related to China. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a strong protest with the US.\nThis bill seriously infringes upon China's sovereignty, advocates for massive military aid to Taiwan, severely violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. It undermines the principles of market economy and fair competition, unreasonably suppressing foreign companies under the guise of so-called \"national security,\" once again exposing the US's consistent bullying and domineering nature. The bill also ignores the substantial work China has done to help the US address the fentanyl crisis, advocating for sanctions against China; it threatens normal economic and trade exchanges between China and Iran within the framework of international law, imposing unilateral sanctions and \"long-arm jurisdiction,\" thus creating serious obstacles to Sino-US cooperation in related fields.\nWe urge the US to respect China's core interests and major concerns, and not to implement the negative provisions concerning China in the aforementioned bill. If the US persists in its course of action, China will take resolute and forceful measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347747.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-04-30","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","It is reported that the two Palestinian factions, Fatah and Hamas, recently held consultations on intra-Palestinian reconciliation in Beijing. Can the spokesperson give you the details?","At the invitation of China, representatives of the Palestinian National Liberation Movement (Fatah) and the Islamic Resistance Movement (Hamas) recently came to Beijing for consultations to have in-depth and candid dialogue on promoting intra-Palestinian reconciliation. The two sides fully expressed their political will to achieve reconciliation through dialogue and consultation, discussed many specific issues and made positive progress, and unanimously agreed to continue this dialogue process and strive for the early realization of Palestinian unity and reunification. Both sides highly appreciated China's firm support for the just cause of the Palestinian people to restore their legitimate national rights, thanked China for its efforts in promoting Palestine's strengthening of internal unity, and reached agreement on the next step of dialogue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347748.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-06","Lin Jian","","A reporter from the China Global Television Network (CGTN) asked: At a US think tank event, Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs, and Coordinator for China Affairs, Mr. Blue, stated that UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 \"does not recognize, does not equal, and does not reflect a consensus on the one-China principle, is unrelated to the sovereign choices of all countries regarding…","Lan Moke's remarks are a complete distortion of the facts, a falsification of history, and a trampling on international law and the basic norms of international relations. It is shocking and infuriating that a U.S. State Department official responsible for China-U.S. relations would openly make baseless accusations, fabricate and spread lies. China has lodged a strong protest with the U.S. side.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is an undeniable objective fact, a universal consensus of the international community, and a universally recognized basic principle of international relations. 183 countries worldwide, including the United States, have established and developed diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle.\nResolution 2758, adopted by the 26th session of the United Nations General Assembly in 1971, clearly states in black and white that it decides to \"restore all the rights of the People's Republic of China, recognize the representatives of her Government as the sole legitimate representative of China in the United Nations, and immediately expel the representatives of Chiang Kai-shek from the seats illegally occupied by him in the United Nations and in all its organs.\" The resolution clearly demonstrates that the Government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legitimate government representing all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations; it clarifies that Taiwan is not a country, but rather an integral part of Chinese territory, and affirms Taiwan's non-sovereign entity status. The resolution not only thoroughly resolved the issue of representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations politically, legally, and procedurally, but also clarified that China has only one seat in the United Nations, and that the issue of \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" does not exist.\nSince the resolution was adopted, the United Nations and its specialized agencies have adhered to the one-China principle on the Taiwan issue, and official UN documents refer to Taiwan as \"Taiwan Province of China.\" A legal opinion issued by the UN Secretariat's Office of Legal Affairs emphasizes that \"the United Nations considers that Taiwan, as a province of China, has no independent status\" and that \"the Taiwan authorities do not enjoy any form of governmental status.\"\nTaiwan's participation in international organizations must and can only be handled in accordance with the One China principle. The United Nations is an intergovernmental organization composed of sovereign states. As a province of China, Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the United Nations and its related agencies. This is stipulated in the UN Charter and is a principle that all member states must follow and an obligation that must be fulfilled.\nAs a major power and a permanent member of the UN Security Council, the United States should have taken the lead in abiding by the resolutions adopted by the UN General Assembly and in upholding international law and the basic norms of international relations. Instead, it has acted in the opposite way, maliciously distorting UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, fabricating the so-called narrative of \"Taiwan's meaningful participation in the UN system,\" thereby undermining and hollowing out the one-China principle, condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, and serving its sinister attempt to contain and suppress China. This erroneous act of turning back the clock of history and defying the world's will inevitably be resisted and opposed by the forces of justice in the international community, and is destined to fail.\nUN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is not to be challenged, and the one-China principle is unshakeable. Playing the \"Taiwan card\" will inevitably lead to disaster, and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" will only bring trouble upon oneself. We urge the US to stand with the majority of the international community and on the right side of history, abide by the solemn decisions made by the UN General Assembly, earnestly adhere to the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and uphold the commitments made by US leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" not to support \"two Chinas,\" and not to establish \"one China, one Taiwan.\" The US should cease any actions that cross China's bottom line and red line on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347749.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-10","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency reporter","Could the spokesperson provide details about President Xi Jinping's state visit to Hungary?","On May 9 local time, President Xi Jinping attended a welcoming ceremony jointly held by Hungarian President Szów Szów and Prime Minister Viktor Orbán in Budapest, held talks with President Szów and Prime Minister Orbán respectively, and jointly met with reporters with Prime Minister Orbán. The two leaders announced that they would upgrade China-Hungary relations to a comprehensive strategic partnership for a new era in all weather conditions.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that Hungary was one of the first countries to recognize the People's Republic of China. Currently, China-Hungary relations are at their best historical period, with traditional friendship deeply rooted in the hearts of the people and fruitful cooperation in various fields. This year marks the 75th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Hungary. Both sides should summarize valuable experiences and chart the course for the future. First, we should adhere to the principle of equality and mutual respect, follow development paths suited to our respective national conditions, and firmly grasp our own future and destiny. The enduring friendship between China and Hungary is neither directed against nor subject to any third party. Second, we should uphold mutual trust and assistance, always understanding and firmly supporting each other in safeguarding each other's sovereignty, security, and development interests. Third, we should adhere to win-win cooperation, expanding cooperation in various fields within the framework of the Belt and Road Initiative and promoting the alignment of our respective development strategies. Fourth, we should uphold fairness and justice, stand on the right side of history, and strive to make positive contributions to the cause of human peace and development.\nPresident Xi Jinping pointed out that China appreciates Hungary's long-standing and firm commitment to a friendly policy towards China and its unequivocal and firm support for China on issues related to Taiwan, Hong Kong, and human rights. China firmly supports Hungary in pursuing a development path suited to its national conditions and is willing to strengthen political mutual trust with Hungary, enhance exchanges between the two governments, legislative bodies, and political parties, and continue to firmly support each other's core interests and major concerns. Chinese-style modernization will undoubtedly bring more opportunities to countries around the world, including Hungary, and China welcomes Hungary to become a partner on the path of Chinese-style modernization. China is willing to strengthen the alignment of development strategies with Hungary, leverage mechanisms such as the China-Hungary Intergovernmental Cooperation Committee on the Belt and Road Initiative, orderly promote cooperation in infrastructure, green energy, and other fields, and complete the construction of the Budapest-Belgrade railway on schedule. China will actively expand cooperation in emerging fields such as clean energy and artificial intelligence. China hopes that Hungary, as the rotating presidency of the EU in the second half of this year, will play a positive role in promoting the healthy and stable development of China-EU relations. Cooperation between China and Central and Eastern European countries has strong endogenous momentum, and China hopes that Hungary will continue to play an important role in promoting China-Central and Eastern European countries cooperation to better benefit the people of all countries.\nFollowing the talks, the two leaders jointly witnessed the exchange of several bilateral cooperation documents in areas such as the Belt and Road Initiative, trade, investment, science and technology, culture, and agriculture. They also issued a Joint Statement between the People's Republic of China and Hungary on Establishing a Comprehensive Strategic Partnership for a New Era and a list of documents outlining the visit's outcomes.\nPresident Xi Jinping's visit to Europe was met with high-level receptions from leaders of various countries and a warm welcome from their people. From the shepherd's song echoing through the Pyrenees to the enthusiastic cheers of the Serbian people, and the Hungarian girl presenting flowers to President Xi Jinping again after 15 years, these heartwarming moments were deeply moving and fully demonstrated that the sincere friendship between China and the countries concerned has won the hearts of the people and that bilateral relations have a solid foundation of public opinion. We are full of confidence in the development prospects of China-France, China-Serbia, and China-Hungary relations, and will further enhance the strategic, stable, constructive, and mutually beneficial nature of China-EU relations, promoting their steady and long-term development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347753.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-13","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","Registration for the 77th World Health Assembly closes today, and Taiwan has still not received an invitation to participate. Meanwhile, the DPP authorities claim that excluding Taiwan from the World Health Assembly will create a \"gap in the international pandemic prevention system.\" What is the Chinese government's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. On the issue of Taiwan's participation in international organizations, including the World Health Organization, China's position is consistent and clear: it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. This is also the fundamental principle affirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1.\nTaiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the World Health Assembly without the consent of the Central Government. Since coming to power in 2016, the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) has refused to acknowledge the \"1992 Consensus\" and stubbornly adhered to its \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, resulting in the loss of the political foundation for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly. Therefore, China has decided not to agree to Taiwan's participation in this year's World Health Assembly. This decision is based on ample reasons and solid legal grounds, both to uphold the one-China principle and to defend the seriousness and authority of the relevant resolutions of the UN General Assembly and the World Health Assembly.\nFor some time now, the DPP authorities and certain countries have deliberately distorted and challenged UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, hyped up the so-called \"Taiwan's status is undetermined,\" and advocated for Taiwan's participation in multilateral forums within the UN system, including the World Health Assembly. This has misled international public opinion and challenged the international community's consensus on the one-China principle. Such actions, which trample on international law and the basic norms of international relations and turn back the clock of history, will never succeed.\nThe DPP authorities and some countries claim that excluding Taiwan from the World Health Assembly will create a \"gap in the international epidemic prevention system,\" and use this as an excuse to clamor for support for Taiwan's \"meaningful\" participation in the WHO. This is a complete political lie. Under the one-China principle, the Chinese central government has made appropriate arrangements for Taiwan's participation in global health affairs. In the past year, 21 groups totaling 24 individuals from Taiwan submitted applications to participate in WHO technical activities, all of which were approved by the Chinese central government. Taiwan has an International Health Regulations contact point, enabling it to promptly obtain information on public health emergencies released by the WHO and to promptly report to the WHO. These facts fully demonstrate that the Chinese central government is sincere in addressing the health concerns of Taiwan compatriots, and the positive measures taken are practical and feasible, ensuring the full protection of Taiwan compatriots' right to health.\nThe one-China principle is the will of the international community and an irresistible trend. China's decision not to allow Taiwan to participate in this year's World Health Assembly has received widespread understanding and support from the international community. Challenging the one-China principle is futile. Turning back the clock of history leads nowhere. Any attempt to play the \"Taiwan card\" or use Taiwan to contain China will only be met with resolute opposition from the international community and is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347754.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-14","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","It has been reported that the US and Taiwanese navies conducted joint military exercises in the Pacific last month. Can the spokesperson confirm this?","I have noted reports that US and Taiwanese ships had an \"unexpected encounter.\" China's position against US-Taiwan military contacts is consistent and clear. We urge the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and to cease its erroneous actions of military collusion with Taiwan. We also solemnly warn the DPP authorities that \"seeking independence by force\" and \"resisting reunification by force\" are dead ends, doomed to failure, and this will not be surprising.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347755.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-15","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","The U.S. State Department's Assistant Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs and Coordinator for China Affairs stated that \"UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 does not endorse, equal, or reflect a consensus on the one-China principle.\" A U.S. project official from the German Marshall Fund stated that China's position on UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is inconsistent with international law.…","For some time now, some U.S. officials, for ulterior motives, have repeatedly made statements that discredit the authority of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, hyped up the so-called \"undetermined status of Taiwan,\" and clamored for Taiwan's meaningful participation in the UN system. These statements are a complete distortion of the facts, a falsification of history, a trampling on international law and the basic norms of international relations, and a betrayal of the U.S.'s own commitments.\nTaiwan has been an integral part of China since ancient times; this is a historical fact and an international consensus. The Cairo Declaration of 1943 and the Potsdam Declaration of 1945 explicitly stipulated the return of Taiwan, Chinese territory seized by Japan, to China. These legally binding documents constitute part of the post-war international order and legally confirm that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory.\nOn October 25, 1971, the 26th UN General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority, which cleanly and thoroughly resolved the issue of the representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations from a political, legal, and procedural perspective. It clarified that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is a part of China, not a country; and that China has only one seat in the United Nations, and that the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legitimate representative. There is no such thing as \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\".\nThe United States is a signatory to the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration. In the three Sino-US joint communiqués, it explicitly stated that \"The Government of the United States of America recognizes the position of China that there is only one China and that Taiwan is a part of China.\" US leaders have also repeatedly pledged not to support \"Taiwan independence\" or \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan.\" However, in recent years, the US has openly questioned and misinterpreted UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, continuously undermining and hollowing out the one-China principle, and vigorously advocating for Taiwan's entry into the UN system, which is only open to sovereign states. This runs counter to the US's commitments and represents a step backward in history.\nThe US's distortion and slander of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is identical to its recent blatant claim that UN Security Council Resolution 2728, which demands an immediate ceasefire in Gaza, is \"not binding.\" Both reflect the US's selective application of international law and basic norms of international relations, using them when convenient and discarding them when not, and are symbols of bullying and domineering behavior. However, the era of hegemony and power dominating international relations is over. Any country, including the US, attempting to challenge UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 or the one-China principle is delusional. 53 years ago, before UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 was adopted by an overwhelming majority, the US proposed a so-called \"dual representation\" motion, attempting to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" which ultimately became a dead letter. Today, if the US continues to go against the tide of the times, playing the \"Taiwan card\" and attempting to \"use Taiwan to contain China,\" it will only suffer greater defeat.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347756.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-16","Wang Wenbin","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that former Japanese Prime Minister Taro Aso met with Taipei Mayor Chiang Wan-an in Tokyo yesterday to discuss people-to-people exchanges between Japan and Taiwan. What is your comment on this?","Regarding the issue of Taiwan's external exchanges, China's position is consistent and clear: it should be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. We urge Japan to abide by the relevant principles and spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and to demonstrate its commitment to \"adhering to the one-China principle\" and \"maintaining only non-governmental and local exchanges with Taiwan\" through concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347757.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-17","Wang Wenbin","Global Times reporter","Some media reports indicate that the Taiwan authorities have long sought political support from Guatemala through bribery of the president or \"dollar diplomacy,\" and recently, they have again employed similar tactics. However, the Guatemalan presidential palace stated that President Arevalo is considering refusing to attend the so-called \"May 20th inauguration ceremony.\" What is China's comment on this?","The DPP authorities have always been accustomed to using the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people to engage in \"dollar diplomacy,\" attempting to bribe other countries' political leaders to \"support\" them. In reality, this serves their own political calculations and aims to promote \"Taiwan independence,\" ultimately harming the interests of the Taiwanese people. Facts have proven that the DPP authorities' \"dollar diplomacy\" not only does not benefit the development of the countries involved but also becomes a breeding ground for corruption. I believe the Guatemalan government and people are well aware of this.\nChina reiterates that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trendsomething that money cannot buy. We hope and believe that the California side will make the right choice as soon as possible, in line with the general trend of international affairs and history, and in accordance with the interests of its people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347758.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-05-17","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","According to US media reports, the DPP authorities are seeking to increase the number of its so-called “military attachés” at the Taipei Economic and Cultural Office in Honolulu from 4 to 10 to increase coordination and intelligence sharing with US Indo-Pacific Command. In addition, it’s reported that Taiwan’s troops conducted joint drills with the US navy in western Pacific in April. Do you have any comment on this?","We have noted relevant reports. The DPP authorities colluded with the US and attempted to solicit US support to push for “Taiwan independence” and resist reunification by force. Such behaviors are doomed to fail. The US side should fully realize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan question, stop any form of official interactions and military contact with China’s Taiwan region and stop sending wrong signals to the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces, and deliver on its commitment of not supporting “Taiwan independence”. The Taiwan question is at the core of China’s core interests. The Chinese side will take resolute and decisive countermeasures against any “Taiwan independence” separatist activities and foreign connivance and support.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-05-20","Wang Wenbin","Xinhua News Agency reporter","Could the spokesperson provide further details regarding Foreign Minister Wang Yi's visit to Tajikistan?","At the invitation of Tajik Foreign Minister Mukhriddin, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, paid an official visit to Tajikistan. During the visit, Tajik President Rahmon met with Foreign Minister Wang Yi, and Foreign Minister Wang Yi held talks with Foreign Minister Mukhriddin, signed cooperation documents between the two foreign ministries, and jointly met with reporters.\nDuring the talks and meetings, Foreign Minister Wang Yi stated that no matter how the international situation changes, China will always be a trustworthy friend and partner of Tajikistan. China is willing to further expand trade with Tajikistan, explore the potential of connectivity, promote cooperation in mineral resources, and expand cooperation in emerging areas such as new energy and green transformation. This will help Tajikistan accelerate its industrialization process, improve its economic and social development, and forge a successful path to development and revitalization, bringing tangible benefits to the Tajik people.\nThe Tajik side stated that China is an important strategic partner of Tajikistan, and promoting relations with China is a priority in Tajikistan's foreign policy. Tajikistan will, as always, firmly adhere to the one-China principle, consider Taiwan an inseparable part of China's territory, oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence,\" and support all efforts made by the Chinese government to achieve national reunification.\nBoth sides agreed that, under the strategic guidance of President Xi Jinping and President Rahmon, China and Tajikistan have established a comprehensive strategic partnership based on the spirit of good-neighborliness and friendship. They have also, in line with the trend of the times, announced the building of a China-Tajikistan security community and a development community, and on this basis, agreed to build a China-Tajikistan community with a shared future. This has paved the way for neighborly relations based on mutual respect, equality, and mutual benefit, setting a model for the development of relations between countries. Looking to the future, both sides should focus on advancing cooperation in the following areas: First, continuing to firmly support each other's core interests. Second, continuing to explore the broad potential for mutually beneficial cooperation. Third, accelerating the \"two-way flow\" of people-to-people exchanges; China welcomes Tajikistan's announcement of a 14-day visa-free policy for eligible Chinese citizens and welcomes more young Tajiks to study in China. Fourth, resolutely safeguarding regional security and stability, further deepening counter-terrorism cooperation, intensifying the fight against the \"three evil forces,\" strengthening border control, enhancing exchanges and consultations in the field of counter-interference, and jointly preventing \"color revolutions.\" China supports the establishment of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation Anti-Drug Center in Dushanbe. Fifth, we should maintain close multilateral cooperation, jointly improve and strengthen the China-Central Asia mechanism, enhance cooperation within multilateral frameworks such as the United Nations and the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO), jointly practice genuine multilateralism, and promote an equitable and orderly multipolar world and inclusive economic globalization. Tajikistan will fully support China's work in assuming the SCO chairmanship.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347759.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-20","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","For a period of time, some people in the United States have been spreading distortions of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, claiming that the resolution \"does not resolve Taiwan's status\" and \"does not prohibit Taiwan from meaningful participation in the United Nations system.\" What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","Taiwan has been an integral part of China’s territory since ancient times and is not a country. This is an issue that the international community has long concluded and has become an important part of the international order after World War II. The \"Cairo Declaration\" clearly requires that the territories stolen by Japan from China, such as Northeast China, Taiwan, and the Penghu Islands, should be returned to China. The Potsdam Declaration further stipulated that the provisions of the Cairo Declaration must be implemented. In its 1945 \"Japanese Surrender Articles\" and the 1972 \"Sino-Japanese Joint Declaration\", Japan promised to abide by the aforementioned provisions of the \"Potsdam Declaration\". Taiwan is an integral part of China, both legally and de facto.\nUN General Assembly Resolution 2758 resolved the issue of who represents all of China. That is, the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government that represents all of China, including Taiwan, at the United Nations. It clarifies that there is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China and a non-sovereign entity, confirming the one-China principle. For more than half a century since the adoption of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, the UN Secretary-General and his spokesperson have made it clear when making statements regarding Taiwan that the UN is guided by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and adheres to the one-China principle. The Legal Affairs Office of the UN Secretariat has issued multiple legal opinions, making it very clear that \"Taiwan is part of China\" and \"Taiwan, as a province of China, has no independent status.\" The number of countries that have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of adhering to the one-China principle has increased from more than 60 to 183. All these clearly show that the one-China principle is not only the universal consensus of the international community, but also has become a basic norm of international relations.\nSome people in the United States maliciously spread fallacies such as that UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 \"does not resolve Taiwan's status\" and \"does not prohibit Taiwan from meaningful participation in the United Nations system.\" They are trying to negate UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and the one-China principle by stirring up \"Taiwan is part of China\", an issue that has long been thoroughly resolved by the international community. This behavior of turning back the clock on history not only challenges China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, but also challenges international justice and conscience, and challenges the post-war international order. It is both absurd and dangerous.\nChina will eventually be reunified and will inevitably be reunified. This cannot be stopped by anyone or any force. We are telling some people in the United States that the trend of the times is great. If you follow it, you will prosper, but if you go against it, you will perish. Those who challenge the one-China principle will eventually be swallowed up by the trend of the times, and those who reverse the course of history will only fall into the abyss of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347759.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-21","Wang Wenbin","People's Daily reporter","Recently, leaders of many countries and international organizations have reiterated their adherence to the one-China principle and their support for China's reunification. Could the spokesperson provide some information on this? What is your comment?","Recently, many political figures and heads of international organizations have spoken out righteously in their commitment to the one-China principle, which fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is the will of the people and the righteous cause.\nKazakh President Kassym-Jomart Tokayev stated that Kazakhstan firmly adheres to the one-China principle, a position that will never change. Uzbek President Shavkat Mirziyoyev stated that the elections in Taiwan are China's internal affairs, and other countries have no right to interfere or meddle. Uzbekistan's firm stance on the one-China principle will never waver. Kyrgyz President Japarov stated that he firmly supports China on issues related to Taiwan, Xinjiang, Hong Kong, and Tibet. Pakistani President Asif Ali Zardari stated that Pakistan firmly adheres to the one-China principle, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territorya fact beyond question. Venezuelan President Nicolás Maduro stated that there is only one China in the world, and only one China within the international system centered on the United Nationsan indisputable fact. Any attempt to undermine the one-China principle is doomed to failure. Kiribati President and Foreign Minister Maamau stated that he supports China's correct position on safeguarding national unity and territorial integrity, and will abide by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758. The 33rd Arab League Summit adopted a resolution reaffirming adherence to the one-China principle. Guyanese Prime Minister Phillips stated that he does not support Taiwan's membership in any international organizations or participation in international conferences that only sovereign states can join. Tongan Prime Minister Huakawameliku stated that Tonga adheres to the one-China principle and firmly supports UN General Assembly Resolution 2758. Russian Foreign Minister Lavrov stated that Russia supports China's national reunification on the Taiwan issue, a position that is very clear. Serbian Foreign Minister Djuric stated that Serbia has only one policy on the Taiwan issue: the friendly and fraternal sovereignty and territorial integrity of China are inviolable. Serbia firmly supports the one-China principle, recognizes all of China's borders, and believes that the method of resolving issues such as Taiwan is a matter for China to decide. Sri Lankan Speaker of Parliament Abedwardena, Botswana's Speaker of Parliament Skeremani, Lao Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Saleumxay Kommasith, the Palestinian Presidential Palace, the Iranian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, as well as the Director-General of the United Nations Office at Geneva, the Director-General of the United Nations Office at Vienna, the Secretary-General of UNCTAD, the Director-General of the International Atomic Energy Agency, the Director-General of the World Intellectual Property Organization, the Secretary-General of the International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies, the Executive Director of the Southern Centre, and the Secretary-General of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation, publicly reiterated their adherence to the one-China principle, compliance with UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, and opposition to any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatism.\nAs Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, pointed out, the one-China principle is inviolable, the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities are unworkable, and the general trend of China's reunification is irreversible. Every time the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces stir up trouble, the international community's consensus on upholding the one-China principle is strengthened, and its understanding and support for China's position increases. This is the principle that those who act justly gain widespread support, while those who act unjustly find themselves isolated. The basic framework of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle is unshakeable. The historical trend of China's complete reunification is unstoppable. Anyone who attempts to challenge the one-China principle or obstruct China's reunification is like a mantis trying to stop a chariot; they will only end up disgraced and ruined.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347760.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-21","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","US Secretary of State Blinken congratulated the new \"leader\" of Taiwan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The U.S.’s actions seriously violate the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, seriously violate the political commitment made by the U.S. to maintain only cultural, commercial and other unofficial relations with the Taiwan region, and send a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China is strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to this, and has lodged stern representations with the United States.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, and firmly opposed the United States interfering in Taiwan affairs in any way and under any pretext. We urge the United States to immediately correct its mistakes, earnestly abide by President Biden's commitments such as not supporting \"Taiwan independence,\" not supporting \"two Chinas,\" \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and not using Taiwan as a tool to contain China.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" is doomed to failure. No intervention by any external force can stop the historical trend of China's reunification. Any act that challenges the one-China principle and jeopardizes China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity will be resolutely and forcefully countered by China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347760.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-22","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from China National Radio","Foreign Minister Wang Yi just attended the SCO Foreign Ministers' Meeting. Could the spokesperson provide further details?","On May 21 local time, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, attended the meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO) in Astana, the capital of Kazakhstan .\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that the \"Shanghai Spirit\"characterized by mutual trust, mutual benefit, equality, consultation, respect for diverse civilizations, and the pursuit of common developmenthas become the fundamental guideline for the SCO's continuous growth and development, and a banner for building a new type of international relations. The more turbulent and complex the world becomes, the more we must uphold the \"Shanghai Spirit,\" stay on the right track, and more effectively safeguard common interests, address various challenges, and defend fairness and justice by further strengthening and consolidating the SCO.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi put forward four suggestions: First, we must uphold strategic autonomy, maintain unity and cooperation, and never allow external forces to turn this region into a geopolitical arena. Second, we must uphold shared security and enhance cooperation, guided by global security initiatives, and make unremitting efforts to safeguard world peace. Third, we must uphold inclusive and win-win cooperation, empowering cooperative development; China is willing to work with all parties to promote the high-quality alignment of the Belt and Road Initiative with the development strategies of member countries of this organization, creating more development opportunities. Fourth, we must uphold openness and inclusiveness, deepen exchanges and mutual learning, allowing diverse civilizations to flourish and fostering deeper understanding among peoples of all countries.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi clarified China's solemn position on the Taiwan issue , stating that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, and that \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities are the biggest destructive factor to peace across the Taiwan Strait. The despicable acts of Lai Ching-te and his ilk, betraying the nation and their ancestors, are contemptible. However, no matter how much they cause trouble, they cannot stop China from achieving complete reunification, and Taiwan will inevitably return to the embrace of the motherland. All \"Taiwan independence\" separatists will be nailed to the pillar of historical shame. China appreciates the SCO member states' firm adherence to the one-China principle. We believe that everyone will continue to support the Chinese people's just cause of opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and striving for national reunification.\nIn their remarks, the foreign ministers of participating countries highly praised the role and development achievements of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO). They unanimously agreed that, facing a complex international and regional situation, member states should uphold the \"Shanghai Spirit,\" explore cooperation potential, adhere to openness and inclusiveness, strengthen cooperation in the political, economic, and security fields, promote connectivity, achieve common development and prosperity, and make new contributions to world peace and sustainable development. The foreign ministers condemned all forms of terrorism and unanimously agreed to strengthen the fight against the \"three evil forces\" (terrorism, separatism, and extremism) and safeguard regional peace and stability. All parties agreed that hotspot issues should be resolved through political and diplomatic means, respecting the sovereignty and territorial integrity of all countries, upholding the authority of the UN Charter, opposing unilateralism, and promoting a multipolar world.\nThe meeting made full preparations for the Astana Summit to be held in July.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347761.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","AFP reporter","Regarding China's ongoing military exercises around Taiwan Island, a US military general said today that China's military exercises are \"concerning.\" What is the spokesperson’s response to the US remarks?","The Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has issued an announcement on relevant joint exercises, which you can check. The Chinese People's Liberation Army's Eastern Theater Command conducts joint exercises around Taiwan to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, effectively punish \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces seeking \"independence\", and issue serious warnings against interference and provocation by external forces. This is in full compliance with international law and international practice, and is completely legitimate and necessary.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. This is both a historical fact and a true status quo, and it will never change in the future. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end. The Chinese people are unwavering in their determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. All \"Taiwan independence\" separatist actions will be met head-on by the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, and all \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces will be defeated in the face of the historical trend of China's complete reunification.\nWe urge the United States to stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" forces and stop interfering in China's internal affairs. Any act that endangers China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity will be met with a firm and forceful response from China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","Reuters reporter","I have a few questions about China's \"punishment\" exercises around Taiwan today and tomorrow. Will China declare a no-fly zone or no-navigation zone for ships during the exercise? Has China notified other countries, foreign airlines or ships of the exercise?","The Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has released relevant information, which you can check. I would like to reiterate once again that the Chinese People's Liberation Army's Eastern Theater Command conducts joint exercises near Taiwan Island to effectively punish \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces seeking \"independence\" and to issue serious warnings against interference and provocation by external forces. This is in full compliance with international law and international practice, and is completely legitimate and necessary.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Japan's TV Asahi","Yesterday, Liu Jinsong, Director-General of the Asian Department of the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs, met with Japanese Minister Akira Hengchi. Regarding the Taiwan issue, what specifically did China talk about and what position did it express?","Regarding Director Liu Jinsong’s meeting with the Chief Minister of the Japanese Embassy in China, China has released\npress release\n, everyone can check it out. In recent years, Japan has frequently made negative moves on Taiwan-related issues, and China has repeatedly made solemn representations and stated its solemn position. We solemnly urge the Japanese side to abide by the relevant principles and spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, demonstrate its commitment to the one-China principle with practical actions, not condone and support \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any form, and effectively safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, rather than the opposite.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from Hong Kong China Review News Agency","According to reports, McCaul, chairman of the Foreign Affairs Committee of the U.S. House of Representatives, recently said that he will lead a delegation to visit Taiwan at the end of May to congratulate Taiwan's new \"leader\" on his inauguration. What is China’s comment on this?","China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, and firmly opposed the United States interfering in Taiwan affairs in any way and under any pretext. The U.S. Congress is an integral part of the U.S. government and should strictly abide by the one-China policy pursued by the United States. If US congressmen visit Taiwan, they will seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiques, interfere in China's internal affairs, damage China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and send a serious wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nChina requires the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, refrain from arranging visits to Taiwan by members of Congress, stop official exchanges between the U.S. and Taiwan, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, and take practical actions to fulfill the U.S. commitment to only maintain cultural, business and other unofficial relations with the Taiwan region and not support \"Taiwan independence.\" If the U.S. insists on going its own way, the U.S. must be entirely responsible for the consequences.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","Reporter from China Global Program Center","On May 20, Chinese Ambassador to Japan Wu Jianghao issued a stern warning to Japan regarding Japan’s recent negative moves related to Taiwan, saying that “if Japan ties itself onto the chariot of splitting China, the Japanese people will be led into a pit of fire.” According to reports, on May 22, Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Hayashi Masaru said that “the relevant remarks are extremely inappropriate.” What is…","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests. It is related to the political foundation of China-Japan relations and is an insurmountable red line. Some people in Japan have been making frequent negative moves on Taiwan-related issues recently, and continue to advocate the absurd and dangerous argument that \"whatever happens to Taiwan means something happens to Japan.\" This seriously violates the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments made by Japan.\nAmbassador Wu Jianghao's relevant statement is based on facts, is righteous and serious, and is completely legitimate and necessary. I want to stress again that no one should underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, firm will and strong ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. If someone insists on interfering in China's internal affairs and obstructing China's reunification, they will pay a heavy price.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-23","Wang Wenbin","Reuters","After conducting exercises around Taiwan this week, does China plan to conduct more similar \"punishment\" exercises? Are there plans to further upgrade the exercise?","Every time the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces stir up trouble, China and the international community will become stronger in defending the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347762.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-24","Wang Wenbin","CCTV reporter","The 77th World Health Assembly will open on May 27. It is understood that many countries have expressed their support for China's position on the Taiwan issue at the World Health Assembly. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. On the issue of Taiwan's participation in international organizations, including the World Health Organization, China's position is consistent and clear: it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. This is also the fundamental principle affirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1.\nFrom 2009 to 2016, based on the principle of one China adhered to by both sides of the Taiwan Strait, China made special arrangements for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly (WHA) for eight consecutive years. Since coming to power in 2016, the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) has refused to acknowledge the \"1992 Consensus,\" which embodies the one-China principle, and stubbornly persisted in its separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence,\" resulting in the loss of the political foundation for Taiwan's participation in the WHA. To uphold the one-China principle and defend the seriousness and authority of relevant UN General Assembly and WHA resolutions, China decided not to agree to Taiwan's participation in this year's WHA, a decision that has received widespread support and understanding from the international community. For some time now, the vast majority of countries in the international community have reiterated to China their adherence to UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, their firm support for the one-China principle, and their opposition to Taiwan's participation in the WHA. Hundreds of countries have supported China's position through letters to the WHO Director-General and other means. This once again proves that the one-China principle is the will of the people and the trend of the times in the international community, and fully reflects the just stance of the vast majority of countries on the Taiwan-related issues at the WHA. A just cause gains widespread support, while an unjust cause finds itself isolated. The fundamental framework of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle is unshakeable. The attempt to promote \"Taiwan independence\" and separatism will never succeed. Any attempt to violate the one-China principle and use the \"Taiwan card\" for political manipulation is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347763.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-24","Wang Wenbin","AFP","The Philippines said today that it has set up a coast guard post in the northern part of the country, saying it was in response to China's \"increased military buildup\" near Taiwan in the past two years. What is China’s response to this?","I am not aware of the relevant situation you mentioned. We urge the Philippines to abide by the one-China principle and act prudently on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347763.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-27","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","A few days after China concluded its military exercises, a caucus of U.S. congressmen visited Taiwan, expressing U.S. support for Taiwan's defense. Congressman McCaul stated that he would urge relevant parties to expedite weapons deliveries for deterrence purposes. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Despite China's strong opposition, certain U.S. lawmakers insisted on visiting Taiwan, violating the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués. This also contradicts the U.S. government's political commitment to maintain only unofficial relations with Taiwan, sending a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a strong protest with the U.S. side. China will take necessary measures to resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China firmly opposes military contacts between the US and Taiwan, opposes arming Taiwan, and urges relevant US lawmakers to stop playing the \"Taiwan card,\" stop interfering in China's internal affairs, stop supporting and condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and stop undermining China-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347764.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-27","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","On May 22, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs announced its decision to take countermeasures against 12 US defense contractors and 10 of their executives. Is this China's retaliation against the US sanctions against Chinese companies and their participation in the inauguration ceremony of the Taiwan leader, based on so-called Russia-related factors?","China announced its decision on May 22 through Foreign Ministry Order No. 7. China has always firmly opposed unilateral sanctions and \"long-arm jurisdiction\" that have no basis in international law and are not authorized by the UN Security Council, and will continue to take all necessary measures to safeguard its legitimate rights and interests. China urges the US to deeply reflect on its own responsibility for the outbreak and escalation of the Ukraine crisis, stop its smear campaign and pressure tactics, and stop imposing illegal unilateral sanctions.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. No country, organization, or individual should underestimate the Chinese government and people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, nor should they fantasize about crossing the line on the Taiwan issue without paying the price.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347764.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-05-28","Mao Ning","Phoenix TV reporter","It has been reported that the U.S. State Department spokesperson recently issued a statement expressing concern about the Chinese military's exercises around Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. The United States has no right to make irresponsible remarks. China's military exercises around Taiwan are a resolute punishment for the provocations by the Taiwan leader's \"May 20\" speech seeking \"independence,\" a stern warning to external forces that condone and support \"Taiwan independence\" and interfere in China's internal affairs, and a just act to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. They are fully in line with international law and international practice and are entirely legitimate and necessary.\nThe leader of Taiwan, upon taking office, couldn't wait to reveal his true colors as a \"Taiwan independence\" advocate. His \"May 20th\" speech was a complete \"Taiwan independence confession,\" fully exposing his nature as a \"Taiwan independence worker.\" Facts have once again proven that the most dangerous change to the status quo across the Taiwan Strait and the most significant damage to peace in the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces led by the United States.\nThe US, disregarding China's firm opposition, made a mistake by sending a delegation to the \"May 20 Inauguration Ceremony\" and by issuing a statement of congratulations to the US Secretary of State. This sent a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and its unfounded accusations against China's legitimate and reasonable measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity only compounded the error. We urge the US to recognize the nature and ambitions of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, to recognize the serious harm and enormous risks they bring to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and to China-US relations, to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, to fulfill the commitments made by US leaders on the Taiwan issue, and to stop supporting and encouraging the \"Taiwan independence\" forces in any way.\nChina's resolve to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering, as is its determination to oppose external interference in China's internal affairs. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" will only lead to self-destruction. Any erroneous attempt to challenge the one-China principle will end in failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202405/t20240530_11347765.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","Recently, the PLA carried out the \"Joint Sword - 2024A\" military exercise around the Taiwan island. Has this exercise reached its expected objectives? Will the PLA continue to carry out \"Joint Sword 2024B\", or even \"C\" and \"D\" exercises of the series in the future?","The \"Joint Sword - 2024A\" military exercise conducted by the PLA Eastern Theater Command was a heavy blow to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and a warning against foreign interference. We have reached the expected objectives. As for whether there will be future exercises codenamed \"Joint Sword 2024 B, C, D\", I want to say that each time \"Taiwan independence\" separatists make provocations, they will be responded with stronger countermeasures from the PLA, until China is completely reunified. The PLA has a glorious tradition of \"three don't believes\" which originated from Yang Gensi, a hero of the Chinese People's Volunteers: we don't believe there are impossible missions, we don't believe there are unconquerable difficulties, and we don't believe there are invincible enemies.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have three questions. First, at the very beginning you mentioned that it was raining heavily outside. Media outlets recently often use the phrase \"high winds and strong waves\" when describing the situation in the Taiwan Strait. How does the Ministry of National Defense assess the situation? Second, after the Eastern Theater Command recently conducted drills around the Taiwan island, Taiwan's military…","On your first question, recently, with the provocations of \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and the interference of external forces, the situation in the Taiwan Strait has escalated. The PLA is always combat-ready to resolutely thwart any forms of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist attempts. As for the \"high winds and strong waves\" you just mentioned, the PLA has full confidence to \"sit tight on the fishing boat despite the rising wind and waves\".\nRegarding the second question, it seems to me that some Taiwan media outlets always like to publish some self-satisfied news, which stems from a misperception of their own strength.\nOn the third question, recently, under the strategic guidance of the two heads of state, the Chinese and US militaries have stepped up communication and exchanges. This momentum does not come by easily and thus should be cherished dearly. But I also need to point out that the US side has been provoking confrontation with China in disregard of China's core interests and major concerns on certain questions. This is the root cause of the instabilities in China-US mil-to-mil relations. We hope that the US side will work with us in the same direction, earnestly implement the important consensus between the two heads of state and uphold the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation, so as to add more positive factors to the mil-to-mil relations. As for whether the two defense chiefs will meet on the margins of the Shangri-La Dialogue, we will hold a press briefing in time if that happens and we welcome your attention and coverage.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","It is reported that Lai Ching-te, leader of the Taiwan region, delivered a so-called \"inaugural speech\" on May 20th, claiming that the two sides of the Taiwan Strait \"are not subordinate to each other\", and the Chinese mainland's military operations are \"the greatest strategic challenges to peace and stability\". He also clamored for \"not harbor any delusion as we pursue the ideal of peace\" and \"strengthen…","Lai Ching-te's address is full of deception to Taiwan compatriots and hostility against people in the Chinese mainland. He brownnosed his \"foreign master\" and harbors the delusion for \"seeking independence by force\". This is a confession of his attempt to solicit external support and use force for \"Taiwan independence\". The PLA firmly opposes this and responds with strong countermeasures.\nTaiwan has been China's territory since ancient times. This is backed by clear historical and jurisprudential basis. The 1943 Cairo Declaration and the 1945 Potsdam Proclamation clearly stipulated that Taiwan, a Chinese territory stolen by Japan, shall be restored to China. UNGA Resolution 2758 made it clear that there is only one China in the world and Taiwan is part of China. Just several days ago, spokesperson for UN Secretary-General explicitly said that Taiwan is \"a province of China\". In disregard of this fact, the DPP authorities have been hellbent on the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", provoke antagonism and confrontation across the Strait and act as a pawn of foreign forces to contain China. Its behaviors seriously challenge the international order and severely damage regional peace. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities constitute the biggest real threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait.\nThe trend of the world is surging forward. Those who follow the trend will prosper; those who go against it will perish. China's national reunification is the overwhelming and irresistible trend of history. \"Taiwan independence\" means war, and division brings no peace. With the sacred mission of safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity on our shoulders, the PLA is fully prepared and stays highly vigilant. We will take resolute actions to smash any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist attempts and thwart any foreign interference.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","Philippine Defense Secretary Gilberto Teodoro declined to comment on the exercise carried out by the PLA Eastern Theater Command around the Taiwan island, and said that it is an internal matter of China. Do you have any comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. This has been wildly recognized by the international community including the Philippines.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first is that the US Department of State said in a statement that the United States is deeply concerned over the People's Liberation Army joint military drills around Taiwan, and urged China to act with restraint. The US Department of Defense spokesperson said that the US is closely monitoring the drills and is concerned about this. What's your comment on this? The second question is…","On your first question, Taiwan is part of China and how to resolve the Taiwan question is a matter for over 1.4 billion Chinese people. The US side is in no position to point fingers at China. The fundamental approach to easing tension in the Taiwan Strait is to stop any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and external interference. National reunification is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The PLA will speak with actions and always be the vanguard in fighting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and pursuing national reunification.\nOn your second question, we have released official information on this and I'd refer you to the China Coast Guard for more details. Just now you asked what message it sends. I think the message is pretty clear, that is, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first is that according to Japanese media reports, 20 field officers from China visited Japan in the second half of May. Some analysts said that it was the first PLA officers delegation to Japan since 2019. Could you confirm this? The second is that will the CCG conduct regular patrols and law enforcement operations in the waters east of the Taiwan island?","On your first question. The PLA sent its 13th delegation of junior and mid-level officers to Japan from May 14th to20th at the invitation of the Sasakawa Peace Foundation. During the visit, the delegation went to the Japanese Ministry of Defense and the National Institute for Defense Studies, and had exchanges and discussions there. They also visited the Medical Service School of the Ground Self-Defense Force, the Komaki Air Base of the Air Self-Defense Force and the Maizuru Naval Base of the Maritime Self-Defense Force. We are willing to continue to work with the Japanese side to enhance mutual understanding, build up consensus and manage differences, so as to promote defense relations between the two countries.\nRegarding the second question, I'd refer you to the CCG for more details. In principle, we will make independent decisions based on the development of the situation.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers recent media queries concerning the military on the afternoon of May 30, 2024. (Photo/mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-05-30","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. First, just now you mentioned that the inaugural speech made by Lai Ching-te is a confession of his attempts for \"Taiwan independence\", and recently, the PLA carried out military exercises around the Taiwan island. You also said that Taiwan independence means war and division brings no peace, and reiterated the PLA's position of fighting against \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and pursuing…","As for your first question, we are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with greatest sincerity and utmost efforts, but we make no promise to renounce the use of force. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces are the biggest real threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait. As long as they exist, the Taiwan Strait will not be stable. The PLA has the confidence and capability to safeguard our sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity.\nOn your second question, why do we need to communicate with the US beforehand? The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. We ask the US side to stop its official exchanges and military contacts with Taiwan, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and take concrete actions to create a favorable atmosphere for exchanges between the two militaries.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers recent media queries concerning the military on the afternoon of May 30, 2024. (Photo/mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-05-31","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","I'd like to follow up with a question about Trump. Trump recently mentioned the Taiwan issue at a campaign rally. What is your comment on this? Is China worried about Trump being elected the next US president?","The election is an internal affair of the United States, and I will not comment on election-related remarks.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463230.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-03","Mao Ning","A reporter from the Dutch Broadcasting Association asked","Last week, a Dutch naval vessel transited the South China Sea and then the Taiwan Strait as part of a larger freedom of navigation exercise in the region. Is China aware of this? Did Chinese naval vessels monitor the vessel? What is China's view on these transits?","I suggest you contact the relevant Chinese authorities for specific details. I would like to point out that China has always respected the navigation rights enjoyed by all countries in accordance with international law, but firmly opposes using freedom of navigation as a pretext to harm China's sovereignty and security. The Asia-Pacific region is a high ground for peace and development. We hope that countries outside the region will do more to maintain regional peace and stability, and refrain from provocations and creating trouble for regional peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463231.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-03","Mao Ning","Shanghai Dragon TV reporter","On June 2, the US, Japan, and South Korea held a trilateral defense ministers' meeting in Singapore and issued a joint statement, specifically criticizing China, strongly opposing any attempt to unilaterally change the status quo in the Indo-Pacific, reiterating the importance of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, calling for a peaceful resolution to cross-strait issues, opposing illegal maritime…","We have noted the situation you mentioned. The US, Japan, and South Korea are using the trilateral defense ministers' meeting and vice foreign ministers' dialogue to advance their so-called \"Indo-Pacific Strategy,\" making unwarranted comments on the Taiwan issue and grossly interfering in China's internal affairs. They are also launching malicious attacks and smears against China on maritime issues, deliberately trying to sow discord between China and its neighboring countries. This seriously violates the basic norms of international relations, and China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition.\nFirst, China firmly opposes the manipulation of bloc politics, any words or actions that provoke or exacerbate conflicts or harm the strategic security and interests of other countries, and resolutely opposes the formation of closed and exclusive \"small circles\" in the Asia-Pacific region. The US should put its statement that it \"does not seek to strengthen alliances against China\" into practice, and should not pursue its own interests at the expense of the strategic security interests of other countries and the well-being of the people of the Asia-Pacific region.\nSecond, the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. Currently, the greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait is separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. If relevant countries truly care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and genuinely value international security and prosperity, they should adhere to the one-China principle, unequivocally oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" and support China's national reunification.\nThird, China is unwavering in its commitment to safeguarding its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and insists on properly handling bilateral maritime issues through dialogue and consultation with the directly involved countries. At the same time, China firmly opposes interference and escalation of tensions by countries outside the region. In recent years, the United States has repeatedly encouraged and supported certain countries to engage in provocative and infringing acts against China at sea. It has also rallied its allies to frequently conduct military exercises and close-in reconnaissance in waters surrounding China, including the South China Sea, flexing its military muscle and exacerbating regional tensions. This has become the greatest threat and challenge to regional peace and stability.\nFourth, China's basic position on the Korean Peninsula issue remains consistent. We have always believed that maintaining peace and stability on the peninsula and promoting a political solution to the peninsula issue are in the common interest of all parties. Military deterrence and sanctions will only exacerbate tensions and escalate conflicts. We urge relevant parties to exercise caution in their words and actions and not to add fuel to the already complex and severe situation on the peninsula. China will continue to handle peninsula affairs based on the merits of the matter and its own position.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463231.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-04","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The Pacific island nation of Palau recently suffered a cyberattack, which Palau claims was carried out by Chinese hackers. Taiwan condemned the attack and expressed its support for Palau. What is China's comment on this?","I am not aware of the specific situation you mentioned. As a matter of principle, China has always firmly opposed and combated all forms of cyberattacks in accordance with the law. Taiwan is part of China, and we hope that relevant countries will recognize the international situation as soon as possible and make choices that are in line with their own long-term interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463232.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-05","Mao Ning","TASS reporter","In an interview with Time magazine, US President Biden stated that he would not rule out the possibility of US military intervention should a military conflict break out across the Taiwan Strait. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. No amount of pressure or threats can shake the Chinese government and people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The true status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves. We urge the US to recognize the nature and ambitions of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, uphold its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop arming Taiwan, and stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any way.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463233.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-06","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","Taiwan's \"President\" Lai Ching-te congratulated Indian leader Modi on his election victory, and Modi expressed his expectation to establish closer relations with Taiwan. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","First of all, there is no \"president\" in Taiwan. Regarding the question you raised, China has consistently and firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and the Taiwan authorities. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The one-China principle is a universally recognized basic norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. India has a serious political commitment to this and should recognize, be vigilant against, and resist the political schemes of the Taiwan authorities. China has lodged representations with India.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463234.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-07","Mao Ning","Al Jazeera reporter","According to a statement released by the U.S. government, the U.S. State Department has approved the sale of F-16 fighter jet parts and related services to Taiwan, with an estimated price of $80 million. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The United States' arms sales to Taiwan seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué. This severely infringes upon China's sovereignty and security interests, seriously damages Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nFacts have repeatedly proven that the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and the greatest disruption to the status quo, lies in the separatist activities of the \"Taiwan independence\" forces and the indulgence and support they receive from external forces led by the United States. \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are irreconcilable. The DPP authorities' attempt to \"seek independence through force,\" and the United States' insistence on \"aiding independence through force,\" are going against the tide of history and will only exacerbate tensions across the Taiwan Strait, inevitably leading to their failure.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, cease arms sales to Taiwan and US-Taiwan military contacts, stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait, stop jeopardizing peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and refrain from going further down the wrong and dangerous path. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463235.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-12","Lin Jian","Oriental Satellite TV reporter","Recently, Japanese scholars Seiya Matsuno and Shigeo Nasu donated a large amount of historical materials on germ warfare to the Yiwu City Archives and the Historical Records of Japanese Invading Bacteriological Warfare (Yiwu) Exhibition Hall, with the message that \"Japan and China are friendly and there will be no more war between Japan and China.\" What is China’s comment on this?","During World War II, the Japanese invaders blatantly violated international law, launched heinous germ warfare against the Chinese people, conducted inhumane human experiments, and committed heinous crimes against humanity. The relevant historical data you mentioned once again show that the fact that Japanese militarism launched germ warfare is irrefutable and cannot be denied or denied.\nWe appreciate the courage of insightful people in Japan to expose and face the historical truth. Japan should face up to and deeply reflect on its history of militaristic aggression, learn from history, eliminate its legacy, and avoid repeating the same mistakes.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463237.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-06-14","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","It’s reported that Lai Ching-te recently visited troops of the Hai Feng Shore-based Anti-ship Missile Group in eastern Taiwan, took pictures with Hsiung Feng III missile vehicle and said that land forces would be used to counter PLA offenses from the sea. Head of Taiwan’s military authorities said that troops in Taiwan would “exercise the right to self-defense” in the event PLA assets enter Taiwan’s…","Taiwan is part of China. How is it possible for Taiwan to have the so-called “right to self-defense”? The DPP authorities led by Lai Ching-te deliberately staged a political show to embolden itself, but such seemingly strong moves only reveal its inward weakness . The PLA remains a strong force that will take resolute countermeasures against any provocations pushing for “Taiwan independence”. The attempt of “Taiwan independence” separatist forces to resist the PLA is no different from moths flying into the fire. The more aggressive they are, the faster they will end up in self-destruction.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-06-17","Lin Jian","China Daily reporter","The G7 summit issued a communiqué, once again hyping up issues related to China, making unwarranted comments on the Taiwan Strait situation, and making irresponsible remarks on issues such as the East China Sea, the South China Sea, Hong Kong, Xinjiang, and Tibet, while also hyping up the so-called \"overcapacity\" in China. What is China's comment on this?","The G7 summit communiqué once again manipulated issues related to China, slandered and attacked China, and rehashed old clichés that have no factual basis, no legal basis, and no moral basis whatsoever. It is full of arrogance, prejudice and lies.\nThe G7 does not represent the international community. These seven countries comprise only 10% of the global population, their share of the global economy is declining year by year, and their combined contribution to world economic growth is less than that of China. Furthermore, their total economic output, measured by purchasing power parity, has been surpassed by the BRICS countries. The G7 has long since deviated from its original purpose of \"coordinating and stabilizing the international economic environment,\" increasingly becoming a political tool for maintaining US and Western hegemony. It places its so-called \"international rules and regulations\" above the purposes and principles of the UN Charter and international law, thus losing its global representation and international credibility.\nThe G7 has gone against the trend of peaceful development. While claiming to uphold world peace, the G7 insists on drawing lines based on ideology and values, vigorously promoting the false narrative of \"democracy versus authoritarianism,\" instigating confrontation within its own cliques, fanning the flames of regional conflicts, shifting blame, sending warships and military aircraft to the Asia-Pacific region to create tension, and repeatedly \"arming\" Taiwan, threatening peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. These erroneous actions that undermine international order and endanger peace and security are increasingly being condemned by international forces of justice.\nThe G7 has strayed from the right path of cooperation and mutual benefit. In recent years, the United States has repeatedly overgeneralized the concept of national security, abused export control measures, imposed unilateral sanctions, intensified its suppression of Chinese companies, and encouraged its allies to replicate these erroneous practices. This seriously violates the principles of market economy and fair competition, and undermines the international economic and trade order. The G7's hype about China's so-called \"overcapacity\" completely deviates from objective facts and economic laws, creating an excuse for protectionism and undermining global efforts to promote green and low-carbon transformation and address climate change. The G7 is the real \"coercor\" that politicizes and weaponizes economic and trade relations, running counter to the trend of deeply intertwined interests among countries in the era of globalization, and will ultimately only shoot itself in the foot.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463240.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-19","Lin Jian","Yonhap News Agency reporter","Yesterday, the ROK-China Diplomatic and Security Dialogue was held in Seoul. According to a press release from the ROK Ministry of Foreign Affairs, at this meeting, China stated that its policy on the Korean Peninsula issue remains unchanged and that it is willing to continue playing a constructive role in resolving the issue. In addition, China also met with ROK Foreign Minister Cho Tae-yeol, expressing its hope…","On June 18, 2024, Vice Foreign Minister Sun Weidong and Zhang Baoqun, Deputy Director of the Office of International Military Cooperation of the Central Military Commission, co-chaired the first China-South Korea Vice-Ministerial Level 2+2 Dialogue on Diplomacy and Security with South Korean First Vice Foreign Minister Kim Hong-kyun and Ministry of National Defense International Policy Officer Lee Seung-beom in Seoul. Both sides introduced their respective diplomatic and security policies and exchanged frank and in-depth views on China-South Korea relations and international and regional issues of common concern. On the same day, Vice Foreign Minister Sun Weidong and his delegation also met with South Korean Foreign Minister Cho Tae-yeol.\nBoth sides reaffirmed their commitment to developing good-neighborly friendship and mutually beneficial cooperation between China and South Korea, and agreed to actively conduct dialogue and exchanges at all levels and in all fields. They agreed to strengthen communication through mechanisms such as the high-level strategic dialogue between diplomatic departments, the 2+2 diplomatic and security dialogue, and the 1.5-track dialogue, to enhance political mutual trust, promote pragmatic cooperation, and advance the healthy and stable development of the China-South Korea strategic cooperative partnership. Both sides agreed to strengthen exchanges at the local and youth levels to continuously improve the friendly feelings between the two peoples. China expressed its solemn position on issues concerning Taiwan and other matters involving China's core interests and major concerns, and demanded that South Korea handle them properly. South Korea reiterated that its position of respecting the one-China principle remains unchanged.\nChina points out that it advocates a common, comprehensive, cooperative, and sustainable security concept, practices genuine multilateralism, insists on respecting the legitimate security concerns of all countries, promotes global security cooperation through dialogue and consultation, and opposes hegemonism, unilateralism, and power politics. China and South Korea are both beneficiaries of economic globalization and should jointly maintain the stability and smooth flow of global supply chains, resist the politicization and securitization of economic issues, and oppose all forms of trade protectionism and \"building walls and barriers.\"\nBoth sides elaborated on their positions and views on the Korean Peninsula issue. China emphasized that maintaining peace and stability on the peninsula is in the common interest of all parties, including China and South Korea. The trajectory and crux of the situation on the peninsula are clear; the urgent task is to de-escalate the situation, avoid escalating confrontation, and adhere to the general direction of a political solution. China has always determined its position based on the merits of the matter itself and will continue to play a constructive role in peninsula affairs in its own way.\nThe South Korean side mentioned exchanges and cooperation between North Korea and Russia. China stated that North Korea and Russia, as friendly neighbors, have a normal need for exchanges, cooperation, and the development of relations, and that relevant high-level exchanges are bilateral arrangements between the two sovereign states. The first vice-ministerial-level diplomatic and security dialogue between China and South Korea was an arrangement agreed upon long ago to meet the needs of bilateral relations and is not specifically related to exchanges with other countries.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463242.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-20","Lin Jian","China News Service reporter","It has been reported that the U.S. Defense Security Cooperation Agency issued a statement saying that the U.S. State Department has approved the sale of two drones, the Switchblade and Altius-600, along with related components and training services, to Taiwan, totaling approximately $360 million. What is China's comment on this?","The United States, disregarding China's consistent opposition and solemn representations, has once again sold weapons to Taiwan, which seriously violates the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué. This severely infringes upon China's sovereignty and security interests, seriously damages Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China strongly condemns and firmly opposes this.\nThe US's repeated arms sales to Taiwan embolden and embolden the DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance and their provocations against the one-China principle. This fact once again proves that the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and the greatest disruption to the status quo, lies in the separatist activities of the \"Taiwan independence\" forces and the indulgence and support of external forces led by the US. It must be pointed out that the DPP authorities' attempt to \"seek independence through force,\" and the US's insistence on \"aiding independence through force,\" will inevitably backfire, lead to their own downfall, and end in failure.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. No one should underestimate China's firm will and strong capability to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China urges the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, rescind its erroneous decision to sell arms to Taiwan, cease the dangerous trend of arming Taiwan, stop its erroneous actions of condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" forces, and stop undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463243.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-21","Lin Jian","Bloomberg","According to reports, the United States and China held informal \"nuclear negotiations\" in March. During the talks, Chinese representatives informed the United States that they would not make nuclear threats to Taiwan. Can you confirm? Is this a track two conversation? Can you give more details?","I will not comment on the status of the Track II dialogue between China and the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463244.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-24","Mao Ning","CCTV-4 reporter","It has been reported that Taiwan's foreign affairs department issued a statement on June 20, making unwarranted comments on the recent Joint Statement between China and Malaysia on Deepening and Upgrading the Comprehensive Strategic Partnership and Building a China-Malaysia Community with a Shared Future, specifically regarding the One-China policy, the statement that Taiwan is an inseparable part of the…","The one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. It is the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with all countries in the world, including Malaysia. In the 1974 Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and Malaysia, the Malaysian government explicitly recognized the Chinese government's position that Taiwan is an inseparable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. Malaysia's reaffirmation of this position in recent high-level exchanges with China fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is the will of the people and the righteous cause. The Taiwan authorities' advocacy of the so-called \"two-state theory\" further exposes their true colors of \"Taiwan independence,\" and will only be met with resistance and rejection. It cannot shake the fundamental framework of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463245.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-25","Mao Ning","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","On June 24, a spokesperson for the U.S. State Department condemned China's issuance of the \"Opinions on Legally Punishing Crimes of Separatist Elements and Inciting Separatism,\" claiming that this move by China escalated the situation and undermined stability, and demanded that China exercise restraint and refrain from unilaterally changing the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's…","We express our strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to the relevant remarks made by the US side. Safeguarding national unity and territorial integrity is the sacred right of every sovereign state. Using criminal justice means to punish criminals who seek to split the country and safeguard national core interests is a common practice in countries around the world. No external force has the right to make irresponsible remarks on this matter. Pursuing the criminal responsibility of die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" elements who seek to split the country and undermine national unity in accordance with the law is an inevitable requirement of enforcing the law and holding violators accountable. It is a necessary measure to safeguard national sovereignty, unity, and territorial integrity, and a powerful guarantee for upholding the one-China principle and maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nThe true status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of Chinese territory. \"Taiwan independence\" is irreconcilable with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The biggest challenges to the current situation in the Taiwan Strait come from \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and interference and sabotage by external forces. If the US truly wants to safeguard regional peace and stability, it should earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, uphold its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any way.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463246.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","Commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command said that the US military has a plan called \"hellscape\" to turn the Taiwan Strait into an unmanned hell using a swarm of unmanned aerial vehicles, surface vessels and underwater systems in response to \"attacks from the Chinese mainland\". The US Naval News website also detailed the plan recently. What's your comment on this?","Those who clamor for turning others' homeland into hell should get ready for burning in hell themselves. In order to contain China with Taiwan, some individuals in the US are making crazy and inhumane plans to turn the Taiwan Strait into a hell. This once again shows that the separatists who are delusional about using US support for \"Taiwan independence\" will ultimately be abandoned as a useless pawn.\nTaiwan belongs to China and China brooks no division. The PLA is able to fight and win in thwarting external interference and safeguarding our national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Threats and intimidation never work on us.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers reporters' questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of June 27, 2024. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Sun Yue)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","At the centennial celebrations for the Whampoa Military Academy in Taiwan, Lai Ching-te, leader of the Taiwan region, claimed that he does not accept the idea of \"the first battle is the final battle\", and the biggest challenge for Taiwan's troops is the Chinese mainland aiming for \"Taiwan's annexation and the elimination of the Republic of China\". He also touted on many occasions absurd narratives in support of…","The Whampoa Military Academy is a historical memory in the heart of all Chinese people and a witness to the arduous journey of the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. Guided by the patriotic and revolutionary Whampoa Spirit, graduates of the academy have a glorious tradition of dedicating themselves to patriotism and revolution, and are an important force for national reunification and rejuvenation. Lai Ching-te and his like who attempt to falsify history and split our nation will surely be condemned by history and punished by law.\nThere is but one China in the world and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle is a prevailing consensus in the international community. No matter how the DPP authorities try to distort or deny it, this basic fact will not change, nor will the family bonds between compatriots on the two sides of the Taiwan Strait be severed. It needs to be emphasized that each time \"Taiwan independence\" separatists make provocations, they will be responded with stronger countermeasures from the PLA. These responses will pave the way for the resolution of the Taiwan question. For the PLA, defeating military elements of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces is like shooting fish in a barrel.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","It's reported that Taiwan's troops will conduct the live-fire segment of the Han Kuang-40 exercise from July 22nd to 26th. The defense authorities of Taiwan said that this year's Han Kuang-40 exercise will not be as \"spectacular\" as previous ones because the component of firepower demonstration for leaders of the Taiwan region is canceled and more focus will be given to simulating real war. A senior official of…","The DPP authorities stages the so-called \"Han Kuang exercise\" every year, but no matter how many shows it makes, the destiny of destruction for \"Taiwan independence\" separatists will not change.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first one is that the Philippine military said that vessels of the China Coast Guard rammed Philippine ships on a resupply mission to Ren'ai Jiao, which left a Filipino sailor injured. Officials of the US Department of State and Department of Defense accused the Chinese side of denying the Philippines from executing resupply missions and said that the US commitment to the Mutual Defense…","Nansha Qundao including Ren'ai Jiao is China's inherent territory, which is fully backed by historical and jurisprudential basis. The Philippine side recently broke its promises and sent ships into waters adjacent to Ren'ai Jiao multiple times to transport construction materials, weapons and ammunitions to its illegally grounded warship. This is the direct reason of an escalation of the situation. In particular, on June 17th, the Philippine side deliberately rammed Chinese vessels in a dangerous way and threw rocks at Chinese personnel. Relevant behaviors violate international law, endanger crews and ships of the two sides and undermine regional peace and stability. Facing infringements and provocation made by the Philippine side, the Chinese side has every reason to take law enforcement measures, which is completely legitimate, lawful and professional.\nI want to emphasize that the Ren'ai Jiao issue has nothing to do with the US. It's very dangerous and extremely irresponsible for the US to encourage and support the Philippines in infringements and provocative actions. And it's no use to threaten the Chinese side with the US-Philippine Mutual Defense Treaty.\nRegarding the remarks made by the former US military official about \"the Philippines is a tool\", I think the international community will have a fair judgment on this. Looking back at history, the Saigon moment and the Fall of Kabul both remind me of a saying by the late Henry Kissinger, and here I quote, \"Being America's enemy may be dangerous, but being America's friend is fatal.\"\nOn your second question, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, resolving the Taiwan question is an internal affair for over 1.4 billion Chinese people, which brooks no foreign interference. The US attempts to intimidate China with its military exercises, which is an impossible mission.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers reporters' questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of June 27, 2024. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Zhang Zhicheng)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","According to reports, the Japanese government has released a draft plan to evacuate residents of Okinawa prefecture and Sakishima islands to Kyushu and Yamaguchi prefectures. Some analysts believe that Japan's evacuation plan aims to cope with the so-called \"Taiwan contingency\". Not long ago, Chinese Ambassador to Japan said that if Japan ties itself onto the chariot of splitting China, its people will be led…","Taiwan is China's Taiwan and the Taiwan question has nothing to do with Japan. The Taiwan question is at the core of China's core interests. It bears on the political foundation of China-Japan bilateral relations and is the red line that must not be crossed. The Chinese side opposes the Japanese side playing up regional tensions under the excuse of the so-called \"Taiwan contingency\". The biggest threat to cross-Strait peace is the separatist activities for \"Taiwan independence\" and connivance and support for such moves from external forces. Japan, in particular, as a country who colonized Taiwan for a long time and committed countless atrocities against the Chinese people, should have reflected on its history of aggression and be prudent about its words and deeds. We urge the Japanese side to earnestly abide by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments it has made and stop using the Taiwan question to provoke confrontation. I want to emphasize that the one-China principle is a prevailing consensus in the international community and a basic norm governing international relations. More than 1.4 billion Chinese people will take resolute and strong actions against any individual or force that attempts to interfere in China's internal affairs or hinder China's reunification.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","Recently, the defense chiefs of China and the US had an in-person meeting on the sidelines of the Shangri-La Dialogue. What's your comment on the current China-US military-to-military relations? Will the two sides have more exchanges in the future?","Following the important consensus reached by Chinese and US heads of state last November, the two militaries have steadily resumed dialogues and consultation on the basis of equality and respect and achieved some positive and tangible results. On the margins of this year's Shangri-La Dialogue (SLD), China's Defense Minister and US Secretary of Defense met in person and they had a positive, substantive and constructive discussion on topics including the state-to-state and military-to-military relations, the Taiwan question and the South China Sea issue. A delegation from the PLA National Defense University (NDU) arrived in Washington D.C. on June 25th for the Strategic Dialogue with its US counterpart. The China-US military relationship is stabilizing from deterioration. The momentum does not come by easily, thus both sides should cherish it.\nI want to emphasize that developing China-US military-to-military relations requires both sides to value peace, prioritize stability and uphold credibility. We hope the US side adopt a right perception of China, respect China's sovereignty, security and development interests and work with us in the same direction to pursue a stable and sound relationship.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers reporters' questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of June 27, 2024. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Lyu Zhe)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-06-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","The PLA recently has conducted many exercises and training in waters around the Taiwan island, and many media outlets refer to them as \"encircling Taiwan from four sides or three sides\". Recently, Taiwan's so-called \"Chief of the General Staff\" said at a legislative hearing that these exercises held by the PLA may turn into wars in the future, and troops of Taiwan need to change their mindsets about warfare to be…","I suggest the DPP authorities to get used to encircling activities held by the PLA. I need to point out that the PLA's relevant actions and operations are targeted at separatist activities held by the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, they are by no means targeted at our compatriots in Taiwan. I want to say that as long as there is no attempt to push for \"Taiwan independence\", there is no need to be anxious.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-06-28","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The U.S. State Department announced that Deputy Secretary of State Campbell spoke by phone with Chinese Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu yesterday. Campbell stated that the U.S. defense commitment to the Philippines is unwavering and expressed serious concern about China's actions in the South China Sea. What were the main topics of discussion during the call, Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu?","On June 27, Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu spoke by phone with U.S. Deputy Secretary of State Kurt Campbell. The two sides exchanged frank and in-depth views on current China-U.S. relations and issues of common concern. Ma Zhaoxu focused on clarifying China's solemn position on issues involving Taiwan, Tibet, the South China Sea, and Ukraine, demanding that the U.S. honor President Biden's commitments to the \"four no's and one no's\" and genuinely respect China's sovereignty, security, and development interests, playing a positive role in the stable development of China-U.S. relations rather than the opposite.\nMa Zhaoxu emphasized that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in Sino-US relations. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" will ultimately backfire. The US should fully recognize the DPP authorities' \"Taiwan independence\" nature and its serious harm to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, abide by the three Sino-US joint communiqués, stop arming Taiwan, and put its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence\" into practice. The Tibet issue concerns China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. The US should stop supporting \"Tibetan independence\" forces in any form and stop interfering in China's internal affairs under the pretext of the Tibet issue. The root cause of the current tension at Ren'ai Reef is the Philippines' reneging on the consensus reached with China, challenging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and insisting on transporting large quantities of building materials to its illegally grounded warship in an attempt to permanently occupy Ren'ai Reef. The US should stop condoning and supporting the Philippines' provocations and take concrete actions to safeguard peace and stability in the South China Sea. China's position on the Ukraine issue is objective and fair. The US should stop its unfounded smears and blame-shifting against China, and stop obstructing normal economic and trade exchanges between China and Russia. China firmly opposes the US's abuse of illegal unilateral sanctions and long-arm jurisdiction, and will resolutely safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese entities and individuals.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463249.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-06-28","Mao Ning","Phoenix TV reporter","It has been reported that the U.S. State Department spokesperson recently issued a statement expressing concern about the Chinese military's exercises around Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. The United States has no right to make irresponsible remarks. China's military exercises around Taiwan are a resolute punishment for the provocations by the Taiwan leader's \"May 20\" speech seeking \"independence,\" a stern warning to external forces that condone and support \"Taiwan independence\" and interfere in China's internal affairs, and a just act to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. They are fully in line with international law and international practice and are entirely legitimate and necessary.\nThe leader of Taiwan, upon taking office, couldn't wait to reveal his true colors as a \"Taiwan independence\" advocate. His \"May 20th\" speech was a complete \"Taiwan independence confession,\" fully exposing his nature as a \"Taiwan independence worker.\" Facts have once again proven that the most dangerous change to the status quo across the Taiwan Strait and the most significant damage to peace in the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces led by the United States.\nThe US, disregarding China's firm opposition, made a mistake by sending a delegation to the \"May 20 Inauguration Ceremony\" and by issuing a statement of congratulations to the US Secretary of State. This sent a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and its unfounded accusations against China's legitimate and reasonable measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity only compounded the error. We urge the US to recognize the nature and ambitions of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, to recognize the serious harm and enormous risks they bring to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and to China-US relations, to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, to fulfill the commitments made by US leaders on the Taiwan issue, and to stop supporting and encouraging the \"Taiwan independence\" forces in any way.\nChina's resolve to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering, as is its determination to oppose external interference in China's internal affairs. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" will only lead to self-destruction. Any erroneous attempt to challenge the one-China principle will end in failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463249.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-03","Mao Ning","","Reuters\nReporter: Taiwan said that China Coast Guard\nyesterday\nThere were three Indonesians on the Taiwanese fishing boat seized in Kinmen. Could the spokesperson give more details?\n?","I am not aware of the relevant situation. I suggest you ask the Chinese competent authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463252.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-03","Mao Ning","","AFP\nReporter:\nLet me follow up on the issue of Taiwanese fishing boats mentioned just now. Taiwan said that five crew members, including the fishing boat and three Indonesians on board, were detained. We noticed that the Chinese Coast Guard did not mention the relevant situation in its statement. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs confirm that the ship and its personnel were seized and taken to a mainland…","I don’t know the relevant situation yet. I suggest you check with the Chinese competent authorities.\n***********************************************","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463252.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-11","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" stated today that it detected 66 Chinese military aircraft around the island within 24 hours, the highest number in recent years. Is this related to the recent NATO summit?","Regarding the questions you mentioned, I suggest you inquire with the relevant authorities. I want to point out here that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and there is no such thing as a \"Ministry of National Defense.\" The Chinese people's determination and will to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity are unwavering.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463257.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-12","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency reporter","On the 11th, NATO Secretary General Jens Stoltenberg reiterated at the closing press conference of the NATO summit that NATO defines China as a \"decisive supporter\" of Russia's war in Ukraine, stating that the joint military exercises between China and Belarus are part of their joint support for the war. He also said that China is taking a more assertive stance in Hong Kong and the South China Sea, threatening…","China strongly condemns the NATO Secretary General's extremely irresponsible and provocative remarks against China. These remarks are rife with Cold War mentality and ideological bias, distort the truth, viciously attack China's system, blatantly interfere in China's internal affairs, maliciously misrepresent China's domestic and foreign policies, shift blame and mislead the international community on the Ukraine issue, and make unwarranted comments on China's normal military buildup and relations with relevant countries. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nChina has previously clearly expressed its position on the Ukraine issue and the NATO summit. It must be emphasized here that, for a long time, the NATO Secretary General has disregarded facts and repeated representations to China, repeatedly using various occasions to smear and attack China, exaggerating the \"China threat theory,\" inciting anti-China sentiment, and blatantly cooperating with certain forces to suppress and contain China. Such clumsy performances cannot but arouse the world's vigilance and fully demonstrate the risks and challenges that NATO, as a remnant of the Cold War, a product of bloc confrontation and group politics, will bring to world peace and stability.\nChina advises certain Western politicians whose political careers are nearing their end not to attempt to leave behind a legacy by fanning the flames, provoking trouble, and scapegoating others. China will firmly follow the path of peaceful development, injecting more stability and positive energy into world peace and stability through its own development and international cooperation, while resolutely safeguarding its own sovereignty, security, and development interests. NATO's attempt to portray China as a \"hypothetical enemy\" will ultimately only backfire.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463258.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-07-12","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","It's reported that Taiwan's military sent letters to local temples and churches asking for permission to use them as ammunition depots in war time, which sparked backlashes in some cities and counties. What's your comment on this?","We have noted relevant reports. The DPP authorities are obstinate in seeking \"Taiwan Independence\" by force. Their attempts to use religious sites in wartime and turn local residents into human shields are appalling. National reunification is the right way forward, while \"Taiwan Independence\" only leads to a dead end. Separatists for \"Taiwan Independence\" will be caught no matter where they hide, and any scheme to resist reunification by force will fail.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-07-15","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","On July 12, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs announced on its website the decision to take countermeasures against six U.S. defense contractors and five senior executives. What further comments does the spokesperson have?","The United States' arms sales to Taiwan seriously violate the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, severely interfere in China's internal affairs, and seriously undermine China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China has taken countermeasures in accordance with the law against the main contractors and senior managers of the recent US arms sales to Taiwan, as well as military industrial enterprises that have participated in US arms sales to Taiwan and visited Taiwan to attend the \"Taiwan-US Defense Industry Forum\" in recent years.\nI want to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. No country, organization, or individual should underestimate the Chinese government and people's firm resolve, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, nor should they fantasize about crossing the line on the Taiwan issue without paying the price.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463259.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-17","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Former President Trump stated in an interview that Taiwan should pay for U.S. defense. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","I reiterate that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. China has always opposed the US using China as a pretext in the election.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463262.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-19","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","In his acceptance speech for the Republican presidential nomination today, former US President Trump stated that he would seek to restore international peace and warned of the risk of conflict in Taiwan and other parts of Asia. What is China's comment on his speech?","The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. China has always opposed the US using China as a pretext in the election.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463264.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-22","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","According to media reports, Taiwan began its annual \"Han Kuang\" military exercises today, including drills on the transfer of overseas supplies under wartime conditions. What is the spokesperson for the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","This is not a diplomatic issue. The reason for the tension in the Taiwan Strait is that the DPP authorities in Taiwan, with the connivance and support of external forces, have been constantly seeking \"independence\" and provoking. I want to emphasize that any attempt to exaggerate tensions, \"seek independence by force,\" or \"resist unification by force\" is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463265.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-23","Mao Ning","Phoenix TV reporter","It has been reported that a U.S. State Department spokesperson recently stated in response to a question that \"Taiwan has purchased billions of dollars worth of military equipment from the United States, and these arms purchases support U.S. manufacturing, industry, and technology. This is not any form of charitable aid from the United States.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Under the guise of maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, the United States is actually profiting from the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people. Taiwan is China's Taiwan, not a pawn for the United States to interfere in China's internal affairs. US arms sales to Taiwan violate the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and China firmly opposes them.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463266.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-24","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","According to sources, Foreign Minister Wang Yi held talks with Ukrainian Foreign Minister Kuleba in Guangzhou today. Can you provide details of the talks?","This morning, Foreign Minister Wang Yi held talks with Ukrainian Foreign Minister Kuleba in Guangzhou.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that China and Uzbekistan are friendly countries, and the friendship and cooperation that have been cultivated throughout their exchanges are the foundation of their relationship. The two countries established a strategic partnership more than a decade ago, respecting each other, treating each other as equals, and continuously advancing mutually beneficial cooperation. The two heads of state emphasized the need to view and plan bilateral relations from a long-term perspective, and to move China-Uzbekistan relations and bilateral cooperation forward. We should follow this principle, maintain communication and exchanges, enhance mutual trust, continue our traditional friendship, promote people-to-people friendship, and drive the healthy and stable development of China-Uzbekistan relations.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that the Third Plenary Session of the 20th CPC Central Committee has ushered in a new round of comprehensive and in-depth reforms. China's comprehensive advancement of Chinese-style modernization will bring new opportunities to people around the world. Ukraine was one of the first countries to support and participate in the Belt and Road Initiative. In recent years, China has consistently been Ukraine's largest trading partner and largest exporter of agricultural products. Bilateral trade volume showed rapid growth in the first half of this year, demonstrating the space and potential for cooperation between the two countries. Both sides should leverage their cooperation mechanisms to strengthen pragmatic cooperation in various fields. China will continue to expand its grain imports from Ukraine and jointly safeguard the smooth flow of logistics channels and international food security. He expressed gratitude to Ukraine for its assistance in evacuating Chinese citizens, especially students, at the beginning of the conflict and hoped that Ukraine would continue to take effective measures to ensure the safety of Chinese personnel and institutions in Ukraine.\nThe two foreign ministers exchanged views on the Ukraine crisis. Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that the Ukraine crisis has entered its third year, and the conflict continues with the risk of escalation and spillover. China remains firmly committed to promoting a political solution to the crisis. President Xi Jinping's \"four shoulds\" provide important guidance for this. Based on this, China and Brazil jointly issued a \"six-point consensus,\" covering the \"three principles\" of conflict norms, the \"three elements\" of a peace agreement, the \"three concerns\" of humanitarian protection, and important content such as preventing nuclear risks and ensuring the stability of supply chains. This consensus represents the greatest common ground of the international community and has received widespread support. China believes that the resolution of all conflicts must ultimately return to the negotiating table; the resolution of all disputes must be achieved through political means. Recently, both Ukraine and Russia have signaled their willingness to negotiate to varying degrees. Although the conditions and timing are not yet ripe, we support all efforts conducive to peace and are willing to continue to play a constructive role in achieving a ceasefire and resuming peace talks. China is concerned about the humanitarian situation in Ukraine and will continue to provide humanitarian material assistance to Ukraine.\nForeign Minister Kuleba stated that China is a great country. Ukraine and China have become strategic partners and important economic and trade partners. Ukraine supports China's position on the Taiwan issue and will continue to adhere to the one-China principle. Ukraine hopes to jointly implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, consolidate political mutual trust, revitalize cooperation in various fields such as trade and agriculture, and strengthen exchanges between sister cities. Ukraine highly appreciates China's positive and constructive role in promoting peace and maintaining international order. Ukraine attaches importance to China's opinions and has carefully studied the \"six-point consensus\" between China and Brazil on the political settlement of the Ukrainian crisis. Ukraine is willing and prepared to conduct dialogue and negotiations with Russia. Of course, the negotiations should be rational and substantive, aiming to achieve a just and lasting peace.\nThe two sides also exchanged views on international and regional issues of common concern. China will release a press release with further details , which you can follow.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240730_11463267.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, it’s reported that the RIMPAC-2024 exercise is taking place near Hawaii, and one of its subjects is sinking a 40,000-ton amphibious assault ship. Some analysts believe this is an act of muscle-flexing against China. Gen. Charles Brown, Chairman of the US Joint Chiefs of Staff, recently said he was “fully confident” that the US would win a war against China, should a conflict break…","We have noted relevant reports. Intimidating China with military exercises or aggressive rhetoric will never work. The PLA will never be swayed by fallacies, deterred by intimidation or cowed by pressure. We have the resolve, capabilities and means to defeat all aggressors, and safeguard our national sovereignty, security and development interests.\nOn your second question, according to the China-Russia annual military engagement plan, the two sides organized a joint strategic air patrol in relevant airspace over the Bering Sea on July 25. It was the 8th joint air patrol conducted by the two militaries since 2019. It further tested and improved coordination between the two air forces, and deepened strategic mutual trust and substantive cooperation between the two militaries. This operation does not target any third party. It is in line with relevant international law and practices, and has nothing to do with the current international and regional situations.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It’s reported by Taiwan media that optronic masts, key components for Taiwan's first homemade submarine Narwhal, have arrived and are being tested at the moment. Narwhal is expected to begin sea trials this September. What's your comment, please?","It would be suicidal for the DPP authorities to seek \"Taiwan independence\" by force. Making or buying more weapons and equipment is purely ornamental and just a waste of time and money. The Narwhal will be a \"fish caught in the net\" by the PLA sooner or later, should it be used for \"Taiwan independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the on-going live-fire component of Han Kuang-40 exercise focused on unscripted and real combat drills. Templates of rules of engagement (ROE) cards were issued for the first time to improve the \"legality and legitimacy\" for the use of force by Taiwan's troops. In addition, the subjects of the drills included the delivery of supplies from overseas. What's your comment?","The DPP authorities are using all possible means to disguise its separatist activities under the cover of \"legality and legitimacy\". Such action is just self-deceiving. The DPP authorities attempt to turn Taiwan into battlefields and use local residents as human shields, so as to seek \"Taiwan independence\" and resist reunification with force. Their attempt is completely futile and only leads to a dead end.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Lai Ching-te, leader of the Taiwan region, recently claimed that \"grey zone intrusions\" by the Chinese mainland into the Taiwan Strait and its surrounding areas are increasing day by day. Taiwan's military authorities have recently added English broadcasts to warn off military aircraft of the Chinese mainland, and released information for the first time on test firing operations by the PLA Rocket Force and the…","The DPP authorities took these sensational actions to embolden themselves. The PLA will not be deterred by any reconnaissance or harassing in our operations. Our resolve and will is unwavering in safeguarding national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to the Japanese government's latest analysis of China's military exercises conducted last year, the PLA has the capability to seize Taiwan within one week. The analysis says with joint operations, the PLA could land massive ground forces on Taiwan within a few days after imposing a maritime and air blockade around the island. What's your comment?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of Chinese territory. China will be and must be reunified. We will strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort. However, should the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces make provocations or even cross our red lines, we will have to take decisive measures. We warn the DPP authorities that soliciting foreign support leads nowhere and resisting reunification by force is a dead end. The PLA will continue to enhance combat readiness and military training, take firm actions to safeguard our national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and preserve peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-07-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported by foreign media that the Japan Coast Guard (JCG) recently conducted a joint exercise with Taiwan's Coast Guard Administration (CGA). It's said that the exercise was a response to the current situation in the South and East China Sea. What's your comment?","We are strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to Japan’s joint maritime exercise with China's Taiwan region. We urge the Japanese side to adhere to the \"one-China\" principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, correct its wrongdoing and do not support \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any form, thus prevent undermining cross-Strait peace and stability and China-Japan relations.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-07-29","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","The Inter-Parliamentary Alliance on China reported that several members of parliament scheduled to attend a meeting in Taipei received phone calls and emails from Chinese officials, indicating that the move was intended to influence the meeting. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The so-called \"alliance\" you mentioned has always maliciously hyped up issues related to China and spread lies and rumors about China, and has absolutely no credibility. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and the Taiwan authorities. We urge the relevant members of parliament to abandon their ideological biases, stop using the Taiwan issue to interfere in China's internal affairs, and do more to benefit bilateral relations instead of the opposite.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240731_11463973.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-29","Lin Jian","Shenzhen TV reporter","Foreign Minister Wang Yi recently attended a series of foreign ministers’ meetings on East Asia cooperation and paid an official visit to Laos. Can the spokesperson further introduce the relevant situation?","From July 25 to 27, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Minister of Foreign Affairs, attended Vientiane, Laos\nChina-ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting\n,\nASEAN and China, Japan and South Korea Foreign Ministers’ Meeting\n,\nEast Asia Summit Foreign Ministers' Meeting\nand\nASEAN Regional Forum Foreign Ministers’ Meeting\n, and paid an official visit to Laos. During this period, Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended\nThe first informal meeting of the foreign ministers of China, Russia and Laos\n, met successively\nIndia\n,\nRussia\n,\nJapan\n,\nUnited Kingdom\n,\nSouth Korea\n,\nEuropean Union\n,\nPhilippines\n,\nUnited States\nand representatives from more than 10 countries and international organizations. China has released information, which you can check.\nAt the China-ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting, Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that China and ASEAN are friendly neighbors who help each other, close partners who share weal and woe, and a community with a shared future that shares weal and woe. In recent years, fruitful results have been achieved in the construction of a China-ASEAN community with a shared future. Economic and trade ties between the two sides have become increasingly closer, people-to-people and cultural exchanges have rapidly recovered, connectivity has become deeper and more solid, and new impetus continues to emerge. China-ASEAN dialogue and cooperation has become the most fruitful and dynamic example of Asia-Pacific cooperation. There are four important experiences worth paying attention to: first, insisting on being kind and good neighborly; second, persisting in treating each other with sincerity; third, persisting in common development; and fourth, persisting in openness and inclusiveness. The Third Plenary Session of the 20th Central Committee of the Communist Party of China made overall arrangements for further comprehensively deepening reforms around promoting Chinese-style modernization. China will continue to firmly support ASEAN's strategic independence, support the expansion and strengthening of the ASEAN-centered regional cooperation mechanism, and build the \"Five Homes\" of China and ASEAN; China is willing to share China's opportunities with ASEAN countries and jointly promote the modernization process in Asia.\nAt the ASEAN, China, Japan and South Korea Foreign Ministers' Meeting, Foreign Minister Wang Yi said that 10+3, as one of the most mature mechanisms for regional cooperation in East Asia, has been deeply involved in practical cooperation in various fields for more than 20 years and has led regional countries in responding to challenges such as the financial crisis and the COVID-19 epidemic. China is willing to give full play to the role of the 10+3 mechanism, deepen economic integration, and promote regional connectivity; strengthen crisis response capabilities and maintain regional stability; expand cooperation in emerging areas and lead regional development; promote social and cultural exchanges, build regional consensus, and add new momentum to regional development.\nAt the 14th East Asia Summit Foreign Ministers’ Meeting, Foreign Minister Wang Yi pointed out that the East Asia Summit should grasp the right direction, enhance unity and coordination, promote long-term regional peace and prosperity, and safeguard international fairness and justice: first, jointly maintain an open and inclusive regional architecture, and be vigilant against the establishment of exclusive \"small circles\" by some countries outside the region; second, jointly abide by regional rules recognized by all parties and not Individual countries can be allowed to place unilateral self-interested \"rules\" above the international laws and regional rules recognized by all parties. The third is to jointly enhance the new driving force of interconnection. \"Decoupling and breaking links\" and \"small courtyards and high walls\" will only lead to the \"fragmentation\" of the regional economy. The fourth is to jointly stimulate the effectiveness and vitality of the East Asia Summit and promote the balanced rotation of the \"two wheels\" of political security and economic development.\nAt the 31st ASEAN Regional Forum Foreign Ministers' Meeting, Foreign Minister Wang Yi put forward four suggestions to deal with current challenges: First, adhere to the vision of peace and follow the path of common, comprehensive, cooperative, and sustainable security; second, adhere to the ASEAN way and insist on increasing mutual trust through dialogue and promoting security through cooperation; third, consolidate the foundation of cooperation and inject more impetus into confidence-building measures and preventive diplomacy; fourth, persist in dialogue and consultation. No matter how complex the issue is, we must persist in dialogue and consultation, and no matter how intense the conflict, we must not give up on political settlement.\nDuring his visit to Laos, Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with\nGeneral Secretary of the Lao People's Revolutionary Party and President Thongloun Sisoulith\n,\nPrime Minister Song Sai\n, and with\nLao Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Salomxay\ntalks. Foreign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that China and Laos have formed an unbreakable community with a shared future. China will continue to be Laos' most reliable friend and most trustworthy partner, and is willing to share its reform and development experience with Laos in a timely manner, jointly improve its governance capabilities, and jointly advance the cause of socialism; it is willing to deepen all-round cooperation with Laos and create an engine to boost Laos' economic development; it supports Laos in serving as the rotating chair of ASEAN and playing a greater role in international and regional affairs.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi also discussed the Taiwan issue,\nSouth China Sea issue\nClarify China's solemn position and emphasize that the Taiwan issue is 100% China's internal affairs and no external force has the right to interfere. If we want to truly maintain peace across the Taiwan Strait, we should resolutely oppose all \"Taiwan independence\" activities. China has recently reached a temporary arrangement with the Philippines on the issue of supplying humanitarian supplies to Ren'ai Reef. The Philippines must fulfill its commitments and not change its orders day and night, renege on its promises, and repeatedly backslidden or create extraneous problems. Otherwise, China will respond resolutely. Foreign Minister Wang Yi also reiterated China's principled position on the Palestinian issue and the Ukraine crisis, stressing that China will continue to play a constructive role in ceasefires and political settlements.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240731_11463973.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-30","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","The Trans-Parliamentary Alliance on China Policy said that several parliamentarians planning to attend the meeting in Taipei received calls and emails from Chinese officials, saying that the move was intended to influence the meeting. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","The so-called \"alliance\" you mentioned has always been maliciously hyping up China-related issues and spreading lies and rumors about China. It has no credibility at all. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs and does not allow for any interference from external forces. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with the Taiwan authorities. We advise relevant members of Congress to abandon ideological prejudice, stop using the Taiwan issue to interfere in China's internal affairs, and do more things that are beneficial to bilateral relations rather than the opposite.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240731_11463972.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-30","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","I have a question about the \"Transnational Inter-Parliamentary Alliance on China Policy\". Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te said at the meeting that \"China's threat to any country is a threat to the world\" and called on \"democratic governments around the world\" to unite to fight \"authoritarian expansion.\" What is China’s response to this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China’s internal affair and does not allow for any interference from external forces. As I just said, the so-called \"alliance\" you mentioned is hyping up China-related issues and spreading lies and rumors about China. It has no credibility at all.\nI would like to stress again that \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. The separatist behavior of \"Taiwan independence\" constitutes the most serious challenge to the international order, the most dangerous change to the status quo of the Taiwan Strait in which both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and the most significant damage to peace in the Taiwan Strait. Lai Qingde's authorities are trying to use force to seek independence. No matter how many weapons you buy, you cannot buy security. You will only be used as a cash machine by the country that sells the weapons. No matter how much we \"strengthen national defense\" and hype up the false narrative of \"democracy versus authoritarianism,\" they cannot stop the historical trend that China will eventually be reunified and will inevitably be reunified.\nThe one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people and the trend of the times. The Lai Qingde authorities are going against the current, seeking \"independence\" and provocation, and \"rejecting reunification with force\", which is doomed to a dead end.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240731_11463972.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-30","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","You just said that Lai Qingde \"used force to seek independence.\" Can you explain when he \"used force to seek independence\"?","I mentioned just now that the Lai Qingde authorities have been engaged in \"seeking independence through force.\" However, no matter how many weapons they buy, they will not bring security. No matter how much they strengthen the so-called \"national defense power,\" they cannot stop the historical trend of China's eventual and inevitable reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202407/t20240731_11463972.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-07-31","Lin Jian","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","It has been reported that Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te stated at the Inter-Parliamentary Alliance meeting on China policy on the 30th that mainland China has misinterpreted UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 to limit Taiwan's international participation and to construct a basis for a military \"attack on Taiwan.\" What is the spokesperson's response to this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is an undeniable objective fact.\nUN General Assembly Resolution 2758 fundamentally resolved the issue of representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations, clarifying that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is a part of China, and that Taiwan is not a country; it also clarifies that China has only one seat in the United Nations, and that the representative of the Government of the People's Republic of China is China's sole legitimate representative in the United Nations, and that there is no such thing as \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan.\" The United Nations and its specialized agencies all adhere to the one-China principle, and official UN documents refer to Taiwan as \"Taiwan, a province of China.\" Legal opinions issued by the Office of Legal Affairs of the UN Secretariat also emphasize that \"Taiwan, as a province of China, has no independent status\" and that \"the Taiwan authorities do not enjoy any form of governmental status.\"\nUN General Assembly Resolution 2758 reaffirms the one-China principle, which is a universally recognized fundamental norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community. How can it be described as a \"misinterpretation\"? As part of China, how can Taiwan be discussed regarding its \"sovereign status\"? Taiwan's participation in international organizations must and can only be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. How can it be considered \"international participation\"?\nI want to reiterate that the one-China principle is unshakable, the trend of reunification is unstoppable, and \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end. No matter what the Lai Ching-te administration says or does, it cannot change the objective fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, it cannot shake the legal status of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, and it cannot stop the historical trend that China will eventually be reunified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240801_11464132.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-01","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that after the foreign ministers' meeting between the Japanese and Chinese governments on July 26, China revised and released the Japanese Foreign Minister's statement. The released statement mentioned: First, Japan's adherence to the one-China principle remains unchanged; second, Japan's semiconductor export restrictions are not targeted at any specific country, and Japan is willing to…","The one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. It is also the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with other countries. Japan made a clear commitment to this principle in the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement , stating that \"The Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China. The Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and adheres to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\" To my knowledge, Foreign Minister Kamikawa reiterated this position during the talks, stating that it remains unchanged.\nRegarding the semiconductor issue, some countries, in order to maintain their own hegemony, have politicized and over-security-ized normal economic and trade cooperation, inducing and pressuring other countries to impose technological blockades on China, and artificially disrupting the stability of the global supply chain. We have noted that Japanese government officials have repeatedly stated publicly that the relevant semiconductor export control measures are not targeted at any specific country. China is willing to work with all countries in the world to uphold openness and cooperation and maintain the stability of the global semiconductor supply chain.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240801_11464855.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-09","Mao Ning","NBC News","What is China's view on the incidents of spectators holding \"Go Taiwan!\" posters and signs during the Paris Olympics? What is China's comment on the confiscation or removal of these signs by staff?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. Regarding the participation of \"Chinese Taipei\" in the Olympic Games, the International Olympic Committee has made clear provisions based on the one-China principle, which are universally observed by the international sports community. The Olympic Charter also has clear and consistent provisions regarding political propaganda expressions within Olympic venues.\nI want to emphasize that the mission of the Olympic Games is to promote international peace and solidarity, and the focus of the Games should be on the athletes' competitive performance. We hope that all parties will abide by the provisions of the Olympic Charter, respect and uphold the purity of sport, and resolutely oppose any individual using the Olympics to engage in \"small actions\" on the Taiwan issue and interfere with the holding of the Olympic Games.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-09","Mao Ning","NBC","How does China view spectators holding \"Go Taiwan\" posters during the Paris Olympics? Any comments on the banners being confiscated by staff or removed from the venue?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. Regarding the issue of \"Chinese Taipei's\" participation in the Olympic Games, the International Olympic Committee has made clear regulations based on the one-China principle, which are generally followed by the international sports community. The Olympic Charter also has clear and consistent provisions on political propaganda and expression in Olympic venues.\nI would like to emphasize that the mission of the Olympic Games is to promote international peace and unity, and the focus of the Olympic Games should be the performance of athletes. We hope that all parties will abide by the provisions of the Olympic Charter, respect and maintain the purity of sports, and resolutely oppose certain individuals using the Olympics to make \"little moves\" on the Taiwan issue and interfere with the holding of Olympic events.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-14","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency reporter","The website of the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs has published a report entitled \"The Actions and True Face of the National Endowment for Democracy.\" Can the spokesperson provide more details?\nLin Jian's report, \"The Actions and True Face of the National Endowment for Democracy,\" exposes the truth hidden beneath the guise of \"promoting democracy and human rights\" by presenting a wealth of detailed…","I have noted the relevant reports. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, and has lodged a strong protest with Japan on this matter.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, concerning the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations, and is an inviolable red line. Japan colonized Taiwan for half a century, committing countless crimes and bearing serious historical responsibility to the Chinese people. Certain Japanese politicians should remember the lessons of history, recognize the fact that there is only one China in the world and that Taiwan is a part of China, adhere to the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and their collusion with external forces to engage in \"seeking independence through foreign support\" are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-14","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency reporter","The Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs website released the report \"What the National Endowment for Democracy has done and what it really is\". Can the spokesperson give more information?","The report \"What the National Endowment for Democracy has done and what it really is\" uses a large number of detailed facts to expose the truth that the National Endowment for Democracy has concealed under the guise of \"promoting democracy and human rights.\"\nThese truths include instigating color revolutions to subvert other countries' regimes; colluding with various forces to interfere in other countries' internal affairs; inciting division and confrontation to undermine the stability of other countries; concocting false information to confuse and disrupt public opinion; and using \"academic activities\" to engage in interference and infiltration. These include extending their black hands to China, supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, inciting \"Xinjiang independence\", \"Hong Kong independence\" and \"Tibet independence\", and planning subversive and infiltration activities aimed at undermining China's political security and social stability.\nWhat the National Endowment for Democracy has done seriously endangers the sovereignty, security and development interests of other countries, seriously violates international law and basic norms of international relations, seriously endangers world peace and stability, and is spurned by those who uphold justice and justice in the world.\nPeace, development, fairness, justice, democracy, and freedom are the common values ​​of all mankind. Every country has the right to explore a development path suitable for itself based on its own reality and the needs of its people. No country can claim to be a teacher of democracy and human rights, let alone do things that harm the interests of other countries under the guise of \"promoting democracy and human rights.\" The international community should conduct exchanges and dialogue on the basis of mutual respect and equal treatment, and jointly make greater contributions to the progress of all mankind.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/","",2,0,0,""],[1,"2024-08-16","Zhang Xiaogang","Zhang Xiaogang","First, I will release three announcements.\nAccording to the annual plan, from mid-August to late November, the PLA Navy's training sailing vessel \"Bofeng\" will conduct an ocean-going training mission and visit Vietnam, Indonesia, Sri Lanka, Singapore, and other countries, with a technical stopover in Hong Kong. This mission aims to improve the professional qualities of growing naval officers, strengthen…","In recent years, the Japanese side has drastically increased its defense budget, converted warships into aircraft carriers, developed offensive weapons such as long-range missiles, and is going further down the dangerous path of military buildup. The international community is increasingly aware of Japan's trick of playing word games to cover up military expansion, and concerns are mounting about Japan returning to the evil path of militarism. We urge Japan to honor its commitment to peaceful development, act prudently in military and security matters, and earn the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community through concrete actions.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-08-19","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Two German warships are scheduled to transit the Taiwan Strait next month. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, and the key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait lies in resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence.\" China has always opposed using \"freedom of navigation\" as a pretext to undermine China's territorial sovereignty and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240819_11475916.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-21","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam and President To Lam has concluded his state visit to China. Could the spokesperson provide further details, including the main achievements and highlights of the visit?","General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam and President To Lam paid a state visit to China from August 18 to 20 at the invitation of the Chinese government. This was Comrade To Lam's first overseas trip since being elected General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam, and he was given a high-level reception by the Chinese side. General Secretary Xi Jinping and President To Lam held talks and a small-scale tea gathering with General Secretary To Lam and President To Lam. Premier Li Qiang, Chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress Zhao Leji, and Chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference Wang Huning also met with him.\nThe top leaders of the two parties and countries made strategic plans for deepening the building of the China-Vietnam community with a shared future, providing political guidance for the next stage of China-Vietnam relations. Both sides agreed that shared ideals and beliefs are the red gene passed down through generations of the two parties, forging a traditional friendship of \"deep friendship between Vietnam and China, comrades plus brothers.\" As the two ruling communist parties in the world today, the two parties should uphold their original aspirations of friendship, continue their traditional friendship, keep their common mission in mind, adhere to the leadership of the Communist Party and the socialist system, jointly promote the development of the world socialist cause, and make positive contributions to the cause of human peace and progress.\nBoth sides agreed that, at this crucial juncture in their respective countries' development and revitalization, they should firmly follow the path jointly determined by the older generation of leaders of the two countries, especially General Secretary Xi Jinping and General Secretary Nguyen Phu Trong, to consolidate the \"six more\" development pattern of higher political mutual trust, more substantial security cooperation, deeper pragmatic cooperation, a stronger foundation of public opinion, closer multilateral coordination and cooperation, and better management and resolution of differences, and to continuously promote the building of a China-Vietnam community with a shared future of strategic significance.\nBoth sides agreed to maintain close strategic communication and high-level exchanges, strengthen institutionalized cooperation in strategic areas such as diplomacy, defense, and security; expand cooperation in aligning the Belt and Road Initiative with the \"Two Corridors and One Economic Circle\" framework, accelerate the \"hard connectivity\" of railway, highway, and port infrastructure, enhance the \"soft connectivity\" of smart customs, and jointly build a safe and stable industrial and supply chain; and take the opportunity of celebrating the 75th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Vietnam next year to jointly organize a series of activities such as the \"China-Vietnam Year of Cultural Exchanges\" to consolidate the public opinion foundation between the two countries.\nBoth sides agreed to uphold the Five Principles of Peaceful Coexistence and other basic norms of international relations, promote an equal and orderly multipolar world and inclusive economic globalization, safeguard international fairness and justice and the common interests of developing countries, promote the building of a community with a shared future for mankind, and make positive contributions to promoting world peace and development. Vietnam reiterated its firm adherence to the one-China policy, recognizing that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and that the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. Vietnam supports the peaceful development of cross-strait relations and the cause of China's reunification, resolutely opposes any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, and will not develop any form of official relations with Taiwan.\nThe two sides issued a joint statement fully reflecting the outcomes of the visit. Relevant departments and local authorities of both countries also signed cooperation documents in areas such as party schools, connectivity, industry, finance, customs and quarantine, health, news agencies and media, local affairs, and people's livelihood, fully demonstrating the positive progress made in building a China-Vietnam community with a shared future.\nStanding at a new historical starting point, China is willing to work with Vietnam, guided by the important consensus reached by the top leaders of the two parties and countries, to enhance political mutual trust, strengthen mutually beneficial cooperation, deepen people-to-people exchanges, and promote the building of a China-Vietnam community with a shared future, in order to make positive contributions to advancing our respective socialist modernization and promoting world peace and development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240821_11477550.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-22","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Paraguay recently stated that despite maintaining diplomatic relations with Taiwan, it remains open to reaching a trade agreement with China through Mercosur. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Regarding the normalization of relations between China and Paraguay, China has stated its position on many occasions. We hope that the Paraguayan government and leaders will follow the historical trend and the wishes of the people, stand on the right side of history and on the side of the vast majority of countries in the international community as soon as possible, and make the correct decision that conforms to the fundamental and long-term interests of their own country.\nChina attaches great importance to economic and trade cooperation with Mercosur and Latin American countries, and believes that with the joint efforts of all parties, relevant cooperation will make positive progress.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240822_11478124.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-08-23","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Has China invited Swaziland, which maintains \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan, to the upcoming Forum on China-Africa Cooperation meeting?","We will release information regarding the specific details of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation Summit in due course; please stay tuned. I want to emphasize that the one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community, and 183 countries worldwide have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle. We hope that the few countries that still maintain so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan can recognize the historical trend and make the correct decision that conforms to their own interests as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202408/t20240823_11478906.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first is about the Xiangshan Forum. Just now you briefed us that the 11th Xiangshan Forum will be held from September 12th to 14th. As of August 28th, official delegations from more than 90 countries have confirmed their attendance. My question is, have the representatives from Russia and the US confirmed their participation? What kind of delegation will Russia send? Last year, Cythia…","On your first question. The host of the 11th Beijing Xiangshan Forum sent invitations to the defense departments and militaries of more than 100 countries, including the US and Russia. As far as I know, both the US and Russia will send representatives to the forum. We also look forward to greater participation from other countries.\nOn your second question, I don't think it's an issue of entering 24 or 12 nautical miles of Taiwan. Instead, it is about zero tolerance and mercy toward \"Taiwan Independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","According to the Reuters, military exercises and drills conducted by the PLA in West Pacific in 2023 cost a total amount of $15.3 billion, accounting for 7% of China's defense budget. In addition, the Joint Sword-2024A exercise in May cost $13.17 million. What's your comment?","I don't know where these data come from, and they sound not credible. I would like to reiterate that the PLA will continue to strengthen military training and combat readiness to counter \"Taiwan independence\" and promote national reunification. We will firmly safeguard our national sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","It is reported that when debriefing the 2025 budget report, Lai Ching-te claimed that the 2025 defense budget of Taiwan would reach NT$ 647 billion(approximately US$19.76 billion), a record high, and that Taiwan had the resolve to upgrade self-defense capabilities. In addition, Taiwan media outlets recently disclosed a picture of Qingtian-2, a new generation of Intermediate-range Ballistic Missile (IRBM) in…","As a province of China, Taiwan is not entitled to have a defense budget. It is worth noting that peace will not be achievable as long as the DPP authorities seek \"Taiwan Independence\". The more blatantly it provokes, the more quickly it will perish. On issues concerning national sovereignty and territorial integrity, no one should have any illusion that the PLA will ever hesitate or back down. Once the PLA takes action, everyone should be assured that it would be resolute and fierce. The so-called self-defense capabilities of the \"Taiwan Independence\" armed forces will be crushed by the PLA.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","It's reported that more than 50 PLA aircraft and vessels were sent to navigate around the Taiwan region last Friday, which coincides with Lai Ching-te's first visit to Kinmen since he took office. According to Taiwan's defense authorities, more than 38 aircraft have been detected in the so-called Air Defense Identification Zone of the island, a record high in recent weeks. What's your comment?","Taiwan is part of China. The PLA's exercises in the waters and airspace around the Taiwan island are targeted at the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and serve as a deterrence to the interference of external forces. Such position has been consistent and clear-cut.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","According to reports, US National Security Advisor Jake Sullivan met with General Zhang Youxia, Vice Chairman of the Central Military Commission (CMC) today. Mr. Sullivan said he hoped to extend bilateral military dialogues to the theater command level, so as to avoid conflicts across the Taiwan Strait. What topics were discussed during the meeting? Was the Taiwan question involved?","The Taiwan question was certainly discussed during the meeting this morning. General Zhang Youxia emphasized that the Taiwan question was at the core of China's core interests, the bedrock of the political foundation of China-US relations, and the first red line that must not be crossed. China is committed to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. However, the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces are as incompatible with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait as fire with water. It is the duty of the PLA to counter \"Taiwan independence\" and promote reunification. The PLA will take countermeasures against audacious provocations made by the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The Chinese side urges the US side to stop military collusion with Taiwan, stop arms sale to Taiwan and stop spreading false narratives on the Taiwan question.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-08-29","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, according to the US Navy, AIM-174B, a new type of long-range air-to-air missile, has already been deployed for operation. Some experts say if the missile were deployed in the Indo-Pacific region, it would reduce China's advantage in air strikes and break the balance in the South China Sea, and would also increase the possibility for US involvement in major conflicts across the…","On your first question, taking China as an imaginary enemy, the US has beefed up forward military deployment in the Asia-Pacific and &nbsp;stoked up confrontation and tensions in the region in recent years. We firmly oppose such approach. We urge the US side to abandon the outdated Cold War mentality and geopolitical rivalry mindset, and do more things that are conducive to peace and stability in the region and the world.\nOn your second question, the Taiwan question is an internal affair of China and brooks no foreign interference. We urge the US to immediately stop any official engagement and military contact with Taiwan in any form. The PLA will remain highly vigilant and take firm actions to thwart any foreign interference and secessionist attempt for \"Taiwan independence\".","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-09-04","Mao Ning","Bloomberg reporter","Swaziland is the only African country that did not participate in the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation. How does the Ministry of Foreign Affairs view its relations with Swaziland? Could you further elaborate on the current state of China-Swaziland relations from political and economic perspectives?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is a universal consensus of the international community. African countries generally adhere to the one-China principle and believe that China-Africa cooperation is conducive to Africa's economic revitalization and the achievement of sustainable development.\nDeveloping official relations with Taiwan is not in Swaziland's own interest. We believe that Swaziland will eventually recognize the international trend and make the right decision in line with the historical trend.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202409/t20240904_11485051.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-09-09","Mao Ning","DPA reporter","German media reports that two German warships will transit the Taiwan Strait in mid-September. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. We have previously stated our position on this issue. The waters within the Taiwan Strait, from both sides outwards, are, in order, China's internal waters, territorial sea, contiguous zone, and exclusive economic zone. China respects the navigation rights enjoyed by all countries in the relevant waters in accordance with Chinese law and international law, including the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, but firmly opposes certain countries using the pretext of freedom of navigation to provoke and endanger China's sovereignty and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202409/t20240909_11487817.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-09-13","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","A German Defense Ministry official said today that the transit of German warships through the Taiwan Strait was not directed against any party and, in fact, supported the international principle of freedom of navigation. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. The Taiwan question is not a matter of freedom of navigation, but a matter of China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. We respect the navigation rights enjoyed by all countries in the relevant waters in accordance with Chinese law and international law, including the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, but we firmly oppose any provocations or actions that endanger China's sovereignty and security under the guise of freedom of navigation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202409/t20240913_11490441.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-09-14","Wu Qian","Question","According to reports, German Defense Minister said that two German naval vessels sailed through the Taiwan Strait. German officials noted that this passage was to maintain freedom of navigation. What is your comment?","On September 13th, two German warships sailed through the Taiwan Strait and later hyped up the issue. Naval and air force troops of the PLA Eastern Theater Command monitored the German warships throughout the transit. Freedom of navigation does not equal willful trespassing, nor should it be used to provoke China or harm China’s sovereignty and security. The Chinese military remains on high alert and will take all necessary measures to resolutely defend China’s national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and firmly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-09-18","Lin Jian","China News Service reporter","It has been reported that on September 17, the U.S. Defense Security Cooperation Agency issued a statement saying that the U.S. State Department had approved a $228 million arms sale to Taiwan, including the return, repair, and reshipment of aircraft and related equipment. What is China's comment on this?","The US arms sales to Taiwan seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué. They severely infringe upon China's sovereignty and security interests, damage Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and send a wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China strongly condemns and firmly opposes this and has lodged a solemn protest with the US. China has taken resolute countermeasures and has announced sanctions against nine US defense contractors.\nThe US continues to arm Taiwan, emboldening Lai Ching-te and the DPP authorities to stubbornly pursue \"Taiwan independence\" and provoke the one-China principle. This fact once again proves that the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and the greatest disruption to the status quo is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" forces and the indulgence and support of external forces led by the US. It must be pointed out that the DPP authorities' attempt to \"seek independence through force\" and the US's insistence on \"aiding independence through force\" will inevitably backfire, leading to their own downfall and ultimate failure.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. No one should underestimate China's firm will and strong capability to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China urges the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, immediately cease the dangerous trend of arming Taiwan, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence,\" and stop undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China will take resolute and forceful measures to firmly safeguard national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202409/t20240918_11492497.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-09-19","Lin Jian","Anadolu Agency reporter","Follow-up question regarding Hezbollah. It is understood that the pagers used in the attacks were originally manufactured by a Taiwanese company, and these devices bore the company's logo. Does the spokesperson know whether this company has any cooperation with Israel or Mossad?","I am not aware of the relevant information.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202409/t20240919_11493204.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-09-26","Lin Jian","A reporter from the Korean Broadcasting Corporation asked","On the 25th, a Japanese Maritime Self-Defense Force destroyer transited the Taiwan Strait for the first time. Japanese media claimed this action was in response to Chinese military activities around Japan and to assert \"freedom of navigation.\" What is China's position on this?","The Taiwan question concerns China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, as well as the political foundation of China-Japan relations; it is a red line that cannot be crossed. In response to the entry of Japanese Self-Defense Force vessels into the Taiwan Strait, the Chinese military has dealt with the matter in accordance with laws and regulations. China is highly vigilant about the political intentions behind Japan's actions and has lodged a strong protest with Japan.\nIn the 1972 Joint Statement between Japan and China, Japan made a clear commitment that the Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China. The Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and adheres to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration. We urge Japan to honor its commitments on the Taiwan issue, exercise caution in its words and actions, and refrain from creating interference in Sino-Japanese relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495585.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that on September 25th, a frigate from the Japanese Maritime Self Defense Force had a transit through the Taiwan Strait. Does the Chinese side know about this? What is your comment?","On September 25th, Japanese destroyer Sazanami, Australian destroyer HMAS Sydney, and New Zealand's supply ship HMNZS Aotearoa transited the Taiwan Strait. The PLA monitored the whole transit and stayed on alert. We are opposed to provocations in the name of \"freedom of navigation\", which sent wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and undermine China's sovereignty and security.\nThe Taiwan question is an internal affair of China and it brooks no foreign interference. We urge relevant countries to respect the one-China principle, stop stirring up troubles, and stop undermining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. The PLA will remain on high alert and take all necessary measures to counter any threat and provocation.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Taiwan's defense authorities recently submitted to the legislative body its budget for 2025 which amounts to 667b TWD (148b RMB). According to another report, Taiwan's army will purchase many types of UAVs for monitoring and attack in urban battlefields. What's your comment?","Sticking to its policy of seeking \"Taiwan Independence\", the DPP authorities have been ignoring public opinion, making irresponsible moves and going further down the dangerous path of seeking independence by force. The more they spend on purchasing weapons, the more insecure people in Taiwan will feel. This strategy will only push Taiwan closer to the brinks of war. We warn the DPP authorities that those who commit too many sins are doomed to self-destruction. More weapons will not change the desolate fate of Taiwan Independence. The PLA has full capabilities to smash all separatist attempts for \"Taiwan Independence\" and defend China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, the first F-16V fighter Taiwan bought from the US will be delivered at the end of September. And 26 UAV manufacturers recently visited Taiwan. Chief of the Taipei Office of the America Institute in Taiwan said recently that there was a possibility for the US and Taiwan to jointly manufacture weapons. Meanwhile, some media reports said the US had given Taiwan large numbers of moldy…","We are firmly opposed to any official and military contact between the US and China's Taiwan region. Currently, the biggest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities by the forces for \"Taiwan Independence\", and the tacit support provided by external forces. Whether it's US arms sale to Taiwan or the so-called joint manufacturing of weapons, the true purpose is never protecting Taiwan, but using the DPP authorities as a dumb cash machine to dump obsolete and stockpiled weapons that would only feed the US military-industrial complex. We warn the DPP authorities that the fate of a pawn is being abandoned. Those colluding with the US to endanger Taiwan will end up being punished by history and justice. The PLA will take all necessary measures to defeat any separatist attempt for \"Taiwan Independence\" and foreign interference.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","In the video Cui Huo , we heard a J-20 pilot saying in an interview that he can never forget the moment when he saw the Taiwan Island while flying in his aircraft. This sparked conjectures that the stealth fighter J-20 also participated in a patrol around Taiwan. Can you confirm that?","Taiwan is part of Chinese territory. PLA fighters can go there anytime as they want. There is no need to be surprised.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, on September 26th, the defense authorities in Taiwan said that they monitored several PLA aircraft flying across the Taiwan Strait. Experts say the exercise was to prevent foreign interference. Can you tell us the purpose of this exercise? Secondly, about yesterday's ICBM launch, which countries has China informed beforehand? The Japanese government said that it was not informed.…","On the first question, it is a legitimate right of the PLA to organize exercises and training in air and maritime spaces around the Taiwan Island. We will continue to strengthen combat readiness and regularly organize relevant military operations.\nOn your second question, the test launch of the ICBM by the PLA Rocket Force is consistent with international law and practices. Prior to the launch, we have issued warnings specifying the prohibited time and areas for navigation, and informed several countries in advance through military and diplomatic channels. This fully demonstrates the openness and transparency of the PLA.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Japan's defense ministry announced a large-scale restructuring of its maritime self-defense force to establish a new marine corps and alert contingency troops. It also plans to increase defense budget and build a small satellite network. Some analysts say that Japan is making preparations for assisting a possible US intervention in the Taiwan Straits. What's your comment?","We have noticed relevant moves by the Japanese side. In recent years, Japan has accelerated its combat forces restructuring and the build-up in new operational domains, and has developed long-range attack capabilities. There is a growing tendency in Japan to return to its militarist past, which violates its Pacifist Constitution and exclusively defense-oriented policy, and challenges the post-war international order. We urge the Japanese side to take lessons from history, be cautious in its words and deeds with regard to military build-up, and do more for regional peace and stability, instead of the opposite.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, the US Navy recently issued a Strategic Guideline on Naval Operations that claimed the Chinese mainland has the greatest ship building capability in the world, and that the US should be prepared for a conflict with China in 2027. What is your comment? Secondly, the Chinese Ministry of State Security exposed a hacker organization called \"Anonymous 64\", claiming that people from this…","On your first question, I think this rhetoric from the US side exposes again its Cold War mindset and belligerent nature. I have to stress that China has no intention to challenge or replace the United States. The goal of our development is to deliver a better life for the Chinese people and provide new opportunities for world peace and growth. China is on the course to build a strong nation and realize national rejuvenation through the Chinese path of modernization. No foreign forces can stop this outcome. The Chinese military fears no threats or challenges, and will take firm actions to safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests.\nOn your second question, I'd refer you to relevant authorities for more information.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Defense News, an American website, recently reported that the US plan to provide Taiwan with nearly US$570 million worth of \"security assistance\" has come to the final stage. This is by far the largest package assistance from the US to Taiwan, which will be spent on training, reserves, anti-armor weapons, air defense, UAVs, and other programs to protect Taiwan from military attacks from the Chinese mainland. What…","We have noticed relevant reports. China is firmly opposed to US arms sales to China's Taiwan region. What it has done seriously violated the One China principle and the three China-US Joint Communiques, severely undermined China's sovereignty and security interests, and sent very wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The US attempts to contain China with Taiwan, and to embolden the DPP authorities and \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces by providing military assistance and weapons. This strategy will only undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. It will eventually backfire and hurt the US itself.\nWe urge the US side to stop military collusion with Taiwan and stop arming Taiwan in any way, so as not to disrupt the overall relations between China and the US. Taiwan is China's Taiwan. It is just across the strait from the mainland, and we will never let it drift away. The PLA will never back down in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We will take firm actions to defeat any attempt for \"Taiwan Independence\" and any interference by foreign forces.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-09-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","The website of Taiwan defense authorities said that the Taiwan military has recently monitored a joint landing exercise conducted by the PLA in waters near Dachengwan in Dongshan, Fujian Province. The exercise involved various types of fighters, helicopters and UAVs, as well as amphibious ships and RO-RO cargo ships loaded with ground forces. Taiwan defense authorities said they had closely monitored the…","The relevant exercise is a routine arrangement within the PLA's annual plan. It aims to improve the capabilities of our troops for fulfilling missions and tasks. The PLA fears no reconnaissance or harassment against its operations. The DPP authorities should be fully aware of the strong capabilities and firm will of the PLA, see clearly that \"Taiwan independence\" will never succeed, and completely abandon their separatist illusions.\nSenior Colonel Zhang Xiaogang, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of September 26, 2024. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Zhang Zhicheng)\nZhang Xiaogang: In a few days, we are going to celebrate the 75th birthday of the PRC. In our epic journey in the past 75 years, the Chinese people, under the leadership of the CPC, have made remarkable and historical achievements. For the the people's armed forces, the past 75 years have been marked by hard-won victories and glory. Under the absolute leadership of the CPC, we have rediscovered our revolutionary nature and gained new vitality through sweeping reforms and historical transformation. We are now more determined than ever to grow strong by tackling all kinds of risks and challenges on our wary forward. The people's military is always a great iron wall in defending national sovereignty, security, and development interests, and a staunch force for world peace and stability. Today, China is building a strong country and advancing national rejuvenation through Chinese modernization, and the Chinese military is forging ahead to achieve its centenary goal and build itself into a world-class military. Here, allow me to wish enduring peace and great prosperity to our great motherland!\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-09-27","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","In August of this year, Shigeru Ishiba visited Taiwan and met with the Taiwanese leader. What is the spokesperson's view on Japan-Taiwan relations after Ishiba's election?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Taiwan leader.\" Regarding the question you raised, China has already clarified its position. China has consistently and firmly opposed visits by Japanese politicians to Taiwan; this position is clear.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495593.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-09-30","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" stated on Sunday that it had detected multiple waves of missile launches by the People's Liberation Army in Inner Mongolia, Gansu, Qinghai, and Xinjiang, and is maintaining a high level of vigilance. What is China's comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Ministry of National Defense\". This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495598.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-08","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","An official said on Monday that Tsai Ing-wen will visit the Czech Republic this month. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China's position on the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear: we firmly oppose any \"Taiwan independence\" elements visiting countries with which China has diplomatic relations under any pretext. We urge the Czech Republic and other relevant countries to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, respect China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, refrain from providing any form of facilitation for \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and avoid doing anything that harms bilateral relations. We also solemnly warn the DPP authorities that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and any political manipulation and attempts to \"seek independence by relying on foreign forces\" are futile.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495605.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-08","Mao Ning","Reporter from the China Global Program Center","According to reports, China has evacuated Chinese citizens in Lebanon in two batches. Has the evacuation of Chinese citizens from Lebanon been basically completed? Can the spokesperson provide details?","Since the sudden escalation of the situation between Lebanon and Israel, we have resolutely implemented the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping’s important instructions. The Ministry of Foreign Affairs worked closely with the Ministry of Transport, the Civil Aviation Administration and the embassies in Lebanon and Cyprus and worked day and night to protect the safety of Chinese citizens and quickly carry out evacuation operations. With the joint efforts of all parties, we have arranged for two batches of 215 Chinese citizens to safely evacuate from Lebanon by ship and chartered flight, including three Hong Kong residents and one Taiwanese compatriot. Here, we would like to express our gratitude to Air China, China Ocean Shipping Group, and Zhejiang Ningbo Zhongmeng Airlines Company for their active support and participation in the transfer and evacuation operations.\nThe current situation in Lebanon and Israel is still complex and serious. The Chinese Embassy in Lebanon remains committed and will continue to guide and assist the small number of Chinese citizens staying there to take safety measures to protect their own safety.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495605.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-10","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te delivered a speech today, emphasizing that \"Taiwan's sovereignty is inviolable or cannot be annexed.\" What is China's comment on this?","Lai Ching-te's speech deliberately severed the historical connection between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, reiterated the arguments of \"not being subordinate to each other\" and \"insisting on sovereignty,\" and changed the way he peddled the fallacy of \"Taiwan independence.\" It once again exposed his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" stance and his sinister intention to escalate tensions in the Taiwan Strait in order to pursue his own political interests.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. No matter what the Lai Ching-te administration says or does, it cannot change the objective fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, nor can it stop the historical trend of China's inevitable reunification. Seeking \"independence\" and provoking conflict is a dead end.\nThe one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. Taiwan has never been a country, and it will never become one; there is no such thing as \"sovereignty\" over it. Upholding the one-China principle, opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" and opposing \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" are our consistent positions in handling Taiwan's external relations and participation in international activities.\nI want to reiterate that China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, and firmly opposes interference in China's internal affairs in any way or under any pretext. We urge the few foreign politicians who have visited Taiwan to correct their erroneous words and deeds, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" and escalating tensions across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495612.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-11","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","US Secretary of State Antony Blinken stated at a press conference in Vientiane today that China should not use the Taiwan leader's \"Double Ten\" speech as a pretext to take \"provocative actions.\" What is China's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and brooks no interference from any external forces. The key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait lies in resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence.\" What the US should do is abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495616.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-14","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","China has announced military exercises in the waters surrounding Taiwan. Could the Ministry of Foreign Affairs provide further details regarding the specific objectives and content of the exercises? Could you disclose when the exercises will conclude? What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to claims that China is undermining regional peace and stability?","This is not a diplomatic issue; I suggest you consult the relevant Chinese authorities. What I can tell you is that \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. Provocations by \"Taiwan independence\" forces will inevitably be met with countermeasures. China has always been committed to maintaining regional peace and stability, which is evident to all countries in the region. If you care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, the first thing you should do is resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495625.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-14","Mao Ning","NHK reporter","The spokesperson of the US State Department expressed serious concerns about this military exercise. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs and does not tolerate any external interference. If the United States really cares about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and regional prosperity, it should abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiques, implement the commitment of U.S. leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop arming Taiwan, and stop sending any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495625.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-15","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","A U.S. Department of Defense spokesperson said on Monday that the military exercises conducted by the Chinese People's Liberation Army near Taiwan yesterday were irresponsible, disproportionate, and destabilizing. What is China's comment on this?","The relevant Chinese authorities have already released the information. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is part of China, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. To truly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must unequivocally adhere to the one-China principle and resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495633.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-16","Mao Ning","NHK reporter","On the 15th, the Center for Strategic and International Studies (CSIS) released a report on China's Anti-Secession Law, noting that next year marks the 20th anniversary of its promulgation and that revisions are possible to legitimize the military reunification of Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and brooks no external interference.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495636.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-16","Mao Ning","Reporter from Japan Broadcasting Association","On the 15th, the US Center for Strategic and International Studies released a report on China's Anti-Secession Law, pointing out that next year will be the 20th anniversary of the promulgation of the law, and revisions may be made to provide legitimacy for the reunification of Taiwan by force. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China’s internal affair and does not tolerate any external interference.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495636.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-17","Mao Ning","China Daily reporter","It has been reported that Taiwan has announced the official operation of its newly established representative office in Mumbai, India. This will be Taiwan's third representative office in India. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China firmly opposes any form of official contact and exchanges between any country that has diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, including the establishment of representative offices in each other's countries, and has lodged a strong protest with India.\nThe one-China principle is a serious political commitment made by India and the political foundation of China-India relations. China urges India to strictly abide by its commitments, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly, refrain from any form of official exchanges with Taiwan, and prevent interference with the process of improving China-India relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495639.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-18","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Did the Ministry of Foreign Affairs ever ask South Africa to close the \"Taiwan Representative Office in South Africa\"?","The one-China principle is the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with all countries in the world. It is also a universally recognized norm of international relations and the will of the people and the general trend of the international community. We appreciate South Africa's correct decision to relocate the \"Taipei Liaison Office in South Africa\" out of its administrative capital, Pretoria. \"Taiwan independence\" is unpopular and will inevitably fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495646.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-21","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that a U.S. destroyer and a Canadian frigate transited the Taiwan Strait on October 20. What is China's comment on this?","Regarding the transit of US and Canadian warships through the Taiwan Strait, the Eastern Theater Command has already responded. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is not a matter of freedom of navigation, but a matter of China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China firmly opposes any country using freedom of navigation as a pretext to provoke or threaten China's sovereignty and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495654.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-21","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","It is reported that a US destroyer and a Canadian frigate passed through the Taiwan Strait on October 20. What is China’s comment on this?","Regarding the passage of US and Canadian warships through the Taiwan Strait, the Eastern Theater Command has already responded. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is not an issue of freedom of navigation, but an issue related to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China firmly opposes any country provoking or threatening China's sovereignty and security in the name of freedom of navigation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495654.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-23","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" claims it is monitoring a Chinese aircraft carrier transiting the Taiwan Strait. Can the Chinese side confirm this? Taiwan's \"Defense Minister,\" referring to military exercises earlier this month, stated today that any blockade of Taiwan is tantamount to war. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Ministry of National Defense\" or a \"Minister of National Defense.\" This is not a diplomatic issue. Taiwan is Chinese territory, and the activities of China's aircraft carrier are perfectly normal.\nI would also like to emphasize that no matter what the Taiwan authorities say or do, they cannot change the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, nor can they change the general trend that the two sides will eventually be unified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495667.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-25","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te visited Kinmen today and delivered a speech stating that he will not relinquish an inch of territory. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China's territory. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they cannot change the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, nor can they change the historical trend that the two sides will inevitably be unified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495676.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-10-29","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" has signed a formal treaty with the United States to purchase offensive drones from two American companies to enhance its defense capabilities. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Ministry of National Defense\" there. China's position of firmly opposing US-Taiwan military ties is consistent and clear. The two US companies and their key executives mentioned in your question have been sanctioned by China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495695.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the US Department of Defense recently approved arms sales worth of US$1.988 billion to Taiwan, including surface-to-air missile system and radar system. What is your comment on that?","The US arms sales to China's Taiwan region severely violate the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués. This move seriously undermines China's sovereignty and security interests, disrupts China-US relations, undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and sends very wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We strongly condemn and firmly oppose it and have lodged solemn representations to the US side.\nThe US has reneged on its own promise and is intensifying efforts to arm Taiwan, emboldening the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and pushing Taiwan closer towards the abyss of military conflict. The DPP authorities purchased weapons to solicit US support, allowing the US to exploit the hard-earned money of the people in Taiwan to feed its military-industrial complex. Records have proven time and again that the \"Taiwan independence' separatists and foreign interference are the source of chaos that undermine the status quo, cause cross-strait crisis, and disrupt regional stability.\nThe Taiwan question is at the very core of China's core interests, and the first red line that must not be crossed in China-US relations. China urges the US to fully recognize the severe consequences of arming Taiwan which would surely backfire, and not to go further down the wrong path. Several pieces of US weaponry will not alter the military strength comparison posture, still less stop the historical trend of China’s reunification. The PLA will continuously improve its combat readiness, comprehensively enhance the military capability to fight and win, and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, Taiwan's \"defense minister\" claims that Taiwan serves as a pivot of the first island chain in the Indo-Pacific, and her neighboring waters are an important international trade route. If the PLA were to block Taiwan, all aircraft and vessels would be prohibited from entering according to international norms. Doing so is not different from an act of war. The international community will…","On your first question. Taiwan is a province of China and there is no such a thing as Taiwan's \"defense minister\". Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people which brooks no foreign interference. The PLA's relevant military exercises are targeted at the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. The purpose is to safeguard the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation and the well-being of the Taiwan compatriots. We sternly warn the DPP authorities not to stick to the wrong path and come back to the right course as soon as possible. Soliciting foreign support is a dead end.\nOn your second question, China firmly opposes military contacts between the US and the Taiwan region. The DPP authorities should understand that whatever &nbsp;weapons they buy will be useless, and they will come to no good end by doing so.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, it is reported that China and India have reached a deal on patrol arrangements in the border areas, which can lead to disengagement, ending a conflict began in 2020. India's Chief of Army Staff recently said that India hopes to restore the border situation to the state before April 2020, and gradually resume normal management along the Line of Control. May I have your comment? The…","On your first question, China and India have reached resolutions on issues concerning the border areas through diplomatic and military channels. The troops on the ground of the two militaries are making progress in implementing the resolutions in a orderly manner. President Xi Jinping met with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi on the margins of the BRICS Summit held in Kazan, Russia. Both sides agreed that China and India should view and handle the bilateral relations from a strategic and long-term perspective, and make sure that differences on specific issues would not affect the overall bilateral relationship. We hope the Indian side will work together with China, take the important common understandings between the two state leaders as guidance, continuously implement the above-mentioned resolutions, and jointly safeguard peace and tranquility in the border areas.\nOn your second question, freedom of navigation doesn't mean willful trespassing. China firmly opposes certain countries making provocations and undermining China's sovereignty and security in the name of freedom of navigation. The Chinese military will remain on high alert, and firmly respond to any threats and provocations to &nbsp;safeguard our sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","An article published on the website of the US journal Foreign Policy claims that during the \"Joint Sword-2024A\" military exercise, Beijing Lande Information Technology, a think tank, disclosed the coordinates of 12 bases where Taiwan's Hai Feng missile units are stationed, as accurate as to the forth decimal places of latitude and longitude. It also gave a very detailed description of the motorcade formation,…","We have noticed relevant reports. The PLA is well aware of any move of the armed forces of \"Taiwan independence\" separatists.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","After participating in the \"Joint Sword-2024B\" exercise, the aircraft carrier Liaoning sailed to the South China Sea to join aircraft carrier Shandong. This was the first time for the two aircraft carrier task groups to train together. Is it a response to recent transits through the Taiwan Strait and the so-called \"freedom of navigation\" operations in the South China Sea by US and European naval vessels? Will…","The exercise conducted by aircraft carrier Liaoning and Shandong is a routine arrangement within our annual plan. The exercise focused on real combat training to improve combat capability of the aircraft carrier task group.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the G7 defense ministers released a joint statement after their meeting, attacking China's positions on Taiwan, the East China Sea, the South China Sea and the Ukraine crisis, and calling for China to stop supplying dual-use materials to Russia. Please comment on that.","The joint statement released after the G7 Defense Ministers' meeting misrepresents facts, makes groundless accusations on China on issues related to Taiwan, the East China Sea and the South China Sea, and is replete with lies and bias. The Chinese side firmly opposes it. On the Ukraine issue, China remains committed to promoting peace talks and strictly managing the export of dual-use materials. By contrast, it is the G7 that has been constantly fanning the flame, escalating tensions, and attempting to shift blame on China and deflect responsibility. It is evident to the international community.\nWe urge relevant countries to earnestly respect the basic norms governing international relations, stop preaching or pointing fingers at others' internal affairs, and make more positive contributions in a turbulent world.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","&nbsp;I have two questions. My first question is that it is reported that the latest review of the US Defense Intelligence Agency revealed that China is accelerating and expanding nuclear arsenal of its Army, Navy and Air Force. According to statistics from the Stockholm International Peace Research Institute (SIPRI), global nuclear arms race is intensifying. As of January 2024, the total number of global nuclear…","&nbsp;On your first question. On the nuclear issue, the US has long been holding a \"flashlight\" only to check out on the behaviors of others but not herself. With the largest nuclear arsenal in the world, the US pursues a nuclear policy of first use of nuclear weapons, conducts nuclear intimidation and blackmail on others, and plays with fire by seeking nuclear proliferation. The US has been deliberately hyping up the non-existent \"China nuclear threat\", only to cover up its malicious agenda of maintaining hegemony.\nChina pursues a nuclear strategy of self-defense, and commits itself to a nuclear policy of no first use of nuclear weapons at any time and under any circumstances. We keeps our nuclear force at the minimum level required for national security and have no intention to engage in arms race with any country. It must be noted that what the US needs to do is not making groundless accusations on others but to conduct some soul searching on herself and correct wrong doings. The US should earnestly assume its special and primary responsibilities toward nuclear disarmament, and do real things for reducing global strategic security risks.\nOn your second question, Taiwan is China's Taiwan and has nothing to do with Japan. The Japan-US military exercise should not target any other country or undermine other countries' interests, still less make an issue of Taiwan. What Asia-Pacific needs is peace and prosperity rather than confrontation and conflicts. Japan and the US, clinging to the Cold War mentality, have been frequently conducting highly targeted military exercises. It has created confrontation and conflicts in the Asia-Pacific and undermined regional peace and stability. We firmly oppose that. We urge Japan and the US to stop meddling in the Taiwan question and be prudent with their words and deeds in military security domains. The Chinese military will continue to strengthen training and enhance military preparedness, and firmly respond to any threat and provocation to safeguard our national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-10-31","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Recently, the agricultural department of Taiwan released a so-called \"wartime food plan\", claiming that Taiwan's rice stockpiles can sustain three-month, and current food and unpolished rice stocks are enough to support the island for at least seven months. Officials from Taiwan's economic department also proposed a corresponding plan to increase its energy reserve and supply. Analysts believe Taiwan is…","The DPP authorities have been seeking \"Taiwan independence', creating social panic and provoking cross-Strait confrontation for selfish gains. No matter what tricks they play, it is pointless and doomed to fail.\nZhang Xiaogang: Friends from the media, November 11 marks the 75th anniversary of the founding of the PLA Air Force. In the theme of \"pursuing dreams and prevailing in the sky\", the PLA Air Force will organize a series of activities including flight demonstration, military band performance, observation, and themed light show, as part of the 15th Airshow China. The people's Air Force will carry forward its glorious tradition, accelerate transformation into a world-class air force, and contribute to the cause of building a strong military.\nMy colleagues from the PLA Air Force have prepared some souvenirs and asked me to send them to you. This is an Air Force badge. On one side is the symbol of this strategic service; on the other are the 12 landmarks that have great importance in the PLA Air Force's history. Now please watch a video \"Above the Clouds\". I hope you will continue to follow and support the PLA Air Force's development.\nThat concludes today's press conference.\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nSite Map\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of\nChina. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-11-04","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","It has been reported that Palau's presidential candidate and incumbent president, Hugh Whipps, stated that China has been pressuring Palau for some time to sever \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan. There are also reports that another presidential candidate, Remengesau, denied any analysis or commentary regarding his pro-China stance. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","183 countries in the world have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle, and the historical trend of upholding the one-China principle is unstoppable. Currently, only a very small number of countries, such as Palau, maintain so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan. This practice not only violates the interests of their own countries and people and contravenes UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, but also constitutes an infringement on China's national sovereignty and must be corrected.\nChina urges these countries to fulfill their obligations under international law, stand on the right side of history as soon as possible, and make the correct decisions that truly conform to their own fundamental and long-term interests. Those who understand the times are wise. China also welcomes insightful individuals in these countries to recognize the general trend of history and the tide of the times, respect China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and choose to stand on the side of international justice as soon as possible. Friendship knows no order of precedence; China is willing to open a new chapter in its relations with these countries on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495707.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-07","Mao Ning","New York Times reporter","I have two questions. First, Trump has stated that he will impose tariffs on all Chinese goods. How will China respond? Second, Trump has said that China will not \"invade\" Taiwan. What is your response to this?","Regarding the first question, we do not answer hypothetical questions. As a matter of principle, I would like to reiterate that there will be no winners in a trade war, nor will it be beneficial to the world.\nRegarding the second question, the Taiwan issue is the most important and sensitive issue in China-US relations. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan; this position is consistent and clear. The US government should adhere to the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, and handle Taiwan-related issues with caution to avoid seriously damaging China-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495720.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-08","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan's Coast Guard Administration announced today that it will offer cash rewards for reporting the sighting of foreign warships, including mainland Chinese warships, in \"Taiwanese waters.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495722.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-12","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","The German State Secretary for Economic Affairs is visiting Taiwan this week, holding talks with Taiwanese officials and business executives and will also visit TSMC. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this visit?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universally recognized norm of international relations and a general consensus of the international community, as well as the political foundation of China-Germany relations. We urge Germany to abide by the one-China principle, cease all forms of official exchanges with the Taiwan authorities, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495734.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-14","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Sources say former Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen plans to visit Canada next week. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","China's position on the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear: we firmly oppose any \"Taiwan independence\" elements visiting countries with which China has diplomatic relations under any pretext. We urge relevant countries to abide by the one-China principle and take concrete actions to safeguard the political foundation of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495748.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-15","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Sources indicate that Lai Ching-te plans to transit through Hawaii and Guam during his upcoming trip in the coming weeks. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community. The Taiwan authorities' attempts to manipulate politics and seek independence through so-called \"diplomatic allies\" are futile. They cannot shake the firm international community's adherence to the one-China principle, nor can they stop the historical trend of China's inevitable reunification. Regarding the so-called \"transit\" of the Taiwan leader in the United States, we have consistently and firmly opposed the US arrangement for such a \"transit.\" We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, not to allow Lai Ching-te to \"transit,\" and not to send any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" forces, so as to safeguard Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495752.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-19","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Follow-up question regarding the Hong Kong High Court's ruling. Taiwan has also condemned the ruling. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response?","Taiwan is a province of China, and the issue you raised is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495761.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-20","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","Taiwan's \"Foreign Minister\" Lin Chia-lung has begun a week-long \"visit\" to Europe and met with Belgian parliamentarians and members of the European Parliament in Brussels on Tuesday. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","First, I must correct you. Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as a \"Foreign Minister\" there. The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and the political foundation of China-EU relations. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan. The EU should adhere to the one-China principle, cease all forms of official exchanges with the Taiwan authorities, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We also solemnly warn the Taiwan authorities that there is absolutely no future in pursuing \"one China, one Taiwan\" or \"two Chinas\" in the international community and attempting to advance \"Taiwan independence.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495765.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-22","Lin Jian","After the meeting, a reporter asked","Has China requested that the US not allow Lai Ching-te to transit through US territory to visit its Pacific \"diplomatic allies\"?","During the meeting between the Chinese and US heads of state in Lima, President Xi Jinping emphasized that the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués are the political foundation of bilateral relations and must be consistently upheld. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities are incompatible with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. If the US wants to maintain peace across the Taiwan Strait, the key is to recognize the \"Taiwan independence\" nature of Lai Ching-te and the DPP authorities, handle the Taiwan issue with utmost caution, clearly oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" and support China's peaceful reunification.\nI wish to reiterate that China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes Taiwan authorities' leaders visiting the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly fulfill the commitments made by US leaders regarding not supporting \"Taiwan independence,\" cease official exchanges with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and oppose external interference in its internal affairs is unwavering.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495778.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-25","Mao Ning","China News Service reporter","It was reported that on the 24th, Russian Deputy Foreign Minister Rudenko stated in an interview with TASS that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. The United States is violating the one-China principle, using the pretext of maintaining the \"status quo\" to strengthen its military and political contacts with Taiwan and increase arms sales to Taiwan. The United States' blatant interference in…","We have noted the relevant reports. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. China highly appreciates Russia's just stance of adhering to the one-China principle and opposing the use of Taiwan to contain China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495782.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-27","Mao Ning","Xinhua News Agency reporter","The G7 foreign ministers' meeting issued a joint statement proposing to seek a constructive and stable relationship with China and cooperate in addressing global challenges. At the same time, it demanded that China stop supporting Russia's defense industry, hyped up the so-called \"overcapacity\" in China, and made unwarranted comments on issues concerning the East China Sea, the South China Sea, Taiwan, Xinjiang,…","Since the beginning of this year, China has repeatedly stated its solemn position on the erroneous remarks made by the G7 regarding China. Since the G7 has proposed seeking to establish a constructive and stable relationship with China and cooperate in addressing global challenges, it should practice the principles of mutual respect, equality, and mutual benefit, and put these statements into practice with concrete actions, rather than attacking and smearing China.\nChina has consistently maintained an objective and impartial stance on the Ukraine crisis, actively promoting peace talks and never providing weapons to either side of the conflict. China strictly controls the export of dual-use items, including civilian drones, and opposes the use of civilian drones for military purposes. Meanwhile, normal economic and trade exchanges between China and Russia should not be interfered with or coerced by any third party. The so-called \"overcapacity in China\" has been proven false by a wealth of detailed data and facts. We hope relevant countries will maintain an open mind and uphold fair competition. China's position on issues such as the East China Sea, the South China Sea, Taiwan, Xinjiang, Tibet, and Hong Kong is consistent and clear. We firmly oppose the G7's actions that undermine China's sovereignty and interfere in China's internal affairs, and urge G7 countries to abide by the purposes and principles of the UN Charter and the basic norms of international relations, and to manage their own affairs.\nCurrently, the world is undergoing profound changes, a phenomenon unseen in a century, and international peace and development face unprecedented challenges. As a responsible major power, China has always upheld justice, morality, openness, and inclusiveness, benefiting the world through its own development. It is hoped that the G7 countries will cease their obsession with geopolitical games, abandon narrow-minded zero-sum thinking, and make tangible contributions to international solidarity and cooperation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495789.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-28","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Lai Ching-te will transit through Hawaii and Guam during his visit to Pacific island nations. What is China's comment on this?","The one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempts to engage in political manipulation and seek \"independence\" through visits to so-called \"diplomatic allies\" will never succeed, nor can they shake the solid foundation of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle, nor can they stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification. We have consistently and resolutely opposed official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, resolutely opposed Taiwan authorities' leaders visiting the US under any name or pretext, and resolutely opposed the US's condoning and support of \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495793.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-28","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Lai Qingde will stop by Hawaii and Guam during his visit to Pacific island countries. What is China’s comment on this?","The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempts to engage in political manipulation and seek \"independence\" provocations by visiting so-called \"diplomatic countries\" will never succeed, nor will they shake the international community's firm adherence to the one-China principle, nor can it stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification. We have always resolutely opposed official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, resolutely opposed leaders of the Taiwan authorities seeking to infiltrate the United States in any name and for any reason, and resolutely opposed any form of connivance by the U.S. in supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist behavior.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495793.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-11-29","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Has China directly requested the United States not to allow Taiwan's Lai Ching-te to transit through Hawaii and Guam during his visit to Pacific island nations?","During the meeting between the Chinese and US heads of state in Lima, President Xi Jinping emphasized that the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués are the political foundation of bilateral relations and must be consistently upheld. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities are incompatible with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. If the US wants to maintain peace across the Taiwan Strait, the key is to recognize the \"Taiwan independence\" nature of Lai Ching-te and the DPP authorities, handle the Taiwan issue with utmost caution, clearly oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" and support China's peaceful reunification.\nI would like to reiterate that China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes Taiwan authorities' leaders visiting the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly fulfill the commitments made by US leaders regarding not supporting \"Taiwan independence,\" cease official exchanges with Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and oppose external interference in its internal affairs is unwavering.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495796.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-02","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te made a stopover in Hawaii during his visit to Pacific island nations and spoke with former US House Speaker Nancy Pelosi. A spokesperson for the Taiwan Presidential Office stated that the two discussed the \"Chinese military threat.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first red line that cannot be crossed in China-US relations. We urge the US to recognize the pro-independence nature of Lai Ching-te and the DPP authorities, to recognize the serious harm that pro-independence separatist activities pose to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, to stop interfering in Taiwan affairs and China's internal affairs, and to stop supporting and condoning pro-independence separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495801.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-02","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwanese leader Lai Ching-te \"stopped\" in Hawaii during his visit to Pacific island countries and had a phone call with former Speaker of the House of Representatives Pelosi of the U.S. Congress. Taiwan’s “Presidential Office Spokesperson” stated that the two sides discussed “China’s military threat.” What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, and firmly opposes any form of connivance by the United States of supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist behavior.\nThe Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. We urge the U.S. to recognize the \"Taiwan independence\" nature of Lai Ching-te and the Democratic Progressive Party authorities, recognize the serious harm that \"Taiwan independence\" separatist actions have done to the peace and stability of the Taiwan Strait, abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, stop interfering in Taiwan affairs and interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop supporting and condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495801.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-03","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Does China plan to conduct more military exercises around Taiwan this weekend when Lai Ching-te returns to Taiwan?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests. China's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is unwavering, and we are closely monitoring the situation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495804.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-05","Lin Jian","Phoenix TV reporter","The Ministry of Foreign Affairs website just announced its decision to take countermeasures against 13 U.S. defense contractors and 6 senior executives. What further comments does the spokesperson have?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests. The United States has recently announced multiple arms sales to Taiwan, which seriously violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, severely interferes in China's internal affairs, and seriously undermines China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. In accordance with the relevant provisions of the Anti-Foreign Sanctions Law of the People's Republic of China, China has decided to take countermeasures against US military industrial enterprises and senior management personnel.\nI want to emphasize that \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. The US's insistence on \"using force to aid independence\" cannot shake our firm determination to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and achieve national reunification; it will only push Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war.\nChina urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, to honor the US leader's commitment not to support Taiwan independence, to immediately stop arming Taiwan, and to stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" forces in their \"seeking independence by force.\"","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495808.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-06","Lin Jian","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","It has been reported that Lai Ching-te, the leader of the Taiwan region, has completed his \"transit\" through Hawaii and Guam. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The US insisted on arranging for Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te to \"transit\" through Hawaii and Guam for official exchanges, helping Taiwan expand its so-called \"international space,\" providing a platform for \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, seriously violating the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sending a seriously wrong signal to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction with this and has lodged a solemn protest with the US.\nThe one-China principle is the political foundation of China-US relations and a basic norm of international relations. The Taiwan question is the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. Separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" are incompatible with peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, honor the commitments made by US leaders not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" cease official exchanges with Taiwan, stop undermining the one-China principle, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their separatist activities in any form, so as to take concrete actions to stabilize China-US relations and safeguard peace across the Taiwan Strait.\nI want to emphasize that \"seeking independence by relying on the US\" will inevitably lead to failure, and \"using Taiwan to contain China\" is doomed to fail. No one should underestimate the Chinese government and people's strong determination, unwavering will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495818.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-09","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" stated today that Chinese warships and coast guard vessels were spotted in the waters surrounding Taiwan, and that the People's Liberation Army has imposed restrictions on airspace along the Chinese coast. What is China's comment on this? Will China conduct military exercises around Taiwan?","First of all, I want to tell you that Taiwan does not have a \"Ministry of National Defense,\" and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, and China will firmly safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495824.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-10","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan stated today that the number of warships recently deployed by mainland China in the waters surrounding Taiwan exceeds the scale of the military exercises conducted by China after then-US House Speaker Nancy Pelosi's visit to Taiwan in 2022. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this? Is China currently conducting or planning to conduct military exercises around Taiwan this week?","For specific questions, I suggest contacting the relevant Chinese authorities. What I can tell you is that the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, and China will firmly safeguard its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495828.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-10","Mao Ning","AFP","Taiwan said today that the scale of warships deployed by China in the waters surrounding Taiwan in recent days has exceeded the scale of China's military exercises after then-US Speaker of the House Nancy Pelosi visited Taiwan in 2022. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this? Is China currently holding or planning to hold military exercises around Taiwan this week?","It is recommended to consult the Chinese competent authorities for specific issues. What I can tell you is that the Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs and China will firmly defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495828.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-11","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","A senior Taiwanese security official told AFP today that mainland China will obviously conduct military exercises around Taiwan this week, aiming to draw a red line for the US before President-elect Trump takes office. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs confirm that China has conducted military exercises? What is your comment?","For specific questions, I suggest contacting the relevant Chinese authorities. What I can tell you is that the Taiwan issue is the first and inviolable red line in China-US relations; this is our consistent position. Adhering to the one-China principle is key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and China will resolutely defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495833.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-12","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","According to multiple sources, in order to establish relations with the next US administration, Taiwan has sent two senior officials to Washington to meet with President-elect Trump's team. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China's position on the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, handle the Taiwan issue prudently, and refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241217_11495839.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-12-12","Wu Qian","Question","Recently, the leader of the Taiwan region Lai Cheng-te transited through Hawaii and the Guam. The PLA has not announced any information on conducting military exercises. Taiwan’s defense authorities claimed that the mainland has implemented restrictive measures on coastal airspace and the number of warships deployed around Taiwan is bigger than ever before, and that Taiwan’s military has established an “Emergency…","It is the PLA’s lofty mission to protect national sovereignty and territorial integrity, safeguard the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation, and defend the shared interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. As water has no constant form, there are in warfare no constant conditions. The PLA will decide whether and when to conduct military exercises in accordance with our needs and the situation on the ground. Whether there is a military exercise or not, the PLA will never be absent in fighting “Taiwan independence” and promoting national reunification. Any attempt to split the nation through soliciting external support or resorting to force will be punished, and will never succeed.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2024-12-16","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" claims it has received 38 Abrams main battle tanks from the United States. What is China's comment on this?","First, I must correct you on this point: Taiwan does not have a \"Ministry of National Defense.\" China's position on firmly opposing US-Taiwan military ties and US arms sales to Taiwan is consistent and clear. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, to stop arming Taiwan, and to stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" forces in their attempts to seek independence through force. The Taiwan authorities' schemes to seek independence through force and by relying on foreign powers are doomed to failure. China will resolutely safeguard its national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241218_11501316.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-19","Lin Jian","TASS reporter","In an interview with Foreign Affairs magazine, US Secretary of State Blinken stated that China's expression of dissatisfaction with the US's policy of coordinating with its Eurasian partners proves the success of US policy toward China. He also said that the Taiwan issue is not only China's own affair but also everyone's affair, because if a crisis occurs in Taiwan, the entire world will be affected. What is…","China has always viewed and developed China-US relations based on the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation, while resolutely safeguarding its own sovereignty, security, and development interests. We have always believed that a \"new Cold War\" is neither feasible nor viable, and that containing China is unwise, undesirable, and will not succeed. During his meeting with President Biden in Lima, Peru, President Xi Jinping summarized seven lessons learned from the past four years of dealing with China and the US, pointing the way for China-US relations. We hope the US will take these lessons seriously and work with China in the same direction.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. The biggest challenge to peace across the Taiwan Strait at present is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the interference and sabotage of external forces. What the US should do is abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, uphold its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and stop interfering in China's internal affairs on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241219_11506257.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2024-12-24","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","On December 23 local time, US President Biden signed the \"National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025\" into law, which contains negative content related to China. What is China's comment on this?","The US insisted on signing the \"National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025,\" which contains negative content about China, into law. Year after year, it has been exaggerating the \"China threat,\" advocating military support for Taiwan, abusing state power to suppress China's scientific and technological development, restricting Sino-US economic and trade exchanges and cultural exchanges, damaging China's sovereignty, security and development interests, and interfering with the efforts of both sides to stabilize Sino-US relations. China is strongly dissatisfied with and firmly opposes this, and has lodged a solemn protest with the US.\nChina urges the US to abandon its Cold War mentality and ideological bias, view China's development and China-US relations objectively and rationally, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, stop arming Taiwan, stop politicizing and weaponizing science and technology and economic and trade issues, stop seeking excuses to increase military spending and maintain hegemony, and refrain from implementing the negative China-related clauses of the aforementioned bill. China will take resolute and forceful measures to safeguard its own sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241224_11517236.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2024-12-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the first batch of M1A2T main battle tanks purchased by Taiwan from the US arrived at the island. This marks the first time in 30 years that Taiwan's military has acquired a new type of tank. What's your comment?","We urge the US side to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly honor its commitment of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", immediately stop arming Taiwan, and stop its dangerous moves that undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We warn the DPP authorities that seeking independence by soliciting US support is doomed to failure, and resorting to force to resist reunification leads nowhere. Several pieces of US weaponry won't be the magic straw that can save a drowning man; they are nothing but easy targets on the battlefields. The PLA will comprehensively improve its combat readiness, enhance its capability to fight and win, and firmly smash any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist plot and foreign interference.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-12-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, it is reported that officials and experts from Taiwan said that low profile drills with little fanfare will be mainland's new tactic against Taiwan. Such routine operations would render military deployment targeting Taiwan tacitly accepted. They would also send messages to the US, Japan and the Philippines that the PLA is able to take actions against Taiwan at any time so as to deter…","On your first question, Taiwan is China's Taiwan, which brooks no foreign interference. How the PLA fights against \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and promotes national reunification is actually not something that separatists need to consider. Rejecting reunification by force is a dead end. The more blatantly they provoke, the tighter the noose around their necks would become.\nOn your second question, the development of China's aircraft carriers will definitely live up to expectations. The aircraft carriers will sail through wind and waves to defend national sovereignty, security and development interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-12-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the Military and Security Developments Involving the People's Republic of China 2024 recently published by the US states claimed that despite the November 2023 resumption of defense engagement, the PRC views defense and military engagements as a tool to punish or reward the US for its perceived behavior. What's your comment?","We firmly oppose such groundless accusations made by the US side. China always develops bilateral and military relations with the US in the principle of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence and win-win cooperation. The two sides maintain effective communication through military diplomatic channels. It must be noted that the current difficulties in China-US mil-to-mil engagement are created solely by the US side. The communication and exchanges between the Chinese and the US militaries is not a political show to the world. We urge the US side to take its own problems seriously, earnestly respect China's core interests and major concerns, and refrain from crossing the lines on issues related to Taiwan, democracy and human rights, China's path and system, and China's development rights, etc., so as to create a favorable atmosphere for dialogues and communication between the two sides.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2024-12-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that Commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command said that China's increased militarization of the Taiwan Strait had forced the US to continue arms sale to Taiwan. In accordance with the Taiwan Relations Act, the US stands ready to defend Taiwan at any time, and provide defensive weapons and services to Taiwan. He also expressed his confidence in the US military to win a potential conflict over…","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. In recent years, the US has been attempting to obscure and hollow out the one-China principle, saying one thing and doing another on the Taiwan question, intensifying efforts to provide military aid and arms sales to Taiwan, and sending seriously wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. These moves severely undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We warn the US side that the scheme of \"using Taiwan to contain China\" is doomed to fail. The PLA has the confidence and capability to defeat any foreign interference and smash any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist plot, so as to achieve complete reunification of China.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2024-12-27","Mao Ning","Xinhua News Agency reporter","The Ministry of Foreign Affairs website announced its decision to take countermeasures against seven U.S. defense contractors and their senior executives. What further comments does the spokesperson have?","The United States recently announced another large-scale arms aid and arms sale to Taiwan. The U.S. National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025 includes several negative clauses concerning China, which seriously violate the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, severely interfere in China's internal affairs, and seriously undermine China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. In accordance with the relevant provisions of the Anti-Foreign Sanctions Law of the People's Republic of China, China has decided to take countermeasures against seven U.S. military industrial companies and their senior management personnel.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and the US's attempt to \"aid independence with force\" will only backfire and bring disastrous consequences. The relevant US bills concerning China are filled with Cold War zero-sum thinking and ideological bias, disregard facts, exaggerate the \"China threat,\" and clamor for US military support for Taiwan. They are merely seeking excuses to increase US military spending and maintain US hegemony, thereby endangering regional peace and stability.\nChina urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, immediately cease arming Taiwan in any way, view China's development and Sino-US relations objectively and rationally, refrain from implementing negative clauses concerning China in relevant bills, and stop taking erroneous words and actions that harm China's interests. China will continue to take all necessary measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202412/t20241227_11521820.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-01-06","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","The Taiwanese authorities said yesterday that the Taiwanese government's network was attacked an average of 2.4 million times per day in 2024, and they claimed that most of the attacks were carried out by \"Chinese cyber troops.\" Is this true?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202501/t20250106_11527766.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-01-16","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","Trump's Secretary of State nominee, Marco Rubio, stated at his hearing yesterday that China is the most powerful, dangerous, and nearly equally capable adversary the United States has ever encountered. The US must demonstrate to China that an \"invasion\" of Taiwan would come at an excessive cost. What is China's comment on this?","China's development has a clear historical logic and strong endogenous driving force. Our goals are clear and aboveboard: to improve the lives of our people and make greater contributions to the world. China has always viewed and handled China-US relations in accordance with the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping, while resolutely safeguarding its own sovereignty, security, and development interests. The US should establish a correct understanding of China and stop its unwarranted attacks and smears against China.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. The biggest challenge to peace across the Taiwan Strait at present is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the interference and sabotage of external forces. What the US should do is abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, uphold its commitment not to support \"Taiwan independence,\" stop condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and stop interfering in China's internal affairs on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202501/t20250116_11536700.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-01-17","Wu Qian","Question","According to media reports, China’s military exchanges with foreign countries have witnessed solid progress with many highlights in the year 2024. Please brief us more information.","In the year of 2024, the Chinese military carried forward its fine traditions and made innovative efforts on military diplomacy, so as to improve the quality and efficiency of international military cooperation. First, shaping a favorable strategic environment. Staying in line with the directions set by head-of-state diplomacy, the Chinese military maintained close substantive military cooperation with Russia; progressively restored strategic communication and institutionalized dialogues with the US; deepened strategic communication with European countries, and engaged in exchanges with defense authorities and militaries from dozens of other countries.Second, safeguarding national sovereignty and security. We lodged diplomatic representations and released information in a timely way to respond to provocations and violations made by certain countries on the Taiwan question and the South China Sea issue, refuting the wrong words and deeds of relevant parties.Third, expanding multilateral diplomacy. As the host, the Chinese military successfully held the 11th Beijing Xiangshan Forum and the West Pacific Naval Symposium. We also had active participation in multilateral events like the Shangri-La Dialogue and the Defense Ministers’ Meeting of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization to make our voice heard on multilateral stages.Fourth, deepening cooperation on joint training and exercises. For the first time, our troops participated in Exercise Peace Unity in Africa and Exercise Formosa in Brazil, which contributed to regional peace and stability.Fifth, fulfilling the responsibilities of a major country. China’s Blue Helmets (peacekeepers) stayed on their combat posts in war zones; Channel 16 (of the PLAN vessel-protection task forces) remains a code for peace in the Gulf of Aden and waters off the coast of Somalia; the Ark Peace, the PLAN hospital ship provided medical services to people of 13 countries in Asia and Africa; and humanitarian demining courses were organized for Cambodia and Laos. The Chinese military has been taking concrete actions to deliver hope, warmth and strength.\nIn the new year, the Chinese military will continuously act on Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and Xi Jinping Thought on Diplomacy in promoting military diplomacy. We will uphold the concept of building a community with a shared future for mankind and go all out to achieve the centenary goal of the PLA.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-01-27","Mao Ning","Xinhua News Agency reporter","It is understood that Han Zheng, Special Representative of President Xi Jinping and Vice President of China, received high-level protocol from the US side during his recent attendance at President Trump's inauguration. Meanwhile, some Taiwanese media outlets reported that Taiwan's so-called \"Legislative Yuan\" recently released a statement claiming that Han Kuo-yu, the so-called \"Speaker of the Legislative Yuan,\"…","On January 20, Han Zheng, Special Representative of President Xi Jinping and Vice President of the People's Republic of China, attended President Trump's inauguration ceremony at the invitation of the President. He was seated on the dais in the Rotunda of the Capitol Building, the main venue of the ceremony, and exchanged pleasantries with leaders of relevant countries and U.S. dignitaries present at the ceremony.\nChina has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan. As for your mention of the so-called \"high-level treatment\" received by Taiwan authorities by the US, it is obvious to anyone with discerning eyes that this is false information, nothing more than Taiwan authorities boasting and entertaining themselves.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202501/t20250127_11546848.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-07","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan says it has spotted six balloons originating from mainland China over the island. Can you confirm this? What is your comment?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250207_11550953.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-10","Guo Jiakun","Global Times reporter","US President Trump recently met with Japanese Prime Minister Shigeru Ishiba. The US and Japan issued a joint statement emphasizing the importance of maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, opposing unilateral changes to the situation through force or coercion, and supporting Taiwan's meaningful participation in international organizations. The statement also stated that Article 5 of the US-Japan…","The US-Japan joint statement blatantly interferes in China's internal affairs, attacks and smears China, and exacerbates regional tensions. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this. China has lodged solemn representations with the US and Japan.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and is the core of China's core interests, brooking no external interference. Both the US and Japanese governments have made solemn commitments to China on the Taiwan issue. Japan, in particular, bears serious historical responsibility for its aggression and colonization of Taiwan and should exercise even greater caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan issue. Currently, the greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait is separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. If relevant countries truly care about peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, they should adhere to the one-China principle and unequivocally oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" Taiwan's participation in international organizations must and can only be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in international organizations that only sovereign states can join.\nThe Diaoyu Islands and their affiliated islands are inherent Chinese territory. China's activities in the relevant waters are entirely legitimate and lawful.\nChina has always acted in accordance with WTO rules, and the so-called \"economic aggression\" by China is completely unfounded.\nWe urge the US and Japan to abide by the one-China principle and their own commitments, immediately stop interfering in China's internal affairs, refrain from sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in any form, earnestly respect China's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, stop manipulating China-related issues, and take concrete actions to play a constructive role in regional peace and development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250210_11552122.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-11","Guo Jiakun","Nikkei reporter","According to information released on the Japan Coast Guard's website, the buoy originally positioned in the waters northeast of Taiwan no longer exists. The Japanese government believes this is because China removed the buoy. Is this assessment by the Japanese government accurate? If so, please explain the reasons and purpose behind China's actions.","China's deployment of hydrological and meteorological observation buoys in the relevant sea areas is in accordance with both Chinese domestic law and international law. Currently, the buoys have completed their operational tasks at their original locations. Based on actual scientific observation needs, relevant Chinese units have implemented autonomous and technical adjustments to them.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250211_11552999.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-12","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","Two US ships transited the Taiwan Strait this week, marking the first such transit since Trump took office. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The Eastern Theater Command of the Chinese People's Liberation Army has already responded.\nI want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is not about freedom of navigation, but about China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China firmly opposes any country using freedom of navigation as a pretext to provoke or threaten China's sovereignty and security.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250212_11553791.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-02-14","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","It is reported that US and Japanese leaders met with each other and issued a joint statement, which emphasized the importance of maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and opposed any attempt to unilaterally change the status quo by force or coercion. Recently, the destroyer USS Johnson and the oceanographic survey ship USNS Bowditch transited the Taiwan Strait. What’s your comment?","The relevant contents in the US-Japan Joint Leaders’ Statement grossly interfered in China’s internal affairs and made unfounded smears and accusations against China. The Chinese side is strongly dissatisfied with and firmly opposed to that. Regarding the passage of the US vessels through the Taiwan Strait, the PLA Eastern Theater Command has already made a response.\nI want to point out that Taiwan is China’s Taiwan. Any military provocation of the US will not change this fact. On the contrary, such US actions expose its hypocrisy and double standard to the international community, and bolster the resolve and will of the Chinese people to safeguard our national sovereignty and realize national reunification. The PLA will continue to strengthen combat readiness, resolutely fight against secession and interference, and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-02-17","Guo Jiakun","Yonhap News Agency reporter","The foreign ministers of South Korea, the United States, and Japan held talks in Munich, Germany on the 15th. In their joint statement, the three countries expressed for the first time their support for Taiwan's meaningful participation in international organizations, opposed unilaterally changing the status quo in the Indo-Pacific and the South China Sea by force or coercion, and emphasized the importance of…","We have always firmly opposed the attempts by certain countries to form \"small circles\" to interfere in China's internal affairs, attack and smear China, and incite confrontation and antagonism. We have lodged solemn representations with the relevant countries.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no interference from any external forces. The key to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait lies in adhering to the one-China principle and resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism. Taiwan's participation in international organizations must and can only be handled in accordance with the one-China principle.\nI want to emphasize that the Asia-Pacific region is a high ground for peace and development, not a chessboard for great power rivalry. We urge relevant parties to genuinely respect the efforts of regional countries to maintain peace and stability, abandon Cold War thinking, and stop creating bloc confrontation and escalating regional tensions. China will firmly defend its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, while committing to properly handling differences with relevant parties through dialogue and consultation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250217_11556446.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-19","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","According to a report from the Financial Times today, three Chinese warships were sailing about 150 miles off the east coast of Australia, which is within Australia’s exclusive economic zone. Last year, an Australian warship sailed into China's exclusive economic zone in the Taiwan Strait. China claimed at the time that Australia had violated China's sovereignty. Do you think Chinese ships have also violated…","I don’t know the specific situation you mentioned. I suggest you ask the Chinese competent authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250219_11558920.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-25","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's Coast Guard detained a mainland Chinese vessel registered in Togo, citing the cutting of an undersea cable. Can the Ministry of Foreign Affairs confirm this? What is your comment?","I am not aware of the situation you mentioned, and this is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250225_11561975.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-26","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Taiwan authorities claim that mainland China has established a \"shooting training\" exercise area approximately 40 nautical miles off the southwest coast of Taiwan without prior notice. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250226_11562770.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-02-27","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Ministry of National Defense\" stated today that 45 mainland Chinese aircraft and 14 warships were detected near Taiwan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","What \"Ministry of National Defense\" does Taiwan have? This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202502/t20250227_11565165.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","US Secretary of State Marco Rubio was interviewed by Fox News recently. When asked \"The Chinese mainland plans to take Taiwan in 2027, if you get woken up at 2 o'clock in the morning and intelligence shows that Taiwan will soon be taken by China, what does the US do?\" He answered that America has existing commitments that it has made to prevent that from happening. He also said that the Chinese mainland is the…","I have listened carefully to your question. First of all, I want to clarify that the wording here should be \"reunify\" instead of \"take\". Taiwan is China's Taiwan. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people, and others are in no position to point fingers.\nWu Qian: If there are no further questions, I would like to introduce some special friends to you. They are representatives from the Renmin University of China (RUC). The RUC is the first modern university founded by the Communist Party of China during the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression. Hailed as the \"revolutionary vanguard\" and a cradle for \"builders of the People's Republic\", the university is the alma mater of many heroic figures.\nOn the afternoon of February 27, representatives from the Renmin University of China observed the regular press conference of the MND. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Sun Zhiying)\nNot long ago, representatives from the RUC visited border outposts and joined stationed troops in guard duty and patrols, experiencing first hand the hardship faced and the sacrifice made by border defense troops. A student said after the trip, \"The magnificent borders of our great nation call for the dedication of more young people, for youth shines brightest where the motherland needs it most.\" And I echo with every word of it. With the word \"Renmin\" (means \"people\" in Chinese) in its name, the RUC is for the people. We hope students of the RUC will carry forward the revolutionary traditions and cherish the love for the nation and its people. We encourage you to live your youth to the full, to write poetic chapters, to explore the mystery of the unknown, and to embrace the majesty of the stars and oceans.\nWu Qian: Before we conclude, I have a piece of good news to share. To offer greater access to information about China's national defense and the Chinese military, we will increase the frequency of MND's regular press briefing from twice a month to three times a month, and open the door of our press conference to more Chinese and international media agencies. Questions are the voice of the times. As an open military, the PLA welcomes all kinds of questions, even tricky ones. Friends from the media, we hope we will meet more, talk more and create more with you. Let's witness together how the Chinese military accomplishes remarkable feats in an era of transformation.\nFax: (+86) 010-6201 8356\nE-mail: modio2022@qq.com\nDeadline: March 10, 2025\n**Note:** Please submit an application letter with an official stamp, including information on the agency, the journalist, and contact details.\nWu Qian: Here concludes today's conference, thanks!\nRelated News\nComments\nWe Recommend\nThousands of PLA personnel deployed to flood-hit Rongjiang\n2025-07-08\nFujian coast guard conducts routine patrol of waters near Kinmen\n2025-05-28\nCNS Shandong's training not aiming at any specific country or target: spokesman\n2025-05-09\nMost Viewed\nChina strongly urges India, Pakistan to exercise calm and restraint: FM spokesperson\n2025-05-10\nChinese, Egyptian air forces hold joint training in Egypt\n2025-05-08\nChina, Vietnam to hold 9th border defense friendship exchange\n2025-04-11\nPhotos\nPLAN hospital ship Silk Road Ark sets sail for Mission Harmony 2025\n2025-09-12\nJ-10 fighters engage in round-the-clock flight training\n2025-08-11\nSelf-propelled mortar howitzer opens fire in training\n2025-08-10\n-->\nCopyright @China Military. All rights reserved.\nReproduction in whole or in part without permission is prohibited.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. First, there are reports saying more than 30 countries including Russia, China, and the US have recently participated in the Multilateral Naval Exercise Komodo 2025 in Indonesia. Can you confirm this? Second, as reported by Taiwan media outlets, the US government will soon unfreeze $870 million in security aid for Taiwan. And according to sources, the DPP authorities are considering…","On your first question. We have noted relevant reports. The Chinese side sent representatives from our embassy in Indonesia to attend relevant activities of the Multilateral Naval Exercise Komodo 2025.\nOn your second question, the Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China, which brooks no foreign interference. We firmly reject any form of US military contact with and US arms sale to China's Taiwan region. Relying on US support for \"Taiwan independence\" is not a viable path. Diverting taxpayer money that should have benefited the public to fill the bottomless hole of \"harming and ruining Taiwan\" will only lead to self-inflicted disasters for the DPP authorities.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of February 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Zhang Zhicheng)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, according to media reports, Taiwan was mentioned as a participant on the official Facebook page for the Cobra Gold exercise but was removed from the post later. Do you have any comment? My second question is about Deepseek. Deepseek is a trending topic right now and many industries are exploring its possibilities. I wonder if you are aware of this, and will the press release work of…","On your first question, we have noted relevant reports and how the US side mentioned Taiwan but deleted it later. The Chinese side is firmly opposed to any form of official interaction and military contact between any country and China's Taiwan region. This position is unwavering.\nOn your second question, I certainly follow Deepseek and I have its app on my phone. When my team and I prepare for the press conference, we sometimes use AI apps to search for information. In this regard, the Chinese side's policy is very clear. We always advocate that a people-centered approach needs to be followed and the principle of developing AI for good needs to be observed in developing AI, and that we must ensure absolute human control over relevant weapon systems.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","Commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command (INDOPACOM) recently said that the PLA had significantly increased its activities around Taiwan in recent years, and had sent multiple spy balloons, naval vessels and military planes around the island in February alone. He also claimed that the Chinese mainland will probably use exercises as a fig leaf to conceal an attack on the island. In addition, Taiwan media outlets…","I will not comment on the specific tactics you mentioned. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one and the same Chinese family. We will strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort. But we make no promise to renounce the use of force, which is targeted at the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external interference. Anyone who dares to push for \"Taiwan independence\" will certainly face swift and strong countermeasures from the PLA. And we warn some individuals of the US side: playing sneaky tricks on Taiwan would only backfire.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of February 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Sun Zhiying)\n‍‍","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, it's reported that Taiwan's Exercise Han Kuang 41 would considerably increase the duration of its live-fire phase, and would mobilize as many as 3000 reserve troops as prodded by the US side. What's your comment on this? Secondly, this year we will celebrate the 80th anniversary of the victory of the World Anti-Fascist War and the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese…","On your first question, the Taiwan question is an internal affair of China, which brooks no external interference. The US side wants to contain China with Taiwan and connives at risky and provocative activities of the DPP authorities for \"Taiwan independence\". This strategy will ultimately backfire.\nThe DPP authorities have an illusion of \"soliciting US support for independence\" and \"resisting unification by force\". It is a serious miscalculation of the situation, the public opinion and the comparison of strength. Overreaching itself in such a way is extremely dangerous. We warn the DPP authorities that holding back the tide with a broom will only end up in self-destruction. We will come and get you, sooner or later.\nOn your second question, we will hold solemn and grand celebrations in commemoration of the 80th anniversary of the victory of the World Anti-Fascist War and the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression. As for more details, I have nothing to offer at this point.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of February 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Li Xiaowei)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","The military authorities of Taiwan said yesterday that the PLA conducted a live-fire drill in waters 70 kilometers off its coast. Can you confirm this? If so, do you have more information on this?","The comments made by relevant authorities of Taiwan on the routine exercises and training activities of the PLA are mere hypes. We require them to stop playing tricks for more attention.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-02-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","It's reported that the military authorities of Taiwan recently issued a draft amendment to Article 4 of Implementation Measures for the Selection and Training of Volunteer Soldiers, easing restrictions on height, eyesight and tattoo for applicants. Do you have any comment on this?","In the face of the prevailing trend of China's reunification, any petty tricks by the DPP authorities are futile. Being too cunning by half will end up costing its life. As the PLA has pointed out multiple times, seeking \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end. For those who are hopelessly stubborn, let them crash headlong into the harsh reality.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of February 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Zhang Zhicheng)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-03-03","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","Recently, US Secretary of State Marco Rubio, in an interview with US media, criticized China on issues such as Taiwan, trade, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the Indo-Pacific. What is China's comment on this?","Rubio's remarks are full of Cold War mentality and spread lies and fallacies. China is strongly dissatisfied with and firmly opposes them, and has lodged a solemn protest with the US.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The US distorts the one-China principle and insists on using Taiwan to contain China. The Taiwan authorities, with US support and indulgence, are seeking independence by relying on the US. This is the most fundamental change to the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The Taiwan question is the most important, sensitive, and explosive issue in China-US relations. If the US does not want to provoke conflict, it should stop overstepping its bounds on the Taiwan issue.\nThere are no winners in trade wars and tariff wars. The US has politicized and weaponized economic and trade issues, using fentanyl as a pretext to impose tariffs on China, artificially creating obstacles to normal economic, trade, and investment cooperation between China and the US, which damages the US's own economic interests and international reputation. China is willing to resolve its respective concerns with the US through dialogue and consultation on the basis of equality and mutual respect, while taking all necessary measures to safeguard its legitimate rights and interests.\nTracing the origin of the novel coronavirus is a serious scientific issue. The conclusion that \"a laboratory leak is extremely unlikely\" is an authoritative scientific conclusion reached by the China-WHO joint expert team based on their on-site visits to relevant laboratories in Wuhan and in-depth exchanges with relevant researchers. This conclusion has been widely recognized by the international community and the scientific community. The international scientific community has increasing clues pointing to a global origin for the virus. The tracing work should be based on a global perspective and requires multi-country and multi-regional efforts, especially in the United States. The US should immediately stop its attempts to frame and smear China and shift blame.\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a forum for cooperation and development, not a chessboard for geopolitical games. History and reality have repeatedly proven that the United States is accustomed to using other countries as pawns, \"stepping stones,\" or even cannon fodder. The United States should not \"mirror\" China with its own hegemonic logic. Engaging in bloc confrontation in the Asia-Pacific is out of step with the trend of the times and goes against the common aspirations of countries in the region. It is destined to lose popular support and will never succeed.\nI want to solemnly tell the US that a lie repeated a thousand times will not become the truth, smearing and slandering China will not mislead the world, and engaging in \"megaphone diplomacy\" will not bring any benefit to China-US relations. We are committed to viewing and developing China-US relations in accordance with the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation proposed by President Xi Jinping, while firmly safeguarding national sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250303_11567318.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-10","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","We noticed that last week, Foreign Minister Wang Yi, at the press conference during the Two Sessions, stated regarding the Taiwan issue that \"the only name for the Taiwan region in the United Nations is 'Taiwan Province of China'.\" Some believe this indicates a hardening of the mainland's policy towards Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's view on this?","UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 of 1971 clearly states that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is not a country, but a part of China, and that China has only one seat in the United Nations, with the government of the People's Republic of China being the sole legitimate representative. To adhere to this resolution, the United Nations and its specialized agencies use the term \"Taiwan Province of China\" when referring to Taiwan. The official legal opinion from the UN Secretariat's Office of Legal Affairs clearly states that \"Taiwan, as a province of China, has no independent status.\" This is the consistent position of the United Nations, and all of this is documented.\nOn the Taiwan question, China's position is consistent and clear. We always adhere to the one-China principle and the 1992 Consensus, and are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and the greatest effort. At the same time, China will take all necessary measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and interference from external forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250310_11572149.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-10","Mao Ning","Reporter from Japan Broadcasting Association","Recently, Taiwan's \"Ministry of Economic Affairs\" stated that it will participate in the Osaka World Expo in Japan in a private capacity. What is China’s comment on this?","We have always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the Taiwan region and countries that have diplomatic relations with us.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250310_11572149.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-13","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's \"President\" Lai Ching-te stated today that mainland China is increasing its influence and infiltration into Taiwan, using Taiwan's \"democratic system\" to attract people from all sectors of society. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","Taiwan is part of China, and there is no \"president\" there. What you're raising isn't a diplomatic issue. I can tell you that no matter what the DPP authorities say, it cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, nor can it change the inevitable trend of China's reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250313_11574297.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-03-14","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, Japanese media reported that Japanese warships transited the Taiwan Strait in February. Officials from Japan's defense agency said this involved SDF operations and would not comment; but they expressed serious concern about the increasingly active Chinese military activities in areas surrounding Japan, and said Japan would respond calmly and resolutely. Do you have any comment?","China respects the navigation rights of all countries under international law, but firmly opposes any country stirring up trouble in the Taiwan Strait, infringing on China's sovereignty and security, and sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nIt should be emphasized that Chinese military activities in relevant sea and airspace are in accordance with international law and international practice, entirely legitimate, reasonable, and beyond reproach. Japan's baseless criticism of China's normal exercises and training is something we firmly oppose.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-03-17","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Recently, the G7 foreign ministers' meeting issued a joint statement and a \"Declaration on Maritime Security and Prosperity,\" once again hyping up issues related to China, making unwarranted comments on issues such as Taiwan and maritime matters, and expressing concerns about China's provision of weapons and dual-use items to Russia, China's so-called \"overcapacity,\" and its military buildup. What is China's…","The joint statement and related declarations of the G7 foreign ministers' meeting disregard facts, distort the truth, slander and smear China, and interfere in China's internal affairs. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition, and has lodged solemn representations with the relevant countries.\nI want to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and brooks no external interference. The situation in the South China Sea is generally stable, and there are no issues with freedom of navigation and overflight. The G7 should stop stirring up trouble and provoking disputes. China has consistently and actively promoted peace talks on the Ukraine issue, has never provided lethal weapons to either side of the conflict, and strictly controls dual-use items. China will never accept the G7's attempts to shift blame and shirk responsibility.\nChina adheres to the path of peaceful development and firmly pursues a defensive national defense policy, always maintaining its nuclear forces at the minimum level required for national security. China's defense spending is necessary to safeguard national sovereignty, security, and development interests, and is open, transparent, reasonable, and appropriate. The G7 avoids discussing the US's nuclear disarmament responsibility and the nuclear proliferation risks posed by the US-UK-Australia trilateral security partnership, instead focusing on Chinaa blatant double standard. The so-called \"Chinese overcapacity\" has been proven to be a false proposition. G7 members should stop politicizing and weaponizing economic and trade relations, and stop undermining the international economic order and disrupting the stability of global supply chains.\nChina urges the G7 to recognize the global trend, abandon Cold War mentality and ideological bias, stop undermining China's sovereignty and interfering in China's internal affairs, stop provoking conflict and confrontation and camp antagonism, focus their energy on major issues such as addressing global challenges and promoting global development, and do more to promote international solidarity and cooperation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250317_11577262.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-19","Mao Ning","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that during Japanese Prime Minister Shigeru Ishiba's visit to the United States in February, he and US President Trump jointly announced that the US and Japan would \"oppose the Chinese government's unilateral attempt to change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait by force or coercion.\" Furthermore, Japanese Maritime Self-Defense Force vessels transited the Taiwan Strait in early February.…","Foreign Minister Wang Yi's trip to Japan is to attend the 11th China-Japan-ROK Foreign Ministers' Meeting and to chair the 6th China-Japan High-Level Economic Dialogue. We released the news and provided relevant information yesterday, which you can refer to.\nThe Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. Japan, having previously colonized Taiwan, bears historical responsibility to the Chinese people and must exercise particular caution in its words and actions on this issue. Regarding the negative moves by Japan concerning China that you mentioned, China has lodged solemn representations with Japan at the first opportunity.\nAt present, China-Japan relations are at a critical period of improvement and development. We hope that Japan will take concrete actions to fulfill its commitment to comprehensively promote the strategic and mutually beneficial relationship between China and Japan and to build a constructive and stable China-Japan relationship that meets the requirements of the new era, so as to remove obstacles to promoting the improvement and development of bilateral relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250319_11578652.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-21","Mao Ning","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that Taiwan's Executive Yuan has appointed former Japan Self-Defense Forces Joint Staff Chief of Staff Shigeru Iwasaki as an advisor. What is China's comment on this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. The one-China principle is the political foundation of China-Japan relations. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. Japan bears historical responsibility to the Chinese people on the Taiwan issue and should be especially cautious in its words and actions, fulfilling its commitment to the one-China principle with concrete actions. China has lodged representations with Japan. The DPP authorities' attempts to provoke and seek \"independence\" by colluding with external forces will not succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250321_11579916.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-24","Guo Jiakun","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","According to a statement released by the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Minister Wang Yi discussed the Taiwan issue with several Japanese political figures during his visit to Japan, emphasizing that the four political documents between China and Japan clearly stipulate the Taiwan issue and must be strictly implemented without ambiguity or regression. Could you elaborate on China's position?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests, and it concerns the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession, and Japan bears an undeniable historical responsibility for its actions on the Taiwan issue. In 1943, the US, China, and the UK issued the Cairo Declaration, explicitly stipulating the return of Taiwan, which Japan had seized, to China. In 1945, the US, China, the UK, and the Soviet Union issued the Potsdam Declaration, Article 8 of which stipulated that the provisions of the Cairo Declaration would be implemented. On August 15, 1945, Japan announced its acceptance of the Potsdam Declaration and its unconditional surrender. Subsequently, in the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, Japan pledged to adhere to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration. The 1978 Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship stated that \"all principles set forth in the Joint Statement shall be strictly observed.\" The Treaty, reviewed and adopted by the legislative bodies of both China and Japan, together with the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, constitutes a legally binding guiding document for bilateral relations. These historical contexts and legal bases fully demonstrate that upholding the one-China principle is a serious political commitment and international legal obligation that Japan must fulfill.\nThe fallacies that \"if something happens to Taiwan, something happens to Japan\" and that \"the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement has no legal binding force\" will seriously erode the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations. These statements are not only completely wrong but also extremely dangerous. We urge Japan to honor its commitments, handle the Taiwan issue prudently, and take concrete actions to safeguard the momentum of improvement and development in Sino-Japanese relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250324_11580922.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-24","Guo Jiakun","Reporter from the China Review News Agency in Hong Kong","According to news released by the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Minister Wang Yi discussed the Taiwan issue with a number of Japanese dignitaries during his trip to Japan, emphasizing that the four political documents between China and Japan have clearly defined the Taiwan issue, which must be strictly implemented, and no vague retrogression will be tolerated. Can you further introduce China's…","Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory. The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and is related to the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's liberation. Japan bears unshirkable historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue. In 1943, China, the United States and Britain issued the Cairo Declaration, which clearly stipulated that Taiwan, which Japan had stolen, should be returned to China. In 1945, China, the United States, Britain and the Soviet Union issued the Potsdam Declaration, and Article 8 stipulated that the provisions of the Cairo Declaration would be implemented. On August 15, 1945, Japan announced its acceptance of the Potsdam Declaration and unconditional surrender. Japan later committed to abide by the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration in the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement. The 1978 Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship states that \"the principles expressed in the Joint Declaration shall be strictly observed.\" The treaty was reviewed and approved by the legislative bodies of China and Japan, and together with the Sino-Japanese Joint Declaration, it constitutes a legally binding document guiding relations between the two countries. These historical merits and legal basis fully demonstrate that adhering to the one-China principle is a serious political commitment and international legal obligation that Japan must fulfill.\nThe so-called fallacies that \"what's going on in Taiwan means what's going on in Japan\" and \"the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement is not legally binding\" will seriously erode the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations. They are not only wrong, but also very dangerous. We urge Japan to keep its promise, handle the Taiwan issue prudently, and take concrete actions to maintain the momentum of improvement and development in China-Japan relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250324_11580922.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-03-26","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","Liu Zhenya, a Chinese internet celebrity, had his residency permit revoked for advocating \"military unification of Taiwan\" and left Taiwan yesterday. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","I haven't been following the relevant reports. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250326_11582391.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","The leader of the Taiwan region, Lai Ching-te, recently made separatist remarks claiming that the two sides across the Taiwan Strait are \"not subordinate to each other\" and called the mainland a \"foreign hostile force\". In mid-March, the PLA conducted a military exercise near Taiwan. Some said that the exercise was a countermeasure against Lai Ching-te's separatist rhetoric and recent movements between Taiwan and…","As the Chinese saying goes, \"When the heaven is about to destroy someone, it first makes them having lunatic ideas.\" Taiwan is a part of China. It has never been a nation. It wasn't in the past. It is not at present, and it will never be in the future.\nRecently, naval and air troops of the PLA Eastern Theater Command conducted readiness patrols and joint exercises in areas around Taiwan to test and enhance their war-fighting capabilities. It serves as an effective punishment and deterrence against the \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and a stern warning against external interfering forces. It is fully legitimate and necessary.\nThe people's military will resolutely implement the Party's overall strategy for resolving the Taiwan question in the new era. We will remain ready and able to fight and win at all times, and will take resolute measures to defeat any separatist attempt for \"Taiwan independence\".\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, &nbsp;spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC),&nbsp; answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of &nbsp;March 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Li Xiaowei)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first one. It is reported that China's aircraft carrier Fujian has recently set sail for its seventh sea trial. Some analysts suggest that the focus of this trial is catapult launch and arrested landing. Can you confirm this?\nThe second question. It is reported that in response to China's increasing defense budget in 2025, Japan's Chief Cabinet Secretary said that China's rapid military…","I have no information to release on your first question. The sea trial is a routine arrangement for the construction of PLANS Fujian. Please take it easy.\nAs for your second question, regarding China's 2025 defense budget, we have provided a detailed explanation. The size, structure, and usage of the budget is open, transparent and beyond reproach. In fact, Japan, as a country that launched aggressive wars during World War II, is the least qualified to criticize defense budgets of other nations. The international community should be alerted to Japan's recent efforts in breaking its pacifist constitution and the \"exclusively defense-oriented\" policy. Japan has significantly increased its defense spending and developed long-range offensive capabilities, heading down the path of military expansion. Such behavior is exactly what peace-loving countries, particularly those once invaded by Japanese militarists, need to be vigilant against and opposed to.\nThis year we will have the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. We urge the Japan side to take lessons from history, adhere to the path of peaceful development, act prudently in the field of military security, and stop misinterpreting China's defense policies and military strategies, so as to avoid further eroding its credibility among its Asian neighbors and the international community. It must be emphasized that the Taiwan question is none of Japan's business, and we firmly oppose Japan's attempts to exploit this matter for its own agenda. Only by upholding the one-China principle and resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" can peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait be ensured.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, &nbsp;spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC),&nbsp; answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of &nbsp;March 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Li Xiaowei)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","According to foreign media reports, the recent G7 Foreign Ministers' Meeting issued a joint statement expressing concerns over China's expansion of its nuclear arsenal, and the situation in the East and South China Seas. The statement emphasizes the importance of maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and opposes any unilateral alteration of the status quo through force or coercion. What is your…","The G7 statement ignores facts and is a vicious slander on China and a brutal interference in China's internal affairs. We strongly condemn and resolutely oppose it. China follows a policy of no-first-use of nuclear weapons and a defensive nuclear strategy. We have been maintaining our nuclear arsenal at the minimum level required for national security. On the nuclear issue, the G7 should reflect on its own actions and has no qualification to criticize China.\nRegarding the East and South China Seas, China is engaging in peaceful dialogue and consultation with relevant countries to resolve disputes. At the same time, we remain steadfast in safeguarding our territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests. China firmly opposes interference from external forces and any provocative acts that undermine regional peace and stability. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China, and the Taiwan question brooks no foreign interference. The one-China principle is a wide consensus of the international community and a fundamental norm in international relations. Any attempt to separate the island from its motherland will inevitably end in complete failure.\nWe urge the G7 to break away from its Cold War mentality and ideological prejudice, stop the finger-pointing and preaching at others. This approach won't work on the Chinese military.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","The Ministry of State Security has reportedly disclosed information about four members of the \"Information, Communications, and Electronic Force Command\" of Taiwan. What is your comment on this?","Justice has long arms. Those who play with fire should have no illusion of escaping. No one who pushes for \"Taiwan independence\" or engages in seceding the motherland would be spared by justice.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. The first question is that media reports say that the PLA is currently building at least three barges that can be used in landing operations against Taiwan. These barges are equipped with springboards over 100 meters in length, allowing tanks to traverse sandy beaches and directly move to the shore. Can you confirm this? My second question is that the leader of the Taiwan region Lai Ching-te…","On your first question about the military equipment, I have no information to release.\nFor your second question, any small trick pushed by the DPP authorities to seek independence and resist unification with force is futile and a dead-end. This will not stop the historical trend of reunification. The PLA has full capability to destroy any attempt to seek independence and resist unification","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","The US Indo-Pacific commander said recently that the PLA's exercises around Taiwan are not only exercises but preparations for an invasion of Taiwan. The US military will put its priority in the Indo-Pacific theater. According to Taiwan's Democratic Progressive Party, the PLA's exercises may one day turn into real battles. Taiwan recently held the first \"Mini Han Kuang\" drills to enhance its combat readiness and…","The exercises conducted by the PLA are targeted against \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and foreign interference. The Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China that allows no foreign interference. The activities conducted by the PLA Eastern Theater Command around Taiwan Island are aimed to improve the real combat capabilities against separatism and interference. They are necessary actions to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and strong deterrence against joint retrogressive provocation made by the US and Taiwan.\nAs for the comment from the DPP, I want to let them know that any attempt to seek independence by force is futile and cannot change its destiny of being a failure.\nSenior Colonel Wu Qian, &nbsp;spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC),&nbsp; answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of &nbsp;March 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Li Xiaowei)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-03-27","Wu Qian","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, in recent years, the mainland has conducted many joint military exercises around Taiwan. The Wall Street Journal recently published a report titled China is Ready to Blockade Taiwan. Some military experts from Western countries believe that the mainland is more likely to take an approach of isolation and pressure. What's your comment on this? Second, the mainland has conducted many…","On your first question, Taiwan is China's Taiwan. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people to decide. The reports you mentioned are deliberately instigating confrontation across the Strait. The exercises taken by the PLA around Taiwan are targeted at \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and foreign interference. The aim is to safeguard China’s national sovereignty and territorial integrity and the peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nFor your second question, I want to point out that the separatist act of \"Taiwan independence\" and foreign interference are the root cause of the tension across the Taiwan Strait. We are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost efforts, but we will never allow Taiwan to be separated from the motherland. The higher the \"Taiwan independence\" supporters jump, the closer they will be to death.\nWu Qian: Before I conclude, I'd like to introduce to you the faculty and student representatives from Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT). We are glad to have them observing the press conference. The BIT was the first science and engineering university founded by the CPC and the first defense industry university in the PRC. Since its founding 85 years ago, the BIT has prioritized virtue and professionalism in cultivating talent, emphasized national defense and industries in serving the nation and the military, and championed openness, inclusiveness and excellence in achieving innovative development. A great number of leading scientists, trailblazers, and heavyweights have come out from the university.\nLiving in this great era, today's students of BIT shoulder great responsibilities. Wish all of you carry on BIT's revolutionary traditions, work hard to scale the heights of science, and build and defend the nation with your iron will and scientific knowledge.\nIf there are no other questions, here concludes today's press conference. To conclude, I wish you every success in your work and good luck in everything in this bright season of spring.\nRelated News\nComments\nWe Recommend\nThousands of PLA personnel deployed to flood-hit Rongjiang\n2025-07-08\nFujian coast guard conducts routine patrol of waters near Kinmen\n2025-05-28\nCNS Shandong's training not aiming at any specific country or target: spokesman\n2025-05-09\nMost Viewed\nChina strongly urges India, Pakistan to exercise calm and restraint: FM spokesperson\n2025-05-10\nChinese, Egyptian air forces hold joint training in Egypt\n2025-05-08\nChina, Vietnam to hold 9th border defense friendship exchange\n2025-04-11\nPhotos\nPLAN hospital ship Silk Road Ark sets sail for Mission Harmony 2025\n2025-09-12\nJ-10 fighters engage in round-the-clock flight training\n2025-08-11\nSelf-propelled mortar howitzer opens fire in training\n2025-08-10\n-->\nCopyright @China Military. All rights reserved.\nReproduction in whole or in part without permission is prohibited.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-03-31","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","U.S. Defense Secretary Hegseth said on Sunday that Japan, the \"nation of samurai,\" is \"indispensable in dealing with Chinese 'aggression'.\" What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China has consistently maintained that US-Japan military and security cooperation should not target third countries or jeopardize regional peace and development. The US, using the so-called \"China threat\" as a pretext, incites ideological confrontation, promotes division and conflict, and even incites individual countries to act as \"cannon fodder\" for the US in maintaining its hegemony. Regional countries should be vigilant and take strict precautions against this. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. Japan, in particular, should learn from historical lessons and act prudently in the field of military and security.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, and how it is resolved is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, which brooks no interference from others. We urge certain individuals in the US to abandon their illusions of using Taiwan to contain China, and to take concrete actions to uphold the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, putting into practice the commitments made by the US on Taiwan-related issues. Japan once carried out aggression and colonial rule over Taiwan, bearing serious historical responsibility to the Chinese people. It should adhere to the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan question, and refrain from sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202503/t20250331_11585144.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-01","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg reporter","U.S. Defense Secretary Hegseth recently stated that the U.S. will provide a \"credible deterrent\" in the Indo-Pacific region, including in the Taiwan Strait. China conducted joint military exercises around Taiwan today. What is the spokesperson's comment on the current situation?","Regarding the joint exercises you mentioned, the Eastern Theater Command and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council have already released information to the public. China's joint exercises are a serious warning and powerful deterrent to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and a legitimate and necessary action to safeguard national sovereignty and maintain national unity.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. The DPP authorities' stubborn adherence to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance and their attempt to split the country by \"relying on external forces\" is futile and doomed to failure. The historical trend of China's eventual reunification is unstoppable.\nRegarding the remarks made by relevant U.S. officials that you mentioned, I already responded yesterday. I want to reiterate that U.S.-Japan military and security cooperation must not target any third country, nor jeopardize regional peace and development. The U.S. is using the so-called \"China threat\" as a pretext to incite ideological confrontation and encourage separatism and conflict. Regional countries should be vigilant and take strict precautions against this. On the Taiwan issue, we urge certain individuals in the U.S. to abandon their illusions of \"using Taiwan to contain China,\" and to take concrete actions to uphold the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, and to put into practice the commitments made by the U.S. on Taiwan-related issues.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250401_11585896.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-02","Guo Jiakun","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that the United States, the European Union, Japan, and other countries have issued comments on the joint military exercises conducted by the Chinese People's Liberation Army around Taiwan on April 1, claiming opposition to unilaterally changing the status quo by force or coercion, and accusing China of irresponsible threats and military pressure around Taiwan without any legitimate reason.…","The accusations made by a few countries and organizations against China disregard the facts, distort the truth, and interfere in China's internal affairs. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. What undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activity and the connivance and support of external forces. If the relevant countries and organizations truly desire peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, they should follow the general trend of the international community upholding the one-China principle, abide by their political commitments to China, respect China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence.\"\nAdvocating \"Taiwan independence\" is tantamount to splitting the country; supporting \"Taiwan independence\" is interference in China's internal affairs; and condoning \"Taiwan independence\" is undermining stability across the Taiwan Strait. China's joint military exercises are a resolute punishment for the Lai Ching-te administration's rampant provocations aimed at \"independence,\" a stern warning to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces for deliberately undermining peace across the Taiwan Strait, and a responsible act to safeguard national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity. No external force has the right to interfere.\nAs long as provocations by \"Taiwan independence\" continue, our efforts to combat \"independence\" will not cease for a moment. We will never allow anyone or any force to separate Taiwan from China in any way, and we will take all necessary measures to firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250402_11587335.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-03","Guo Jiakun","Beijing Daily reporter","It has been reported that Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Yoshimasa Hayashi stated at a press conference on April 1st regarding China's joint military exercises around Taiwan that the Japanese government is deeply concerned about these developments and is closely monitoring them. Japan has already expressed its concerns to China through diplomatic channels. What is China's comment on this?","Japan's relevant words and actions blatantly violate the one-China principle. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition, and has lodged a solemn representation with Japan. China's joint exercises are a serious warning and powerful deterrent to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and a legitimate and necessary action to safeguard national sovereignty and national unity. Japan has no right to make irresponsible remarks, much less interfere. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, concerning the political foundation of China-Japan relations and the basic trust between the two countries. Japan exercised colonial rule over Taiwan for half a century, committing countless crimes and bearing serious historical responsibility to the Chinese people. It should be especially cautious in its words and actions. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. We urge Japan to deeply reflect on its history, earnestly abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan and its solemn commitments on the Taiwan question, immediately cease interfering in China's internal affairs, and uphold the one-China principle with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250403_11588149.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-07","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","Wu Chao-hsieh, Secretary-General of Taiwan's National Security Council, recently led a delegation to Washington for \"special channel\" talks with the Trump administration. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan. This position is consistent and clear, and we have lodged a strong protest with the US. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, cease official exchanges with Taiwan, stop interfering in the Taiwan issue, and stop creating new tensions in the Taiwan Strait. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempt to seek independence by relying on the US has no future and will not succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250407_11589637.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-04-09","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, Lai Ching-te said he would not retaliate against the US on tariffs, would \"take hardship as nourishment,\" and would make large-scale purchases of agricultural, industrial, energy products, and weapons from the US. Do you have any comment?","The Lai Ching-te authorities, disregarding the interests of Taiwan's industries and people, are fawning upon and seeking favors from their \"foreign master\" — this amounts to \"measuring Taiwan's resources to win the favor of the United States.\" Giving the US whatever it demands will only drain Taiwan's future and harm Taiwan's people's livelihoods. The DPP authorities' attempt to pursue \"independence through reliance on the US\" and \"resist reunification through force\" is ultimately a dead end.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-04-09","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to US media, the US Defense Secretary signed a secret internal guidance memorandum designating China as the \"only pacing threat,\" with \"preventing the mainland from seizing Taiwan\" and strengthening homeland defense as primary priorities. Do you have any comment?","We have noted the relevant reports. I think the US side's \"China fear and paranoia\" is becoming increasingly severe. Treating China as a threat is a severe strategic miscalculation that will only lead to catastrophic consequences. It needs to be emphasized that China will and must be reunified — this is a historical trend that no person or force can stop.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-04-09","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, Taiwan has received its first F-16V aircraft from the United States, with 65 more to be delivered by the end of 2026. Analysts say this is intended to counter the increasingly modernized mainland air force. Do you have any comment?","We have noted the relevant reports. This is yet another instance of the US reneging on its solemn political commitments, violating the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, grossly interfering in China's internal affairs, and undermining stability in the Taiwan Strait region — a classic example of double standards. It needs to be emphasized that US arms sales to Taiwan cannot change the military balance across the strait, much less stop the irresistible historical trend of China's reunification. The DPP authorities are pouring tax money that should benefit the people into the bottomless pit of harming and destroying Taiwan, recklessly attempting to \"use the US to pursue independence\" and \"resist reunification through force.\" This will only push Taiwan into the danger of war, ultimately leading to self-destruction.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-04-11","Lin Jian","Shanghai Dragon TV reporter","It has been reported that Japanese Prime Minister Shigeru Ishiba, during a meeting with NATO Secretary General Mark Rutte on April 9, stated that a stable NATO is beneficial to Japan, and Japan will continue to play a leading role in deepening cooperation between NATO and its Indo-Pacific partners. In their joint statement, both sides made negative remarks concerning China regarding the situations in the East…","I have noted the relevant situation. China expresses strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to Japan's unreasonable interference in China's internal affairs in collusion with NATO, its exaggeration of regional tensions, and its instigation of confrontation.\nThe Asia-Pacific region is a high ground for cooperation and development; it does not need military blocs, nor does it need \"small circles\" that engage in great power confrontation and incite a new Cold War. NATO is a regional, defensive military organization and should not exceed the geographical boundaries defined by its treaties or overstep its authority. Due to historical reasons, Japan's military and security movements have always been a focus of attention for its Asian neighbors and the international community. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. Japan should deeply learn from historical lessons, adhere to the right path of Asia-Pacific cooperation, and play a constructive role in maintaining and promoting peace, stability, development, and prosperity in the region and the world. Acting as the \"vanguard\" of NATO's Asia-Pacific expansion will inevitably lead to its own disastrous consequences.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250411_11593654.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-17","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Can you provide more information about the recent repatriation of Taiwanese people from Cambodia to China?","China highly appreciates the Cambodian government's handling of the relevant issues in accordance with the one-China principle. China is willing to continue to deepen law enforcement cooperation with Cambodia and other relevant countries, resolutely crack down on online gambling and telecom fraud, safeguard the safety and legitimate rights and interests of Chinese citizens overseas, and maintain the normal order of personnel exchanges between China and relevant countries.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250417_11596227.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-21","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg reporter","The United States and the Philippines began their annual military exercises today, amid a dispute between China and the Philippines over the South China Sea. A Philippine military officer commanding the exercises stated that Manila is treating this exercise as a \"defensive exercise.\" What is China's response to this?","Currently, the international community is facing the impact of unilateralism, protectionism, and bullying. Countries in the region urgently hope to strengthen unity and cooperation, jointly safeguard regional stability, and work together to address these challenges. Against this backdrop, the Philippines, in collusion with countries outside the region, has conducted large-scale military exercises, introduced and deployed strategic and tactical weapons, undermined regional strategic stability, damaged the region's economic growth prospects, and openly stood in opposition to other countries in the region, which has already provoked strong resentment and opposition from these countries.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and is at the core of China's core interests. China firmly opposes any country using the Taiwan question as a pretext to strengthen its military deployments in the region, provoke tensions and confrontation, and undermine regional peace and stability. We advise relevant parties not to provoke on the Taiwan issue; those who play with fire will get burned.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250421_11600794.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-04-22","Guo Jiakun","A reporter from the Spanish newspaper ABC asked","Pope Francis repeatedly expressed his desire to visit China and meet with Chinese leaders. Is the Vatican's severing of diplomatic relations with Taiwan a precondition for such a visit?","In recent years, China and the Vatican have maintained constructive contact, carried out beneficial exchanges, and communicated extensively on international issues.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. We see more and more countries recognizing and adhering to the one-China principle. We hope that relevant countries will recognize the historical trend and return to the correct path of upholding the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250422_11601566.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-04-24","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the US, the Philippines and other countries are conducting Exercise Balikatan. As part of drills, the US military has, for the first time, deployed anti-ship missile system to the Luzon Strait north of the Philippines. Some analysts believe that this is to simulate the blockade of the Bashi Channel during a crisis in the Taiwan Strait. The Philippines and the US also organized Exercise Cope…","We always hold that military cooperation between countries should not target or hurt the interests of any third party, nor should it jeopardize regional peace and stability. The South China Sea should be a sea of peace, cooperation and friendship. However, the Philippines holds a candle to the devil by currying favor and colluding with the US and other outside countries to make provocations. It frequently conducts the so-called joint patrols and exercises, and invites and deploys strategic and tactical weapons, which seriously undermines the common interests of regional countries. We firmly oppose any country strengthening military deployment in the region and provoking tensions and confrontation under the excuse of the Taiwan question. Regardless of external challenges and turbulence, the Chinese side will resolutely safeguard our territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and firmly maintain peace and stability in the region.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-04-24","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, as revealed by Taiwan media outlets, there is a wave of resignation inside the troops of Taiwan. Many military officers on the ground chose early decommissioning or resignation to avoid fighting in war. Some analysts think that it's because they don't want to be cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\" separatists. What's your comment on this? Secondly, the Japanese Ministry of…","On your first question, this is another evidence that “Taiwan independence” separatists have no support from the people of Taiwan and will collapse like a house of cards.\nOn your second question, we firmly oppose the Japanese side playing up the so-called \"China military threat\", hyping up tensions in the region, and deliberately provoking confrontation. China follows a path of peaceful development and pursues a national defense policy that is defensive in nature. Our military development is aimed at safeguarding our national sovereignty, security and development interests. We have no intention to challenge or threaten any country. Engagements and cooperation between the Chinese and Russian militaries feature non-alignment, non-confrontation and non-targeting any third party.\nIn recent years, the Japanese side has drastically increased defense budget, and sought breakthroughs in military build-up. Its behaviors have led to serious concerns among its Asian neighbors and the international community. We urge the Japanese side to recalibrate its strategic perception of China, stop provoking bloc confrontation, be prudent with its words and actions in the military and security domain, and contribute more to regional peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-04-24","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command said in a recent Senate hearing that \"China's increasingly aggressive actions near Taiwan are not just exercises, but rehearsals for attacking Taiwan\". He suggested that the US should significantly advance autonomous systems and deploy them in the Taiwan Strait, so as to build a \"hellscape\" to deter China. What's your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China. How to resolve it is a matter for the Chinese, which brooks no foreign interference. Some individuals of the US side point fingers at and make groundless speculations on the legitimate and necessary measures taken by the Chinese side to safeguard our national sovereignty and territorial integrity. They also attempt to bluff us with a fancy slogan. This exposes their true motive of clinging to US hegemony and selfish interests at the cost of destroying others' homeland. Threats and intimidation will never work on China or the Chinese military.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-04-24","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, it's reported that the troops in Taiwan started the computer-assisted command post drill (computer-simulated war games) under &nbsp;Exercise Han Kuang 41 on April 5. The drill will last for 14 days and 13 nights. The scenarios include the so-called potential operations by the Chinese mainland, such as \"gray-zone harassment\" and \"transition from exercise to war\". Koo Li-hsiung, Head…","On your first question, the military elements of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces put on a flashy show by conducting exercises. This does nothing more than embolden and comfort themselves. No matter how many drills they carry out, they will not be able to escape from their destined failure.\nSenior Colonel Zhang Xiaogang, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of April 24, 2025. (mod.gov.cn/Photo by Sun Yue)\nOn your second question, for its selfish gains, the DPP authorities hysterically hype up the so-called \"mainland's threat\", stir up social panic, and double down on their “combat readiness for Taiwan independence\". If left unchecked, their behaviors will surely plunge Taiwan into war. The DPP authorities' so-called \"whole-of-society defence\" actually harms the whole society, as they take the Taiwan island as a battlefield and coerce the local people into cannon fodders for \"Taiwan independence\". Their actions are shameful. The PLA is committed to fighting against \"Taiwan independence\" separatists, promoting national reunification, and safeguarding China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We hope our Taiwan compatriots recognize the true nature of the DPP authorities as a source of chaos and disasters, take active actions to oppose \"Taiwan independence\", and protect their own well-being and livelihood. We hope the two sides of the Taiwan Strait will join hands to promote national reunification and rejuvenation.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-04-24","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports from Taiwan media, the US side sent a retired four-star army general, who was also a former commander of US Forces Korea, to serve as the senior observer for the war games of this year's Han Kuang Exercise. In addition, the war games revealed five potential patterns of joint operations between Taiwan and the US in wartime. May I have your comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military collusion between the US and Taiwan. To embolden and support \"Taiwan independence\" separatists is to ruin peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. Those who do that will get burned for playing with fire, and taste the bitter fruit of their own doing. We urge the US side to stop stirring up troubles on the Taiwan question, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the stipulations of the three China-US joint communiqués, and deliver on its promise of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\". We solemnly warn the DPP authorities that those who solicit US support for \"Taiwan independence\" will be stabbed in the back, and be abandoned as a useless pawn.\nZhang Xiaogang: If no other questions, this concludes today's press conference. Thank you.\nRelated News\nComments\nWe Recommend\nThousands of PLA personnel deployed to flood-hit Rongjiang\n2025-07-08\nFujian coast guard conducts routine patrol of waters near Kinmen\n2025-05-28\nCNS Shandong's training not aiming at any specific country or target: spokesman\n2025-05-09\nMost Viewed\nChina strongly urges India, Pakistan to exercise calm and restraint: FM spokesperson\n2025-05-10\nChinese, Egyptian air forces hold joint training in Egypt\n2025-05-08\nChina, Vietnam to hold 9th border defense friendship exchange\n2025-04-11\nPhotos\nPLAN hospital ship Silk Road Ark sets sail for Mission Harmony 2025\n2025-09-12\nJ-10 fighters engage in round-the-clock flight training\n2025-08-11\nSelf-propelled mortar howitzer opens fire in training\n2025-08-10\n-->\nCopyright @China Military. All rights reserved.\nReproduction in whole or in part without permission is prohibited.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-04-30","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Taiwan claims that Somalia has banned Taiwanese citizens from entering the country due to its dissatisfaction with the development of relations between Taiwan and Somaliland. Somalia's move is attributed to pressure from China. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","China has noted that the Somali Federal Government recently announced, in accordance with the Somali Federal Constitution and UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, a ban on the entry, exit, or transit of persons holding travel documents issued by the Taiwan authorities into or through Somalia. China reiterates its adherence to the one-China principle and emphasizes that the establishment of so-called \"representative offices\" and official exchanges between the Taiwan authorities and Somaliland directly infringes upon Somalia's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThe aforementioned decision is a legitimate measure taken by Somalia as a sovereign state to safeguard its legitimate rights and interests, and it also reflects Somalia's firm adherence to the one-China principle, for which China highly appreciates. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle has been affirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, is a basic norm of international relations and a broad consensus of the international community, and is an irresistible trend and the will of the people.\nSomaliland is part of Somali territory. China firmly supports the efforts of the Federal Government of Somalia to safeguard national unity, sovereignty and territorial integrity, and resolutely opposes the Taiwan authorities establishing institutions with Somaliland or conducting any form of official exchanges.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202504/t20250430_11614172.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-08","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te told Western diplomats at an event commemorating the end of World War II that Taiwan and Europe are facing a \"threat from a new totalitarian bloc.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Taiwan's return to China in 1945 was an important part of the fruits of victory in World War II and the post-war international order. A series of documents with international legal force, such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Declaration, and the Instrument of Surrender of Japan, have affirmed China's sovereignty over Taiwan and laid the cornerstone of the post-war international order.\nThe DPP authorities have consistently used the guise of \"democracy\" and \"freedom\" to conceal the separatist nature of \"Taiwan independence.\" No matter what they say or do, they cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, nor can they alter the international community's universal consensus on the one-China principle.\nWe urge relevant countries to abide by their political commitments to China on the Taiwan issue, to effectively restrain their personnel, not to support the performance of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and not to send any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250508_11617555.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-05-08","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","It is reported that during the Philippine-U.S. “Balikatan” exercise, the Chinese aircraft carrier Shandong appeared in the waters north of the Philippines. Some analysts believe this might be a response to the Philippine-U.S. military exercise, or to the Philippine patrol vessel’s entering into the waters near Huangyan Dao. Furthermore, the Philippine Navy spokesperson claimed that the Philippine military and…","The Shandong aircraft carrier task group was conducting its annual training mission in relevant waters to further test and enhance the integrated combat capabilities of the carrier task group. This is in accordance with international law and common practice, and is not directed at any specific country or target.\nCertain individuals in the Philippines are colluding with external forces such as the U.S., to “stir up the sea” for selfish gains, undermining peace and stability in the South China Sea region. They even attempt to play with fire on the Taiwan question. We sternly warn the Philippine side to cease its infringements and provocations, and stop offending China’s core interest in any form. China will continue to take resolute and forceful measures to defend its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-05-13","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Why were the flags of Haiti and Saint Lucia, Taiwan's \"diplomatic allies,\" displayed at the opening ceremony of the Fourth Ministerial Meeting of the China-CELAC Forum this morning?","The China-CELAC Forum is an important platform for China to carry out mutually beneficial cooperation with Latin American and Caribbean countries. China has always welcomed and supported the participation of CELAC member states in activities within the framework of the Forum.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250513_11621984.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-15","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency reporter","It is understood that the 78th World Health Assembly will open on May 19, and Taiwan has not yet received an invitation to participate. What is the Chinese government's comment on this?","China's position on the participation of Taiwan in international organizations, including the World Health Organization, is consistent and clear: it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. This is also the fundamental principle affirmed by UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 and World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1. Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the World Health Assembly without the consent of the central government. The DPP authorities in Taiwan stubbornly adhere to their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, rendering the political foundation for Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly nonexistent. In order to uphold the one-China principle and defend the seriousness and authority of the relevant resolutions of the UN General Assembly and the World Health Assembly, China has decided not to agree to Taiwan's participation in this year's World Health Assembly.\nFor some time now, the DPP authorities and certain countries have openly turned back the clock of history, deliberately distorting and challenging UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 in an attempt to challenge the one-China principle. This is not only a challenge to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, but also a challenge to international justice and universal consensus, and a challenge to the post-World War II international order. China's decision not to agree to Taiwan's participation in this year's World Health Assembly has received widespread understanding and support from the international community. This fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is the will of the people, the general trend, and the righteous cause; the international community's adherence to the one-China principle is unchallenged and unshakable. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they cannot change the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China and that Taiwan is a part of China, nor can they stop the historical trend of China's inevitable reunification. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and attempts to seek \"independence\" are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250515_11623657.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-22","Mao Ning","Reporter from China Review News Service in Hong Kong","According to reports, Solomon Islands Prime Minister Manele recently issued a statement reiterating that the Solomon Islands government firmly adheres to the one-China principle and requires government departments and officials at all levels to abide by the one-China policy. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The Solomon Islands government firmly supports the one-China principle and adheres to a just stance, which China highly appreciates. There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legal government representing all of China. The one-China principle was confirmed by the United Nations General Assembly Resolution 2758 and is a basic norm of international relations and a broad consensus of the international community. Adhering to the one-China principle and supporting China's reunification are the general trend, the righteousness and the aspiration of the people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250522_11630692.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-22","Mao Ning","AFP","Yesterday, Taiwan’s Democratic Progressive Party expelled five party members accused of spying for Beijing. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","I don’t understand the situation you mentioned. This is not a diplomatic issue.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250522_11630692.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-22","Mao Ning","Reuters","Taiwanese official Lin Jialong said yesterday that China does not have the final say on Taiwan’s name and that Taiwan can decide for itself whether it is a country. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","Taiwan has never been a country. The relevant remarks can only expose someone's arrogance and ignorance and are a naked provocation for \"Taiwan independence.\"\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legitimate government representing the whole of China. This is a basic norm for international relations and a broad consensus of the international community. Taiwan's future can only be determined by the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. China will eventually be reunified and will be reunified. This is a historical trend that no force can stop.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250522_11630692.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-23","Mao Ning","TVB reporter","It has been reported that the Taiwanese fishing vessel \"Hong Cai Tou 6\" was recently seized by Japanese government vessels for violating fisheries regulations and was released only after paying a large bail. Last year, China lodged a protest with Japan regarding the seizure of the Taiwanese fishing vessel. Has China lodged another protest with Japan this time?","The Chinese government attaches great importance to safeguarding the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese fishermen, including those from Taiwan. According to the China-Japan Fisheries Agreement, Japan has no right to take enforcement measures against Chinese fishing vessels in the relevant waters. Regarding Japan's seizure of the \"Hongcaitou 6\" fishing vessel, China has lodged a strong protest with Japan, demanding that it immediately correct its erroneous actions and take effective measures to prevent similar incidents from happening again.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250523_11631403.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-28","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Japan's defense ministry says the Chinese aircraft carrier Liaoning and its carrier strike group have passed Japan's southern islands and are heading towards the western Pacific. Japan is closely monitoring the situation. Why is the Chinese carrier strike group so close to Japan? Is China trying to send a message to Japan, the United States, and Taiwan?","For specific questions, I suggest contacting the relevant Chinese authorities. What I can tell you is that the activities of Chinese warships in the relevant waters are entirely in accordance with international law and practice. We hope Japan will view this objectively and rationally.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250528_11635366.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-29","Mao Ning","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that China has removed a buoy located in the exclusive economic zone south of Yonaguni Island in Okinawa Prefecture, Japan. Why did China remove this buoy?","China's deployment of meteorological observation buoys in waters under Chinese jurisdiction east of Taiwan is in accordance with both Chinese domestic law and international law. It is understood that relevant Chinese departments are currently conducting routine maintenance on the buoys as needed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250529_11636603.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-05-30","Lin Jian","Reuters","According to reports, the United States plans to increase arms sales to Taiwan, exceeding the level during Trump’s first term. What impact will this have on Sino-US relations? What measures may China take in response?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the first insurmountable red line in Sino-US relations. China firmly opposes the U.S. selling arms to Taiwan, and urges the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17\" communiqué, stop selling weapons to Taiwan, and stop creating tension in the Taiwan Strait. China is unswervingly determined to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202505/t20250530_11637703.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-04","Lin Jian","China Daily reporter","Recently, some European leaders, while attending the Shangri-La Dialogue, drew parallels between the Taiwan issue and the Ukraine issue, alluded to the \"China threat\" in the South China Sea, and suggested that NATO \"has reason to intervene in the Asia-Pacific region.\" What is China's comment on this?","We firmly oppose the relevant remarks. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is entirely China's internal affair, which has no comparison with the Ukraine crisis. China firmly opposes any words or deeds that attempt to confuse or distort the nature of the Taiwan issue, and urges relevant parties to take concrete actions to uphold the one-China principle and respect China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nThe situation in the South China Sea is generally stable, and the freedom of navigation and overflight enjoyed by all countries in accordance with the law is not in question. China has always adhered to the principle of properly handling maritime disputes and differences with the directly concerned parties through negotiation and consultation on the basis of respecting historical facts. Countries outside the region should respect the efforts made by regional countries to maintain peace and stability in the South China Sea, rather than instigate conflicts and create disputes.\nNATO is a regional, defensive military organization and has no right to exceed the geographical boundaries defined by its own treaties or overstep its authority. China firmly opposes NATO's \"eastward expansion into the Asia-Pacific,\" which creates tension, provokes confrontation, and undermines regional and even global peace and stability. Asia-Pacific countries do not welcome \"NATO becoming more like the Asia-Pacific,\" and the Asia-Pacific region does not need an \"Asia-Pacific version of NATO.\"\nI want to emphasize that Asia is the shared home of China and all Asian countries. In recent years, thanks to the joint efforts of countries in the region, Asia has maintained rapid growth, becoming a high ground for global development and an oasis of peaceful development. China has always adhered to the principles of amity, sincerity, mutual benefit and inclusiveness in its neighborhood diplomacy, resolutely opposed \"camp confrontation,\" and never sought any so-called \"sphere of influence.\" Relevant parties should not engage in malicious speculation or sowing discord among Asia-Pacific countries based on Cold War thinking, but should instead do more to promote peace, stability, and prosperity in the Asia-Pacific region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250604_11640779.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-06","Lin Jian","EFE reporter","It has been reported that Guatemalan President Arevalo, during his meeting with Lai Ching-te in Taipei, expressed his willingness to elevate Guatemalan-Taiwan relations to a new level. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is a universal consensus of the international community and cannot be challenged. The DPP authorities' attempts to use so-called \"diplomatic allies\" for political manipulation are nothing but self-deception and cannot stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.\nCurrently, 183 countries worldwide have established diplomatic relations with China, which fully demonstrates that adhering to the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. Recognizing the one-China principle, developing relations with China, and sharing development opportunities truly serve the fundamental interests of Guatemala and its people. We urge the governments of relevant countries to recognize the general trend, follow public opinion, and make the right choice as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250606_11642581.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-06-09","Jiang Bin","Reporter","It is reported that the British government recently released its Strategic Defense Review , claiming that China is leveraging its economic, technological, and military capabilities to establish dominance in the Indo-Pacific, posing a \"sophisticated and persistent challenge.\" What's your comment on this?","China stays committed to the path of peaceful development and a defense policy that is defensive in nature. China has worked all along to uphold, promote and contribute to security in the Asia Pacific region. China's development brings opportunities, not challenges, to other countries, and contributes stability and positive energy to world peace. We hope that the UK side adopts a right perception of China, respect facts, take a rational view of China and its military development, stop hyping up the so-called \"China threat\", and do more to facilitate the development of bilateral ties and military relations between the two countries.\nOn the afternoon of June 9, 2025, Senior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of China's Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answers recent media queries concerning the military. (Photo by Li Xiaowei)\nJournalist：It is reported that the US is transporting a new batch of M1A2 tanks to Taiwan and plans to increase its arms sales to Taiwan over the next four years. New arms sales may surpass that of the first Trump administration. In addition, a former official of the US military said that about 500 US military personnel are operating in Taiwan, which is over ten times of the number previously disclosed by the US Congress. What's your comment on this?\nJiang Bin: This is another solid piece of evidence that the US side and the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces are taking efforts to violate China's core interests, change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait and escalate regional tensions. Who is making provocations despite strong opposition from the Chinese side? Who is undermining cross-Strait stability and repeatedly stirring up troubles? We believe we all know the answers. The Chinese side is strongly dissatisfied and firmly opposed to this act.\nThe Taiwan question is at the very core of China's core interests, and is the first red line that must not be crossed in China-US relations. We urge the US side to stop its military collusion with Taiwan in any form; otherwise it will get burnt for playing with fire and gain more harm than good. We warn the DPP authorities that US weapons cannot save them, and soliciting external support for \"Taiwan independence\" will only fail. The PLA will continue to strengthen military training and combat readiness and enhance its capability to fight and win. We will take resolute measures to thwart \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and external interference.\nRelated News\nComments\nWe Recommend\nThousands of PLA personnel deployed to flood-hit Rongjiang\n2025-07-08\nFujian coast guard conducts routine patrol of waters near Kinmen\n2025-05-28\nCNS Shandong's training not aiming at any specific country or target: spokesman\n2025-05-09\nMost Viewed\nChina strongly urges India, Pakistan to exercise calm and restraint: FM spokesperson\n2025-05-10\nChinese, Egyptian air forces hold joint training in Egypt\n2025-05-08\nChina, Vietnam to hold 9th border defense friendship exchange\n2025-04-11\nPhotos\nPLAN hospital ship Silk Road Ark sets sail for Mission Harmony 2025\n2025-09-12\nJ-10 fighters engage in round-the-clock flight training\n2025-08-11\nSelf-propelled mortar howitzer opens fire in training\n2025-08-10\n-->\nCopyright @China Military. All rights reserved.\nReproduction in whole or in part without permission is prohibited.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-13","Jiang Bin","Question","According to reports, the Taipei School of Economics and Political Science Foundation recently held a chief-of-staff level war-gaming for the first time. The war-gaming hosted by the civilian group was under the scenario of a crisis in the Taiwan Strait, and the former “Chief of the General Staff” of the Taiwan region, the former Chairman of the US Joint Chiefs of Staff, and the former Chief of Staff of the Japan…","The Taiwan question is purely China’s internal affair, which brooks no external interference. Whoever emboldens “Taiwan independence” separatist forces to seek secession will undermine cross-Strait peace and stability, and is bound to get burnt for playing with fire. We urge relevant countries to truly abide by the one-China principle, stop sending any wrong signal to the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. In the face of the prevailing trend that China will and must be reunified, any scheme to solicit foreign support for independence and contain China with Taiwan is doomed to fail.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-06-17","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg reporter","According to our report, under pressure from the United States, the Taiwanese authorities have added Huawei and SMIC to Taiwan's Entity List. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","China has consistently opposed the US politicizing science and technology and economic and trade issues, overgeneralizing the concept of national security, abusing export controls and long-arm jurisdiction, and maliciously blocking and suppressing China. The DPP authorities' \"kowtowing to the US\" will only harm and destroy Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250617_11651839.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-18","Guo Jiakun","China Daily reporter","On June 17 local time, Canadian Prime Minister Carney, in his summary of the G7 summit, stated that the G7 emphasized the importance of building a constructive and stable relationship with China, called on China to avoid market distortions and overcapacity, expressed serious concern about China's destabilizing activities in the East China Sea and South China Sea, and stressed the importance of maintaining peace…","The G7 summit once again manipulated China-related issues, making irresponsible remarks on issues such as Taiwan, the South China Sea, and the East China Sea, and smearing China with so-called \"overcapacity\" and \"market distortion,\" interfering in China's internal affairs and violating the basic norms of international relations. China firmly opposes this and has lodged solemn representations with the relevant parties.\nThe biggest threats to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait are separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and interference from external forces. If the G7 truly cares about peace across the Taiwan Strait, it must adhere to the one-China principle, explicitly oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" and support China's reunification.\nThe situation in the East China Sea and the South China Sea remains generally stable. The G7 should respect the joint efforts of regional countries to resolve issues through dialogue and consultation and maintain peace and stability, and stop using maritime issues to provoke relations between regional countries and exacerbate regional tensions.\nThe claims of \"market distortion\" and \"overcapacity\" in China are completely false. The G7 is using these as an excuse to carry out trade protectionism, which is essentially aimed at curbing and suppressing the development of China's industries. It is a politicization and instrumentalization of economic and trade issues.\nChina once again urges the G7 to recognize the general trend of world development, abandon Cold War mentality and ideological bias, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, stop provoking conflict and confrontation, and do more positive things that benefit the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250618_11652681.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-20","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te on Thursday ordered defense and security departments to strengthen monitoring and intelligence work targeting Chinese military activities. He stated that these activities have not diminished even with escalating tensions in the Middle East. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The DPP authorities are once again \"riding the coattails\" of current events. No matter what they say or do, they cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, nor can they change the inevitable trend of China's eventual reunification. Their attempt to seek independence through force is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250620_11654061.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-23","Guo Jiakun","Beijing Youth Daily reporter","We recently noticed that the temporary flight evacuating Chinese citizens from Iran from Turkmenistan has successfully arrived in China. What is the latest progress of China's evacuation operations from Iran and Israel?","In accordance with the decisions and arrangements of the CPC Central Committee, and with the joint efforts of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Chinese embassies and consulates in Iran and other countries, as well as the Ministry of Transport, the Civil Aviation Administration of China, and other departments, 3,125 Chinese citizens have been safely evacuated from Iran. Among them are infants as young as 10 months old, elderly people in their seventies, and residents of Hong Kong and Taiwan. Currently, all Chinese citizens in Iran who wished to evacuate have been evacuated to safe areas, and the Chinese government's large-scale, organized evacuation of personnel from Iran has been completed. Meanwhile, the Chinese Embassy in Israel has assisted in organizing the safe departure of over 500 Chinese citizens from Israel and has also assisted in the safe transfer of some British, Indian, and Polish citizens.\nDuring the evacuation, Iran, Azerbaijan, Turkmenistan, Armenia, Turkey, Iraq, the United Arab Emirates, Oman, Kuwait, Egypt, Jordan and other countries provided valuable support to China, for which we express our heartfelt gratitude.\nCurrently, some Chinese citizens are still choosing to remain in the country, and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs reminds them to pay close attention to their safety. Diplomats at the Chinese Embassy and Consulates in Iran and the Chinese Embassy in Israel remain at their posts and will continue to do their utmost to provide assistance to Chinese citizens in the country.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250623_11655211.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, according to media reports, sea trial of PLANS Fujian is steadily advancing and the PLA Navy will soon have three operational aircraft carriers. Does that mean China's third aircraft carrier will be commissioned soon? What role will the three carrier task groups play in safeguarding China's overseas interests and maintaining regional stability? Second, it is reported that the US side…","On your first question, building a strong and modernized navy is a century-old dream of the Chinese nation. China builds aircraft carriers in line with our national security needs and the development of equipment and technology. Starting from scratch, the PLA Navy has made leapfrog progress in aircraft carrier development. After successive commissioning of PLANS Liaoning and PLANS Shandong capable of ski jump launch, we now have the first carrier with electromagnetic catapult launch, PLANS Fujian. It should be emphasized that China develops weapons and equipment only to safeguard our national sovereignty, security and development interests. The Chinese military remains a staunch force for world peace. The more capable we are, the stronger the force in defending peace and preventing war.\nOn your second question, we firmly oppose any form of military collusion between the US and China's Taiwan region. Such collusion, be it military aid, arms sale or under any other excuse, reveals the extremely malicious intention of the US to mislead Taiwan into the flames of war, harming Taiwan itself and destroying its interests. We urge the US side to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We warn the DPP authorities that \"soliciting US support for independence\" is doomed to fail, and \"resisting reunification by force\" is a dead end.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, it is reported that the poll initiated by the Democratic Culture and Education Foundation in Taiwan showed that 66% of the respondents believed that the US may sell out Taiwan for its own interests; 67% believed that the US mainly uses Taiwan as a bargaining chip in its rivalry with the Chinese mainland. What's your take on that? Second, the leader of the Taiwan region Lai Ching-te…","On your first question, the US always puts its own interests first and this won't be different when it comes to the Taiwan question. Acting as a pawn, the DPP authorities cannot escape the fate of being abandoned. Many more compatriots in Taiwan have now realized that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, foreign support is unreliable, and China's reunification is inevitable. Those who act against the trend of reunification and attempt to separate the country will never have a good end.\nOn your second question, Taiwan is a part of China. It has never been and will never be a country. Lai Ching-te has distorted historical facts and made up false theories with an ill attempt to provoke for independence and escalate tensions across the Strait. His delirious talks will never change the legal fact that Taiwan is a part of China and the international community's commitment to the one-China principle, and will never stop the historical trend that China will and must be reunified. The PLA shows zero tolerance towards \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. We will strengthen military training and combat readiness and resolutely safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","The DPP authorities claimed that 46 PLA fighter jets crossed the Taiwan Strait and six PLA vessels circled around Taiwan within 24 hours, which is the largest PLA operation around the island recently. What's your comment on this?","PLA military drills around the Taiwan Island are necessary actions to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, as well as stern warnings against the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and the interference of external forces. They are fully justified, legitimate, and reasonable. The Lai Ching-te authorities have taken continued actions to seek independence, which could push Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war. They are the culprits who undermine security and well-being of Taiwan compatriots and will surely be disdained by the people and judged by the time.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","A former commander of the US Pacific Command has reportedly said that 2027 is a critical year for the PLA not only to attack Taiwan but also to become a world-class military. The Chinese side now sails its aircraft carriers and other large vessels beyond the Second Island Chain to put pressure on Taiwan, Japan and the US. He called it \"gunboat diplomacy\". Do you have any comment?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people, which brooks no foreign interference. The operation and training activities conducted by Chinese aircraft carrier task groups conform to international law and practices, and do not target at any third party. In addition, China has never done such things as \"gunboat diplomacy\". We urge the US side not to perceive China with its own hegemonic mindset, and stop misinterpreting China's legitimate actions with false ideas.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the US Secretary of Defense recently claimed at a congressional hearing that China is a \"pacing threat\", and that the US will prioritize re-establishing deterrence in the Indo-Pacific region to \"achieve peace through strength\". The One Big Beautiful Bill of the US would allocate 12 billion US dollars for the \"Pacific Deterrence Initiative\", further strengthening combat readiness of US forces…","Zero-sum game should not be the way that major countries handle each other, and peaceful coexistence should be a bottom line both China and the US hold. China's development poses no threat to other countries and we never resort to deterrence or coercion preferred by some certain country.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair which brooks no foreign interference. The US side has repeatedly gone back on its own words and kept arming Taiwan, which would only backfire. We urge the US side to have an objective and rational perception of China, stop blaming China on everything, and stop deceiving and misleading the US public and the international community, so as to create favorable conditions for developing state-to-state and mil-to-mil relations between China and the US.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, it is reported that this year's enrollment in military academies in Taiwan has been hotly discussed, with the number of female cadets in many academies surpassing that of male cadets. \"When male soldiers are not enough, female soldiers have to fill the gap\". Such a situation does not reflect gender equality, but rather a fact that no one want to throw their lives away for \"Taiwan…","There is a good point in your first question, no one want to throw their lives away for \"Taiwan independence\". It is unworthy and meaningless to be cannon fodders for the armed forces of \"Taiwan independence\".\nOn your second question, Lai Ching-te and his kind are trying to find all kinds of ways to pay \"protection fees\" to their US masters, which squandered hard-earned money of the people in Taiwan. This is exactly \"selling off the farmland of one's family without being conscience-stricken\". We warn the DPP authorities that their attempts to solicit US support for \"Taiwan independence\" and resist reunification by force will only fail.\nSenior Colonel Zhang Xiaogang, spokesperson for the Ministry of National Defense (MND) of the People's Republic of China (PRC), answers questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of&nbsp;June 26, 2025. (mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, during its summit in the Hague from June 24 to 25, NATO accused China of providing Russia with key support in the Russia-Ukraine conflict, and expressed concerns over the South China Sea, the East China Sea and the Taiwan question. NATO Secretary General recently said that China is significantly strengthening its military capabilities, building the world's largest navy, and expanding its…","China adheres to the path of peaceful development, and is committed to a national defense policy that is defensive in nature. China's military development is purely aimed at safeguarding national sovereignty, security and development interests. China-Russia cooperation does not target at any third party, nor will it be interfered by any third party.\nAs a product of the Cold War and the largest military bloc in the world, NATO stirs up troubles and provokes conflicts and wars in various regions, making itself a true war machine. In recent years, NATO has overstretched its geographic boundary stipulated by its own Treaty, and ill-expanded its power and authority, arousing high vigilance among regional countries. We firmly oppose NATO using China as an excuse to \"expand eastward into the Asia-Pacific\" and urge NATO to reflect on its own behaviors, change course, and contribute more to global security and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to media reports, Taiwan's first indigenous submarine Hai Kun recently completed its maiden sea trial. Do you have any comment on that?","The \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces tried very hard to build the submarine Hai Kun only to find a form of psychological comfort. It can be easily defeated by the PLA.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-06-26","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the Stockholm International Peace Research Institute of Sweden recently released its annual report on global nuclear forces, stating that China currently possesses 600 nuclear warheads, ranking third in the world. It says China's stockpile is increasing at a speed of approximately 100 per year, faster than that of any other country. What is your comment?","I will not comment on this kind of speculative reports. China adheres to a nuclear strategy of self-defense, and commits itself to a nuclear policy of no first use of nuclear weapons. We keep our nuclear force at a minimum level required for national security and have no intention to engage in arms race with any country. China will continue to safeguard its legitimate security interests and uphold world peace and stability.\nZhang Xiaogang: If there are no other questions, it concludes today's press conference.\nRelated News\nComments\nWe Recommend\nThousands of PLA personnel deployed to flood-hit Rongjiang\n2025-07-08\nFujian coast guard conducts routine patrol of waters near Kinmen\n2025-05-28\nCNS Shandong's training not aiming at any specific country or target: spokesman\n2025-05-09\nMost Viewed\nChina strongly urges India, Pakistan to exercise calm and restraint: FM spokesperson\n2025-05-10\nChinese, Egyptian air forces hold joint training in Egypt\n2025-05-08\nChina, Vietnam to hold 9th border defense friendship exchange\n2025-04-11\nPhotos\nPLAN hospital ship Silk Road Ark sets sail for Mission Harmony 2025\n2025-09-12\nJ-10 fighters engage in round-the-clock flight training\n2025-08-11\nSelf-propelled mortar howitzer opens fire in training\n2025-08-10\n-->\nCopyright @China Military. All rights reserved.\nReproduction in whole or in part without permission is prohibited.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-06-27","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Czech media reports that last year, during Hsiao Bi-khim's stay in Prague, personnel from the Chinese Embassy in the Czech Republic followed her. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this report?","The Czech Republic's permission for Hsiao Bi-khim, a die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" activist, to visit China seriously violates the one-China principle and the Czech Republic's political commitments to China, and constitutes a blatant interference in China's internal affairs. China has expressed its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nI want to emphasize that Chinese diplomats have always abided by the laws and regulations of the host countries. China urges relevant parties not to be provoked and exploited by \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and not to create trouble or maliciously hype things up, interfering with and damaging bilateral relations. No matter how the DPP authorities change their tactics of \"seeking independence through foreign influence,\" they cannot conceal their sinister schemes and are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250627_11660620.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-06-30","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan's \"Vice President\" Hsiao Meiqin said she would not be intimidated by Beijing. Taiwanese authorities previously claimed that during her official visit to the Czech Republic in March last year, Chinese embassy personnel planned to \"ram\" the vehicle she was traveling in. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","First of all, Taiwan is part of China and there is no \"vice president\". Chinese diplomats have always abided by the laws and regulations of the host countries. No matter how the DPP authorities change their tactics to \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\" and sow discord between China and countries that have diplomatic relations with it, they cannot conceal their sinister intentions, let alone succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202506/t20250630_11661711.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-01","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","The U.S. Department of Justice announced yesterday that it had shut down a network that allegedly helped North Korea raise funds for its weapons program by conducting remote information technology work. Six Chinese citizens and two Taiwanese residents were indicted in connection with the case. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","China has always opposed unilateral sanctions that have no basis in international law and are not authorized by the UN Security Council. We will take all necessary measures to safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese citizens.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250701_11662827.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-03","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","It has been reported that the US House of Representatives recently passed the \"Taiwan Non-Discrimination Act,\" requiring the US government to support Taiwan's accession to the International Monetary Fund (IMF), granting it the right to participate in economic oversight, obtain technical assistance, and have its personnel appointed to positions within the IMF. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. Taiwan has no basis, reason, or right to participate in the United Nations or other international organizations that only sovereign states can participate in. We urge the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, comply with international law and the basic norms governing international relations, stop advancing relevant legislation, stop interfering in China's internal affairs under the pretext of the Taiwan issue, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250703_11664465.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-07-08","Jiang Bin","Question","According to reports, Taiwan’s military will conduct the Han Kuang-41 live-troop exercise starting from July 9. The exercise will focus on such subjects as the so-called “response to gray-zone harassment”, “joint anti-landing operations” and “resilient defense on the Island”. Meanwhile, many US weapons will make their debut during the exercise. What’s your comment?","The Han Kuang exercise is nothing but a bluffing and self-deceiving trick played by the DPP authorities to hijack Taiwan compatriots on-board its “Taiwan Independence” war chariot. The DPP authorities are harming Taiwan out of its selfish interests. We solemnly warn the DPP authorities that \"seeking independence by force\" is a dead end. Whatever subjects they drill and whatever weapons they use, the PLA’s resolute countermeasures against “Taiwan Independence” would not be deterred, nor would the overwhelming and irresistible trend of China’s national reunification be stopped.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-07-09","Mao Ning","AFP reporter","Taiwan launched its annual military exercises today, marking the first time it has utilized a newly delivered high-tech rocket system from the United States. Taiwan stated that the exercises aim to demonstrate its capability and confidence in safeguarding its \"sovereignty\" and \"free and democratic way of life.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","Our position against US-Taiwan military ties is consistent and very firm. The DPP authorities' attempt to seek independence through force or by relying on foreign powers is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250709_11668073.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-07-14","Jiang Bin","Question","The head of Taiwan’s military agency has reportedly announced the establishment of Taiwan’s first HIMARS company, and that it will greatly improve the Taiwan military’s precision strike and overall defense capabilities. In addition, Taiwan’s military agency has approved the acquisition of 168 units of US M109A7 self-propelled howitzers. Do you have any comment?","In order to solicit US support for “Taiwan independence”, the DPP authorities are selling Taiwan’s interests to flatter the US and squandering the hard-earned money of the Taiwan people to pay protection fees. Buying US weapons to embolden themselves is useless and self-deceiving. Resisting reunification by force is a dead end. War provocations made by the “Taiwan independence” armed forces are futile, and will only lead to self-destruction.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-07-14","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, following the Civil Aviation Administration’s announcement to open the M503 air route W121 connection line, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities claimed that this move compresses Taiwan’s air defense depth and early-warning time, attempting to completely erase the “median line of the Taiwan Strait,” and constitutes a “military threat” to Taiwan. Some media noted that the adjustment…","Taiwan is a part of China; there is no such thing as a “median line of the Taiwan Strait.” The establishment and opening of the relevant air routes are routine measures conducted by competent authorities based on civil aviation management and development needs and are beneficial to compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nFor the sake of a single party, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities exploit this to exaggerate the so-called “military threat from the mainland,” attempting to create security anxiety, escalate confrontation, and obstruct cross-strait exchanges. Their actions are unpopular and will not succeed.The root cause of the current tension and instability in cross-strait relations lies in the Democratic Progressive Party authorities’ collusion with external forces to continuously provoke “Taiwan independence.” We hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will clearly recognize the true nature of the DPP’s separatist ambitions, understand the serious harm caused by “Taiwan independence,” firmly oppose “Taiwan independence” separatist activities, and jointly safeguard peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-07-15","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Paraguayan President said preparations are underway for Lai Ching-te's \"visit\" to the country next month. Lai is also expected to \"visit\" Belize, and will likely transit through the United States. Has China requested the US not to allow Lai's transit? What is the US response?","Regarding the issue of Paraguay maintaining so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan, China has repeatedly stated its solemn position. The one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. Adhering to the one-China principle is in the spirit of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend.\nFor some time now, many people from Latin American countries, including Paraguay, have visited China. Their biggest takeaway is that Paraguay can no longer continue to \"turn its back\" on China and remain an \"outsider\" in the international community. They should recognize the one-China principle as soon as possible and make changes in their relations with China. We urge the current Paraguayan government not to go against the tide of the times and be manipulated and used by \"Taiwan independence\" forces, but instead to listen to the voice of the Paraguayan people and make the right choice that truly serves the fundamental and long-term interests of its own people. We also hope that relevant Latin American and Caribbean countries will recognize the general trend, handle Taiwan-related issues prudently, and join the big family of China-Latin America friendly cooperation as soon as possible.\nRegarding your question about Lai Ching-te's potential transit through the United States, China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, firmly opposes any visit by Taiwan authorities' leaders to the US under any name or pretext, and firmly opposes the US condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatists and their separatist activities in any form. The US should recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue, abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and handle the Taiwan issue with utmost caution.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250715_11671030.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-18","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's Vice President Hsiao Bi-khim stated at today's press conference that \"China's aggressive military posture will only backfire, and maintaining the status quo across the Taiwan Strait is in the interest of the entire region.\" What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people. The true status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that both sides belong to one China, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of Chinese territory. The greatest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait is the indulgence and support of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external forces. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they cannot change the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, nor can they change the international community's adherence to the one-China principle, and they certainly cannot change the historical trend that China will eventually be unified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250718_11673038.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-24","Guo Jiakun","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","It has been reported that the South African government has issued a statement saying it no longer recognizes the \"Taipei Commercial Office\" located in Pretoria, urging the Taiwanese authorities to relocate the office to Johannesburg and rename the \"Taipei Liaison Office in Cape Town\" to a \"Commercial Office.\" What is China's comment on this?","The one-China principle is the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with all countries in the world. It is a basic norm of international relations and a broad consensus of the international community. The South African government's independent and autonomous adoption of the above-mentioned measures is a positive action in adhering to the one-China principle, in line with the spirit of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, and also an inherent requirement of the China-South Africa all-round strategic cooperative partnership for a new era. China appreciates this and is willing to continue to firmly support South Africa on issues involving each other's core interests.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250724_11676510.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-28","Guo Jiakun","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that the head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department recently visited Japan in a \"private capacity\" and met with Japanese politicians including former Minister of Economy, Trade and Industry Sanae Takaichi and Liberal Democratic Party Youth Bureau Chief Yasutaka Nakasone. What is China's comment on this?","Japan's condoning of Lin Chia-lung's so-called \"private\" visit provides a platform for \"Taiwan independence\" forces to engage in anti-China separatist activities, seriously violating the basic norms of international relations and the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, and sending a seriously wrong signal. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition, and has lodged a strong protest with Japan in Beijing and Tokyo.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, concerning the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations and the fundamental trust between the two countries. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan once exercised colonial rule over Taiwan for half a century and bears serious historical responsibility to the Chinese people.\nChina urges Japan to abide by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and the solemn commitments made, deeply reflect on history, learn from historical lessons, exercise caution in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue, refrain from undermining China's sovereignty in any form, refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and not underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, firm will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250728_11678340.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-29","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg reporter","According to the Financial Times and Bloomberg, Taiwan's \"President\" Lai Ching-te will be unable to transit through the United States en route to South America, apparently because his plan to transit through New York was rejected by the Trump administration. Has China communicated with the US on this matter, requesting that the US government refuse Lai Ching-te's transit through New York and the United States?","First of all, Taiwan is a province of China and has no \"president.\" China has noted the relevant reports. I want to emphasize that China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and firmly opposes any visit by Taiwan's leader to the US under any name or pretext. This position is consistent, clear, and firm. We hope the US will abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, handle the Taiwan issue with utmost caution, and jointly promote the stable, healthy, and sustainable development of Sino-US relation","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250729_11679085.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-30","Guo Jiakun","Xinhua News Agency","According to reports, Lai Ching-te postponed his plan to visit Taiwan’s so-called “diplomatic countries” in Latin America because his plan to “transit” to New York was rejected by the United States. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","I would like to emphasize again that the one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. Adhering to the one-China principle is the international justice, the aspiration of the people, and the general trend. The provocative actions of the Lai Qingde authorities seeking \"independence\" will never succeed, nor can they shake the international community's firm adherence to the one-China principle, nor can they block the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.\nWe also hope that the so-called \"diplomatic countries\" with Taiwan will not be repeatedly manipulated and exploited by \"Taiwan independence\" forces, but will recognize the situation clearly, turn back when they are lost, and make correct decisions that are in line with the trend of history and the long-term interests of their people at an early date.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250730_11679797.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-07-30","Guo Jiakun","Xinhua News Agency reporter","It has been reported that Lai Ching-te has postponed his planned visit to Taiwan's so-called \"diplomatic allies\" in Latin America after the US rejected his plan to transit through New York. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","I want to reiterate that the one-China principle is a fundamental norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. Adhering to the one-China principle is the greater good of the international community, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempts to seek \"independence\" and its provocative actions will never succeed, nor can they shake the solid foundation of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle, nor can they stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.\nWe also hope that Taiwan's so-called \"diplomatic allies\" will not be repeatedly manipulated and exploited by \"Taiwan independence\" forces, but will instead recognize the situation, correct their course, and make the right decisions that conform to the historical trend and the long-term interests of their own people as soon as possible.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250730_11679797.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Britain's Defense Secretary John Healey said on July 27 during his visit to Australia that the UK is ready to engage in a fight in the Pacific if conflict breaks out over Taiwan. What's your comments on this?","The Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China, which brooks no foreign interference. We urge the UK side to be prudent on its words and actions concerning the Taiwan question, refrain from sending wrong signals to separatist forces for \"Taiwan independence\", and avoid undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. No one should underestimate the firm will and strong ability of the PLA to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, it's reported that the Philippine Defense Secretary said that the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) is shifting its focus from combating domestic insurgency to external defense, and will take firm measures against China's \"aggressive\" behaviors in the South China Sea. The Philippine side is strengthening defense cooperation with the US, Australia, Japan and India. What's your…","On your first question, relevant remarks of the Philippine side misrepresent the facts and attempt to cast itself as the victim. China's Nanhai Zhudao is beyond the limits of the Philippine territory, which has long been defined by a series of international treaties. The Philippine side illegally occupies some islands and reefs of China's Nansha Qundao, repeatedly makes provocations and harassment against the Chinese side at sea, and seduce foreign forces to make waves in the South China Sea. It has become the source of trouble and dangers. The Chinese side never wavers in our resolve and will to safeguard national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and will take resolute countermeasures against any provocations by the Philippine side in accordance with laws and regulations.\nOn your second question, there are many negative comments about this TV show in Taiwan. The DPP authorities are criticized for stoking anxiety about war and making provocations, in an attempt to plunge Taiwan into war and make ordinary people of Taiwan to serve as \"Taiwan independence\" cannon fodder. Their scheme to force compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait into conflict and to harm and ruin Taiwan will find no support and is doomed to failure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, the Taiwan region recently conducted the Han Kuang 41 exercise, with the duration doubled from last year. Many US weapon systems made their debut in the exercise. The drills mobilized record-high personnel, and included subjects on in-depth defense and protracted warfare. What's your comments on that? Second, the US Air Force recently held Exercise Resolute Force Pacific &nbsp;in the…","On your first question, the Han Kuang exercise is no more than a show. It cannot change the destined failure of separatists seeking \"Taiwan independence\". The drills will only expose the vicious calculation of the DPP authorities to harm and ruin Taiwan in the name of protection, and to coerce the people of Taiwan into being cannon fodder. We warn the DPP authorities that too many vile deeds will lead to one's self-destruction, and whatever they do will be of no avail. We firmly oppose any forms of military collusion between the US and the Taiwan region, and request the US side to earnestly abide by the promise of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", stop sending wrong signals to separatist forces, and stop disrupting peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nOn your second question, the Pacific should be an ocean of peace, not a place to stir storms. Holding onto its Cold-War mentality, the US side keeps flexing its muscles in the Asia Pacific, forms exclusive blocs under the guise of military exercises, and coerces and puts pressure on others. Its behaviors damage peace and stability in the Asia Pacific. Come what may, we will remain composed. The Chinese military has full confidence and capability to overcome any risks and challenges, safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests, and remain a staunch force for global and regional peace.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, in response to the Chinese mainland inviting the Kuomintang (KMT) veterans to observe the military parade on September 3, the DPP authorities warned those veterans that whoever attends relevant events would lose their retirement benefits. What's your comments on this? My second question is that Hsiao Bi-khim reportedly said that Taiwan does not seek conflict with China and will not…","On your first question, the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression is a righteous fight in which all the Chinese people united together against the invasion of Japanese militarists. The DPP authorities threatening and intimidating these war veterans are shameful behaviors that betray the nation, history and conscience.\nOn your second question, Taiwan is China's Taiwan. No one is more committed to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait than we are. The root cause of cross-Strait tension lies with the DPP authorities obstinately pushing for \"Taiwan independence\" and colluding with foreign forces to make provocations. In the face of separatist activities, the PLA will not sit idly by, and will continue to speak with actions to safeguard our national sovereignty, territorial integrity and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that according to sources, the US administration denied permission for Lai Ching-te to stop in New York en route to Latin America. At the same time, Lai's office said that there are no immediate plans for his overseas travel. May I have your comments on this?","Upholding the one-China principle is what justice demands, and is where the public opinion trends and the arc of history bends. The Chinese side firmly opposes any forms of official interactions between China's Taiwan region and any other countries. We require the US side to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-US joint communiqués, handle the Taiwan question with extra prudence, and work with us to promote the steady, sound and sustainable development of China-US relations.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the troops of Taiwan recently conducted the Han Kuang 41 exercise, which, for the first time, included the so-called urban resilience drills and had chain supermarkets participating in air defense simulation drills. During the exercise, multiple districts of Taiwan were stricken by a typhoon. When victims turned to the military for help, Lai Ching-te said that they should not rely on the troops…","The Han Kuang exercise is no more than a show. The Lai Ching-te authorities are too busy with their bluffing shows to care about the people of Taiwan stricken by natural disasters. They will be despised for sure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to the UK media, the US is pushing Japan and Australia to clarify what role the two countries will play if a war over Taiwan breaks out, which frustrated the two countries. Could you please comment on this?","I will not comment on hypothetical questions. But I want to emphasize that some external forces always want to use the Taiwan question to make trouble and challenge the core interests of China. Such behavior is extremely dangerous and will not succeed. It's known to all that the US side can only be fair-weather friends for its allies and partners. We hope relevant countries will not be cat's paws for others, which will end up harming themselves, and will not disrupt peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that the US side dispatched over 400 observers, including active and retired military officers, to the Han Kuang 41 exercise. May I have your comments on this?","The Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China, which brooks no foreign interference. We firmly oppose any forms of military collusion between the US and the Taiwan region. We warn the DPP authorities that a useful fool will eventually become an abandoned tool, and that soliciting US support for \"Taiwan independence\" and resisting reunification by force will not succeed.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-07-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, in the Extended Deterrence Dialogue attended by their heads of foreign and defense departments, the US and Japan held multiple tabletop exercises to strategize a scenario in which a conflict broke out in East Asia and the US is pressured to use nuclear weapons. May I have your comments on this? Secondly, it's reported that the troops of Taiwan plan to purchase five more types of…","On your first question, as a victim of nuclear explosions, the Japanese side should have a profound realization that a nuclear war must not be fought and cannot be won. However, some individuals of the Japanese side attempt to upgrade the so-called extended deterrence of the US, push for the introduction and even the use of nuclear weapons through \"nuclear sharing\", and provoke arms race. It's a very dangerous development. The Chinese side urges the US and Japan to abandon their Cold-War mentality, reduce the role of nuclear weapons in national and collective security policies, and take concrete actions to uphold strategic stability and regional peace and security.\nOn your second question, here is what I want to say: the \"Taiwan Independence\" armed forces are overreaching themselves and their efforts are futile.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-07-31","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","It has been reported that a US congressional delegation will visit Taiwan in August. What is China's response to this?","China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China demands that the US abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, stop interfering in China's internal affairs under any pretext, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, stop official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202507/t20250731_11680726.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-08-01","Guo Jiakun","Global Times reporter","It has been reported that Paraguayan Acting Speaker of the House of Representatives, Mesa, recently stated publicly that Paraguay is \"wasting its time\" on Taiwan, which is merely a province of China. Paraguay should engage in serious discussions regarding the development of relations with China based on its national interests. Paraguay should no longer act as a \"beggar nation\" waiting to \"cooperate\" with the…","China has noted the relevant reports. We have heard similar sentiments many times, and these statements reflect the strong will of the majority of the Paraguayan people.\nIn recent years, more and more Paraguayan friends have realized that Paraguay can no longer continue to be an \"outsider\" in the international community, \"turning its back\" on China. We hope that the Paraguayan government will seriously listen to these voices and make the right choice that truly serves the fundamental and long-term interests of Paraguay and its people. We also welcome more Paraguayan friends to visit China, experience China's development firsthand, feel the openness and inclusiveness of Chinese civilization, and get to know the real China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202508/t20250801_11681319.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-08-08","Jiang Bin","Reporter","It is reported that Lai Ching-te recently said that the \"national defense budget\" of Taiwan for next year will exceed 3% of its GDP. Some analysts believe this increase is a response to concerns from the US side. Please comment on that.","As a province of China, how is it possible for Taiwan to have the so-called national defense budget? Lai Ching-te and his like show no regard for the well-being of the people of Taiwan and shamelessly cozy up to the US and sell out Taiwan in pursuit of soliciting external support for \"Taiwan independence\". Not only do they sugarcoat the tariff exploitation as achievements of negotiations to deceive the public, but they also plan to squander the hard-earned money of the people in Taiwan to pay \"protection fees\" to the US. Such acts amount to sending a lamb to a tiger's den and will make everything lost and nothing gained.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-08-08","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Reports indicate that the chairman of the US Senate Armed Services Committee may soon lead a congressional delegation to Taiwan, which will be the first visit to Taiwan by a senator holding this position since 2016. May I have your comments?","There is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of the Chinese territory. The Chinese side firmly opposes any form of official engagement between the US and the Taiwan region. We require the US side to abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-US joint communiqués, earnestly fulfill its promise of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", stop any form of official interaction and military connection with China's Taiwan region, and stop conniving at or supporting separatists for \"Taiwan independence\". The PLA will stay on high alert at any time and take resolute measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nRelated News\nComments\n-->\nAbout Us\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © China Military. All rights reserved.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-08-14","Lin Jian","A reporter from Japan's Jiji Press asked","The Japanese government stated that Chinese Minister of Agriculture and Rural Affairs Han Jun has cancelled his planned visit to Japan. Analysts believe this is related to the recent visit to Japan by Taiwan's Foreign Minister Lin Chia-lung. What are the reasons for the Chinese Minister of Agriculture and Rural Affairs' cancellation of his trip? How does China view the necessity of exchanges between Chinese and…","Regarding the specific reasons for Minister Han Jun's postponement of his visit to Japan, I suggest inquiring with the relevant authorities. China remains open to maintaining contact between China and Japan at all levels. If Japan is sincere in engaging with China, it should take concrete actions to earnestly adhere to the one-China principle, safeguard the political foundation of China-Japan relations, and put into practice the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and its commitment to comprehensively advancing the strategic and mutually beneficial relationship between the two countries, instead of saying one thing and doing another.\nRegarding Lin Chia-lung's visit to Japan, which you mentioned, I want to reiterate that Japan's condoning of Lin Chia-lung's so-called \"private capacity\" visit provided a platform for \"Taiwan independence\" forces to engage in anti-China separatist activities. This seriously violates the basic norms of international relations and the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, sending a seriously wrong signal. We urge Japan to deeply reflect on its history, learn from its lessons, exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan issue, and refrain from undermining China's sovereignty in any form or sending any wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202508/t20250814_11690046.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-08-15","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Taiwan’s defense authorities recently stated that within a 24-hour period they detected 57 sorties of PLA military aircraft operating around Taiwan, among which as many as 38 sorties crossed the so-called “median line of the Taiwan Strait,” setting a recent high. What comment does the spokesperson have?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory; there is no such thing as the so-called “median line of the Taiwan Strait.” Military activities conducted by the People’s Liberation Army in areas surrounding Taiwan Island are entirely natural and fully reasonable and lawful.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities’ claim that the “situation is fully under control” is nothing more than self-deception. As long as the malignant tumor of “Taiwan independence” remains, the PLA will not pause for a single moment in its efforts to combat “independence” and promote reunification.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-08-18","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","Recently, the head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department stated that after World War II, the Treaty of San Francisco replaced political declarations such as the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration. This treaty did not hand over Taiwan to the People's Republic of China, and the People's Republic of China has never ruled Taiwan. What is China's response to this?","The fallacies in question distort the truth and confuse the public, once again exposing the Lai Ching-te administration's thorough \"Taiwan independence\" separatist nature.\nTaiwan's return to China is an important part of the outcomes of World War II and the post-war international order. A series of documents with international legal force, including the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Declaration, and the terms of Japan's surrender, all affirm China's sovereignty over Taiwan. The historical and legal fact that Taiwan belongs to China is indisputable.\nOn October 1, 1949, the Central People's Government of the People's Republic of China was established, becoming the sole legal government representing all of China. This was a change of regime without any change in China's status as a subject of international law; China's sovereignty and inherent territorial boundaries remained unchanged, and the government of the People's Republic of China rightfully and fully enjoys and exercises China's sovereignty, including its sovereignty over Taiwan. The so-called \"San Francisco Peace Treaty\" was an illegal and invalid document issued after World War II by the United States and a group of countries, excluding the People's Republic of China and the Soviet Union, to achieve a separate peace with Japan. This document violates the provisions of the 1942 Declaration of the United Nations, signed by 26 countries including China, the United States, the United Kingdom, and the Soviet Union, as well as the Charter of the United Nations and basic principles of international law. Any disposition concerning the sovereignty of Taiwan and other territorial and sovereign rights of China as a non-signatory party is illegal and invalid.\nThe Lai Ching-te administration has completely lost its national stance, ignored the achievements of the Chinese people's victory in the War of Resistance Against Japan, and wantonly distorted the history of World War II, which is despicable. I want to emphasize that no matter what the Lai Ching-te administration says or does, it cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, it cannot change the basic consensus of the international community on adhering to the one-China principle, and it cannot stop the historical trend that China will eventually be unified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202508/t20250818_11691863.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-08-21","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that, regarding the news released by the Chinese side that Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with Indian Foreign Minister S. Jaishankar, in which India stated that \"Taiwan is part of China,\" Indian officials clarified that the statement was misquoted, claiming that India's position on the Taiwan issue remains unchanged and that it will continue to promote economic, technological, and cultural…","Regarding the China-India foreign ministers' meeting, China has already released relevant information. China is surprised by India's so-called \"clarification.\" This is inconsistent with the facts. It seems that some people in India are attempting to undermine China's sovereignty on the Taiwan issue and damage the improvement of China-India relations. China expresses serious concern and firm opposition to this.\nI want to emphasize that there is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is a universal consensus of the international community, including India. We hope that India will earnestly abide by the one-China principle, properly handle sensitive issues, and promote the stable development of China-India relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202508/t20250821_11693782.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-08-28","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, according to Japanese media reports, Japan has deployed the Sea Guardian large unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) to conduct surveillance and imaging activities against China Coast Guard (CCG) vessels over the waters surrounding Diaoyu Dao. This type of UAV has carried out multiple missions since April this year. Does the Chinese side know about the information collection activities of…","On your first question, Diaoyu Dao and its affiliated islands are China's inherent territory. We urge the Japanese side to immediately cease all activities complicating maritime and airspace situations near Diaoyu Dao. China will continue to take effective measures to firmly safeguard our territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.\nOn your second question, the overall situation in the East China Sea and the South China Sea remains stable. The Taiwan question is an internal affair of China, which brooks no external interference. To uphold peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, we must abide by the one-China principle and firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts. We urge relevant parties to cease their erroneous words and deeds that fuel conflicts and heighten tensions.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-08-28","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to media reports, an article posted in the U.S. magazine The Diplomat claimed that this year's Han Kuang 41 Exercise is nothing more than a show, and that the society and people of Taiwan are unprepared for war, both psychologically and institutionally. What is your comment on this?","We have expressed our views on the so-called Han Kuang exercise. The public have sharp eyes and they have long seen through the self-deceiving tricks of the DPP authorities. It is also clear to all that seeking independence and resisting reunification by force is doomed to fail.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-08-28","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the Taiwan authorities recently approved the 2026 budget, with defense spending amounting to 949.5 billion New Taiwan dollars, accounting for about 3.32% of its GDP. This is the first time since 2009 that its defense spending has exceeded 3% of GDP. It is in response to U.S. pressure to ramp up military investment. Not long ago, Lai Ching-te announced a target of increasing the defense budget…","Peace, development, exchange and cooperation are common aspirations of the general public in Taiwan. The Lai Ching-te authorities keep going further down the evil path of seeking independence by force and continue to serve as a cash machine and make unconditional concessions to the U.S. at the cost of Taiwan's resources. Such moves will ultimately lead to self-destruction. The PLA will continuously enhance combat readiness and our ability to fight and win, and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-08-29","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Senator Roger Wicker, chairman of the Senate Armed Services Committee, has arrived in Taipei. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between the US and Taiwan. The visit of US congressmen to Taiwan seriously violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, undermines China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction with this.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. China demands that the US abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, stop interfering in China's internal affairs under any pretext, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, cease official exchanges between the US and Taiwan, and stop creating tensions in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202508/t20250829_11698363.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-05","Guo Jiakun","The Paper reporter","In response to a reporter's question regarding the Philippines' condoning of the visit of the head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department to the Philippines, Philippine Defense Secretary Teodoro stated that China should not impose its red lines on the Philippines. He added that the visit of Taiwanese \"officials\" is a matter of Philippine sovereignty. Lin Chia-lung did not meet with Philippine officials. He…","China has already stated its solemn position on the Philippines' condoning of the visit of the head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department to the Philippines. The Philippines has repeatedly taken erroneous and provocative actions on the Taiwan issue, seriously violating the basic norms of international relations and the commitments made on the Taiwan issue, continuously damaging China-Philippines relations, and crossing China's red line. It will inevitably pay the price, and the Philippines must bear all the consequences arising therefrom.\nWe have noted that Philippine Defense Secretary Teodoro and others have repeatedly made absurd remarks and deliberately hyped up issues related to China, such as Taiwan, openly challenging China's core interests and red lines. China will not tolerate this and firmly opposes it. We solemnly warn the Philippines that anyone who attempts to provoke trouble on the Taiwan issue, interfere in China's internal affairs, and undermine China's sovereignty and territorial integrity will ultimately only shoot themselves in the foot. We advise these people in the Philippines to stop playing the role of clowns.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250905_11703299.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-08","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","The Chinese Foreign Ministry announced today that it is imposing sanctions on Japanese Senator Seki Hei. What is the spokesperson's view on this?","Seki Hei, who previously held Chinese citizenship, went to Japan and obtained Japanese citizenship. He then spread false information and colluded with anti-China forces in Japan to launch a massive attack and smear campaign against China. He made extremely negative remarks on issues such as Taiwan, the Diaoyu Islands, history, Tibet, Xinjiang, and Hong Kong. After being elected as a member of parliament, he openly visited the Yasukuni Shrine, seriously violating the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and the one-China principle, severely interfering in China's internal affairs, and seriously damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. In response to Seki Hei's egregious actions, China has decided to take countermeasures against him effective immediately.\nI want to point out that Seki Hei, for his own selfish interests, has betrayed his ancestors and conscience, colluding with anti-China forces to provoke trouble. China's countermeasures are a strong punishment and a stern warning to the likes of Seki Hei. Those who sell out their country for personal gain will only suffer the consequences.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250908_11704444.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-10","Lin Jian","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that former Taiwan leader Tsai Ing-wen visited Japan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","China has lodged a serious protest and issued a warning to Japan regarding this matter. China firmly opposes any \"Taiwan independence\" elements visiting countries with which China has diplomatic relations under any pretext. As a former leader of Taiwan, Tsai Ing-wen's visit to Japan, regardless of the name or pretext, cannot change the fact that she is \"seeking independence through foreign collusion,\" and this is absolutely unacceptable.\nJapan bears historical responsibility for its actions and statements against the Chinese people on the Taiwan issue, and should therefore exercise particular caution. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. We urge Japan to earnestly abide by the one-China principle, handle relevant issues prudently and properly, refrain from interfering in China's internal affairs in any form, and avoid sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250910_11705901.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-12","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","The head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department is currently in Europe. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China, and the person you just mentioned is just a local foreign affairs official of China.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question concerns China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. We have consistently and firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan, and we firmly oppose providing a platform for the activities of \"Taiwan independence\" elements. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged solemn representations with the relevant countries.\nWe urge relevant European countries to adhere to the one-China principle and immediately take effective measures to prevent \"Taiwan independence\" elements from visiting Taiwan. We also solemnly warn the Taiwan authorities that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and any attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" in the international community is doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250912_11707735.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-15","Lin Jian","Reporter from the China Global Television Network (CGTN)","We noticed that Chiu Chui-cheng, Chairman of Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council, recently visited the United States, met with members of Congress from both parties, and gave a speech at the Heritage Foundation, a US think tank. During his visit, Chiu stated that mainland China is the biggest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, hyped up the so-called \"mainland military attack on Taiwan,\" and…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and the connivance and support of external forces are the greatest threats to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges and military collusion between the US and Taiwan, and resolutely safeguards national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We urge the US to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. No matter how the DPP authorities hype up the \"mainland threat,\" exaggerate tensions across the Taiwan Strait, and attempt to \"seek independence through external forces\" with the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people, they cannot change the objective fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, nor can they stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.\nHere's a message for people like Chiu Chui-cheng: Trying to achieve \"Taiwan independence\" by betraying national interests is nothing but petty scheming and clown antics; it will all be in vain and doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250915_11708660.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-16","Lin Jian","China Daily reporter","We noticed that Foreign Minister Wang Yi has just concluded his visits to Austria, Slovenia, and Poland. Could the spokesperson provide further details about this visit?","From September 12 to 16, Foreign Minister Wang Yi visited Austria, Slovenia, and Poland at the invitation of their respective governments. During his visit to Austria, Foreign Minister Wang met with Austrian President Alexander Van der Bellen and held talks with Foreign Minister Meir-Reisinger. During his visit to Slovenia, Foreign Minister Wang met with Slovenian President Musár, Prime Minister Golob, and Chairman of the National Council Lotrich, and held talks with Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Fajón. During his visit to Poland, Foreign Minister Wang met with President Navrodsky, held talks with Deputy Prime Minister and Foreign Minister Sikorski, and co-chaired the fourth plenary meeting of the China-Poland Intergovernmental Cooperation Committee. This visit effectively consolidated the traditional friendship between China and the relevant European countries, strengthened the consensus between the two sides on deepening cooperation, promoting common development, and safeguarding peace, and achieved positive results.\nFirst, bilateral relations were deepened. Foreign Minister Wang Yi stated that China is willing to strengthen strategic communication with the three countries, deepen China-Austria green cooperation, expand China-Sri Lanka pragmatic cooperation, advance China-Poland cooperation in the Belt and Road Initiative, and strengthen people-to-people exchanges. China and Poland also released a joint document for the fourth plenary meeting of the Intergovernmental Cooperation Committee. Foreign Minister Wang Yi stated that China and the EU should be friends, not rivals, and should cooperate, not confront. He hoped that Austria, Sri Lanka, and Poland would play a positive role in promoting an objective and rational understanding of China within the EU, and contribute to the healthy and stable development of China-EU relations. Leaders of Austria, Sri Lanka, and Poland all expressed their high regard for relations with China, their willingness to maintain high-level exchanges, and emphasized that the EU and China are partners and should strengthen constructive dialogue and cooperation. All three countries welcomed Chinese enterprises to invest and cooperate in Europe.\nSecond, it promoted a correct view of World War II history. Foreign Minister Wang Yi emphasized that this year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory in the World Anti-Fascist War. The Chinese people paid a huge price and made significant contributions to the victory on the main Asian battlefield of World War II and to the global anti-fascist war. It is essential to safeguard the achievements of the victory in World War II, including the return of Taiwan to China. Some \"Taiwan independence\" forces are attempting to split the country and undermine the post-war international order, but their efforts are doomed to failure. The leaders of Austria, Sri Lanka, and Poland all highly recognized the enormous sacrifices and outstanding contributions made by the Chinese people to the victory in World War II and reiterated their firm adherence to the one-China policy.\nThird, we are committed to jointly safeguarding international peace and promoting the reform and improvement of global governance. Foreign Minister Wang Yi stated that the current international situation is complex and volatile, with unilateral power politics rampant, which China and Europe should jointly resist and oppose. President Xi Jinping's global governance initiative aims to reform and improve the global governance system, which aligns with the common expectations of the international community. China is willing to strengthen solidarity and cooperation with all countries, firmly uphold the international system with the United Nations at its core, and work together to build a more just and equitable global governance system. The leaders of Austria, Sri Lanka, and Poland highly praised China's development achievements and its responsibility as a major power, valued and welcomed China's global governance initiative, and expressed their willingness to strengthen communication and coordination with China, uphold the authority of the United Nations, safeguard multilateralism, and work together to promote world peace and development","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250916_11709475.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-09-16","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, aircraft carrier PLANS Fujian recently conducted sea trials and passed through the Taiwan Strait to operate in the South China Sea. Do you have any comment? Does this sea trial indicate that PLANS Fujian is about to be commissioned?","Recently, China's third aircraft carrier, PLANS Fujian, transited the Taiwan Strait and proceeded to relevant sea areas of the South China Sea to carry out test and training missions. This is a normal arrangement in the carrier's construction process, consistent with relevant international law and international practice, and is not directed at any specific country or target.\nChina adheres to the path of peaceful development and pursues a defensive national defense policy. We have consistently advanced aircraft carrier construction based on national security and equipment technology development needs. As a major national asset, PLANS Fujian will assuredly play its due role in defending national sovereignty, security, and development interests.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-09-17","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that, in response to the American Institute in Taiwan (AIT)'s previous statement that documents such as the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration \"did not determine Taiwan's final political status,\" a spokesperson for the U.S. State Department stated that the AIT has accurately conveyed the message that mainland China has \"distorted\" World War II-era documents to support its actions…","I have already answered this question before. Taiwan's return to China is an important part of the outcomes of World War II and the post-war international order. In 1943, the governments of China, the United States, and the United Kingdom issued the Cairo Declaration, which clearly stipulated that Taiwan, which had been seized by Japan, would be returned to China. In 1945, China, the United States, the United Kingdom, and the Soviet Union issued the Potsdam Declaration, reaffirming that \"the terms of the Cairo Declaration will be carried out.\" In the same year, Japan signed the Instrument of Surrender, pledging to \"faithfully fulfill its obligations under the provisions of the Potsdam Declaration.\" This series of documents with international legal force clearly affirms China's sovereignty over Taiwan.\nTaiwan is part of China. As a signatory to the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration, the United States is fully aware of the historical and legal facts that Taiwan belongs to China. Yet, it openly revives the fallacy of \"Taiwan's status being undetermined,\" smears and slanders China's legitimate actions to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity, maliciously misleads international public opinion, seriously violates international law and the basic norms of international relations, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nHistory cannot be altered. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community, and the United States' unilateral distortion and misinterpretation cannot shake the international community's adherence to the one-China principle. China urges the United States to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, stop manipulating Taiwan-related issues, stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" in any form, and stop interfering in China's internal affairs. No one and no force can stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250917_11710263.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-22","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Taiwan's Foreign Minister Lin Chia-lung recently visited Vienna, Austria. We noted that Foreign Minister Wang Yi also visited Austria a week ago. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory.\nThe one-China principle is the political foundation for the establishment and development of diplomatic relations between China and Austria, as well as a basic norm of international relations and a broad consensus of the international community. China consistently and firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan. We urge relevant countries to abide by the one-China principle, cease providing platforms for the activities of \"Taiwan independence\" elements, and refrain from sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nPursuing \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and \"seeking independence by relying on foreign powers\" will not succeed. No matter how the DPP authorities try to capitalize on hot topics or conduct unauthorized visits in an attempt to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" these schemes are doomed to failure and cannot shake the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250922_11713277.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-23","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","The foreign ministers of the United States, Japan, and South Korea issued a joint statement expressing concern over the increasingly frequent destabilizing activities around Taiwan and strongly opposing \"illegal\" maritime claims in the South China Sea. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","China strongly disapproves of and firmly opposes the US, Japan, and South Korea's meddling in China's internal affairs and their slander and smear campaigns on Taiwan and maritime issues.\nTaiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no external interference. Currently, the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait requires adherence to the one-China principle and a clear opposition to \"Taiwan independence.\" Relevant countries should abide by the one-China principle, cease condoning \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities in any form, and refrain from sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nThe situation in the South China Sea remains generally stable. China firmly safeguards its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, while committing to properly handling differences with relevant parties through dialogue and consultation. Relevant countries should respect the joint efforts of regional countries to resolve issues and maintain peace and stability through dialogue and consultation, and cease escalating tensions and provoking confrontation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250923_11714190.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-24","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV reporter","It has been reported that the Taiwanese authorities, citing \"national security,\" have imposed restrictions on chip exports to South Africa. Taiwan's so-called \"Ministry of Economic Affairs\" issued a statement announcing export controls on 47 products destined for South Africa and urging South Africa to consult with Taiwan on this matter as soon as possible. The new regulations will take effect after a 60-day…","The Taiwan authorities' blatant political manipulation and deliberate disruption of the global chip supply chain, attempting to weaponize chips to counter the international consensus on the One China principle, will only end in failure. In recent years, China's chip industry has developed rapidly, with mature process chip production capacity accounting for approximately 28% of the global total, and continuous breakthroughs in advanced process chips. According to South African customs statistics, in 2024, mainland China's chip exports to South Africa were three times that of Taiwan's chip trade with South Africa. The Taiwan authorities' actions will not have a substantial impact on related industries in South Africa; they will only backfire.\nChina appreciates the South African government's firm commitment to relocating Taiwan's institutions in South Africa and is willing to expand cooperation with South Africa in various fields, including semiconductors, to promote greater development of the China-South Africa all-round strategic partnership for a new era.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250924_11716001.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-25","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Lin Jialong attended an event in New York during the UN General Assembly general debate. What is China's comment on this?","We have noted the relevant reports. The US's permission for Lin Chia-lung to visit New York during the UN General Assembly, providing a stage for the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces to stage their provocative acts, constitutes a blatant interference in China's internal affairs, a serious violation of the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nThe DPP authorities sent Lin Chia-lung to New York during the UN General Assembly, where he colluded with Taiwan's so-called \"diplomatic allies\" and interacted with some American politicians. His blatant political scheme of \"seeking independence through foreign connections\" and \"seeking independence through the US\" is blatantly obvious. We solemnly warn the DPP authorities and die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" elements that those who do many unjust things will surely perish, and any provocation aimed at \"independence\" will only backfire.\nWe also advise Taiwan's few remaining so-called \"diplomatic allies\" not to be repeatedly manipulated and exploited by the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. They should recognize that the one-China principle is the general trend and the will of the people, and that there is no future in tying themselves to the \"Taiwan independence\" forces.\nThere is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The international community firmly believes that the one-China principle is unshakeable, and the trend toward China's complete reunification is unstoppable.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250925_11717166.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-09-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It is reported that the 12th Beijing Xiangshan Forum was successfully held in Beijing recently and has attracted high attention from both domestic and foreign media. Could you please provide more details?","The 12th Beijing Xiangshan Forum was successfully held from September 17 to 19. General Zhang Youxia, Vice Chairman of the Central Military Commission, attended and addressed the welcome dinner. Admiral Dong Jun, Minister of National Defense, attended the opening ceremony of the forum and made a keynote speech. The forum was warmly received and well spoken of both at home and abroad. The appeal and influence of this year's forum have been further enhanced. There are three highlights.\nFirst, the forum carried more profound historical significance and showed a clearer vision for the future. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, of the founding of the United Nations, and of the restoration of Taiwan. In particular, President Xi Jinping formally proposed the Global Governance Initiative. Participants at the forum, focusing on addressing global challenges and resolving pressing issues, contributed ideas and suggestions to improving the global governance system, and pooled positive forces to promote global governance through constructive approaches and measures.\nSecond, the composition of participants was diverse and balanced, making the \"Xiangshan Spirit\" more appealing. Adhering to the concept of \"equality, openness, inclusiveness and mutual learning\", over 1,800 attendees, including official representatives, experts, scholars and observers from more than 100 countries, regions and international organizations gathered together, engaging in candid exchanges regardless of the size of their respective nations. We did not stick to fixed positions, but sought common ground; we were not confrontational rivals, but sincere interlocutors who listened to each other. Many netizens commented that this could only be seen in China, and such intense yet harmonious discussions were particularly precious.\nThird, the dialogues and exchanges were extensive and in-depth, with China's propositions attracting significant attention. The topics of the forum were set to provide strategic guidance and address realistic issues, so that participants could engage in meaningful discussions and achieve real results. Additionally, for the first time, the forum organized high-end interviews, hosted a briefing on China's Armed Forces in UN Peacekeeping Operations, and arranged participants to visit an exhibition of innovations and achievements in national defense science and technology. Attendees felt that a stronger Chinese military means greater assurance for world peace.\nA just journey with many companions gets far. The Chinese military is willing to work with all parties to further strengthen strategic communication, deepen military mutual trust, and carry out higher-level security cooperation, so as to provide strong support for global governance and jointly build a community with a shared future for humanity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-09-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Taiwan's military authorities submitted a budget proposal of over 1 trillion new Taiwan dollars, and planned to once again serve as a dumb cash machine by procuring more weapons. However, a U.S. official recently revealed that U.S. President Donald Trump declined to approve 400 million dollars in military aid to Taiwan this summer. Could you please comment on this?","The DPP authorities is called \"dumb cash machine\" every time it buys weapons from external forces. Spending more money on arms procurement will not bring security, but only squeeze out social and livelihood spending and push Taiwan to the brink of war. We hope the U.S. side will abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-US joint communiqués, exercise extra caution in handling the Taiwan question, truly deliver on its promise of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\", and refrain from disrupting peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-09-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. The first one is that it's reported that interactions between the Chinese and U.S. sides increased recently, with a video call between two defense leaders as well as a meeting between the Chinese Defense Minister and a delegation of US House lawmakers. Do you have any comment on this? The second question is that Taiwan established the world's first research center named after Shinzo Abe. Lai…","On your first question, at his recent phone call with U.S. President Donald Trump, President Xi Jinping emphasized that China and the U.S. are fully capable of helping each other succeed and prospering together for the good of the two countries and the whole world. China is positive about and open to developing its military relations with the U.S.. We always deal with the U.S. side based on the principles of mutual respect, peaceful coexistence and win-win cooperation. We hope the U.S. side will work with us in the same direction to build a military-to-military relationship featuring equality, mutual respect, peaceful coexistence and greater stability.\nOn your second question, we all know that during its colonial rule over Taiwan of more than 50 years, Japan committed countless atrocities, inflicting great suffering upon Taiwan compatriots. We celebrated the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and of the restoration of Taiwan this year. Lai Ching-te tries to curry favor with Japan, who once colonized Taiwan. His words and actions are disdained by the people.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-09-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","The American Institute in Taiwan claimed that documents such as the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Proclamation \"did not determine Taiwan's ultimate political status\", and a U.S. State Department spokesperson echoed this comment. In addition, the head of Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council peddled the narrative of the so-called mainland's forcible takeover of Taiwan during his visit to the U.S.. What is your…","The false remarks of the U.S. side misrepresent the fact and mislead the public. China is strongly dissatisfied with and firmly opposed to this. The restoration of Taiwan to China is an integral part of the outcomes of WWII victory and the post-war international order. The 1943 Cairo Declaration clearly stipulates that all the territories Japan has stolen from the Chinese, such as Taiwan, shall be restored to China. The Potsdam Proclamation issued in 1945 reiterates that the terms of the Cairo Declaration shall be carried out. In the same year, Japan signed the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, pledging to carry out the provisions of the Potsdam Proclamation in good faith. These instruments with legal effect under international law have all clearly affirmed China’s sovereignty over Taiwan.\nAs a signatory to the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Proclamation, the U.S. is fully aware of the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China. Yet, it blatantly rehashes the false narrative that \"Taiwan's status is undetermined\", and smears China's legitimate actions to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, in order to mislead international public opinion. Such acts gravely violate international law and the basic norms governing international relations, and send a seriously wrong signal to separatist forces for \"Taiwan independence\".\nSeparatist activities seeking \"Taiwan independence\" pose the most serious threat to the post-war international order and the greatest damage to peace in the region. We urge the U.S. side to abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, stop manipulating the Taiwan question, and stop aiding and abetting \"Taiwan independence\" in any form. We warn the DPP authorities that \"Taiwan independence\" leads nowhere and reunification is unstoppable. We will never allow any separatist schemes to succeed, and are ready to thwart any external interference at any time and to safeguard national sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-09-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","It's reported that videos of China's V-day parade were aired 24/7 on many media outlets and we-media accounts in Taiwan, with online views exceeding 5 million. Many Taiwan compatriots praised the development achievements of the motherland and its strong military capabilities. A recent poll also showed a growing \"pro-mainland\" sentiment among the youth in Taiwan. What is your take on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait all belong to the Chinese nation and are members of one and the same family. The 14-year arduous history of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression witnessed compatriots from both sides of the Strait fighting side by side to resist foreign aggression and recover Taiwan. This great victory belongs to all the sons and daughters of the Chinese nation. The purpose of China's grand commemorative events to mark the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War is to remember history, honor fallen heroes, cherish peace and create a better future.\nThe future of Taiwan and the security and well-being of Taiwan compatriots depend on national reunification. We hope our Taiwan compatriots will understand the situation and follow the overwhelming trend of the times. They are hoped to join hands with their compatriots from the Chinese mainland, to promote the great spirit of the Chinese nation and the spirit of the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression, strengthen the national confidence of being a Chinese with integrity, resolutely oppose separatist activities for \"Taiwan independence\" and external interference, and create a bright future of national rejuvenation.\nZhang Xiaogang: If there are no more questions, this concludes today's press conference. Thank you!\nRelated News\nComments\n-->\nAbout Us\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © China Military. All rights reserved.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-09-26","Guo Jiakun","Kyodo News reporter","It has been reported that former Japanese Prime Minister and Liberal Democratic Party Supreme Advisor Taro Aso met with the Speaker of Taiwan's Legislative Yuan on the 25th, stating that \"Taiwan is a country that shares fundamental values ??with Japan.\" What is China's comment on this?","Certain Japanese politicians have repeatedly provoked and stirred up trouble on the Taiwan issue, seriously violating the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and grossly interfering in China's internal affairs. We express our strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this, and have lodged a solemn protest through diplomatic channels. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration clearly stipulate that the territories seized by Japan, including Taiwan and the Penghu Islands, should be returned to China, constituting an important part of the post-World War II international order.\nTaiwan is a province of China, and has never been a country. The Taiwan question involves China's core interests and concerns the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations and the basic trust between the two countries. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japan and the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan bears historical responsibility for its actions on the Taiwan issue and should be especially cautious in its words and deeds. We urge Japan to abide by the principles and spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, properly handle Taiwan-related issues, put into practice its commitment to \"fully understand and respect that Taiwan is an inseparable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China,\" refrain from any form of official exchanges with Taiwan under any pretext, avoid provocation and adventurism on the Taiwan issue, and not underestimate the Chinese people's strong determination, firm will, and powerful capability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250926_11718172.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-29","Guo Jiakun","Xinhua News Agency reporter","As the 80th session of the United Nations General Assembly convenes, some members of the US Congress issued a statement falsely claiming that mainland China has long distorted the meaning of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, attempting to link the resolution with the one-China principle in order to isolate Taiwan within the United Nations, and calling on the international community to support the Taiwan…","The Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Proclamation clearly stipulated the return of Taiwan and the Penghu Islands, which Japan had seized, to China, constituting an important part of the post-war international order. It is precisely based on the fact and premise that \"Taiwan is Chinese territory\" that in 1971, the 26th UN General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority, restoring all the legitimate rights of the People's Republic of China in the United Nations. This resolution solemnly affirmed that there is only one China in the world, that Taiwan is an inseparable part of Chinese territory, and that the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China; there is no such thing as \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan.\"\nUN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is a \"living document\" that not only establishes \"ironclad rules\" but also represents the \"hard truth\" for maintaining the current international order. Any words or actions that challenge UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 are attempts to shake the foundations of the post-war international order and interfere in China's internal affairs, and will only end in utter defeat.\nHistorically, during the deliberation of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, some countries put forward so-called \"dual representation\" proposals, attempting to create \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" but these failed and became obsolete. What was impossible then is absolutely impossible now.\nLegally speaking, UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 completely resolved the issue of representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations, and possesses broad and authoritative legal force. Between 1971 and 1972, various UN agencies, based on this resolution, successively expelled the \"representatives\" of the Taiwan authorities and restored the legitimate seat enjoyed by the People's Republic of China. The legal opinion issued by the UN Secretariat also emphasized that \"Taiwan, as a province of China, has no independent status.\"\nIn practice, since the adoption of UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, the UN system and other international and regional organizations have adhered to the one-China principle, clearly stipulating that any question concerning Taiwan's participation in international organizations must be handled under the one-China principle. The only official UN document designates Taiwan as \"Taiwan Province of China.\" 183 countries have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of the one-China principle.\nWe must reiterate that Taiwan's future lies in national reunification. With a strong motherland as our support, our compatriots in Taiwan will have greater room for development, and will enjoy greater security and dignity. The historical trend of China's eventual reunification is unstoppable.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250929_11719907.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-09-30","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","A Taiwanese \"official\" stated in Poland that Taiwan and Europe both face the same threat of \"authoritarianism.\" What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is the political foundation for China to establish and develop diplomatic relations with countries that have established diplomatic ties with it, as well as a basic norm of international relations and a broad consensus of the international community. China has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have established diplomatic ties with China and Taiwan. We urge relevant countries to strictly abide by the one-China principle, stop providing platforms for the activities of \"Taiwan independence\" elements, and refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nRecently, the Lai Ching-te administration has frequently traveled around under various pretexts, spreading lies and fallacies about \"Taiwan independence,\" exaggerating the \"China threat,\" and rehashing the fallacy of \"democracy versus authoritarianism.\" They are trying to embolden external forces to pursue their \"independence\" agenda, deliberately provoking confrontation and antagonism, seemingly eager to see the world in chaos. Their sinister intentions are blatantly obvious. No matter what the DPP administration says or does, it cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, nor can it shake the international community's adherence to the one-China principle, nor can it stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202509/t20250930_11721876.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-10","Guo Jiakun","China News Service reporter","On October 10, Lai Ching-te once again spread pro-Taiwan independence remarks in his \"Double Ten\" speech, falsely claiming that China should \"stop distorting UN General Assembly Resolution 2758\" and making unfounded claims that he would \"strive to maintain the status quo and safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Lai Ching-te's speech distorted the truth, confused the public, and revived the lie of \"democracy versus authoritarianism.\" He also repeated the old tune of peddling the fallacy of \"Taiwan independence,\" distorted and challenged historical facts and international consensus, and once again exposed his stubborn nature as a \"troublemaker,\" \"dangermaker,\" and \"warmaker.\"\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. Currently, the greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\" and external interference. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempts to fabricate various lies to advance \"seeking independence by force\" and \"resisting reunification by force\" will only drag Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait requires adhering to the one-China principle and unequivocally opposing \"Taiwan independence.\" The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. Opposing \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan,\" and supporting China's complete reunification, are the inherent obligations of the international community in upholding the one-China principle.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. International legal documents such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Declaration, and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender all affirm China's sovereignty over Taiwan, and Taiwan's return to China is a significant achievement of the victory in the World Anti-Fascist War. UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 politically, legally, and procedurally resolved the issue of representation of all of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations. It not only solemnly affirms and fully embodies the \"ironclad rule\" of the one-China principle but also represents a \"hard truth\" in upholding the international order. Any attempt to distort historical facts and challenge UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 is not only a challenge to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity but also a challenge to the authority of the United Nations and the post-World War II international order. It is a blatant attempt to reverse the course of history, utterly absurd, and extremely dangerous.\nChina has always firmly opposed any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with China and Taiwan. We urge the few foreign politicians who have visited Taiwan to immediately cease interfering in China's internal affairs and immediately stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. Whether these erroneous words and deeds are for their own selfish interests or stem from the sinister plot to \"use Taiwan to contain China,\" they have miscalculated and will inevitably meet a crushing defeat in the face of the historical trend of China's complete reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251010_11729410.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-10-10","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, there are claims that Taiwan’s first domestically built submarine, the Hai Kun, has encountered construction difficulties and may not be delivered on schedule. What comment does the spokesperson have?","Disregarding the safety and well-being of the people of Taiwan, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are wasting the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people in an attempt to seek “independence” through military means. Persisting obstinately along the misguided path of harming, endangering, and destroying Taiwan will only push the island toward the abyss of disaster.\nThe “Taiwan independence” armed forces are spending enormous sums to assemble and piece together a so-called “indigenous submarine.” In the face of the People’s Liberation Army, it would be incapable of withstanding even a single blow. This is completely overestimating their own capabilities and will ultimately lead only to self-destruction.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-10-17","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, the U.S. Senate and House of Representatives have passed a new version of the National Defense Authorization Act containing multiple negative provisions related to China. The act explicitly allocates $1 billion for the so-called “Taiwan Security Cooperation Initiative,” strengthens U.S.–Taiwan defense cooperation, and invites Taiwan to participate in the Rim of the Pacific exercise. What…","The negative China-related provisions in the U.S. legislation constitute a crude interference in China’s internal affairs, harm China’s sovereignty, security, and development interests, and undermine world peace and stability. China firmly opposes this.\nThe Taiwan question is the first red line that must not be crossed in China–U.S. relations. Playing the “Taiwan card” is tantamount to playing with fire, and arming Taiwan is destined to be a dangerous gamble for which the United States will inevitably pay a heavy price.\nWe urge the U.S. side to abide by the One-China principle and the three China–U.S. Joint Communiqués, to genuinely honor its commitment not to support “Taiwan independence,” to stop sending wrong signals to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces, and to cease all forms of military contact with China’s Taiwan region so as to avoid damaging relations between the two countries and their militaries, as well as peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-10-17","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","In his so-called October 10 speech, Lai Ching-te clamored for increasing defense budget, establishing T-Dome air defense system and building “whole-of-society defense resilience”, and claimed that peace was won through strength. May I have your comment?","In his relevant remarks, Lai Ching-te distorted historical facts and international jurisprudence, and peddled the same old separatist narrative for “Taiwan independence”. Lai used his whole bag of tricks to pander to foreign power, deceive the people in Taiwan, and provoke cross-Strait confrontation. This is yet another evidence that he is undermining peace and creating troubles. It exposed his malicious intention of selling out and ruining Taiwan.\nIn disregard of the well-being of the people in Taiwan, the DPP authorities keep barrelling down the wrong path of seeking independence by force, and try to embolden themselves with the T-Dome, which is just a castle in the air. Their behaviors are pushing Taiwan closer to the brink of war, and they are the ones who sow chaos and disrupt peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. We warn the DPP authorities that soliciting foreign support for independence and resisting reunification by force will not succeed. The PLA stays a strong force safeguarding the unity of our motherland. We will continue to enhance our real combat capabilities in countering separatist activities and foreign interference, and take resolute measures to safeguard national sovereignty, territorial integrity and cross-Strait peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-10-20","Guo Jiakun","China News Service reporter","It has been reported that Paraguayan First Vice President of the House of Representatives, Mesa, recently reiterated his public call for a \"serious and extensive discussion\" on the potential establishment of diplomatic and economic relations between Paraguay and China, emphasizing that this issue concerns the long-term interests of the country. What is China's comment on this?","The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations. Maintaining so-called \"diplomatic\" relations with the Taiwan authorities is a dead end with no way out. It cannot shake the firm international community's adherence to the one-China principle, nor can it change the general trend of China's eventual reunification.\nUpholding the one-China principle is a matter of international justice, the will of the people, and an irresistible trend. We urge the governments of a very small number of countries, including Paraguay, to recognize the situation, listen carefully to the appeals of insightful people, not to turn a blind eye to the will of the people, and to make the right political decision as soon as possible, based on the fundamental and long-term interests of their own people.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251020_11736645.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-21","Guo Jiakun","Kyodo News reporter","Sanae Takaichi, president of Japan’s Liberal Democratic Party, has just been elected prime minister. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this? What does China expect from her? What impact will it have on Japan-China relations?","We have noticed the relevant election results, which are Japan’s internal affairs. China and Japan are close neighbors to each other. China's basic position on China-Japan relations is consistent and clear. It is hoped that Japan will work with China to meet each other halfway, abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, keep its political commitments on major issues such as history and Taiwan, maintain the political foundation of bilateral relations, and comprehensively promote China-Japan strategic and mutually beneficial relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251021_11737578.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-21","Guo Jiakun","AFP reporter","US President Trump on Monday questioned claims of a \"Chinese invasion of Taiwan\" and said he was confident in his relationship with Chinese leaders. When asked about a US War Department assessment that mainland China would \"seize\" Taiwan in 2027, Trump said, \"We get along well with China, and they don't want to do that.\" Trump also stated he would visit China early next year. What is the Foreign Ministry's…","China's position on the Taiwan issue is consistent and clear. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves. We are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and the greatest effort, but we will never allow anyone or any force to separate Taiwan from China in any way.\nRegarding issues related to head-of-state diplomacy, we would like to emphasize that head-of-state diplomacy plays an irreplaceable strategic guiding role in China-US relations, and the heads of state of China and the United States maintain close communication and exchanges. As for the specific question you mentioned, I currently have no information to provide.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251021_11737578.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-23","Guo Jiakun","Yomiuri Shimbun reporter","When Fumio Kishida and Shigeru Ishiba took office as Prime Ministers of Japan, Chinese leaders sent congratulatory telegrams. Will you send a congratulatory telegram to Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi this time?","China has made appropriate arrangements in accordance with diplomatic practice. China and Japan are close neighbors. China's basic position on China-Japan relations is consistent and clear. We hope that Japan will work with China in the same direction, abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, honor its political commitments on major issues such as history and Taiwan, safeguard the political foundation of bilateral relations, and comprehensively advance the strategic and mutually beneficial relationship between China and Japan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251023_11739485.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-24","Guo Jiakun","Beijing Youth Daily reporter","According to Reuters, German Foreign Minister Waldfol stated in an interview with the agency that the German government's stance on the One China policy remains unchanged, but it will decide on the specific implementation of the policy independently and does not support using force to change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. What is China's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is a part of China, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is the most complete, accurate, and only statement of the One-China principle, and there is no reason or room for any \"customization.\"\nThe greatest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must adhere to the one-China principle and explicitly oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" Simply stating the need to maintain the status quo across the Taiwan Strait without mentioning opposition to \"Taiwan independence\" is, in effect, condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" activities, which will severely impact peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nWe hope that Germany will strictly adhere to the one-China principle and unequivocally oppose any separatist activities aimed at \"Taiwan independence\".","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251024_11740246.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-24","Guo Jiakun","NHK reporter","At yesterday's press conference, regarding the question of congratulating Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi, China responded that \"appropriate arrangements have been made in accordance with diplomatic practice.\" Could you please confirm that you have sent congratulations?","As you said, we already answered relevant questions yesterday. We would like to emphasize again that China has made appropriate arrangements in accordance with diplomatic practice. China and Japan are close neighbors to each other. China's basic position on China-Japan relations is consistent and clear. It is hoped that Japan will work with China to meet each other halfway, abide by the principles of the four political documents between China and Japan, keep its political commitments on major issues such as history and Taiwan, maintain the political foundation of bilateral relations, and comprehensively promote China-Japan strategic and mutually beneficial relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251024_11740246.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-27","Guo Jiakun","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","China recently decided to designate October 25th as Taiwan Retrocession Day, which has attracted significant international media attention. Could the spokesperson provide further details? What is your comment on this?","In 1945, after 14 years of unyielding and bloody struggle, the Chinese people won a great victory in the War of Resistance Against Japan and the World Anti-Fascist War. On October 25 of that year, the surrender ceremony of Taiwan Province in the China Theater was held in Taipei, and Taiwan and the Penghu Islands returned to China's sovereign jurisdiction.\nThe retrocession of Taiwan was an important achievement of the victory in the War of Resistance against Japan, an important and irrefutable proof of the Chinese government's resumption of the exercise of sovereignty over Taiwan, an important link in the historical fact and legal chain of Taiwan as a part of China, and a shared national memory of all Chinese sons and daughters.\nOn the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession, the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress of China decided to establish Taiwan Retrocession Commemoration Day. This demonstrates the firm stance of all ethnic groups in China in upholding the one-China principle and safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity. It reflects the common aspirations of Chinese people at home and abroad, including compatriots in Taiwan, and highlights the strong will of the Communist Party of China to resolutely shoulder historical responsibilities and unswervingly achieve the complete reunification of the motherland.\nThe retrocession of Taiwan is an important component of the outcomes of World War II and the post-war international order. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community and a fundamental norm of international relations. China's establishment of the Taiwan Retrocession Day effectively consolidates the international consensus that there is only one China and that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China. We hope that all countries will adhere to the one-China principle, jointly promote a correct view of World War II history, firmly safeguard the outcomes of the victory in World War II, and support the Chinese people's just cause of opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and achieving national reunification.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251027_11741741.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-28","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","Lin Jialong said that \"Taiwan-US relations are very stable,\" so he is not worried that President Trump will \"abandon Taiwan\" after meeting with Chinese leaders. What is China’s response to this?","Taiwan is an integral part of China’s territory. The biggest threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait currently is \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and the connivance and support of external forces. China has always opposed any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan. We hope that the United States will abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques and handle the Taiwan issue with caution and prudence. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly \"use foreign resources to seek independence\" and use various occasions to peddle the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" in an attempt to confuse right and wrong and confuse the public. Their behavior is despicable and shameful, and their plot is doomed to fail. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they can't change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, let alone stop the historical trend that China will eventually be reunified and will be reunified.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251028_11742618.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-10-30","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV reporter","According to reports, a recent poll in Paraguay this month shows that 58.3% of Paraguayans believe establishing diplomatic relations with China is very important, and 29.8% believe it is very important, totaling nearly 90%. Several Paraguayan lawmakers have called on the Paraguayan government to establish diplomatic relations with China and sever ties with Taiwan. What is China's comment on this?","China has taken note of the relevant reports. In recent years, we have repeatedly heard strong calls from friends from all walks of life in Paraguay for developing relations with China, and relevant public opinion polls once again show the Paraguayan people's fervent anticipation for the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Paraguay.\nWe want to reiterate that China's reunification is an unstoppable historical trend. Maintaining so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with the Taiwan authorities not only does not serve the fundamental and long-term interests of Paraguay and its people, but also runs counter to the international consensus on upholding the one-China principle. We urge the Paraguayan government to listen to the voice of the people, change course as soon as possible, stand on the right side of history, and make the correct choice to recognize the one-China principle and sever so-called \"diplomatic relations\" with the Taiwan authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202510/t20251030_11744169.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-10-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to media reports, the so-called US-Taiwan Defense Industry Conference 2025 was held in the US recently. The two sides discussed joint R&amp;D and production of weapons, and more US arms sales to Taiwan. What's your comment?","The DPP authorities are pandering to the US for selfish interests at the expense of Taiwan's interests and seeking independence by force at the cost of Taiwan's resources, dragging the people in Taiwan down into an abyss. No matter how much weaponry the DPP authorities plans to buy from the US, it will not change the military strength comparison across the Strait, nor the desolate fate of \"Taiwan Independence\".\nThe US should fully recognize the high sensitivity and severe consequences of its arms sales to Taiwan, stop playing with fire on the Taiwan question which concerns China's core interests, and take concrete actions to deliver on its promise of not supporting \"Taiwan independence\".\nThe PLA will firmly smash any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist plot and foreign interference, and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity with stronger capabilities and more reliable means.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-10-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","October 25 is the Commemoration Day of Taiwan's Restoration. However, Lai Ching-te did not mention anything about Taiwan's restoration on the day. Instead, he released a statement clamoring for the Battle of Guningtou. He said that \"the conviction of the Taiwanese people and military to defend Taiwan, Penghu, Kinmen, and Matsu has never wavered\". What's your comment on this?","On the occasion of the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's restoration, the designation of the Commemoration Day of Taiwan's Restoration in the name of the state fully responds to people's aspirations and reflects the national will. It underscores the historical and juridical fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and demonstrates the firm resolve of all ethnic groups across the nation to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, promote peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and advance the great cause of national reunification. It also embodies the broad consensus of the international community on upholding the one-China principle. This move will undoubtedly guide compatriots on both sides of the Strait in carrying forward and promoting the tradition of patriotism, the spirit of the War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression, and the great national spirit, inspiring all Chinese people to unite in striving for national reunification and rejuvenation.\nLai Ching-te and his ilk stand on the opposite side of history, against compatriots across the Strait and in defiance of the international consensus. Their attempts to \"seek independence by force\" and \"resist reunification by force\" are nothing but a mantis trying to stop a chariot, overestimating their own strength. They are doomed to be buried by the historical trends and face the severest judgment by justice.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-10-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","The recent hit TV series Silent Honor has sparked widespread interest across the Strait on TV series related to the reunification of China. Some young people in Taiwan said that the series helped them learn about a lesser-known chapter in the history of cross-Strait relations and found it deeply moving. What's your comment?","I have noticed that a growing number of people are reading history and paying tribute to heroes and martyrs after watching relevant television dramas. This will undoubtedly strengthen the resolve and sense of duty among compatriots on both sides of the Strait in advancing the great cause of national reunification. I firmly believe that family reunion and national reunification is the common aspiration of our people, and reunification is an unstoppable historical trend. The unfinished cause of the martyrs will ultimately be accomplished.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-10-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, on October 25, the Commemoration Day of Taiwan's Restoration, Jilin-1, a commercial satellite, released multiple high-resolution images of Taiwan. From the satellite's view, every street in Taiwan is clearly visible. Local media commented that technological development in mainland is impressive — \"when commercial satellites can detect these facilities so clear, military satellites are…","Regarding the first question, it is perfectly normal for Chinese satellites to capture images of the magnificent landscapes of China's Taiwan region. No need to make a big deal out of it.\nRegarding the second question, given Japan's history of militarist aggression, Japan's military and security moves are closely watched. In recent years, Japan has substantially increased its defense budget, continuously relaxed restrictions on arms export, and sought military breakthroughs. There are greater concerns over Japan's commitment to the exclusively defense-oriented policy and the path of peaceful development. We urge the Japanese side to act prudently in military and security areas, and earn the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community with concrete actions.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-10-30","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, according to media reports, Lai Ching-te recently stated that strengthening national defense was not a provocation, and Taiwan must show \"firm opposition to annexation, opposition to invasion, and opposition to advancing unification.\" What is your comment on this? Second, you just mentioned Defense Minister Dong Jun's participation in the 12th ADMM-Plus. Is there any plan to meet the…","Regarding the first question, Lai Ching-te and his ilk have consistently used deceptive rhetoric to mislead the public, concealing their sinister intention of pursuing \"Taiwan independence\" and provoking conflicts. Their actions are nothing but schemes that harm and destroy Taiwan. We solemnly warn the DPP authorities that national reunification is an unstoppable historical trend, and those who \"seek independence by force\" will only court their own destruction.\nRegarding the second question, China maintains an open attitude towards developing military-to-military relations with the US. We hope the US side will work with us in the same direction to build a military-to-military relationship featuring equality, mutual respect, peaceful coexistence and greater stability. Concerning the specific matter you mentioned, I have no information to release at this time.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-11-05","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Taiwan said today that mainland China has imposed \"several conditions\" on Chinese Taipei's participation in next year's APEC Leaders' Informal Meeting, including the requirement to adhere to the one-China principle. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Participating in APEC as a regional economy under the one-China principle and adhering to the relevant APEC Memoranda of Understanding and practices is the political prerequisite for Chinese Taipei's participation in APEC. On this issue, China's position is clear and firm.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251105_11747551.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-06","Mao Ning","Beijing Daily reporter","It has been reported that the Japanese government announced its list of foreign honorees for the fall of 2025 on March 3, awarding the Grand Cordon of the Order of the Rising Sun to former Taipei Economic and Cultural Representative Office in Japan, Hsieh Chang-ting. Hsieh posted on social media on March 3, stating that he will continue to contribute to promoting \"Japan-Taiwan friendship.\" What is China's comment…","What is Japan's intention in awarding medals to those who advocate \"Taiwan independence\"? Is it trying to support and encourage \"Taiwan independence\" elements? What signal does Japan want to send to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces?\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, concerning the political foundation of China-Japan relations and Japan's basic credibility. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. China urges Japan to deeply reflect on its historical responsibilities, abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan question, and cease sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251106_11748399.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-11-07","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, Taiwan’s army recently held a ceremony to induct the M1A2T tanks into service. Lai Ching-te claimed that strengthening Taiwan’s defense is intended to maintain peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and that only strength can bring about genuine peace. What comment does the spokesperson have?","The “Taiwan independence” forces are well aware of the comparison of military strength across the Taiwan Strait. Their high-profile showmanship is merely an attempt to bolster their own courage while misleading the people of Taiwan.\nThe determination and capability of the People’s Liberation Army to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity cannot be challenged by the Taiwan military simply displaying a few pieces of U.S.-made weaponry. Any desperate resistance by “Taiwan independence” forces cannot halt the mighty wheels of history from moving forward.\nWe solemnly warn people like Lai Ching-te that attempting to seek “independence” through military means is a dead end. Only by completely abandoning separatist schemes for “Taiwan independence” and following the historical trend toward cross-strait reunification can genuine peace be brought to Taiwan.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-11-10","Lin Jian","Hong Kong China Review News Agency reporter","On November 7, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi stated during a parliamentary question-and-answer session that if mainland China were to deploy warships and use force against Taiwan, it could constitute an \"existential crisis.\" According to Japanese law, in the event of an \"existential crisis\" deemed a threat to Japan's survival, the Self-Defense Forces can exercise the right of collective self-defense.…","The Japanese leader recently made erroneous remarks about Taiwan in the Diet, hinting at the possibility of military intervention in the Taiwan Strait. This constitutes a blatant interference in China's internal affairs, a serious violation of the one-China principle, the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and the basic norms of international relations. It is also severely inconsistent with the political commitments made by the Japanese government to date, and its nature and impact are extremely egregious. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this and has lodged a solemn representation and strong protest with Japan.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan. How the Taiwan issue is resolved and national reunification achieved is purely China's internal affair, and brooks no interference from any external forces. What signal is the Japanese leader trying to send to the \"Taiwan independence\" forces through his remarks? Is he attempting to challenge China's core interests and obstruct China's reunification? Where exactly does Japan intend to steer Sino-Japanese relations?\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan once exercised colonial rule over Taiwan, committing countless crimes. The Japanese authorities' attempt to intervene in cross-strait affairs is not only a trampling on international justice and a provocation against the post-war international order, but also a serious damage to Sino-Japanese relations. China will eventually be unified, and it will surely be unified. The Chinese people have the firm will, full confidence, and sufficient capability to resolutely crush all attempts to interfere in and obstruct China's great cause of reunification. China urges Japan to immediately cease interfering in China's internal affairs, stop its provocations and transgressions, and refrain from going further down the wrong path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251110_11750313.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-12","Guo Jiakun","Global Times reporter","It was reported that on the 11th, the Japanese government held an autumn medal awarding ceremony, conferring the \"Grand Cordon of the Order of the Rising Sun\" on former \"Taipei Economic and Cultural Representative Office in Japan\" Hsieh Chang-ting. Hsieh Chang-ting posted on social media on the same day that he will continue to work for \"Japan-Taiwan friendship.\" What is China's comment on this?","China has already stated its position on this issue. The Japanese government's insistence on proposing and pushing for the awarding of medals to those who advocate \"Taiwan independence\" is yet another erroneous move by Japan on Taiwan-related issues, and China firmly opposes it.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests, concerning the political foundation of China-Japan relations and Japan's basic credibility; it is a red line that cannot be crossed. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. China solemnly urges Japan to deeply reflect on its historical responsibilities, abide by the relevant principles and spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, demonstrate its commitment to the one-China principle with concrete actions, exercise caution in its words and deeds on the Taiwan question, and cease sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251112_11751644.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-13","Lin Jian","People's Daily reporter","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently made remarks suggesting that a Chinese military attack on Taiwan could constitute a \"life-or-death crisis\" for Japan. According to reports, Takaichi insisted during a parliamentary debate that her remarks reflected the Japanese government's views and that she had no intention of retracting or canceling them. What is China's comment on this?","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently made blatantly provocative remarks about Taiwan in the Diet, hinting at the possibility of military intervention in the Taiwan Strait. Despite China's strong protests and solemn representations, Japan remains obstinate and refuses to retract its statements. These erroneous words and actions seriously violate the one-China principle, the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and the basic norms of international relations. They constitute gross interference in China's internal affairs, challenge China's core interests, and infringe upon China's sovereignty. China firmly opposes and will not tolerate this. Japan must immediately correct its actions and retract its egregious remarks; otherwise, Japan must bear all the consequences.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan once exercised colonial rule over Taiwan, committing countless crimes. Throughout its history, Japanese militarism has repeatedly used the pretext of a so-called \"existential crisis\" to launch foreign aggression, including brazenly creating the \"September 18 Incident\" under the guise of \"exercising the right of self-defense,\" provoking the war of aggression against China and bringing profound suffering to the people of Asia, including China, and indeed the world. Today, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi has again raised the so-called \"existential crisis situation.\" What are her true intentions? Is she trying to repeat the mistakes of militarism? Is she once again becoming an enemy of the Chinese and Asian people? Is she attempting to subvert the post-war international order?\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan. How the Taiwan issue is resolved and national reunification achieved is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, and brooks no interference from any external forces. The Japanese authorities' attempt to intervene in cross-strait affairs is not only a blatant trampling on international justice and an open provocation against the post-war international order, but also a serious damage to Sino-Japanese relations. If Japan dares to intervene militarily in the Taiwan Strait situation, it will constitute an act of aggression, and China will certainly retaliate forcefully! We will resolutely exercise the right to self-defense granted to us by the UN Charter and international law, and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We solemnly warn Japan that it must deeply reflect on its historical crimes, immediately cease its erroneous words and deeds of interfering in China's internal affairs and provoking and crossing the line, and not play with fire on the Taiwan issuethose who play with fire will get burned!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251113_11752756.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-14","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","It has been reported that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently avoided giving a clear answer when asked in the Diet whether she adheres to the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles.\" Separately, regarding the question of whether Japan will introduce nuclear-powered submarines, Chief Cabinet Secretary Minoru Kihara stated that he does not rule out any option. Defense Minister Shinjiro Koizumi stated that the…","China is seriously concerned about Japan's recent military and security developments. Japan touts itself as a \"peaceful country\" and promotes the establishment of a world without nuclear weapons, but the Takaichi administration has been vague and ambiguous in its statements on the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles,\" implying that it may abandon them. High-ranking Japanese officials have even claimed that they do not rule out the introduction of nuclear submarines. All of this fully exposes a major negative shift in Japan's policy and sends a dangerous signal to the international community.\nDuring World War II, Japanese militarism launched a war of aggression, committing heinous crimes against humanity and bringing profound suffering to the region and the world. In recent years, Japan has drastically adjusted its security policy, increasing its defense budget year by year, relaxing restrictions on arms exports, and seeking to develop offensive weapons, going further and further down the wrong path of military expansion. Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently made blatantly provocative remarks about Taiwan, hinting at the possibility of military intervention in the Taiwan Strait. These actions by Japan have inevitably raised strong questions and concerns among its Asian neighbors and the international community: Has Japan truly severed ties with militarism? Is the Japanese government genuinely committed to its exclusively defensive defense policy and the \"three non-nuclear principles\"? Will Japan continue to uphold its commitment to peaceful development?\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of the retrocession of Taiwan. We urge Japan to deeply reflect on its history of aggression, adhere to the path of peaceful development, stop seeking excuses for its own military expansion, and take concrete actions to win the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251114_11753607.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-11-14","Jiang Bin","Question","It is reported that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently said that if the Chinese mainland uses military vessels and other forces against Taiwan, it would cause a situation threatening Japan’s survival, and the Japanese Self-defense Force could exercise the right of collective self-defense in accordance with law. Do you have any comment?","The erroneous remarks on Taiwan made by the Japanese leader constitute a gross interference in China’s internal affairs, and a serious violation of the one-China principle, the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and the basic norms governing international relations. The remarks have challenged the post-war international order, and sent very wrong signals to the “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. Such words are egregious in nature and have caused very negative impact. They are extremely irresponsible and dangerous.\nThe Taiwan question is purely China’s internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. This year, we commemorated the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People’s War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, and the 80th anniversary of the restoration of Taiwan. Should the Japanese side fail to draw lessons from history and dare to take a risk, or even use force to interfere in the Taiwan question, it will only suffer a complete failure before the steel-willed PLA and pay a heavy price.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-11-14","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, relevant authorities in Taiwan have announced that nearly one quarter of the volunteer soldiers recruited over the past four years have not completed the minimum required term of service and instead chose to pay compensation in order to leave the military early. What comment does the spokesperson have?","This indicates that an increasing number of people in Taiwan have come to clearly see the sinister intention of the Lai Ching-te authorities to bind Taiwanese society to the “Taiwan independence” war chariot for the sake of the interests of a single party. It also shows that more and more young people in Taiwan are unwilling to become cannon fodder.\n“Taiwan independence” would not only bury the future—and even the lives—of Taiwan’s younger generation, but would also destroy Taiwan’s future as a whole. We hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will more courageously say “No” to “Taiwan independence,” safeguard their own security and interests, and uphold peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-11-17","Mao Ning","CCTV reporter","Recently, some Japanese politicians claimed that China's reaction to Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks on Taiwan was \"overreaction.\" Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Minoru Kihara also argued that the Japanese government's position on the Taiwan issue remains unchanged and consistent with the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement. What is China's response to this?","China has repeatedly stated its solemn position on Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan. These remarks seriously violate the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and fundamentally damage the political foundation of China-Japan relations.\nWhen China and Japan discussed the resumption of diplomatic relations, China clearly put forward the \"three principles for the resumption of diplomatic relations\": the government of the People's Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the Chinese people; Taiwan Province is an inseparable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China; and the so-called \"Japan-Chiang Kai-shek Treaty\" is illegal and invalid and should be abolished.\nIn 1972, the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement was signed, formally establishing diplomatic relations between the two countries. The Joint Statement addresses the Taiwan issue in three places: first, in the preamble, it states, \"The Japanese side reiterates its position of fully understanding the 'Three Principles for the Normalization of Diplomatic Relations' put forward by the Government of the People's Republic of China, and seeks to achieve the normalization of diplomatic relations between China and Japan\"; second, in Article 2, it states, \"The Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China\"; and third, in Article 3, it states, \"The Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and adheres to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\"\nIn 1978, China and Japan signed the Treaty of Peace and Friendship, which clearly stated that \"the Joint Statement between China and Japan is the foundation of peaceful and friendly relations between the two countries, and all principles expressed in the Joint Statement shall be strictly observed.\" This legally confirmed the principles and contents of the Joint Statement and established legal norms for Sino-Japanese relations.\nIn 1998, the two sides issued the \"Joint Declaration of China and Japan on Establishing a Friendly Partnership for Peace and Development,\" in which Japan pledged to \"continue to abide by Japan's position on the Taiwan issue as stated in the China-Japan Joint Statement and reiterate that there is only one China. Japan will continue to maintain only non-governmental and regional exchanges with Taiwan,\" thereby excluding the legal space for Japan to develop official relations with Taiwan.\nIn 2008, Article 5 of the Joint Statement between China and Japan on Comprehensively Promoting Strategic and Mutually Beneficial Relations clearly stipulated that Japan \"will continue to adhere to the position expressed in the Joint Statement between China and Japan on the Taiwan issue.\"\nThe above-mentioned provisions on the Taiwan issue in the four political documents between China and Japan represent a clear commitment made by the Japanese government and have the force of international law. There is no room for ambiguity or misinterpretation. Regardless of which political party or individual is in power in Japan, they must uphold and abide by the Japanese government's commitments on the Taiwan issue. We urge Japan to act responsibly towards history and bilateral relations, cease its overstepping of boundaries and actions, retract its erroneous words and deeds, and earnestly translate its commitments to China into concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251117_11754686.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-18","Mao Ning","A reporter from the German Press Agency (DPA) asked","Following a financial dialogue with Vice Chancellor He Lifeng, German Vice Chancellor and Finance Minister Klingbeer stated that the two sides discussed the Taiwan issue, and the German government expressed concern about a potential escalation of tensions across the Taiwan Strait. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. How to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no interference from any external forces. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait hinges on adhering to the one-China principle and resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251118_11755479.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-19","Mao Ning","CGTN reporter","On November 18 local time, the 80th UN General Assembly considered the issue of Security Council reform. During his speech, the Chinese representative clearly stated that Japan is not qualified to apply for permanent membership on the UN Security Council. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","According to the UN Charter, the Security Council bears the primary responsibility for maintaining international peace and security. Japan launched a war of aggression during World War II, bringing profound suffering to the people of Asia and the world. Even today, Japan has not thoroughly reflected on its war crimes, and some still promote erroneous views of World War II history, visit the Yasukuni Shrine, and distort, deny, or even glorify its history of aggression. Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently made blatantly erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan, grossly interfering in China's internal affairs, trampling on international law and the basic norms of international relations, and challenging the post-war international order. Such a country cannot shoulder the responsibility of maintaining international peace and security and is not qualified to be a permanent member of the UN Security Council.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251119_11756196.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-20","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","Regarding Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's remarks about \"something happening in Taiwan,\" many Chinese people believe that Japan bears historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue and is the least qualified party to talk about \"something happening.\" What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Historically, Japan forcibly occupied Taiwan and imposed colonial rule for half a century. During the Japanese occupation, the people of Taiwan suffered greatly; hundreds of thousands of compatriots were killed, and the people were deprived of all political rights, freedom of religion, and cultural freedom. Mineral resources and daily necessities were plundered. The Japanese invaders committed countless crimes in Taiwan, writing the darkest page in Taiwan's history.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan should remember that Taiwan is part of China. Whether Taiwan is in trouble or not is none of Japan's concern. Trying to create trouble for Taiwan will only cause problems for Japan!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251120_11757114.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-21","Mao Ning","Reuters reporter","Recently, Chinese diplomats have posted numerous messages on social media regarding the Japanese Prime Minister's remarks on Taiwan. For example, the Chinese Embassy in the Philippines released a series of cartoons. Some analysts say this signifies the resumption of China's \"wolf warrior diplomacy.\" What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi openly made erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan, hinting at the possibility of military intervention in the Taiwan Strait. This undermines the political foundation of China-Japan relations and has aroused public indignation and condemnation from the Chinese people. China will resolutely retaliate against anyone who crosses the red line on the Taiwan issue. The international community should pay attention to what Japan's true intentions are and whether it can still adhere to the path of peaceful development.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251121_11757769.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-24","Mao Ning","CNR reporter","It has been reported that in response to China's letter to the UN Secretary-General regarding Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks on Taiwan, a Japanese government spokesperson told reporters during the G20 summit that China's claim that Japan has changed its position on the Taiwan issue is baseless. Japan has repeatedly explained the essence of Prime Minister Takaichi's remarks and its…","Regarding Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks concerning Taiwan, China has repeatedly stated its solemn position. These remarks seriously violate the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and fundamentally damage the political foundation of China-Japan relations.\nWe have noticed Japan's recent mention of its \"consistent position\" on the Taiwan issue, but what exactly is the content of Japan's so-called \"consistent position\"? Can Japan fully and publicly express this \"consistent position\"? If Japan merely reiterates the concept that its position has not changed, but remains vague about the specific content and continues to cross the line in its actions, then such reiteration is just empty talk and is hollowing out and undermining the One China principle.\nThe one-China principle is an unshakable and universal consensus of the international community. If the Japanese government's position on the Taiwan issue has truly not changed, it should explicitly adhere to the one-China principle, abide by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and its commitments to date, including the specific content of the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, namely, \"The Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China,\" and \"The Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and adheres to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\" Why can't Japan fully and accurately reiterate the above position?\nChina urges Japan to take China's serious demands seriously, earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, and translate its commitments to China into concrete actions. Japan should not be stubborn and should not say one thing and do another.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251124_11758891.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-25","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan have aroused indignation among the Chinese people. Some in Japan are claiming that it was the Republic of China, not the People's Republic of China, that accepted Japan's surrender, therefore the People's Republic of China has no right to discuss the Taiwan issue. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","People who make such remarks are either ignorant of history or deliberately distort history and disregard international law.\nIn 1945, Japan signed the instrument of surrender, explicitly pledging to faithfully implement the Potsdam Declaration and unconditionally return Taiwan to China. China resumed the exercise of sovereignty over Taiwan, legally and de facto recovering it. In 1949, the government of the People's Republic of China replaced the government of the Republic of China. This was a change of regime without any change in China's subject matter of international law; China's sovereignty and inherent territorial boundaries remained unchanged. The government of the People's Republic of China rightfully and fully enjoys and exercises China's sovereignty, including its sovereignty over Taiwan. The 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement explicitly stated that the Government of Japan recognized the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. This is an irrefutable fact that cannot be distorted or altered.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251125_11759947.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-26","Mao Ning","People's Daily reporter","On November 25, in response to whether the Japanese government's criteria for identifying a crisis of survival would remain unchanged, the Japanese cabinet passed a written reply stating that Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's parliamentary answer \"does not change the Japanese government's consistent position,\" emphasizing that \"the government will comprehensively assess all information based on the specific…","Regarding Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks on Taiwan, China has repeatedly stated its solemn position. These remarks seriously violate the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, undermine the political foundation of China-Japan relations, and challenge the post-war international order. China firmly opposes them. Knowledgeable people within Japan have widely expressed their doubts and criticisms, and international public opinion has also condemned them.\nThe Japanese government's cabinet response on November 25th still reiterated its so-called \"consistent position\" or \"unchanged position\" regarding Taiwan, which is far from sufficient. What China and the international community demand confirmation of is: what exactly is Japan's so-called \"consistent position\"? Does Japan still adhere to the one-China principle? Japan should honestly, accurately, and completely explain its so-called \"consistent position.\" Glossing over the issue with superficial details, only mentioning concepts and avoiding the substance, in an attempt to evade the issue, will not work.\nMoreover, instead of repenting, Japan once again made unwarranted comments on the Taiwan issue and interfered in China's internal affairs in its response. I want to emphasize that Taiwan is China's Taiwan. How the Taiwan issue is resolved and national reunification is achieved is entirely China's internal affair, and Japan will never utter a word of criticism or interfere. China once again urges Japan to take China's solemn demands seriously, earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, retract its erroneous remarks as soon as possible, and translate its commitments to China into concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251126_11760672.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-11-27","Guo Jiakun","CCTV reporter","We noticed that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi stated during yesterday's party leader debate that \"(Japan) has relinquished all its rights under the Treaty of San Francisco and has no position on recognizing Taiwan's legal status.\" Does China agree with this statement?","Taiwan's return to China is an important part of the outcomes of World War II and the post-war international order. A series of documents with international legal force, such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Declaration, and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, all affirmed China's sovereignty over Taiwan. The issue of Taiwan's status was thoroughly resolved as early as 1945 with the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japan. On October 1, 1949, the Central People's Government of the People's Republic of China was established, becoming the sole legal government representing all of China. This was a change of regime without any change in China as a subject of international law; China's sovereignty and inherent territorial boundaries remained unchanged, and the government of the People's Republic of China rightfully and fully enjoys and exercises China's sovereignty, including its sovereignty over Taiwan. The 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement clearly states that \"the Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China,\" and \"the Government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Government of Japan fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and adheres to the position of Article VIII of the Potsdam Declaration.\"\nThe so-called \"San Francisco Peace Treaty\" was a document issued to negotiate a unilateral peace with Japan, excluding major parties to World War II such as China and Russia. This document violates the provisions of the 1942 Declaration of the United Nations, signed by 26 countries including China, the United States, the United Kingdom, and the Soviet Union, which prohibits unilateral peace negotiations with enemy states. It also violates the Charter of the United Nations and fundamental principles of international law. Any provisions concerning China's territorial and sovereign rights as a non-signatory country, such as those concerning the sovereignty of Taiwan, are illegal and invalid.\nPrime Minister Sanae Takaichi avoided mentioning the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration, which have full legal force under international law and are clearly emphasized in bilateral documents such as the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement and the Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship. Instead, she singled out the illegal and invalid Treaty of San Francisco. This once again demonstrates that she remains unrepentant and continues to undermine the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations established by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan. She disregards the authority of the United Nations, openly challenges the post-war international order and basic norms of international law, and even attempts to hype up the so-called \"undetermined status of Taiwan.\" This is compounding her mistakes, which China firmly opposes, and the international community should also be highly vigilant. We once again urge Japan to earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, retract its erroneous statements, demonstrate its commitment to China with concrete actions, and fulfill its minimum obligations as a member state of the United Nations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251127_11761822.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to Japanese media reports, a JSDF representative noted that if the Chinese aircraft carrier PLANS Fujian were to engage in military actions in the Taiwan Strait, Japanese and American forces would be able to destroy it. What's your comment?","A simple response to such ignorant remarks: sheer illusion. One should never overestimate its own strength.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, the Chinese and US militaries held the second working group meeting and the annual session of the Maritime Military Communication Agreement (MMCA) from November 18 to 20 in Hawaii. How does the Chinese side evaluate the current China-US military-to-military relationship? Are there any other planned exchanges between the two sides in the near future? Secondly, the Japanese side…","On your first question, representatives from the Chinese and US militaries held the second working group meeting and the annual session of the Maritime Military Communication Agreement (MMCA) in Hawaii from November 18 to 20. The meetings were held to implement the consensus between the Chinese Defense Minister and the US Secretary of War on strengthening communication and exchanges between troops on the ground to avoid misunderstanding and miscalculation, manage risks and crises, and add positive factors to building a stable and positive mil-mil relationship featuring equality, mutual respect, and peaceful coexistence. As for exchanges in the near future, the two sides maintain contact at the working level. We will release information in due course.\nAs for your second question, the Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China. How to solve the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese, and has nothing to do with Japan. This year marks the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's restoration. Instead of repenting for its war crimes of invading and colonizing Taiwan, Japan is taking an extremely wrong approach by suggesting military intervention into a so-called Taiwan contingency. This dangerous approach will uproot the post-WWII international order, and lead Japan to repeat the mistakes of its militarist past. The PLA has strong capabilities and reliable means to defeat any aggressors. Should the Japanese side dare to cross the red line and invite troubles to itself, it is destined to pay a heavy price.\nSenior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of the Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answered questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of November 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","The PLA started military operations in the waters of the northern Yellow Sea near the Bohai Strait on November 23 and the operations will run through until December 7. Are these exercises intended to warn Japan? Recently, the Chinese military sent messages through multiple channels about its readiness to fight and win at any time. Given that the Japanese side rejected to retract relevant remarks, will the PLA…","The root cause for deteriorating relations between China and Japan lies in that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi blatantly made erroneous remarks relating to Taiwan. Since Japan's surrender in 1945, it was the first time for a Japanese leader to publicly clamor for something like \"what's happening in Taiwan is directly linked to Japan\" and relate it to the right of collective self-defense. Such claims revealed for the first time Japan's intent to have armed intervention in the Taiwan question. It was also the first-ever threat using force against China made by Japan. Relevant remarks, which blatantly challenge China's core interests, are extremely wrong, dangerous and egregious. It is the Chinese military's sacred duty to safeguard national sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity. We will show no mercy to any aggressive moves and crush them with a head-on blow.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","It was reported that the Japanese government sold its domestically produced Patriot air-defense missiles to the US. It was the first export of deadly weapons since Japan relaxed controls on its arms export. Besides, the Liberal Democratic Party of Japan has started discussions on revising its three security documents, including the revision of its three non-nuclear principles and increasing its defense spending.…","It is an ironclad fact that Japan was a defeated country in WWII. International treaties and instruments such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Proclamation, and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, explicitly ban Japan from rearmament. The international community must be on high alert against Japan's revisionist attempts to break away from the restraints of its pacifist Constitution by brazenly expanding its military build-up, drastically increasing its defense budget, expediting the revision of its security policies, relaxing restrictions on weapons export, and attempting to revoke the three non-nuclear principles. It is even attempting to intervene militarily on the Taiwan question. These moves pose serious threats to regional peace and stability.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. People around the world, especially those from China and other victimized countries in Asia, will never forget the catastrophe brought by Japanese Fascists. The specter of Japanese militarism must never be allowed to haunt the world again. We urge the Japanese side to fully repent for its war crimes and immediately abandon dangerous attempts in constitutional revision and military build-up. Any attempt to repeat the evil path of aggression and expansion and undermine the post-WWII international order will not succeed.\nSenior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of the Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answered questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of November 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","After China took countermeasures against Sanae Takaichi's provocative remarks, the head of Taiwan's so-called external affairs department alleged that Taiwan would support Japan at critical moments as the mainland is bullying Japan through economic coercion and military threats. Lai Ching-te posted pictures on social media of himself eating Japanese food to show his support for Japan. What's your comment on this?","Lai Ching-te has already been disgraced for fawning over Japan. This time, he is so obsequious that he's even licking Japan's boots. We warn the DPP authorities that any attempt to pursue \"Taiwan independence\" by soliciting support from external forces is doomed to fail. Anyone who betrays the nation and seeks to divide the country will be nailed to the pillar of shame.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, according to media reports, US Ambassador to Japan and Deputy Spokesperson for the US Department of State both mentioned this month that the US-Japan Security Treaty applies to the defense of the Diaoyu Dao. Some analyzed that the US intends to counter China's increasing pressure on Japan. What's your comment? Secondly, as was reported by Taiwan media on November 23, Taiwan's Marine…","On your first question. Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi made blatant and erroneous remarks on Taiwan. Those remarks implied the possibility of Japan's armed intervention in a Taiwan contingency, which triggered outrage and condemnation from the Chinese people. Diaoyu Dao and its affiliated islands are China's inherent territory. No matter what the US or Japan say or do, this fact will not change and China's resolve in safeguarding its national sovereignty and territorial integrity will not be wavered. Certain individuals in the US should act in ways that befit their positions and contribute to regional peace and stability, instead of provoking tensions and stirring up chaos.\nOn your second question, the Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China, which brooks no foreign interference. We firmly oppose any form of military collusion between the US and the Taiwan region. We warn the DPP authorities that any attempt to seek \"Taiwan independence\" by soliciting support from external forces or reject reunification by force is doomed to failure.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","An investigation reveals that in recent years, Japan has spent over 13.1 billion yen in Taiwan on cultivating pro-Japanese influencers and relevant propaganda efforts. What's your comment?","During its colonial rule of Taiwan, Japan aggressively enforced the so-called Kominka (Imperial Subject) Movement. Today, it is investing heavily in a more covert campaign of ideological and cultural infiltration targeting the people of Taiwan. This is an attempt to whitewash its own history of aggression and to strip the island's younger generation of their national and cultural identity as Chinese. History must not be distorted, nor can family ties be severed. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait must heighten their vigilance against Japan's political manipulation, resolutely oppose any betraying acts of fawning over Japan and forsaking one's ancestors, and be proud and upright Chinese.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","It was reported that the DPP authorities launched a massive mailing campaign to distribute civil defense handbooks to households across the island from November 19, marking an effort to strengthen public preparedness for emergencies, including the possibility of a military attack from the Chinese mainland. An official of the DPP authorities said that it shows Taiwan's determination to defend itself and people…","The so-called handbooks concocted by the DPP authorities are packed with lies. They spread fear of war and create a tense, impending-war atmosphere, inciting confrontation and hostility across the Strait. This runs completely counter to the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan, which desires peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation. It fully exposes the DPP authorities' malicious intent to seek \"Taiwan independence\" by force and military buildup. We believe that our fellow Taiwan compatriots will see through the DPP authorities' true nature of harming Taiwan and will take active actions to jointly oppose the separatist forces' reckless attempts for \"Taiwan independence\", safeguard their own security and well-being as well as peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We hope the compatriots on both sides of the Strait will work together to achieve national reunification and the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.\nSenior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of the Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answered questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of November 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, the recent maiden sea trial by China's first Type 076 amphibious assault ship, PLANS Sichuan, has attracted international attention. Could you please brief us more on the major improvements of the Type 076 compared to its predecessor, Type 075, in terms of combat capabilities and core technologies? Additionally, does the PLA Navy have a clear plan for mass production and systematic…","On your first question, as a new-generation amphibious assault ship, PLANS Sichuan will play a significant role in advancing the PLA Navy's transformation and modernization, as well as enhancing its capabilities of far seas operations. China's independent research and development of amphibious assault ships and other military equipment serves China's national security and supports the overall development of the PLA Navy. The goal is to safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests, and to better protect peace and stability in the region and beyond.\nOn your second question, it is the Chinese military's sacred duty to safeguard national sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity. We will show no mercy to any aggressive moves and crush them with a head-on blow.\nSenior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of the Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answered questions at a regular press conference on the afternoon of November 27, 2025. (mod.gov.cn)","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-11-27","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Lai Ching-te announced a special defense budget of NT$1.25 trillion over the next eight years, claiming that the mainland intends to use force to \"coerce reunification, compel surrender and annex Taiwan\". He also proposed two security action plans. What's your comment? Besides, he said that the mainland would complete preparations for reunification by force in 2027. What's your comment?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no such thing as president in the region. Separatist actions for \"Taiwan independence\" and interference from external forces constitute the biggest threat to peace across the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities keep generating war scares, constantly devising new and costly schemes under the guise of soliciting external support for \"Taiwan independence\" or seeking \"Taiwan independence\" by force. These so-called plans are completely futile. They cannot stop the historical trend of national reunification and will only accelerate the demise of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatists.\nJiang Bin: As there are no more questions, I'd like to bring this press conference to a close. Thank you.\nRelated News\nComments\n-->\nAbout Us\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © China Military. All rights reserved.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-11-28","Mao Ning","Global Times reporter","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks have drawn opposition and criticism from the international community and insightful individuals within Japan. However, the Taiwan authorities have repeatedly made gestures of support for Takaichi. Lai Ching-te recently expressed his so-called support by eating sushi, and Taiwan's foreign affairs department falsely claimed that China's letter to the UN…","Japan once colonized Taiwan for half a century, committing countless crimes. The DPP authorities' \"pro-Japan and pro-independence\" stance is despicable.\nJapanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's remarks on Taiwan interfered in China's internal affairs, sent a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and endangered peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan should deeply reflect on its historical culpability, learn from its historical lessons, adhere to the one-China principle, and exercise caution in its words and actions on the Taiwan issue. We demand that Japan retract its erroneous remarks, cease interfering in China's internal affairs, and demonstrate its commitment to China with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202511/t20251128_11762812.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-01","Lin Jian","Global Times reporter","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi previously stated that Japan had relinquished all rights under the Treaty of San Francisco and therefore \"cannot recognize Taiwan's legal status.\" When asked on November 28 whether this meant \"Japan does not recognize China's sovereignty over Taiwan,\" Japanese Foreign Minister Toshimitsu Motegi reiterated the relevant statement regarding the Treaty of San Francisco, adding…","Japan has repeatedly been evasive and ambiguous about its position on the Taiwan issue. It avoids mentioning the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Declaration, and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, which clearly return Taiwan to China. It also avoids mentioning the four political documents that form the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations and the Japanese government's political commitment to the one-China principle. It repeatedly uses \"unchanged position\" as a pretext and cannot even fully reiterate its position.\nWhat Japan avoids discussing is likely more than just its stance on the Taiwan issue. Today marks the 82nd anniversary of the Cairo Declaration. The Cairo Declaration and a series of other international legal documents not only clearly define China's sovereignty over Taiwan but are also significant achievements of the World Anti-Fascist War, forming an important part of the post-war international order. Adhering to its provisions is an international legal obligation that Japan must fulfill and a prerequisite for Japan's regaining international acceptance after the war. Now, Japan remains silent on these documents, which have full international legal force, while repeatedly citing a document that excludes its Asian neighbors, especially China, who suffered the most from Japanese colonial aggression. This disregard for the painful memory of Japanese militarist aggression, a desecration of the historical truth of the World Anti-Fascist War, and a blatant challenge to the authority of the United Nations and the post-war international order. In recent years, Japan has significantly adjusted its security policy, increasing its defense budget year by year, and attempting to revise the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles.\" Certain forces in Japan are striving to break free from the constraints of the \"Peace Constitution\" and attempt to violate the obligations of a defeated nation under international law. These people have never truly learned from history, never truly confronted and reflected on the heinous crimes Japan committed during the war, and never truly prevented the resurgence of militarism in Japan. Instead, they have attempted to use narratives that glorify aggression and the tactic of \"avoiding the topic\" to make the world forget and \"untie\" themselves. Such tricks cannot deceive the world.\nHistory cannot be reversed, and the bottom line of peace cannot be crossed. Japan's verbal evasions and obstinate actions are unacceptable to China. On matters of principle, Japan should not attempt to get away with it. We urge Japan to learn from history, deeply reflect on its actions, take China's demands seriously, honestly retract its erroneous statements, and demonstrate its political commitment to China through concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251201_11764222.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-02","Lin Jian","Shenzhen TV reporter","On November 24, Japan's Permanent Representative to the United Nations sent a letter to the UN Secretary-General stating that China's claim that Japan would exercise its right to self-defense even without being attacked militarily is incorrect; Japan's basic defense policy is a passive defense strategy of \"exclusively defensive defense\"; Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's remarks were based on Japan's consistent…","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan openly challenge the achievements of the victory in World War II and the post-war international order, and seriously violate the purposes and principles of the UN Charter. China's letter to the UN Secretary-General clarifying its solemn position is entirely legitimate and necessary.\nThe Japanese letter is filled with erroneous views and falsehoods. It mentions Japan's so-called \"consistent position\" on the Taiwan issue, but has consistently been evasive and vague about what this \"consistent position\" actually is, and has yet to provide a direct answer to China. Here, we must ask again: Can the Japanese government provide the international community with a complete and accurate answer regarding its \"consistent position\" on the Taiwan issue in the four political documents between China and Japan?\nJapan emphasizes its adherence to its so-called \"exclusively defensive\" and \"passive defense\" policies, stating that Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's previous remarks were based on this stance. Taiwan is Chinese territory, and how to resolve the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, which brooks no external interference. However, Takaichi Sanae has linked Japan's \"existential crisis\" with a \"contingency in Taiwan,\" implying military action against China. Is this the true meaning of Japan's so-called \"exclusively defensive\" and \"passive defense\" policies?\nArticle 2, paragraph 4 of Chapter 1 of the UN Charter stipulates that \"No Member State may use the threat or force in its international relations.\" As the current leader of a defeated nation in World War II, Takaichi has dared to threaten the victorious nation with force under the guise of a so-called \"existential crisis.\" Given this alone, how can Japan still shamelessly claim to \"respect and abide by international law, including the UN Charter\"?\nJapan's accusations and insinuations regarding other countries' defense capabilities and \"coercion\" are a complete case of blaming the victim. In fact, since Japan's defeat in World War II, right-wing forces have continuously pushed for a rewriting of its history of aggression. In recent years, Japan has increased its defense spending for thirteen consecutive years, loosened its own rights to collective self-defense, repeatedly relaxed restrictions on arms exports, developed so-called \"attack capabilities against enemy bases,\" and attempted to revise the \"three non-nuclear principles,\" gradually undermining the provisions explicitly stipulated for Japan in the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration, and violating its own commitments under the Japanese Constitution. It is Japan itself that is accused of \"expanding its military power,\" \"coercing other countries,\" and \"attempting to unilaterally change the status quo despite opposition from neighboring countries.\"\nIn light of this, the Permanent Mission of China to the United Nations has once again sent a letter to the UN Secretary-General, reiterating China's solemn position. This year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. China firmly opposes Japan's retrograde actions that challenge the post-war international order and revive militarism. China once again urges Japan to earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, fulfill its obligations as a defeated nation, and take concrete actions to honor its commitments to China and the international community, and to refrain from repeatedly breaking its promises.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251202_11765147.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-03","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","A Taiwanese official said that Taiwan looks forward to rebuilding relations with Honduras, and that Taiwan had been in contact with both presidential candidates ahead of the Honduran elections. What is the Foreign Ministry's comment on this?","The one-China principle is the political foundation and fundamental premise of China-Honduras relations. In the two years since the establishment of diplomatic ties, bilateral relations have developed rapidly, with fruitful cooperation in various fields. The agricultural technical school built with Chinese assistance has been successfully completed; companies from both countries signed an agreement to purchase over 10,000 tons of white shrimp; and Honduran tobacco has entered the Chinese market. In 2024, China's coffee imports from Honduras increased 14-fold year-on-year. China has also provided Honduras with coffee greenhouses and planting tool kits, and has provided multiple batches of humanitarian aid in response to disasters such as hurricanes and floods. Cooperation in areas such as human resource training, government scholarships, and tourism has effectively enhanced Honduras's long-term development capabilities. These achievements fully demonstrate that China-Honduras relations bring tangible benefits to the Honduran people and are in line with the fundamental and long-term interests of both countries and their people.\n\"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities go against the tide of history and are doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251203_11766027.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-04","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","Some media outlets reported that on December 3, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi, during a plenary session of the House of Councillors, cited the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, expressing \"understanding and respect\" for the Chinese government's position that \"Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory.\" What is China's comment on this?","According to verification, the reports are inaccurate. The Kaohsiung Prime Minister himself only mentioned that \"Japan's basic position on the Taiwan issue remains unchanged, as stated in the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement.\" That's all.\nChina's stance is clear: we urge Japan to earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, and retract Prime Minister Takaichi's erroneous remarks. Faced with a matter of principle clearly documented in historical archives and written in black and white, and despite repeated questioning from China and criticism from within Japan and the international community, Prime Minister Takaichi continues to evade the issue by merely stating that \"our position has not changed.\" China cannot accept this. Since Prime Minister Takaichi claims that Japan's basic position on the Taiwan issue is as stated in the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, can she accurately and completely reiterate the contents of the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement? Why is Japan deliberately refusing to clarify its existing commitments and legal obligations? What is the logic and ulterior motive behind this? Japan needs to provide an explanation to China and the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251204_11766780.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-05","Lin Jian","CGTN reporter","It has been reported that Lai Ching-te recently participated in the New York Times \"Deal-Taking Summit\" via pre-recorded video and made inflammatory remarks about the situation across the Taiwan Strait. What is China's comment on this?","The relevant U.S. media outlets provided a platform for the Taiwan authorities' leader to spread separatist fallacies about \"Taiwan independence,\" which seriously violates the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and sends a seriously wrong signal to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. China firmly opposes this.\nLai Ching-te's words and actions once again expose his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" nature and his sinister plot to seek independence by relying on the US, proving once again that he is a \"peace disruptor\" and a \"troublemaker.\" We urge the US to recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue and to put into practice the commitments made by US leaders. No matter what Lai Ching-te says or does, it is futile and doomed to failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251205_11767729.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-08","Guo Jiakun","Reuters reporter","The newly released U.S. National Security Strategy report states that the U.S. does not support any unilateral actions that change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait, and also mentions the U.S. and its allies' ability to prevent any attempt to \"seize Taiwan.\" What is the Foreign Ministry's response? The strategy also mentions the \"Quad\" mechanism; what is China's comment on this?","We have noted the U.S. government's National Security Strategy report. China has always maintained that cooperation between China and the U.S. benefits both sides, while confrontation harms both. Mutual respect, peaceful coexistence, and win-win cooperation are the correct way for China and the U.S. to get along, and the only correct and realistic choice. China is willing to work with the U.S. to promote the continued stable development of China-U.S. relations, while firmly safeguarding its own sovereignty, security, and development interests. We hope that the U.S. will work with China to implement the important consensus reached by the two heads of state, strengthen dialogue and cooperation, properly manage differences, and promote the stable, healthy, and sustainable development of China-U.S. relations, injecting more certainty and stability into the world.\nRegarding the Taiwan question, we want to emphasize that Taiwan is China's Taiwan and an inseparable part of China's territory. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the first inviolable red line in China-US relations. How to resolve the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and brooks no external interference. The US should earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, fulfill the commitments made by US leaders, handle the Taiwan question with utmost caution, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces in their attempts to seek independence by force and resist reunification by force. China's determination and will to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity are unwavering.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251208_11768841.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-08","Guo Jiakun","CCTV reporter","According to reports, on December 3, in response to Japanese Prime Minister Takaichi Sanae’s Taiwan-related remarks, Liberal Democratic Party Vice President Taro Aso expressed affirmation of Takaichi’s attitude. What is China’s comment on this?","The remarks of this Japanese politician reflect that Prime Minister Takaichi and the Japanese right-wing forces behind him still misjudge the situation, are unrepentant, turn a deaf ear to criticism at home and abroad, downplay the interference in other countries' internal affairs and threaten other countries with force, confuse right and wrong, show no basic respect for international law and basic norms of international relations, and attempt to break through the post-war international order by provoking conflict and confrontation, and invoking Japanese militarism. Asian neighbors and the international community should remain highly vigilant about this.\nIt needs to be pointed out that this kind of behavior that uses provoking China as a way to gain attention and harvest public opinion is vile in nature and very dangerous. We advise the Japanese side to seriously reflect on and repent, to retract the fallacy of Prime Minister Takaichi, to stop playing with fire, and not to go further down the wrong path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251208_11768841.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-09","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV reporter","We have noticed that recently, neighboring countries such as Russia have voiced their opposition to Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan, and Pakistan, Laos, Cambodia, and other countries have publicly supported the One-China principle. Media outlets and academics from many countries in the region have stated that the atrocities committed by the Japanese army during World…","Since modern times, Japanese militarism has launched wars of aggression against China and other Asian countries under the pretext of so-called \"crisis of survival\". Wherever it went, it committed all kinds of atrocities and its blood debts are horrifying.\nOf the three major massacres of civilians committed by the Japanese army during World War II, the Nanjing Massacre killed over 300,000 people; the Manila Massacre claimed the lives of approximately 100,000 Filipino civilians within a month; and the Singapore Massacre resulted in the deaths of tens of thousands of locals. The International Military Tribunal for the Far East verdict records over 100 large-scale massacres perpetrated by the Japanese army in Malaysia, Indonesia, Burma, Thailand, and other locations.\nThe Japanese army cruelly mistreated Allied prisoners of war, with a mortality rate as high as 27% among Allied prisoners captured by the Japanese. During the Bataan Death March alone, approximately 15,000 American and Filipino prisoners of war died.\nThe Japanese army engaged in widespread forced labor, resulting in the deaths of tens of thousands of Southeast Asian laborers and Allied prisoners of war during the construction of the Burma Railway. More than 4 million Chinese laborers forcibly conscripted by the Japanese army were injured or killed due to harsh conditions and excessive labor.\nThe Japanese army also forced women from China, the Korean Peninsula, Southeast Asia, the Netherlands and other countries and regions to serve as \"comfort women\" and subject them to inhumane sexual slavery.\nWar crimes cannot be erased, and the history of aggression cannot be overturned. Any leniency or indulgence towards the provocative words and actions of Japanese right-wing forces will only revive the specter of militarism and once again place the people of Asia in danger. All countries have the responsibility and obligation to join hands to thwart any attempt to restore militarism and fascism, jointly safeguard the achievements of the victory in World War II, jointly defend the post-war international order, and jointly ensure world peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251209_11769586.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-10","Guo Jiakun","Asahi Shimbun reporter","The Japanese Defense Minister stated today regarding the \"radar illumination\" issue that the key point of the incident was that China conducted intermittent illumination. Could you confirm whether there was any targeted, intermittent illumination? Can the Chinese Foreign Ministry confirm this?","China has repeatedly stated its solemn position on this matter, and the facts are very clear. Japan previously claimed it had not received any notification from China, but now admits to receiving prior information, contradicting itself and evading the issue. Furthermore, Japan refuses to explain why, despite receiving prior notification, it insisted on sending fighter jets to intrude into China's training area, conducting close-in reconnaissance and harassment, creating tension, and continuing to maliciously hype the situation. Is Japan deliberately shifting the focus and attempting to mislead the international community?\nWhat Japan should do now is to face up to the crux of the current difficulties in China-Japan relations, earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, and honestly retract the Kaohsiung Prime Minister's erroneous remarks about Taiwan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251210_11770455.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-11","Guo Jiakun","Reporter from China-Arab TV","It has been reported that in response to her remarks regarding Taiwan during a parliamentary debate, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi recently stated that precisely because of the various unresolved issues with China, it is all the more important to adhere to the policy of reducing problems and enhancing understanding and cooperation. Japan remains open to dialogue with China at all levels. Two days ago,…","Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan have not only aroused strong indignation among the Chinese people, but have also drawn increasing objective and rational opposition and criticism within Japan. I noticed that recently, the former editor-in-chief of *Sekai* magazine and former president of Iwanami Shoten stated that while Prime Minister Takaichi frequently talks about \"dialogue,\" true dialogue begins with respecting the other party and understanding them from an equal standpoint. Takaichi's attitude makes dialogue completely impossible. This statement captures the essence of the problem.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251211_11771129.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-12","Guo Jiakun","Beijing Daily reporter","With the 12th National Memorial Day for the Victims of the Nanjing Massacre approaching, and on the occasion of the 80th anniversary of China's victory in the War of Resistance Against Japan, especially against the backdrop of tensions in Sino-Japanese relations caused by Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's remarks on Taiwan, how will China carry out commemorative activities?","This year marks the 88th anniversary of the Nanjing Massacre. In accordance with the legislative decision of the National People's Congress, China will hold a national memorial ceremony for the victims of the Nanjing Massacre, as is customary.\nThe Nanjing Massacre was a brutal crime committed by Japanese militarism, and the evidence is irrefutable. 300,000 Chinese people were massacred, marking one of the darkest chapters in human history. Under the pretext of a so-called \"crisis of survival,\" Japanese militarism launched a war of aggression against China and other Asian countries, committing countless crimes against humanitya disgrace to human civilization.\nInternational legal documents such as the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration clearly stipulate the opposition to aggression, the punishment of war criminals, and the eradication of militarism. The Allied Powers also established the International Military Tribunal for the Far East to try Japanese war criminals. However, the Japanese government has long tolerated the perverse actions of right-wing elements; multiple prime ministers and other political figures have insisted on visiting the Yasukuni Shrine, which enshrines Class-A war criminals; and some politicians have openly questioned the \"Murayama Statement,\" which expressed remorse and apology for Japan's colonial aggression. Japan has also repeatedly revised textbooks, attempting to glorify its crimes of aggression and rewrite its history of aggression. These egregious acts blatantly challenge the post-war international order and trample on human conscience, drawing strong indignation and high vigilance from the international community.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of the retrocession of Taiwan. Eighty years ago, the Chinese people fought a bloody battle to defeat Japanese imperialism, recovering Taiwan and other stolen territories from the Japanese invaders, and defending the safety of our nation and international justice. Eighty years later, the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation is unstoppable. We will never allow Japanese right-wing forces to turn back the clock of history, never allow external forces to interfere in Taiwan, and never allow Japanese militarism to resurface. Japanese militarism is the common enemy of all the people of the world. China will work with all peace-loving countries and people to safeguard the fruits of victory in World War II and the post-war international order. We urge Japan to deeply reflect on its history, earnestly learn from its lessons, completely sever ties with militarism, and eliminate its remaining poison through concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251212_11771774.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-15","Guo Jiakun","Kyodo News reporter","The Chinese Foreign Ministry announced today that it is taking countermeasures against former high-ranking Japan Self-Defense Force official Shigeru Iwasaki. What is the reason for this?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and an inviolable red line. China firmly opposes the appointment of former Chief of Staff of the Japan Self-Defense Forces, Shigeru Iwasaki, as a so-called \"political advisor\" to the Taiwan authorities. China has lodged numerous solemn representations with Japan on this matter and taken countermeasures against Iwasaki. Instead of repenting, Iwasaki has intensified his actions, colluding with \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and repeatedly engaging in provocations, seriously violating the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, seriously interfering in China's internal affairs, and seriously damaging China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. In response to Iwasaki's egregious actions, in accordance with the \"Anti-Foreign Sanctions Law of the People's Republic of China,\" China issued a Ministry of Foreign Affairs order announcing countermeasures against him to punish his collusion and provocations with \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251215_11773003.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-12-15","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, Lai Ching-te recently stated that the People’s Liberation Army will possess the capability to seize Taiwan before 2027. He said that Taiwan must make the worst-case preparations while striving for the best outcomes, will continue strengthening its self-defense capabilities, and will maintain regional peace so as to achieve the goal of avoiding war through preparedness for war. What comment…","Lai Ching-te has repeatedly hyped up the so-called “military threat” from the mainland and escalated cross-strait confrontation and antagonism. His so-called “planning” and “preparations” are nothing more than a disguised attempt to peddle war anxiety and to seek excuses for his erroneous “Taiwan independence provoking war” line. The Lai Ching-te authorities’ pursuit of “independence” and provocative actions is the worst malignant tumor harming and destroying Taiwan. The realization of reunification across the Taiwan Strait is the best choice for ensuring lasting peace in Taiwan.\nWe hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will clearly recognize the extreme danger and harm posed by the Lai authorities’ efforts to “prepare for war in pursuit of independence,” firmly oppose “Taiwan independence” separatist activities, and effectively safeguard peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait as well as their own security and well-being.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[1,"2025-12-15","Jiang Bin","Question","It was reported the Japanese side backtracked on what they previously said about the flight training of Chinese carrier-based aircraft, claiming that they received the Chinese side’s notification beforehand, but didn’t get sufficient information on the specifics, including the training duration and area, to avoid accidents. What’s your comment?","The facts of the incident are clear and the evidence is irrefutable. The Japanese side has no ground to defend or deny its wrongdoing. On December 6, PLANS 101 of the naval task group led by PLANS Liaoning notified the Japanese side that the task group would conduct carrier-based aircraft flight training, with Japanese Ship (JS) 116 confirming reception of the message. Later on, PLANS 101 again notified the Japanese side that the training was expected to start from 1500 and last for about 6 hours, mainly to the south of the carrier, with JS 116 again confirming reception of the message. Against this backdrop, Japanese fighter jets still intruded into the training zone multiple times to harass the Chinese side. Therefore, the Japanese side shall bear all the responsibility on endangering flight safety.\nThe Japanese side has once again lied to its own people and misled the international community by hyping up a regular military training of the Chinese side as a so-called security threat and portraying itself, the real provoker, as a victim. We therefore are entitled to ask the following questions: Is this an attempt by the Japanese side to divert attention from the severe consequences sparked by the erroneous remarks on Taiwan made by Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi? Is the Japanese side trying to use this incident to create excuses to break away from the post-war system, to loosen restrictions on its military development, and to revive the spectre of its militarist past? We strongly urge the Japanese side to squarely face up to the crux of the current difficulty in China-Japan relations, and earnestly reflect on and rectify its wrongdoings. Those despicable moves and political manipulation to evade the real issue, to divert attention, or to recriminate will never work.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2025-12-16","Guo Jiakun","CCTV reporter","On December 15, at a meeting of the Japanese House of Councillors, Japanese Foreign Minister Toshimitsu Motegi stated regarding the Taiwan issue that the Japanese government respects and understands the position of the People's Republic of China and adheres to Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration. Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi stated that Japan's consistent position on the Taiwan issue is to hope for a…","We noted that the Japanese Foreign Minister yesterday reiterated certain clauses in the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement concerning the Taiwan issue, namely, \"Article 3 of the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement states that the Government of Japan fully understands and respects the position of the Government of the People's Republic of China and adheres to the position of Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\" However, we also noted that the Japanese side did not reiterate important contents of the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement, such as \"The Government of Japan recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China\" and \"Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China.\" We also noted that when citing clauses of the Cairo Declaration, the Japanese side only mentioned Northeast China, Taiwan, and the Penghu Islands, deliberately avoiding the important statement of \"territory stolen by Japan from China.\" The Japanese side also placed the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement alongside the so-called \"San Francisco Peace Treaty,\" violating existing commitments and principles of international law, attempting to revive the \"undetermined status of Taiwan\" theory, and interfering in China's internal affairs. Judging from a series of recent statements by the Japanese side, it is still squeezing out time and planting seeds of doubt on key issues, attempting to confuse the public and get away with it. China firmly opposes this.\nRecently, Foreign Minister Wang Yi authoritatively and comprehensively elaborated on the \"seven-fold lock\" on Taiwan's status. The core points are: The 1943 Cairo Declaration explicitly stipulated that Taiwan, which Japan had seized from China, must be returned to China. The 1945 Potsdam Declaration stated that the terms of the Cairo Declaration would be implemented. On August 15, 1945, Japan was defeated, and the Japanese Emperor pledged to faithfully fulfill the provisions of the Potsdam Declaration and surrender unconditionally. On October 25, 1945, the Chinese government announced the resumption of sovereignty over Taiwan. On October 1, 1949, the Central People's Government of the People's Republic of China replaced the Republic of China as the sole legal government representing all of China, exercising sovereignty over all territory, including Taiwan. The 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement made clear provisions regarding the Taiwan issue. The 1978 Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship, ratified by the legislative bodies of both countries, confirmed that the principles stated in the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement should be strictly observed.\nWe must also point out the following facts: During the negotiations for the normalization of diplomatic relations between China and Japan in September 1972, Masuo Takashima, Director-General of the Treaty Bureau of the Japanese Ministry of Foreign Affairs, clearly stated the Japanese government's position: \"Taiwan should be returned to China; this is Japan's unchanging view.\" After the normalization of diplomatic relations, in November 1972, Prime Minister Kakuei Tanaka and Foreign Minister Masayoshi Ohira publicly stated in a parliamentary debate that \"the conflict between the mainland and Taiwan is China's internal affair,\" and that \"the issue of the conflict between the People's Republic of China and Taiwan is China's domestic issue.\" In February 1975, Foreign Minister Kiichi Miyazawa stated in a parliamentary debate that \"a conflict between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait should be legally considered a civil war.\" Furthermore, in 1998, the Chinese and Japanese governments issued the \"Joint Declaration of the People's Republic of China and Japan on Establishing a Friendly Partnership for Peace and Development,\" which contained the crucial statement: \"Japan continues to abide by the position on the Taiwan issue expressed in the Sino-Japanese Joint Statement and reiterates that there is only one China.\"\nWe must emphasize that this year marks the 80th anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, as well as the 80th anniversary of Taiwan's retrocession. Japan invaded and colonized Taiwan for 50 years, committing countless crimes and bearing historical responsibility for the Taiwan issue. Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, and how to resolve the Taiwan issue is entirely China's own business; Japan has no right to interfere.\nWe once again urge Japan to abide by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, and retract the Kaohsiung City Prime Minister's erroneous remarks.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251216_11774382.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-17","Guo Jiakun","Phoenix TV reporter","It has been reported that Keiichi Ichikawa, Director-General of Japan's National Security Secretariat, recently communicated with the UK, France, Germany, and Canada to clarify Japan's position and refute China's claims regarding Sanae Takaichi's remarks on Taiwan. He stated that Prime Minister Takaichi's parliamentary response did not change Japan's consistent stance on Taiwan. Some in Japan claim that Japan is…","Japan's actions once again expose the habit of some people in Japan to distort the truth and turn black into white, refuse to correct their mistakes, knowingly commit wrongdoings, and even attempt to feign innocence and deceive sympathy on the international stage.\nJapanese right-wing forces are habitual perpetrators of fabricating \"false narratives.\" They portray their war of aggression against neighboring Asian countries as the \"liberation of Asia,\" downplay the horrific Nanjing Massacre as the \"Nanjing Incident,\" glorify the infamous Unit 731 as a \"unit engaged in health research,\" and distort the forced labor and \"comfort women\" narratives as \"voluntary acts.\" After the war, Japan cultivated a narrative of being a \"victim\" of the war while avoiding mentioning that militarism was the root cause of the conflict; it insists on so-called \"exclusively defensive\" and \"passive defense,\" yet it continuously loosens its own rights to collective self-defense, repeatedly relaxes restrictions on arms exports, and even attempts to revise the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles.\"\nPrime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan have not only aroused strong public indignation among the Chinese people, but have also drawn opposition and criticism from within Japan and many other countries. What Japan should do is listen carefully and reflect deeply, rather than engaging in sophistry and lobbying internationally, only to make a fool of itself. We urge certain individuals in Japan to stop manipulating false narratives, face history squarely, reflect on and correct their mistakes, retract their fallacies, fulfill their commitments, and give China and the international community a responsible explanation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251217_11775178.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-18","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV reporter","According to reports, sources say that in response to Chinese military actions, the Japanese Ministry of Defense signed a land lease agreement on the 15th to deploy a mobile radar system on Okinawa's easternmost island to monitor Chinese aircraft carriers and aircraft activities in the waters between Okinawa and Miyako Island. The deployment is scheduled to begin in 2026, with approximately 30 personnel expected…","We have noted the relevant reports. It should be pointed out that all countries enjoy freedom of navigation and overflight in the relevant sea and air areas in accordance with international law.\nDue to its history of militaristic aggression, Japan's military and security movements have always been a major concern for its Asian neighbors and the international community. Japan has previously been strengthening its targeted military deployments near Taiwan, even claiming to be deploying intermediate-range missiles. Now, it has gone even further, announcing plans to deploy radar and troops, engaging in spying on its neighbor. Considering the series of erroneous and dangerous statements and actions by Prime Minister Kaohsiung regarding Taiwan, one must ask: Is Japan creating trouble and provoking close proximity to provide cover and an excuse for its own military expansion and maritime presence? Is it following the design of right-wing forces and retracing the path of militarism to its doom? We urge Japan to learn from history!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251218_11775856.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-19","Guo Jiakun","Global Times reporter","Yesterday, after the US approved a large-scale arms sale to Taiwan, some foreign media reported that the US move was to \"help Taiwan maintain sufficient defense capabilities\" and that the weapons sold to Taiwan were commensurate with the \"threats\" facing Taiwan. What is China's comment on this?","We already stated China's solemn position on this issue yesterday. The US's large-scale arms sales to Taiwan constitute a blatant interference in China's internal affairs, seriously undermine China's sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity, severely damage peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and send a seriously wrong signal to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and the outside world. China expresses its strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition, and has lodged a solemn protest with the US at the earliest opportunity.\nWe must emphasize that China's core interests are inviolable, the Taiwan issue is not open to interference, and China's bottom line is inviolable. \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are irreconcilable, and any attempt to arm Taiwan will face serious consequences. The real threat to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities of the Lai Ching-te administration and the intervention of external forces. So-called assistance to Taiwan in dealing with this \"threat\" will only embolden \"Taiwan independence\" forces, placing the Taiwanese people on a \"powder keg,\" pushing the Taiwan Strait into a dangerous situation, and inevitably increasing the risk of conflict and confrontation between China and the United States.\nNo one, no force, should underestimate the firm will and powerful capability of the Chinese government and people to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. No matter how many advanced weapons are sold to Taiwan, they cannot stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification. China will take all necessary measures to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. China urges the US to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, implement the solemn commitments made by US leaders, cease its dangerous actions of arming Taiwan, stop undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251219_11776971.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-19","Guo Jiakun","Nippon TV Network reporter","Some U.S. congressmen submitted a resolution to express support for Japan and criticize China for exerting economic and military pressure on Japan. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","Maintaining the results of the victory in World War II and safeguarding the post-war international order are the common responsibilities of the international community, including China and the United States, and justice and morality are at home in the hearts of the people. It should be pointed out that Prime Minister Takaichi's fallacy has not only aroused strong indignation among the Chinese people, but also has many objective and rational voices of opposition and criticism in Japan, the U.S. strategic community and international public opinion. What Japan should do is to listen carefully and reflect deeply, instead of making excuses and lobbying in the international community, shirk responsibility, and seek help. We once again urge the Japanese side to conscientiously reflect on and correct its mistakes, retract Prime Minister Takaichi's erroneous remarks honestly, fully and accurately explain the political commitments made by Japan on the Taiwan issue in the four political documents between China and Japan, and earnestly fulfill the obligations of a defeated country stipulated in the Cairo Declaration, Potsdam Declaration, Japan's Instrument of Surrender and other documents with full force of international law.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251219_11776971.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-22","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","A senior official from Japan's Liberal Democratic Party is visiting Taiwan for three days and is expected to meet with Taiwan's \"President\" Lai Ching-te. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China, and there is no \"president\" there. I want to point out that the visit of relevant Japanese lawmakers to Taiwan is a betrayal of the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and Japan's own commitments, and a violation of the one-China principle. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a strong protest with Japan.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. We once again urge Japan to deeply reflect on its mistakes, retract the Kaohsiung Prime Minister's erroneous remarks, and refrain from interfering in China's internal affairs. We also solemnly warn the DPP authorities that their \"pro-Japan and pro-independence\" stance is despicable and destined to be a dead end.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251222_11780748.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-24","Lin Jian","CCTV Reporter","It has been reported that comments made by a senior official at the Japanese Prime Minister's Office regarding nuclear weapons have caused a stir both domestically and internationally. Former Japanese politicians, political parties, local and civic organizations have all criticized the remarks, and many neighboring countries have expressed strong opposition. A former Japanese politician stated that nuclear…","We have noticed the relevant reports, and we have also noticed that various local and non-governmental organizations in Japan have issued protest statements and petitions.\nIt now appears that the recent pro-nuclear remarks by a high-ranking official at the Japanese Prime Minister's Office are not an isolated incident. In recent years, Japan has loosened its own \"collective self-defense rights,\" developed medium- and long-range offensive weapons, increased troop deployments, restructured its command structure, and expanded the scope of the Self-Defense Forces' activities, seriously violating the provisions of internationally binding documents such as the Cairo Declaration and the Potsdam Declaration, as well as its own constitution. In just two months since taking office, Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi has accelerated the expansion of the military, achieving the goal of defense spending at 2% of GDP two years ahead of schedule, further relaxing restrictions on arms exports, pushing forward the revision of the \"Three Security Documents,\" including the National Security Strategy, discussing revisions to the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles,\" and hinting at the introduction of nuclear-powered submarines.\nFollowing the Kaohsiung Prime Minister's erroneous remarks regarding Taiwan, his close associates have again made fallacious statements. This is a continuous test of the international community's bottom line, exposing the consistent erroneous claims of the Kaohsiung Prime Minister and Japanese right-wing forces, as well as their ambition to continuously promote \"remilitarization,\" sending an extremely dangerous signal. These developments challenge the post-war international order, threaten regional peace and stability, and are not in the interests of the Japanese people themselves. China will work hand in hand with all peace-loving countries to jointly address these issues and resolutely prevent the resurgence of Japanese militarism.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251224_11786235.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-25","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","Nasri Asfula won the Honduran presidential election. During his campaign, Asfula promised to rebuild \"diplomatic relations\" with Taiwan. What is China's comment on his victory and the aforementioned promise?","The presidential election is an internal affair of Honduras, and China respects the choice of the Honduran people. China is willing to work with Honduras to jointly promote the continuous development of China-Honduras relations on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251225_11786962.html","",0,0,0,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","China's international military cooperation in 2025 is impressive. Can you further brief us on that?","This year, with a pioneering spirit and proactive efforts, work related to China's military diplomacy has been conducted in a way that kept in alignment with the overall work of the Party and the state, adhered to the strategic guidance of head-of-state diplomacy, and focused on contributing to the improvement of combat readiness.\nFirstly, we have strengthened strategic communication with countries including Russia, the US, and European countries. A Vice Chairman of the CMC visited Russia upon invitation. The Defense Minister had virtual and in-person meetings with the US Secretary of War, and paid visits to France and Germany. China and Indonesia held the first Joint Foreign and Defense Ministerial Dialogue under the 2+2 mechanism. Senior military leaders of China and the UK held bilateral talks. We have deepened institutional consultations with defense authorities of several countries. All these efforts have strengthened China's defense ties with other countries and fostered a more favorable strategic security environment.\nSecondly, we successfully hosted the SCO Defense Ministers' Meeting, the China-LAC States Defense Forum, and the inaugural Young Leaders Conference of the China-Africa Peace and Security Forum in China. At the UN Peacekeeping Ministerial, China put forward proposals in support of the reform and transformation of UNPKOs. The Beijing Xiangshan Forum has become more attractive and influential. Multilateral military diplomacy builds consensus and sends out the voice of the Chinese military.\nThirdly, the joint exercises and training with foreign militaries featured many highlights. These include China-Russia joint naval exercise and joint aerial strategic patrol, China-Malaysia Aman Youyi joint exercise, China-Egypt Eagles of Civilization joint air force training, and China-Serbia Peace Guardian joint army training. Through these realistic exercises and training, we have enhanced our capabilities to jointly respond to security challenges.\nFourthly, we responded to violations and provocations made by relevant countries concerning Taiwan and the South China Sea with timely diplomatic representations and press releases to counter misinformation and defend national interests. The MND increased the frequency of press releases, expanded media participation, and launched an account on the X platform to help overseas audiences to get better access to information on the Chinese military.\nIn the coming year, we will thoroughly implement Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military and Xi Jinping Thought on Diplomacy, actively practice the four major global initiatives, and promote high-quality development of international military cooperation, so as to provide support for achieving the military's centenary goal and to open a new chapter in major-country military diplomacy with Chinese characteristics.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to media reports, regarding the introduction of nuclear-powered submarines, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi said, \"We will not rule out all options.\" An official from the Prime Minister's Office stated that Japan should possess nuclear weapons. Additionally, the Japanese Ministry of Defense recently released a report, claiming that China's defense spending is growing rapidly and China is…","China's defense expenditure is reasonable, moderate, and remains below the global average as a share of GDP. The operations of the Chinese military in relevant waters are fully in compliance with international law and practice, and brook no interference or provocation. We urge Japan to cease its false narratives and halt targeted deployments against China. We will take resolute countermeasures against any harassment or provocation.\nIn recent years, Japan has relentlessly pursued remilitarization and accelerated its military buildup, with an increasingly visible and dangerous tendency towards a militarist revival. To cover up its underlying ambitions, Japan has repeatedly used China as a pretext. Not long ago, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi made erroneous remarks concerning the Taiwan question. Now, right-wing forces in Japan have thrown away their hypocritical mask and are openly advocating for nuclear armament. These actions constitute a direct defiance of international norms, a blatant challenge to the bottom line of international justice, the post-WWII international order, and the global non-proliferation regime. They pose a severe threat to peace and stability in the region and beyond. What Japan is doing runs directly counter to its own professed commitment to peaceful development. We call upon all peace-loving nations and peoples to take action to resolutely contain the revival of militarism by Japan's right-wing forces, and prevent the world from sliding into turmoil or reliving tragedies of the past.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, it was reported that the Taiwan authorities' security bureau recently stated that around 3,600 sorties of PLA aircraft had been detected around the island this year, setting a new record. PLA aircraft and ships had conducted 39 joint combat readiness patrols. In response, Taiwan authorities' defense department claimed to have formulated contingency procedures in response to mainland…","On your first question, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The PLA's regular training and combat readiness exercises around the Taiwan island, as well as the operations to counter separatism and foreign interference, are entirely justified, necessary, and legitimate, with an aim to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The PLA will relentlessly combat separatist activities to advance the cause of reunification. For every provocation made by the \"Taiwan independence\" forces, we will respond by increasing pressure and pushing forward resolutely until the complete reunification of the motherland is achieved. We sternly urge the DPP authorities to face reality, follow the overwhelming trend of the times, abandon their separatist schemes of \"Taiwan independence\" once and for all and cease all provocative actions that could lead to conflicts. This is the only correct choice.\nOn your second question, the history of Japanese militarist aggression is an indisputable fact and its heinous crimes cannot be concealed. How Japan treats this part of history serves as a litmus test for its moral conscience and genuine commitment to peace. We therefore urge Japan to cease its evasion, obfuscation, and deception, and offer a sincere apology and genuinely atone for its crimes. Only by taking such actions can it truly earn the trust of its Asian neighbors and the wider international community.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. First, the US recently announced that the 19th US-China Defense Policy Coordination Talks were held from December 15 to 16. The US side stressed that America's interests in the Indo-Pacific are significant and it stands ready to defend them. Could you please brief us more on that? Did the two sides clarify specific plans and arrangements for military-to-military engagement next year? The…","On your first question, China has its principle in developing military relations with the US, that is, China's sovereignty, dignity and core interests brook no infringement. The US talks a lot about engaging with China. At the same time, it keeps undermining China's sovereignty and security. This two-faced approach—saying nice words but doing bad things—is very hypocritical and will not work on China. Challenging China's red lines and bottom lines will come at a cost. We urge the US side to immediately correct its wrongdoings, stop all infringements and provocations, and do not challenge China's resolve in safeguarding our sovereign rights and interests.\nOn your second question, the negative provisions in the US Act concerning Taiwan grossly interfere in China's internal affairs. They have sent extremely wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and seriously undermined peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The US side has violated its commitments by increasing arms sales to Taiwan. This will only embolden the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and push the Taiwan Strait closer to the abyss of military conflict. The DPP authorities are letting the US to exploit and exhaust the island at the cost of the well-being of the people in Taiwan.\nUsing Taiwan to contain China is doomed to fail, and seeking independence by force is a path to self-destruction. We urge the US side to fully recognize the sensitivity of the Taiwan question, strictly observe the one-China principle and the three China-US joint communiqués, exercise utmost caution in handling Taiwan-related matters, stop arming Taiwan in any form, and take concrete actions to maintain the overall stability of state-to-state and military-to-military relations between China and the US.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to reports, Lai Ching-te stated in a media interview the need to \"seek peace through strength\", reiterated that the relationship between the US and Taiwan is \"as solid as a rock\", and promoted a $40 billion arms procurement. The head of Taiwan authorities'defense department also claimed that the US emphasizes the shared responsibilities of allies in defense, and that Taiwan must continue to promote a…","The root cause of the current cross-strait tensions and instabilities lies in the DPP authorities' provocative pursuit of \"Taiwan independence\" in collusion with external forces. Lai Ching-te, with his unprincipled subservience to the US, reckless militarization, and escalation of cross-strait confrontation, is an out-and-out saboteur of peace and instigator of war. Therefore shame on him that he talked about \"peace\" and hisempty boast of \"strength\" was ignorant. It is little more than overestimating and deceiving oneself. We sternly warn the DPP authorities that national reunification is unstoppable. Those who act as pawns will inevitably be discarded and those who betray the nation and engage in secession will be nailed to the pillar of historical shame.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Recently, Japan has not only taken frequent acts around the Taiwan Strait but has also been taking more operations in the South China Sea. It has built an ammunition depot in the Philippines and deepened defense cooperation with the Philippines and Vietnam, which includes weapons exports and the normalization of troop deployments. What's China view on Japan's systematic intervention in the South China Sea?","Japan is not a party to the South China Sea issue. Worse still, it once invaded and illegally occupied China's Xisha Qundao and Nansha Qundao. What Japan needs to do is to engage in serious soul-searching, rather than making wavesin the South China Sea, provoking confrontation and undermining regional peace and stability. We hope relevant countries will see through Japan's sinister intentions. Counting on external forces to make troublesin the South China Sea will prove fruitless, and letting in the wolfwill only backfire.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to US media reports, the PLA would \"attack Taiwan\" in three steps, listing the so-called optimal attack timing and optimal landing sites. Recently exposed details from a classified US Department of War report suggest that the mainland could destroy advanced US weapons before they reach Taiwan, indicating that the US is no longer capable of \"defending Taiwan\". Please comment on that.","Certain media outlets have speculated about the operations of the PLA with ulterior motives, fueling unwarranted \"war anxiety\", which only undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. We are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort, but we will never promise to renounce the use of force and reserve the option to take all necessary measures. Should \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces provoke and even cross the red line, we will have no choice but to take resolute and decisive measures. The PLA stands ready at all times to fight and win, and will resolutely defeat any schemes for \"Taiwan independence\" or any form of external interference.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","I have two questions. The first question: recently, the Japanese and the US air forces conducted their respective tactical exercises over the Sea of Japan. The drills involved two US B-52 bombers and six Japanese fighter jets. Japan stated that the purpose was to reaffirm that Japan and the US will not tolerate any unilateral attempts to change the status quo by force. External analysis suggests that this move is…","On your first question, China has consistently emphasized that military cooperation between the US and Japan should not target third parties, much less undermine regional peace and stability. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference. The PLA's determination to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is rock-solid. If anyone attempts to interfere in China's internal affairs through military provocation, we will never tolerate or indulge such actions and will respond with resolute countermeasures.\nOn your second question, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has already responded to it. We urge Japan not to repeat its mistakes, to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and to immediately cease all erroneous words and actions regarding Taiwan. The DPP authorities' fawning posture and attempts to curry favor with Japan are despicable and their schemes to seek \"independence\" by relying on external forces are doomed to fail.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","The US Department of War recently released Annual Report to Congress: Military and Security Developments Involving the PRC . Please comment on that.","Year after year, the US releases such reports, which grossly interfere in China's internal affairs, deliberately misrepresent China's national defense policy, groundlessly speculate on China's military development, and smear the normal activities of the Chinese military. Filled with wrong perceptions of China and geopolitical prejudices, these reports hyped up the so-called China's military threat to mislead the international community. We express strong dissatisfaction and resolute opposition to this.\nChina steadfastly pursues a defensive national defense policy, adheres to the military strategy of active defense, and advances the modernization of national defense and armed forces with high quality. These efforts are solely aimed at safeguarding national sovereignty, security and development interests. China has always been a force for peace, stability and progress in the world. The Chinese military actively implements the Global Security Initiative, acts in strict compliance with domestic and international laws, safeguards its legitimate rights and interests in a reasonable and measured manner, endeavors to provide international public security goods, and works with other militaries to foster the building of a community with a shared future for humanity.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan and resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people. The PLA defends national sovereignty and territorial integrity. Its efforts to combat separatist activities and promote reunification are entirely justified and unwavering. The US has no right to interfere. China has indisputable sovereignty over the South China Sea islands and reefs and their adjacent waters. While certain countries within the region have infringed upon and provoked China and external forces have meddled and stirred up trouble, China's resolute defense of its territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests is legitimate, lawful, rational and restrained. It is worth pointing out that the US has deliberately rallied its allies to send naval and air forces to China's doorstep for close-in harassment. The necessary measures taken by the Chinese military in response are beyond reproach. The fundamental solution to avoiding maritime and air incidents is for the US and its allies to cease all dangerous and provocative actions. We urge the US to adopt a correct perception of China, view China and the development of the Chinese military objectively, stop fabricating false narratives, cease stoking division and confrontation, and avoid leading the state-to-state and military-to-military relations astray.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2025-12-25","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","According to Taiwan authorities' defense department, PLANS Fujian passed through the Taiwan Strait on December 16 for the first time. It claimed to maintain close monitoring of the situation. Please comment on that.","The passage is part of the routine training of PLANS Fujian. Similar activities will continue to be organized as needed in the future. We urge the “Taiwan independence” armed forces to recognize the reality and abandon futile struggles and illusions.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2025-12-26","Lin Jian","RT reporter","The Japanese government approved its fiscal year 2026 budget today, with defense spending exceeding 9 trillion yen, a new record high. What is China's comment on this??","We have noted the relevant reports. Recently, the international community has been increasingly critical of Japan's military and security trends. Instead of reflecting on its actions and restraining itself, Japan plans to significantly increase its defense budget again, further exposing the sinister intentions of Japan's right-wing forces to promote Japan's \"remilitarization\" and attempt to revive militarism.\nDue to the countless acts of aggression committed by Japanese militarism, Japan's military and security movements have always been a major concern for its Asian neighbors and the international community. Since the new Japanese government took office, it has significantly accelerated its pace of military buildup. From Prime Minister Takaichi's erroneous remarks about Taiwan and his threats of force against China, to senior officials at the Prime Minister's Office making statements advocating for nuclear weapons, and pushing forward with revisions to the \"Three Security Documents\" and hinting at changes to the \"Three Non-Nuclear Principles,\" Japan is deviating from its long-standing claim of \"following the path of peaceful development\" and heading further and further down a dangerous path.\nIn recent years, Japan has loosened its own restrictions on the right of collective self-defense, developed so-called \"capabilities to attack enemy bases,\" strengthened cooperation on \"extended deterrence,\" and turned coastal islands into \"forward positions,\" clearly exceeding the scope of \"exclusively defensive defense.\" The so-called \"defense\" and \"counterattack\" have become pretexts for Japanese right-wing forces to incite public opinion, deceive the media, and circumvent the post-war international order and the provisions of the Japanese Constitution. These moves have already aroused high vigilance from the international community.\nThe Japanese people are also victims of militarism. I have noticed that some insightful Japanese individuals have pointed out that increasing defense spending will not bring peace and stability. Recently, citizens in many parts of Japan have held rallies to strongly protest the Japanese government's policy of military expansion. Furthermore, some scholars have pointed out that increasing defense spending is an extremely heavy burden on the Japanese economy, which will ultimately be borne by ordinary Japanese citizens.\nChina will work with all peace-loving countries to resolutely curb any dangerous acts that revive militarism and shape a \"new type of militarism,\" and jointly safeguard the achievements of the victory in World War II.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251226_11788128.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-29","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","This morning, the Eastern Theater Command conducted military exercises near Taiwan. Some reports suggest these exercises are in response to the recent US announcement of a massive $11.1 billion arms sale to Taiwan. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","The spokesperson for the Eastern Theater Command has already released information regarding the military exercises. The People's Liberation Army's military exercises are a severe punishment for the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces' attempts to seek independence through force, and a necessary action to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nI want to emphasize that the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to their \"Taiwan independence\" stance, attempting to \"seek independence by relying on the US,\" and are willing to turn Taiwan into a \"powder keg\" and \"ammunition depot,\" fully exposing their vicious faces as \"peace destroyers,\" \"crisis creators,\" and \"war instigators.\" External forces' attempts to \"use Taiwan to contain China\" and arm Taiwan will only embolden the arrogance of \"Taiwan independence\" and push the Taiwan Strait to a dangerous state of war.\nThe Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests. China's will to safeguard its national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity is unwavering. Any provocative act that crosses the line on the Taiwan issue will inevitably be met with a resolute response from China, and any sinister attempt to obstruct China's reunification will not succeed.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251229_11789802.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-29","Lin Jian","Reuters reporter","Is the trigger for China's drills near Taiwan island to be the US$11.1 billion arms sales to Taiwan? Does the \"external intervention force\" mentioned in the Eastern Theater Command refer to the United States? (The Japan Broadcasting Association reporter also asked)","I would like to stress again that China is unswervingly determined to defend its national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity. Any bad behavior that crosses the line and is provocative on the Taiwan issue will be met with a resolute response from China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251229_11789802.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-30","Lin Jian","AFP reporter","The Chinese People's Liberation Army is conducting live-fire exercises near Taiwan. Yesterday you mentioned that this was a response to the actions of external forces. US President Trump said he was not worried about China's military exercises, as China has been conducting exercises in the region for decades. What is the Foreign Ministry's response to this?","Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory. The military exercises conducted by the Chinese People's Liberation Army are a severe punishment for the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces' attempts to seek independence through force, and a necessary action to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251230_11790799.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-31","Lin Jian","Reporter from TV Tokyo","Japanese Senator Seki Hei said on social media today that he plans to visit Taiwan early next year. He also said that he is prohibited from entering Taiwan by China. If he can enter Taiwan, it will prove that Taiwan is an \"independent country\" that has nothing to do with China. What is China’s comment on this?","The ugly words and deeds of this scum are not worth commenting on.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251231_11796371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-31","Lin Jian","Bloomberg reporter","A delegation of Japanese business executives postponed their planned visit to China at the end of January because of difficulties in arranging meetings with Chinese officials. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","We have noticed relevant reports and also noticed that many knowledgeable people in Japan are deeply worried about the negative impact and serious consequences caused by Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi’s wrong remarks on Taiwan. We urge the Japanese leaders to take concrete actions, face up to the root causes of the current situation in China-Japan relations, reflect on and correct mistakes, withdraw their erroneous remarks, and create necessary conditions for normal exchanges between China and Japan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251231_11796371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-31","Lin Jian","CCTV reporter","According to reports, Japan, Australia, EU institutions and some European countries have publicly expressed concerns about China’s military exercises near Taiwan Island. What is the spokesperson's response to this?","These countries and institutions have turned a blind eye to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces' \"use of force to seek independence\" and turned a blind eye to external forces' interference in China's internal affairs. However, they have made irresponsible remarks about China's necessary and just actions to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. They confuse right and wrong, confuse right and wrong, and are extremely hypocritical. China firmly opposes this and has lodged solemn representations.\nTaiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not allow any interference from external forces. The biggest current situation in the Taiwan Strait is that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. The biggest threat to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait is the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\" and the connivance and support of external forces. The one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is the political basis for China to develop relations with 183 countries that have diplomatic relations with China. Japan, Australia, and European countries made political commitments in this regard when they established diplomatic relations with China. We strongly urge the above-mentioned countries and institutions to strictly abide by the one-China principle, stop interfering in China's internal affairs, and stop condoning and supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251231_11796371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2025-12-31","Lin Jian","China News Service reporter","Following China's recent countermeasures and punitive measures on the Taiwan issue, and the People's Liberation Army's military exercises near Taiwan, Russia, Cuba, Serbia, Venezuela, Zimbabwe, Pakistan, and many other countries have expressed their support. What is China's comment on this?","Since China announced its countermeasures and launched relevant military exercises, dozens of countries have expressed their support for China's position in various forms, pointing out that Taiwan is an inseparable part of China's territory, the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, they oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence,\" support China in safeguarding its national sovereignty and territorial integrity, oppose external interference in China's internal affairs, and will continue to adhere to the one-China principle. We highly appreciate the firm support of all countries for China.\nWe want to reiterate once again that China's determination to safeguard national sovereignty, security, and territorial integrity is unwavering, its resolve to defend national unity and interests is unwavering, and its determination to curb the collusion between \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their attempts to destabilize the Taiwan Strait is unwavering! Any provocative act that crosses the line on the Taiwan issue will be met with a resolute response from China, and any sinister attempt to obstruct China's reunification will not succeed!","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202512/t20251231_11796371.html","",0,0,0,""],[0,"2026-01-05","Lin Jian","Bloomberg","Taiwanese officials believe that Trump's arrest of Venezuelan President Maduro is a powerful deterrent to China, saying that this incident shows that the United States has the ability to defeat troops equipped with Chinese-made weapons. They believe that this U.S. action sends a signal to the United States' \"adversaries.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair. How to solve the Taiwan issue is the Chinese people's own business. No external force has the right to interfere. The DPP authorities' attempts to \"rely on external forces for independence\" and \"reject reunification with force\" are despicable and doomed to failure.","台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。台湾问题纯属中国内政，如何解决台湾问题是中国人自己的事，任何外部势力无权干涉。民进党当局妄图“倚外谋独”、“以武拒统”，令人不齿，注定失败。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260105_11806736.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260105_11806730.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-05","Lin Jian","Shenzhen Satellite TV","On December 30, 2025, the Saudi Ministry of Foreign Affairs issued a statement expressing concern about the situation in southern Yemen. On the same day, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the United Arab Emirates issued a statement in response, stating that it respected Saudi Arabia's sovereignty and security, would conduct comprehensive coordination with Saudi Arabia, respect Yemen's sovereignty, and called for…","China has noted the statement issued by the Saudi Ministry of Foreign Affairs and the response from the UAE, and appreciates both the Saudi and Saudi sides' emphasis on respecting each other's sovereignty and security. The international community generally recognizes the legitimate government of Yemen. China has always supported the maintenance of Yemen's sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity, welcomed the holding of a dialogue meeting between parties in southern Yemen in Riyadh, and called on all parties to remain calm and restrained, insist on resolving differences and disputes through political dialogue, and create conditions for the early restoration of peace and tranquility in Yemen.","中方注意到沙特外交部发表的声明以及阿联酋方面作出的回应，赞赏沙阿双方均强调尊重彼此主权和安全。国际社会普遍承认也门合法政府。中方一贯支持维护也门主权、统一和领土完整，欢迎在利雅得举行也门南方各派对话会，呼吁各方保持冷静克制，坚持通过政治对话化解分歧争端，为早日恢复也门和平安宁创造条件。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260105_11806736.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260105_11806730.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-06","Mao Ning","AFP","Japanese Congressman Ishihara is currently in Taiwan. He said his visit to Taiwan showed that Taiwan is an \"independent country.\" What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","Xiaoxiao's arrogance is not worthy of comment.","宵小狂言，不值一评。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260106_11807319.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260106_11807212.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-07","Mao Ning","Japan Broadcasting Association","The Ministry of Commerce of China issued an announcement yesterday on strengthening the export control of dual-use items to Japan. The 2026 \"Catalogue for Export License Management of Dual-Use Items and Technologies\" announced by the Chinese government includes rare earth-related items. Do the measures to strengthen export controls to Japan issued yesterday also cover rare earth products? Last night, the Japanese…","Please refer to the Chinese competent authorities for specific questions. What I want to point out is that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's wrong remarks regarding Taiwan infringed on China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, blatantly interfered in China's internal affairs, and issued threats of force against China. In order to safeguard national security and interests and fulfill international obligations such as non-proliferation, China has taken measures in accordance with laws and regulations, which are completely legitimate, reasonable and legal. We urge the Japanese side to face up to the root of the problem, reflect on and correct mistakes, and withdraw Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's erroneous remarks.","具体的问题请向中方主管部门了解。我想指出的是，日本首相高市早苗涉台错误言论侵害中国主权和领土完整，公然干涉中国内政，对中方发出武力威胁。为了维护国家安全和利益，履行防扩散等国际义务，中方依法依规采取措施，完全正当、合理、合法。我们敦促日方正视问题根源、反思纠错，撤回首相高市早苗错误言论。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260107_11807882.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260107_11807855.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-09","Mao Ning","\"Beijing Daily\"","On the 8th, Foreign Minister Wang Yi held the ninth China-AU strategic dialogue with Yusuf, Chairman of the AU Commission, at the AU headquarters. Can the spokesperson further introduce the situation? What is your assessment of the current relationship with the African Union?","The AU is the banner of Africa's unity and self-strength. China has always developed relations with the AU from a strategic height and a long-term perspective. This dialogue is an important strategic communication between China and the African Union since the new African Union Commission took office. Foreign Minister Wang Yi had in-depth exchanges with President Youssouf on the development of China-Africa relations, China-AU cooperation, and international and regional issues of common concern, deepening strategic mutual trust, strengthening mutual support, and consolidating solidarity and cooperation.\nBoth sides agreed that under the strategic guidance of President Xi Jinping and African leaders, China-Africa relations have achieved leapfrog development and opened a new stage of jointly building an all-weather China-Africa community with a shared future in the new era. Both sides agreed to continue to firmly support each other in safeguarding core interests and major concerns, and to strengthen communication, coordination and mutual support on major initiatives proposed by each other. The two sides will jointly safeguard the international order based on international law and work together to defend the legitimate rights and interests of the global South. The African Union reaffirms its firm commitment to the one-China principle and its firm support for all efforts made by the Chinese government to achieve national reunification.\nWe are willing to work with the African Union to implement the results of this dialogue and continue to tap the potential of China-AU practical cooperation to better benefit the people of China and Africa.","非盟是非洲联合自强的旗帜，中方始终从战略高度和长远角度发展同非盟关系。这次对话是新一届非盟委员会就职以来，中国同非盟之间一次重要战略沟通。王毅外长同优素福主席就中非关系发展、中国非盟合作以及共同关心的国际和地区问题深入交流，深化了战略互信、强化了相互支持、巩固了团结合作。\n双方一致认为，在习近平主席和非方领导人战略引领下，中非关系实现跨越式发展，开启共筑新时代全天候中非命运共同体新阶段。双方同意继续坚定支持彼此维护核心利益和重大关切，就各自提出的重大倡议加强沟通协调和相互支持。双方将共同维护以国际法为基础的国际秩序，携手捍卫全球南方正当权益。非盟方重申坚定奉行一个中国原则，坚定支持中国政府为实现国家统一所做的一切努力。\n我们愿同非盟一道，落实好本次对话成果，继续深挖中国非盟务实合作潜能，更好惠及中非人民。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260109_11810122.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260109_11810157.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-09","Mao Ning","Reuters","In response to analysts' claims that China may take inspiration from the U.S. military strike on Venezuela, U.S. President Trump told the New York Times that he would be very unhappy if China sought to change the status quo in Taiwan during his term. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on Trump’s remarks?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs. The solution of the Taiwan issue is the Chinese people's own business and does not tolerate external interference.","台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，台湾问题纯属中国内政，解决台湾问题是中国人自己的事，不容外部干涉。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260109_11810122.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260109_11810157.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-12","Mao Ning","\"Beijing Youth Daily\"","According to reports, on the 9th, Taiwan stated that the Taiwan-related content in the joint press communiqué of the China-AU Strategic Dialogue seriously distorted the facts and derogated Taiwan’s so-called \"sovereignty.\" It expressed regret that the AU echoed China's position. What is China’s comment on this?","The one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is also the political foundation of China-Africa relations. The Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation in 2024 adopted the Beijing Declaration. The participating African countries and the African Union Commission reaffirmed their firm adherence to the one-China principle, reiterated that there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and the government of the People's Republic of China is the only legitimate government representing the whole of China. It firmly supports all efforts made by the Chinese government to achieve national reunification. The Joint Press Communiqué of the Ninth China-African Union Strategic Dialogue completely and accurately reflects Africa’s consistent and clear position on the Taiwan issue. Just a few days ago, Chairman of the African Union Commission Yusuf said in an interview that \"the African Union will always stand with China on the issue of adhering to the one-China principle.\"\nWe advise the Taiwan authorities to recognize the reality and stop clumsy political performances that humiliate themselves.","一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识和国际关系基本准则，也是中非关系的政治基础。2024年中非合作论坛北京峰会通过《北京宣言》，与会非洲国家和非盟委员会重申坚定奉行一个中国原则，重申世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，中华人民共和国政府是代表全中国的唯一合法政府，坚定支持中国政府为实现国家统一所作的一切努力。中国—非盟第九次战略对话联合新闻公报完整准确反映了非方在台湾问题上一以贯之的鲜明立场。就在前几天，非盟委员会主席优素福接受采访时表示，“在坚持一个中国原则问题上，非盟永远与中国站在一起”。\n奉劝台湾当局认清现实，停止自取其辱的拙劣政治表演。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260112_11811345.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260112_11811154.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-12","Mao Ning","AFP","Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi was scheduled to visit Somalia last week, but the visit was postponed due to scheduling reasons. What was the reason for the change in plan? Is it for safety reasons?","After friendly consultations between the foreign ministries of China and Somalia, Foreign Minister Wang Yi’s visit itinerary has been adjusted. During his visit to Africa, Foreign Minister Wang Yi held a telephone conversation with Somali Foreign Minister Deai, emphasizing that China will continue to support Somalia in safeguarding sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity. The two sides reached a new consensus on deepening cooperation between the two countries in various fields.","经中国和索马里两国外交部门友好协商，王毅外长的访问行程有所调整。访非期间，王毅外长同索马里外长德埃举行了电话会谈，强调中方将一以贯之支持索马里维护主权、统一和领土完整。双方就深化两国各领域合作达成了新的共识。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260112_11811345.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260112_11811154.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-16","Guo Jiakun","nippon television network","The former Chief Cabinet Secretary of Japan visited Taiwan and held talks with Taiwan's \"President\" Lai Ching-te. Lai thanked the Japanese Prime Minister for continuing to express his position of attaching importance to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is a province of China and does not have a \"president\". There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. China firmly opposes any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with the Taiwan authorities. We urge Japan to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and refrain from sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces. We also want to emphasize that the most important thing Japan should do now is to withdraw Takaichi’s erroneous remarks related to Taiwan.","台湾是中国的一个省，没有什么“总统”。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。中方坚决反对建交国同台湾当局进行任何形式的官方往来。我们敦促日方切实恪守一个中国原则，不要向“台独”分裂势力发出任何错误信号。我们也要强调，现在日方最应该做的是撤回高市涉台错误言论。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260116_11814196.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260116_11814163.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-01-16","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","On Thursday, the United States and Taiwan signed a trade agreement to reduce tariffs on many Taiwanese export products. Taiwan will increase investment in the U.S. technology industry. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","China has always firmly opposed the negotiation and signing of any agreement with sovereign connotations and official nature between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan and China. The United States should earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques.","中方一贯坚决反对建交国与中国台湾地区商签任何具有主权意涵和官方性质的协定。美方应当切实恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260116_11814196.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260116_11814163.shtml",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-01-16","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","There are concerns in Taiwan that the mainland might follow what the US did to Venezuela to legitimize the use of force against the island. Meanwhile, some international media argued that if Beijing were to adopt a similar approach, it would face much higher risks and costs. What's your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair. How to resolve it is a matter for the Chinese, which brooks no interference from external forces. For us, to deal with the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces is like catching a turtle in a jar, and all options that can punish the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces remain on the table.","台湾问题纯属中国内政，如何解决是中国人自己的事，外部势力无权置喙。我们对付“台独”武装就像瓮中捉鳖，凡是能够严惩“台独”分子的措施都是可选项。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16437788.html","",1,1,3,""],[1,"2026-01-16","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","A poll in Taiwan found that more than 60% of respondents were unwilling to fight in a war, or to have their family members do so. What's your comment on this?","This once again proves that the overwhelming majority of people in Taiwan desire peace, development, exchange and cooperation, not confrontation or conflict, even less to fight a war. Defying the people's wishes, the Lai Ching-te authorities are pursuing separatist goals by stoking tensions. More people will see through their nature of undermining peace, provoking crisis and inciting wars. I believe that no one is willing to be cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\" schemes. The separatist forces who go against the will of the people are doomed to be thrown into the dustbin of history.\nRelated News\nComments\n-->\nAbout Us\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © China Military. All rights reserved.\nback","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2026-01-16","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Some public opinion on the island is concerned that the mainland might imitate the U.S. approach toward Venezuela to justify taking action against Taiwan. Some foreign media say that if the mainland hopes to emulate the U.S. approach in handling the Taiwan issue, the costs and risks would be much higher. What is your comment?","The Taiwan issue is purely China’s internal affair. How it is resolved is a matter for the Chinese people themselves, and external forces have no right to comment. Dealing with “Taiwan independence” armed forces would be like catching turtles in a jar—we would have them completely trapped. Any measures that can severely punish “Taiwan independence” elements are on the table","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2026-01-27","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","Japanese Prime Minister Takaichi Sanae said that in the event of a crisis in Taiwan, Japan and the United States will jointly rescue the citizens of the two countries. She also said that under such circumstances, Japan would never abandon its long-term ally, the United States. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The Japanese side needs to be reminded that the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement clearly stated that \"the Japanese government recognizes the government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China\" and \"the government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Japanese government fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and insists on following Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\" The 1978 Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship was approved by the legislative bodies of China and Japan, confirming that the principles stated in the Sino-Japanese Joint Declaration should be strictly observed.\nAccording to a series of documents with full international legal effect, such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Proclamation and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, Taiwan, which Japan stole from China, must be returned to China; Japan should be completely disarmed and must not maintain industries that allow it to rearm. The Japanese Constitution also imposes strict restrictions on military strength, belligerent power, and war power.\nThese are political commitments and legal obligations that Japan must strictly fulfill. Japan claims to act within the scope of the law, but it has repeatedly interfered in China's internal affairs and even threatened China with force. This is completely contradictory. Japan once colonized Taiwan for half a century, committed countless crimes, and bore serious historical responsibilities against the Chinese people. Neither historically nor legally, Japan has any qualification to comment on Taiwan, China. Japan's relevant remarks once again exposed the ambition of Japan's right-wing forces to provoke confrontation, create troubles, take the opportunity to promote \"remilitarization\" and challenge the post-war international order. This has posed a serious threat to regional peace and stability and the political foundation of China-Japan relations. The international community must be highly vigilant and resolutely resist. We once again urge the Japanese side to abide by the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and the political commitments made, earnestly reflect on and correct mistakes, and stop manipulating and reckless actions on the Taiwan issue.","需要提醒日方的是，1972年《中日联合声明》明确，“日本国政府承认中华人民共和国政府是中国的唯一合法政府”，“中华人民共和国政府重申：台湾是中华人民共和国领土不可分割的一部分。日本国政府充分理解和尊重中国政府这一立场，并坚持遵循《波茨坦公告》第八条的立场”。1978年《中日和平友好条约》经中日两国立法机构批准，确认《中日联合声明》所表明的各项原则应予严格遵守。\n根据《开罗宣言》《波茨坦公告》和《日本投降书》等一系列具有充分国际法效力的文件，日本窃取于中国之台湾必须归还中国；日本应完全解除武装，不得维持能使其重新武装的产业。日本宪法对军力、交战权、战争权也作出严格限制。\n以上这些都是日本必须严格履行的政治承诺和不容推卸的法律义务。日方声称要在法律范围内行动，却一再粗暴干涉中国内政，甚至对中国发出武力威胁，这完全是自相矛盾。日本曾对台湾殖民统治长达半个世纪，犯下罄竹难书的罪行，对中国人民负有严重历史罪责。无论在历史上、法律上，日方都没有任何资格对中国台湾置喙。日方有关言论再次暴露日本右翼势力挑动对立、制造事端，借机推进“再军事化”、挑战战后国际秩序的野心。这已经对地区和平稳定和中日关系政治基础构成严重威胁，国际社会必须高度警惕、坚决抵制。我们再次敦促日方恪守中日四个政治文件精神和所作政治承诺，切实反思纠错，停止在台湾问题上的操弄和妄动。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202601/t20260127_11846105.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202601/t20260127_11846080.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-02-06","Lin Jian","Reuters","Lithuania's Prime Minister said on Tuesday that allowing (Taiwan) to open a representative office in Vilnius under the name \"Taiwan\" was a strategic mistake made by Lithuania. Will China consider restoring comprehensive diplomatic relations with Lithuania? What conditions need to be met first?","China has stated its position on neutral relations many times. The door of communication between China and the Lithuanian side is always open. We hope that the Lithuanian side will translate its willingness to improve bilateral relations into practical actions, correct its mistakes as soon as possible, return to the right track of adhering to the one-China principle, and accumulate conditions for the normalization of neutral relations.","中方已经多次就中立关系表明立场。中方同立方沟通的大门始终敞开，希望立方将改善双边关系的意愿转化为实际行动，尽早纠正错误，回到恪守一个中国原则的正确轨道上来，为中立关系正常化积累条件。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202602/t20260206_11852932.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260206_11852777.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-02-09","Lin Jian","Kyodo News","Yesterday, the Liberal Democratic Party won an overwhelming victory in Japan's House of Representatives election, and Sanae Takaichi is expected to remain in power. What foreign policy does China hope the new government led by Sanae Takaichi will pursue?","Elections are Japan's domestic affairs, but this election reflects some deep-seated and structural problems as well as thoughts, trends, and trends, which are worthy of deep thought by people of insight from all walks of life in Japan and the international community. Yin Jian is not far away, so we must pay attention to it. We urge the Japanese ruling authorities to face up to the concerns of the international community instead of ignoring them, to follow the path of peaceful development instead of repeating the mistakes of militarism, and to abide by the four political documents between China and Japan instead of betraying trust. If Japan's far-right forces misjudge the situation and act arbitrarily, they will surely be boycotted by the Japanese people and hit head-on by the international community.\nChina's policy towards Japan has always maintained stability and continuity and will not change due to a certain election in Japan. We once again urge Japan to withdraw its erroneous remarks on Taiwan and take concrete actions to demonstrate its basic sincerity in safeguarding the political foundation of China-Japan relations. We also want to tell the Japanese ruling authorities that the Chinese people are unwavering in their determination to safeguard the country’s core interests, to defend the results of the victory in World War II and the post-war international order, and to counter and thwart the provocative and reckless actions of various anti-China forces.","选举是日本的国内事务，但本次选举反映一些深层次、结构性的问题以及思潮、动向、趋势，值得日本各界有识之士和国际社会深思。殷鉴不远，不可不察。我们敦促日本执政当局正视而不是漠视国际社会的关切，走和平发展道路而不是重蹈军国主义覆辙，恪守中日四个政治文件而不是背信弃义。日本极右翼势力若误判形势恣意妄为，必将遭到日本人民的抵制和国际社会迎头痛击。\n中方对日政策始终保持稳定性和连续性，不会因日本某一次选举而变化。我们再次敦促日方撤回高市涉台错误言论，以实际行动展现维护中日关系政治基础的基本诚意。我们也要正告日本执政当局，中国人民维护国家核心利益的决心坚定不移，捍卫二战胜利成果和战后国际秩序的决心坚定不移，反击和挫败各种反华势力挑衅妄动的决心坚定不移。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202602/t20260209_11854459.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260209_11854350.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-02-10","Lin Jian","AFP","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi said yesterday that she was open to dialogue with China and that the two countries would continue to exchange views. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this? Is China willing to dialogue with Takaichi?","China has stated its solemn position on this issue many times. Real dialogue should be based on respecting each other and adhering to consensus. No one will accept this kind of \"dialogue\" when you are shouting dialogue but your hands are busy fighting. If Japan really wants to develop a strategic and mutually beneficial relationship between China and Japan, it is very simple and clear, that is to withdraw Takaichi’s erroneous remarks on Taiwan, abide by the four political documents between China and Japan and the political commitments made by Japan, and show sincerity in dialogue with practical actions.","中方已多次阐明相关严正立场。真正的对话应建立在尊重对方、恪守共识的基础上。嘴里喊着对话、手上却忙着对抗，这样的“对话”没人会接受。日方如果真心想发展中日战略互惠关系，很简单，也很明确，就是撤回高市涉台错误言论，恪守中日四个政治文件和日方作出的政治承诺，以实际行动展现对话诚意。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202602/t20260210_11855328.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260210_11855248.shtml",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-02-10","Jiang Bin","Reporter","It is reported that troops of Taiwan plan to forward deploy HIMARS rocket systems to Penghu and Dongyin, with strike ranges covering PLA positions in Fujian, Zhejiang and other areas. Some scholars in Taiwan revealed that Taiwan's military authorities once proposed the idea of conducting \"preemptive strikes\" against the PLA. Please comment on that.","From forward deploying weapons to launching so-called preemptive strikes, \"Taiwan independence\" separatists are coming up with increasingly absurd ideas and overestimating their strength. In the face of the PLA's strong capabilities, should \"Taiwan independence\" armed forces dare to provoke a conflict, they will inevitably bring destruction upon themselves.\nOn the afternoon of February 10, 2026, Senior Colonel Jiang Bin, Deputy Director-General of the Information Office of the Ministry of National Defense (MND) and Spokesperson for the MND, answers recent media queries concerning the military. (mod.gov.cn)\nJiang Bin: The Spring Festival of the Year of the Horse is approaching. In traditional Chinese culture, the horse symbolizes loyalty, courage and enterprise. In the military context, the horse represents the fighting spirit of charging into battle and protecting the homeland. Along thousands of miles of borderlines, across the vast territorial waters, and from the skies above to the deep blue oceans, PLA officers and soldiers are fully prepared and stay highly vigilant. We are relentlessly honing our capabilities to fight and win, so as to better protect the tranquility of our homeland.\nWith the 15th Five-Year Plan drawn up, the call for marching towards our centenary goal rings louder. In the coming year, the people's military will charge ahead like horses with courage, vitality and energy, and stride forward along the path of building a strong nation and military and advancing national rejuvenation.\nHere, my comrades and I would like to wish our country prosperity and tranquility, and wish all the Chinese people vitality and happiness!\n-->\nloading...\n原图\nAbout Us\n|\nChinese Edition\nCopyright © Ministry of National Defense of the People's Republic of China. All Rights Reserved","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2026-02-12","Lin Jian","AFP","Lai Qingde said in the interview that once Taiwan is \"annexed\", the next threats will be Japan, the Philippines and other Indo-Pacific countries. What is China’s response?","Lai Ching-te's relevant remarks once again exposed his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" nature, fully proving that Lai Ching-te is a \"peace destroyer\", \"crisis creator\" and \"war instigator\". It fully proves that \"Taiwan independence\" is the root cause of peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. No matter what Lai Ching-te says or does, it cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory. It cannot shake the international community's basic pattern of adhering to the one-China principle, and it cannot stop the historical trend that China will eventually be reunified and will be reunified. \"Relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"rejecting reunification with force\" are just like a worm trying to shake a tree, and are doomed to failure!","赖清德有关言论再次暴露其顽固“台独”分子本质，充分证明赖清德是“和平破坏者”、“危机制造者”、“战争煽动者”，充分说明“台独”是台海和平稳定的祸根乱源。无论赖清德说什么、做什么，都改变不了台湾是中国领土一部分的历史和法理事实，撼动不了国际社会坚持一个中国原则的基本格局，更阻挡不了中国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。“倚外谋独”“以武拒统”是蚍蜉撼树，注定失败！","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202602/t20260212_11857764.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260212_11857627.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-02-12","Lin Jian","AFP","Lai Ching-te said he hopes Taiwan and Europe can strengthen cooperation in military industry and technology in the future. What is the spokesperson's response to this?","I have just pointed out very clearly that \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"rejecting reunification with force\" are mantis trying to control the chariot and are doomed to failure!","我刚才已经非常清晰指出了，“倚外谋独”“以武拒统”是螳臂当车，注定失败！","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202602/t20260212_11857764.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260212_11857627.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-02-15","Lin Jian","Fuji TV","Sanae Takaichi stated in her policy speech that it is the consistent policy of her cabinet to comprehensively promote strategic and mutually beneficial relations with China and build constructive and stable Japan-China relations; as an important neighboring country, due to various unresolved issues and challenges on both sides, Japan will continue to communicate with China and adopt calm and appropriate response…","China has stated its solemn position on this issue many times. Real communication should be based on respecting each other and adhering to consensus. If Japan sincerely wants to develop a strategic and mutually beneficial relationship between China and Japan, it should withdraw its erroneous remarks on Taiwan, abide by the four political documents between China and Japan and its own commitments, and take practical actions to demonstrate its basic sincerity in safeguarding the political foundation of China-Japan relations.","中方已多次阐明相关严正立场。真正的沟通应建立在尊重对方、恪守共识的基础上。日方如果真心想发展中日战略互惠关系，就应该撤回高市涉台错误言论，恪守中日四个政治文件和自身所作承诺，以实际行动展现维护中日关系政治基础的基本诚意。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202602/t20260223_11862032.shtml","",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-02-28","Zhang Xiaogang","Question","As was reported, Lai Ching-te recently made noises about accelerating the buildup of asymmetric capabilities, and pushed hard for advancing arms purchases from the US and the approval of related budgets, so as to \"ensure security of the island and maintain peace and stability in the Indo-Pacific\". What's your comment on this？","Lai Ching-te and his ilk, driven by partisan and personal interests, have recklessly squandered public funds to purchase US-made weapons. This will only drain Taiwan's coffers faster, push Taiwan closer to the peril of war, and drag the people in Taiwan down into an abyss. We sternly warn the DPP authorities that seeking independence by soliciting foreign support is doomed to fail, and resisting reunification by force is a dead end. We hope that compatriots in Taiwan will see through the very dangerous and destructive nature of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, stand with us to resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" schemes and foreign interference, and take concrete actions to safeguard their own safety and well-being, as well as peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","赖清德之流为一党一己之私，大肆挥霍民脂民膏买美制武器，只会加速掏空台湾，让台湾兵凶战危，将台湾民众推向灾难深渊。正告民进党当局，“倚外谋独”注定失败，“以武拒统”死路一条。我们希望广大台湾同胞切实认清“台独”分裂的极端危害性和破坏性，同我们一道坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，以实际行动维护自身安全福祉和台海和平稳定。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16445028.html","",1,0,3,""],[0,"2026-03-03","Mao Ning","Reuters","Some analysts believe that China may take bolder actions to declare its territorial claims, including its territorial claims over Taiwan, when the United States is distracted by conflicts in the Middle East. What's the spokesperson's comment on this? Some analysts believe that the actions taken by the United States in Venezuela and Iran may affect China's oil supply and weaken the strength of its diplomatic…","Regarding the first question, Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs and the solution of the Taiwan issue is the Chinese people's own business.\nRegarding your second question, China firmly opposes the use of force in international relations and infringes on the sovereignty and security of other countries. Energy security is very important to the world economy, and all parties should ensure stable and smooth energy supply. China will take necessary measures to ensure its own energy security.","关于第一个问题，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，台湾问题是中国内政，解决台湾问题是中国人自己的事。\n关于第二个问题，中方坚决反对在国际关系中使用武力，侵犯别国主权安全。能源安全对世界经济非常重要，各方都应当确保能源供应稳定畅通。中方将采取必要措施，保障自身能源安全。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260303_11867987.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260303_11867941.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-09","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","Last weekend, Taiwan's \"Executive President\" Zhuo Rongtai went to Japan to watch the baseball game between Taiwan and the Czech Republic. Zhuo Yingwen said that the visit was private and not official. Does China accept this explanation? Any further comments on his trip to Japan?","The person you mentioned has ulterior motives. He secretly and furtively traveled to Japan to engage in small provocations for \"independence\". This kind of shameful deeds and tactics are despicable.\nChina is highly vigilant and firmly opposes Japan's attempt to make a \"sideline\" and make a breakthrough on the Taiwan issue. Japan will pay a price for its connivance, provocation and willful actions, and all consequences must be borne by Japan. China will continue to unswervingly fight against \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, resolutely oppose external interference in the Taiwan issue, and resolutely defend national sovereignty, security and territorial integrity.","你提到的这个人心怀鬼胎，偷偷摸摸、鬼鬼祟祟地跑到日本搞谋“独”挑衅的小动作，这种见不得人的勾当和伎俩令人不齿。\n中方高度警惕、坚决反对日方妄图在台湾问题上打“擦边球”、搞突破。日方的纵容挑衅和恣意妄为必将付出代价，由此造成的一切后果必须由日方承担。中方将继续坚定不移打击“台独”分裂势力，坚决反对外部势力干涉台湾问题，坚决捍卫国家主权安全和领土完整。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260309_11871584.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260309_11871477.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-09","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Taiwan said that in the past 10 days, the number of mainland military aircraft flying around the island has decreased significantly. Can the spokesperson explain why?","This is not a diplomatic issue.","这不是外交问题。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260309_11871584.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260309_11871477.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-10","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","Taiwanese authorities are considering issuing bonds for the first time to fund overseas investments in partner countries. This is an action taken by this \"democracy\" to counter the mainland's diplomatic isolation. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ comment on this?","The DPP authorities are accustomed to engaging in \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities internationally and expanding the so-called \"international space\" under the guise of economy, trade, investment, etc., with sinister intentions and doomed to failure. The DPP authorities' despicable tricks cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, nor can it shake the international community's solid pattern of adhering to the one-China principle, nor can it stop the historical process of realizing the complete reunification of the motherland.","民进党当局惯于打着经贸、投资等各种幌子在国际上从事“台独”分裂活动，拓展所谓“国际空间”，用心险恶，注定失败。民进党当局的卑鄙伎俩，根本改变不了台湾是中国领土一部分的历史和法理事实，也撼动不了国际社会坚持一个中国原则的稳固格局，更阻挡不了实现祖国完全统一的历史进程。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260310_11872314.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260310_11872097.shtml",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-03-11","Jiang Bin","Question","It’s reported that the 2026 Goodwill Cruising and Training Squadron of Taiwan’s naval force has set sail to visit its so-called diplomatic allies in Central and South America for a “large-scale goodwill mission”. Do you have any comment on this?","The so-called goodwill mission is merely an excuse for the DPP authorities to solicit foreign support for “Taiwan independence”. The one-China principle is a prevailing international consensus and a basic norm in international relations. It is the political foundation for China’s relations with all the 183 countries who have diplomatic ties with China. We hope that countries in the relevant region can follow the historical trend of the times and make, at an early date, the right decision that serves the fundamental and long-term interests of their peoples. We warn the DPP authorities that no form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities or political manipulation can change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, or alter the international community’s support for the one-China principle. Such attempts are futile.","所谓“敦睦”只是民进党当局“倚外谋独”的借口。一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是中国同183个建交国发展关系的政治基础。我们希望有关地区国家顺应历史大势和时代潮流，早日作出真正符合本国人民根本和长远利益的正确选择。正告民进党当局，任何形式的“台独”分裂活动和政治操弄，都改变不了台湾属于中国的事实和国际社会坚持一中原则的格局，注定徒劳无功。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16447915.html","",1,0,3,""],[0,"2026-03-13","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","According to reports, a large-scale U.S. arms sales package to Taiwan is ready and awaiting approval by President Trump, who may sign it after his visit to China. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","China's position on firmly opposing the United States' arms sales to China's Taiwan region is consistent and clear. The United States should earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17\" communiqué, stop arms sales to Taiwan, and take practical actions to maintain the stable development of Sino-US relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","中方坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器的立场是一贯、明确的。美方应切实恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报特别是“八·一七”公报规定，停止对台军售，以实际行动维护中美关系稳定发展，以及台海和平稳定。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260313_11874728.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260313_11874556.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-18","Lin Jian","Phoenix TV","Recently, Lai Ching-te attended an event and said that Japan colonized Taiwan in order to promote the \"East Asia Co-Prosperity Sphere\". This statement caused strong dissatisfaction on the island. What is the spokesperson’s comment on this?","The Lai Qingde authorities blatantly used the lies of the invaders to beautify Japan's colonial rule. This is a serious blasphemy against history and a shameful betrayal of the nation. Japan once implemented colonial rule over Taiwan, China, for half a century, bloodyly suppressed the resistance of the Taiwanese compatriots, plundered various resources, and caused serious damage to Taiwan's economy, culture, and people's livelihood. This unforgettable history of blood and tears cannot be forgotten or distorted.\nMore than 80 years ago, Taiwan got rid of the yoke of colonial rule and returned to the embrace of the motherland. This is a great victory forged by the bloody struggle of the entire Chinese people, including our Taiwan compatriots. Today, more than 80 years later, we will never allow anyone to justify colonization or overturn the verdict of aggression. Relevant remarks once again exposed Lai Qingde's provocative nature of selling Taiwan to Japan and seeking \"independence\". The Lai Ching-te administration confuses the truth of history, whitewashes colonial atrocities, and attempts to block the general trend of reunification of the motherland with a \"Taiwan independence\" view of history. This will only lead to self-destruction.","赖清德当局公然用侵略者的谎言美化日本侵略殖民统治，这是对历史的严重亵渎和对民族的可耻背叛。日本曾对中国台湾实施长达半个世纪的殖民统治，血腥镇压台湾同胞反抗，大肆掠夺各类资源，对台湾经济、文化、民生等造成严重破坏。这段刻骨铭心的血泪史不容遗忘，不容歪曲。\n80多年前，台湾摆脱殖民统治枷锁，回到祖国怀抱。这是包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民浴血奋战、共同铸就的伟大胜利。80多年后的今天，我们决不允许任何人为殖民张目，为侵略翻案。有关言论再次暴露赖清德媚日卖台、谋“独”挑衅的本质。赖清德当局颠倒历史黑白，粉饰殖民暴行，企图以“台独”史观阻挡祖国统一大势，只会自取灭亡。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260318_11876954.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260318_11876825.shtml",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-03-18","Jiang Bin","Reporter","According to reports, some DPP politicians recently smeared the Chinese mainland's embassy in Israel for helping Taiwan compatriots register for evacuation, calling it \"political manipulation.\" The DPP authorities also used the Middle East situation to pressure the Blue-White camp, demanding accelerated review of the defense budget. Do you have any comment?","War is merciless, but the motherland cares for her people. Taiwan compatriots are our family, bound to us by blood. In every moment of crisis and every emergency evacuation, we have spared no effort to protect our compatriots and bring our family members home. This reflects the deep care of our great motherland for every Chinese person, and is our consistent practice of putting the people first and valuing life above all else. Rather than caring about the safety of Taiwan's people or taking any action to help stranded compatriots escape the war zone, the DPP authorities have obstructed them from receiving mainland evacuation assistance and even tried to exploit the crisis for political gain, pursuing \"independence through force\" at all costs. Such behavior is utterly devoid of conscience and humanity, and deserves only contempt and rejection.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,0,3,""],[0,"2026-03-19","Lin Jian","Reuters","The U.S. intelligence community noted in its annual global threat assessment report that China currently has no plans to \"attack Taiwan\" in 2027, but instead seeks to \"control Taiwan\" without the use of force. What is China’s comment on this and this report?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair, and the solution of the Taiwan issue is entirely the Chinese people's own business and does not allow for any interference from external forces. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, and be cautious in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue. At the same time, relevant US institutions and individuals should abandon ideological prejudice and Cold War zero-sum mentality, correct their understanding of China, and stop hyping the \"China threat theory.\"","台湾问题是中国内政，解决台湾问题完全是中国人自己的事，不容任何外部势力干涉。美方应恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，在台湾问题上谨言慎行。同时，美方有关机构和人士应摒弃意识形态偏见和冷战零和思维，端正对华认知，停止炒作“中国威胁论”。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260319_11877725.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260319_11877656.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-19","Lin Jian","Reuters","The U.S. intelligence agency said in its annual global threat assessment report that Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's statement about assuming that China would \"attack Taiwan\" marked a \"major change\" in Japan's stance on Taiwan-related issues. The Japanese government expressed opposition to this and said that Japan's position on judging the \"existential crisis situation\" has not changed. What is China’s…","Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi blatantly interfered in China's internal affairs with his fallacies related to Taiwan, expressed his ambition to intervene in the Taiwan issue with force, and threatened China with force. China has stated its solemn position on many occasions. Relevant reports show that the international community is increasingly aware of the bad nature and impact of Takaichi's remarks, and remains vigilant against Japan's dangerous trends of provocation and trouble. Japan cannot justify itself by saying \"its position remains unchanged\" and cannot win the trust of its Asian neighbors and the international community. We urge the Japanese side to reflect on and correct its mistakes, change course, implement the four political documents between China and Japan and its own commitments with practical actions, abide by the pacifist provisions in the Japanese Constitution, and not to go further down the wrong path.","日本首相高市早苗涉台谬论公然干涉中国内政，表达企图武装介入台湾问题的野心，对中国发出武力威胁，中方已多次阐明严正立场。有关报告表明，国际社会越来越清醒认识到高市言论的恶劣性质和影响，对日方主动挑衅滋事的危险动向保持警惕。日方只靠一句“立场未变”难以自圆其说，无法取信亚洲邻国和国际社会。我们敦促日方反思纠错、改弦更张，以实际行动践行中日四个政治文件和自身承诺，并恪守日本宪法中的和平主义条款，不要在错误的道路上越走越远。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260319_11877725.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260319_11877656.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-19","Lin Jian","yonhap news agency","Dissatisfied with the word \"Taiwan, China\" marked on South Korea's electronic entry declaration, Taiwan said it would change South Korea on some entry-exit documents to \"South Korea.\" What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. We believe that South Korea will continue to adhere to the one-China principle stipulated in the Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and South Korea, and appropriately handle the Taiwan issue accordingly.","台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识。我们相信韩方将继续坚持中韩建交联合公报既已明确的一个中国原则，并据此妥处台湾问题。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260319_11877725.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260319_11877656.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-20","Lin Jian","Kyodo News","According to reports, during the Japan-US leaders’ talks, the two sides confirmed the importance of maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. What is China’s comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs. The solution of the Taiwan issue is the Chinese people's own business. If we want to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we should take a clear-cut stand against \"Taiwan independence\" and separatism. China is unswervingly determined to defend its national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，台湾问题纯属中国内政，解决台湾问题是中国人自己的事。要想维护台海和平稳定，就应旗帜鲜明反对“台独”分裂。中方捍卫国家主权和领土完整的决心坚定不移。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260320_11878433.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260320_11878245.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-20","Lin Jian","nippon television network","The leaders of Japan and the United States held talks this morning. Japanese Prime Minister Takaichi Sanae said that Japan has always been open to dialogue with China. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","China has stated its solemn position on this issue many times. Real dialogue should be based on respecting each other and adhering to consensus. If one claims dialogue and engages in confrontation at the same time, no one will accept such \"dialogue.\" If Japan really wants to improve Sino-Japanese relations, it should abide by the four Sino-Japanese political documents and the commitments it has made, withdraw its erroneous Taiwan-related remarks as soon as possible, seriously reflect on and correct deviations, and take practical actions to safeguard the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations.","中方已多次就此阐明严正立场。真正的对话应建立在尊重对方、恪守共识的基础上。如果是一边声称对话、一边在搞对抗，任何人都不会接受这样的“对话”。日方如果真心想改善中日关系，就应恪守中日四个政治文件和自身所作承诺，尽早撤回错误涉台言论，认真反思纠偏，以实际行动维护中日关系政治基础。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260320_11878433.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260320_11878245.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-24","Lin Jian","Global Times","This morning in Tokyo, a Japanese Self-Defense Forces officer broke into the Chinese Embassy in Japan. Could the spokesperson provide further information on the situation?","On the morning of March 24, a criminal who claimed to be an active official of the Japanese Self-Defense Forces climbed over the wall and forced his way into the Chinese Embassy in Japan. This person admitted that his actions were illegal and threatened to kill Chinese diplomats \"in the name of God.\"\nChina is deeply shocked by this incident and has made solemn representations and lodged a strong protest with Japan. The relevant incident seriously violated the Vienna Convention on Diplomatic Relations, seriously threatened the personal safety of Chinese diplomats and the safety of diplomatic facilities, and was of extremely bad nature. This incident once again reflects the rampant far-right ideological trends and forces in Japan and the growing trend of \"new militarism\". It also exposes the Japanese government's erroneous policies on history, Taiwan and other major core issues related to Sino-Japanese relations. Japan has neglected the discipline of Self-Defense Force personnel and failed to fulfill its security responsibilities for Chinese embassy, ​​consulates and diplomatic personnel.\nChina requires Japan to immediately investigate the incident thoroughly, severely punish the relevant personnel, and give China a responsible explanation. The Japanese side must effectively ensure the safety of the Chinese embassy and consulates in Japan and personnel, reflect on and correct mistakes in its China policy, and fundamentally prevent such incidents from happening again. The international community should be highly vigilant against Japan's dangerous trends of accelerating rightward shift and uncontrolled expansion of the Self-Defense Forces.","3月24日上午，一名自称为日本自卫队现役官员的不法之徒翻墙强行闯入中国驻日本大使馆。此人承认自身行为非法，威胁要以“神的名义”杀死中国外交人员。\n中方对这一事件深感震惊，已向日方严正交涉、提出强烈抗议。有关事件严重违反《维也纳外交关系公约》，严重威胁中方外交人员人身安全和外交设施安全，性质影响极为恶劣。这一事件再次反映出日本国内极右翼思潮和势力十分猖獗，“新型军国主义”成势为患，也暴露日本政府在历史、台湾等涉及中日关系重大核心问题上的错误政策流毒深重，日方对自卫队人员失管失教，未能履行对中国使领馆和外交人员的安保责任。\n中方要求日方立即彻查事件，严惩有关人员，给中方一个负责任的交代。日方必须切实保障中国驻日使领馆馆舍及人员安全，在对华政策上反思纠错，从根本上杜绝此类事件再次发生。国际社会应高度警惕日本国内加速右倾化和自卫队扩军失管的危险动向。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260324_11880206.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260324_11880190.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-24","Lin Jian","AFP","Taiwan said that because the host Cameroon marked it as a province of China in the materials issued to the Taiwan delegation, Taiwan will miss the WTO high-level meeting for the first time. What's the spokesperson's comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. On the issue of China's Taiwan region's participation in international organization activities, China's position is consistent and clear, that is, it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. The one-China principle is the political prerequisite for Taiwan's participation in the WTO. The DPP authorities used the issue of participation in the conference to engage in political manipulation, which is extremely despicable. Its provocation for \"independence\" is doomed to fail and will only bring humiliation to itself.\nThe current international economic and trade order is facing severe challenges, unilateralism and protectionism are on the rise, and the multilateral trading system has been severely impacted. The WTO holds a ministerial conference in Africa again after 10 years, which is of special significance. China firmly supports Cameroon in successfully hosting this WTO Ministerial Conference.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。在中国台湾地区参与国际组织活动问题上，中方立场是一贯的、明确的，即必须按照一个中国原则来处理。一个中国原则是中国台湾地区参与世贸组织的政治前提。民进党当局借参会问题进行政治操弄，手段极其卑鄙，其谋“独”挑衅图谋注定失败，只会自取其辱。\n当前国际经贸秩序遭遇严峻挑战，单边主义、保护主义抬头，多边贸易体制受到严重冲击。世贸组织时隔10年再次在非洲举办部长级会议，具有特殊重要意义。中方坚定支持喀方办好本届世贸组织部长级会议。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260324_11880206.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260324_11880190.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-24","Lin Jian","Reuters","According to Reuters, the draft annual diplomatic report being reviewed by the Japanese government plans to downgrade the positioning of Japan-China relations from \"one of the most important bilateral relations\" to an \"important neighbor\", retaining the expression \"strategic mutual benefit\". What is China’s comment on this?","The root cause of the current situation in Sino-Japanese relations lies in Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's fallacies related to Taiwan, which aroused the public indignation of the Chinese people and challenged the red lines of the post-war international order. If Japan sincerely wants to improve and develop Sino-Japanese relations, it should abide by the four Sino-Japanese political documents and the commitments it has made, withdraw its erroneous Taiwan-related remarks as soon as possible, seriously reflect on and correct deviations, and take practical actions to safeguard the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations.","中日关系当前局面的根源在于日本首相高市早苗发表涉台谬论，激起中国人民的公愤，挑战战后国际秩序的红线。日方如果真心想改善和发展中日关系，就应恪守中日四个政治文件和自身所作承诺，尽早撤回错误涉台言论，认真反思纠偏，以实际行动维护中日关系政治基础。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260324_11880206.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260324_11880190.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-25","Lin Jian","Reuters","Has the Japanese side assured the Chinese side that incidents like this incident will not happen again? Will this matter deepen the rift in Sino-Japanese relations?","This incident once again reflects the rampant far-right ideological trends and forces in Japan and the growing trend of \"new militarism\". It also exposes the Japanese government's erroneous policies on history, Taiwan and other major core issues related to Sino-Japanese relations. Japan has neglected the discipline of Self-Defense Force personnel and failed to fulfill its security responsibilities for Chinese embassy, ​​consulates and diplomatic personnel. As for what measures Japan will take to properly handle this incident and how to ensure that similar incidents will never happen again, I suggest you ask Japan directly. The international community, including China, is waiting to see.","这一事件再次反映出日本国内极右翼思潮和势力十分猖獗，“新型军国主义”成势为患，也暴露日本政府在历史、台湾等涉及中日关系重大核心问题上的错误政策流毒深重，日方对自卫队人员失管失教，未能履行对中国使领馆和外交人员的安保责任。至于日方将采取什么措施妥善处理此次事件，如何从根源上确保类似事件不再发生，建议你直接问日本方面，包括中方在内的国际社会都在拭目以待。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260325_11880943.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260325_11880819.shtml",0,0,2,""],[1,"2026-03-26","Jiang Bin","Reporter","I have two questions. Firstly, according to reports, the U.S. Office of the Director of National Intelligence recently released 2026 Annual Threat Assessment of the U.S. Intelligence Community . It's assessed in the document that the Chinese mainland does not plan to attack Taiwan in 2027, and prefers to achieve unification without the use of force. In recent years, the U.S. side has been keen on peddling…","On your first question, the Taiwan question is purely an internal affair of China. How to resolve it is a matter for the Chinese, which brooks no foreign interference. We urge the U.S. side to abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, be prudent on its words and actions concerning the Taiwan question, stop sending wrong signals to separatists seeking \"Taiwan independence\", and take concrete actions to maintain the overall stability of China-U.S. state-to-state and military-to-military relations.\nOn your second question, Taiwan is part of China. China will and must achieve reunification. It is an unstoppable historical trend that no one and no force can hold back. We will strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and utmost effort, but we make no promise to renounce the use of force. Should separatist forces seeking “Taiwan independence” dare to cross the red lines, they will only face a thunderous crackdown.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2026-03-26","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Recently, PLANS Dongguan and PLANS Anqing completed their first formation training and live-fire training after being commissioned to the PLA Eastern Theater Command Navy. It's believed by some experts that the two latest Type 055 guided-missile destroyers will significantly enhance the capabilities of the PLA Navy in deterring and countering forces pushing for \"Taiwan independence\". What's your comment on this?","To achieve complete reunification of China is inevitable. It is a righteous cause for the Chinese nation and is whole-heartedly supported by all Chinese people. The PLA will continue to strengthen military training and enhance combat readiness. We will take resolute measures against separatist forces seeking \"Taiwan independence\" and stand against external interference with stronger capabilities and through more diversified means. There is no escape should the \"Taiwan independence\" armed forces put up a stubborn resistance.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2026-03-26","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Lai Ching-te recently said at an event that Japan's colonization of Taiwan was intended to promote the Greater East Asia Co-Prosperity Sphere. His remarks were criticized as \"endorsing militarism in Japan\", sparking strong backlash in Taiwan. Do you have any comment on this?","Lai Ching-te's remarks, characterized by the absence of conscience and moral baseline, are truly shocking. His obsequious flattery of Japan, who once colonized Taiwan, is despicable. As is widely known, Japanese militarists, under the guise of \"co-prosperity\", committed atrocities such as killing, pillaging and the enslavement of people. Lai Ching-te has ignored Japanese aggressors' heinous crimes of slaughtering hundreds of thousands of Taiwan compatriots, and betrayed history to whitewash Japanese colonialism. Such a disgrace to the Chinese nation like him will be nailed to the pillar of shame.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[1,"2026-03-26","Jiang Bin","Reporter","Outcome documents of the recent US-Japan summit once again underlined that peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is an indispensable element. However, according to reports, a major U.S. arms package for Taiwan, which includes advanced interceptor missiles, is ready for President Trump's approval and could be signed after his visit to China. Do you have any comment on this?","It's a consistent and clear position of China in opposing U.S. arms sales to China's Taiwan region. The U.S. side needs to recognize the high sensitivity and severe consequences of arms sales to Taiwan, earnestly abide by the one-China principle and stipulations of the three China-US joint communiqués, exercise utmost caution in handling the Taiwan question, and take concrete actions to build a stable China-U.S. relations and preserve cross-Strait peace and stability.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2026-03-30","Mao Ning","Brazil's Evening News","The Japanese ambassador to Brazil recently said in an interview that Japan is willing to ease diplomatic tensions with China over the Taiwan issue and stabilize relations between the two countries. Is China willing to start a dialogue with Japan on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs, and the one-China principle is the political foundation of China-Japan relations. Dialogue should be based on respecting the other party and adhering to consensus. We should not ask for dialogue while harming the core interests of the other party. Japan should reflect on and correct its mistakes, abide by the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments it has made, and demonstrate its sincerity in dialogue with practical actions.","台湾问题是中国内政，一个中国原则是中日关系的政治基础。对话应当建立在尊重对方、恪守共识的基础上，不能一边要求对话、一边损害对方的核心利益。日方应反思纠错，恪守中日四个政治文件和自身所作承诺，以实际行动展现对话诚意。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260330_11883723.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260330_11883715.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-30","Mao Ning","Headquarters Chinese Global Program Center","This morning, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs website announced the decision to take countermeasures against Japanese Congressman Keiji Furuya. Can the spokesperson further introduce the relevant situation?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and an insurmountable red line. China has made solemn representations to Japan regarding the visit of Japanese Congressman Keiji Furuya to the Taiwan region of China. After the Japanese leader made fallacies related to Taiwan, China has stated its solemn position many times. However, Keiji Furuya still refuses to restrain himself, does not stop, and refuses to stop. He insists on continuing to collude with the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces to cause trouble, seriously interfering in China's internal affairs, and seriously infringing on China's sovereignty and core interests. In response to Keiji Furuya's bad behavior, in accordance with the Anti-Foreign Sanctions Law of the People's Republic of China, China issued a Ministry of Foreign Affairs order, announced countermeasures, and punished him to serve as a warning to others. China will also take all other necessary punitive measures against it as appropriate.","台湾问题是中国核心利益中的核心，是不可逾越的红线。中方已就日本国会众议员古屋圭司窜访中国台湾地区向日方提出严正交涉。在日本领导人发表涉台谬论后，中方多次阐明严正立场，但古屋圭司仍不收敛、不收手、不知止，执意同“台独”分裂势力持续勾连滋事，严重干涉中国内政，严重侵害中方主权和核心利益。针对古屋圭司的恶劣行径，依据《中华人民共和国反外国制裁法》，中方发布外交部令，公布反制措施，对其加以惩戒，以儆效尤。中方还将视情对其采取其他一切必要的惩治措施。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260330_11883723.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260330_11883715.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-03-30","Mao Ning","Reuters","Four U.S. senators are visiting Taiwan. Considering Trump's upcoming visit to China, how does China view this visit? This morning, China announced sanctions against a Japanese congressman. Will China also impose sanctions on these four US senators?","China has always firmly opposed official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan and has made solemn representations to the United States. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiques, handle the Taiwan issue prudently and properly, stop any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and take practical actions to safeguard the overall situation of China-U.S. relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. China's position on Taiwan-related issues is consistent and clear, and it will take necessary measures to firmly safeguard its sovereignty and territorial integrity.","中方一贯坚决反对美台官方往来，已向美方提出严正交涉。美方应当恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，慎重妥善处理台湾问题，停止任何形式的美台官方往来，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出任何错误信号，以实际行动维护中美关系大局和台海和平稳定。中方在涉台问题上的立场是一贯的、明确的，将采取必要措施坚定维护自身主权和领土完整。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202603/t20260330_11883723.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202603/t20260330_11883715.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Taiwan’s United Daily News","Regarding the recent controversy over the appointment of the mainland spouse Li Zhenxiu and the case of Xu Chunying, the mainland stated that the thugs and accomplices who investigated, tried, and judicially persecuted the mainland spouse will be punished in accordance with the law, held accountable for life, and will not be lenient. Will the mainland announce in the near future that it will publicly hold…","The mainland of the motherland is the natal family of the mainland spouses, and we are very concerned about the life and situation of the mainland spouses on the island. When storms come, we must protect them emotionally and rationally. We will not be lenient to the \"Taiwan independence\" thugs and accomplices who persecute mainland spouses. We will hold them accountable in accordance with the law and punish them severely.\nZhang Han:\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Reporter of \"Strait Flying Rainbow\" of China Central Radio and Television Station and Guoguang Broadcasting Corporation:\nWorshiping ancestors during the Tomb Sweeping Day is a Chinese tradition inherited by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Please introduce the situation of ancestor worship by compatriots on both sides of the mainland during the Tomb Sweeping Day this year.","Huangdi Xuanyuan is the humanistic ancestor of the Chinese nation. Every year during the Qingming Festival, a public memorial ceremony for Huangdi Xuanyuan is held at the Mausoleum of the Yellow Emperor. It is a traditional event for all Chinese people to trace their roots and condense their hearts and souls. On April 5, the \"Bingwu 2026 Qingming Public Memorial Ceremony to Xuanyuan Huangdi\" co-organized by the Shaanxi Provincial People's Government, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, the Overseas Chinese Affairs Office of the State Council, and the China Federation of Returned Overseas Chinese will be held grandly at the Huangdi Mausoleum in Huangling County, Yan'an City, Shaanxi Province. This year's ceremony includes nine ritual procedures, including singing \"Ode to the Yellow Emperor\", reading memorial texts, and offering music and dance. During the public memorial event, a number of activities will also be held, such as \"Cultural Sustainability and the Road to Rejuvenation\" - Huangling Roots Search, \"Kiuzhou has the same roots, both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one lineage\" - the 19th Cross-Strait Culture and Art Exhibition.\nFrom March 31 to April 5, the 2026 Cross-Strait Confucius Cultural Spring Conference was held in Qufu, Shandong. The Spring Festival will hold cross-Strait education lectures, cross-Strait youth worshiping Confucius, cross-Strait ritual and music carnival and sainthood coming-of-age ceremony, \"Into Confucius\" Taiwan youth reading Confucianism experience camp, cross-Strait youth Hanfu cultural exchange activities, cross-Strait \"The Analects\" reading and writing conference and many other activities, more than 900 Taiwanese guests were invited to attend.\nFrom April 2nd to 4th, the 10th Kaizhang Saint King Cultural Festival will be held in Yunxiao, Zhangzhou, Fujian. This cultural festival focuses on the cultural core of \"Kaizhang is auspicious and has roots all over the world\". More than 200 Taiwanese compatriots, descendants of the eighty-seven surnames of Kaizhang from all over the world, and folks at home and abroad are invited to witness the grand ceremony and feel the blood, family ties and cultural resonance across regions. From April 4th to 5th, Quanzhou Dongyuan Luo Clan Ancestral Hall and Baiqi Guo Clan Temple will also invite clan members on the island to jointly hold ancestor worship activities.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Beijing Daily","Regarding the mainland's emphasis on the one-China principle as the political prerequisite for Taiwan's participation in WTO activities, Taiwan's foreign affairs department stated that \"Taiwan joined the WTO in the name of 'individual tariff areas', and there is no unilateral claim by China.\" Any comments on this?","Regarding the issue of China's Taiwan region's participation in the activities of international organizations, our position is consistent and clear, that is, it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle, and the World Trade Organization is no exception. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities continue to spread the fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" and use clumsy means to stage a farce on the WTO platform. It cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, and cannot shake the international community's adherence to the one-China principle. Its behavior can really be described as \"an underestimation of one's own capabilities\".\nTaiwan TVBS reporter:\nRegarding KMT Chairman Cheng Li-wun’s upcoming visit to the mainland, what are the mainland’s expectations? What issues will the two sides focus on?\nZhang Han:\nSince taking office, Chairman Zheng Liwen of the Chinese Kuomintang has repeatedly expressed her wish to visit the mainland. In order to promote the peaceful development of relations between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party and cross-Strait relations, the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and General Secretary Xi Jinping welcome and invite Chairman Zheng Liwen to lead a Chinese Kuomintang delegation to visit Jiangsu, Shanghai, and Beijing from April 7 to 12. Chairman Cheng Li-wun expressed her gratitude and gladly accepted the invitation. We will communicate with the Kuomintang regarding Chairman Cheng Li-wun’s visit and make appropriate arrangements.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Hong Kong China Review Press","Gu Lixiong, the head of Taiwan's defense department, recently asked whether the U.S.-Taiwan arms sales would proceed as scheduled. He said that he had received a letter of assurance from the U.S. that the U.S. was willing to sell. He was currently in close communication with the U.S. on the specific details of the arms sales and had not received any notice of postponement. Any comments on this?","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities are trying to \"rely on the United States to seek independence\" and \"use force to seek independence\" and beg for false \"protection\" from external forces, putting Taiwan in a dangerous situation. In the end, it will only destroy itself with an egg against a stone.\nI would like to emphasize again that we firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, be cautious in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue, stop selling weapons to Taiwan, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" forces.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Xiamen TV, Fujian","According to reports, mainland background: The Togo-registered Hongtai 58 cargo ship was involved in towing and disrupting the Tai-Peng 3rd Sea cable. The mainland captain surnamed Wang was sentenced to 3 years in prison and accompanied by civil damages. But Captain Wang denied committing any crime by destroying the cable. Any comments on this?","After investigation by the public security agency, two Taiwanese residents, Jian Wenxi and Chen Shunjin, controlled ships such as the \"Hongtai 58\" and smuggled frozen goods to the mainland for a long time. In December 2025, the public security organs issued a reward notice for the two people, hoping that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait would actively provide clues about illegal crimes.\nThe DPP authorities ignored the facts of the case, protected and condoned smuggling crimes, and slandered the \"Hongtai 58\" operated by a Taiwanese smuggling gang as a convenience ship with mainland background. They used the mainland captain under their command to engage in political manipulation. This is despicable means and will surely be opposed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching the Taiwan Strait”","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching the Taiwan Strait” reporter:\nRecently, a number of achievements in the construction of the People's Liberation Army's unmanned combat system have been disclosed, and a series of \"new combat effectiveness\" equipment have been unveiled, which has attracted widespread attention on the island. Public opinion believes that these equipment will enhance the People's…","Our will to resolutely smash all \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts and external interference and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity is rock-solid, and our capabilities are getting stronger and stronger.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Sichuan Daily \"Cover News\"","The Taiwanese film \"Sunshine Girls\" will enter the mainland market. The producer labeled \"Taiwan, China\" on social media, causing controversy on the island. Taiwan's cultural department said in response that it had asked the crew to get an explanation as soon as possible, adding that \"the mainland has always used various means and methods to carry out united front actions. In addition to achieving the purpose of…","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China, and \"Taiwan Region of China\" is a normative expression in line with the one-China principle. The labeling of the relevant film industry reflects the objective facts, is normal, reasonable, and beyond reproach.\nFor Taiwanese films to enter the mainland market, it is a good thing to share the vast market opportunities in the mainland and achieve mutual benefit and win-win results for the film and television industries across the Taiwan Strait. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities are engaged in \"green terror\" on the island and frequently label normal cross-Strait exchanges as a \"united front\", fully exposing their sinister intentions of restricting cross-Strait exchanges and inciting cross-Strait confrontation. Their actions harm the interests of Taiwanese businesses and people and are unpopular. We have always supported cross-Strait film and television cultural exchanges and cooperation, and welcome Taiwanese film and television industry players to provide more excellent works to compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We will firmly safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwanese businesses. No political suppression can stop the general trend of cross-strait exchanges and cooperation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","China News Service","Taiwanese media recently reported that Xu Chunying, a land assistant, was prosecuted by the New Taipei District Prosecutor's Office under the \"Anti-infiltration Law\" and other crimes for allegedly \"assisting the election of specific candidates under instructions from the mainland.\" The Mainland Affairs Council stated in this regard that \"the CCP's intervention and use of land distribution groups has a highly…","The Xu Chunying case is another egregious example of the DPP authorities’ judicial persecution of mainland spouses. Recently, the DPP authorities have done their best to suppress and persecute mainland spouses, including intimidation, detention, and sentencing. Mainland Chinese spouses have become the largest victim group of the \"green terror\". Why? Because they are from mainland China, the DPP authorities \"must kill them\". Is this the \"democracy and freedom\" that the DPP authorities have in mind? I want to emphasize that we will punish the thugs and accomplices who investigate and prosecute and judicially persecute mainland spouses in accordance with the law, hold them accountable for life, and will never give them leniency.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","\"Reference News\"","Taiwanese media reported that Kinmen County Mayor Chen Fuhai recently led a delegation to visit the Mainland Affairs Council to explain issues such as \"increasing flights on the three minor links\" and \"exploiting diversified tourist sources\". He hoped that the Democratic Progressive Party authorities could understand Kinmen's needs and support a prosperous economy. Any comments on this?","The \"mini three links\" route is one of the most important and convenient channels for people to communicate between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, especially those in Fujian and Taiwan. It has played an important role in deepening the integrated development of the two sides and improving the well-being of the people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family. Taiwanese folks are welcome to come to the mainland through the \"mini three links\" route to visit their roots, worship their ancestors, visit relatives and friends, and exchange and cooperate.\nThe mainland has always adhered to the concept of \"Two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family\" and has continued to work hard and release goodwill to promote exchanges and cooperation in various fields such as cross-Strait personnel exchanges and tourism. We will continue to promote travel related work for mainland residents to Kinmen and actively respond to the expectations and calls of the Taiwanese people and the tourism industry.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Henan Daily \"Top News\"","Regarding \"whether Taiwanese farmers should give up the mainland market,\" the Democratic Progressive Party authorities stated that they \"have been working hard to help expand overseas markets that are stable and free from political interference.\" Any comments on this?","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and continue to pursue \"independence\" provocations. They use the \"decoupling and disconnection\" of the cross-strait economy as a bargaining chip in economic and trade negotiations with the United States and a pledge of loyalty to the United States. They hinder the normal flow of cross-strait agricultural trade, compress the development space of Taiwan's agriculture, and harm the vital interests of Taiwan's farmers.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have similar dietary structures and eating habits. The mainland has always been an important export destination for Taiwan's agricultural products, and it has always been the best choice for Taiwanese farmers and Taiwan-funded agricultural enterprises to take root and develop.\nAdhering to the concept of \"one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait\", we have taken a series of measures such as expanding access to varieties and implementing tariff reductions and exemptions, and have successively introduced a large number of special policies and measures that benefit Taiwan's farmers and agricultural enterprises, and have effectively enhanced the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. We welcome more Taiwanese, agricultural, and Taiwanese enterprises to come to the mainland to invest and start business, share opportunities, and seek common development.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Taiwan’s China Times","KMT Chairman Cheng Li-wun is about to visit the mainland. When will the mainland arrange for her to meet with General Secretary Xi Jinping? As the Taiwan Strait has long been regarded as a factor of regional instability, what message does the mainland hope this invitation will send to the outside world? Can we expect exchanges between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party to return to normal? Taiwan will hold…","I will comprehensively answer a series of questions you raised.\nWe attach great importance to the visit of the Chinese Kuomintang delegation led by Chairman Cheng Li-wun and will make appropriate arrangements for various activities.\nThe Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang led a delegation to visit the mainland again after 10 years. It is an important part of the exchanges and dialogue between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party under the new situation. It meets the needs of the development of cross-Strait relations, the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, and the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation. Strengthening exchanges and dialogue between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party will have an important positive impact on maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and promoting the peaceful development of cross-strait relations. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with Taiwan's political parties, groups, and people from all walks of life, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to strengthen exchanges and interactions, maintain positive interactions, and jointly promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and benefit compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nWanting peace, development, exchanges and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan society. I believe that political parties and politicians who comply with public opinion and do what they should will win the recognition and support of the Taiwanese people.\nBoth sides of the Taiwan Strait are Chinese and one family. Cross-strait affairs are family affairs of compatriots on both sides of the strait, and of course they should be handled through consultation among family members. Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are fully intelligent and capable of solving their own affairs, protecting and building their own homes.\nTaiwan’s “China Television” News Reporter:\nFirst question, please introduce the relevant arrangements for KMT Chairman Cheng Li-wun’s visit to the mainland. What outcomes are expected to be achieved? The second question is regarding the Penghu-registered fishing boat \"Dajinman 8\", which was suspected of being detained for illegally selling oil in mainland waters. Please introduce the current situation.\nZhang Han:\nThe first question. The Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and General Secretary Xi Jinping invited Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun to lead a delegation to visit, which will point the way, open up a broad space and inject strong impetus for the development of relations between the two parties and cross-Strait relations in the right direction. It reflects the responsibility of the two parties to seek peace in the Taiwan Strait, benefit our compatriots, and seek rejuvenation for the nation. We have always adhered to the concept of \"one family across the Taiwan Strait\" and will continue to support and promote cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields, enhance the family ties and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and realize the yearning of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait for a better life.\nSecond question. Relevant departments are verifying the situation.\nReporter from Taiwan Dongsen New Media ETtoday:\nAfter the news of Cheng Li-wun's visit to the mainland was announced, a spokesperson for the US State Department said, \"Meaningful cross-strait exchanges should focus on precondition-free dialogue between mainland leaders and Taiwan's democratically elected government. This also includes interactions between the mainland and other Taiwanese political parties; the United States supports cross-strait dialogue and expects the two sides to resolve differences through peaceful means, without coercion, and in a manner acceptable to the people on both sides.\" Any comment on this?\nZhang Han:\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. Both sides of the Taiwan Strait are Chinese and one family. Of course, cross-strait matters should be discussed and handled by family members. Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are fully intelligent and capable of solving their own affairs, protecting and building their own homes.\nHistory and reality have proven that as long as we adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" the Taiwan Strait will be peaceful and stable, and Taiwan compatriots will benefit; otherwise, the Taiwan Strait will be tense and turbulent, and the interests of Taiwan compatriots will be harmed. On the basis of the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with Taiwan's political parties, groups and people from all walks of life, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to strengthen exchanges and interactions, maintain positive interactions, and seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, welfare for our compatriots, and rejuvenation for the nation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","\"United Daily News\"","Regarding whether cross-Strait religious exchanges can help both sides understand each other, the Mainland Affairs Council said that the crux of the cross-Strait issue is not whether they understand each other, but rather their different understandings of \"political systems and happy lives.\" Any comments on this?","Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait share the same roots, culture and race. Chinese culture is the root and belonging of the souls of the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. It is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to enhance understanding, deepen understanding, get closer, and create a future together through cross-Strait exchanges in various fields, including religion and folk beliefs. It has long played an important and positive role in the development of cross-Strait relations.\nOut of their pursuit of \"independence\" and their own selfish interests, the DPP authorities have repeatedly used institutional differences as an excuse to interfere and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges in all fields. They are afraid that the \"information cocoon\" they have carefully built will be broken, and their attempts to deceive the world and separate the two sides will go bankrupt. The people on the island are seeing this more and more clearly, and they are becoming more and more disgusted with the despicable behavior of the DPP authorities.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station CCTV's \"Cross the Strait\"","Regarding former People's Party Chairman Ke Wenzhe being sentenced to 17 years in prison and deprived of public rights for six years in the first instance, the Mainland Affairs Council said that Taiwan's judicial cases are tried independently by judicial organs, \"without pointing fingers from the mainland, let alone taking the opportunity to gain benefits from the united front.\" According to an online poll…","In order to seek political self-interest, the DPP authorities have blindly manipulated the judiciary to suppress and persecute political dissidents. Their perverse actions have aroused opposition from more and more people on the island. Right and wrong are in the heart of the people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on April 1, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalists, good morning. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask questions.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","the People's Political Consultative Conference","Regarding the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council's statement that \"after peaceful reunification, we will assist Taiwan in building a high-speed rail around the island and an east-west expressway,\" etc., the Mainland Affairs Council said, \"Relevant discussions mostly focus on material interests and have limited appeal to Taiwanese society. The differences between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait cannot…","All our efforts to promote the development of cross-Strait relations are aimed at enhancing the family ties and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and realizing their yearning for a better life. National reunification is an unstoppable historical trend. Peaceful reunification will create huge opportunities for Taiwan's economic and social development and bring tangible benefits to Taiwan compatriots. This is the biggest attraction. The earlier reunification is achieved, the better it will be for Taiwan's development and the better life for Taiwan compatriots.\nFor the selfish interests of one party, the DPP authorities stubbornly pursue \"independence\" and refuse reunification, which will only deprive the Taiwanese people of their right to pursue a better life. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will actively participate in the just cause of promoting the reunification of the motherland and build our common homeland into a better place.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","According to reports, after years of joint efforts by both sides of the Taiwan Strait, before this year’s Tomb Sweeping Day, the ashes of several victims on Taiwan’s hidden fronts returned to the mainland and their souls returned to their hometowns. Any comments on this?","Tomb Sweeping Day is a traditional festival for the Chinese nation to be careful about the end and pursue the future. Remember the history, honor the martyrs, and inspire the future. The people and history will never forget the heroic deeds of people with lofty ideals. Their ideals, beliefs and willpower will surely inspire compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits to work tirelessly to complete the great cause of reunification of the motherland at an early date and realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.\nNew media reporters from China Central Radio and Television Station's \"Look at Taihai\" and \"Sun and Moon Tantian\":\nLai Ching-te recently said that Taiwan has been integrated into the \"non-red supply chain\" led by the United States, which can ensure Taiwan's competitive advantage in the future. However, public opinion on the island believes that Taiwan should be deeply integrated into the mainland's robotics industry chain in fields such as chips to seize the opportunities of the times. More and more Taiwanese people realize that embracing the mainland is a must, and \"anti-China and anti-China\" will only be pushed further and further away. Any comments on this?\nZhang Han:\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities claim to build the so-called \"non-red supply chain\", which is nothing more than giving away Taiwan's industries to realize its plot of \"relying on foreign countries for independence.\" Cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation is mutually beneficial and has brought tangible benefits to Taiwan compatriots. More and more Taiwan compatriots have seen the convenience and opportunities brought by cross-Strait integrated development.\nThis year is the first year of the “15th Five-Year Plan”. During the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, we will promote the in-depth integration of technological innovation and industrial innovation, create new situations in optimizing and upgrading traditional industries, cultivating and strengthening emerging industries, and planning future industries in advance. This will certainly open up a broader space for cross-strait industrial cooperation and provide more opportunities for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies.\nWe have always adhered to the concept of \"Two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family\", deepened cross-Strait exchanges, cooperation, and integrated development, so that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can share the fruits and opportunities of Chinese-style modernization. We also welcome Taiwan compatriots to participate in the high-quality development of the mainland and jointly strengthen the Chinese national economy.\nReporter from Shanghai \"The Paper\":\nRecently, Zhuo Rongtai, the head of Taiwan's administrative agency, said that \"Taiwan's food safety is a world standard, not a Chinese standard\" when accepting a question about \"China's imported pork must never be fed with clenbuterol but Taiwan cannot\". Any comments on this?\nZhang Han:\nWe put people and life first when it comes to food safety. We adhere to the strictest food safety standards on the issue of clenbuterol and strictly prohibit the import of any pork containing clenbuterol to effectively protect people's life safety and health.\nIn order to pursue the selfish interests of the party, the DPP authorities did not hesitate to \"kneel to the United States and betray Taiwan\" at the expense of the life safety and health of Taiwan compatriots. Against the will of the Taiwanese people, they insisted on opening up the import of American pork containing ractopamine, triggering public outrage and opposition from the people on the island. The successive incidents of US pork \"origin laundering\" on the island, and the winning of lawsuits by relevant counties and cities to ban \"lai pig\" from entering school meals, fully demonstrate that the DPP authorities' actions are unpopular, and they should make a responsible explanation to the people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Shanghai Oriental TV","Taiwanese media reported that due to the war in the Middle East, Taiwan's oil supply has been tight, which has also impacted the plastic raw material market. Therefore, there has been a \"plastic rush\" on the island recently, and there may be a \"drug shortage\" in the future. Public opinion on the island pointed out that in the face of these difficulties, the DPP authorities would only say that \"the oil and gas…","The DPP authorities’ so-called “oil and gas supply is secure” is nothing but self-comfort for the “inability of oil and gas supply”, and it is also a fool and deception to the public. The DPP authorities are powerless to deal with the crisis of people's livelihood on the island and will only blindly avoid it. All walks of life in Taiwan have long been strongly dissatisfied with this.\nAfter peaceful reunification, the two sides of the Taiwan Strait will be interconnected and fully connected. The mainland's complete industrial system and stable market supply capacity will become the most solid reliance of Taiwan compatriots, which can fully make up for Taiwan's shortages in crude oil, natural gas, industrial raw materials, etc. No matter how turbulent the external situation is, we can provide timely guarantees for Taiwan's energy resource security and industrial production materials supply. Taiwan compatriots no longer need to worry about shortages of various energy sources and materials.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","People's Daily","Fujian recently released the first batch of landmark results for the construction of a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone, covering three major categories: policies, projects, and platforms. Please introduce the relevant situation. What are the plans for the next step in promoting the construction of the demonstration area?","Since the release of the \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring New Roads for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zones\", the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the National Development and Reform Commission and other departments and Fujian Province have conscientiously implemented the implementation and strengthened policy and institutional innovation. The demonstration effect of the Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone has gradually emerged and its influence has been increasingly expanded, and the construction of the demonstration zone has made phased progress.\nRecently, Fujian Province released the first batch of landmark results for the construction of a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone. Among them, there are 7 policy achievements, including the initial formation of a policy system for the construction of a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone; a number of Fujian and Taiwan enterprises and corporate brands in the Jin and Ma regions were rated as \"time-honored brands\"; the variety of commodities in Taiwan's small commodity trading market has been expanded; There are 5 project-related achievements, including the \"mini three links\" that have resumed normal operation after the epidemic; Fujian has added 8 new Taiwanese farmers' entrepreneurial parks to achieve province-wide coverage; introduced mainland China's first special local regulations related to Taiwan in the cultural field; Fujian's water supply project to Kinmen has become a model for cross-strait cooperation in the field of people's livelihood; and built the largest iron ore transfer port and storage and transportation base from mainland China to Taiwan. There are 5 platform achievements, including the creation of a digital \"first home\" service platform for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises; the Straits Forum has become the largest and most widely participated cross-strait non-governmental exchange event; the establishment of a \"one city, one product\" ancestral land and Taiwan faith and cultural exchange brand system; the first joint establishment of a provincial baseball team between Fujian and Taiwan to achieve success in the National Games; the establishment of a \"Cross-Strait Professional Qualification Integrated Service Center\", etc.\nDuring the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the National Development and Reform Commission will continue to work with relevant departments to thoroughly implement General Secretary Xi Jinping's important expositions on Taiwan work, the Party's overall strategy for solving the Taiwan issue in the new era, and the Party Central Committee's decision-making and deployment on Taiwan work. They will highlight the promotion of integration, promotion of integration with benefits, and promotion of integration with sentiments. They will promote the construction of demonstration zones with more practical measures, greater efforts, high standards, and high quality, and support Fujian to take greater steps and achieve more development on the new path of exploring integrated development across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station CGTN","In response to Japanese Congressman Keiji Furuya’s bad behavior related to Taiwan, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs recently announced that it will take countermeasures against him. Japan called China's countermeasures \"regrettable.\" Any comment on this?","I would like to emphasize again that the Taiwan issue is at the core of China's core interests and an insurmountable red line. Keiji Furuya blatantly interfered in China's internal affairs on the Taiwan issue and seriously violated China's sovereignty and territorial integrity. China's countermeasures to this end are reasonable and legal. Japan should deeply reflect on history, learn historical lessons, earnestly reflect on and correct mistakes, abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and must not condone anyone or any force in provoking trouble on the Taiwan issue.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Fujian Southeast TV","Recently, Columbia University professor Jeffrey Sachs once again made it clear in an interview with Taiwanese media that \"it is a very dangerous mistake to believe that the United States will 'protect' Taiwan.\" This warning echoes the growing \"suspicious theory\" on the island. Any comments on this?","Currently, many foreign experts and scholars are publicly speaking out, expressing concern and criticism about the Democratic Progressive Party authorities' flattery and provocation towards Taiwan, which harms the interests of the Taiwanese people and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. These rational voices have also received a lot of attention and support.\nThe future of Taiwan and the safety, security, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots have always been tied to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and the reunification of the motherland. More and more people in Taiwan realize that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end and outsiders cannot be trusted. The DPP authorities' \"relying on the United States and seeking independence\" cannot buy security and protection, and will eventually become an \"abandoned son\", which will bring disaster to the present and endless harm.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Hong Kong Phoenix TV","Recently, Raymond Greene, director of the Taipei Office of the American Institute in Taiwan, encouraged Taiwan to overcome political differences and pass a \"special defense budget\" as soon as possible to respond to President Trump's expectation that \"defense spending should account for 5%.\" Lai Ching-te also advocated that \"now is the moment when Taiwan and the U.S. economy are most closely connected.\" Any…","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and does not tolerate any external interference. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, be cautious in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue, stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and stop interfering in China's internal affairs.\nIn pursuit of \"independence\" self-interest, the Lai Ching-te administration continues to increase the defense budget and is willing to act as a \"cash machine\" for American arms dealers. In the face of blatant plunder by external forces, not only did they not resist, but they actively catered to it and even deliberately beautified it, deceiving the public opinion and people on the island. Their intentions were sinister and their actions were shameful. Lai Qingde's authorities \"use force to seek independence\" and take desperate risks will only dig their own graves.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-01","Zhang Han","Xinhua News Agency","Recently, Chairman Qiu Chuizheng of the Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council stated that the mainland's policy towards Taiwan \"high-quality promotion of cross-strait integrated development\" is intended to integrate Taiwanese compatriots into their lives through institutionalization, and by providing equal treatment to induce Taiwanese companies and funds to integrate into its industrial supply chain, creating the…","The Taiwanese people are our flesh and blood compatriots. For a long time, we have adhered to the concept of \"one family across the Taiwan Strait\", actively promoted cross-Strait economic and cultural exchanges and cooperation, deepened integrated development in all fields across the Taiwan Strait, implemented the policy of equal treatment for Taiwan compatriots, and continuously achieved new progress and new results. We have fully demonstrated our goodwill to benefit Taiwan compatriots and our sincerity in promoting the peaceful and integrated development of cross-Strait relations, and have received high support and widespread praise from Taiwan compatriots.\nOut of its \"Taiwan independence\" nature, the DPP authorities are afraid that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will come closer to each other and deliberately incite cross-Strait confrontation. They will blindly slander, smear, and obstruct everything that is conducive to developing cross-Strait relations and benefiting compatriots on both sides. It is unpopular and will not succeed.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260401_12758538.htm","",1,0,5,""],[0,"2026-04-07","Mao Ning","AFP","Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Zheng Liwen visited the mainland a month before Trump's visit to China. It is reported that the issue of US arms sales to Taiwan will be discussed during the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States. Will President Xi Jinping meet with Cheng Li-wun? Will it talk about arms sales to Taiwan?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. Cross-Strait relations are not a diplomatic issue. China's position against US-Taiwan military ties is consistent and clear.","台湾问题是中国内政。两岸关系不是外交问题。中方反对美台军事联系的立场是一贯和明确的。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260407_11887704.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260407_11887644.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-08","Mao Ning","Hubei Radio and Television","According to reports, the United Nations Security Council voted on the 7th to vote on a draft resolution involving the Strait of Hormuz proposed by Bahrain. China and Russia voted against and exercised their veto power, and the draft was not passed. However, the permanent representatives of China and Russia to the United Nations said that the two countries have proposed a new Security Council draft resolution on…","Regarding the draft resolution on the Strait of Hormuz that the Security Council has just voted on, China's Permanent Representative to the United Nations has clarified China's position in his explanatory speech. China maintains that the sovereignty, security and territorial integrity of Gulf countries should be fully respected, and the safety of waterways and energy infrastructure should be guaranteed. The fundamental reason for the obstruction of navigation in the Strait of Hormuz is the illegal military actions of the United States and Israel against Iran. The fundamental solution to the navigation problem in the Strait of Hormuz is to cease fire and end the war as soon as possible. The actions of the Security Council should be aimed at slowing down the situation and cooling down the situation. It should not cover unauthorized military operations with a legal veneer, give a pass for the use of force, let alone add fuel to the fire and escalate the conflict. China's voting stance is objective and fair and can stand the test of history.\nThe draft resolution on the Strait of Hormuz issue jointly proposed by Russia and China has been officially circulated to members of the Security Council. The content of this draft is objective and fair. It is committed to easing tensions, calling for dialogue and negotiation, and safeguarding navigation rights and freedoms. It is in line with the expectations of the international community and I believe it will be supported by all parties. China is willing to continue to work with relevant parties to make unremitting efforts to ease the situation and restore peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and the Middle East as soon as possible.","关于安理会刚刚表决的霍尔木兹海峡问题决议草案，中国常驻联合国代表已经在解释性发言中阐明了中方立场。中方主张，海湾国家的主权、安全和领土完整应得到充分尊重，航道以及能源基础设施安全应得到保障。霍尔木兹海峡通航受阻的根本原因是美国和以色列对伊朗的非法军事行动。解决霍尔木兹海峡通航问题的根本之策是尽快停火止战。安理会的行动应着眼于缓局降温，不能给未经授权的军事行动披上合法外衣，不能给使用武力开通行证，更不能火上浇油，导致冲突升级。中方的投票立场客观公正，经得起历史的检验。\n俄中共同提出的霍尔木兹海峡问题决议草案已正式向安理会成员散发。这一草案内容客观公正，致力于缓和紧张局势、呼吁对话谈判、维护航行权利与自由，符合国际社会期待，相信将得到各方支持。中方愿继续同有关各方一道，为推动局势尽快缓和降温、恢复海峡和中东地区和平稳定作出不懈努力。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260408_11888565.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260408_11888456.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Beijing Daily","The AI short film \"Rescuing the Fox in the Snowy Mountains\" became a hit in the mainland and then spread to Taiwan. \"Have you ever saved a fox in the snowy mountains?\" has become a buzzword on major social platforms on the island. Netizens and well-known artists have carried out various forms of secondary creation. Any comment on this?","The interesting and interesting creation and communication methods are loved and spread by netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which shows that the Chinese cultural genes of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are of the same origin, and they are naturally connected and highly sympathetic in terms of cultural aesthetics and taste expression. The rapid development of artificial intelligence technology in mainland China has provided new tools and new space for netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to express their creativity and innovation, stimulating enthusiasm and vitality for co-creation. We are happy to see netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait use new technologies to carry out lively and interesting creative expressions and interactions, and we are happy to see compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have more exchanges, frequent exchanges, and common development.\nNew media reporters from China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Sun and Moon Tan Tian” and “Watching Taiwan Strait”:\nThe United States will impose 100% high tariffs on imported drugs. Although the Democratic Progressive Party authorities claim to have obtained preferential treatment, Taiwan is not mentioned in the list of tariff preferences listed by the United States. Any comment on this?\nZhu Fenglian:\nThe United States always pursues \"America First\" and only cares about \"American interests.\" More and more facts have made the Taiwanese people realize that the United States' plundering does not make any sense, and the DPP authorities' servility cannot buy any mercy. The so-called \"preferential treatment\" of the DPP authorities is actually the bullying and oppression of Taiwan by the United States. It is the DPP authorities' flattery and sincerity at the expense of Taiwan's economy. It conceals the DPP's evil intention of \"relying on the United States and seeking independence.\"","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Recently, the US CNN reported that military pressure in the Taiwan Strait has intensified, which has led some Taiwanese people to pay attention to inquiries about emigrating overseas and planning to move assets overseas. In response, some politicians from the Democratic Progressive Party said, \"Only by preparing for war can we stop war, and we appeal to the people to prioritize protecting Taiwan.\" Any comment on…","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and collude with external forces to carry out \"independence\" provocations, resulting in tense and turbulent situations across the Taiwan Strait. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities have engaged in \"war preparations for independence\" and \"all people as soldiers\", tying the people onto the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist chariot, which is why the Taiwanese people are so worried. It must be pointed out that only by adhering to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\" can peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait be effectively guaranteed and Taiwan compatriots can live a good life.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Hong Kong China Review Press","Recently, Taiwan’s agricultural department stated that Taiwan’s commitment not to impose special defensive measures (SSG) tariffs on U.S. agricultural products has been assessed to have limited impact on the island’s industries. This has triggered widespread concern among the island's agricultural community that the influx of U.S. agricultural products will severely impact the island's chicken, pork, beef and…","In the face of U.S. economic bullying, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have blindly compromised and flattered, allowing it to take whatever it wants, turning Taiwan into a dumping ground for U.S. agricultural products. This will inevitably severely impact Taiwan's agricultural products market, affect the income of Taiwan's farmers and fishermen, and will inevitably arouse concerns among the island's agricultural community and consumers. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities have no bottom line in \"kneeling against the United States and betraying Taiwan\". It harms the interests of the Taiwanese people and sacrifices the future of Taiwan's agriculture.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Recently, the \"Joint Statement\" issued after Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi held talks with French President Macron emphasized the importance of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and urged the peaceful resolution of cross-strait issues through constructive dialogue. Taiwan’s foreign affairs department expressed its gratitude. Any comment on this?","Solving the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people themselves and does not tolerate any external interference. We are firmly opposed to the so-called \"Joint Statement\" making irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan issue and interfering in China's internal affairs. Relevant countries should abide by the one-China principle and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" forces. The DPP authorities' attempt to rely on external forces to split the country is doomed to fail.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","\"Shangguan News\" of Liberation Daily","Recently, Taiwan's \"maritime committee chairman\" Guan Biling said that mainland official ships continue to \"harass\" Taiwan's main island and outlying islands, which \"is not only sorry to the people on both sides of the strait\", but also does not help improve cross-strait relations. Any comment on this?","The relevant remarks are completely contrary to the facts and are purely malicious smear and hype. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and deliberately seek \"independence\" provocations. This is the source of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait. Taiwan is part of China. Mainland China Coast Guard and other departments carry out law enforcement and inspections in relevant sea areas to maintain normal navigation and operating order and protect the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. This is legitimate and legal, and is welcomed by fishermen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Chengdu Commercial Daily \"Red Star News\"","Taiwanese media reported that junior high school students in New Taipei City recently posted five-star red flags at school, wrote \"Long Live China\", \"Unify Taiwan\" and other words, and shouted slogans in the classroom. The New Taipei City Education Bureau stated that the school had removed the poster and that the matter was an individual student's behavior. It had intervened to understand and provide counseling…","Achieving motherland reunification and national rejuvenation is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. More and more Taiwan compatriots, including young people, realize that the two sides of the Taiwan Strait must and will be reunified. This is a historical trend that the DPP authorities cannot stop.\nTaiwan TVBS reporter:\nAccording to reports, KMT Chairman Zheng Liwen is expected to go to Beijing on the 9th and asked the spokesperson to introduce the Beijing visit itinerary. Will General Secretary Xi Jinping meet with Cheng Li-wun on the 10th? What is the current progress of relevant arrangements?\nZhu Fenglian:\nWe attach great importance to the visit of the Chinese Kuomintang delegation led by Chairman Zheng Liwen. Proper arrangements will be made for the delegation's various itineraries during their stay in Jiangsu, Shanghai and Beijing.\nZhu Fenglian:\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Lai Ching-te recently said that the United States has become Taiwan’s largest foreign investment destination and export market, and Taiwan’s investment in the mainland has dropped to 3.7%. Taiwan will continue to deepen cooperation with the United States to maintain the security of the global supply chain. Any comment on this?","Out of one-party political self-interest, the Lai Ching-te administration continues to betray the United States in an attempt to promote the \"decoupling and disconnection\" of the cross-strait economy, harming the island's industries and the interests and well-being of the people. His bold talk of \"deepening cooperation with the United States and maintaining the security of the global supply chain\" is essentially \"relying on the United States and selling Taiwan,\" which further exposes his deliberate and unscrupulous efforts to \"rely on foreign countries for independence.\"\nAccording to statistics from the General Administration of Customs, in the first two months of this year, the total cross-strait trade maintained a steady growth momentum, reaching 52.54 billion US dollars, of which mainland exports to Taiwan increased by 28.1%, and mainland imports from Taiwan increased by 19%. This fully shows that the cross-Strait economies cannot be decoupled or broken, and deepening cross-Strait integrated development is in line with the common interests of compatriots on both sides and the laws of the market. The Lai Ching-te administration's attempt to undermine cross-Strait economic ties is unpopular and will not succeed.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Xinhua News Agency","Regarding KMT Chairman Cheng Li-wun leading a delegation to visit the mainland, a spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council previously stated that cross-strait affairs are family matters and should be handled by family members through consultation. The Mainland Affairs Council said that the mainland's statement highlighted its intention to \"anti-intervention\" and \"domesticize cross-strait…","Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to the same China, are all Chinese, and are one family. Cross-strait affairs are family affairs of compatriots on both sides of the strait, and should be handled by family members through consultation. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have sufficient wisdom and ability to solve their own problems. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with various political parties, groups and individuals in Taiwan, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, benefit our compatriots, and seek rejuvenation for the nation. Out of their own selfish interests of \"Taiwan independence\", the DPP authorities have slandered and smeared Taiwan, which is unpopular.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","China News Service","Recently, the Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council called on the mainland to lift the restrictions unilaterally imposed since April 2020 and resume mainland students from coming to Taiwan to study for degrees. It said that mainland students have always been welcome to come to Taiwan. Due to mainland policy restrictions, the number of mainland freshmen coming to Taiwan for five consecutive years has been zero, and the…","This statement is simply confusing right and wrong, spreading rumors and smearing China. In recent years, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have obstructed cross-Strait exchanges and ignored the strong wishes of Taiwan’s education sector and young students to participate in cross-Strait exchanges. They have also exerted extreme control and suppression on cross-Strait educational exchanges and cooperation. On the one hand, the DPP authorities have banned exchanges and cooperation between colleges and universities on the island and 10 universities including Jinan University and Beijing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics. They have used various excuses to obstruct educational exchanges and cooperation among universities, middle schools and primary schools across the Taiwan Strait. They have also imposed various unreasonable restrictions on mainland students studying in Taiwan and adopted various unfair treatments. On the other hand, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have intensified \"green terror\" against some presidents, deans, and teachers of Taiwan universities who come to the mainland for exchanges by \"checking water meters,\" cutting funding, and blocking projects. These political manipulations seriously undermine the normal development of cross-strait educational exchanges. The DPP authorities are advised to listen more to the opinions of the people on the island and less resort to shirk-shifting tactics.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Zhejiang Daily \"Chao News\"","The mainland motorcycle brand \"Zhang Xue Motorcycle\" won the championship in the World Superbike Championship, triggering heated discussions among netizens on the island. They all believed that the mainland's manufacturing quality has reached the world's first-class level, which greatly enhances the aspirations of the Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The industries on both sides of the Taiwan…","As you can see, more and more excellent mainland brands and products such as robots, drones, new energy vehicles, and motorcycles are constantly going global, attracting global attention, gaining widespread recognition, and becoming the first choice of consumers. Relying on a complete industrial system and deep industrial foundation, mainland manufacturing continues to create new records. During the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, we will continue to promote high-quality development and build a modern industrial system with advanced manufacturing as the backbone. The mainland is a hot spot for innovative entrepreneurs, opening up a broader space for cross-strait industrial cooperation. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises to take root in the mainland for development, deepen cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, integrate development, and jointly strengthen the Chinese national economy.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Nanfang Daily, Nanfang+","The Sixth China International Consumer Goods Expo will be held in Haikou, Hainan. Please introduce the participation of Taiwanese companies in this expo.","The 6th China International Consumer Goods Expo will be held in Haikou City, Hainan Province from April 13th to 18th. It is understood that this year’s Consumer Expo will set up a Taiwan-specific exhibition area for the first time, and 20 Taiwanese companies will bring high-quality products such as unique cultural and creative products, biotechnology and health, fashionable goods, and selected gourmet foods. The mainland market with a population of more than 1.4 billion is large enough and is the most potential consumer market in the world. We welcome more high-quality Taiwanese products to enter the mainland market, and will continue to build more market-oriented and professional platforms for Taiwanese businessmen and enterprises to share mainland development opportunities and take root in mainland development.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","People's Daily","Regarding Zheng Liwen's delegation's visit to the mainland, according to a YouTube poll, 60% of netizens believe that this visit will have a positive impact on this year's Lanying County mayoral election and will have a bonus effect. Any comment on this?","Chairman Cheng Li-wun led the Chinese Kuomintang delegation to visit the mainland and carried out dialogue and exchanges on the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\". It complied with the mainstream public opinion on the island that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation. It is of great significance to promoting the peaceful development of cross-strait relations and safeguarding the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots, and will be recognized and supported by the Taiwanese people.\nFujian Radio and Television's \"Taiwan Strait Moment\" new media reporter:\nDuring the Qingming Festival, many Taiwan compatriots cross the Taiwan Straits to visit various parts of the mainland to worship their ancestors and reunite with relatives and friends. Please introduce the relevant situation.\nZhu Fenglian:\nIt is the fine tradition of the Chinese nation to be careful about pursuing the past, respect our ancestors and love our hometown. During the Qingming Festival holiday, many Taiwanese compatriots participated in worship activities on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Some came to Shaanxi to participate in the Qingming Festival ceremony of Xuanyuan Huangdi in Bingwu (2026), and expressed their admiration and gratitude to Xuanyuan Huangdi, the founder of Chinese humanity, with their mainland compatriots; some returned to their ancestral home in the mainland to carry out activities such as visiting their ancestors, tracing their roots, and bonding with relatives, fully embodying the idea that \"cross-straits are one family.\" Here, I will focus on several clan worship activities that will be held in Fujian.\nFrom April 10th to 11th, more than 40 people from the Huang Clan Association in Miaoli County, Taiwan will go to Nanping Shaowu to pay homage to their ancestors. Huang clan members from both places will jointly worship the Huang Qiao Gong, review the Huang Qiao family tradition and family motto, and continue the blood and family ties.\nOn April 12, the Chen family's ancestor worship event in Fengshan, Chiayi, Taiwan will be held in Nan'an City, Quanzhou. More than 200 folks from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including more than 70 Taiwanese compatriots, will participate in activities such as ancestor worship, genealogy docking, and clan friendships.\nOn April 17, the 2026 \"Mazu from all over the world returns to her natal home\" event will be launched on Meizhou Island in Putian. Representatives of nearly a hundred Mazu cultural institutions, including more than 60 Taiwanese Mazu cultural groups, and nearly 10,000 guests will visit Mazu and pray for peace. On the day of the event, the \"Hometown of Mazu·Youth Vision\" Putai College Youth Meizhou Island Image Creation Camp will be held. Young students from more than 10 colleges and universities on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will gather in Meizhou to carry out a short video creation competition.\nIn addition, the 10th Pingtan Cross-Strait Employee Cycling Race and the 6th Cross-Strait Employee Cycling Tour will be held in Pingtan, Fujian from April 18th to 19th, and are expected to attract more than 1,000 athletes from both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The track of this event integrates Pingtan Coastal Road, island fishing villages and other unique scenery. Athletes will enjoy the beautiful scenery of the island during racing competitions and leisure cycling, experience the fun of riding, and enhance the friendship between compatriots.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on April 8, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Good morning, everyone, and welcome to the press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Now start asking questions.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-08","Zhu Fenglian","Xiamen TV, Fujian","According to reports, during the Qingming Festival, the \"Little Three Links\" passenger routes ushered in the peak of Taiwanese compatriots returning home to worship their ancestors. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The \"Little Three Links\" passenger route is one of the most important and convenient channels for people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to communicate with each other, especially those from Fujian and Taiwan. During the Tomb-Sweeping Day holiday, the \"small three links\" passenger routes experienced peak passenger flow. Relevant port units strengthened passenger service guarantees, strengthened organization and dispatch, opened up \"green channels\", and ensured that \"small three links\" passenger ships would travel first. The \"Family Fun\" channel for customs clearance at Xiajin's \"Little Three Links\" port and the convenient and exclusive channel for \"oversized luggage\" are open at all times; the \"Little Three Links\" port at Fuma has added 6 round-trip boat trips to meet the travel needs of passengers; the \"Little Three Links\" port at Quanjin, in conjunction with the Fujian-Taiwan Marriage Museum, carried out the \"Qingming Festival Root Searching, Cross-Strait Origins\" activities at the port site and held a Fujian and Taiwan Root Searching Cultural Exhibition to strengthen the emotional resonance of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. According to statistics, from April 1 to 6, the \"small three links\" route carried a total of 34,100 passengers, a year-on-year increase of 9.49%.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family. We welcome more Taiwanese folks to come to the mainland through the \"mini three links\" route to trace their roots and worship their ancestors, visit relatives and friends, and exchange and cooperate.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260408_12759515.htm","",1,0,5,""],[1,"2026-04-09","Zhang Xiaogang","Reporter","Recently, the world's largest cargo drone, CY-8, successfully completed its maiden flight. Some people in Taiwan claimed that it may become the PLA's new \"aircraft carrier killer\". In addition, the PLA's achievement in unmanned combat system has drawn widespread attention from the island, with many believing it will enhance the PLA's capabilities to deter and strike separatist forces seeking \"Taiwan…","Taiwan is China's Taiwan. No one is more committed to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait than we are. We will never allow anyone or any force to separate Taiwan from China by any means. The PLA will develop more diversified means in countering separatist activities and external interference to resolutely smash any separatist illusions for \"Taiwan independence\", and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/D_251802/index.html","",2,1,3,""],[0,"2026-04-10","Mao Ning","Japan Broadcasting Association","The Japanese government released its annual document \"Diplomatic Blue Book\" today, in which the description of China was downgraded from \"one of the most important bilateral relations\" last year to \"an important neighbor.\" What is China’s comment on this?","The root cause of the current situation in Sino-Japanese relations lies in Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi's Taiwan-related fallacies, which breach of trust undermined the political foundation of Sino-Japanese relations and challenged the post-war international order. Japan should abide by the four political documents between China and Japan and the commitments it has made, reflect on and correct mistakes, and take practical actions to safeguard the political foundation of China-Japan relations.","中日关系当前局面的根源在于日本首相高市早苗发表涉台谬论，背信弃义损害中日关系政治基础，挑战战后国际秩序。日方应当恪守中日四个政治文件和自身所作承诺，反思纠错，以实际行动维护中日关系政治基础。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260410_11890053.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260410_11889948.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-14","Guo Jiakun","China News Service","This afternoon, a spokesman for the South Korean Ministry of Foreign Affairs stated that the South Korean government, through the 1992 Joint Statement on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between South Korea and China and the subsequent South Korea-China Joint Statement, has continued to confirm China’s position that there is only one China and that Taiwan is part of China, and emphasized that the…","We would like to reiterate that the Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations between China and South Korea clearly stipulates that the Government of the Republic of Korea recognizes the Government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China and respects China's position that there is only one China and that Taiwan is part of China. When President Lee Jae-myung accepted exclusive interviews with Chinese media and paid a state visit to China at the beginning of this year, he made it clear that he respected the one-China position.\nTaiwan is part of China, so it is natural to label it as \"Taiwan, China\". China's position on the Taiwan issue is clear and consistent. The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is also the political basis for China to establish and develop relations with other countries and relevant organizations around the world, including South Korea. We hope that the South Korean government will fully realize that the Taiwan issue is related to the national sentiments of more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, adhere to the relevant spirit of the joint communique on the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and South Korea, abide by the one-China principle, resist and oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence,\" and work with China to take practical actions to promote the healthy and stable development of China-South Korea relations.","我们愿重申，中韩建交联合公报明确规定，大韩民国政府承认中华人民共和国政府为中国的唯一合法政府，并尊重中方只有一个中国、台湾是中国的一部分之立场。李在明总统今年年初接受中国媒体专访以及对中国进行国事访问时，都明确表示尊重一个中国的立场。\n台湾是中国的一部分，标注为“中国台湾”理所当然。中方在台湾问题上的立场是明确的、一贯的。一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，也是中国与包括韩国在内的世界各国和有关组织建立和发展关系的政治基础。我们希望韩国政府充分认识到台湾问题事关14亿多中国人民的民族感情，坚持中韩建交联合公报有关精神，恪守一个中国原则，抵制、反对任何形式的“台独”，同中方一道以实际行动推动中韩关系健康稳定发展。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260414_11891740.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260414_11891610.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Taiwan’s United Daily News","The sixth of the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation is to “study the construction of wharves and berths in qualified areas to serve the berthing of Taiwanese distant-water fishing vessels and the landing of distant-water catches.” Is the \"region\" here a port in mainland China, or does it include overseas ports? The mainland has established multiple offshore fishing overseas…","We have introduced ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, with the aim of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and enhancing the family well-being of our compatriots. Studying the construction of wharves and berths in qualified areas to serve the berthing of Taiwan's distant-water fishing vessels and the landing of distant-water catches is a specific arrangement for us to do practical things and solve problems for Taiwan's fishermen. We care about the production and life of Taiwanese fishermen, and will continue to promote cross-Strait fishery cooperation and create better conditions for the development of Taiwanese fishermen.\nTaiwan’s “China Television” News Reporter:\nRecently, U.S. President Trump threatened to block the Strait of Hormuz, putting global energy supplies under strain. CNN reported in the United States that if Taiwan is blocked by the People's Liberation Army of the People's Republic of China, the supply of electricity, water and chips will be in crisis. Do you have any comment on this?\nChen Binhua:\nThe Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and brooks no comment from outsiders. Relevant reports create panic about the \"China threat\" and peddle anxiety about the Taiwan Strait crisis, with ulterior motives. It must be emphasized that the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and continue to collude with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations. This is the root cause of tension and instability in the Taiwan Strait and is also a \"troublemaker\" for regional peace and stability.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Hong Kong Phoenix TV","Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun recently visited the mainland. Raymond Greene, director of the Taipei Office of the American Institute in Taiwan (AIT), said that the United States' consistent position is to hope for stable cross-strait exchanges. It expects the mainland to maintain communication channels with all political parties in Taiwan, especially the \"democratically elected government\". It also expects the…","Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. As long as they agree with the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" there will be no obstacles for any political party or group in Taiwan to interact with us.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities' collusion with external forces to continuously pursue \"independence\" provocations is the root cause of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait. Some people in the United States are jumping up and down and constantly hyping up the so-called \"mainland threat or military pressure\". They are completely confusing right and wrong and have sinister intentions. It needs to be emphasized that the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and does not allow outsiders to comment. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques and handle the Taiwan issue with caution.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Fujian Southeast TV","The civil aviation side announced that it would once again urge Taiwan to fully resume the normalization of direct air passenger flights across the Taiwan Strait through the Cross-Strait Air Transport Exchange Committee and the Taipei Air Transport Business Association. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Direct air flights across the Taiwan Strait have greatly facilitated the exchanges between people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and played an important role in improving the well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. At present, cross-strait routes have been disrupted by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities, and flights to destinations have not yet fully returned to normal. There are 15 destinations in 14 cities on the mainland, and more than 300 passenger flights are operated every week (counted as 1 round trip). Compared with the mainland's 61 destinations and a maximum of 890 passenger flights per week before 2020, there is still a large gap, which seriously affects the exchanges between compatriots on both sides of the strait. In 2025, there will be more than 5.78 million passengers traveling between the two sides on direct air passenger flights, and the current average passenger load factor on cross-strait routes exceeds 80%. People on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have a very strong voice for the full resumption of direct flights across the Taiwan Strait.\nWe have no policy restrictions on the full resumption of direct air flights across the Taiwan Strait. The crux of the obstacle lies entirely with the DPP authorities. We hope that Taiwan will comply with public opinion and lift unreasonable restrictions on cross-strait air transport as soon as possible, allowing airlines on both sides to independently arrange flight plans based on market demand.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Central Radio and Television Station CCTV's \"Cross the Strait\"","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council explained at a previous press conference that among Taiwan's \"seven better things\" after peaceful reunification, \"energy and resource security will be better\" and \"infrastructure construction will be better\", which attracted great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's explanation for \"After…","One of the main goals of developing cross-Strait relations and realizing the reunification of the motherland is to enable compatriots on both sides of the Strait to live a better life. We have always upheld the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and actively worked on practical matters, done good deeds, and solved problems for our Taiwan compatriots. Peaceful reunification will create huge opportunities for Taiwan's economic and social development, bring tangible benefits to Taiwan compatriots, and create a better future for both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nDuring the \"14th Five-Year Plan\" period, people's livelihood protection on the mainland has been solid and stable. We have won the battle against poverty, historically solved the problem of absolute poverty, and achieved the goal of building a moderately prosperous society in all respects as scheduled. The number of new urban jobs every year has stabilized at more than 12 million, residents' income has grown in step with economic growth, and the world's largest education, medical and social security systems have been built. The people's sense of gain continues to increase, and the common prosperity of all people is steadily advancing. During the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, we will increase efforts to protect and improve people's livelihood, solidly promote the common prosperity of all people, and take new and solid steps in promoting high-quality and full employment and improving the income distribution system.\nAfter peaceful reunification, in terms of people's livelihood, we will promote the sharing of public services and public resources between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, provide more convenience for Taiwan compatriots, make the supply of people's livelihood materials in Taiwan more abundant and richer in variety, people can enjoy more high-quality and low-priced products, and further reduce the cost of production and living. In addition, with the backing of a strong motherland, Taiwan does not need to spend huge amounts on defense. Fiscal and tax revenues can be used to improve people's livelihood and increase funds for annuities, health insurance, labor insurance, etc. Taiwan compatriots will have higher levels of medical care, science, education, culture, sports, and social welfare, and better security.\nIn terms of employment, we will further introduce and implement policies and measures that benefit Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises, implement equal treatment for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises, create better conditions for Taiwanese compatriots to study, work, and live on the mainland, so that Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises can further share the opportunities and fruits of the rapid development of new industries and new business formats on the mainland, and obtain more employment options than on the island. Taiwan's advantageous industries such as integrated circuits and precision machinery can complement mainland industries and \"cooperate to make money all over the world.\" Traditional industries such as agriculture, fishery, and tourism will be revitalized and fully stimulate employment on the island.\nIn terms of housing, we will actively take measures to assist urban renewal and the upgrading of old houses in Taiwan, help solve housing difficulties for young people, disadvantaged groups and other groups, gradually narrow the gap between the rich and the poor, promote common prosperity, and make the living environment of Taiwan compatriots more comfortable.\nIn terms of emergency disaster relief, we will fully support the Taiwan region in improving its disaster prevention, reduction, and relief capabilities, improve its disaster early warning and response mechanism, and provide immediate disaster relief assistance when Taiwan encounters major natural disasters or emergencies such as earthquakes, windstorms, and tsunamis. The mainland's powerful emergency rescue force can be used by Taiwan compatriots. With the backing of a strong motherland, Taiwan's security and development interests will be fully protected, and Taiwan compatriots will have a greater sense of security, gain, and happiness.\nIn short, national reunification is both a great cause and a great benefit. We hope that our compatriots will uphold the great interests of the nation, understand the interests of reunification, and actively participate in the just cause of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and promoting the reunification of the motherland.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Central Radio and Television Station's \"China News\"","Regarding the mainland’s announcement of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities said that many of the measures this time are “united front coercion practices that turn exchanges into tools and weaponize economic and trade.” Any comment on this?","Whenever the mainland introduces measures to benefit Taiwan compatriots, the DPP authorities smear them; they strongly oppose anything that is beneficial to the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. This approach was ridiculed by Taiwanese media as a \"knee-jerk reaction\" and was widely criticized and opposed by all walks of life on the island. We advise the DPP authorities to listen more to the public opinion on the island and do more to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, instead of being enemies of the people and blocking their gains.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Xinhua News Agency","On April 10, General Secretary Xi Jinping met with Zheng Liwen, Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang in Beijing and delivered an important speech. Please explain the spirit of the speech and how will the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council implement it?","On April 10, Xi Jinping, General Secretary of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, met with the Chinese Kuomintang delegation led by Chairman Cheng Li-wen in Beijing and delivered an important speech on promoting relations between the two parties and cross-strait relations. This is the first meeting between the leaders of the two parties in 10 years, opening a new chapter in the exchanges between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party, and is of great significance. General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech coordinates the overall strategy of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation and the world's major changes unseen in a century, grasps the general trend of history and world development, focuses on the overall interests and long-term development of the Chinese nation, has lofty intentions, rich connotations, and is full of affection. It further points out the direction for the development of cross-Strait relations, and is the fundamental compliance and action guide for doing a good job in dealing with Taiwan in the new era.\nIn his speech, General Secretary Xi Jinping put forward four opinions on the development of cross-Strait relations, profoundly clarifying the major policy principles of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and advancing the great cause of reunification of the motherland under the new situation, revealing that compatriots on both sides of the Strait belong to the Chinese nation and are all Chinese, inheriting and carrying forward Chinese culture, strengthening correct identification, and promoting the spiritual harmony of compatriots. It also revealed that both sides of the Strait belong to the same community. China resolutely opposes \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, promotes the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and protects the common homeland of the Chinese nation; demonstrates our sincerity and goodwill in continuing to uphold the concept of one family, promote cross-Strait exchanges and integration, and enhance the people's livelihood and well-being of compatriots; encourage compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to unite and work together to create a bright future for the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation.\nGeneral Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech connects history, present and future, demonstrates the magnanimity and magnanimity of a world-class leader, embodies the mission and historical responsibility of seeking peace for both sides of the Taiwan Strait, the welfare of compatriots, and the rejuvenation of the nation. It is full of care and affection for Taiwan compatriots, arouses strong resonance among Chinese people at home and abroad and a warm response from the international community, and will surely have a significant and far-reaching impact on the development of cross-Strait relations.\nWe will thoroughly implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech, adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\", unite broadly with Taiwan compatriots, deepen cross-Strait exchanges, cooperation, and integrated development, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and advance the great cause of motherland reunification and national rejuvenation. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will follow the general trend of history, uphold national justice, and work with us to firmly protect the common homeland of the Chinese nation, jointly create long-lasting well-being for the Chinese nation, and share the great glory of the reunification of the motherland and the rejuvenation of the nation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","People's Daily","Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun leads a Kuomintang delegation to visit the mainland and has attracted much attention. How do you evaluate the visit of Cheng Li-wun and his delegation? What results were achieved? What impact will it have on the future development of cross-strait relations?","At the invitation of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and General Secretary Xi Jinping, the Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Zheng Liwen led a Chinese Kuomintang delegation to visit Jiangsu, Shanghai, and Beijing from April 7 to 12. General Secretary Xi Jinping met with Chairman Cheng Li-wun in Beijing on the morning of the 10th and delivered an important speech, which pointed out the direction for the development of relations between the two parties and cross-strait relations, and had a major and far-reaching impact on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the international community. The leaders of the Kuomintang and the Communist Party met again after 10 years, which is of great significance to the development of relations between the two parties and cross-Strait relations.\nIn order to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and enhance the family well-being of compatriots, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China was authorized to issue ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, which have been widely praised and warmly welcomed by Taiwan compatriots.\nOn the basis of the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" the Kuomintang and the Communist Party strengthen exchanges and dialogues, maintain positive interactions, insist on promoting spiritual unity with correct identification, insist on protecting the common homeland with peaceful development, insist on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and insist on using unity to Working together to achieve the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation is in line with the general trend of historical development, in line with the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and in the overall interests of the Chinese nation. It is conducive to seeking peace on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, benefiting compatriots, and rejuvenating the nation. The future of cross-Strait relations is firmly in the hands of the Chinese people themselves. No matter how the international situation and the situation across the Taiwan Strait change, the general direction of human development and progress will not change, the general trend of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation will not change, and the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits getting closer and coming together will not change. This is the law of history and we have full confidence in it.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on April 15, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Hello, fellow journalists. Welcome to attend the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Now please ask your questions.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Shenzhen Satellite TV’s “Direct News”","Recently, when meeting with individual U.S. senators, Lai Ching-te said, \"Taiwan is willing to communicate, but any exchange cannot be at the expense of democracy, freedom and national interests.\" Any comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of official exchanges between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan and China, and we firmly oppose collusion between foreign politicians and \"Taiwan independence\" forces. Since Lai Ching-te came to power, he has implemented a \"green authoritarian\" autocratic rule on the island, trampled on democracy, harmed freedom, attempted to \"use force to seek independence\" and \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\", and raised tensions across the Taiwan Strait, which has aroused strong dissatisfaction among the Taiwanese people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Hong Kong China Review Press","The Dalian Maritime Safety Administration recently announced live ammunition firing in parts of the northern Yellow Sea. A spokesman for the Democratic Progressive Party said in response, \"The seeds of peace planted by Zheng Liwen were slapped in the face by the CCP's artillery shells before they could sprout.\" Any comment on this?","Rambling, stretching, fabricating, and substituting are common deceptive tactics used by DPP politicians in order to attack political opponents who seek peace across the Taiwan Straits and benefit their compatriots. Taiwanese people see this very clearly.\nChen Binhua:\nThe press conference ends here. Thanks.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Sun Moon Lake Sky” new media","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Sun Moon Lake Sky” new media reporter:\nOn April 12, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China was authorized to issue ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, which were affirmed and welcomed by all walks of life in Taiwan. Please give the spokesperson further explanation on the ten policy…","We uphold the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, insist on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, focus on allowing compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to live a better life, focus on the actual needs of Taiwan compatriots, and introduce ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. The ten policy measures cover inter-party exchanges between political parties on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, youth exchanges, as well as the economy, people's livelihood, culture and tourism and other fields. It is another important measure for us to promote cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields, and enhance the family well-being of compatriots. It complies with the common aspirations of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait for peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation, and responds to the warm expectations of the people on the island.\nIn the next step, we will work with relevant departments and local governments to promote the implementation of relevant policies and measures, so that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can benefit from them and share the benefits as soon as possible. It is hoped that the DPP authorities will comply with the public opinion on the island and respond to the calls of the industry, lift all artificial restrictions as soon as possible, and remove obstacles to the normalization and normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Beijing Daily","In response to the Central Taiwan Affairs Office's authorized release of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, the Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council said, \"Mainland's various economic and trade concessions are just sugar-coated poison packaged in a gift package.\" Any comment on this?","Whenever the mainland introduces measures to benefit Taiwan compatriots, the DPP authorities will discredit them; they will vigorously oppose anything that is beneficial to the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. Taiwanese society has become accustomed to their behavior. The DPP authorities should ask Taiwan's various industries whether these ten measures are good and whether they are necessary, instead of smearing and slandering them. I would like to advise the DPP authorities to talk less empty words and do more practical things.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Shanghai Oriental TV","During a visit to Shanghai recently, Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang Zheng Liwen said, \"Both sides of the Taiwan Straits will definitely shoulder the mission of creating peace and maintaining stability in the entire region.\" \"Birds should fly in the sky, not bullets. Peace is the best gift I can bring back to Taiwan.\" Any comment on this?","Peace is the common value of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We are willing to work together with all parties, groups and people of insight on the island to promote the peaceful development of cross-strait relations and enhance the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the strait on the basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\". \"Taiwan independence\" is the main culprit undermining peace across the Taiwan Strait. We will never tolerate it or tolerate it. Only by resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatist plots and curbing \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts can compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait jointly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nReporter of Henan Radio and Television’s “Elephant News”:\nRecently, Hunan Satellite TV's \"Chengfeng 2026\" program has aroused heated discussions among audiences on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The performance of many senior Taiwanese artists on stage has attracted particular attention. Any comment on this?\nChen Binhua:\nHunan Satellite TV and Mango TV’s multiple brand variety shows are deeply loved by Taiwanese audiences. I noticed that from the beginning, it was called \"Sister Riding the Wind and Waves\" to now called \"Riding the Wind 2026\". This program, which is centered on showcasing female style and promoting cultural exchanges, has Taiwanese artists participating in every season. They competed on the same stage with mainland artists and created works together, which not only evoked the youthful memories of many people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, but also relied on the influence of the show to be known and loved by more young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We are happy to see such a program that conveys emotions through sound and connects hearts through art. We welcome more Taiwanese artists to come to the mainland to participate in various cultural activities such as program recordings and artistic performances, and contribute to enhancing the cultural resonance and friendship between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We also wish the \"Taiwanese sisters\" participating in this season to ride the waves and achieve great results.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Daily","According to reports, Lai Qingde will lead a delegation to visit Swaziland from April 22 to 27. Any comment on this?","We have always adhered to the one-China principle in dealing with Taiwan's foreign exchanges and resolutely oppose any attempt to create \"two Chinas\", \"one China, one Taiwan\" and \"Taiwan independence\" in the international community. We hope that relevant countries will recognize the general trend, correct their mistakes as soon as possible, and stand on the right side of history.\nReporter from Taiwan Dongsen New Media ETtoday:\nThe first question is the tenth of the ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation: \"Promote the resumption of pilot individual travel for residents of Shanghai and Fujian Province to Taiwan (main island)\". Will the residents of Beijing and Jiangsu visited by Chairman Cheng Li-wen this time follow the same procedures and be allowed to travel to Taiwan in the future? Second question, the mainland has recently announced ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, many of which require Taiwan's consent to be implemented. The Kuomintang is currently the \"opposition party\" in Taiwan and has no administrative power. How does the mainland evaluate the implementation of these policies and measures? How do you hope the KMT can help in Taiwan?\nChen Binhua:\nThe first question. There is currently no further news on whether other provinces and cities such as Beijing and Jiangsu will follow suit and open up tourism to Taiwan. We hope that Taiwan can take practical measures to create conditions for the normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges.\nSecond question. The introduction of ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation fully reflects our stance on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, aiming to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and enhance the family well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogue with various political parties, groups and people from all walks of life in Taiwan, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to advance relevant work. We believe that sharing peace, seeking common development, and jointly promoting prosperity on both sides of the Taiwan Strait is a blessing for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and will surely receive universal support from the people of Taiwan.\nReporter from Shanghai \"The Paper\":\nRegarding the visit of Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun to the mainland, some DPP politicians said that the current relevant laws and regulations on the island do not regulate the trip of party chairpersons to the mainland, and that the law should be \"amended\" in the same way that public servants traveling to the mainland must obtain permission from the Joint Review Committee. The Mainland Affairs Council said it supported the proposal. Any comment on this?\nChen Binhua:\nThe DPP authorities are trying to control and obstruct the exchanges and visits of political party leaders on the island to the mainland. The purpose is to undermine cross-strait relations and promote \"Taiwan independence and autocracy\" and \"green terror\" on the island. This is unpopular and will not succeed.\nPeace, development, exchanges, and cooperation are the aspirations of the people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. No one can stop the torrent of cross-Strait exchanges and dialogue. On the basis of the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with various political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life in Taiwan, enhance mutual trust, and jointly seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, benefit for our compatriots, and rejuvenation for the nation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Henan Daily \"Top News\"","Taiwanese media reported that the so-called \"Taiwan self-developed\" and \"realizable physical application\" robots previously hyped by green media were actually disguised products produced by mainland companies and relabeled, triggering doubts and ridicule on the island. Any comment on this?","Mainland China is the world's largest robot producer. The scale of the industry continues to grow, innovation capabilities continue to improve, and application scenarios are comprehensively expanded. Mainland robot products are widely welcomed by consumers around the world. We are also happy to see Taiwanese people using the mainland's useful products, and we are happy to see Taiwan-funded enterprises sharing the development opportunities of the mainland's robot industry. Through Chairman Zheng Liwen's visit, everyone can feel the rapid development and world-class level of mainland's robotics industry, humanoid robots, embodied intelligence, etc. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities have engaged in political manipulation for the selfish interests of one party, promoting cross-strait \"decoupling and breaking of links\" and obstructing cross-strait economic and trade exchanges and cooperation. However, these self-deceptive practices are ultimately unsustainable. Their hypocrisy has been seen clearly by more and more Taiwanese people, and they have been opposed and spurned by Taiwanese society.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Hunan Daily","The 2026 Cross-Strait (Hunan) Youth Exchange and Development Conference will be held soon, which has attracted the attention of young friends on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The opening ceremony of the 2026 Cross-Strait (Hunan) Youth Exchange and Development Conference will be held in Changsha on April 16. The conference will be themed \"Friendly Hunan, Youthful 'Hunan' Agreement\" and will rely on Hunan's policy dividends of building a youth-friendly province, complete industrial foundation, good business environment, profound cultural heritage and regional advantages of \"low-cost entrepreneurship, high-quality life\" to further promote youth exchanges between Hunan and Taiwan and deepen exchanges and integration between the two places in various fields. During the conference, activities such as the 2026 Cross-Strait Entrepreneurs and Youth Innovation and Entrepreneurship Exchange, the \"Spring in the Xiangjiang River\" Hunan-Taiwan Cross-Strait Art Exchange Week, and the Cross-Strait Youth E-Sports, Music, Trend and Culture Exchange Camp will be held. Relevant policies and measures to support Taiwanese youths in Hunan to study, live, find employment, and start businesses will be promoted to provide all-round support for Taiwanese youths to come to Hunan to study, internship, employment, and entrepreneurship.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Xiamen TV, Fujian","Recently, Xiamen City, Fujian Province launched the \"Service Package for Taiwan Compatriots Coming to Xiamen for the First Time\", which has attracted the attention of Taiwanese compatriots and youth. Please introduce the relevant situation.","In order to actively explore a new path of integrated development across the Taiwan Strait and strive to create the \"first stop\" for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises to land in their first home, Xiamen, Fujian Province recently launched an innovative \"Xiamen Service Package\" for first-time Taiwanese compatriots, which includes providing free rides on Xiamen's city buses, subways, BRT and Gulangyu tourist routes within 7 natural days; free tours of 15 scenic spots and tourist projects including Gulangyu Island, Jinmen on the Sea; and discounts on accommodation at 26 state-owned hotels in Xiamen. The \"service package\" adopts the distribution mode of \"getting it as soon as you come to Xiamen, and using it as soon as you come to Xiamen\". When entering Xiamen, you can go to the \"Near Convenience\" service area for Taiwanese compatriots next to the Wutong Passenger Terminal, or the \"One-stop Comprehensive Service Center for Overseas Visitors\" in the entry hall of Terminal 3 of Gaoqi International Airport to get it. We welcome more and more Taiwanese compatriots to come to Xiamen for sightseeing and exchanging experiences.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Lai Ching-te recently issued an article mentioning that the Taiwan Relations Act and the US's Six Assurances to Taiwan are the key cornerstones of stability and security in the Indo-Pacific region; peace must rely on strength, and strength must rely on long-term investment, and requested Taiwan's public opinion institutions to pass a special defense budget as soon as possible. Any comment on this?","The so-called \"Taiwan Relations Act\" and the \"Six Assurances\" by the United States seriously violate the one-China principle and the provisions of the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and seriously violate the basic norms of international relations. They are completely wrong, illegal, and invalid. We have always been firmly opposed to them.\nThe Lai Ching-te administration continues to cater to the \"Indo-Pacific\" concept hyped by the United States and actively acts as a vanguard of the United States' \"use of Taiwan to contain China.\" Its so-called \"investment strength\" is actually \"investing in war\" and \"seeking independence through force.\" In the face of our strong strength to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity, the Lai Ching-te administration, no matter how much budget it prepares or how many weapons it buys, is overestimating its capabilities and hitting stones with eggs, which cannot change the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\" and may even accelerate it.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching Taiwan Sea” new media","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching Taiwan Sea” new media reporter:\nFour Taiwanese films have been released in mainland theaters since the end of March, setting off a wave of cross-strait film and television exchanges. The upcoming 16th Beijing International Film Festival has also attracted media attention on the island. Some public opinion on the island pointed out that many Taiwanese films…","Filmmakers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait create film and television works from different perspectives and in diverse ways, showing the profound heritage of Chinese culture and the humanistic care of the Chinese nation, which is the inheritance, promotion and innovation of Chinese culture.\nWe will implement the ten policies and measures recently issued by our office to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, promote the screening and broadcast of film and television cultural works on both sides of the Strait that are conducive to showing the family ties and beautiful life on both sides of the Strait, and enhance mutual understanding and understanding among compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We also welcome more outstanding Taiwanese film and television works to share the mainland market opportunities.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","China Taiwan Network","Cross-Strait exchange activities have been carried out recently and are rich in content. Please introduce the relevant situation.","Spring is warm and flowers are blooming, and cross-strait exchange activities continue to flourish in various places. I will briefly introduce a few activities. The 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Micro-Short Drama Competition was recently launched in Hengdian, Dongyang, Zhejiang. With the theme of \"Building Dreams in Zhejiang and Drama Connecting Cross-Strait\", it focuses on six major themes including cross-strait memory, youth together, life as a song, Chinese cultural context, dream rebirth, and AI dance, and collects micro-short plays and script works from both sides of the strait. The deadline for submission is May 15th. Fans of micro-short drama creation on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are welcome to sign up to participate.\nThe third \"Beijing Color Taiwan\" cross-strait youth short film collection activity has been launched recently. In addition to the four units of daily light and shadow, future vision, cultural imprint, and walking picture scroll, this year's event has a new AI special unit - My Family Memory, which encourages young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to use technology to record colorful lives through the lens, showing the integration of Beijing and Taiwan and the beautiful moments in personal family memories. The collection activity will end on May 20, and young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait are welcome to pay attention and submit contributions.\nThe Jingtai Cultural Exchange Concert \"Same Origin of Literature and Same Tune of Songs\" was held on April 11 in Nanjing County, Zhangzhou, Fujian. The concert uses Hokkien as the medium, inviting 22 artists from Penghu County to perform on the same stage, presenting the audience with a familiar Hokkien song event, using local accents to connect hometown sentiments and friendships, and using singing to convey the concerns of the same roots.\nThe 2026 Cross-Strait (Xiamen) Folk Culture Festival and Tzu Chi cultural activities for life preservation were launched today (April 15) at the Qingjiao Tzu Chi Palace in Haicang District, Xiamen City. More than 500 representatives of temples and believers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait gathered in Haicang to jointly promote folk culture. During the event, supporting activities such as the Haicang District Biomedical Industry Exchange and Matchmaking Meeting, the \"Technology Empowerment, Hometown Rhymes Together\" visit and exchange, and the Cross-Strait (Xiamen) Folk Culture Festival Concert will also be held to expand technology empowerment channels and build a bridge for cultural integration for Taiwanese compatriots to participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in the field of medicine and health.\nFrom April 15 to 20, the \"2026 Jiangsu Nanjing Taiwan Week\" was held in Nanjing, including more than 20 exchange activities such as folk culture, cultural and sports interaction, and economic and trade cooperation, attracting nearly a thousand compatriots from both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nOn April 19 (the third day of the third lunar month), the Ancestor Worship Ceremony in the Yellow Emperor's Hometown in the Bingwu Year, co-sponsored by the Henan Provincial People's Government, the Henan Provincial Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, the China Overseas Chinese Federation, the All-China Taiwan Federation, and the Chinese Yanhuang Culture Research Association, will be held grandly in Sincheng, Henan. More than 600 representatives from all walks of life in Taiwan will go to Xinzheng to participate in the ceremony, and worship activities will continue to be held on the island. During the period, a series of exchange activities will be held for the 2026 \"Exploring the Origin of Chinese Culture in the Central Plains\". Through archaeological research, intangible cultural heritage experience, academic seminars, economic and trade inspections, etc., Taiwanese compatriots from all walks of life will understand Henan's rich historical and cultural heritage and the vigorous vitality of economic and social development.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Hong Kong Economic Herald","Regarding the Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun leading a delegation to visit the mainland, Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council chairman Qiu Chuizheng said that party exchanges cannot replace official mechanisms. Only by communicating with the \"Taiwan government\" can cross-strait relations develop healthily. Any comment on this?","Adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" are the basis for cross-strait communication and dialogue. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance and continue to carry out \"Taiwan independence\" provocations, which is the biggest real threat to cross-Strait relations and peace across the Taiwan Strait. They talk about communication but are actually provocative. This is a typical double-faced approach.\nOn the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with all political parties, groups, and people from all walks of life in Taiwan, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to strengthen exchanges and dialogues to seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, benefit our compatriots, and rejuvenate the nation, and keep the future of cross-Strait relations firmly in the hands of the Chinese people themselves.\nFujian Radio and Television's \"Taiwan Strait Moment\" new media reporter:\nThere is public concern on the island. Cheng Li-wun has publicly expressed her willingness to meet and communicate with Lai Qingde before and after her visit to the mainland, and sincerely awaits his invitation. However, she has not received any positive response from Lai Qingde. Any comment on this?\nChen Binhua:\nChairman Cheng Li-wun led the Chinese Kuomintang delegation to visit the mainland, which conforms to the mainstream public opinion on the island that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation. It is of positive and important significance in promoting the peaceful development of cross-strait relations and safeguarding the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. However, the Lai Ching-te administration stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and deliberately obstructs and undermines cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, which goes against public opinion and is deeply unpopular.\nPeace and war, dialogue and confrontation, cooperation and struggle are two completely different paths. Therefore, I would like to respond to your question with a famous saying from The Analects of Confucius, that is, \"If the Tao is different, there will be no mutual conspiracy.\"","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Reporter of \"Strait Flying Rainbow\" of China Central Radio and Television Station and Guoguang Broadcasting Corporation:\nAccording to Taiwanese media reports, Denmark will change the nationality and birthplace registration of Taiwanese residents in Denmark from Taiwan to China from March 2024. Taiwan's foreign affairs department recently stated that it has canceled the courtesy of several Danish representatives…","The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people and the trend of the times. No matter how deliberately the DPP authorities try to make small moves, they cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, and they cannot shake the international community's basic pattern of adhering to the one-China principle.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","\"Reference News\"","Although the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have tried their best to restrict cross-strait exchanges, data released by the National Immigration Administration showed that in the first quarter of this year, the number of Taiwan compatriot certification applications increased by 11.8% year-on-year, and the number of Taiwan compatriots entering the mainland increased by 27.6% year-on-year. Any comment on this?","Facts have repeatedly proved that peace, development, exchanges and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan society. The DPP authorities ignored public opinion and went against the trend, which is doomed to failure.\nWe will continue to uphold the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and in line with the principle of \"wide openness, the most convenient and safer\", actively promote cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields, and create better conditions and provide more convenience for Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland for tourism and business, visits and exchanges, study and internship, and work and life. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, to take a \"just go\" trip, enjoy the magnificent mountains and rivers of the motherland, and personally experience the development and progress of the mainland and the ubiquitous family warmth.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Chengdu Commercial Daily \"Red Star News\"","Taiwanese media reported that a mainland man applied to travel to Taiwan last year. He was accused of calling \"Taiwan, China\" and adding the five-star red flag in a Taiwan travel video posted on social media. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities considered it \"maliciously derogatory to Taiwan's dignity\" and refused him entry for two years. His complaint was recently dismissed. Any comment on this?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and \"Taiwan, China\" is a completely correct title. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and unreasonably suppress the mainland residents. This is completely political manipulation with ulterior motives. We firmly oppose any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. The DPP authorities should correct their mistakes and stop obstructing normal cross-strait personnel exchanges, exchanges and cooperation for unjustifiable reasons.\nMainland residents traveling to Taiwan should bring special documents, namely the \"Taiwan Travel Permit for Mainland Residents\" and an endorsement. We hope that everyone will abide by the relevant regulations to avoid damage to their personal rights and interests.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-15","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Regarding this meeting between the leaders of the Kuomintang and the Communist Party, a spokesman for the U.S. State Department said that meaningful cross-strait exchanges should focus on unconditional dialogue between the mainland and Taiwan's \"democratically elected government,\" including interactions with all Taiwanese political parties. The United States opposes any party unilaterally changing the status quo,…","We have just had an important dialogue with the Chinese Kuomintang. The political basis or prerequisite for the interaction between the two parties is to adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence.\" We are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with various political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life in Taiwan on this common political basis, enhance mutual trust, and jointly seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, welfare for our compatriots, and rejuvenation for the nation.\nThere is only one China in the world, and the mainland and Taiwan belong to the same China. This is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and continue to collude with external forces to carry out \"independence\" provocations. They are the destroyers of the status quo across the Taiwan Strait, the biggest source of chaos for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and the initiator of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait.\nThe United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, and handle Taiwan-related issues with caution, instead of making irresponsible remarks and interfering in China's internal affairs.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260415_12760779.htm","",1,0,5,""],[0,"2026-04-17","Guo Jiakun","Global Times","A Japanese Self-Defense Force ship entered the Taiwan Strait today. What is China's comment on this?","The Japanese Self-Defense Force ships entered the Taiwan Strait and the Chinese military has dealt with it in accordance with the law and regulations. Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi made erroneous remarks related to Taiwan, which has had a serious impact on Sino-Japanese relations. Japan's sending Self-Defense Force ships into the Taiwan Strait to show off its power and deliberately provoke is a mistake after mistake. It once again exposed the dangerous plot of some people in Japan to intervene in the Taiwan Strait with force and undermine peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. This move seriously damaged the political foundation of China-Japan relations and seriously threatened China's sovereignty and security. China firmly opposes this and has lodged a strong protest with Japan.\nThe Taiwan issue is related to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and is related to the political foundation of China-Japan relations. It is an insurmountable red line. China once again urges Japan to earnestly reflect on and correct its mistakes, step back from the brink, be cautious in its words and deeds, and not to go further down the wrong path.","日本自卫队舰艇进入台湾海峡活动，中国军队已依法依规处置。日本首相高市早苗发表涉台错误言论，已经给中日关系带来严重冲击。日方派自卫队舰艇进入台湾海峡耀武扬威、蓄意挑衅，是错上加错，再次暴露日方一些人企图武力介入台海、破坏台海和平稳定的危险图谋。此举严重损害中日关系政治基础，严重威胁中国主权和安全。中方对此坚决反对，已向日方提出强烈抗议。\n台湾问题事关中国主权和领土完整，事关中日关系政治基础，是不可逾越的红线。中方再次敦促日方切实反思改错，悬崖勒马，谨言慎行，不要在错误道路上越走越远。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260417_11894293.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260417_11894119.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-17","Guo Jiakun","China Arab Satellite TV","The Chinese Embassy in Japan has received successive terrorist threats. Only a week after the embassy break-in, a person claiming to be an emergency reserve self-defense officer sent a terrorist threat video online, telling the embassy that he had installed a long-distance remote control bomb. Discriminatory cases against Chinese people in Japan have also increased significantly recently. What is China's response…","In recent years, there have been constant harassment and provocations against Chinese diplomatic missions in Japan. Recently, there have been a series of serious and vicious incidents such as active-duty Self-Defense Force officials breaking into the mission with knives. These incidents came one after another and had a bad impact, exposing many deep-seated problems currently existing in Japan, including the rampant right-wing ideological trends and forces in Japan, and the suppression of objective and rational voices; the Japanese government's erroneous policies on history, Taiwan and other major core issues related to China-Japan relations; the serious lack of correct historical education, and the prevalence of erroneous historical views; Japan's security policy has changed in an offensive, expansionary, and dangerous direction; Japan has lost control of the Self-Defense Forces, and there is a lack of discipline within the Self-Defense Forces.\nHow to fundamentally solve the problem and eradicate the social soil behind it is worthy of deep thought by people of insight in Japan. If we downplay such cases, or even divert attention and confuse right and wrong, it will only lead to more serious consequences and cause more Japanese people to suffer. The emergence of \"new militarism\" will also threaten regional peace and stability. We once again urge Japan to reflect on and correct its mistakes, thoroughly investigate and make corrections, and give China a responsible account.","近年来，针对中国驻日外交机构的滋扰和挑衅不断，近期更是出现自卫队现役官员持刀闯馆等一系列严重恶性事件。这些事件接踵而至，性质影响恶劣，暴露出当前日本存在的诸多深层问题，包括日本国内右翼思潮和势力猖獗，客观理性的声音受到压制；日本政府在历史、台湾等涉及中日关系重大核心问题上的错误政策流毒深重；正确的历史教育严重缺失，错误史观大行其道；日本安保政策朝着进攻性、扩张性、危险性方向转变；日方对自卫队失管失控，自卫队内部失管失教。\n如何从根本上解决问题，铲除背后的社会土壤，值得日本国内有识之士深思。如果对此类案件轻描淡写，甚至转移视线、混淆是非，只会从恶如崩，产生更为严重的后果，导致更多日本民众深受其害，“新型军国主义”成势为患也将威胁地区和平稳定。我们再次敦促日方反思纠错、彻查整改，给中方一个负责任交代。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260417_11894293.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260417_11894119.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-20","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","Last week, the Japan Self-Defense Forces destroyer \"Kamagami\" sailed through the Taiwan Strait to participate in the annual \"shoulder-to-shoulder\" military exercise. What is China’s comment on Japan’s active participation in the military exercise this year?","Regarding the passage of Japanese Self-Defense Force ships through the Taiwan Strait, China has stated its solemn position. Regarding the issue you mentioned, we would like to emphasize that Japan carried out aggression and colonial rule against Southeast Asian countries, including the Philippines, during World War II and bears serious historical responsibilities. Japan should seriously reflect on its history of aggression and be cautious in its words and deeds in the field of military security, instead of showing off its force everywhere and undermining regional stability.","关于日本自卫队舰艇过航台湾海峡事，中方已经表明了严正立场。关于你提到的问题，我们想强调，二战时日本曾对包括菲律宾在内的东南亚国家进行侵略和殖民统治，负有严重历史罪责。日本应该认真反省侵略历史，在军事安全领域谨言慎行，而不是到处炫耀武力、破坏地区稳定。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260420_11895636.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260420_11895519.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-21","Guo Jiakun","nippon tv","The Japanese government today revised the \"Three Principles of Defense Equipment Transfer\" to allow the export of weapons, saying that this move will strengthen Japan's security cooperation with partner countries. What is China’s comment on this?","China is seriously concerned about this. At that time, Japanese militarism went on a rampage of aggression and expansion and committed heinous crimes against China and its Asian neighbors. It is precisely based on Japan's history of aggression and in order to prevent the resurgence of Japanese militarism that a series of documents with full force of international law, such as the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Proclamation and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, clearly stipulate that Japan should be completely disarmed and must not maintain industries that can enable it to rearm. Japan's constitution also places strict restrictions on the country's military strength, belligerent power, and war power. After the war, Japan also established strict norms such as \"exclusive defense\" to restrict the development of military power and arms exports. In 1976, the Japanese government issued a unified view on arms exports, making it clear that Japan, as a peaceful country, handles arms exports prudently.\nJapan's recent series of dangerous developments in the military and security fields have exposed its self-proclaimed \"peaceful country\" and \"specialized in defense.\" Many experts and scholars are worried that Japan will restart its \"war machine\" and \"export war\" to other countries. Japan's accelerated \"remilitarization\" is a fact and reality, with actual routes and actions. The international community, including China, will remain highly vigilant and resolutely resist Japan's \"new type of militarism\".","中方对此严重关切。当年日本军国主义大肆侵略扩张，对中国及亚洲邻国犯下滔天罪行。正是基于日本的侵略历史，为了防范日本军国主义死灰复燃，《开罗宣言》《波茨坦公告》和《日本投降书》等一系列具有充分国际法效力的文件明确规定，日本应完全解除武装，不得维持能使其重新武装的产业。日本宪法对本国军力、交战权、战争权也作出严格限制，战后日本还确立了“专守防卫”等限制军力发展和武器出口的严格规范。1976年日本政府发表对武器出口的统一见解，明确表示日本作为和平国家，慎重处理武器出口。\n日方近期在军事安全领域一系列危险动向戳穿了其“和平国家”和“专守防卫”的自我标榜。很多专家学者担心日本重新开启“战争机器”，对外“输出战争”。日本加速“再军事化”是事实和现实，有实际的路线和行动。包括中国在内的国际社会将对此保持高度警惕，坚决抵制日本“新型军国主义”的妄动。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260421_11896628.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260421_11896396.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-22","Guo Jiakun","Global Times","According to reports, after offering sacrifices to the Yasukuni Shrine yesterday, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi once again offered sacrifices today. Minoru Shirouchi, Minister in Charge of Growth Strategy, Hariko Arimura, Chairman of the Liberal Democratic Party General Affairs Committee, and a number of Diet members went to pay homage. What is China’s comment on this?","We stated China's solemn position yesterday. Japan's series of negative moves involving the Yasukuni Shrine blatantly challenge international justice and brutally trample on human conscience. China is very indignant and severely condemns the above-mentioned evil acts.\nDuring World War II, Japanese militarism committed countless heinous crimes, which brought serious disasters to China and other Asian countries and the world. Yasukuni Shrine is the spiritual tool and symbol of Japanese militarism's war of aggression against foreign countries. It is the de facto \"War Criminals Shrine\" and enshrines World War II Class-A war criminals who were directly responsible for the war of aggression, including the war madman, the number one war criminal Hideki Tojo, and the leader of the Chinese invaders. Kenji Doihara, Iwane Matsui, the chief culprit of the Nanjing Massacre, Osamu Nagano, the orderer of the attack on Pearl Harbor, Kuniaki Oiso, the culprit who killed countless anti-Japanese people on the Korean Peninsula, etc. These people are all important war-responsible persons for committing heinous crimes against people in Asia and the world.\nThe essence of the Yasukuni Shrine issue is whether Japan can correctly understand and deeply reflect on its history of militaristic aggression, learn historical lessons, and avoid repeating historical mistakes. This is related to the political foundation of China-Japan relations, to Japan’s national integrity, and to the post-war international order, international peace, and international justice. Japan’s negative actions involving the Yasukuni Shrine reflect Japan’s disregard for the concerns of the international community, its disregard for public opinion on justice at home and abroad, its consistent refusal to acknowledge its history of aggression in World War II, and its attempt to overturn the conviction of the war of aggression and Class A war criminals, thus challenging the conclusions of the Tokyo Trial and the post-war international order. In recent times, the Japanese government has made prominent negative moves on issues involving China's Taiwan, the history of World War II, and military security, and has frequently taken provocative and risky actions. Takaichi published fallacies related to Taiwan, which seriously impacted Sino-Japanese relations. In the face of strong criticism and opposition from China and Japan at home and abroad, some Japanese politicians and right-wing forces not only refused to repent, but intensified their efforts. The Chinese people, the people of other countries that were invaded by the Japanese army, and all peace-loving and righteous forces in the world will never agree to this.\nThis year marks the 80th anniversary of the opening of the Tokyo Trial. This trial convicted Japanese militarism and militarist elements of launching and carrying out an aggressive war and related crimes, and defended historical truth, international justice and human dignity. Today, 80 years later, Japan's \"new militarism\" has once again exposed its fangs and become a threat to world peace and stability. The international community must resolutely fight back and never allow the resurgence of Japanese militarism.","我们昨天已阐明中方的严正立场。日方涉靖国神社一系列消极动向公然挑衅国际正义，粗暴践踏人类良知。中方对上述恶行十分愤慨、严厉谴责。\n二战期间，日本军国主义犯下罄竹难书的滔天罪行，给中国等亚洲国家和世界带来深重灾难。靖国神社是日本军国主义对外发动侵略战争的精神工具和象征，是事实上的“战犯神社”，供奉有对侵略战争负有直接罪责的二战甲级战犯，包括战争狂人、头号战犯东条英机、侵华贼首土肥原贤二、南京大屠杀元凶松井石根、偷袭珍珠港的下令者永野修身、杀害无数朝鲜半岛抗日民众的罪魁小矶国昭等，这些人均是对亚洲乃至世界人民犯下滔天罪行的重要战争责任者。\n靖国神社问题的实质是日本能否正确认识和深刻反省军国主义侵略历史，能否汲取历史教训、避免重蹈历史覆辙。这事关中日关系政治基础，事关日本国家信义，事关战后国际秩序与国际和平、国际正义。日方涉靖国神社消极动向，反映出日本罔顾国际社会关切，漠视国内外正义舆论，始终拒绝承认二战侵略历史，企图为侵略战争和甲级战犯翻案，进而挑战东京审判定论和战后国际秩序。近一段时间，日本政府在涉及中国台湾、二战历史和军事安全等问题上消极动向突出，挑衅冒险举动频频。高市发表涉台谬论，严重冲击中日关系。面对中方和日本国内外的强烈批评反对，日方某些政客和右翼势力不仅不思悔改，反而变本加厉，中国人民、当年遭受日军侵略的各国人民、世界上一切爱好和平的正义力量，对此绝不答应。\n今年是东京审判开庭80周年。这场审判判定了日本军国主义及军国主义分子发动和实施侵略战争及其相关罪行，捍卫了历史真相、国际公义和人类尊严。80年后的今天，日本“新型军国主义”再次露出獠牙、成势为患，威胁世界和平稳定。国际社会必须予以坚决反击，决不允许日本军国主义死灰复燃。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260422_11897589.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260422_11897449.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-22","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","Taiwan stated that Lai had to cancel his visit to Swaziland due to the cancellation of flight permits by Seychelles, Mauritius, and Madagascar, adding that the three countries were subject to \"economic coercion\" from China. What is China’s response to this? Have there been any contacts with these three countries or other African countries regarding flight permission issues?","With the exception of Swaziland, 53 African countries have established diplomatic relations with China and, together with the African Union, adopted the Beijing Declaration of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation in 2024. They have repeatedly expressed their firm commitment to the one-China principle and reiterated that there is only one China in the world and that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The government of the People's Republic of China is the only legitimate government representing the whole of China and firmly supports all efforts made by the Chinese government to achieve national reunification. The relevant countries adhere to the one-China principle, which is fully in line with international law and the basic norms of international relations. China highly appreciates this. The facts are very clear. The so-called \"President of the Republic of China\" no longer exists in the world. Anyone who pretends to be deceitful in this capacity is going against the trend of history and will only bring humiliation to himself. The one-China principle is the aspiration of the people, the trend of the times, and the great cause of justice. No one can stop the historical trend of China's eventual reunification. The separatist plot of the \"Taiwan independence\" forces is just a mantis mantis trying to pull a chariot, and will surely lead to its own destruction.","非洲除斯威士兰外53国均同中国建交，并同非盟一道通过2024年中非合作论坛《北京宣言》，多次表示坚定奉行一个中国原则，重申世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，中华人民共和国政府是代表全中国的唯一合法政府，坚定支持中国政府为实现国家统一所作的一切努力。有关国家坚持一个中国原则，完全符合国际法和国际关系基本准则，中方表示高度赞赏。事实十分清楚，世界上早已不存在所谓“中华民国总统”，任何人以这种身份招摇撞骗，都是逆历史潮流而动，只会自取其辱。一个中国原则是人心所向、大势所趋、大义所在，任何人都无法阻挡中国终将统一的历史潮流。“台独”势力的分裂图谋只是螳臂当车，必将自取灭亡。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260422_11897589.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260422_11897449.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","First question. Regarding Lai Ching-te canceling his trip to Eswatini, the Lai administration has pointed the finger at the mainland's pressure. We believe the mainland will continue to struggle against the Lai administration. The mainland has also stated clearly that this is targeted at \"Taiwan independence\" forces, not at the broad Taiwanese public. But Lai is, after all, \"President of the Republic of China,\"…","First, let me emphasize: there is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and there is no so-called \"president.\"\nOn the first question. The one-China principle is a recognized basic norm of international relations. We consistently apply the one-China principle to questions of Taiwan's external interactions, and firmly oppose any attempt to manufacture \"two Chinas\" or \"one China, one Taiwan\" internationally. Lai Ching-te is attempting, through external trips, to spread \"Taiwan independence\" separatist fallacies, incite \"anti-China resistance,\" collude with external forces to provoke \"independence,\" escalate cross-strait confrontation, undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and harm the interests of people on the island — and he is bound to meet with opposition and failure.\nOn the basis of the one-China principle, through cross-strait consultation, questions concerning Taiwan's external interactions can be properly resolved. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are family. As long as we are willing to talk things over and discuss issues, there are no contradictions or differences that cannot be resolved.\nOn the second question. Wanting peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation is the mainstream public opinion on the island. The KMT and CPC, on the common political foundation of upholding the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" are strengthening exchanges at all levels between the two parties and promoting the peaceful development of cross-strait relations — which is of great significance for safeguarding peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and advancing the affection and welfare of compatriots. The DPP authorities have persecuted and suppressed \"opposition\" forces, obstructed and disrupted cross-strait exchanges, gone to every extreme, and accumulated a long record of misdeeds, manufacturing \"Green Terror\" — which runs counter to mainstream public opinion on the island and is unpopular.\nOn the third question. We have always supported and encouraged the screening and broadcasting of cross-strait film and television cultural works that showcase cross-strait kinship and the good life, and that promote the protection, inheritance, and innovative development of Chinese culture. Here is some data on films that I will share. In 2024, a total of 9 Taiwanese films were released on the mainland, with combined box office revenue of approximately 742 million yuan; in 2025, 8 Taiwanese films were released on the mainland, with combined box office revenue of approximately 88.1057 million yuan. So far this year, 6 Taiwanese films have been released on the mainland. We can say that as long as Taiwanese films apply through proper procedures and the content meets mainland market demand, the channel for their release on the mainland is open, and the box office results speak for themselves. By contrast, the Taiwan side has long imposed a quota system on mainland films, which seriously fails to meet the expectations of the industry and Taiwanese audiences, affects cross-strait film exchanges and cooperation, and urgently needs review and improvement.\nOn the fourth question. Recently, mainland TV dramas such as \"Pursuit of Jade\" have been popular on both sides of the Strait, and the lead actors have drawn attention and affection from audiences on the island. The remarks by young people in the KMT delegation reflect the sincere expectations of Taiwan's youth for cross-strait film and television exchanges and the peaceful development of cross-strait relations. They vividly illustrate the unique role of film and television cultural exchanges in narrowing the psychological distance between compatriots on both sides. We have always supported \"two-way travel\" between the cross-strait film and television cultural communities, and we are happy to see mainland artists go to Taiwan for exchanges and meet with people on the island.\nCompatriots on both sides share the same roots, the same culture, and the same race. Cultural resonance is the most natural bond connecting hearts. We will continue to create favorable conditions for cross-strait cultural exchange and cooperation, and support more cross-strait artists and youth groups in coming and going regularly, using culture as a bridge to enhance mutual understanding and promote spiritual unity.\nOn the fifth question. The DPP authorities ignore public opinion and disregard people's livelihoods, and farmers and fishermen long ago lost hope in them. We attach great importance to and actively cooperate with the wishes of Taiwanese farming friends to expand into the mainland market. On the basis of comprehensive evaluation of relevant rectification measures and conformity with mainland inspection and quarantine standards, we have successively resumed imports of Taiwanese custard apples, pomelos, and other agricultural products.\nWe will continue to work together with relevant parties on the island, on the political foundation of upholding the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" to establish communication mechanisms and actively advance the careful implementation of the ten measures including those on agricultural products. Provided inspection and quarantine standards are met, we will help Taiwanese agricultural and fishery products enter the mainland, and work hard to do practical things, do good things, and resolve difficulties for Taiwanese compatriots.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","\"Reference News\"","As for the mainland's push to resume the pilot program for individual travel to Taiwan (main island) for residents of Shanghai and Fujian Province, Liang Wenjie, deputy chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, said that whether the mainland opens up independent travel or group travel, the \"Two Sessions\" consultations are inevitable, causing concern in the island's tourism industry. Public opinion believes that…","Promoting the resumption of the pilot program of individual travel for Shanghai and Fujian residents to the island is in line with the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan society that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation, and is a positive measure to promote the peaceful development of cross-strait relations.\nThe DPP authorities should face up to the voices of the tourism industry and people on the island, stop political manipulation, lift all unreasonable restrictions on mainland residents traveling to Taiwan, and take pragmatic measures to create favorable conditions for the normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges, instead of blindly erecting barriers for various flimsy reasons to antagonize the people and prevent them from making profits.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Recently, Brazil’s “representative in Taiwan” said in an exclusive interview with Taiwanese media that “Taiwan is part of China.” The Foreign Affairs Department of the Taiwan authorities falsely claimed that its words and deeds were \"untrue and inappropriate\" and were highly dissatisfied and expressed solemn protest. Any comment on this?","The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the general trend and the direction of justice. The \"breaking of defenses\" of the DPP authorities just exposes their fierce appearance and inner weakness, and only adds to the laughing stock.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Fujian Southeast TV","Cross-party senators in the U.S. Congress recently sent a letter to Taiwan's legislative body, urging the expeditious passage of Taiwan's \"special defense budget\" to strengthen Taiwan's defense capabilities and accelerate the purchase of U.S. arms. Some members of Congress called on the U.S. executive branch to continue advancing the U.S. arms sales process to Taiwan. Any comment on this?","We have noticed that for some time, some people in the United States have frequently expressed concerns about Taiwan's budget and even publicly exerted pressure in an attempt to use the \"Taiwan card\" to \"use Taiwan to contain China\" and obstruct China's reunification. We are firmly opposed to this. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities are plotting to \"use force to seek independence\" and \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\" and are willing to serve as a \"cash machine\" for US arms dealers. In the end, they will only turn Taiwan into a \"powder keg\" and \"ammunition depot\", destroy Taiwan and bring about their own destruction.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching Taiwan Sea” new media","China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Watching Taiwan Sea” new media reporter:\nRecently, a cross-party federal senator in the United States once again proposed the \"Taiwan Relations Strengthening Act\" to comprehensively enhance U.S.-Taiwan relations, aiming to ensure that U.S. policy supports \"Taiwan's democracy and international participation\" and urges Taiwan to invest in increasing combat capabilities…","Members of the U.S. Congress have proposed erroneous bills related to Taiwan, encouraging Taiwan to purchase arms and prepare for war, seriously violating the one-China principle and grossly interfering in China's internal affairs.\nWe resolutely oppose any attempt to create \"two Chinas\", \"one China, one Taiwan\" and \"Taiwan independence\" under various pretexts in the international arena, and we resolutely oppose any form of military contact between countries that have diplomatic relations with Taiwan and China. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, immediately stop advancing relevant proposals, and handle the Taiwan issue with caution and prudence.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station CGTN","Recently, a Japanese Self-Defense Force ship entered the Taiwan Strait. Any comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and an insurmountable red line. Japan sent Self-Defense Force ships into the Taiwan Strait as a deliberate provocation, seriously damaging the political foundation of China-Japan relations, seriously threatening China's sovereignty and security, and once again exposing the sinister plot of some people in Japan to intervene in the Taiwan Strait with force and undermine peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. We are firmly opposed to this. Japan should deeply reflect on history, learn historical lessons, earnestly reflect on and correct mistakes, abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and stop all wrong words and deeds related to Taiwan.\nTaiwan’s “China Television” News Reporter:\nRegarding the ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, which ones can the mainland unilaterally promote and implement immediately? Which ones still require consultation and cooperation with Taiwan before they can be implemented? Among the issues that Taiwanese people are concerned about are the resumption of mainland tourists to Taiwan, the resumption of normalization of direct flights across the Taiwan Strait, and the promotion of film and television cultural exchanges. Is there anything that the mainland can unilaterally promote?\nZhang Han:\nWe uphold the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, insist on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and aim to enable compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to live a better life. Focusing on the actual needs of Taiwan compatriots, ten policies and measures were introduced to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation. The ten policy measures cover inter-party exchanges between political parties on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, youth exchanges, as well as the economy, people's livelihood, culture and tourism and other fields. It is another important measure for us to promote cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields, and to enhance the family well-being of compatriots. It conforms to the mainstream public opinion and common aspirations of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait for peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation, and responds to the eager expectations of the people on the island.\nIn the next step, we will work with relevant departments and local governments to promote the implementation of relevant policies and measures, so that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can benefit from it and share its benefits. It is hoped that the DPP authorities will comply with the public opinion on the island and respond to the calls of the industry, remove various artificial restrictions, and remove obstacles to the normalization and normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Taiwan’s United Daily News","The first question is regarding Lai Qingde’s cancellation of his trip to Swaziland. The DPP authorities stated that the reason was “the mainland used economic coercion to forcefully pressure three countries to temporarily cancel flight permits.” Please confirm.\nSecond question, on April 16, a Taiwanese fishing boat caught fire and sank in an accident near the Diaoyu Islands. The mainland coast guard stated on the…","The first question. The DPP authorities tried to change their tricks to achieve a \"breakthrough\", but failed to succeed and then fabricated the fallacy of the so-called \"economic coercion.\" They were completely nonsense, self-deception, rumors and smearing, and they were just trying to cover up their own predicament.\nIt must be emphasized that the historical merits of the Taiwan issue are clear, and the legal fact that Taiwan is part of China is clear. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they can't change the fact that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and they can't stop the inevitable reunification of the motherland. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will recognize the ambitions and selfish desires of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and resolutely oppose the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities.\nSecond question. It is understood that the mainland coast guard recently rescued a burning Taiwanese fishing boat in the waters northeast of Huangwei Island, and actively participated in putting out the fire and searching for Taiwanese fishermen who fell into the water. Six people were rescued.\nThe DPP authorities ignore the facts and even take the opportunity to smear and attack the mainland. This is not only a desecration of the spirit of humanity, but also a disregard for the safety of the lives and property of the Taiwanese people.\nThe mainland has always provided timely rescue to Taiwanese ships in distress, demonstrating the brotherhood of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait who are thicker than water and help each other. This reflects the spirit of humanitarian relief and is also an inevitable requirement for the mainland to always adhere to the concept of putting people's lives first.\nReporter from Taiwan's \"Central News Agency\":\nThe first question is about the Taiwan Chamber of Commerce’s statement that it hopes that the mainland’s ten policies and measures will not be suspended due to political factors. Only by institutionalizing and normalizing cross-strait economic and trade stability can the Taiwanese people view cross-strait relations in a pragmatic way. Any comment on this?\nSecond question: Regarding Lai Ching-te’s cancellation of his trip to Swaziland, Taiwan’s Mainland Affairs Council said that after the mainland announced ten Taiwan-related policies and measures, it was a “two-handed strategic operation” to “maliciously sabotage Lai Ching-te’s trip.” Any comment on this?\nZhang Han:\nThe first question. The current cross-Strait relations situation remains complex and severe, with \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces colluding with external forces\nplot\n\"Independence\" provocations deliberately create cross-strait confrontation and undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. This is a threat facing the Taiwan Strait.\nWanting peace, development, exchanges and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan society. We have always upheld the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Straits, insisted on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and actively worked on practical things, done good things, and solved problems for Taiwan compatriots. We are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogue with all political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life in Taiwan on the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" and promote the implementation of relevant policies and measures. We hope that all walks of life in Taiwan will resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, work with us to safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, create a good atmosphere and favorable conditions for the normalization and normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields.\nSecond question. No matter how the DPP authorities collude with external forces and engage in so-called \"diplomatic breakthroughs\" in any form to serve the purpose of \"Taiwan independence,\" they are all in vain. They can't change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, and they can't shake the general consensus and basic pattern of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle.\nTaiwan TVBS reporter:\nWill the mainland continue to use different methods to prevent Lai Qingde's \"foreign visit\"?\nZhang Han:\nOur position is very clear. If you gain the right path, you will get a lot of help, but if you get the wrong path, you will get little help. Facts have proved that the one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the general trend, the great cause and the aspiration of the people.\nZhang Han:\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","\"Shangguan News\" of Liberation Daily","Recently, when participating in the so-called \"Han Kuang 42\" military exercise on the island, Lai Qingde said, \"The exercise should be based on actual combat, combined with the defense resilience of the whole society and asymmetric combat thinking, and continue to improve the national military's adaptability and overall deterrent strength. Peace does not rely on a paper agreement, but on strength.\" Any comment on…","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and attempt to \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"use force to seek independence\", which is the source of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait. It does not hesitate to tie the Taiwanese people onto the \"Taiwan independence\" chariot, which will only ultimately harm the security and well-being of the Taiwanese people.\nNo matter how many \"military push\" and \"exercises\" the DPP authorities engage in, they are all trying to pull the strings. They cannot change the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\", let alone stop the historical trend of the reunification of the motherland.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","","At the press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council on April 22, a reporter asked about the Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun leading a delegation to visit the mainland. Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council Chairman Qiu Chuizheng said, \"Zheng Lai-wen's use of the '1992 Consensus' as a prerequisite for cross-strait dialogue is helping the mainland eliminate the endorsement of the 'Republic of China'. This is poison for annexation, not an antidote to peace.\" Any comment on this?\nZhang Han, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to inquiries that the DPP authorities, out of their \"Taiwan independence\" nature, are blatantly selling the \"two-state theory\", have no intention to seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, and are incapable of properly handling cross-Strait relations. They have repeatedly deliberately undermined cross-Strait relations and escalated tensions across the Taiwan Strait. They are the \"poison\" that harms the people of Taiwan.\nZhang Han said that peace is not difficult, nor is the establishment of Taiwan. As long as we adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" cross-Strait relations will develop peacefully, the Taiwan Strait will be peaceful and stable, and compatriots on both sides of the Strait will be able to live a good life.\nAddress: No. 6-1, Guang'anmen South Street, Xicheng District, Beijing Postal Code: 100053\nBeijing ICP No. 14023536 Beijing Public Network Security No. 110401200028","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260422_12762144.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Reporter of China Central Radio and Television Station Guoguang's \"Strait Flying Rainbow\"\n:\nRecently, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Hunan) Youth Exchange and Development Conference was successfully held in Hunan. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From April 10 to 18, the main event of the 2026 Cross-Strait (Hunan) Youth Exchange and Development Conference was successfully held in Hunan, with more than 500 youth representatives, entrepreneurs, and innovation and entrepreneurship teams from both sides of the Taiwan Strait participating.\nThe event conscientiously implemented the spirit of the important speech delivered by General Secretary Xi Jinping when he met with Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wen. It carried out cultural performances, youth dialogues, on-site visits, etc., and announced relevant policy initiatives, internships and employment positions. It demonstrated Hunan's multi-dimensional efforts to build a youth-friendly province and provide young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait with a \"low-cost entrepreneurship, high-quality life\" development environment through the implementation of the \"four friendships\" actions of employment-friendly, entrepreneurship-friendly, life-friendly and growth-friendly. We welcome more Taiwanese youth to come to the mainland for exchanges and development.\nAfter the main event, Hunan will also hold a series of youth exchange activities between Hunan and Taiwan, covering cultural origins, sports events, medical and health care, internship and employment, etc., to promote exchanges between Hunan and Taiwan and promote spiritual harmony between young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Nanfang Daily, Nanfang+","Recently, a poll on the island released by Taiwan's \"Democratic Culture and Education Foundation\" showed that if a military conflict broke out between the two sides, 54.4% of the respondents believed that the United States would definitely not or probably would not send troops to protect Taiwan unconditionally, while only 28.6% thought it would. Any comment on this?","Relevant polls have once again shown that more and more Taiwanese compatriots realize that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end and that outsiders cannot be trusted. They realize that in the eyes of the United States, Taiwan is just a \"chess piece\" to curb the development of the mainland and an \"abandoned piece\" that can be abandoned at any time.\nIt must be emphasized that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not tolerate any external interference. The DPP authorities stubbornly \"rely on the United States and seek independence\", which will not bring security and peace, but will only bring harm to the present and future generations.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Xinhua News Agency","Regarding the Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun’s delegation visiting the mainland, Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council Chairman Qiu Chuizheng said, “By taking the ‘1992 Consensus’ as a prerequisite for cross-strait dialogue, Cheng Li-wun is helping the mainland eliminate the endorsement of the ‘Republic of China’. This is the poison of annexation, not the antidote to peace.” Any comment on this?","Out of their \"Taiwan independence\" nature, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are nakedly selling the \"two-nation theory\". They have no intention to seek peace across the Taiwan Strait and are incapable of properly handling cross-Strait relations. They have repeatedly deliberately undermined cross-Strait relations and escalated tensions across the Taiwan Strait. They are the \"poison\" that harms the people of Taiwan.\nPeace is not difficult, nor is the establishment of Taiwan. As long as we adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" cross-Strait relations will develop peacefully, the Taiwan Strait will be peaceful and stable, and compatriots on both sides of the Strait will be able to live a good life.\nFujian Radio and Television's \"Taiwan Strait Moment\" new media reporter:\nRecently, cross-strait exchange activities have taken various forms. Please introduce the relevant situation.\nZhang Han:\nRecently, there have been many exciting cross-Strait exchange activities. Let me introduce some of them.\nFujian holds a series of cross-strait exchange activities. The 7th \"Cross-Strait Unity, Tea and Tourism Integration\" tea-picking exchange event was held on April 11 in Taining, Sanming, Fujian. The event used tea as a medium to trace the historical context of the same origin and flow of tea culture in Fujian and Taiwan, and effectively promoted the in-depth exchange and integrated development of the tea towns in Fujian and Taiwan. The 2026 Rongtai Gateball Invitational Tournament was held in Fuzhou from the 13th to the 17th. Eight Taiwanese teams participated. Players from both sides of the Taiwan Strait used the ball to meet friends, exchange ideas and enhance friendship. The 12th \"Cross-Strait Love, Heart-to-Heart Relationship\" Baosheng Emperor Cultural Exchange Event ended peacefully in Zhangzhou on the 16th. Nearly 200 representatives of the Lai clan from Taiwan came across the sea to gather together with local folks and share friendships. The 2026 Haicang-Tainan Industrial In-depth Integration Exchange Week will be held in Haicang, Xiamen from the 16th to the 20th. It will deepen the industrial docking and integrated development of the two places through Taiwanese businessmen roundtable meetings and other forms. Fuzi loves China with one heart. The 13th \"March 3\" She Nationality Cultural Week in Fujian Province was held in Shanghang, Longyan from the 18th to the 19th. It included genealogy docking, theme evenings and other activities. Guests from all ethnic groups on both sides of the Taiwan Strait talked about the family ties on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and sang about the love between sons and daughters of China. From the 19th to the 22nd, the \"Searching for Roots and Ancestors and Sharing Cultures\" cross-strait college students' performance and drama activity was held in the Zhangzhou Taiwanese Investment Zone, attracting nearly 130 college students and skit actors from both sides of the strait to compete in skills and exchange and learn from each other.\nOn April 16, China is one family - the 2026 \"Guangxi March 3rd\" celebration event for all ethnic groups in Guangxi and Taiwan was held in Nanning. More than 500 compatriots from Guangxi and Taiwan enthusiastically participated. On the same day, Wenzhou, Zhejiang held a gathering of media and Internet celebrities from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to collect ideas from Wenzhou. Participants conducted exchanges and discussions on the co-production of cross-Strait short dramas, co-creation of film and television IP, and new media content dissemination. Wenzhou and Taiwan also established a cross-Strait new media exchange and cooperation base to promote more cross-Strait film and television cooperation projects.\nIn addition, the five-episode micro-short drama \"Poetic Hearts of the Same Poetic Heart - Exploring Henan in Taiwan Textbooks\" created by Henan's \"Elephant News\" relied on its profound cultural core and innovative narrative. It was successfully selected into the first batch of recommended plays in the \"Micro-Short Drama+\" action plan of the State Administration of Radio, Film and Television in 2026, and won the Outstanding Work Award in the Second International Micro-Short Drama Competition. The play helps the young generation on both sides of the Taiwan Strait appreciate the depth of Chinese history through poetry and emotion, and feel the warmth of the development of the times through technological innovation.\nThe 10th Cross-Strait Nezha Folk Culture Exchange Event will be held in Jiangyou, Sichuan from April 28 to May 3. A series of activities including cultural and creative competitions, economic, trade and cultural exchanges will be carried out around Li Bai culture, Nezha culture, Chinese blessing culture, etc.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Hong Kong China Review Press","Recently, the civil aviation sector announced that it once again urges Taiwan to fully resume the normalization of direct air passenger flights across the Taiwan Strait. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stated that the actual demand for cross-strait direct flights at this stage is not as high as expected, and the current actual operating flights can meet the current demand. Any comment on this?","Cross-Strait direct air flights are air links that facilitate cross-Strait personnel exchanges and smooth economic and cultural exchanges and cooperation, and bear the urgent needs of the people to travel frequently. Whether the demand is high or not, the data will tell. In 2025, there will be 31,973 cross-strait air flights, carrying 5.7828 million passengers. In the first quarter of this year, there will be 8,079 flights, carrying 1.4672 million passengers. The number of passengers has increased by double digits year-on-year, and the passenger load factor has exceeded 80%. These solid data confirm the strong demand in the cross-strait direct air flight market and the strong demand and willingness of the people for exchanges. It is understood that Continental Airlines has basically used up its flight capacity quota for cross-strait routes.\nAccording to relevant cross-strait air transport arrangements, cross-strait airlines can arrange a total of no more than 890 passenger flights per week between 61 destinations on the mainland and 10 destinations in Taiwan. This is an existing arrangement that has been running for many years before 2020. The Cross-Strait Air Transport Exchange Committee has repeatedly urged Taiwan to fully resume the normalization of direct air flights across the Taiwan Strait, which is a positive measure to respond to the voices of the people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and promote the full resumption of flights.\nDirect cross-strait air flights are a bridge of communication, not a political bargaining chip. The DPP authorities should face up to market demand, stop political manipulation, stop obstructing cross-Strait personnel exchanges, return cross-Strait air direct flights to their essence of serving people's livelihood and promoting exchanges, and give compatriots on both sides a smooth, convenient and efficient air road.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","People's Daily","Regarding the visit of Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun to the mainland with a delegation, the person in charge of Taiwan's security department said that cross-strait exchanges should be led by the Taiwan authorities and should not be decided by party to party; the mainland's new measures against Taiwan may be an act of \"election preparation\" in the hope of influencing the island's elections. Any comment…","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", which has led to the suspension of cross-strait dialogue and consultation. They have also deliberately smeared, attacked, and suppressed normal exchanges and exchanges between other political parties, groups and all walks of life on the island and the mainland. We launched ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. All walks of life on the island and the majority of Taiwan compatriots applauded and supported them, and they all wanted to benefit from them as soon as possible. Only the DPP authorities jumped out to attack, slander, and oppose them.\nThis once again fully exposed the true face of the DPP authorities' conspiracy to seek \"Taiwan independence\" and its evil nature of undermining cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, harming people's well-being, and working against the people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260422_12762143.htm"],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Hong Kong Phoenix TV","Lai Ching-te recently said, \"Peace cannot be achieved by compromising and conceding sovereignty, and can only be achieved by incorporating Taiwan into the one-China framework; packaging reunification with peace not only goes against public opinion, but will also bring endless troubles to Taiwan.\" Any comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. It has never been a country and cannot become one. There is no so-called \"sovereignty\" at all. China is the common homeland of the Chinese nation. For compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to protect and build this common home, the fundamental thing is to adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence\". The core is to recognize that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China.\nPeace is the common value of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities go against the mainstream public opinion, stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", continue to manipulate \"the use of force to seek independence\", and deliberately obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. They are the culprits of undermining peace across the Taiwan Strait and the initiator of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait.\nThe future of Taiwan and the safety, security, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots have always been tied to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and the reunification of the motherland. More and more Taiwan compatriots have realized that the Lai Ching-te administration's pursuit of \"independence\" will only lead to war and destroy Taiwan. They firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, and actively seek peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Hong Kong Economic Herald","The 18th West Lake-Sun Moon Lake \"Two Lakes Forum\" was held today in Sun Moon Lake, Nantou, Taiwan. Any comment on this?","Since 2009, Hangzhou City and Nantou County have taken turns hosting the \"West Lake Sun Moon Lake\" Forum, which has been held for 17 times so far. This forum has become an important platform for deepening exchanges and cooperation between the two places, achieving a series of positive results and improving the livelihood and well-being of the people in the two places. I wish this forum a complete success!\nNew media reporters from China Central Radio and Television Station’s “Sun and Moon Tan Tian” and “Watching Taiwan Strait”:\nRecently, exchanges and interactions between people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have become more and more lively. From the owner of a chicken pot shop in Foshan, Guangdong, who cordially interacted with Taiwanese diners and shouted, \"Chinese people must be united, the backing of the motherland is strong.\" to the Xinjiang tour guide girl introducing the Tianshan Victory Tunnel to Taiwanese tourists. Any comment on this?\nZhang Han:\nWhether it is the owner of a Guangdong chicken pot shop telling Taiwanese diners about his feelings about his family and country in simple words, or the Xinjiang tour guide girl's heart-to-heart explanations that resonate with Taiwanese tourists, these warm and touching moments are the vivid epitome of a family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, demonstrating the common national identity and blood ties of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nWe are happy to see and believe that there will be more and more cross-strait exchange activities. We can bring each other closer through food and beautiful scenery, enhance understanding and recognition through exchanges, and promote spiritual harmony with sincerity. No one can stop the trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait getting closer and coming together. If compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait unite and love each other, they will surely work together to create a bright future for the Chinese nation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","China News Service","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities announced yesterday that Lai Qingde's planned visit to Swaziland was canceled because the relevant country refused to issue a flight permit to his chartered flight. Any comments on this?","We express our appreciation for the stance and practices of relevant countries in adhering to the one-China principle. If you gain the right path, you will get a lot of help, but if you get the wrong path, you will get little help. Facts have once again proved that the one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the general trend, the great cause and the aspiration of the people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","the People's Political Consultative Conference","Recently, the Taiwan Chamber of Commerce invited representatives from the island's seven major industries, including travel, hotels, and food, to hold a press conference on \"Industry Views on the Mainland's Recent Policies to Benefit Taiwan,\" calling on the DPP authorities to put people's livelihood first and not politicize economic issues related to people's livelihood or even sacrifice the living space of…","The sentiments expressed by the Taiwan Chamber of Commerce and related industry circles fully reflect that the ten policies and measures we have recently released to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation are in line with the needs of the island's industrial recovery and will help solve the pain points of the economy and people's livelihood. The DPP authorities ignore the public opinion on the island and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. They will only blindly smear and attack the goodwill and sincerity shown by the mainland and the policies and measures introduced to benefit Taiwan and the people, and take the opportunity to engage in political manipulation in an attempt to resume cross-strait consultation and dialogue without recognizing the \"1992 Consensus.\" These common tricks cannot deceive people, nor can they succeed. They will only make them more and more in opposition to the mainstream public opinion on the island.\nExchanges and integration are the aspirations and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. No one can stop the trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait getting closer and coming together. The DPP authorities should stop political manipulation, follow the will of the people and the general trend, and change their attitude in promoting cross-strait exchanges and cooperation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260422_12762146.htm"],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on April 22, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalists, good morning. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask your questions below.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station CCTV's \"Cross the Strait\"","After Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Cheng Li-wun returned to Taiwan from a visit to the mainland, Taiwan's \"Democratic Culture and Education Foundation\" released the latest poll on cross-Strait issues on the island, which showed that more than half of the respondents agreed that Taiwan should take the initiative to face and discuss the issue of cross-Strait reunification, and nearly 70% of the people supported…","Relevant polls show that Chairman Cheng Li-wun led the Chinese Kuomintang delegation to visit the mainland, which responded to the mainstream public opinion on the island for peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation. It followed the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait getting closer and coming together. It played an important role in promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and safeguarding the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots.\nReunification is the only future for Taiwan and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots; \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end and will only bring serious harm to the Taiwan Strait. It is hoped that more Taiwan compatriots will follow the general trend of history, uphold national justice, understand the great interests of reunification, and actively participate in the just cause of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and promoting the reunification of the motherland.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260422_12762145.htm"],[2,"2026-04-22","Zhang Han","China Central Radio and Television Station's \"China News\"","Regarding the mainland’s launch of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, Mainland Affairs Council Chairman Qiu Chuizheng said, “The ten policies and measures all involve core national security and the exercise of government power, and must be formally negotiated by the two governments before appropriate arrangements are made.” Any comment on this?","Since the release of the ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, they have been welcomed by all walks of life on the island. Everyone has expressed their eager anticipation for the implementation of the policy measures, believing that this is an important measure to revive Taiwan's related industries and inject vitality into the economy.\nIn the face of the people's eager expectations, the DPP authorities will only smear and denigrate, pour cold water and set up obstacles. This practice of disregarding people's livelihood for the selfish interests of one party has been widely criticized and opposed by the island and the industry. The DPP authorities are advised to comply with the public opinion on the island, respond to the calls of the industry, and do more to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation.\nAs long as we adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with Taiwan's political parties, organizations, and people from all walks of life to seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, the welfare of our compatriots, and the rejuvenation of the nation.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260422_12762160.htm","",1,0,5,""],[0,"2026-04-23","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","The U.S. State Department criticized China for exerting influence to force three African countries to cancel flight permission for Lai Qingde's visit. What is the Ministry of Foreign Affairs' response to this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people, the trend of the times, and the great cause of justice. The United States is criticizing China's legitimate actions in safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and is arbitrarily criticizing the just actions of relevant countries in safeguarding the one-China principle. This is completely confusing right and wrong and confusing right and wrong. China is firmly opposed to it and will never accept it. China urges the United States to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, stop using the Taiwan issue to interfere in China's internal affairs, stop helping Taiwan consolidate so-called \"diplomatic relations\", and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是人心所向、大势所趋、大义所在。美方对中方捍卫国家主权和领土完整的正当行动指手画脚，对有关国家维护一个中国原则的正义之举横加指责，完全是混淆是非、颠倒黑白，中方坚决反对，绝不接受。中方敦促美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，停止借台湾问题干涉中国内政，停止助台巩固所谓“邦交”，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260423_11898587.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260423_11898539.shtml",0,0,2,""],[0,"2026-04-24","Guo Jiakun","Main station CGTN","We have noticed that in the past month, the evil seeds of Japan's \"new militarism\" have grown at an alarming rate: active-duty Self-Defense Force officials broke into the Chinese Embassy in Japan with knives, destroyers sailed through the Taiwan Strait, the Self-Defense Force officially participated in the US-Philippines joint military exercise for the first time, the cabinet significantly relaxed arms export…","This once again shows that Japan's \"new type of militarism\" is an indisputable fact and poses a real threat.\nHistorically, Japanese militarism has created \"external threats,\" incited nationalism, kidnapped state machinery, launched aggressive wars abroad, committed heinous crimes, and brought havoc to the people of all Asia-Pacific countries. Today, instead of deeply reflecting on the history of aggression, Japan's right-wing forces continue to promote the transformation of security policies in an offensive and expansionary direction, in an attempt to accelerate Japan's \"remilitarization\" by reorganizing the military-industrial complex.\nIn reality, Japan is lobbying everywhere in an attempt to confuse right and wrong and whitewash the image of a so-called \"peaceful country\" that has already gone bankrupt. The eyes of the world are sharp. Japan is pushing to amend the constitution, relax exports of anti-personnel weapons, deploy offensive missiles, and significantly expand military spending. No matter how rhetorical it may be, it cannot conceal its true intention of paving the way for military expansion. Japan also frequently interacts with NATO and attempts to introduce extraterritorial military organizations into the Asia-Pacific, clearly showing its intention to provoke confrontation.\nYin Jian is not far away, so we must pay attention to it. Countries in the region, including China, must maintain a high degree of vigilance and jointly defend the victory of World War II. They must never allow Japanese militarism to resurgence, never allow historical tragedies to happen again, and never allow anyone or any force to undermine peace and cause harm to the region.","这再次表明，日本“新型军国主义”成势为患是不争的事实，构成现实的威胁。\n历史上，日本军国主义就是通过制造“外部威胁”、煽动民族主义、绑架国家机器，对外发动侵略战争，犯下滔天罪行，给亚太各国人民带来浩劫。如今，日本右翼势力不但没有深刻反省侵略历史，反而不断推动安保政策朝着进攻性、扩张性的方向转变，妄图通过重整军工复合体加速日本“再军事化”。\n现实中，日本还四处游说，妄图颠倒黑白，粉饰早已破产的所谓“和平国家”形象。世人的眼睛是雪亮的。一个行动上推动修改宪法、放宽杀伤性武器出口、部署进攻性导弹、大幅扩充军费的日本，嘴上说的再天花乱坠，也掩盖不了为军事扩张铺路的真实意图。日本还同北约频频互动，试图将域外军事组织引入亚太，挑动对抗之心昭然若揭。\n殷鉴不远，不可不察。包括中国在内的地区国家必须保持高度警惕，共同捍卫二战胜利成果，绝不允许日本军国主义死灰复燃，绝不能让历史悲剧再度上演，绝不允许任何人、任何势力破坏和平、为祸地区。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260424_11899448.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260424_11899403.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Taiwan’s China Times","The first question is that regarding the car accident involving a Taiwanese tourist in Gansu, the Mainland Affairs Council said that it would contact the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Strait through the Straits Exchange Foundation to learn about the situation as soon as possible. Under the cross-strait agreement mechanism, has the mainland taken the initiative to formally notify Taiwan officials or…","The first question. As we all know, because the DPP authorities refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, the cross-strait communication mechanism of the two sessions has long been suspended. We hope that the DPP authorities will stop deceiving the Taiwanese people on this issue.\nRegarding this accident that occurred to Taiwanese compatriots in Gansu, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and governments at all levels in Gansu Province immediately activated the emergency response mechanism to provide medical assistance to the injured Taiwanese compatriots, initiate travel accident insurance claims procedures, and assist family members in handling the aftermath. We express our condolences to the Taiwanese compatriots who died unfortunately and express our condolences to their families and injured Taiwanese compatriots. We hope that cross-Strait tourism exchanges can resume as soon as possible and be carried out safely and orderly. The DPP authorities should lift unpopular restrictive measures such as the \"ban on group tours\" as soon as possible to create favorable conditions for the resumption of normal cross-strait tourism exchanges.\nTaiwan compatriots are our family and relatives. The mainland has always attached great importance to protecting the life and property safety of Taiwan compatriots, and has taken practical and effective measures to safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots. This has been the case in the past and will continue to be the case in the future.\nSecond question, April 23 this year is the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People's Navy. On the same day, the Navy opened six warships to the public in Qingdao, Shandong Province. Many Taiwanese compatriots participated in the opening activities, boarded the warships, communicated with naval officers and soldiers, and experienced the powerful strength and fine style of the People's Navy on the spot. The mission of the People's Navy is to defend the country and the people, which naturally includes Taiwan compatriots. The Taiwanese compatriots' speeches expressed their sincere national sentiments and received praise from compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait share the same culture and ethnicity, and share weal and woe. They should firmly identify with the Chinese nation, Chinese culture, and the great motherland, and strengthen their ambition and backbone to be upright Chinese people.\nThe DPP authorities ignore the facts, infringe on freedom of speech, intimidate and suppress those who participate in cross-strait exchanges and dare to speak out for justice, and engage in \"green terror\" and \"Taiwan independence and autocracy.\" Those who commit any injustice will be punished by death.\nTaiwan’s “China Television” News Reporter:\nThe first question is, regarding the car accident that occurred in a tour group of Taiwan compatriots from Gansu, what was the cause of the accident?\nThe second question is, among the ten measures proposed by the mainland to benefit Taiwan, which ones can be promoted unilaterally by the mainland without consultation with Taiwan? Is there a specific time for implementation?\nChen Binhua:\nThe first question. After the Taiwan-related traffic accident occurred in Xiahe County, Gansu Province on April 24, relevant parties in Gansu Province attached great importance to it and made every effort to treat the injured Taiwan compatriots. At present, most of the injured have been discharged from the hospital and plan to return to Taiwan in the near future. Relevant parties are also actively assisting the families of the unfortunately deceased Taiwanese compatriots to deal with the aftermath. The family members have returned to Taiwan a few days ago. As for the cause of the accident, relevant departments are conducting further investigations, and the conclusions of the investigation will be announced in a timely manner.\nSecond question. The introduction of ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation fully reflects our stance on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration. The purpose is to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and enhance the family well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council will coordinate with relevant departments and localities to promote the implementation of policies and measures. At the same time, on the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogue with Taiwan's political parties, groups and people from all walks of life to jointly advance relevant work. We believe that sharing peace, seeking common development, and jointly promoting prosperity on both sides of the Taiwan Strait is a blessing for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and will surely receive universal support from the people of Taiwan.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","","At the State Council Taiwan Affairs Office press conference on April 29, a reporter asked: The TAO spokesperson has, at previous press conferences, separately explained three of the \"seven betters\" for Taiwan after peaceful reunification, drawing close attention from cross-strait public opinion. How does the spokesperson interpret \"After peaceful reunification, with a strong motherland as backing, Taiwan's economic development will be better\"?\nState Council Taiwan Affairs Office spokesperson Chen Binhua said in response: During the \"14th Five-Year Plan\" period, the mainland's economic aggregate reached a new level, with GDP rising to 140 trillion yuan, average annual growth of 5.4% — among the top of the world's major economies. New breakthroughs were achieved in scientific, technological, and industrial innovation; new strides were taken in reform and opening up; and people's livelihood and welfare reached new levels. The \"15th Five-Year Plan\" outline makes strategic arrangements for building a modern industrial system, accelerating high-level scientific and technological self-reliance, building a strong domestic market, accelerating the construction of a high-level socialist market economy system, and expanding high-level opening up. This year is the opening year of the \"15th Five-Year Plan.\" Although the external environment is more complex and severe, the mainland economy got off to a good start in the first quarter, with GDP growing 5.0%, continuing to rank at the top among major global economies. Major macroeconomic indicators have rebounded, new growth drivers are growing rapidly, and new productive forces are developing steadily. The mainland economy has strong momentum and vitality. The fundamentals of stability, improvement, and long-term positive trends have not changed and will not change.\nAfter peaceful reunification, drawing on the mainland's super-large market, large-scale economy, and other advantages, and combining Taiwan's own scientific and technological characteristics and talent strengths, Taiwan's economy will gain new vitality, and Taiwanese compatriots will derive tangible benefits. Cross-strait trade will further release new growth drivers, and the mainland market of more than 1.4 billion people will become a strong support for Taiwan's stable economic growth. Cross-strait industrial and supply chains will be deeply integrated, further activating the endogenous momentum of Taiwan's industrial development. In upgrading traditional industries, Taiwanese enterprises can — through cross-strait upstream-downstream collaborative innovation — achieve digital transformation and intelligent upgrading, gaining vigorous momentum that is high-end, intelligent, and green. In strengthening emerging industries, Taiwanese enterprises can develop new technologies, new products, and new application scenarios, entering more new fields and new tracks and leaping to the high end of industrial and value chains. In positioning future industries, Taiwanese enterprises can leverage the mainland's science, technology, and industrial resources, actively integrate into the innovation ecosystem, and gain greater room for development. Moreover, the two sides will achieve interconnection and full connectivity, and the flow of goods, people, capital, and information will become smoother, providing more job and entrepreneurial opportunities for Taiwanese people.\nPeaceful reunification will inject greater certainty and growth potential into Taiwan's investment and business environments, and is an unprecedented opportunity and the greatest source of confidence for Taiwan's economic development. We hope that the broad Taiwanese compatriots will join hands with mainland compatriots to promote cross-strait peaceful reunification, share the achievements of Chinese-style modernization, and create a bright future of sustained development and shared prosperity.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260429_12763396.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","","At the press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council on April 29, a reporter asked that the \"traffic light countdown\" function of the mainland's AutoNavi Map APP was recently launched in Taiwan, which triggered people on the island to like the navigation countdown with almost \"zero error\", which is convenient and efficient. Some people in the Democratic Progressive Party alleged that there were safety concerns, and the DPP authorities also said that once safety concerns are confirmed, they will first ask public departments to ban their use and persuade the public not to use them. Any comment on this?\nChen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to inquiries that the mainland has the world's leading digital map, navigation and location service technologies. Many applications have been widely used in the mainland and some countries and regions for many years, meeting the actual needs of the people, making everyone travel more time-saving and convenient, and making life more convenient and enriched. It is a concrete manifestation of the development of science and technology that benefits mankind. In addition to Amap, mainland China also has many innovative, high-quality products and high-end, cutting-edge technologies. The compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and we are happy to let our Taiwan compatriots take the lead in sharing.\nIn order to seek \"Taiwan independence,\" the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have become \"anti-China\" to the point of being anti-intellectual and anti-technological. Since the Democratic Progressive Party came to power, Taiwanese society has seen a strange phenomenon of ideological confinement and suppression of speech. The most typical example is that they cannot say \"no\" to the United States and cannot speak well of the mainland. Just because Mainland China's technologies and products are easy to use and Taiwanese people like to use them, it is really ridiculous and ridiculous to prevent Taiwanese people from using them. This approach is unpopular and will not succeed.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260429_12763391.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Taiwan’s United Daily News","The first question is regarding the full resumption of normalization of direct air passenger flights across the Taiwan Strait. The Mainland Affairs Council said that airlines will apply if they think it is profitable. Taiwan's transportation department said that currently, 15 scheduled flight destinations and 13 charter flight destinations have been opened for cross-strait direct flights, covering almost all…","The first question. The cross-Strait direct air flight agreement is an important cooperation arrangement reached by the two sides based on the principles of equality, mutual benefit and benefiting people's livelihood. It should be jointly maintained and effectively implemented by both sides. The DPP authorities unilaterally violated the agreement, adjusted the route policy at will, and changed regular scheduled direct flight points into charter points with complicated procedures and demanding conditions. Even if airlines applied, they blocked them by \"discouraging\" and \"not accepting them\", setting up artificial barriers to civil aviation. This not only increases the operating costs of cross-Strait airlines and makes their organization more difficult, but also makes traveling between the two sides cumbersome and inconvenient, seriously damaging the legitimate rights and interests of the industry, and is tantamount to \"turning back the clock\" on cross-Strait direct air travel.\nIn the face of market demand and public voice, the DPP authorities, on the one hand, restricted flight destinations and discouraged acceptance, and on the other hand, they used despicable methods on the pretext that airlines were \"unprofitable\" and unwilling to fly. This kind of behavior that violates the laws of the market, ignores the spirit of contract, and ignores people's livelihood needs just shows that it is not an economic issue, but a political manipulation account. It is not concerned about the development of the civil aviation industry on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the interests of the people, but the political self-interest of one party.\nSecond question. The mainland announced in February this year that it would resume tourism for Shanghai residents to Kinmen and Matsu. This step is a follow-up implementation of the results of the think tank forum between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party. We are happy to see Shanghai tourism industry operators go to Kinmen for on-the-spot inspections and have discussions and exchanges with Taiwanese industry operators. The successful arrival of the Shanghai thread-walking group in Kinmen fully reflects our sincerity in practicing the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and enhancing the well-being of Taiwan compatriots. We hope that relevant parties in Taiwan will comply with public opinion, remove obstacles, and take pragmatic measures to promote the normalization of cross-Strait personnel exchanges and normalized exchanges in all fields. After the thread trip is completed, subsequent relevant matters will be announced to the public.\nThe third question. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are all Chinese and one family. Cross-strait affairs are family affairs of compatriots on both sides of the strait, and of course they should be handled through consultation among family members. Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are fully intelligent and capable of solving their own affairs, protecting and building their own homes.\nAt the same time, I would like to emphasize that the Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affairs. We urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques and properly handle Taiwan-related issues.\nReporter from Taiwan Dongsen New Media ETtoday:\nAt present, more and more Taiwanese people are traveling to the mainland. How will the mainland protect the rights and safety of Taiwanese tourists traveling in the mainland? Will the two sides of the Taiwan Strait consider restoring existing communication mechanisms or establishing new communication channels for this purpose in the future?\nChen Binhua:\nBefore the DPP authorities imposed restrictions such as the \"Group Ban\" and \"Orange Alert\" on travel to the mainland, Taiwanese compatriots had been traveling to the mainland for many years, and overall it was very smooth. There have always been very smooth channels between the tourism industry on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including emergency coordination channels after accidents, which have been operating effectively and have been recognized by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nChen Binhua:\nNext, I will announce the status of the eleventh Taiwan-related knowledge prize-winning Q&A activity.\nOn April 13, the WeChat official account of the \"Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council\" released the titles of the 11th \"Taiwan-related Questions and Answers\" activity, and netizens actively participated in answering the questions. As of April 27, the top ten netizens with correct answers and the most likes were: \"Returning to the boat to reflect the moon\", \"Tide of the same heart\", \"Love the Taiwan Strait\", \"Qiyu\", \"Have a good meal\", \"Follow the dust\", \"Mochen\", \"Warm sun in winter\", \"Little Daidai\", and \"Yunbo\". Congratulations to the above ten netizens, who will receive exquisite souvenir shell sculptures \"Treasure Island of Taiwan\". I hope that the majority of netizens will continue to care about the work on Taiwan and actively participate in promoting the peaceful development of cross-strait relations.\nOn May 11, the WeChat official account of the \"Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council\" will release the title of the 12th \"Taiwan-related Questions and Answers\" activity. Everyone is welcome to participate!\nChen Binhua:\nThis concludes today's press conference.\nThe May Day holiday is approaching. I wish all hard-working journalists and friends a happy holiday and good health to their families. Thank you all!","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","China Daily","Taiwan’s defense department recently stated that it has signed a number of arms purchase contracts with the United States, including 6 joint production of anti-armor missiles and large-caliber ammunition. Any comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, especially the \"August 17 Communique\", and immediately stop selling weapons to Taiwan and stop arming Taiwan.\nIn order to pursue the political self-interest of \"Taiwan independence\", the DPP authorities are willing to act as a \"cash machine\" for the US military-industrial complex and beg for unreliable \"protection\" from external forces. This will only put Taiwan into a more dangerous situation and bring serious disasters to Taiwan compatriots. I am telling the Democratic Progressive Party authorities that the reunification of the motherland is unstoppable. No matter how many weapons we buy, it is just a mantis trying to do the trick, and it will not change the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\".","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","Regarding Lai Ching-te's cancellation of his visit to Swaziland, some public opinion believes that more and more countries will regard adhering to the one-China principle as a rational decision, and it will be more difficult for Taiwan to \"make friends\" in the international community. There are also public opinions that the Lai Ching-te administration used this incident to exaggerate \"mainland suppression\" to…","Our position on Taiwan's foreign exchanges is consistent and clear, that is, it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle. The one-China principle is the aspiration of the people, the trend of the times, and the great cause of justice. Any attempt to challenge the one-China principle in the international community will only hit walls everywhere.\nThe Lai Ching-te administration stubbornly adheres to the stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and is the initiator of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait. The Lai Ching-tak authorities attempted to achieve a so-called \"diplomatic breakthrough\" through external channels. After being rejected by the relevant countries, they not only refused to repent, but also blatantly distorted the facts, fabricated the so-called \"victim\" narrative, and deceived the people on the island. The DPP has brought trouble upon itself, and its usual tactics have long been seen through by the Taiwanese people.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260429_12763392.htm"],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Hong Kong China Review Press","Recently, Taiwan's \"Democratic Culture and Education Foundation\" released the latest poll on the island, showing that 55.2% of the people believe that it is difficult for Taiwan to \"continue to maintain the status quo\", and 61.6% of the people agree that \"rather than waiting for the mainland to decide Taiwan's fate, it is better for Taiwan to actively participate in negotiations and propose the most guaranteed…","Relevant polls show that more and more Taiwan compatriots realize that the motherland will eventually be reunified and that the historical trend of reunification is rolling forward and unstoppable. On the premise of ensuring national sovereignty, security, and development interests, after peaceful reunification, Taiwan's social system and lifestyle will be fully respected, and the private property, religious beliefs, and legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots will be fully protected. Peaceful reunification will create huge opportunities for Taiwan's economic and social development, bring tangible benefits to Taiwan compatriots, and Taiwan's future will be even better.\nOn the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to conduct extensive and in-depth consultations with people from all parties, sectors, and classes in Taiwan on cross-Strait relations and national reunification issues, so as to jointly promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and advance the process of peaceful reunification of the motherland. We welcome the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots to actively offer suggestions and suggestions on the prospects of realizing the peaceful reunification of the motherland, and firmly hold Taiwan's future and destiny in the hands of the Chinese themselves.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260429_12763394.htm"],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Xiamen TV, Fujian","In response to the mainland's push to connect Kinmen and Matsu with water, electricity, ventilation and bridges when conditions permit to improve the welfare of the people of Kinmen and Mazu, Kinmen County recently formed an inspection team to Xiamen. It was originally planned to be led by Kinmen County Deputy County Mayor Li Wenliang and Speaker Hong Yundian. However, because the Mainland Affairs Council failed…","Promoting the connection of water, electricity, ventilation and bridges with Kinmen and Matsu in the coastal areas of Fujian when conditions permit, and supporting Kinmen to share the new Xiamen Airport, are our positive measures to respond to the expectations of the people of Kinmen and Ma, enhance the interests and welfare of the people in the two places, and promote the development of the Kinmen region. The inspection team from Kinmen to Xiamen was deliberately censored and blocked, which fully exposed the true nature of the DPP authorities who put political self-interest above people's livelihood and well-being. This approach goes against public opinion and is unpopular. It has been strongly opposed by the people of Jinma and Macao and widely criticized by public opinion in Taiwan.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","China Central Radio and Television Station's \"China News\"","The \"Fujian Provincial City Football League\" (\"Fujian Super League\") is currently being held in full swing, and players from both sides of the Taiwan Strait participating in the same field have attracted attention. Any comment on this? In the future, will the mainland rely on Fujian's geographical advantage over Taiwan to support more such private sports events and exchange activities, and build a platform for…","The \"Fujian Super League\" started this year and became very popular. The opening game attracted more than 51,000 spectators, setting a record for the number of spectators at a single sports event in Fujian Province. The rules of the competition clearly welcome Taiwan compatriots who work and live in Fujian to join city teams from various places. It is understood that Taiwanese compatriots have joined the Pingtan team and cheerleading team, making the \"Fujian Super League\" an event with cross-strait integration characteristics.\nBuilding a communication platform through sports events allows compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to enhance understanding, integrate and progress together in the same competition. This is an innovative measure that Fujian continues to implement based on its unique advantages over Taiwan. It highlights the unique role of sports in promoting the spiritual harmony of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and promoting the construction of a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone. In 2024, Fujian will form the Fujian Sea Sharks Baseball Team in the form of a \"Fujian-Taiwan Joint Team\" to participate in the Mainland Baseball League, National Games and other events.\nIn the next step, Fujian will continue to carry out nearly 100 cross-strait folk sports events and exchange activities to build a platform for cross-strait youth to exchange ideas and deepen friendship. Taiwanese youth are welcome to actively participate.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Chengdu Commercial Daily \"Red Star News\"","Please introduce the recent cross-strait exchange activities.","This month, cross-strait exchange activities in various fields have flourished and become more lively. On the 8th, the Cross-Strait Cultural and Creative Industry Exchange and Cooperation Conference was held in Chengdu, Sichuan. Experts and scholars, cultural entrepreneurs, designers and representatives of cultural institutions from both sides of the Strait had in-depth exchanges on topics such as the inheritance of Chinese culture, cultural and creative IP development, industrial cooperation and transformation, and jointly explored new ways for cross-Strait cultural and creative cooperation.\nFujian is separated from Taiwan by a river and is the province with the most frequent and active exchanges with Taiwan. The \"Fu Yun Luoyuan Pearl of the Mountains and Seas\" She Township folk culture living inheritance \"March 3\" event was held in Luoyuan County, Fuzhou City on the 18th. Taiwan's Hualien Ethnic Dance Troupe danced with the local She ethnic minority children on the same stage to enhance the friendship between ethnic minority compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The 6th \"Handmade Youth Village\" Cross-Strait Youth Township Entrepreneurship and Research Work Camp was held in Jimei District, Xiamen on the 19th. More than 50 college students from both sides of the Taiwan Strait created short plays around the five major themes of \"family affection, neighborliness, love, nostalgia, and brotherhood\", exploring the cultural origins of Fujian and Taiwan and the story of cross-strait integration and development. The Mingtai Agricultural Characteristics Industry Matchmaking Event with the theme of \"Drinking Together, Mingtai and Mingtai\" was held in Yong'an City, Sanming City on the 19th. More than 60 Taiwanese entrepreneurial youth, agricultural experts, university scholars and local folks had in-depth exchanges around agriculture and cultural tourism. \"Careers Lead You, Build Dreams in Huli\" The second two-way matchmaking meeting for employment internships and internships of Taiwanese college students was held in Huli District, Xiamen City from the 24th to the 26th. 92 high-quality companies provided 1,163 employment and internship positions, and provided two-way matching for more than 280 Taiwanese students from 66 universities on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The \"Tea Rhythm Symbiosis and Heart Connection\" ecological low-carbon tea series exchange event was held on the 25th in Anxi County, a famous tea town. More than 100 tea people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait exchanged skills and sought common development. The 2026 Jinbao Parent-child Research Camp \"Xiamen Golden Children's Fun·Ocean Intelligence\" was held in Xiamen from the 25th to the 26th. 60 parent-child families from Kinmen and Xiamen parent-child families jointly explored the mysteries of the ocean and felt the charm of marine technology.\n\"Hua Feng Fashion - 2026 Chinese Aesthetics Fashion Development Conference\" was held in Shanghai on the 25th. The conference was based on the joint inheritance and promotion of Chinese culture by both sides of the Taiwan Strait, empowered industrial development with Chinese aesthetics, and promoted in-depth exchanges between the two sides in fashion design, cultural creativity and other diverse industrial fields. More than 300 industry professionals, designers, and youth representatives from both sides of the Taiwan Strait participated.\nFrom the 26th to the 30th, the Cross-Strait Exchange Fund of the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Straits and Beijing Normal University jointly organized cross-Strait youth filmmaker exchange workshops, which included lectures by experts and scholars in the mainland film and television industry and well-known filmmakers, creative exchange and seminars for young filmmakers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, screenings of outstanding works by Taiwanese young filmmakers in recent years, visits to the China Film Museum, etc.\nThe \"WAY! Come to Shenzhen\" 2026 internship and employment activity for Taiwanese youth in Shenzhen has been officially launched, providing 1,920 internship positions and 2,492 jobs for Taiwanese youth, including global Fortune 500 and industry leading companies such as Tencent, Ping An, and Shenzhen Stock Exchange, covering diverse fields such as technology, finance, law, and medical care. The majority of Taiwan youth are welcome to pay active attention. From April 29th to May 3rd, the launch ceremony and cycling series of the second Cross-Strait Folk Culture and Sports Exhibition were held in Luhe County, Guangdong. 300 young Taiwanese riders competed with mainland riders to participate in the Hill Climb King Challenge, the Guangdong Province Cycling Greenway League, etc.\nThe compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family and should be able to visit each other frequently and stay close to each other. If you keep doing it, you will have a promising future. Activities and gatherings will surely make the straits no longer a barrier and prevent relatives from being alienated. The mainland of the motherland has magnificent mountains and rivers, a long history, and everything is changing with each passing day. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots to come and visit more. We are not afraid of seeing or not seeing. We believe that our compatriots will make their trip to the mainland worthwhile.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Hong Kong Phoenix TV","Taiwanese media reported that after the signing of the so-called \"U.S.-Taiwan Reciprocal Trade Agreement\" (ART), Taiwan lowered its inspection and quarantine standards for U.S. potato imports, and sprouted potatoes will be exported to Taiwan, triggering food safety concerns and panic among people on the island. Any comment on this?","We have noted relevant reports and are highly concerned about the health of Taiwan compatriots. In the face of economic bullying and product dumping by the United States through the so-called \"U.S.-Taiwan reciprocal trade agreement\", the Democratic Progressive Party authorities went against the will of the Taiwanese people and openly abandoned the bottom line of food safety. After opening up pigs, they brought \"poisonous potatoes\" to the tables of Taiwanese people. They once again sacrificed people's lives and health as a \"signature\" to flatter the United States in exchange for support from external forces for their \"independence\" actions. This harmed Taiwan's people and must be opposed.\nNew media reporters from China Central Radio and Television Station's \"Look at Taihai\" and \"Sun and Moon Tantian\":\nMainland China’s AutoNavi Map APP has recently launched a “traffic light countdown” function in Taiwan, which has attracted people on the island to like the fact that the navigation countdown has almost “zero error”, which is convenient and efficient. Some people in the Democratic Progressive Party alleged that there were safety concerns, and the DPP authorities also said that once safety concerns are confirmed, they will first ask public departments to ban their use and persuade the public not to use them. Any comment on this?\nChen Binhua:\nMainland China has the world's leading digital map, navigation and location service technologies. Many applications have been widely used in the mainland and some countries and regions for many years, meeting the actual needs of the people, making everyone's travel more time-saving and convenient, and making life more convenient and enriched. It is a concrete manifestation of the development of science and technology that benefits mankind. In addition to Amap, mainland China also has many innovative, high-quality products and high-end, cutting-edge technologies. The compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and we are happy to let our Taiwan compatriots take the lead in sharing.\nIn order to seek \"Taiwan independence,\" the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have become \"anti-China\" to the point of being anti-intellectual and anti-technological. Since the Democratic Progressive Party came to power, a strange phenomenon has emerged in Taiwanese society where thoughts are imprisoned and speech is suppressed. The most typical example is that they cannot say \"no\" to the United States and cannot say \"good\" to the mainland. Just because Mainland China's technologies and products are easy to use and Taiwanese people like to use them, it is really ridiculous and ridiculous to prevent Taiwanese people from using them. This approach is unpopular and will not succeed.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Xinhua News Agency","April 23 is the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People's Navy. During the Navy Day, the opening of People's Navy ships was held in Qingdao and other places, attracting reporters from Taiwanese media, many famous Taiwanese influencers, and many Taiwanese people. They all praised the achievements of the People's Navy and said that only with the People's Army protecting the people of Taiwan can the Chinese…","Since the new era, the People's Navy has made great efforts to strengthen the sea and move towards the deep blue. This year's Navy Day open event showcased the People's Navy's new achievements and new style, and demonstrated the People's Navy's firm will, determination and capability to defend territorial waters, airspace and national sovereignty. The heartfelt sighs of the Taiwanese people after the visit expressed the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, that is, only a first-class military and a strong national defense can be the most reassuring backing for the Chinese people at home and abroad, and can be the sharp sword that thwarts any attempt to split China.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202604/t20260429_12763390.htm"],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","People's Daily","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has explained three of the \"seven better things\" for Taiwan after peaceful reunification at previous press conferences, which has attracted great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's explanation for \"After peaceful reunification, Taiwan's economic development will be better with the backing…","During the \"14th Five-Year Plan\" period, the mainland's economic aggregate achieved a new leap, with its GDP jumping to a new level of 140 trillion yuan, with an average annual growth rate of 5.4%, ranking among the world's major economies; new breakthroughs were made in technological and industrial innovation, new steps were taken in reform and opening up, and people's livelihood and well-being reached a new level. The \"15th Five-Year Plan\" outline makes strategic arrangements for building a modern industrial system, accelerating self-reliance in high-level science and technology, building a strong domestic market, accelerating the construction of a high-level socialist market economic system, and expanding high-level opening up to the outside world. This year is the first year of the \"15th Five-Year Plan\". Although the external environment is more complex and severe, the mainland's economy got off to a good start in the first quarter, with gross domestic product (GDP) growing by 5.0%, continuing to rank among the best among the world's major economies. The growth rate of major macro indicators has picked up, new drivers of growth have grown rapidly, and new productivity has developed steadily. Mainland China's economic development has strong momentum and abundant vitality. The fundamentals of stable and long-term improvement have not changed and will not change.\nAfter peaceful reunification, based on the mainland's advantages in various aspects such as its large market and large-scale economy, combined with its own technological characteristics and talent advantages, Taiwan's economy will be revitalized with new vitality, and Taiwan compatriots will benefit from it. Cross-Strait trade will further unleash new growth momentum, and the mainland market with a population of more than 1.4 billion will become a strong support for Taiwan's stable economic growth; cross-Strait industrial and supply chains will be deeply integrated, further activating the endogenous driving force for Taiwan's industrial development. In terms of upgrading traditional industries, Taiwanese companies can realize digital transformation and intelligent upgrading through collaborative innovation between upstream and downstream industries across the Taiwan Strait, and become high-end, intelligent, and green. In terms of strengthening emerging industries, Taiwanese companies can enter more new fields and new tracks by developing new technologies, new products, and new scenarios, and leap to the high end of the industrial chain and value chain. In terms of arranging future industries, Taiwanese companies can gain greater development space by making good use of mainland technology industry resources and actively integrating into the innovation ecosystem. In addition, the two sides of the Taiwan Strait will achieve interconnection and communication, and the flow of logistics, people, capital, and information will be smoother, providing more employment and entrepreneurship opportunities for Taiwanese people.\nPeaceful reunification will inject greater certainty and growth into Taiwan's investment environment and business environment, and will be an unprecedented opportunity and the greatest confidence for Taiwan's economic development. We hope that our Taiwan compatriots will work with our mainland compatriots to promote peaceful cross-Strait reunification, share the fruits of Chinese-style modernization, and create a bright future of sustained development and common prosperity.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Fujian Southeast TV","Regarding the law enforcement patrols in Kinmen waters by mainland Coast Guard ships and the Maritime Safety Administration, the Taiwan Strait Patrol Department stated that it would videotape the entire process to collect evidence and inform other countries of \"how the mainland uses gray zone methods to intrude on the Kinmen and Matsu areas.\" Any comment on this?","Taiwan, Penghu, Jin, and Ma are all sacred territories of China. Relevant mainland departments carry out law enforcement and inspections in relevant sea areas to maintain normal navigation and operating order and protect the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which is legal and legitimate. The DPP authorities are distorting facts, maliciously hyping up the so-called \"grey zone intrusion\" in an attempt to provoke cross-strait confrontation and \"relying on external forces to seek independence\". They will not succeed.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","China News Service","Taiwanese media reported that according to the terms of the U.S.-Taiwan Reciprocal Trade Agreement (ART), U.S. peanuts will be imported to Taiwan with zero tariff. Public opinion on the island is worried that it may lead to dumping of U.S. peanuts. Taiwan's agricultural department said it is ready to assist in industrial transformation and increase the added value of Taiwan's peanuts. Any comment on this?","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities are trying to \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\". In the trade negotiations with the United States, they are unprincipled, flattering foreign countries and betraying Taiwan without a bottom line, allowing them to take whatever they want. If reports that U.S. agricultural products are imported to Taiwan with zero tariffs are true, it will have a serious impact on Taiwan’s agricultural development and squeeze the living space of farmers on the island. The so-called rhetoric of \"industrial transformation and increasing added value\" by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities is just an empty statement trying to shift the focus, perfunctory the people, and cover up losses. It cannot resolve the actual impact of dumping of foreign agricultural products at all. It blindly opens the market to the United States to please others, and ignores the livelihood and well-being of grassroots people internally. It harms the interests of the Taiwanese people and sacrifices the future of Taiwan's agriculture.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[2,"2026-04-29","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on April 29, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Hello, fellow journalists. Welcome to attend the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Now please ask your questions.","","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202604/t20260429_12763382.htm","",1,0,5,""],[0,"2026-04-30","Lin Jian","Hubei Radio and Television","According to reports, Japan's cross-party alliance of foreign diplomats thinking about human rights held a meeting in the Diet to discuss the issue of Lai Qingde's blocked visit to Africa and compiled a proposal to be submitted to the Japanese government. The proposal points out that the diplomatic independence of each country cannot be compromised due to any coercion, and requires the Japanese government to play…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an integral part of China's territory. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community. The relevant countries have taken practical actions to implement the one-China principle and oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, which are fully in line with international law and the basic norms of international relations. China highly appreciates this.\nThe Japanese side must be reminded that the 1972 Sino-Japanese Joint Statement clearly stated that \"the Japanese government recognizes the government of the People's Republic of China as the sole legal government of China\" and \"the government of the People's Republic of China reiterates that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People's Republic of China. The Japanese government fully understands and respects this position of the Chinese government and insists on following Article 8 of the Potsdam Declaration.\" The 1978 Sino-Japanese Treaty of Peace and Friendship was approved by the legislative bodies of China and Japan, confirming that the principles stated in the Sino-Japanese Joint Declaration should be strictly observed. Since the normalization of diplomatic relations between China and Japan, the Japanese government has repeatedly stated that the Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. These are legal obligations and political commitments that Japan must fulfill.\nAs for issues of diplomatic independence, democracy, and human rights, I have noticed that many insightful people in Japan are reflecting on Japan's domestic and foreign policies. There are also many discussions surrounding historical issues such as \"comfort women\" and forced labor, as well as issues such as the rights of indigenous people and ethnic minorities in Japan. Some Japanese politicians either remain silent or pretend to be deaf and dumb on these issues, but they make irresponsible remarks about Taiwan, China. I am afraid only they themselves know best what their true intentions are.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识。有关国家以实际行动践行一个中国原则、反对“台独”分裂活动，完全符合国际法和国际关系基本准则，中方表示高度赞赏。\n必须提醒日方的是，1972年《中日联合声明》明确，“日本国政府承认中华人民共和国政府是中国的唯一合法政府”，“中华人民共和国政府重申：台湾是中华人民共和国领土不可分割的一部分。日本国政府充分理解和尊重中国政府的这一立场，并坚持遵循《波茨坦公告》第八条的立场”。1978年《中日和平友好条约》经中日两国立法机构批准，确认《中日联合声明》所表明的各项原则应予严格遵守。中日邦交正常化以来，日本政府多次表示台湾问题是中国内政。这些都是日方必须履行的法律义务和恪守的政治承诺。\n至于外交独立性和民主、人权问题，我注意到日本国内很多有识之士都在反思日本的内政外交政策，围绕“慰安妇”、强征劳工等历史遗留问题和日本国内的原住民、少数族裔权利等问题也有很多讨论。一些日本政客对这些问题要么噤若寒蝉，要么装聋作哑，却对中国台湾说三道四，真正意图究竟是什么，恐怕只有他们自己最清楚。","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202604/t20260430_11903597.html","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202604/t20260430_11903286.shtml",0,0,2,""],[2,"2026-05-02","Chen Binhua","Not specified (reporter question, outlet not named)","A reporter asked that Lai Qingde's previous visit to Swaziland was frustrated because the relevant country refused to issue a charter flight permit. According to reports, Lai Qingde secretly got into Swaziland's plane and arrived in Swaziland on May 2. Any comment on this?","Chen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to inquiries that Lai Qingde's previous attempt to visit Swaziland on a chartered flight was canceled because the relevant countries adhered to the one-China principle. However, he was unwilling to fail and even ignored his face and sneaked to Swaziland in a sneaky way. Currently, the island is experiencing an earthquake, but Lai Qingde is ignoring it. This shows that he is cold-blooded and ruthless towards the people on the island, has a stubborn stance on \"Taiwan independence\", and is a complete \"troublemaker\".\nAdhering to the one-China principle is the aspiration of the people of the international community, the general trend and the great cause of justice. Lai Qingde's dirty behavior is like a rat crossing the street and will be ridiculed by the international community. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and living a stable and prosperous life are the aspirations of the people on the island. Lai Qingde disregarded the safety of the people and wantonly deceived the people, and will be spurned by the majority of Taiwan compatriots. The so-called \"diplomatic results\" that Lai Qingde worked so hard to concoct are nothing but tricks and make the world laugh. The inevitable trend of reunification of the motherland is rolling forward and unstoppable.","国务院台办发言人陈斌华应询表示，此前因有关国家坚持一个中国原则，赖清德企图乘包机窜访斯威士兰被迫取消，但其不甘失败，竟然不顾颜面，以偷鸡摸狗的方式外窜至斯。当前岛内正遭遇地震，赖清德不管不顾。由此可见其对岛内民众冷血无情，“台独”立场顽固，是彻头彻尾的“麻烦制造者”。\n坚持一个中国原则是国际社会人心所向、大势所趋、大义所在，赖清德如同过街老鼠的龌龊行径，必为国际社会所耻笑。维护台海和平稳定、过上安稳富足生活，是岛内民意所盼，赖清德不顾民众安危、肆意欺骗民众，必为广大台湾同胞所唾弃。赖清德费尽心机炮制的所谓“外交成果”，不过是玩弄伎俩、贻笑天下。祖国必然统一大势滚滚向前、不可阻挡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260502_12763833.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-06","Lin Jian","China Daily","Lai Ching-te sneaked into Eswatini on its plane. While in Eswatini, he spoke about “diplomatic independence.” Yet the international community and people in Taiwan described his action as “thief-like” and an “international joke.” What is your response?","Even though there was widespread opposition, Lai Ching-te sneaked onto a foreign plane and cheated himself into Eswatini by concealing passenger information with the country. On his return flight, after use of airspace was rejected by relevant countries, Lai again slipped onto the plane and forced his way through these countries’ skies. The whole thing showed the world how little Lai respects relevant countries’ airspace and sovereignty and cares for the opinion of the world. What he did was extremely dangerous and outrageous. The fact that he would smuggle himself in and out of the country shows exactly “Taiwan independence” separatism is just shady business and unacceptable to the international community. His act was nothing but a scandalous stunt.\nSome politicians in Eswatini who are kept in Taiwan’s pay have been wrongly providing space for “Taiwan independence.” China strongly condemns it. In recent years, we’ve heard people from various sectors in so-called Taiwan’s “diplomatic allies” strongly call on their countries to grow ties with China. Which is the right thing to do? To see where the arc of history bends and follow their people’s will, or to continue serving as a political prop and keeping up the appearances for Lai Ching-te and his kind? The politicians in these countries need to come to the wise decision and stop going further down the doomed path.\nThere’s but one China in the world and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is an international consensus that has solid support and is simply unshakable. The pursuit of “Taiwan independence” is a dead end and its days are numbered. Any new attempt Lai Ching-te makes to advance his separatist agenda will only box himself further in. We urge those separatists to turn back from the wrong path and mend their ways sooner rather than later.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260506_11905648.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-06","Lin Jian","Reuters","I have two questions. The first one is a follow-up to Taiwan leader Lai Ching-te’s return flight from Eswatini. Based on the flight route that we’ve seen, he has taken a rather long flight path back to Taiwan. So we wanted to know if China has spoken or made any requests to countries such as Madagascar and Mauritius about letting his flight through their airspace? Also, we noted that on his way back, he did fly…","Whether to open a country’s airspace falls within the country’s sovereignty. Relevant countries, in upholding the one-China principle, have refused to issue flight permits for Lai Ching-te’s visit. This just act is fully consistent with international law and basic norms in international relations, and fully proves that the one-China principle is where the arc of history bends and that “Taiwan independence” separatist moves have no support.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260506_11905648.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-05-06","Chen Binhua","Not specified (reporter question, outlet not named)","A reporter asked: The company where Yan Wenqun, the nephew of the \"Taiwan independence\" die-hard Liu Shifang, works, issued a statement yesterday severing Yan Wenqun from all positions in the Taiwan head office and the mainland branch. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Chen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to inquiries that \"Taiwan independence\" undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and harms the interests of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. It is a dead end. \"Taiwan independence\" harms others and ourselves and must be punished. We will never allow \"Taiwan independence\" die-hards and their relatives to invest and do business in the mainland for profit, and we will never allow those who support \"Taiwan independence\" and undermine cross-Strait relations to make money on the mainland while supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. Our measures to punish \"independence\" only target a very small number of \"Taiwan independence\" elements and do not involve the vast number of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese companies. We will, as always, welcome and support the broad masses of Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies to take root in the development of the motherland, share the opportunities and achievements of Chinese-style modernization development, and give Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies a greater sense of happiness and gain.","国务院台办发言人陈斌华应询表示，“台独”破坏台海和平稳定、损害两岸同胞利益，是一条走不通的绝路，搞“台独”害人害己，必遭惩治。我们决不允许“台独”顽固分子及其亲属在大陆投资经商谋利，决不允许支持“台独”、破坏两岸关系的人一边在大陆赚钱、一边支持“台独”分裂活动。我们的惩“独”举措只针对极少数“台独”分子，不涉及广大台胞台企，我们将一如既往欢迎、支持广大台胞台企扎根祖国大陆发展，分享中国式现代化发展机遇与成果，让台胞台企更有幸福感、获得感。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260506_12764333.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-07","Lin Jian","CCTV","With the China-U.S. presidential meeting approaching, there is speculation that Taiwan tops Beijing’s agenda for the summit. What’s your comment?","The Taiwan question is at the very core of China’s core interests, and the bedrock of the political foundation of China-U.S. relations. Abiding by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, and honoring the commitments made by U.S. administrations on the Taiwan question is the U.S.’s due international obligation and the prerequisite for a steady, sound and sustainable China-U.S. relationship. China has unwavering resolve in safeguarding national unity and territorial integrity. “Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. To keep the Taiwan Strait peaceful and stable, there must be unequivocal opposition to “Taiwan independence.”","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260507_11906405.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-07","Lin Jian","TV Tokyo","Responding at the Diet on November 7 last year, Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi said that a Taiwan emergency involving the use of military vessels and military force from the Chinese mainland could constitute a “survival-threatening situation” for Japan. It has been six months since then. I wonder if you have any comment today?","We have made clear China’s solemn position on multiple occasions. The root cause of the serious difficulties in bilateral relations lies in Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi’s erroneous remarks on Taiwan. The responsibility rests solely with the Japanese side. Genuine exchange and dialogue is only possible when there is respect and consensus is honored. If the Japanese side truly hopes to improve relations with China, it should abide by the four political documents between the two countries and the commitments it made to China, retract its erroneous remarks, and safeguard the political foundation for bilateral relations with concrete actions. We urge the Japanese authorities to face up to the root cause of the issue, do soul-searching, rectify their wrongdoings, and create necessary conditions for normal exchanges between China and Japan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260507_11906405.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-07","Lin Jian","EFE","Paraguay’s president Santiago Peña is right now visiting Taiwan with a delegation of business leaders, reaffirming ties between the two sides. How does China respond to this visit?","The one-China principle is a basic norm in international relations and a prevailing international consensus. On the basis of this principle, a total of 183 countries have established diplomatic relations with China. We urge the Paraguayan authorities to come to the right side of history as soon as possible, and make the right decision to recognize the one-China principle and sever so-called “diplomatic ties” with the Taiwan authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260507_11906405.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-07","Lin Jian","Asahi Shimbun","Exchanges between Japan and China have been dwindling. Does the Chinese side hope to see people-to-people exchange between the two countries restored?","As I pointed out just now, the root cause of the serious difficulties in bilateral relations lies in Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi’s erroneous remarks on Taiwan. The responsibility rests solely with the Japanese side. If the Japanese side truly hopes to improve relations with China, it should abide by the four political documents between the two countries and the commitments it made to China, retract its erroneous remarks, safeguard the political foundation for bilateral relations with concrete actions, and create necessary conditions for normal exchanges with China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260507_11906405.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-08","Lin Jian","Bloomberg","Honduras’ new president said his government needs to review his predecessor’s agreements with China. He also said that equipment from Huawei will be part of the review, and Honduras is in talks with the U.S. on using tech from Cisco. Does the foreign ministry have any comments on this?","The report puts headline-grabbing sensationalism before journalistic ethics of reporting the truth, taking things out of context, misrepresenting facts and sowing discord. Let me stress, there is but one China in the world. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The one-China principle is a prevailing international consensus and a basic norm governing international relations. It is the political foundation and prerequisite for the development of China-Honduras ties and bilateral cooperation. There is not the slightest room for ambiguity here. Since the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Honduras, the two sides have engaged in practical cooperation across various fields in the principle of mutual respect and equal consultation, delivering win-win outcomes that greatly benefit the two peoples and gaining popular support in both countries. Facts fully prove that upholding the one-China principle is the right choice that accords with the trend of history and our times, and serves the fundamental interests of Honduras and its people. The separatist attempts of “Taiwan independence” forces find no support and are doomed to fail.\nAs to the agreements between China and Honduras that you mentioned, I would like to stress that China-Honduras cooperation does not target any third party and should be free from disruptions from any third party. The legitimate and lawful rights and interests of the Chinese side must be fully respected.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260508_11907266.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-08","Lin Jian","AFP","The Paraguay president got a red carpet welcome in Taiwan today and met the Taiwan leader. What is China’s comment?","I answered a related question yesterday. Let me reiterate, the one-China principle is a basic norm in international relations and a prevailing international consensus. On the basis of this principle, a total of 183 countries have established diplomatic relations with China. We urge the Paraguayan authorities to come to the right side of history as soon as possible, and make the right decision to recognize the one-China principle and sever so-called “diplomatic ties” with the Taiwan authorities.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260508_11907266.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-05-09","Jiang Bin","","According to reports, the PLA recently dispatched naval and air forces to conduct joint combat-readiness patrols around the Taiwan Island, while sending a task force of main battleshipsto waters southwest of Penghu. Some analysts believe that the increased number of PLA vessels and aircraft crossing the so-called median line of the Taiwan Strait may be related to the recent overseas visit by Taiwan's leadership.…","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory , and there is no so-called \"median line\" of the Taiwan Strait. Military operations carried out by the PLA in relevant areas are completely legitimate and justified. \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces are the root cause of tensions and the primary source of instability in the Taiwan Strait, whichwe will never tolerate or condone. The PLA will continue to take concrete actions to resolutely safeguard China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, and firmly uphold peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","台湾是中国的一部分，根本不存在所谓“海峡中线”。解放军位相关区域开展军事行动，完全正当合理。“台独”是破坏台海和平的罪魁祸首，我们决不姑息、决不容忍。解放军将继续以实际行动坚决捍卫国家主权和领土完整，坚决维护台海和平稳定。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16460455.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16459588.html",1,1,4,""],[0,"2026-05-11","Guo Jiakun","Phoenix TV","The 79th World Health Assembly (WHA) will open on May 18. Taiwan has not yet been invited to attend. Does the Chinese government have any comment on that?","There is but one China in the world. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. China’s position on the Taiwan region’s participation in the activities of international organizations, including the WHO, is consistent and clear. That is, this must be handled in line with the one-China principle, which is also a fundamental principle recognized by UNGA Resolution 2758 and WHA Resolution 25.1.\nChina’s Taiwan region, unless given approval by the Central Government, has no basis, reason or right to participate in the WHA. Due to the DPP authorities’ persistent separatist stance, the political foundation for the Taiwan region to participate in the WHA no longer exists. To uphold the one-China principle as well as the sanctity and authority of relevant UNGA and WHA resolutions, China has decided not to approve the Taiwan region’s participation in this year’s WHA. Any attempt to play the “Taiwan card” for political manipulation in defiance of the one-China principle is doomed to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260511_11908438.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-12","Guo Jiakun","Global Times","It is reported that President of Paraguay Santiago Peña visited Taiwan from May 7 to 10. He met with Lai Ching-te on May 8 in Taipei and signed several so-called “cooperation documents.” President Peña claimed that Paraguay supported Taiwan’s “participation in international multilateral systems,” “the international community should recognize Taiwan,” and Taiwan does not need to worry about changes in their…","China firmly opposes and condemns such moves made by the Paraguayan side. There is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The one-China principle is a basic norm governing international relations and a prevailing consensus in the international community. Over the years, we have heard time and again the strong call of people from various sectors in Paraguay to develop relations with China. According to a poll in Paraguay, nearly 90 percent of the respondents supported establishing diplomatic ties with China. This fully demonstrates that establishing diplomatic relations with China serves the fundamental and long-term interests of the Paraguayan people, and that colluding with the Taiwan authorities wins no support. Relevant Paraguayan political figures not only turn a blind eye to it, but also blatantly visit Taiwan to endorse Lai Ching-te and his like in defiance of global criticism and willingly serve as chess pieces for “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. It’s apparent for all whether it is truly for the benefit of the Paraguayan people or for some ulterior motive.\nWe urge the Paraguayan government to change course at an early date, see where the arc of history bends, follow their people’s will, and make the right political decision to recognize the one-China principle. The wheels of history wait for no one. Rejecting the one-China principle will only isolate oneself from the international community.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260512_11909099.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-12","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","U.S. President Trump said yesterday that he would discuss with the Chinese side the U.S. arms sales to Taiwan and about Jimmy Lai’s case. Is China prepared to engage on these topics with Trump?","During President Trump’s visit to China, the two heads of state will have an in-depth exchange of views on major issues concerning China-U.S. relations and world peace and development.\nChina’s firm opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent and clear. As to the Lai Chee-ying case, China has made its position clear more than once.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260512_11909099.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-12","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV","Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi remains unwilling to retract what she said on Taiwan last November. We see that China has been amplifying criticism of Japan’s neo-militarism. Meanwhile, Sanae Takaichi and other Japanese officials have visited many countries in a short period of time to explain Japan’s “peaceful” stance, while easing restrictions on export of lethal weapons and planning to revise its…","Japanese militarism inflicted untold suffering on people in the Asia Pacific. The prosperity enjoyed by Asia-Pacific countries rests on the peaceful foundation laid down by the post-WWII international order. But the reality that must not be ignored is that Japan’s right-wing forces are gearing up with an actual roadmap to tear apart that order and foundation, and the action has already begun. The “gray rhino” of Japan’s remilitarization is charging towards us. Many international experts, scholars and media reports have pointed to Japan’s abandonment of pacifism and most dangerous shift in military and security policy since WWII, which threatens peace and stability in the region and beyond. History shall not be forgotten. Reality shall not go unchecked. All Asia-Pacific countries need to stay clear-eyed and jointly reject Japanese neo-militarism to safeguard the order of peace on which all countries rely to live and thrive.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260512_11909099.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-13","Guo Jiakun","Phoenix TV","It is reported that Lai Ching-te addressed the Copenhagen Democracy Summit 2026 via video. The Summit is hosted by an NGO in Denmark. Lai said that the Taiwanese people have every right to engage with the international community. The people of Taiwan have never backed down in the face of mounting external challenges. Taiwan is a “ sovereign independent nation.” What’s your comment?","The Copenhagen Democracy Summit you mentioned is filled with ideological bias. The summit deliberately invited “Taiwan independence” separatists to broadcast their nefarious proposition. This is a severe violation of the one-China principle. China firmly opposes it and urges relevant parties to adhere to the one-China principle and stop offering platforms for “Taiwan independence” forces.\nTaiwan is part of China. It has never been a country and will never be a country. The one-China principle is an international consensus that has solid support and is simply unshakable. Lai Ching-te and his kind chant so-called “democracy” in defiance of mainstream public opinion in Taiwan for peaceful development of cross-Strait ties, peddle their “Taiwan independence” separatist narrative, spread disinformation and incite antagonism and confrontation across the Taiwan Strait. Such moves once again expose their reckless, provocative and diehard stance of pursuing “Taiwan independence.” Whatever Lai Ching-te says or does, it does not change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, evidenced by both history and law, nor will it ever undermine international commitment to the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260513_11909838.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on May 13, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalist friends, good morning! Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. I would like to ask your questions below.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好！欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会，下面请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","新华社记者","The third Cross-Strait Chinese Cultural Summit opened in Beijing on May 11. Please introduce the main situation and results of this summit.","In order to thoroughly implement Xi Jinping's cultural thoughts and the spirit of the important speech delivered by General Secretary Xi Jinping when he met with Chinese Kuomintang Chairman Zheng Liwen, further promote cross-strait cultural exchanges, and jointly promote Chinese culture, relevant institutions and cultural groups on both sides of the strait will hold the third Cross-Strait Chinese Culture Summit in Beijing from May 11 to 13. A total of about 2,000 guests from both sides of the Taiwan Strait attended the conference, including about 1,000 Taiwanese guests, cultural representatives, youth and grassroots representatives.\nThe Cross-Strait Chinese Culture Summit has the permanent theme of \"Inheritance, Promotion, and Development\". This summit takes \"Connected by Blood and Connected Cultures\" as its annual theme. It holds an opening ceremony, a main forum, sub-forums on literature, cultural creativity, film and television, drama, traditional culture, and a cross-Strait media summit. It also holds summit special exhibitions, symphony concerts, Peking Opera performances and other performances, and organizes cross-Strait clans, \"Taiwanese Youth Watch Beijing\" and other societies and youth cultural exchange activities. The holding of these activities will definitely further promote the spiritual unity of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits and work together to promote Chinese culture.","为深入贯彻习近平文化思想和习近平总书记会见中国国民党主席郑丽文发表的重要讲话精神，进一步促进两岸文化交流，共同弘扬中华文化，两岸有关机构和文化团体于5月11日至13日在京举办第三届海峡两岸中华文化峰会。两岸嘉宾共约2000人与会，其中台湾嘉宾、文化界代表人士、青年和基层代表共约1000人。\n两岸中华文化峰会以“传承·弘扬·发展”为永久主题，本届峰会以“血脉相连、文化相通”为年度主题，举办开幕式、主论坛，文学、文创、影视音、戏剧、传统文化分论坛及两岸媒体人峰会，还举办峰会特展、交响音乐会、京剧演出等展演展示，组织两岸宗亲、“台湾青年看北京”等社团、青年文化交流活动。这些活动的举办，必将进一步促进两岸同胞心灵契合，共同携手弘扬中华文化。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765378.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has explained four of the \"seven better things\" for Taiwan after peaceful reunification at previous press conferences, which has attracted great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's explanation for \"After peaceful reunification, with the backing of a strong motherland, Taiwan's spiritual and…","\"Peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\" are the best way to achieve national reunification and best serve the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation, including Taiwan compatriots. After reunification, in the embrace of a strong motherland, the spiritual and cultural lives of Taiwan compatriots will be better protected, developed further, and improved faster.\nFirst, the cultural roots return to the true spiritual home. Chinese culture is the root and origin of the souls of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits. After peaceful reunification, China's excellent traditional culture, historical memory, and national spirit will be better inherited and promoted in Taiwan, and the Taiwanese people will no longer be in a state of ambiguous cultural identity and confused historical understanding. From Minnan culture and Hakka culture to folk beliefs, literature and art, they can all shine brighter when nourished by the roots of Chinese culture. Taiwan compatriots who were born as Chinese will have a more fulfilling spiritual world and a stronger sense of belonging.\nSecond, the space for cultural development will be greatly expanded, and cultural undertakings will become more prosperous. After peaceful reunification, the cultural creativity of Taiwanese society will be fully unleashed. Taiwanese literature, film and television, music, publishing and other works can easily enter the huge mainland market and receive policy and resource support in cultural undertakings, cultural industries, talent training, intangible inheritance and other aspects. People in the relevant industry can achieve better development on a larger platform and more opportunities, and gain more development opportunities internationally. Cross-Strait cultural exchanges are booming, and Taiwan's cultural characteristics will shine brightly in the overall prosperity of Chinese culture.\nThe third is to get rid of political manipulation, and the spiritual world will be clearer and more peaceful. For a long time, the spiritual culture of Taiwanese society has been seriously disturbed by political party disputes and ideological confrontations, and education, media, and public opinion have been deliberately distorted and fiercely opposed. After peaceful reunification, political manipulation was corrected, and the society on the island turned from confusion and anxiety to calmness and calmness, with people's hearts being stable and society being harmonious. The people's needs for spiritual and cultural life will be better met, and they can live with peace of mind, focus on development, and pursue happiness, and will no longer be trapped in confrontation and tearing.\nFourth, the national dignity has been improved and the ambition and confidence have been strengthened. After peaceful reunification, Taiwan compatriots have strong backing from the powerful motherland no matter where they are in the world. They are no longer \"chess pieces\" in international games, and no longer fear being looked down upon by outsiders. Instead, they are Chinese people who hold their heads high and are upright. They will be the masters of the great motherland, their national self-confidence and pride will be comprehensively enhanced, and they will gain the most fundamental and lasting spiritual enrichment.\nThe extensive and profound Chinese culture is the common \"root\" and \"soul\" of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits, and is our common heirloom. Standing at the historical tide of national rejuvenation, only by joining hands and moving toward each other can compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait deepen the cultural integration and strengthen the friendship between our compatriots, so that every Taiwan compatriot can reap stable happiness and rejuvenate with a new spirit.","“和平统一、一国两制”是实现国家统一的最佳方式，最符合包括台湾同胞在内的中华民族的根本利益。统一之后，在强大祖国怀抱里，广大台湾同胞的精神文化生活将得到更好保障、更大发展、更快提升。\n一是文化根脉回归真正精神家园。中华文化是两岸同胞心灵的根脉与归属。和平统一后，中华优秀传统文化、历史记忆、民族精神将在台湾得到更好传承与弘扬，台湾民众不再处于文化身份模糊、历史认知混乱的状态。从闽南文化、客家文化到民俗信仰、文学艺术，都能在中华文化根脉滋养中绽放更加灿烂的光芒，台湾同胞生而为中国人的精神世界更充实、归属感更强。\n二是文化发展空间极大拓展，文化事业将更加繁荣。和平统一后，台湾社会的文化创造力将得到充分发挥。台湾文艺、影视、音乐、出版等作品，可便捷进入大陆巨大市场，获得在文化事业、文化产业、人才培养、非遗传承等方面的政策与资源支持，相关业界人士可在更大平台、更多机遇中实现自身更好发展，并在国际上获得更多发展机会。两岸文化交流蓬勃开展，台湾文化特色在中华文化整体繁荣中将大放异彩。\n三是摆脱政治操弄，精神世界将更清朗安宁。长期以来，台湾社会精神文化被政党纷争、意识形态对抗严重干扰，教育、媒体、舆论被刻意扭曲、激烈对立。和平统一后，政治操弄得到纠正，岛内社会从迷茫、焦虑转向淡定、从容，人心安定、社会和谐。民众对精神文化生活的需求将得到更好满足，可以安心生活、专注发展、追求幸福，不再被裹挟于对抗与撕裂之中。\n四是民族尊严提升，志气底气更足。和平统一后，台湾同胞无论在世界任何地方，都有强大祖国作为坚强后盾，不再是国际博弈的“棋子”，不再怕被外人冷眼看待，而是昂首挺胸、堂堂正正的中国人。他们将是伟大祖国的主人翁，民族自信心、自豪感全面提升，将获得最根本、更持久的精神富足。\n博大精深的中华文化是两岸同胞共同的“根”与“魂”，是我们共同的传家宝。站在民族复兴历史潮头，两岸同胞唯有携手同心、相向而行，才能让两岸文化交融更深厚、同胞情谊更浓厚，让每一位台湾同胞都收获稳稳的幸福，焕发全新的精气神。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765377.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, Lai Ching-te delivered a video speech at the \"Copenhagen Democracy Summit\", claiming that \"Taiwan is a sovereign and independent country\", spreading the narrative of \"democracy versus authoritarianism\", and advocating unity and cooperation to protect \"democracy\". What is your comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is a historical and legal fact that cannot be denied or denied. Taiwan has never been a country. It has not been in the past and it will definitely not be in the future. Lai Qingde's lie is still a lie even if it is told a thousand times, and it will never become true.\nThe Lai Ching-tak authorities are accustomed to bluffing in the international arena under the guise of \"democracy\", wooing anti-China forces in certain countries, using the so-called \"summit\" to spread the false narrative of \"democracy versus authoritarianism\", inciting cross-strait confrontation, and engaging in acts of separatism. It is a complete political farce that has long been seen through by the world and will only be spurned by all Chinese people. Lai Qingde's poor performance cannot conceal his despicable behavior and authoritarian nature of constantly cracking down on political dissidents and suppressing speech on the island. \"Democracy\" is false, but seeking \"independence\" is true.\nOur will to oppose \"Taiwan independence\" is as solid as a rock, and our ability to crush \"Taiwan independence\" is indestructible. Relevant agencies should fully recognize the high sensitivity of the Taiwan issue and the serious harm of supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, abide by the one-China principle, and stop providing convenience and a stage for the DPP authorities to seek \"independence\" internationally.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是无法否认也不容否认的历史和法理事实。台湾从来不是一个国家，过去不是，今后更绝对不是。赖清德的谎话说一千遍还是谎话，绝对成不了真。\n赖清德当局惯于打着“民主”的幌子在国际上招摇撞骗，拉拢某些国家的反华势力，借所谓“峰会”散布“民主对抗威权”虚假叙事，煽动两岸对立对抗，从事分裂国家的行径，是一场彻头彻尾的政治闹剧，早已被世人看破，只会遭到全体中华儿女的唾弃。赖清德的拙劣表演掩盖不了其在岛内不断打击政治异己、钳制言论的卑劣行为和独裁本质。“民主”是假，谋“独”是真。\n我们反对“台独”的意志坚如磐石，粉碎“台独”的能力坚不可摧。有关机构应充分认清台湾问题的高度敏感性和支持“台独”分裂活动的严重危害性，恪守一个中国原则，停止为民进党当局在国际上谋“独”提供便利和舞台。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765376.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, an inter-provincial working meeting on building a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone was held in Beijing. What is the current status of the implementation of the \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian to Explore a New Road for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Build a Cross-Strait Integrated Development…","Since the release of the \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring New Roads for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone\" in September 2023, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the National Development and Reform Commission, together with relevant departments of the central and state agencies and Fujian Province, have resolutely implemented the decisions and arrangements of the Party Central Committee, comprehensively promoted the implementation of the key tasks of the \"Opinions\" and effectively promoted the deepening and solidification of the construction of the Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone. In the past three years, the demonstration effect of the Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone on Taiwan has gradually emerged and its influence has been increasingly expanded. It has become more convenient for Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese companies to land in their first home, economic and trade exchanges between Fujian and Taiwan have continued to be vigorous, Fujian has maintained a good momentum of deepening cross-Strait integrated development, Fujian and Taiwan have continued to deepen humanistic and social exchanges, and the construction of the demonstration zone has made significant progress.\nIn the next step, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the National Development and Reform Commission will work with relevant departments of the central and state agencies and Fujian Province to thoroughly implement General Secretary Xi Jinping’s important expositions on Taiwan work and the Party Central Committee’s decisions and arrangements on Taiwan work, closely focusing on the goal of building a cross-Strait integrated development demonstration zone tasks, strengthen responsibility, strengthen planning and advancement, support Fujian in continuously exploring new paths and new models for cross-Strait integrated development, launch more innovative measures, deepen the integrated development of Fujian and Taiwan in various fields, and accumulate replicable and promoteable experience for deepening cross-Strait integrated development on a larger scale.","自2023年9月《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》发布以来，中央台办、国家发展改革委会同中央和国家机关有关部门及福建省，坚决贯彻落实党中央决策部署，全面推动《意见》各项重点任务落地生效，有力推动两岸融合发展示范区建设走深走实。近三年来，两岸融合发展示范区对台示范效应逐步显现、影响力日益扩大，台胞台企登陆第一家园更加便利、闽台经贸往来持续热络、福建全域深化两岸融合发展保持良好势头、闽台人文社会交流不断深化，示范区建设取得显著进展。\n下一步，中央台办、国家发展改革委将会同中央和国家机关有关部门及福建省，深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于对台工作的重要论述和党中央对台工作决策部署，紧紧围绕建设两岸融合发展示范区的目标任务，强化责任担当，加强谋划推进，支持福建不断探索海峡两岸融合发展的新路径、新模式，推出更多创新举措，深化闽台各领域融合发展，为在更大范围深化两岸融合发展积累可复制、可推广的经验。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765375.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","Regarding the dismissal of Yan Wenqun, the nephew of the \"Taiwan independence\" die-hard Liu Shifang, from his Taiwanese company, Liu Shifang said, \"Taiwanese people must be careful when going to the mainland, otherwise their personal safety and property safety will be threatened.\" The Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council said it \"will study countermeasures,\" and the Straits Exchange Foundation also reminded Taiwanese…","Liu Shifang's pursuit of \"Taiwan independence\" is a criminal act of splitting the country and inciting secession. Yan Wenqun has long been benefiting from the mainland, but has provided Liu with political donations. The two men were punished in accordance with the law and deserved their punishment. Liu Shifang has no intention of repenting and rehabilitating herself, but she fabricates lies in an attempt to sway the Taiwanese people and create a \"chilling effect\", which is disgraceful. In recent years, Taiwanese compatriots have continued to come to the mainland more enthusiastically without fear of obstruction and intimidation from the Democratic Progressive Party authorities. The proportion of Taiwanese young people among them has continued to increase, which shows that Liu Shifang and his like have not succeeded and will not succeed in their attempts to intimidate the Taiwanese people.\nOur attitude is consistent. Punishing \"independence\" in accordance with the law and hanging a sharp sword are aimed at a very small number of \"Taiwan independence\" die-hards and do not involve the vast number of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese companies. As long as Taiwan compatriots are willing to participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and do not engage in separatist activities, we welcome them to come to the mainland for sightseeing, exchanges, study, life, employment, and entrepreneurship.","刘世芳搞“台独”是分裂国家、煽动分裂国家的犯罪行为，颜文群长期从大陆获取利益，却为刘提供政治献金。两人依法遭到惩治，罪有应得。刘世芳不思悔过自新，却编造谎言，企图拉台湾民众垫背，制造“寒蝉效应”，令人不齿。近年来，台湾同胞无惧民进党当局的阻挠恐吓，来大陆持续热络，其中台湾青年占比不断提高，表明刘世芳之流恐吓台湾民众的图谋没有得逞，也不会得逞。\n我们的态度是一贯的，依法惩“独”、利剑高悬，针对的是极少数“台独”顽固分子，不涉及广大台胞台企。台湾同胞只要愿意参与两岸交流合作，不搞分裂活动，我们对他们来大陆观光、交流、学习、生活、就业、创业都欢迎。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765374.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","Recently, the State Council announced the \"Regulations on Industrial Chain and Supply Chain Security.\" Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council stated that this has put pressure on foreign investors and Taiwanese businessmen in mainland China to comply with the law, and they are trapped in the dilemma of \"complying with relevant US bans will violate mainland Chinese laws, and ignoring the bans will result in US…","The \"Regulations on Industrial Chain and Supply Chain Security\" focuses on promoting high-level opening up to the outside world and promoting the stability and smoothness of global industrial and supply chains. It fills the mainland's legislative gaps in related fields and protects Taiwan-funded enterprises operating legally and compliantly in the mainland. The sanctions involved are aimed at implementing or assisting in the implementation of behaviors that endanger the safety of the mainland's supply chain, and do not target companies that operate legally and compliantly. As for the so-called \"increased personal safety risks for businessmen in mainland China and Taiwan\", it is pure nonsense and a common tactic used by the DPP authorities to discredit the mainland.","《关于产业链供应链安全的规定》着力推进高水平对外开放，促进全球产业链供应链稳定畅通，填补了大陆在相关领域的立法空白，在大陆合法合规经营的台资企业受其保护。其中涉及的制裁措施针对的是实施或协助实施危害大陆产供链安全的行为，并不针对合法合规运营的企业。至于所谓“增加在陆台商人身安全风险”，纯属无稽之谈，是民进党当局抹黑大陆的惯用伎俩。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","According to reports, in order to implement the so-called \"U.S.-Taiwan Reciprocal Trade Agreement\" (ART), the Democratic Progressive Party authorities will massively relax pesticide residue standards for 174 U.S. agricultural products following the \"poisonous potatoes\", including pesticides that are even listed as having \"carcinogenic potential\" by the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency. This has frequently…","Food safety is the bottom line of people's livelihood. If the reports are true, the DPP authorities will add another evil act of catering to the needs of the United States without a bottom line, constantly trampling on food safety red lines, and disregarding the lives and health of the people on the island after opening the \"Laizhu\" containing clenbuterol and releasing the germinated \"poison potatoes\". The DPP authorities blindly pursue \"independence\" and ignore people's livelihood, which brings disaster to the people and is bound to be opposed.","食品安全是民生底线。如果报道属实，民进党当局继开放含瘦肉精的“莱猪”、放行发芽的“毒马铃薯”后，将又添一桩无底线迎合美方需求、不断践踏食品安全红线、弃岛内民众生命健康于不顾的恶行。民进党当局一味谋“独”、漠视民生的行径，祸台殃民，必遭反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","上海东方卫视记者","Recently, the Shanghai Municipal Bureau of Culture and Tourism issued an announcement announcing that Shanghai residents can sign up for group and individual tours to Kinmen and Matsu through travel agencies with relevant qualifications in Shanghai and Fujian Province. How is the current progress of the relevant situation? When will Shanghai residents be able to travel to Taiwan?","On April 29, the Shanghai Municipal Bureau of Culture and Tourism made arrangements for Shanghai residents to travel to Kinmen and Matsu. This is the concrete implementation of the results of the think tank forum between the Kuomintang and the Communist Party in February this year. Recently, the tourism industry on both sides of the Taiwan Strait has begun mutual visits and inspections, paving the way for subsequent cross-Strait tourism exchanges and cooperation. We have announced the resumption of the pilot program for individual travel to Taiwan (main island) for residents of Shanghai and Fujian Province. We hope that relevant parties in Taiwan will comply with public opinion and open the door as soon as possible to create conditions for the normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and normalized exchanges in various fields.","4月29日，上海市文旅局就上海居民赴金门、马祖旅游作出安排，这是今年2月国共两党智库论坛成果的具体落实。近期两岸旅游业界已经开始互访考察，为后续两岸旅游交流合作铺路。我们已经宣布推动恢复上海市及福建省居民赴台（本岛）个人游试点，希望台湾有关方面顺应民意，尽早开放，为实现两岸人员往来交流正常化和各领域交流常态化创造条件。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","福建厦门卫视记者","The mainland tourism market is booming during this year's May Day holiday. The \"small three links\" between Xiamen and Jinmen are full of passengers, making Kinmen a popular destination for mainland tourists. Industry insiders on the island have called on the Democratic Progressive Party authorities to reopen cross-strait tourism as soon as possible to attract mainland tourists to Taiwan. Any comment on this?","According to incomplete statistics, during this year's May Day holiday, the cross-strait \"mini-three links\" passenger routes carried a total of about 32,900 passengers, a year-on-year increase of 10.57%. The Xiamen-Jinmen \"Mini Three Links\" passenger route also ushered in a peak passenger flow, with a passenger occupancy rate exceeding 95%. Among them, nearly 5,000 mainland residents traveled to Kinmen, fully reflecting the deep friendship and exchange needs of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe mainland has always actively promoted the normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and normalized exchanges in various fields, and has taken the lead in launching a series of convenient measures, demonstrating sincerity and goodwill. The tourism industry on the island has repeatedly called on the DPP authorities to comply with public opinion and lift restrictions on cross-strait tourism exchanges as soon as possible. The DPP authorities should face up to the voices of the industry and the needs of the people on the island, abandon political manipulation, remove artificial obstacles as soon as possible, and promote cross-strait tourism exchanges to return to normal as soon as possible.","据不完全统计，今年“五一”假期期间，两岸“小三通”客运航线共计发送旅客约3.29万人次，同比增长10.57%。厦金“小三通”客运航线也迎来客流高峰，客座率超过95%，其中大陆居民赴金门旅游近5000人次，充分体现两岸同胞的深厚情谊和交流往来需求。\n大陆方面始终积极推动两岸人员往来正常化和各领域交流常态化，率先推出一系列便利措施，展现了诚意和善意。岛内旅游业界多次呼吁民进党当局顺应民意，尽快解除对两岸旅游交流的限制。民进党当局应正视岛内业界呼声和民众需求，摒弃政治操弄，尽快解除人为障碍，推动两岸旅游交流早日恢复正常。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765372.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, the island's public opinion organization passed the \"Special Regulations on Military Purchase\" that lowered the upper limit from NT$1.25 trillion to NT$780 billion. The Democratic Progressive Party said in response that it was regrettable that the \"opposition parties\" turned a deaf ear to reminders from the United States and the international community, which may cause gaps in future defense security.…","We firmly oppose military collusion between Taiwan and the United States. The so-called \"defense and security\" of the Democratic Progressive Party authorities contains all kinds of evil intentions of \"seeking independence by force\" and \"rejecting reunification by force.\" It squanders the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people and is willing to act as a \"cash machine\" for the United States, harming the vital interests of the Taiwanese people and undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nOur determination to resolve the Taiwan issue and achieve national reunification is rock-solid, and our capabilities are indestructible. I am telling the Democratic Progressive Party authorities that the reunification of the motherland is unstoppable. No matter how many weapons we buy, it will only be a mantis mantis. It will only accelerate the defeat of \"Taiwan independence\" and be judged by history and justice.","我们坚决反对台美军事勾连。民进党当局所谓“防务安全”包藏着“以武谋独”、“以武拒统”的种种祸心，其大肆挥霍台湾老百姓的血汗钱，甘当美国的“提款机”，损害台湾民众切身利益，破坏台海和平稳定。\n我们解决台湾问题、完成国家统一的决心坚如磐石，能力坚不可摧。正告民进党当局，祖国统一势不可挡，买再多武器都是螳臂当车，只会让“台独”加速败亡，受到历史和正义的审判。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","According to reports, the \"Triple Forum New Party Roundtable\" was held in Taipei recently. This meeting focused on cross-strait issues such as Taiwan's prospects and peaceful reunification, and attracted public attention. Any comment on this?","The reunification of the motherland is a historical trend that is rolling forward and unstoppable. The sooner reunification is achieved, the better it will be for Taiwan's development and the better it will be for Taiwanese people to live a better life. More and more Taiwan compatriots see this clearly. We welcome all political parties, groups, and people of insight from all walks of life in Taiwan, including the New Party, to provide suggestions and suggestions for peace across the Taiwan Strait, the well-being of our compatriots, national reunification, and national rejuvenation. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait must jointly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, work together to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and advance the great cause of motherland reunification.","祖国统一是历史大势，滚滚向前、不可阻挡。越早实现统一，越有利于台湾发展，越有利于台湾民众过上更好的日子。越来越多台湾同胞看清了这一点。我们欢迎包括新党在内的台湾各政党、团体和各界有识之士，为台海和平、同胞福祉、国家统一、民族复兴建言献策。两岸同胞要共同反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，携手推动两岸关系和平发展、推进祖国统一大业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","《参考消息》记者","Recent polls on the island show that nearly a quarter of the people accept \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems.\" Some commentators said that this shows that the people on the island are gradually increasing their recognition of \"one country, two systems\" and their calls for peaceful reunification are getting louder. Any comment on this?","Unification is an unstoppable historical trend. \"Peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\" is our basic policy for solving the Taiwan issue. It is the best way to achieve the reunification of the motherland and is most beneficial to compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the Chinese nation. More and more Taiwan compatriots have begun to discuss the specific content of the \"one country, two systems\" Taiwan plan, imagine the prospects for Taiwan after reunification, and realize that peaceful reunification will create huge opportunities for Taiwan's economic and social development and will bring tangible benefits to the majority of Taiwan compatriots. We will work with our Taiwan compatriots to create the great cause of motherland reunification and national rejuvenation.","统一是不可阻挡的历史大势。“和平统一、一国两制”是我们解决台湾问题的基本方针，是实现祖国统一的最佳方式，对两岸同胞和中华民族最有利。越来越多的台湾同胞开始讨论“一国两制”台湾方案的具体内容，畅想统一后台湾的前景，认识到和平统一将给台湾经济社会发展创造巨大机遇，将给广大台湾同胞带来实实在在的好处。我们将同广大台湾同胞一道，共创祖国统一、民族复兴的伟业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260513_12765373.htm"],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","Recently, Taiwan's retired major captain Lui Lishi participated in the opening of naval ships in Qingdao to celebrate the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People's Navy, and said, \"I feel that the motherland is stronger, which means Taiwan is safer.\" In response, Taiwan's \"Retirement Association\" established a task force to launch an administrative investigation into Lui Shi. Any comment on this?","Mr. Lu Lishi's speech came from the heart and aroused strong resonance among compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities' intention to intimidate and punish not only exposes their lies about the so-called \"freedom of speech\" they advertise, but also exposes their fear of facing the powerful power of the mainland.","吕礼诗先生的感言发自肺腑，引发了两岸同胞的强烈共鸣。民进党当局意图恐吓惩处，不仅戳破了他们标榜的所谓“言论自由”的谎言，也暴露了他们面对大陆强大实力的恐惧。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","During this year’s May Day holiday, mainland Chinese people made 1.517 billion trips, a record high. The consumption was full of enthusiasm, which once again reflected the momentum and vitality of the mainland’s economic and social development, and attracted the attention and praise of netizens on the island. Any comments on this?","During the May Day holiday, the cross-regional movement of people across mainland China reached 1.517 billion, a year-on-year increase of 3.49%, a record high for the same period in history; domestic travel was 325 million, a year-on-year increase of 3.6%, with a total expenditure of 185.492 billion yuan, a year-on-year increase of 2.9%; holiday consumption-related industry sales increased by 14.3% year-on-year, comprehensive retail sales revenue increased by 12.4% year-on-year; movie box office exceeded 750 million yuan. A holiday picture with active people traveling, strong consumer demand, and a prosperous cultural and tourism industry fully demonstrates the vitality of China. We warmly welcome more Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland to take a walk, see the magnificent rivers and mountains, experience the friendship between compatriots, and feel the prosperity of the great motherland in the warm and rising human fireworks.","“五一”假期期间，大陆全社会跨区域人员流动量达15.17亿人次，同比增长3.49%，创历史同期新高；境内出游3.25亿人次，同比增长3.6%，总花费1854.92亿元，同比增长2.9%；假日消费相关行业销售同比增长14.3%，综合零售销售收入同比增长12.4%；电影票房突破7.5亿元人民币。一幅民众出行活跃、消费需求旺盛、文旅产业红火的假日图景，尽显中国活力。我们热忱欢迎更多台湾同胞来大陆走一走、看一看，欣赏壮美河山、体验同胞情谊，在温暖升腾的人间烟火中感受伟大祖国的繁荣昌盛。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Please introduce the recent cross-Strait cultural exchange activities.","Recently, cross-strait cultural exchange activities have continued to flourish.\nOn May 12, the Taiwan League Central Committee, together with the Ministry of Natural Resources and the All-China Taiwan Federation, held the 2026 Cross-Strait Marine Cultural Exchange Platform home event in the Pingtan Comprehensive Experimental Zone in Fujian Province. Nearly 300 guests from both sides of the Taiwan Strait who participated in the event focused on the \"origin\" and \"flow\" of the Austronesian language group. Through keynote speeches, roundtable dialogues, cultural carnivals, etc., they elaborated that Taiwan's ethnic minorities are an important part of the diverse unity of the Chinese nation. They called on compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to adhere to correct identification, inherit and carry forward the roots of Chinese culture, firmly build a sense of community for the Chinese nation, and protect the common home of the Chinese nation.\nFujian Province has recently held more than 10 cultural and sports exchange activities between Fujian and Taiwan. Among them, Haicang District of Xiamen City held the 9th Cross-Strait (Xiamen Haicang) Children's Swimming League. Sanming City held the 2026 Mingtai Hand in Hand Senior Training and Age Creation Research Symposium and the 2026 Hakka Culture Study Camp. A series of activities to commemorate the 1066th anniversary of Mazu's birth were held on Meizhou Island in Putian City. Nearly 50 Taiwanese Mazu temples and more than 400 Mazu believers and ancestral temple believers visited Mazu and shared peace. Taiwan's county and city Taoist churches led an exchange group of 45 people to visit Wutong Palace in Xiage Town, Zhao'an County, Zhangzhou City. Believers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait jointly paid homage to Emperor Wu Xian, talked about their hometown, and passed on their faith and customs. Quanzhou City held three Quanzhou-Taiwan exchange activities including the first Cross-Strait (Quanzhou) Youth Basketball Carnival, \"Come to Nan'an and Meet Success\". Longyan City held the 13th Cross-Strait College Students Creative Culture Festival.\nIn addition, the Suixi Lion Dance Troupe from Zhanjiang, Guangdong recently went to Chaotian Palace in Beigang, Yunlin, Taiwan to perform an intangible cultural heritage lion dance performance. The fourth \"Colorful Clouds\" series of activities for overseas Taiwan compatriots to travel to Yunnan were held in Kunming, Dali, Lijiang, Yuxi, Honghe and other places. More than 350 compatriots from both sides of the Taiwan Strait and overseas Taiwan compatriots participated in the launching ceremony. The rich and colorful series of activities allowed everyone to personally experience \"there is a life called Yunnan.\"","近期，两岸文化交流活动持续蓬勃开展。\n5月12日，台盟中央会同自然资源部、全国台联在福建省平潭综合实验区举办了2026两岸海洋文化交流平台主场活动。近300名参加活动的两岸嘉宾聚焦南岛语族“源”与“流”，通过主旨演讲、圆桌对话、文化嘉年华等，阐述台湾少数民族是中华民族多元一体的重要组成部分，号召两岸同胞坚持正确认同，传承弘扬中华文化根脉，坚定铸牢中华民族共同体意识，守护中华民族共同家园。\n福建省近日举办了10多场闽台文化、体育交流活动。其中，厦门市海沧区举办了第九届海峡两岸（厦门海沧）少年儿童游泳联赛。三明市举办了2026年明台携手乐龄培训·创龄研究座谈会及2026年客家文化研习营活动。纪念妈祖诞辰1066周年系列活动在莆田市湄洲岛举办，近50家台湾妈祖宫庙、400多名妈祖信众与祖庙信众同谒妈祖、共享平安。台湾县市道教会率45人交流团到漳州市诏安县霞葛镇五通宫进香参访，两岸信众共同拜谒五显大帝，畅叙乡情，传承信俗文化。泉州市举办了“来南安·会成功”首届海峡两岸（泉州）青少年篮球嘉年华活动等3场泉台交流活动。龙岩市举办了第13届海峡两岸大学生创意文化节。\n此外，广东湛江遂溪醒狮团近日赴台湾云林北港朝天宫开展非遗醒狮技艺展演。第四届“彩云之约”海外台胞云南行系列活动在昆明、大理、丽江、玉溪、红河等地举办，350余名两岸同胞和海外台胞参加启动仪式，丰富多彩的系列活动让大家亲身感受到“有一种叫云南的生活”。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","According to reports, Hainan University recently established a Taiwan Studies Center, with the main consideration being to connect with the advantages of the free trade port system and provide decision-making reference for exchanges with Taiwan. According to incomplete statistics, more than 10 universities in mainland China have established research institutions on Taiwan. Any comment on this? How do these…","The Hainan Free Trade Port will launch island-wide customs closure operations on December 18, 2025. A series of innovative measures in the Free Trade Port will bring more opportunities and benefits to Taiwanese compatriots and enterprises. Hainan University established the Taiwan Research Center to provide theoretical support for better serving the integrated development of both sides of the Taiwan Strait based on the characteristics of the free trade port.\nIn recent years, mainland Taiwan-related research has developed steadily, forming a number of influential research institutions and talent teams, which have played a positive role in promoting the peaceful development and integrated development of cross-Strait relations. We sincerely welcome Taiwanese academics and mainland research institutions to conduct academic exchanges, enhance mutual understanding, and work together to develop cross-strait relations.","海南自由贸易港于2025年12月18日启动全岛封关运作，自贸港一系列创新举措将给台胞台企带来更多机遇和利好。海南大学成立台湾研究中心，旨在立足自贸港特色，为更好服务两岸融合发展提供理论支撑。\n近年来，大陆涉台研究稳步发展，形成了一批具有影响力的研究机构和人才队伍，为推动两岸关系和平发展、融合发展发挥了积极作用。我们诚挚欢迎台湾学术界与大陆研究机构开展学术交流，增进相互了解，携手发展两岸关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council stated that in the past two years, it has received numerous cases of people missing contact and suspected of having their personal freedoms restricted while traveling to the mainland. It once again stated that the risks of traveling to the mainland remain high, and reminded the public to avoid non-essential travel. Any comments on this?","Mainland China's good social security environment is recognized around the world. It is a fact that all Taiwanese compatriots have a safe, comfortable, convenient and comfortable travel experience when traveling on the mainland to visit relatives and friends. The DPP authorities have been deliberately smearing and fabricating so-called \"risks\" in order to create panic, obstruct and disrupt cross-Strait exchanges and personnel exchanges, and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. I would like to reiterate that as long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots can travel happily and return safely to the mainland.","大陆良好的社会治安环境为世界公认。广大台湾同胞在大陆旅游观光、探亲访友，拥有安全舒适、便捷舒心的出行体验，这是有目共睹的事实。民进党当局不断蓄意抹黑，编造所谓“风险”，意图制造恐慌，阻挠破坏两岸交流和人员往来，升高两岸对立对抗。我要重申，只要不从事违法犯罪活动，广大台湾同胞到大陆旅行交流，完全可以高高兴兴来、平平安安回。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","According to reports, an advisory member of Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council said that cross-strait religious exchanges are actually a tool for the mainland's \"united front\" operation against Taiwan. The mainland has long used \"united front\" propaganda images such as ancestral temples and \"same roots and same origin\" to weaken Taiwan's religious and cultural autonomy. Any comment on this?","The DPP authorities have repeatedly distorted and discredited cross-Strait religious and cultural exchanges, which is unpopular. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait share the same roots, culture and ethnicity. Most of the religions and folk beliefs in Taiwan originate from the mainland of the motherland. It is natural for Taiwanese compatriots to go to mainland China to offer incense and worship in ancestral temples and pray for a better life. The essence of what the DPP authorities say and do is to promote \"cultural Taiwan independence\" and \"de-Chinaization\", which goes against public opinion and will not succeed.\nWe welcome Taiwanese compatriots to visit the mainland and explore historical and cultural imprints in ancestral temples and ancestral halls. We will continue to support extensive exchanges and exchanges between temples, groups and religious figures on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and build a platform and create conditions for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to jointly inherit China's excellent traditional culture.","民进党当局一再歪曲抹黑两岸宗教文化交流，不得人心。两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种，台湾地区绝大多数宗教和民间信仰都起源于祖国大陆。台湾同胞到大陆祖庙祖庭进香、朝拜，祈求美好生活，是人之常情。民进党当局的说法、做法实质就是在推动“文化台独”“去中国化”，违背民意，不会得逞。\n我们欢迎台湾同胞多来大陆走走看看，到祖庙祖庭探寻历史文化印记。我们将继续支持两岸宫庙、团体和宗教界人士广泛开展交流交往，为两岸同胞共同传承中华优秀传统文化搭建平台、创造条件。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","香港经济导报记者","Taiwan's public opinion agency recently reviewed a draft amendment to some provisions of the relevant security law, and plans to severely punish words and deeds such as \"advocating military reunification\". Public opinion representatives of the Kuomintang questioned Taiwan's administrative department's suppression of freedom of speech. A Taiwanese Internet celebrity said, \"The DPP wants to restrict the freedom of…","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and ignore the mainstream public opinion that Taiwan wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation. It deliberately and unscrupulously undermines cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, incites \"anti-China resistance\", continues to aggravate tensions across the Taiwan Strait, and intensifies to create a \"chilling effect.\" Its various evil deeds of \"Taiwan independence and dictatorship\" and \"green dictatorship\" are unpopular and doomed to failure.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，罔顾台湾要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的社会主流民意，处心积虑、不择手段破坏两岸交流合作，煽动“反中抗中”，持续加剧台海紧张局势，变本加厉制造“寒蝉效应”。其“台独专制”、“绿色独裁”的种种恶行不得人心，注定失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","北京日报记者","Recently, President Enrique Peña Nieto of Paraguay, Taiwan's so-called \"ally\", visited Taiwan. Any comment on this?","The one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. 183 countries around the world have established diplomatic relations with China on the basis of adhering to the one-China principle. We advise relevant countries to make correct decisions that conform to the general trend of history. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities' provocation for \"independence\" goes against the trend of history, and complete failure is bound to happen sooner or later.","一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识。全世界有183个国家在坚持一个中国原则基础上同中国建立外交关系。奉劝有关国家作出顺应历史大势的正确抉择。民进党当局谋“独”挑衅，逆历史潮流，彻底失败是早晚的事。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question, US Secretary of State Rubio said in a recent interview that US President Trump will discuss Taiwan issues with President Xi Jinping during his visit to China, and US policy remains unchanged. Any comment on this? The second question is that the United States is dissatisfied with the NT$780 billion special defense budget passed by Taiwan's legislative body recently, and hopes that the remaining…","The first question. The Taiwan issue is at the core of China's core interests. It is the international obligation of the United States to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiqués, and abide by the commitments made by successive US governments on the Taiwan issue. China is unswervingly determined to safeguard national unity and territorial integrity.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and are willing to act as a \"chess piece\" for their own selfish interests. In the end, they cannot escape the fate of becoming an \"abandoned pawn\". To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"\nSecond question. The Taiwan issue is purely China's internal affair and does not tolerate any external interference. We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. We urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, handle the Taiwan issue prudently, stop selling arms to Taiwan, and avoid sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","第一个问题。台湾问题是中国核心利益中的核心。恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，恪守美国历届政府在台湾问题上所做承诺，是美方应尽的国际义务。中方维护国家统一和领土完整的决心坚定不移。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，为一己私利甘当“棋子”，终究逃不出变成“弃子”的命运。要维护台海和平稳定，就必须反对“台独”。\n第二个问题。台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系。敦促美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，慎重处理台湾问题，停止售台武器，不要向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾TVBS电视台记者","First question, regarding the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, what specific responses does the mainland hope the United States will give on the Taiwan issue? Will the United States be required to make clearer commitments on arms sales to Taiwan or related policies? The second question is that the 2026 APEC event will be hosted by the mainland. Taiwan’s “Executive Yuan Political…","The first question. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. We firmly oppose the sale of weapons to China's Taiwan region by countries that have diplomatic relations with us. This position is consistent and clear.\nSecond question. Relevant departments have recently released relevant information regarding the upcoming APEC Trade Ministers’ Meeting in Suzhou. As the host of this year's Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) events, we will handle Taiwan's participation in the event in accordance with the one-China principle and the provisions and practices of APEC's relevant memorandum of understanding.","第一个问题。台湾问题是中国内政。我们坚决反对建交国向中国台湾地区出售武器，这一立场是一贯的、明确的。\n第二个问题。有关部门近日已就即将在苏州举办的APEC贸易部长会发布了相关信息。作为今年亚太经合组织（APEC）活动的东道主，我们将按照一个中国原则和APEC有关谅解备忘录的规定及惯例处理台湾地区参会事宜。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾《中国时报》记者","The first question is: Zheng Liwen, Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang, is expected to start a two-week visit to the United States on June 1. How does the mainland view it? Second question: Chinese KMT Chairman Cheng Li-wun recently proposed the concept of a \"Chain of Peace and Prosperity\" in an exclusive interview with CNN. Regarding the KMT's attempt to play the role of a \"regional peace connector\" in…","The first question. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are all Chinese and one family. Cross-strait affairs are family affairs of compatriots on both sides of the strait, and of course they should be handled through consultation among family members. Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are fully intelligent and capable of solving their own affairs, protecting and building their own homes. On the basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\", we are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with Taiwan's political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life, including the Chinese Kuomintang, to jointly seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, welfare for our compatriots, and rejuvenation for the nation.\nSecond question. The root cause of the current tension and turmoil across the Taiwan Strait is that the Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to a separatist stance, wantonly spread separatist remarks about \"Taiwan independence\", continue to seek \"independence\" and provoke, and attempt to seek \"independence\" by relying on foreign countries and using force. Only by adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle and resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference can we promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and effectively safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nThe third question. Recently, many mainland film and television dramas have been popular on the island, and some actors in the dramas are deeply loved by Taiwanese audiences. We are happy to hear this and support relevant Taiwanese groups in inviting mainland artists to Taiwan for exchanges and meetings with audiences on the island.","第一个问题。两岸同胞都是中国人、是一家人。两岸的事是两岸同胞的家里事，当然也应该由家里人商量着办。两岸中国人完全有智慧、有能力解决好自己的事情，守护好、建设好自己的家园。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”共同政治基础上，加强同中国国民党在内的台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士交流沟通，共同为台海谋和平，为同胞谋福祉，为民族谋复兴。\n第二个问题。当前台海紧张动荡的根源是民进党当局顽固坚持分裂立场，大肆散布“台独”分裂言论，不断谋“独”挑衅，妄图倚外谋“独”、以武谋“独”。只有坚持体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，才能推动两岸关系和平发展，切实维护台海和平稳定。\n第三个问题。近期多部大陆影视剧在岛内热播，剧中一些演员深受台湾观众喜爱。我们对此喜闻乐见，支持台湾有关团体邀请大陆艺人赴台交流，与岛内观众见面。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","The first question is that Taiwan's legislative body recently passed a special defense budget of NT$780 billion. When the heads of state of China and the United States meet, will the mainland negotiate with or put pressure on the United States regarding its arms sales to Taiwan? Second question, it has been a month since the mainland released ten policies and measures. In addition to inter-party exchanges between…","The first question. The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs, and its resolution is a matter for the Chinese people themselves. We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and Taiwan, China, and the sale of weapons by the United States to Taiwan, China. This position is consistent and clear. To maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, we must oppose \"Taiwan independence.\"\nSecond question. Since the release of the ten policy measures, we have adhered to the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, focused on the people's livelihood needs on the island, and on the basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" on the common political basis, we have actively worked with relevant departments and local governments to promote the implementation of relevant policies, persisted in improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and strived to allow compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to benefit from and share in the benefits. The DPP authorities should comply with the public opinion on the island and respond to the calls of the industry, remove various artificial restrictions, and remove obstacles to the normalization and normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields.\nThe third question. We have always spared no effort to actively promote the restoration of cross-strait routes and destinations. China Eastern Airlines plans to resume direct flights from Chengdu to Taichung from July 1, which is a concrete measure taken by the mainland to actively respond to the travel needs of Taiwanese compatriots. In April this year, a total of 3,140 direct air passenger flights were carried out across the Taiwan Strait, transporting 641,000 passengers. The number of passengers increased by 14% compared with the same period last year. The average passenger load factor of cross-strait airlines exceeds 85%. These data clearly show that people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have strong demand for exchanges, and there is a strong call for exchanges and the resumption of air routes and flights. The DPP authorities should comply with public opinion, face the laws of the market, and meet the travel needs of people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.","第一个问题。台湾问题是中国内政，解决台湾问题是中国人自己的事。我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系，坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器。这一立场是一贯的、明确的。要维护台海和平稳定，就必须反对“台独”。\n第二个问题。十项政策措施发布以来，我们秉持两岸一家亲的理念，聚焦岛内民生需求，在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”共同政治基础之上，积极会同有关部门、地方研究推进相关政策落实落细，坚持以交流融合增进民生福祉，争取让两岸同胞早蒙其利、共享其好。民进党当局应顺应岛内民意、回应业界呼声，取消种种人为限制，为两岸人员往来和各领域交流合作正常化、常态化撤除障碍。\n第三个问题。我们始终不遗余力积极推动恢复两岸航线航点。东方航空计划自7月1日起恢复执飞成都直航台中航线是大陆方面积极作为响应广大台胞出行需求的具体举措。今年4月，两岸共执行空中客运直航往返航班3140班，运输旅客64.1万人次，旅客数量较去年同期增长14%。两岸航空公司平均客座率超过85%。这些数据清清楚楚地表明，两岸民众往来需求旺盛，要交流、要恢复航线航班的呼声强烈。民进党当局应顺应民意，正视市场规律，满足两岸民众出行需求。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","英国独立电视新闻记者","In the upcoming meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, the Taiwan issue and arms sales may be discussed. Does the mainland believe that U.S. arms sales to Taiwan should be banned or restricted?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. We firmly oppose the sale of weapons to China's Taiwan region by countries that have diplomatic relations with us. This position is consistent and clear.","台湾问题是中国内政。我们坚决反对建交国向中国台湾地区出售武器，这一立场是一贯的、明确的。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾“中央社”记者","First question, Taiwanese media reported that Li Yanhe, the editor-in-chief of \"Eight Banners Culture\", was released from prison in May. Please tell us the specific time of his release from prison and the time of his departure. Will he have to serve an additional year in the mainland? The second question is that the Mainland Affairs Council said today that it is clarifying whether Taiwan's retired major captain…","The first question. The criminal facts of Li Yanhe's case are clear. The judicial authorities will hold a public hearing in accordance with the law and the punishment will be carried out in accordance with the law. Certain media outlets on the island have repeatedly hyped up judicial cases, slandered and discredited the mainland's judicial system, with ulterior motives.\nSecond question. This is another evil act of the DPP authorities to engage in \"green terror\" and create a \"chilling effect\" on the island. For a long time, the DPP authorities have suppressed Taiwanese people who threaten to participate in cross-strait exchanges out of self-interest for \"independence\". They have tried to restrict and block cross-strait exchanges, and even obstructed and disrupted the close relations between compatriots on both sides of the strait at the expense of the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people. This is unpopular.\nThe compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family. The mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation cannot be suppressed or stopped. The deep friendship between the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which has the same origin, culture, race and blood connection, cannot be severed. We will uphold the concept of one family across the Taiwan Straits and continue to provide more convenience and create better conditions for Taiwan compatriots to visit the mainland for sightseeing, business negotiations, exchange visits, study and internship, and work and life.","第一个问题。李延贺案犯罪事实清楚，司法机关依法公开开庭审理，也将依法执行刑罚。岛内个别媒体一再翻炒司法个案，诬蔑抹黑大陆司法体制，居心叵测。\n第二个问题。这是民进党当局在岛内大搞“绿色恐怖”、制造“寒蝉效应”的又一恶行。一直以来，民进党当局出于谋“独”私利，打压威胁参与两岸交流的台湾民众，妄图限缩阻断两岸交流，甚至不惜以牺牲台湾民众利益福祉为代价阻挠破坏两岸同胞走近走亲，不得人心。\n两岸同胞是一家人，要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的台湾社会主流民意是压不下、挡不住的，两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种、血脉相连的深厚情谊更是无法被斩断的。我们将秉持两岸一家亲理念，继续为广大台湾同胞来大陆观光旅游、洽谈商务、交流访问、学习实习、工作生活提供更多便利，创造更好条件。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-13","Zhang Han","台湾东森电视台记者","Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council spokesman Liang Wenjie said, \"Two Taiwanese civil servants visited the mainland and were interrogated by national security officers late at night. Do you have any comment on this?","We have always encouraged and supported cross-Strait exchanges in various fields, including tourism, and protected the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in accordance with the law. In 2025, Taiwan compatriots will visit the mainland nearly 5 million times. As long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots do not have to worry about anything when traveling to the mainland. They can come happily and return safely. Out of political self-interest, the DPP authorities have maliciously hyped and spread rumors to smear the mainland in an attempt to create a \"chilling effect.\" The purpose is to obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. This is unpopular and will not succeed.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","我们一贯鼓励、支持包括旅游在内的两岸各领域交流往来，依法保护台湾同胞的正当权益。2025年台湾同胞来大陆近500万人次。只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞往来大陆不必有任何顾虑，完全可以高高兴兴来、平平安安回。民进党当局出于政治私利，恶意炒作、造谣抹黑大陆，企图制造“寒蝉效应”，目的是阻挠破坏两岸交流合作，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心，不会得逞。\n今天的新闻发布会到此结束，谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260513_12765382.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-14","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","Two questions going back to President Xi’s meeting with Trump. President Xi talked about a new positioning in ties with the U.S. and also he said both leaders agree that building a constructive and strategically stable relation will guide ties in the next three years and beyond. Could you elaborate on that as well? My second question is, President Xi also said if Taiwan issue was handled poorly, then bilateral…","On your first question, President Xi Jinping and President Trump held talks this morning. Both sides agreed on a new vision of building a constructive China-U.S. relationship of strategic stability. This will provide strategic guidance for China-U.S. relations over the next three years and beyond. “Constructive strategic stability” means positive stability with cooperation as the mainstay, healthy stability with competition within proper limits, constant stability with manageable differences, and lasting stability with expectable peace. China stands ready to work with the U.S. to translate the new vision into actions in the same direction and jointly work for a steady, sound and sustainable development of China-U.S. relations.\nOn your second question, as President Xi Jinping noted during the talks with President Trump, the Taiwan question is the most important issue in China-U.S. relations. If it is handled properly, the bilateral relationship will enjoy overall stability. Otherwise, the two countries will have clashes and even conflicts, putting the entire relationship in great jeopardy. “Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. Safeguarding peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the biggest common denominator between China and the U.S. The U.S. side must exercise extra caution in handling the Taiwan question.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260514_11910614.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-14","Guo Jiakun","The New York Times","Did the two leaders specifically discuss American arms sales to Taiwan?","China’s opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent and clear.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260514_11910614.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-18","Guo Jiakun","China-Arab TV","Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi lost no time in securing a phone call with U.S. President Donald Trump to reaffirm the importance of their alliance, as the latter was on the way home after the visit to China. The Japanese side will collect information on interactions between the United States and China, including their possible impact on Japan, and respond appropriately. How would you comment on this?","During President Trump’s visit, the two heads of state had in-depth exchanges on regional issues of mutual interest. More than eighty years ago, China and the U.S., along with the other members of the Allied Forces, jointly defeated Japanese militarists and fascists and built the postwar international order—the bedrock for peace and development in the Asia Pacific. Today, Japan’s right-wing forces are seeking to challenge this order, which threatens to shake the very foundation of regional peace and has raised global concerns. Japan should first and foremost address its wrongful rhetoric and action on Taiwan, halt its reckless remilitarization drive, return to the right track of good neighborliness, friendship and peaceful development, and earn trust from its Asian neighbors and the world with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260518_11912625.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-18","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","There are media reports saying that Taiwan’s Lin Chia-lung is in Geneva to attend events that coincide with the World Health Assembly (WHA). Has China reached out to Switzerland about such participation by the Taiwan side around this WHA event?","We have already made our position clear. There is but one China in the world. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. When handling issues related to the Taiwan region, WHO and other international organizations must follow the one-China principle, which is also a fundamental principle as demonstrated by the UNGA Resolution 2758 and WHA Resolution 25.1. China firmly opposes any official exchanges in any forms between countries having diplomatic ties with China and the Taiwan region, and firmly opposes any attempts to offer platforms for “Taiwan independence” separatist activities. The Taiwan authorities’ practice of sending representatives to various meetings to seek attention is nothing but political theatrics and doomed to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260518_11912625.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-18","Guo Jiakun","Shenzhen TV","U.S. President Trump said in an exclusive interview aired on May 15 that the U.S. policy on Taiwan remains unchanged. He said, “I don’t like to see anybody going independent. I’m not looking to have somebody say, let’s go independent because the United States is backing us.” The United States has no intention of seeking war and he hopes both sides across the Taiwan Strait will remain calm, he added. The Taiwan…","We have noted President Trump’s remarks. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. It is never a country, not in the past, and never in the future. “Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. To seek “Taiwan independence” by soliciting external support is a dead end. Cross-Strait reunification is the only bright path forward. The DPP authorities should recognize the overwhelming trend, stop burying their heads in the sand, and stop going further down the wrong path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260518_11912625.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-18","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Taiwan’s leader Lai Ching-te said on Sunday that Taiwan will never be traded away as he pressed the United States to keep selling weapons to them. He said arms sales from the United States to Taiwan were an element in maintaining regional peace and stability. What is the foreign ministry’s comment on this?","China’s firm opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent and clear.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260518_11912625.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-18","Guo Jiakun","Phoenix TV","It is reported that, on the evening of May 17, in response to President Trump’s remarks that the U.S. is against “Taiwan independence” after his visit to China, Lai Ching-te posted on social media that Taiwan has always been a firm defender of the status quo on both sides of the Strait; Taiwan, the Republic of China, is a sovereign and independent democratic country; and there is no “Taiwan independence” issue.…","Lai Ching-te’s latest act is just self-defeating, which once again lays bare his separatist stance and intent to advance “Taiwan independence.”\nThere is but one China in the world. Taiwan is never a country, not in the past, and never in the future. The Chinese mainland and Taiwan belong to one and the same China. This constitutes the real status quo in the Taiwan Strait. By colluding with external forces to seek independence and attempting to make the Taiwan question an international issue, the Lai Ching-te authorities are the biggest destroyer of the status quo and the biggest source of disruption to peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\n“Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace and stability are as irreconcilable as fire and water. To uphold the one-China principle, one must oppose “Taiwan independence.” Any attempts to seek independence with external forces’ backing or by force are delusional.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260518_11912625.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-05-18","Jiang Bin","","According to reports, the DPP authorities officially unveiled a new version of the special defense budget, claiming that it meets the urgent need for arms purchases from the United States. However, the budget has been significantly scaled back and remains incomplete. What is your comment on this?","The massive arms purchases are nothing but a \"blood-sucking bill\" for the DPP authorities to fleece the public and undermine people's wellbeing. In total disregard of the hardships of the people and the reality that young people on the island are unwilling to fight on the battlefield for \"Taiwan independence\", the DPP authorities insist on using the people's hard-earned money to fawn on external forces, reducing themselves to an \"ATM\" for foreign arms dealers. They even clamor that \"the more money spent, the safer it is\". Such retrogressive moves are extremely unpopular.\nBuying foreign weapons cannot guarantee Taiwan's security. Those willingly serving as a \"pawn\" will only be sucked dry and thrown away. Taiwan's true security lies on reunification and the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. The further the DPP authorities go down the path of seeking \"Taiwan independence\" by force and by soliciting external support, the faster they will court their own demise.","巨额军购是民进党当局压榨民众、掏空民生的“吸血账单”。民进党当局罔顾民生疾苦，无视岛内青年不愿为“台独”上战场的现实，执意拿民众血汗钱讨好外部势力，沦为外国军火商的“提款机”，还鼓吹“花钱越多越安全”，其倒行逆施不得人心。\n军购买不来安全，甘当“棋子”只会被榨干吃净。祖国统一和中华民族伟大复兴，才是台湾最坚实的保障。民进党当局“以武谋独”“倚外谋独”越甚，越会加速“台独”败亡的进程。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16463707.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16461760.html",1,1,4,""],[2,"2026-05-18","Chen Binhua","Not specified (reporter question, outlet not named)","A reporter asked that the 79th World Health Assembly once again decided not to include Taiwan-related proposals on the agenda of the assembly. Any comment on this?","Chen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to inquiries that this is the 10th consecutive year that the World Health Assembly has rejected so-called Taiwan-related proposals put forward by individual countries. The relevant decision once again shows that adhering to the one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people, the trend of the times, and the great cause of justice. The basic pattern of the international community's insistence on the one-China principle cannot be challenged and cannot be shaken. It also shows once again that the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and do not recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle. They attempt to take a different approach and make a so-called \"breakthrough\" on the issue of Taiwan's participation in the World Health Assembly. This road will not work and will be frustrated.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan, and Taiwan compatriots are our relatives and family members. We always have the health and well-being of our Taiwan compatriots at heart. While Taiwan has not participated in the World Health Assembly, we have made appropriate arrangements for Taiwan's participation in global health on the basis of the one-China principle. In the past year, Taiwanese medical technology experts participated in a total of 18 WHO technical activities. Under the framework of the International Health Regulations, any information on public health emergencies reported by the WHO to various places can be obtained in a timely manner by the Taiwan region and can be reported to the WHO in a timely manner. Both sides of the Taiwan Strait also have a smooth information reporting mechanism for infectious disease epidemics, and have held hospital director forums and other activities. This fully demonstrates that we are serious about addressing the health issues of concern to Taiwan compatriots, that Taiwan has fully open channels to participate in WHO technical communication and cooperation, and to obtain information and support on various public health emergencies, and that the health rights of Taiwan compatriots are effectively protected.\nFor some time, the DPP authorities have colluded with external forces and have continued to make a fuss about participating in the World Health Assembly, deliberately distorting and challenging the fundamental principles confirmed by United Nations General Assembly Resolution 2758 and World Health Assembly Resolution 25.1. This is not only a political maneuver for \"independence\" under the guise of health and a challenge to China's sovereignty and territorial integrity, it is also a challenge to the post-World War II international order, international justice and universal consensus. No matter what tricks the DPP authorities play, they can't deceive people, they can't achieve anything, they can't change the doomed outcome of seeking \"independence\", and they can't stop the historical trend that the motherland will eventually be reunified and will be reunified.","国务院台办发言人陈斌华应询表示，这是世界卫生大会连续第10年拒绝个别国家提出的所谓涉台提案。有关决定再次表明，坚持一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识，是人心所向、大势所趋、大义所在，国际社会坚持一个中国原则的基本格局不容挑战、不可撼动；也再次表明，民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，企图在台湾地区参加世卫大会的问题上走旁门左道、搞所谓“突破”，此路不通、必遭挫败。\n台湾是中国的台湾，台湾同胞是我们的亲人、家人。我们始终把台湾同胞的健康福祉放在心上。在台湾地区未参加世卫大会的情况下，我们在一个中国原则基础上，对台湾地区参与全球卫生事业作出了妥善安排。过去一年，中国台湾医疗技术专家参加世卫组织技术活动共计18人次。在《国际卫生条例》框架下，世卫组织向各地通报的任何突发公共卫生事件信息，台湾地区都能够及时获得，也能够及时向世卫组织通报。两岸还有通畅的传染病疫情信息通报机制，并举行了医院院长论坛等活动。这充分说明，我们认真解决台湾同胞关心的卫生健康问题，台湾地区参与世卫组织技术领域沟通合作、获取各种突发公共卫生事件信息和支援的渠道充分畅通，台湾同胞的健康权利有切实保障。\n一段时间以来，民进党当局勾连外部势力，不断拿参加世卫大会做文章，蓄意歪曲挑战联合国大会第2758号决议和世界卫生大会25.1号决议确认的根本原则。这不仅是在打着卫生事业的幌子进行谋“独”政治操弄，挑战中国的主权和领土完整，也是在挑战二战后国际秩序，挑战国际正义和普遍共识。无论民进党当局耍什么伎俩，都骗不了人、成不了事，都改变不了谋“独”注定失败的结局，更阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260518_12766265.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-19","Guo Jiakun","Beijing Daily","The 79th World Health Assembly (WHA) decided to reject the so-called proposal on Taiwan. This has been the 10th year in a row that the WHA has rejected the so-called proposal concerning Taiwan. What’s your comment?","The WHA has rejected the so-called proposal on Taiwan for 10 consecutive years, which fully shows that the international commitment to the one-China principle is unshakable, and the authority of the UNGA Resolution 2758 is indisputable. The rejection of the proposal over the past decade shows that the DPP authorities’ “Taiwan independence” separatist stance is doomed to fail. It’s time for the DPP authorities to put to rest their political stunts for “Taiwan independence.” China will achieve complete reunification. Taiwan must return to the motherland.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260519_11913636.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-19","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","The Philippines’ President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. said his country would likely be involved in any conflict over Taiwan due to his country’s proximity to the island. To quote him, we do not have a choice because Taiwan is so close to the Philippines, and we have almost 200,000 Filipino nationals living and working in Taiwan. Does the foreign ministry have any comment?","China noted that the Philippine leader reiterates his commitment to the one-China policy and non-interference in China’s internal affairs. It should be emphasized that, “large number of Filipinos living and working” on the Taiwan island and “geopolitical proximity” should not serve as the excuse for one country to interfere in another country’s internal and sovereign affairs. We hope the Philippines could honor its commitments, match its words with actions, and abide by the one-China principle with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260519_11913636.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-20","Guo Jiakun","Asahi Shimbun","Taiwan’s Lai Ching-te expressed his hope to continue U.S. arms purchases, and said that if he had the opportunity to have a phone call with President Trump, he had a responsibility to express the voice of Taiwanese society. He added that Taiwan is an “independent sovereign country.” What’s China’s comment?","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. It has never been a country and will never be a country. The Lai Ching-te authorities have developed a conditioned response of making every attempt to grab attention, which only time and again revealed their true nature as provocateurs and saboteurs of peace. “Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. Soliciting external support and pursuing military buildup to seek “Taiwan independence” is doomed to fail. China’s firm opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent and clear. The U.S. needs to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, and take concrete actions to uphold the overall China-U.S. relations and peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260520_11914528.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-20","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Taiwan’s leader Lai Ching-te said today in a speech that foreign forces cannot decide the future of Taiwan, nor can Taiwan be held hostage by fear, division or short-term interest. What is the foreign ministry’s reaction to these comments and Lai’s speech today?","There is but one China in the world. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. The two sides of the Strait belong to one and the same China, and this is the real status quo across the Taiwan Strait. “Taiwan independence” and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water. “Taiwan independence” separatist forces constitute the biggest destroyer of the status quo across the Strait and the biggest source of disruption to peace and stability in the region. To safeguard peace and stability across the Strait, one must firmly follow the one-China principle and stand against “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. Leaders and political figures from the overwhelming majority of countries in the international community have reaffirmed their commitment to the one-China principle through various ways. Facts show that opposing “Taiwan independence” separatism and supporting China’s reunification is where the arc of history bends and public opinion trends.\nLai Ching-te’s persistent separatist stance and his true agenda of seeking “Taiwan independence” under the cover of so-called democracy has proved himself as a saboteur of peace, creator of crisis and troublemaker. No matter what “Taiwan independence” separatist forces say or do, the people in the Taiwan region will not be misled; the fundamental reality that the Taiwan question is purely China’s internal affair will not be changed; the international commitment to the one-China principle will not be shaken; and the historical trend that China will and must achieve reunification will not be stopped.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260520_11914528.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-05-20","Jiang Bin","","据报道，赖清德5月20日发表讲话，声称维持台海和平稳定是台湾的“战略目标”，鼓噪强化不对称战力，提升“全民防卫韧性”。请问对此有何评论？","","面对祖国必然统一的大势和国际格局深刻调整的现实，赖清德依旧沉迷于“倚外谋独”的幻觉，打着所谓“和平”的幌子，大肆兜售“台独”谬论，煽动“以武谋独拒统”，妄图改变台湾属于中国这一根本现状，将谋“独”野心置于台湾民众福祉之上，完全是自欺欺人、打错算盘。\n赖清德当局罔顾民族大义和台湾主流民意，勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，是导致台海局势紧张动荡的根源所在。其固守不可能实现的“台独”执念，变本加厉拿老百姓的血汗钱媚外输诚，强行把台湾民众绑上“台独”战车，一步步把台湾推向兵凶战危的险境。正告民进党当局，砸再多的钱，买再多的武器，都是螳臂当车、以卵击石，“以武谋独”死路一条，祖国统一才是光明大道。\n国土不可分、民族不可散，“台独”与台海和平水火不容。解放军始终保持高度戒备，坚决挫败任何“台独”妄动，坚决捍卫国家主权和领土完整。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/fyrthhdjzw/16462417.html","",1,3,4,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on May 20, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Welcome to today's press conference, and I'll take your questions now.","欢迎大家参加今天的新闻发布会，现在开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","President Xi Jinping emphasized at the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States on May 14 that the Taiwan issue is the most important issue in Sino-US relations, and the United States must handle the Taiwan issue with caution. Please interpret its important meaning.","The Taiwan issue is one of the important topics at this meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States. President Xi Jinping emphasized that the Taiwan issue is the most important issue in Sino-US relations. If handled well, the relationship between the two countries can maintain overall stability. If it is not handled well, the two countries will collide or even conflict, pushing the entire Sino-US relationship into a very dangerous situation. \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States. The United States must handle the Taiwan issue with caution. This provides us with a fundamental basis for our work in Taiwan.\nThe Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. It has been a fact since ancient times that the mainland and Taiwan belong to the same China. It is the true status quo of the Taiwan Strait and an important part of the international order after World War II. Solving the Taiwan issue and realizing the complete reunification of the country is the common aspiration of all Chinese people and is also the fundamental interest of the Chinese nation.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and continue to collude with external forces to carry out \"independence\" provocations, which is the root cause of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States. The prerequisite for achieving this is that we must not support or condone \"Taiwan independence.\" We hope that the U.S. will abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, handle the Taiwan issue with caution and prudence, avoid sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and take practical actions to safeguard the stable development of Sino-U.S. relations and peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","台湾问题是这次中美元首会晤的重要议题之一。习近平主席强调，台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题。处理好了，两国关系就能保持总体稳定。处理不好，两国就会碰撞甚至冲突，将整个中美关系推向十分危险的境地。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数，美方务必慎之又慎处理台湾问题。这为我们做好对台工作提供了根本遵循。\n台湾问题是中国内政。大陆和台湾同属一个中国是自古到今的事实，是台海真正的现状，也是二战后国际秩序的重要组成部分。解决台湾问题、实现国家完全统一是全体中华儿女的共同愿望，也是中华民族的根本利益。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，不断勾连外部势力进行谋“独”挑衅，是台海和平稳定的祸根乱源。维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。做到这一点的前提就是绝不能支持和纵容“台独”。我们希望美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，务必慎之又慎处理台湾问题，不向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号，以实际行动维护中美关系的稳定发展以及台海和平稳定。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766746.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","The Shanghai Municipal Bureau of Culture and Tourism recently announced that Shanghai residents can apply to travel to Kinmen. The first batch of Shanghai tourists arrived in Kinmen on the 11th and returned to Shanghai on the 13th. Taiwanese media reported that this ushered in the \"Spring Swallow\" for the local tourism industry. The Kinmen County Government stated that it plans to hold four Kinmen tourism…","We are happy to see the positive response to the resumption of Shanghai residents' travel to Kinmen, Matsu and Kinmen. This fully demonstrates the eager expectation of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, especially those in Kinmen, for the normalization of cross-Strait personnel exchanges and normalized exchanges and cooperation.\nWe are willing to actively promote anything that is conducive to enhancing the well-being and exchanges of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and will take active measures to support and encourage people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to strengthen interaction and exchanges. Relevant parties in Taiwan should comply with public opinion, face up to the calls of the island's tourism industry and people, lift unreasonable restrictions as soon as possible, and promote cross-strait tourism exchanges to return to normal.","对于恢复上海居民赴金门、马祖旅游及金门方面的积极反响，我们乐见其成。这充分显示了两岸同胞特别是金门乡亲，对两岸人员往来正常化和交流合作常态化的热切期盼。\n凡是有利于增进两岸同胞福祉和交流往来的事，我们都愿意积极推动，将采取积极措施，支持、鼓励两岸民间加强互动交往。台湾有关方面应顺应民意，正视岛内旅游业界和民众的呼声，尽快解除不合理禁限，推动两岸旅游交流恢复正常。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766738.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","According to reports, many mainland airlines plan to resume direct cross-strait air passenger routes in the near future. What is the spokesperson's comment on this?","Direct air flights across the Taiwan Strait have greatly facilitated the exchanges between people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and played an important role in improving the well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We have been actively promoting the full resumption of normalization of direct air passenger flights across the Taiwan Strait. It is understood that China Eastern Airlines, Spring Airlines, and Shandong Airlines plan to resume direct flights from Chengdu to Taichung, Ningbo to Kaohsiung, and Qingdao to Taichung respectively from July this year. These are concrete measures taken by Continental Airlines to actively respond to the needs of people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. They are a good thing to facilitate cross-Strait personnel exchanges and promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. We strongly support them.\nIt is hoped that Taiwan will comply with public opinion and resume cross-strait flights in Urumqi, Xi'an, Harbin, Kunming, Lanzhou and other cities as soon as possible, and then comprehensively lift unreasonable restrictions on cross-strait air transport, allowing cross-strait airlines to independently arrange flight plans according to market demand.","两岸空中直航极大便利了两岸民众往来，为增进两岸同胞福祉发挥了重要作用。我们一直在积极推动全面恢复两岸空中客运直航正常化。据了解，东方航空、春秋航空、山东航空拟自今年7月起分别恢复开通成都至台中、宁波至高雄、青岛至台中直航航线。这些是大陆航空公司积极响应两岸民众需求的具体措施，是便利两岸人员往来和促进两岸交流合作的好事，我们大力支持。\n希望台湾方面顺应民意，尽快恢复乌鲁木齐、西安、哈尔滨、昆明、兰州等城市两岸航班，进而全面取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，由两岸航空公司根据市场需求自主安排航班计划。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","According to reports, Taiwan Electric Power Company recently spent nearly one million New Taiwan dollars to replace its corporate logo, replacing the old version of the logo that had been in use for more than 70 years and was inscribed by the famous calligrapher Yu Youren. Public opinion on the island has criticized it for spending money on \"de-Sinicization\" despite years of losses and rising electricity prices…","The actions of the DPP authorities reveal their disregard for people's livelihood and their use of all possible means to sever the historical and cultural ties between the two sides of the Taiwan Straits. The relevant tactics are both shameless and incompetent. These small moves by the DPP authorities are in vain. No one can erase the Chinese national identity and Chinese cultural identity of Taiwan compatriots.","民进党当局的所作所为暴露其不顾民生，为割裂两岸历史文化联结无所不用其极，相关伎俩既无耻又无能。民进党当局的这些小动作枉费心机，台湾同胞的中华民族认同、中华文化认同，任何人都抹灭不掉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","Two years after Lai Ching-te came to power, the latest polls on the island show that Taiwanese people are more dissatisfied with Lai Ching-te's governance than satisfied, with 51% of the people having no confidence in his future performance. Any comment on this?","Relevant polls have fully shown that what Lai Qingde has done in the two years since he took office is contrary to the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people and has become increasingly unpopular. The Lai Ching-te authorities stubbornly adhere to the stance of \"Taiwan independence\", wantonly peddle fallacies of separatism, deliberately obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, and intensify efforts to create \"green terror\"; under the guise of so-called \"democracy\" and \"peace\", they concoct false narratives of \"democracy versus authoritarianism\" to incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation; and serve one party and one self. They are selfish, ignore people's livelihood and well-being, ignore economic laws, and seek to \"decouple\" cross-Strait economic and trade and \"disconnect\" industries; they abuse the judiciary to suppress and persecute political dissidents, continue to manipulate and provoke vicious political fights; they ignore the people's livelihood and wantonly squander the people's wealth and money, flatter and surrender to external forces, and attempt to \"rely on external forces\" and \"use force to seek independence.\" The various perverse actions of the Lai Ching-te administration have seriously violated the mainstream public opinion of Taiwanese society for peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation, seriously undermined peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and brought Taiwan into the dangerous situation of war. They have fully exposed their stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" nature, and are fully convinced that they are a \"destroyer of cross-Strait peace,\" a \"crisis creator in the Taiwan Strait,\" and a \"betrayer of Taiwan's public opinion.\"\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and confrontation has no way out. The reunification of the motherland is a historical trend that no one or any force can stop. We will adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", unite broadly with Taiwan compatriots, resolutely fight against \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, oppose interference from external forces, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and promote the great cause of reunification of the motherland. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will follow the general trend of history, uphold national justice, work with us to safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, protect the common home of the Chinese nation, and jointly create a bright future of national reunification and national rejuvenation.","相关民调充分表明，赖清德上台两年的所作所为与台湾民众利益福祉背道而驰，越来越不得人心。赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，大肆兜售分裂谬论，处心积虑阻挠两岸交流合作，变本加厉制造“绿色恐怖”；打着所谓“民主”、“和平”的幌子，炮制所谓“民主对抗威权”虚假叙事，煽动两岸对立对抗；为一党一己之私，漠视民生福祉，无视经济规律，图谋两岸经贸“脱钩”、产业“断链”；滥用司法打压迫害政治异己，不断操弄、挑起政治恶斗；漠视民生疾苦，大肆挥霍民脂民膏，向外部势力献媚输诚，妄图“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”。赖清德当局种种倒行逆施严重违背台湾社会要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意，严重破坏台海和平稳定，把台湾带向兵凶战危险境，充分暴露其冥顽不化的“台独”本质，充分坐实其是不折不扣的“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”和“台湾民意背叛者”。\n“台独”是绝路，对抗没有出路。祖国统一是任何人任何势力都阻挡不了的历史大势。我们将坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，广泛团结台湾同胞，坚决打击“台独”分裂势力，反对外来势力干涉，推动两岸关系和平发展，推进祖国统一大业。希望广大台湾同胞顺应历史大势，坚守民族大义，同我们一道维护台海和平稳定，守护中华民族共同家园，共创国家统一、民族复兴的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766743.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","A poll recently released by the Chinese Kuomintang think tank showed that 80.3% of the people on the island believe that cross-strait issues should be resolved peacefully through consultation, and 65% of the people agree to establish a \"chain of peace and prosperity\" to replace regional confrontation. Any comment on this?","Wanting peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society. The DPP authorities seek \"independence\" to provoke provocations, \"rely on external forces to seek independence\" and incite confrontation, which completely goes against public opinion and is unpopular. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and cross-Strait affairs are family matters of the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and should be discussed and handled by the family members. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to engage in dialogue and consultation with people from all political parties, all walks of life, and all walks of life in Taiwan on the development of cross-Strait relations and the future of the nation, to jointly maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, jointly promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and advance the process of the peaceful reunification of the motherland.","要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会主流民意。民进党当局谋“独”挑衅、“倚外谋独”，煽动对抗，完全是违背民意，不得人心。两岸同胞是一家人，两岸的事是两岸同胞的家里事，理应由家里人商量着办。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，与台湾各党派、各界别、各阶层人士就两岸关系发展和民族未来开展对话协商，共同维护台海和平稳定、共同推动两岸关系和平发展、推进祖国和平统一进程。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The 79th World Health Assembly was held in Geneva on May 18. Taiwan was unable to attend the meeting for the 10th consecutive year. The head of Taiwan's health department and the head of the foreign affairs department held activities outside the WHO in the form of a \"dual ministerial meeting\". Any comments on this?","The DPP authorities are hyping up issues related to the World Health Assembly, using the guise of health services to engage in political manipulation for \"independence\". They are not caring about the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people at all, but are using the meeting to enhance their presence, make political articles, and deceive the people on the island. The result will only be self-humiliation and will not change the fate of \"independence\" provocations that are destined to fail.","民进党当局炒作世卫大会相关问题，打着卫生事业的幌子，进行谋“独”政治操弄，根本不是关心台湾民众的利益福祉，而是借“蹭会”刷存在感、做政治文章，欺骗岛内民众，结果只会自取其辱，改变不了谋“独”挑衅注定失败的下场。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-strait exchange activities.","Recently, various parts of the mainland have been actively organizing a variety of cross-Strait exchange activities, inviting people from all walks of life on both sides to participate, and actively promoting cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation.\nIn terms of economic and trade exchanges, from May 14 to 17, the 2026 Cross-Strait Industrial Cooperation Zone Construction Promotion Conference was held in Jinan, Shandong Province, focusing on the development direction of new productive forces, striving to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in the fields of intelligent manufacturing, food and medicine, and helping Taiwanese businesses and enterprises share development opportunities. On the 15th, the Cross-Strait Tea Industry Exchange Association, the Taiwan Tea Society and many other tea industry groups from both sides of the Taiwan Strait held the seventh International Tea Day themed event \"Tea to Honor Mazu and Harmonize the World\" in Putian, Fujian Province. Nearly 200 representatives of tea industry groups and tea people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait jointly issued the \"Cross-Strait Tea People Initiative\", calling for the promotion of Chinese tea culture, deepening cross-strait emotional identification, and promoting the high-quality development of the tea industry. On the 19th, the 2026 \"Work-Assisted Revitalization\" Zhangtai Employees \"Cooking God Competition\" skills competition was held in Zhangzhou, Fujian. More than 60 contestants from 30 teams from Zhangzhou and Taiwan competed on the same stage and exchanged cooking skills.\nIn terms of cultural exchanges, the 4th \"Love Connects Cross-Strait, Yunnan and Taiwan Walk Together\" and Taiwan New Media People's Lincang Exchange Event, \"Water Ripples Concentric · Cross-Strait Songs\" - Yuntai Youth 2026 Water Splashing Festival cultural exchange event was held in Yunnan, with more than 90 Taiwanese self-media Tiren and young people from Taiwanese ethnic minorities visited Lincang, Yunnan, and participated in a water-splashing carnival with tens of thousands of people. They immersed themselves in the ethnic customs and landscapes of the Wa, Lahu and Dai people, and went deep into the tea and coffee gardens to experience the charm of the tea and coffee aromas of Awa Mountain and Ali Mountain. From May 13 to 16, Master Yanjue, President of the Buddhist Association of China, led a delegation to Taiwan to attend a series of commemorative events for the 60th anniversary of the founding of Fo Guang Shan, and conducted in-depth exchanges on cross-strait Buddhist culture and education with the Taiwan Federation of Chinese Humanistic Buddhism and other major Buddhist organizations and monasteries in Taiwan. On the 14th, the 2026 China Jigong Cultural Festival was held on the rooftop of Zhejiang. More than 800 Jigong believers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait and overseas gathered together to spread the Jigong spirit and share the nostalgia of our compatriots. On the 15th, the 2026 Bashu Culture and Art Season was held in Chengdu, Sichuan. More than 100 artists, cultural scholars, teachers and students from colleges and universities from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, etc., focused on \"Wuhou Qianqiu Rhythm, Cross-Strait Love\" and conducted in-depth exchanges on the charm of Bashu culture through a series of activities such as academic seminars and exhibitions of original art works by teachers and students from Sichuan and Taiwan.\nIn terms of youth exchanges, on the 19th, the 8th Cross-Strait (Hubei) Youth East Lake Exchange Season was held in Wuhan. About 300 youths from both sides of the Taiwan Strait met in Jiangcheng to discuss youth friendship and show the power of youth through keynote exchanges, young teacher exchange meetings, traditional sports carnivals, literary evenings, and the \"Thousands of Posts to Welcome Taiwan Youth\" special job fair. From the 19th to the 31st, the Xiamen-Taoyuan Autonomous Cycling Exchange Event \"Riding to Gather Landscapes and Connecting Two Places\" was held in Fujian. More than 80 cyclists from Xiamen and Taoyuan, Taiwan, set off from Wuyi Mountain and cycled about 600 kilometers. They will arrive at Jimei, Xiamen on the 31st, and enjoy cycling while enjoying the beautiful scenery of Fujian.\nTwo events are previewed here. From May 20th to 27th, the 20th Cross-Strait Media Tour to Jingchu was held in Hubei. More than 20 cross-Strait and Hong Kong news media reporters and self-media people went to Tianmen, Qianjiang, Xiantao and other places for interviews and exchanges to fully experience the cultural heritage, industrial vitality and new urban appearance of Jingchu. On May 26, the 2026 Zhejiang Taiwan Cooperation Week event co-sponsored by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and the Zhejiang Provincial People's Government will be held in Hangzhou. With the theme of \"Gathering together to innovate and draw a vivid picture together,\" this year's event will focus on exchanges and docking cooperation in the fields of artificial intelligence, high-end manufacturing, biomedicine, cultural tourism, etc. About 600 people, including heads of relevant industry associations and industrial and commercial groups on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and business representatives, will participate in relevant activities. Media friends are welcome to pay attention and report.","近期，大陆各地积极举办丰富多彩的两岸交流活动，邀请两岸各界人士参加，积极推动两岸交流合作。\n经贸交流方面，5月14日至17日，2026海峡两岸产业合作区建设推进会在山东济南举办，聚焦新质生产力发展方向，着力推动两岸智能制造、食品与医药领域的交流合作，助力台商台企共享发展机遇。15日，海峡两岸茶业交流协会、台湾茶叶学会等两岸多家茶业社团在福建莆田举办“茶敬妈祖 和合天下”第七个国际茶日主题活动，两岸近200位茶业社团代表及茶人共同发布《两岸茶人倡议书》，呼吁弘扬中华茶文化，深化两岸情感认同，推动茶产业高质量发展。19日，2026年“工助振兴”漳台职工“厨神大比拼”技能竞赛在福建漳州举办，漳台两地30支代表队60余名选手同台竞技、交流厨艺。\n文化交流方面，第四届“情牵两岸·滇台同行”暨台湾新媒体人临沧行交流活动、“水漾同心·两岸欢歌”——云台青年2026年泼水节文化交流活动在云南举办，90多名台湾自媒体人及台湾少数民族青年走进云南临沧，参与万人泼水狂欢盛会，沉浸式体验佤族、拉祜族、傣族的民族风情山水风光，深入茶园和咖啡园感受阿佤山牵手阿里山茶香、咖啡香的魅力。5月13日至16日，中国佛教协会会长演觉法师率团赴台出席佛光山开山60周年系列纪念活动，并与台湾中华人间佛教联合总会等台湾地区佛教界主要组织和寺院就两岸佛教文化和教育等进行深入交流。14日，2026中华济公文化节在浙江天台举办，800多名两岸及海外济公信众相聚一堂，共传济公精神，共叙同胞乡情。15日，2026巴蜀文化艺术季在四川成都举办，两岸100多名艺术家、文化学者、院校师生代表等，围绕“武侯千秋韵 两岸一脉情”，通过学术研讨会、川台师生原创艺术作品展等系列活动，深度交流巴蜀文化魅力。\n青年交流方面，19日，第八届两岸（湖北）青年东湖交流季在武汉举办，约300名两岸青年相约江城，通过主旨交流、青年教师交流会、传统体育嘉年华、文艺晚会、“千岗迎台青”专场招聘会等多场活动，共话青春情谊，展现青春力量。19日至31日，“骑聚山水·友连两地”厦桃自协骑行交流活动在福建举办，厦门与台湾桃园两地80多名骑行爱好者，从武夷山出发，骑行约600公里，31日会抵达厦门集美，在领略八闽山水美景中享受骑行乐趣。\n在此预告两项活动。5月20日至27日，第二十届海峡两岸媒体荆楚行活动在湖北举办，20余家两岸及香港新闻媒体记者和自媒体人深入天门、潜江、仙桃等地进行采访交流，全方位感受荆楚大地的人文底蕴、产业活力和城市新貌。5月26日,由国务院台办、浙江省人民政府共同主办的2026浙江·台湾合作周活动将在杭州举办。本届活动以“聚力融合创新，共绘生动图景”为主题，重点围绕人工智能、高端制造、生物医药、文化旅游等领域开展交流与对接合作，两岸相关产业协会和工商团体负责人、企业代表等约600余人将参加有关活动。欢迎媒体朋友关注并报道。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","Taiwan's public opinion organization voted on the \"Lai Qingde impeachment case\" on the 19th. Any comment on this?","In the two years since he came to power, Lai Ching-te has stubbornly adhered to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", disregarded the livelihood and well-being of the people on the island, pursued political selfishness, incited cross-strait confrontation, undermined cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, betrayed Taiwan without a bottom line, abused the judiciary to suppress and persecute political dissidents, trampled on democracy wantonly, engaged in \"green terror\" and created a \"chilling effect\". It can be said that he is incompetent in governance and incompetent, and his actions seriously deviate from the mainstream public opinion on the island. The relevant \"impeachment case\" fully expressed the Taiwanese people's strong dissatisfaction and condemnation of Lai Qingde's actions.","赖清德上台两年来，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，罔顾岛内民生福祉，一心谋取政治私利，煽动两岸对立对抗，破坏两岸交流合作，无底线卖台，滥用司法打压迫害政治异己，肆意践踏民主，大搞“绿色恐怖”、制造“寒蝉效应”，可谓施政无能、内斗万能，其所作所为严重背离岛内主流民意。有关“弹劾案”充分表达了台湾民众对赖清德所作所为的强烈不满和谴责。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","In order to promote the implementation of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, Fujian Province has recently issued measures to benefit Taiwan such as the \"Fujian-Taiwan Entry Fujian Tourist Route\". Please introduce the relevant situation.","Fujian Province is based on the origins of the same culture, customs, clans and tastes between Fujian and Taiwan, and meets the needs of Taiwanese people in returning to their hometowns to find their roots, trace their cultural origins, visit ancestral temples, socialize with relatives, and experience delicious food. It selects southern Fujian culture, folk beliefs and customs, ancestral temples, and Fujian cuisine. We will create five 6- to 7-day exclusive inbound tourism itineraries for Taiwanese compatriots based on the five major themes that highlight the historical and cultural symbols of Fujian and Taiwan, deeply presenting the cultural charm of the same roots in Fujian and Taiwan, and providing Taiwanese compatriots with more personalized and optional inbound tourism itineraries in Fujian. At the same time, we have launched multiple Easter egg gift packs and other heart-warming measures to benefit Taiwan's \"Solo people\" traveling to Fujian, as well as measures such as Shanghai residents visiting Fujian and Jinma boutique tourist routes.\nThese measures are warm and powerful. They not only allow Taiwanese compatriots, especially those from Taiwan who come to the mainland for the first time, to fully feel the intimacy of \"home\" in Fujian, but also allow them to get a better cultural and tourism experience in Fujian through real discounts and conveniences. This is a vivid embodiment of \"the two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and Fujian and Taiwan are close relatives.\"","福建省立足闽台同文、同俗、同宗、同味等渊源，以满足台湾民众返乡寻根、文化溯源、拜谒祖庙、联谊宗亲、体验美食等需求为核心，精选闽南文化、民间信俗、宗庙祠堂、八闽美食等闽台历史文化标识突出的五大主题，打造5条6至7天台湾同胞入境旅游专属精品线路，深度呈现闽台同根同源的文化魅力，为台胞提供更多个性化、可选择的入境福建旅游线路产品。同时，推出为台湾“首来族”来闽旅游服务多重彩蛋礼包等暖心惠台利民措施，以及上海居民来福建、游金马精品旅游线路等举措。\n这些举措有温度、有力度，不仅让台湾同胞特别是第一次来大陆的台湾乡亲，在福建充分感受“家”的亲切，也通过实实在在的优惠便利，让他们在福建获得更好的文旅体验，正是“两岸一家亲、闽台亲上亲”的生动体现。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","After the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, U.S. President Trump made it clear in an interview that he did not want Taiwan to be \"independent.\" How does the mainland interpret the signal released by the United States? Do you call on the DPP authorities to return to dialogue based on the \"1992 Consensus\"?","President Xi Jinping pointed out in his meeting with President Trump that the Taiwan issue is the most important issue in Sino-US relations. If it is handled well, the relationship between the two countries can maintain overall stability. If it is not handled well, the two countries will collide or even conflict, pushing the entire Sino-US relationship into a very dangerous situation. \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States. The United States understands China's position and takes China's concerns seriously. Like the international community, it does not agree with or accept Taiwan's move toward \"independence.\"\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle. This is the biggest source of chaos for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. It will surely reap the consequences and be spurned by history and the people.","习近平主席在同特朗普总统会谈中指出，台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题。处理好了，两国关系就能保持总体稳定，处理不好，两国就会碰撞甚至冲突，将整个中美关系推向十分危险的境地。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。美方了解中方的立场，重视中方的关切，同国际社会一样，不认同也不接受台湾走向“独立”。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，是台海和平稳定的最大乱源，必将自食恶果，遭到历史和人民的唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","The mainland film \"A Love Letter to Grandma\" has recently attracted widespread attention from both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The \"love and justice\" and \"feelings of family and country\" conveyed in the film have strongly resonated with audiences on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Any comment on this?","The movie \"A Love Letter to Grandma\" uses overseas Chinese batches as a carrier and uses delicate and simple lenses to tell a story of the overseas Chinese in Chaoshan who have watched over the mountains and seas for more than half a century. Chaoshan area and Taiwan area have many similarities in language and customs. Taiwanese people who have watched the film were particularly touched by the large number of Chaoshan dialects, the core of integrity and friendship, and the strong feelings of family and country in the film. The sound \"grandma\" is the local pronunciation of the same origin on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and the phrase \"you must be affectionate and righteous\" is the root soul of both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe Taiwanese people love this movie, which fully demonstrates that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have a common inheritance and strong resonance with Chinese culture. As of the end of May this year, 9 Taiwanese films have been released in mainland theaters and attracted the attention of mainland audiences. We are also happy to see more Taiwanese compatriots pay attention to and watch excellent mainland movies. We hope that more mainland movies can be released in Taiwan, so that more Taiwanese people can deeply experience the profound heritage and innovative development of Chinese culture.","电影《给阿嬷的情书》以侨批为载体、以细腻质朴的镜头讲述一个跨越山海、长达半个多世纪的潮汕侨乡守望故事。潮汕地区和台湾地区在语言、习俗方面有很多相近的地方。看过影片的台湾民众对影片中大量的潮汕方言、诚信与情义的内核和浓厚的家国情怀，特别有感触。一声“阿嬷”是两岸同根同源的乡音，一句“做人一定要有情有义”是两岸同文同种的根魂。\n台湾民众喜爱这部电影，充分说明两岸同胞对中华文化有着共同的传承和强烈的共鸣。截至今年5月底，已有9部台湾电影在大陆院线上映，受到大陆观众的关注。我们也乐见更多台湾同胞关注、观看大陆优秀电影，希望更多大陆电影能在台湾上映，让更多台湾民众深入感受中华文化的深厚底蕴与创新发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766736.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Foreign media recently reported that Taiwanese society is setting off a wave of \"exodus\" to apply for a \"second passport\" and move assets abroad. Some media on the island claimed that the DPP authorities used the fear of war as a tool for electoral mobilization and political struggle, and constantly strengthened the \"anti-China card\" and \"sense of national subjugation\" to reap political benefits. The result was a…","Relevant reports indicate that under the bad governance of the Democratic Progressive Party authorities seeking \"independence\" and provocations, more and more Taiwanese people are worried that \"Taiwan independence\" will trigger a war, and are worried that their life and property safety and development rights will not be protected, and they are forced to make plans to leave their country and find another way out. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities place one-party political self-interest above the people's immediate well-being and industrial development interests. They continue to resort to \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"using force to seek independence\", creating war anxiety on the island, and cooperating with external forces to hollow out Taiwan's advantageous industries. What he has done not only betrays Taiwan and harms it, but also causes chaos and harms Taiwan. It has made Taiwan increasingly war-torn and dangerous, and people in panic.\nWe hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will recognize the harm and danger of the DPP authorities' promotion of \"Taiwan independence\", consciously draw a clear line with the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their activities, and work with us to safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, and protect the common home of the Chinese nation.","相关报道表明，在民进党当局谋“独”挑衅的恶政之下，越来越多台湾民众担忧“台独”引发战争、担忧自身的生命财产安全和发展权益得不到保障，被迫作出远走他乡、另谋出路的打算。民进党当局将一党政治私利凌驾于民众切身福祉和产业发展利益之上，不断操弄“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，在岛内制造战争焦虑，配合外部势力掏空台湾优势产业。其所作所为不仅卖台祸台，也乱台害台，让台湾日益兵凶战危、人心惶惶。\n希望广大台湾同胞认清民进党当局推行“台独”的危害性、危险性，自觉与“台独”分裂势力及其活动划清界限，同我们一道维护台海和平稳定，推动两岸交流合作，守护好中华民族共同家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766739.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","After the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, U.S. President Trump once again named Taiwan's chip industry to set up factories in the United States. He said that \"Taiwan stole the U.S. chip industry\" and asked Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co., Ltd. and other Taiwanese technology companies to invest in Arizona. Now that TSMC has increased investment in Arizona, will the…","The DPP authorities ignore the well-being of Taiwan compatriots and the interests of the industry and continue to \"sacrifice\" the island's semiconductor industry and enterprises as bargaining chips for political gain. Their despicable behavior has long been seen and despised by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Expanding cross-Strait economic cooperation and deepening cross-Strait integrated development are the right choices to promote the sustainable development of Taiwan's high-tech industry.","民进党当局罔顾台湾同胞的福祉和产业界的利益，将岛内半导体产业和企业当成谋取政治私利的筹码不断“献祭”，其卑劣行径早已被两岸同胞看穿和不齿。扩大两岸经济合作、深化两岸融合发展才是推动台湾高新科技产业持续发展的正确选择。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","The Democratic Progressive Party recently recruited Shen Boyang to run for mayor of Taipei. Public opinion on the island questioned that Shen, apart from being good at cognitive warfare and conducting so-called \"reverse infiltration\" cognitive attack and defense, has no concern for people's livelihood issues. Any comment on this?","Shen Boyang, a die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" activist, vigorously promoted the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" and engaged in criminal activities to split the country. He was punished in accordance with the law and held accountable for life. I believe that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will draw a clear line with them, resolutely safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and resolutely protect their own interests and well-being.","“台独”顽固分子沈伯洋大肆宣扬“台独”分裂谬论，从事分裂国家犯罪活动，被依法惩治、终身追责。相信广大台湾同胞会与其划清界限，坚定维护台海和平稳定，坚定守护自身利益福祉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","Jay Chou and other Taiwanese singers held concerts in many places on the mainland this year, attracting a large number of fans to travel across the city. Faced with the ensuing consumer demand for accommodation, catering and travel, cultural and tourism departments in various places have taken measures to not only escort performing arts activities, but also promote local cultural tourism, achieving a two-way…","Since the beginning of this year, the performance market in mainland China has continued to grow explosively. Taiwanese entertainers have held solo concerts in many cities on the mainland, attracting fans from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to watch performances across the city. Various localities have actively implemented policies to optimize traffic flow, standardize market prices, and strengthen cultural tourism service guarantees. At the same time, they have taken advantage of the trend to launch cultural tourism themed routes, issue consumer coupons, and promote urban cultural tourism resources, achieving a mutually beneficial and win-win situation between the safe and orderly holding of performing arts activities and the diversion of local cultural tourism revenue.\nThe two sides of the Taiwan Strait share the same roots and cultural background, and pop music is one of the most friendly and down-to-earth carriers of cross-Strait cross-Strait folk exchanges. We have always supported cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in the fields of culture, performing arts, tourism and other fields, and are happy to see more warm and popular cross-Strait cultural exchange activities to promote two-way flows of people, consumption and culture. We welcome Taiwanese entertainers to come to the mainland to hold concerts or participate in various cultural performances. We also welcome fans and friends on the island to take advantage of the increasingly convenient entry and exit policies for Taiwanese compatriots to come to various parts of the mainland to watch various cultural performances and experience the wonderful cultural and tourism life.","今年以来，大陆演出市场持续爆发式增长，台湾演艺人员在大陆多座城市纷纷举办个人演唱会，吸引两岸歌迷跨城观演。各地积极施策，优化交通疏导、规范市场价格、强化文旅服务保障，同时顺势推出文旅主题线路、发放消费券、宣传城市文旅资源，实现了演艺活动安全有序举办与地方文旅引流增收互利双赢。\n两岸同根同源，文脉相同，流行音乐是两岸民间交流最具亲和力、最接地气的载体之一。我们一贯支持两岸文化、演艺、旅游等领域交流合作，乐见更多有温度、有人气的两岸文化交流活动，带动人流、消费流、文化流双向流动。我们欢迎台湾演艺人员来大陆举办演唱会或参加各类文化演出活动，也欢迎岛内歌迷朋友用好越来越便利的台胞入出境政策，来大陆各地观看各类文化演出活动，体验精彩文旅生活。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766737.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","On May 17, Lai Ching-te published the so-called \"5-point statement\" on Facebook, declaring that \"Taiwan is the defender of the peace and stability of the Taiwan Strait and the region; the mainland is the source of regional instability and changes in the status quo\"; he once again advocated \"non-affiliation\" between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait. Any comment on this?","Lai Ching-te's so-called remarks were full of lies and deception, hostility and confrontation, paranoia and arrogance. He ignored the international community's stance against \"Taiwan independence\", deceived the people of Taiwan and deceived international public opinion with bluff, which fully exposed his ruthless, cunning and despicable nature. Since taking office, Lai Ching-te has stubbornly adhered to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", clamored for the so-called \"non-subordination\" of the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, incited cross-Strait confrontation, and continued provocations for \"independence\". He is a destroyer of the status quo across the Taiwan Strait and the biggest source of chaos for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. While vigorously advocating the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\", he is doing his best to obstruct and undermine cross-strait exchanges and cooperation. These evil actions have been firmly opposed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the international community, and are doomed to failure.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is the real status quo across the Taiwan Strait. Taiwan's future can only and must be jointly decided by the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including 23 million Taiwan compatriots. No matter what Lai Qingde says or does, it cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, nor can it stop the historical trend that the motherland will eventually be reunified and will be reunified.","赖清德所谓谈话充斥谎言与欺骗、敌意与对抗、偏执与狂妄，无视国际社会反对“台独”的立场，掩耳盗铃、虚张声势，妄图蒙蔽台湾民众、欺骗国际舆论，充分暴露其色厉内荏、狡诈卑劣的本质。赖清德上台以来，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，鼓噪所谓两岸“互不隶属”，煽动两岸对立对抗，不断进行谋“独”挑衅，是台海现状的破坏者、台海和平稳定的最大乱源。其一边大肆鼓吹“台独”分裂谬论，一边竭力阻挠破坏两岸交流合作。这些恶行遭到两岸同胞和国际社会的坚决反对，注定失败。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分，这是真正的台海现状。台湾的前途只能也必须由包括2300万台湾同胞在内的14亿多中国人民共同决定。无论赖清德说什么、做什么，都改变不了台湾是中国领土一部分的历史和法理事实，阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766740.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","中国日报记者","Polls in Taiwan show that among young people aged 20 to 29 on the island, the proportion of those who favor \"Taiwan independence\" has declined in recent years, while the proportion of those who support cross-strait reunification continues to rise, showing a development trend in which the younger generation increasingly disagrees with \"Taiwan independence\" and is more inclined to support reunification. Any comment…","Since coming to power, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have been peddling the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\", deliberately manipulating \"de-Chinaization\", restricting cross-strait exchanges, and creating an \"information cocoon\" in an attempt to deceive and mislead the Taiwanese people, especially the younger generation, and create confusion in historical memory and distortion of national identity. What they do deviates from history and facts, becomes increasingly unpopular, and is destined to fail.\nYouth are the hope of the country and the future of the nation. The future of cross-Strait relations rests on the youth of both sides of the Taiwan Strait. More and more Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, are actively participating in cross-Strait exchanges, learning from each other, and understanding each other. They are increasingly realizing that reunification is the general trend and the future. We welcome and support more young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to come and go frequently to strengthen their ambition, strength and confidence to be Chinese, and to work together for national reunification and national rejuvenation.","民进党当局上台以来，大肆兜售“台独”分裂谬论，处心积虑操弄“去中国化”，阻限两岸交流交往，制造“信息茧房”，妄图蒙蔽误导台湾民众特别是青年一代，制造历史记忆混乱和国家认同扭曲。其所作所为背离历史和事实，越来越不得人心，注定失败。\n青年是国家的希望、民族的未来。两岸青年身上寄托了两岸关系的未来，越来越多台湾同胞特别是青年朋友积极参与两岸交流，互学互鉴，相交相知，越来越认识到统一是大势所趋、前途所在。我们欢迎并支持更多的两岸青年常来常往，一同增强做中国人的志气、骨气、底气，一同为国家统一、民族复兴携手奋斗。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766741.htm"],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Zhuo Rongtai said on the 19th that the People's Liberation Army's military exercises are \"the biggest source of unrest and destabilization in the entire region\" and hoped that \"healthy and orderly exchanges, equal and dignified dialogue\" can be carried out between the two sides. Any comment on this?","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and wantonly collude with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations. This is the root cause of chaos that undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We will never tolerate or condone any separatist activities seeking \"Taiwan independence.\" The relevant military actions of the People's Liberation Army are a stern warning to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external interference forces, and are a necessary and just move to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nOn the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogues with Taiwan's political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, benefit our compatriots, and seek rejuvenation for the nation.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，大肆勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，是破坏台海和平稳定的祸根乱源。我们对一切“台独”分裂行径决不容忍、决不姑息。解放军有关军事行动是对“台独”分裂势力和外部干涉势力的严正警告，是捍卫国家主权和领土完整的必要、正义之举。\n在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，我们愿意同台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士加强交流对话，推动两岸关系和平发展，为台海谋和平，为同胞谋福祉，为民族谋复兴。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","The first question is that Taiwanese leader Lai Ching-te delivered a speech this morning on the second anniversary of his inauguration. Do you have any comment on the content related to cross-strait relations?\nThe second question is that the cross-Strait official communication mechanism has been suspended for ten years since 2016. As a result, many cross-Strait people's livelihood, economic and trade issues…","The first question. No matter what Lai Ching-te says or does, it cannot conceal his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" essence, change Taiwan's status as a part of China, break the historical and legal connection that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and cannot block the historical trend that the motherland will eventually be reunified and will be reunified.\nRegarding cross-strait relations. The fundamental reason why the deadlock in cross-Strait relations is difficult to thaw and the cross-Strait dialogue and communication mechanism has been suspended is that the DPP authorities ignore the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle. The fundamental reason why the Taiwanese people are anxious and worried about the situation across the Taiwan Strait is that the Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and blindly engage in \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"using force to seek independence\", inciting cross-strait confrontation and constantly escalating tensions in the Taiwan Strait.\nOn the basis of the one-China principle, there will be no obstacles for any political party or group in Taiwan to interact with us. As long as we return to the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" and recognizing the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to the same country and nation, the cross-Strait dialogue and communication mechanism can be restarted, and cross-Strait relations can return to the right track of peaceful development.","第一个问题。不管赖清德说什么、做什么，都掩盖不了其冥顽不化的“台独”本质，改变不了台湾是中国一部分的地位，割裂不了两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理联结，更阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。\n关于两岸关系的问题。两岸关系僵局之所以难以解冻、两岸对话沟通机制之所以停摆，根本原因在于民进党当局置两岸同胞利益福祉于不顾，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”。台湾民众之所以对台海局势感到焦虑忧心，根本原因在于民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，一味操弄“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，煽动两岸对立对抗，不断升高台海紧张局势。\n在一个中国原则基础上，台湾任何政党、团体同我们的交往都不存在障碍。只要回到坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上来，承认两岸同属一个国家、一个民族的事实，两岸对话沟通机制就能够重启，两岸关系就能够重回和平发展的正确轨道。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","香港经济导报记者","Regarding Lai Ching-te's recent Facebook post stating that \"there is no issue of Taiwan independence in defense of the status quo of the Republic of China,\" former Chairman of the People's Party Ko Wenzhe said that the DPP is fully aware that the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\" will not work in international reality, so it can only keep changing concepts and say that the \"Constitution of the Republic of…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is an unquestionable historical and legal fact, and it is also the status quo across the Taiwan Strait that cannot be changed. Since Lai Ching-te came to power, he has wantonly colluded with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations, severely damaged cross-strait relations, and severely damaged the security and well-being of the Taiwanese people. Everyone can see clearly what he has done, and any sophistry is of no avail. \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. We will never condone or tolerate \"Taiwan independence\". If the DPP authorities really do not have a \"Taiwan independence\" issue, they should immediately abandon the \"Taiwan independence party platform\", stop \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, and take practical actions to improve cross-strait relations.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是不容置疑的历史和法理事实，也是不容改变的台海现状。赖清德上台以来，大肆勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，严重破坏两岸关系，严重损害台湾民众安全福祉，所作所为大家都看得很清楚，任何诡辩都无济于事。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，我们对“台独”决不姑息、决不容忍。如果民进党当局真的没有“台独”问题，就应当立即废弃“台独党纲”、停止“台独”分裂活动，承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，以实际行动改善两岸关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","Recently, Shen Boyang, who is running for mayor of Taipei, said, \"Holding the 'Twin Cities Forum' is extremely ineffective. Don't do things that are ineffective.\" The Taipei City Government stated that \"the results of the 'Twin Cities Forum' can be seen in all aspects.\" Shen should listen more to citizens and have more contact with the municipal government. Any comment on this?","The remarks made by Shen Boyang, a die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" activist, completely ignore the facts and are malicious slanders. The Shanghai-Taipei City Forum has been held for 16 consecutive years. It has reached many consensuses on issues such as economy, culture, technology, society, sports, and urban management, and achieved fruitful results. It has been widely recognized by citizens of the two cities and compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and has become an important platform for cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. Shen Boyang is accustomed to spreading rumors, slandering, attacking and undermining cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. His bad behavior will be condemned.","“台独”顽固分子沈伯洋的言论完全是罔顾事实、恶意污蔑。上海台北城市论坛已连续举办16年，围绕经济、文化、科技、社会、体育、城市管理等议题达成诸多共识，取得丰硕成果，得到两市市民、两岸同胞的普遍肯定，成为两岸交流合作的重要平台。沈伯洋惯于造谣诬蔑、攻击破坏两岸交流合作，其恶劣行径必遭唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","The first question is that U.S. President Trump recently stated that he \"does not want Taiwan to be independent.\" U.S. Ambassador to China Pang Dewei also said that when Trump met with President Xi Jinping, he said that he did not support \"Taiwan independence\" and that the U.S. policy toward Taiwan remains unchanged and hopes that cross-strait issues will be resolved peacefully. Any comment on this?\nSecond…","The first question. President Xi Jinping pointed out in his meeting with President Trump that the Taiwan issue is the most important issue in Sino-US relations. If it is handled well, the relationship between the two countries can maintain overall stability. If it is not handled well, the two countries will collide or even conflict, pushing the entire Sino-US relationship into a very dangerous situation. \"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States. The United States understands China's position and takes China's concerns seriously. Like the international community, it does not agree with or accept Taiwan's move toward \"independence.\"\nWe hope that the United States will abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, never support or condone \"Taiwan independence\", and take practical actions to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nSecond question. We have taken note of President Trump’s relevant remarks. The DPP authorities are servile and militaristic, fully exposing their evil nature of seeking \"independence\" and their cowardice of relying on others. \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. \"Relying on external forces to seek independence\" and \"using force to seek independence\" are wishful thinking and a dead end.","第一个问题。习近平主席在同特朗普总统会谈中指出，台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题。处理好了，两国关系就能保持总体稳定，处理不好，两国就会碰撞甚至冲突，将整个中美关系推向十分危险的境地。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。美方了解中方的立场，重视中方的关切，同国际社会一样，不认同也不接受台湾走向“独立”。\n我们希望美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，绝不能支持和纵容“台独”，以实际行动维护台海和平稳定。\n第二个问题。我们注意到特朗普总统有关表态。民进党当局奴颜婢膝、穷兵黩武，充分暴露其谋“独”邪恶本质和仰人鼻息的心虚胆寒。“台独”与台海和平水火不容。“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”是痴心妄想、绝路一条。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《联合报》记者","The first question is that after the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, the two countries reached a new positioning of \"China-US constructive strategic and stable relations.\" Will this affect mainland China's work with Taiwan? What new prospects does the mainland have for cross-strait relations in the future?\nSecond question: After the meeting between the heads of state of China…","The first question. President Xi Jinping and President Trump have taken \"China-US constructive strategic and stable relationship\" as the new positioning of the relationship between the two countries, providing strategic guidance for China-US relations in the next three years and beyond. This has been welcomed by the people of the two countries and the international community, and has also pointed out the direction for China and the United States to properly manage differences on the Taiwan issue. \"China-US constructive strategic and stable relations\" is not a slogan, it is a goal that both sides adhere to and actions they take together.\nThe Taiwan issue is the core of China's core interests and the most important issue in Sino-US relations, affecting the whole country. To grasp the new positioning of Sino-US relations, we must resolutely safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, which is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States. \"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible, and the United States must handle the Taiwan issue cautiously. We hope that the United States will abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, never support or condone \"Taiwan independence\", and take practical actions to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.\nWe will thoroughly implement the spirit of President Xi Jinping's important speeches, firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", resolutely combat \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, deepen cross-Strait exchanges, cooperation and integrated development, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and promote the great cause of the reunification of the motherland. We hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will recognize the extreme danger and harm of the Lai Ching-te administration's pursuit of \"independence\" and triggering war, and work with us to firmly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and create a bright future for the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation.\nSecond question. There is only one China in the world. Mainland China and Taiwan belong to the same China. Taiwan has never been a country. This is the real status quo across the Taiwan Strait. Achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese people. It is the general trend, the great cause, and the aspiration of the people. No one or any force can stop it!\nOn the one hand, the DPP authorities refuse to recognize that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", and continue to pursue \"independence\" provocations. On the other hand, they play word games to deceive the people on the island and the international community, trying to cover up and deceive themselves and others.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. Only by completely giving up the \"Taiwan independence\" stance, stopping provocations for \"independence\", and returning to the political basis of the \"1992 Consensus\" can the DPP authorities truly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and improve and develop cross-strait relations.","第一个问题。习近平主席同特朗普总统将“中美建设性战略稳定关系”作为两国关系的新定位，为未来3年乃至更长时间的中美关系作出战略指引，受到两国人民和国际社会的欢迎，也为中美双方在台湾问题上妥善管控分歧指明了方向。“中美建设性战略稳定关系”不是一句口号，是双方坚守的目标，共同采取的行动。\n台湾问题是中国核心利益中的核心，是中美关系中最重要的问题，牵一发而动全身。把握中美关系新定位，必须坚决维护台海和平稳定这个中美双方最大公约数。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，美方务必慎之又慎处理台湾问题。我们希望美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，绝不能支持和纵容“台独”，以实际行动维护台海和平稳定。\n我们将深入贯彻落实习近平主席重要讲话精神，坚定维护国家主权和领土完整，坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，坚决打击“台独”分裂，深化两岸交流合作、融合发展，推动两岸关系和平发展，推进祖国统一大业。希望广大台湾同胞认清赖清德当局谋“独”引战的极端危险性、危害性，同我们一道坚定维护台海和平稳定，共创祖国统一和民族复兴美好未来。\n第二个问题。世界上只有一个中国，大陆和台湾同属一个中国，台湾从来不是一个国家，这是真正的台海现状。实现祖国完全统一，是全体中华儿女的共同心愿，是大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向，任何人任何势力都无法阻挡！\n民进党当局一方面拒不承认两岸同属一个中国，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不断进行谋“独”挑衅，另一方面又玩弄文字游戏，欺骗岛内民众和国际社会，欲盖弥彰、自欺欺人。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。民进党当局只有彻底放弃“台独”立场，停止谋“独”挑衅，回到“九二共识”的政治基础上来，才能真正维护台海和平稳定，才能改善和发展两岸关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","After the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, U.S. President Trump said that arms sales to Taiwan were a good bargaining chip, but he decided to shelve the decision for the time being. Did China and the United States mention the issue of U.S. arms sales to Taiwan this time? What do you think of Trump’s statement? In addition, Trump also said that before confirming the arms sales…","We firmly oppose any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, China, and the sale of arms by the United States to Taiwan, China. This position is consistent and clear.","我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区进行任何形式的官方往来，坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器，这一立场是一贯的、明确的。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中央社”记者","The first question is that Lai Qingde recently claimed that there is currently no \"Taiwan independence\" issue. After the meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States, is it possible for the two sides to ease relations and promote more exchanges and cooperation by \"putting aside disputes\"?\nSecond question: Shi Chongliang, the head of Taiwan’s health department, recently said that when a…","The first question. Lai Ching-te stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", constantly invents new tricks to hype the \"new two-nation theory\", and does his best to obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. He is a \"destroyer of cross-Strait peace\", a \"creator of crisis in the Taiwan Strait\" and a \"betrayer of Taiwan's public opinion.\"\nRegarding cross-Strait exchanges, our attitude is very clear. We are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogue with various political parties, groups and people from all walks of life in Taiwan to share the results of cooperation on the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence.\"\nSecond question. We follow the one-China principle to handle Taiwan's participation in international organizations and their activities, including the WHO. This position is consistent and clear. The DPP stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and refuses to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle. This is the fundamental reason why Taiwan cannot participate in the conference.\nThe DPP authorities are hyping up issues related to the World Health Assembly and engaging in political manipulation for \"independence\". They do not care about the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people at all. Instead, they use the meeting to enhance their presence, make political articles, and deceive the people on the island. The result is only self-humiliation and cannot change the fate of \"independence\" provocations that are destined to fail.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。赖清德顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不断翻新花样炒作“新两国论”，竭力阻挠两岸交流合作，是“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”和“台湾民意背叛者”。\n关于两岸交流，我们的态度很明确，愿意在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，同台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士加强交流对话，共享合作成果。\n第二个问题。我们按照一个中国原则，处理台湾地区参与包括世卫组织在内的国际组织及其活动问题，这一立场是一贯的、明确的。民进党顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，是导致台湾地区不能与会的根本原因。\n民进党当局炒作世卫大会相关问题，进行谋“独”政治操弄，根本不关心台湾民众的利益福祉，而是借“蹭会”刷存在感、做政治文章，欺骗岛内民众，结果只会自取其辱，改变不了谋“独”挑衅注定失败的下场。\n今天发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260520_12766733.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-20","Chen Binhua","Not specified (spokesperson statement)","","On the 20th, Chen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said on the 20th that in the \"May 20\" speech by Taiwan leaders and in answering reporters' questions about cross-strait relations:\nLai Ching-te's speech today was full of lies and deception, hostility and confrontation. He stubbornly adhered to the wrong position of \"Taiwan independence\", promoted the so-called fallacies of \"sovereign independence\" and \"non-subordination\", exaggerated the \"mainland threat\", escalated cross-Strait confrontation, deliberately \"sought independence by force\" and \"relying on external forces\", undermined the peace and stability of the Taiwan Strait, and once again proved to be an out-and-out \"cross-Strait peace destroyer\" and \"Taiwan Strait crisis creator\". While continuing to advocate \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and manipulating \"anti-China resistance\", it falsely claims to promote cross-strait dialogue and exchanges in an attempt to deceive the Taiwanese people and deceive international public opinion. These common tactics have been seen through by more and more people in Taiwan. Their deceptive and provocative behaviors will be firmly opposed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the international community, and are destined to fail.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan. It has never been a country. It has not been in the past and it will definitely not be in the future. The Taiwan issue is a legacy of China's civil war in the 1940s. No matter how Taiwan is elected or who is elected after 1949, it cannot change Taiwan's status as a part of China. It cannot sever the historical and legal connection that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. It cannot break the iron law that Taiwan's future can only be determined by all the Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. Defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity is the firm will of all Chinese people. We will never allow anyone or any force to carry out separatist plots for \"Taiwan independence\" under any pretense.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait and is the main culprit undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We will adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", unite broadly with Taiwan compatriots, resolutely combat \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. The motherland will eventually be reunified, and the tide of reunification will surely roll forward unstoppably!","国务院台办发言人陈斌华20日就台湾地区领导人“5·20”讲话及答记者问中有关两岸关系内容表示：\n赖清德今天的讲话充斥谎言与欺骗、敌意与对抗，顽固坚持“台独”错误立场，宣扬所谓“主权独立”、“互不隶属”谬论，渲染“大陆威胁”，升高两岸对立对抗，蓄意“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”，破坏台海和平稳定，再次坐实其是不折不扣的“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”。其一边继续鼓吹“台独”分裂、操弄“反中抗中”，一边假惺惺宣称推动两岸对话交流，妄图蒙蔽台湾民众、欺骗国际舆论。这些惯用伎俩已被越来越多台湾民众看穿看透，其欺骗行为和挑衅行径必将遭到两岸同胞和国际社会的坚决反对，注定失败。\n台湾是中国的台湾，从来不是一个国家，过去不是，今后更绝对不是。台湾问题是上世纪40年代中国内战的遗留问题，不管1949年以后台湾地区以什么方式选举、选了什么人，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的地位，都割裂不了两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理联结，都打破不了台湾前途只能由包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民共同决定的铁律。捍卫国家主权和领土完整是全体中华儿女的坚定意志，我们决不允许任何人、任何势力打着任何幌子遂行“台独”分裂图谋。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容，是破坏台海和平稳定的罪魁祸首。我们将坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，广泛团结台湾同胞，坚决打击“台独”分裂，维护台海和平稳定。祖国终将统一、也必将统一的大潮滚滚向前、势不可挡！","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260520_12766685.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-21","Guo Jiakun","AFP","U.S. President Donald Trump said on Wednesday he would speak with Taiwan’s leader Lai Ching-te about a possible arms sale. Lai also said on Thursday he would be “happy” to talk to Trump. Can the foreign ministry comment on this?","China’s opposition to any official exchanges between the U.S. and China’s Taiwan region, and the U.S.’s arms sales to Taiwan is consistent, clear and rock-firm. China urges the U.S. to implement the important common understandings between our two leaders, honor its commitments and statements, exercise extra caution in handling the Taiwan question, stop sending any wrong message to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces, and safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait as well as the momentum of steady development of China-U.S. relations with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260521_11915471.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-21","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","The Financial Times has reported that the under-secretary of defense for policy in the U.S. has discussed a summer visit to Beijing with Chinese officials. It cites people familiar with the talks. However, the FT reports that China has signaled that it cannot approve a visit until President Trump decides how he will proceed with the arms package. And this is referring to the 14 billion weapons package to Taiwan.…","China’s opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent and clear. As to your specific question, I would refer you to the Ministry of National Defense.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260521_11915471.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-22","Guo Jiakun","AFP","The acting U.S. navy secretary said Thursday that arm sales to Taiwan had been put on pause to ensure that the American military had sufficient munitions for its Iran operations. Taiwan said Friday that there was no information indicating that the U.S. intends to make any adjustments to this arms sale. What is the Chinese foreign ministry’s comment on this?","China’s opposition to U.S. arms sales to China’s Taiwan region is consistent, clear and firm.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260522_11916315.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-22","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Taiwanese prosecutors are investigating three people for allegedly smuggling Nvidia AI chips to China in violation of U.S. export controls. Does the foreign ministry have a comment on this?","It is not a question about foreign affairs. I’m not aware of that.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260522_11916315.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-25","Mao Ning","DPA","A multiparty delegation of lawmakers from Germany is starting a visit to Taiwan. A member of the delegation said that “Taiwan is a very important partner for Germany.” The delegation is set to meet with Lai Ching-te. What is the foreign ministry’s comment?","There is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. China firmly opposes official interactions of any form between China’s Taiwan region and countries having diplomatic ties with China. The one-China principle is a well-recognized norm in international relations and a prevailing international consensus. It is also the political foundation for China-Germany relations. We urge certain people from Germany to abide by the one-China principle, and stop sending wrong messages to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. The DPP authorities’ attempt to solicit external support for their “independence” agenda will surely end in failure.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260525_11917325.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-25","Mao Ning","Reuters","China has stopped exporting to Japan several heavy rare earths and other materials for at least four months, according to the Chinese customs data. The timing coincides with the dispute between China and Japan over Taiwan. Can we confirm if Beijing has effectively stopped these exports in response to Japanese Prime Minister Takaichi’s remarks on Taiwan?","For anything specific, I’d refer you to competent authorities. Let me say that China banned the export of dual-use items to Japanese military users and for military purposes in accordance with laws and regulations to contain Japan’s remilitarization and its attempt to possess nuclear weapons.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260525_11917325.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-25","Mao Ning","AFP","Taiwanese authorities claim that the Chinese mainland deployed more than 100 vessels to the region last week from the Yellow Sea to the South China Sea. So some are located near South Korea, Japan and the Philippines, according to the map they provided. What is your response to this claim by the Taiwanese authorities?","The remarks of “Taiwan independence” separatists are not worth commenting. Let me say that the Chinese military carries out activities in accordance with international law and international practice. China is always a constructive force for peace and stability in the region.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260525_11917325.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-05-26","Chen Binhua","Not specified (spokesperson statement)","","The Fujian Coast Guard carried out law enforcement inspections in accordance with the law in the waters near Kinmen on May 26. Chen Binhua, spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said on the same day that Taiwan, Penghu, Jin, and Malaysia are all part of China. The mainland coast guard department’s law enforcement and patrol operations in relevant waters are reasonable and legal, which is conducive to maintaining the order of maritime operations and ensuring the safety of fishermen on both sides of the strait. We firmly support this.","福建海警5月26日位金门附近海域依法开展执法巡查。国务院台办发言人陈斌华当天表示，台、澎、金、马都是中国的一部分。大陆海警部门在相关海域开展执法巡查行动合理合法，有利于维护海上作业秩序，保障两岸渔民生命财产安全。我们对此坚决支持。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260526_12767624.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on May 27, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Hello fellow journalists, welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask questions.","各位记者朋友大家好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","新华社记者","Regarding the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council's refutation of Lai Ching-te's fallacy in promoting \"Taiwan independence\" in his speech on the second anniversary of his inauguration, Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council stated that \"Taiwan has never been ruled by the People's Republic of China and is not part of it. It is an objective fact and is also the status quo of the Taiwan Strait.\" It hopes that the…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is an unquestionable historical and legal fact, and it is also the current status of the Taiwan Strait that cannot be changed. As the only legal government of the whole of China and the only legal representative internationally, the Central People's Government of the People's Republic of China fully enjoys and exercises China's sovereignty as a matter of course, including sovereignty over Taiwan. The DPP authorities misrepresented the special state of long-term political confrontation between the two sides of the Taiwan Straits caused by China's civil war and interference from external forces as \"mutual non-subordination.\" This is a separatist proposition that ignores the facts and is a complete lie. No matter what the DPP authorities say or do, they can't change the fact that Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and they can't stop the inevitable reunification of the motherland.\nWanting peace, development, exchanges, and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society. We are willing to work with all political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life in Taiwan to strengthen exchanges and dialogue on the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" to seek peace for both sides of the Taiwan Strait, the welfare of our compatriots, and the rejuvenation of the nation.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。这是不容置疑的历史和法理事实，也是不容改变的台海现状。中华人民共和国中央人民政府作为全中国的唯一合法政府和在国际上的唯一合法代表，理所当然地完全享有和行使中国的主权，其中包括对台湾的主权。民进党当局把中国内战和外部势力干涉造成海峡两岸陷入长期政治对立的特殊状态歪曲为“互不隶属”，是罔顾事实的分裂主张，是彻头彻尾的谎言。不管民进党当局说什么、做什么，都改变不了台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分的事实，都阻挡不了祖国必然统一的大势。\n要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会主流民意。我们愿同台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，加强交流对话，为两岸谋和平、为同胞谋福祉、为民族谋复兴。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767892.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","人民日报记者","Regarding Lai Ching-te's speech on the second anniversary of his inauguration, public opinion on the island pointed out that the DPP's current strategy has gradually shifted from plotting \"de jure Taiwanese independence\" to \"substantial Taiwanese independence based on identity and culture.\" Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is a historical and legal fact that no one can shake, and it is also a general consensus of the international community. Taiwan has never been a country, and it will never become one in the future. Out of their \"independence\" nature and political self-interest, the DPP authorities are vigorously promoting \"cultural Taiwan independence\" and \"de-Sinicization\" in an attempt to distort the national identity of Taiwan compatriots, forgetting their ancestors and betraying the nation, and will surely be liquidated by history. We will never tolerate or tolerate any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. No matter what tricks Lai Ching-te and the DPP try, they are all in vain. They cannot change the fact that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, cannot cut off the blood ties of Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, cannot erase the imprint of Chinese culture on Taiwanese society and Taiwan compatriots, and cannot stop the historical trend of the eventual reunification of the motherland.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. We hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the true face and sinister intentions of the Democratic Progressive Party authorities' \"Taiwan independence\" campaign, strengthen their identification with the Chinese nation, Chinese culture, and the great motherland, strengthen their ambition and backbone to be upright Chinese, and work with us to resolutely oppose all kinds of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities and protect the common homeland of the Chinese nation.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是谁都无法撼动的历史和法理事实，也是国际社会普遍共识。台湾从来就不是一个国家，今后更绝无可能成为一个国家。民进党当局出于谋“独”本性和政治私利，极力推进“文化台独”、“去中国化”，企图扭曲台湾同胞的国家认同，数典忘祖、背叛民族，必遭历史的清算。我们对任何形式的“台独”分裂行径，都决不容忍、决不姑息。无论赖清德和民进党变换什么花招，都是枉费心机，都无法改变两岸同属一个中国的事实，无法割断两岸中国人的血脉亲情，无法抹去台湾社会和台湾同胞身上的中华文化印记，更无法阻挡祖国终将统一的历史大势。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。希望广大台湾同胞看清民进党当局“台独”真实面目和险恶用心，坚定对中华民族、中华文化、伟大祖国的认同，增强做堂堂正正中国人的志气骨气底气，同我们一起坚决反对形形色色的“台独”分裂行径，守护好中华民族共同家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767891.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","In response to Lai Ching-te's recent Facebook post stating that he \"defends the status quo of the Republic of China and has no Taiwan independence issue,\" public opinion on the island called for the DPP to delete the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\" as soon as possible. Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is an unquestionable historical and legal fact, and it is also the current situation across the Taiwan Strait. As we all know, the Democratic Progressive Party is a \"Taiwan independence\" party that has long advocated splitting Taiwan from China. In October 1991, the Democratic Progressive Party revised its party platform and wrote the establishment of a \"sovereign and independent Republic of Taiwan and the formulation of a new constitution\" into the party constitution. This is what everyone calls the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform.\" Although the party passed several \"resolutions\" later, although they made some disguises in their expressions, they never gave up the idea of ​​splitting the country. During each period when the Democratic Progressive Party was in power in Taiwan, it always deliberately sought to promote \"Taiwan independence\" separatism in an attempt to change the status quo across the Taiwan Strait in which both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. Lai Ching-te's \"Taiwan independence\" stance is stubborn, he has made constant provocations for \"independence\", and now he has changed his rhetoric in an attempt to mislead public opinion and deceive the people. He is a complete \"Taiwan independence liar.\"\n\"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait. It is the greatest danger to Taiwan's development and a dead end. The DPP should recognize the situation clearly, comply with public opinion, immediately abandon the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\", stop \"Taiwan Independence\" separatist activities, recognize that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and stop obstructing and undermining cross-Strait relations.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是不容置疑的历史和法理事实，也是台海现状。众所周知，民进党是长期主张把台湾从中国分裂出去的“台独”政党。1991年10月，民进党用修改党纲的方式，把建立“主权独立的台湾共和国及制定新宪法”写入党章，这就是大家所说的“台独党纲”；该党之后通过的多份“决议文”，虽然在表述上作了一些伪装，但从未放弃分裂国土的主张。民进党在台湾当权的各个时期总是处心积虑搞“台独”分裂，企图改变两岸同属一中的台海现状。赖清德“台独”立场冥顽不化，谋“独”挑衅动作不断，现在又变换话术，企图误导舆论、蒙骗民众，是十足的“台独骗子”。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容，是台湾发展的最大危害，是走不通的绝路。民进党应认清形势、顺应民意，立即废弃“台独党纲”、停止“台独”分裂活动，承认两岸同属一个中国，停止阻挠破坏两岸关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767890.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","《参考消息》记者","As for the 10-year suspension of the contact mechanism between the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Strait and the Taiwan Straits Exchange Foundation, the Mainland Affairs Council said, \"The reason for the suspension is that the mainland set unacceptable political preconditions and it was the other party's decision to suspend it.\" Any comment on this?","In 1992, the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Straits and the Taiwan Strait Foundation reached the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle and clearly defined the nature of cross-strait relations. It was on this political basis that the two sessions launched negotiations and signed a series of agreements, benefiting compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\", and unilaterally undermine the political foundation for cross-Strait dialogue and consultation. This is the root cause of the suspension of dialogue and consultation between the two sessions, and the source of tension and turmoil in the Taiwan Strait.","1992年海协会与台湾海基会达成体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，明确界定了两岸关系的性质。正是在这一政治基础上，两会开启协商谈判，签署了一系列协议，让两岸同胞都从中受益。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认“九二共识”，单方面破坏两岸对话协商的政治基础，这是两会对话协商停摆的根本原因，也是台海局势紧张动荡的根源。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767888.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","On May 24, the Shenzhou 23 manned spacecraft was successfully launched. The first Hong Kong astronaut participated in the national manned space mission, triggering heated discussions among people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Some public opinion on the island hopes that Taiwan compatriots, especially Taiwanese youth, can participate in the motherland's aerospace industry in the future. Any comment on this?","Developing the aerospace industry and building a powerful aerospace nation is the aerospace dream pursued unremittingly by the Chinese nation. The Shenzhou 23 manned spacecraft launch mission was a complete success, which is the common pride and glory of all Chinese people. We extend warm congratulations to Dr. Lai Jiaying for becoming the first Hong Kong astronaut and the fourth Chinese female astronaut! Her space journey and spirit of courage to challenge and never give up will inspire Hong Kong teenagers to love and join the national aerospace industry and realize that with the support of the great motherland, everyone can shine their own glory. The stars and rivers are vast, chasing dreams in the sky. We look forward to our Taiwan compatriots working with our mainland compatriots to explore the vast universe and turn their dreams into reality.","发展航天事业、建设航天强国，是中华民族不懈追求的航天梦。神舟二十三号载人飞船发射任务取得圆满成功，是全体中华儿女共同的骄傲与荣耀。我们对黎家盈博士成为首位香港航天员、第四位中国女航天员致以热烈祝贺！她的太空之旅和勇于挑战、永不言弃的精神将激励香港青少年热爱、投身国家航天事业，认识到有伟大祖国的支持，每个人都可以绽放属于自己的光彩。星河浩荡，逐梦苍穹。我们期待台湾同胞同大陆同胞一道探索浩瀚宇宙，把梦想照进现实。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767887.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, the song \"Happy Breakup on May 20\" written by netizens to commemorate the second anniversary of Lai Qingde's coming to power has become popular on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Many netizens said that the lyrics in the lyrics, such as \"Hard days are lived every day, happy breakup, goodbye Qingde\", express the unspeakable feelings of the people on the island towards Lai Qingde's rebellious behavior in…","I have listened to this song and noticed the \"complaint-style\" adaptation by netizens. The lyrics are vivid and vivid, which fully reflects netizens' strong dissatisfaction and opposition to Lai Qingde's actions in the two years since he came to power, and has resonated with many Taiwanese people. I hope Lai Qingde will pay more attention to people's livelihood and welfare and less political manipulation and self-interest calculations.","我听过这首歌，也注意到网友的“吐槽式”改编，歌词鲜活生动，充分反映了网友对赖清德上台两年来所作所为的强烈不满和反对，引发很多台湾民众共鸣。希望赖清德多一些民生福祉考量，少一些政治操弄与私利盘算。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","中新社记者","DPP spokesperson Wu Zheng recently said that he was \"bored to death\" because he couldn't stand the criticism of Lai Qingde by the spokesman for the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council every week. This triggered discussion among netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, who believed that this statement was an emotional loss caused by his understanding that \"Taiwan independence\" would not work. Any…","The more you debate the truth, the clearer it becomes. Only when the truth is distorted will you be at a loss for words. The emotional expression of the spokesperson of the Democratic Progressive Party fully exposed his lack of integrity. The Lai Ching-te administration stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", and its various perverse actions seriously violate the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society and severely undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. It will surely be strongly criticized and firmly opposed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the international community, and its pursuit of \"Taiwan independence\" will eventually be ruined.","真理越辩越明，理屈才会词穷。民进党发言人的情绪性表达，充分暴露其理不直气不壮。赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，种种倒行逆施严重违背台湾社会主流民意，严重破坏台海和平稳定，必将遭到两岸同胞与国际社会的强烈抨击和坚决反对，搞“台独”终将身败名裂。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, Fuzhou launched the \"Third Batch of Pilot Policies to Create a \"City Life Circle\" in Fuzhou\", which attracted the attention of the people on the island. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On May 22, Fuzhou City, following the release of two batches of 20 pilot policies to create Fuzhou-Mazhou \"Intra-city Living Circle\" at the 26th and 27th Cross-Strait Economic and Trade Fairs and achieved remarkable results, focused on areas where Taiwan compatriots and Matsu residents have loud voices, wide needs, and high urgency, and promoted The more valuable \"Third Batch of Pilot Policies for Building a \"City Life Circle\" in Fuma\" was released at the 28th China International Maritime Fair, which includes 10 specific measures in three aspects: optimizing the Taiwan-related business environment, deepening scientific and technological exchanges and cooperation between Rong and Taiwan, and improving the convenience of Fuma's \"small three links\".\nAfter the policy was released, it was widely praised and welcomed by the Taiwan compatriots in Rong and Matsu residents. The third batch of policies will further promote the development of Taiwan-funded enterprises in Rong, make Fuma's \"same-city living circle\" more convenient, provide more support for Taiwan compatriots and Matsu residents in implementing equal treatment, improving the convenience of living in the same city, expanding the mainland market, and integrating into the mainland's industrial chain and supply chain. It will further deepen Rong-Taiwan fishery cooperation, common cross-strait standards and promote the development of Taiwan-related parks, which will help accelerate urbanization and promote the spiritual harmony and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.","5月22日，福州市继在第26届、第27届海峡两岸经贸交易会上发布打造福马“同城生活圈”两批20条先行先试政策并取得明显成效基础上，聚焦台胞及马祖居民呼声大、需求广、迫切性高的领域，推出含金量更高的《打造福马“同城生活圈”先行先试第三批政策》，并在第28届海交会上发布，包含优化涉台营商环境、深化榕台科技交流合作、提升福马“小三通”通行便利等三方面共10条具体措施。\n政策发布后受到广大在榕台胞及马祖居民的广泛好评和欢迎。第三批政策将进一步推动在榕台资企业的发展，使福马“同城生活圈”更加便利，为台胞及马祖居民在落实同等待遇、提升同城生活便利化、拓展大陆市场、融入大陆产业链供应链等方面提供更多支持，进一步深化榕台渔业合作、两岸标准共通和推进涉台园区的发展，有利于加速同城化，促进两岸同胞心灵契合和福祉增进。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","The \"Holy Land of Confucianism, Hospitality in Shandong\" tourism promotion exhibition recently opened at the 2026 Kaohsiung Summer Travel Fair. Many Taiwanese people expressed at the event that they learned about Shandong through movies and TV dramas and yearned to travel to the mainland. Any comment on this?","Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait share the same roots, culture and race. Cultural exchanges are an important bridge to promote spiritual unity among compatriots. Film and television works are an important channel to enhance mutual understanding and emotional connection between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe land of Qilu has a long history. As the birthplace of Chinese civilization and Confucian culture, sages such as Confucius and Mencius were born here, accumulating a profound cultural heritage. Shandong has beautiful and diverse landscapes. Mount Tai is the top of the Five Mountains, and Mount Laoshan and Yimeng Mountain are breathtaking. The Yellow and Bohai Seas are vast and long, and the Yellow River rushes into the sea to create a rare intersection of yellow and blue. The ancient charm of the Grand Canal is spread, the springs in Jinan are beautiful and beautiful, and the mountains, seas, rivers and lakes have their own customs. The folk customs here are wonderful, the intangible cultural heritage skills have a long history, and the seasonal festivals are lively. Shandong cuisine, which ranks first among the eight major cuisines, has an authentic flavor. Specialties such as Zibo Barbeque and Dezhou Braised Chicken are fresh and attractive. The mountains, rivers, humanities, scenery and delicious food are integrated, showing the unique charm of Shandong. Hearing is worth seeing. We welcome more Taiwanese compatriots to come to Shandong and the mainland to visit and discover the beauty of the mainland with their own eyes.","两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种，文化交流是促进同胞心灵契合的重要桥梁，影视作品是增进两岸同胞彼此了解与情感联结的重要渠道。\n齐鲁大地文脉悠长，作为中华文明与儒家文化发源地，孔子、孟子等先贤在此诞生，积淀下深厚人文底蕴。山东山水风光秀美多姿，泰山雄踞五岳之首，崂山、沂蒙山景致奇绝；黄渤海海域辽阔绵长，黄河奔涌入海造就罕见黄蓝交汇盛景，大运河古韵流传，济南群泉灵动秀美，山海河湖各有风情。这里民俗精彩纷呈，非遗技艺源远流长，四季节庆热闹非凡。位列八大菜系之首的鲁菜风味地道，淄博烧烤、德州扒鸡等特色美食鲜香诱人，山水人文、风物美食相融，尽显山东独特魅力。百闻不如一见，我们欢迎更多台湾同胞来山东、来大陆走走、看看，用自己的眼睛发现大陆的美好。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, the \"Happy Island Alliance\", an \"urgent independence\" political party on the island, issued an open letter expressing its willingness to adjust the party's fundamental position under the condition that \"Taiwanese rule Taiwan and a high degree of autonomy\" obtain clear legal commitments, consider incorporating it into the governance framework of the People's Republic of China, and participate in the…","The two sides of the Taiwan Strait will eventually be reunified and will be reunified. On the basis of the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to engage in dialogue and consultation with people from various political parties, groups, sectors, and classes in Taiwan on the development of cross-Strait relations and the future of the nation, and jointly promote the process of the reunification of the motherland.","两岸终将统一，也必将统一。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，同台湾各政党、团体、界别、阶层人士就两岸关系发展和民族未来开展对话协商，共同推进祖国统一进程。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Recently, the second Cross-Strait Industrial Development Conference was held in Fuzhou. The conference released the \"Initiative for Strengthening Cross-Strait Industrial Cooperation\", which attracted attention and praise from the industries on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On May 21, the second Cross-Strait Industrial Development Conference with the theme of \"Cross-Strait Industrial Chain, Join Hands for Shared Prosperity\" was held in Fuzhou. The China Federation of Industrial Economics and other ten mainland industrial federations (associations) jointly released the \"Initiative for Strengthening Cross-Strait Industrial Cooperation\" focusing on five aspects: technological innovation, green and low carbon, digital and intelligent empowerment, opening up overseas markets, and giving full play to the role of industry associations. The \"Initiative\" proposes that at a time when global economic growth is slowing down, tariff increases and trade policies are full of uncertainty, industrial and supply chains are deeply restructured, and market competition is fierce, the industrial circles on both sides of the Taiwan Strait should adhere to the concept of \"complementary advantages, mutual benefit and win-win, and joint development\", actively promote dialogue and exchanges, and promote the common development of cross-strait industrial and supply chains. We encourage and support the industries on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to seize the development opportunities of the \"15th Five-Year Plan\", deepen the complementary advantages of cross-Strait industries and achieve mutual benefit and win-win results, jointly build a more resilient and safer cross-Strait industrial chain and supply chain, and jointly promote the vigorous development of cross-Strait industries.","5月21日，以“工业链两岸，携手共荣景”为主题的第二届海峡两岸工业发展大会在福州举办。中国工业经济联合会等大陆十家工业联合会（协会）围绕技术创新、绿色低碳、数智赋能、开拓海外市场和发挥行业协会作用等五个方面，共同发布《加强海峡两岸工业合作的倡议》。《倡议》提出，当前全球经济增长趋缓、关税上调与贸易政策充满不确定性、产业链供应链深度重构、市场竞争激烈，海峡两岸工业界应秉持“优势互补、互利共赢、携手发展”的理念，积极推动对话与交流，促进两岸产业链供应链共同发展。我们鼓励支持两岸工业界把握“十五五”发展机遇，深化两岸产业优势互补、互利共赢，共同打造更具韧性更加安全的两岸产业链供应链，携手推动两岸产业蓬勃发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","香港经济导报记者","According to reports, after the signing of the \"U.S.-Taiwan Reciprocal Trade Agreement\", the import tariffs on agricultural products such as American oranges were reduced from 35% to 10%, which caused dissatisfaction among the island's industry. Some public opinion believed that the DPP authorities did not communicate with the island's farmers before and after the event, and they were simply \"selling agriculture…","The so-called \"reciprocal agreement\" is actually a list of the United States' bullying of Taiwan's economy and industry. It is a betrayal contract for the DPP authorities to kneel to the United States without a bottom line. In order to \"rely on the United States and seek independence\", the DPP authorities ignore the well-being of the Taiwanese people and turn Taiwan into a dumping ground for American products. This despicable behavior goes against the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society, harms Taiwan's industry and the vital interests of the people, and will inevitably be counterattacked.","所谓“对等协议”，实则是美国对台湾经济、产业的霸凌清单，是民进党当局无底线跪美的卖台契约。民进党当局为“倚美谋独”，罔顾台湾民众福祉，将台湾变为美国产品倾销地。这种卑劣行径背离台湾社会主流民意，损害台湾产业和民众的切身利益，必遭反噬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767885.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-strait exchange activities.","Recently, a variety of cross-strait exchange activities have been held across the mainland.\nEconomic and trade exchanges. The 28th Cross-Strait Economic and Trade Fair was held in Fuzhou, Fujian. It set up three major platforms: \"result display and release, economic and trade industry docking, and Fuma's first trial\". It held more than 10 exchange activities and released the third batch of Fuma's \"same-city living circle\" pilot policies. The scale of the event and the number of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese businessmen participating in the event reached new highs. The 22nd China (Shenzhen) International Cultural Industry Expo and Trade Fair was held in Shenzhen. In addition to setting up a Taiwan Pavilion at the main venue and inviting 18 high-quality Taiwanese cultural and creative brand manufacturers to participate in the exhibition, it also set up branch venues and held activities such as the theme salon of \"Design Co-shaping·Digital Intelligence Rebirth\" to build an interactive platform for makers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait and help Taiwanese youth pursue and realize their dreams in Shenzhen. On May 20, Shenzhen held a financial assistance event for Taiwan. Nearly 100 Taiwanese businessmen, including representatives from Taiwanese enterprises, Taiwanese financial institutions, and the Shenzhen Taiwanese Business Association, met with Shenzhen securities firms to discuss building a tripartite collaborative cooperation channel between cross-Strait governments, banks, and enterprises to help Taiwanese companies better leverage the mainland capital market to achieve high-quality development.\nCultural exchange. On May 23, the 36th National Day for Disabled Persons, the \"Full Protection, Integration and Blooming\" Lutai Disabled Persons Art Exchange Performance was held in Xiamen, Fujian Province, showcasing the artistic talents and self-improvement spirit of disabled compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. In mid-May, the 2026 Southern Fujian Poetry Festival was held at Fujian Minnan Normal University, and the Shoutai North Road Opera exchange event was held in Shouning County, Ningde, Fujian. Taiwanese Beiguan Opera was invited to return to their hometown for the first time for exchanges, to jointly inherit China's excellent traditional culture and enhance the friendship between folks on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nYouth exchange. The 14th Straits Youth Gathering and Lutai Youth Together Event was held in Xiamen. Youth from both sides of the Taiwan Strait conducted exchanges and discussions around Southern Fujian culture and intangible cultural heritage skills. \"Integrating Haicang to Create a Future Together\" Taiwan Youth Employment and Entrepreneurship Sharing Forum was held in Haicang District, Xiamen City. Through the form of \"enterprise visits + employment guidance + experience sharing\", it provided more opportunities and convenience for Taiwanese youth to find employment and entrepreneurship in Haicang. On May 24, the 2026 Zhangtai \"Basketball Association Longjia Cup\" Youth Baseball Invitational Tournament and Sports Cultural Exchange Event was held in Zhangzhou. More than 300 young players from both sides of the Taiwan Strait competed competitively while also carrying out social activities such as campus interaction and Southern Fujian cultural experience.","近期，大陆各地举办了丰富多彩的两岸交流活动。\n经贸交流方面。第28届海峡两岸经贸交易会在福建福州举办，设置“成果展示发布、经贸产业对接、福马先行先试”三大平台，举办10多场交流活动，发布福马“同城生活圈”先行先试第三批政策，活动规模、参会台胞台商人数均创新高。第22届中国（深圳）国际文化产业博览交易会在深圳举行，除在主会场设置台湾馆、邀请18家台湾优质文创品牌厂商参会外，还设置分会场，举办“设计共塑·数智新生”主题沙龙等活动，为两岸创客搭建互动平台，助力台湾青年在深圳追梦、圆梦。5月20日，深圳市举办金融助台活动，在深台企、台资金融机构、深圳台商协会代表等近100位台商与深圳券商机构座谈交流，共同探讨搭建两岸政银企三方协同合作渠道，助力台企更好借助大陆资本市场实现高质量发展。\n文化交流方面。5月23日，第36个全国助残日“全程守护 融合绽放”鹭台残疾人艺术交流汇演在福建厦门举行，展示两岸残疾人同胞的艺术才华和自强精神。5月中旬，2026闽南诗歌节在福建闽南师范大学举办，寿台北路戏交流活动在福建宁德寿宁县举办，邀请台湾北管戏首次回乡交流，共同传承中华优秀传统文化，增进两岸乡亲情谊。\n青年交流方面。第十四届海峡青年荟·鹭台青年同心同行活动在厦门举办，两岸青年围绕闽南文化与非遗技艺进行交流研讨。“融汇海沧 共创未来”台湾青年就业创业分享汇在厦门市海沧区举办，通过“企业参访+就业辅导+经验分享”形式，为台青在海沧就业创业提供更多机会及便利。5月24日，2026年漳台“棒协·龙佳杯”青少年棒球邀请赛暨体育文化交流活动在漳州举办，两岸300余名青少年选手在竞技比拼的同时，开展了校园互动、闽南文化体验等联谊活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, when asked whether he would have a phone call with Lai Ching-te before making a decision on U.S. arms sales to Taiwan, U.S. President Trump said he would \"talk\" with him. Lai Ching-te said that if there is an opportunity for dialogue, he will emphasize that the purchase of US troops is a necessary means to safeguard Taiwan's security and maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. Any comment…","We firmly oppose any form of official exchanges between the United States and Taiwan, China, and the sale of weapons to Taiwan by the United States. We urge the U.S. to implement the important consensus reached at the China-U.S. Presidential Meeting, abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, handle the Taiwan issue with caution and prudence, stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and take practical actions to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and the steady development of China-U.S. relations.\nThe DPP authorities deliberately \"rely on the United States to seek independence\" and \"use force to seek independence,\" escalate cross-Strait confrontation and undermine peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. They are out-and-out \"cross-Strait peace destroyers\" and \"Taiwan Strait crisis creators.\" I am warning the Democratic Progressive Party authorities that the reunification of the motherland is unstoppable. No matter how many weapons we buy, it will only be a mantis' attempt to do the trick and will only accelerate the defeat of \"Taiwan independence.\"","我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的官方往来，坚决反对美国向台湾出售武器。敦促美方落实好中美元首会晤重要共识，恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，慎之又慎处理台湾问题，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号，以实际行动维护台海和平稳定和中美关系稳定发展态势。\n民进党当局蓄意“倚美谋独”、“以武谋独”，升高两岸对立对抗，破坏台海和平稳定，是不折不扣的“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”。正告民进党当局，祖国统一势不可挡，买再多武器都是螳臂当车，只会让“台独”加速败亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767886.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","According to reports, the Taiwan military spent more than NT$980 million to purchase multiple self-made drone countermeasures systems, and received \"zero points\" on both inspections. Some public opinion on the island has questioned that the DPP authorities are using drones to feed \"green friends\". Do you have any comment on this?","Out of their \"Taiwan independence\" nature and political self-interest, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities invested hard-earned money that could have been used to improve the livelihood and well-being of the Taiwanese people into a bottomless pit of meaningless arms purchases. The Taiwanese people clearly see how many ulterior interests are involved in sharing the spoils and lining their own pockets.","民进党当局出于“台独”本性和政治私利，把本来可用于改善台湾民众民生福祉的血汗钱，投入毫无意义的军购无底洞，背后有多少利益分赃、中饱私囊等不可告人的勾当，台湾民众看得很清楚。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","香港中评社记者","According to reports, the acting secretary of the U.S. Navy recently stated that the United States is suspending an arms sales to Taiwan worth approximately US$14 billion. The DPP authorities said they would continue to fight. Any comment on this?","Our position of firmly opposing the US arms sales to China's Taiwan region is consistent, clear and firm. The DPP authorities' attempts to \"rely on the United States for independence\" and \"reject reunification with force\" are doomed to lead to their own destruction.","我们坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器的立场一贯、明确、坚定。民进党当局妄图“倚美谋独”、“以武拒统”，注定是螳臂当车、自取灭亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","环球时报、环球网记者","The Nauru government recently issued an announcement stating that it has adopted internal norms on the one-China principle, requiring public officials to strictly abide by the one-China principle in all official activities. The DPP authorities made groundless accusations. Any comment on this?","We express our appreciation for the stance and practices of relevant countries in adhering to the one-China principle. If you gain the right path, you will get a lot of help, but if you get the wrong path, you will get little help. Facts have once again proved that the one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is the general trend, the great cause and the aspiration of the people. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and go against the historical trend, which will only cause obstacles in the international community.","我们对有关国家坚持一个中国原则的立场和做法表示赞赏。得道多助，失道寡助。事实再次证明，一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识和国际关系基本准则，是大势所趋、大义所在、人心所向。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，逆历史潮流，只会在国际社会四处碰壁。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","北京日报记者","In his speech on the second anniversary of his inauguration, Lai Ching-te said that direct democratic elections 30 years ago not only represented that \"sovereignty rests with the people\", but also demonstrated that Taiwan is already a \"sovereign and independent country.\" Any comment on this?","Lai Qingde fabricated lies and fabricated legal principles in an attempt to package the \"new two-nation theory\" under the guise of \"elections\" and \"democracy.\" This was pure self-deception. Taiwan is part of China. It has never been a country and will never become one. There is no so-called \"sovereignty\" at all.\nNo matter how many lies you tell, they will never become true. The more Lai Qingde tells him, the more he proves his guilty conscience. Taiwan is China's Taiwan. No matter how the Taiwan region elects or who is elected, it cannot change Taiwan's status as a part of China. It cannot sever the historical and legal connection that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. It cannot break the iron law that Taiwan's future can only be determined by all the Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots.","赖清德编造谎言、虚构法理，妄图通过“选举”“民主”的幌子来包装“新两国论”，纯属自欺欺人。台湾是中国的一部分，从来不是一个国家，也绝不可能成为一个国家，根本不存在所谓“主权”。\n谎言说得再多也变不成真的，赖清德说得越多越证明其心虚。台湾是中国的台湾，不管台湾地区以什么方式选举、选了什么人，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的地位，都割裂不了两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理联结，都打破不了台湾前途只能由包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民共同决定的铁律。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202605/t20260527_12767889.htm"],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","Regarding the joint statement signed by China and Russia reaffirming the one-China principle, Taiwan's foreign affairs department stated that \"the two sides of the Taiwan Strait are not subordinate to each other, and any statement intended to distort Taiwan's sovereign status is an act of bullying that undermines international peace and stability.\" Any comment on this?","This joint statement is the most important political outcome document reached at the meeting between the heads of state of China and Russia. Facts have once again proved that the one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people and the trend of the times. Taiwan is part of China, and there is no so-called \"sovereignty\" at all. No matter how the DPP authorities spread fallacies, they cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China, and they cannot shake the international community's basic pattern of adhering to the one-China principle.","此次联合声明是中俄两国元首会晤达成的最重要的政治成果文件。事实再次证明，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是人心所向、大势所趋。台湾是中国的一部分，根本不存在所谓“主权”。无论民进党当局如何散布谬论，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的事实，撼动不了国际社会坚持一个中国原则的基本格局。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","南方日报、南方+记者","The Taipei office of the American Institute in Taiwan (AIT) recently stated that the Kuomintang echoes the mainland's position on some diplomatic and security issues and ignores Taiwan's traditional allies such as the United States and Japan. During Cheng Li-wun's visit to the United States, she may be asked whether she will change her past political line. Any comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affairs. Solving the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and no outsiders can comment on it. For some time, relevant institutions have frequently made irresponsible remarks on cross-Strait affairs, which we firmly oppose. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-US joint communiques, and be cautious in its words and deeds on the Taiwan issue. Our position on Taiwan's foreign exchanges is consistent and clear, that is, it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle.","台湾问题是中国的内政。解决台湾问题，是两岸中国人自己的事，不容外人置喙。一段时间以来，有关机构频频对两岸事务说三道四，我们对此坚决反对。美方应恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，在台湾问题上谨言慎行。我们对待台湾对外交往的立场是一贯的、明确的，即必须按照一个中国原则处理。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","台湾《中国时报》记者","Shenzhou 23 was launched successfully a few days ago, and there were also Kuomintang members leading Taiwanese young students to visit the site. We also noticed that when the spokesperson came in today, he had the Shenzhou 23 logo badge pinned on the collar of his suit jacket, which was very shiny. What are the spokesperson’s expectations for Taiwan’s young people to participate in the space program in the…","The first question. As I just said, the Shenzhou 23 manned spacecraft launch mission was a complete success, which is the common pride and glory of all Chinese people, so I especially wear the logo of this mission today. In addition, I have noticed that many Taiwanese compatriots are also proud and honored. The Chinese nation’s space dream belongs to our compatriots on the mainland, Hong Kong and Macao, and overseas Chinese, as well as our compatriots in Taiwan. We believe that in the near future, Taiwan compatriots will be able to explore the vast universe together with their mainland compatriots and turn their dreams into reality.\nSecond question. We have always encouraged and supported cross-Strait exchanges in all fields and protected the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in accordance with the law. As long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots do not have to have any concerns when traveling to the mainland. Out of political self-interest, the DPP authorities maliciously hyped and spread rumors to smear the mainland in an attempt to create a \"chilling effect\", obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. This is unpopular and will not succeed.","第一个问题。正如我刚才所说的，神舟二十三号载人飞船发射任务取得圆满成功，是全体中华儿女共同的骄傲与荣耀，所以我今天特别佩戴了这次任务的标识。另外，我注意到，很多台湾同胞也引以为傲，与有荣焉。中华民族的航天梦是属于大陆同胞、港澳同胞、海外侨胞的，也是属于台湾同胞的。我们相信在不久的将来，台湾同胞一定能同大陆同胞一道探索浩瀚宇宙，将梦想照进现实。\n第二个问题。我们一贯鼓励、支持两岸各领域交流往来，依法保护台湾同胞的正当权益。只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞往来大陆不必有任何顾虑。民进党当局出于政治私利，恶意炒作、造谣抹黑大陆，企图制造“寒蝉效应”，阻挠破坏两岸交流合作，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","The list of new directors recently announced by Taiwan's \"Center for Cultural Affairs\" includes Taiwanese artist Lin Chi-ling, which has attracted public attention on the island. Lin recently stated that he decided to resign from the position \"in order to avoid more untrue speculations and misunderstandings.\" Any comment on this?","In recent years, the \"Cultural Content Initiative\" has instigated and financed the filming of many film and television dramas such as \"Zero Day Attack\" that distorted history and exaggerated the \"mainland threat\". It is a political tool for the Democratic Progressive Party authorities to promote \"cultural Taiwan independence\" and instigate \"resistance to China and Taiwan.\" It is a wise decision for people in Taiwan’s literary and artistic circles to see clearly its essence and draw a clear line with it.","“文化内容策进院”近年来策动、出资拍摄了《零日攻击》等多部歪曲历史、渲染“大陆威胁”的影视剧，是民进党当局推行“文化台独”、煽动“抗中保台”的政治工具。台湾文艺界人士看清其本质、与其划清界限的决定，是明智的。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","台湾《联合报》记者","The first question is that the recent mining disaster in Shanxi caused heavy casualties. Lai Qingde expressed his condolences and condolences. What is the mainland's comment on its condolences? Do you think it is showing goodwill to the mainland? If Taiwan’s rescue team can go to the mainland to assist in further disaster relief, will the mainland accept it?\nSecond question: Li Hongyuan, vice chairman of the KMT…","The first question. Recently, a gas explosion occurred underground in a coal mine in Qinyuan County, Changzhi City, Shanxi Province, causing heavy casualties. Relevant parties have made every effort to carry out the treatment of the wounded and on-site rescue. People from all walks of life on the island also expressed their concern and condolences through various forms.\nSecond question. Exchanges and integration are where the aspirations and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait lie. We have always actively supported cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in all fields, supported compatriots on both sides of the Strait to enhance mutual understanding, achieve mutual benefit and win-win results, work together to develop cross-Strait relations, and build and protect our common home.\nThe third question. Whether there is a big demand for restoring cross-strait destinations or not, data will tell. We have previously published relevant data. No matter what the DPP authorities say, it cannot change the fact that there is strong demand in the cross-strait direct air flight market and people's strong desire for exchanges. We have always been actively promoting the full resumption of normalization of direct cross-Strait air passenger flights. It is hoped that the DPP authorities will face up to the demand, comply with public opinion, and lift unreasonable restrictions on cross-strait air transport as soon as possible, allowing cross-strait airlines to independently arrange flight plans based on market demand. The DPP authorities have always claimed that the so-called 13 \"charter points\" that have been opened have complicated application procedures and harsh conditions, which the aviation industry \"can see but cannot eat.\" If it is true that it \"fully considers the needs of industry and travel companies\", it should restore the so-called \"charter points\" to regular flight points to facilitate cross-strait personnel exchanges.","第一个问题。近日山西长治市沁源县一煤矿井下发生瓦斯爆炸事故，造成重大人员伤亡。有关方面全力开展伤员救治、现场救援等工作。岛内各界和民众也通过多种形式表达了关心慰问。\n第二个问题。交流融合是两岸同胞愿望所系、福祉所在。我们一贯积极支持两岸各领域交流合作，支持两岸同胞增进相互了解，实现互利共赢，携手发展两岸关系，建设好、守护好共同家园。\n第三个问题。恢复两岸航点的需求大不大，数据会说话。此前，我们已经公布了相关数据。无论民进党当局说什么，都无法改变两岸空中直航市场需求旺盛和民众往来意愿强烈的事实。我们始终积极推动全面恢复两岸空中客运直航正常化。希望民进党当局正视需求，顺应民意，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，由两岸航空公司根据市场需求自主安排航班计划。民进党当局一直声称已开放的所谓13个“包机点”，申请手续繁杂、条件苛刻，航空业者“看得到，吃不到”。如果真如其所说“充分考量业者及旅运需求”，就应该将所谓的“包机点”恢复为定期航点，方便两岸人员往来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","广东广播电视台“粤TV”记者","Recently, the Taipei International Tourism Expo opened, but Taiwan's tourism department required tourism operators on the island not to post advertisements and copywriting for travel to the mainland, causing dissatisfaction and criticism from the tourism industry on the island. Any comment on this?","The DPP authorities deliberately obstruct cross-Strait tourism exchanges, which not only violates the laws of the market, but also harms the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots and tourism operators. Facts have once again shown that the crux and obstacle of cross-strait tourism issues lies in the interference and obstruction of the DPP authorities. The DPP authorities should comply with public opinion and remove unreasonable restrictions such as the \"ban on group travel\" to the mainland as soon as possible to create favorable conditions for cross-strait tourism exchanges and cooperation.","民进党当局刻意阻挠两岸旅游交流，既违背市场规律，也损害台湾同胞和旅游业者的正当权益。事实再次说明，两岸旅游问题的症结和障碍在于民进党当局干扰阻挠。民进党当局应顺应民意，尽早撤除赴大陆旅游“禁团令”等不合理禁限，为两岸旅游交流合作创造有利条件。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","台湾“中央社”记者","The Taiwanese novel \"Taiwan Odyssey\" recently won the 2026 International Booker Prize. According to Agence France-Presse, author Yang Shuangzi said, \"I hope this novel can be published in China in the future and promote dialogue about what the Taiwanese people want for the future.\" What are the conditions for mainland bookstores to introduce this work or publish its simplified version? When Taiwanese books enter…","I want to emphasize that Taiwanese books are not published in \"China\" but in mainland China.\nWriters on both sides of the Taiwan Strait should take a firm national stance, respect historical facts, face up to and deeply understand the huge harm caused by Japan's aggressive war and fascism to the Chinese people and the people of the world, and promote the spiritual harmony of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait with responsible and high-quality works.","我要强调，台湾书籍不是在“中国”，而是在大陆出版。\n两岸作家都应站稳民族立场，尊重历史事实，正视并深刻理解日本发动侵略战争和法西斯主义给中国人民、世界人民带来的巨大伤害，以负责任、优质的作品促进两岸同胞心灵契合。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-05-27","Chen Binhua","台湾TVBS电视台记者","The Ma Ying-jeou Foundation has long promoted cross-Strait youth exchanges. Will the mainland worry about the internal strife affecting the credibility of cross-Strait non-governmental exchanges? Will the future interaction between mainland China and the foundation be affected by this matter?","We have taken note of the relevant reports. In recent years, the Ma Ying-jeou Foundation has carried out a series of cross-strait exchange activities to promote exchanges between compatriots on both sides of the strait, especially young people. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits are all Chinese and one family. The general trend of getting closer and coming together cannot be changed by any force.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","我们注意到了有关报道。近年来，马英九基金会开展了系列两岸交流活动，促进了两岸同胞特别是青年交流往来。两岸同胞都是中国人、一家人，走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流是任何力量都改变不了的。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202605/t20260527_12767895.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-05-28","Mao Ning","Reuters","The International Institute for Strategic Studies has come out with its strategic assessment report. It says that a major conflict between the U.S. and China over Taiwan could risk escalation, potentially to a nuclear level, and both sides could target each other’s commands and communication hubs. How does the ministry view this assessment?","The Taiwan question is China’s internal affair. Resolving the question is a matter for the Chinese ourselves that brooks no external interference. To keep the Taiwan Strait peaceful and stable, it is absolutely essential to unequivocally oppose “Taiwan independence.” The U.S. side should earnestly implement the important common understandings between the two presidents in their meetings and exercise extra caution in handling the Taiwan question.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260528_11919951.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-05-28","Jiang Bin","","Reports say that during his visit to China, U.S. President Trump said that he \"is not looking to have somebody go independent\", nor is he looking to \"travel 9,500 miles to fight a war\" for Taiwan. In response, Lai Ching-te disingenuously claimed that Taiwan will never become a \"bargaining chip,\" while defending the status quo of the \"Republic of China\", and asserted that there is \"no question of Taiwan…","\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are mutually incompatible. Safeguarding peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait represents the greatest common ground between China and the United States.\nLai Ching-te once blatantly labeled himself a \"pragmatic worker for Taiwan independence\". Now, he is hypocritically claiming that \"there is no Taiwan independence issue\"— a mere repackaging of his rhetoric after being harshly confronted by reality. This only shows that the pursuit of \"Taiwan independence\" has reached a dead end, and the illusion of seeking U.S. support for \"Taiwan independence\" is bound to be shattered.","“台独”与台海和平水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。赖清德曾明目张胆自称“务实台独工作者”，现在假惺惺地宣称“没有‘台独’问题”，这是其被现实狠狠打脸后变换话术的重新伪装，也恰恰说明搞“台独”已是穷途末路，“倚美谋独”幻想终将破灭。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16467353.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16466689.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-05-28","Jiang Bin","","I have two questions. Firstly, it was reported that President Xi Jinping met with Pakistani Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif during his visit to China. Additionally, General Zhang Shengmin, Vice Chairman of the Central Military Commission, met with Field Marshal Syed Asim Munir, Chief of Defense Forces and Chief of the Army Staff of the Pakistan Armed Forces, who visited China concurrently with the Prime Minister.…","On your first question, China and Pakistan are good neighbors connected by the same mountains and rivers, good friends bound by trust, good partners watching out for each other, and good brothers sharing weal and woe. Since the establishment of diplomatic relations 75 years ago, the friendship between our two nations has stood the test of shifting international landscapes. It has grown stronger over time and taken deep root in the hearts of our peoples. Pakistani friends often describe China-Pakistan friendship as \"higher than mountain, deeper than sea, and sweeter than honey\", while the Chinese people affectionately refer to Pakistan as an \"iron-clad brother\".\nChina and Pakistan enjoy close military-to-military relationship. Fruitful outcomes have been witnessed in practical cooperation across areas such as strategic communication, joint exercises and training, personnel training, and equipment and technology. A series of flagship joint exercises—such as Exercise Warrior for the armies, Exercise Sea Guardian for the navies, and Exercise Shaheen for the air forces—have become signature programs for bilateral cooperation. We stand ready to work with Pakistan to follow the strategic guidance of our leaders, carry forward traditional friendship, strengthen strategic communication, enhance practical cooperation, firmly support each other on issues involving our core interests, so as to elevate our military-to-military relations to a higher level and jointly contribute to the building of an even closer China-Pakistan community with a shared future in the new era, as well as to global development and security.\nOn your second question, China advocates that defense and security cooperation between countries must not target any third party or harm the interests of any third party, still less undermine regional peace and stability. Japan's right-wing forces continue to take dangerous strides and engage in provocations in the military and security sphere. Its resurgent neo-militarism is poised to become a source of turmoil for East Asia. All peace-loving people should reject Japan's regressive course, preventing it from damaging regional peace and bring catastrophe upon the wider world once again.","关于第一个问题。中国和巴基斯坦是山水相连的好邻居、信义相交的好朋友、守望相助的好伙伴、患难与共的好兄弟。建交75年来，两国友谊经历了国际风云变幻的考验，历久弥坚、深入人心。巴基斯坦朋友常用“比山高、比海深、比蜜甜”来形容中巴友谊，而中国人民也亲切地称呼巴基斯坦为“巴铁”。\n中巴两军关系密切，在战略沟通、联演联训、人员培训、装备技术等领域务实合作成果丰硕。两国陆军“勇士”、海军“海洋卫士”、空军“雄鹰”等系列联演联训已成为双方合作的品牌项目。我们愿与巴方一道，按照两国领导人的战略指引，赓续传统友谊，加强战略沟通，密切务实合作，在涉及彼此核心利益问题上坚定相互支持，把两军关系推向更高水平，为加快构建新时代更加紧密的中巴命运共同体、促进世界发展和安全贡献力量。\n关于第二个问题。中方一贯主张，有关国家间军事合作不应针对第三方或损害第三方利益，不应破坏地区和平稳定。日本右翼势力在军事安全领域不断危险冒进、试探挑衅，“新型军国主义”大有成为东亚“祸源”之势。所有爱好和平的人们都不应放任日本倒行逆施，让其破坏和平、为祸世界。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16467353.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16466689.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-05-28","Jiang Bin","","The U.S. Acting Secretary of the Navy recently stated publicly that Washington is deferring a planned arms sale package to the Taiwan region worth approximately USD 14 billion, drawing close attention from observers on the island. Meanwhile, the U.S. House of Representatives has unveiled some contents of the Fiscal Year 2027 National Defense Authorization Act, which includes the \"Taiwan Security Cooperation…","China's position is consistent and unequivocal: we firmly oppose U.S. arms sales to China's Taiwan region. The U.S. side must abide by the one-China principle and the stipulations of the three China-U.S. Joint Communiqués, especially the August 17 Communiqué, faithfully implement the important common understandings reached between the two presidents, honor its commitments and public statements to China, and handle the Taiwan question with the utmost prudence. It should take concrete actions to keep bilateral and military-to-military relations on a stable, sound and sustainable track.","中方坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器的立场是一贯、明确的。美方应恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报特别是“八·一七”公报规定，落实好中美元首会晤重要共识，兑现对中方所作承诺和表态，慎之又慎处理台湾问题，以实际行动维护中美两国两军关系稳定、健康、可持续发展。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16467353.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16466689.html",1,1,4,""],[0,"2026-05-29","Mao Ning","Reuters","There have been reports that a Canadian warship transited the Taiwan Strait. Is the foreign ministry able to confirm this and do you have any comment?","China respects the right of navigation that all countries are entitled to under international law, but firmly opposes acts that undermine China’s sovereignty and security in the name of freedom of navigation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260529_11921368.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-05-29","Mao Ning","CCTV","Yesterday during the Philippine President’s visit to Japan, the two countries issued a joint statement announcing the start of talks on the delimitation of exclusive economic zone and continental shelf between Japan and the Philippines. What’s China’s comment?","The area the two countries announced they will delimit is east of China’s Taiwan island. According to China’s domestic law and international law including UNCLOS, China has exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in this area. Japan and the Philippines’ so-called maritime delimitation talks constitute a severe violation of China’s maritime rights and interests, UNCLOS and other international law and basic norms governing international relations. China strongly deplores and firmly opposes that and has lodged serious protests with both countries.\nThe so-called delimitation talks are completely illegal, null and void, and will have no effect on China’s claims to rights in the area east of the Taiwan island or exercise of China’s lawful rights. China urges Japan and the Philippines to immediately stop any violation of China’s maritime rights and interests and take concrete actions to uphold regional peace and stability.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202605/t20260529_11921368.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-01","Lin Jian","TV Asahi","According to the New York Times, one of its journalists was deported. What’s your comment?","The New York Times provided platform for Taiwan authorities to peddle separatist rhetoric for “Taiwan independence,” and blatantly called China’s Taiwan region a “country.” This grossly violates the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, and sends a gravely wrong signal to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces. China firmly opposes it. The New York Times should correct its wrongdoings rather than continue down the wrong path.\nDuring the time the journalist you mentioned was stationed in China, she had a track record of deceiving people into unknowingly taking interviews, and violated the Regulations of the People’s Republic of China on News Coverage by Permanent Offices of Foreign Media Organizations and Foreign Journalists. Her residence permit was thus revoked as dictated by laws and regulations. The U.S. side, out of so-called “reciprocity,” is engaged in political suppression against journalists from Xinhua News Agency working legally in the United States. China firmly opposes this.\nThe facts and merits of the issue of media between China and the U.S. are clear. The root cause is the U.S. side’s unilaterally stirring up trouble, and politicizing issues related to media. China always provides facilitation for foreign journalists as they report and live in China. In recent years, China has shown flexibility and provided visa facilitation for quite a few U.S. journalists coming to China to do reporting, whereas Chinese journalists’ applications for reporting in the United States have rarely been approved. The U.S. side should earnestly implement the understanding reached with China on media issues and take concrete actions to ensure the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese journalists who work and stay in the United States.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260601_11922642.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-02","Mao Ning","Shenzhen TV","On May 31, in response to the Foreign Ministry Spokesperson’s remarks on Japan-Philippines announcement of maritime delimitation talks, Taiwan’s “foreign affairs department” commended Japan and the Philippines and questioned Chinese mainland’s sovereign rights over relevant waters. What is your comment?","China has made clear its position on the announced maritime delimitation talks between Japan and the Philippines. Let me reiterate that the area involved in their planned talks is east of China’s Taiwan island. According to China’s domestic law and international law including UNCLOS, China has exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in this area. As per UNCLOS, the delimitation of the exclusive economic zone and the continental shelf between States with opposite or adjacent coasts shall be effected by the States concerned by agreement on the basis of equity. Any delimitation concerning waters to the east of Taiwan must have China as a party to the talks. Japan and the Philippines’ attempt to bypass China and initiate the so-called maritime delimitation talks constitutes a severe violation of UNCLOS and other international laws and basic norms governing international relations. It also seriously infringes on China’s maritime rights and interests. China will not allow this.\nThe two sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one and the same China. To uphold national sovereignty and maritime rights and interests is the shared responsibility of all Chinese people on both sides of the Strait. The DPP authorities, in pursuing selfish political gains, have gone so far as to put the Chinese nation’s vital interest up for sale, a move that betrays ancestors and breaches all moral boundaries. This once again shows that these separatists have completely forfeited the national stance and degenerated into traitors to the nation. What awaits them is contempt from Chinese on both sides of the Strait and the judgement of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260602_11923474.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-02","Mao Ning","Nippon TV","Cheng Li-wen is visiting the U.S. Does the foreign ministry have any comment on this?","Issues related to external exchanges of China’s Taiwan region should be handled in line with the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260602_11923474.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-03","Mao Ning","Hubei Media Group","According to media in Africa and the Taiwan region, before and after Lai Ching-te’s visit to Eswatini, the DPP authorities provided the country with 25 billion or so New Taiwan dollars worth of funding, and pledged that the income of related project belongs entirely to the king and the royal family. Taiwan’s representatives in Eswatini will also profit from that. What’s your comment?","Those reports are yet another example of how far the Lai Ching-te authorities would go to selfishly advance their “Taiwan independence” agenda. Their expensive dollar diplomacy—a combination of corruption, fraudulence, bribery and money for abuse of power—has cost dearly the people in Taiwan, equivalent to collecting more than NT$1,000 from every person in Taiwan. Having Eswatini as a “diplomatic ally” is not about delivering real benefits for the people, but to line the pockets of the very few people who profit from it. This is political theatrics steeped in greed and graft.\nThe one-China principle is a prevailing international consensus, and a basic norm governing international relations. This year, China has extended zero-tariff treatment to all 53 African countries having diplomatic relations with China. This is a fresh opportunity for African countries to expand exports to China and grow their economies. It has delivered tangible benefits to Chinese and Africans. Eswatini is the only country left in Africa with so-called “diplomatic ties” to Taiwan. Betting on “Taiwan independence” has no future. It will only cost them opportunities for development and lead to international isolation.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260603_11936890.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on June 3, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Let’s start asking questions now.","欢迎大家参加国台办例行发布会，现在开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","Please introduce the preparations for the 18th Straits Forum.","The 18th Straits Forum will be held in Fujian in mid-June, and the forum conference will be held on June 13. The main venue of the forum is located in Xiamen, and relevant activities will be held in the Pingtan Comprehensive Experimental Zone of Fujian's districted cities. This forum adheres to the positioning of \"non-governmental, grassroots and extensive\" and continues the theme of \"expanding non-governmental exchanges and deepening integrated development\". It has set up 58 activities in four major sections: grassroots exchanges, youth exchanges, cultural exchanges and economic exchanges. Representatives of Taiwan's relevant political parties and representatives from trade unions, youth, women, folk beliefs, agriculture, fishery, water conservancy, culture and tourism, health, industry, commerce and finance will be invited to participate.\nAt present, the preparations for the forum are advancing steadily and progressing smoothly. The Forum News Center will issue an application notice for reporters, and all media reporters are welcome to interview and report.","第十八届海峡论坛将于6月中旬在福建举办，6月13日举办论坛大会。论坛主会场设在厦门，福建有关设区市和平潭综合实验区将举办相关活动。本届论坛坚持“民间性、草根性、广泛性”定位，延续“扩大民间交流、深化融合发展”主题，设置基层交流、青年交流、文化交流、经济交流四大板块58项活动，将邀请台湾有关政党代表以及工会、青年、妇女、民间信仰、农渔水利、文化旅游、卫生健康、工商金融等各界人士参加。\n目前论坛各项筹备工作稳步推进，进展顺利。论坛新闻中心将发布记者采访申请通知，欢迎各位媒体记者前往采访报道。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769130.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic, trade and exchange activities.","From May to June, cross-strait exchange activities in various fields continued to be vigorous. Gatherings time after time have brought compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait closer to each other, and events after events have made the Chinese culture of the same roots deeply rooted in the hearts of the people.\nOn May 22, Huacan·College Industry-Education Integration Exchange Event was held in Nanchang, Jiangxi. More than 100 young designer representatives from more than 60 universities and industry organizations on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and overseas gathered together to share experiences and discuss development. On May 29, the launching ceremony of the third series of cultural exchange activities between Buddhist platforms was held in Foshan, Guangdong. Nearly 500 people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait participated. The event focused on sports exchanges. In addition to traditional folk cultural sports such as martial arts, dragon boating, and lion dance, it also added fashionable sports such as pickleball, slow pitch, and roller skating that are popular among young people to create a multi-dimensional and normalized youth exchange platform for Buddhist platforms. From May 29th to 31st, the 21st Straits Tourism Expo was held in Xiamen, Fujian Province. The expo focused on creating an urban weekend micro-vacation destination and attracted 55 Taiwanese companies to participate. On June 2, the 2026 Third Season Xiangtai Cultural Exchange Event was held in Xiang'an District, Xiamen, Fujian. More than 300 guests from both sides of the Taiwan Strait passed on and carried forward the excellent traditional culture of southern Fujian through the exchange of Minnan songs.\nTwo events are previewed here. On June 11, the \"World Chinese Yandi Hometown Root-Seeking Festival in the Year of Bingwu\" will be held in Suizhou, Hubei. More than 130 Taiwanese cultural circles, youth and grassroots representatives will participate in the ceremony to pay homage to Yandi Shennong and inherit the millennium cultural heritage. From June 12 to 16, the second Cross-Strait Youth E-Sports Carnival will be held in Suzhou, Jiangsu Province. 150 young people from both sides of the strait will jointly carry out e-Sports exhibitions, base camps, technology experiences and other exchange activities.","从5月到6月，两岸各领域交流活动持续热络。一次次的相聚拉近两岸同胞彼此距离，一场场活动让同根同源的中华文化深入人心。\n5月22日，华灿·高等学校产教融合交流活动在江西南昌举办,来自两岸及海外60多家高校、行业机构100余名青年设计师代表齐聚一堂，分享经验、共话发展。5月29日，第三届佛台系列文化交流活动启动仪式在广东佛山举行，两岸近500人参加，活动以体育交流为重点，除武术、龙舟、醒狮等传统民俗文化运动项目之外，还加入匹克球、慢垒、轮滑等深受青年喜爱的时尚体育项目，打造多维度、常态化佛台青年交流平台。5月29日至31日，第21届海峡旅游博览会在福建厦门举办，博览会以打造城市周末微度假目的地为主轴，吸引55家台湾企业参展。6月2日，2026第三季翔台文化交流活动在福建厦门翔安区举行，两岸300多名嘉宾通过闽南语歌曲交流等形式，传承弘扬闽南优秀传统文化。\n在此预告两项活动。6月11日，“丙午年世界华人炎帝故里寻根节”将在湖北随州举行，130余名台湾文化界、青年和基层代表将参加拜谒炎帝神农大典，同承千年文脉。6月12日至16日，“两相竞美 阳澄悦见”第二届两岸青年电竞嘉年华活动将在江苏苏州举办，两岸150名青年共同开展电竞表演赛、基地探营、科技体验等交流活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","In recent times, \"Provincial Super League\" has been held in full swing across the mainland. In particular, the \"Fujian Super League\" has launched a series of special activities against Taiwan, which has attracted enthusiastic attention from the majority of Taiwanese compatriots. Please introduce the relevant situation.","As you can see, this summer, the \"Suzhou Super League\"'s outing, the \"Fujian Super League\"'s cross-strait love, the \"Guangdong Super League's\" cheerleaders, the \"Sichuan Super League's\" roar, and the \"Northeast Super League's\" fireworks ignited the passion and blood of fans on both sides of the Taiwan Strait every weekend.\nIn order to support the construction of cross-strait integrated development demonstration zones, \"Minchao\" has recently innovatively launched three series of special activities against Taiwan. The first is to \"call you to participate\", opening up exclusive quotas for Taiwanese compatriots, and each Fujian Super League participating team can add 2 new Taiwanese compatriots players. The second is to \"invite you to watch the game.\" Each major competition area invites Taiwanese compatriots to go to Fujian to watch the game, launches a short video collection campaign for \"Fans on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to cheer in the same frame\", and invites Kinmen and Matsu specialty cheerleaders to perform on the same stage as the Fujian cheerleaders. The third is \"Invite you to come and communicate.\" Each competition area will take the initiative to connect with teams from Taiwan, Hong Kong, Macao and overseas Chinese, and carry out friendly exchange matches on a regular basis. Xiamen, Pingtan and other places will hold at least one special exchange match between a Fujian Super League team and a team from a city in Taiwan.","大家看到，这个夏天，“苏超”的出圈梗、“闽超”的两岸情、“粤超”的啦啦队、“川超”的雄起吼、“东北超”的烟火气，在每一个周末点燃两岸球迷的激情与热血。\n为助力两岸融合发展示范区建设，“闽超”近日创新推出三大特色对台系列活动。一是“喊您来参赛”，开放台胞专属参赛名额，每一支闽超参赛队伍均可新增2名台胞球员。二是“邀您来观球”，各大赛区主场邀请台胞赴闽观球，启动“两岸球迷同框加油”短视频征集活动，邀请金门、马祖特色啦啦队同福建啦啦队同台展演。三是“请您来交流”，各赛区主动对接台湾、港澳及海外侨胞球队，常态化开展友谊交流赛，厦门、平潭等地将举办至少1场闽超队伍与台湾地区城市球队的专项交流赛。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769122.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","Among the ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, \"Taiwanese entrepreneurs can participate in the creation of mainland micro-short dramas in various ways\" has attracted attention. What are the ways and means for Taiwanese compatriots to participate in the creation of micro-short dramas?","Micro-short plays are new popular literature and art in the Internet era. They are deeply loved by young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and have become a new growth point in the cultural industry. On April 12, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China was authorized to issue ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation. The ninth item included \"Taiwanese industry operators can participate in the creation of mainland micro-short dramas in various ways.\" This provides strong policy support for promoting cross-strait micro-short drama exchanges and cooperation.\nCurrently, there are three main ways for Taiwanese industry players to participate in the creation of mainland micro-short dramas.\nFirst, you can invest in and establish radio and television program production and operation companies in Fujian. The \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone\" clearly states that \"a pilot program will allow Taiwanese businesses to invest in and establish radio and television program production and operating companies in Fujian.\" Currently, 18 Taiwan-funded enterprises in Fujian have obtained radio and television program production and operation licenses and are producing micro-short dramas.\nSecond, we can co-produce and create micro-short dramas with mainland industry players. The creative teams on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can jointly create, leverage their respective strengths in production coordination, participation in publicity, shooting execution, and picture design, and develop together.\nThird, you can participate in micro-short drama performances. Taiwanese entertainers can participate in the filming of various types of short dramas. Taiwanese industry professionals who have dreams and love to work hard are welcome to seize the opportunity and actively participate in the creation of micro-short dramas to jointly promote the inheritance, protection, innovation and development of Chinese culture.","微短剧是互联网时代的新大众文艺，深受两岸青年喜爱，成为文化产业新增长点。中央台办4月12日受权发布十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，其中第九项包含“台湾业者可以多种方式参与大陆微短剧创作”，这为推进两岸微短剧交流合作提供了有力的政策支持。\n目前，台湾业者参与大陆微短剧创作主要有三种途径。\n一是可以在闽投资设立广播电视节目制作经营公司。《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》明确提出“试点允许台湾业者在闽投资设立广播电视节目制作经营公司”。目前在福建已有18家台资企业获得广播电视节目制作经营许可证，正在开展微短剧制作。\n二是可以与大陆业者合拍共创微短剧。两岸创作团队可联合创制，在制片统筹、参演宣发、拍摄执行及画面设计等方面发挥各自优势、携手发展。\n三是可以参与微短剧演出。台湾演艺人员可参与各种类型的微短剧摄制。欢迎有梦想、爱打拼的台湾业界人士把握机遇，积极参与微短剧创作，共同促进中华文化传承保护与创新发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769126.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","Recently, Lai Ching-te said in a conversation with high school students on the island that the impact of TikTok and Xiaohongshu on Taiwan's young generation has reached a security crisis. Over time, Taiwan may not have the will to protect democracy and will regard \"China\" as a good guy; it will require the education and cultural departments to handle it properly. Any comment on this?","To our Taiwan compatriots, compatriots on the mainland are not only good people, but also relatives and family members. Taiwanese compatriots, especially Taiwanese youth, are increasingly fond of using mainland social software because they can use these social software to enjoy more life experiences and opportunities for free expression. When they share delicious food and beautiful scenery, they will receive enthusiastic interactions that fill the screen with \"I want to go see it\"; when they post about looking for relatives, many mainland netizens will enthusiastically respond and provide clues; when they want to communicate and learn, they will encounter various note-taking tutorials and even \"hand-in-hand\" remote teaching... All the warm moments of intersection are \"two-way rushes\" of \"sharing and co-creation\" by netizens on both sides of the strait, and are a vivid embodiment of \"one family on both sides of the strait\".\nMainland social software helps Taiwanese youth grow, develop, and realize their dreams, but the Lai Ching-te authorities continue to smear it and even intimidate and threaten Taiwanese youth, which shows their guilt and cowardice. No matter how deliberately the Lai authorities try to undermine cross-Strait exchanges and integration, they will never succeed.","大陆同胞对于台湾同胞，不仅是好人，更是亲人、家人。台湾同胞特别是台湾青年越来越喜欢用大陆社交软件，是因为他们可以用这些社交软件享受更多生活体验和自由表达的机会。他们分享美食美景，会收获满屏“好想去看看”的热情互动；他们发帖寻亲，会有许多大陆网友热情响应提供线索；他们想交流学习，会刷到各类笔记教程，甚至“手把手”的远程教导......所有温暖交集的瞬间，都是两岸网友“共享共创”的“双向奔赴”，是“两岸一家亲”的生动体现。\n大陆社交软件助力台湾青年成长、发展、圆梦，而赖清德当局却不断进行抹黑，甚至对台湾青年进行恐吓、威胁，表明其心虚胆寒。无论赖当局如何处心积虑破坏两岸交流交融，都不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769128.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","The 2026 joint interview event for journalists from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, \"Meet in the Central Plains and See the Wonders in Henan\", was recently held in Henan. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From May 27 to June 2, the 2026 joint interview event for journalists from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, \"Meet in the Central Plains and See the Wonders in Henan\", was successfully held. More than 40 journalists from both sides of the Taiwan Strait and Hong Kong, as well as Taiwanese youth self-media people, participated in the event and went to Zhengzhou, Luoyang, Kaifeng and other places to interview companies, cultural and museum institutions, etc., and reported on Henan's development in rural revitalization, advanced manufacturing, cultural tourism and other aspects from all aspects and angles, and experienced the rich heritage and vitality of the Central Plains on the ground.\nThe cross-Strait reporter joint interview event is jointly organized by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and the China Journalists Association. It has been held for 24 times since 2000. Journalists from both sides of the Taiwan Strait traveled to various parts of the mainland to conduct in-depth interviews and reports, playing a positive role in promoting cross-Strait media exchanges and enhancing mutual understanding between compatriots on both sides. More journalists are welcome to have the opportunity to participate in this brand activity.","5月27日至6月2日，“相约中原·豫见精彩”——2026年海峡两岸记者联合采访活动顺利举行。来自两岸暨香港的40多名记者、台青自媒体人参加活动，深入郑州、洛阳、开封等地采访企业、文博机构等，全方位、多角度采访报道河南在乡村振兴、先进制造、文化旅游等方面的发展，实地感受中原大地的厚重底蕴和蓬勃活力。\n两岸记者联合采访活动由国务院台办和中国记协共同举办，自2000年至今已举办24届。两岸记者联袂到大陆各地进行深度采访报道，为促进两岸媒体交流、增进两岸同胞相互了解发挥了积极作用。欢迎更多记者朋友有机会参加这项品牌活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","The United States recently announced that the non-semiconductor 232 tariff preferential measures for Taiwan specified in the Taiwan-US Investment MOU will take effect from May 1, including auto parts and logs, timber and wood derivatives with a tax rate of no more than 15%. Taiwan's administrative department stated that the preferential treatment received by Taiwan is consistent with that of the European Union,…","The DPP authorities have bowed to the United States and lost faith, betrayed Taiwan's core industries, sacrificed Taiwan's industrial development prospects, and harmed the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people. The US$500 billion investment in the United States and the implementation of \"zero tariffs\" on 4,885 industrial products and 1,482 agricultural products in the United States and other bloody concessions were only exchanged for symbolic tax concessions. The DPP authorities actually have the nerve to take credit for this and claim it as their own \"merit\", which is completely deceiving themselves and others. Such perverse actions will not deceive Taiwan's industry and people. They will only reap the consequences and become a laughing stock.","民进党当局跪美输诚，出卖台湾核心产业，牺牲台湾产业发展前景，损害台湾民众利益福祉。用5000亿美元对美投资、对美国4885项工业产品及1482项农产品实施“零关税”等失血般的让步，仅仅换来象征性的税率优惠。民进党当局对此竟然还有脸大肆邀功，标榜为自己的“功绩”，完全是自欺欺人。如此倒行逆施，蒙蔽不了台湾产业界和民众，只会自食恶果、沦为笑柄。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769127.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Taiwanese Internet celebrity \"curators\" recently visited Sichuan and Chongqing live, checking in to the Chongqing Anti-Japanese War Relics Museum, visiting Zhang Xue Motorcycle Factory, watching Sichuan Opera Changing Faces and Giant Pandas, and Taiwanese Internet celebrities climbed 178 meters to overlook the Xiamen-Jinjiang Bridge, and went to Yichang to measure the Three Gorges Dam with their feet. These have…","During this period, we have seen many Taiwanese Internet celebrity friends visit and broadcast live in Chongqing, Sichuan, Fujian, Hubei and other places, sharing with the people on the island the beautiful scenery, tasting delicious food, exploring museums and major projects in various parts of the mainland, learning about history, experiencing unique culture, integrating into the daily life of mainland compatriots, and interacting with mainland entrepreneurial youth and entrepreneurs, and talking about cooperation scenes and feelings. Many netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, especially Taiwanese netizens, responded enthusiastically and expressed the hope that there would be more similar kind-hearted interactions and objective recommendations.\nHearing a hundred times is better than seeing it, and meeting it makes you fall in love. We welcome Taiwanese compatriots, including Taiwanese internet celebrities, to visit the mainland, learn about the mainland in various ways, introduce the mainland, and share their real experiences and development opportunities in the mainland with more friends.","这段时间，我们看到多位台湾网红朋友到重庆、四川、福建、湖北等地参访、直播，与岛内民众分享在大陆各地打卡美景、品尝美食、探寻博物馆和重大工程，了解历史、体验特色文化，融入大陆同胞日常生活，以及与大陆创业青年、企业家交流互动、畅谈合作的场景和感受。很多两岸网民特别是台湾网民对此予以热情回应，表示希望有更多类似的善意互动和客观推介。\n百闻不如一见，见面三分情。我们欢迎包括台湾网红在内的台湾同胞多来大陆走走看看，用各种方式了解大陆、介绍大陆，与更多朋友分享在大陆的真实见闻和发展机遇。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769121.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","The Taiwan Film Festival of the 17th Cross-Strait Film Festival was recently held in Ya'an, Sichuan, and the Mainland Film Festival will also meet with Taiwanese audiences in the near future. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The Cross-Strait Film Exhibition is a brand event for cross-Strait film and television exchanges. The 17th Taiwan Film Festival of the Cross-Strait Film Festival was held in Ya'an, Sichuan from May 30 to June 3. Seven Taiwanese films including \"96 Minutes: The Train Bombing\", \"Girls\", and \"Our Unexpected Courage\" were screened in Ya'an. Filmmakers from both sides of the Taiwan Strait conducted discussions on the theme of \"Story and Emotion: Film Expression of China's Excellent Traditional Culture\". The Taiwanese film delegation not only brought the exhibited works to enthusiastically share and interact with mainland audiences at the post-screening exchange site, but also went to the Ya'an Tea Factory and the Ya'an Base of the China Giant Panda Conservation and Research Center for interviews and exchanges, and deeply experienced the charm of Ya'an as a natural film location and fertile ground for film and television development.","两岸电影展是两岸影视交流的品牌活动。第十七届两岸电影展之台湾电影展于5月30日至6月3日在四川雅安举办，《96分钟：列车爆炸案》、《女孩》、《我们意外的勇气》等7部台湾电影在雅安集中展映，两岸电影人围绕“故事与情感：中华优秀传统文化的电影表达”开展主题探讨。台湾电影代表团不仅带着参展作品在映后交流现场与大陆观众热情分享互动，还深入雅安茶厂、中国大熊猫保护研究中心雅安基地等采风交流，深入感受雅安作为天然电影取景地和影视发展沃土的魅力。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Recently, the leaders of Japan and the Philippines issued a joint statement, which emphasized the importance of peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and announced the launch of the so-called \"maritime delimitation negotiations.\" The DPP authorities echoed this. Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of China's Taiwan Island. Their so-called \"delimitation negotiations\" seriously infringe on China's maritime rights and interests, seriously violate international law and basic norms of international relations, and are completely illegal and invalid.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to the Chinese nation and should stand firm on their national stance, uphold national justice, jointly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and safeguard the overall interests of the Chinese nation. If the DPP authorities dare to rely on external forces and betray national interests, they will be spurned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and punished by history.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。日本、菲律宾宣布的拟划界海域位于中国台湾岛以东，其所谓“划界谈判”严重侵害中国海洋权益，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，完全非法无效。\n两岸同胞同属中华民族，应站稳民族立场，坚持民族大义，共同维护国家主权和领土完整，维护中华民族的整体利益。民进党当局胆敢贴靠外部势力、出卖民族利益，必将受到两岸同胞的唾弃和历史的惩罚。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769124.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, the Fujian Coast Guard carried out law enforcement inspections in the waters near Kinmen in accordance with the law. The Taiwan Coast Guard said the mainland coast guard \"attempted to create the illusion that it has jurisdiction over Kinmen waters.\" Any comment on this?","Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan, Penghu, Kinmen and Malaysia are all part of China. The mainland coast guard department carries out law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas in accordance with the law to maintain the order of maritime operations and protect the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which is a normal performance of their duties.","海峡两岸同属一个中国，台、澎、金、马都是中国的一部分。大陆海警部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查，维护海上作业秩序、保障两岸渔民的生命财产安全，是正常履职行为。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769123.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","NVIDIA founder Huang Jen-Hsun recently said, \"Taiwan needs more electricity.\" Some public opinion on the island pointed out that this statement highlighted concerns about Taiwan's power supply capacity, but the DPP has always dared not face the energy issue that is the lifeline of the industry. Any comment on this?","The DPP authorities are obsessed with pursuing \"Taiwan independence\" and have neither the will nor the ability to solve the structural problems facing the island's economic and social development. \"Lack of electricity\" has become the Achilles heel of Taiwan's sustainable economic and social development, which is obvious to all. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities have highly politicized the energy issue. Instead of solving it head-on, they use it as a tool to suppress dissenters and suppress opponents, exposing their self-interest and disregard for Taiwan's people's livelihood and future development.","民进党当局一门心思搞“台独”，既没有意愿也没有能力解决岛内经济社会发展面临的结构性问题。“缺电”已经成为台湾经济社会持续发展的软肋，这一点大家有目共睹。民进党当局把能源问题高度政治化，不是直面去解决，而是把它当作党同伐异、打压对手的工具，暴露其只顾一党之私、不顾台湾民生福祉和未来发展的嘴脸。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","Recently, the 2026 Shangri-La Dialogue was held in Singapore. Some public opinion noticed that US Secretary of Defense Hegseth rarely mentioned Taiwan in his keynote speech, but highly affirmed the series of results achieved by President Trump's recent visit to China. Any comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair and does not tolerate any external interference. Maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the United States.","台湾问题是中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中国日报记者","Australia's Lowy Institute recently released a report, \"After Annexation: China's Plan to Rule Taiwan,\" stating that China's strategy toward Taiwan has shifted from its past emphasis on \"peaceful reunification and a high degree of autonomy\" to a \"high-pressure model\" of \"first suppression, then governance.\" Any comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is China's internal affair. The reunification of the motherland is a matter for the Chinese people and a just cause to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The so-called \"annexation\" and \"suppression\" completely confuse right and wrong. The relevant report deliberately spreads the fallacy of the \"China threat\" and peddles panic about the Taiwan Strait crisis, which is unpopular.\nWe would like to emphasize again that \"peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\" are our basic policy for solving the Taiwan issue and the best way to achieve national reunification. The specific implementation form of \"one country, two systems\" in Taiwan will fully take into account Taiwan's actual situation, fully absorb the opinions and suggestions from all walks of life on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and fully take into account the interests and feelings of Taiwan compatriots. On the premise of ensuring national sovereignty, security, and development interests, after peaceful reunification, Taiwan's social system and way of life will be fully respected, and the desire of Taiwan compatriots to be the masters of the country will be fully protected in accordance with the law.","台湾问题是中国内政。完成祖国统一是中国人自己的事，是维护国家主权和领土完整的正义事业，所谓“并吞”、“镇压”之说完全颠倒黑白。有关报告蓄意散播“中国威胁”谬论，兜售台海危机恐慌，不得人心。\n我们要再次强调，“和平统一、一国两制”是我们解决台湾问题的基本方针，也是实现国家统一的最佳方式。“一国两制”在台湾的具体实现形式会充分考虑台湾现实情况，会充分吸收两岸各界意见和建议，会充分照顾到台湾同胞利益和感情。在确保国家主权、安全、发展利益的前提下，和平统一后，台湾的社会制度和生活方式等将得到充分尊重，台湾同胞当家作主的愿望将依法得到充分保障。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Recently, the so-called \"Taiwan-U.S. Defense Industry Forum\" was held in Taiwan. Huang Zhifang, chairman of the Taiwan Foreign Trade Association, said that Taiwan's industry is ready to work with the United States to jointly create a more reliable \"defense technology ecosystem\" for the Indo-Pacific region. Any comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. The so-called \"defense science and technology ecosystem\" embodies the DPP authorities' evil intentions of \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence\", \"using force to seek independence\" and becoming a \"chess piece\" of the United States' \"use Taiwan to contain China\". It will only put Taiwan into a more dangerous situation and bring serious disasters to Taiwan compatriots. The DPP authorities continue to collude with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations, overestimating their own capabilities and hitting stones with eggs, which will only accelerate the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\".","我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系。所谓“防务科技生态系”包藏着民进党当局“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”和成为美国“以台制华”“棋子”的祸心，只会让台湾陷入更加危险的境地，给台湾同胞带来深重灾难。民进党当局不断勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，自不量力、以卵击石，只会加速“台独”必然败亡的结局。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","In recent days, governments and political figures from many countries including Russia, Canada, and Thailand have continued to speak out, emphasizing their adherence to the one-China stance. Any comment on this?","We express our appreciation for the stance and practices of relevant countries in adhering to the one-China principle and supporting China's reunification cause. Facts have repeatedly proved that the one-China principle is the basic norm of international relations and the general consensus of the international community. It is the aspiration of the people and the trend of the times.","我们对有关国家坚持一个中国原则、支持中国统一事业的立场和做法表示赞赏。事实一再证明，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是人心所向、大势所趋。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","羊城晚报“阅台海”记者","Recently, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities stated that four mainland-developed applications, including Amap, Bilibili, iQiyi and BIMOBIMO, all have risks such as real-time behavior monitoring, system information acquisition, data transmission and sharing, and reminded Taiwanese people to be more vigilant to ensure their digital security. Any comment on this?","In recent years, more and more mainland applications have been welcomed by Taiwanese compatriots, who believe that these applications are technologically advanced, practical and easy to use. For example, a video \"Teaching you step-by-step to book high-speed rail tickets at 12306\" has recently become popular on the Taiwanese Internet. Many Taiwanese people are searching online for tips on traveling to the mainland and downloading mainland apps to facilitate their various experiences in the mainland. Mainland China's innovative, high-quality products and high-end cutting-edge technologies are constantly meeting the needs of Taiwanese people and becoming a good helper for them to enjoy a better and more convenient life.\nOut of the sinister intention of \"anti-China\", the Democratic Progressive Party authorities continue to maliciously smear and slander mainland technology products and application software, and obstruct the use of Taiwanese people in every possible way. To the point of being anti-technology and anti-era, it will only make more and more Taiwanese people disgusted and despised.","近年来，越来越多大陆应用软件受到台湾同胞的欢迎，认为这些应用软件技术先进、实用好用。例如，近期有一个视频“手把手教你在12306订高铁票”在台湾网络走红，很多台湾民众在网上查找来大陆的攻略，下载大陆应用软件，便利他们到大陆进行各种体验。大陆创新优质的产品和高端前沿的技术正在不断满足台湾民众的需要，成为他们享受美好、便捷生活的好帮手。\n民进党当局出于“反中抗中”的险恶用心，不断对大陆科技产品、应用软件等恶意抹黑污蔑，百般阻挠台湾民众使用，到了反科技、反时代的地步，只会让越来越多台湾民众反感和唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","Many Taiwanese media reported that Lai Qingde visited Swaziland by \"smuggling\" in early May, and the price he paid for this was as high as NT$25 billion. The investment plan signed by both parties shows that Taiwan will invest NT$25 billion to build a fuel storage facility in Swaziland, and all profits after completion will belong to the Swaziland royal family. Any comment on this?","In order to pursue \"independence\" political self-interest, the Lai Qingde authorities ignored the livelihood and well-being of the people on the island and squandered the people's hard-earned money. They are out-and-out \"gold and dollar diplomacy\" and \"unscrupulous politicians.\"","赖清德当局为谋“独”政治私利，罔顾岛内民生福祉，大肆挥霍百姓血汗钱，是不折不扣的“金元外交”、“无良政客”。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","人民政协报记者","Shen Youzhong, deputy chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, recently said that polls show that the majority of Taiwanese people are unwilling to accept \"one country, two systems\" and do not agree with \"the Chinese Communist Party's suppression of Taiwan.\" He insists that Taiwan's future should be jointly decided by the 23 million Taiwanese people. Any comment on this?","Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and Taiwan's future can only and must be jointly decided by the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. \"Peaceful reunification and one country, two systems\" are the best way to achieve national reunification and are in the best interest of the Chinese nation, including Taiwan compatriots. It is also the best choice to maintain the existing social system and way of life of Taiwan compatriots. Out of the separatist plot of \"Taiwan independence\", the DPP authorities deliberately reject peaceful reunification and discredit \"one country, two systems\" in an attempt to mislead public opinion and deceive the Taiwanese people. They will not succeed.\nWhat needs to be emphasized is that different systems are not an obstacle to unification, nor an excuse for division. More and more insightful people in Taiwan are no longer coerced and deceived by the DPP authorities, support peaceful cross-strait reunification, gradually understand and think about the benefits of \"one country, two systems\", and provide advice and suggestions for the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan through various methods. We believe that more Taiwan compatriots will fully understand the superiority of \"one country, two systems\" and that the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan will be more fully discussed and demonstrated.","台湾是中国的台湾，台湾的未来只能也必须由包括台湾同胞在内的14亿多中国人民共同决定。“和平统一、一国两制”是实现国家统一的最佳方式，最符合包括台湾同胞在内的中华民族根本利益，也是维护台湾同胞现有社会制度和生活方式的最佳选择。民进党当局出于“台独”分裂图谋，处心积虑拒绝和平统一、抹黑“一国两制”，企图误导舆论、蒙蔽台湾民众，不会得逞。\n需要强调的是，制度不同，不是统一的障碍，更不是分裂的借口。越来越多台湾有识之士已经不受民进党当局裹挟欺骗，支持两岸和平统一，逐步认识和思考“一国两制”的好处，通过各种方式为“两制”台湾方案建言献策。我们相信，会有更多台湾同胞充分认识“一国两制”的优越性，“两制”台湾方案将会得到更充分的讨论和展现。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769129.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","Recently, Taiwan's public opinion agency reviewed a new batch of nearly NT$300 billion in special budget for US military purchases. Several political parties and groups on the island protested against the DPP authorities' blind purchase of US troops and called for strengthening cross-strait dialogue and sharing the dividends of peace. Any comment on this?","In order to seek political self-interest for \"Taiwan independence\", the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have resorted to militarism and \"prepared for war to seek independence.\" They have intensified their efforts to squander the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people. They are willing to serve as a \"cash machine\" for the US military-industrial complex. They do not hesitate to turn Taiwan into a \"powder keg\" and coerce the people to serve as \"Taiwan independence\" cannon fodder. They have pushed the majority of Taiwan compatriots into the danger of war. All walks of life in Taiwan have expressed strong dissatisfaction and firm opposition to this.\nThe future of Taiwan and the security, security, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots depend on the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and national reunification. We hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will recognize the extreme danger and harm of the DPP authorities' stubborn insistence on the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist line, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, work with us to bring cross-Strait relations back to the right track of peaceful development, and effectively safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait as well as their own security and well-being.","民进党当局为谋取“台独”政治私利，穷兵黩武、“备战谋独”，变本加厉挥霍台湾老百姓的血汗钱，甘当美国军工复合体的“提款机”，不惜把台湾变成“火药桶”，裹挟民众充当“台独”炮灰，将广大台胞推入兵凶战危的险境，台湾社会各界已经对此已表达强烈不满和坚决反对。\n台湾的前途、台湾同胞的安全保障和利益福祉，在于两岸关系和平发展和国家统一。希望广大台湾同胞认清民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂路线的极端危险性、危害性，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，同我们一道推动两岸关系重回和平发展正轨，切实维护台海和平稳定和自身安全福祉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260603_12769125.htm"],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","The Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council recently stated that the United States and China continue to \"fight without breaking up\" to strive for bargaining chips and space for strategic adjustment. Taiwan must continue to strengthen relations between Taiwan, the United States and Taiwan and Japan, and consolidate the trust of \"friends and alliances\". Any comment on this?","The relevant remarks exposed the DPP authorities' stubborn persistence in separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and their attempt to collude with external forces for \"independence\" provocations. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and outsiders cannot be trusted. \"Relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" will only make Taiwan a \"chess piece\" of external forces, and it will inevitably become an \"abandoned piece\".","有关言论暴露民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场、妄图勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅的色厉内荏。“台独”是绝路，外人靠不住。“倚外谋独”只会让台湾沦为外部势力的“棋子”，终究难逃变成“弃子”的命运。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","U.S. President Trump has said that arms sales to Taiwan are an important bargaining chip in the hands of the United States. U.S. Secretary of State Rubio recently stated that the U.S. policy toward Taiwan has not changed and that the current US$14 billion in arms sales to Taiwan are still under review. Any comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. \"Taiwan independence by force\" is a dead end. It cannot change the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\" and cannot stop the general trend of the motherland's unification. We urge the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiques, handle the Taiwan issue prudently, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系。“以武谋独”是绝路，改变不了“台独”必然败亡的结局，阻挡不了祖国必将统一的大势。敦促美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，慎重处理台湾问题，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","In recent years, the mainland has vigorously supported Fujian in building a cross-strait integrated development demonstration zone, but Lai Qingde recently said that the mainland's \"united front penetration\" into Taiwan has five major aspects, including opening an \"integrated development demonstration zone\" to conduct united front work for Taiwanese businessmen and Taiwanese young people. He also said that he has…","We support Fujian in exploring new paths for cross-Strait integrated development and building cross-Strait integrated development demonstration zones in order to deepen cross-Strait integrated development in various fields, allow Taiwan compatriots to share development opportunities on the mainland, and enhance the well-being of Taiwan compatriots. This is a real move to benefit the majority of Taiwan compatriots.\n\"Central Committee of the Communist Party of China\" Since the State Council’s Opinions on Supporting Fujian in Exploring New Roads for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zones” was released in 2023, relevant departments and Fujian Province have issued a series of supporting documents and policy measures, and Fujian Province has also formulated and issued policies to promote Regulations on common standards across the Taiwan Strait have been introduced. Xiamen City has issued several regulations for the direct recognition of professional qualifications in Taiwan. For three consecutive years, Fuzhou City has issued three batches of 30 pilot policies to create a \"city living circle\" in Fuma, taking concrete actions to support the development of Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies in Fujian. The number of Taiwan compatriots visiting Fujian will increase from 573,000 in 2023 to 1.042 million in 2025. The number of newly established Taiwanese companies in Fujian will increase from 2,117 in 2023 to 2,612 in 2025. The popularity of exchanges between Fujian and Taiwan continues to rise, and exchanges and cooperation will become closer. It is the general trend and the people's will for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to get closer.\nOut of one-party political self-interest and ignoring the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises, the Lai Ching-te administration has slandered and smeared the construction of the Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone in every possible way, and even attempted to create a chilling effect and restrict cross-Strait exchanges through so-called \"amendments to the law.\" This is reversing the course of history. Its bad behavior deprives Taiwan compatriots of their right to pursue a better life and seriously damages the vital interests of Taiwan compatriots. It is unpopular and will inevitably fail.","我们支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路、建设两岸融合发展示范区，是为了深化两岸各领域融合发展，让台湾同胞共享大陆发展机遇，增进台湾同胞福祉，是实实在在的为广大台湾同胞谋利造福之举。\n《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》于2023年发布以来，有关部门和福建省出台了一系列配套文件和政策举措，福建省还制定出台促进两岸标准共通条例，厦门市出台直接采认台湾地区职业资格若干规定，福州市连续三年发布打造福马“同城生活圈”的三批30条先行先试政策，以切实行动支持台胞台企在闽发展。来闽台胞从2023年的57.3万人次增长到2025年的104.2万人次，在闽新设台企数量从2023年的2117户增长到2025年的2612户，闽台往来热度持续攀升，交流合作更加密切，两岸同胞走亲走近是大势所趋、民心所向。\n赖清德当局出于一党政治私利，无视台胞台企利益福祉，对两岸融合发展示范区建设百般诋毁抹黑，甚至妄图通过所谓“修法”制造寒蝉效应，限制两岸交流，是在开历史倒车。其恶劣行径，是在剥夺台湾同胞追求美好生活的权利，严重损害台湾同胞的切身利益，不得人心，必遭失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《联合报》记者","First question, regarding the so-called \"maritime delimitation negotiations\" launched by Japan and the Philippines involving the waters east of Taiwan, does the mainland know about the progress of the negotiations between Japan and the Philippines? If negotiations advance in the future, will the mainland carry out regular law enforcement patrols or take other actions near Taiwan's eastern waters? Taiwan's foreign…","The first question. The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of China's Taiwan Island. Their so-called \"delimitation negotiations\" seriously infringe on China's maritime rights and interests, seriously violate international law and basic norms of international relations, and are completely illegal and invalid.\nThe mainland coast guard department carries out law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas in accordance with the law to maintain the order of maritime operations and protect the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which is a normal performance of their duties. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to the Chinese nation and should stand firm on their national stance, uphold national justice, jointly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity, and safeguard the overall interests of the Chinese nation.\nSecond question. There is only one China in the world, and the mainland and Taiwan belong to the same China. This is the true status quo of the Taiwan issue. Although the two sides of the Taiwan Strait have not yet been completely reunified, China's sovereignty and territory have never been divided, and the fact that the mainland and Taiwan belong to the same China has never changed. No matter how the international situation and the situation across the Taiwan Strait change, the general trend of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation will not change, and the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits getting closer and coming together will not change.\nAchieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese people. It is the general trend, the great cause and the aspiration of the people. No one or any force can stop it. We firmly believe that more and more Taiwan compatriots will have a profound understanding that Taiwan's development future lies in a strong motherland and that the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots depend on the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. We have full confidence in uniting our Taiwan compatriots to jointly open up new prospects for cross-Strait relations and create a bright future of national rejuvenation and motherland reunification.","第一个问题。日本、菲律宾宣布的拟划界海域位于中国台湾岛以东，其所谓“划界谈判”严重侵害中国海洋权益，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，完全非法无效。\n大陆海警部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查，维护海上作业秩序、保障两岸渔民的生命财产安全，是正常履职行为。两岸同胞同属中华民族，应站稳民族立场，坚持民族大义，共同维护国家主权和领土完整，维护中华民族的整体利益。\n第二个问题。世界上只有一个中国，大陆和台湾同属一个中国，这是台湾问题的真正现状。尽管海峡两岸尚未完全统一，但中国的主权和领土从未分割，大陆和台湾同属一个中国的事实从未改变。无论国际形势、台海局势如何变化，中华民族伟大复兴的大趋势不会改变，两岸同胞走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流不会改变。\n实现祖国完全统一，是全体中华儿女的共同心愿，是大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向，任何人任何势力都无法阻挡。我们坚信，会有越来越多台湾同胞深刻认识到台湾的发展前途在于强大祖国、台湾同胞的利益福祉系于中华民族伟大复兴。我们有充分信心团结广大台湾同胞共同开辟两岸关系新前景，携手创造民族复兴、祖国统一的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-03","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中央社”记者","Garbage was thrown at a comedy club in Taipei during a recent rehearsal. The police arrested two suspects. The outside world is concerned about whether this is related to the stand-up comedians who have ridiculed the mainland, but the suspects have denied it. In addition, this year, paint was thrown at the studios of Taiwanese and Hong Kong residents and \"anti-extradition activists\", triggering discussions on…","I don't know the specific situation you mentioned. Two points need to be pointed out: First, \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end. People despise, spit on, and abandon it. This is an expression of public opinion. The so-called \"cross-border suppression\" is completely nonsense, a clumsy trick to divert attention, and a deliberate smear campaign with ulterior motives. Second, the main axis of cross-Strait exchanges is the sincere interaction based on \"one family on both sides of the Strait\", which is the aspiration of the people and the general trend. We deepen cross-Strait integrated development in order to promote mutual understanding and joint development between compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nNow I will announce the status of the twelfth Taiwan-related knowledge prize-winning Q&A event.\nOn May 11, the WeChat public account of the \"Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council\" released the titles of the 12th \"Taiwan-related Questions and Answers\" activity, and netizens actively participated in answering the questions. As of June 1st, the top ten netizens with correct answers and the most likes were: \"Qingshan Luotuo\", \"Oreo\", \"Yiwei Crossing the Gorge\", \"Alishan Moon\", \"Spring\", \"Guiyan Zhidu\", \"Little Dot\", \"ASUS Choice\", \"Tide Frequency\", and \"Jeronimos Titon\". Congratulations to the above ten netizens, who will receive the exquisite shell carving \"Treasure Island of Taiwan\" designed by a national first-class technician and handmade by primary school students in Pingtan, Fujian.\nFrom June 2025 to May 2026, the \"Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council\" public account launched 12 consecutive Taiwan-related knowledge Q&A activities. Nearly 190,000 netizens from both sides of the Taiwan Strait actively participated in the interaction, and learned about the central government's policies on Taiwan and various aspects of improving the well-being of compatriots through Q&A. policy initiative, the 12,000 comments in the comment area were sincere, with the sentence \"More exchanges will bring reunion closer\", which expresses the deep friendship between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits who have the same roots, culture and race, and expresses the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait's firm belief and deep expectation for the reunification of the motherland.\nWe hope that netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will pay more attention to Taiwan affairs, actively participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in various fields, and contribute to promoting the peaceful and integrated development of cross-Strait relations and promoting the reunification process of the motherland.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","我不了解你提到的具体情况。需要指出两点：第一，“台独”是绝路，人们鄙之、唾之、弃之，这是民意的表达。所谓“跨境镇压”完全是无稽之谈，是转移视线的拙劣伎俩，是别有用心的蓄意抹黑。第二，两岸交流的主轴是基于“两岸一家亲”的诚意互动，是民心所向、大势所趋，我们深化两岸融合发展，就是要促进两岸同胞相互了解，携手发展。\n下面我公布第十二期涉台知识有奖问答活动情况。\n5月11日，“国务院台办”微信公众号发布第十二期“涉台知识问答”活动题目，网友们踊跃参与答题。截至6月1日，答案正确且留言点赞排名前十的网友依次是:“青衫落拓”、“奥利奥”、“一苇渡峡”、“阿里山月”、“春天”、“归燕知途”、“小不点”、“华硕天选”、“潮汐同频”、“杰罗尼摩斯蒂顿”。对以上十名网友表示祝贺，他们将获得由国家一级技师设计、福建平潭小学生手工完成的精美贝雕作品《宝岛台湾》。\n从2025年6月至2026年5月，“国务院台办”公众号连续推出12期涉台知识问答活动，近19万人次两岸网友踊跃参与互动，通过知识问答了解中央对台方针政策和增进同胞福祉的各项政策举措，评论区1.2万条留言情真意切，一句“交流多一些，让团圆再近一些”，道出了两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种的深厚情谊，表达了两岸同胞对实现祖国统一的坚定信念与深切期盼。\n我们期待两岸网友更多关心对台工作，积极参与两岸各领域交流合作，为推动两岸关系和平发展、融合发展，推进祖国统一进程贡献力量。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260603_12769117.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-06-04","Mao Ning","AP","First, what was the reason China banned four New Zealand lawmakers from traveling for one year and demanded an apology after they traveled to Taiwan, if you can explain a little bit more? Secondly, intelligence agencies from the so-called Five-Eyes Alliance including the U.S. and the UK said that Chinese spies are using online job platforms to recruit people. What would you say about that?","On your first question, several individual New Zealand lawmakers visited China’s Taiwan region in disregard of the grave concern and firm opposition of the Chinese side. Their action violates the one-China principle and interferes in China’s internal affairs. In accordance with relevant laws of the People’s Republic of China, the Chinese side has decided to take measures including an entry ban.\nI need to stress that the one-China principle, a prevailing international consensus and a basic norm in international relations, is also the political cornerstone of China-New Zealand relations. We urge the individuals concerned to earnestly respect China’s sovereignty and territorial integrity and strictly abide by the one-China principle. Anyone who tramples on the red line and oversteps on the Taiwan question must pay the price.\nOn the second question, as the world’s largest intelligence cooperation network, the “Five Eyes” has long engaged in massive systemic espionage all over the world. It is ironic that such an organization is accusing China of “spy threat.”","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260604_11937670.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-04","Mao Ning","DPA","About the last question on New Zealand, some German lawmakers also visited Taiwan in May. Will China ban lawmakers from Germany and other countries that have visited Taiwan from entering China?","Taiwan is part of China, and the one-China principle is a prevailing international consensus and a basic norm in international relations. Anyone who crosses the red line on the Taiwan question must pay the price.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260604_11937670.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-05","Mao Ning","CCTV","The city of Nagasaki reportedly plans to conclude work to update exhibition panels at the Nagasaki Atomic Bomb Museum by the end of this year. There have been reports that regarding the Nanjing Massacre, the wording on the explanatory panel “massacre” will no longer be used and will be changed to “the Nanjing Incident in which numerous civilians and prisoners were killed.” Can I have your comment on that?","There is abundant evidence for the Nanjing Massacre—a horrendous war crime of Japanese militarists that shall never be erased. The Tokyo Trials ruled in black and white that the wartime atrocities of the Japanese army in Nanjing were a “massacre”, not a mere “incident”. The Judgement of the International Military Tribunal for the Far East dedicated a special chapter to detail “the Rape of Nanking”. With numerous survivors’ testimonies, records of third-country witnesses and Japanese army files, the judgement, in the form of the ruling of international justice, made it very clear that the Japanese army who invaded China committed the heinous crime of the Nanjing Massacre. The Massacre’s chief perpetrator Iwane Matsui was sentenced to death by hanging as a class-A war criminal.\nThe verdict of history must not be overturned. I noted that many survivors of the atomic bombs in Japan, Nagasaki citizen groups and people with insights have called for fully and accurately depicting the crimes and history of Japanese militarists as victimizers. We urge the Japanese side to deeply reflect on its war crimes and make a clean break with militarism.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260605_11938443.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-09","Lin Jian","TV Asahi","According to reports, China Coast Guard vessels sailed in the “exclusive economic zone” near Yonaguni Island of the Okinawa Prefecture earlier this month. In response to Japan Coast Guard’s call, the Chinese side claimed that they were conducting routine patrol in areas under China’s jurisdiction. Can you confirm this?","China Coast Guard (CCG) has released information on the law enforcement patrols of the CCG vessel formation in waters east of China’s Taiwan island in accordance with the law. Let me reiterate that China has exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in this area. Japan and the Philippines bypassing China to initiate the so-called maritime delimitation talks constitutes a severe violation of UNCLOS and other international laws and basic norms governing international relations. It also seriously infringes on China’s maritime rights and interests. China will by no means accept this.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260609_11940743.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-09","Lin Jian","Yonhap News Agency","Taiwan’s “foreign ministry” said that on June 8, three ROK lawmakers met with Taiwan’s Deputy Foreign Minister. The two sides exchanged views on addressing geopolitical challenges and the development of the semiconductor and AI industries. What is your comment?","Taiwan is part of China. There is no such thing as “foreign ministry” of Taiwan. China firmly opposes official interactions of any form between China’s Taiwan region and countries having diplomatic relations with China. The 1992 joint communiqué on China-ROK diplomatic ties clearly stipulates that the ROK recognizes the People’s Republic of China as the sole legal government representing China and respects China’s position that there is but one China in the world and that Taiwan is part of China. Since early this year, the ROK has publicly reiterated on multiple occasions that its commitment to the one-China principle remains unchanged. China has lodged serious representations with the ROK over the matter you mentioned. We urge the ROK side to bear in mind the bigger picture of our bilateral relationship, honor its commitments and earnestly adhere to the one-China principle. The ROK side should refrain from any form of official interactions with the Taiwan region, avoid being exploited by “Taiwan independence” separatists, send no wrong signals to them, and maintain the sound and steady growth of our bilateral ties with real actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260609_11940743.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-06-09","Zhang Xiaogang","","Soon after Japan and the Philippines unilaterally announced initiating maritime delimitation negotiations on the waters east of China's Taiwan Island, the China Coast Guard was reportedly conducted law enforcement patrols in the relevant waters, and the Ministry of Transport later carried out a special law enforcement action on maritime traffic. What is your comment on this?","Regarding the announcement by Japan and the Philippines to bypass China and initiate the so-called \"maritime delimitation negotiations\" on the waters east of China's Taiwan Island, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs has stated China's solemn position of firm opposition many times. We urge Japan and the Philippines to immediately stop their illegal rights-violating and provocative acts. If they choose to persist in their wrong course, they will only be hoisted by their own petard. The Chinese side will take resolute and effective measures to safeguard national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.","针对日菲擅自宣布启动中国台湾岛以东海域划界谈判，外交部已多次阐明坚决反对的严正立场。我们敦促日菲立即停止非法侵权挑衅行径，若一意孤行只会求锤得锤，中方将以坚决有力的行动举措维护国家领土主权和海洋权益。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16471276.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16466352.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-06-09","Zhang Xiaogang","","It's reported that the head of Taiwan's defense department stated that although the U.S.defense secretary did not mention Taiwan in his keynote speech at the Shangri-LaDialogue, Taiwan would continue to strengthen its \"self-defense\" capabilities, maintain close military cooperation with America, and uphold its \"responsibility and capability to maintain peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait\".What is your…","\"Taiwan independence\" and cross-Strait peace are as irreconcilable as fire and water, and safeguarding peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait serves as the greatest common denominator between China and America. Recent statements made by the the U.S. side regarding Taiwan show that America now better understands and attaches greater importance to China's position and concerns on the Taiwan question. There is growing evidence that the prevailing trend of China's reunification is unstoppable. Any plot to \"seek independence by relying on foreign support\" or \"seek independence by force\" is doomed to failure. Those forces that stubbornly cling to their wrong course and move against the historical trend will eventually be overwhelmed by the torrent of history.","“台独”与台海和平水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数。近来美方涉台表态显示其更加了解、重视中方在台湾问题上的立场与关切，越来越多的事实印证中国终将统一也必将统一的大势不可阻挡。任何“倚外谋独”“以武谋独”的图谋注定失败，执迷不悟、逆流而动的势力都会被历史洪流淹没。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16471276.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16466352.html",1,1,4,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on June 10, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalist friends, good morning. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好。欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","新华社记者","The 18th Straits Forum is about to be held. Please introduce the relevant preparation progress. Which Taiwanese guests will attend this Straits Forum?","The 18th Straits Forum Conference will be held in Xiamen on June 13. Vice Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang Zhang Ronggong and other representatives from all walks of life in Taiwan will attend the conference. At present, all preparatory work for the forum is basically in place. A series of forum activities have been carried out in various parts of Fujian. Four events have been held, including the Taiwan Talents Xiamen Matchmaking Conference, the Straits People Forum, the Cross-Strait Dragon Boat Races, and the Common Home Forum, with nearly a thousand Taiwanese compatriots actively participating.\nThis forum continues to pay attention to and serve grassroots and youth groups, so that the results of cross-strait integrated development can benefit more compatriots on both sides of the strait. The activities cover diverse fields such as grassroots governance, marriage and family, social welfare, sports events, folk beliefs, singing and dancing arts, financial technology, rural revitalization, agricultural and fishery cooperation, new media creation, etc., innovatively promote the docking of education, e-commerce, biomedicine and small and medium-sized enterprises across the Taiwan Strait, protect the growth of young children, and help Taiwanese youth expand employment and entrepreneurship tracks. We warmly welcome compatriots from all walks of life in Taiwan to gather across the sea to rekindle friendship, share opportunities, seek common development and create a better future.","第十八届海峡论坛大会将于6月13日在厦门举办，中国国民党副主席张荣恭等台湾各界代表人士将出席大会。目前，论坛各项筹备工作基本就绪。论坛系列活动在福建各地陆续开展，已举办台湾人才厦门对接会、海峡百姓论坛、海峡两岸龙舟赛、共同家园论坛等4场活动，近千名台胞踊跃参与。\n本届论坛持续关注、服务基层和青年群体，让两岸融合发展成果惠及更多两岸同胞。活动涵盖基层治理、婚姻家庭、社会公益、体育赛事、民间信仰、歌舞艺术、金融科技、乡村振兴、农渔合作、新媒体创作等多元领域，创新推动两岸教育、电商、生物医药和中小企业等界别对接，护航少年儿童成长，助力台湾青年拓宽就业创业赛道。热忱欢迎台湾各界同胞跨海相聚，共叙情谊、共享机遇、共谋发展、共创未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770186.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","The 18th Straits Forum will be held soon. The Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council said that \"the Straits Forum is a united front platform for mainland China\" and further expanded restrictions this year, requiring county, city and public officials not to attend relevant activities. Public opinion on the island believes that banning communication based on a single official document makes people feel very threatened.…","The Straits Forum is a cross-Strait non-governmental exchange platform that adheres to the principle of \"non-governmental, grassroots and extensive\". It has played an important and positive role in promoting cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in various fields and enhancing the interests and well-being of compatriots. It is generally welcomed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nOut of its stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" stance, the DPP authorities ignore the will of the people and local development needs, and have neither the will nor the ability to properly handle cross-strait relations. For its own political self-interest, it smeared and slandered the Straits Forum, undermined cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, restricted the movement and freedom of speech of the Taiwanese people, and seriously harmed the interests and well-being of compatriots on the island. What he did fully exposed his \"fake democracy, true dictatorship\" nature. What I want to emphasize is that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and no force can stop the trend of getting closer and coming together.","海峡论坛是坚持“民间性、草根性、广泛性”的两岸民间交流平台，对促进两岸各领域交流合作、增进同胞利益福祉发挥了重要积极作用，受到两岸同胞普遍欢迎。\n民进党当局出于顽固“台独”立场，漠视民众意愿和地方发展需要，没有意愿也没有能力处理好两岸关系。其为一己政治私利，抹黑污蔑海峡论坛，破坏两岸交流合作，禁锢台湾民众行动和言论自由，严重损害岛内同胞利益福祉。其所作所为充分暴露了其“假民主、真独裁”的本质。我要强调的是，两岸同胞是一家人，走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流是任何力量都阻挡不了的。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770185.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台央视《中国新闻》记者","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council has explained five of the \"seven better things\" for Taiwan after peaceful reunification at previous press conferences, which has attracted great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's explanation for \"After peaceful reunification, with the backing of a strong motherland, Taiwan's security will…","After peaceful reunification, with the backing of a strong motherland, the people of Taiwan will be safer. The risk of war brought about by \"Taiwan independence\" will be eliminated from its roots. The Taiwanese people will no longer be used as \"cannon fodder\" by \"Taiwan independence\". The people's hard-earned money will no longer be squandered to purchase arms, and ammunition will not be hoarded in private houses and temples. The black hands of external forces interfering in the internal affairs of the Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will be completely cut off. Taiwan will no longer be a \"chess piece\" of external forces. It will no longer be the \"powder keg\", \"mine island\" and \"hell scene\" that the DPP authorities colluded with external forces to create. It will escape the fate of being ruined by \"Taiwan independence\" and external forces at any time. Taiwan's economy will develop sustainably and stably, and its industrial and supply chains will be more autonomous, controllable, safe and reliable, achieving a healthy combination of high-quality development and high-level security. The legitimate rights and interests of Taiwanese fishermen operating in the waters surrounding Taiwan Island will be promptly and effectively protected by national maritime forces.\nAfter peaceful reunification, Taiwan will become an island of peace, security and prosperity, guarded by all the sons and daughters of the Chinese nation. Taiwan compatriots can truly live a good life of peace and contentment in a peaceful and tranquil environment, and fully enjoy the peaceful years of the reunification of the motherland and the rejuvenation of the nation.","和平统一后，有强大祖国做后盾，台湾人民将更安全。“台独”带来的战争风险将从根源上被消除，台湾民众不再被“台独”裹挟当“炮灰”，民众的血汗钱不再被挥霍用于购买军火，民宅、宫庙不会囤放弹药。外部势力干涉两岸中国人内部事务的黑手将被彻底斩断，台湾将不再是外部势力的“棋子”，不再是民进党当局勾连外部势力妄图打造的“火药桶”、“地雷岛”和“地狱景象”，摆脱随时被“台独”和外部势力葬送的命运。台湾经济将可持续、稳定发展，产业链供应链将更自主可控、安全可靠，实现高质量发展和高水平安全的良性结合。台湾渔民在台湾岛周边海域生产作业的合法权益将获得国家海上力量及时、有力的保护。\n和平统一后，台湾将成为和平安全繁荣之岛，由全体中华儿女共同守护。台湾同胞可以在和平安宁的环境中，真正过上安居乐业的美好生活，充分享受祖国统一、民族复兴的太平岁月。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770184.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","人民政协报记者","A recent poll by Taiwan's \"Democratic Culture and Education Foundation\" showed that nearly 60% of Taiwanese people support proactive peace negotiations with the mainland, and nearly 70% of Taiwanese people believe that cross-strait relations should be improved and peace should be strived for. Some public opinion on the island believes that when the cross-strait issue shifts from reunification and \"independence\"…","The mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society, which wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation, cannot be suppressed. Relevant polls have once again proved that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are Chinese and one family. They all look forward to peace and tranquility across the Taiwan Strait, the improvement and development of cross-Strait relations, and a better life.\nThe future of the motherland and the nation rests on its young people. More and more Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, realize that Taiwan's development and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots depend on the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, the reunification of the motherland, and the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. We welcome and support more young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to visit each other frequently, enhance understanding, and work together to keep the future of cross-Strait relations firmly in the hands of the Chinese people themselves.","要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的台湾社会主流民意是压制不住的。相关民调再次证明，两岸同胞都是中国人、一家人，都期盼台海和平安宁，期盼两岸关系改善发展，期盼生活更加美好。\n祖国和民族的前途寄托在青年人身上。越来越多台湾同胞特别是青年朋友认识到台湾的发展、台湾同胞的利益福祉系于两岸关系和平发展、祖国统一、中华民族伟大复兴。我们欢迎并支持更多的两岸青年常来常往、增进理解、同心同行，把两岸关系的未来牢牢掌握在中国人自己手中。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770183.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","Recently, Taiwan's public opinion representative Gao Jin Sumei and his assistant were prosecuted by the Taipei District Prosecutor's Office for corruption and other crimes. They were sentenced to 12 years and 6 months in prison and 16 years in prison respectively. Some public opinion on the island believes that this is the Democratic Progressive Party authorities choosing specific candidates to deal with, and the…","The DPP authorities have used judicial means to crack down on and persecute political dissidents and engage in \"green terror\", which has aroused strong dissatisfaction among the people on the island. The DPP authorities act arbitrarily and recklessly, and their perverse actions will inevitably be counterattacked by public opinion, and they will eventually suffer the consequences.","民进党当局操弄司法手段打击迫害政治异己，大搞“绿色恐怖”，已经引发岛内民众的强烈不满。民进党当局恣意妄为，其倒行逆施必遭民意反噬，终将自食恶果。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","中新社记者","A recent survey by Taiwan's \"Tianxia\" magazine pointed out that Taiwan's AI-related industries are growing rapidly, but a large number of traditional industries are becoming marginalized. Some public opinion believes that one of the important reasons for Taiwan's traditional industries to maintain competitiveness in the past was the cross-strait division of labor; if traditional industries want to save…","At present, Taiwan's industry can be described as \"one industry thrives while all industries decline.\" The problem of an overly single industrial structure has become increasingly obvious, and the vulnerability of economic development has become more prominent. Traditional industries are in a difficult situation and their development space is shrinking. The income of most residents is far less than the median, and their unpaid leave is getting longer and longer. The people on the island are strongly dissatisfied with this. The DPP authorities not only fail to face up to the outstanding problems and serious hidden dangers of the island's industry and find a way out for the industry, but instead repeatedly promote the \"decoupling and breaking of links\" between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait and obstruct the division of labor and cooperation between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nMainland China's \"15th Five-Year Plan\" outline proposes \"building a modern industrial system\" and \"optimizing and upgrading traditional industries.\" Traditional industries are highly related to the development of people's livelihood. With the strong support of the industrial chain, supply chain and market, innovative development can be achieved through intelligence, greenness and integration. We will, as always, actively support cross-Strait industrial cooperation and support Taiwanese enterprises, including those in traditional industries, to give full play to their own advantages, seize the development opportunities of the \"15th Five-Year Plan\", and achieve better and greater development.","当前台湾的产业可谓“一业兴、百业衰”，产业结构过于单一的问题愈发明显，经济发展脆弱性更加突出。传统产业处境艰难、发展空间日益萎缩，多数居民收入远不及中位数、无薪假越来越长。岛内民众对此强烈不满。民进党当局不仅不正视岛内产业存在的突出问题和严重隐患，为产业找出路，反而一再推动两岸“脱钩断链”，阻挠两岸产业分工协作，可谓作茧自缚、愚不可及。\n大陆“十五五”规划纲要提出“建设现代化产业体系”“优化提升传统产业”，传统产业与民生发展高度相关，在产业链供应链和市场的有力支撑下，完全可以通过智能化、绿色化、融合化实现创新发展。我们将一如既往积极支持两岸产业合作，支持包括传统产业业者在内的广大台企，充分发挥自身优势，把握“十五五”发展机遇，获得更好更大的发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770181.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","上海东方卫视记者","According to the 2024 Shanghai-Taipei Urban Forum cooperation memorandum between the two parties, two red pandas from the Shanghai Zoo were exchanged with black-footed penguins from the Taipei Zoo. On June 5 this year, a red panda handover ceremony was held at the Shanghai Zoo, which attracted attention and praise from netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Some DPP politicians claimed that the Twin Cities…","As an important institutionalized exchange platform between the two cities, the Shanghai-Taipei City Forum has played a positive role in promoting exchanges and cooperation between the two places in various fields. We have also noticed the enthusiastic comments from netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, such as \"Cute animals serve as bridges across the sea, and warmth rides the wind across the strait\" and \"Using animal conservation as an exchange, there is no confrontation, only warmth. The more such activities, the better.\" More movement and more exchanges are the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We will continue to support exchanges and cooperation in various fields including cross-strait city exchanges, continue to enhance the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and promote the spiritual harmony of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe \"Taiwan independence\" forces frequently use the so-called \"infiltration gap\" to discredit cross-strait exchanges and cooperation. This time they are making a political fuss about the red panda, which is ridiculous.","上海台北城市论坛作为两城市间的重要机制化交流平台，为促进两地各领域交流合作发挥了积极作用。我们也注意到两岸网友的热评，譬如“萌兽跨海当桥梁，暖意乘风渡海峡”、“以动物保育作交流，没有对立只有温情，这样的活动多多益善”。多走动、多交流是两岸同胞的共同心声，我们将一如既往地支持包括两岸城市交流在内的各领域交流合作，不断增进两岸同胞利益福祉，促进两岸同胞心灵契合。\n“台独”势力动辄以所谓“渗透破口”抹黑两岸交流合作，这次又在小熊猫身上做政治文章，荒唐可笑。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","In response to Japan and the Philippines announcing the launch of the so-called \"maritime delimitation negotiations,\" the mainland emphasized the one-China principle and that both sides of the Taiwan Strait should jointly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities falsely claimed that \"the two sides of the Taiwan Strait are not subordinate to each other,…","The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of Taiwan Island. China has an exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the above-mentioned waters. Japan and the Philippines launched the so-called \"delimitation negotiations\" without authorization, bypassing China, seriously infringing on China's maritime rights and interests, seriously violating international law and basic norms of international relations, and is completely illegal and invalid.\nThe DPP authorities have kowtowed to cater to external forces and have become complete national scum. Faced with the unanimous condemnation of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, the DPP authorities changed their face again and spread the fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" in an attempt to shift the focus and deceive the people. I am telling the DPP authorities that anyone who forgets their ancestors and betrays the nation will be nailed to the pillar of shame in history without exception.","日、菲宣布的拟划界海域位于台湾岛以东，中国在上述海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日、菲绕开中国擅自启动所谓“划界谈判”，严重侵害中国海洋权益，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，完全非法无效。\n民进党当局卑躬屈膝迎合外部势力，已经沦为彻头彻尾的民族败类。面对两岸同胞的同声谴责，民进党当局又变了副嘴脸，翻炒“台独”谬论，妄图转移焦点、欺骗民众。正告民进党当局，任何数典忘祖、背叛民族的人都将无一例外被钉在历史的耻辱柱上。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770179.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, Lai Ching-te said in an exclusive interview that he \"resisted China's pressure\" and made a \"surprise visit\" to Swaziland. He also said that Taiwanese people are unwilling to accept \"Chinese rule\" and hope to continue to live a life of \"freedom, democracy, and human rights.\" Any comment on this?","Lai Ching-te squandered the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people, engaged in \"gold-dollar diplomacy\", and spent huge sums of money to buy \"smuggling\" people. He became the laughing stock of the international community and the island. However, he was not ashamed but proud of it, which fully exposed his \"Taiwan independence\" nature and paranoid despicability.\nThe DPP authorities have been shouting \"freedom\" on the island, but they have long controlled the media, supported cyber troops, suppressed public opinion, and obstructed and restricted cross-strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields; they flaunted \"democracy\" but engaged in \"green terror\", abused justice, and Administrative and other means are used to suppress and persecute political dissidents, and they continue to manipulate and provoke political fights; they talk about \"human rights\" but ignore the interests and well-being of the people on the island. They repeatedly discriminate and make things difficult for mainland-based groups, and label and slap relevant people on the island, which has completely lost people's hearts.\nDifferent social systems are not an excuse for separatism. As long as we agree on the one-China principle, promote the reunification of the motherland, speak things out well, and discuss matters easily, there will be no conflicts and differences that cannot be resolved. We hope that Taiwan compatriots will have a correct understanding of the mainland's social system and development path, see clearly the true face and sinister intentions of the DPP authorities seeking \"independence\" under the guise of \"democracy\", draw a clear line with the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and their activities, and work with us to safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","赖清德挥霍台湾民众的血汗钱，大搞“金元外交”，斥巨资买“偷渡”，成为国际社会和岛内的笑柄，却不以为耻、反以为荣，充分暴露其“台独”本性和偏执卑劣。\n民进党当局在岛内一直高喊“自由”，却长期操控媒体、豢养网军、钳制舆论，阻挠禁限两岸人员往来和各领域交流合作；标榜“民主”，却大搞“绿色恐怖”，滥用司法、行政等手段打压迫害政治异己，不断操弄、挑起政治恶斗；大谈“人权”，却罔顾岛内民众利益福祉，一再歧视、刁难陆配群体，给岛内有关人士贴标签、扣帽子，人心尽失。\n社会制度不同，不是搞分裂的借口。只要认同一个中国原则，推进祖国统一，有话好好说、有事好商量，就没有化解不了的矛盾分歧。希望广大台湾同胞正确认识大陆社会制度和发展道路，看清民进党当局打着“民主”的幌子谋“独”的真实面目和险恶用心，与“台独”分裂势力及其活动划清界限，同我们一道维护台海和平稳定。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770182.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities said that on June 5, a mainland coast guard ship entered the \"restricted waters\" of the Dongsha Islands, and a confrontation broke out between the ships of the two sides. Any comment on this?","China has sovereignty over the South China Sea Islands, including the Dongsha Islands and their adjacent waters, and it is normal for the mainland coast guard to perform law enforcement and inspections in relevant waters. If the DPP authorities dare to make provocations, they must bear all the consequences.","中国对南海诸岛包括东沙群岛及其附近海域拥有主权，大陆海警部门在相关海域执法巡查是正常履职行为。民进党当局胆敢挑衅，必须承担由此引发的一切后果。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260610_12770180.htm"],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","Recently, Su Jiaquan, chairman of the Straits Exchange Foundation, said that mainland China's selective \"reading\" and \"returning\" without institutional regulations can easily damage the protection of the rights of people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Any comment on this?","As we all know, because the DPP authorities refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, the cross-strait communication mechanism between the two conferences has been suspended. What really damages the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait is the DPP authorities' stubborn insistence on the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence.\"","众所周知，由于民进党当局拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，两岸两会联系沟通机制已停摆。真正对两岸同胞利益福祉造成损害的是民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","香港经济导报记者","Recently, the United States stated that it would impose an additional 10% tariff on goods from 14 economies, including Taiwan, after investigating so-called \"forced labor practices.\" The Democratic Progressive Party authorities claim that Taiwan has achieved good results in terms of industry and tariffs. Any comment on this?","Regarding the U.S.'s imposition of additional tariffs, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities not only did not dare to express protest, but instead boasted about the so-called \"good results\". This is really flattering and shameless.\nFacts have repeatedly proved that Taiwan's future lies in national reunification and the well-being of Taiwan compatriots depends on national rejuvenation. There is no way out for the Democratic Progressive Party (DPP) authorities in their attempt to \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\". They try to please outsiders by sacrificing Taiwan's industrial foundation and people's livelihood. This is a miscalculation that will inevitably lead to backlash.","对于美国加征关税，民进党当局不仅不敢表达抗议，反而夸耀是所谓“不错的成绩”，真是仰人鼻息、厚颜无耻。\n事实反复证明，台湾前途在于国家统一，台湾同胞福祉系于民族复兴。民进党当局妄图“倚外谋独”没有出路，妄想靠献祭台湾产业根基和民众生计来讨外人欢心，打错算盘、必遭反噬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","Recently, with the advent of summer and high temperatures, people on the island have increased their electricity consumption for air conditioners, freezers, etc. However, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have raised electricity prices for people's livelihood, which is the most expensive in history. Many stores complained that the average monthly electricity bill increased by more than 30%. People…","The Democratic Progressive Party authorities often falsely claim that \"power supply is safe,\" but the fact is that Taiwanese people have already endured too many power outages and power rations. Now that electricity prices have hit a new high in summer, not only stores are suffering, but the interests of many employees and consumers are also being harmed. This once again proves that the DPP authorities are bent on seeking \"independence\" and are indifferent to people's livelihood, disregarding people's livelihood, and harming people's interests.","民进党当局经常妄言“供电无虞”，事实是台湾民众早已承受了太多的停电、限电。如今夏季电价再创新高，不只门店受害，众多的从业人员、消费者的利益也连带受损。这再一次证明民进党当局一心谋“独”，漠视民瘼、罔顾民生、损害民利。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, relevant agencies in Kinmen County and Xiamen City made an appointment to simultaneously release a total of 5.61 million fish and shellfish in the waters of Xiamen and Jinmen, demonstrating the loving kindness of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to protect marine resources. However, because the Democratic Progressive Party authorities require Taiwanese ships not to approach mainland ships,…","Xiamen and Jinjiang are separated by a strip of water. The two places work together to release and conserve marine fishery resources. This is a good thing that benefits the people's livelihood in both places and is a good story of the people-to-people ties on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities have artificially set up restrictions, imposed arbitrary obstructions, and used political barriers to harm the friendship between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits, exposing their true nature of being anti-peace, anti-exchange, seeking division, and engaging in confrontation.","厦金一衣带水，两地携手放流、养护海洋渔业资源，是惠及两地民生的好事，是两岸民心相通的佳话。民进党当局人为设限、横加阻挠，用政治隔阂伤害两岸同胞情谊，暴露其反和平、反交流、谋分裂、搞对抗的真实面目。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, Quanzhou, Fujian Province held an event to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the opening of the Quanjin “Small Three Links” passenger route. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On June 8, a commemorative event for the 20th anniversary of the opening of the Quanjin \"Mini Three Links\" passenger route was held at the Quanjin Passenger Terminal in Shijing Town, Nan'an, Quanzhou. More than 100 compatriots from both sides of the Taiwan Strait attended. With the theme of \"Twenty Years of Quanjin Passenger Transport Route and Setting Sail to Start a New Journey\", the event reviewed the process of the Quanjin Passenger Transport Route from its opening to vigorous development, and vividly explained the role and significance of the \"golden channel\" of this strait. Not only were the participants, promoters, and witnesses of the route telling warm stories and development changes since the launch of the route with their personal experiences, but there were also food tastings, calligraphy exchanges, Nanyin performances, cross-strait home book exhibitions, and handicraft experiences between Quanjin and Quanzhou. It is worth mentioning that the event officially launched the selection of dishes for the Kinmen Wuzhou Banquet. It is a special food selection activity carried out by the mainland for Kinmen, using food as a link to bring the food culture of the two sides closer together.\nThe \"Little Three Links\" passenger route is one of the most important and convenient channels for people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to communicate with each other, especially those from Fujian and Taiwan. Since the Quanjin \"Small Three Links\" passenger route was put into operation on June 8, 2006, it has safely and stably transported more than 1.6 million passengers. Relying on the advantages of short-distance shipping, the route uses low-cost and short-distance maritime connectivity to continuously bring the hearts of the people of Quanjin closer. People on both sides of the Taiwan Strait use the Quanjin route to visit relatives and friends, trace their roots and ancestors, find jobs and start businesses, and travel and exchange. They are getting closer and closer.","6月8日，泉金“小三通”客运航线通航20周年纪念活动在泉州南安石井镇泉金客运码头举行，两岸同胞100余人参加。活动以“廿载泉金通航路 奋楫扬帆启新程”为主题，回顾了泉金客运航线从开通运营到蓬勃发展的历程，生动诠释了这条海峡“黄金通道”的作用与意义。现场不仅有航线亲历者、推动者、见证者结合亲身经历讲述航线通航以来的温暖故事与发展变化，还有泉金两地美食品鉴、书法交流、南音表演、两岸家书展、手工体验等。值得一提的是，活动正式启动金门浯洲宴菜品遴选工作，系大陆面向金门开展的特色美食甄选活动，以美食为纽带拉近两岸饮食文化联结。\n“小三通”客运航线是两岸特别是闽台民众交流往来最重要、最便捷的通道之一。泉金“小三通”客运航线自2006年6月8日开通运营以来，已安全平稳运送旅客超160万人次。依托短途航运优势，航线以低成本、近距离的海上联通，不断拉近泉金民众心与心的距离，两岸民众经由泉金航线探亲访友、寻根谒祖、就业创业、观光交流，越走越近、越走越亲。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic, trade and exchange activities.","Cross-Strait exchange activities continue to be lively and exciting. Let me introduce several recent activities.\nFrom June 2 to 3, the 13th Cross-Strait (Nanjing) New Display Industry Matchmaking Conference was held in Nanjing, Jiangsu Province. More than 400 cross-strait entrepreneurs, industry experts, representatives of universities and research institutes conducted exchanges and discussions around the theme of \"Display to Intelligence, AI to Innovation, and Industry to Integration\".\nFrom June 11 to 15, the Putian-Taiwan youth cultural exchange event \"Youth Together, Youth Go Together\" will be held in Putian, Fujian. Young people from Putian and Taiwan will gather in Mazu's hometown to experience Mazu's belief culture. During the same period, Putian will also hold Putian-Taiwan fishery breeding exchange activities. Fisheries colleagues in Putian and Taiwan will exchange breeding experiences and sign cooperation agreements to jointly promote the common advancement of fishery technology, resource sharing, industrial prosperity, and market expansion.\nOn June 14, the 2026 \"Meet Zhuhai, Meet Youth\" cross-strait youth dragon boat culture and \"Village BA\" basketball friendly match exchange event will be held in Zhuhai. Youth from both sides of the strait will watch the dragon boat race, taste intangible cultural heritage delicacies, make rice dumplings together, and experience the charm of Lingnan folk customs and the heritage of Chinese culture.\nOn June 16, the second cross-strait folk culture and sports event - Maoming Xian Fu Folk Culture Exchange was held in Maoming, Guangdong. The event was themed \"Continuing Intangible Cultural Heritage and Inheriting the Spirit of Xian Yi\" and focused on the \"good-hearted spirit\" of safeguarding the reunification of the motherland and national unity. Nearly 500 Taiwanese compatriots participated in the exchange activities.","两岸交流活动持续热络精彩，我介绍近期几项活动。\n6月2日至3日，第十三届海峡两岸（南京）新型显示产业对接会在江苏南京举办，400余位两岸企业家、行业专家、高校及科研院所代表，围绕“显示向智·AI向新·产业向融”主题，进行交流研讨。\n6月11日至15日，“青年同心 青春同行”莆台青年文化交流活动将在福建莆田举办，莆台两地青年将齐聚妈祖故里，感受妈祖信仰文化。同期，莆田还将举办莆台渔业养殖交流活动，莆台两地渔业同行交流养殖经验、签订合作协议，携手推动渔业技术共进、资源共享、产业共兴、市场共拓。\n6月14日，2026“遇见珠海 青春相约”海峡两岸青年龙舟文化暨“村BA”篮球友谊赛交流活动将在珠海举办，两岸青年将一起观看龙舟比赛、品尝非遗美食、同包粽子，感受岭南民俗魅力与中华文化底蕴。\n6月16日，第二届海峡两岸民俗文体汇——茂名冼夫人民俗文化交流活动在广东茂名举行，活动以“赓续非遗文化·承传冼义精神”为主题，以维护祖国统一民族团结的“好心精神”为主线，近500名台湾同胞参加交流活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","It is understood that the 3rd Shaanxi-Taiwan Culture Week and Cross-Strait Youth Han and Tang Culture Summer Camp will be held in Shaanxi. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From June to October, \"Meet in Chang'an, Walk with Youth\" - the 3rd Shaanxi-Taiwan Culture Week and the Han and Tang Culture Summer Camp for Cross-Strait Youth will be held in Xi'an, Shaanxi and other places. More than 40 sub-activities will be held. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will conduct interactive exchanges in more than 10 fields such as culture, science and technology, and education.\nShaanxi is an important birthplace of Chinese civilization and carries the important spiritual code of Chinese civilization. Xi'an is one of the four ancient capitals in my country. As the summer vacation is approaching, Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, are welcome to visit the land of Sanqin, explore the beginning of Chinese civilization in front of the Yellow Emperor's Mausoleum, experience the splendid brilliance of Eastern culture in the Terracotta Warriors and Horses Pit, and gaze at the gold inscriptions on the Duhu Talisman at the Shaanxi History Museum. Look up at the Big Wild Goose Pagoda and reminisce about Xuanzang's perseverance in his journey to the west; take a night tour in the Evernight City of the Tang Dynasty and feel the bright lights of Chang'an Night; climb to the top of Huashan Mountain and visit the \"Sword Discourse Platform\" written by Jin Yong; visit the Hukou Falls in person to witness the majestic power of the Yellow River.\nIn Shaanxi, in addition to experiencing the rich history and culture and beautiful natural scenery, you can also go to a feast in the \"Carbohydrate Capital\", eat a bowl of biangbiang noodles, eat a bite of meat buns, taste various snacks such as gourd heads, golden thread oil towers, squid and fish, and experience the infinite charm of the Qin and Han Dynasties and the grand scenery of the Tang Dynasty through the delicious food on the tip of your tongue.","6月至10月，“相约长安·青春同行”——第三届陕台文化周暨海峡两岸青年汉唐文化夏令营将在陕西西安等地举行，将举办40多个分项活动，两岸同胞将在文化、科技、教育等10多个领域开展互动交流。\n陕西是中华文明的重要发祥地，承载着中华文明重要的精神密码。西安是我国四大古都之一。暑期将至，欢迎台湾同胞特别是青年朋友到访三秦大地，在黄帝陵前探寻中华文明的肇始，在兵马俑坑感受东方文化的灿烂辉煌，在陕西历史博物馆凝视杜虎符上的错金铭文。仰望大雁塔，追忆玄奘西行的执著；夜游大唐不夜城，感受长安夜的灯火璀璨；登临华山之巅，打卡金庸笔下的“论剑台”；亲临壶口瀑布，见证黄河奔腾不息的磅礴力量。\n在陕西，除了实地感受厚重的历史文化和优美的自然风光，还可以奔赴一场“碳水之都”的盛宴，咥一碗biangbiang面，吃一口肉夹馍，品尝葫芦头、金线油塔、浆水鱼鱼等各色小吃，通过舌尖上的美味体会秦汉雄风、大唐盛景的无限魅力。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","中国日报记者","The \"Fujian Super League\" football league has launched a series of special activities against Taiwan. The Mainland Affairs Council said that in recent years, the mainland has used various sports exchange activities as a package to strengthen the attraction of Taiwanese sports talents and united front propaganda. Taiwanese people who go to the mainland to engage in sports exchanges \"should not accept any…","Fujian and Taiwan are geographically close, related by blood, and culturally related. It is natural for people from Fujian and Taiwan to have close exchanges. Compatriots from Taiwan go to the mainland to participate in football leagues and other sports exchange activities, which will help compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait enhance understanding and achieve harmony and progress together. The DPP authorities have made irresponsible remarks and slandered the non-governmental events and exchange activities loved by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, which only proves that they are afraid of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait getting closer.","福建与台湾地缘相近、血缘相亲、文缘相承，闽台人员往来密切是很自然的事。台湾同胞赴大陆参加足球联赛及其他体育交流活动，有助于两岸同胞增进了解，共融共进。民进党当局对两岸同胞喜爱的民间赛事和交流活动说三道四，污蔑抹黑，只能证明其害怕两岸同胞走亲走近。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","环球时报、环球网记者","Taiwanese media reported that the island’s travel industry associations have recently stated that there is a clear demand for tourism to the mainland on the island, calling on the Democratic Progressive Party authorities to lift the “ban on group travel” and the so-called “orange alert” to mainland China, so that the people and industry can work together to improve the tourism market. Do you have any comments on…","Relevant reports fully reflect the strong desire of the island's industry to resume cross-strait tourism exchanges, and indicate that the restrictive measures such as the \"ban on group travel\" to mainland China implemented by the DPP authorities are unpopular.\nAccording to statistics, there will be as many as 4.89 million Taiwanese residents coming to the mainland in 2025. Out of self-interest for \"independence\" politics, the DPP authorities turned a deaf ear to the calls of the island's industry and people. This not only harmed the livelihoods of Taiwan's tourism industry, but also deprived Taiwanese youth of the opportunity to understand the true face of the mainland.\nWe have always upheld the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, promoted the resumption of travel for mainland residents to Taiwan and continued to express goodwill. Since 2024, we have resumed travel to Kinmen and Matsu for residents of Fujian and Shanghai. It is hoped that the DPP authorities will face up to public opinion, remove political barriers, and create favorable conditions for the normalization of cross-strait personnel exchanges and tourism exchanges.","有关报道充分反映了岛内业界对恢复两岸旅游交流的强烈愿望，表明民进党当局推行的赴大陆旅游“禁团令”等限制做法不得人心。\n据统计，2025年台湾居民来大陆高达489万人次。民进党当局出于谋“独”政治私利，对岛内业者和民众的呼声充耳不闻，不仅损害了台湾旅游业者的生计，更剥夺了台湾青年了解大陆真实面貌的机会。\n我们始终秉持两岸一家亲理念，推动恢复大陆居民赴台旅游并持续释放善意，2024年以来先后恢复福建、上海居民赴金门、马祖旅游。希望民进党当局正视民意，撤除政治藩篱，为两岸人员往来和旅游交流恢复正常创造有利条件。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","Regarding the recent special maritime traffic law enforcement operations carried out by the mainland in the waters east of Taiwan, the Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council stated that the mainland’s official ships have affected foreign merchant ships in this area. “This violates international law and international conventions and undermines regional peace and stability.” Any comment on this? Does the mainland have a…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China. The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of Taiwan Island. China has an exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the above-mentioned waters. Japan and the Philippines launched the so-called \"delimitation negotiations\" without authorization, bypassing China, seriously infringing on China's maritime rights and interests, seriously violating international law and basic norms of international relations, and is completely illegal and invalid.\nThe Chinese Coast Guard carries out law enforcement patrols in the waters east of Taiwan Island in accordance with the law. This is a necessary action taken against Japan and the Philippines for seriously infringing on China's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests. It will continue to strengthen the control of relevant waters. The DPP authorities confuse right and wrong and confuse right and wrong, which cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China.\nThe relevant mainland departments carry out law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas in accordance with the law, which is a just move to safeguard the country's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and is conducive to ensuring the safety of Taiwan's fishermen's lives and property. The DPP authorities are distorting facts and maliciously hyping up the situation in an attempt to provoke cross-strait confrontation and \"rely on external forces to seek independence.\" They will not succeed.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国不可分割的一部分。日、菲宣布的拟划界海域位于台湾岛以东，中国在上述海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日菲绕开中国擅自启动所谓“划界谈判”，严重侵害中国海洋权益，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，完全非法无效。\n中国海警在台湾岛以东海域依法开展执法巡查，是针对日菲严重侵犯中国领土主权和海域权益采取的必要行动，并将持续加强对有关海域的管控。民进党当局颠倒黑白、混淆是非，改变不了台湾是中国一部分的历史和法理事实。\n大陆有关部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查，是维护国家领土主权和海洋权益的正义之举，有利于保障台湾渔民生命财产安全。民进党当局歪曲事实，恶意炒作，企图挑起两岸对立对抗、“倚外谋独”，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","台湾《旺报》记者","Recently, some Taiwanese people have reported that when participating in cross-strait exchange activities or related communities, they encountered criminals using false identities to commit emotional or investment fraud, which has affected the trust in cross-strait people-to-people exchanges. Does the mainland know the relevant situation? What specific measures will be taken in the future to combat this kind of…","I don't know the specific situation you are talking about. Fraud is a crime deeply abhorred by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and it is also a target that mainland judicial authorities crack down on in accordance with the law. If Taiwan compatriots encounter illegal abuse in the mainland, please report it to the public security organs in time. The relevant departments will do their best to protect the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in the mainland.","我不了解你说的具体情况。诈骗是两岸同胞深恶痛绝的犯罪行为，也是大陆司法机关依法打击的对象。如果台胞在大陆遭遇不法侵害，请及时向公安机关报警，有关部门将尽全力保障好台胞在大陆合法权益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","台湾“中央社”记者","First question, it is reported that Li Yanhe, editor-in-chief of Taiwan's \"Eight Banners Culture\", has been released from prison, but cannot leave the country due to an additional one-year sentence. Please explain the situation. Second question: On the 6th, the Ministry of Transport of China announced a special maritime traffic law enforcement operation in the eastern waters of Taiwan. The Democratic Progressive…","The first question. Regarding Li Yanhe's case, the relevant departments have always handled it in accordance with the law and at the same time protected the legitimate rights and interests of the parties concerned in accordance with the law.\nSecond question. Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is part of China. There is no so-called \"sovereignty\". Relevant mainland departments carry out law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas in accordance with the law, which is a just act to safeguard national sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.\nI have noticed that many Taiwanese people and netizens are applauding the decisiveness and toughness of the mainland. They praise the relevant actions as supporting Taiwanese fishermen. At the same time, they express strong dissatisfaction and opposition to the DPP authorities' self-indulgence and groveling.","第一个问题。对于李延贺案，有关部门始终依法处理，同时依法保障当事人合法权益。\n第二个问题。两岸同属一个中国，台湾是中国一部分，不存在所谓“主权”。大陆有关部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查，是维护国家主权和海洋权益的正义之举。\n我注意到，许多台湾民众、网友都在为大陆方面的果断、硬气叫好，赞许有关行动是在为台湾渔民撑腰，同时对民进党当局自丧立场、卑躬屈膝，表达强烈的不满和反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","First question, the Taiwan Strait Foundation said on the 5th that Taiwanese Taoist priests have been detained in the mainland in the past two weeks. Can you explain the specific reasons? Second question, Shen Boyang, the Taipei mayoral candidate of the Democratic Progressive Party, said in an interview that \"the Twin Cities Forum has not been beneficial so far.\" He also said that he does not exclude exchanges on…","The first question. We have always encouraged and supported cross-Strait exchanges in all fields and protected the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in accordance with the law. As long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots do not have to have any concerns when traveling to the mainland. Out of political self-interest, the DPP authorities maliciously hyped, smeared and spread rumors, and attacked the mainland in an attempt to create a \"chilling effect\", obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. This is unpopular and will not succeed.\nThe second question is that the Shanghai-Taipei City Forum, as an important institutionalized exchange platform between Shanghai and Taipei, has played a positive role in promoting exchanges and cooperation between the two cities in various fields, and the results are obvious to all. Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are Chinese and one family. They should visit each other frequently and become closer as we go more and more. We treat all Taiwan compatriots equally and welcome them as long as they are willing to participate in cross-strait exchanges and cooperation and do not engage in separatist activities.\nShen Boyang is a die-hard \"Taiwan independence\" person on the list, a black sheep who undermines exchanges, family ties and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. He constantly promotes separatist ideas, harbors the evil intentions of \"Taiwan independence\", exaggerates his own self-esteem and grandstands, and is not worthy of comment.","第一个问题。我们一贯鼓励支持两岸各领域交流往来，依法保护台湾同胞的正当权益。只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞往来大陆不必有任何顾虑。民进党当局出于政治私利，恶意炒作、抹黑造谣、攻击大陆，企图制造“寒蝉效应”，阻挠破坏两岸交流合作，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心，不会得逞。\n第二个问题，上海台北城市论坛作为上海与台北两市间重要的机制化交流平台，为促进两市各领域交流合作发挥了积极作用，成果有目共睹。两岸同胞都是中国人、一家人，应该常来常往、越走越亲。我们对广大台湾同胞一视同仁，只要愿意参与两岸交流合作，不搞分裂活动，我们都欢迎。\n沈伯洋是清单在列的“台独”顽固分子，是破坏两岸同胞交流往来、亲情福祉的害群之马，其不断宣扬分裂主张，包藏“台独”祸心，自抬身价、哗众取宠，不值一评。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-10","Zhang Han","台湾东森新闻记者","Taiwan’s Mainland Affairs Council has explicitly banned local government personnel from participating in this year’s Straits Forum. Taitung County Magistrate Rao Qingling’s application to go to the mainland was also rejected. What do you think of this?","The Straits Forum is a cross-Strait non-governmental exchange platform that adheres to the principle of \"non-governmental, grassroots and extensive\". It has played an important and positive role in promoting cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in various fields and enhancing the interests and well-being of compatriots. It is generally welcomed by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nOut of its stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" stance, the DPP authorities ignore the will of the people and local development needs, and have neither the will nor the ability to properly handle cross-strait relations. For its own political self-interest, it smeared and slandered the Straits Forum, undermined cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, restricted the movement and freedom of speech of the Taiwanese people, and seriously harmed the interests and well-being of compatriots on the island. What he did fully exposed the essence of \"fake democracy and true dictatorship\". Compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and no force can stop the trend of getting closer and coming together.\nWe are willing to work with all political parties, organizations, counties, cities and people from all walks of life in Taiwan to jointly oppose the DPP authorities' provocations and disruptions in pursuit of \"independence\" on the political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\", and promote cross-strait exchanges, cooperation and personnel exchanges in all fields to benefit compatriots on both sides.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","海峡论坛是坚持“民间性、草根性、广泛性”的两岸民间交流平台，对促进两岸各领域交流合作、增进同胞利益福祉发挥了重要积极作用，受到两岸同胞普遍欢迎。\n民进党当局出于顽固“台独”立场，漠视民众意愿和地方发展需要，没有意愿也没有能力处理好两岸关系。其为一己政治私利，抹黑污蔑海峡论坛，破坏两岸交流合作，禁锢台湾民众行动和言论自由，严重损害岛内同胞利益福祉。其所作所为充分暴露了“假民主、真独裁”的本质。两岸同胞是一家人，走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流是任何力量都阻挡不了的。\n我们愿与台湾各政党、团体、县市和各界人士在坚持“九二共识”政治基础上，共同反对民进党当局谋“独”挑衅和干扰破坏，促进两岸各领域交流合作和人员往来，造福两岸同胞。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260610_12770189.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-06-16","Lin Jian","Xinhua News Agency","Foreign Minister Wang Yi just concluded his visit to Mongolia. Can you share more details?","At the invitation of Minister of Foreign Affairs of Mongolia Battsetseg Batmunkh, Foreign Minister Wang Yi visited Mongolia from June 13 to 15. During the visit, Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with Mongolian President Khurelsukh Ukhnaa and Prime Minister Uchral Nyam-Osor respectively, held large and small group talks with Foreign Minister Battsetseg Batmunkh, and issued a joint press communiqué. Foreign Minister Wang Yi also, together with senior Mongolian officials, attended the water-flow commissioning ceremony of the Ulaanbaatar Central Wastewater Treatment Plant, a project funded under China’s preferential buyer’s credit.\nBoth sides agree that, connected by mountains and rivers and with a shared future, China and Mongolia are natural neighbors and comprehensive strategic partners. Both sides always respect each other’s independence, sovereignty, and territorial integrity, and any attempts by third countries to utilize the territory to harm the other’s sovereignty and security will not be allowed. These are the important safeguards of the sound development of China-Mongolia relations. Both sides agree, under the important common understandings between the two heads of state, to strengthen strategic mutual trust, deepen practical cooperation, foster people-to-people connectivity, and make continuous efforts to jointly build a bilateral community with a shared future characterized by peaceful coexistence, mutual assistance, and win-win cooperation.\nThe Mongolian side said that developing friendly relations with China is a top priority of Mongolia’s foreign policy, and Mongolia will not do anything that harms China’s interests, regardless of its relations with other countries. It emphasized that the Mongolian side understands and respects China’s positions and concerns, and is firmly committed to the one-China principle. It regards Taiwan as an inalienable part of China’s territory, does not support any form of “Taiwan independence” activity, and supports China’s national reunification. The Mongolian side reiterated its support on the vision of building a community with a shared future for humanity and the Global Development Initiative, the Global Security Initiative, the Global Civilization Initiative and the Global Governance Initiative.\nForeign Minister Wang Yi stated that China’s policy toward Mongolia remains consistent and stable, and that China has always placed the development of its relations with Mongolia in an important position in its neighborhood diplomacy. China has both the will and the capability to be a neighbor that Mongolia can rely on, a trustworthy friend, and a partner for accelerated development. China supports Mongolia in developing its economy and improving people’s livelihoods, and stands ready to strengthen the synergy of development strategies with Mongolia, pursue high‑quality Belt and Road cooperation and follow modernization paths suited to our respective national conditions.\nBoth sides have issued a joint press communiqué of the foreign ministers’ talks and established that the important common understandings between the two heads of state shall serve as the guidance for advancing China-Mongolia comprehensive strategic partnership. The two sides should respect each other’s independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity, and not interfere in each other’s internal affairs. Any attempts by third countries to utilize the territory to harm the other’s sovereignty and security should not be allowed. The Mongolian side reiterated that as its natural neighbor, China is a top priority of Mongolia’s foreign policy. It opposes “Taiwan independence” and believes that Xizang-related issues are China’s internal affairs. Both sides condemn fascism and militarism in any form and do not support any attempt to revive them.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260616_11946864.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-06-16","Chen Xi","","据报道，日菲单方面宣布启动位中国台湾岛以东“海域划界谈判”，中国海警在相关海域开展执法行动，台湾防务部门称这是“挑衅行为”和“认知作战”。请问对此有何评论？","","台湾是中国的一部分，中国在台湾岛以东海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架，中国海警开展执法巡查行动，正当必要、不容侵扰。两岸同属一个中国，共同捍卫国家主权和海洋权益是两岸同胞义不容辞的责任。民进党当局不仅消极应对，还颠倒黑白、倒行逆施，丧失民族立场，这种数典忘祖的行径令人唾弃。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16467725.html","",1,3,4,""],[0,"2026-06-17","Lin Jian","Global Times","It is reported that regarding the case in which Kodai Murata, a sitting officer of Japan’s Self-Defense Forces, illegally entered the Chinese embassy in Japan with a knife, the Tokyo District Public Prosecutors Office has decided to prolong his detention period for psychiatric assessment to determine whether he is criminally responsible for his actions. What is your comment?","Nearly three months have passed since Kodai Murata, a sitting officer of Japan’s Self-Defense Forces, illegally broke into the Chinese Embassy in Japan armed with a knife. The Japanese side’s investigation and handling of the case have been proceeding slowly, while vicious incidents threatening the security of Chinese diplomatic missions in Japan continue to occur. China deplores this and has lodged protests against the Japanese side on many occasions.\nThe incident again reveals multiple deep-seated issues in Japan: the worsening right-wing impact and the suppression of objective and rational voices, the toxicity of the Japanese government’s erroneous policies on vital issues concerning China-Japan relations such as history and Taiwan, the serious lack of education on true history, the pervasive erroneous historical views, the ongoing push for a more offensive and expansionist defense policy and failure in supervising the SDF and maintaining discipline inside the forces. We notice that, for some time, many people with insight in Japan have asked the Japanese government to make an apology to China. Some have urged the government to reflect on itself and take corrective actions concerning the supervision of SDF, the education on history, and Japan’s policy towards China so as to fundamentally address the issue and remove its breeding ground in the Japanese society. We once again urge the Japanese side to do serious soul-searching, correct its wrongdoings, conduct a thorough probe and take full responsibility for the incident.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260617_11947701.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on June 17, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalists, good morning. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","新华社记者","The 18th Straits Forum has attracted public attention from both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Could the speaker introduce the results of this Straits Forum?","The 18th Straits Forum was held in Xiamen on the morning of June 13. Wang Huning, member of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference, attended the forum and delivered a speech. Before the conference, he met with Taiwanese guests and representatives attending the forum. This forum adheres to the positioning of \"non-governmental, grassroots and extensive\", continues the theme of \"expanding non-governmental exchanges and deepening integrated development\", and organizes a series of colorful grassroots, youth, cultural and economic exchange activities. So far, more than 30 activities have been held, and more than 6,000 Taiwanese compatriots, especially \"Shou Lai\" and Taiwanese youth, have participated enthusiastically without fear of interference from the DPP authorities. This fully proves that the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits getting closer and coming together will not change. The DPP authorities’ interference and sabotage are unpopular and will not succeed.\nThis forum insists on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and promotes the release, signing, and implementation of a series of policies, measures, cooperation projects, and phased progress during the forum, visually demonstrating the solid results of the \"small four links\" and the bright prospects of the \"new four links\", and comprehensively showing the actual construction of Fujian as the first home for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies. A signing meeting for the docking of ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation was held on June 13. A number of intention purchase agreements were signed in the agricultural and fishery industries on both sides of the Strait. Fujian Province implemented five measures to deepen cross-Strait film and television cultural exchanges, took the lead in introducing Taiwanese TV series to be broadcast on satellite TV during prime time, and established a cross-Strait audio-visual copyright exchange center. The Straits Financial Forum and the Taiwan Enterprise Development Forum released the mainland banking industry’s first group standard for financial services to Taiwan. The Cross-Strait Maritime Cultural Exchange Event released 5 work measures to promote the high-quality development of cross-Strait shipping. The Straits Science and Technology Expert Forum facilitated the signing of 6 cross-Strait science and technology exchange and cooperation projects, providing more development opportunities and convenience for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises to participate in Chinese-style modernization.\nThis forum effectively promotes exchanges and integration between young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The Straits Youth Forum has established a cross-Strait youth association cooperation mechanism, released 23 cross-Strait association cooperation projects, and 19 groups of cross-Strait youth associations have united to co-build and sign cooperation contracts. The Straits Women's Forum helped pair up 10 families of the same origin. Dozens of Taiwanese young people took to the podium at the forum and a series of events to share their experiences of crossing the Taiwan Strait, finding their roots, and integrating into the life and development of the mainland. More than 100 college students from both sides of the Taiwan Strait formed a co-creation team to hold a short play competition, using the lens to tell vivid stories of Fujian and Taiwan sharing the same roots and helping each other. In his performance at the forum, young mainland actor Zhang Linghe expressed his sincere hope that more Taiwanese compatriots would cross the Taiwan Strait and come to the mainland for a visit. His sentence \"The distance across the Taiwan Strait cannot stop our compatriots from getting closer and closer to each other\" resonated with the audience. When Taiwanese guests from all walks of life participated in the forum activities, they all called for cross-Strait relations to return to the track of peaceful development as soon as possible. They looked forward to expanding exchanges and cooperation between the two sides and working together to create a bright future for national rejuvenation.","第十八届海峡论坛大会6月13日上午在厦门举行，中共中央政治局常委、全国政协主席王沪宁出席论坛大会并致辞，在大会开始前会见参加论坛的台湾嘉宾代表。本届论坛坚持“民间性、草根性、广泛性”定位，延续“扩大民间交流、深化融合发展”主题，组织一系列丰富多彩的基层、青年、文化、经济交流活动。截至目前，已举办30余项活动，超过6000名台胞特别是“首来族”和台湾青年不惧民进党当局干扰阻挠踊跃参加。这充分证明两岸同胞走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流不会改变，民进党当局干扰破坏不得人心，也不会得逞。\n本届论坛坚持以交流融合增进民生福祉，推动一系列政策措施、合作项目、阶段性进展在论坛期间发布、签约、落地，直观展示“小四通”扎实成果和“新四通”美好前景，全面展现福建作为台胞台企登陆第一家园的建设实景。十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施对接签约会6月13日举行，两岸农渔产业领域签订多项意向采购协议。福建省落地深化两岸影视文化交流5项举措，率先引进台湾电视剧在卫视黄金时段播出，成立两岸视听版权交流中心。海峡金融论坛·台企发展论坛发布大陆银行业首个对台金融服务团体标准，海峡两岸航海文化交流活动发布5项促进两岸航运高质量发展的工作措施，海峡科技专家论坛促成6个两岸科技交流合作项目签约，为台胞台企参与中国式现代化提供更多发展机遇和便利。\n本届论坛有力促进两岸青年交流交往交融。海峡青年论坛搭建两岸青年社团合作机制，发布23项两岸社团合作项目，19组两岸青年社团结对共建、签约合作。海峡妇女论坛促成10对同宗同源家庭结对。数十位台湾青年登上论坛大会和系列活动讲台，分享自己跨越海峡、寻找血缘根脉、融入大陆生活发展的心路历程。两岸百余名大学生组成共创团队开展短剧创演大赛，用镜头讲述闽台同根同源、守望相助的生动故事。大陆青年演员张凌赫在论坛大会表演讲述中，真诚期待更多台湾同胞跨越海峡来大陆走一走看一看，一句“海峡的距离，挡不住同胞走亲走近的交流步伐”引发全场共鸣。各界台湾嘉宾在参加论坛活动时，纷纷呼吁两岸关系早日重回和平发展正轨，期盼两岸扩大交流合作，携手共创民族复兴美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771509.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","人民日报记者","Please introduce the situation of the special promotion meeting for the construction of cross-strait integrated development demonstration zones. Since the promulgation of the \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Road for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration…","The special promotion meeting for the construction of cross-strait integrated development demonstration zones was held in Xiamen, Fujian Province on June 13. Wang Huning, member of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference, attended and delivered a speech. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the National Development and Reform Commission and other relevant central and state departments as well as relevant responsible comrades from Fujian Province attended the meeting.\nThis meeting summarized the work results since the release of the \"Opinions of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the State Council on Supporting Fujian to Explore a New Road for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Build a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone\" (hereinafter referred to as the \"Opinions\"), exchanged work experience, proposed next-step work plans, and laid a solid foundation for the high-quality construction of a cross-Strait integrated development demonstration zone. The meeting made it clear that it is necessary to implement the requirements of the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" to build the demonstration zone for cross-strait integrated development, and to adhere to high-quality development throughout the entire process of the construction of the demonstration zone. It is necessary to focus on the key tasks of building cross-strait integrated development demonstration zones, increase policy and institutional innovation, and promote pilot demonstration zones to provide experience. It is necessary to improve policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, optimize the business environment, strengthen industrial cooperation, and expand the benefits and sense of gain for Taiwan compatriots and enterprises. It is necessary to intensify cross-Strait cultural exchanges, strengthen the role of Chinese cultural ties, and enhance Taiwan compatriots' recognition of the Chinese nation, Chinese culture, and our great motherland. It is necessary to unblock the channels for Taiwanese youth to come to the mainland for development, guide Taiwanese youth to participate in the mainland's high-quality development and modernization, and enhance family well-being and spiritual harmony through exchanges and interactions.\nSince the release of the \"Opinions\" in 2023, relevant departments of the central and state agencies have formulated and issued a series of supporting policy documents. Fujian has issued 5 batches of 74 policy measures to promote the integration of Fujian and Taiwan, implemented a batch of key projects for the integrated development of Fujian and Taiwan on a rolling basis, and publicly released the first batch of With 17 landmark achievements, the demonstration zone's demonstration effect on Taiwan has gradually emerged and its influence has been expanding. It has become more convenient for Taiwanese compatriots and Taiwanese companies to land in their first home. Economic and cultural exchanges and cooperation between Fujian and Taiwan have continued to deepen. The integrated development of Fujian has maintained a good momentum. The construction of the demonstration zone has made phased progress. In 2025, 2,612 new Taiwan-funded enterprises will be established in Fujian, a year-on-year increase of 6.8%. From January to May this year, 518,000 Taiwan compatriots entered the country through Fujian ports, an increase of 29.7% year-on-year, and 939,000 tourists traveled between the two sides of the \"mini three links\", an increase of 25.6%.\nIn the next step, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the National Development and Reform Commission will work with relevant central and state departments and Fujian Province to implement the deployment of this meeting, adhere to the goal of integrating people's hearts, use institutional innovation as the starting point, and use key areas as the engine, use more practical measures, greater efforts, high standards, and high quality to promote the construction of demonstration zones, strive to create a \"Fujian model\" for cross-Strait integrated development, and promote cross-Strait integrated development to achieve greater results during the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period.","两岸融合发展示范区建设专题推进会于6月13日在福建厦门召开，中共中央政治局常委、全国政协主席王沪宁出席并讲话。中央台办、国家发展改革委等中央和国家有关部门及福建省有关负责同志出席会议。\n本次会议总结了《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》（下称《意见》）发布以来的工作成果，交流了工作经验、提出了下步工作规划，为高质量建设两岸融合发展示范区打下坚实基础。会议明确，要落实“十五五”规划要求抓好两岸融合发展示范区建设工作，把坚持高质量发展贯穿示范区建设全过程。要聚焦两岸融合发展示范区建设重点任务，加大政策和制度创新，推动示范区先行先试、提供经验。要完善促进两岸交流合作政策措施，优化营商环境，加强产业合作，扩大台胞台企受益面和获得感。要密切两岸人文交流，强化中华文化纽带作用，增进台湾同胞对中华民族、中华文化、伟大祖国的认同。要畅通台湾青年来大陆发展渠道，引导台湾青年投身大陆高质量发展和现代化建设，在交流交往交融中增进亲情福祉、促进心灵契合。\n自2023年《意见》发布以来，中央和国家机关有关部门制定出台了一系列配套政策文件，福建先后发布5批74项促进闽台融合政策措施，滚动实施一批闽台融合发展重点项目，公开发布了首批17项标志性成果，示范区对台示范效应逐步显现、影响日益扩大，台胞台企登陆第一家园更加便利、闽台经济文化交流合作不断深化、福建全域融合发展保持良好势头，示范区建设取得阶段性进展。2025年，福建新设台资企业2612家，同比增长6.8%。今年1至5月，从福建口岸入境台胞51.8万人次、同比增长29.7%，往来“小三通”两岸旅客93.9万人次、增长25.6%。\n下一步，中央台办、国家发展改革委将会同中央和国家有关部门及福建省，贯彻落实本次会议部署，坚持以融通人心为目标、以制度创新为抓手、以重点区域为引擎，以更实举措、更大力度高标准、高质量推动示范区建设，努力打造两岸融合发展的“福建样板”，推动“十五五”时期两岸融合发展取得更大成效。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771508.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台央视《中国新闻》记者","During the Straits Forum, a signing meeting for the docking of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation was held, which was welcomed and praised by people on both sides of the strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","A signing meeting for the docking of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation was held in Xiamen on the 13th. Mainland enterprises have signed contracts with enterprises and chambers of commerce and associations from many places in Taiwan to purchase agricultural and fishery products such as pineapple custard apples, pomelos, and tea from counties and cities in Taitung, Yunlin, and Nantou in Taiwan. More than 120 guests from both sides of the Taiwan Strait attended the matchmaking meeting. Taitung County Mayor Rao Qingling and Su Qingquan, chairman of the Pingtung County Party Committee of the Chinese Kuomintang, sent congratulations via video.\nSong Tao, director of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, attended the signing meeting and delivered a speech, introducing the positive progress and phased results achieved in the implementation of the ten measures, emphasizing that only by adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\", opposing \"Taiwan independence\", and recognizing that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China, can cross-Strait relations develop peacefully, only peace and tranquility exist in the Taiwan Strait, and only the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait can be guaranteed. Zhang Ronggong, Vice Chairman of the Chinese Kuomintang, said in his speech that cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation are the best channels to promote mutual understanding and enhance the well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. The Chinese Kuomintang will be committed to promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and insisting on seeking peace across the Taiwan Strait and improving people's livelihood. Taiwanese industry players who participated in the signing meeting said that the ten measures will allow farmers and fishermen on the island to obtain tangible cross-strait peace dividends. They hope that the two sides will continue to promote more and better results through good-faith dialogue and communication.\nIn the future, we will further promote the implementation of the ten measures, insist on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and strive to allow more compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to benefit from and share the benefits.","十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施对接签约会13日在厦门举行。大陆企业与来自台湾多地的企业和商会协会进行签约，采购台湾台东、云林、南投等县市凤梨释迦、文旦柚、茶叶等农渔产品。来自两岸的120余名嘉宾参加对接会，台东县长饶庆铃、中国国民党屏东县党部主任委员苏清泉通过视频方式发来祝贺。\n中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛出席签约会并致辞,介绍落实十项措施取得的积极进展和阶段性成果，强调只有坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”，认同两岸同属一个中国，两岸关系才能和平发展，台海才有和平安宁，两岸同胞利益福祉才有保障。中国国民党副主席张荣恭致辞表示，两岸交流合作是促进两岸同胞相互理解、增进福祉的最佳渠道，中国国民党将致力于推动两岸关系和平发展，坚持为台海谋和平、为民生谋福祉。参加签约会的台湾业者表示，十项措施让岛内农渔民获得实实在在的两岸和平红利，希望两岸通过善意对话沟通，推动更多更好成果不断落地。\n今后，我们将进一步推动十项措施落实落细，坚持以交流融合增进民生福祉，争取让两岸更多同胞同获其利、共享其惠。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771507.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","《参考消息》记者","Regarding the active participation of people from all walks of life on the island in this Straits Forum, the Taiwan Mainland Affairs Council said, \"The Straits Forum is an out-and-out platform for the mainland's united front against Taiwan. It is impossible to watch the mainland use exchanges to cover up the united front, infiltration and division.\" Public opinion on the island pointed out that the DPP cannot…","Since its establishment 18 years ago, the Straits Forum has always adhered to the positioning of being \"civilian, grassroots, and broad-based.\" It has so far held more than 800 colorful cross-strait exchange activities covering grassroots, youth, culture, and economy, attracting the enthusiastic participation of more than 100,000 Taiwanese compatriots. The active participation of Taiwan compatriots is a full affirmation of the effectiveness of the Straits Forum, and is also a source of confidence and motivation for relevant institutions on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to continue to successfully run the forum. In recent years, relevant activities of the Straits Forum have become more and more relevant to the needs of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, with continuous innovation in the form and content of the activities and fruitful results, which are fully recognized by all walks of life on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe peaceful development of cross-Strait relations is a historical trend. The strong desire and forward pace of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to communicate and cooperate cannot be stopped by anyone or any force. Out of political self-interest, the DPP authorities come out to smear and attack every year. This year, they have tightened restrictions and obstructed people from all walks of life on the island from participating in the Strait Forum. However, the more they cause trouble, the more they fail.","海峡论坛创办18年来，一直坚持“民间性、草根性、广泛性”定位，迄今已举办800多项涵盖基层、青年、文化和经济等领域丰富多彩的两岸交流活动，吸引十余万名台湾同胞热情参与。台湾同胞的踊跃参与，是对海峡论坛成效的充分肯定，也是两岸相关机构继续办好论坛的信心所在和动力源泉。近年来，海峡论坛相关活动越来越贴近两岸同胞需求，活动形式和内容不断创新，取得丰硕成果，两岸各界对此充分肯定。\n两岸关系和平发展是历史大势，两岸同胞要交流、要合作的强烈愿望和前行步伐是任何人任何势力都阻挡不住的。民进党当局出于政治私利，每年都跳出来抹黑攻击，今年更变本加厉限制阻挠岛内各界人士参加海峡论坛，但是他们越捣乱越失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Taiwan's security department recently stated that it has completed the construction of the so-called \"Chinese Public Contact Window\" website as a channel for mainland people to provide intelligence. Any comment on this?","The DPP authorities blatantly targeted the mainland for intelligence theft and infiltration and sabotage activities, escalating cross-Strait antagonism and damaging cross-Strait relations, fully exposing their stubborn stance on \"Taiwan independence\" and their obsession with confrontational thinking. We strongly condemn this and will resolutely counterattack.\nIn accordance with relevant laws and regulations, Chinese citizens, political parties and people's organizations, enterprises, institutions and other social organizations all have the responsibility and obligation to maintain security. For those who provide intelligence to Taiwan's intelligence agencies and constitute a crime, the relevant departments will pursue their legal responsibilities in accordance with the law.","民进党当局公然以大陆为目标进行情报窃取和渗透破坏活动，升高两岸对立、破坏两岸关系，充分暴露其“台独”立场冥顽不化、对抗思维执迷不悟。我们对此表示强烈谴责，并将坚决反制。\n依照有关法律规定，中国公民、各政党和人民团体、企业事业组织和其他社会组织都有维护安全的责任和义务。对于向台湾情报机构提供情报、构成犯罪的，有关部门将依法追究其法律责任。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771504.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中新社记者","Recently, actor Zhang Linghe participated in the 18th Straits Forum and talked about his youth experience across the strait. He also responded to the call of young friends on the island to come to Taiwan for exchanges, which attracted attention on the island. Any comment on this? What is your response to Zhang Linghe’s exchange in Taiwan?","At the 18th Strait Forum Conference, Mr. Zhang Linghe told the story of his youth across the Taiwan Strait, echoing the expectations of young people on the island for close communication and dialogue. He showed the sincere feelings of mainland youth who care about cross-strait development and are willing to contribute to cross-strait exchanges. He received attention and praise from public opinion on both sides of the strait. We always support the \"two-way travel\" of young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and are happy to see well-known mainland actors, singers and other literary and artistic workers go to Taiwan to meet and communicate with the people and young people on the island.","张凌赫先生在第十八届海峡论坛大会上，讲述了跨越海峡的青春故事，呼应了岛内青年与其近距离交流对话的期待，展现了大陆青年关心两岸发展、愿为两岸交流付出的真挚情怀，受到两岸舆论的关注和好评。我们始终支持两岸青年“双向奔赴”，乐见大陆知名演员、歌手等文艺工作者赴台，与岛内民众和青年见面交流。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771506.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","香港中评社记者","A few days ago, a signing meeting for the docking of ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation was held in Xiamen, including the purchase of some agricultural and fishery products from Taiwan. Due to the obstruction of the DPP authorities, Taitung County Mayor Rao Qingling could only participate in the video speech. However, there are still DPP politicians who claimed that they…","The signing of the contract will make it easier for agricultural and fishery products such as pineapples and sugar apples from some counties and cities in Taiwan to be imported into the mainland, which will open up sales channels and increase income for farmers and fishermen in central and southern Taiwan. For such a good thing, the DPP authorities are speaking out against it. Are they going against Taiwan's farmers and fishermen friends? Is it legitimate to threaten to \"settle accounts\" with county mayors who work for fruit farmers to make a living? If you don't do any real things or do bad things yourself, but don't let others do good things, this is called \"green terror\" and evil people are in power. In this regard, I have only one comment, that is, those who do too much injustice will be punished by themselves.","签约会使台湾部分县市的凤梨释迦等农渔产品将更为便捷输入大陆，将为台湾中南部农渔民开拓销路、增加收入。对于这样的好事，民进党当局却大唱反调，是要与台湾的农渔民朋友作对吗？扬言要对为果农讨生计的县市长“秋后算账”，有正当性吗？自己实事不干、坏事干绝，还不让别人做好事，这就叫“绿色恐怖”、恶人当道。对此，我只有一句评论，那就是多行不义必自毙。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771503.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","香港凤凰卫视记者","The head of the Mainland Affairs Council said at a symposium on the island recently that \"China continues to exert pressure on Taiwan. It is not Taiwan that really changes the status quo, but China; Taiwan has always maintained the status quo.\" Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is an unquestionable historical and legal fact, and it is also the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait.\nNo matter what pretext the DPP authorities use, they cannot conceal the \"Taiwan independence\" nature of their attempt to separate Taiwan from China. What the DPP authorities want to \"maintain\" is their imagined \"divisive status quo.\" To this end, it has engaged in provocations for \"independence\", exaggerated the \"mainland threat\", and manipulated \"anti-China resistance\". It is a destroyer of the status quo in the Taiwan Strait and the biggest source of chaos for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. We will never leave any space for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. The DPP authorities should completely abandon the \"Taiwan independence\" stance, stop provocations for \"independence\", return to the political basis of the \"1992 Consensus\", and use practical actions to maintain peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是不容置疑的历史和法理事实，也是真正的台海现状。\n民进党当局无论打着什么幌子，都掩盖不了其妄图把台湾从中国分裂出去的“台独”本质。民进党当局想要“维持”的是其臆想的“分裂现状”。其为此大肆进行谋“独”挑衅，渲染“大陆威胁”，操弄“反中抗中”，是台海现状的破坏者，是台海和平稳定的最大乱源。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。我们决不为任何形式的“台独”分裂行径留下任何空间。民进党当局应当彻底放弃“台独”立场，停止谋“独”挑衅，回到“九二共识”的政治基础上来，用实际行动维护台海和平稳定。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771505.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The public memorial ceremony for Fuxi, the founder of Chinese humanity, will be held in Gansu in 2026 (Bingwu). Please introduce the relevant situation.","On June 21, the 2026 (Bingwu) public memorial ceremony for Fuxi, the founder of Chinese humanity, co-sponsored by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, the Hong Kong and Macao Affairs Office of the State Council, and the Gansu Provincial People's Government, will be held grandly at the Fuxi Temple in Tianshui City, Gansu Province. On the same day, the 13th Cross-Strait Ceremony to Commemorate Fu Xi will be held simultaneously in Taiwan. During the public memorial event, many activities such as a root-seeking and ancestor worship tour for Xihuang compatriots from Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan, and overseas Chinese, and the 2026 Fuxi Cultural Forum will also be held.\nThe third Longtai Cultural Exchange Month event will also open in Tianshui on the same day. More than 1,000 people including Taiwanese college students and scientific and technological workers will participate in more than 20 activities such as commemorating Fuxi, sports events, and cultural studies.\nGansu is not only the hometown of Emperor Xi, but also the core area of ​​the Silk Road and the golden corridor connecting Europe and Asia. Summer is approaching. We welcome Taiwanese compatriots, especially young friends, to cross the mountains and seas and come to Longyuan for a spiritual journey of cultural roots and visual feast. Go to Tianshui Fuxi Temple to experience the virtues of the ancestors of humanity, visit the Maijishan Grottoes to gaze at the warmth of the \"Oriental Smile\", and go to Dunhuang Mogao Grottoes to witness the thousand-year-old murals. You can sit by the Crescent Moon Spring in the Mingsha Mountain and listen to the distant echo of the camel bells along the Silk Road. You can dream back to the Jiayuguan Gate Tower and recall the pride of the frontier fortress. You can watch Zhangye Danxia and marvel at the uncanny craftsmanship of nature. You can ride in Gannan to encounter the green grass of the Sangke Prairie. You can climb Kongtong Mountain to appreciate the profound artistic conception of Taoism and nature.\nIn Gansu, you can also go to a carnival of \"Noodle Paradise\" and \"Cattle and Sheep Feast\". Eat a bowl of authentic Lanzhou noodles, taste a delicious hand-caught mutton dish, try stuffed skin, gray beans, water noodles, milk and egg fermented glutinous rice and various special snacks. Let this hearty taste on the tip of your tongue take you to relive the glory of the Han and Tang Dynasties and witness the rapid changes in Gansu today.","6月21日，由国务院台办、国务院港澳办、甘肃省人民政府共同主办的2026（丙午）年公祭中华人文始祖伏羲大典，将在甘肃省天水市伏羲庙隆重举行。当天，第十三届海峡两岸共祭伏羲典礼将在台湾同步举行。公祭活动期间，还将举办港澳台同胞、海外侨胞羲皇故里寻根祭祖行、2026年伏羲文化论坛等多项活动。\n第三届陇台文化交流月活动也将于同日在天水开幕，台湾大学生、科技工作者等1000余人将参加共祭伏羲、体育赛事、文化研习等20余项活动。\n甘肃，不仅是羲皇故里的桑梓热土，亦是丝绸之路的核心地带，还是联通欧亚的黄金走廊。暑期将至，欢迎台湾同胞特别是青年朋友跨越山海，来陇原大地赴一场文化寻根与视觉盛宴的心灵之旅，到天水伏羲庙感受人文始祖的明德，游麦积山石窟凝视“东方微笑”的温润，赴敦煌莫高窟见证千年壁画的绚丽，坐鸣沙山月牙泉边静听丝路驼铃的悠远回响，梦回嘉峪关城楼追忆金戈铁马的边塞豪情，观赏张掖丹霞感叹大自然的鬼斧神工，纵马甘南邂逅桑科草原的绿草如茵，登临崆峒山感悟道法自然的深邃意境。\n在甘肃，还可以奔赴一场“面食天堂”与“牛羊盛宴”的狂欢。吃一碗地道的兰州拉面，品一道美味的手抓羊肉，尝一尝酿皮子、灰豆子、浆水面、牛奶鸡蛋醪糟和各种特色小吃。让这份舌尖上的酣畅淋漓，带你重温汉唐盛世的辉煌灿烂，见证当今甘肃的日新月异。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, a Taiwanese artist posted a video saying that searching the island's TV channels did not include the World Cup football match. Related topics sparked heated discussions among netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Mainland netizens have shouted to Taiwan compatriots, \"It's free to watch in mainland China\" and \"Come to the mainland to watch, and watch whichever of the 104 games you want to watch.\"…","The Football World Cup is the world's top event and a sports feast for fans. Relying on its huge market size and the institutional advantages of \"concentrating its efforts on big things\", the mainland negotiated with FIFA and signed a broadcast contract, and obtained the exclusive all-media rights and media sub-licensing rights for this World Cup in mainland China. It covers all channels such as open-circuit TV, pay TV, the Internet and mobile devices, and is provided to all people free of charge, truly realizing \"all people share\".\nWe welcome compatriots on the island to use the mainland network, APP, etc. to watch the live broadcast of the event, or come to the mainland to watch football and games, enjoy the passion of greenery with the mainland compatriots, and at the same time experience the mainland's convenient life services and vigorous development vitality.","足球世界杯是全球顶级赛事，也是球迷的体育盛宴。大陆依托庞大市场规模和“集中力量办大事”的制度优势，由中央广播电视总台与国际足联统一谈判，签署转播合约，获得本届世界杯在大陆的独家全媒体权利及媒体分授权利，覆盖开路电视、付费电视、互联网和移动设备等全渠道，并免费向全民提供，真正实现了“全民共享”。\n我们欢迎岛内同胞使用大陆网络、APP等观看赛事直播，或者来大陆看球观赛，与大陆同胞一同畅享绿茵激情，同时体会大陆便捷的生活服务、蓬勃的发展活力。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","Taiwanese media reported that many kindergartens on the island have selected mainland songs such as \"Snow Dragon Song\" and \"Light the Future\" as graduation songs or songs for daily singing and dancing activities. They have been smeared by the Green Camp. Many kindergarten teachers have spoken out and begged strange netizens to stop bullying. Any comment on this?","These two songs have beautiful melodies and positive contents. One praises the spirit of hard work and progress, and the other hopes that children will have a bright heart and grow up toward the sun. Regarding these two popular songs that are widely sung and popular, the green camp cyber forces and flankers on the island are smearing them for no reason. They extend their black hands into pure kindergartens and bully and attack the preschool teachers who sing the songs. It is disgusting.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities and the \"Taiwan independence\" forces \"will oppose China when encountering China and soften when encountering the United States.\" They regard mainland pop culture as a scourge. They go crazy when they see simplified Chinese characters. They get violent online when they hear someone saying that mainland China is good. They claim to be engaged in \"united front\" whenever there are cross-strait exchange activities. Weird things happen one after another, fully exposing the fragility and darkness in their hearts. Regarding these unbelievable phenomena, all walks of life in Taiwan should uphold justice and condemn them with one voice.","这两首歌曲旋律优美，内容积极正向，一首颂扬拼搏奋进精神，一首期许孩童心怀光明、向阳成长。对于这两首传唱度很高、广受欢迎的流行歌曲，岛内绿营网军、侧翼却无端抹黑，将黑手伸进纯净的幼儿园，霸凌攻击传唱歌曲的幼教老师，令人不齿。\n民进党当局、“台独”势力“逢中必反、遇美必软”。他们视大陆流行文化为洪水猛兽，看到简体字就抓狂，听到有人说大陆好就网暴，只要是两岸交流活动就宣称在“统战”。咄咄怪事，层出不穷，充分暴露他们内心的脆弱和阴暗。对于这些匪夷所思的现象，台湾各界应秉持正义，同声谴责。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771498.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic, trade and exchange activities in various fields.","Cross-Strait exchange activities continue to be lively and exciting. Let me introduce several recent activities.\nFrom June 1st to 7th, an agricultural exchange delegation from Dehua County, Fujian Province went to Taiwan to carry out industry-specific exchanges. They went deep into Taiwan's grassroots farmers' associations, tea associations, well-known tea companies, and boutique tea gardens. They exchanged views on the coordinated development of modern agriculture and the quality and upgrading of specialty industries, and reached a number of cooperations such as the co-creation of tea and porcelain cultural creation, tea tree variety improvement, and tea-making technology research.\nFrom June 9 to 13, the second cross-strait coffee cultural exchange event \"Coffee on the Cloud·Fragrant Cross-Strait\" was held in Baoshan City, Yunnan Province. Nearly 200 coffee industry representatives, experts and scholars from both sides of the Taiwan Strait conducted exchanges and discussions around cross-strait coffee cultural exchanges, coffee industry cooperation, talent training and introduction, etc., and reached a number of cooperation. The event also launched the first cross-strait co-branded coffee product - \"Shanhai Coffee\".\nOn June 10, the 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition was launched in Jiangsu. Focusing on the development of new productivity, five major tracks were set up, including high-end manufacturing, electronic information, new energy and new materials, synthetic biology, and cultural and creative services. High-quality innovation and entrepreneurship projects from both sides of the Taiwan Strait were invited to participate. The registration deadline is July 15th. Young entrepreneurs from both sides of the Taiwan Strait are welcome to log on to the \"Jiangsu and Taiwan\" website or related WeChat public accounts to register for the competition.\nFrom June 12 to 16, the second Cross-Strait Youth E-Sports Carnival, \"Two Competing for Beauty and Seeing Yangcheng,\" was held in Suzhou, Jiangsu. 150 youths from both sides of the strait competed on the same stage and further enhanced friendship through e-Sports exhibitions, base camps, technology experiences and other activities.\nOn June 13, on the occasion of the 23rd World Blood Donor Day, Zhuhai held a voluntary blood donation charity event called \"Blood Relations, Zhuhai and Taiwan\". Nearly 50 compatriots from both sides of the Taiwan Strait successfully donated blood, demonstrating the deep friendship between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Blood is thicker than water and they are one family.\nFrom June 15th to 19th, the 2026 Zhaotai calligraphy and painting art exchange event \"Mo Yuan Zhaotai has the same origin and common veins\" was held in Zhao'an County, Fujian Province, the \"Hometown of Chinese Painting and Calligraphy\". More than 60 calligraphers and painters from both sides of the Taiwan Strait used pen to make friends and express emotions with ink, and jointly witnessed the opening of the Zhaotai Calligraphy and Painting Art Integration Hall.","两岸交流活动持续热络精彩，我介绍近期几项活动。\n6月1日至7日，福建省德化县农业交流团赴台开展产业专题交流，深入台湾基层农会、茶业协会及知名茶企、精品茶园，就现代农业协同发展、特色产业提质升级等进行交流，达成茶瓷文创共创、茶树品种改良、制茶技术共研等多项合作。\n6月9日至13日，“云上咖啡·香飘两岸”第二届海峡两岸咖啡文化交流活动在云南省保山市举办，两岸近200位咖啡业者代表及专家学者，围绕两岸咖啡文化交流、咖啡产业合作、人才培养引进等进行交流研讨，达成多项合作。活动并推出两岸第一款联名咖啡产品——“山海咖语”。\n6月10日，2026海峡两岸青年创新创业大赛在江苏启动，围绕发展新质生产力，设置高端制造、电子信息、新能源新材料、合成生物、文创服务等五大赛道，邀请两岸优质创新创业项目参赛。报名截止时间是7月15日，欢迎两岸青年创业者登录“江苏与台湾”网站或相关微信公众号报名参赛。\n6月12日至16日，“两相竞美 阳澄悦见”第二届两岸青年电竞嘉年华活动在江苏苏州举办，150名两岸青年同台竞技，通过电竞表演赛、基地探营、科技体验等活动，进一步增进友谊。\n6月13日，在第23个世界献血者日来临之际，珠海举办“血脉亲 珠台情”无偿献血公益活动，近50名两岸同胞成功献血，彰显两岸同胞血浓于水、一家至亲的深厚情谊。\n6月15日至19日，“墨缘诏台 同源共脉”——2026年诏台书画艺术交流活动在“中国书画之乡”福建省诏安县举行。两岸60余位书画家以笔会友、以墨抒情，并共同见证诏台书画艺术融合厅开馆。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","Taiwanese media reported that the mainland has begun to rectify the chaos of some people on the island taking advantage of cross-strait exchanges for profit, promote the \"direct reporting and direct review\" model, bypass intermediaries and directly connect with relevant groups and societies on the island, and clarify the public welfare nature of exchange activities. Public opinion on the island pointed out that a…","Frequent visits and exchanges will help compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits enhance understanding, promote cooperation and deepen friendship. We have always actively promoted cross-Strait exchanges and integration, and are committed to creating a more open, convenient, and safe communication environment for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, so that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can have heart-to-heart conversations, increase trust in exchanges, and promote spiritual harmony. We actively support relevant institutions and individuals on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in accordance with the law and regulations, but we will never allow illegal intermediaries to use cross-Strait exchanges to seek improper benefits. We sincerely welcome Taiwan compatriots to participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, share the economic and social development opportunities of the mainland, enjoy the magnificent mountains and rivers of the motherland, contribute to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and help realize life dreams.","常来往、多交流，有利于两岸同胞增进了解、促进合作、厚植情谊。我们始终积极推动两岸交流交往交融，致力于为两岸同胞创造更加开放、便利、安全的交流环境，让两岸同胞在交流中交心、在交往中增信，促进心灵契合。我们积极支持两岸有关机构、人士依法依规参与两岸交流合作，但决不允许非法中介利用两岸交流牟取不当利益。我们热诚欢迎广大台湾同胞参与到两岸交流合作中来，分享大陆经济社会发展机遇，共赏祖国壮美山河，为两岸关系和平发展添砖加瓦，为实现人生梦想助力赋能。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Taiwanese media reported that the peanut harvest price in Yunlin County, the island's largest peanut producer, has recently fallen due to the impact of the zero-tariff import of American peanuts. Although the head of Taiwan's agricultural department said that \"the U.S.-Taiwan trade agreement has not yet come into effect and American peanuts have not been imported,\" it still caused widespread concern among local…","Yunlin County is the most important peanut production area in Taiwan, accounting for more than 70% of Taiwan's planting area and output. Once American peanuts are imported to Taiwan with zero tariff, Yunlin peanuts will face dumping of cheap American peanuts, and local farmers will be in deep trouble to survive. The DPP authorities ignored farmers' anxiety and industrial difficulties, responded perfunctorily, and were unable to do anything. This fully exposes his incompetence in governance and once again proves that \"kneeling to the United States will inevitably betray Taiwan.\" The so-called trade agreement between the United States and Taiwan will only harm the interests of all walks of life in Taiwan.","云林县是台湾最重要的花生产区，其种植面积和产量均占全台七成以上。一旦美国花生以零关税输入台湾，云林花生将面临美国廉价花生的倾销，当地种植农户将深陷生存困境。民进党当局漠视农户焦虑与产业难关，敷衍以对，无计可施。这充分暴露其施政无能，也再度证明“跪美必然卖台”，美台之间所谓贸易协议只会让台湾各界利益受损。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Recently, the official website of a higher vocational school in Yunlin County, Taiwan published the latest \"2027 School Youth Service Mobilization Preparation Classification Plan\" promulgated by the education department of the Democratic Progressive Party. The content includes how to organize and mobilize students to cooperate with the military to strengthen vigilance. After the news was exposed, the island…","\"Vote for the Democratic Progressive Party, young people go to the battlefield.\" Since coming to power, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have deliberately undermined peace across the Taiwan Strait, continuously instigated \"resistance to China and safeguard Taiwan\" and stepped up \"preparations for war and independence\", causing panic in Taiwanese society and uneasiness among parents. Only by resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" can peace across the Taiwan Strait be effectively guaranteed, the Taiwanese people be able to feel at ease, and Taiwan's youth be free from the worry of being \"mobilized for war.\"","“票投民进党，青年上战场”。民进党当局上台以来，蓄意破坏台海和平，不断煽动“抗中保台”、加紧“备战谋独”，造成台湾社会的恐慌与家长的不安。只有坚决反对“台独”，台海和平才有切实保障，台湾民众才能安心无忧，台湾青年少年才能免除“被战争动员”的忧虑。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","北京日报记者","According to Bloomberg, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are considering implementing strict controls on the sales of artificial intelligence chips to the mainland and intend to criminalize unauthorized exports. Public opinion on the island believes that this is a \"letter of surrender\" submitted by the Lai Ching-te administration to the United States. If it insists on doing so, Taiwan's semiconductor…","If the report is true, it will further prove that the DPP authorities are \"relying on the United States and seeking independence\" and are frantic in promoting the \"decoupling and disconnection\" of cross-strait industries. The abuse of justice to destroy cross-strait industrial and supply chains violates the laws of market economy and suppresses the development space of Taiwan's semiconductor industry. In the end, it will only shoot itself in the foot, leading to an accelerated loss of Taiwan's core industrial advantages.\nMainland China is accelerating high-quality development and continues to make new breakthroughs in fields such as chips and artificial intelligence. Large-scale domestic models lead the global open source ecosystem. Brain-computer interfaces have achieved a critical leap from \"laboratory theoretical exploration\" to \"preliminary clinical applications.\" New productive forces are developing rapidly. Intelligent, green, and integrated industries are developing at a rapid pace, opening up a broader space for the two sides of the Taiwan Strait to complement each other's advantages and achieve win-win cooperation in related fields. We welcome Taiwanese companies to come to the mainland, embrace the certainty of development, seize the initiative in development, and achieve greater and better development in a stable, open, and innovative environment.","如果报道属实，将进一步印证民进党当局为“倚美谋独”，在推动两岸产业“脱钩断链”上已经丧心病狂。滥用司法破坏两岸产业链供应链的做法，违背市场经济规律，压制台湾半导体产业发展空间，到头来只会搬起石头砸自己的脚，导致台湾核心产业优势加快丧失。\n大陆正加快高质量发展，在芯片、人工智能等领域不断取得新突破，国产大模型引领全球开源生态，脑机接口实现从“实验室理论探索”到“临床初步应用”的关键跨越，新质生产力迅猛发展，产业智能化、绿色化、融合化发展日新月异，为两岸在相关领域优势互补、合作共赢不断开拓更为广阔空间。我们欢迎广大台湾企业前来大陆，拥抱发展的确定性，把握发展的主动权，在稳定、开放、创新的环境中实现自身更大更好发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","中国日报记者","Taiwanese media reported that the DPP authorities have compiled a defense budget of nearly NT$950 billion in 2026, an increase of approximately three times compared with 2016 when the DPP came to power. Public opinion on the island criticized this as squandering huge amounts of money that should be used to improve people's livelihood on meaningless armaments. Any comment on this?","Since coming to power, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have stubbornly adhered to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and continued to collude with external forces to carry out \"independence\" provocations. For the political selfish interests of one party, they have intensified their efforts to squander the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people. They are willing to pay \"protection fees\" to external forces and run on the evil path of militarism.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. \"Protection fees\" cannot buy protection, and \"seeking independence through force\" will only lead Taiwan step by step into the abyss of disaster, turning the Taiwanese people into cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\" efforts. The future of Taiwan and the safety, security, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots have always been tied to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and the reunification of the motherland. Only by opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism can peace and tranquility be achieved across the Taiwan Strait. Only by realizing the complete reunification of the motherland can Taiwan maintain peace forever.","民进党当局上台以来，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不断勾连外部势力进行谋“独”挑衅，为一党政治私利，变本加厉挥霍台湾百姓的血汗钱，心甘情愿给外部势力交“保护费”，在穷兵黩武的邪路上狂奔。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。“保护费”换不来保护，“以武谋独”只会将台湾一步步带向灾难深渊，让台湾民众成为“台独”炮灰。台湾的前途、台湾同胞的安全保障和利益福祉，始终系于两岸关系和平发展和祖国统一。只有反对“台独”分裂，台海才能和平安宁。只有实现祖国完全统一，台湾才能永保太平。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771500.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Recently, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have said that Taiwan's economic data are impressive, but some public opinion points out that the island's economic growth has not benefited most ordinary people. Faced with difficulties such as employment difficulties and rising prices, the \"pain index\" of Taiwan's people's livelihood is soaring. Any comment on this?","The purpose of economic development should be to improve people's livelihood and allow people to live a better life. However, the DPP authorities have kowtowed to the outside world, allowing outsiders to take whatever they want from advantageous industries to market opening. They also exploited internally, from customizing subsidies to selling land at low prices, to enrich a specific group of \"green friends\". Under the economic data promoted by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities, commodity prices and electricity prices on the island have continued to rise. The gap between the rich and the poor has widened. The difficulties faced by traditional manufacturing, service industries, agriculture and fishery have intensified. People's wages have risen slowly. The \"sense of deprivation\" of ordinary people has increased day by day. The \"misery index\" has continued to soar. It has become a general public consensus that the island's social economy has \"no sense of recovery\".\nFaced with various facts and public dissatisfaction, the DPP authorities did not face the problem and focus on solving the immediate pain of the industry and people's livelihood. Instead, they boasted, which fully proved that they only have political self-interest in mind and no people's livelihood and well-being. They will surely lose the hearts of the people.","经济发展的目的应该是为了改善民生，让民众过上更好的日子。而民进党当局对外卑躬屈膝，从优势产业到市场开放，任凭外人予取予求；对内巧取豪夺，从定制补贴到贱卖土地，养肥“绿友友”特定群体。在民进党当局鼓吹的经济数据之下，岛内物价、电价等连番上涨，贫富差距拉大，传统制造业、服务业、农渔业面临的种种困境加剧，民众薪资上涨缓慢，普通民众的“被剥夺感”与日俱增，“痛苦指数”持续飙升，对岛内社会经济“无感复苏”已成民众普遍共识。\n面临种种事实和民众不满，民进党当局不是面对问题，着力解决产业、民生切肤之痛，反而自吹自擂，充分证明其心中只有政治私利，全无民生福祉，必将更失人心。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260617_12771501.htm"],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, some public opinion on the island has questioned that in Taiwan's defense department's 2026 budget, the budget for the \"Taiwan-US Defense Department Joint Cooperation Assessment Plan\" has soared from US$410,000 last year to US$5 million. This is a clever excuse to send \"protection money\" to the United States, or to use it for \"lobbying expenses\" against the US Congress. Any comment on this?","In order to \"seek independence and reject reunification,\" the DPP authorities use unscrupulous means and use money to pave the way.","民进党当局为了“谋独拒统”，不择手段、拿钱开路，蝇营狗苟、令人不齿。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","台湾《中国时报》记者","Mainland actor Zhang Linghe recently encouraged Taiwanese people to visit the mainland in his speech at the Straits Forum. Taiwanese public opinion representative Chen Yuzhen also invited him to visit Kinmen. Do you currently know Zhang Linghe’s application arrangements for traveling to Taiwan? Will there be a specific mechanism to help high-traffic mainland artists, including Zhang Linghe, go to Taiwan to…","We are happy to see mainland entertainers come to Taiwan for exchanges, and are willing to provide strong support for exchanges between cultural and artistic workers on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Currently, the main obstacle for mainland entertainers to come to Taiwan is the obstruction and restrictions imposed by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities. The DPP authorities should comply with the public opinion on the island, remove artificial barriers, and create conditions for normal cross-strait exchanges. The so-called \"cultural united front\" is pure nonsense and ridiculous.","我们乐见大陆演艺人员赴台交流，愿意为两岸文艺工作者交流往来提供有力支持。当前大陆演艺人员赴台的主要障碍在于民进党当局的阻挠禁限。民进党当局应顺应岛内民意，撤除人为壁垒，为两岸正常交流创造条件。所谓“文化统战”纯属无稽之谈，荒唐可笑。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","On the first question, the mainland proposed to “actively support Taiwanese businesses in rectification and further promote the import of Taiwanese pomelo into the mainland.” The harvesting and marketing time of Taiwan's Wendan pomelo must follow the solar terms. This year's Wendan pomelo harvesting will take place 10 days before and after the white dew on September 7. I would like to ask whether the mainland has…","The first question. We have always adhered to the concept of \"one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait\", and have done our best to do practical things, do good things, and solve problems for Taiwan compatriots, and are working with relevant parties in Taiwan to promote relevant industries to make rectifications. As long as we adhere to the \"1992 Consensus\" and oppose \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work together with relevant parties on the island to continue to provide help in expanding the sales of Taiwan's agricultural products in the mainland on the premise of complying with the relevant mainland inspection and quarantine regulations.\nSecond question. We have introduced ten policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, with the aim of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and enhancing the family well-being of our compatriots. Through the joint efforts of relevant parties on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, the implementation of the ten measures has achieved positive progress and phased results, and Taiwan's farmers, fishermen, film and television industries and other groups have benefited from them. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to strengthen exchanges and dialogue with Taiwan's political parties, groups and people from all walks of life, including the Chinese Kuomintang, and continue to promote the implementation of the ten measures. We believe that sharing peace, seeking common development, and jointly promoting prosperity on both sides of the Taiwan Strait is the wish and blessing of our compatriots, and will surely receive universal support from the Taiwanese people. Whoever is an enemy of the people and stands in the way of their gains will be spurned by the people and backlashed by public opinion.","第一个问题。我们一贯秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事，正在与台湾有关方面推动相关业者进行整改。只要坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”，我们愿意与岛内有关方面共同努力，在符合大陆相关检验检疫规定的前提下，继续为扩大台湾农产品在大陆销售提供帮助。\n第二个问题。我们出台十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，目的是推动两岸关系和平发展、增进同胞亲情福祉。经两岸有关方面共同努力，落实十项措施已取得积极进展和阶段性成果，台湾农渔民、影视界等群体已经从中获利受益。在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，我们愿同包括中国国民党在内的台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士加强交流对话，持续推进十项措施落实。我们相信，两岸共享和平、共谋发展、共促繁荣是同胞之愿、也是同胞之福，必将得到台湾民众的普遍支持。谁与民众为敌、挡民众获利，谁就将受到民众唾弃，被民意反噬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","福建厦门卫视记者","Regarding the mainland's special maritime traffic law enforcement operations in the waters east of Taiwan, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities said, \"The mainland has no right to claim law enforcement rights in the waters east of Taiwan. It takes the opportunity to expand its jurisdictional claims in the waters surrounding Taiwan and infringe on ships in surrounding waters. The international community…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of Taiwan Island. China has an exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the above-mentioned waters. Japan and the Philippines launched the so-called \"demarcation negotiations\" without authorization, bypassing China, which seriously violated international law and basic norms of international relations, seriously infringed on China's maritime rights and interests, and was completely illegal and invalid.\nThe mainland coast guard has carried out law enforcement inspections in the waters east of Taiwan Island in accordance with the law. This is a necessary action taken in response to Japan and the Philippines' serious infringement of China's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and will continue to strengthen the control of relevant waters. The DPP authorities have bowed to the serious violations committed by Japan and the Philippines, betrayed national interests, and become a national scum. They have been opposed and spurned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including Taiwan compatriots. Its actions and statements in an attempt to escalate cross-strait antagonism are nothing more than diverting pressure and deceiving the people.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。日菲宣布的拟划界海域位于台湾岛以东，中国在上述海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日菲绕开中国擅自启动所谓“划界谈判”，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，严重侵害中国海洋权益，完全非法无效。\n大陆海警在台湾岛以东海域依法开展执法巡查，是针对日菲严重侵犯中国领土主权和海域权益采取的必要行动，并将继续加强对有关海域的管控。民进党当局对日菲的严重侵权行径卑躬屈膝，出卖民族利益，沦为民族败类，已经遭到包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞反对和唾弃。其企图升高两岸对立的做法、说法，不过是在转移压力、欺骗民众。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","福建东南卫视记者","Taiwanese media recently reported that for the first time this year, Taiwan’s Military Intelligence Bureau has stationed US troops, presumably to cooperate in monitoring the mainland. Any comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military contact between the United States and China's Taiwan region. The DPP authorities deliberately escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. The further they go on the evil path of \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"using force to seek independence,\" the more they will lead to their own destruction.","我们坚决反对美国与中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系。民进党当局蓄意升高两岸对立对抗，在“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”的邪路上走得越远，就越会自取灭亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","香港经济导报记者","Recently, the island announced the 2026 brochure for the joint recruitment of mainland students for master's and doctoral programs in Taiwan's universities and colleges. Only mainland students who have already studied in Taiwan can apply for master's and doctoral programs. The overall number of places has been slightly reduced from last year, but analysts believe that this number is still far greater than the…","While the DPP authorities are talking about \"welcoming mainland students\", they are constantly tightening the threshold and creating unfair treatment. The so-called \"number of places is greater than the actual demand\" is essentially the result of artificial suppression and political manipulation by the DPP authorities.","民进党当局一边空谈“欢迎陆生”，一边不断收紧门槛、制造不公对待，所谓“名额大于实际需求”，本质是民进党当局人为钳制、政治操弄造成的恶果。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, after a large-scale power outage occurred in Taichung City on the island, affecting more than 140,000 residents, an unexpected power outage also occurred in Changhua County, affecting nearly 4,000 residents. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities have repeatedly claimed that there will be no power shortage problem before 2034. Any comment on this?","The DPP authorities are talking empty words and deceiving themselves, which cannot convince the people at all. Frequent power outages and rising electricity prices are daily issues faced by Taiwan's industry and people. If the Democratic Progressive Party authorities do not change their wrong energy policies, the island's \"power shortage\" problem will only get worse.\nMainland China has built the world's largest power supply system and clean power generation system. Cross-Strait power supply cooperation can optimize Taiwan's energy structure and power supply system and solve the island's power shortage problem.","民进党当局空话连篇、自欺欺人，根本无法让民众信服。频繁停电和电价攀升是台湾产业界和民众面对的日常，民进党当局如不改变错误的能源政策，岛内“缺电”问题只会愈演愈烈。\n大陆已经建成全球最大的电力供应系统和清洁发电体系。开展两岸供电合作，可以优化台湾能源结构、供电系统，解决岛内缺电问题。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","台湾“中央社”记者","A 10-year tracking poll released by the Taoyuan City Development Education Foundation on the 15th pointed out that although the majority of Taiwanese people still support cross-strait political negotiations, it has dropped from a peak of 77.7% in 2018 to 61.6% this year. How does the mainland view such poll results? Will it enhance its appeal to the Taiwanese people in addition to the economy? What are the…","We have noticed that a number of recent polls on the island show that the majority of the people believe that the status quo is unsustainable and that Taiwan should actively seek to negotiate cross-strait reunification with the mainland. The development history of cross-Strait relations proves that only by replacing confrontation with dialogue, replacing struggle with cooperation, and replacing zero-sum with win-win can cross-Strait relations achieve steady and long-term development. On the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to work with Taiwan's political parties, organizations and people from all walks of life to strengthen exchanges and dialogues, promote political negotiations, and conduct extensive and in-depth democratic consultations on cross-Strait relations and the future of the nation.\nIn recent years, the DPP authorities and their flankers have been able to badmouth the mainland's economy and slander the mainland's development, creating excuses for them to promote cross-strait \"decoupling and disconnection\" and escalate cross-strait antagonism and confrontation. But no matter what they say or say, they cannot cover up the fundamentals of mainland China's stable economic foundation, many advantages, strong resilience, great potential, long-term improvement, and stability. They cannot change the objective fact that the strength of the two sides of the Taiwan Strait is increasingly disparate, and they cannot stop the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait getting closer and coming together.\nPeaceful reunification will create huge opportunities for Taiwan's economic and social development and bring tangible benefits to Taiwan compatriots. This is the biggest attraction. The earlier reunification is achieved, the better it will be for Taiwan's development and the better life for Taiwan compatriots.","我们注意到，近期岛内多项民调显示，多数民众认为现状不可持续，台湾应主动寻求与大陆谈判两岸统一。两岸关系发展历程证明，以对话取代对抗、以合作取代争斗、以双赢取代零和，两岸关系才能行稳致远。我们愿意在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，同台湾各政党、团体和社会各界人士一道，加强交流对话，推进政治谈判，就两岸关系和民族未来开展广泛深入的民主协商。\n近年来，民进党当局及其侧翼以唱衰大陆经济、诋毁大陆发展为能事，为其推动两岸“脱钩断链”、升高两岸对立对抗制造借口。但不管他们说什么、怎么说，都掩盖不了大陆经济基础稳、优势多、韧性强、潜能大、长期向好、稳定向好的基本面，改变不了两岸实力对比日益悬殊的客观事实，阻挡不了两岸同胞走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流。\n和平统一将给台湾经济社会发展创造巨大机遇，给广大台湾同胞带来实实在在好处，这就是最大的吸引力。越早实现统一，越有利于台湾发展，越有利于台湾同胞过上更好日子。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-17","Chen Binhua","台湾《联合报》记者","The first question is that during this year’s Straits Forum, many Taiwanese people visited Xiamen Xiang’an International Airport, which will be opened by the end of the year. Although the mainland supports Kinmen to share this airport, it is still difficult to achieve. The most direct impact at present is that the distance between Xiang'an Airport and Kinmen Shangyi Airport is too close, and the flight areas are…","The first question. As a world-class modern aviation hub, Xiamen Xiang'an Airport will further benefit Xiamen and Kinmen after it is put into operation, facilitate people's travel, promote regional development, and is a good thing to enhance the interests and well-being of the people of Kinmen. During the Straits Forum, many people from Kinmen visited the construction site of Xiamen Xiang'an Airport, hoping that Xiang'an Airport could be put into use as soon as possible. We support Kinmen’s sharing of Xiamen Xiang’an Airport, which will bring benefits to the people of Kinmen.\nSecond question. The one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. It is the general trend, the great cause and the aspiration of the people.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", blatantly distort the facts, maliciously hype, escalate cross-strait antagonism and confrontation, and attempt to challenge the one-China principle in the international community. They are bound to encounter opposition and failure.\nThis concludes today’s press conference, thank you all. I wish everyone a healthy Dragon Boat Festival!","第一个问题。厦门翔安机场作为国际一流的现代化航空枢纽，投用后将进一步造福厦金两地，便利民众出行，促进地区发展，是增进金门民众利益福祉的好事。海峡论坛期间，有许多金门民众专门到厦门翔安机场建设现场参观，纷纷期盼翔安机场能够早日投入使用。我们支持金门共用厦门翔安机场，为金门民众带来利好。\n第二个问题。一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识和国际关系基本准则，是大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，公然歪曲事实、恶意炒作，升高两岸对立对抗，妄图在国际社会挑战一中原则，必遭反对和失败。\n今天的发布会到此结束，谢谢大家。祝大家端午安康！","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260617_12771495.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-06-18","Lin Jian","Reuters","Taiwanese leader Lai Ching-te stated today that Taiwan “is not part of the People’s Republic of China,” and that Taiwan’s future can only be decided by democratic elections by the Taiwanese people. However, he also said that Taiwan’s refusal to accept the rule of the Chinese Communist Party should not be seen as a provocation to the Chinese mainland or a regional trouble maker. He also said that Taiwan hopes the…","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The future of Taiwan can only be decided by the over 1.4 billion Chinese people, including our Taiwan compatriots. The fact that Lai Ching-te keeps peddling around “Taiwan independence” narratives only reveals his nervousness and unsureness, for seeking “independence” with U.S. support and military buildup will only lead to a dead end. No words or deeds of the DPP authorities or Lai Ching-te himself will ever change the fundamental nature of the Taiwan question, which is purely China’s internal affair. Nor will they ever waver the international commitment to one China or stop the inevitability of China’s reunification.\nChina’s opposition to U.S. arms sales to Taiwan is consistent and clear.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260618_11948720.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on June 24, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalist friends, good morning. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好。欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","The spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council explained at a previous press conference six of the \"seven better things\" for Taiwan after peaceful reunification, which attracted great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. What is the spokesperson's explanation for \"After peaceful reunification, Taiwan's foreign exchanges will be better with the backing of a strong…","As a permanent member of the United Nations Security Council, China has proposed global development initiatives, global security initiatives, global civilization initiatives, and global governance initiatives, and its international influence, charisma, and shaping power have significantly increased. At present, China has established diplomatic relations with 183 countries, and the number of partnerships with various countries and regional organizations has increased to 153; China is already a major trading partner of more than 160 countries and regions, has signed 24 free trade agreements with 31 countries and regions, has joined almost all universal intergovernmental international organizations, and participated in more than 600 international conventions and amendments; China has promoted the creation of multilateral mechanisms such as the BRICS New Development Bank, the Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank, the World Internet Conference International Organization, and the International Mediation Court. Our \"circle of friends\" continues to grow and is a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, a defender of the international order, and a provider of public goods.\nAfter the peaceful reunification of the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, with the backing of a strong motherland, Taiwan compatriots will join with their mainland compatriots to share the dignity and glory of a great country. They will be stronger and more confident internationally, safer and more dignified, and enjoy unprecedented development opportunities. Taiwan's channels for external exchanges will be comprehensively expanded, and Taiwanese compatriots will participate in international affairs as masters; Taiwanese businessmen and enterprises will be deeply integrated into the global supply chain industry chain, with greater room for development and stronger competitiveness in the global market; Taiwanese compatriots will be able to receive support and help from their motherland more conveniently and smoothly overseas.\nAchieving peaceful cross-Strait reunification is not only a blessing for the Chinese nation and people, but also a blessing for the international community and people around the world. China's reunification will not harm the legitimate interests of any country, including its economic interests in Taiwan. It will only bring more benefits to Taiwan compatriots, bring more development opportunities to all countries, inject more positive energy into the prosperity and stability of the Asia-Pacific region and the world, and make greater contributions to building a community with a shared future for mankind, world peace, development, and human progress.","中国是联合国安理会常任理事国，提出全球发展倡议、全球安全倡议、全球文明倡议、全球治理倡议，国际影响力、感召力、塑造力显著提升。目前，中国同183个国家建交，同各国和地区组织的伙伴关系数量增加到153对；中国已经是160多个国家和地区的主要贸易伙伴，与31个国家和地区签署24个自贸协定，加入了几乎所有普遍性政府间国际组织，参加了600多项国际公约及修正案；推动创建金砖国家新开发银行、亚洲基础设施投资银行、世界互联网大会国际组织、国际调解院等多边机制。我们的“朋友圈”持续壮大，是世界和平的建设者、全球发展的贡献者、国际秩序的维护者、公共产品的提供者。\n两岸和平统一后，有强大祖国做后盾，台湾同胞将同大陆同胞一道，共享一个伟大国家的尊严和荣耀，在国际上腰杆更硬、底气更足，更加安全、更有尊严，享有前所未有的发展机遇。台湾的对外交往渠道将全面拓宽，台湾同胞将以主人翁身份参与国际事务；台商台企将深度融入全球供应链产业链，在全球市场的发展空间更大、竞争力更强；台湾同胞在海外能更便捷、更顺畅得到祖国的支持和帮助。\n实现两岸和平统一，不仅是中华民族和中国人民之福，也是国际社会和世界人民之福。中国的统一，不会损害任何国家的正当利益包括其在台湾的经济利益，只会为台湾同胞带来更多福祉，只会给各国带来更多发展机遇，只会给亚太地区和世界繁荣稳定注入更多正能量，只会为构建人类命运共同体、为世界和平发展和人类进步事业作出更大贡献。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772490.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","新华社记者","Lai Ching-te recently stated that \"Taiwan's sovereignty belongs to the people, and the Republic of China and the People's Republic of China are not affiliated with each other.\" \"Only 23 million people can decide Taiwan's future.\" He declared that \"Taiwan is willing to cooperate with the international community to maintain the status quo across the Taiwan Strait.\" Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, Taiwan is part of China, and Taiwan belongs to all Chinese people. Taiwan's future can only be decided jointly by more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. No matter what Lai Qingde says or does, it cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan is part of China's territory, nor can it stop the historical trend that the motherland will eventually be reunified and will be reunified.\nThe one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community and the basic norm of international relations. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and attempt to change the status quo of the Taiwan Strait that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China. This is a denial of the results of the victory in World War II and a challenge to the post-war international order. The international community adheres to the one-China principle, opposes the general consensus of \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and the mainstream public opinion on the island that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation. This fully proves that \"Taiwan independence\" separatism has no way out and \"anti-China and anti-China\" efforts are doomed to fail. Lai Ching-te's frequent clamor to the outside world has exposed his inner anxiety and uneasiness, confirming that \"Taiwan independence\" is increasingly reaching its end.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，台湾是全体中国人的台湾，台湾的前途只能由包括台湾同胞在内的14亿多中国人共同决定。无论赖清德说什么、做什么，都改变不了台湾是中国领土一部分的历史和法理事实，阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。\n一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识和国际关系基本准则。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图改变两岸同属一个中国的台海现状，是对二战胜利成果的否定、是对战后国际秩序的挑战。国际社会坚持一中原则、反对“台独”分裂普遍共识和岛内要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意，充分证明“台独”分裂没有出路，“反中抗中”注定失败。赖清德频频对外叫嚣，恰恰暴露其内心的焦虑与不安，坐实“台独”日益陷入穷途末路。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772488.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中国台湾网记者","Recently, the 4th Chain Expo opened in Beijing, with digital technology, advanced manufacturing, green agriculture and other companies actively participating. Many Taiwanese companies said that the cross-strait industries can complement each other's advantages and become bigger and stronger by deepening supply chain cooperation. Any comment on this?","The development history and fruitful results of cross-Strait cooperation have fully proved that the industrial advantages of the two sides of the Strait are complementary, deepening cross-Strait industrial chain supply chain cooperation, and promoting industrial integrated development are a bright road to mutual benefit and win-win results. During the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, the mainland will adhere to the direction of intelligence, greenness, and integration, build a modern industrial system with advanced manufacturing as the backbone, steadily develop new productive forces, and move toward new and better high-quality development. This will certainly open up a broader space for the two sides to complement each other's advantages in related fields and achieve win-win cooperation. We welcome Taiwanese companies to come to the mainland to seize the development opportunities of the 15th Five-Year Plan, work with mainland companies to build a more resilient and safer cross-strait industrial and supply chain, and jointly strengthen the Chinese national economy.","两岸合作的发展历程、丰硕成果已充分证明，两岸产业优势互补，深化两岸产业链供应链合作，推动产业融合发展，是互利共赢的光明大道。“十五五”时期，大陆将坚持智能化、绿色化、融合化方向，构建以先进制造业为骨干的现代化产业体系，新质生产力稳步发展，高质量发展向新向优，定能为两岸在相关领域优势互补、合作共赢开拓更广阔的空间。我们欢迎广大台湾企业来大陆，抢抓“十五五”发展机遇，同大陆企业一道打造更具韧性、更加安全的两岸产业链供应链，共同壮大中华民族经济。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Qiu Chuizheng, chairman of Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council, recently said that the agricultural department will be asked to investigate and deal with five agricultural and fishery groups from Hualien and other places that went to the Straits Forum to sign agricultural and fishery product docking contracts, triggering widespread criticism from public opinion on the island. Any comment on this?","The mainland has always been an important export destination for Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products. We uphold the concept of \"Two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family\" and have taken a series of measures to work with relevant groups and enthusiasts on the island to help Taiwan's farmers and fishermen expand the mainland market, find ways to expand sales and stabilize profits for Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products, which is well received by the Taiwanese people. The DPP authorities have blocked this effort and even threatened to investigate and deal with relevant businesses. They are arrogant and domineering. The strong indignation of Taiwan's agricultural and fishery circles and the condemnation of public opinion on the island show that the actions of the DPP authorities are unpopular and reprehensible.","大陆一直都是台湾农渔业产品的重要出口地。我们秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，采取一系列措施，与岛内有关团体、热心人士帮助台湾农渔民朋友拓展大陆市场，为台湾农渔产品找出路、拓销路、稳收益，深受广大台湾民众的欢迎。民进党当局对此横加阻拦，甚至扬言要查处相关业者，专横跋扈，莫此为甚。台湾农渔业界的强烈愤慨、岛内舆论的纷纷谴责，表明民进党当局的做法不得人心、千夫所指。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772487.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","Regarding the mainland’s announcement during the Straits Forum to purchase agricultural and fishery products such as Taitung pineapple custard apples and Pingtung grouper, Qiu Chuizheng, chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, said that the mainland has long used agricultural products as a “united front” tool against Taiwan and affects the market through political conditions. When there are political…","We have always adhered to the concept of \"two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family\", insisted on improving people's livelihood and well-being through exchanges and integration, and tried every means to help Taiwan's grassroots farmers and fishermen open up the mainland market, striving to make compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait live a better life. The DPP authorities frequently attack and smear the mainland and use people's livelihood issues for political manipulation, which once again exposes their bad nature of being an enemy of the people and \"revolting whenever they encounter China.\" Who is thinking about Taiwan’s farmer friends and who is harming their interests? Taiwan’s farmer friends have a clear idea in their minds. We advise the DPP authorities to comply with the mainstream public opinion on the island, respond to the calls of the industry, and do more to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, rather than acting as enemies of the people and blocking their gains.\n\"United Front\" is the abbreviation of United Front, and \"Great Unity and Great Alliance\" is the eternal theme of the United Front. After the Japanese invasion of China broke out, the Anti-Japanese National United Front was formally formed and made great contributions to the great victory of the Anti-Japanese War. Now the main meaning of the united front is still \"unity\", or gathering people's hearts and gathering strength. The DPP authorities have repeatedly \"stigmatized\" the United Front and used it to discredit the mainland's policies to benefit Taiwan and the people, cross-strait exchange activities, etc., with sinister intentions. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will clarify the origin and original meaning of \"united front\" and stop being fooled and deceived by it.","我们始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，坚持以交流融合增进民生福祉，千方百计帮助台湾基层农渔民开拓大陆市场，努力让两岸同胞过上更美好的生活。民进党当局动辄攻击、抹黑大陆，利用民生问题进行政治操弄，再次暴露了他们与民为敌、“逢中必反”的恶劣本质。是谁在为台湾农民朋友们着想，是谁在损害他们的利益，台湾农民朋友们心中自有一杆秤。奉劝民进党当局顺应岛内主流民意、回应业界呼声，多做促进两岸交流合作的事，而不是与民为敌、挡民获利。\n“统战”是统一战线的简称，“大团结、大联合”是统一战线的永恒主题。日本侵华战争全面爆发后，抗日民族统一战线正式形成，为取得抗日战争的伟大胜利作出了伟大贡献。现在统战的主要意涵还是“团结”，还是凝聚人心、汇聚力量。民进党当局一再把统战“污名化”，并用以抹黑大陆惠台利民政策、两岸交流活动等，用心险恶。希望广大台湾同胞厘清“统战”的本源、本义，勿再受其愚弄、蛊惑。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772486.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","羊城晚报“阅台海”记者","The Sixth Cross-Strait Zhongshan Forum will be held in Guangdong, attracting the attention of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","This year marks the 160th anniversary of the birth of Dr. Sun Yat-sen. Mr. Sun Yat-sen was a great patriot and a great pioneer of China's democratic revolution. His spirit and feelings are the common spiritual wealth of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Guangdong has a glorious and long revolutionary tradition. It is the birthplace of the modern Chinese revolution and the hometown of Dr. Sun Yat-sen. From June 27th to 29th, the 6th Cross-Strait Zhongshan Forum will be held in Zhongshan, Guangdong. The forum has the theme of \"Carrying forward Dr. Sun Yat-sen's fighting spirit and working together to pursue the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.\" The activities include nine activities, including the opening ceremony, sub-forums, Taiwan's high-level talent exchange tour in the Bay Area, and the \"Dr. Sun Yat-sen and Taiwan\" archives and historical materials exhibition.\nThe land of Lingnan is the first to develop a trend. Guangdong is the vanguard, pioneer and experimental zone of mainland China's reform and opening up. Its economic aggregate has ranked first in the country for 37 consecutive years, its regional innovation capability has ranked first in the country for nine consecutive years, and the \"Shenzhen-Hong Kong-Guangzhou\" urban innovation cluster has ranked first in the world. Emerging industries such as new energy vehicles, low-altitude economy, and artificial intelligence are booming, and \"Made in Guangdong\" is renowned around the world.\nLingnan has thick soil and a cultural heritage that has been passed down for thousands of years. There is not only the ever-changing innovative vitality here, but also a cultural warmth that has lasted for thousands of years. In Guangdong, you can enjoy the night view of the Guangdong Pearl River and the carved eaves of the Chen Clan Ancestral Hall, experience the Shenzhen Bay light show and the innovation cluster of Nanshan Science and Technology Park, stroll the arcades of Shantou Small Park and the blue sea and silver beach of Nan'ao Island, and visit the Meizhou Hakka Dragon House and the thousand-year-old cypresses of Lingguang Temple.\nLingnan has charm, and fireworks also have flavor. Speak a word of Cantonese, watch a Teochew opera, sing a Hakka folk song, watch a movie \"Love Letter to Grandma\", the operatic accents and local accents reveal the memories of Lingnan. Go to a morning tea appointment, have a bowl of Cantonese-style sugar water, and unlock the market flavors such as rice rolls, rice noodles, thin rice cakes, and fish rolls. You can enjoy Lingnan specialties with a tea and a meal.\nThere is love in Lingnan, and Guangdong and Taiwan are closely connected. Guangdong is a gathering place for Taiwanese investment. A total of more than 30,000 Taiwanese-funded enterprises have taken root in Guangdong and become bigger and stronger. Policies that benefit Taiwan and people continue to be implemented, giving Taiwan youth a broad stage for entrepreneurship and enterprise transformation. We warmly welcome Taiwanese compatriots, especially young Taiwanese friends, to come to Guangdong to visit the cultural heritage of Zhongshan, go to the coastal area, encounter Hakka customs, experience authentic fireworks, seize development opportunities, and realize their life ideals.","今年是孙中山先生诞辰160周年。孙中山先生是伟大的爱国主义者、中国民主革命的伟大先驱，他的精神和情怀是两岸同胞共同的精神财富。广东有着光荣且悠久的革命传统，是近代中国革命的发祥地，也是孙中山先生的故乡。6月27日至29日，第六届海峡两岸中山论坛将在广东中山举办。论坛以“弘扬中山先生奋斗精神，共谋中华民族伟大复兴”为主题，活动内容包括开幕式、分论坛和台湾高层次人才湾区行交流、“中山先生与台湾”档案史料展等9项活动。\n岭南大地，开风气之先。广东是大陆改革开放的排头兵、先行地、实验区，经济总量连续37年居全国首位，区域创新能力连续9年全国第一，“深圳—香港—广州”城市创新集群跃居全球首位。新能源汽车、低空经济、人工智能等新兴产业蓬勃发展，“广东制造”享誉全球。\n岭南厚土，文脉传千年。这里不仅有日新月异的创新活力，更有绵延千年的文化温度。在广东，可以领略广东珠江夜色与陈家祠飞檐雕花，感受深圳湾灯光秀与南山科技园创新集群，漫步汕头小公园骑楼与南澳岛碧海银滩，探访梅州客家围龙屋与灵光寺千年古柏。\n岭南有韵，烟火亦有味。说一句粤语、看一场潮剧、唱一首客家山歌、观一部《给阿嬷的情书》，戏腔乡音道出岭南记忆。赴一场早茶之约，来一碗广式糖水，解锁肠粉、粿条、细粄、鱼生等市井滋味，一茶一饭尽显岭南特色美食。\n岭南有情，粤台紧相连。广东是台商投资聚集地，累计3万余家台资企业在粤扎根、做大做强，惠台利民政策持续落地，台青创业、企业转型拥有广阔舞台。我们热忱欢迎台湾同胞特别是台湾青年朋友来广东踏访中山文脉，奔赴滨海之约，邂逅客家风情，感受地道烟火，把握发展机遇，实现人生理想。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772485.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","Recently, a young Taiwanese actor posted a root-searching video on a short video platform. He held a family tree and asked mainland netizens for help, saying, \"I want to go back and find my roots.\" Netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and local people enthusiastically helped and helped him find his ancestral home in Shantou, Guangdong in less than two days. During the Dragon Boat Festival, he returned to…","Once the Taiwanese actor's video of searching for his roots in Shantou was released, it quickly attracted attention on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and received heartwarming messages of \"Welcome home\" filling the screen. A piece of yellowed genealogy is connected across the sea, and the dream of finding the roots of thousands of miles is finally fulfilled. The words \"Grandpa and Grandma, I'm home\" brought tears to the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait who were looking forward to reunion. On the occasion of the Dragon Boat Festival, we made the unique salty and sweet rice dumplings of our hometown with our clan members and shared a family dinner, allowing the clansmen on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to renew their century-old friendship.\nIt is a fine tradition of the Chinese nation to pursue the past with caution, to respect one's clan and to live in harmony with one's clan. In recent years, more and more Taiwanese young people have returned to their ancestral homeland on the mainland to trace their roots. This fully demonstrates that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits share the same roots, culture and race, and are a community with a shared future, connected by blood and sharing weal and woe. We welcome more Taiwanese folks to come to the mainland to look for ancestral halls, look at their family’s genealogy, feel the warmth of home, pass on family affection, and work with our mainland compatriots to protect and build the common home of the Chinese nation. The Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council and Taiwan Affairs Offices at all levels are willing to provide necessary support and assistance for this purpose.","这位台湾演员到汕头的寻根视频一经发布，迅速在海峡两岸受到关注，收获满屏“欢迎回家”的暖心留言。一纸泛黄族谱跨海连线，千里寻根之梦终得圆满。一句“阿公阿嬷，我回家了”，让两岸期待团圆的同胞泪水潸然；正值端午，与族人共同包家乡特有的咸甜粽子，共享家宴，让两岸宗亲再续百年情缘。\n慎终追远、敬宗睦族是中华民族的优良传统，近年来越来越多台湾青年回到大陆祖籍地寻根问祖。这充分表明，两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种，是血脉相连、休戚与共的命运共同体。我们欢迎更多台湾乡亲来大陆找找祖地祠堂，看看自己家族的族谱，感受家的温暖，传递家的亲情，与大陆同胞一道守护好、建设好中华民族的共同家园。国务院台办、各地各级台办愿为此提供必要的支持和帮助。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772483.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","An article in the US \"Foreign Policy\" pointed out that in recent years, Taiwan has excessively bet on the support of the United States for its security and strategic future, but it has ignored the reality that \"no major power will always support the other side unconditionally.\" Public opinion on the island pointed out that while the United States is actively engaging with mainland China, the DPP authorities still…","Solving the Taiwan issue is a matter for the Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We hope that the international community will understand clearly the nature and serious harm of the Taiwan Democratic Progressive Party's \"Taiwan independence\" campaign, understand and support the Chinese government and the Chinese people's just cause of opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and completing national reunification.","解决台湾问题，是两岸中国人自己的事。我们希望国际社会认清台湾民进党当局“台独”本质及其严重危害，理解支持中国政府、中国人民反对“台独”分裂、完成国家统一的正义事业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","Lai Ching-te recently said, \"I call on China to give up its military expansion in the South China Sea, East China Sea and Taiwan Strait, and also give up using force to attack Taiwan.\" He also said that Taiwan is \"willing to engage in exchanges and cooperation with China under the principle of reciprocity and dignity to promote peace and common prosperity.\" Any comment on this?","Currently, the situation in the South China Sea and East China Sea remains generally stable. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and attempt to \"rely on foreign countries to seek independence\" and \"use force to seek independence.\" This is the source of tension and instability in the Taiwan Strait and a \"troublemaker\" for regional peace and stability.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that we are willing to strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the greatest sincerity and our best efforts, but we will never promise to give up the use of force, and we will never leave any space for any form of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities. Only if the DPP authorities recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle and stop the separatist behavior of \"Taiwan independence\" can cross-Strait consultation and dialogue be restored, and cross-Strait relations return to the right track of peaceful development.","当前，南海和东海局势保持总体稳定。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，是台海局势紧张动荡的根源，也是地区和平稳定的“麻烦制造者”。\n我要强调的是，我们愿以最大诚意、尽最大努力争取和平统一的前景，但决不承诺放弃使用武力，决不为任何形式的“台独”分裂活动留下任何空间。民进党当局只有承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，停止“台独”分裂行径，两岸协商对话才能恢复，两岸关系才能重回和平发展的正确轨道。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772484.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","Lai Qingde recently stated that \"China's non-coastal countries have no right to intervene in Japan-Philippines exclusive economic zone negotiations,\" adding that \"gray harassment by China's Coast Guard and others has caused regional unrest, and China's expansion attempts in the Western Pacific have become increasingly obvious.\" Any comment on this?","The proposed delimitation area announced by Japan and the Philippines is located east of Taiwan Island. China has an exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the above-mentioned waters. Japan and the Philippines bypassed China and initiated so-called maritime delimitation negotiations without authorization, seriously violating international law and basic norms of international relations, including the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, and seriously infringing on China's maritime rights and interests. It is legitimate and necessary for the relevant mainland departments to carry out law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas in accordance with the law. It is a just act to safeguard national sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.\nThe DPP authorities have turned a blind eye to the abuses committed by Japan and the Philippines, but they have taken the opportunity to spread the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" and incited \"anti-China resistance\". They have become an accomplice of external forces that infringe on the overall interests of the Chinese nation. They are despicable and shameless and must be liquidated.","日、菲宣布的拟划界海域位于台湾岛以东，中国在上述海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日菲绕开中方擅自启动所谓海域划界谈判，严重违反包括《联合国海洋法公约》在内的国际法和国际关系基本准则，严重侵害中国海洋权益。大陆有关部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查正当必要，是维护国家主权和海洋权益的正义之举。\n民进党当局对日菲侵权行径装聋作哑、视而不见，却借机大肆散播“台独”分裂谬论，煽动“反中抗中”，已经沦为外部势力侵害中华民族整体利益的帮凶，卑劣无耻，必遭清算。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","《参考消息》记者","A recent poll on the island showed that in terms of maintaining peace across the Taiwan Strait, the proportion of people who chose \"showing goodwill to the mainland\" was much higher than \"deepening cooperation with the United States.\" Any comment on this?","Wanting peace, development, exchanges and cooperation are the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society. In line with the mainstream public opinion on the island, we have always been committed to maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and continuing to introduce policies and measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. This fully reflects our commitment to safeguarding the overall interests of the Chinese nation and our goodwill and sincerity in doing good things for the well-being of Taiwan compatriots. We have been widely recognized and welcomed by all walks of life in Taiwan.\nOut of their nature to pursue \"independence\", the DPP authorities ignored the mainstream public opinion on the island, deliberately escalated cross-strait antagonism and confrontation, constantly obstructed cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, turned a blind eye to the island's economic and people's livelihood issues, turned a deaf ear to the voices of the island's businesses and people, and allowed external forces to drive Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war. More and more Taiwan compatriots are dissatisfied with this and have condemned it.\nTaiwan's future and destiny depend on the great rejuvenation of the nation and the unity and prosperity of the country. Only by adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\", opposing \"Taiwan independence\" and recognizing that both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one China can cross-Strait relations develop peacefully, peace and tranquility can be found across the Taiwan Strait, and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots can be fundamentally guaranteed. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will follow the general trend, uphold justice, and work with us to safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and protect the common home of the Chinese nation.","要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会的主流民意。我们顺应岛内主流民意，始终致力于维护台海和平稳定，推动两岸关系和平发展，持续出台促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，充分体现维护中华民族整体利益的胸怀担当和为台胞谋福祉办好事的善意诚意，得到台湾社会各界广泛肯定和普遍欢迎。\n民进党当局出于谋“独”本性，罔顾岛内主流民意，蓄意升高两岸对立对抗，不断阻挠两岸交流合作，对岛内经济和民生问题视若无睹，对岛内业者和民众呼声充耳不闻，任由外部势力驱使，把台湾带向兵凶战危的险境。越来越多台湾同胞对此不满，纷纷予以谴责。\n台湾的前途命运系于民族的伟大复兴、国家的统一强盛。只有坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”，认同两岸同属一个中国，两岸关系才能和平发展，台海才有和平安宁，台湾同胞利益福祉才有根本保障。希望广大台湾同胞顺应大势，坚守大义，与我们一道维护台海和平稳定，守护中华民族的共同家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202606/t20260624_12772489.htm"],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","Regarding Taitung County Magistrate Rao Qingling’s video participation in the signing meeting for the purchase of agricultural and fishery products on the island during the Straits Forum, Mainland Affairs Council Chairman Qiu Chuizheng said that Rao Qingling has previously had relevant violation records and will ask the competent authorities to conduct administrative investigations and punishments in accordance…","County Mayor Rao Qingling participated in a signing ceremony for ten policies and measures to promote cross-strait exchanges and cooperation through a pre-recorded video to promote Taitung's agricultural products and benefit the local people, which received widespread support and recognition. Out of self-interest for \"independence\", the DPP authorities have repeatedly obstructed and sabotaged relevant activities and set up numerous obstacles for related activities. Now they want to \"settle accounts later\". They are basically abusing their power and specifically working against the people of Taiwan. They do bad things themselves and prevent others from doing good things. They are opposed by more and more Taiwanese people.","饶庆铃县长以预录影片方式参与十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施对接签约会，推广台东农产品，为当地民众谋福祉，得到广泛支持与肯定。民进党当局出于谋“独”私利，一再阻挠破坏，为相关活动设置重重障碍，现在又要“秋后算账”，根本是滥权妄为、专门与台湾老百姓作对，自己坏事干绝，又不让别人做好事，遭到越来越多台湾民众的反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中新社记者","Just as the mainland is actively expanding sales of agricultural and fishery products such as pineapples and custard apples from some counties and cities in Taiwan, Liang Wenjie, spokesperson of the Mainland Affairs Council, recently said that \"Taiwanese people hardly eat pineapples and custard apples. It can be said that they are completely dependent on the mainland for agricultural products.\" This triggered an…","The DPP authorities have always been indifferent to people's livelihoods and harmed people's interests. They not only do not care about, do not care about, and do not solve the livelihood problems of grassroots farmers and fishermen on the island, they also mock, despise, and belittle the fruits of labor of farmers and fishermen, and attack, slander, and discredit the good intentions of the mainland. Justice lies in the hearts of the people, but his outrageous behavior has aroused public resentment on the island. If the DPP authorities do not stop political manipulation and stop restricting cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, they will surely face a greater backlash from public opinion.","民进党当局一贯漠视民瘼、罔顾民生、损害民利，他们不仅不关心、不在意、不解决岛内基层农渔民的生计问题，还挖苦、轻视、贬损农渔业者的劳动成果，攻击、污蔑、抹黑大陆的好意善意。公道自在人心，其胡作非为已在岛内激起民怨。民进党当局如不停止政治操弄，停止阻限两岸交流合作，必遭民意更大反噬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic, trade and exchange activities in various fields.","Recently, cross-Strait exchange activities in various fields have continued to flourish. Let me introduce some of them.\nIn June, Fujian held a series of cross-strait exchange activities. From the 10th to the 14th, the Zhangzhou Intangible Cultural Heritage Theater Exchange Troupe went to New Taipei, Miaoli and other counties and cities in Taiwan for exchange performances. The performances of Gezi Opera (Xiang Opera) and puppet show with strong Fujian and Taiwan characteristics vividly interpreted the saying that \"cross-strait families are close, and Fujian and Taiwan are close relatives.\" On the 19th, the 20th Fujian-Taiwan Crossing Cultural Festival and the Kaijiang Water Splashing Festival were held in Quanzhou. More than a hundred Taiwanese compatriots celebrated the Dragon Boat Festival with local folks. From the 23rd to the 27th, the 14th Strait Youth Gathering and the 4th Cross-Strait Youth \"Creating the Future\" Science Popularization Summer Camp was held in Fuzhou. From the 26th to the 29th, the 2026 Ninth Jimei District Cross-Strait Characteristic Temple Fair and Jimei Cross-Strait Concentric Integrated Consumption Season will be held in Jimei, Xiamen. Representatives of relevant enterprises and youth from both sides of the Taiwan Strait will conduct in-depth exchanges and docking around leisure, tourism, residence and employment. On the 27th, the 35th Cross-Strait (Dongshan, Fujian) Guandi Cultural Tourism Festival will be held in Dongshan, Zhangzhou. Nearly a thousand Taiwanese believers will experience the cultural charm of Guandi's loyalty and righteousness together with local folks.\nFrom June 16th to 21st, more than 80 Taiwanese night market stall owners were invited to Tongzhou District, Beijing, where they made, displayed and sold Taiwanese night market specialties such as Shihlin Sausage, Shenkeng Stinky Tofu, Liuhe Iron Plate Small Tubes, and Ximending Oyster Noodles. They were welcomed and loved by more than 100,000 mainland people.\nFrom June 21st to 25th, the 2026 \"China Good Anchors\" Cross-Strait Youth Livestreaming E-commerce Entrepreneurship Exchange Conference was held in Yiwu, Zhejiang, the \"World Capital of Small Commodities\". It included a series of activities such as a livestreaming e-commerce training camp, Yiwu International Trade City research, special salons, and resource docking. More than 500 youths from both sides of the Taiwan Strait participated.\nFrom June 22 to July 1, the first batch of \"Ecology and Humanities\" study camp for outstanding youths from both sides of the Taiwan Strait was held in Chengdu, Sichuan. It focused on topics such as ecological protection and the inheritance of China's excellent traditional culture, and included academic lectures, learning about pastures in Tibetan areas and intangible cultural heritage, and interviews with herders.\nFrom June 24 to 27, Chongqing will hold the 2026 \"Taiwanese Businessmen and Taiwan Youth Chongqing Tour\" event. More than 250 Taiwanese businessmen and Taiwanese youth will participate in the exchange and discussion on promoting the financial empowerment industry to help Taiwanese businesses and enterprises develop high-quality development and better integrate into Chongqing's modern manufacturing cluster system.\nIn addition, during the Dragon Boat Festival, China Central Radio and Television broadcast the Dragon Boat Festival special program \"Hundreds of Couples Competing to Praise the Dragon Boat Festival\", which received widespread attention from netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. One of the short films, \"Lan Zhi Weixin\", tells the story of the two Quyuan Palaces in Zhangzhou and Taipei facing each other across the sea for more than 300 years, and the blood and family ties of the same origin. It resonated with netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. They left messages saying, \"One palace is across the strait, and one root connects the two sides of the Taiwan Strait\", \"We are one family\", etc.","近期，两岸各领域交流活动持续热络，我介绍其中几项。\n6月，福建举办一系列两岸交流活动。10日至14日，漳州非遗戏剧交流团赴台湾新北、苗栗等县市交流演出，富有浓厚闽台特色的歌仔戏（芗剧）、木偶戏表演，生动诠释了“两岸一家亲 闽台亲上亲”。19日，第20届闽台对渡文化节暨蚶江海上泼水节在泉州举办，百余名台湾同胞与当地乡亲一道欢度端午佳节。23日至27日，第14届海峡青年荟·第四届两岸青年“创未来”科普夏令营在福州举办。26日至29日，2026年第九届集美区两岸特色庙会暨集美两岸同心融合消费季活动将在厦门集美举办，两岸相关企业及青年代表，将围绕休闲旅游、居住就业等进行深入交流对接。27日，第35届海峡两岸（福建东山）关帝文化旅游节将在漳州东山举办，近千名台湾信众与当地乡亲一道感受关帝忠义文化魅力。\n6月16日至21日，80余位台湾夜市摊主受邀来到北京市通州区，现场制作、展卖士林大香肠、深坑臭豆腐、六合铁板小管、西门町蚵仔面线等台湾夜市特色美食，受到10万余名大陆民众的欢迎与喜爱。\n6月21日至25日，2026“中华好主播”两岸青年直播电商创业交流大会在“世界小商品之都”浙江义乌举行，包括直播电商研习营、义乌国际商贸城调研、专题沙龙和资源对接等系列活动，500余名两岸青年参加。\n6月22日至7月1日，第一批次海峡两岸杰出青年《生态与人文》研习营活动在四川成都举办，聚焦生态保护和中华优秀传统文化传承等主题，包括学术讲座、藏区牧场及非遗文化学习、牧民访谈等活动。\n6月24日至27日，重庆将举办2026“台商台青重庆行”活动，250余位台商台青参加，就推动金融赋能产业助力台商台企高质量发展，更好融入重庆现代制造业集群体系进行交流研讨。\n此外，端午节日期间，中央广播电视总台播出端午特别节目《百舸争流颂端阳》，受到两岸网友广泛关注。其中一个短片《兰芷为信》，讲述漳州和台北两座跨越300余年的屈原宫隔海相望、一脉同源的血脉亲情，引发两岸网友共鸣，纷纷留言表示“一座宫隔着海峡，一份根连着两岸”、“咱们本就是一家人”等。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Taiwanese media reported that Taiwan’s military is conducting a so-called “immediate war preparation exercise”, claiming that “this exercise focuses on verifying the resilience and joint combat capabilities of each combat zone when the mainland takes action.” Any comment on this?","The so-called \"drill\" conceals the evil intention of the DPP authorities to \"seek independence through force,\" which fully proves that it is the root cause of incitement to cross-Strait confrontation and tension and instability across the Taiwan Strait. In the face of the powerful people's army, the pretentiousness of the DPP authorities is completely in vain and will only harm Taiwan and destroy itself.","所谓“操演”包藏着民进党当局“以武谋独”的祸心，充分证明其是煽动两岸对立对抗、导致台海局势紧张动荡的祸根乱源。在强大的人民军队面前，民进党当局的装腔作势纯属徒劳，只会害台毁台、自取灭亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","环球时报、环球网记者","According to reports, Lai Ching-te recently said that \"Taiwan is not part of the People's Republic of China,\" hoping that the United States will approve an arms sale worth US$14 billion as soon as possible, and declared that \"rejecting reunification, Taiwan's future can only be determined by the Taiwanese people.\" Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is a historical and legal fact that no one can change or shake, and it is also a general consensus of the international community. Our position of firmly opposing the United States' arms sales to China's Taiwan region is consistent and clear. The U.S. is urged to abide by the one-China principle and the three Sino-U.S. joint communiqués and handle the Taiwan issue prudently.\nNo matter what fallacies Lai Ching-te spreads or how many weapons he buys, they will not change Taiwan's status as part of China, nor will it change the iron law that Taiwan's future can only be determined by all Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. It will not change the inevitable demise of \"Taiwan independence\".","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是谁都无法改变和撼动的历史和法理事实，也是国际社会普遍共识。我们坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器的立场是一贯的、明确的。敦促美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，慎重处理台湾问题。\n不管赖清德散布什么谬论、买多少武器，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的地位，改变不了台湾前途只能由包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民共同决定的铁律，改变不了“台独”必然灭亡的结局。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","After the island's public opinion organizations passed the \"abridged version\" of the defense budget, Lai Qingde recently said that he will not give up increasing defense expenditures and will propose special regulations or use additional budgets to ensure the smooth progress of defense equipment procurement. Any comment on this?","For the sake of one-party political self-interest, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are trying to \"seek independence through force.\" They continue to squander the hard-earned money of the Taiwanese people to engage in militarization, and engage in \"all people as soldiers\" in an attempt to tie the Taiwanese people to the \"Taiwan independence\" chariot. This will only push Taiwan into a more dangerous situation. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and outsiders cannot be trusted. We have the firm will, strong determination, and strong capabilities to smash all separatist plots for \"Taiwan independence\" and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nReporter of Shenzhen Satellite TV's \"Direct News\"\n: Taiwan's administrative agency recently passed the so-called \"Special Regulations on the Procurement of Defense Autonomous Unmanned Vehicles\" draft, planning to allocate NT$210 billion from 2026 to 2031 to purchase independent defense unmanned vehicle equipment to build the so-called \"immediate detection and strike\" asymmetric combat capability. Any comment on this?\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and attempt to \"seek independence by force\", which will only put Taiwan into danger and bring serious disasters to Taiwan compatriots. The wheel of history of the reunification of the motherland is rolling forward. No matter how many weapons the DPP authorities buy, it will be like a mantis trying to pull a chariot, and it cannot change the inevitable defeat of \"Taiwan independence\".","民进党当局为一党政治私利，妄图“以武谋独”，不断挥霍台湾老百姓的血汗钱穷兵黩武，大搞“全民皆兵”，企图把台湾民众绑上“台独”战车，只会把台湾推入更加危险的境地。“台独”是绝路，外人靠不住。我们有坚定意志、坚强决心、强大能力，粉碎一切“台独”分裂图谋，维护国家主权和领土完整。\n深圳卫视《直新闻》记者\n：台行政机构近日通过所谓“防务自主无人载具采购特别条例”草案，规划2026年至2031年编列2100亿元新台币，筹购防务自主无人载具装备，建构所谓“即侦即打”不对称战力。请问对此有何评论？\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图“以武谋独”，只会让台湾陷入险境，给台湾同胞带来深重灾难。祖国统一的历史车轮滚滚向前，民进党当局买再多武器，都是螳臂当车，改变不了“台独”必然败亡的结局。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question, Taiwan media reported that the mainland's \"Xiangyanghong 22\" scientific research vessel was driven away by the Taiwan Coast Guard in the eastern waters of Taiwan. Taiwan claimed that the ship entered the relevant waters without permission. I would like to ask if the ship's scientific research route in eastern Taiwan has been adjusted compared to the past? Due to the current lack of communication…","The first question. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. In order to comprehensively understand the natural ecological conditions of sea areas under national jurisdiction and support and serve marine ecological protection, the Ministry of Natural Resources conducted a marine environmental survey in the sea east of Taiwan Island from June 16 to 18. The operations of mainland China's marine scientific research vessels in relevant waters are completely legitimate and legal. The DPP authorities' interference with normal scientific examination operations is political manipulation with ulterior motives. If we continue to use this to cause trouble and provocation and escalate cross-strait antagonism and confrontation, we will definitely be defeated.\nSecond question. I want to reiterate that there is only one China in the world and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. Relevant mainland departments have carried out law enforcement inspections in the waters under their jurisdiction in accordance with the law. This is a necessary action in response to Japan and the Philippines' serious infringement of China's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and will continue to strengthen the control of relevant waters.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\", confuse right and wrong, and confuse right and wrong. On the one hand, they endorse the serious violations committed by Japan and the Philippines and sell out national interests. On the other hand, they attempt to provoke cross-strait confrontation. Their evil deeds have been firmly opposed by compatriots on both sides of the strait and will surely be punished by history.","第一个问题。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。为全面了解国家管辖海域自然生态状况，支撑服务海洋生态保护，6月16日至18日，自然资源部在台湾岛以东海域开展了海洋环境调查。大陆海洋科考调查船在相关海域作业完全正当合法。民进党当局对正常科考作业进行滋扰是别有用心的政治操弄。如再借此滋事挑衅，升高两岸对立对抗，必遭挫败。\n第二个问题。我要重申，世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。大陆有关部门在管辖海域依法开展执法巡查，是针对日菲严重侵犯中国领土主权和海洋权益的必要行动，并将持续加强对有关海域的管控。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，颠倒黑白、混淆是非，一方面附和日、菲严重侵权行径，出卖民族利益，另一方面妄图借此挑动两岸对立对抗，其恶行遭到两岸同胞的坚决反对，也必将遭到历史的惩罚。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","The first question is that Liang Wenjie, deputy chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, recently said that \"pineapples and custard apples are an agricultural product that Taiwanese people hardly eat and rely entirely on the mainland.\" Some comments pointed out that if you just shout \"anti-Taiwan independence\" and promote the export of agricultural products to the mainland, you will be banned, cross-strait…","The first question. DPP politicians are arrogant and self-righteous and ignorant of the suffering of the people. An apology cannot calm the anger of farmers and fishermen, nor can it restore the lost hearts and minds. What the DPP authorities should apologize for most is that they went against the mainstream public opinion on the island and blocked cross-strait exchanges and cooperation. What they should most change are their separatist stance on \"Taiwan independence\" and their provocative actions seeking \"independence.\"\nSecond question. Pineapple and custard apples on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have their own characteristics. The mainland has a very large market that can fully accommodate agricultural products from Taiwan. We will uphold the concept of \"Two sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family\" and continue to help Taiwanese farmers and fishermen expand the mainland market and effectively increase their income.","第一个问题。民进党政客高高在上、自以为是，不知民间疾苦。道歉，并不能平息农渔民的怒火，也挽回不了失去的人心。民进党当局最应该道歉的是违背岛内主流民意、阻挡两岸交流合作，最应该改变的是“台独”分裂立场和谋“独”挑衅行径。\n第二个问题。两岸凤梨释迦各有特色，大陆拥有超大规模市场，完全容得下来自台湾的农产品。我们将秉持“两岸一家亲”的理念，持续帮助台湾农渔民朋友拓展大陆市场，切实增加他们的收益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-06-24","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","The first question is that the recent topic of mainland importing Taitung pineapple and custard apples has triggered controversy on the island. Taipei Mayor Chiang Wanan, in addition to supporting pineapple custard apples, also called on the mainland to establish stable and sustainable institutional practices such as reasonable quarantine and tax rates when importing Taiwanese agricultural products. Any comment…","The first question. As we have repeatedly emphasized, we have always adhered to the concept of \"one family across the Taiwan Straits\", and we have done our best to do practical things, do good things, and solve problems for Taiwan compatriots. We have introduced a series of policies and measures that benefit Taiwan's farmers, fishermen, and enterprises, help Taiwan's farmers and friends expand the mainland market, and effectively enhance the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. I believe everyone can clearly see who is helping Taiwanese farmers and who is harming Taiwanese farmers. We will, as always, actively promote cross-Strait agricultural cooperation to solve problems for Taiwanese farmers and fishermen. We also welcome more Taiwanese farmers and Taiwanese enterprises to invest and start business in the mainland to share opportunities and seek common development.\nSecond question. Both sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to the same country, and the compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are all Chinese and one family. Cross-strait affairs are family affairs of compatriots on both sides of the strait, and of course they should be handled through consultation among family members.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is the culprit that undermines peace across the Taiwan Strait. To seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, we must resolutely oppose all kinds of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist actions, strive to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and firmly protect the common home of the Chinese nation.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。正如我们反复强调，我们一贯秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事，出台一系列惠及台湾农渔民、企业的政策措施，帮助台湾农民朋友拓展大陆市场，切实增进台湾同胞利益福祉。是谁在帮助台湾农民，是谁在伤害台湾农民，相信大家看得很清楚。我们将一如既往积极推动两岸农业合作，为台湾农渔民排忧解难，也欢迎更多台农台企来大陆投资兴业，共享机遇，共谋发展。\n第二个问题。两岸同属一个国家，两岸同胞都是中国人、是一家人。两岸的事是两岸同胞的家里事，当然也应该由家里人商量着办。\n“台独”是破坏台海和平的罪魁祸首，要谋求台海和平，就必须坚决反对形形色色的“台独”分裂行径，致力推动两岸关系和平发展，坚定守护中华民族共同家园。\n今天的新闻发布会到此结束，谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202606/t20260624_12772496.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-06-25","Guo Jiakun","Hubei Media Group","It is reported that Taiwan’s so-called “deputy foreign minister” said that the Taiwan authorities are in dialogue and consultation with political figures and social communities in Honduras regarding the restoration of “diplomatic ties” between China’s Taiwan region and Honduras. However, not long ago, the Foreign Ministry of Honduras clarifies on social media that Honduras is not engaged in any official talks or…","We note that the government of Honduras has made clarifications on the DPP authorities’ lies. Apparently, upholding the one-China principle is recognized internationally as the right thing to do. It is where the arc of history bends and public opinion trends. The “Taiwan independence” forces and the DPP authorities’ unjust pursuit have little support and will end up in failure.\nSince the two countries established diplomatic ties, China-Honduras ties which were built on the basis of the one-China principle have grown rapidly, and the economic and social development of Honduras has benefited from the practical cooperation it has had with China in various fields. It is quite clear that China-Honduras diplomatic ties serve the fundamental and long-term interests of both countries and peoples. China is committed to further advancing ties with Honduras on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260625_11952387.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-25","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","Chinese embassies and consulates in the United States have reportedly contacted U.S. local government offices and private firms to discourage engagement with Taiwan, while mischaracterizing U.S. policy. This is according to letters sent by U.S. government departments to governors’ offices and business leaders in the U.S. How does the ministry respond to these allegations?","China firmly opposes official interactions of any form between China’s Taiwan region and the U.S., including its federal and state governments. To only maintain unofficial relations with Taiwan is a commitment made by the U.S. side in the Joint Communiqué on the Establishment of Diplomatic Relations. China urges the U.S. to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, stick to the statements and commitments President Trump has made to China, prudently handle the Taiwan question, and not to have any official interactions with the Taiwan region under any pretext or send any wrong signal to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260625_11952387.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-25","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","The United States, Britain, France, and Germany have expressed concern that recent Chinese activities off Taiwan’s east coast, where China has deployed Coast Guard patrols, threaten regional stability, freedom of navigation, and the safety of international shipping. How does the ministry view these concerns?","According to China’s domestic law and international law including UNCLOS, China has exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in waters east of China’s Taiwan island. Chinese authorities’ law enforcement and patrol activities in these waters are legitimate actions to exercise China’s jurisdiction, safeguard regional stability and uphold order at sea in accordance with the law. These actions are also a necessary response to Japan and the Philippines’ manipulation of their delimitation agenda and violation of China’s maritime rights and interests. Relevant countries need to respect China’s sovereignty, territorial integrity and maritime rights and interests, and stop mischaracterizing facts and truth. Relevant institutions should not make statements unsuited to their identity.\nThe DPP authorities are playing deaf to the infringement of Japan and the Philippines and even joining with external forces to vilify the Central Government’s effort to safeguard rights, and peddle their separatist narratives. It once again exposes the DPP authorities’ separatist nature and betrayal of the overriding interest of the Chinese nation. What awaits them is contempt from the people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and the judgment of history.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260625_11952387.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","台湾地区领导人赖清德近日表示，对于防务特别预算遭台湾“立法院”大幅删减，他不会放弃提高防务支出，会另提特别条例，或通过追加预算等方式支持台军。台行政机构随后通过“防务自主无人载具采购特别条例”草案，经费上限为2100亿新台币，并表示台湾急需链接全球的“非红供应链”，以确保防务自主。请问对此有何评论？","","民进党当局变本加厉挥霍台湾老百姓的血汗钱，投入毫无意义的军购无底洞，加速把台湾推入兵凶战危险境。正告民进党当局，统一大势不可阻挡，“以武谋独”必将自取灭亡。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","据报道，美国会众议院拨款委员会公布“2027财年国防拨款法案”草案，其中20亿美元用于向台湾提供武器装备及服务等。请问对此有何评论？","","关于该草案，我想说的是，武力换不来和平，穷兵黩武只会透支未来。台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。“以台制华”注定不会得逞，“以武助独”只会加剧台海紧张，最终引火烧身、自食恶果。我们要求美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，切实落实中美元首会晤重要共识，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号，以实际行动维护台海和平稳定。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","在台军22日启动为期5天的“立即备战操演”之际，台湾“国防部”23日晚表示，解放军航空母舰福建舰当天航经台湾海峡，并再度公布航拍画面，指台军运用联合情监侦手段严密监控，台“国防部长”顾立雄表示，对此有充分掌握，重要动态会适时公布。请问能否证实福建舰航经台海，并介绍航向与此次行动任务？","","台湾是中国的一部分，哪有什么“国防部长”？这是福建舰开展的例行训练，今后我们还会继续组织。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","据报道，赖清德称推动无人机产业是台湾重大政策，无人机可以塑造“地狱景象”，吓阻效果巨大。请问对此有何评论？","","赖清德总想把台湾民众往火坑里推，大肆谋“独”引战，挑动两岸对立对抗。要和平还是战争，要人间烟火还是“地狱景象”？相信台湾老百姓有自己的选择。希望台湾同胞认清赖清德“战争制造者”“和平破坏者”的邪恶面目，坚守大义、顺应大势，与我们一道反对“台独”分裂，守护中华民族共同家园。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","我有两个问题。第一个问题，据报道，在今年3月中方反驳日方炒作中国国防支出一事后，日本防卫大臣近期再次公开质疑中国国防费透明度，同时声称“日本将以透明的方式投资于无人机和人工智能等新型作战手段，以适应不断变化的冲突性质”。请问对此有何评论？第二个问题，据报道，台安全部门近期开设网站，诱拉大陆人员向其提供情报。请问对此有何评论？","","先回答你的第一个问题。中国的国防费公开透明，每年都依法公开国防支出预算总额及其规模、结构、用途等信息，积极参加联合国军费透明制度，2008年以来每年都向联合国提交上一财政年度军事开支报告。中国国防支出一贯坚持合理、适度、克制，占GDP的比重长期低于1.5%。反观日本，作为二战战败国，防卫预算连续14年快速增长，防卫支出占GDP比重飙升至2%，甚至还要进一步提升至3.5%，人均防卫支出是中国的3倍多。清者自清，浊者自浊。日方用“阴谋论”抹黑中国国防开支，妄想转移视线、误导舆论，掩饰其“再军事化”野心和举动。真正应该向世界讲清楚的是日本：“新型军国主义”成势为患，意欲何为？\n现在回答你的第二个问题。国台办已对此作了回应。我再送民进党当局一句话：机关算尽太聪明，反误了卿卿性命。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","据报道，台防务部门称大陆军机进入台西南空域及西太平洋进行“远海长航”，并公开解放军无侦-10无人机绕台飞行的高清影像，宣称“严密掌握、适切应处”。请问对此有何评论？","","“台独”武装吹哨壮胆，纯属自欺欺人。台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，解放军位台岛周边开展演训活动合理合法、光明正大。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","美日正在开展“英勇盾牌”大规模军演，台军同步举行备战操演，双方演训时间高度重合，针对台海的意味很强，请问对此有何评论？","","民进党当局蓄意制造紧张，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心。靠军演壮胆换不来真正安全。不管是谁，把对抗当成常态，把民生福祉放在政治私利之后，最终都将付出相应代价。解放军始终保持高度戒备，坚决挫败任何“台独”妄动。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","日菲启动专属经济区谈判，中国展开台湾岛东部海域执法行动。美、英、法、德驻台机构表态认为，中方行动威胁区域稳定、航行自由和国际航运安全，加剧紧张局势。请问对此有何评论？未来相关行动是否会更多考虑国际社会的呼吁？","","日菲宣布的拟划界海域位于中国台湾岛以东，中国在上述海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日菲绕开中方擅自启动所谓海域划界谈判，严重违反包括《联合国海洋法公约》在内的国际法和国际关系基本准则，严重侵害中国海洋权益。我们在相关海域依法开展执法巡查正当必要，是维护国家领土主权和海洋权益的正义之举。判断是非的标准，不是看谁的嗓门大，在这个问题上侵权挑衅的是日菲，拉帮结派对中方施压没有用。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[1,"2026-06-25","Zhang Xiaogang","","赖清德与外媒会见时表示，台湾“拒绝一国两制和中国共产党统治”不应被解读为挑衅，并呼吁大陆放弃武力攻台。请问对此有何评论？","","“和平统一、一国两制”是我们解决台湾问题的基本方针，是实现祖国统一的最佳方式，对两岸同胞和中华民族最有利。当前赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，不断谋“独”挑衅，是危害台湾安全的根源所在。我们决不允许“台独”分裂势力以任何名义、任何方式把台湾从中国分裂出去。任何分裂祖国的势力和行径必将遭到全中国人民的迎头痛击。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16469695.html","",1,3,4,""],[0,"2026-06-26","Guo Jiakun","NHK","Several Japanese economic delegations are visiting China to attend the China International Supply Chain Expo. How does China assess non-governmental exchanges between the two countries and what does China expect to achieve in the future? Besides, the delegation of Japan’s Association for the Promotion of International Trade also visited China’s Foreign Ministry and met with Vice Minister of Foreign Affairs Hua…","On your first question, the Fourth China International Supply Chain Expo (CISCE) that kicked off this Monday attracted active participation of companies and organizations across the world. We’ve learned that many Japanese companies and economic groups also registered for the event, which represents the urgent call from Japan’s business sector for improving China-Japan relations and having cooperation with China. It’s hoped that those running the Japanese government can heed the call, face up to the root cause of problems, do serious soul-searching, correct the wrongdoings, show the sincerity of improving ties with China with concrete actions and create necessary conditions for normal exchanges between the two countries.\nOn your second question, Vice Minister of Foreign Affairs Hua Chunying on Monday met with the delegation led by Gaku Hashimoto, acting chief of the Japanese Association for the Promotion of International Trade (JAPIT), who traveled to China for the CISCE. The Chinese side expressed condolences over the passing of Yohei Kono, the president of JAPIT, and stated its consistent position on China-Japan relations and Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi’s erroneous remarks on Taiwan. The Chinese side expressed the hope that the Japanese business sector can help foster a right view of history in the country and improve bilateral relations between China and Japan.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260626_11953253.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-06-29","Guo Jiakun","Bloomberg","Tokyo’s top government spokesman has said that China Coast Guard ’s activity in Japan’s exclusive economic zone south of Yonaguni Island and territorial claims on those waters are unacceptable. What is the foreign ministry’s comment?","China has made its position clear on many occasions. Let me reiterate that China has exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in waters east of China’s Taiwan island. It is fully legitimate, lawful and justified for Chinese authorities to carry out relevant activities in these waters. Japan and the Philippines’ attempt to bypass China and initiate the so-called maritime delimitation talks constitutes a severe violation of UNCLOS and other international laws and basic norms governing international relations. It also seriously infringes on China’s maritime rights and interests. China will not allow this.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202606/t20260629_11954304.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-01","Guo Jiakun","The Paper","It’s reported that regarding Honduran foreign ministry’s recent statement that it did not discuss “resuming diplomatic ties” with Taiwan and China’s response over the matter, the so-called spokesperson for Taiwan’s “foreign affairs office” said that Taiwan is open to “restoring ties” with Honduras without preconditions. What is China’s comment?","We notice that the government of Honduras has made clarifications on relevant issues, laying bare the DPP authorities’ deception-based diplomacy. Let me stress that the “Taiwan independence” separatism, running counter to the overwhelming trend, wins no public support and is doomed to fail. China is ready to promote China-Honduras relations and bring more benefits to our two peoples on the basis of the one-China principle.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260701_11955939.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-01","Guo Jiakun","Jiji Press","I have three questions on China-Japan relations. First, regarding the Japanese citizens who were placed under compulsory measures in Dalian, what is the current status of the case? Have the individuals been formally arrested? Second, concerning the export control regulations, apart from the Dalian case, are there any other law-enforcement operations involving Japanese companies or citizens? Third, certain actions…","On your first question, the case is being handled in accordance with the law.\nOn your second question, the competent Chinese authorities deal with illegal acts and criminal offences in accordance with the law. The Japanese side should remind its nationals and businesses in China to comply with Chinese laws and regulations.\nOn China-Japan economic and trade relations, I’d refer you to the competent authorities. In fact, the competent authorities have made China’s position clear on many occasions. What you just said is not the truth. China has said more than once that the root cause of the serious difficulties in bilateral relations lies in the Japanese authorities’ erroneous remarks and actions on Taiwan and in the fields of military and security. The responsibility rests solely with the Japanese side. Why not ask those running the Japanese government whether they will respect China’s core interests and stop interfering in China’s internal affairs; whether they will honor the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan and safeguard the political foundation of China-Japan relations and foster an enabling environment for economic and trade cooperation; and whether they will do serious soul-searching and demonstrate the sincerity to bring the bilateral relations back to the right track with real actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260701_11955939.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-01","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Paraguay’s foreign minister said yesterday that the country is open to trade with China, as long as it does not have to sever ties with Taiwan. Does the foreign ministry have a comment on this?","China has made its position clear on relevant issues on many occasions. The government and leadership of Paraguay need to ask themselves what the people want, what best serves Paraguay’s fundamental and long-term interest and where the arc of history bends, and decide whether they should stop being on the wrong side of history and join the overwhelming majority of countries instead.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260701_11955939.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-02","Guo Jiakun","AFP","Taiwan said on Thursday that prosecutors had detained two employees of U.S. company Supermicro Computer after expanding a probe into the alleged smuggling of Nvidia AI chips to China. Does the foreign ministry have a comment on this？","It is not a question about foreign affairs. I’m not familiar with that.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260702_11963957.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on July 2, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Welcome to today's press conference. Please start asking questions.","欢迎大家参加今天的新闻发布会，请大家开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","On July 1, a conference to celebrate the 105th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China was held in Beijing. General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech. The content related to Taiwan has attracted the attention of Taiwan compatriots. Please explain.","General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the conference celebrating the 105th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, pointing out that our party has developed into the world's largest ruling party with major global influence, has received the heartfelt support and support of the people, and is the strong leadership core of the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics. Solving the Taiwan issue and realizing the complete reunification of the motherland is the unswerving historical mission of our party and the common aspiration of all Chinese people. General Secretary Xi Jinping’s important speech emphasized adhering to the one-China principle and the “1992 Consensus,” demonstrating the sincerity and goodwill of uniting Taiwan compatriots and deepening cross-strait exchanges, cooperation, and integrated development. It demonstrated the firm will to resolutely combat “Taiwan independence” separatist forces and oppose interference from external forces, and demonstrated the strong determination to firmly promote the great cause of the reunification of the motherland.\nSince its founding 105 years ago, the Communist Party of China has always been concerned about the future and destiny of Taiwan and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots, and has always worked tirelessly to solve the Taiwan issue and achieve the complete reunification of the motherland. Based on the 105th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China and the important moment when the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation has shown unprecedented bright prospects, General Secretary Xi Jinping has a profound grasp of the historical trend and the situation across the Taiwan Strait, and profoundly clarified the major policies of the work on Taiwan, which further pointed out the direction for the development of cross-Strait relations, and is the fundamental compliance and action guide for the work on Taiwan in the new era. We will thoroughly study, understand and fully implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping’s important speech, thoroughly implement the Party’s overall strategy for solving the Taiwan issue in the new era, unite the majority of Taiwan compatriots, work together to promote the peaceful and integrated development of cross-Strait relations, and jointly create a bright future for the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation.","习近平总书记在庆祝中国共产党成立105周年大会发表重要讲话，指出我们党已经发展成为具有重大全球影响力的世界第一大执政党，得到人民衷心拥护和支持，是中国特色社会主义事业的坚强领导核心。解决台湾问题、实现祖国完全统一，是我们党矢志不渝的历史任务，是全体中华儿女的共同愿望。习近平总书记的重要讲话强调坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，展现了团结广大台湾同胞、深化两岸交流合作和融合发展的诚意善意，表明了坚决打击“台独”分裂势力、反对外部势力干涉的坚定意志，彰显了坚定推进祖国统一大业的坚强决心。\n中国共产党成立105年来，始终关注台湾前途命运和台湾同胞利益福祉，始终为解决台湾问题、实现祖国完全统一而不懈奋斗。立足中国共产党成立105周年、中华民族伟大复兴展现出前所未有光明前景的重要时刻，习近平总书记深刻把握历史大势和台海形势，深刻阐明对台工作的大政方针，为两岸关系发展进一步指明了方向，是做好新时代对台工作的根本遵循和行动指南。我们将深入学习领会、全面贯彻落实习近平总书记重要讲话精神，深入贯彻新时代党解决台湾问题的总体方略，团结广大台湾同胞，携手推动两岸关系和平发展、融合发展，共创祖国统一、民族复兴的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774063.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","The 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Summit opened in Beijing on July 2 and attracted great attention from young people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Summit will be held in Beijing from July 2 to 6. The summit was co-sponsored by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, the Ministry of Education, the All-China Youth Federation and the Beijing Municipal People's Government. With the theme of \"Join Hands to Draw Youth and Forge New Era\", the summit held an opening ceremony and main forum on July 2, followed by nine main activities, including the Beijing-Taiwan University Dragon Boat Race, the Young Scientists Forum, the Workers' Exchange Week for Various Industries, the Classical Poetry Couple Exchange, and the Youth Sparks and Thoughts Party. A series of 30 activities, including related cultural training camps, sports exchange competitions, and audio-visual experience tours, will last until the end of August. About 5,000 young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait will participate in the summit series activities, learning from each other and deepening friendship through sports competitions, study visits, and intangible cultural cultural experiences. We welcome more Taiwanese young people to come to Beijing to participate in activities, where they can personally experience the warmth and friendliness of their mainland compatriots, experience in-depth the excellent traditional Chinese culture, and attend youth appointments together to rekindle blood ties and talk about a better future.","2026两岸青年峰会于7月2日至6日在北京举办。峰会由国务院台办、教育部、全国青联和北京市人民政府共同主办，以“携手绘青春 奋进新时代”为主题，7月2日举办开幕式和主论坛，京台大学生龙舟赛、青年科学家论坛、百工百业职工交流周、古典诗联吟交流会、青年火花思享会等9场主体活动随后开展。相关文化研习营、体育交流赛、影音体验行等30个系列活动将持续至8月底。两岸青年约5000人将参加峰会系列活动，在体育竞技、参访学习、非遗文化体验中互学互鉴、加深情谊。我们欢迎更多台湾青年来北京参加活动，亲身感受大陆同胞的热情友善，深入体验中华优秀传统文化，共赴青春之约，共叙血脉亲情，共话美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774062.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","The Sixth Cross-Strait Zhongshan Forum was held in Zhongshan, Guangdong, with compatriots on both sides actively participating. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From June 27th to 29th, the Sixth Cross-Strait Zhongshan Forum was held in Zhongshan City, Guangdong Province. About 2,000 people from all walks of life from both sides of the Taiwan Strait and Hong Kong and Macao participated. Focusing on commemorating the 160th anniversary of the birth of Dr. Sun Yat-sen, with the theme of \"Carrying forward Dr. Sun Yat-sen's fighting spirit and jointly seeking the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation\", the forum held 1 main forum, 2 sub-forums and 9 exchange activities. The scale of the activities, the participation of Taiwanese compatriots, and the proportion of young people participating in the forum all reached new highs. The forum brings together all walks of life, industries, youth and other forces on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, builds the consensus of both sides to inherit and carry forward the spirit of Dr. Sun Yat-sen, conveys the common aspirations of peace, development, exchange and cooperation, continues to deepen the integrated development of the two sides of the Taiwan Strait, and inspires compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to work together to realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.\nDuring the forum, the National Federation of Taiwan Enterprises renewed the strategic cooperation framework agreement with the Zhongshan Municipal People's Government and held a signing ceremony for related industrial cooperation projects. The total contract value reached more than 30 billion yuan, including 10.8 billion yuan for Taiwan-funded projects.","6月27日至29日，第六届海峡两岸中山论坛在广东省中山市举办，来自海峡两岸和港澳地区的各界人士约2000人参加。论坛围绕纪念孙中山先生诞辰160周年，以“弘扬中山先生奋斗精神，共谋中华民族伟大复兴”为主题，开展了1场主论坛、2场分论坛和9场交流活动，活动规模、台胞参与度、青年参会比例均创新高。论坛汇聚两岸各界、产业、青年等力量，凝聚两岸共同传承和弘扬孙中山先生精神的共识，传递要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的共同心声，持续深化两岸融合发展，激励两岸同胞为实现中华民族伟大复兴而共同奋斗。\n论坛举办期间，全国台企联与中山市人民政府续签战略合作框架协议，举行相关产业合作项目签约仪式，签约总额达到300多亿元人民币，其中台资项目108亿元。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Please introduce the recent cross-strait exchange activities.","Recently, various exchange activities across the Taiwan Strait have continued to flourish. Here we will highlight a few of them.\nOn June 24, two industrial docking activities between Jiangsu and Taiwan were held in Jiangsu. One was a special docking event held in Nanjing for central enterprises and Taiwanese enterprises. About 120 people from 16 central enterprises and 35 Taiwan-funded enterprises participated. It promoted the complementary technological advantages of the resources of central enterprises and Taiwanese enterprises in the fields of equipment manufacturing and electronic information, and helped the deep integration and two-way empowered development of Jiangsu and Taiwan industries. The other event was an integrated circuit industry chain docking event held in Wuxi. More than 100 industry professionals from nearly 70 companies on both sides of the Taiwan Strait participated to build a platform for precise matching and efficient docking of the integrated circuit industries on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nFrom June 26 to 28, the 2026 Xiajin Bay Paddleboard Exchange Competition was held in Xiamen, Fujian. More than 100 paddleboard enthusiasts from both sides of the Taiwan Strait gathered at Dadeng Island in Xiang'an to compete on the same field and meet friends through competitions. They also went to the former site of the Kinmen County Government in Dadeng to participate in related activities such as the Wind Lion Cultural Fair and the Youth Exchange Camp to jointly experience the charm of southern Fujian culture. From June 27 to July 1, the 4th Xiamen and Taiwan Youth Music Research and Exchange Activities were also held in Xiamen. More than 500 young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait used national music as a carrier to compare skills and blend emotions. Among them, 120 teachers and students from 4 Taiwanese campus folk bands participated in the research and exchange activities.\nOn June 26, the award ceremony of the 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Micro-Short Drama Competition was held in Dongyang, Zhejiang. With the theme of \"Building Dreams in Zhejiang and Dramas Connecting Cross-Strait\", the competition collected a total of 1,070 works from both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including 125 works from Taiwan, and selected 9 categories of awards including the \"Golden Camellia Award\" for the Best Micro Short Drama Award and the Best Script Award. More than 600 people including film and television industry practitioners, youth, journalists and self-media people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait attended the award ceremony. During the competition, a series of activities such as micro-short drama theme salons, micro-short drama real-shooting training camps, and micro-short drama production base inspections were also held to build a platform for young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to participate in the creation of micro-short dramas and exchange experiences.\nFrom July 3 to 9, the 5th Cross-Strait Emei Martial Arts Cultural Exchange Event will be held in Leshan, Sichuan, with nearly 200 Chinese martial arts enthusiasts, experts and scholars from both sides participating. Martial arts enthusiasts from both sides of the Taiwan Strait compete on the same stage to exchange skills and jointly inherit the spirit of Chinese martial arts. They will also visit the Leshan Giant Buddha, the Golden Summit of Emei, the Forbidden City Cultural Relics Southward Relocation Exhibition Hall and the Giant Panda Base to experience the charm and development achievements of Sichuan's cultural tourism.\nIn addition, from July to August, the All-China Taiwan Federation will hold the 23rd Youth Summer Camp for Taiwan Compatriots with the theme of \"Dragon Veins, Youthful China\" to carry out study and exchanges around the achievements of Chinese modernization development, scientific and technological innovation, China's excellent traditional culture, cross-strait integrated development and other themes. A general summer camp visit and exchange event will be held in Wuhan, Hubei Province from July 3 to 6, with approximately 330 Taiwan compatriot youths participating. Afterwards, branch camp activities will be held in various parts of the mainland, covering 30 provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities, with approximately 1,300 Taiwanese youth participating.","近期，两岸各项交流活动持续热络，在此重点介绍其中几项。\n6月24日，两场苏台产业对接活动在江苏举办。一场是在南京举办的央企台企专场对接活动，16家央企与35家台资企业约120人参加，推动装备制造及电子信息领域央企资源与台企技术优势互补，助力苏台产业深度融合、双向赋能发展。另一场是在无锡举办的集成电路产业链对接活动，两岸近70家企业100余名业界人士参加，为两岸集成电路产业搭建精准匹配、高效对接的平台。\n6月26日至28日，2026年厦金湾桨板交流赛在福建厦门举办，两岸100余名桨板爱好者齐聚翔安大嶝岛，同场竞技、以赛会友，并前往大嶝原金门县政府旧址参加风狮爷文化集市、青年交流营等相关活动，共同感受闽南文化魅力。6月27日至7月1日，第四届厦台青少年音乐研学交流活动亦在厦门举办，两岸青少年共500余人以民族音乐为载体，切磋技艺、交融情感，其中4支台湾校园民乐队120名师生参加研学交流活动。\n6月26日，2026两岸青年微短剧大赛颁奖典礼在浙江东阳举办。大赛以“筑梦‘浙’里 剧连两岸”为主题，共征集两岸作品1070部，其中台湾作品125部，评选出“金茶花奖”最佳微短剧奖、最佳剧本奖等9类奖项。两岸影视行业从业者、青年、新闻记者和自媒体人等600余人参加颁奖典礼。大赛期间，还举办了微短剧主题沙龙、微短剧实拍训练营、微短剧制作基地考察等系列活动，为两岸青年深入参与微短剧创作和交流经验搭建平台。\n7月3日至9日，第五届海峡两岸峨眉武术文化交流活动将在四川乐山举行，两岸近200位中华武术爱好者及专家学者参与。两岸武术爱好者同台切磋技艺，共同传承中华武术精神，并将参访乐山大佛、峨眉金顶、故宫文物南迁陈列馆及大熊猫基地等，感受四川文旅魅力与发展成就。\n此外，7月至8月，全国台联将举办以“龙脉相传 青春中华”为主题的第二十三届台胞青年千人夏令营活动，围绕中国式现代化发展成就、科技创新、中华优秀传统文化、两岸融合发展等主题开展研习交流。7月3日至6日将在湖北武汉举办夏令营总营参访交流活动，约330名台胞青年参加。之后，将在大陆各地相继举办分营活动，覆盖30个省区市，约1300名台青参加。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","June 28 this year marks the 15th anniversary of the launch of individual tours for mainland residents to Taiwan. Some public opinion believes that tourism is a \"touch\" without words, and it is also the best way for both sides to win-win. Only close interaction can resolve differences. Individual tours will bring business opportunities and expand Taiwan's demand market. Any comment on this?","Tourism is the encounter between people and scenery, and the encounter between people. Group tours and individual tours to Taiwan will not only bring customers to Taiwan's cultural tourism industry, revitalize the island's consumer market, but also promote mutual understanding between compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. This is a mutually beneficial and win-win good thing, and the industry on the island is full of expectations.\nWe warmly welcome compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to interact with each other and travel together. When coming to the mainland, you can climb the Great Wall to experience the majesty of the mountains and rivers, walk into the Forbidden City in Beijing to appreciate the history and culture, and stroll through the West Lake in Hangzhou to appreciate the charm of the south of the Yangtze River. When in Taiwan, you can climb Mount Ali, go boating in the Sun Moon Lake, explore the Gukeng Green Tunnel, walk in the East Rift Valley, and enjoy the coastal scenery. The two sides of the Taiwan Strait are interdependent in mountains and rivers and have the same cultural heritage. It is expected that more compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait can visit and communicate across the Taiwan Strait to continuously enhance the friendship between compatriots and shorten the psychological distance.","旅游是人与景的邂逅，是人与人的相逢。赴台团队游、个人游既为台湾文旅行业带来客源，盘活岛内消费市场，也能促进两岸同胞相互了解，这是互利共赢的好事，岛内业界对此满怀期待。\n我们热忱欢迎两岸同胞相互来往、结伴游览。来大陆，大家可以登临万里长城感受山河壮阔，走进北京故宫感悟历史文化，漫步杭州西湖品味江南风韵；到台湾，可以攀登阿里山、泛舟日月潭，也能探访古坑绿色隧道，行走花东纵谷，尽享海岸风光。两岸山水相依、文脉同源，期待更多两岸同胞能够跨越海峡走访交流，不断增进同胞情谊，拉近心理距离。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","Summer is approaching, and many students on the island have expressed their interest in coming to the mainland to participate in research activities. Please tell us what kind of study activities can Taiwan Qingdao students take part in in mainland China? How to participate?","Conducting research and exchanges can help young people broaden their horizons and increase their knowledge. Mainland China is developing rapidly in science and technology, the Chinese culture has a long history, there are exciting sports and folk activities, and the research resources are very rich. We welcome young people from Taiwan to come to the mainland to participate in a variety of study activities and will provide various services and guarantees. Here I introduce three types of study activities to young Taiwanese friends.\nThe first is scientific and technological innovation research. Taiwanese teenagers who are interested in technological innovation can come to Shanghai to visit the Science and Technology Museum, the Maritime Museum, the Lingang Super Factory, etc., come to Shenzhen to experience leading companies in AI driverless driving and drone light shows, and come to Hangzhou to learn about the City Brain Operation Command Center, the Metaverse Experience Hall, etc.\nThe second is historical and cultural research. Taiwanese teenagers who are interested in history and culture can come to Beijing to visit the Forbidden City, the Great Wall, the National Museum, etc.; come to Henan to visit the Longmen Grottoes, Yin Ruins, Erlitou Summer Capital Ruins, Chinese Characters Museum, etc.; come to Shandong to climb Mount Tai, visit the Confucius Temple, and experience Qilu culture.\nThe third is sports folklore research. Taiwanese teenagers who want to exercise and experience passion can come to Guizhou to participate in village BA basketball games and experience spinning tops, bamboo pole dancing, etc.; come to Inner Mongolia to learn intangible cultural heritage skills such as Mongolian leather carving and wool felt handicrafts; and come to Heilongjiang to learn intangible cultural heritage skills such as Hezhen fish skin stickers.\nWe welcome Taiwan Qingdao students to study in various parts of the mainland, find what they love, learn what they are good at, and determine their own development space and future goals.","开展研学交流有助于青少年开拓眼界、增长知识。大陆科技发展日新月异，中华文化源远流长，体育民俗活动精彩纷呈，研学资源十分丰富。我们欢迎台湾青少年来大陆参加丰富多彩的研学活动，将做好各项服务和保障。在此我向台湾青少年朋友介绍三类研学活动。\n一是科技创新类研学。对科技创新感兴趣的台湾青少年可以来上海参观科技馆、航海博物馆、临港超级工厂等，来深圳体验AI无人驾驶、无人机灯光秀龙头企业等，来杭州了解城市大脑运营指挥中心、元宇宙体验馆等。\n二是历史文化类研学。对历史文化感兴趣的台湾青少年可以来北京参观故宫、长城、国家博物馆等，来河南参观龙门石窟、殷墟、二里头夏都遗址、中国文字博物馆等，来山东登临泰山，参观孔庙，体验齐鲁文化等。\n三是体育民俗类研学。既想锻炼身体又想体验激情的台湾青少年可以来贵州参加村BA篮球赛，体验打陀螺、竹竿舞等；来内蒙古学习蒙古皮雕、羊毛毡手作等非遗技艺；来黑龙江学习赫哲族鱼皮贴画等非遗技艺等。\n我们欢迎台青台生们来大陆各地研学，找到自己所爱，学习自己所好，确定自己的发展空间和未来目标。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774056.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Regarding the recent law enforcement patrols carried out by the mainland coast guard in the waters east of Taiwan, Lai Qingde said, \"China's recent maritime actions are expansion in the name of law enforcement, undermining the security, peace and stability of the Indo-Pacific region, and undermining the rules-based international order.\" Any comments on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. China has an exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the waters east of Taiwan Island. Japan and the Philippines bypassed China and initiated delimitation negotiations in relevant maritime areas without authorization, seriously violating international law and basic norms of international relations, seriously infringing on China's maritime rights and interests, and are completely illegal and invalid. The mainland coast guard's law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas are an exercise of jurisdiction in accordance with the law and a just act to safeguard the country's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests. It is also a necessary action against Japan and the Philippines for bypassing China and arbitrarily launching delimitation negotiations in this sea area and infringing on China's maritime rights and interests.\nThe DPP authorities have turned a blind eye to the abuses committed by Japan and the Philippines and turned a blind eye to the harm to the interests of the people on the island. However, they have taken the opportunity to spread the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" and incited \"anti-China resistance\". They have become an accomplice of external forces that infringe on the overall interests of the Chinese nation. This despicable and shameless behavior will be condemned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。中国在台湾岛以东海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。日本、菲律宾绕开中国擅自启动在相关海域划界谈判，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则，严重侵害中国海洋权益，完全非法无效。大陆海警在相关海域开展执法巡查，是依法行使管辖权，是维护国家领土主权和海洋权益的正义之举，也是针对日本、菲律宾绕开中国擅自启动在该海域划界谈判、侵害中国海洋权益采取的必要行动。\n民进党当局对日、菲侵权行径装聋作哑，对岛内民众利益受损视而不见，却借机大肆散播“台独”分裂谬论，煽动“反中抗中”，已沦为外部势力侵害中华民族整体利益的帮凶。这种卑劣无耻的行径必遭两岸同胞唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774052.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Recently, Zhang Xue, the founder of \"Zhang Xue Motorcycle\", was in a video connection with the first motorcycle owner on the island. When the owner praised \"your industrial technology is really advanced,\" Zhang Xue responded heartily, \"It's us,\" which aroused widespread emotional resonance among netizens on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Any comment on this?","This kind of conversation reminds me of a song \"We are all a family\", \"We were a family in the past, and we are still a family now.\" Because we are one family, Chinese people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait will be proud of a large number of mainland industrial technological innovation and development achievements such as \"Zhang Xue Motorcycle\". Because we are one family, our compatriots on the mainland are willing to take the lead in sharing the development opportunities of Chinese-style modernization with our Taiwan compatriots and jointly create the great cause of national rejuvenation. We warmly welcome our Taiwanese compatriots to visit the mainland and experience the rapid development of the motherland first-hand, actively participate in cross-strait exchanges, cooperation and integrated development, and work together to create a bright future for the Chinese nation.","这样的对话，让我想起一首歌《我们都是一家人》，“从前的时候是一家人，现在还是一家人”。因为我们是一家人，所以两岸中国人都会为“张雪机车”等一大批大陆产业技术创新发展成果感到骄傲。因为我们是一家人，大陆同胞愿意率先同台湾同胞共享中国式现代化发展机遇，共创民族复兴伟业。我们热忱欢迎广大台湾同胞多来大陆走走看看，亲身感受祖国大陆日新月异的发展，积极参与两岸交流合作、融合发展，携手共创中华民族美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","The summer vacation is about to begin, and some places in mainland China are gradually releasing internship positions for Taiqing students, which is very popular. How can we make it more convenient for more and more Taiwanese students from Qingdao and Taiwan to come to the mainland for internships and employment?","There are sufficient summer internship positions for Taiwanese Youth in various places and a wide range of categories, and they are welcomed by the majority of Taiwanese Youth and Taiwanese students. This fully demonstrates that high-quality development in the mainland contains vast opportunities, and cross-strait youth exchanges and integration are what the people want. The steady advancement of Chinese-style modernization will provide huge space for the development of Taiwanese compatriots, especially Taiwanese youth. Taiwanese youth can make great achievements in the vast world of the motherland. We warmly welcome Taiwanese compatriots, especially young friends, to come to the mainland to pursue, build, and realize their dreams. We will continue to create better conditions and more opportunities for this. We look forward to more young Taiwanese friends bravely rising to the forefront of the times and actively coming to the mainland for internships and employment, accumulating work experience, improving professional skills, expanding development space, and realizing their life ideals.","各地推出的暑期台青实习岗位充足、门类丰富，受到广大台青台生欢迎，充分说明大陆高质量发展蕴藏广阔机遇，两岸青年交流融合是民心所向。中国式现代化的稳步推进，将为广大台湾同胞特别是台湾青年发展提供巨大空间，台湾青年在祖国大陆的广阔天地可以大有作为。我们热忱欢迎台湾同胞特别是青年朋友来大陆追梦、筑梦、圆梦，将持续为此创造更好条件、更多机遇，期待更多台湾青年朋友勇立时代潮头，积极来大陆实习就业，积累岗位经验，提升职业技能，拓展发展空间，实现人生理想。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","According to media reports, the United States, the United Kingdom, France, and Germany have expressed concern about mainland coast guard ships conducting law enforcement patrols in waters east of Taiwan Island, claiming that relevant law enforcement actions threaten regional stability, freedom of navigation, and international shipping security. Taiwan's foreign affairs department is hyping this up. Any comment on…","Taiwan is part of China, and China has its exclusive economic zone and continental shelf in the waters east of Taiwan Island. The mainland coast guard's law enforcement inspections in relevant sea areas are an exercise of jurisdiction in accordance with the law and a just act to safeguard national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests. It is also a just action taken against Japan and the Philippines for bypassing China and arbitrarily launching delimitation negotiations in this sea area and infringing on China's maritime rights and interests.\nOur actions are reasonable, legal, legitimate and necessary, and are conducive to safeguarding the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation and the common interests of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, maintaining regional stability and maritime order, and protecting the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Strait. Relevant countries should respect China's sovereignty, territorial integrity and maritime rights and interests, instead of confusing right and wrong or confusing right and wrong. The DPP authorities not only compromised with Japan and the Philippines, but also supported the infringements committed by external forces, harmed the overall interests of the Chinese nation and the vital interests of Taiwanese fishermen in order to \"rely on foreign countries for independence\", and became a national scum. They have been spurned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait and must be liquidated by history.","台湾是中国的一部分，中国在台湾岛以东海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。大陆海警在相关海域开展执法巡查，是依法行使管辖权，是维护国家领土主权和海洋权益的正义之举，也是针对日本、菲律宾绕开中国擅自启动在该海域划界谈判、侵害中国海洋权益采取的正义行动。\n我们的行动合理合法、正当必要，有利于维护中华民族根本利益和两岸同胞共同利益，有利于维护地区稳定和海上秩序，有利于保障两岸渔民生命财产安全。有关国家应尊重中国的主权、领土完整和海洋权益，而不是混淆是非、颠倒黑白。民进党当局不仅对日、菲妥协退让，还为外部势力侵权行为帮腔，为“倚外谋独”损害中华民族整体利益及台湾渔民切身利益，沦为民族败类，已遭到两岸同胞的唾弃，必遭历史清算。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, the 17th Mainland Film Festival of the Cross-Strait Film Festival was held in Taiwan and was well received by audiences on the island. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The Mainland Film Exhibition of the 17th Cross-Strait Film Exhibition was held in Taipei from June 22 to 27. Eight mainland films with various styles, including \"The Sun is High\", \"Eastern Island\", and \"Chang'an's Lychee\", were screened together, bringing a feast of light and shadow to the island's audiences. During the film festival, many mainland filmmakers went to Taiwan to participate in a number of post-screening talks and industry exchange activities for the audience, interacting enthusiastically with Taiwanese audiences and sharing their creative experiences. We support and hope that cross-Strait film and television exchange activities will be held more and better, so as to promote mutual understanding and friendship between people on both sides of the Strait.","第十七届两岸电影展之大陆电影展于6月22日至27日在台北举办，《日掛中天》、《东极岛》、《长安的荔枝》等8部风格多样的大陆影片集中展映，为岛内观众带来一场光影盛宴。影展期间，多位大陆电影人赴台参加多场面向观众的映后谈和行业交流活动，与台湾观众热情互动、分享创作心得。我们支持并期盼两岸影视交流活动越办越多、越办越好，促进两岸民众相互了解、增进情谊。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","Mainland Affairs Council Chairman Qiu Chuizheng said in a recent interview that the consistent policy of the DPP authorities is to \"maintain the status quo.\" There is no issue of \"Taiwan independence\" in cross-strait relations at this stage, only the issue of \"forced reunification\" by the mainland. Any comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is the real status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The Democratic Progressive Party authorities use the \"new two-nation theory\" to define the current status of the Taiwan Strait, which is completely contrary to legal principles, history and reality. It is an out-and-out separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\". It engages in \"independence\" provocations, incites \"anti-China\" on the island, escalates cross-Strait confrontation, and undermines cross-Strait relations. It is the destroyer of the status quo in the Taiwan Strait and the root cause of tension and instability in the Taiwan Strait.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is incompatible with peace across the Taiwan Strait and runs counter to mainstream public opinion in Taiwan. If the DPP really believes that there is no \"Taiwan independence\" issue, it should immediately abandon the \"Taiwan independence party platform\", stop \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, and take practical actions to improve cross-strait relations.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是真正的台海现状。民进党当局以“新两国论”界定台海现状，完全违背法理、历史与现实，是不折不扣的“台独”分裂谬论。其大搞谋“独”挑衅，煽动岛内“反中抗中”，升高两岸对立对抗，破坏两岸关系，是台海现状的破坏者和台海局势紧张动荡的祸根乱源。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容，与台湾主流民意背道而驰。如果民进党真的认为没有“台独”问题，就应立即废弃“台独党纲”，停止“台独”分裂活动，承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，以实际行动改善两岸关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","Recently, the 6th Cross-Strait Zhongshan Forum was successfully held in Guangdong. Regarding the active participation of Taiwanese youths in this forum, Qiu Chuizheng, chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, said that \"low prices, on-site hospitality or full subsidies are obviously suspected of united front.\" Any comment on this?","It is a good thing for young people from both sides of the Taiwan Strait to gather together to commemorate Dr. Sun Yat-sen and discuss national rejuvenation. The DPP authorities politically manipulate such exchanges out of political selfishness, trying to create \"green terror\" and deter Taiwan compatriots from coming to the mainland. They are afraid that the \"information cocoon\" they have painstakingly fabricated will be exposed, and they are afraid that their lies that vilify the mainland and incite cross-strait confrontation will go bankrupt. I would like to warn the DPP authorities that compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait are one family, and the general trend of getting closer and coming together will not change. Any attempt to separate the two sides and seek \"independence\" confrontation will not succeed.","两岸青年相聚缅怀孙中山先生、共议民族复兴，是一件好事。民进党当局出于政治私利对这样的交流活动进行政治操弄，试图制造“绿色恐怖”、吓阻台湾同胞来大陆，害怕其苦心编造的“信息茧房”被戳破，害怕其丑化大陆、煽动两岸对立对抗的谎言破产。正告民进党当局，两岸同胞是一家人，走亲走近、走到一起的大潮流不会改变，任何割裂两岸、谋“独”对抗的图谋不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","上海东方卫视记者","In response to the DPP authorities' rejection of Shanghai and Fujian tourism operators' applications to travel to the island, tourism groups and industry players on the island have voiced their opposition, calling on the DPP authorities to do less political manipulation and allow tourism to take priority, leaving room for relaxation in cross-strait relations. Any comment on this?","Promoting the resumption of tourism to Taiwan by Shanghai and Fujian residents is a positive measure that conforms to the mainstream public opinion in Taiwanese society and promotes the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations. Stepping on the line is a routine industry operation. The purpose is to connect accommodation, attractions, and reception processes. It is a purely non-governmental and purely business exchange. However, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities unilaterally set the prerequisite that \"negotiation must first be negotiated by the tourism \"Two Sessions\"\" and directly rejected the application of the group that crossed the line to enter the island. This is a typical political manipulation and artificial obstacle. The industry's call for \"less political manipulation and let tourism take precedence\" fully reflects the dissatisfaction and opposition of the tourism industry to the DPP authorities' deliberate politicization of cross-strait tourism and ignoring the survival difficulties of tourism operators on the island and the livelihood demands of ordinary people.\nWe have always upheld the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Straits, promoted the resumption of travel for mainland residents to Taiwan and continued to express goodwill. Since 2024, we have resumed travel to Kinmen and Matsu for residents of Fujian and Shanghai. If the DPP authorities really care about the livelihood of business operators, they should lift restrictions on mainland residents traveling to Taiwan as soon as possible.","推动恢复上海、福建居民赴台湾旅游，是顺应台湾社会主流民意、促进两岸关系和平发展的积极举措。踩线是常规行业操作，目的是对接食宿、景点、接待流程，属于纯民间、纯业务交流。但民进党当局却单方面抛出“必须先经观光‘小两会’协商”作为前置门槛，直接驳回踩线团入岛申请，是典型的政治操弄、人为设障。业界呼吁“少一些政治操弄，让旅游观光先行”，充分反映了旅游业界对民进党当局蓄意将两岸旅游政治化、无视岛内旅游业者生存困难与普通民众民生诉求的不满和反对。\n我们始终秉持两岸一家亲理念，推动恢复大陆居民赴台旅游并持续释放善意，2024年以来先后恢复福建、上海居民赴金门、马祖旅游。如果民进党当局真的关心业者生计，就应尽早解除对大陆居民赴台旅游的限制。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774053.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, public opinion on the island pointed out that in the context of both the United States and China working hard to establish communication and reduce risks, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities must face up to the fact that peace across the Taiwan Strait requires political mutual trust. The issue of its \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\" is no longer just an intra-party issue of the Democratic…","The DPP stubbornly adheres to the stance of \"Taiwan independence,\" and the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\" is an example of its deliberate efforts to pursue \"Taiwan independence\" and attempt to split Taiwan from China. Since coming to power, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have wantonly colluded with external forces to pursue \"independence\" provocations, severely damaged cross-Strait relations, threatened peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and seriously damaged the security and well-being of the Taiwanese people. They have been opposed and spurned by the majority of Taiwan compatriots.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace across the Taiwan Strait are incompatible. \"Relying on foreign countries to seek independence\" cannot bring security and peace, and \"using force to seek independence\" will only lead Taiwan step by step into the abyss of disaster. The future of Taiwan and the safety, security, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots have always been tied to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and the reunification of the motherland. Only by abandoning the \"Taiwan Independence Party Platform\", stopping \"Taiwan Independence\" separatist activities, and recognizing the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle can the DPP truly improve cross-Strait relations and ensure peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. We are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with various political parties, groups and people from all walks of life in Taiwan on the basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" to jointly seek peace across the Taiwan Strait, welfare for our compatriots, and rejuvenation for the nation.","民进党顽固坚持“台独”立场，“台独党纲”是其处心积虑搞“台独”、企图把台湾从中国分裂出去的例证。民进党当局上台以来，大肆勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，严重破坏两岸关系，威胁台海和平稳定，严重损害台湾民众安全福祉，遭到广大台湾同胞的反对和唾弃。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。“倚外谋独”换不来安全与和平，“以武谋独”只会将台湾一步步带向灾难深渊。台湾的前途、台湾同胞的安全保障和利益福祉，始终系于两岸关系和平发展和祖国统一。民进党只有废弃“台独党纲”，停止“台独”分裂活动，承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，才能真正改善两岸关系，确保台海和平稳定。我们愿意在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，加强同台湾各政党、团体和各界人士交流沟通，共同为台海谋和平，为同胞谋福祉，为民族谋复兴。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774060.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","北京日报记者","Recently, when attending an exchange meeting on the island, Lai Qingde said that the award for \"Taiwan Odyssey\" showed that \"Taiwanese literature continues to be read, understood and affirmed by the world\", and declared that he would continue to expand the cultural budget and \"build Taiwanese literature and culture into an irreplaceable international force.\" Any comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. The mother body of Taiwanese culture is Chinese culture, which is not only an important part of Chinese culture, but also enriches the connotation of Chinese culture. Any remarks that promote the \"Taiwan independence view of history\" and ignore historical facts will be unanimously condemned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities are trying to smuggle the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\" into the international community in the name of culture, which goes against the trend of history and will only run into obstacles in the international community.","台湾是中国的一部分。台湾文化的母体是中华文化，既是中华文化的重要组成部分，也丰富了中华文化的内涵。任何宣扬“台独史观”、罔顾历史事实的言论，必将遭到两岸同胞的一致谴责。民进党当局妄图借文化之名在国际社会偷渡“台独”分裂谬论，违背历史潮流，只会在国际社会四处碰壁。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Recently, the director of the Taipei Office of the American Institute in Taiwan accepted an exclusive interview with the island media and said that 70% of Taiwan's public opinion supports \"maintaining the status quo\", which can be used as the basis for dialogue between Taiwan leaders and the mainland. The mainland's attempts to create divisions in Taiwan will not get the desired results. The US policy towards…","The meeting between the heads of state of China and the United States reached important consensus and achieved fruitful results. Some people are jumping up and down, subtly and covertly contradicting President Trump's Taiwan-related statements, creating noise on the Taiwan issue, and slandering and slandering the mainland's Taiwan policy. They have sinister intentions. We are firmly opposed to this.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is the real status quo across the Taiwan Strait. Any attempt by anyone or any force to change this status quo will not succeed.","中美元首会晤达成重要共识，取得丰硕成果。某些人上蹿下跳，对特朗普总统的涉台表态阳奉阴违，在台湾问题上制造杂音，对大陆对台政策污蔑抹黑，用心险恶，我们对此坚决反对。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分，这是真正的台海现状。任何人、任何势力妄想改变这一现状的企图都不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","人民政协报记者","The National Unity and Progress Promotion Law has been officially implemented. Some DPP politicians claimed that the regulations would create a \"chilling effect\" on Taiwan's academic circles, media and people friendly to Taiwan by holding overseas organizations and individuals accountable, and use legal tools to expand \"cross-border suppression.\" Any comment on this?","As a promotional law that safeguards the fundamental interests and overall interests of the Chinese nation, the formal implementation of the Law on the Promotion of National Unity and Progress will provide a solid legal guarantee for the steady and long-term development of the cause of national unity and progress, and will gather great strength to promote people of all ethnic groups in the country to jointly promote the construction of a strong country and the great cause of national rejuvenation through Chinese-style modernization.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Straits belong to the same Chinese nation and are all Chinese. People of all ethnic groups, including our Taiwan compatriots, have jointly created a unified multi-ethnic country, jointly written the glorious history of China, jointly created the splendid Chinese culture, and have condensed into a community with a shared future of blood, same beliefs, cultural interdependence, economic interdependence, and emotional affinity. The implementation of the National Unity and Progress Promotion Law will be conducive to further promoting cross-Strait economic and cultural exchanges and cooperation, deepening the integrated development of various fields across the Strait, promoting compatriots on both sides of the Strait to jointly inherit and carry forward Chinese culture, and enhancing Taiwan compatriots' sense of belonging, identity, and honor towards the Chinese nation.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence\". Out of political self-interest, they have repeatedly made irresponsible remarks about the law, spread slanders, fabricated lies, and deliberately confuse the public. The purpose is to incite cross-strait confrontation and intimidate the Taiwanese people. They have ulterior motives and will not succeed.","民族团结进步促进法作为一部维护中华民族根本利益和整体利益的促进型法律，其正式实施，将为民族团结进步事业的行稳致远提供坚实法治保障，为推动全国各族人民共同以中国式现代化推进强国建设、民族复兴伟业凝聚磅礴力量。\n两岸同胞同属中华民族，都是中国人。包括台湾同胞在内的各族人民共同缔造了统一的多民族国家，共同书写了辉煌的中国历史，共同创造了灿烂的中华文化，凝聚成血脉相融、信念相同、文化相通、经济相依、情感相亲的命运共同体。民族团结进步促进法的实施，有利于进一步促进两岸经济文化交流合作，深化两岸各领域融合发展，推动两岸同胞共同传承弘扬中华文化，增进台湾同胞对中华民族的归属感、认同感、荣誉感。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，出于政治私利，一再对该法说三道四、造谣抹黑，编造谎言，故意混淆视听，目的是煽动两岸对立对抗，恐吓台湾民众，居心叵测，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774061.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","Recently, Taiwanese artist Zeng Peici won the championship in Hunan Satellite TV's \"Chengfeng 2026\" program. Taiwanese players successfully scored goals in the Fujian Super League. Many Taiwanese compatriots have found a broad platform to display their talents in all walks of life on the mainland, which personally proves that the mainland has huge development opportunities. Any comment on this?","As you can see, the five \"Taiwanese sisters\" participating in \"Riding the Wind 2026\" not only brought unique stage performances to the audience, but also impressed audiences on both sides of the Taiwan Strait with their courage to break through themselves. In the Fujian Super League, 12 Taiwanese players have joined the team, playing side by side with their mainland teammates, working closely together, scoring many goals, and winning enthusiastic support from fans on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Facts have proved that if you have passion and persevere to the end, you can win applause on bigger and bigger stages.\nThe \"bigness\" of the mainland lies in its large stage and great opportunities. The development of economy, culture, education, science and technology, sports, health and other undertakings has provided a large stage and created great opportunities for Taiwan compatriots to display their talents and realize their dreams. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland to develop and realize their dreams, keeping pace with the times and walking with the motherland.","大家看到，参与《乘风2026》的5位“台湾姐姐”不仅给观众带来各具特色的舞台表演，更以勇于突破自我的风采折服两岸观众。在福建闽超联赛赛场，已经有12名台胞球员加入球队，与大陆队友并肩作战，配合默契，多次破门得分，获得两岸球迷热烈支持。事实证明，心怀热爱、坚持到底，就能在越来越大的舞台获得掌声。\n大陆之“大”，在于舞台之大、机遇之大，经济、文化、教育、科技、体育、卫生等事业的发展，为台湾同胞施展才华、实现梦想提供了大舞台、创造着大机遇。我们热忱欢迎广大台湾同胞到大陆来发展、圆梦，与时代同频，与祖国同行。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","According to the milk market price rankings recently released by the Global Statistics Database, milk prices in Taiwan rank first in the world at US$3.07 per liter. In the face of complaints from people on the island, the DPP authorities deliberately turned the topic to \"anti-China.\" Any comment on this?","When it comes to milk, I can inform you of a set of data: Mainland China will produce 40.91 million tons of milk annually in 2025; the average retail price of urban fresh milk in May this year was 11.5 yuan per liter, only about half of the milk price in Taiwan; diversified dairy products meet diversified market demands; during the \"14th Five-Year Plan\" period, the average height of boys aged 6 to 17 increased by 2.1 cm, and the average height of girls increased by 2.2 cm. It can be said that the mainland has a stable supply of fresh milk, excellent quality and high cost performance, and there is huge potential for cross-strait cooperation in the field of dairy products.\nRegrettably, the DPP authorities pay no attention to people's livelihood issues that are related to the vital interests of the people on the island. They only care about political self-interest and political manipulation. On the one hand, they unilaterally restrict the import of mainland agricultural products into Taiwan, hindering cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, abandoning the near and far away, spending a lot of money, and are willing to act as a \"cash machine\" for external forces; on the other hand, they divert public attention by inciting oppositional sentiments, and immediately \"blame the mainland\" whenever governance incompetence and shortcomings are exposed. This trick has long been seen through by compatriots on the island.","提到牛奶，可以向大家通报一组数据：大陆2025年年产牛奶4091万吨；今年5月城市鲜奶平均零售价每升11.5元人民币，仅约为台湾奶价的一半；多元奶制品满足多样化市场需求；“十四五”期间6岁至17岁青少年男生平均身高增长2.1厘米、女生平均身高增长2.2厘米。可以说，大陆生鲜奶源供应稳定、品质优秀、性价比高，两岸在奶制品领域合作潜力巨大。\n遗憾的是，民进党当局对于事关岛内民众切身利益的民生问题毫不在意，一心只有政治私利、只顾政治操弄。他们一边单方面限制大陆农产品输入台湾，阻碍两岸交流合作，舍近求远，大把撒钱，甘当外部势力的“提款机”；一边靠煽动对立情绪转移民众注意力，但凡治理失能、短板暴露，就立刻“甩锅大陆”，这种伎俩早已被岛内同胞所看破。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","Taiwan's \"Beautiful Island Electronic News\" recently released the latest poll, which showed that 47.6% of the people were dissatisfied with Lai Ching-te's governance, an increase of 2.7 percentage points from May, and a \"death cross\" in which satisfaction dropped by 1.7 percentage points from May. Some public opinion on the island also criticized Lai Qingde's administration for having no concrete achievements…","Relevant polls and public opinion on the island show that Lai Qingde's authorities only care about political self-interest, ignore people's livelihood and well-being, are contrary to public opinion, and are unpopular.\nFor some time, the Lai Ching-te authorities have been peddling the separatist fallacy of \"Taiwan independence\", constantly seeking \"independence\" provocations, trying every means to manipulate \"anti-China and anti-China\", obstructing and undermining cross-strait exchanges and cooperation; suppressing and persecuting political dissidents, and engaging in \"green terror\"; for their own selfish interests, they have tied the Taiwanese people to the \"Taiwan independence\" chariot and pushed Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war; there is no bottom line to flatter foreigners and sincerity, and stubbornly \"rely on foreign countries\" and \"use force to seek independence.\" People on the island no longer buy into the political deceit of the Lai Ching-te administration, and increasingly see it as the biggest source of chaos for peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and the biggest scourge for Taiwan's people's livelihood and well-being. Only by resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference can peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait be effectively maintained, and the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan's development prospects be effectively guaranteed.","相关民调及岛内舆论表明，赖清德当局只顾政治私利、漠视民生福祉，背离民意，不得人心。\n一段时间以来，赖清德当局大肆兜售“台独”分裂谬论，不断谋“独”挑衅，费尽心机操弄“反中抗中”，阻限破坏两岸交流合作；打压迫害政治异己，大搞“绿色恐怖”；为一己私利不惜把台湾老百姓绑上“台独”战车、把台湾推向兵凶战危险境；无底线媚外输诚，顽固“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”。岛内民众对赖清德当局的政治骗术已经不买账了，越来越看清其是台海和平稳定的最大乱源、台湾民生福祉的最大祸端。只有坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，台海和平稳定才能得到切实维护，台湾同胞的利益福祉、台湾的发展前途才能得到切实保障。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","The National Unity and Progress Promotion Law has been officially implemented. How will the mainland define the legal boundary between undermining national unity and legitimate cross-strait people-to-people exchanges? Are you worried that under this relatively \"fuzzy\" definition, there is a risk of overturning the dividends of cross-strait people-to-people exchanges in the past? If Taiwanese people discuss…","The Mainland Affairs Council's remarks about the National Unity and Progress Promotion Act are completely rumors and slander, deliberately confusing the public, fabricating so-called \"risks\", intimidating the Taiwanese people and creating a \"chilling effect.\" The door to cross-strait exchanges is always open. We always welcome Taiwan compatriots and businessmen to come to the mainland to carry out exchanges and cooperation in various fields. It is convenient and easy for Taiwan compatriots and businessmen to come to the mainland without any worries. We have also always safeguarded the life, property, safety and legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including Taiwan compatriots, in accordance with the law, and at the same time persisted in cracking down on various illegal crimes in accordance with the law. If \"Taiwan independence\" forces carry out actions to split the nation and undermine national unity for the purpose of seeking \"independence\", they will also be punished in accordance with the law.","陆委会对民族团结进步促进法的有关说法完全是造谣抹黑，故意混淆视听，编造所谓“风险”，恐吓台湾民众，制造“寒蝉效应”。两岸交流的大门始终是敞开的，我们始终欢迎广大台胞台商来大陆开展各领域交流合作，台胞台商来大陆既方便又轻松，不需要有任何顾虑。我们也始终依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞生命财产安全和合法权益，同时坚持依法打击各类违法犯罪。如果“台独”势力出于谋“独”目的施行分裂民族、破坏民族团结的行为，也必将依法受到惩治。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","香港经济导报记者","Lai Ching-te recently said, \"China has weaponized agricultural products in an attempt to use agriculture to force government, including banning imports and raising tariffs under the pretext that the United States and Japan have become the top two export markets for Taiwan's agricultural products.\" Any comment on this?","Mainland China has always been an important export destination for Taiwan's agricultural products. We uphold the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and do our best to do practical things, do good things, and solve problems for Taiwan compatriots, and take a series of measures to help Taiwan's farmers and fishermen friends expand the mainland market, find ways to expand sales for Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products, and stabilize profits, so that more and more Taiwanese farmers and fishermen can enjoy the dividends of Chinese-style modern development and live a better life.\nThe DPP authorities have not only long-term unilaterally restricted the import of mainland agricultural products to Taiwan (including more than a thousand agricultural products), obstructed normal economic and trade exchanges and exchanges and cooperation between the two sides, and threatened to punish county mayors and relevant agricultural and fishery associations that actively promote the export of Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products to the mainland. They have also surrendered to the United States, betrayed Taiwan's core industries, and implemented \"zero tariffs\" on 4,885 industrial products and 1,482 agricultural products from the United States, seriously damaging the interests of Taiwan's related industries and the welfare of the people.\nTaiwan's farmers and fishermen have a clear account of who is sincerely seeking benefits for the people, and who is tyrannical and blocking people's profits. Grassroots businessmen in Taiwan are worried and extremely indignant that the DPP authorities not only fail to help farmers and fishermen solve practical problems, but also try their best to obstruct cross-strait exchanges and cooperation, trying to please outsiders by sacrificing the island's industries and people's livelihood. We advise the DPP authorities to stop political manipulation and do more things that are beneficial to the interests and well-being of the Taiwanese people.","大陆一直都是台湾农产品的重要出口地。我们秉持两岸一家亲理念，尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事，采取一系列措施，帮助台湾农渔民朋友拓展大陆市场，为台湾农渔产品找出路、拓销路、稳收益，让越来越多台湾农渔民享受到中国式现代化发展红利，过上更美好的生活。\n民进党当局不仅长期单方面限制大陆农产品输入台湾（包括超过千余项农产品），阻挠两岸正常经贸往来和交流合作，扬言惩处积极推动台湾农渔产品输陆的县市长和相关农渔协会，还跪美输诚，出卖台湾核心产业，对美国4885项工业产品及1482项农产品实施“零关税”，严重损害台湾相关产业利益和民众福祉。\n谁真心实意为民众谋利，谁专横跋扈挡民众获利，台湾农渔民心中有明明白白的一笔账。台湾基层业者忧心忡忡，对民进党当局不仅不帮助农渔民解决实际问题，还极力阻挠两岸交流合作、妄想靠献祭岛内产业和民众生计来讨外人欢心有极大愤慨。奉劝民进党当局停止政治操弄，多做有利于台湾民众利益福祉的事情。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260702_12774059.htm"],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, Lai Ching-te said at the joint graduation ceremony of Taiwan's military academies, \"In the face of China's military actions around the Taiwan Strait, Taiwan will continue to improve its self-defense, cooperate with the Democratic Alliance to exert deterrent force, and achieve peace with strength. The national military must establish a clear awareness of ourselves and the enemy, resist threats and…","Lai Qingde's relevant remarks further exposed his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" stance and his sinister intentions of \"seeking independence by force\" and \"relying on foreign countries to seek independence.\" It ignores the mainstream public opinion on the island that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation, vigorously promotes the fallacy of separatism, exaggerates the so-called \"mainland threat\", deliberately escalates cross-strait confrontation and undermines peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait. It will only push Taiwan into a dangerous situation of war and danger. It is an out-and-out \"cross-strait peace destroyer\", \"Taiwan Strait crisis creator\" and \"war instigator\".\nThe general trend of the reunification of the motherland is vast and rolling forward. Any act that goes against the general trend is doomed to failure, and any attempt to split the country will go bankrupt.","赖清德相关言论进一步暴露其顽固“台独”立场和“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”的险恶用心。其罔顾岛内要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意，大肆鼓吹分裂谬论、渲染所谓“大陆威胁”，蓄意升高两岸对立对抗、破坏台海和平稳定，只会把台湾推向兵凶战危的险境，是不折不扣的“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”、“战争煽动者”。\n祖国统一大势浩浩荡荡、滚滚向前，任何违逆大势的行径都注定失败，任何分裂国家的图谋都必将破产。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","The first question, regarding the National Unity and Progress Promotion Law, Taiwan’s Mainland Affairs Council and the Democratic Progressive Party stated that “this law is too subjective.” How does the mainland respond to questions about the law's \"vague criminalization\" or \"unification or independence\"? Can it be clearly defined?\nThe second question is that on the 16th anniversary of the signing of ECFA, the…","The first question. There is no such thing as \"vague criminalization\" or \"unification or independence\". The relevant statements made by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities are completely slanderous, deliberately confusing the public, fabricating so-called \"risks\", and intimidating the Taiwanese people. We always welcome Taiwanese compatriots and businessmen to come to the mainland to carry out exchanges and cooperation in various fields. It is convenient and easy for Taiwanese compatriots and businessmen to come to the mainland. We have also always protected the life, property, safety and legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, including Taiwan compatriots, in accordance with the law, and persisted in cracking down on various illegal crimes in accordance with the law.\nSecond question. Since coming to power, the Democratic Progressive Party authorities have stubbornly adhered to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance, advocated the \"decoupling and breaking of links\" in cross-strait economic and trade, and implemented more discriminatory trade restriction policies against the mainland. On the other hand, they have colluded with external forces, betrayed Taiwan's core industries, and harmed the interests of most Taiwanese industries and people. This despicable trick will only make compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait more aware of the selfishness of the DPP authorities and the risk of the DPP authorities exacerbating Taiwan's economic structural problems.\nThe third question. From January to May this year, cross-strait trade volume reached US$150.837 billion, a year-on-year increase of 22%. Among them, mainland China's exports to Taiwan were US$41.874 billion, a year-on-year increase of 30.6%; China's imports from Taiwan were US$108.963 billion, a year-on-year increase of 19.1%. These figures show that the economic ties between the two sides of the Taiwan Strait have not weakened, but have strengthened.\nThe problems that arise in cross-Strait economic and trade are entirely due to the fact that the DPP authorities ignore the objective fact that the cross-Strait economies are highly complementary and inseparable, deliberately destroy the cross-Strait industrial and supply chains, and artificially restrict and interfere with the investment layout of Taiwanese businesses. On the one hand, they forcefully promote cross-strait \"decoupling and cutting off chains\"; on the other hand, they vigorously hype the so-called \"non-red supply chain\". This is completely retrograde and puts political self-interest above economic laws. It destroys the foundation of the long-term development of Taiwan's industries and harms the vital interests of Taiwanese businessmen and enterprises.\nStrengthening cross-Strait economic cooperation and deepening cross-Strait integrated development is the right path in the world that serves the common interests of compatriots and enterprises on both sides. The mainland's economy has strong resilience, great potential, good foundation, broad development space and bright prospects. It has always been the best choice for Taiwanese businessmen and enterprises to invest and start businesses. No matter how the situation changes, the trend of closer exchanges and cooperation and deepening integrated development between the two sides of the Taiwan Straits is unstoppable.\nThe fourth question. In June 2010, the two sides of the Taiwan Strait signed the \"Cross-Strait Economic Cooperation Framework Agreement\" (ECFA) on the political basis of the \"1992 Consensus\". Over the years, we have earnestly fulfilled our commitments, promoted and guaranteed the effectiveness and implementation of ECFA, and brought tangible benefits to relevant enterprises and people on the island, especially the majority of small and medium-sized enterprises, farmers and fishermen.\nThe DPP attacked ECFA before coming to power and severely hindered the implementation of ECFA after taking office. Not only did it fail to take practical measures to lift discriminatory trade restrictions on the mainland, it also continued to intensify the revision of rules and set up obstacles, maliciously obstructing and undermining normal cross-strait economic exchanges and cooperation. As a result, relevant mainland departments had to suspend tariff concessions for some ECFA products. The relevant responsibility lies entirely with the DPP authorities.\nTo protect and enhance the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots, the key is for compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait to unite, resolutely oppose the separatist activities of \"Taiwan independence\", eradicate the root causes of \"Taiwan independence\", and jointly safeguard the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations. On the basis of the \"1992 Consensus\", any issues related to ECFA can be properly resolved through cross-strait consultations. But if the DPP authorities ignore public opinion and even create more problems, they will definitely shoot themselves in the foot.","第一个问题。完全没有所谓“模糊入罪”、“非统即独”的问题。民进党当局的有关说法完全是造谣抹黑，故意混淆视听，编造所谓“风险”，恐吓台湾民众。我们始终欢迎广大台胞台商来大陆开展各领域交流合作，台胞台商来大陆既方便又轻松。我们也始终依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞生命财产安全和合法权益，坚持依法打击各类违法犯罪。\n第二个问题。民进党当局上台以来，一方面顽固坚持“台独”立场，鼓吹两岸经贸“脱钩断链”，对大陆实行更多歧视性贸易限制政策，一方面勾连外部势力，出卖台湾核心产业，损害大部分台湾产业和民众利益。这种卑劣伎俩只会让两岸同胞更加看清民进党当局的自私自利，看清民进党当局加剧台湾经济结构性问题的风险。\n第三个问题。今年1至5月，两岸贸易额1508.37亿美元，同比增长22%。其中，大陆对台出口418.74亿美元，同比增长30.6%；自台进口1089.63亿美元，同比增长19.1%，这些数字说明两岸的经济联系不是变弱了，而是增强了。\n两岸经贸中出现的问题，完全是因为民进党当局不顾两岸经济互补性强、密不可分的客观事实，处心积虑破坏两岸产业链供应链，人为限制干扰台商投资布局。他们一方面强推两岸“脱钩断链”，另一方面极力炒作所谓“非红供应链”，完全是将政治私利凌驾于经济规律之上的倒行逆施，破坏的是台湾产业长远发展根基，伤害的是广大台商台企的切身利益。\n加强两岸经济合作、深化两岸融合发展，是符合两岸同胞、企业共同利益的人间正道。大陆经济韧性强、潜力大、基础好，发展空间广阔，前景光明，始终是广大台商台企投资兴业的最佳选择。无论风云如何变幻，两岸密切交流合作、深化融合发展的大势不可阻挡。\n第四个问题。2010年6月，两岸在“九二共识”政治基础上，签署了《海峡两岸经济合作框架协议》（ECFA）。多年来，我们切实履行承诺，推动和保障了ECFA的生效和实施，为岛内相关企业和民众，特别是广大中小企业和农渔民带来了实实在在的利益。\n民进党在上台前攻击ECFA，上台后严重阻碍ECFA实施，不仅不采取切实措施解除对大陆歧视性贸易限制，还不断变本加厉修改规则、设置障碍，恶意阻挠破坏两岸经济正常交流合作，导致大陆有关部门不得不中止ECFA部分产品的关税减让。相关责任完全在民进党当局。\n广大台湾同胞的利益福祉要得到保障和增进，关键在于两岸同胞团结起来，坚决反对“台独”分裂行径，铲除“台独”祸根，共同维护两岸关系和平发展。在“九二共识”基础上，与ECFA有关的任何问题可以通过两岸协商予以妥善解决。但如果民进党当局罔顾民意，甚至制造更多问题，必将搬起石头砸自己的脚。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-02","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","Regarding the 16th anniversary of the signing of ECFA, the Mainland Affairs Council stated that \"cross-strait economic and trade has undergone structural changes.\" How do you comment on the phenomenon of \"de-mainlandization\" of Taiwan's economy and trade while Taiwan's economy is on the rise?","It is impossible to \"de-mainland\" Taiwan's economy and trade.\nTwo points need to be emphasized: First, the Cross-Strait Economic Cooperation Framework Agreement (ECFA) is an important institutionalized economic cooperation achievement signed by the two sides on the political basis of the 1992 Consensus. Since the implementation of ECFA, it has brought tangible benefits to relevant enterprises and people on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, especially in Taiwan. However, the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the stance of \"Taiwan independence\" and do not recognize the \"1992 Consensus.\" They not only refuse to implement the cross-Strait services trade agreement under the ECFA, but also refuse to take measures to lift trade restrictions on the mainland, seriously undermining cross-Strait negotiations and the foundation for ECFA implementation. The responsibility for ECFA’s failure to benefit more businesses and people in Taiwan lies entirely with the DPP authorities.\nSecond, we uphold the concept of one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, actively deepen cross-Strait integrated development, and enhance the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Cross-Strait trade volume will reach US$314.33 billion in 2025, maintaining a high growth rate of 7.3% despite the slowdown in global trade growth. 8,132 new Taiwan-funded enterprises have been established in the mainland, indicating that cross-Strait industrial cooperation is becoming increasingly close and economic and trade exchanges continue to be vigorous. The development history and fruitful results of cross-Strait economic and trade relations fully demonstrate that the motherland has always been a strong backing for Taiwan compatriots and Taiwanese enterprises and the best choice for investment and business development. Deepening cross-Strait integrated development is the only way to benefit the people's livelihood and well-being on both sides of the Strait.\nThe press conference ends here. Thank you all.","台湾经贸是不可能“去大陆化”的。\n需要强调两点：第一，《海峡两岸经济合作框架协议》（ECFA）是两岸在“九二共识”政治基础上签署的重要经济制度化合作成果。ECFA实施以来，给两岸特别是台湾相关企业和民众带来实实在在的利益。但是，民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，不承认“九二共识”，不仅拒绝实施ECFA项下的两岸服务贸易协议，还拒不采取措施取消对大陆贸易限制措施，严重破坏两岸协商和ECFA实施基础。ECFA不能惠及更多广大台湾业者和民众的责任完全在民进党当局。\n第二，我们秉持两岸一家亲理念，积极深化两岸融合发展，增进两岸同胞利益福祉。2025年两岸贸易额达3143.3亿美元，在全球贸易增速放缓背景下保持7.3%的高位增长，大陆新设台资企业8132家，显示两岸产业合作日益密切、经贸往来持续热络。两岸经贸关系发展历程和丰硕成果充分说明，祖国大陆始终是台胞台企坚强后盾和投资兴业的最佳选择，深化两岸融合发展是惠及两岸民生福祉的必由之路。\n发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260702_12774050.htm","",1,2,7,""],[0,"2026-07-03","Guo Jiakun","China News Service","It is reported that Taiwan’s so-called “Ministry of Foreign Affairs” said recently that Taiwan is in contact with Honduras for restoring their diplomatic relations. President of Paraguay Peña, when visiting Taiwan, said that he strongly encourage Honduras to look at the partnership that Paraguay and Taiwan have. However, Honduras’ Foreign Minister Agüero said that Honduras has already refuted claims of alleged…","We commend Foreign Minister Agüero’s remarks on China. The one-China principle is a prevailing international consensus and a basic norm in international relations. It is what the greater national interests entail and where global opinion trends and the arc of history bends. The Taiwan authorities are going against the overwhelming tide. All separatist acts aimed at “Taiwan independence” are doomed to fail and will bring nothing but shame.\nSince diplomatic ties were established between China and Honduras in 2023, bilateral relations have grown rapidly on the basis of the one-China principle, with fruitful outcomes in practical cooperation. Facts have fully proven that the establishment of diplomatic relations serves the fundamental and long-term interests of both countries and peoples. On the basis of the one-China principle, China stands ready to advance relations with Honduras for the greater benefit of both peoples.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260703_11974685.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on July 8, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press conference hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-strait hot issues.","Dear journalist friends, hello everyone, welcome to attend the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Now please ask your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家好，欢迎前来参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。现在请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,2,7,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","新华社记者","Taiwan's defense department recently stated that in consideration of the increasing \"military threat from the mainland to Taiwan\" and in order to understand the mission of soldiers \"why and for whom they fight,\" the \"patriotic education and political training course\" for military officer school graduates was renamed to \"anti-communist patriotic education.\" Any comment on this?","The Communist Party of China is the vanguard of the Chinese people and the Chinese nation. Since its founding 105 years ago, it has led the people through unremitting struggle to completely end the history of old China's domestic and foreign troubles, poverty and weakness, and its decline into a semi-colonial and semi-feudal society. It has established a new China in which the people are the masters of the country. , it took only a few decades to complete the industrialization process that developed countries had gone through for hundreds of years, created two miracles of rapid economic development and long-term social stability, achieved historic and brilliant achievements that are universally recognized, and wrote the most magnificent epic in the thousands-year history of the Chinese nation. The Communist Party of China has always adhered to its original mission of seeking happiness for the Chinese people and rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. It has always maintained flesh-and-blood ties with the people, and has always received the heartfelt support and support of the people. It is the core of leadership in contemporary China.\nThe Democratic Progressive Party authorities are trying to instill \"anti-communist\" views into military academy graduates in Taiwan and instigate them to fight for \"Taiwan independence\" and the Democratic Progressive Party. This is reversing the course of history and deliberately elevating cross-strait antagonism and confrontation.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and \"seeking independence through force\" is a dead end. We hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will recognize the evil intentions and harm of the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, refuse to be buried or cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\", stand on the right side of history and the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, join hands with us to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, promote the great cause of reunification of the motherland, and jointly create the long-lasting welfare of the Chinese nation.","中国共产党是中国人民和中华民族的先锋队，成立105年来，领导人民经过不懈奋斗，彻底结束旧中国内忧外患、积贫积弱、沦为半殖民地半封建社会的历史，建立了人民当家作主的新中国，仅用几十年时间就走完发达国家几百年走过的工业化历程，创造了经济快速发展和社会长期稳定两大奇迹，取得了举世公认的历史性辉煌成就，书写了中华民族几千年历史上最恢宏的史诗。中国共产党始终坚守为中国人民谋幸福、为中华民族谋复兴的初心使命，始终保持着同人民群众的血肉联系，也始终得到人民衷心的拥护和支持，是当代中国的领导核心。\n民进党当局企图对台湾地区军校毕业生灌输“反共”主张，教唆他们为“台独”而战、为民进党而战，是在大开历史倒车，是在蓄意升高两岸对立对抗。\n“台独”是绝路，“以武谋独”是死路一条。希望广大台湾同胞认清“台独”分裂势力的祸心和危害，拒绝成为“台独”的陪葬和炮灰，站在历史正确的一边、站在中华民族伟大复兴的一边，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，与我们携手推动两岸关系和平发展、推进祖国统一大业，共同开创中华民族绵长福祉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775133.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中新社记者","Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council recently stated on the so-called \"how to distinguish normal cross-strait exchanges from united front activities\" that there is no problem with normal cross-strait exchanges. However, any activities hosted by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the Mainland China to declare a unified stance on Taiwan have a united front nature that is quite clear. Cross-strait exchanges will be…","I would like to ask the DPP authorities, do they know what united front is? Do you know the origin and original meaning of united front? \"United Front\" is the abbreviation of United Front. Its essence is great unity and alliance, which unites people's hearts and gathers strength. It unites all forces that can be united and mobilizes all positive factors that can be mobilized to work together for the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation on the basis of common interests, common goals, common emotions and common future. The united front work has been carried out for many years and is fair and aboveboard.\nIn our work with Taiwan, we have always kept in mind the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation and the common interests of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We have always insisted on uniting the majority of Taiwan compatriots, fully understood the special historical experience of Taiwan compatriots, fully considered the actual situation in Taiwan, and fully accommodated the interests and feelings of all classes and groups in Taiwan. We are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with various political parties, groups and people from all walks of life in Taiwan on the basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\". We will continue to uphold the concept of \"one family on both sides of the Taiwan Strait\", continue to implement equal treatment for Taiwan compatriots, introduce policies and measures to benefit Taiwan and the people, smooth channels for cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation and personnel exchanges, facilitate Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan companies to share development opportunities in the mainland, and continuously enhance the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait.\nThe DPP authorities have repeatedly \"stigmatized\" the United Front and used it to discredit the mainland's policies to benefit Taiwan and the people, cross-Strait exchange activities, and intimidate and suppress Taiwan compatriots who participate in cross-Strait exchanges. In their eyes, do they still have normal cross-Strait exchanges? We hope that the majority of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly their sinister intentions and despicable acts, join us in resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, jointly promote cross-Strait exchanges and integration, continuously enhance the family well-being of compatriots, and jointly create a bright future for the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation.","试问民进党当局，知道什么是统战吗？知道统战的本源、本义吗？“统战”是统一战线的简称，其本质是大团结、大联合，是凝聚人心、汇聚力量，是在共同利益、共同目标、共同情感和共同前途的基础上，把一切可以团结的力量团结起来，把一切可以调动的积极因素调动起来，为中华民族伟大复兴共同奋斗。统战工作行之有年，光明正大。\n我们的对台工作始终胸怀中华民族根本利益和两岸同胞共同利益，始终坚持团结广大台湾同胞，充分理解台湾同胞的特殊历史遭遇，充分考虑台湾地区的现实情况，充分照顾台湾各阶层、各群体的利益感情。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，加强同台湾各政党、团体和各界人士交流沟通。我们将继续秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，面向台湾同胞持续落实同等待遇，出台惠台利民政策举措，畅通两岸经贸合作、人员往来渠道，方便台胞台企分享大陆发展机遇，不断增进两岸同胞利益福祉。\n民进党当局一再把统战“污名化”，并用以抹黑大陆惠台利民政策、两岸交流活动，恐吓打压参与两岸交流的台湾同胞，在他们眼里还有正常的两岸交流吗？希望广大台湾同胞看清其险恶用心和卑劣行径，与我们一道坚决反对“台独”分裂，共同促进两岸交流融合，不断增进同胞亲情福祉，共同创造祖国统一、民族复兴的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775132.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","香港凤凰卫视记者","Raymond Greene, director of the Taipei Office of the American Institute in Taiwan (AIT), recently said that nothing can be more effective in deterring conflicts than turning Taiwan into a \"hive\" full of aerial, surface and underwater drones. Raymond Greene and Lin Jialong also invited representatives from Taiwan's so-called \"diplomatic countries\" to reaffirm their \"commitment\" to Taiwan. Any comment on this?","The Taiwan issue is the most important issue in Sino-US relations and one of the key topics at the Sino-US presidents’ meeting in May this year. After the meeting, President Trump publicly stated that he did not want to see anyone seeking \"independence\", did not want the US military to travel 9,500 miles to fight, did not want to be a backer of \"Taiwan independence\", and would not easily commit to arms sales to Taiwan. China takes the political statements and actions of the United States seriously.\nFor some time, Raymond Greene has regarded himself as the \"Taiwan Emperor\", constantly making irresponsible remarks on the political situation on the island in an attempt to suppress the political forces that oppose \"Taiwan independence\" and maintain peace across the Taiwan Strait; he has repeatedly made trouble in the Taiwan Strait, supported the DPP authorities' pursuit of \"independence\" provocations, deliberately distorted the \"status quo\" on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and spread the fallacy of the so-called \"unpredicated dialogue\" as The \"Taiwan independence\" route is unblocked; it continues to spread \"porcupine\" remarks, concocts the \"honeycomb\" concept, pressures the island's public opinion organizations to pass a \"special defense budget\", advocates helping Taiwan increase its \"asymmetric combat power\", \"hands a knife\" to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, continues to incite cross-strait confrontation, and attempts to turn Taiwan into a \"tinderbox\" and \"landmine island.\"\nRaymond Greene's words and deeds violated President Trump's solemn statement, undermined peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, and attempted to lead Sino-US relations and cross-strait relations in a very dangerous direction. The United States should abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiques, require relevant institutions and personnel to stop spreading wrong remarks, stop stirring up trouble in the Taiwan Strait region, stop forming gangs to support \"Taiwan independence\", and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题，是今年5月中美元首会晤的重点议题之一。特朗普总统在会晤后公开表示不希望看到有人搞“独立”、不想美军跋涉9500英里去打仗、不要当“台独”靠山、不轻易承诺对台军售。中方严肃看待美方的政治表态与行动。\n一段时间以来，谷立言俨然把自己当成“太上皇”，不断对岛内政局说三道四，企图压制反对“台独”和维护台海和平的政治力量；一再在台海兴风作浪，支持民进党当局谋“独”挑衅，故意歪曲两岸“现状”，散布所谓“无前提对话”谬论为“台独”路线解套；持续散布“豪猪”言论、炮制“蜂巢”概念，施压岛内民意机构通过“特别防务预算”，鼓吹助台提升“不对称战力”，为“台独”分裂势力“递刀子”，持续煽动两岸对立对抗，妄图把台湾变成“火药桶”、“地雷岛”。\n谷立言的言行违背了特朗普总统所作的严肃表态，破坏台海和平稳定，企图把中美关系和两岸关系引向十分危险的方向。美方应恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，要求有关机构和人员停止散布错误言论，停止在台海地区拱火搅局，停止拉帮结伙为“台独”张目，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775131.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","This year marks the 89th anniversary of the July 7th Anti-Japanese War, and all walks of life on both sides of the Taiwan Strait have held various commemorative activities. Any comment on this?","On July 7, 1937, the \"Marco Bridge Incident\" broke out, and Japanese militarists launched a full-scale war of aggression against China. At a time when the nation was in danger, the Kuomintang and the Communist Party cooperated to establish the anti-Japanese national united front. All Chinese people, regardless of party affiliation, united as one, fought against powerful enemies with iron bones, and built the Great Wall with flesh and blood. They achieved the first complete victory against foreign invasion in modern times. They also returned the treasure island of Taiwan, which had been occupied by Japanese imperialism for 50 years, to the embrace of the motherland. They also made significant contributions to saving human civilization and safeguarding world peace.\nThe mountains and rivers are safe and sound. During the arduous war of resistance, compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait shared the same breath and destiny, resisted foreign aggression side by side, and defended their country to the death. Holding the belief that \"if you want to save Taiwan, you must first save the motherland,\" a large number of Taiwan compatriots resolutely crossed the Taiwan Strait and returned to the mainland of the motherland, joining the anti-Japanese torrent and national salvation, demonstrating their iron-blooded devotion to their country and nation. We will always remember the heroic spirit of our Taiwan compatriots in resisting Japan and their efforts for the liberation of the Chinese nation. We hope that our compatriots in Taiwan will inherit the glorious tradition of patriotism, adhere to a correct view of history, ethnicity, and country, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and interference from external forces, and work with our compatriots on the mainland to pursue a bright future of motherland reunification and national rejuvenation.","1937年7月7日，“卢沟桥事变”爆发，日本军国主义发动全面侵华战争。在民族危亡之际，国共两党合作建立抗日民族统一战线，全体中华儿女不分党派、众志成城，以铮铮铁骨战强敌、以血肉之躯筑长城，取得了近代以来反抗外敌入侵的第一次完全胜利，也使遭受日本帝国主义侵占长达50年的宝岛台湾回到祖国怀抱，也为拯救人类文明、保卫世界和平作出了重大贡献。\n山河无恙，岁月有声。在艰苦卓绝的抗战中，两岸同胞同呼吸、共命运，并肩抵御外侮，誓死捍卫家国。大批台胞抱持“欲救台湾，必先救祖国”的信念，毅然跨越海峡回到祖国大陆，投身抗日洪流和民族救亡，彰显了爱国家、爱民族的铁血丹心。我们将永远铭记台湾同胞英勇抗日的精神和为中华民族解放事业所付出的努力。希望广大台湾同胞传承光荣的爱国主义传统，坚持正确的历史观、民族观、国家观，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外部势力干涉，与大陆同胞一道，共同追求祖国统一、民族复兴的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,2,7,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775130.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","人民日报记者","The Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress has taken effect. Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council said that the law is a \"unification law\" packaged in the outer garment of ethnic unity, which links \"national unification\" with \"ethnic unity\", reflecting that the CPC's approach to Taiwan has shifted from \"opposing Taiwan independence\" to a new stage of legal warfare of \"coercively promoting unification\". What is…","The Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress clearly stipulates the use of rule-of-law means to resist all kinds of unlawful acts involving the ethnic domain. It is grounded in national conditions, consistent with legal principles and in line with international common practice, and is a just and necessary measure to safeguard national sovereignty, unity and territorial integrity.\nOut of their \"independence\"-seeking nature and political self-interest, the DPP authorities vainly attempt to erase and distort Taiwan compatriots' identity with the Chinese nation, and have repeatedly launched unreasonable attacks on this law and spread rumours to smear it, with the aim of fabricating excuses for their betrayal of the nation, splitting of the country, sabotage of cross-Strait relations and restriction of cross-Strait exchanges.\nNo matter what tricks the DPP authorities change to, they cannot change the fact that both sides of the Strait belong to one China, cannot sever the deep bonds of blood between Chinese people on both sides of the Strait, cannot erase the imprint of Chinese culture on Taiwan society and compatriots, and still less can they stop the historical trend that the motherland will ultimately be reunified and is bound to be reunified. If the \"Taiwan independence\" forces dare to carry out acts that split the nation and undermine ethnic unity, we will resolutely punish them in accordance with the law.","民族团结进步促进法明确规定以法治化手段抵御各类涉民族领域的不法行为，立足国情、契合法理、符合国际通例，是维护国家主权、统一、领土完整的正义必要之举。\n民进党当局出于谋“独”本性和政治私利，妄图抹灭扭曲台湾同胞的中华民族认同，一再对这部法律进行无理攻击、造谣抹黑，目的就是为其背叛民族、分裂国家、破坏两岸关系、限制两岸交流编造借口。\n无论民进党当局变换什么花招，都无法改变两岸同属一个中国的事实，无法割断两岸中国人的血脉深情，无法抹去台湾社会和同胞身上的中华文化印记，更无法阻挡祖国终将统一也必将统一的历史大势。如果“台独”势力胆敢实施分裂民族、破坏民族团结的行为，我们将依法予以坚决惩治。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775129.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","In response to the implementation of the Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress, Taiwan's executive department has set up a so-called \"cross-agency coordination platform on transnational repression\". The Mainland Affairs Council said that specific countermeasures are under study and that it will strengthen the review of cross-Strait exchanges. What is your comment on this?","The Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress is a promotional law that safeguards the fundamental interests and overall interests of the Chinese nation. Its formal implementation will provide a solid rule-of-law guarantee for the steady and long-term advancement of the cause of ethnic unity and progress, and will gather mighty strength for promoting the people of all ethnic groups across the country to jointly advance the building of a strong country and the great cause of national rejuvenation through Chinese-style modernization.\nResolving the Taiwan question and realizing the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters and an inevitable requirement for realizing the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. Reunification is a historical verdict, the general trend, where righteousness lies and what the people desire. No matter how many petty moves the DPP authorities make in collusion with external forces, they cannot stop the historical trend that the motherland will ultimately be reunified and is bound to be reunified. With the joint efforts of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, the complete reunification of the motherland must be realized and can certainly be realized.","民族团结进步促进法是一部维护中华民族根本利益和整体利益的促进型法律，其正式实施将为民族团结进步事业的行稳致远提供坚实法治保障，为推动全国各族人民共同以中国式现代化推进强国建设、民族复兴伟业凝聚磅礴力量。\n解决台湾问题、实现祖国完全统一，是全体中华儿女的共同愿望，是实现中华民族伟大复兴的必然要求。统一是历史定论、大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向。无论民进党当局伙同外部势力搞多少小动作，都阻挡不了祖国终将统一也必将统一的历史大势。在两岸同胞的共同努力下，祖国完全统一一定要实现，也一定能实现。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775128.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","On July 6, a strategic nuclear submarine of the Navy successfully launched a submarine-launched strategic missile carrying a training dummy warhead. The DPP authorities said in response that \"the mainland is raising tensions in the surrounding area and undermining regional peace and stability. Taiwan will firmly defend its sovereignty and security and regional peace and stability, and calls on the international…","The spokesperson of the Ministry of National Defense has already given an explanation on this. This missile test launch is a routine arrangement of annual military training, relevant countries were notified in advance, it is in line with international law and international practice, and it is not directed at any particular country or target.\nWe have the firm will, the strong determination and the powerful capability to smash all \"Taiwan independence\" separatist schemes and safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity. The DPP authorities' overreaction to this missile test launch fully exposes that their \"independence\"-seeking provocation is fierce in appearance but faint-hearted within.","国防部的发言人对此已经作了说明。此次导弹试射是年度军事训练的例行性安排，已事先向有关国家作了通报，符合国际法和国际惯例，不针对任何特定国家和目标。\n我们有坚定的意志、坚强的决心和强大的能力，粉碎一切“台独”分裂图谋，维护国家主权和领土完整。民进党当局对此次导弹试射的过度反应，充分暴露其谋“独”挑衅的色厉内荏。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775125.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","《参考消息》记者","Recently, the Chinese Kuomintang side stated that cross-Strait peace is the most fundamental interest of the people of Taiwan; to enable the two sides of the Strait to avoid conflict relies not on slogans, not on confrontation, and still less on the dangerous political manoeuvring of the DPP that pushes Taiwan to the brink of war; cross-Strait peace requires a common political foundation and the establishment of…","Wanting peace, wanting development, wanting exchanges and wanting cooperation is the mainstream public opinion of Taiwan society and also the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. When family members get along, as long as they talk things over properly and consult more on matters, they can avoid conflict and confrontation, resolve contradictions and differences, and consolidate mutual trust. We are willing, on the common political foundation of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\", to strengthen exchanges and communication with Taiwan's political parties, groups and people from all walks of life, including the Chinese Kuomintang, deepen cross-Strait exchanges, cooperation and integrated development, and jointly seek peace for the Taiwan Strait, well-being for compatriots and rejuvenation for the nation.","要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会的主流民意，也是两岸同胞的共同心声。一家人相处，只要有话好好说、有事多商量，就可以避免冲突对抗，就可以化解矛盾分歧，就可以巩固互信。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，加强同包括中国国民党在内的台湾各政党、团体和各界人士交流沟通，深化两岸交流合作和融合发展，共同为台海谋和平、为同胞谋福祉、为民族谋复兴。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775127.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中国台湾网记者","Recently, the book \"The Development of Cross-Strait Relations and the Benefits of Reunification\" was officially published and released and has attracted attention. Please introduce the relevant situation.","I believe everyone saw this booklet when entering the press conference hall.\nIn October 2025, Xinhua News Agency released on three consecutive days the articles signed \"Zhong Taiwen\", \"The Origin and Nature of the Taiwan Question\", \"The Development of Cross-Strait Relations and the Benefits of Reunification\" and \"The Reunification of the Motherland Is Inevitable and Unstoppable\", which attracted great attention from compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Recently, the book \"The Development of Cross-Strait Relations and the Benefits of Reunification\", with the three signed articles as its main body, was officially published and released by Jiuzhou Press. The book is a combined edition in simplified and traditional characters, accompanied by colour illustrations, with both pictures and text, making it easy to read. We hope that compatriots on both sides of the Strait will, through this book, further understand the historical background of the Taiwan question, the course of development of cross-Strait relations and the bright prospects after the reunification of the motherland, better understand and support the major principles and policies on Taiwan, participate more actively in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, and make new and greater contributions to the early realization of the reunification of the motherland.","相信大家进入发布会会场时看到了这本小册子。\n2025年10月，新华社连续三天播发“钟台文”署名文章《台湾问题的由来和性质》、《两岸关系发展和统一利好》、《祖国必然统一势不可挡》，受到两岸同胞高度关注。近日，以三篇署名文章为主体的《两岸关系发展和统一利好》一书，由九州出版社正式出版发行。该书为简、繁体合辑，并配以彩色插图，图文并茂，便于阅读。希望两岸同胞借由本书进一步了解台湾问题的历史经纬、两岸关系发展历程和祖国统一后的光明前景，更加理解、支持对台大政方针，更加积极参与两岸交流合作，为早日实现祖国统一作出新的更大贡献。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","This June marks the tenth anniversary of the unified brand of the China-Europe Railway Express. It is understood that numerous Taiwan-funded enterprises in Chongqing, Fujian, Jiangsu and other places have shipped products to Europe via the China-Europe Railway Express, significantly reducing costs and increasing efficiency and broadening \"Belt and Road\" markets, and some Taiwan-funded enterprises have also used…","With its advantages of fast delivery, favourable cost and wide coverage, the China-Europe Railway Express is increasingly becoming an important channel for Taiwan-funded enterprises on the mainland to expand into markets in Europe and along the \"Belt and Road\". Taiwan-funded enterprises can use the China-Europe Railway Express to achieve efficient end-to-end linkage of raw material imports, parts distribution and finished product exports, with more stable order delivery, higher turnover efficiency and faster market expansion. For example, Taiwan-funded enterprises in Chongqing such as Quanta and Inventec ship goods relying on this major international logistics corridor, shortening freight time to Europe from nearly two months to 25 days. The Fujian Taiwan-funded enterprise TPV Group used the \"COSCO Star\" ro-ro passenger ship to carry computer parts from Taichung Port to Xiamen, and then shipped them to Europe and other places via the \"Taiwan-Xiamen-Chengdu-Europe\" train, becoming the country's first shipment of Taiwan goods by sea-rail intermodal transport, reducing the 40 to 45 days needed by traditional sea transport to 18 days, greatly improving logistics efficiency and saving time costs. As of the end of June this year, the China-Europe Railway Express (Xiamen) had carried Taiwan goods by sea-rail intermodal transport equivalent to a total of 418 TEUs, with a carried value of 224 million yuan (RMB).\nNext, we will continue to optimize relevant services and support, strengthen customs clearance facilitation, multimodal transport and customized logistics support, provide Taiwan-funded enterprises with more reliable, more economical and more efficient international logistics solutions, use corridors to empower industries and openness to promote cooperation, help Taiwan-funded enterprises' products expand into emerging foreign trade markets, and continuously promote cross-Strait industrial integration and high-quality development.","中欧班列以其时效快、成本优、覆盖广等优点，日益成为大陆台企拓展欧洲和“一带一路”沿线市场的重要通道。台企可借助中欧班列，实现原物料进口、零部件分拨、制成品出口全程高效衔接，订单交付更稳、周转效率更高、市场拓展更快。比如重庆台企广达、英业达等依托这条国际物流大通道发货，将至欧洲的货运时间从近两个月缩短至25天。福建台企冠捷集团利用“中远之星”客滚轮将电脑配件从台中港运抵厦门，再通过“台厦蓉欧”班列运往欧洲等地，成为全国首单海铁联运的台湾货物，将传统海运需要用时40至45天降至18天，大幅提升物流效能和节省时间成本。截至今年6月底，中欧班列（厦门）通过海铁联运方式承接台湾货物共折合418个标准柜，承运价值达人民币2.24亿元。\n下一步，我们将继续优化相关服务保障，加强通关便利化、多式联运和定制化物流支持，为台资企业提供更可靠、更经济、更高效的国际物流解决方案，以通道赋能产业、以开放促进合作，推动台企产品拓展新兴外贸市场，持续促进两岸产业融合与高质量发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","香港中评社记者","According to reports, TSMC will inject 20 billion US dollars of capital into its US subsidiary for building a 12-inch wafer fab and an advanced packaging plant. This is the sixth time Taiwan's economic authorities have approved TSMC's investment in its US subsidiary, and so far the cumulative approved amount of TSMC's investment in the US has reached as much as 44 billion US dollars. This has once again…","The DPP authorities are using TSMC's investment in the US as a pledge of allegiance for \"relying on the US to seek independence\", cosying up to the US without any bottom line and actively cooperating with the US in seizing Taiwan's advantageous industries, trading away the foundation of industry and sacrificing industrial interests in exchange for so-called \"support\". The further they go down the wrong road, the more the worries of the Taiwan public will become reality.","民进党当局把台积电赴美投资作为“倚美谋独”的投名状，毫无底线贴靠美国，主动配合美国攫取台湾优势产业，通过放弃产业根基、牺牲产业利益换取所谓的“支持”。他们在错误的道路上走得越远，台湾民众的担忧就越会变成现实。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","香港经济导报记者","In the first half of this year, the market value of Taiwan-funded enterprises listed on the mainland showed a good overall trend, attracting the attention of netizens on both sides of the Strait. Please introduce the situation of Taiwan-funded enterprises listing on the mainland.","The Outline of the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" clearly proposes \"encouraging eligible Taiwan-funded enterprises to list on the mainland\", and Taiwan-funded enterprises listing on the mainland already enjoy the same treatment as mainland enterprises. In recent years, more and more Taiwan-funded enterprises have chosen to list, take root and develop on the mainland, and the mainland stock market has become an important channel for Taiwan-funded enterprises to carry out direct financing, expand their scale and enhance their brand image. To date, 67 Taiwan-funded enterprises have listed on the mainland. We will, as always, provide good services for the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan-funded enterprises. We hope that Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan-funded enterprises will fully seize the new opportunities of the mainland capital market, cultivate the mainland market deeply, and achieve a dual improvement in their own scale and competitiveness.","“十五五”规划纲要明确提出，“鼓励符合条件的台资企业在大陆上市”，台资企业在大陆上市已享受与大陆企业同等待遇。近年来，越来越多的台资企业选择在大陆上市、扎根发展，大陆股市已成为台资企业进行直接融资、扩大企业规模、提升品牌形象的重要渠道。截至目前，在大陆上市的台企已达67家。我们将一如既往为广大台商台企做好服务。希望广大台商台企充分把握大陆资本市场新机遇，深耕大陆市场，实现自身规模与竞争力的双重提升。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“看台海”和“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Recently, the mainland dance poetry drama \"Only This Green\" was performed in Taiwan and was warmly welcomed by Taiwan audiences. What is your comment on this?","From July 2 to 5, the dance poetry drama \"Only This Green\" by the China Oriental Performing Arts Group was staged in Taipei. It is understood that two additional performances were added at short notice, increasing from five to seven, every performance sold out as soon as tickets went on sale, every seat was filled during the performances, the applause at the curtain calls was thunderous, and after watching there was a flood of praise. Taiwan audiences marvelled one after another that the production was stunningly beautiful and fully displayed the depth of Chinese culture. Many audience members were moved to tears, saying that \"cultural exchange is very good\" and \"you must come back to Taiwan to perform again\". I believe everyone has seen a great many similar videos on social media.\n\"Only This Green\" draws its material from the famous Chinese painting handed down through the ages, \"A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains\", and through beautiful and lively dance and a stage interpretation of far-reaching artistic conception, it recreates traditional Chinese aesthetics and brings to life thousands of years of Chinese culture. This drama has not a single line of dialogue, yet \"the greatest sound is soundless\" and it goes straight to people's hearts, fully demonstrating that Chinese culture is the deepest and most enduring strength of the Chinese nation and the spiritual bond that most evokes empathy and resonance among compatriots on both sides of the Strait, and fully confirming that \"we are born Chinese, and the most fundamental thing is that we have the unique spiritual world of Chinese people\". We hope there will be more and more such cultural exchanges between the two sides of the Strait, and we are willing to promote more high-quality troupes to go to Taiwan so that compatriots on the island can enjoy wonderful performances of world-class standard.","7月2日至5日，中国东方演艺集团舞蹈诗剧《只此青绿》在台北上演。据了解，演出临时加演两场，从五场变成七场，场场开票即售罄，演出时座无虚席，谢幕时掌声雷动，观看后好评如潮。台湾观众纷纷赞叹剧目惊艳绝美，尽显中华文化底蕴。许多观众感动落泪，表示“文化交流非常好”、“一定要再来台湾演出”。相信大家在社交媒体看到非常多类似的视频。\n《只此青绿》取材于中国传世名画《千里江山图》，以唯美灵动的舞蹈、意境悠远的舞台演绎，复刻中华传统美学，活化中华千年文化。这部剧没有一句台词，却大音希声、直抵人心，充分说明中华文化是中华民族最深沉、最持久的力量，是两岸同胞最共情、最共鸣的精神纽带，充分印证了“我们生而为中国人，最根本的是我们有中国人的独特精神世界”。我们希望两岸之间这样的文化交流越来越多，愿意推动更多优质院团赴台，让岛内同胞欣赏世界一流水平的精彩演出。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","环球时报、环球网记者","Regarding the law enforcement patrols of mainland coast guard vessels in the waters around the island of Taiwan, Taiwan's coast guard authorities said they have advised Taiwan vessels not to respond to inquiries from mainland coast guard vessels, to notify the coast guard at the first moment, and to move towards Taiwan coast guard boats, and if the situation is urgent the coast guard will position itself between…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The law enforcement patrols conducted in accordance with the law by relevant mainland departments in the relevant waters are a just and necessary move to safeguard national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and are welcomed by compatriots on both sides of the Strait, including the broad masses of Taiwan fishermen. Out of their \"independence\"-seeking political self-interest, the DPP authorities betray the interests of the nation and disregard the livelihoods and well-being of the Taiwan public, vainly attempting to use this for malicious hype and to stir up cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, which will not succeed. If the DPP authorities dare to provoke and stir up trouble, they must bear all the consequences arising therefrom.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。大陆有关部门在相关海域依法开展执法巡查，是维护国家领土主权和海洋权益的正义、必要之举，受到两岸同胞包括广大台湾渔民欢迎。民进党当局出于谋“独”政治私利，出卖民族利益，置台湾民众的生计福祉于不顾，妄图借此恶意炒作，挑动两岸对立对抗，不会得逞。民进党当局如果胆敢挑衅滋事，必须承担由此引发的一切后果。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","福建厦门卫视记者","According to statistics, as of early July, Fujian had supplied a cumulative total of more than 50 million tonnes of water to Kinmen, with a water quality compliance rate of 100 percent. This drew likes from netizens on both sides of the Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","We have always attached great importance to and actively supported the economic and social development of Kinmen, and have continuously taken measures to enhance the interests and well-being of Kinmen folks. The project for supplying water from Fujian's coastal areas to Kinmen officially began supplying water on August 5, 2018, and has now been supplying water for nearly 8 years. As of July 1 this year, Fujian's coastal areas had supplied a cumulative total of more than 50 million tonnes of water to Kinmen, accounting for 87% of the total daily supply of Kinmen's waterworks, and the water quality compliance rate has remained stable at 100% year-round. At present, the average daily water supply from Fujian's coastal areas to Kinmen is about 22,000 tonnes, continuously ensuring the water needs of Kinmen folks and effectively conserving Kinmen's groundwater, relieving urgent needs and removing worries for Kinmen's livelihood security and construction and development, and it has been warmly welcomed by Kinmen folks. \"The two sides of the Strait are one family, drinking water from the same river\": the project for supplying water from Fujian's coastal areas to Kinmen has become a model of cross-Strait cooperation in the field of people's livelihoods. In the future, we will continue to deliver safe, high-quality and clean water to Kinmen, using a river of living water as a bond to benefit the livelihoods of people on both sides of the Strait.","我们一贯高度重视、积极支持金门经济社会发展，不断采取措施增进金门乡亲利益福祉。福建沿海地区向金门供水工程在2018年8月5日正式通水，至今已供水近8年。截至今年7月1日，福建沿海地区累计向金门供水超过5000万吨，占金门自来水厂日常供水总量的87%，水质合格率常年稳定保持在100%。目前，福建沿海地区向金门日均供水量约2.2万吨，持续保障金门乡亲用水需求，有效保育金门地下水，为金门民生保障、建设发展解燃眉之急、免后顾之忧，受到金门乡亲的热烈欢迎。“两岸一家亲、共饮一江水”，福建沿海地区向金门供水工程已成为两岸民生领域合作典范。未来，我们将持续向金门输送安全、优质、洁净的水源，以一江活水为纽带，惠泽两岸民生。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","福建东南卫视记者","In the first half of this year, the number of inbound and outbound passengers on the Fuzhou-Matsu \"mini three links\" route reached more than 62,000 person-trips, a year-on-year increase of over 40%, of which inbound and outbound Taiwan compatriots exceeded 55,000 person-trips, a year-on-year increase of 39%. Yet Kinmen and Matsu's hopes of adding more sailings have never been approved by the DPP authorities. What…","The \"mini three links\" passenger routes are one of the most important and most convenient channels for exchanges and contacts between people on both sides of the Strait, especially between Fujian and Taiwan. As of June 30, 2026, the \"mini three links\" had safely carried more than 27 million passenger-trips. In the first half of this year, passenger volume on the Fuzhou-Matsu \"mini three links\" route was about 63,000 person-trips, a year-on-year increase of over 40%, and passenger volume on the Xiamen-Kinmen \"mini three links\" route exceeded 1 million person-trips, setting a new record for the fastest time for this route to exceed one million passengers. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family, and we welcome Taiwan folks to come to the mainland via the \"mini three links\" routes to walk around and have a look, seek their roots and worship their ancestors, visit relatives and friends, and engage in exchanges and cooperation. The DPP authorities should put the well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait first, remove all artificial restrictions as soon as possible, and increase \"mini three links\" sailings according to the travel needs of people on both sides of the Strait.","“小三通”客运航线是两岸特别是闽台民众交流往来最重要、最便捷的通道之一。截至2026年6月30日，“小三通”已安全运送旅客超过2700万人次。今年上半年，福马“小三通”航线客运量约6.3万人次，同比增长超40%，厦金“小三通”航线客运量突破100万人次，刷新这条航线破百万客流最快记录。两岸同胞是一家人，欢迎台湾乡亲通过“小三通”航线来大陆走走看看，寻根祭祖、走亲访友、交流合作。民进党当局应以两岸同胞福祉为重，尽快取消所有人为限制，根据两岸民众出行往来需求增加“小三通”航班。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic and trade activities.","To implement the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation released under authorization by the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee, from July 2 to 4 the Shenzhen Taiwan Business Association organized more than 10 Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan-funded enterprises to exhibit at the 2026 High-end Food and Quality Agricultural Products (Shenzhen) Expo, displaying more than 20 product categories including Taiwan's characteristic fresh aquatic products, traditional pastries, Nangang characteristic Pouchong tea, Taiwanese snacks and meals, and wax apples and pineapple sugar-apples, helping Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products expand sales channels on the mainland.\nFrom July 7 to 12, the 14th Yunnan-Taiwan Economic, Trade and Cultural Exchange and Cooperation Symposium was held in Kunming, Yunnan Province and other places. This \"Yunnan-Taiwan Conference\" took \"Sharing New Opportunities of RCEP, Opening a New Situation of Yunnan-Taiwan Integrated Development\" as its theme, aiming to give full play to Yunnan's advantages in resources, location and openness, continuously guide Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan-funded enterprises to make full and good use of RCEP policy dividends, and deepen Yunnan-Taiwan economic and cultural exchanges and cooperation. About 900 people attended, of whom more than 600 were guests from Taiwan.\nDuring the same period, the 17th Tianjin-Taiwan Investment Cooperation Fair was held in Tianjin. This \"Tianjin-Taiwan Fair\" took \"Pooling Wisdom for New Development, Sharing New Opportunities\" as its theme, aiming to continuously promote Tianjin-Taiwan economic and trade exchanges and cooperation and deepen Tianjin-Taiwan economic and social integrated development. It included segments such as an opening ceremony, a Tianjin-Taiwan artificial intelligence industry cooperation and exchange meeting, a Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei-Taiwan big health industry exchange meeting, and industry matchmaking and inspection tours. About 350 people, including members of the Cross-Strait CEO Summit, figures from political and business circles and Taiwan youth, attended, of whom about 280 were guests from Taiwan.","为落实中央台办受权发布的十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，7月2日至4日，深圳台商协会组织10余家台商台企参展2026高端食品及优质农产品（深圳）博览会，展出台湾特色生鲜水产、传统糕点、南港特色包种茶、台式小吃餐食，及莲雾、凤梨释迦等20余种产品品类，帮助台湾农渔产品拓展大陆销售渠道。\n7月7日至12日，第14届滇台经贸文化交流合作研讨会在云南省昆明市等地举行。本届“云台会”以“共享RCEP新机遇 开创云台融合发展新局面”为主题，旨在充分发挥云南资源、区位、开放等优势，持续引导台商台企用足用好RCEP政策红利，深化云台经济文化交流合作。与会人员约900人，其中台湾嘉宾超过600人。\n同期，第17届津台投资合作洽谈会在天津市举行。本届“津台会”以“聚智新发展 共享新机遇”为主题，旨在持续推动津台经贸交流合作，深化津台经济社会融合发展。包括开幕式、津台人工智能产业合作交流会、京津冀台大健康产业交流会、产业对接考察等环节。两岸企业家峰会、政商界人士和台湾青年等约350人参会，其中台湾嘉宾约280人。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities.","With the arrival of the summer vacation, cross-Strait exchanges have become even more lively.\nFujian has always been the forefront of cross-Strait exchanges. From June 29 to July 3, the fifth anniversary of the implementation of the \"two national standards\" for Taiwanese-style oolong tea and the Zhangzhou-Taiwan tea farmers' vocational skills competition were held in Zhangping, Longyan, where more than 60 tea experts and tea enterprise representatives from both sides of the Strait held in-depth exchanges on the implementation results of common standards for the cross-Strait tea industry and on paths for integrated development. From July 1 to 9, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Yong'an) Youth Basketball Tournament series of activities was held in Yong'an, Sanming, where more than 200 Taiwan youths competed in basketball skills with local peers of the same age and took part in activities such as Fujian-Taiwan families' \"Seeking Flavours in Yancheng\" and practical study tours. From July 3 to 5, more than 600 Taiwan compatriots came to Meizhou Island in Putian to carry out a pilgrimage of walking around the island to pay homage to the ancestor and offer incense at 15 Meizhou Mazu temples. From July 3 to 9, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Jianyang) Youth Tea Bowl Culture Exchange Activity was held in Jianyang, Nanping, where more than 230 representatives of the tea bowl industry and young people from both sides of the Strait held in-depth exchanges on topics such as establishing an industry alliance and cooperating in cultivating talent. During the same period, the 14th Straits Youth Gathering · 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Sports Study Tour was held in Mawei, Fuzhou, where more than 200 young people from both sides of the Strait visited study bases such as the Ship Administration Museum and the thousand-year-old Min'an ancient town and carried out activities such as sports competitions, cultural visits and themed study. On July 3, the second \"Ming-Tai Cup\" Cross-Strait Youth Baseball Tournament opened in Ninghua, Sanming, where more than 70 young baseball players from both sides of the Strait competed on the same field, made friends through baseball, and savoured the Hakka cultural lineage during a study tour of the Hakka ancestral land. On July 6, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Zhangzhou) Summer Youth Exchange Season was launched in Zhangzhou, and nearly a thousand Taiwan youths were invited to take part in 17 rich and colourful summer youth study activities. From July 8 to 12, the \"2026 Cross-Strait Persons with Disabilities Exchange Carnival\", jointly held by the China Disabled Persons' Federation together with the Fujian Disabled Persons' Federation and others, was held in Xiamen and other places, including a series of activities such as a cross-Strait \"Jointly Creating Technology for Well-being\" exchange and sharing session, cultural and sports exchanges for persons with disabilities, and rehabilitation exchanges. During this period, the \"Several Measures of the China Disabled Persons' Federation on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path for the Integrated Development of Cross-Strait Undertakings for Persons with Disabilities\" will be released, including 13 measures in 3 areas, supporting Fujian in giving play to its unique advantages regarding Taiwan and its role of piloting first and leading by example, implementing equal treatment for Taiwan compatriots with disabilities in Fujian, and promoting practical progress in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in fields such as rehabilitation services, the assistive devices industry, technology assisting persons with disabilities, culture and sports, and volunteer services.\nOn July 3, the \"2026 Cross-Strait (Anhui) Youth Exchange Season\" opened in Hefei, and 13 exchange activities, including a Hui culture summer camp, an e-sports carnival, baseball games and a lighting design roadshow, will be held in many places in Anhui Province, with more than 500 young people and representatives from all walks of life from both sides of the Strait taking part.\nOn July 4, the two-week \"Notes of Common Origin — Shanghai Gathering Study Camp\" opened in Shanghai, covering sections such as baseball, e-sports, performing arts, creativity and skills, and including activities such as a cross-Strait baseball culture festival, a cross-Strait e-sports culture festival, a cross-Strait original ecological art festival and a \"Magic City Experience Tour\". More than 500 Taiwan youths took part. On the same day, the 2026 Poetry City Fengjie Chongqing-Taiwan Youth Poetry Gathering was held in Fengjie, Chongqing, where nearly 400 young people from both sides of the Strait went together to the summit of the Three Gorges, entered Baidi City, revisited the classic poems of masters such as Li Bai and Du Fu, and jointly appreciated the charm of Chinese poetry.\nFrom July 4 to 12, the second Qingdao Taiwan Food and Cultural-Creative Carnival was held in Qingdao, Shandong, using food and cultural creativity as a vehicle to link up cultural experiences, youth interaction and the integration of culture and tourism, and raising the friendship of compatriots on both sides of the Strait with a strong atmosphere of everyday life. On July 6, the \"Hand in Hand Setting Sail, Building Dreams in the Deep Blue\" Cross-Strait Youth Sailing Experience Camp opened in Qingdao, with more than 400 Taiwan youths taking part, sailing in the same boat with mainland youths, experiencing the sport of sailing, and appreciating the unique charm of the \"Sailing Capital\" and \"Beer City\".\nOn July 7, the \"Moon City\" Cross-Strait (Yangzhou) Youth Cultural and Creative Week opened in Yangzhou, Jiangsu, where more than 380 young literary and art workers from Taiwan, together with local youths, took part in activities such as the \"Notes of Common Origin\" Yangzhou-Taiwan youth lawn concert, the Cross-Strait (Yangzhou) Youth Cultural and Creative Boutique Exhibition, the \"Sharing This Bright Moon, Reflecting Artists\" Yangzhou-Taiwan contemporary art exchange joint exhibition, the \"Common Origin Elegant Gathering\" cross-Strait artists' writing and painting session, and a Yangzhou intangible cultural heritage experience tour.\nOn July 10, the 2026 Henan Province Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Month and Cross-Strait Youth Taekwondo Exchange Competition will be launched in Zhengzhou, where more than 500 youth representatives from all walks of life in Taiwan will carry out activities with local youths such as taekwondo competitions, pickleball exchanges, cultural study and vocational education, visit the four great ancient capitals, visit modern enterprises, and take part in study tours and internships. On the same day, the 20th Hubei · Wuhan Taiwan Week opens, and more than 10 activities will be held, including a Cross-Strait (Wuhan) New Energy and Intelligent Connected Vehicle Industry Integrated Development Exchange Meeting, a Cross-Strait (Hubei) University Students' Jingchu Culture Tour, and Hubei-Taiwan workers' and family cultural exchanges.\nIn addition, inter-university exchanges across the Strait are also being carried out enthusiastically with the arrival of the summer vacation. Many universities, including Shandong University, Chang'an University and the Xi'an Academy of Fine Arts, have launched activities such as the second \"Straits Art Charm · Youth Harmony\" Cross-Strait Youth Art Workshop, inviting young Taiwan students to come and gather.\n\"To study alone without friends is to be solitary and ill-informed.\" We believe that through in-depth exchanges and mutual learning, young people on both sides of the Strait will certainly grow together and help each other succeed. Though mountains and seas are far apart, one who sets out will surely arrive. We warmly welcome the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland to visit and exchange, take in the splendid rivers and mountains, witness the new look of the Divine Land, and feel the warmth of mainland compatriots, which is like summer.","进入暑期，两岸交流更加热络。\n福建向来是两岸交流的前沿。6月29日至7月3日，台式乌龙茶“两项国家标准”实施五周年暨漳台茶农职业技能竞赛在龙岩漳平举办，两岸60余名茶叶专家、茶企代表，就两岸茶产业共通标准落地成效与融合发展路径开展深入交流。7月1日至9日，2026年两岸（永安）青少年篮球赛系列活动在三明永安举办，200多名台湾青少年与当地同龄人切磋球技，并参加闽台家庭“寻味燕城”、实践研学等活动。7月3日至5日，600余名台胞前来莆田湄洲岛开展徒步环岛15座湄洲妈祖宫庙谒祖进香活动。7月3日至9日，2026年海峡两岸（建阳）青年茶盏文化交流活动在南平建阳举办，230多位两岸茶盏行业代表及青少年，围绕建立产业联盟、合作培育人才等议题深入交流。同期，第14届海峡青年荟·2026年海峡两岸青少年体育研学活动在福州马尾举办，200多名两岸青年走进船政博物馆、千年闽安古镇等研学基地，开展体育竞技、文化参访、主题研学等活动。7月3日，第二届“明台杯”两岸青少年棒球赛在三明宁化开赛，70多名两岸青少年棒球选手同场竞技、以球会友，并在客家祖地研学中品味客家文脉。7月6日，2026年海峡两岸（漳州）暑期青少年交流季在漳州启动，近千名台湾青少年受邀参加17项丰富多彩的暑期青少年研学活动。7月8日至12日，由中国残联会同福建省残联等共同举办的“2026两岸残障人士交流嘉年华”在厦门等地举行，包含两岸“共创科技福祉”交流分享会、残疾人文化体育交流、康复交流等系列活动。期间将发布《中国残疾人联合会关于支持福建探索海峡两岸残疾人事业融合发展新路的若干措施》，包括3个方面13项举措，支持福建发挥对台独特优势和先行先试、示范带头作用，落实在闽残障台胞享受同等待遇，促进海峡两岸康复服务、辅具产业、科技助残、文化体育及志愿服务等领域交流合作取得务实进展。\n7月3日，“2026海峡两岸（安徽）青年交流季”活动在合肥开幕，将在安徽省内多地举办徽文化夏令营、电竞嘉年华、棒球比赛、灯饰设计路演等13场交流活动，两岸青年及各界人士代表500余人参加。\n7月4日，为期两周的“同源音符——海上汇研修营”在上海开营，涵盖棒球、电竞、演艺、创意、技能等板块，包括两岸棒球文化节、两岸电竞文化节、两岸原生态艺术节、“魔都体验行”等活动。500多名台湾青年参加。当天，2026诗城奉节渝台青年诗词会在重庆奉节举办，近400名两岸青年共赴三峡之巅，走进白帝城，重温李白、杜甫等名家的经典诗作，共同体悟中华诗词的韵味。\n7月4日至12日，第二届青岛台湾美食文创嘉年华在山东青岛举办，以美食文创为载体，串联起文化体验、青年互动与文旅融合，以浓浓烟火气升腾两岸同胞情谊。7月6日，“携手扬帆 筑梦深蓝”海峡两岸青少年帆船体验营在青岛开营，400余名台湾青少年参加，与大陆青少年同舟共济、体验帆船运动，领略“帆船之都”、“啤酒之城”的独特魅力。\n7月7日，“月亮城”两岸（扬州）青年文化创意周在江苏扬州开幕，来自台湾的380多名青年文艺工作者与当地青年一道，参加“同源音符”扬台青年草坪音乐会、海峡两岸（扬州）青年文化创意精品展、“共此明月 照见艺人”扬台当代艺术交流联展、“同源雅集”两岸艺术家笔会、扬州非遗文化体验之旅等活动。\n7月10日，2026河南省两岸青年交流月暨海峡两岸青少年跆拳道交流赛将在郑州启动，500余名台湾各界青年代表将与在地青年开展跆拳道比赛、匹克球交流、文化研习、职业教育等活动，走访四大古都，参访现代企业，参与研学实习。当天，第20届湖北·武汉台湾周开幕，将举办两岸（武汉）新能源与智能网联汽车产业融合发展交流会、海峡两岸（湖北）大学生荆楚文化行、鄂台职工和家庭文化交流等10余项活动。\n此外，两岸高校校际交流也随着暑假到来而热烈开展。山东大学、长安大学、西安美术学院等多所高校纷纷推出第二届“海峡艺韵·青春和弦”两岸青年艺术工作营等活动，邀请台湾青年学子前来相聚。\n“独学而无友，则孤陋而寡闻。”我们相信，两岸青年深入交流、互学互鉴，定能共同成长、相互成就。山海虽远，行则必至。我们热诚欢迎广大台湾同胞前来大陆参访、交流，饱览锦绣江山，见证神州新貌，感受大陆同胞如夏日一样的热情。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","南方日报、南方+记者","According to a Reuters report, the DPP authorities recently held a so-called \"whole-of-society defence resilience exercise\" in Nantou County to test whether mountain counties and cities could still maintain normal operations if attacked by the mainland. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance, collude with external forces to seek \"independence\" and provoke, and incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, and they are the chief culprit causing tension and turbulence in the Taiwan Strait. Their pursuit of \"everyone a soldier\" and their willingness to strap the Taiwan public onto the \"Taiwan independence\" war chariot seriously harm the security and well-being of the Taiwan public. In the face of the powerful people's army, no matter how many exercises the DPP authorities hold, it is all posturing and futile, and it cannot change the doomed fate of \"Taiwan independence\" nor stop the historical trend of the inevitable reunification of the motherland.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，为勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，煽动两岸对立对抗，是引发台海紧张动荡的罪魁祸首。其大搞“全民皆兵”，不惜将台湾民众绑上“台独”战车，严重损害台湾民众安全福祉。在强大的人民军队面前，民进党当局搞再多演习都是装腔作势、徒劳无功，改变不了“台独”注定败亡的下场，阻挡不了祖国必然统一的历史大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","深圳卫视记者","Taiwan's foreign affairs department recently said it has amended the so-called \"measures for subsidies encouraging businesses to invest in countries with diplomatic relations\", relaxing the scope of subsidies, raising the airfare subsidy for inspection trips to \"allies\" to NT$100,000, and substantially raising the maximum cumulative subsidy over 7 years from NT$20 million to NT$60 million. What is your comment on…","Earlier, Lai Ching-te, disregarding face, used a huge investment pledge of NT$25 billion and sky-high travel expenses in exchange for a sneaky, furtive visit to Eswatini. The Lai Ching-te authorities act externally as a \"money-scattering boy\", giving away large amounts of the Taiwan people's hard-earned money for nothing to so-called \"diplomatic allies\", while internally ignoring the livelihoods and well-being of people on the island, having neither the intention nor the ability to solve the island's economic and livelihood problems, and now they are even mobilizing businesses in a disguised form to further hollow out Taiwan. This out-and-out \"sucker diplomacy\" brings disaster to Taiwan and harm to its people, is a laughing stock to all, and is contemptible.","此前赖清德不顾颜面，以250亿元新台币巨额投资承诺，以及天价出行开支，换取对斯威士兰进行偷鸡摸狗的窜访。赖清德当局对外充当“散财童子”，把台湾大量民脂民膏白白送给所谓“邦交国”，对内却罔顾岛内民生福祉，根本无心也无能力解决岛内经济、民生问题，现在更变相动员业者进一步掏空台湾。这种不折不扣的“凯子外交”祸台害民，贻笑大方，令人不齿。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: former Japanese journalist Akio Yaita was recently attacked in Taichung by a Hong Kong man, who has been arrested. Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council and foreign affairs department said that \"this is the first case of transnational repression since the implementation of the Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress, and it is suspected that external forces are using the convenience of Hong Kong…","First question. This Hong Kong man acted out of righteous indignation; it was entirely an ordinary public-order case that happened by chance. The DPP authorities are using the opportunity for political manipulation, dragging in far-fetched connections and distorting and smearing the Law on Promoting Ethnic Unity and Progress, with the aim of stirring up cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation and misleading and intimidating the Taiwan public. Even people on the island do not approve of their vile conduct. We sternly warn the DPP authorities that they must not harm the legitimate rights and interests of this Hong Kong man and must guarantee that his person and property are safe from infringement.\nSecond question. If governance is sound, people's hearts are at ease, and you cannot drive them away even if you try; if governance is chaotic, people's hearts are in turmoil, and you cannot keep them even if you want to. Since the DPP authorities came to power, they have continuously sought \"independence\" and provoked, and have intensified their suppression and persecution of dissidents, plunging Taiwan society into division and antagonism and placing Taiwan compatriots under \"green terror\", making the Taiwan Strait fraught with the danger of war and leaving the people of Taiwan anxious and uneasy. That some Taiwan people choose to leave and move assets abroad is a normal risk-avoidance operation, reflecting deep worry about \"Taiwan independence\" provoking war.\nIf \"Taiwan independence\" is not eliminated, Taiwan will have no peace. We hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the nature and harm of the DPP authorities' pursuit of \"independence\", and, proceeding from their own safety, interests and well-being, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and foreign interference and commit themselves to safeguarding peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.","第一个问题。这名香港男子出于义愤做出相关举动，完全是偶然发生的普通治安类个案。民进党当局借机进行政治操弄，生拉硬扯、歪曲抹黑民族团结进步促进法，目的就是挑起两岸对立对抗，误导恐吓台湾民众。他们的恶劣行径连岛内民众都不认同。正告民进党当局，不得损害这名香港男子的正当权益，必须保障其人身财产安全免受侵害。\n第二个问题。治下若安，民心则安，想赶也赶不走；治下若乱，民心则乱，想留都留不住。民进党当局上台以来，持续谋“独”挑衅，变本加厉打压迫害异己，置台湾社会于撕裂对立之中、置台湾同胞于“绿色恐怖”之下，致使台海兵凶战危、台湾百姓惶惶不安。一些台湾民众选择出走、外移资产，是正常的避险操作，反映了对“台独”引战的深切忧虑。\n“台独”不除，台湾不宁。希望广大台湾同胞认清民进党当局谋“独”的本质和危害，从自身安全和利益福祉出发，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，致力维护台海和平稳定。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260708_12775126.htm"],[2,"2026-07-08","Chen Binhua","台湾“中视”记者","First question: US President Trump recently again mentioned Taiwan's semiconductors, saying that Taiwan took almost 100 percent of America's chip business, and said that \"Taiwan is in a somewhat vulnerable position now\", vowing to have the US control 40 to 60 percent of chip production capacity before he leaves office. There are worries on the island that the Taiwan Strait situation is being manipulated and may…","First question. The DPP authorities' bottomless fawning on the US and selling out Taiwan has won them nothing more than the US's pushing for more and more and squeezing them dry. Once TSMC becomes \"AMSC\", it will drive the overall outward relocation of upstream and downstream talent, technology and capital, becoming \"the last straw that breaks the camel's back\" for Taiwan's industry, and it will be the broad masses of the Taiwan public who are harmed.\nSecond question. The claim that \"some of the precursor raw materials come mainly from the mainland\" is pure nonsense. The DPP authorities' incompetent governance has led to rampant drugs on the island, and yet they blindly shift the blame and evade responsibility, with sinister intent and utmost shamelessness.\nI want to stress that the state resolutely cracks down on drug crimes, especially drug crimes involving both sides of the Strait, and severely punishes drug criminals, never tolerating them or going soft.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。民进党当局无底线媚美卖台，换来的不过是美国得寸进尺、吃干榨净。台积电一旦变成“美积电”，将带动上下游人才、技术、资金整体外迁，成为台湾产业“压死骆驼的最后一根稻草”，受伤害的将是广大台湾民众。\n第二个问题。所谓“部分先驱原料主要来自大陆”的说法纯属无稽之谈。民进党当局治理无能以致岛内毒品泛滥，还一味甩锅卸责，用心险恶，无耻至极。\n我要强调的是，国家坚决打击毒品犯罪，特别是涉及两岸的毒品犯罪，严惩毒品犯罪分子，绝不姑息手软。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260708_12775135.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-07-09","Mao Ning","AFP","Media outlets in Taiwan are reporting that China’s recent long-range submarine launch missile test was actually fired from the sea surface south of Guangdong rather than from underwater. Does the foreign ministry have a comment on this?","We have stated our position on the test launch on multiple occasions. I don’t have anything further to add.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260709_11978719.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-07-09","Chen Xi","","President Xi Jinping, also general secretary of the Communist Party of China (CPC) Central Committee and chairman of the Central Military Commission, delivered an important speech at a gathering commemorating the 105th anniversary of the founding of the CPC. He stressed that a strong country must have a strong military, and that only a strong military can ensure national security. How will the military study and…","From the strategic perspective of the overall development of the Party and the country, President Xi looked back on the remarkable journey and great achievements of the Chinese people of all ethnic groups led by the CPC over the past 105 years, and spelled out the defining qualities and crucial code of success that have enabled the Party to achieve one milestone after another. He set forth the clear requirements of \"five musts\" for all Party members to stay firm in convictions and forge ahead, and called on the entire Party and the Chinese people of all ethnic groups to strive for new historic achievements.\nPresident Xi's important speech has further charted the course and provided fundamental guidance for fulfilling the Party's central task on the new journey in the new era. Only through in-depth learning can we act with greater resolve. Party organizations at all levels in the military have made the study and implementation of President Xi's important speech a major political task. They have coordinated efforts to study the original texts of the speech, delve deep into every detail, integrate theory with reality, carry out rigorous oversight and follow targeted guidance, so as to gain a thorough understanding of the great significance, rich substance and practical requirements of the speech and comprehend and act on Xi Jinping Thought on Party Building. Through these efforts, they have consistently aligned their thinking and actions with the guiding principles of President Xi's important speech and the major decisions and arrangements of the CPC Central Committee and President Xi, and devoted themselves to following and fulfilling the Party's historical missions. Under the guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, all officers and soldiers will thoroughly implement Xi Jinping Thought on Strengthening the Military, resolutely uphold the leadership core, unwaveringly follow the Party's command, carry forward the great founding spirit of the Party, remain true to the Party's original aspiration and founding mission, and press ahead with military preparedness, combat readiness and force development. They are committed to effectively fulfilling the missions and tasks of the people's armed forces in the new era and translating the outcomes of their study into a strong will and strength to forge political loyalty, reinforce the Party's organizational strengths, and achieve the military's centenary goal.","习主席站在党和国家事业发展全局的战略高度，全面回顾总结了105年来中国共产党团结带领全国各族人民走过的光辉历程、创造的伟大成就，深刻揭示了中国共产党之所以能够不断铸就辉煌的优秀特质和关键密码，对新征程上全体中国共产党人坚定信心、接续奋斗提出了“五个必须”的明确要求，向全党全国各族人民发出了奋力创造新的历史辉煌的伟大号召。\n习主席重要讲话为新时代新征程实现党的中心任务进一步指明了方向、提供了遵循。只有学之愈深，方能行之愈笃。军队各级党组织把学习贯彻习主席重要讲话作为一项重大政治任务，坚持原原本本学、深入细致学、联系实际学、严督实导学同向发力，深入学习领会习主席重要讲话的重大意义、丰富内涵和实践要求，学思践悟习近平党建思想，始终把思想和行动统一到习主席重要讲话精神上，统一到党中央和习主席重大决策部署上，服从服务于党的历史使命。全军官兵坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻习近平强军思想，坚定维护核心、坚决听党指挥，弘扬伟大建党精神，践行初心使命，深入推进斗争、备战、建设，有效履行人民军队新时代使命任务，真正把学习成果转化为铸牢政治忠诚、强固组织优势、攻坚建军百年的强大意志力量。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16476190.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16472665.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-09","Chen Xi","","It is reported that Lai Ching-te, while attending a graduation ceremony of a military academy, said that Taiwan would continue to expand foreign arms procurement and strengthen its indigenous defense capabilities. It is also reported that the Taiwan's naval force has recently established a Littoral Combat Command. Do you have any comment?","Clamoring for seeking \"Taiwan independence\" by force and external support, Lai Ching-te has once again exposed his true nature as a saboteur of peace and an instigator of war. Whatever Lai Ching-te says or does, he cannot change the military strength comparison across the Taiwan Strait, nor can he stop the irresistible trend of China's reunification.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, while reunification is the right path forward. We hope Taiwan compatriots see through the the extreme danger and grave harm of the DPP authorities' obstinate pursuit of \"Taiwan independence\", and join us in combating \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, opposing external interference, and safeguarding peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","赖清德鼓噪“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”，再次暴露其“和平破坏者”、“战争煽动者”的真实面目。无论赖清德说什么、做什么，都改变不了两岸军力对比态势，更阻挡不了祖国必然统一的历史大势。\n“台独”是绝路，统一是正道。希望广大台湾同胞看清民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂路线的极端危险性、危害性，与我们一道坚决打击“台独”分裂势力，反对外部势力干涉，共同维护台海和平稳定。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16476190.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16472665.html",1,1,4,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on July 15, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian first announced the holding of the 9th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum and the 6th Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month, and then answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Hello, friends from the press, and welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council.","各位记者朋友大家好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/closing)","","First, I will release two pieces of news.\nThe 9th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum will be held from July 17 to 21 in Hangzhou, Zhejiang, and other places, and on the morning of July 17 the forum's opening ceremony and the launch ceremony of the Zhejiang-Taiwan Youth Exchange Season will be held in Hangzhou. Hung Hsiu-chu, former chairperson of the Kuomintang and chairperson of the Chinese Youth Geese Peace Education Foundation, will attend the forum at invitation. About 1,000 people, including guests from relevant parties on both sides of the Strait and youth representatives from all walks of life, will take part in the forum's activities. Media reporters are welcome to go and cover it.\nThe 6th Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month opened on July 15 in Suzhou, Jiangsu. This culture month takes \"Same Heart, Walking Together, the Power of Youth\" as its theme and \"New Expressions of Traditional Culture\" as its main thread, building interactive and experiential exchange platforms for young people on both sides of the Strait and promoting exchanges, interaction and integration among cross-Strait youth. The activities will run from mid-July to late September, during which more than 40 main-venue supporting events and more than 30 sub-venue events will be held in culture and art, scientific and technological innovation, sports competitions, intangible cultural heritage study tours and other areas, including the Cross-Strait Film and Television Development Exchange Conference, the \"Guochao Han Style\" Chinese culture exchange series, the Cross-Strait Mei Lanfang Art and Culture Week, and the Huang Gongwang-themed cross-Strait cultural and creative competition, creating a cultural carnival belonging to the youth of both sides of the Strait. We warmly welcome young friends from both sides of the Strait to take part enthusiastically, jointly appreciate the immortal charm of fine traditional Chinese culture, gain joy and friendship in exchanges and mutual learning, and return fully laden.","首先，发布两则消息。\n第九届海峡两岸青年发展论坛将于7月17日至21日在浙江杭州等地举办，7月17日上午在杭州举办论坛开幕式暨浙台青年交流季启动仪式。中国国民党前主席、中华青雁和平教育基金会董事长洪秀柱将应邀出席论坛。两岸有关方面嘉宾、各界青年代表等约1000人将参加论坛有关活动。欢迎媒体记者前往采访报道。\n第六届海峡两岸青年文化月于7月15日在江苏苏州开幕。此次文化月以“同心同行 青春力量”为主题，以“传统文化新表达”为主线，为两岸青年搭建互动式、体验式交流平台，促进两岸青年交流交往交融。活动从7月中旬持续到9月下旬，期间将举办文化艺术、科技创新、体育竞赛、非遗研学等40余项主场配套活动和30余项分场活动，包括两岸影视发展交流大会、“国潮汉风”中华文化系列交流活动、海峡两岸梅兰芳艺术文化周、黄公望主题两岸文创大赛等，打造属于两岸青年的文化嘉年华。热忱欢迎两岸青年朋友踊跃参与，共同感悟中华优秀传统文化的不朽魅力，在交流互鉴中收获欣喜，收获友谊，满载而归。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776670.htm https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776672.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/closing)","","Please begin asking questions.","请大家开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","It is reported that a Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation arrived in Shanghai on the 14th for a visit and exchanges. May I ask which places they will visit on this trip? What is the Taiwan Affairs Office's comment on the delegation's visit to the mainland?","From July 14 to 17, a Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation is visiting Shanghai for exchanges, touring Yangshan Port, the 12345 citizen service hotline operations center, the Sihang Warehouse Memorial of the War of Resistance and other places, and holding a discussion and exchange with young teachers and students of Shanghai Jiao Tong University. We welcome the delegation's visit, will make the relevant arrangements for its activities, and will provide the necessary facilitation.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Strait share the same roots and origin, the same language and the same ethnicity; they are one family bound by blood that is thicker than water, and they should visit each other often and draw close as relatives. We warmly welcome the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends from Taiwan, to come to the mainland more often to look around, to experience the magnificent mountains and rivers for themselves, to feel the depth of its civilization, to experience its trendy lifestyle, to keep a date with youth together, and to create a bright future together.","7月14日至17日，台湾民众党青年交流团到上海参访交流，参观洋山港、12345市民服务热线运营中心及四行仓库抗战纪念馆等地，并与上海交通大学青年师生开展座谈交流。我们欢迎该团来访，将做好相关活动安排，并提供必要便利。\n两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种，是血浓于水的一家人，理应常来常往、走亲走近。我们热忱欢迎广大台湾同胞特别是台湾青年朋友多到大陆走走看看，亲身领略壮美河山，感受文明底蕴，体验潮流生活，共赴青春之约，共创美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776669.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","羊城晚报“阅台海”记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities.","The first dog-days period begins on the third geng day after the Summer Solstice; today is the first day of the dog days, and cross-Strait youth exchange activities in midsummer are diverse and wonderful.\nFirst, sports exchange activities let the youth of both sides of the Strait fully release their vitality. From July 7 to 11, a Fuzhou-Taiwan youth inter-school football friendship exchange was held in Fuzhou, with more than 150 teachers and students from six middle schools in Fuzhou and Taiwan taking part; most of the Taiwan players were indigenous youths coming to the mainland for the first time. From July 9 to 14, the 14th Straits Youth Gathering \"Ice and Snow Bond\" 2026 Cross-Strait (Fujian) Youth Land Curling Summer Camp and the 11th Cross-Strait (Fujian) Youth Rugby Exchange Tournament were held one after another in Fuzhou, where more than 300 young people from both sides of the Strait made friends through ball games and engaged in in-depth exchanges. On July 9, the 6th Taekwondo Competition of the 2026 Longyan City National Fitness Games and the Longyan-Taiwan Taekwondo Exchange were held in Longyan, where 111 young athletes from both sides of the Strait competed on the same stage and made friends through martial arts. From July 13 to 26, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Putian) Sports Series is being held in Putian, including youth football, basketball, taekwondo, wushu and other events, among which the university basketball tournament has 16 university basketball teams from both sides of the Strait taking part.\nSecond, music and dance exchange activities bring more enjoyment of beauty to the youth of both sides of the Strait. From July 11 to 13, the 2nd Cross-Strait Folk Culture and Sports Festival \"Drum Rhythms Resounding Across the Four Seas, Chaozhou Sentiments Uniting Both Sides of the Strait\" Chaozhou drum music cultural exchange was held in Chaozhou, Guangdong, where more than 160 Taiwan youths and mainland drum music enthusiasts jointly held drum music flash mobs and performances, and experienced Yingge dance and other Chaoshan folk culture. From July 19 to 20, the \"Dance Rhythms of One Heart, Bonds Across the Strait\" 2026 Zhangzhou-Taiwan Youth Study and Practice Exchange will be held in Zhangzhou City, Fujian, inviting more than 60 Taiwan youths to come to Zhangzhou for song and dance performance exchanges with local peers. From July 20 to 25, Wenzhou, Zhejiang, will hold the Cross-Strait Banping Mountain Minnan-Language Music Season, including a Minnan-language music gathering, a short video competition, resident performances by young Taiwan musicians, and a cross-Strait youth experience camp; more than 400 Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan youths will take part, jointly passing on and spreading Minnan culture.\nThird, food and short video exchange activities let the youth of both sides of the Strait feel more of life's good things. On July 12, Zhuhai City held the first \"Taiwan Bond, Zhuhai Affection\" Taiwan Food Carnival, in which more than 600 compatriots from both sides of the Strait took part; the event brought together classic Taiwanese snacks such as braised pork rice, oyster vermicelli, and small sausage in large sausage, and released a Zhuhai Taiwan food map, letting compatriots on both sides of the Strait fully experience taste memories of shared roots and origins. If you go to Zhuhai, you can follow the map and check in one by one at the 17 Taiwanese food restaurants listed on it. From July 14 to 17, the grand final of the 8th \"Guangdong Is Fun\" Cross-Strait Youth Creative Short Film Competition was held in Zhongshan, Guangdong Province. Themed on commemorating the 160th anniversary of the birth of Dr. Sun Yat-sen, the competition collected more than 800 works, and 20 teams from both sides of the Strait advanced to the final, 10 of them Taiwan teams, helping young people on both sides of the Strait who love creative film and television to engage in in-depth exchanges.","夏至三庚数头伏，今天是入伏的第一天，盛夏时节的两岸青年交流活动类型多样、精彩纷呈。\n一是体育交流活动让两岸青年充分释放活力。7月7日至11日，榕台青少年校际足球友谊交流活动在福州举办，榕台两地六所中学150多名师生参加，台湾参赛球员多为首次前来大陆的少数民族青少年。7月9日至14日，第十四届海峡青年荟·“冰雪情缘”2026年海峡两岸（福建）青少年陆地冰壶夏令营、第十一届海峡两岸（福建）青年橄榄球交流赛先后在福州举行，300多名两岸青年以球会友，深入交流。7月9日，2026年龙岩市全民健身运动会第六届跆拳道比赛暨龙台跆拳道交流活动在龙岩举办，两岸111名青少年选手同台竞技、以武会友。7月13日至26日，2026海峡两岸（莆田）体育运动系列赛在莆田举办，包括青少年足球、篮球、跆拳道、武术等多个项目，其中大学生篮球赛共有16支两岸高校篮球队参加。\n二是音乐舞蹈交流活动为两岸青年带来更多美的享受。7月11日至13日，第二届海峡两岸民俗文体汇“鼓韵扬四海·潮情融两岸”潮州鼓乐文化交流活动在广东潮州举办，160余名台湾青少年与大陆鼓乐爱好者共同开展鼓乐快闪及汇演活动，并体验英歌舞等潮汕民俗文化。7月19日至20日，“舞韵同心·情牵两岸”2026年漳台青少年研学实践交流活动将在福建漳州市举办，邀请60多名台湾青少年前来漳州与当地同龄人进行歌舞展演交流。7月20日至25日，浙江温州将举办两岸半屏山闽南语音乐季活动，包括闽南语音乐荟、短视频大赛、台湾青年音乐人驻唱、两岸青年体验营等活动，400余名台胞台青参加，一起传承和传播闽南文化。\n三是美食及短视频交流活动让两岸青年感受更多美好。7月12日，珠海市举办首届“台湾缘 珠海情”台湾美食嘉年华，600多名两岸同胞参与活动，现场汇集卤肉饭、蚵仔面线、大肠包小肠等台式经典小吃，并发布珠海台湾美食地图，让两岸同胞充分感受同根同源的味蕾记忆。大家如果到珠海，可以按图索骥，一一打卡列入地图的17家台湾美食餐厅。7月14日至17日，第八届“粤来粤有趣”两岸青年创意短片大赛总决赛在广东省中山举办，大赛以纪念孙中山先生诞辰160周年为主题，征集到800余件作品，两岸20支队伍晋级决赛，其中有10支台湾队伍，助力两岸热爱创意影视的青年深入交流。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic and trade activities.","From July to August, the 2026 Hainan-Taiwan Cooperation Week series of activities will be held in Haikou City, Hainan Province, and other places, with the theme \"Two Islands of One Heart Walking Together, Hainan and Taiwan Integrating and Winning Together.\" It will hold a launch ceremony, a Hainan-Taiwan economic and trade cooperation exchange meeting, a Cross-Strait Leisure Agriculture Development (Hainan) Seminar, a Hainan-Taiwan youth employment and entrepreneurship exchange event, a Hainan-Taiwan marriage and kinship event, and 10 other sub-venue events. About 600 or more people, including people from Taiwan's industrial and commercial circles, heads of key Taiwan enterprises and representatives of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan youth, will take part. The activities will help deepen integrated development between Hainan and Taiwan in all fields and help Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises share the development dividends of the Hainan Free Trade Port.\nFrom July 12 to 15, the 2026 Guizhou-Taiwan Economic, Trade, Exchange and Cooperation Symposium was held in Guiyang City, Guizhou. This \"Guizhou-Taiwan Conference\" took \"Riding New Opportunities of Integration, Creating a New Future for Industry\" as its theme and set up a series of dedicated industry matchmaking events, youth innovation and entrepreneurship exchange events and characteristic cultural events; more than 200 Taiwan entrepreneurs, industry experts, young elites and others went to Guizhou to visit and exchange. The activities aim to build an integrated exchange platform for industry matchmaking, youth interaction and cultural friendship, and to push practical economic and trade cooperation and grassroots exchanges between the two places to improve in quality and efficiency and to go deeper and more substantive.","7月至8月，2026琼台合作周系列活动将在海南省海口市等地举行，以“双岛同心同行，琼台共融共赢”为主题，将举行启动仪式、琼台经贸合作交流会、海峡两岸休闲农业发展（海南）研讨会、琼台青年就业创业交流活动、琼台姻亲缘等10个分场活动。台湾工商界人士，重点台企负责人及台胞台青代表等约600余人参加。活动将有利于深化琼台各领域融合发展，助力台胞台企共享海南自贸港发展红利。\n7月12日至15日，2026年贵州·台湾经贸交流合作恳谈会在贵州贵阳市举行。本届“黔台会”以“乘融合新机遇 创产业新未来”为主题，设置系列专项产业对接活动、青年创新创业交流活动和特色文化活动，台湾企业家、行业专家、青年菁英等200余人赴黔参访交流。活动旨在搭建产业对接、青年互动、文化联谊一体化交流平台，推动两地经贸务实合作与基层交流提质增效、走深走实。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","Although the DPP authorities have used all kinds of means to intimidate the Taiwan public not to come to the mainland, the willingness of the Taiwan public to come to the mainland for exchanges continued to rise in the first half of this year, the number of participants in many cross-Strait exchange activities repeatedly hit record highs, and many young people in Taiwan are hotly discussing \"whether coming to the…","Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland is indeed becoming more and more popular. According to statistics from the National Immigration Administration, from January to June this year, cross-Strait personnel exchanges reached 3.119 million person-trips, up 22.1% year on year, of which Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland accounted for 2.85 million person-trips, up 24.9% year on year.\nThe relevant data fully show that wanting peace, development, exchange and cooperation is the mainstream public opinion in Taiwan society and the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. The lie that \"the mainland is very dangerous,\" deliberately fabricated by the DPP authorities, has long since collapsed on its own. More and more Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, have already planned or are planning to travel to the mainland or come for exchanges, measuring the vast and magnificent mountains and rivers with their feet, feeling the brilliant and splendid Chinese civilization with their hearts, observing the booming economy and technology with their eyes, and experiencing with feeling the fraternal affection of the mainland people and the ubiquitous bustle of everyday life.\nHearing is believing less than seeing. We warmly welcome more Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland for exchanges and visits, study and internships, employment and entrepreneurship, sightseeing and tourism, and business inspections, and will provide more facilitation and create better conditions for this. With the summer vacation coming, Taiwan compatriot friends, especially young student friends, can head to all parts of the mainland: gallop on horseback on the grasslands beyond the Great Wall and take in the green fields and vast sky where \"the wind blows, the grass bends, and cattle and sheep appear\"; stroll leisurely in the water towns south of the Yangtze and savor the cultural code of \"for a thousand li orioles sing amid green and red\"; drive a thousand li through the northwestern desert and feel the majestic vastness of \"the bright moon rises over the Tianshan Mountains\"; escape the summer heat on the black soil of the Northeast and experience the northern scenery where \"clouds are cool, the wind is clear, and the summer heat recedes of itself.\" A trip to the mainland is not only worth it, it is more than worth it.","台胞来大陆确实越来越火爆。据国家出入境管理局统计，今年1至6月，两岸人员往来311.9万人次，同比增长22.1%，其中台胞来大陆285万人次，同比增长24.9%。\n相关数据充分表明，要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会的主流民意，是两岸同胞的共同心声。民进党当局刻意编造的“大陆很危险”的谎言早已不攻自破。越来越多的台胞特别是青年朋友，已经或正在规划来大陆旅行或交流，用脚丈量辽阔壮丽的大好河山，用心感受辉煌灿烂的中华文明，用眼观察蓬勃发展的经济科技，用情体会大陆民众的同胞情谊和无处不在的烟火气。\n耳听为虚，眼见为实。我们热忱欢迎更多台胞来大陆交流参访、学习实习、就业创业、观光旅游、商务考察，将为此提供更多便利，创造更好条件。暑期来临，台胞朋友特别是青年学生朋友可以奔赴大陆各地，到塞外草原策马扬鞭，一览“风吹草低见牛羊”的碧野苍穹；去江南水乡闲庭信步，体味“千里莺啼绿映红”的文化密码；赴西北大漠驰行千里，感受“明月出天山”的雄浑浩荡；到关东黑土避暑纳凉，体会“云冷风清暑自收”的北国风光。来大陆一趟，不仅值，而且超值。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776667.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","The State Administration for Market Regulation recently announced that over more than two years, the two sides of the Strait have jointly developed and implemented 378 cross-Strait common standards, covering many fields such as specialty agricultural products, modern service industries, food, new energy, and culture and tourism, giving full play to the \"soft connectivity\" role of the relevant standards,…","In September 2023, Xinhua News Agency was authorized to release the \"Opinions of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path of Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Demonstration Zone for Cross-Strait Integrated Development\" (hereinafter the \"Opinions\"), which made comprehensive arrangements for supporting Fujian in building a demonstration zone for cross-Strait integrated development. Since the release of the \"Opinions,\" the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the National Development and Reform Commission have taken the lead, together with the State Administration for Market Regulation and other relevant departments of central and state organs, in solidly pushing forward the detailed implementation of the key tasks of the \"Opinions,\" and support for Fujian's high-quality building of the demonstration zone for cross-Strait integrated development has made phased progress.\nCross-Strait standard commonality effectively promotes the integration of industries, markets and talent across the Strait and is an important component of building the demonstration zone for cross-Strait integrated development. In 2023 the State Administration for Market Regulation took the lead in issuing dedicated support measures focused on the \"soft connectivity\" of standards, supporting Fujian in systematically carrying out cross-Strait standard commonality in building the demonstration zone for cross-Strait integrated development and in exploring new models and new mechanisms for cross-Strait standard commonality work, forming an integrated development pattern of \"standards jointly researched, markets shared, and talent interconnected.\"\nFirst, it took the lead in implementing the \"four joints and three adoptions\" working mechanism, namely jointly selecting topics, jointly comparing, jointly developing and jointly using common standards; advanced mainland standards adopted by Taiwan, advanced Taiwan standards adopted by the mainland, and standards in blank areas jointly developed and adopted by both sides of the Strait. This removes technical barriers in the circulation of goods and in technical cooperation.\nSecond, it innovatively carried out pilots of cross-Strait standard commonality, advancing 75 pilot projects in fields such as machinery manufacturing, modern service industries and folk culture, of which 11 pilots, including architectural design, dragon fruit cultivation and tea industry study tours, have achieved application results in the Taiwan region.\nThird, it supported the issuance of the \"Fujian Province Regulations on Promoting Cross-Strait Standard Commonality,\" building a comprehensive, whole-chain Taiwan-related standardization legal system.\nFourth, it built a cross-Strait standard commonality service platform, which includes 6,047 entries of cross-Strait terminology standard comparison information and provides \"one-stop\" services for cross-Strait industry, academic and research institutions and enterprises.\nSince the release of the \"Opinions,\" the results of cross-Strait standard commonality have continued to expand. Industry, academia and research parties on both sides of the Strait have jointly developed and implemented 378 common standards; the standards system has been continuously improved, application scenarios have extended to multiple dimensions such as industry, trade and culture, and they have played a positive role in promoting social integration, economic integration and emotional integration.","2023年9月，新华社受权发布《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》（下称《意见》），就支持福建建设两岸融合发展示范区作出全面部署。《意见》发布以来，中央台办、国家发展改革委牵头会同市场监管总局等中央和国家机关有关部门，扎实推动《意见》各项重点任务落实落细，支持福建高质量建设两岸融合发展示范区取得阶段性进展。\n两岸标准共通有效促进两岸产业、市场、人才的融合，是两岸融合发展示范区建设的重要组成部分。市场监管总局于2023年率先出台专项支持措施，聚焦标准“软联通”，支持福建在两岸融合发展示范区建设中系统开展两岸标准共通，探索两岸标准共通工作新模式新机制，形成了“标准共研、市场共享、人才互通”的融合发展格局。\n一是率先推行“四共同三采用”工作机制，即共同选题、共同比对、共同研制、共同使用共通标准；大陆先进标准台湾采用、台湾先进标准大陆采用、空白领域标准两岸共同研制采用。消除商品流通、技术合作中的技术性障碍。\n二是创新开展两岸标准共通试点，围绕机械制造业、现代服务业、民俗文化领域等推动75个试点项目，其中建筑设计、火龙果栽培、茶业研学等11个试点在台湾地区取得应用成果。\n三是支持出台《福建省促进两岸标准共通条例》，构建综合性、全链条的涉台标准化法治体系。\n四是建设两岸标准共通服务平台，收录6047条两岸名词术语标准对照信息，为两岸产学研机构和企业提供“一站式”服务。\n《意见》发布以来，两岸标准共通成果持续扩容。两岸产学研各方共同研制实施共通标准达378项，标准体系不断完善，应用场景向产业、贸易、文化等多维度延伸，在促进社会融合、经济融合、情感融合等方面发挥积极作用。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, the head of Taiwan's economic department said that with changes in the geopolitical situation, the \"non-red supply chain\" has become an international trend, and that he hopes to push the island's 5 major industries to become \"non-red,\" to establish closer supply chain links with the world's democratic countries, and even to form an ecosystem, in order to strengthen resilience. What is your comment on this?","The so-called \"non-red supply chain\" is political manipulation by certain countries that draws lines by ideology; it seriously violates economic laws and market laws, undermines the stability of the world economy, disrupts normal international trade, and also harms the island's economic development. Out of their nature of seeking \"independence,\" the DPP authorities follow the trend in making noise and cooperate energetically. On the one hand, they do all they can to obstruct and restrict cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation; on the other hand, they grovel before external forces and sell out Taiwan's advantageous industries, handing over the autonomy of economic development with folded hands. But what their actions have earned is only more unscrupulous extraction and plunder by their \"foreign masters,\" and what is harmed is the interests and future of Taiwan's enterprises and people.\nThe mainland has a complete industrial system, an open super-large market, abundant innovation factors and a resilient supply chain network; it is a main engine of global economic growth, a hot spot and focus of global capital investment, and also a blessed land for the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople to invest, develop and grow. According to statistics from the General Administration of Customs, from January to June 2026, total cross-Strait import and export trade was about US$185.03 billion, up 25.3% year on year. Of this, mainland exports to Taiwan were US$51.884 billion, up 32.9% year on year, and mainland imports from Taiwan were US$133.154 billion, up 22.5% year on year. This fully proves that cross-Strait industrial chain and supply chain cooperation continues to deepen and cross-Strait economic integrated development continues to strengthen. The DPP authorities' obstinate push for cross-Strait \"decoupling and breaking of chains,\" acting recklessly and wildly, will only amount to lifting a rock to drop it on their own feet.","所谓“非红供应链”是某些国家以意识形态划线的政治操弄，严重违背经济规律和市场规律，破坏世界经济稳定，扰乱正常国际贸易，也损害岛内经济发展。民进党当局出于谋“独”本性，跟风鼓噪、卖力配合。一方面竭力阻挠限制两岸经贸合作，另一方面向外部势力低三下四出卖台湾优势产业，拱手相让经济发展自主权。但其所作所为换来的只是“洋主子”更加肆无忌惮的榨取和掠夺，损害的是台湾企业、民众的利益和未来。\n大陆有完备的产业体系、开放的超大规模市场、丰富的创新要素和富有韧性的供应链网络，是全球经济增长的主要引擎，是全球资本投资的热点重点，也是广大台商投资、发展、壮大的福地宝地。据海关总署统计，2026年1至6月，两岸进出口贸易总额约1850.3亿美元，同比增长25.3%。其中大陆对台出口518.84亿美元，同比增长32.9%；大陆自台进口1331.54亿美元，同比增长22.5%。这充分证明两岸产业链供应链合作不断深化，两岸经济融合发展不断增强。民进党当局一意孤行推动两岸“脱钩断链”，蛮干胡来，只会搬起石头砸自己的脚。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776660.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","A DPP politician said that the mainland is changing the status quo in the Taiwan Strait through a variety of military and non-military actions, and that the international community should pay close attention to the mainland's actions, otherwise the current status quo in the Taiwan Strait will gradually disappear. What is your comment on this?","The DPP politician's statement completely distorts the facts and is pure malicious hype. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China; this is the true status quo in the Taiwan Strait. The DPP authorities define the so-called \"status quo in the Taiwan Strait\" with a \"new two-state theory,\" which completely runs counter to law, history and reality and is an out-and-out \"Taiwan independence\" separatist fallacy. They stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" position, refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, and constantly collude with external forces to carry out provocations seeking \"independence\"; they are the destroyers of the status quo in the Taiwan Strait and the biggest source of disorder for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait.\n\"Taiwan independence\" and peace in the Taiwan Strait are as incompatible as fire and water. Only by resolutely striking at the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and opposing interference by external forces can \"Taiwan independence\" adventurism be curbed, can peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait truly be maintained, can national sovereignty and territorial integrity be defended, and can the common interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait and the fundamental interests of the Chinese nation be safeguarded.","民进党政客的说法完全歪曲事实，纯属恶意炒作。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分，这是真正的台海现状。民进党当局以“新两国论”界定所谓“台海现状”，完全违背法理、历史与现实，是不折不扣的“台独”分裂谬论。其顽固坚持“台独”立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，不断勾连外部势力进行谋“独”挑衅，是台海现状的破坏者，是台海和平稳定的最大乱源。\n“台独”与台海和平水火不容。只有坚决打击“台独”分裂势力、反对外部势力干涉，才能遏阻“台独”冒险，才能真正维护台海和平稳定，才能捍卫国家主权和领土完整，才能维护两岸同胞共同利益和中华民族根本利益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776668.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","Recently, Guangxi, Hubei, Gansu and other places suffered wind disasters and floods. May I ask whether any Taiwan compatriots or Taiwan enterprises were affected? Could you introduce the relevant situation?","Recently, Guangxi, Hubei, Gansu and many other places have suffered heavy rainfall, strong winds and other extreme weather, which triggered floods and geological disasters and caused heavy casualties and economic losses. General Secretary Xi Jinping gave important instructions on flood control and disaster relief work, and the relevant departments and localities have thoroughly implemented the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions and are going all out in emergency rescue and disaster relief work.\nWe attach great importance to flood control and disaster relief work for Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises on the mainland. We surveyed at the first moment how Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises in the relevant areas were affected by the disasters, and simultaneously carried out emergency rescue, resettlement, relief, support and other work. As we understand it, Taiwan compatriots in Guangxi, Hubei and Gansu are all safe, and some Taiwan-funded enterprises in Guangxi have suffered economic losses of varying degrees. The Taiwan Affairs Office is working with Guangxi to actively help the affected Taiwan enterprises overcome difficulties and help them resume work and production as soon as possible.\nWe have noted that, affected by Typhoon \"Bavi,\" the public in many places on the island has suffered from the disaster. We express our sympathy to the affected compatriots in Taiwan and sincerely hope they will restore normal production and living order as soon as possible.","近期，广西、湖北、甘肃等多地遭受强降雨、大风等极端天气，引发洪涝和地质灾害，造成重大人员伤亡和经济损失。习近平总书记对防汛救灾工作作出重要指示，相关部门和地方深入贯彻落实习近平总书记重要指示精神，全力开展抢险救灾工作。\n我们高度重视大陆台胞台企防汛救灾工作，第一时间摸排相关地区台胞台企受灾情况，同步开展抢险、安置、救助、扶持等各项工作。据了解，广西、湖北、甘肃三地台胞均安全，广西部分台资企业有不同程度经济损失。国台办正会同广西方面在积极为受灾台企纾困解难，帮助他们尽快复工复产。\n我们注意到，受台风“巴威”影响，岛内多地民众受灾。我们对台湾受灾同胞表示慰问，衷心希望他们尽快恢复正常生产和生活秩序。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776658.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Recently, Kuomintang Chairperson Cheng Li-wun said in Penghu County that Penghu has excellent natural landscapes and cultural heritage, but its development has been restricted in recent years; she called for a full restart of the \"mini three links,\" so that Penghu can welcome mainland tourists as Kinmen and Matsu do, which is the key to reviving its tourism. What is your comment on this?","The \"mini three links\" is a livelihood channel and a kinship route connecting the peoples of both sides of the Strait. As of June 30, 2026, the \"mini three links\" had safely carried more than 27 million passenger trips, and in the first half of this year alone carried more than 1.15 million passenger trips, injecting strong momentum into the development of Taiwan's tourism industry.\nTourism is an important carrier of a good life and a natural bridge for promoting exchanges. We have carefully listened to the opinions and suggestions of all sectors in Taiwan and actively pushed for the resumption of travel by Shanghai and Fujian residents to Kinmen and Matsu, which has been warmly welcomed by the Taiwan public. To date, travel by Shanghai and Fujian residents to Kinmen and Matsu has exceeded a cumulative 300,000 person-trips.\nWhen Penghu is mentioned, everyone will surely think of \"Grandma's Penghu Bay,\" the Twin Hearts Stone Weir on Qimei Islet and the Penghu Tianhou Temple. Mainland people are very willing to travel to all parts of Taiwan, including Penghu. The main obstacle now is that the DPP authorities interfere with and obstruct mainland residents' travel to Taiwan on all kinds of untenable grounds, artificially blocking the channel for the recovery of the cross-Strait tourism market. We advise the DPP authorities to give priority to the interests of the peoples on both sides of the Strait and lift the restrictions on mainland residents' travel to Taiwan as soon as possible.","“小三通”是连接两岸民众的民生通道、亲情航线，截至2026年6月30日，“小三通”已安全运送旅客超过2700万人次，仅今年上半年就运送旅客超过115万人次，为台湾旅游业发展注入强劲动力。\n旅游是美好生活的重要载体，是促进交流的天然桥梁。我们认真听取台湾各界意见建议，积极推动恢复上海、福建居民赴金门、马祖旅游，受到台湾民众的热烈欢迎。截至目前，上海、福建居民赴金门、马祖旅游累计超过30万人次。\n提到澎湖，大家一定会想到《外婆的澎湖湾》、七美屿的双心石沪和澎湖天后宫。大陆民众是很愿意去包括澎湖在内的台湾各地旅行的。现在主要的障碍在于民进党当局以各种站不住脚的理由干扰阻挠大陆居民赴台旅游，人为阻断两岸旅游市场复苏通道。奉劝民进党当局以两岸民众利益为重，尽早解除对大陆居民赴台旅游的限制。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776662.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Recently, soybean salad oil on the island was found to contain excessive levels of the carcinogen \"benzo[a]pyrene,\" raising concerns in Taiwan society about food safety regulation and other issues. What is your comment on this?","Food concerns people's livelihoods, and food safety is the bottom line of people's livelihoods. \"Benzo[a]pyrene\" is listed by the World Health Organization as a Group 1 carcinogen. More than 3,900 tonnes of the problem oil flowed to the dinner tables of many households, schools and restaurants, seriously endangering the lives and health of the Taiwan public. Faced with such a major food safety incident, the DPP authorities delayed handling it and attempted to \"cover the cards\" and conceal information, fully exposing their ugly face of disregard for people's livelihoods.","食品关乎民生，食品安全是民生底线。“苯并芘”被世界卫生组织列为一级致癌物质，超过3900吨的问题油品流向众多家庭、学校、餐馆的餐桌，严重危害台湾民众的生命健康。面对如此重大的食安事件，民进党当局拖延处置，企图“盖牌”隐瞒信息，充分暴露其漠视民生的丑恶嘴脸。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776661.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, the Ministry of Culture and Tourism issued the \"15th Five-Year Plan for Building a Tourism Power,\" stating that it will advance cross-Strait tourism exchanges and cooperation and strengthen exchanges between young people on both sides of the Strait. May I ask how cross-Strait tourism cooperation will be promoted next?","The \"15th Five-Year Plan for Building a Tourism Power\" proposes advancing cross-Strait tourism exchanges and cooperation and strengthening exchanges between young people on both sides of the Strait. This points the direction for upgrading the quality of the culture and tourism industry in the new era and provides a solid basis for deepening cross-Strait culture and tourism exchanges and cooperation.\nWith mountains and seas as the medium, culture and tourism build a bridge. Tourism is a natural bond for the meeting of hearts of compatriots on both sides of the Strait; in mutual visits and exchanges, compatriots on both sides personally experience a culture of the same origin, a history of the same roots and beautiful scenery. Tourism also concerns economic and livelihood development; cross-Strait tourism exchanges can fully drive increased income for Taiwan's catering, transport, cultural and creative and other industries, ease the business difficulties of practitioners on the island, and improve the well-being of the industry and the public.\nWe will continue to promote cross-Strait tourism cooperation, smooth two-way cross-Strait tourism channels, use tourism to draw compatriots' feelings closer, and deepen cross-Strait cultural identity.","《旅游强国建设“十五五”规划》提出，要推进海峡两岸旅游交流合作，加强两岸青少年交流。这为新时期文旅产业提质升级指明了方向，为深化两岸文旅交流合作提供坚实依据。\n山海为媒，文旅搭桥。旅游是两岸同胞心灵契合的天然纽带，两岸同胞在互访交流中，亲身感受同源文化、同根历史、秀美风光。旅游也事关经济民生发展，两岸旅游交流能够充分带动台湾餐饮、交通、文创等行业增收，纾解岛内从业者经营困境，增进业界与民众福祉。\n我们将持续推动两岸旅游合作，畅通两岸双向旅游通道，以旅游拉近同胞情感，厚植两岸文化认同。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Taiwan media reported that because the mainland has in recent years continuously carried out \"verbal attacks and military intimidation\" against Taiwan, the Taiwan military this week held its first \"joint defense drill,\" simulating \"threat scenarios such as detecting enemy forces setting out and entering territorial waters,\" in order to respond to possible potential threats. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities vainly attempt to \"seek independence by force\" and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation; they are the chief culprit behind the tension and turbulence in the Taiwan Strait situation. In the face of the powerful people's army, no matter how many drills the DPP authorities conduct, it is all posturing and futile; it cannot change the doomed fate of \"Taiwan independence,\" nor can it block the historical trend of the inevitable reunification of the motherland.","民进党当局妄图“以武谋独”，升高两岸对立对抗，是台海形势紧张动荡的罪魁祸首。在强大的人民军队面前，民进党当局搞再多演习都是装腔作势、徒劳无功，改变不了“台独”注定败亡的下场，也阻挡不了祖国必然统一的历史大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776657.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","北京日报记者","Recently, the European Parliament adopted a report on the geopolitical situation in East Asia, saying it opposes any act of unilaterally changing the status quo through coercion. Taiwan's foreign affairs department expressed thanks for this. What is your comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China; this is the true status quo in the Taiwan Strait. The relevant European Parliament report grossly interferes in China's internal affairs, and we firmly oppose it. We urge the European Parliament to immediately correct its erroneous Taiwan-related words and deeds and to handle Taiwan-related issues prudently and properly.\nThe DPP authorities' vain attempt to win over external forces to endorse their provocations seeking \"independence\" is doomed to fail.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分，这是真正的台海现状。欧洲议会有关报告粗暴干涉中国内政，我们对此坚决反对。敦促欧洲议会立即纠正涉台错误言行，慎重妥善处理涉台问题。\n民进党当局妄图拉拢外部势力为其谋“独”挑衅行径背书，注定失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","Recently, \"Reference News\" published an article, \"Silicon Valley Smells 'New Winds Rising in Cross-Strait Situation,'\" pointing out that the Taiwan Strait issue is becoming a hot topic in Silicon Valley in the United States and is drawing attention. A Silicon Valley investor said that China and the United States have no reason to fight a war, and Taiwan will be gradually reunified by the mainland within 10 to 20…","Resolving the Taiwan question and achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters. The motherland must be reunified and will inevitably be reunified; this is a historical trend that no person and no force can stop. Cross-Strait reunification is not only an inevitable requirement of the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, it will also provide a more reliable guarantee for world peace and development and inject more powerful energy into global economic and trade cooperation.","解决台湾问题、实现祖国完全统一，是全体中华儿女的共同愿望。祖国必须统一，也必然统一，这是任何人任何势力都无法阻挡的历史大势。两岸统一不仅是中华民族复兴的必然要求，也必将为世界和平发展提供更可靠保障，为全球经贸合作注入更强大能量。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Recently, the foreign ministers of the United States, Japan and South Korea met and stressed the importance of maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and \"expressed concern about increasingly frequent, destabilizing activities around Taiwan,\" encouraged peaceful resolution of cross-Strait issues, and opposed any attempt to unilaterally change the status quo. What is your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no outside comment. There is only one China in the world, and the mainland and Taiwan both belong to one China; this is the true status quo in the Taiwan Strait. The relevant actions carried out by the mainland's relevant departments around the island of Taiwan are a just act to safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and to safeguard the overall interests of the Chinese nation. The countries concerned should abide by the one-China principle, stop making irresponsible remarks on the Taiwan question, and stop sending any wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" forces.","台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容外人置喙。世界上只有一个中国，大陆和台湾同属一个中国，这是真正的台海现状。大陆相关部门在台岛周边实施有关行动，是维护国家主权和领土完整、维护中华民族整体利益的正义之举。有关国家应恪守一个中国原则，停止在台湾问题上说三道四，停止向“台独”势力发出任何错误信号。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","It is reported that Zhang Xue, chairman of Zhang Xue Motorcycle, said in an interview that he very much wants to open a store in Taiwan, no later than next year; he promised that his future Taiwan owners will enjoy exactly the same after-sales service guarantees as mainland owners; and he said he longs to ride around the island of Taiwan. Zhang Xue's remarks were praised by netizens on both sides of the Strait.…","Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family. We are willing to share good mainland products with the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots and support two-way investment and win-win cooperation between enterprises on both sides of the Strait. We hope industries on both sides of the Strait will give full play to their respective advantages, carry out in-depth exchanges and cooperation, and better serve the peoples on both sides of the Strait, so that the peoples on both sides can all buy and use good products of fine quality and moderate price.","两岸同胞是一家人。我们愿意同广大台湾同胞分享大陆好产品，支持两岸企业双向投资、合作共赢。希望两岸业界充分发挥各自优势，深入交流合作，更好服务两岸民众，让两岸民众都能买到和用上质量优良、价格适中的好产品。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","Lai Ching-te recently said, \"According to statistics from 2024 to the end of June this year, 374 Taiwan people have gone missing, been detained for questioning, or had their personal freedom restricted after going to China; if not necessary, people should avoid going to China.\" What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities repeatedly fabricate lies and maliciously hype them, attempting to create a \"chilling effect\" and intimidate the Taiwan public, which fully exposes their sinister intention of deliberately obstructing and sabotaging cross-Strait exchanges and personnel contacts in order to seek \"independence.\"\nWe have always encouraged and supported exchanges and contacts in all fields across the Strait and protected the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in accordance with the law. Since 2024, more and more Taiwan compatriots have come to the mainland for exchanges and visits, study and employment, sightseeing and tourism, business inspections and so on, totaling more than 11.7 million person-trips. The facts fully prove that as long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland can come happily and return safely, and also prove that the DPP authorities' lies and schemes have been seen through by more and more Taiwan compatriots.","民进党当局反复编造谎言，恶意炒作，企图制造“寒蝉效应”、恐吓台湾民众，充分暴露其为谋“独”刻意阻挠破坏两岸交流和人员往来的险恶用心。\n我们一贯鼓励支持两岸各领域交流往来，依法保护台湾同胞的正当权益。2024年以来，越来越多的台湾同胞来大陆交流参访、学习就业、观光旅游、商务考察等，累计1170余万人次。事实充分证明，只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台胞来大陆完全可以高高兴兴来、平平安安回，也证明民进党当局的谎言和阴谋已被越来越多的台湾同胞识破。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","During the 2026 FIFA World Cup in the United States, Canada and Mexico, many cinemas in Fujian launched live broadcast services of World Cup matches, attracting many Taiwan compatriots to come and watch the matches together with mainland fans. Some commentators pointed out that this gives Taiwan fans an excellent experience and makes cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges ever warmer and more vivid. What is your…","The 2026 FIFA World Cup is a joyful feast for football fans around the world. The World Cup has now entered the semi-finals, and the tournament has entered its final sprint. We welcome Taiwan compatriot fans to come to the mainland to watch the matches. On the mainland they can watch live matches anytime and anywhere using mainland television, the internet, apps and so on, and they can also go to cinemas that have launched live broadcasts of World Cup matches, to fully experience the passion of the pitch together with mainland compatriots and enjoy the mainland's convenient living services and vigorous development vitality. After watching the World Cup, Taiwan compatriot friends can also watch the Fujian Super League, Jiangsu Super League, Guangdong Super League, Northeast Super League and Sichuan Super League in person, and fully experience the charm of football and the splendor of culture and tourism in various places.","2026年国际足联世界杯是全世界球迷的快乐盛宴。目前世界杯已经进入半决赛，赛事进入最后冲刺阶段。我们欢迎台胞球迷朋友们来大陆观赛，他们在大陆既可以随时随地使用大陆电视、网络、APP等观看直播赛事，也可以去推出世界杯赛事直播的电影院，与大陆同胞一起充分体验绿茵激情，享受大陆便捷的生活服务和蓬勃的发展活力。看完世界杯，台胞朋友们还可以现场观看闽超、苏超、粤超、东北超、川超，充分感受足球的魅力和各地文旅的精彩。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260715_12776659.htm"],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: the Mainland Affairs Council recently said that within the past ten days, 10 Taiwan people lost contact after going to the mainland. May I ask whether the Taiwan Affairs Office and relevant mainland units know the specific whereabouts of these 10 Taiwan people? Could it involve telecom fraud, criminal offenses, or simply cases of lost contact? In addition, the Mainland Affairs Council also said…","First question. The Mainland Affairs Council's fabrication and deliberate spreading of false information in an attempt to mislead the Taiwan public is completely untenable. There is no need for media friends to engage in groundless speculation about this.\nThe broad masses of Taiwan compatriots enjoy a safe and comfortable, convenient and pleasant travel experience when touring and sightseeing and visiting relatives and friends on the mainland; this is a fact for all to see. The DPP authorities deliberately smear this, intending to create panic, obstruct and sabotage cross-Strait exchanges and personnel contacts, and escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation; their conduct is detestable and their intentions deserve condemnation.\nSecond question. Cross-Strait direct air links are an important air bond connecting the kinship of compatriots on both sides of the Strait and smoothing economic, trade and cultural exchanges, carrying the urgent needs of people's contacts. In the first half of this year, passengers traveling across the Strait on direct passenger flights reached 3.1378 million person-trips, up 15% year on year, fully confirming the strong demand in the cross-Strait direct flight market and the strong wish of the peoples on both sides of the Strait for contacts.\nWe actively promote the full restoration and normalization of cross-Strait direct air links; this attitude is consistent and clear. We hope the Taiwan side will face squarely the real demand for cross-Strait direct passenger flights, go along with public sentiment, lift the unreasonable restrictions on cross-Strait air transport as soon as possible, and let airlines on both sides of the Strait arrange flight schedules independently according to market demand.","第一个问题。陆委会编造、故意传播假信息，企图误导台湾民众，完全站不住脚。媒体朋友没有必要对此进行没有根据的猜测。\n广大台湾同胞在大陆旅游观光、探亲访友，拥有安全舒适、便捷舒心的出行体验，这是有目共睹的事实。民进党当局刻意抹黑，意图制造恐慌，阻挠破坏两岸交流和人员往来，升高两岸对立对抗，其行可恶，其心可诛。\n第二个问题。两岸空中直航是联结两岸同胞亲情、畅通经贸文化交流的重要空中纽带，承载着民众往来的迫切需求。今年上半年，乘坐空中客运直航航班往来两岸的旅客达313.78万人次，同比增长15%，充分印证两岸直航市场的旺盛需求和两岸民众往来的强烈意愿。\n我们积极推动全面恢复两岸空中直航正常化，这个态度是一贯的、明确的。希望台湾方面正视两岸空中客运直航的现实需求，顺应民心，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，由两岸航空公司根据市场需求自主安排航班计划。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-15","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","Taiwan recently had a toxic oil problem break out, and now \"toxic apples\" are suspected to have been exposed as well: the DPP authorities plan to relax the fipronil residue standard for apples sixfold, and people on the island question whether this is related to the United States. Taiwan's \"Food and Drug Administration\" responded that it has nothing to do with the United States. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities completely disregard the health and well-being of the Taiwan public and openly abandon the bottom line of food safety. From opening up to \"ractopamine pork\" and \"ractopamine beef\" and \"toxic potatoes\" to \"toxic apples,\" time and again they use sacrificing the lives and health of the public as a \"pledge of allegiance\" to curry favor with the United States, trying to obtain external forces' support for their conduct of seeking \"independence.\" The DPP authorities' reckless misconduct is unpopular and will surely be spurned.\nThis concludes the press conference. Thank you all.","民进党当局全然不顾台湾民众的健康福祉，公然弃守食品安全底线，从开放“莱猪”、“莱牛”、“毒马铃薯”到“毒苹果”，一次又一次把牺牲民众的生命健康作为向美国献媚的“投名状”，试图换取外部势力对其谋“独”行径的支持。民进党当局的胡作非为不得人心，必遭唾弃。\n发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260715_12776655.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-07-20","Lin Jian","Shenzhen TV","It is reported that on July 17, Taiwan’s “foreign affairs office” decided to remove Cambodia from visa facilitation programs, saying that Cambodia had failed to reciprocate Taiwan’s goodwill and instead echoed China in supporting the one-China policy. Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation responded that Cambodia viewed Taiwan as a province of China. Its commitment to the one-China…","Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. This is a prevailing consensus in the international community. By exploiting people-to-people facilitation measures to coerce other countries, the DPP authorities’ moves constitute a blatant challenge to the one-China principle, a basic norm in international relations, and once again lay bare the malignant nature of their “Taiwan independence” separatist agenda. The firm commitment of the Cambodian government to the one-China principle fully proves that the DPP authorities’ separatist playbook finds no support and will lead nowhere.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260720_11986625.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-21","Lin Jian","Beijing Youth Daily","Thai Prime Minister Anutin Charnvirakul concluded his official visit to China. Can you share more details on his visit?","From July 16 to 20, Thai Prime Minister Anutin Charnvirakul paid an official visit to China and attended the 2026 World AI Conference. President Xi Jinping held a meeting with Prime Minister Anutin Charnvirakul. Premier Li Qiang and Chairman Zhao Leji held talks and met with him respectively. The two sides had in-depth exchanges of views on China-Thailand relations and international and regional issues of mutual interest, and reached wide consensus. During his visit, the two sides released the Joint Statement between the Government of the People’s Republic of China and the Government of the Kingdom of Thailand towards a China-Thailand Community with a Shared Prosperous Future. There are three highlights of the visit.\nFirst, firming up mutual support. The two sides agreed to speed up the establishment of a China-Thailand community with a shared future for enhanced stability, prosperity, and sustainability, and make full use of the China-Thailand 2+2 strategic dialogue mechanism co-chaired by foreign ministers and defense ministers to elevate strategic coordination to new heights. China supports the new government of Thailand in its governance. Thailand reaffirms the unwavering commitment to the one-China policy, firmly supports China’s peaceful reunification and will not support any call for the independence of Taiwan.\nSecond, deepening mutually beneficial cooperation. Thailand welcomes China’s initiative to establish the World AI Cooperation Organization and stands ready to work with China to strengthen international cooperation and global governance on AI. The two sides agreed to advance high-quality Belt and Road Initiative, speed up the construction of the China-Thailand high-speed railway and other key projects, expand cooperation in emerging areas such as aerospace, new energy vehicles, and clean energy and resolutely crack down on cross-border crimes including online gambling and telecom fraud. Prime Minister Anutin also traveled to Sichuan province to attend the China-Thailand Investment and Economic Forum and the Inauguration Ceremony of the Thailand Board of Investment of the Thailand’s Consulate General in Chengdu. The two sides have also signed 10-plus cooperation documents on science and technology, AI education and combating cross-border crimes.\nThird, carrying out closer multilateral coordination. Thailand appreciates and welcomes the four global initiatives put forward by President Xi Jinping, as the initiatives demonstrate China’s commitment to multilateralism. Both sides will firmly safeguard the UN-centered international system and the international order underpinned by international law, and strengthen coordination and collaboration under multilateral mechanisms such as the UN, APEC, China-ASEAN cooperation and the Lancang-Mekong Cooperation.\nThrough the visit, China is ready to deepen strategic communication with Thailand, strengthen synergy of our development strategies, and expand practical cooperation so as to produce more outcomes in developing China-Thailand relations and better benefit the two countries and two peoples.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260721_11989141.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on July 22, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Friends of the press, good morning, and welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please begin asking questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","人民日报社记者","During the Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month activities, Director of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council Song Tao announced that the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" platform had gone online, providing Taiwan young people with all kinds of information on coming to the mainland for internships, study, employment and entrepreneurship, which has received wide attention and praise from Taiwan youth and public opinion…","In order to smooth the channels for Taiwan young people to come to the mainland for exchanges, study, internships and employment, and to better serve the integrated development of youth on both sides of the Strait, the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" service platform officially went online on July 15 on the Taiwan.cn website. Focusing on the needs of Taiwan young people, the platform has four major sections, \"Come for Internships\", \"Find a Job\", \"Go for Exchanges\" and \"Choose a School\", and also has special zones for provinces and cities, policy information, exchange activities, living guides and Taiwan youth experience talks, providing one-stop services for Taiwan young people.\nAmong them, the \"Come for Internships\" and \"Find a Job\" sections gather information on internship and employment positions on the mainland that recruit Taiwan young people, compiled in a unified way and updated in real time; Taiwan young people can search online and submit applications with one click, efficiently connecting with the employment needs of all parties. The \"Go for Exchanges\" section centrally publishes information on exchange activities such as study programmes, visits, social practice and entrepreneurship training for young people from both sides of the Strait, making it convenient for Taiwan youth to sign up and take part in time. The \"Choose a School\" section integrates information such as key mainland universities' admissions policies for Taiwan students, application channels and introductions to majors, providing guidance for Taiwan young people who aspire to come to the mainland for further education. The \"Taiwan Youth Experience Talks\" zone collects real cases, practical insights and life sharing from Taiwan youth studying, interning, working and starting businesses on the mainland, directly presenting the mainland's development environment from the perspective of Taiwan youth, answering Taiwan youth's questions and providing reference.\nWe welcome the broad masses of Taiwan young people to use the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" service platform often and well, to learn about internship and employment positions, cross-Strait exchange activities and university admissions information, to draw on the growth experiences of Taiwan youth on the mainland, to actively seize the development opportunities of Chinese-style modernisation, and to come to the mainland enthusiastically to pursue further studies, intern and work, and put down roots and develop. Going forward, we will continue to enrich the platform's resource supply and iteratively optimise the platform's functions, continuously raise the level of refinement and convenience of services, support young people on both sides of the Strait in having more interactions and deeper integration, jointly promote cross-Strait integrated development to go deeper and more substantive, and let more young people in Taiwan benefit from it.","为畅通台湾青年来大陆交流、求学、实习、就业渠道，更好服务两岸青年融合发展，“台青e家”服务平台于7月15日在中国台湾网正式上线运行。平台聚焦台湾青年需求，设置来实习、找工作、去交流、选学校四大板块，同时设立省市、政策资讯、交流活动、生活指南及台青经验谈等专区，为台湾青年提供一站式服务。\n其中，“来实习”、“找工作”板块，归集大陆招收台湾青年的实习就业岗位信息，统一汇总、实时更新，台湾青年可以在线检索、一键投递，高效对接各方用人需求。“去交流”板块，集中发布两岸青年研习、参访、社会实践、创业培训等交流活动资讯，方便台青及时报名参与。“选学校”板块，整合大陆重点高校对台招生政策、报考渠道、专业介绍等信息，为有志来大陆升学的台湾青年提供指引。“台青经验谈”专区，收录台青在大陆求学、实习、就业、创业真实案例、实操心得与生活分享，以台青视角直观展现大陆发展环境，为台青答疑解惑、提供参考。\n我们欢迎广大台湾青年常用、用好“台青e家”服务平台，了解实习就业岗位、两岸交流活动、高校招生资讯，借鉴在大陆台青成长经验，主动把握中国式现代化发展机遇，踊跃来大陆求学深造、实习就业、扎根发展。后续我们将持续充实平台资源供给、迭代优化平台功能，不断提升服务精细化、便利化水平，支持两岸青年多往来、深交融，共同推动两岸融合发展走深走实，让更多台湾年轻人从中受益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778249.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","Recently, the 9th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum was held in Zhejiang. Please introduce the relevant outcomes.","From July 17 to 21, the 9th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum was held in Hangzhou, Zhejiang. Director of the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council Song Tao, Secretary of the CPC Zhejiang Provincial Committee and Director of the Standing Committee of the Provincial People's Congress Wang Hao, and former Kuomintang Chairwoman and Chairwoman of the Chinese Youth Geese Peace Education Foundation Hung Hsiu-chu attended the forum's opening ceremony and delivered speeches. More than 1,000 people, including guests from both sides of the Strait and youth representatives from all sectors, gathered together around the forum theme \"Youth Growing Together, Building the Future with One Heart\" to exchange and communicate and build consensus, achieving positive results.\nThe number of Taiwan young people participating in this forum reached a record high. The forum carried out study camps and other activities in Ningbo, Wenzhou, Huzhou and other places. Young people from both sides of the Strait learned from each other and moved forward together with one heart, going into cities and villages, schools and communities, exploring the poetic and picturesque land south of the Yangtze and its green waters and green mountains, and getting hands-on with cutting-edge technologies such as AI and robots, enhancing understanding and friendship, encouraging each other in the nation's mission, talking together about the ideals of youth, and jointly creating a beautiful future.\nWe will continue to thoroughly implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's congratulatory letter to the 6th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum, continue to run well the Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum and other exchange activities, provide more opportunities for the growth and success of young people on both sides of the Strait, and encourage young people on both sides of the Strait to bravely shoulder the responsibilities of the times and to be firm promoters of exchanges and integration, firm guardians of the common home, and firm drivers of national rejuvenation, injecting more youthful strength into promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and advancing the reunification of the motherland.","7月17日至21日，第九届海峡两岸青年发展论坛在浙江杭州举办。中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛，中共浙江省委书记、省人大常委会主任王浩和中国国民党前主席、中华青雁和平教育基金会董事长洪秀柱出席论坛开幕式并致辞。两岸嘉宾、各界青年代表等1000余人相聚一堂，围绕“青春共成长·同心筑未来”的论坛主题，交流沟通、凝聚共识，取得积极效果。\n参与本届论坛的台湾青年规模创历史新高，论坛在宁波、温州、湖州等地开展研习营等活动，两岸青年互学互鉴、同心同行，走进城市与乡村、学校与社区，探寻诗画江南、绿水青山，触摸AI、机器人等前沿科技，增进了解友谊，共勉民族使命、共话青春理想、共创美好未来。\n我们将继续深入贯彻落实习近平总书记致第六届海峡两岸青年发展论坛贺信精神，持续办好海峡两岸青年发展论坛等交流活动，为两岸青年成长成才提供更多机遇，促进两岸青年勇担时代重任，做交流融合的坚定促进者、共同家园的坚定守护者、民族复兴的坚定推动者，为推动两岸关系和平发展、推进祖国统一注入更多青春力量。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778250.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, cross-Strait youth exchange activities such as the Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month and the Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum have been held one after another. The summer holidays are precisely the time when youth exchanges and internships and employment for Taiwan youth and Taiwan students are in full swing. Please introduce the positive measures on the mainland side to promote exchanges and…","For a long time, we have practised the concept that \"both sides of the Strait are one family\", continuously improved policies and measures to enhance the well-being of Taiwan compatriots, provided more convenience for Taiwan compatriots, especially Taiwan young people, to come to the mainland to study and live, work and start businesses, and helped Taiwan young people pursue, build and realise their dreams on the mainland. In April this year, the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee was authorised to release ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. On July 15, when attending the 6th Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month, Director Song Tao announced that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\", a nationally unified online service platform for Taiwan youth, had gone online, providing Taiwan young friends with full-chain information services on exchanges, study, internships and employment. So far many Taiwan young people have visited and registered, and we hope everyone will make good use of the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" service platform to better put down roots and develop on the mainland.\nAt present, the motherland mainland is comprehensively implementing the 15th Five-Year Plan and actively advancing the building of Chinese-style modernisation. The vast world offers great scope for achievement, and now is exactly the right time to get things done and start businesses. More and more Taiwan young friends are crossing the Strait and coming to the mainland to strive hard for their dreams. We sincerely welcome more Taiwan young friends to come to the mainland for exchanges and development, to find their direction in life and realise their life ideals.","长期以来，我们践行“两岸一家亲”理念，持续完善增进台湾同胞福祉政策举措，为台湾同胞特别是台湾青年来大陆学习生活、就业创业等提供更多便利，助力台湾青年在大陆追梦、筑梦、圆梦。今年4月，中央台办受权发布了十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施。7月15日，宋涛主任出席第六届海峡两岸青年文化月活动时宣布，全国统一的台青线上服务平台“台青e家”上线运行，为台湾青年朋友提供交流、学习、实习、就业等全链条资讯服务，截至目前已有许多台湾青年访问并注册，希望大家用好“台青e家”服务平台，更好在大陆扎根发展。\n当前，祖国大陆正全面实施“十五五”规划，积极推进中国式现代化建设。广阔天地大有可为，干事创业正当其时，越来越多台湾青年朋友跨越海峡、来到大陆，为自己的梦想奋力打拼。我们热诚欢迎更多台湾青年朋友来大陆交流发展，找到自己的人生方向，实现自己的人生理想。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","新华社记者","The DPP held its national congress on July 19. Taiwan region leader Lai Ching-te, who concurrently serves as DPP chairman, once again advocated separatist statements such as the two sides of the Strait \"not being subordinate to each other\" at the meeting, wildly played up the mainland's \"threat\" to Taiwan, and clamoured that he would never let \"democratic Taiwan\" become \"China's Taiwan\", and so on. What is the…","Lai Ching-te spouted outrageous words and spoke shamelessly at the DPP national congress. His speech was filled from beginning to end with hostility and confrontation, lies and slander, bigotry and arrogance, once again exposing that his \"Taiwan independence\" stance is obstinate and incorrigible, that he stirs up trouble and provokes with radical adventurism, and that he wilfully persists in harming and ruining Taiwan. It fully proves that Lai Ching-te and the DPP are the root of disaster undermining the stability of cross-Strait relations and the peace of Taiwan society, the source of disorder for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and the region, and out-and-out \"peace breakers\", \"war instigators\" and \"troublemakers\".\nNot long after its founding, the DPP set out on the wrong path of \"Taiwan independence\" separatism. In the decades since, it has painstakingly schemed to pursue \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, vainly attempting to change the status quo in the Taiwan Strait that both sides of the Strait belong to one China; it is an out-and-out \"Taiwan independence party\". In the past ten years, the DPP authorities have been even more single-mindedly \"relying on foreign support to seek independence\" and \"seeking independence by force\", causing the situation in the Taiwan Strait to become increasingly tense and turbulent. In this speech Lai Ching-te once again propagated the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist fallacy, advocated that \"the two sides of the Strait are not subordinate to each other\", and brazenly challenged the one-China principle, completely tearing off his disguise of so-called \"there is no 'Taiwan independence' issue\" and revealing his true face as a \"Taiwan independence worker\". Since taking office, Lai Ching-te has engaged heavily in \"green terror\", done his utmost to muzzle freedom of speech, abused the judiciary to suppress political dissidents, wantonly persecuted forces that support the development of cross-Strait relations, and crudely harmed the legitimate rights and interests of the Taiwan people to participate in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. Such a person who tramples on democracy, obstructs freedom and destroys the rule of law actually still talks grandly about democracy and freedom and clamours about \"democracy against authoritarianism\"; this is truly shameless. In short, Lai Ching-te has become \"the bane of Taiwan\", and the DPP has become the biggest \"group bringing disaster to Taiwan\", which has already aroused strong dissatisfaction among people on the island.\nTaiwan is China's Taiwan and has never been a country; it was not in the past, and it absolutely will not be in the future. The Taiwan question is a question left over from China's civil war in the 1940s. No matter in what way the Taiwan region holds elections or whom it elects, this cannot change the status of Taiwan as part of China, cannot sever the historical and legal link that both sides of the Strait belong to one China, and cannot break the iron law that Taiwan's future can only be decided jointly by all the Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. We adhere to the one-China principle and the 1992 Consensus, broadly unite Taiwan compatriots, resolutely strike at \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and maintain peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. The great trend that the motherland will inevitably be reunified is mighty and unstoppable!","赖清德在民进党全代会上大放厥词、大言不惭，讲话通篇充斥着敌意与冲撞、谎言与谰言、偏执与狂妄，再次暴露其“台独”立场冥顽不化、滋事挑衅激进冒险、害台毁台一意孤行，充分证明赖清德、民进党是破坏两岸关系稳定和台湾社会安宁的祸根，是台海及地区和平稳定的乱源，是不折不扣的“和平破坏者”、“战争煽动者”、“麻烦制造者”。\n民进党成立后不久就走上了“台独”分裂的错误道路，此后数十年里处心积虑搞“台独”分裂，妄图改变两岸同属一中的台海现状，是彻头彻尾的“台独党”。近十年，民进党当局更是一门心思“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，导致台海形势日益紧张动荡。此次赖清德讲话中再度宣扬“台独”分裂谬论，鼓吹“两岸互不隶属”，猖狂挑战一个中国原则，彻底撕下其所谓“没有‘台独’问题”的伪装，露出“台独工作者”的本来面目。赖清德上台以来，大搞“绿色恐怖”，极力钳制言论自由，滥用司法打压政治异己，肆意迫害支持两岸关系发展的力量，粗暴损害台湾民众参与两岸交流合作的正当权益。这样一个践踏民主、妨害自由、戕害法治的人，竟然还夸夸其谈民主自由、鼓噪“民主对抗威权”，真是恬不知耻。简而言之，赖清德已经成为“台湾之害”，民进党已经成为最大的“祸台团体”，已经引发岛内民众的强烈不满。\n台湾是中国的台湾，从来不是一个国家，过去不是，今后也绝对不是。台湾问题是上世纪40年代中国内战的遗留问题，不管台湾地区以什么方式选举、选了什么人，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的地位，都割裂不了两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理联结，都打破不了台湾前途只能由包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民共同决定的铁律。我们坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，广泛团结台湾同胞，坚决打击“台独”分裂，维护台海和平稳定。祖国必然统一的大势浩浩荡荡、不可阻挡！","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778251.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","Recently, the Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation came to Shanghai for a visit and exchanges. This is the first time since the party's founding that it has formally organised a delegation to the mainland for exchanges, and it said it hopes to express goodwill through exchanges and replace confrontation with dialogue. What is your comment on this?","From July 14 to 17, the Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation came to Shanghai for exchanges, visiting economic construction projects, historical venues, technology companies, youth entrepreneurship bases and so on, and holding a discussion with teachers and students of Shanghai Jiao Tong University, and received a warm reception and welcome from the relevant parties.\nWanting peace, wanting development, wanting exchanges and wanting cooperation is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family bound by blood that is thicker than water and should visit each other often and grow closer as kin; this is the general trend, and no force can stop it. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait should join hands, follow the great trend of history, strengthen exchanges and cooperation in all fields, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, enhance the kinship and well-being of compatriots, and jointly create a beautiful future for cross-Strait relations.","7月14日至17日，台湾民众党青年交流团来上海交流，参访了经济建设项目、历史场馆、科技公司、青创基地等，并与上海交通大学师生座谈，受到有关方面的热情接待与欢迎。\n要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是两岸同胞的共同愿望。两岸同胞是血浓于水的一家人，应该常来常往、走亲走近，这是大势所趋，是任何力量都阻挡不了的。两岸同胞应该携起手来，顺应历史大势，加强各领域交流合作，推动两岸关系和平发展，增进同胞亲情福祉，共创两岸关系美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","《参考消息》记者","Recently, the head of the Taiwan region's executive body, Cho Jung-tai, while attending an event of the \"Asia Taiwanese Chambers of Commerce\", said that Taiwan has corrected its past dependence on the \"single China market\" and shifted to Europe, America and the southbound countries, and that it has also formed an assistance platform for Taiwan businesspeople investing around the world. What is your comment on this?","In the first half of 2026, cross-Strait trade reached 185 billion US dollars, of which mainland imports from Taiwan were 133.1 billion US dollars, up 22.5% year on year, and mainland exports to Taiwan were 51.9 billion US dollars, up 32.9% year on year. This fully shows that the industrial structures of the two sides of the Strait have complementary advantages and that the prospects for cooperation are broad. Strengthening cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation and deepening cross-Strait integrated development are in the common interests of compatriots and enterprises on both sides of the Strait, and are also the result of economic laws and market principles acting together. Cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and mutual benefit and win-win results cannot be stopped by anyone.\nIn order to \"rely on foreign support to seek independence\", the DPP authorities shamelessly sell out Taiwan, fawn and pledge allegiance, and cater to external forces in hollowing out Taiwan's advantageous industries; this is out-and-out behaviour that harms Taiwan and brings disaster to Taiwan.","2026年上半年，两岸贸易额达到1850亿美元，其中大陆自台进口1331亿美元，同比增幅22.5%，大陆对台出口519亿美元，同比增幅32.9%。这充分说明，两岸产业结构优势互补，合作前景广阔。加强两岸经贸合作、深化两岸融合发展，符合两岸同胞、企业的共同利益,也是经济规律和市场原则共同作用的结果。两岸交流合作、互利互赢是任何人都阻挡不了的。\n民进党当局为“倚外谋独”，无耻卖台、献媚输诚，迎合外部势力掏空台优势产业，是不折不扣的害台、祸台行为。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778247.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中新社记者","Recently, some Taiwan compatriots were involved in a car accident near Irkutsk Oblast in Russia. After learning of it, the Chinese Consulate General in Irkutsk immediately assisted the injured in going to a local hospital for treatment, and visited and comforted the injured Taiwan compatriots. What is your comment on this?","It is understood that recently, a tour group of Taiwan compatriots was involved in a car accident near Irkutsk Oblast in Russia. After receiving the Taiwan compatriots' request for help late at night, the Chinese Consulate General in Irkutsk immediately coordinated with a local hospital to send ambulances to carry out the rescue, and visited and comforted the more seriously injured Taiwan compatriots. The injured Taiwan compatriots are currently in stable condition.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Strait are all Chinese, and providing consular protection and assistance abroad to Chinese citizens, including Taiwan compatriots, is our duty. Wherever compatriots have expectations and appeals, there will be the care and protection of the motherland. We will continue to shelter our compatriots from wind and rain and relieve their worries and difficulties, so that every Chinese person feels the warmth and strength of the motherland.","据了解，近日，有台胞旅行团在俄罗斯伊尔库茨克州附近遭遇车祸。中国驻伊尔库茨克总领馆深夜接获台胞求助信息后，第一时间协调当地医院派出救护车辆实施救助，并探望慰问了伤势较重的台湾同胞。目前受伤台胞情况稳定。\n两岸同胞都是中国人，为包括台湾同胞在内的中国公民在境外提供领事保护和协助是我们的职责所在。哪里有同胞的期待和诉求，哪里就会有祖国的关爱和守护。我们将继续为同胞们遮风挡雨、排忧解难，让每一个中国人都感受到祖国的温暖与强大。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778248.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","The Mainland Affairs Council recently said that from now on it will regularly publish weekly data on people who lose contact or are detained after going to the mainland, reminding the public to assess carefully before going to the mainland and \"not to go if they can avoid it\". What is your comment on this?","According to statistics from the National Immigration Administration, from January to June this year, cross-Strait personnel exchanges totalled 3.119 million trips, up 22.1% year on year, of which Taiwan compatriots made 2.85 million trips to the mainland, up 24.9% year on year. More and more Taiwan compatriots are coming to the mainland for exchanges and visits, study and employment, and tourism and sightseeing. We protect in accordance with the law the safety of life and property and the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots who come to the mainland, and the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots travel back and forth across the Strait safely and smoothly.\nThe DPP authorities disregard the facts and fabricate lies, repeatedly rehashing so-called data on people who have lost contact, in an attempt to create a \"chilling effect\" and to deceive and intimidate the Taiwan people, so as to achieve the aim of restricting cross-Strait exchanges and cutting off the kinship between compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Their conduct is shameful and their intentions are damnable.","据国家出入境管理局统计，今年1至6月，两岸人员往来311.9万人次，同比增长22.1%，其中台胞来大陆285万人次，同比增长24.9%。越来越多的台湾同胞来大陆交流参访、学习就业、旅游观光。我们依法维护来大陆的台湾同胞生命财产安全和合法权益，广大台湾同胞平安顺利往返两岸。\n民进党当局罔顾事实、编造谎言，屡屡翻炒所谓失联人员数据，企图制造“寒蝉效应”，欺骗恐吓台湾民众，以达到限缩两岸交流、隔断两岸同胞亲情的目的，其行可耻、其心可诛。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778246.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, the government of Papua New Guinea announced the closure of the \"Taipei Economic Office in Papua New Guinea\". Taiwan's foreign affairs department protested against this. What is your comment on this?","We highly appreciate the relevant action of the government of Papua New Guinea. Facts have proven time and again that the one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community, and that adhering to the one-China principle is where the greater righteousness lies and where the general trend is heading. A just cause enjoys abundant support, while an unjust cause finds little support. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position and go against the tide of history, and will only run into walls everywhere in the international community.","我们对巴布亚新几内亚政府有关做法表示高度赞赏。事实一再证明，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，坚持一个中国原则是大义所在、大势所趋。得道多助，失道寡助。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，逆历史潮流，只会在国际社会四处碰壁。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778245.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","香港经济导报记者","Regarding the Philippines' recent deliberate provocation at Ren'ai Jiao, its violent attack on Chinese law enforcement personnel, and its subsequent distortion and hype, Taiwan's foreign affairs department actually echoed it, saying that it \"condemns the mainland for using force to injure people\" and opposes any attempt or action to unilaterally change the status quo by means of force, coercion, grey-zone…","Regarding the Philippines' deliberate provocation at Ren'ai Jiao and its attack on China Coast Guard law enforcement personnel, the relevant departments have immediately clarified the truth of the facts, released footage from the scene, and lodged stern representations with the Philippine side.\nRen'ai Jiao is part of China's Nansha Qundao and is Chinese territory. The DPP authorities have lost their national standpoint, echo external forces in confusing right and wrong, and attack and smear the mainland, once again exposing their evil nature of forgetting their ancestors and \"relying on foreign support to seek independence\".","关于菲律宾在仁爱礁蓄意挑衅、袭击中国海警执法人员一事，有关部门已第一时间阐明了事实真相，公布了现场画面，并向菲方提出了严正交涉。\n仁爱礁是中国南沙群岛的一部分，是中国领土。民进党当局丧失民族立场，附和外部势力混淆是非，攻击抹黑大陆，再次暴露了其数典忘祖、“倚外谋独”的邪恶本质。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778243.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","上海东方卫视记者","Recently, the Cross-Strait Artificial Intelligence Integrated Development Innovation Forum was held during the 2026 World Artificial Intelligence Conference, attracting attention from industry on both sides of the Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","The Cross-Strait Artificial Intelligence Integrated Development Innovation Forum and exhibition activities of the 2026 World Artificial Intelligence Conference were held in Shanghai from July 17 to 20. This series of activities was jointly hosted by the Straits Economic and Technological Cooperation Center and other units, with the theme \"Intelligence Leading a New Journey, Integration Creating the Future\", centrally showcasing the results of cross-Strait artificial intelligence cooperation and exploring in depth the paths of integrated development.\nAmong them, the cross-Strait forum invited about 150-plus representatives from all sectors on both sides of the Strait to take part and held thematic dialogues focusing on AI empowering advanced manufacturing and health care, jointly promoting technological breakthroughs, industrial coordination and joint building of the ecosystem; the cross-Strait exhibition area invited more than 20 representative artificial intelligence enterprises from both sides of the Strait to exhibit, centrally showcasing the development results and cutting-edge technological breakthroughs in key links of the cross-Strait artificial intelligence industrial chain. We sincerely welcome the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople to take part in similar activities and to embrace broader development opportunities on the mainland while integrating into the new development pattern.","2026年世界人工智能大会两岸人工智能融合发展创新论坛及展览展示活动，于7月17日至20日在上海举办。该系列活动由海峡经济科技合作中心等单位共同主办，以“智领新程 融创未来”为主题，集中展示两岸人工智能合作成果，深入探讨融合发展路径。\n其中，两岸论坛邀请约150余名两岸各界代表参加，开展主题对话，聚焦人工智能赋能先进制造和健康医疗，共同推动技术突破、产业协同与生态共建；两岸展区邀请20余家两岸人工智能代表性企业参展，集中展示两岸人工智能产业链关键环节的发展成果与前沿技术突破。我们热诚欢迎广大台商参加类似活动，在融入新发展格局中拥抱更广阔的大陆发展机遇。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","Regarding the Taiwan People's Party organising a delegation to visit the mainland for the first time, the Mainland Affairs Council said that it \"does not oppose political parties going to the mainland for exchanges, but they should maintain parity and dignity and should not echo the CCP's narrative or positions. The Taiwan Affairs Office did not emphasise 'the 1992 Consensus and opposing Taiwan independence'…","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position and do their utmost to obstruct dialogue and communication among all sectors on both sides of the Strait and exchanges and interactions in all fields. They stand completely on the opposite side of the great trend of history and mainstream public opinion and are bound to be spurned and to fail.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，极力阻挠两岸各界对话沟通和各领域交流往来，完全站在历史大势和主流民意的对立面，必遭唾弃与失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","北京日报记者","According to reports, TSMC will add 100 billion US dollars of investment in Arizona in the United States and is expected to build another four wafer fabs as well as advanced packaging plants, once again triggering concerns in public opinion on the island that TSMC will become \"America Semiconductor Manufacturing Company\" and that Taiwan's semiconductor industry will be hollowed out. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities' \"relying on the US to seek independence\" and \"kneeling to the US and selling out Taiwan\" is the chief culprit harming Taiwan's economy and causing Taiwan to gradually lose its advantages. For their selfish political interests, they sell out the interests of industry and hollow out the foundations of Taiwan's economy; what is harmed is not only the future of industry, but even more the livelihoods of the broad masses of the Taiwan people.","民进党当局“倚美谋独”、“跪美卖台”，是损害台湾经济、导致台湾优势逐步丧失的罪魁祸首。他们为了政治私利，出卖产业界利益，掏空台湾经济根基，受害的不仅是产业的未来，更是广大台湾民众的生计。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","Regarding \"Zhang Xue Motorcycles\" hoping to open stores in Taiwan, Taiwan's economic department said that under the current customs import tariff regulations, motorcycles (complete vehicles) made in mainland China fall under the item \"mainland goods not permitted to be imported\" and may not be imported into Taiwan in accordance with the law. What is your comment on this?","As \"Zhang Xue Motorcycles\" continues to achieve good results in professional competitions around the world, more and more Taiwan compatriots have said they hope to ride a \"Zhang Xue Motorcycle\" and personally experience the progress of mainland technology. We are happy to see Taiwan compatriots use good mainland products and share in the development results of Chinese-style modernisation.\nWe advise the DPP authorities to follow public opinion, lift unreasonable restrictive measures as soon as possible, and do more practical and good things that benefit the Taiwan people.","随着“张雪机车”在全球专业赛事中不断取得佳绩，越来越多台湾同胞表示希望骑上“张雪机车”，亲身体验大陆科技的进步。我们乐见台湾同胞用上大陆好的产品，共享中国式现代化的发展成果。\n奉劝民进党当局顺应民意，尽早解除不合理的限制措施，多做有利于台湾民众的实事、好事。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities.","Recently, cross-Strait exchange activities have been rich and colourful.\nIn terms of youth exchanges: from July 8 to 12, the 7th Cross-Strait Youth Mazu Culture Study Camp was held in Putian, Fujian. From the 12th to the 15th, the 4th Fuzhou-Taiwan Youth Handball Exchange was held in Fuzhou, Fujian, with young people from both sides of the Strait forming 10 handball teams for competitive exchanges. From the 13th to the 20th, the 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Medical Culture Exchange Summer Camp was held in Jiangsu, Zhejiang and Shanghai. From the 14th to the 17th, the 2026 Fuzhou-Taiwan Youth Study Camp was held in Fuzhou, Fujian. From the 18th to the 25th, the 2026 Cross-Strait University Student Basketball Tournament was held in Putian, Fujian. On the 22nd, the 3rd \"Rong Guotuan Cup\" Cross-Strait, Hong Kong and Macao Youth Table Tennis Exchange Competition was held in Zhuhai, Guangdong, with about 300 young people from both sides of the Strait and Hong Kong and Macao taking part.\nIn terms of economic and trade exchanges and cooperation: from July 15 to 18, \"Smart Links Between Lan and Taiwan Create the Future, Intellectual Property Builds Bridges to Promote Integration\", the first Lan-Taiwan intellectual property special exchange activity, was held in Pingtan, Fujian. On July 19, the 12th Straits Tea Gathering and Cross-Strait Oriental Beauty Tea Culture Exchange was held in Sanming, Fujian.\nIn terms of cultural and sports exchanges: on July 12, \"Strings of the Silk Road, Music Moving the Yellow River: Concert of One Hundred Young People from Gansu, Shanghai and Taiwan\" was held in Lanzhou, Gansu, where more than 500 Taiwan young people and 12 visiting delegations gathered with young students from 8 universities in Lanzhou on the banks of the Yellow River to play a harmonious movement of \"both sides of the Strait are one family\". From July 12 to 16, the 22nd Cross-Strait Book Fair was held in Taipei, with 60 mainland book publishing and library collection units going to Taiwan to exhibit and attend, displaying about 20,000 titles of mainland books. On July 11, the opening ceremony of the 2026 Cross-Strait Intercollegiate Alliance Basketball Tournament (Lanzhou leg) was held in Lanzhou, Gansu. On July 12, the 2nd Hang-Taiwan Genealogy Airing Day was held in Shanghang, Longyan, Fujian, where nearly one hundred inheritors of surname culture, genealogy researchers and clan representatives from both sides of the Strait held exchanges and discussions on deepening cross-Strait Hakka genealogy culture. On July 16, the 2026 Cross-Strait Chinese Character Culture Series was held in Xiamen, promoting the inheritance and innovative integration of Chinese character culture. From July 19 to 22, the 2nd Cross-Strait (Jiaocheng) Harmonica Culture Week was held in Ningde, inviting nearly 300 Taiwan compatriots, including a Taiwan harmonica world champion, well-known bands and harmonica enthusiasts, to take part.\nIn terms of grassroots exchanges: from July 2 to 8, the \"Joyfully Crossing Mountains and Seas, Meeting in Hunan\" cross-Strait grassroots exchange activity was held in Loudi, Hunan, including multiple special activities such as the 3rd Cross-Strait Ethnic Minority Music Festival, and more than 300 compatriots from the island came to take part.","近期，两岸交流活动精彩纷呈。\n青年交流方面。7月8日至12日，第七届两岸青年妈祖文化研习营在福建莆田举办。12日至15日，第四届榕台青少年手球交流活动在福建福州举办，两岸青少年组成10支手球队展开竞技交流。13日至20日，2026年两岸青年医学文化交流夏令营在江苏、浙江、上海举办。14日至17日，2026年榕台青少年研学营在福建福州举办。18日至25日，2026海峡两岸大学生篮球赛在福建莆田举办。22日，第三届“容国团杯”海峡两岸暨港澳地区青少年乒乓球交流赛活动在广东珠海举办，海峡两岸暨港澳地区约300名青少年参加。\n经贸交流合作方面。7月15日至18日，“智联岚台创未来 知产搭桥促融合”——首届岚台知识产权专项交流活动在福建平潭举办。7月19日，第十二届海峡茶会暨海峡两岸美人茶文化交流活动在福建三明举办。\n文化体育交流方面。7月12日，“丝路弦音·乐动黄河——陇沪台百名青少年音乐会”在甘肃兰州举办，500余名台湾青年、12个参访团与兰州市8所高校的青年学子共聚黄河之滨，奏响“两岸一家亲”的和谐乐章。7月12日至16日，第22届海峡两岸图书交易会在台北举办，60家大陆图书出版、图书馆藏单位赴台参展参会，展出大陆图书约2万种。7月11日，2026海峡两岸校际联盟篮球赛（兰州站）开幕式在甘肃兰州举办。7月12日，第二届杭台晒谱日活动在福建龙岩上杭举办，两岸近百名姓氏文化传承人、族谱研究者及宗亲代表，就深化两岸客家族谱文化进行交流研讨。7月16日，2026海峡两岸汉字文化系列活动在厦门举办，推动汉字文化传承与创新融合。7月19日至22日，第二届海峡两岸（蕉城）口琴文化周在宁德举办，邀请台湾口琴世界冠军、知名乐团、口琴爱好者等近300名台胞参加。\n基层交流方面。7月2日至8日，“乐越山海 相遇湖南”海峡两岸基层交流活动在湖南娄底举办，包括第三届海峡两岸少数民族音乐节等多个特色活动，300余名岛内同胞前来参加。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The 2026 Taipei Summer Travel Fair opened recently, and the Taipei Office of the Cross-Strait Tourism Exchange Association exhibited with the twin themes \"Travel Following Cultural Relics\" and \"Travel Following Food\", which was welcomed by people on the island. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From July 17 to 20, 2026, the Taipei Office of the Cross-Strait Tourism Exchange Association took part in the 2026 Taipei Summer Travel Fair, with twin-themed exhibition areas, \"Travel Following Cultural Relics\" and \"Travel Following Food\", centrally showcasing new forms of integrated culture and tourism on the mainland and creating an atmosphere with culture as its soul and the bustle of everyday life as its rhythm. By promoting resources such as cultural relic derivative products and specialty foods, this exhibition area showed Taiwan compatriots new immersive, everyday-life styles of travel on the mainland, allowing Taiwan compatriots to feel up close the new charm of mainland tourism in which \"cultural relics give depth and food gives warmth\".\nThe Taipei Office of the Cross-Strait Tourism Exchange Association joined hands with the National Museum to launch the \"Travel Following Cultural Relics\" themed exhibition area, displaying more than 50 cultural and creative products in 9 major themes, such as the \"National Museum Derivative Art\" Haiyan Heqing zun series and the Four-Ram Square Zun series, relying on the Chinese cultural lineage to highlight that the two sides of the Strait share the same roots and origins and the same language and ethnicity. Together with the Anhui Provincial Department of Culture and Tourism, it launched the \"Travel Following Food\" themed exhibition area, replicating the scene of Hui-style ancient architecture, using realistic food models to recreate a Hui cuisine banquet, and pairing it with an intangible cultural heritage display of Huizhou fish lanterns; through the cross-border integration of \"architecture + food + intangible cultural heritage\", it let Taiwan compatriots understand the regional culture behind the food and experience immersively the charm of the mainland's everyday-life culture and tourism.\nAt the same time, the Taipei Office of the Cross-Strait Tourism Exchange Association also set up a mainland culture and tourism resources exhibition area, a Hanfu experience area, a mainland airlines exhibition area, a Taiwan Compatriot Permit application consultation area and a stage promotion area, and invited 9 mainland airlines including Air China, China Eastern and China Southern, as well as Straits Friendship Travel Agency and the magazine Lü Du, to exhibit, so that Taiwan compatriots could obtain comprehensive, multi-level information and services on travelling to the mainland.\nCultural relics carry the cultural lineage showing that the two sides of the Strait share the same roots and origins and the same language and ethnicity, and food links together the everyday life of compatriots on both sides of the Strait who are connected by blood. More Taiwan compatriots are welcome to come to the mainland to experience in person the iteratively upgraded travel experience.","2026年7月17日至20日，海峡两岸旅游交流协会台北办事处参加2026台北夏季旅展，以“跟着文物去旅行”“跟着美食去旅行”双主题展区集中展示大陆文旅融合新业态，营造出文化为魂、烟火为韵的氛围。本次展区以文物衍生品、特色美食等资源的推广，向台湾同胞展示大陆沉浸式、生活化旅游新方式，让台湾同胞近距离感受“文物赋予底蕴、美食赋予温度”的大陆旅游新魅力。\n海旅会台北办与国家博物馆联手推出“跟着文物去旅行”主题展区，展出“国博衍艺”海晏河清尊系列、四羊方尊系列等9大主题50余款文创产品，依托中华文脉凸显两岸同根同源、同文同种。与安徽省文化和旅游厅共同推出“跟着美食去旅行”主题展区，复刻徽派古建场景，用仿真菜模还原徽菜宴席，搭配徽州鱼灯非遗展示，通过“建筑+美食+非遗”跨界融合，让台湾同胞了解美食背后的地域文化，沉浸式感受大陆烟火文旅魅力。\n同时，海旅会台北办还设置了大陆文旅资源展区、汉服体验区、大陆航空展区、台胞证办理咨询区和舞台推介区，邀请国航、东航、南航等大陆9家航空公司和海峡友谊旅行社、《旅读》杂志参展，台湾同胞由此可获得全方位、多层次赴大陆旅游资讯和服务。\n文物承载着两岸同根同源、同文同种的文脉，美食串联起两岸同胞血脉相连的人间烟火。欢迎更多台湾同胞来大陆亲身感受迭代升级的旅游体验。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","Recently, Taiwan's \"Central Election Commission\" said regarding the qualifications of candidates for the \"nine-in-one\" elections that if any former residents of the mainland area apply to register as candidates, it will check whether they have submitted a notation certifying the loss of their original household registration and whether they have held household registration in the Taiwan area for a full 10 years.…","The mainland and Taiwan both belong to one China, and compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family; there is simply no so-called \"nationality\" issue. Mainland spouses are relatives of Taiwan compatriots and are builders of and contributors to Taiwan society; they ought to be recognized and respected.\nOut of their \"Taiwan independence\" nature, the DPP authorities have long wantonly suppressed and bullied the group of mainland spouses and have intensified their efforts to restrict their rights of political participation in Taiwan. This is unpopular and will inevitably meet with the unanimous opposition of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.","大陆和台湾同属一个中国，两岸同胞是一家人，根本不存在所谓“国籍”问题。大陆配偶是台湾同胞的亲人，是台湾社会的建设者、贡献者，理应得到认可、尊重。\n民进党当局出于“台独”本性，长期以来肆意打压欺凌陆配群体，变本加厉限缩他们在台湾的参政权利，不得人心，必然遭到两岸同胞的一致反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","It is reported that the \"Cross-Strait Young Teachers' Trip to Northern Xinjiang\" activity has drawn attention on the island after being accused of involving \"united front\" work. Taiwan's education authority said it has repeatedly sent letters reminding schools not to violate relevant regulations, will strictly control this, and will continue to supervise schools to pay attention to the issue of mainland…","The DPP authorities are quick to pin labels on and set up obstacles to normal cross-Strait educational exchanges, and in recent years they have intensified their efforts, including prohibiting institutions on the island from exchanges and cooperation with 10 mainland schools such as Jinan University and Beihang University, and requiring institutions on the island to report teachers' and students' exchanges to the mainland, and so on. All of this is aimed at manipulating \"opposing China and resisting China\" and creating \"green terror\".\nWhy are the DPP authorities so afraid of Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland for exchanges? It is nothing more than a worry that people will learn the true state of the mainland's development, see through the false narratives they have deliberately fabricated, and break the information cocoon they have painstakingly built.","民进党当局动辄给两岸正常教育交流扣帽子、设障碍，近年来变本加厉，包括禁止岛内院校与大陆暨南大学、北京航空航天大学等10所学校交流合作，要求岛内院校须申报师生到大陆交流情况等等。凡此种种，目的都是为了操弄“反中抗中”、制造“绿色恐怖”。\n民进党当局为什么这么惧怕台湾同胞来大陆交流？无非是担心大家了解到大陆真实的发展情况，戳穿其处心积虑编造的虚假叙事，戳破其费尽心机构建的信息茧房罢了。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","The Mainland Affairs Council recently said that one serving police officer and one retired police officer, while traveling in Fujian in June this year, were forcibly taken away by mainland national security personnel from the homestay where they were staying, isolated and interrogated, and pressed with questions about Taiwan's critical infrastructure and their past work; after the two returned to Taiwan, they…","We have always encouraged and supported exchanges and interactions across the Strait in all fields, including tourism, and protect the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots in accordance with the law. Taiwan compatriots have come to the mainland in large numbers for sightseeing and tourism, exchanges and visits, study and employment, and business inspections, totaling more than 11.7 million person-trips since 2024.\nOut of political self-interest, the DPP authorities have consistently maliciously hyped up, spread rumors about and smeared the mainland, attempting to create a \"chilling effect\", with the aim of obstructing cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and escalating cross-Strait confrontation. This is unpopular and will not succeed.","我们一贯鼓励、支持包括旅游在内的两岸各领域交流交往，依法保护台湾同胞的正当权益。台湾同胞纷纷来大陆观光旅游、交流参访、学习就业、商务考察，2024年以来累计达1170余万人次。\n民进党当局出于政治私利，一贯恶意炒作、造谣抹黑大陆，企图制造“寒蝉效应”，目的是阻挠两岸交流合作，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","It is reported that the head of Taiwan's defense department recently called for passage of the executive branch's draft drone regulations, so as to drive the development of related industries and form a \"non-red supply chain\" that does not rely on the mainland. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" position, deliberately escalate cross-Strait confrontation, continually obstruct and undermine cross-Strait economic exchanges and cooperation, and fabricate all kinds of excuses to forcibly \"decouple and break chains\" with the mainland. Their aim is precisely \"seeking independence by force\" and \"relying on foreign support to seek independence\". More and more Taiwan compatriots have recognized the \"Taiwan independence\" nature and serious harm of the DPP authorities and refuse to pay for \"Taiwan independence\" actions.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，蓄意升高两岸对立对抗，不断阻挠破坏两岸经济交流合作，编造种种借口强行与大陆“脱钩断链”，其目的就是要“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”。越来越多台湾同胞已经认清民进党当局“台独”本质和严重危害，拒绝为“台独”行径买单。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","Taiwan's Liberty Times reported that, regarding the review of the drone regulations by Taiwan's public opinion institution, there are rumors that the mainland is \"giving guidance\" to the blue and white camps on the island. What is your comment on this?","This green media outlet has long wantonly spread rumors about and smeared the mainland, and cooperated with the DPP authorities in suppressing dissidents and inciting confrontation. It has no credibility whatsoever.","这家绿媒长期肆意造谣、抹黑大陆，配合民进党当局打压异己、煽动对抗，毫无公信力可言。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","中国日报记者","The Taiwan authorities said that because Cambodia spoke out in support of one China, they are canceling so-called \"visa\" facilitation measures for Cambodia. In response, the Cambodian government said that the Cambodian side has always regarded Taiwan as a province of China and will not change its position of adhering to the one-China principle. What is your comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China. The Cambodian government's firm position conforms to the trend of history and the will of its own people, and once again shows that the one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community.\nThe DPP authorities attempt to coerce relevant countries into providing space for \"Taiwan independence\"; they are overreaching and have miscalculated. Their despicable tricks are doomed to fail.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国不可分割的一部分。柬埔寨政府的坚定立场顺应历史潮流和本国人民的意愿，再次表明一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识。\n民进党当局企图胁迫有关国家为“台独”提供空间，自不量力、打错算盘。其卑劣伎俩注定失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260722_12778244.htm"],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","Recently, Hong Kong police searched certain bookstores in accordance with the law. Lai Ching-te posted on a social platform saying, \"No country should fear people reading, nor should it suppress freedom of speech in this way; we continue to pay attention to Hong Kong and support anyone who supports freedom of speech and defends democracy\". What is your comment on this?","The relevant departments of the Hong Kong SAR Government have already given an explanation of this. The persons concerned violated Hong Kong law, and the SAR Government taking action against them is proper, lawful and only natural.\nSince the implementation of the Hong Kong National Security Law, under the escort of high-level security, Hong Kong's social order has been restored, the spirit of the rule of law has been demonstrated, the various rights and freedoms enjoyed by Hong Kong residents in accordance with the law have been fully safeguarded, and the strong vitality and superiority of \"one country, two systems\" have been fully displayed. The relevant laws and ordinances target a very small number of criminals who endanger national security. Safeguarding national security is safeguarding Hong Kong's democracy and freedom, and safeguarding the human rights and well-being of all Hong Kong citizens. All schemes to undermine Hong Kong's process of moving from stability to prosperity, and the delusion of disrupting Hong Kong to contain China, are bound to be defeated.\nThe DPP authorities have been engaging in \"green terror\" on a large scale on the island, \"fake democracy, real dictatorship\", which has already aroused strong dissatisfaction among ordinary people, yet out of their nature of seeking \"independence\", under the banner of so-called \"democracy and freedom\", they confuse black and white, maliciously attack and smear Hong Kong's rule of law, and threaten and intimidate the Taiwan public. Their real purpose is to incite \"opposing China and resisting China\" and undermine cross-Strait relations; their intentions are sinister, and they are despicable and shameless.","香港特区政府有关部门已对此进行说明。相关人员违反香港法律，特区政府对其采取行动，正当合法、理所当然。\n香港国安法实施以来，在高水平安全护航下，香港社会秩序恢复、法治精神彰显，香港居民依法享有的各项权利和自由得到充分保障，“一国两制”的强大生命力和优越性得到充分显现。相关法律和条例打击的是极少数危害国家安全的违法犯罪分子。保国家安全，就是保香港的民主自由，就是保香港全体市民的人权和福祉。一切破坏香港由治及兴进程、妄想乱港遏华的图谋都必遭挫败。\n民进党当局在岛内大搞“绿色恐怖”，“假民主、真独裁”，已经引发老百姓强烈不满，却还出于谋“独”本性，打着所谓“民主自由”的幌子，颠倒黑白，恶意攻击抹黑香港法治，威胁恐吓台湾民众。其真实目的就是煽动“反中抗中”、破坏两岸关系，用心险恶、卑劣无耻。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","台湾《中国时报》记者","Recently, a bookstore in Hong Kong was investigated and dealt with by law enforcement departments. The mainland side has repeatedly emphasized in recent years that it hopes compatriots on both sides of the Strait will jointly carry forward Chinese culture. Some Taiwan public opinion questions whether \"the right to define Chinese culture\" and how to carry it forward are limited to what the mainland authorities…","The question you raise has no connection with Chinese culture, and inciting separatism and turmoil has never been advocated by Chinese culture. On the contrary, Chinese civilization has a prominent unity, and the sons and daughters of the Chinese nation at home and abroad, including compatriots on both sides of the Strait, have firmly forged the common belief that the territory cannot be divided, the country cannot be thrown into chaos, the nation cannot be scattered, and the civilization cannot be broken.\nHong Kong is a society under the rule of law, where laws must be observed and violations must be prosecuted. The persons concerned violated relevant Hong Kong laws, and the SAR Government taking action against them is proper, lawful and only natural. Since the implementation of the Hong Kong National Security Law, under the escort of high-level security, Hong Kong's social order has been restored, the spirit of the rule of law has been demonstrated, the various rights and freedoms enjoyed by Hong Kong residents in accordance with the law have been fully safeguarded, and the strong vitality and superiority of \"one country, two systems\" have been fully displayed.\nOut of their nature of seeking \"independence\", the DPP authorities have repeatedly colluded with those who disrupt Hong Kong and maliciously attacked and smeared Hong Kong's rule of law, with the aim of inciting \"opposing China and resisting China\" and undermining cross-Strait relations; their intentions are sinister.\nWhat I want to emphasize is that the successful practice of \"one country, two systems\" in Hong Kong will not tolerate rumor-mongering and sabotage by any force, and any evil acts of disrupting Hong Kong or seeking \"independence\" will never succeed. We sincerely hope that compatriots on both sides of the Strait will work together in unity and move forward hand in hand, jointly promote cross-Strait integration and exchanges, and jointly advance the complete reunification of the motherland.","你提的问题与中华文化并无关联，而且煽动分裂、动乱从来不为中华文化所提倡。恰恰相反，中华文明具有突出的统一性，包括两岸同胞在内的海内外中华儿女牢牢铸就了国土不可分、国家不可乱、民族不可散、文明不可断的共同信念。\n香港是法治社会，有法必依、违法必究。相关人员违反香港有关法律，特区政府对其采取行动，正当合法、理所当然。香港国安法实施以来，在高水平安全护航下，香港社会秩序恢复、法治精神彰显，香港居民依法享有的各项权利和自由得到充分保障，“一国两制”的强大生命力和优越性得到了充分的显现。\n民进党当局出于谋“独”本性，一再勾结乱港分子，恶意攻击抹黑香港法治，目的就是煽动“反中抗中”、破坏两岸关系，用心险恶。\n我要强调的是，“一国两制”在香港的成功实践不容任何势力造谣破坏，任何乱港、谋“独”的邪恶行径绝不会得逞。我们真诚期盼两岸同胞和衷共济、携手向前，共同推动两岸融合交流，共同促进祖国完全统一。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","台湾“中央社”记者","It is reported that a serving police officer and a retired police officer from Taiwan were questioned by mainland national security personnel while traveling in Fujian in June. Previously, a Taiwan judge traveling in north China was also asked by public security personnel at the hotel where he was staying about work matters such as judicial differences between the two sides of the Strait. Will Taiwan's judicial…","I want to emphasize that we adhere to governing the country according to law, attach great importance to building the rule of law, protect in accordance with the law the various rights and freedoms enjoyed by the people, and safeguard in accordance with the law the safety of life and property and the legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, including Taiwan compatriots. As long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots need have no concerns whatsoever about coming to the mainland. Since 2024, Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland for sightseeing and tourism, exchanges and visits, study and employment, and business inspections have totaled more than 11.7 million person-trips, among them judicial and police personnel who came to travel and visit relatives and friends; as long as they abide by the rules and the law, they all come happily and return safely.\nOut of political self-interest, the DPP authorities have consistently maliciously hyped up, spread rumors about and smeared the mainland and created a \"chilling effect\", with the aim of obstructing cross-Strait exchanges and interactions and escalating cross-Strait confrontation. This is unpopular and will not succeed.","我要强调，我们坚持依法治国，高度重视法治建设，依法保护人民享有的各项权利和自由，依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞的生命财产安全和合法权益，只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞来大陆完全不需要有任何顾虑。2024年以来，来大陆观光旅游、交流参访、学习就业、商务考察的台胞累计达1170余万人次，其中也有前来旅游、探亲访友的司法、警务人员，只要遵规守法，都是高高兴兴来、平平安安回。\n民进党当局出于政治私利，一贯恶意炒作、造谣抹黑大陆，制造“寒蝉效应”，目的是阻挠两岸交流交往，升高两岸对立对抗，不得人心，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","Regarding the Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation's visit to Shanghai, Li Wei-hua, chair of the TPP Central Review Committee who led the delegation, said during the visit that \"we hope today is a starting point of understanding and the beginning of more cooperation in the future\", which coincides with the Taiwan Affairs Office's emphasis that \"as one family, we should visit each other often\". Now that…","From July 14 to 17, the Taiwan People's Party youth exchange delegation came to Shanghai for visits and exchanges. The itinerary was compact and rich in content: they visited economic construction projects, historical venues, technology companies, youth entrepreneurship bases and so on, and also had in-depth exchanges with teachers and students of Shanghai Jiao Tong University, talking together about the responsibilities of youth. I believe every member of the delegation gained a great deal and the trip was well worth it.\nCompatriots on both sides of the Strait all belong to the Chinese nation and are one family bound by blood that is thicker than water. Visiting each other often and drawing closer is a natural thing and also the general trend, which no force can stop. Faced with a complex and grave situation in the Taiwan Strait, cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation cannot stop, cannot be broken off and cannot be reduced. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait should join hands, work together to remove interference and break down obstacles, strengthen exchanges and cooperation, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, enhance the kinship and well-being of compatriots, and jointly create a bright future for cross-Strait relations.","7月14日至17日，台湾民众党青年交流团来上海参访交流，行程紧凑、内容丰富，既参访了经济建设项目、历史场馆、科技公司、青创基地等，又与上海交通大学师生深入交流、共话青春担当，相信各位团员收获满满、不虚此行。\n两岸同胞同属中华民族，是血浓于水的一家人，常来常往、走近走亲是自然而然的事，也是大势所趋，是任何力量都阻挡不了的。面对复杂严峻的台海形势，两岸交流合作不能停、不能断、不能少。两岸同胞应该携起手来，共同努力排除干扰、破除障碍，加强交流合作，推动两岸关系和平发展，增进同胞亲情福祉，共创两岸关系美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","The first question: regarding the list of Taiwan people who went missing after traveling to the mainland recently published by the Mainland Affairs Council, as of now, have Taiwan's Straits Exchange Foundation, the Mainland Affairs Council or the relevant police system formally transferred, through existing agreement channels, the so-called \"missing\" list and related case report materials to the relevant mainland…","The first question. As everyone knows, the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position and refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle, causing the implementation of agreements between the two cross-Strait associations to be seriously affected. Recently, the DPP authorities have kept fabricating so-called missing-persons data, yet cannot produce specific examples; their aim is to mislead public perception and deceive and intimidate the Taiwan public. We have always safeguarded in accordance with the law the safety of life and property and the legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, including Taiwan compatriots. The statistics on Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland in the first half of this year are sufficient to prove that the DPP authorities' schemes and tricks have not succeeded.\nThe second question. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" position, keep adding discriminatory trade restrictions on the mainland, intensify the setting up of obstacles, and maliciously obstruct and undermine normal cross-Strait economic and trade exchanges and cooperation; Taiwan's traditional industries and small and medium-sized enterprises have long expressed dissatisfaction with this. We have always held a positive and open attitude toward cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation; it is the DPP authorities who restrict and obstruct good mainland products from entering Taiwan. We advise the DPP authorities to follow public opinion, lift the unreasonable restrictive measures as soon as possible, and do more practical and good things that benefit the people.\nThe building of the mainland's modern industrial system continues to advance, high-level opening up to the outside world continues to expand, and the building of a unified national market is advancing in depth, providing broad development space for Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises. Upholding the concept that \"the two sides of the Strait are one family\", we actively promote cross-Strait economic and trade exchanges and cooperation, help enterprises on both sides cooperate for mutual benefit, and jointly enhance the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.","第一个问题。众所周知，民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，导致两岸两会协议执行受到严重影响。近段时间，民进党当局不断编造所谓失联数据，又拿不出具体例证，目的就是误导公众认知，欺骗恐吓台湾民众。我们始终依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞生命财产安全和合法权益。今年上半年台湾同胞前来大陆的统计数据，足以证明民进党当局的阴谋诡计并未得逞。\n第二个问题。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，持续加码对大陆歧视性贸易限制，变本加厉设置障碍，恶意阻挠破坏两岸经贸正常交流合作，台湾的传统产业和中小企业早已对此表达不满。我们对两岸经贸合作向来持积极、开放态度，限制阻挠大陆好产品入台的是民进党当局。奉劝民进党当局顺应民意，尽早解除不合理的限制措施，多做有利于民众的实事、好事。\n大陆现代化产业体系建设不断推进，高水平对外开放持续扩大，统一大市场建设纵深推进，为广大台商台企提供了广阔发展空间。我们秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，积极推动两岸经贸交流合作，助力两岸企业合作共赢，共同增进两岸同胞的利益福祉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-22","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","Taiwan will hold the \"Han Kuang 42 exercise\" from August 5 to 14. The urban resilience (air defense) exercise will for the first time include network disconnection, which may affect livelihood functions such as navigation and mobile payment during the exercise. Some public opinion on the island questions that this is using the exercise to play up the \"mainland threat\" and strengthen the atmosphere of \"resisting…","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position and incite cross-Strait confrontation; they are the chief culprit causing tension and turbulence in the Taiwan Strait situation. Their delusional attempt at \"seeking independence by force\" and their willful recklessness have already seriously undermined the peace and tranquility of Taiwan society. In the face of the powerful people's army, no matter how many exercises the DPP authorities hold, it is all posturing, whistling to bolster their courage; it cannot change the fate that \"Taiwan independence\" is doomed to defeat, and cannot stop the historical trend that the motherland will inevitably be reunified.\nToday's press conference ends here. Thank you all.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，煽动两岸对立对抗，是引发台海形势紧张动荡的罪魁祸首。其妄图“以武谋独”，任性妄为，已经严重破坏台湾社会安宁。在强大的人民军队面前，民进党当局搞再多演习都是装腔作势、吹哨壮胆，改变不了“台独”注定败亡的下场，阻挡不了祖国必然统一的历史大势。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260722_12778253.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-07-23","Lin Jian","Reuters","A follow-up of the ASEAN issue. Why did China decide to conduct live drills in the Taiwan Strait just a day after U.S. Secretary of State Marco Rubio and Foreign Minister Wang Yi met in the Philippines. During their meeting, they discussed many issues including Taiwan. Could the timing of the live drills be interpreted as carrying a message for the U.S.?","On the military drill you mentioned, Chinese competent authorities have released relevant information.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260723_11990875.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-07-24","Lin Jian","Bloomberg","This is regards to reports from Australia that Chinese diplomats requested that representatives from Taiwan be excluded from the conference of the Labour Party of Australia. When the Labour Party then refused to exclude the Taiwanese representatives, the Chinese diplomats are said to have left the conference. Can you confirm if these reports are accurate? Can you offer any further comment on the incident?","The DPP authorities’ attempt to advance the “independence” agenda by showing up at various conferences and generate publicity is doomed to be futile. We urge relevant sides to properly handle Taiwan-related issues in strict accordance with the one-China principle and not to provide any convenience or lend platform to “Taiwan independence” separatist acts.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202607/t20260724_11991873.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on July 29, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Friends from the press, hello everyone! Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please now ask your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家好！欢迎大家前来参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会，现在请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","新华社记者","Regarding the mainland's launch of the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" service platform, the Mainland Affairs Council said that the mainland is using it to win over young Taiwanese, and that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" has functions such as online resume submission and online registration, posing an extremely high risk that the mainland will use it to collect and control Taiwan youth's personal data for further use and pressure.…","These claims are completely brainless remarks and deliberate smears. May I ask the DPP authorities: is there an online job-seeking platform in the Taiwan region that does not require filling in one's name and submitting a resume? \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" is a public-interest comprehensive service platform built for Taiwan youth. Its original intention is to build a convenient digital channel, solve the problem of information asymmetry for Taiwan youth coming to the mainland for exchanges, study, internships and employment, smooth information service channels, and make it more convenient for Taiwan youth to pursue and fulfill their dreams on the mainland. At present, nearly 2,000 enterprises have joined \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" and posted nearly 6,000 positions. The platform adheres to the \"principle of minimum necessity\" for filling in information and strictly protects job seekers' data in accordance with the law; Taiwan youth need have no concerns whatsoever about using \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\".\nThe more the DPP authorities fabricate rumors and lies and hype up so-called \"risks\", the more it proves that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" meets the needs of Taiwan youth and has touched the DPP's sore spot. Taiwan youth have the freedom to choose where to develop; wherever there are more opportunities and greater space, they will naturally go there. We believe the vast number of Taiwan youth will distinguish right from wrong and make their choice with their feet. We welcome Taiwan youth to actively use \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\", and we will continue to improve the platform's functions and wholeheartedly provide more convenience and support for Taiwan youth coming to the mainland to develop.","相关说法完全是无脑言论、蓄意抹黑。请问民进党当局，台湾地区有不需要填报姓名、投递履历的网络求职平台吗？“台青e家”是面向台湾青年打造的公益性综合服务平台，初衷就是搭建数字化便捷通道，解决台湾青年来大陆交流、求学、实习、就业信息不对称难题，畅通信息服务渠道，让台青到大陆追梦圆梦更加便利。目前，已有近2000家企业入驻“台青e家”，发布岗位近6000个。平台坚持以“最小必要原则”填报信息，依法严格保护求职者资料，台青使用“台青e家”不必有任何顾虑。\n民进党当局越是编造谣言谎言、炒作所谓“风险”，就越证明“台青e家”契合了台青的需求，触到了民进党的痛点。台青有选择到哪里发展的自由，哪里机遇多、空间大，自然就会去哪里。相信广大台湾青年自会明辨是非，用脚作出选择。我们欢迎台湾青年积极使用“台青e家”，将持续完善平台功能，竭诚为台湾青年来大陆发展提供更多便利与支持。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779609.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","人民日报记者","The summer vacation is the peak period for cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges. To help more Taiwan youth come to the mainland for exchanges, study tours and so on, relevant airlines have offered discounts on cross-Strait flight fares, which have been widely praised. Please introduce the relevant situation.","Since the summer vacation began, cross-Strait exchanges have remained lively. Mainland airlines have resumed 4 cross-Strait direct routes, which have been very popular with passengers. On July 1, China Eastern Airlines resumed operation of the Chengdu to Taichung route and has so far operated 7 round-trip flights, with an average load factor of 95%; on July 4, Spring Airlines resumed operation of the Ningbo to Kaohsiung route and has operated 5 round-trip flights, with an average load factor of 87%; on July 23, Shandong Airlines resumed operation of the Qingdao to Taichung route, with a load factor of 97% on the first flight. On July 28, Zhejiang Loong Airlines resumed operation of the Chengdu to Taichung route.\nTo further meet the needs of passengers on both sides of the Strait, relevant airlines have worked hard to resume operation of cross-Strait direct routes, while increasing capacity, enriching their product range and upgrading transfer services. For example, airlines on both sides of the Strait have one after another switched the aircraft types flying popular routes to larger models, carried out price promotions, added flights, and launched discounted air-ticket products linking transportation, accommodation and dining, and culture and tourism.\nI would like to reiterate once again that our attitude of promoting the full restoration and normalization of cross-Strait direct air links is positive and clear. We hope the Taiwan side will face squarely the real demand for cross-Strait direct passenger air transport, follow the will of the people, lift the unreasonable restrictions on cross-Strait air transport as soon as possible, and let airlines on both sides of the Strait arrange flight schedules independently according to market demand.","暑期以来，两岸往来持续热络。大陆航空公司恢复了4条两岸直航航线，备受旅客欢迎。7月1日东航恢复运营成都至台中航线，迄今已执行7个往返班次，平均客座率为95%；7月4日春秋航空恢复运营宁波至高雄航线，已执行5个往返班次，平均客座率为87%；7月23日，山东航空恢复运营青岛至台中航线首班客座率为97%。7月28日，浙江长龙航空恢复运营成都至台中航线。\n为进一步满足两岸旅客需求，有关航空公司努力恢复运营两岸直航航线，并增加运力投入，丰富产品体系，升级中转服务。例如，两岸航空公司纷纷把热点航线执飞机型更换为较大机型，开展价格促销活动，增加航班，推出交通、食宿、文旅联动的机票优惠产品等。\n我愿再次重申，我们推动全面恢复两岸空中直航正常化的态度，是积极的、明确的。希望台湾方面正视两岸空中客运直航的现实需求，顺应民心，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，由两岸航空公司根据市场需求自主安排航班计划。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779608.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, while attending the commissioning ceremony of the \"Tan Chiang\", Lai Ching-te said that this move \"demonstrates the navy's firm determination to defend national security and the maritime frontier in the face of China's military and maritime gray-zone harassment, and proves to the world that Taiwan's national security policy achieves the goal of deterrence through strength\". What is your comment on this?","Lai Ching-te's relevant remarks further expose his stubborn \"Taiwan independence\" position and his evil intention of \"seeking independence by force\". The DPP authorities disregard the mainstream public opinion on the island that wants peace, development, exchanges and cooperation, and attempt to \"resist reunification by force\", which is purely overreaching and will only push Taiwan toward disaster. The great trend of the motherland's reunification is mighty and rolling forward, and any act that goes against this trend is doomed to fail!","赖清德相关言论进一步暴露其顽固“台独”立场和“以武谋独”祸心。民进党当局罔顾岛内要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意，企图“以武拒统”，纯属自不量力，只会把台湾推向灾难。祖国统一大势浩浩荡荡、滚滚向前，任何违逆大势的行径都注定失败！","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779607.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Recently, the Straits Exchange Foundation held a background briefing saying that the contact mechanism between the two cross-Strait associations has been suspended, that cases of Taiwan people going missing after going to the mainland could not be handled through the original system, that the essence of the problem lies in mainland China's failure to ensure the personal safety of Taiwan people on the mainland,…","In 1992, the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Straits and Taiwan's Straits Exchange Foundation reached the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle, which clearly defined the nature of cross-Strait relations. It was precisely on this political foundation that the two associations began consultations and negotiations and signed a series of agreements, from which compatriots on both sides of the Strait have benefited. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position, refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\", and have unilaterally undermined the political foundation of cross-Strait dialogue and consultation, leading to the suspension of dialogue and consultation between the two associations and obstacles to the implementation of relevant agreements. As an important participant in reaching the \"1992 Consensus\", the Straits Exchange Foundation is now deliberately confusing black and white and misleading the public, which is a betrayal of the history of consultations between the two associations and a deception of the vast number of Taiwan people.\nFor Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland for exchanges and visits, we have always guaranteed their personal safety and various legitimate rights and interests in accordance with the law; as long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, they can absolutely come happily and return safely. The DPP authorities keep stirring up and hyping so-called \"going missing after going to the mainland\" with the aim of smearing the mainland, intimidating the Taiwan public and undermining cross-Strait exchanges. No matter how the DPP authorities slander and fabricate, they cannot stop the enthusiasm of the vast number of Taiwan compatriots to come to the mainland for sightseeing and visits.","1992年，海协会与台湾海基会达成体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，明确界定了两岸关系的性质。正是在此政治基础上，两会开启协商谈判，签署了一系列协议，让两岸同胞都从中受益。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认“九二共识”，单方面破坏两岸对话协商的政治基础，导致两会对话协商停摆和相关协议执行存在障碍。海基会作为“九二共识”达成的重要参与者，现在故意颠倒黑白、混淆视听，是对两会协商历史的背叛，是对广大台湾民众的欺骗。\n台胞到大陆交流参访，我们始终依法保障其人身安全及各项合法权益，只要不从事违法犯罪活动，完全可以高高兴兴来、平平安安回。民进党当局不断煽炒所谓“赴大陆失联”，目的是抹黑大陆，恐吓台湾民众，破坏两岸交流。无论民进党当局如何污蔑编造，都阻挡不了广大台胞前来大陆观光、参访的热情。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The mainland film \"Love Letters to Grandma\" will be shown at Taiwan's Taoyuan Film Festival in mid-August, and is welcomed and eagerly anticipated by Taiwan film fans. What is your comment on this?","\"Love Letters to Grandma\" uses overseas Chinese remittance letters (\"qiaopi\") as its vehicle and, with restrained and understated cinematic language, tells a story of family affection and watchful waiting that spans mountains and seas and spans the years. With its delicate portrayal of emotion and its sincere story core, the film quickly \"broke out of its circle\" after its release, arousing wide resonance among sons and daughters of the Chinese nation at home and abroad.\nOverseas Chinese going down to Nanyang and \"crossing from Tangshan to Taiwan\" are both histories of residents of the Fujian and Guangdong coast leaving their hometowns, fearless of hardship and danger, crossing the sea to make a living and start businesses, and they are the common memory of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We hope Taiwan audiences can see in \"Love Letters to Grandma\" the figures of their own grandfathers and grandmothers and great-grandfathers and great-grandmothers, understand their attachment to their Tangshan homeland and their concern for relatives, friends and old acquaintances, and recognize that compatriots on both sides of the Strait share a common culture and the same emotions. We actively support exchanges and cooperation in the field of film, television and culture across the Strait, and hope that more outstanding mainland films can be screened on the island.","《给阿嬷的情书》以侨批为载体，用克制内敛的镜头语言，讲述了跨越山海、跨越岁月的亲情守望故事。影片凭借细腻的情感刻画与真挚的故事内核，上映以来迅速“破圈”，引发海内外中华儿女的广泛共鸣。\n华侨下南洋和“唐山过台湾”，都是闽粤沿海居民远离故乡、不畏艰险、跨海谋生创业的历史，是两岸同胞的共同记忆。希望台湾观众能从《给阿嬷的情书》中看到自己阿公阿嬷、阿祖祖嬷的身影，理解他们对唐山故土的眷恋、对亲友、故人的牵挂，体认到两岸同胞有着共同的文化、相同的情感。我们积极支持两岸影视文化领域交流合作，希望更多大陆优秀电影能在岛内上映。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779605.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中新社记者","For some time recently, there has been a boom in Taiwan people traveling to the mainland. Some tourism operators on the island said that with the mainland's various advantages, such as being close in distance, having beautiful scenery, sharing the same language, convenient living and low prices, going to the mainland to have fun is simply an unstoppable trend, and even those whose political stance leans green go…","Great China, how long its history, how vast its civilization. The land of ten thousand li, its rivers and mountains so enchanting, the scenery here uniquely fine. Taiwan compatriots are a part of the Chinese nation; loving our China is a heartfelt outpouring of emotion, while \"opposing China and resisting China\" is political manipulation that goes against human nature, which will hardly succeed and cannot last long.\nThe mainland's scenery varies through the four seasons, with all kinds of views formed by nature. From cultural landmarks carrying thousands of years of history such as the Palace Museum in Beijing and the Terracotta Warriors in Xi'an, to world-renowned natural wonders such as Huangshan, Zhangjiajie and the landscapes of Guilin, there is the gentle elegance of the Jiangnan water towns where one \"sleeps listening to the rain on a painted boat\", the majestic grandeur of the northwestern desert where \"the setting sun is round over the long river\", and the vast misty waves of the coast where \"the bright moon rises over the sea\".\nThe mainland's culture and tourism industry has mature supporting facilities and convenient transportation, the high-speed rail network extends in all directions, and public service systems such as accommodation, dining and guided tours are complete; the cultures of many ethnic groups shine together, intangible cultural heritage crafts, specialty foods and folk activities are splendid and varied, combining multiple functions such as sightseeing tourism and cultural study tours. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots to come more often to walk around and have a look, and, while touring famous mountains and great rivers, visiting historical sites and witnessing the new look of development, to strengthen their pride and sense of honor in being Chinese.","泱泱中华，历史何其悠久，文明何其博大。万里神州，江山如此多娇，风景这边独好。台湾同胞是中华民族一分子，爱我中华是发自内心的情感流露，“反中抗中”是违背人性的政治操弄，难以得逞、长久不了。\n大陆四时风物各异，万般景致天成。从北京故宫、西安兵马俑等承载千年历史的人文地标，到黄山、张家界、桂林山水等享誉世界的自然胜景，既有“画船听雨眠”的江南水乡温婉雅致，又有“长河落日圆”的西北大漠雄浑壮阔，还有“海上生明月”的滨海烟波浩渺。\n大陆文旅产业配套成熟，交通方便，高铁网络四通八达，住宿、餐饮、导览等公共服务体系完备；多民族文化交相辉映，非遗技艺、特色美食、民俗活动精彩纷呈，兼具观光旅游、文化研学等多种功能。我们热诚欢迎台湾同胞多来走走看看，在畅游名山大川、探访历史古迹、见证发展新貌的同时，增强身为中国人的骄傲和自豪。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779606.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","环球时报、环球网记者","Today (July 29), Taipei City held a \"Red Panda Meet-the-Taipei-Citizens Ceremony\". Shanghai Municipality, as the donor, had originally planned to send a delegation to Taiwan to attend, but it was unable to make the trip because the DPP authorities rejected the entry applications of the head of the delegation and others. What is your comment on this?","The Shanghai-Taipei City Forum, as an important institutionalized exchange platform between the two cities of Shanghai and Taipei, has played a positive role in promoting exchanges and cooperation between the two cities in various fields, and its achievements are there for all to see. The red pandas' going to Taiwan has been widely welcomed by Taiwan compatriots. The DPP authorities actually unreasonably obstructed and rudely refused the Shanghai donor's sending of personnel to attend the meeting ceremony, fully exposing their \"Taiwan independence\" nature and confrontational mindset. We condemn this. The DPP authorities' practice of obstructing and restricting normal cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation at every turn and undermining cross-Strait relations runs completely contrary to mainstream public opinion on the island and will inevitably be opposed and spurned by the people of Taiwan.","上海台北城市论坛作为上海与台北两市间重要的机制化交流平台，为促进两市各领域交流合作发挥了积极作用，成果有目共睹。小熊猫赴台，受到台湾同胞的广泛欢迎。民进党当局竟对上海赠送方派员参加见面仪式无理刁难、无礼拒绝，充分暴露其“台独”本性和对抗思维。我们对此予以谴责。民进党当局动辄阻挠限制两岸正常交流合作、破坏两岸关系的做法，完全违背岛内主流民意，必遭台湾民众反对与唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779604.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities in various fields.","Recently, cross-Strait exchanges in various fields have remained lively, and Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland to take part in exchange activities have been arriving in an endless stream.\nIn terms of cultural exchanges, from June 28 to July 26, the \"Charm of Xiangshan, Affection for Treasure Island\" cross-Strait art works exhibition was held in Zhongshan City, Guangdong Province. From July 17 to 23, a Hubei Province cultural exchange delegation went to Taiwan to carry out activities such as artistic performances, cultural symposiums and grassroots exchanges, and more than 800 Taiwan audience members watched the performances. From July 21 to 25, the 2026 \"Deep Cross-Strait Affection, Hearts Linked to Fujian and Ningxia\" Taiwan youth Fujian-Ningxia exchange activity was held in both Fujian and Ningxia. From July 23 to 28, the Taiwan media mainland kin-visiting group's Inner Mongolia field reporting and exchange activity was successfully held. From July 24 to 28, the cross-Strait youth photography-travel exchange camp, jointly hosted by the Jiuzhou Cultural Communication Center, the Shandong Provincial Taiwan Compatriots Federation and the Jinan Municipal Taiwan Affairs Office, was held in Jinan, Shandong, and more than 40 young campers from both sides of the Strait wrote a harmonious and beautiful new chapter of joining hands with one heart through one exquisite work of light and shadow after another. On July 28, the \"Jiangsu Charm, Knowing and Doing\" overseas Chinese-language teachers' study camp opened in Nanjing, and more than 20 Chinese-language teachers long rooted overseas gathered in Jinling to begin a Chinese culture immersion journey integrating thematic lectures, on-site study and cultural experiences. From July 29 to August 2, the 2026 \"Hakka Sound π · Hakka Voice\" cross-Strait (Longyan) Hakka youth storytelling exchange competition was held in Shanghang, Longyan, Fujian. In addition, the national competition of the Aiyinsitan 2026 10th Cross-Strait and Hong Kong and Macao Regions Chinese Classic Poetry and Prose Recitation Contest was recently launched, and a \"Cross-Strait Voice Talent Exchange Program\", lectures by famous teachers, industry observation visits, practice signings and youth study activities will also be held. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are welcome to take an active part and together use their voices to spread the Chinese classics.\nIn terms of sports exchanges, from July 15 to 19, the 2026 Fujian Province Roller Hockey Open and Quanzhou-Taiwan Roller Hockey Exchange Tournament was held in Luojiang, Quanzhou, Fujian, with more than 40 teams and more than 300 athletes from both sides of the Strait competing on the same court. From July 18 to 19, the \"Riding the Waves in Hui'an, Discs Gathering Both Sides of the Strait\" 2026 Cross-Strait Beach Ultimate Frisbee Invitational was held in Hui'an, Quanzhou. From July 22 to 29, the first Cross-Strait (Nanping) Youth Table Tennis Invitational was held in Nanping, Fujian, and more than 100 Taiwan youths were invited to compete. From July 23 to 27, the 2026 \"Zhongshan Cup\" Guangdong-Taiwan-Hong Kong-Macao Youth Badminton Mixed Team Tournament was held in Zhongshan, Guangdong, with more than 200 players from both sides of the Strait and Hong Kong and Macao competing on the same stage. From July 23 to 27, the first Cross-Strait (Xiamen) Youth Folk Sports Exchange Activity was held in Jimei, Xiamen, with the participation of more than 200 young diabolo and lion dance players and folk culture performers from Taiwan; the 7th Cross-Strait Youth Around-Taihu-Lake Exchange Activity was launched in Changzhou, Jiangsu, with more than 400 young people from both sides of the Strait taking part. From July 24 to 27, the \"Light of Egret Island\" Cup Cross-Strait Youth Go Friendship Tournament was held in Xiamen. From July 25 to 26, the R3 round of the 2026 Cross-Strait (Xiamen) Auto and Motorcycle Super League was held in Xiang'an, Xiamen, with more than a hundred drivers and riders from both sides of the Strait competing. From July 26 to August 8, the 2026 Cross-Strait Inter-School Alliance Baseball Tournament was held in Beijing and Guizhou respectively. From July 29 to August 5, the \"Same Roots, Same Origin, Affection Uniting Both Sides of the Strait\" 2026 Cross-Strait Youth (Summer) Pickleball Exchange Activity was held in Hebi, Henan. On August 4, the 3rd Cross-Strait (Guangzhou) Youth Sports Carnival and Guangzhou-Taiwan-Hong Kong-Macao Youth Roller Hockey Exchange Tournament will be launched in Guangzhou, holding more than 20 sports exchange series activities in total, and nearly 800 young people from more than 20 non-governmental sports organizations on the island will be invited to take part.\nIn terms of youth internships: from July 13 to 29, the All-China Federation of Taiwan Compatriots outstanding law students study activity was held in Pingtan, Fujian, organizing Taiwan law students to personally take part in systematic process shadowing in the Pingtan court system, practical case-following practice and so on. On July 29, the \"Tide Rising Across the Strait: Tide Technology · New Engine\" Taiwan youth innovation and entrepreneurship empowerment and incubation roadshow was held in Shenzhen, with 11 outstanding Taiwan young entrepreneur teams giving project roadshows.","近期两岸各领域交流持续热络，前来大陆参加交流活动的台胞络绎不绝。\n文化交流方面，6月28日至7月26日，“香山韵·宝岛情”两岸艺术作品展在广东省中山市举办。7月17日至23日，湖北省文化交流团赴台开展文艺演出、文化座谈、基层交流等活动，800余名台湾观众观看演出。7月21日至25日，2026年“海峡情深·心系闽宁”台湾青年闽宁交流活动在福建、宁夏两地举办。7月23日至28日，台湾媒体大陆走亲团——内蒙古采风交流活动成功举办。7月24日至28日，由九州文化传播中心、山东省台联、济南市台办共同主办的两岸青年行摄交流营在山东济南举行，两岸40余位青年营员以一件件精美的光影作品，书写携手同心的和美新篇。7月28日，“苏韵知行”海外华文老师研习营在南京开营，20多名长期扎根海外的华文教师相聚金陵，开启一场集专题授课、实地研学、文化体验于一体的中华文化浸润之旅。7月29日至8月2日，2026“客音π·客家音”两岸（龙岩）客青讲古交流赛在福建龙岩上杭举办。此外，爱音斯坦2026第十届海峡两岸暨香港、澳门地区中华经典诗文诵读大赛全国赛事近期启动，还将举办“两岸声音人才交流企划”、名师讲座、产业观摩、实践签约及青年研学活动等，欢迎两岸同胞积极参与，一起用声音传播中华经典。\n体育交流方面，7月15日至19日，2026年福建省轮滑冰球公开赛暨泉台轮滑冰球交流赛在福建泉州洛江举办，两岸40余支代表队、300余名运动员同场竞技。7月18日至19日，“逐浪惠安 盘聚两岸”2026年海峡两岸沙滩飞盘邀请赛在泉州惠安举办。7月22日至29日，首届海峡两岸（南平）青少年乒乓球邀请赛在福建南平举办，100多名台湾青少年受邀参赛。7月23日至27日，2026“中山杯”粤台港澳青年羽毛球混合团体赛在广东中山举办，200多名两岸暨港澳选手同台竞技。7月23日至27日，首届海峡两岸（厦门）青少年民俗体育交流活动在厦门集美举办，来自台湾的200多名空竹及舞狮等青少年选手、民俗文化表演艺人参与；第七届海峡两岸青年环太湖交流活动在江苏常州启动，来自两岸400多名青年参加。7月24日至27日，“鹭岛之光”杯海峡两岸青少年围棋友谊赛在厦门举办。7月25日至26日，2026年海峡两岸（厦门）汽摩超级联赛R3站在厦门翔安举办，两岸百余名车手参赛。7月26日至8月8日，2026海峡两岸校际联盟棒球赛分别在北京、贵州举行。7月29日至8月5日，“同根同源 情融两岸”2026海峡两岸青年（暑期）匹克球交流活动在河南鹤壁举办。8月4日，第三届海峡两岸（广州）青少年体育嘉年华暨穗台港澳青少年轮滑冰球交流赛将在广州启动，共举办20多项体育交流系列活动，将邀请来自岛内20多个民间体育机构的近800名青少年参加。\n青年实习方面。7月13日至29日，全国台联优秀法科生研学活动在福建平潭举办，组织台湾法科生亲身参与平潭法院系统化流程跟岗、实战化跟案实践等。7月29日，“潮起两岸之潮科技·新引擎”台青创新创业赋能培育路演活动在深圳举行，11支优秀台湾创业青年团队进行项目路演。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Taiwan media reported that Chou Man-chih, chairwoman of the \"Taiwan New Residents Care Association\" and a mainland spouse, was accused of so-called \"accepting mainland instructions and funding to develop organizations in Taiwan\". After the first-instance court found the evidence of guilt insufficient and acquitted her, the second-instance court sentenced her to 8 years in prison, and her appeal was recently…","Mainland spouses are family members and relatives of Taiwan compatriots, and builders of and contributors to Taiwan society, but for many years they have never received fair and just treatment in Taiwan. In recent years, the DPP authorities have gone even further, violating human ethics and utterly losing their conscience, doing everything they can to suppress and persecute mainland spouses: some have been expelled from Taiwan, some have had their public posts revoked, and the most severely harmed have been convicted and imprisoned. The Chou Man-chih case is typical evidence of the DPP authorities' judicial persecution of mainland spouses and their \"green terror\", proving that under \"green authoritarianism\", it is indeed \"if you want to convict someone, you can always find a charge\".\nWe firmly oppose the DPP authorities' groundless persecution of mainland spouses, and firmly support cross-Strait married families in uniting to defend their own lawful and legitimate rights and interests. We hope Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the ugly face of the DPP authorities and give the mainland spouse community support and care. I also want to stress once again that those who act as \"Taiwan independence\" thugs and accomplices in persecuting mainland spouses will be held accountable for life in accordance with the law, and will never be treated leniently.","大陆配偶是台湾同胞的家人、亲人，是台湾社会的建设者、贡献者，但是多年来在台湾始终未获得公平、公正的待遇。近年来，民进党当局更是违背人伦、丧尽天良，对大陆配偶极尽打压迫害之能事，有的被驱离台湾，有的被取消公职，受害最严重的获罪入刑。周满芝一案就是民进党当局对陆配进行司法迫害、搞“绿色恐怖”的典型罪证，证明在“绿色威权”之下，确实是“欲加之罪，何患无辞”。\n我们坚决反对民进党当局无端迫害大陆配偶，坚定支持两岸婚姻家庭团结起来捍卫自身合法正当权益，希望台湾同胞看清民进党当局的丑恶嘴脸，给陆配群体以支持和关爱。我也要再次强调，对充当“台独”打手、帮凶迫害陆配者，我们将依法终身追责，决不宽贷。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","《团结报》记者","Taiwan's defense department recently amended the \"Regulations on Applications by Current and Retired or Departed Personnel Engaged in Defense Affairs to Enter the Mainland Area\", changing the degree of kinship for which active-duty military, civilian and other personnel may apply to go to the mainland to visit relatives, visit the sick or attend funerals from within the fourth degree of kinship to within the…","Next year is the 40th anniversary of the opening of cross-Strait family visits. The DPP authorities' practice is turning back the wheel of history, and is another evil act of theirs in obstructing, prohibiting and restricting cross-Strait exchanges and interactions. The DPP authorities have racked their brains to obstruct and restrict Taiwan compatriots from coming to the mainland, maliciously narrowing the scope of family visits to the mainland for specific groups of Taiwan people, disregarding human ethics and family affection; this perverse conduct is unpopular. Such abuse of power and reckless behavior will inevitably be spurned by public opinion.","明年是开放两岸探亲40周年，民进党当局的做法是在开历史倒车，是其阻挠禁限两岸交流往来的又一恶行。民进党当局费尽心机阻挠限制台湾同胞来大陆，恶意限缩台湾特定民众群体来大陆探亲范围，罔顾人伦亲情，倒行逆施、不得人心。这种滥权妄为的行径，必遭民意唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","According to reports, Ma Chih-wei, a former Taoyuan City \"legislator\" candidate, was accused of accepting mainland funding to run for election, was found to have violated the provisions of the island's \"Anti-Infiltration Act\", and was sentenced to 2 years and 8 months in prison. What is your comment on this?","The so-called \"Anti-Infiltration Act\" is nothing more than a political tool concocted by the DPP authorities to suppress political dissidents, intimidate the people of Taiwan and seek selfish gains for one party; it is an out-and-out \"evil law\". The so-called \"guilty verdict\" handed down on the basis of this \"evil law\" is a presumption of guilt serving the DPP authorities' \"Taiwan independence\" separatist schemes, and is unjust political manipulation.\nOut of their \"Taiwan independence\" nature, the DPP authorities have repeatedly fabricated all kinds of pretexts to slander the \"mainland as interfering in elections\", and then trumped up charges and manipulated the judiciary to suppress political dissidents, creating a \"green terror\". We strongly condemn this.","所谓“反渗透法”不过是民进党当局炮制的打压政治异己、恐吓台湾民众、谋取一党私利的政治工具，是一部不折不扣的“恶法”。依据这部“恶法”作出的所谓“有罪判决”，是服务于民进党当局“台独”分裂图谋的有罪推定，是不公不义的政治操弄。\n民进党当局出于“台独”本性，一再编造种种借口诬蔑“大陆介选”，进而罗织罪名操弄司法打压政治异己，制造“绿色恐怖”，我们对此予以强烈谴责。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, the mainland's \"Lanhai 201\" scientific research vessel conducted a fishery resources survey in the waters east of Taiwan Island. The DPP authorities said that \"the other side's move is to assert jurisdiction over those waters, maliciously conducting political manipulation and cognitive warfare\", that situations of this kind are becoming more and more frequent, that the coast guard and the Taiwan…","From July 17 to 23, a scientific survey vessel of the Chinese Academy of Fishery Sciences carried out a fishery resources survey in the waters east of Taiwan Island. This was to gain a comprehensive understanding of the state of fishery resources in waters under China's jurisdiction and to provide a scientific basis for carrying out the conservation of marine fishery resources in those waters and promoting the sustainable development of marine fisheries; it is completely legitimate and lawful, and is also a normal scientific survey activity that benefits both sides of the Strait. The DPP authorities have no reason to make irresponsible remarks about this, and as for taking the opportunity to clamor for increased budgets for maritime forces, that is even more political manipulation with ulterior motives, attempting to stir up cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation.","7月17日至23日，中国水产科学研究院的科学调查船在台湾岛以东海域开展渔业资源调查，是为全面了解中国管辖海域渔业资源状况，为在该海域开展海洋渔业资源养护、促进海洋渔业可持续发展提供科学依据，完全正当合法，也是利在两岸的正常科学调查活动。民进党当局没有理由对此说三道四，至于借机鼓噪增加海上力量预算，更是别有用心的政治操弄，企图挑动两岸对立对抗。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779603.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","福建东南卫视记者","The Zhangzhou Maritime Safety Administration in Fujian issued a navigation warning that live-fire shooting would be conducted in parts of the Taiwan Strait on the 23rd and 24th of this month. Taiwan's foreign affairs department said the move was \"once again a provocation and an undermining of regional security and stability\", and that the mainland should exercise rational restraint and immediately stop its…","Taiwan is part of China. The PLA's organizing of exercise and training activities around the Taiwan Strait is reasonable and lawful, and perfectly justified. Out of the selfish political interest of seeking \"independence\", the DPP authorities have consistently maliciously hyped, spread rumors to smear the mainland, and incited cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, once again exposing that their seeking of \"independence\" is fierce in appearance but feeble at heart; it will not succeed.","台湾是中国的一部分。解放军在台海周边组织演训活动，合理合法，天经地义。民进党当局出于谋“独”政治私利，一贯恶意炒作、造谣抹黑大陆，煽动两岸对立对抗，再次暴露其谋“独”的色厉内荏，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中国日报记者","Recently, Thai Prime Minister Anutin paid an official visit to China, and China and Thailand issued a joint statement in which the Thai side firmly supports the great cause of China's peaceful reunification, does not support \"Taiwan independence\" in any form, and supports China's \"one country, two systems\" policy. In response, Taiwan's foreign affairs department protested that \"China uses every opportunity of…","We highly appreciate the position of the Thai government. More and more countries are reaffirming their adherence to the one-China principle, clearly opposing all \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts, and supporting the great cause of China's reunification. Facts have proven time and again that the one-China principle is the universal consensus of the international community and a basic norm of international relations; it is the trend of the times, where righteousness lies, and what the people desire. \"Taiwan independence\" separatism has no room to survive and is increasingly at a dead end.","我们对泰国政府的立场表示高度赞赏。越来越多的国家重申坚持一个中国原则，明确反对一切“台独”分裂行径，支持中国统一大业。事实一再证明，一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识和国际关系基本准则，是大势所趋、大义所在、人心所向。“台独”分裂没有生存空间，日益穷途末路。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202607/t20260729_12779602.htm"],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","香港中评社记者","Recently, Lin Chia-lung, head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department, said that a standard operating procedure (SOP) has been formulated to deal with the mainland's \"transnational repression\", that Taiwan people who encounter \"coercion situations\" in foreign countries can contact Taiwan's overseas institutions, and that Taiwan will continue to communicate with various countries to jointly respond. What is your…","Out of the selfish interest of seeking \"independence\", the DPP authorities keep fabricating false narratives of so-called \"repression\" and \"coercion\", attempting to intimidate and deceive the people of Taiwan, create a \"chilling effect\", and incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. This political manipulation by the DPP of confusing black and white is bound to end in failure.","民进党当局出于谋“独”私利，不断捏造所谓“镇压”、“胁迫”等虚假叙事，企图恐吓欺骗台湾民众，制造“寒蝉效应”，煽动两岸对立对抗。民进党这种颠倒黑白的政治操弄，必将以失败告终。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Taiwan media reported that the Institute of Communication at Taiwan's National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University appointed a mainland \"Changjiang Scholar\" as a member of its teacher evaluation committee; although the chair is a retired professor of Yang Ming Chiao Tung University, he has been teaching on the mainland for 7 years, which raises major \"national security concerns\". Taiwan's education department has…","Experts and scholars teaching at different schools and holding concurrent posts is a very common form of talent exchange and cooperation between universities. The DPP authorities' seeing enemies behind every bush reflects their consistent antagonistic and confrontational mindset and their stubborn stance of seeking \"independence\".","专家学者在不同学校任教、兼任职务，是高校间十分常见的人才交流合作。民进党当局草木皆兵，反映的是其一贯的对立对抗思维和顽固谋“独”立场。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","On the 25th, a rally and protest themed \"I am human, I oppose poisoning Taiwan\" was held on the island in response to the recently erupted incident of carcinogenic substances exceeding standards in edible oil. What is your comment on this?","Out of the selfishness of one party, the DPP authorities disregard the vital interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots and stand completely on the opposite side of public opinion on the island; their face of incompetent governance and indifference to people's livelihoods has been fully exposed. The DPP authorities' perverse acts will inevitably meet with strong opposition from the people on the island.","民进党当局出于一党之私，置台湾同胞切身利益福祉于不顾，完全站在岛内民意的对立面，其施政无能、漠视民生的嘴脸暴露无遗。民进党当局倒行逆施必然遭到岛内民众强烈反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","台湾《中国时报》记者","Recently, the film \"The Way Home\", adapted from the true experience of Kaohsiung borough chief Liu Te-wen escorting the ashes of more than 400 veterans who went to Taiwan back to their hometowns, released its trailer. Its writer-director and cast come from both sides of the Strait and Hong Kong, and some Taiwan public opinion considers it to involve \"united front\". What is the spokesperson's comment on this? The…","As we understand it, the film \"The Way Home\" draws on the good deeds and righteous acts of borough chief Liu Te-wen, and reflects the heartfelt longing of the veterans who went to Taiwan for their native land and their wish for fallen leaves to return to their roots. In Mr. Yu Kwang-chung's famous poem \"Nostalgia\" there are these lines: \"Later on, nostalgia is a low, low grave, I am outside, and mother is inside. And now, nostalgia is a shallow, shallow strait, I am on this side, and the mainland is on that side.\" Chinese people on both sides of the Strait reading such lines and seeing films like \"The Way Home\" are all moved. Separated by a strip of water, so near and yet so far: that the two sides of the Strait have not yet been fully reunified is a wound left to the Chinese nation by history. Chinese people on both sides of the Strait should work together to seek national reunification and heal the wounds of history.\nThe pain of separation caused by the times should not and will not continue indefinitely. We have always been committed to breaking down obstacles and actively promoting cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, and will continue to actively provide assistance for veterans' ashes returning home and for Taiwan compatriots seeking their roots and relatives.","据了解，电影《回家之路》取材于刘德文里长的善行义举，反映了去台老兵思念故土、叶落归根的心声。余光中先生的名篇《乡愁》中有这样的诗句：“后来啊，乡愁是一方矮矮的坟墓，我在外头，母亲在里头。而现在，乡愁是一湾浅浅的海峡，我在这头，大陆在那头。”两岸中国人读到这样的诗句，看到像《回家之路》这样的影片，无不动容。一水之隔、咫尺天涯，两岸迄今尚未完全统一是历史遗留给中华民族的创伤。两岸中国人应该共同努力谋求国家统一，抚平历史创伤。\n时代造成的分离之苦，不该也不会无限延续。我们始终致力于破除障碍，积极促进两岸交流往来，将继续为老兵骨灰归乡、台胞寻根寻亲，积极提供协助。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","台湾《联合报》记者","First question: China and the Philippines recently had a clash at Ren'ai Reef, and the Taiwan side, together with the United States and the Philippines, condemned the Chinese side for using force and injuring people. However, when the Chinese and Philippine foreign ministers held talks in Manila on the 22nd, the Philippine foreign secretary reaffirmed adherence to the \"one-China policy\". What is your comment on…","First question. Ren'ai Reef is part of China's Nansha Islands and is Chinese territory. The DPP authorities fawn on foreigners and beg for aid without any bottom line, but this is not the first time their warm face has been pressed against a cold backside.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community, and is also the political foundation for countries to develop relations and carry out cooperation with China.\nSecond question. We have always kept our word to Taiwan compatriots and done what we said. As we understand it, the signing parties are actively advancing the purchasing matters. Instead of finding ways to help Taiwan's grassroots farmers and fishermen expand sales channels, the DPP authorities only coldly set up obstacles and make sour, idle remarks about beneficial measures such as the ten measures. We advise the DPP authorities to engage in less political manipulation and do more practical things, otherwise they will surely lose even more popular support.","第一个问题。仁爱礁是中国南沙群岛的一部分，是中国领土。民进党当局无底线媚外乞援，但热脸贴上冷屁股不是第一回。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分。一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，也是各国同中国发展关系、开展合作的政治基础。\n第二个问题。我们对台湾同胞向来言而有信，说到做到。据了解，各签约方正在积极推进采购事宜。民进党当局不是想办法帮助台湾基层农渔民拓展销路，而是对十项措施这样的利好举措只会冷冰冰地设障碍、酸溜溜地说闲话。奉劝民进党当局少些政治操弄、多办点实事，否则必将更失民心。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-07-29","Chen Binhua","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: Lee Tui-chih, a DPP member and Taiwan's former \"deputy minister of the Council of Agriculture\", has in recent years turned to developing in the business world and gone to the mainland to negotiate business cooperation. In addition, Hong Chi-chang, a founding elder of the DPP, has also done business across the Strait in recent years. With cross-Strait communication mechanisms currently suspended,…","First question. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family, and frequent comings and goings and visiting and drawing closer to relatives are natural things; this is the trend of the times and what the people desire. As long as Taiwan compatriots are willing to take part in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and do not engage in separatist activities, we welcome them to come to the mainland for sightseeing, exchanges, study, living, employment and entrepreneurship. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait should join hands, strengthen exchanges and cooperation, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, enhance the kinship and well-being of compatriots, and jointly create a bright future for cross-Strait relations.\nSecond question. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory, and there is simply no so-called \"Taiwan Strait median line\". The relevant operations of the PLA and the coast guard around Taiwan Island are aimed at safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity and safeguarding the fundamental interests of the entire Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots, and of the Chinese nation; they are legitimate and lawful, and perfectly justified.\nI have an announcement to make. During the 2026 summer vacation, the regular press conferences of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council will be suspended on August 5 and August 12 and will resume on August 19.\nThank you for your hard work, friends from the press, and I wish everyone a pleasant summer!","第一个问题。两岸同胞是一家人，常来常往、走亲走近是自然而然的事，是大势所趋、人心所向。台湾同胞只要愿意参与两岸交流合作，不搞分裂活动，我们对他们来大陆观光、交流、学习、生活、就业、创业都欢迎。两岸同胞应该携起手来，加强交流合作，推动两岸关系和平发展，增进同胞亲情福祉，共创两岸关系美好未来。\n第二个问题。台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，根本不存在所谓“台海中线”。解放军、海警在台岛周边的有关行动，旨在维护国家主权和领土完整、维护包括台湾同胞在内的全体中国人民和中华民族的根本利益，正当合法，天经地义。\n我发布一则通知。2026年暑期休假期间，国务院台办例行新闻发布会将于8月5日、8月12日暂停举行，8月19日恢复举行。\n各位记者朋友们辛苦了，祝大家暑期愉快！","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202607/t20260729_12779598.htm","",1,4,6,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","Japan is set to inaugurate the National Intelligence Bureau (NIB) on July 31, which will be the first centralized intelligence agency since World War II. However, the move has sparked widespread public concern that the concentration of power could revive the specter of \"rule by spymanship\". What is your comment on this?","We have noted relevant developments and the widespread debate and grave public anxiety they have sparked. This evokes memories of the Tokko (Special Higher Police), which once surveilled and suppressed the Japanese populace while facilitating the military's aggressive campaigns against other nations. Under the pretext of addressing so-called \"security threats,\" the Japanese government is pushing forward the centralization and military transformation of its intelligence apparatus. Such moves risk triggering significant repercussions for peace and stability in the Asia-Pacific and beyond. The international community must remain on high alert, resolutely deterring Japan's right-wing forces from breaking free from the post-WWII international order and reviving the specter of militarism.","我们注意到相关动向在日本国内引发广泛争议和强烈不安，让人联想到二战期间日本对内监视镇压、对外服务侵略的“特高课”。日本执政当局以应对所谓“安全威胁”为借口，大力推进情报机构集权化、军事化转型，与一系列扩军备武动向环环相扣，实质是打造服务军事扩张和战争准备的情报体系，给亚太和世界和平稳定埋下重大隐患。国际社会必须对此高度警惕，坚决遏阻日本右翼势力挣脱战后体制束缚、复活军国主义的野心。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","Taiwan's military authorities claimed that on Monday, a PLA helicopter and a drone flew through the \"restricted airspace\" east of the \"median line\" of the Taiwan Strait for the first time, loitering in the area for over nine hours. Analysts on the island suggest the operation likely represents a \"new modality of joint combat training\" and a \"pre-set battlefield rehearsal.\"","Taiwan is part of China's territory. There is no such thing as the so-called \"median line\" in the Taiwan Strait. The PLA's operations in the relevant waters and airspace are fully legitimate and necessary. The \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces' attempt to designate a \"restricted airspace\" for the PLA is nothing but a bluff. It serves no purpose whatsoever.","台湾是中国的一部分，根本不存在所谓“台海中线”，解放军在相关海空域活动天经地义。“台独”武装划设所谓“限航区”纯属虚张声势，没有任何意义。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","The defense authorities of Taiwan are set to launch annual \"Han Kuang\" military exercises next week. What's your response to this move, and will the Chinese mainland take any countermeasures in response?","No matter how hard the DPP authorities try, their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist schemes are ultimately doomed to fail.","无论民进党当局怎么演，都摆脱不了“台独”必亡的结局。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","Citing data from Taiwan's military authorities, as of 2025, over 4,000 troops opted to pay hefty early-discharge penalties rather than remain in service. Total compensation stands at around NT$920 million, and the top individual penalty exceeds NT$20 million. What's your comment on this?","This is nothing new. The louder the DPP authorities cry about their so-called \"whole-of-society defense,\" the fewer people are willing to risk their lives for them. This is because a growing number of Taiwan compatriots have seen through the DPP authorities' true nature—seeking \"independence\" to provoke conflict, thereby bringing calamity upon Taiwan and its people. They are now speaking out against \"Taiwan independence\" with greater courage. Bound by shared blood ties and a common destiny, compatriots on both sides of the strait must stand together in solidarity, uphold the paramount national interest, and resolutely oppose separatist agendas. Only by doing so can we jointly safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, advance the peaceful development of cross-strait relations, and realize the bright future of national reunification and rejuvenation.","这早已不是什么新闻。民进党当局越喊“全民防卫”，越是“无人卖命”，因为越来越多台湾民众看清了民进党当局谋“独”引战、祸台害民的本质，更加勇敢地站出来向“台独”说不。两岸同胞血脉相连、命运相依，应当携手同心，坚守民族大义，坚决反对“台独”分裂，共同维护台海和平稳定，推动两岸关系和平发展，创造国家统一、民族复兴的美好未来。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","From August 5 to 14, Taiwan's military will conduct the Han Kuang No. 42 exercises. For the first time, the drills will simulate a large-scale communications blackout as part of urban air defense and civil defense scenarios. During the exercise window, residents will face disruptions to navigation systems, mobile payment platforms, and other internet-dependent services. Observers on the island say the DPP…","The DPP authorities' insistence on \"Taiwan independence\" separatism will only undermine Taiwan's prosperity and the livelihoods of its people. Their true priority is their own selfish agenda — dragging people in Taiwan onto the \"Taiwan independence\" war chariot by stoking war fears and inflaming cross-strait confrontation. However, their separatist schemes are ultimately doomed to fail.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，是台湾社会民生的最大祸害。他们为一党之私劳民伤财、穷兵黩武，不断制造战争焦虑、煽动两岸对立对抗，妄想把台湾老百姓绑上“台独”战车，等待他们的只有“台独”败亡的下场。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","Taiwan's military authorities have detected a total of 1,334 sorties by PLA aircraft and vessels operating near the Taiwan island in the first half of this year, marking the lowest recorded figure in three years. Some analysts have attributed this decline to the intensive high-level exchanges between China and the United States in recent months. What is your comment on this?","Taiwan is part of China. It is entirely lawful and beyond reproach for the PLA to conduct activities in relevant waters and airspace. The timing and mode of such operations are matters solely for China to arrange.","台湾是中国的一部分，解放军在相关海空域活动天经地义，什么时间、怎么组织都自有安排。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-07-30","Jiang Bin","","Foreign media reports claim the PLA has constructed full-scale replicas of key administrative complexes of the DPP authorities at a remote domestic testing range. The setup is designed to allow troops to drill in highly realistic scenarios, with analysts noting the unprecedented scale and specificity of the simulations. Responding to the reports, a spokesperson for Taiwan's defense authorities asserted that this…","Our military trains under realistic combat scenarios to forge indomitable warfighting capabilities. We remain always ready and capable of fighting and winning. We will resolutely crush any separatist schemes, safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity.\nIn just two days, we will celebrate the 99th Army Day of the PLA. Over the past century, we have stayed true to our original aspiration and are now marching steadily toward the centenary goal of building a world-class military.\nUnder the guidance of Xi Jinping Thinking on Strengthening the Military, all officers and soldiers are carrying forward the revolutionary spirit and answering the call to enhance combat readiness. With loyalty, we safeguard national sovereignty; with competence, we protect our people; and with responsibility, we contribute China's strength to global peace.\nOn this occasion, I would like to extend my warmest greetings to all comrades-in-arms.","解放军始终坚持实战实训，锤炼克敌制胜过硬本领，全时待战、随时能战，坚决粉碎“台独”分裂图谋，坚决捍卫国家主权和领土完整。\n再过两天就是中国人民解放军建军99周年。守初心，向百年，奔一流。全军官兵将始终以习近平强军思想为指引，赓续红色血脉，吹响攻坚冲锋号角，锻造强大胜战能力，以赤胆忠心护山河无恙，以硬核实力保人民安康，为维护世界和平稳定贡献中国力量。在此，提前祝战友们节日快乐！","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16477751.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n7y/16476927.html",1,1,4,""],[0,"2026-08-05","Lin Jian","Yomiuri Shimbun","Japan’s latest defense white paper identifies China as “its greatest strategic challenge” while presenting defence investment as beneficial to Japan’s economy and society. Given China’s intensifying activities in the region surrounding Japan, the white paper states that Japan should respond with its comprehensive national power and in cooperation and collaboration with its ally, like-minded countries and others.…","The Defense of Japan 2026 white paper once again targeted China with groundless accusations, rehashing the so-called “China threat” and grossly interfering in China’s internal affairs with brazen comments on China’s Taiwan region. We deplore and firmly reject this, and have lodged serious representations with Japan. China is committed to peaceful development and a national defense policy that is defensive in nature. The military activities that were conducted are just and valid. Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Taiwan question is entirely China’s internal affair. How to resolve it is a matter for the Chinese ourselves and Japan is in no place to interfere. Diaoyu Dao and its affiliated islands have been China’s territory since ancient times. This fact will never change no matter what the Japanese side says or does.\nJapanese militarists once inflicted immense suffering on Asia and the world, and committed untold crimes. Yet Japan has not only failed to reflect on that history, but also kept speeding up remilitarization, breaching Japan’s own Constitution and the international and domestic laws, and challenging the post-war international order. This has become a serious factor threatening regional peace and stability. The latest white paper continues to trumpet the development of long-range offensive capabilities and new ways of warfare, and even packages Japan’s rearmament as a growth driver. All these once again exposed the truth behind Japan’s claim of being a “peaceful nation”. The international community must stay on high alert and push it back. We urge Japan to deeply repent for historical crimes, learn the lesson of history, stop cooking up justification for its military buildup, and step back from the wrong path.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260805_11999024.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-08-07","Lin Jian","China Daily","According to a press release from the Office of the Prime Minister of Solomon Islands, on August 5, Prime Minister Matthew Wale clearly stated in his address to the National Parliament that the relationship between Solomon Islands and China is vital to the country’s development, and reaffirmed that the government will stay committed to the one-China principle. What is China’s comment?","There is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. The Government of the People’s Republic of China is the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This is the prevailing consensus in the international community. China commends the new government of the Solomon Islands for reiterating its firm commitment to the one-China principle. This will solidify our bilateral political foundation and provide the necessary conditions for deeper cooperation. China stands ready to work with Solomon Islands to continue deepening the comprehensive strategic partnership featuring mutual respect and common development for a new era, and make new progress in building a China-Solomon Islands community with a shared future in the new era.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260807_12000444.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-08-10","Chen Binhua","Not specified (reporter question, outlet not named)","A reporter asked: The DPP authorities have openly blocked the \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" launched by the mainland, preventing Taiwan people from accessing the platform, and claimed that the platform carries risks of personal data leakage and is a means of the mainland's public opinion warfare and psychological warfare against Taiwan. What is your comment on this?","Chen Binhua, spokesperson of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, said in response to the question: \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" is a public-welfare comprehensive service platform for Taiwan youths, aimed at responding to Taiwan youths' needs to come to the mainland for exchanges and development, and providing Taiwan youths with full-chain information services covering exchanges, study, internships, employment and so on. Since going online, it has been welcomed and recognized by the people of Taiwan, especially young people on the island.\nThe DPP authorities disregard Taiwan youths' wishes and needs for exchanges and development and have openly blocked \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\", on the pretexts of personal data leakage, winning people over for the united front, and \"governing before reunification\", all of which are \"Taiwan independence\" rhetoric. Is giving Taiwan youths one more opportunity called \"united front\", and letting Taiwan youths compare for themselves called \"risk\"? In fact, the more they block it, the more it proves that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" meets the needs of Taiwan youths and hits the DPP authorities' sore spot. The DPP authorities act perversely, issuing orders to block the website address and lock the web page, but they cannot lock up Taiwan youths' hearts seeking opportunities and development, still less can they seal the door of home that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" represents in the hearts of people on both sides of the Strait.\nThe mainland's \"15th Five-Year Plan\" has started strongly and got off to a good beginning, and high-quality development holds broad opportunities; it is a fertile land for Taiwan youths' exchanges, study, employment and entrepreneurship. We always uphold the concept that \"both sides of the Strait are one family\", and will continue to create better conditions and provide more convenience for Taiwan youths coming to the mainland to build and fulfill their dreams. We welcome Taiwan youths to actively use \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\", feel the warmth of home, and experience ever better services.","国务院台办发言人陈斌华应询表示，“台青e家”是面向台湾青年的公益性综合服务平台，旨在回应台湾青年来大陆交流发展的需求，为台湾青年提供交流、学习、实习、就业等全链条资讯服务。上线以来，得到台湾民众尤其是岛内青年的欢迎和认可。\n民进党当局罔顾台湾青年要交流、要发展的愿望和需求，公然封锁“台青e家”，借口是个资外泄、拉拢统战、未统先治，全是“台独”话术。难道给台湾青年多一个机会就叫“统战”，让台湾青年自己比较就叫“风险”，实际上越封越证明“台青e家”契合台湾青年需求、戳中民进党当局痛点。民进党当局倒行逆施，下指令屏蔽网址、锁住网页，但锁不住台湾青年寻机遇、求发展的心，更封不住“台青e家”在两岸民众心中的那扇家门。\n大陆“十五五”起步有力、开局良好，高质量发展蕴藏广阔机遇，是台湾青年交流、学习、就业、创业的热土。我们始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，将持续为台湾青年来大陆筑梦圆梦创造更好条件、提供更多便利。欢迎台湾青年积极使用“台青e家”，感受家的温暖，体验越来越好的服务。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260810_12781461.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-08-11","Guo Jiakun","AFP","It is understood that an official from the Pacific Islands Forum said Taiwan will attend an annual leaders meeting hosted in Palau from August 30 to September 4; Taiwan was barred from attending the meeting hosted by Solomon Islands last year following protests from China. What is China’s comment?","On the participation of China’s Taiwan region in the events of international organizations, China’s position is consistent and clear, that is, it must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle, which is a basic norm in international relations confirmed by UNGA Resolution 2758 and a prevailing international consensus. China urges the Secretariat of the Pacific Islands Forum (PIF) to abide by the one-China principle and properly handle Taiwan-related issues to avoid disrupting the sound and steady development of the relations between China and the PIF.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260811_12002221.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-08-12","Guo Jiakun","Financial Times","Taiwan’s Mainland Affairs Council put up a notice yesterday, saying it “strongly condemns” Chinese mainland’s navigation drills in waters east of Taiwan island, the drills “infringe on Taiwan’s sovereignty and threaten regional security,” and the moves are intended to create a “false impression” that Beijing has jurisdiction over waters east of Taiwan. What is the foreign ministry’s comment on the notice and also…","This is not a question on foreign affairs. The Ministry of National Defense of China has released relevant information.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260812_12002972.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-08-14","Chen Xi","","According to reports, during this year's Exercise Han Kuang 42 in Taiwan, Lai Ching-te rehearsed a \"wartime escape\" route. Meanwhile, the troops of Taiwan experienced accidents including tank parts falling off and a fighter jet overshooting the runway. Simulated communications degradation and phased internet blackouts as part of the exercise sparked panic among local residents. What is your comment on this?","The so-called Han Kuang exercise has always been a grandstanding stunt that exhausts the public and squanders resources. This year's drill has revealed Lai Ching-te's cowardly nature: getting himself ready to flee at the first sign of trouble in the name of defense. The DPP authorities also recklessly creats war panic, turns cities into battlefields at a faster pace, and forces civilians to the frontlines, all of which disrupt social tranquility in Taiwan and undermine the safety and well-being of local residents. We caution the DPP authorities that no matter how many exercises they conduct, \"Taiwan independence\" will not succeed. The PLA will remain on high alert, focus on combat readiness, and continuously enhance our combat capabilities against separatism and foreign interference. We will remain a powerful guarantee for safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity and maintaining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait.","","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16481373.html","",1,1,4,""],[0,"2026-08-19","Lin Jian","Phoenix TV","Malaysian Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim said at a recent interview that Taiwan is part of China. When asked about his view on China not committing to renouncing the use of force, the prime minister said that if one province of Malaysia decides to break away, he will use force to protect the unity of the nation, otherwise the nation will be fragmented. What is China’s comment?","Upholding the one-China principle is where public opinion trends and the right thing to do. The international community’s commitment to the one-China principle is not to be shaken. China commends Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim’s remarks.\nLet me stress once again that there is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. China must and will achieve reunification. This will not be stopped.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260819_12006784.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on August 19, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian first announced the Shanghai-stop activities of the \"Same Heart, Walking Together\" Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season, and then answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Friends from the press, good morning, and welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Before you ask questions, we will first release a piece of news.\nTo implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at his meeting with Kuomintang Chairwoman Cheng Li-wun, the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee on April 12 was authorized to release ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, including establishing an institutionalized platform for two-way youth exchanges between the Communist Party and the Kuomintang.\nFrom August 24 to 28, relevant youth organizations from both sides of the Strait will jointly hold the Shanghai-stop activities of the \"Same Heart, Walking Together\" Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season in Shanghai. At that time, young people from both sides of the Strait will carry out in-depth exchanges and discussions at the main forum on topics such as emerging technologies, Chinese culture and cross-Strait youth exchanges; check in at the trendy market for food and trendy toys, experiencing the leisurely atmosphere of a summer night in one stop; and sing and dance together with performing stars from both sides of the Strait at the gala evening, fully displaying the passion and vigor of youth. Afterward, young people from both sides of the Strait will also go to places such as Shanghai and Zhejiang for visits and study, going into schools, villages, companies and so on, exploring the poetic and picturesque Jiangnan and its green waters and green mountains, and getting hands-on with cutting-edge technologies such as AI and robots.\nWe warmly welcome Taiwan youths to come to the mainland to take part in the relevant activities, and also look forward to more Taiwan youths taking part in cross-Strait exchanges, and, together with mainland youths, walking together with the same heart, exchanging and celebrating together, learning from each other, jointly talking about the ideals of youth and jointly creating a bright future.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。在大家提问之前，我们先发布一条消息。\n为贯彻落实习近平总书记会见中国国民党主席郑丽文重要讲话精神，中共中央台办于4月12日受权发布十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，其中包括建立国共两党青年双向交流机制化平台。\n8月24日至28日，两岸有关青年组织将在上海共同举办同心同行——两岸青年交流季上海站活动，届时两岸青年将在主论坛上围绕新兴科技、中华文化、两岸青年交流等主题，进行深入交流研讨；在潮流集市上打卡美食、潮玩，一站式体验夏夜闲适气息；在联欢晚会上与两岸演艺明星们一起欢歌起舞，尽情展示青春的热烈与昂扬。之后，两岸青年还将赴上海、浙江等地参访研习，走进学校、乡村、企业等，探寻诗画江南、绿水青山，触摸AI、机器人等前沿科技。\n我们热烈欢迎台湾青年来大陆参与有关活动，也期待更多台湾青年参与到两岸交流中，与大陆青年一道，同心同行、交流联欢、互学互鉴，共话青春理想、共创美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783185.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/closing)","","Now let us begin the questions.","下面开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council recently said that \"the united front is one of the Chinese Communist Party's three magic weapons for seizing power on the Chinese mainland; the work of the Mainland Affairs Council has never been to engage in united front, but to resist the Chinese Communist Party's united front\". What is your comment on this?","The united front, abbreviated as \"tongzhan\", is in essence great unity and great alliance; it is making friends and promoting unity, seeking common ground while reserving differences, and jointly seeking development. From rallying the strength of the entire nation to jointly resist foreign aggression during the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression, to today uniting compatriots at home and abroad to jointly promote national rejuvenation, united front work has always adhered to its original aspiration. Taiwan compatriots are our relatives and family members; having close exchanges with them, strengthening unity, and seeking benefits and bringing well-being to them is perfectly justified and aboveboard.\nThe DPP authorities have repeatedly distorted and smeared united front work and clamored for so-called \"resisting the united front\", standing completely on the opposite side of the people of Taiwan. They attempt to deepen cross-Strait estrangement and antagonism and obstruct and sabotage cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, in service of their \"Taiwan independence\" separatism; their behavior is despicable and their intentions are sinister.\nThe general trend of the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation is mighty and unstoppable, and the great tide of compatriots on both sides of the Strait visiting relatives, drawing closer and coming together is surging forward and irreversible. The DPP authorities go against the general trend of history and against the popular will and public opinion, and will inevitably be opposed and spurned by more and more of the people of Taiwan.","统一战线简称统战，其本质是大团结大联合，是交朋友、促团结，是求同存异、共谋发展。从抗日战争时期凝聚全民族力量共御外侮，到今天团结海内外同胞共促民族复兴，统战工作始终坚守初心。台湾同胞是我们的亲人、家人，密切交流、加强团结，为他们谋利造福，天经地义、光明正大。\n民进党当局一再歪曲抹黑统战工作，鼓噪所谓“抵御统战”，完全站在了台湾民众的对立面。他们企图加深两岸隔阂对立，阻挠破坏两岸交流合作，为其“台独”分裂服务，行为卑劣、用心险恶。\n祖国统一、民族复兴的大势浩浩荡荡、不可阻挡，两岸同胞走亲走近、走到一起的大潮滚滚向前、不可逆转。民进党当局违背历史大势，违逆民心民意，必将遭到越来越多台湾民众的反对和唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783184.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","The \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" will take effect on September 15. The Mainland Affairs Council said in response that such provisions may affect Taiwan businesspeople in the technology and semiconductor industries investing or working on the mainland, Taiwan-national managers and related practitioners, and that risk assessments should be done well. A small number of Taiwan…","Taiwan residents coming to the mainland have absolutely no need to worry about any risk. The \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" are intended to regulate exit and entry administration, protect the lawful rights and interests of persons exiting and entering the country, and safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests. The provisions mainly improve the system for preventing exit security risks, make clear that the stated reasons in exit and entry applications must be truthful and lawful, and regulate exit and entry intermediary services, among other things. The provisions help safeguard the lawful rights and interests of people on both sides of the Strait in their exchanges, and create a better rule-of-law environment for Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland. Recently, a chance encounter at Lugu Lake in Yunnan allowed a younger relative from Tongxiang to find a paternal uncle in Taiwan with whom contact had been lost for many years; shuttling through the three provinces of Sichuan, Qinghai and Gansu in a single day, a Taiwan girl riding a motorcycle toured the great rivers and mountains safely; a Vlog about touring Guangdong went viral, with Taiwan students recording the real mainland through concrete and vivid details; in Hotan, Xinjiang, a Taiwan tourist's words \"China's Taiwan\" set off shouts of \"welcome home\" from the compatriots on the spot... Such scenes will become more and more numerous, and the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots who come to the mainland to travel, visit relatives, tour and exchange will surely arrive in high spirits and return having enjoyed themselves to the full.\nThe DPP authorities are fearmongering, with sinister intentions. They spare no effort to ban and restrict cross-Strait exchanges, try by every means to block compatriots on both sides of the Strait from visiting relatives and drawing closer, with an endless variety of methods such as suppression, intimidation and rumor-mongering, and the Mainland Affairs Council has rushed to the front to become a \"stumbling block\" to cross-Strait exchanges and interactions. In the first half of this year, visits by Taiwan compatriots to the mainland reached 2.85 million person-trips, up 24.9% year on year, and during the summer Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland for sightseeing and visits have streamed in an endless flow; these are the clearest response to the DPP authorities' bans, restrictions and obstruction. Facing the surging tide of cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, what the DPP authorities fear most is that the information cocoon they have manufactured keeps being punctured and the false \"Taiwan independence\" narrative they have constructed keeps being exposed, which is why they talk such nonsense so recklessly.","台湾民众来大陆完全不需要担心有什么风险。《国务院关于出境入境管理的规定》是为了规范出境入境管理，保障出境入境人员的合法权益，维护国家主权、安全、发展利益。规定主要健全出境安全风险防范制度，明确出境入境申请事由应当真实、合法，规范出境入境中介服务等。该规定有利于维护两岸民众往来的合法权益，为台湾同胞来大陆营造更好的法治环境。近期，云南泸沽湖的一次偶遇，让桐乡晚辈找到了在台湾失联多年的堂叔；一天之内穿梭四川、青海、甘肃三个省，台湾女生骑摩托平安游历大好河山；畅游广东的Vlog走红，台湾学生用具体鲜活的细节记录真实大陆；在新疆和田，台湾游客一句“中国台湾”让现场同胞爆发出“欢迎回家”的呼声……这样的场景会越来越多，广大台湾同胞来大陆旅游、探亲、参访、交流，一定会乘兴而来，尽兴而归。\n民进党当局危言耸听，用心险恶。他们不遗余力禁限两岸交流往来，千方百计阻挡两岸同胞走亲走近，打压、恐吓、造谣等手段花样百出，陆委会更是冲在前面成为两岸交流交往的“绊脚石”。今年上半年台胞来大陆达到285万人次、同比增长24.9%，暑期来大陆观光、参访的台湾同胞络绎于途，都是对民进党当局禁限阻挠最明确的回应。面对两岸交流交往滚滚潮流，民进党当局最害怕的是他们制造的信息茧房不断被戳破、构建的虚假“台独”叙事不断被揭穿，所以才会如此地信口雌黄。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783183.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","Recently, cities such as Fuzhou, Guangzhou and Shenzhen have held a series of cross-Strait exchange activities, attracting the attention of young people on the island. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On August 6, the Straits Youth Heart-to-Heart Gathering, the main-venue event of the 14th Straits Youth Festival, was held in Fuzhou City, Fujian Province, with more than 1,100 young people and people from all walks of life from both sides of the Strait taking part. The event focused on the four dimensions of social integration, economic integration, emotional integration and all-round integration, and set up three major sharing chapters, \"Inheritance: the Enduring Roots\", \"Chasing the Light: the New Journey of the Times\" and \"Building Together: a Home of One Heart\", as well as a release ceremony for the \"Five Ones\" co-construction cooperation items of the Straits youth-development-oriented cities, giving a panoramic display of the growth trajectory of young people on both sides of the Strait who share the same roots and origins and advance together in science and innovation, and a multi-dimensional presentation of the vivid journey of Taiwan youth landing on the mainland, settling down, building careers and building dreams. This Straits Youth Festival is carrying out a total of 47 activities, and is expected to invite more than 3,100 Taiwan youth to take part.\nOn August 8, the \"Building Dreams on the Pearl River: 2026 Guangzhou Taiwan Exchange Season\" was launched in Guangzhou City, Guangdong Province. With the theme \"Building Dreams with One Heart: Guangzhou and Taiwan Blending in Affection\", the event set up five major sections, \"Cultural Unity\", \"New Waves of Technology\", \"Birth Anniversary of Sun Yat-sen\", \"Economic and Trade Links\" and \"Professional Study Tours\", with a total of 42+N activities, covering cultural root-seeking, scientific and technological innovation, tracing history, economic and trade cooperation, professional exchanges and other areas.\nOn August 18, the 4th Cross-Strait Exchange and Integration Series of Activities and the Finals of the 7th Cross-Strait Student Baseball League opened in Shenzhen City, Guangdong Province. With the theme \"Cross-Strait Youth in Shenzhen, Hand in Hand Toward the Future\", the series carried out a total of 36 exchange activities in fields such as economy and trade, culture, science and technology, sports, the grassroots and youth, with nearly 10,000 compatriots from both sides of the Strait taking part. Among these, the Finals of the 7th Cross-Strait Student Baseball League attracted more than 1,000 athletes, coaches and referees from 39 teams from both sides of the Strait, including nearly 500 people from 19 teams from Taiwan.","8月6日，第十四届海峡青年荟主场活动海峡青年连心汇在福建省福州市举办，两岸青年及各界人士1100余人参加。活动聚焦社会融合、经济融合、情感融合、全域融合四个维度，设置“传承，绵延的根脉”“逐光，时代的新程”“共筑，同心的家园”三大分享篇章及海峡青年发展型城市“五个一”共建合作事项发布仪式，全景展现两岸青年同根同源、科创同行的成长轨迹，立体化呈现台青登陆、安居、立业、筑梦的生动历程。本届海峡青年荟共开展47项活动，预计邀请超过3100名台青参加。\n8月8日,“筑梦珠江·2026 广州台湾交流季”在广东省广州市启动。活动以“同心筑梦·穗台情融”为主题,设立“文化同心”“科技新潮”“中山诞辰”“经贸联结”“专业研学”五大板块共 42+N 项活动,涵盖文化寻根、科技创新、历史溯源、经贸合作、专业交流等方面。\n8月18日，第四届海峡两岸交流融合系列活动暨第七届海峡两岸学生棒球联赛总决赛在广东省深圳市开幕。系列活动以“两岸圳青春 携手向未来”为主题，在经贸、文化、科技、体育、基层、青年等领域共开展36项交流活动，两岸同胞近万人参加。其中第七届海峡两岸学生棒球联赛总决赛共吸引两岸39支球队1000余名运动员、教练员和裁判员参加，其中包括来自台湾的19支球队近500人。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Although the Mainland Affairs Council has smeared simple cross-Strait sports exchanges, cross-Strait sports exchanges have been especially lively this summer. Please introduce the relevant situation.","Sport is an important bond for promoting cross-Strait exchange and integration. During the summer vacation, cross-Strait sporting events and activities have been in full swing and extremely popular.\nBaseball has already become popular in many mainland cities. From August 3 to 10, the 2026 Eastern Broadcasting Cup Cross-Strait (Liancheng) Youth Baseball Invitational was held in Liancheng County, Fujian Province, with a total of 276 people from 15 teams from both sides of the Strait competing and exchanging; since its launch in 2024, the event has cumulatively attracted nearly 300 Taiwan young people to come to Fujian to compete and exchange. From August 7 to 8, the 2026 2nd \"Kunshan Mazu Cup\" Junior Baseball Tournament was held in Kunshan City, Jiangsu Province, with about 300 people from 12 junior baseball teams from both sides of the Strait competing.\nAs for the three major ball sports, from August 7 to 11, the 10th Cross-Strait (Zhangzhou) Youth Exchange Week and Youth Women's Volleyball Exchange Tournament began in Zhangzhou City, Fujian Province, with about 350 players from a total of 20 teams from both sides of the Strait competing. From August 8 to 9, the 2026 6th Cross-Strait Youth Basketball Invitational was held in Wuxi City, Jiangsu Province, with about 230 young people from both sides of the Strait competing. From August 13 to 20, Chuzhou City, Anhui Province, held the 2026 Anhui-Taiwan Youth Cultural Exchange Week and the \"Tinghao Cup\" Cross-Strait Youth Basketball Invitational, with a total of 500 young people from both sides of the Strait competing. On August 14, the 2nd \"Straits Friendship Cup\" Cross-Strait (Shaxian) Youth Football Tournament kicked off in Shaxian, Fujian Province, with nearly 180 Taiwan young people competing; during the event, special activities such as an emergency firefighting study camp and a root-seeking and flavor-tracing exploration were also held, and young people from both sides of the Strait made friends through the ball and conveyed affection through flavors.\nOn August 15, the 2026 \"Guangxi-Taiwan Youth Sports Gathering\" and Guangxi-Taiwan Youth Badminton Exchange Tournament opened in Guilin City, Guangxi Autonomous Region, with nearly 100 Taiwan young players competing on the same court as Guangxi players, exchanging and making friends. On August 17, the Cross-Strait (Hubei) Youth Table Tennis Exchange Tournament opened in Huangshi City, Hubei Province, with more than 210 athletes from 30 delegations from both sides of the Strait taking part in competitions in 14 events, comparing skills together and enhancing friendship.","体育是促进两岸交流融合的重要纽带。暑假期间两岸体育赛事及活动如火如荼，十分火爆。\n棒球运动已经在大陆多个城市流行。8月3日至10日，2026年东森杯海峡两岸（连城）青少年棒球邀请赛在福建省连城县举办，两岸15支队伍共276人参赛交流，活动自2024年开办以来已累计吸引近300名台湾青少年来闽参赛交流。8月7日至8日，2026第二届“昆山妈祖杯”少年棒球赛在江苏省昆山市举办，两岸12支少年棒球队约300人参赛。\n三大球方面，8月7日至11日，第十届海峡两岸（漳州）青年交流周暨青少年女子排球交流赛在福建省漳州市开赛，两岸共20支球队约350名球员参赛。8月8日至9日，2026第六届海峡两岸青年篮球邀请赛在江苏省无锡市举办，约230名两岸青少年参赛。8月13日至20日，安徽省滁州市举办2026皖台青年文化交流周暨“亭好杯”海峡两岸青年篮球邀请赛，两岸共计500名青年参赛。8月14日，第二届“海峡友谊杯”海峡两岸（沙县）青少年足球赛在福建省沙县拉开帷幕，近180名台湾青少年参赛，期间并举办应急消防研学营、寻根追味探索记等特色活动，两岸青少年以球会友、以味传情。\n8月15日，2026年“桂台青年体育汇”暨桂台青少年羽毛球交流赛在广西自治区桂林市开幕，近百名台湾青少年选手与广西选手同场竞技，交流会友。8月17日，海峡两岸（湖北）青年乒乓球交流赛在湖北省黄石市开幕，两岸30支代表队共210余名运动员参与14个项目比赛，一起切磋球艺，增进友谊。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","This summer, cross-Strait exchanges in the cultural field have blossomed in many places. Please introduce the relevant situation.","This summer, cross-Strait exchanges in the cultural field have been brilliant and varied.\nIn terms of exchanges on the island, from July 29 to August 3, the China Coal Mine Art Troupe took the special folk-performing-arts show \"Eighteen Kinds of Quyi Arts\" to Taipei and Kaohsiung for 3 performances, presenting island audiences with a variety of traditional Chinese folk performing arts such as crosstalk, double act, Peking opera, face-changing, clapper talk and traditional magic, which were loved and welcomed by audiences on the island.\nIn terms of cultural exchanges, from July 30 to August 3, the 2026 Cross-Strait Literature Activity Week and the 14th Cross-Strait Literary Pen Gathering, co-hosted by the China Writers Association, the Fujian Federation of Literary and Art Circles and the People's Government of Xiang'an District, Xiamen, were held in Xiamen City, Fujian Province, including more than 10 activities such as keynote speeches, thematic seminars, a cross-Strait literary pen gathering, a literary creation camp and field trips to collect material. From August 6 to 9, the 11th Straits Poetry Gathering, \"Coming for the Lotus\", was held in Sanming City, Fujian Province, where more than 70 poets from both sides of the Strait walked into the ten-thousand-mu lotus fields of Jianning and the Danxia landscape of Taining, experiencing Hakka culture and customs. From August 7 to 9, the 6th Cross-Strait Folk Genealogy Culture Exchange Conference was held at the China Museum for Fujian-Taiwan Kinship, with about 150 representatives from both sides of the Strait attending. This conference received a total of 138 Taiwan-related genealogies in 215 volumes, 22 family letters and 83 volumes of other documentary materials, added 8 new root-seeking liaison points including Fuzhou and Kaohsiung, and appointed the first batch of 18 root-seeking liaison persons.\nIn terms of Hakka cultural exchanges, from August 10 to 13, the Cross-Strait Hakka Culture Exchange Conference with the theme \"Young Sails Setting Out, Hakka Blending Both Sides of the Strait\" was held in Longyan City, Fujian Province, with more than 300 Hakka fellow villagers, experts and scholars, and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait attending. From August 18 to 23, the \"Mountain Songs Sing Out Love for the Hometown\" Cross-Strait Hakka Mountain Song Duet Exchange Activity was held in Meizhou City, Guangdong Province, where more than 250 Hakka fellow villagers and youth representatives from Taiwan Hakka associations and art groups sang mountain songs on the same stage with inheritors of Meizhou mountain songs as intangible cultural heritage and youth representatives, promoting Hakka culture and passing on Hakka hometown affection.\nIn terms of music and food exchanges, from August 9 to 15, Henan Province held a Taiwan youth Central Plains food culture origin-tracing activity, in which 40 Taiwan young people went to Kaifeng to explore in depth the origin, evolution and inheritance of Central Plains cuisine. From August 10 to 19, the \"Elegant Charm of Silk and Bamboo, Music Gathering in the Spring City\" Shandong-Taiwan Folk Music Exchange Concert and the \"Strings, Dragon Charm, Cross-Strait Affection\" 2nd Shandong-Taiwan Youth Zhucheng School Guqin Exchange Activity were held successively in Jinan City and Weifang City, Shandong Province, where renowned folk musicians and young folk music performers from both sides of the Strait performed on the same stage, conveying affection through music and playing a harmonious and beautiful movement of compatriots on both sides of the Strait sharing the same roots and origins and advancing together with one heart.\nToday is the Qixi Festival, and we wish lovers on both sides of the Strait that they will be united in marriage and be happy and fulfilled. From August 18 to 21, the \"Love Across the Strait, Affection Linking Both Sides\" 2026 5th Cross-Strait Qixi Matchmaking Gathering was held in Xiamen City, Fujian Province, where more than 400 Taiwan youth and Taiwan compatriots gathered in Huli and, through activities such as a group wedding, Qixi matchmaking and friendship events for unmarried young men and women, and visits themed on the shared culture of Fujian and Taiwan, jointly witnessed young people from both sides of the Strait getting to know each other, falling in love and happily tying the knot.","今年暑期，两岸文化领域交流精彩纷呈。\n入岛交流方面，7月29日至8月3日，中国煤矿文工团携曲艺专场《十八般曲·艺》赴台北、高雄开展3场演出，为岛内观众送上相声、双簧、京剧、变脸、快板、古彩戏法等多种中华传统曲艺表演，受到岛内观众喜爱和欢迎。\n文化交流方面，7月30日至8月3日,由中国作家协会、福建文学艺术界联合会、厦门市翔安区人民政府联合主办的2026海峡两岸文学活动周暨第十四届海峡两岸文学笔会在福建省厦门市举办，包括主题演讲、主旨研讨、两岸文学笔会、文学创作营、实地采风等10余项活动。8月6日至9日，“为荷而来”第11届海峡诗会在福建省三明市举办，70余名两岸诗人走进建宁万亩荷田、泰宁丹霞山水，感悟客家人文风情。8月7日至9日，第六届海峡两岸民间谱牒文化交流大会在中国闽台缘博物馆举办，两岸约150位代表参会。本届大会共收到涉台谱牒138部215册、家书22件及其它文献资料83册，新增福州、高雄等8个寻根联络点，聘任首批18个寻根联络员。\n客家文化交流方面，8月10日至13日，以“Young帆启航 客融两岸”为主题的海峡两岸客家文化交流大会在福建省龙岩市举办，两岸客属乡亲、专家学者和青年代表300余人参加。8月18日至23日，“山歌唱响故乡情”海峡两岸客家山歌对唱交流活动在广东省梅州市举办，250多名来自台湾客属社团、艺术团体的客家乡亲及青年代表，与梅州山歌非遗传承人、青年代表同台唱山歌，弘扬客家文化，传承客家乡情。\n音乐美食交流方面，8月9日至15日，河南省举办台湾青年中原美食文化溯源活动，40名台湾青年走进开封，深度探寻中原美食起源、演变与传承。8月10日至19日，“丝竹雅韵 乐聚泉城”鲁台民乐交流音乐会、“丝弦龙韵两岸情”第二届鲁台青年诸城派古琴交流活动先后在山东省济南市、潍坊市举办，两岸民乐名家和青年民乐演奏者同台献艺，以乐传情，奏响两岸同胞同根同源、同心同行的和美乐章。\n今天是七夕佳节，我们祝愿两岸有情人终成眷属、幸福美满。8月18日至21日，“爱越海峡 情牵两岸”2026第五届海峡两岸七夕牵手会在福建省厦门市举办，400多名台青台胞相聚湖里，通过集体婚礼、未婚男女青年七夕相亲联谊、闽台同源文化主题参访等活动，共同见证两岸青年相识相恋、喜结良缘。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","Regarding the DPP authorities' blocking of \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\", a public-interest comprehensive service platform launched by the mainland, the Mainland Affairs Council claimed that \"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" is actually meant to achieve united front goals while also collecting the personal data of young people in Taiwan, and that while Taiwan youth obtain employment resources, they must also accept conditions such…","\"Taiwan Youth e-Home\" is a public-interest service platform built to help more Taiwan young people conveniently access development opportunities on the mainland. It is a convenient window serving Taiwan young people who come to the mainland to study, intern and work, and a practical vehicle to help Taiwan young people pursue, build and realize their dreams on the mainland. At present, quite a few Taiwan young people have already used the platform to look up information, submit resumes and find jobs they like.\nThe DPP authorities' statements completely confuse black and white and are an out-and-out malicious smear. Instead of thinking about how to open up development space for Taiwan youth, they go all out on information blockades; they ignore the trend of the times of youth exchanges across the Strait and keep fabricating lies to deliberately obstruct them; they disregard the real needs of Taiwan youth looking for development opportunities and concoct false claims to intimidate and suppress Taiwan youth. In essence, they fear that young people on both sides of the Strait will draw closer, open their hearts and enhance mutual understanding, fear that more and more Taiwan young people will see through the falsehood of \"Taiwan independence\", and fear that the various lies smearing the mainland will be exposed.\nThe mainland's \"15th Five-Year Plan\" has got off to a strong start and a good beginning, the economy shows a development trend of momentum shifting toward the new and structure toward the better, and high-quality development holds broad opportunities, making it fertile ground for Taiwan young people to exchange, study, work and start businesses. Our goodwill toward Taiwan youth is sincere, and our policy measures benefiting the people of Taiwan are substantial; the general trend of cross-Strait exchanges and interactions is unstoppable, and the legitimate right of Taiwan youth to choose their stage for development cannot be taken away. No man-made blockade can stop the popular will of the people on both sides of the Strait to visit and draw closer. The broad masses of Taiwan young people have their own scales in their hearts and will make their own choices.","“台青e家”是为帮助更多台湾青年便捷获取大陆发展机遇打造的公益性服务平台，是服务台湾青年来大陆求学实习就业的便民窗口，是助力台湾青年在大陆追梦、筑梦、圆梦的务实载体。目前，已有不少台湾青年通过平台查阅资讯、投递简历，找到心仪工作。\n民进党当局的相关说辞完全颠倒黑白，是彻头彻尾的恶意抹黑。他们不去思考如何为台湾青年开拓发展空间，反而大搞信息封锁；他们无视两岸青年交流的时代潮流，不断编造谎言刻意阻扰；他们不顾台湾青年寻找发展机遇的现实需求，炮制不实说法恐吓打压台青。究其本质，他们就是惧怕两岸青年走近交心、增进了解，惧怕越来越多台湾青年看清“台独”的虚妄，惧怕种种抹黑大陆的谎言被戳穿。\n大陆“十五五”规划起步有力、开局良好，经济呈现动能向新、结构向优的发展态势，高质量发展蕴藏广阔机遇，是台湾青年交流、学习、就业、创业的热土。我们对台湾青年的善意是真诚的，对台惠民政策措施是实在的，两岸交流交往的大势不可阻挡，台湾青年选择发展舞台的正当权利不可剥夺。任何人为的封锁都挡不住两岸走亲走近的民心民意。广大台湾青年心中自有一杆秤，会自主作出选择。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783182.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","To implement the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, Xiamen, Fujian, recently launched twelve measures to promote exchanges and cooperation with Taiwan, which have been well received by Taiwan compatriots. Please introduce the relevant situation.","To implement the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation released by the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee as authorized, Xiamen City, Fujian Province, on August 18 issued the \"Twelve Measures of Xiamen City to Promote Exchanges and Cooperation with Taiwan\", focusing on many aspects such as economic and trade cooperation with Taiwan, cultural exchanges, youth work, platform building and service guarantees. These include building a distribution center for Taiwan agricultural and fishery products and expanding sales channels for Taiwan agricultural and fishery products; optimizing and upgrading the \"Xiamen Service Package for First-Time Taiwan Compatriot Visitors\", enriching the content of rights and interests and expanding service scenarios; holding cross-Strait exchange activities on the protection and inheritance of intangible cultural heritage; and building a service platform for cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in the audiovisual industry, guiding Taiwan young people to take part in talent training for digital content creation, and promoting the participation of Taiwan industry players in the creation of mainland micro-short dramas. These measures are broad in coverage, strongly targeted and quick to take effect, and will help inject new momentum into economic and trade cooperation, youth and cultural exchanges and so on between Xiamen and Taiwan.","为落实中央台办受权发布的十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，福建省厦门市于8月18日发布《厦门市促进对台交流合作十二条措施》，聚焦对台经贸合作、文化交流、青年工作、平台建设、服务保障等多个方面。包括打造台湾农渔产品集散中心，拓展台湾农渔产品销售渠道；优化提升“首来台胞厦门服务包”，丰富权益内涵，拓展服务场景；举办两岸非物质文化遗产保护传承交流活动；搭建两岸视听产业交流合作服务平台，引导台湾青年参与数字内容创作人才实训，推动台湾业者参与大陆微短剧创作等。这些措施覆盖面广、针对性强、落地见效快，有利于为厦台两地经贸合作、青年和文化交流等注入新动能。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783177.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, the 14th Straits Youth Heart-to-Heart Gathering was held in Fuzhou, and Fuzhou City released the third batch of 10 measures supporting the building of \"Straits youth-development-oriented cities\", which attracted the attention and praise of young people on the island. Could you introduce the relevant situation in detail?","\"Straits youth-development-oriented cities\" is a youth development cooperation mechanism initiated by Fuzhou City in 2025 and jointly built in linkage with 17 cities including Beijing, Chongqing and Guangzhou, aiming to create for young people on both sides of the Strait a development ecosystem in which they \"can come in, can stay, can integrate deeply, and can achieve something\". The third batch of measures for \"Straits youth-development-oriented cities\" recently released by Fuzhou City focuses on employment and entrepreneurship, innovation cooperation, and exchanges and interactions, and rolls out a series of highly valuable policy packages such as pure-credit loans for youth entrepreneurship, computing-power consumption vouchers for new AI business forms, and the participation of Taiwan talent in science and technology \"open competition for leading roles\" projects, with wider coverage, greater precision and a stronger sense of gain for Taiwan compatriots. The \"Five Ones\" co-construction cooperation items for Straits youth-development-oriented cities released at the same time bring together the youth development policies and opportunity platforms of 18 cities including Fuzhou, Beijing and Chongqing, and launch one \"Straits Youth Development Guide\", a batch of high-quality study-tour sites, a batch of high-quality internship and employment positions, and a batch of Straits youth service stations, continuously deepening cross-regional coordination in cross-Strait integrated development and creating a better environment for Taiwan young people to come to the mainland to exchange and develop.","“海峡青年发展型城市”是由福州市于2025年发起并联动北京、重庆、广州等17个城市共同建设的青年发展合作机制，旨在为两岸青年营造“进得来、留得住、融得深、有作为”的发展生态。福州市近日发布的“海峡青年发展型城市”第三批措施聚焦就业创业、创新合作、交流交往，推出青年创业纯信用贷、AI新业态算力消费券、台湾人才参与科技“揭榜挂帅”等一系列含金量十足的政策礼包，覆盖面更广、精准度更高、台胞的获得感更强。同步发布的海峡青年发展型城市“五个一”共建合作事项，汇集福州、北京、重庆等18个城市的青年发展政策和机遇平台，推出一本《海峡青年发展指南》、一批精品研学点位、一批优质实习就业岗位、一批海峡青年服务驿站，持续深化两岸融合发展跨域协同，为台湾青年来大陆交流、发展创造更好环境。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783179.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","As of August 16, the total box office of the mainland's 2026 summer film season has exceeded 10 billion yuan, and many Taiwan audiences are full of anticipation for films such as \"The Eight Immortals\" and \"Welcome to the Dragon Restaurant\", hoping they can be released on the island soon. Please introduce the relevant situation.","This year's summer season films are rich and diverse in genre and subject matter, and their box office performance is impressive, reflecting the vigorous development and strong vitality of the mainland film market. Taiwan compatriots' love for mainland films fully shows that compatriots on both sides of the Strait share common cultural genes, historical memory and deep emotional resonance.\nWe have always supported cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in fields such as film, television and culture, and hope that the films concerned can be released in Taiwan as soon as possible, so that more Taiwan residents can deeply experience the charm of Chinese culture. We also welcome more Taiwan compatriots, when they come to the mainland, to go into cinemas and watch films, or check in at film shooting locations, or they can also \"travel the mainland through dramas\", going to real film sets to pick a role and star in a film, and fulfill the \"dream of stardom\" hidden deep in their hearts.","今年暑期档电影类型题材丰富多元，票房表现亮眼，反映出大陆电影市场蓬勃发展、活力强劲。台湾同胞对大陆影片的喜爱，充分说明两岸同胞有着共同的文化基因、历史记忆和深厚的情感共鸣。\n我们一贯支持两岸影视文化等领域交流合作，希望相关影片能够尽快在台湾上映，让更多台湾民众深入感受中华文化的魅力。我们也欢迎更多台湾同胞来大陆时能走进电影院看看电影，或打卡电影取景地，也可以“剧游大陆”，去实景片场选角色当主角演电影，圆一圆深藏心底的“明星梦”。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Recently, Xu Chunying, former chair of the Taiwan People's Party's New Immigrants Committee and a mainland spouse, was sentenced to 7 years in prison on charges including so-called \"violation of the 'Anti-Infiltration Act'\". The Taiwan region's authority in charge of internal affairs claimed it is processing the revocation or annulment of her qualification for settlement or permanent residence in Taiwan. What is…","The Xu Chunying case was only recently sentenced, yet DPP politicians publicly declared months ago that she would be forcibly deported after serving her sentence. This fully shows that the prosecution of mainland spouses on so-called security grounds is entirely judicial persecution by the DPP authorities, who \"shoot the arrow first and then draw the target\", and that the so-called \"crimes\" they list are entirely a case of \"if you want to condemn someone, you can always find a charge\". The so-called \"judiciary\" of the Taiwan region has become a tool for the DPP authorities to practice \"politics of terror\" and \"green dictatorship\".\nWe firmly oppose the DPP authorities' persecution of mainland spouses in any form, support cross-Strait married families in uniting to safeguard their own rights and interests, and hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will oppose the DPP authorities' evil deeds. Those who act as thugs and accomplices of \"Taiwan independence\" in persecuting mainland spouses will be held accountable for life in accordance with the law, and will never be shown leniency.","徐春莺案近日才宣判，民进党政客却早在数月前就已公然宣称要在其服刑结束后将其强制遣送出境。这充分说明，陆配被以所谓安全理由起诉，完全是民进党当局“先射箭再画靶”的司法迫害，其罗列的所谓“罪状”完全是欲加之罪、何患无辞。台湾地区所谓“司法”已成为民进党当局搞“恐怖政治”、“绿色独裁”的工具。\n我们坚决反对民进党当局以任何形式迫害大陆配偶，支持两岸婚姻家庭团结起来维护自身权益，希望广大台湾同胞反对民进党当局的恶行。对充当“台独”打手、帮凶迫害陆配的人，我们将依法终身追责，绝不宽贷。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","北京日报记者","Regarding the DPP authorities' requirement that Taiwan civil servants going to the mainland to visit relatives must submit an application form to their units, together with a list of relatives and friends on the mainland and their contact telephone numbers on the mainland, public opinion on the island has criticized this as treating civil servants as \"communist spies\", while the Mainland Affairs Council claimed…","The DPP authorities previously obstructed public servants from coming to the mainland to visit relatives and attend funerals, and now they wantonly infringe on Taiwan compatriots' personal privacy, all in order to obstruct Taiwan compatriots from coming to the mainland, because they are afraid that more Taiwan compatriots will see through their true face of relying on lies to deceive and inciting \"opposing China and resisting China\" to seek selfish political gain. The critical voices on the island already show the strong dissatisfaction of the broad masses of Taiwan residents.","民进党当局此前阻挠公职人员来大陆探亲、奔丧，如今又肆意侵犯台胞个人隐私，为的是阻挠台胞前来大陆，怕的是他们靠谎话欺骗、煽动“反中抗中”谋取政治私利的真实面目被更多台胞看穿。岛内的批评声音已经表明了广大台湾民众的强烈不满。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","Recently, the British weekly The Economist published its latest commentary on Taiwan's political situation, rarely directly naming and criticizing Lai Ching-te as \"stubborn\" and unwilling to negotiate with the Kuomintang's moderates, and describing Taiwan's political situation as \"holding Taiwan's democracy hostage\". What is your comment on this?","Since Lai Ching-te took office, he has stubbornly adhered to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, been arrogant and domineering, abused power and misgoverned; in order to realize a \"Taiwan independence dictatorship\", he has ignored public opinion and people's livelihoods on the island, continually provoked vicious political struggles, wantonly suppressed dissidents, created \"green terror\" and a \"chilling effect\", and aggravated internal friction and division in Taiwan society. Lai's \"fake democracy, real dictatorship\" has long been notorious.","赖清德上台以来，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，傲慢专横，滥权乱政，为实现“台独专政”，无视岛内民意民生，不断挑起政治恶斗，肆意打压异己，制造“绿色恐怖”和“寒蝉效应”，加剧台湾社会内耗撕裂。赖“假民主、真独裁”，早已恶名远扬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783181.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","According to Taiwan media reports, Taiwan's outbound tourism deficit in the first half of this year was as high as 6.36 million person-trips, and industry players on the island analyze that the gap is mainly because mainland tourists cannot travel to Taiwan normally, calling on the DPP authorities to open up to mainland tourists visiting Taiwan as soon as possible. What is your comment on this?","We have always upheld the concept that \"both sides of the Strait are one family\" and actively promoted cross-Strait personnel exchanges. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance and keep delaying opening Taiwan to tourism by mainland residents, artificially splitting the cross-Strait tourism market, which will only cause them to miss out on the dividend of the mainland's huge tourist source. We advise the DPP authorities to face squarely the livelihood demands of the industry on the island and no longer obstruct mainland residents from traveling to Taiwan under various pretexts.","我们一贯秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，积极推动两岸人员往来。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，迟迟不开放大陆居民赴台湾旅游，人为割裂两岸观光市场，只会错失大陆庞大的客源红利。奉劝民进党当局正视岛内业界民生诉求，莫再以各种借口阻挠大陆居民赴台旅游。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783178.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","人民政协报记者","August 15 this year is the 81st anniversary of Japan's announcement of unconditional surrender. Many civil groups on the island recently held a number of activities to commemorate the victory of the War of Resistance and Taiwan's return to the embrace of the motherland, to protest the DPP authorities' playing down the history of the War of Resistance and severing the shared historical memory of both sides of the…","Taiwan pro-reunification groups have commemorated the victory of the War of Resistance and Taiwan's restoration through various means such as holding seminars and forums and staging rallies, opposing the DPP authorities' playing down the history of the War of Resistance and glorifying Japanese colonial rule, protesting Japan's renewed interference in the Taiwan question, and calling on Taiwan residents to oppose and stop \"Taiwan independence\" forces from colluding with Japan to obstruct the reunification of the motherland and undermine peace in the Taiwan Strait. We highly commend these just actions, and severely condemn the DPP authorities' ugly conduct of betraying the nation and betraying history.","台湾统派团体通过举办研讨会和论坛、开展集会等多种方式纪念抗战胜利和台湾光复，反对民进党当局淡化抗战历史、美化日本殖民统治，抗议日本再次介入台湾问题，呼吁台湾民众反对和制止“台独”势力勾连日本阻挠祖国统一、破坏台海和平。我们对于这些正义行动表示高度赞赏，并严厉谴责民进党当局背叛民族、背叛历史的丑恶行径。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","南方日报、南方+记者","Recently, Joseph Wu, in an exclusive media interview, regarding the mainland's law-enforcement and rights-protection operations around Taiwan island over the past two years, preposterously claimed that he is \"most worried that the people of Taiwan will become numb, letting China's jurisdiction become a fact\". What is your comment on this?","Taiwan is a part of China; this is a historical and legal fact that brooks no doubt and no challenge. The relevant departments' law-enforcement and rights-protection operations in the waters around Taiwan island in accordance with the law are legitimate and just actions to defend national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, safeguard the safety of the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Strait, and maintain normal navigation and operating order in the relevant waters. The DPP authorities distort the facts and maliciously hype this up, vainly attempting to manipulate \"resisting China and protecting Taiwan\" to seek selfish political gain, which is doomed to be in vain.","台湾是中国的一部分，这是不容置疑、不容挑战的历史事实、法理事实。有关部门依法在台湾岛周边海域开展执法维权行动，是捍卫国家领土主权和海洋权益、保障两岸渔民生命财产安全、维护相关海域正常航行和作业秩序的正当、正义之举。民进党当局歪曲事实、恶意炒作，妄图操弄“抗中保台”以谋取政治私利，注定徒劳。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","A few days ago, the mainland Maritime Safety Administration announced that, due to the impact of Typhoon \"White Dolphin\", it was imposing traffic control on vessels passing through the southern entrance of the Taiwan Strait and heading north. The Mainland Affairs Council responded that \"the CCP, using the typhoon as a pretext, claimed control of the relevant waters, violating international norms such as the…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China. China enjoys sovereignty, sovereign rights and jurisdiction over the Taiwan Strait. In accordance with the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea and China's domestic law, the waters of the Taiwan Strait are divided into China's internal waters, territorial sea, contiguous zone and exclusive economic zone. The mainland's maritime administration performed its duties in accordance with the law, implementing necessary traffic management in the Taiwan Strait during the typhoon, with the aim of ensuring maritime traffic safety. The DPP authorities on the one hand maliciously hype this up and use the occasion to smear and attack the mainland, and on the other hand do their utmost to echo external forces and sell out Taiwan's interests; having lost their national standpoint and harboring the evil intent of \"Taiwan independence\", they will surely reap what they sow.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。中国对台湾海峡享有主权、主权权利和管辖权。根据《联合国海洋法公约》和中国国内法，台湾海峡水域分为中国内水、领海、毗连区和专属经济区，大陆海事管理机构依法履职，在台风期间对台湾海峡实施必要交通管理，旨在保障海上交通安全。民进党当局一方面恶意炒作，借机抹黑攻击大陆，另一方面竭力附和外部势力出卖台湾利益，丧失民族立场，包藏“台独”祸心，必将自食恶果。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, the DPP authorities held the so-called \"Han Kuang 42 exercise\", for the first time including a drill slowing down the mobile phone network. Society on the island has questioned this kind of \"network cutoff\" drill, which left people unable to order food delivery or use payment cards for purchases, affecting normal life. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, vigorously push \"seeking independence by force\", and abuse power and act recklessly, which has already seriously undermined social tranquility in Taiwan and affected the daily lives, interests and well-being of Taiwan residents. The so-called \"drill\" will only let Taiwan residents see even more clearly that \"Taiwan independence\" separatism is the greatest threat to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and the greatest scourge to the well-being of Taiwan residents. Only by adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" can peace and tranquility be maintained and people live and work in peace and contentment.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，大肆推动“以武谋独”，滥权妄为，已经严重破坏台湾的社会安宁，影响台湾民众的日常生活和利益福祉。所谓“演练”只会让台湾民众进一步看清，“台独”分裂是台海和平稳定的最大威胁，是台湾民众福祉的最大祸害。只有坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”，才能维护和平安宁、实现安居乐业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Taiwan media reported that Hsu Shu-po, chairman of the General Chamber of Commerce of Taiwan, said that in order to strive to restore more cross-Strait direct flight points, he has consulted with the Mainland Affairs Council to push in the direction of \"charter flights first, then direct flights\", and has submitted the demand for charter flights between Xi'an and Taiwan to Taiwan's civil aviation department for…","The relevant parties in Taiwan and enthusiastic people have been running around and appealing to strive to restore more cross-Strait direct flight points, which fully reflects the common wish of compatriots on both sides of the Strait who eagerly look forward to the full restoration and normalization of cross-Strait direct passenger air services.\nThe Civil Aviation Administration of China accepted China Eastern Airlines' charter flight application for Xi'an to Taoyuan. But it is understood that the Taiwan civil aviation authority has already rejected this charter flight application on the grounds that it is not within the scope of holiday charter flights. This proves once again that the so-called \"charter flight points\" that the DPP authorities have always claimed to have opened come with harsh application conditions, so that the public and industry players \"can see them, but cannot touch them, much less taste them\". The DPP authorities should face squarely the real need for cross-Strait direct passenger air services, go along with the popular will, cancel the unreasonable restrictions on cross-Strait air transport as soon as possible, and give compatriots on both sides of the Strait back a smooth, convenient and efficient air route.","台湾有关方面和热心人士为争取恢复两岸更多直航点四处奔走、呼吁，充分反映了两岸同胞热切期盼全面恢复两岸空中客运直航正常化的共同心愿。\n大陆民航局受理了东方航空公司关于西安至桃园的包机申请。但据了解，台民航主管部门以不在节日包机范围内为由，已拒绝本次包机申请。这再次证明民进党当局一直声称已开放的所谓“包机点”，申请条件苛刻，民众和业者“看得到，摸不着，更吃不到”。民进党当局应当正视两岸空中客运直航的现实需求，顺应民心，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，还两岸同胞一条畅通、便捷、高效的空中之路。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","Taiwan media reported that a Taiwan business disassembled a mainland \"Zhang Xue motorcycle\" into components, shipped them to Taiwan in batches and then assembled them into a vehicle, which was investigated and seized by Taiwan's economic department. What is your comment on this?","It is the working of market laws that consumers look forward to using high-quality products and merchants do their best to meet this demand. Regarding the seizure of Taiwan's first \"Zhang Xue motorcycle\" assembled from parts bought by a member of the public on their own, there is an incisive comment online: \"The mainland is staging a myth, while Taiwan is making a joke of itself.\" Out of their \"independence\"-seeking nature, the DPP authorities obstruct and restrict high-quality mainland products from entering Taiwan, harming consumers' rights and interests; their overbearing conduct is unpopular and will only undermine and worsen Taiwan's business environment.","消费者期盼使用优质产品，商家尽力满足这一需求，是市场规律使然。对于台湾首辆民众自行购买零件组装的“张雪机车”被查扣，网上有一句精辟的评论：“大陆在演神话，台湾在闹笑话”。民进党当局出于谋“独”本性，阻挠限制大陆优质产品入台，损害消费者权益，其霸道行径不得人心，只会破坏和恶化台湾的营商环境。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260819_12783180.htm"],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中国日报记者","Taiwan media reported that Taiwan's executive body will propose a 16% increase in the 2027 defense budget, making the island's defense budget exceed NT$1 trillion for the first time. What is your comment on this?","Since the DPP authorities took office, they have stubbornly adhered to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, squandered the hard-earned money of Taiwan residents ever more wantonly, and run wild on the evil path of militarism, which not only squeezes out livelihood and social welfare spending on the island and harms the vital interests of Taiwan residents, but also leads Taiwan step by step into the abyss of disaster, and will surely be spurned by public opinion.","民进党当局上台以来，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，变本加厉挥霍台湾民众血汗钱，在穷兵黩武的邪路上狂奔，不仅挤占岛内民生社会福利开支，损害台湾民众切身利益，更将台湾一步步带向灾难深渊，必将遭到民意唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","According to reports, the DPP authorities continue to restrict cross-Strait educational exchanges. Taiwan's education authority has required schools to provide the daily itineraries, course topics, places visited and so on of mainland visiting students in Taiwan, and plans to tighten the review of applications by mainland visiting students and teachers to go to Taiwan, and many programs for mainland visiting…","This is yet another evil act by the DPP authorities to obstruct, ban and restrict normal cross-Strait exchanges and interactions. The mutual dispatch of visiting students between universities on both sides of the Strait has been practiced for years and is an important part of cross-Strait educational exchanges, helping to promote mutual learning of academic achievements across the Strait and the common development of education on both sides of the Strait. The DPP authorities abuse power and act recklessly, ignore the strong wish and real needs of universities on the island to take part in cross-Strait exchanges, frequently reach their \"black hands\" into cross-Strait educational exchanges, forcibly restrict mainland students from going to Taiwan for study visits, and use threats and inducements on Taiwan's education sector, seriously harming cross-Strait educational exchanges and the legitimate rights and interests of students, which is despicable.","这是民进党当局阻挠禁限两岸正常交流交往的又一恶行。两岸高校互派研修生行之有年，是两岸教育交流的重要组成部分，有利于推动两岸学术成果互学互鉴、促进两岸教育共同发展。民进党当局滥权妄为，无视岛内高校参与两岸交流的强烈愿望与现实需求，频繁将“黑手”伸向两岸教育交流，强行限缩大陆学生赴台研修，对台湾教育界威逼利诱，严重损害两岸教育交流和学生正当权益，令人不齿。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","The carcinogenic oil controversy on the island continues to escalate. The DPP authorities deliberately shield the state-owned enterprise involved, Taiwan Sugar Corporation, narrowing the scope of its reporting obligation over its failure to report the problem oil, which has provoked strong doubts among people on the island. A recent poll on the island shows that nearly 60% of respondents said they are…","The carcinogenic oil problem has dragged on until now without being resolved, fully exposing the ugly nature of the DPP authorities' disregard for people's livelihoods, evasion of responsibility and incompetence in governance; it is only natural that Taiwan residents are strongly dissatisfied with this.","致癌油问题延宕至今没有得到解决，充分暴露民进党当局漠视民生、逃避责任、治理无能的丑恶本质，台湾民众对此强烈不满，在情理之中。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","First question: a few days ago, when a Taiwan resident entered Uganda, their \"Taiwan passport\" was detained and they were asked to switch to a mainland passport. Previously, countries such as Cuba also did not recognize the \"Taiwan passport\". What is your comment on this? For Taiwan residents who have a need to travel to the relevant countries in the future, or who encounter similar problems there, what…","First question. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China. We have no objection to non-governmental economic and cultural exchanges between China's Taiwan region and foreign countries. The DPP authorities keep using facilitation measures for personnel exchanges to coerce other countries, openly challenging the one-China principle, and what is ultimately harmed is the vital interests of Taiwan compatriots.\nTaiwan compatriots are Chinese citizens, and we have always attached great importance to safeguarding the legitimate rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots overseas. If Taiwan compatriots need assistance, they can contact the Chinese embassy or consulate in the locality at any time, or call the consular protection hotline 12308.\nSecond question. From September 22 to 27 this year, the 48th WorldSkills Competition will be held in Shanghai. We look forward to the splendid performances of contestants from both sides of the Strait and wish them good results in advance. As for matters concerning the participation of relevant persons from the Taiwan region in activities related to the competition, we will handle them in accordance with the one-China principle and the provisions of the relevant memorandum of understanding.","第一个问题。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国一部分。我们对中国台湾地区同外国进行民间性质的经济、文化往来不持异议。民进党当局不断利用人员往来便利措施胁迫他国，公然挑战一个中国原则，最终损害的是台湾同胞切身利益。\n台湾同胞是中国公民，我们始终高度重视维护台胞在海外的正当权益。如果有台胞需要协助，可随时联系中国驻当地使领馆，或拨打领保热线12308。\n第二个问题。今年9月22日至27日，第48届世界技能大赛将在上海举办。我们期待两岸选手的精彩表现，预祝他们取得好成绩。对于台湾地区有关人员参加赛事有关活动事宜，我们将按照一个中国原则和有关谅解备忘录规定处理。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","Recently, Hsiao Bi-khim, deputy leader of the Taiwan region, said in an interview with foreign media that \"China's intention to seize Taiwan has long been no secret; China is adopting a two-handed strategy, on the one hand intimidating with force, and on the other hand declaring that the people of Taiwan are part of the big family of the Chinese nation\", and claimed that Taiwan's strategy is to \"strengthen…","The relevant remarks confuse right and wrong and harbor evil intent; they are yet another clumsy performance by the DPP authorities in an attempt to mislead public opinion and bewitch the public, fully exposing their true face as \"wreckers of cross-Strait peace\" and \"makers of crises in the Taiwan Strait\". The DPP authorities refuse to acknowledge the \"1992 Consensus\", which embodies the one-China principle, and stubbornly pursue \"relying on foreign support to seek independence\" and \"seeking independence by force\", which will only push Taiwan ever further into the perilous situation of war and danger. Whatever they say and whatever they do, they cannot stop the historical trend of the reunification of the motherland and the rejuvenation of the nation.\nThe broad masses of Taiwan compatriots are all Chinese and part of the Chinese nation. We have always upheld the concept that \"both sides of the Strait are one family\", actively promoting cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in all fields, and enhancing the interests and well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We are willing to create broad space for peaceful reunification and strive for the prospect of peaceful reunification with the utmost sincerity and the greatest effort, but we will never promise to renounce the use of force, and will never leave any room for \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities in any form.","相关言论混淆是非、包藏祸心，是民进党当局企图误导舆论、蛊惑民众的又一次拙劣表演，充分暴露其“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”的本来面目。民进党当局拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，顽固“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，只会愈发将台湾推向兵凶战危的险境。无论其说什么、做什么，都阻挡不了祖国统一、民族复兴的历史大势。\n广大台湾同胞都是中国人，是中华民族一分子。我们始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，积极推动两岸人员往来和各领域交流合作，增进两岸同胞利益福祉。我们愿意为和平统一创造广阔空间，以最大诚意、尽最大努力争取和平统一的前景，但决不承诺放弃使用武力，决不为任何形式的“台独”分裂活动留下任何空间。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-19","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: August 15 is the anniversary of Japan's defeat. Faced with Japanese Defense Minister Shinjiro Koizumi and others visiting the Yasukuni Shrine, the Taiwan side claimed to \"respect\" it. What is your comment on this?\nSecond question: in order to promote a meeting with Kim Jong Un, U.S. President Trump has greatly scaled down U.S.-ROK joint military exercises. How do you view the DPP authorities'…","First question. Regarding Japanese political figures visiting the \"war criminals' shrine\", the relevant department has already stated our solemn position. As a country that bears historical guilt on the Taiwan question, Japan should deeply reflect on history, earnestly reflect on and correct its errors, abide by the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and be cautious in word and deed on the Taiwan question. The DPP authorities' \"fawning on Japan and nostalgia for colonialism\" has let the world once again see clearly their ugly face of betraying history and betraying the nation.\nSecond question. The United States always pursues \"America First\" and cares only about \"American interests\". In the eyes of Americans, Taiwan's real value is as \"fat meat\" and an \"ATM\", a pawn for containing the mainland and a tool serving the United States. For selfish political gain, the Lai Ching-te authorities bow and scrape to external forces, cater to and curry favor with them, fawn on and kneel to the United States without principle, and sell out and harm Taiwan without a bottom line; this has already been opposed by more and more Taiwan residents, who do not want to see Taiwan go from being a \"pawn\" of the United States to becoming an \"abandoned pawn\".\nThis concludes the press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。对于日本政要参拜“战犯神社”，有关部门已表明严正立场。日本作为在台湾问题上负有历史罪责的国家，应深刻反省历史、切实反思纠错，恪守一个中国原则和中日四个政治文件精神，在台湾问题上谨言慎行。民进党当局“媚日恋殖”，让世人再度看清其背叛历史、背叛民族的丑恶嘴脸。\n第二个问题。美国永远奉行“美国优先”，关心的只有“美国利益”。在美国人眼中，台湾真正的价值就是“肥肉”和“提款机”，是遏制大陆的棋子、服务美国的工具。赖清德当局为了政治私利，对外部势力卑躬屈膝、迎合讨好，媚美跪美无原则、卖台害台无底线，已经遭到越来越多台湾民众反对，不愿意看到台湾由美国“棋子”变“弃子”。\n发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260819_12783169.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10:00 a.m. on August 26, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press release hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Good morning, friends from the press. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please begin asking your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好。欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。下面请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","Please describe the \"Same Heart, Walking Together\" Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season Shanghai Station event. What other activities are planned this year for the institutionalized platform for two-way youth exchanges between the Communist Party of China and the Kuomintang?","On August 25, the \"Same Heart, Walking Together\" Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season Shanghai Station event opened in Shanghai. The event is a concrete measure to implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at his meeting with Kuomintang Chairwoman Cheng Li-wun and to establish an institutionalized platform for two-way youth exchanges between the Communist Party of China and the Kuomintang. It is co-hosted by the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, the All-China Youth Federation, the Shanghai Municipal People's Government, the Kuomintang Youth Affairs Development Committee, the Chinese Youth Geese Peace Education Foundation, the Youth Corps of the Industrial and Commercial Development Research Association, the Cross-Strait Peace and Development Foundation and others. Song Tao, director of the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council; Gong Zheng, deputy secretary of the Shanghai Municipal Party Committee and mayor of Shanghai; A Dong, first secretary of the Secretariat of the Central Committee of the Communist Youth League; Chang Jung-kung, vice chairman of the Kuomintang; and Lien Sheng-wu, chairman of the Kuomintang Youth Affairs Development Committee, attended the event and delivered speeches, and about 1,000 people from all walks of life and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait took part. Young people from both sides of the Strait held in-depth exchanges and discussions at the main forum on themes such as emerging technologies, Chinese culture and cross-Strait youth exchanges, and will also go to Shanghai, Zhejiang and other places for visits and study, fully displaying the positive, upward spirit of young people on both sides of the Strait joining hands and striving forward. The event will run until August 28.\nNext, through the institutionalized platform for two-way exchanges between the Communist Party of China and the Kuomintang, we will invite more delegations to come to the mainland for exchanges and visits, with rich and varied content. We also sincerely invite the broad ranks of young friends in Taiwan to come to the mainland to walk around and have a look. We hope young people on both sides of the Strait will walk together with one heart and continually gather the strength of youth to promote the peaceful development and integrated development of cross-Strait relations.","8月25日，同心同行——两岸青年交流季上海站活动在沪开幕。活动是贯彻落实习近平总书记会见中国国民党主席郑丽文重要讲话精神、建立国共两党青年双向交流机制化平台的具体举措，由国务院台办、全国青联、上海市人民政府、中国国民党青年事务发展委员会、中华青雁和平教育基金会、工商建设研究会青年团、两岸和平发展基金会等共同主办。中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛，上海市委副书记、市长龚正，共青团中央书记处第一书记阿东，中国国民党副主席张荣恭，中国国民党青年事务发展委员会主委连胜武出席活动并致辞，两岸各界人士和青年代表约1000人参加。两岸青年在主论坛上围绕新兴科技、中华文化、两岸青年交流等主题进行深入交流研讨，还将赴上海、浙江等地参访研习，充分展现两岸青年积极向上、携手奋进的精神风貌。活动将持续至8月28日。\n接下来，通过国共两党双向交流机制化平台，我们将邀请更多团组来大陆交流参访，内容精彩纷呈。我们也将诚挚邀请广大台湾青年朋友来大陆走一走、看一看。希望两岸年轻人同心同行，为推动两岸关系和平发展、融合发展不断汇聚青春力量。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784589.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","The New Party held its 33rd anniversary celebration on August 22, saying that the New Party will hold firm to its stance and resolutely promote the reunification of the Chinese nation. In addition, the event was originally scheduled to be held at CPC Corporation, Taiwan; reportedly, because of suppression by the DPP authorities, CPC Corporation broke the agreement at the last minute and the event had to change…","Resolving the Taiwan question and achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all the sons and daughters of the Chinese nation. The motherland must be reunified and will inevitably be reunified. More and more Taiwan compatriots, including the New Party, recognize that cross-Strait reunification is a historical trend that no person and no force can stop. We are willing, on the basis of the one-China principle, to continue working together with Taiwan's political parties, groups and individuals, including the New Party, to jointly promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, jointly create the great historic cause of reunification of the motherland, and jointly share the great glory of national rejuvenation.\nThe DPP authorities go against the general trend of history, stubbornly adhere to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence,\" and use every means to attack and persecute political dissidents, including pro-unification forces on the island, engaging in a \"green terror\" on a large scale. This fully exposes their despicable nature of fake democracy, real dictatorship, and fake protection of Taiwan, real harm to Taiwan, and they will inevitably be spurned by history and spurned by the people.","解决台湾问题、实现祖国完全统一，是全体中华儿女的共同愿望。祖国必须统一，也必然统一。包括新党在内越来越多的台湾同胞认识到，两岸统一是任何人任何势力都无法阻挡的历史大势。我们愿在一个中国原则基础上，继续同包括新党在内的台湾各政党、团体和人士一道，共同推动两岸关系和平发展，共创祖国统一历史伟业，共享民族复兴伟大荣光。\n民进党当局违逆历史大势，顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不择手段打击迫害包括岛内统派在内的政治异己，大搞“绿色恐怖”，充分暴露其假民主、真独裁，假保台、真害台的卑劣本质，必然遭到历史的唾弃和人民的唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784588.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","新华社记者","Recently, at an event in Kinmen marking the \"68th anniversary of the August 23 artillery battle,\" Lai Ching-te once again rehashed the \"new two-state theory,\" clamored about \"using force to reject reunification,\" and said the island should \"support national defense, defend the country and guard democracy.\" What is your comment on this?","Lai Ching-te stubbornly adheres to the separatist stance of \"Taiwan independence,\" continually propagates the fallacies and heresies of \"Taiwan independence,\" deliberately distorts history, strenuously plays up the so-called \"China threat,\" and continually incites \"opposing China and resisting China,\" vainly attempting \"to use force to reject reunification\" and \"to seek independence by force,\" pushing Taiwan step by step toward the dangerous brink of war. He is an out-and-out \"destroyer of cross-Strait peace\" and \"maker of Taiwan Strait crises.\"\nWe solemnly warn Lai Ching-te and the DPP authorities that the general trend of reunification cannot be stopped, and \"seeking independence by force\" will hasten their demise. We hope the broad ranks of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the deceptiveness and harmfulness of Lai Ching-te's provocations in pursuit of \"independence,\" join us in resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and safeguard their own security and well-being and peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait with concrete actions.","赖清德顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，不断宣扬“台独”歪理邪论，蓄意歪曲历史，极力渲染所谓“中国威胁”，不断煽动“反中抗中”，妄图“以武拒统”、“以武谋独”，一步步把台湾推向兵凶战危的险境，是不折不扣的“两岸和平破坏者”、“台海危机制造者”。\n正告赖清德及民进党当局，统一大势不可阻挡，“以武谋独”加速灭亡。希望广大台湾同胞认清赖清德谋“独”挑衅的欺骗性和危害性，同我们一道坚决反对“台独”分裂，以实际行动维护自身安全福祉和台海和平稳定。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784587.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","香港经济导报记者","Recently, the Chinese National Federation of Industries in Taiwan released its \"2026 CNFI White Paper,\" in which the cross-Strait policy section takes \"confident and steady, building a new situation for cross-Strait development\" as its theme, recommends that the DPP authorities simplify the review process for mainland professionals visiting Taiwan, and expresses the hope of creating more stable cross-Strait…","Compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family and should visit each other frequently, as kin, and draw closer. Taiwan's business and industrial circles hope that cross-Strait exchanges and interactions will be smooth and lively; this is what the people want and where the general trend is heading. For a long time, we have upheld the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family,\" actively promoted cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in all fields, and continually taken measures to facilitate interactions between people on both sides of the Strait. We hope the DPP authorities will listen to the voice of industry, cancel as soon as possible the unreasonable restrictive measures that hinder cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, and facilitate cross-Strait exchanges and integration.","两岸同胞是一家人，理应常来常往、走亲走近。台湾工商界、产业界希望两岸交流往来顺畅热络，这是民心所向、大势所趋。长期以来，我们秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，积极推动两岸各领域交流合作，不断采取措施为两岸民众往来提供便利。希望民进党当局倾听业界呼声，尽快取消阻碍两岸交流往来的不合理限制措施，便利两岸交流融合。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784583.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","《参考消息》记者","The \"Measures for Supervision and Inspection of Cyberspace Security by Public Security Organs\" issued by the Ministry of Public Security will take effect on October 1. The DPP authorities claimed that the mainland is building \"an authoritarian chain of legal tools, from the inside out, strict and tight,\" and that people in Taiwan must carefully assess the necessity before going to the mainland and must not…","Recently, the Ministry of Public Security issued the departmental rules \"Measures for Supervision and Inspection of Cyberspace Security by Public Security Organs.\" The measures apply to supervision and inspection conducted by public security organs in accordance with the law of how network operators, data processors and personal information processors fulfill their data security obligations, and they regulate public security law enforcement conduct. The formulation of the measures is conducive to supervising network operators, data processors, personal information processors and others, strengthening the security protection of networks, data and personal information, jointly preventing illegal and criminal activities such as telecom and online fraud, and safeguarding national security and the public interest of society.\nThe relevant statements of the DPP authorities are entirely rumor-mongering and smears meant to confuse the public. The DPP authorities are precisely the chief culprit extending a \"black hand\" into people's lives. They repeatedly rehash the false narrative of \"democracy versus authoritarianism,\" deliberately escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, and obstruct, restrict and sabotage cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation; on the island they wantonly trample on democracy, undermine the rule of law, ban and restrict freedoms, and engage in a \"green terror\" on a large scale. Recently they have also repeatedly demanded that Taiwan civil servants visiting relatives on the mainland provide data such as lists of relatives and friends and their telephone numbers, and required schools on the island going to the mainland for exchanges to register on the Mainland Affairs Council website, and so on. Wantonly infringing on the personal privacy of the people of Taiwan in this way, what qualifications and what face do the DPP authorities have to prate about \"information security\"?","近日，公安部发布的部门规章《公安机关网络空间安全监督检查办法》。该办法适用于公安机关依法对网络运营者、数据处理者、个人信息处理者履行数据安全义务情况开展监督检查，并对公安执法行为予以规范。该办法制定有利于监督网络运营商、数据处理者、个人信息处理者等，加强对网络、数据和个人信息的安全保护，共同防范电信网络诈骗等违法犯罪，维护国家安全和社会公共利益。\n民进党当局有关说法完全是造谣抹黑、混淆视听。民进党当局正是把“黑手”伸向人民生活的最大祸首，他们反复翻炒“民主对抗威权”虚假叙事，蓄意升高两岸对立对抗，阻限破坏两岸交流合作；在岛内肆意践踏民主、破坏法治、禁限自由，大搞“绿色恐怖”，近日又一再要求赴大陆探亲的台湾公务员提供亲友名单和电话等数据、要求赴大陆交流的岛内学校在陆委会网站登记等，如此肆意侵犯台湾民众个人隐私，民进党当局有何资格和颜面奢谈“信息安全”？","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784584.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中新社记者","Recently, Liu Shyh-fang, head of Taiwan's interior affairs authority, said that since the restriction of the Xiaohongshu app last December, the number of fraud cases has fallen 80% and the amount lost to fraud has fallen 55%, which is very effective; now, following procedure, another registered letter will be sent to Xiaohongshu, and if it still ignores it, it is very likely to be blocked for another year. What…","The data you mentioned were scripted and directed by the DPP authorities themselves, with the aim of fabricating a pretext to ban and restrict mainland social media platforms and inciting cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. The DPP authorities crudely deprive the people of Taiwan, especially young people, of their right to know and their freedom to use social media platforms, and crudely obstruct communication and interaction between young people on both sides of the Strait, which is completely unpopular. Their perverse actions cannot stop the enthusiasm of the people of Taiwan for communicating through mainland social media platforms, and cannot stop the tide of popular will for people on both sides of the Strait to visit each other as kin and draw closer.","你提到的数据是民进党当局自编自导的，目的是捏造借口禁限大陆社交平台，煽动两岸对立对抗。民进党当局粗暴剥夺台湾民众特别是青年的知情权和使用社交平台的自由，粗暴阻挠两岸青年沟通交往，完全不得人心。其倒行逆施挡不住台湾民众通过大陆社交平台进行交流的热情，挡不住两岸民众走亲走近的民意潮流。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The 30th Shandong-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair will be held soon. Please describe the relevant situation.","From August 31 to September 3, the 30th Shandong-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair will be held in Weifang, Shandong and other places. The fair is co-hosted by the Shandong Provincial People's Government and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, with the theme \"Forging ahead on the momentum of the 15th Five-Year Plan, Shandong and Taiwan jointly painting a new picture.\" The main venue is set up in Weifang City, where the opening ceremony and the theme event of the Conference on High-Quality Development of Cross-Strait Industrial Integration will be held, together with special events on modern agriculture, green chemicals, marine health, intelligent manufacturing, youth entrepreneurship, vocational education and more. Sub-venues will be set up at the same time in Zibo, Jining, Dezhou, Heze and other cities, holding a series of cross-Strait exchange activities, with the aim of promoting Shandong-Taiwan economic, trade and cultural exchanges and cooperation and building a new pattern of Shandong-Taiwan integrated development.","8月31日至9月3日，第30届鲁台经贸洽谈会将在山东潍坊等地举办。洽谈会由山东省人民政府和国务院台办共同主办，以“乘势奋进‘十五五’ 鲁台共绘新图景”为主题，在潍坊市设置主会场，举办开幕式暨两岸产业融合高质量发展大会主题活动和现代农业、绿色化工、海洋大健康、智能制造、青年创业、职业教育等专题活动，同期在淄博、济宁、德州、菏泽等市设立分会场，举办系列两岸交流活动，旨在推动鲁台经贸文化交流合作，构建鲁台融合发展新格局。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, the first Cross-Strait Film Exchange Conference was held in Beijing and was welcomed by film and television practitioners on both sides of the Strait. Some Taiwanese creators said that cross-Strait film and television exchanges have been interrupted for many years, and they look forward to restarting exchanges and dialogue through a formal platform, bringing more possibilities for cooperation to…","To implement the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation released under authorization by the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee, the first Cross-Strait Film Exchange Conference, guided by the China Film Administration and hosted by the Cross-Strait Exchange Fund of the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Straits, was held in Beijing from August 20 to 21 and drew the attention of film circles on both sides of the Strait. With the theme \"Light and Shadow in the Same Boat,\" the event held sub-events including a cross-Strait film project pitch roadshow, a cross-Strait film and television industry forum, and master-class lectures by filmmakers from both sides of the Strait. More than 170 representatives of the film and television industry from both sides of the Strait took part. Fourteen original cross-Strait co-produced film projects were showcased and promoted, and the \"Cross-Strait Film Project Same Boat Award\" was selected; this is also the first award established for cross-Strait cooperative co-produced film projects.\nWe have always supported cross-Strait film exchanges. The long-running flagship project \"Cross-Strait Film Exhibition\" is very popular on the island. Cross-Strait film and television exchange activities built on mainland film festivals and film awards continue to be held; for example, the \"Golden Rooster Awards\" have a Taiwan film showcase segment, the Shanghai film festival screens films co-created by both sides of the Strait, and the Silk Road International Film Festival has a section of cross-Strait film exchange activities.\nThe DPP authorities disregard the calls of the industry and the public, obstruct cross-Strait film exchanges, engage in artificial political manipulation, and to this day still impose all kinds of unreasonable restrictions on the public screening of mainland films in Taiwan. The DPP authorities should lift the restrictions as soon as possible and not block cross-Strait film, television and cultural exchanges and cooperation.","为落实中央台办受权发布的十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，由国家电影局指导，海协会两岸交流基金主办的首届两岸电影交流会于8月20日至21日在北京举办，受到两岸电影界的关注。活动以“光影同舟”为主题，举办了两岸电影项目路演提案大会、两岸影视产业论坛、两岸影人大师班讲座等子活动。两岸影视业170余名代表参加。14个两岸合拍原创电影项目参与展示推介并评选产生“两岸电影项目同舟奖”，这也是首次为两岸合作合拍电影项目设立的奖项。\n我们一贯支持开展两岸电影交流。持续多年的品牌项目“两岸电影展”在岛内很受欢迎。依托大陆电影节、电影奖项开展的两岸影视交流活动持续举办，如“金鸡奖”设置台湾电影展示环节，上海电影节展映两岸共创电影，丝绸之路国际电影节设置两岸电影交流活动版块等。\n民进党当局罔顾业界和民众呼声，阻挠两岸电影交流，人为进行政治操弄，至今仍对大陆电影在台公映设置种种不合理限制。民进党当局应尽快取消限制，不要阻挡两岸影视文化交流合作。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784585.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","Recently, Taiwan's education authority said that it has cooperated with the Mainland Affairs Council to set up a \"registration platform,\" and schools on the island going to the mainland for exchanges must fill in information on the platform; if the information filled in is untrue, it will consider reducing the school's future subsidies for exchange applications or activity equipment. This move has once again…","The DPP authorities go to every extreme to sabotage normal cross-Strait exchanges in education and among young students, fully exposing their sinister intention of obstructing cross-Strait personnel interactions and all kinds of exchanges and cooperation and escalating cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation.\nFacts have repeatedly proved that the DPP authorities are the biggest obstacle to cross-Strait exchanges and interactions and the biggest threat to peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. Wanting peace, wanting development, wanting exchanges and wanting cooperation is the mainstream public opinion in society on the island; the desire of compatriots on both sides of the Strait to visit each other as kin and draw closer, and the general trend of cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, cannot be stopped. Any act that turns back the wheel of history and goes against the popular will shall ultimately be spurned by public opinion.","民进党当局破坏两岸教育和青年学生正常交流无所不用其极，充分暴露其阻碍两岸人员往来和各项交流合作，升高两岸对立对抗的险恶用心。\n事实一再证明，民进党当局是两岸交流交往的最大障碍，是台海和平稳定的最大威胁。要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是岛内社会主流民意，两岸同胞走亲走近的愿望、两岸交流合作的大势不可阻挡。任何开历史倒车、违逆民心民意的行径，终将被民意所唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784582.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","上海东方卫视记者","The Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season Shanghai Station event opened yesterday (August 25). The Mainland Affairs Council said of this that \"exchanges are exchanges; do not echo the CCP's narratives and positions,\" and that it will continue to pay attention to this event. What is your comment on this?","Strengthening cooperation and exchanges between compatriots on both sides of the Strait is an unstoppable historical tide and is also in line with mainstream public opinion on the island. In particular, young people on both sides of the Strait shoulder the hope of the country and the future of the nation; letting them strengthen exchanges and enhance understanding is a \"Project Hope\" for the country's strength and the nation's rejuvenation that benefits the present and will be meritorious for millennia. We advise the DPP authorities to listen more to the voice of mainstream public opinion on the island, do more things that benefit cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, and do fewer things that sabotage and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation.","两岸同胞加强合作和交流是不可阻挡的历史潮流，也符合岛内主流民意。尤其是两岸青年肩负着国家的希望、民族的未来，让他们加强交流、增进理解，对于国家强盛、民族复兴是利在当下、功在千秋的“希望工程”。奉劝民进党当局多倾听岛内主流民意心声，多做有利于两岸交流合作之事，少做对两岸交流合作破坏阻挠之举。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Recently, district prosecutors' offices across Taiwan have one after another sent election investigation and awareness letters to village and borough chief elections in their jurisdictions, including content such as \"mainland election interference\" and \"must not violate the Anti-Infiltration Act.\" Public opinion on the island considers this to be \"intimidation in the name of awareness-raising,\" while the Mainland…","Every time there is an election on the island, the DPP deliberately manipulates \"resisting China and protecting Taiwan\" and slanders the mainland with \"mainland election interference\" to seek political self-interest. This time it has again not hesitated to use prosecutorial and investigative organs and judicial means to threaten and intimidate the public and create a \"green terror\" on a large scale. This despicable practice of the DPP has been seen through and spurned by more and more people in Taiwan.","每逢岛内选举，民进党就刻意操弄“抗中保台”、诬蔑“大陆介选”，以谋取政治私利。这次又不惜动用检调机关和司法手段威胁恐吓民众、大肆制造“绿色恐怖”。民进党这种卑劣的做法已经被越来越多的台湾民众看穿和唾弃。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","A few days ago, the website of the General Administration of Customs announced the registration of a new batch of Taiwan wentan pomelo packing plants and orchards. Please explain the relevant situation.","We have always upheld the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family\" and done our utmost to do practical things, do good things and solve difficult problems for Taiwan compatriots. Since the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee was authorized in April this year to release ten measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, relevant parties on both sides of the Strait, on the political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" have pushed for the measures to be implemented in detail and achieved positive results. On the premise of complying with the mainland's relevant inspection and quarantine regulations, we welcome more high-quality Taiwan products to be sold to the mainland, so that compatriots on both sides of the Strait share the dividends of the peaceful development and integrated development of cross-Strait relations.","我们一贯秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事。今年4月中央台办受权发布十项促进两岸交流合作的措施以来，两岸有关方面在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”政治基础上，推动各项措施落实落细，取得了积极成效。在符合大陆相关检验检疫规定的前提下，我们欢迎更多台湾优质产品销往大陆，让两岸同胞共享两岸关系和平发展、融合发展的红利。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202608/t20260826_12784586.htm"],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","Regarding the Taiwan Affairs Office spokesperson's criticism of the DPP authorities for forcibly curtailing mainland students going to Taiwan for study programs, the Mainland Affairs Council responded that the policy on mainland study-program students going to Taiwan is consistent and this is not a problem at all; what Taiwan lacks is degree students, and it is the mainland side that does not let students go to…","This statement purely confuses black and white. In recent years, the DPP authorities have wantonly obstructed cross-Strait exchanges, ignored the strong desire of Taiwan's education circles and young students to take part in cross-Strait exchanges, and suppressed and restricted cross-Strait educational exchanges and cooperation to the utmost. As everyone knows, they prohibit colleges and universities on the island from exchanges and cooperation with 10 mainland schools including Jinan University and Beihang University, obstruct educational exchanges and cooperation between universities, secondary and primary schools on both sides of the Strait under various pretexts, and impose many unreasonable measures and restrictions on mainland students studying in Taiwan in areas such as scholarships, internships and health insurance, giving them much unfair treatment and seriously harming the rights and interests of mainland students studying in Taiwan.\nWhat the DPP authorities have done is the fundamental obstacle affecting mainland students going to Taiwan to study. The DPP authorities' bans, restrictions and encirclement of cross-Strait educational exchanges have aroused widespread opposition in the island's education circles. We advise the DPP authorities to stop political manipulation as soon as possible, earnestly safeguard the rights and interests of mainland students in Taiwan, and restore normal cross-Strait educational exchanges.","这种说法纯属颠倒黑白。近年来，民进党当局对两岸交流横加阻挠，无视台湾教育界和青年学生参与两岸交流的强烈愿望，他们对两岸教育交流合作极尽打压、限控。众所周知，他们禁止岛内大专院校与暨南大学、北京航空航天大学等10所大陆学校交流合作，以各种名目阻挠两岸大中小学教育交流合作等，对大陆学生赴台就读在奖学金、实习、健保等方面设置多种不合理措施和限制、给予诸多不公平的对待，严重损害在台就读陆生的权益。\n民进党当局所作所为是影响大陆学生赴台就读的根本障碍。民进党当局对两岸教育交流的禁限围堵已引起岛内教育界的普遍反对。奉劝民进党当局，尽快停止政治操弄，切实保障在台陆生权益，恢复两岸正常教育交流。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","福建厦门卫视记者","Recently, Xiamen, Fujian released new measures to promote exchanges and cooperation with Taiwan, including advancing construction of the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge (Xiamen section) and striving to open the main line over the sea to traffic by the end of this year, and simultaneously advancing study of plans for the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge (Kinmen section). Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council said that the issue of a…","Building the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge is the common call and urgent wish of the people of Xiamen and Kinmen. The \"Opinions of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path for Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Demonstration Zone for Cross-Strait Integrated Development\" released in 2023 clearly proposed to \"explore a model for Xiamen-Kinmen cooperation in jointly building infrastructure, and accelerate connecting Kinmen with electricity, gas and a bridge.\" Among these, the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge (Xiamen section) project began construction in October 2023 and is currently advancing in an orderly manner. After the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge opens to traffic along its entire length, it will bring convenience to interactions between the people of the two places and add impetus to Kinmen's economic development and improvement of livelihoods, and Xiamen and Kinmen will become a closer \"same-city living circle.\" After the bridge is built, water, electricity and gas can be delivered to Kinmen through pipelines in the bridge body, improving Kinmen's development environment, and it will also complement the maritime \"mini three links\" shipping routes and others, adding passageways between Xiamen and Kinmen. The DPP authorities should face squarely the interests and demands of the people of Kinmen, stop political calculation, truly seek benefits for the people, and support the early completion and opening of the Xiamen-Kinmen Bridge.","建设厦金大桥是厦金两地民众的共同呼声和迫切心愿。2023年发布的《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》明确提出，要“探索厦金合作共建基础设施模式，加快推进与金门通电、通气、通桥”。其中，厦金大桥（厦门段）工程于2023年10月动工，目前正在有序推进。厦金大桥全线通车后，将为两地民众往来带来便利，为金门经济发展、民生改善增添动力，厦金两地将成为更紧密的“同城生活圈”。大桥建成后，可通过桥体管道实现向金门输送水、电、燃气，改善金门发展环境，还将与海上“小三通”通航等形成互补，增加厦金通行通道。民进党当局应正视金门乡亲的利益诉求，停止政治算计，真正为民谋利，支持厦金大桥早日建成通车。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","To remedy the decline of the Penghu tourism market, the Penghu County Tourism Association recently called on the Mainland Affairs Council hoping to restart the Penghu \"mini three links.\" The DPP authorities responded that, considering security issues and the continued harassment of Taiwan by mainland military aircraft and vessels, there is currently no plan to open the Penghu \"mini three links.\" What is your…","The \"mini three links\" routes are one of the most important and most convenient channels for exchanges and interactions between the people of both sides of the Strait, especially between Fujian and Taiwan. They are a livelihood channel and a kinship route connecting the people of both sides of the Strait, and have played an important role in deepening cross-Strait integrated development and enhancing the interests and well-being of the people. We have actively promoted the resumption of travel by residents of Shanghai and Fujian to Kinmen and Matsu, which has been warmly welcomed by the people of Taiwan. Since August 2024, residents of Shanghai and Fujian have made a cumulative total of about 350,000 trips to Kinmen and Matsu via the \"mini three links\" routes.\nThe mainland side has always upheld the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family\" and made continuous efforts to promote cross-Strait personnel interactions. The DPP authorities disregard public opinion and engage in political manipulation, which is unpopular.","“小三通”航线是两岸特别是闽台民众交流往来最重要、最便捷的通道之一，是连接两岸民众的民生通道、亲情航线，为深化两岸融合发展和增进民众利益福祉发挥了重要作用。我们积极推动恢复上海、福建居民赴金门、马祖旅游，受到台湾民众的热烈欢迎。2024年8月以来，上海、福建居民通过“小三通”航线，赴金门、马祖旅游累计约35万人次。\n大陆方面始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，为推动两岸人员往来持续努力。民进党当局罔顾民意、政治操弄，不得人心。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities in various fields.","Recently, exchanges across the Strait in all fields have continued to be lively.\nIn terms of economic and trade exchanges, from August 13 to 15, the 15th Cross-Strait Hospital Presidents Forum was held in Hangzhou, Zhejiang, jointly seeking a path for collaborative innovative development of cross-Strait healthcare. More than 650 people from both sides of the Strait attended, including 250 Taiwan compatriots from more than 100 related associations and institutions. From August 17 to 19, the second Cross-Strait \"Three Teas\" Development Forum was held in Xiamen, Fujian, attended by more than 200 experts and scholars, tea enterprise representatives and intangible cultural heritage inheritors from both sides of the Strait. From August 18 to 20, the fifth Cross-Strait (Sanming) Rural Integrated Development Forum was held in Sanming, Fujian; about 600 Taiwan compatriots were invited to attend, and 27 Sanming-Taiwan cooperation results in seven fields were released. From August 20 to 23, the 2026 Henan-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair and cross-Strait intelligent equipment manufacturing matchmaking event was held in Hebi, Henan, where representatives of relevant industries from both sides of the Strait held discussions and exchanges and cooperation matchmaking. From August 26 to September 1, the second Guizhou-Taiwan Youth Big Data Industry Development Exchange Week, \"Data Speaks Guizhou's Colors, Jointly Promoting Integration,\" was held in Guizhou.\nIn terms of cultural exchanges, from August 15 to 19, the second Cross-Strait Folk Culture and Sports Gathering South China Sea (Yangjiang) Fishing Season Opening folk culture exchange event was held in Yangjiang, Guangdong, attended by more than 600 guests and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait. From August 16 to 20, the Cross-Strait (Zherong) Ma Xian Belief and Custom Culture Activity Week was held in Ningde, Fujian, attended by more than 100 Taiwan compatriots including Taiwanese experts and scholars, Taoist temples and believers. From August 18 to 21, the fifth Straits Poetry and Couplet Culture Exchange event was held in Putian, Fujian, with more than 200 people from poetry circles on both sides of the Strait gathering on Meizhou Island. On August 20, the fourth Cross-Strait Youth Grand Canal Culture Exchange event opened in Tianjin. From August 20 to 27, the \"Music Moves Haicang\" 2026 Cross-Strait (Xiamen) Folk Music Exchange series was held in Haicang, Xiamen. From August 21 to 23, the ninth Nan'an Zheng Chenggong Culture Activity Week was held in Nan'an, Quanzhou, Fujian, the hometown of Zheng Chenggong, with more than 400 Taiwanese guests invited to attend; during the same period, the third \"Soul of Minnan\" Minnan-language choral art showcase was held in Zhangzhou, Fujian, where more than 200 Taiwan compatriots from 6 Taiwanese choirs performed classic Minnan-language songs in chorus together with 20 local choirs. From August 21 to 27, the \"Father's Grassland, Mother's River\" music collecting trip for compatriots on both sides of the Strait was held in Inner Mongolia. From August 22 to 27, the \"Seeking Roots in Minnan, Scholarly Fragrance Across the Strait\" 2026 Cross-Strait (Fujian) Academy Culture Exchange event was held in Xiamen, Fujian.\nIn terms of youth exchanges, on August 20, the \"Realizing Dreams in the Greater Bay Area, Integrating to Create the Future\" cross-Strait youth theme exchange camp was launched in Shenzhen, attended by more than 120 youth representatives from both sides of the Strait, who gained an immersive understanding of the Greater Bay Area's development achievements in fields such as information technology, artificial intelligence and cultural creativity. From August 21 to 28, the \"Entering Wuhu, Feeling the Hometown Affection\" summer camp for young Taiwan compatriots was held in Wuhu, Anhui. From August 26 to 29, the \"Youth Looking Toward Kinship, Nourishing Hearts and Walking Together\" cross-Strait youth volunteer service exchange event was held in Suqian, Jiangsu.","近期，两岸各领域交流持续热络。\n经贸交流方面，8月13日至15日，第十五届海峡两岸医院院长论坛在浙江杭州举办，共寻两岸医疗协同创新发展之路。两岸650余人参会，包括来自100多家相关协会和机构的250名台胞。8月17日至19日，第二届海峡两岸三茶发展论坛在福建厦门举办，200多位两岸专家学者、茶企代表、非遗传承人参加。8月18日至20日，第五届海峡两岸（三明）乡村融合发展论坛在福建三明举办，约600名台胞受邀参会，发布了七个领域27项明台合作成果。8月20日至23日，2026年豫台经贸洽谈会暨两岸智能装备制造对接活动在河南鹤壁举办，两岸相关行业产业代表进行研讨交流和合作对接。8月26日至9月1日，“数说黔彩·共促融合”第二届黔台青年大数据产业发展交流周在贵州举办。\n文化交流方面，8月15日至19日，第二届海峡两岸民俗文体汇南海（阳江）开渔季民俗文化交流活动在广东阳江举办，600余位两岸嘉宾及青年代表参加。8月16日至20日，海峡两岸（柘荣）马仙信俗文化活动周在福建宁德举办，台湾专家学者、道教宫庙、信众等100多名台胞参加。8月18日至21日，第五届海峡诗词楹联文化交流活动在福建莆田举办，200多名两岸诗词界人士相聚在湄洲岛。8月20日，第四届两岸青年大运河文化交流活动在天津开幕。8月20日至27日，“乐动海沧”2026年海峡两岸（厦门）民乐交流系列活动在厦门海沧举办。8月21日至23日，第九届南安郑成功文化活动周在郑成功故里福建泉州南安举办，400多位台湾嘉宾受邀参加；同期，第三届“闽南魂”闽南语合唱艺术展演在福建漳州举办，6支台湾合唱团200余名台胞与当地20支合唱团以合唱形式演绎闽南语经典曲目。8月21日至27日，“父亲的草原母亲的河”两岸同胞音乐采风活动在内蒙古举办。8月22日至27日，“寻根闽南·书香两岸”2026年海峡两岸（福建）书院文化交流活动在福建厦门举办。\n青年交流方面，8月20日，“圆梦大湾区 融合创未来”海峡两岸青年主题交流营活动在深圳启动，两岸120多名青年代表参加，沉浸式了解大湾区在信息技术、人工智能、文化创意等领域的发展成就。8月21日至28日，“走进芜湖 感受乡情”青少年台胞夏令营活动在安徽芜湖举办。8月26日至29日，“青望亲好 润心同行”两岸青年志愿服务交流活动在江苏宿迁举办。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中国网记者","The 2026 Cross-Strait Relations Symposium opened in Wuhan on the 20th, and a number of Taiwanese scholars were invited to attend. Please describe the relevant situation.","The 2026 Cross-Strait Relations Symposium was held in Wuhan, Hubei from August 20 to 21, and more than 160 relevant figures, experts and scholars from both sides of the Taiwan Strait took part in this important cross-Strait academic exchange event.\nWith the theme \"Holding Fast to the Nation's Great Cause, Jointly Pursuing the Great Undertaking of Rejuvenation,\" the symposium's participants held in-depth discussions on topics such as \"Firmly holding the correct identity, guarding our common homeland\" and \"Deepening exchanges and integration, cultivating the kinship and well-being of compatriots.\" Participants said one after another that General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at the conference celebrating the 105th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China pointed the direction for the development of cross-Strait relations; that the mainland has successfully blazed a path of Chinese-style modernization, and its economic development has strong momentum and abundant vitality, opening broad prospects for the development of cross-Strait relations and national rejuvenation; they held that compatriots on both sides of the Strait are one family and should strive together for national rejuvenation and national reunification; and they stressed that compatriots on both sides of the Strait should resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, expand cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in all fields, continually enhance the kinship and well-being of compatriots, safeguard peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait, and guard well the common great homeland of the Chinese nation.","2026年两岸关系研讨会于8月20日至21日在湖北武汉举行，海峡两岸有关人士和专家学者160余人参加了这一两岸重要学术交流活动。\n研讨会以“坚守民族大义 共谋复兴伟业”为主题，与会代表围绕“坚定正确认同 守护共同家园”“深化交流融合 厚植亲情福祉”等议题进行深入研讨。大家纷纷表示，习近平总书记在庆祝中国共产党成立105周年大会上的重要讲话，为两岸关系发展指明方向；大陆成功走出一条中国式现代化道路，经济发展具有强劲动能和充沛活力，为两岸关系发展和民族复兴开辟了广阔前景；认为两岸同胞是一家人，要为民族复兴、国家统一共同打拼；强调两岸同胞应坚决反对“台独”分裂，扩大两岸各领域交流合作，持续增进同胞亲情福祉，维护台海和平稳定，守护好中华民族共同的大家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","北京日报记者","Recently, the concert \"Echoes of Mountains and Seas, Singing Together Through Four Seasons: Classic Voices of Cross-Strait Folk Songs\" was held in Beijing and drew an enthusiastic response on site. Please describe the relevant situation.","The concert \"Echoes of Mountains and Seas, Singing Together Through Four Seasons: Classic Voices of Cross-Strait Folk Songs,\" jointly hosted by the Movie Channel, China Arts and Entertainment Group Ltd. and Phoenix Satellite Television, was recently held successfully in Beijing. With \"one continuous land of mountains and rivers, singing together through four seasons\" as its core narrative, the concert was jointly created by professional teams from both sides of the Strait, and more than 20 well-known artists from both sides of the Strait and nearly 300 members of choirs and symphony orchestras from both sides of the Strait took part in the performance. Together they sang classic melodies, jointly praising the splendid mountains and rivers and the turning of the four seasons of the Chinese land, expressing the theme \"Let Chinese culture shine in the hearts of Chinese people on both sides of the Strait,\" paying tribute to the spirit of \"singing Chinese people's own songs\" of Taiwan's folk song movement 50 years ago, and enhancing the shared memory and emotional resonance of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. The concert will be produced for broadcast; please stay tuned.","由电影频道、中国对外文化集团有限公司、凤凰卫视联合主办的“山海回响 四季同歌——两岸民歌经典之声”音乐会近日在北京成功举办。音乐会以“一脉山河、四季同歌”为核心叙事，两岸专业团队共同创作，20多位两岸知名艺人和近300位两岸合唱团及交响乐团人员参加演出。大家携手唱响经典旋律，共同歌咏中华大地的锦绣河山、四季流转，表达“让中华文化在两岸中国人心中闪光”的主题，致敬50年前台湾民歌运动“唱中国人自己的歌”的精神，增进两岸同胞的共同记忆和情感共鸣。音乐会将制作播出，敬请期待。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","中国日报记者","Malaysian Prime Minister Anwar said in a recent interview that Taiwan is part of China, and that if a state of Malaysia insisted on breaking away, he too would defend the sanctity and unity of the country. Taiwan's foreign affairs authority said of this that the remarks demean Taiwan's \"sovereignty\" and may adversely affect the confidence of Taiwan businesspeople investing in Malaysia. What is your comment on this?","We express appreciation for the relevant country's position of adhering to the one-China principle.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. There is no such thing as Taiwan's \"sovereignty\" at all. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance, spread \"Taiwan independence\" fallacies everywhere, and at every turn use economic, trade and investment ties to pressure relevant countries, which precisely exposes their nature of \"using the economy to seek independence.\"","我们对有关国家坚持一个中国原则的立场表示赞赏。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。台湾根本不存在什么“主权”。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，四处散布“台独”谬论，动辄拿经贸投资施压有关国家，恰恰暴露了其“以经谋独”的本质。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","The Mainland Affairs Council recently released its latest poll showing that 70% of people in Taiwan believe the mainland's dispatch of coast guard vessels to patrol the waters east of Taiwan is \"malicious.\" Although the mainland side has said the relevant law enforcement is a countermeasure against Japan's and the Philippines' \"maritime delimitation\" acts, the Taiwan side says it is using this to advance…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The mainland coast guard's conduct of law enforcement patrols and inspections in the relevant waters and exercise of jurisdiction in accordance with the law is a legitimate and just act to defend national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, ensure the safety of the lives and property of fishermen on both sides of the Strait, and maintain normal navigation and operational order in the relevant waters.\nThe DPP authorities designed and put out this poll with sinister intentions. The DPP authorities habitually use so-called \"gray-zone harassment\" to attack and smear the mainland, deliberately play up the \"mainland threat,\" incite \"anti-China, resist-China\" sentiment, and stir up cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. People on both sides of the Strait have expressed strong dissatisfaction with the despicable conduct of the DPP authorities in abandoning their own stance and betraying the interests of the nation.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。大陆海警在相关海域开展执法巡查、依法行使管辖权，是捍卫国家领土主权和海洋权益、保障两岸渔民生命财产安全、维护相关海域正常航行和作业秩序的正当正义之举。\n民进党当局设计并抛出这种民调，居心险恶。民进党当局惯用所谓“灰色地带的侵扰”攻击抹黑大陆，刻意渲染“大陆威胁”，煽动“反中抗中”情绪，挑动两岸对立对抗。两岸民众对民进党当局自丧立场、出卖民族利益的卑鄙行径表达强烈不满。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-08-26","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: following the claims that \"mainlanders cannot afford tea eggs\" and \"China's high-speed trains have no seat backs,\" recently someone on a program on the island claimed that \"Beijing doesn't even have refrigerators\" and \"Beijing people don't drink cold drinks.\" What is your comment on this? Does this reflect that, with the long-term lack of exchanges between the two sides of the Strait, there is…","The first question. Such statements divorced from the facts will only become a laughingstock. The DPP authorities ban, restrict and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, deliberately create an information cocoon on the island, and attempt to block the people of Taiwan from understanding the mainland, with sinister intentions. We welcome the people of Taiwan to break through the obstacles, come to the mainland more to walk around and have a look, and understand the real and lovable mainland.\nThe second question. During this year's Straits Forum, we held a matchmaking and signing ceremony for the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, helping Taiwan's agricultural and fishery products expand into the mainland market and letting Taiwan's farmers and fishermen truly share the dividends of cross-Strait peaceful development. After the signing ceremony, relevant parties on both sides of the Strait, on the political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" actively promoted the steady implementation of the signed items. A few days ago, the General Administration of Customs newly announced the registration of a batch of Taiwan wentan pomelo orchards and packing plants, making it easier for more Taiwan businesses to sell wentan pomelos to the mainland. We will continue to implement the ten measures and seek benefits and well-being for compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nThis concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。这种脱离事实的言论，只会沦为笑柄。民进党当局禁限阻挠两岸交流交往，在岛内蓄意制造信息茧房，企图封锁台湾民众了解大陆，用心险恶。我们欢迎台湾民众突破障碍，多来大陆走走看看，了解真实可爱的大陆。\n第二个问题。在今年海峡论坛期间，我们举办十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施对接签约会，帮助台湾农渔产品拓展大陆市场，让台湾农渔民实实在在共享两岸和平发展红利。签约会后，两岸有关方面在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”政治基础上，积极推动签约事项稳步落实。日前，海关总署新公布注册了一批台湾文旦柚果园和包装厂，便利更多台湾业者把文旦柚销往大陆。我们将持续落实十项措施，为两岸同胞谋利造福。\n今天的新闻发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202608/t20260826_12784575.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-08-27","Lin Jian","NHK","We have learned that a group of Japanese lawmakers visiting China met today with an official of the International Department of the CPC Central Committee. Could you provide more details about the meeting? Does the foreign ministry have any comment on it?","Chinese competent authorities will release information on the meeting in due course. The root cause of the serious difficulties in bilateral relations lies in the erroneous remarks and actions on Taiwan and in the fields of military and security made by those running the Japanese government. They should heed and value the voice of reason in Japan, do serious soul-searching, correct the wrongdoings, abide by the four political documents, and safeguard the political foundation of China-Japan relations with concrete actions.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202608/t20260827_12011637.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","According to media reports, the Taiwan administrative agency on August 20 passed the fiscal year 2027 general budget proposal. The DPP authorities in the Taiwan region have pegged overall so-called defense spending at NT$1.1225 trillion, up NT$173 billion from fiscal year 2026, an increase of 18.2% — the first time the figure has crossed the NT$1 trillion threshold and set a record high. The so-called defense…","Peace, development, exchanges and cooperation represent the mainstream public will in Taiwan society. The Lai Ching-te authorities, driven by the partisan and personal interests of the DPP alone, act against the tide—vainly currying favor with and pandering to external forces, recklessly squandering the people's hard-earned wealth, and rushing headlong down the reactionary path of arms expansion. This gravely undermines the livelihood and well-being of our compatriots on the island, will ultimately drain Taiwan's coffers, and the DPP authorities are bound to be spurned by the public and meet their defeat.","要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作，是台湾社会的主流民意。赖清德当局为一党之私逆势而为，竭力迎合讨好外部势力，肆意挥霍民脂民膏、穷兵黩武，极大损害岛内民生福祉，终将掏空台湾家底，难逃败亡结局。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","According to media outlets in Taiwan, China and Indonesia have carried out maritime exercises in waters to the east of Taiwan Island, which is a political manipulation to expand presence under the pretext of exercise. A US State Department spokesperson claimed that relevant countries should seek a peaceful resolution of the Taiwan question, instead of peddling narratives that the mainland may undermine peace and…","Taiwan is part of China. China has an exclusive economic zone and a continental shelf in waters to the east of Taiwan Island. The exercise conducted by the navies of China and Indonesia in the waters is completely justified, lawful, and necessary. It further enhances integrated combat capabilities and promotes pragmatic cooperation, which is conducive to maintaining regional peace and stability.","台湾是中国的一部分，中国在台湾岛以东海域拥有专属经济区和大陆架。中印尼两国海军舰艇在台岛以东海域开展演练，合理合法、正当必要，进一步提升了联合行动能力，深化了双方务实合作，有助于维护地区和平稳定。\n8月27日下午，国防部举行例行记者会，国防部新闻发言人张晓刚大校答记者问。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","I have two questions. Firstly, it was reported that Chinese Defense Minister Dong Jun recently paid a visit to Timor-Leste and went to Indonesia to attend the Second Ministerial Meeting of China-Indonesia Joint Foreign and Defense Ministerial Dialogue. Please share more information with us. Secondly, on August 23rd, Lai Ching-te claimed that the DPP authorities will not yield an inch of Taiwan, Penghu, Kinmen,…","On your first question, upon invitation, Defense Minister Dong Jun recently visited Timor-Leste and went to Indonesia for the Second Ministerial Meeting of China-Indonesia Joint Foreign and Defense Ministerial Dialogue. These are concrete steps implementing the important consensus between the leaders of China and Timor-Leste, and China and Indonesia. The visits will further deepen mutual trust on security and defense cooperation, and contribute to building a community with a shared future with neighboring countries.\nThe relationship between China and Timor-Leste is stronger than ever before. During this first Chinese defense minister's visit to Timor-Leste, Minister Dong Jun held separate meetings with the President and the Prime Minister of Timor-Leste. The two sides had in-depth exchanges on bilateral relations and military-to-military ties, the international and regional situation, and other issues of shared interest. They agreed to further deepen defense cooperation in both bilateral and multilateral formats, and elevate the military-to-military relationship to a higher level.\nIn recent years, bilateral defense cooperation between China and Indonesia has improved in both quality and efficiency, setting an example for new-type defense cooperation among the Global South and major developing countries. China will work with Indonesia to advance cooperation in defense and military development from a strategic perspective, further tap the potential of defense cooperation, and promote regular and institutionalized cooperation on defense equipment and technology, joint exercises and training, personnel training, and maritime security. The two sides will continue these efforts to provide solid security safeguards for their respective development, play a key role in regional stability, and inject more stability, certainty, and constructive factors into a world marked by transformation and disruption.\nOn your second question, there is but one China in the world, and Taiwan, Penghu, Kinmen, and Matsu are all parts of China. Peace, development, exchange, and cooperation are the common aspirations of compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. Lai Ching-te's deliberate distortion of history and his attempts to stir up cross-strait confrontation and antagonism go against the will of the people and will find no support. We hope that our fellow compatriots in the Taiwan region will join hands with us to oppose and strike the \"Taiwan independence separatist forces, firmly oppose interference by external forces, resolutely advance the great cause of national reunification, and work together for peace across the Taiwan Strait and for the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.","关于第一个问题，国防部长董军应邀访问东帝汶，赴印尼出席中印尼外长防长“2+2”对话机制第二次部长级会议，这是落实中东、中印尼领导人重要共识的务实举措，进一步深化安全互信与防务合作，服务构建周边命运共同体。\n当前中东关系迈入历史最好时期，这也是中国防长首次访问东帝汶。董军部长分别与东帝汶总统、总理举行会见会谈，就两国两军关系、国际地区形势以及共同关心的问题深入交换意见，双方将进一步深化双多边防务合作，把两军关系推向更高水平。\n近年来，中印尼防务合作提质增效，为全球南方、发展中大国开展新型防务合作提供范例。中方将与印尼一道，坚持以战略眼光推进国防和军队建设合作，深挖防务合作潜能，推动装备技术、联演联训、人员培训、海上安全等务实合作常态化机制化发展，不断提高质量效益，为各自发展筑牢安全屏障，为地区稳定发挥中坚作用，为变乱交织的世界注入更多稳定性、确定性、建设性。\n关于第二个问题，世界上只有一个中国，台、澎、金、马是中国的一部分，要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是两岸同胞的共同心声。赖清德蓄意曲解历史，挑动两岸对立对抗不得人心。希望广大台湾同胞与我们一道，坚决打击“台独”分裂势力，反对外部势力干涉，坚定推进祖国统一大业，共同为台海谋和平、为民族谋复兴。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","According to media reports, several Japanese politicians visited the Yasukuni Shrine, which enshrines Class-A war criminals, on August 15th, the anniversary of Japan's surrender. Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi offered a ritual offering fee. Rather than condemning the move, the DPP authorities in Taiwan went so far as to claim that they respect the diverse views in Japanese society on historical issues. What's your…","The Yasukuni Shrine is a veritable shrine for war criminals and a house for summoning the soul of militarism. Japanese politicians' repeated collective \"worship of the dead\" tramples wantonly on the feelings of people across the Asia-Pacific, grossly profanes historical justice, and lays bare the true nature of Japan's right-wing forces, who cling to the obsession of reviving militarism and the inherent instinct for external aggression and expansion. The international community must heighten its vigilance and firmly check such moves.\nBeyond the 14 convicted Class A war criminals, the shrine also honors war criminals such as Rikichi Ando and Nogi Maresuke, whose hands were stained with the blood of our compatriots in Taiwan. The DPP authorities in the Taiwan region, by fawning over Japan and worshipping the colonizer while treating the aggressor as kin, have sunk to a despicable low. We hope the broad mass of Taiwan compatriots will stand as upright Chinese nationals, firmly oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, and actively join the just cause of the motherland's peaceful reunification.","靖国神社是名副其实的“战犯神社”、军国主义招魂所。日本政客一再集体“拜鬼”，肆意践踏亚太人民感情，严重亵渎历史正义，也让日本右翼势力复活军国主义执念、对外侵略扩张本性暴露无疑。国际社会对此应高度警惕、坚决遏制。\n靖国神社不仅供奉着14名甲级战犯，还有双手沾满台湾同胞鲜血的安藤利吉、乃木希典等战犯。民进党当局媚日恋殖、认贼作父，令人不齿。希望广大台湾同胞做堂堂正正的中国人，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外部势力干涉，积极参与到祖国和平统一的正义事业中来。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","According to data published by Taiwan's defense authorities, their troops have detected 1,334 sorties of PLA military aircraft in the first half of this year. The number has fallen by more than half year-on-year. During this period, the PLA has not carried out any large military exercises around the island. But the Chinese government vessels have stepped up their operations in the waters around Taiwan. Some…","China's national reunification is an overwhelming historical trend. As we build a great country and advance national rejuvenation, we will enhance our capability to resolve the Taiwan question and have stronger capabilities and more reliable means at our disposal. No matter how many exercises they carry out, the doomed fate of \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces can never be changed. The PLA will temper and sharpen its combat capabilities, serve as a powerful guarantee for national reunification, resolutely smash any \"Taiwan independence\" separatist plot, and firmly safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity.","祖国统一的历史大势不可阻挡。随着强国建设、民族复兴进程全面推进，我们解决台湾问题的能力会更强、手段会更丰富。民进党当局搞再多演习都改变不了“台独”必亡的下场。解放军全面砺练过硬本领，当好祖国统一的稳固底牌，坚决挫败任何形式的“台独”分裂图谋，捍卫国家主权和领土完整。\n8月27日下午，国防部举行例行记者会，国防部新闻发言人张晓刚大校答记者问。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-08-27","Zhang Xiaogang","","According to Taiwan media, the first two single-seat fighters from the 66 brand-new F-16V Block 70 jets the DPP authorities in the Taiwan region bought from the US under the so-called \"Feng Xiang Project\" are about to be handed over to the Taiwan side. What's your comment on that?","China firmly opposes US arms sales to China's Taiwan region. This position is consistent and unequivocal. \"Taiwan independence\" is utterly incompatible with peace in the Taiwan Strait. Arming Taiwan to abet \"Taiwan independence\" separatists will only lead to playing with fire and getting burned, and leave them to taste the bitter fruit of their own making. We urge the US side to honor the one-China principle and the provisions of the three China-US joint communiqués, particularly the August 17th Communiqué of 1982, stop arming Taiwan in whatever form, and stop disrupting cross-Strait peace and stability.","中方坚决反对美对台售武的立场是一贯的、明确的。“台独”与台海和平水火不容，“以武助独”只会引火烧身。我们要求美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，特别是“八·一七”公报规定，立即停止以任何方式武装台湾，停止破坏台海和平稳定。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16483651.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzhzt/2026lxjzh/2026n8y/16481856.html",1,1,4,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on September 2, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Good morning, friends of the press, and welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please go ahead with your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好，欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。下面请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","Recently, the 30th Shandong-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair was held in Shandong, with active participation by Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On August 31, the 30th Shandong-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair, co-hosted by the Shandong Provincial People's Government and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, opened in Weifang, Shandong. About 800 people from all sectors on both sides of the Strait attended the event, including Zhang Ping, vice chairman of the mainland side of the Cross-Strait CEO Summit; Song Tao, director of the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council; Lin Wu, secretary of the Shandong Provincial Party Committee; Hsiao Hsu-tsen, vice chairman of the Kuomintang; Mao Chi-kuo, vice chairman of the Taiwan side of the Cross-Strait CEO Summit; Lee Cheng-hung, president of the Association of Taiwan Investment Enterprises on the Mainland; Hsu Shu-po, chairman of the General Chamber of Commerce of the ROC; and Lei Hung-yi, chairman of the Taiwan Industrial and Commercial Development Research Association.\nSince 1994, the Shandong-Taiwan Economic and Trade Fair has been held 30 times and is one of the longest-running cross-Strait economic and trade exchange activities. This session of the Shandong-Taiwan Fair carried out 6 thematic matchmaking sessions in fields such as modern agriculture, green chemicals, the marine economy, intelligent manufacturing, youth entrepreneurship and vocational education, organized a number of exchange activities at sub-venues in Zibo, Jining, Dezhou, Heze and elsewhere, and reached a series of cooperation outcomes. Enterprises, associations and universities of the two places signed 7 cooperation agreements or memorandums covering park construction, joint-venture operation, scientific and technological cooperation and other areas, and 1 school-enterprise innovation practice base was inaugurated.\nDuring the event, the Shandong side also launched 11 policy measures to support the development of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises in Shandong during the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period, covering project investment, agricultural cooperation, scientific and technological innovation, financial services and other aspects, to support Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises in better integrating into Shandong's economic and social development, achieving greater and better development of their own, and opening up a new situation in Shandong-Taiwan economic and trade cooperation.","8月31日，由山东省人民政府和国务院台办共同主办的第30届鲁台经贸洽谈会在山东潍坊开幕。两岸企业家峰会大陆方面副理事长张平，中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛，山东省委书记林武，中国国民党副主席萧旭岑，两岸企业家峰会台湾方面副理事长毛治国，全国台企联会长李政宏，台湾商业总会理事长许舒博，台湾工商建研会理事长雷宏毅等约800位两岸各界人士出席活动。\n鲁台经贸洽谈会自1994年起已举办30届，是举办时间最长的两岸经贸交流活动之一。本届鲁台会在现代农业、绿色化工、海洋经济、智能制造、青年创业、职业教育等领域开展了6项专题对接，在淄博、济宁、德州、菏泽等分会场组织多场交流活动，达成一系列合作成果。两地企业、协会、高校签署园区建设、合资经营、科技合作等方面合作协议或备忘录7个，揭牌成立校企创新实践基地1个。\n活动期间，山东方面还推出“十五五”时期支持台商台企在鲁发展11条政策措施，涵盖项目投资、农业合作、科技创新、金融服务等方面，支持台商台企更好融入山东经济社会发展，实现自身更大更好发展，开创鲁台经贸合作新局面。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记者","On August 26, a mudslide occurred on the Nepal side, causing casualties and missing persons at the Gyirong port of Xigaze City, Tibet. After the disaster, Kuomintang Chairwoman Cheng Li-wun, people from all sectors in Taiwan, and Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises on the mainland expressed concern and sympathy one after another and donated money to the disaster-hit area and people. What is your response to…","After the mudslide disaster in Gyirong County, Xigaze City, Tibet, General Secretary Xi Jinping attached great importance to it and gave important instructions, and Premier Li Qiang, entrusted by General Secretary Xi Jinping, went to the disaster area to guide rescue and relief work. We have activated a national Level II disaster relief emergency response, all parties are going all out to organize rescue, and we are doing our utmost to safeguard the safety of the people's lives and property.\nIt is understood that so far no Taiwan compatriots have been killed, injured or gone missing in the disaster. We will continue to follow and pay attention to the situation of Taiwan compatriots in the area and provide necessary assistance in a timely manner. People from all sectors in Taiwan and Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises on the mainland have expressed concern and sympathy in various forms, reflecting the compatriot feeling across the Strait that blood is thicker than water and of watching out for and helping one another. We express our heartfelt thanks for this.\nRecently, southern Taiwan has been hit by repeated heavy rainfall in succession, seriously affecting the production and lives of local people. We express our sympathy to the compatriots affected by the disaster and are willing to provide help, and we hope they restore normal order of production and life as soon as possible.","西藏日喀则市吉隆县泥石流灾害发生后，习近平总书记高度重视并作出重要指示，李强总理受习近平总书记委托前往灾区指导抢险救灾工作。我们已启动国家二级救灾应急响应，各方面全力组织救援，尽最大努力维护人民群众生命财产安全。\n据了解，截至目前没有台胞因灾伤亡、失联情况。我们会持续跟进关注当地台胞情况并及时提供必要协助。台湾各界人士和在大陆的台胞台企通过多种形式表达关心慰问，体现了两岸血浓于水、守望相助的同胞之情。我们对此表示衷心感谢。\n近期台湾南部遭受连续多次强降雨，严重影响当地民众的生产生活。我们对受灾同胞表示慰问并愿提供帮助，希望他们尽快恢复正常的生产生活秩序。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785959.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, Xiamen, Fujian set up the first batch of \"Taiwan Compatriot Financial Service Centers\" to make it convenient for Taiwan compatriots to handle finance-related business, which have been welcomed by local Taiwan compatriots. Please introduce the relevant situation.","To implement the \"Opinions of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path for Integrated Development Across the Strait and Building a Demonstration Zone for Cross-Strait Integrated Development,\" Xiamen has relied on bank outlets to set up \"Taiwan Compatriot Financial Service Centers.\" The first batch of 10 outlets are located at airports and ferry terminals, tourist attractions, major business districts, government service points, Taiwan business association halls and other places that Taiwan compatriots frequently visit. Centered on the practical needs of Taiwan compatriots for sightseeing and for settling down and working in peace, the service centers are equipped with integrated services and standardized processes, making it convenient for Taiwan compatriots to handle all kinds of financial business such as opening accounts, currency exchange, mobile payment, fund remittance, buying homes and property, and wealth management and starting businesses. This better meets the financial needs of Taiwan compatriots living and developing in Xiamen, and builds a home of financial services for Taiwan compatriots that is exclusive to Taiwan compatriots, proactively connecting, integrated in one stop, standardized in process, and tangible and accessible.","为贯彻落实《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》，厦门市依托银行网点，设立“台胞金融服务中心”，首批10家网点布设在机场码头、旅游景点、各大商圈、政务服务点、台商会馆等台胞经常到访的地方。服务中心围绕台胞旅游观光和安居乐业等实际需要，配套集成化服务、标准化流程，便利台胞办理账户开立、现金兑换、移动支付、资金汇兑、购房置业以及理财创业等各类金融业务，更好满足台胞在厦门生活发展的金融需要，打造台胞专属、主动对接、一站集成、标准流程、可感可及的台胞金融服务家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","Not long ago, the website of the General Administration of Customs announced the registration of a new batch of Taiwan wendan pomelo packing plants and orchards, which attracted attention on the island. Will wendan pomelos from more Taiwan counties and cities be approved for import into the mainland?","In April this year, the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee released under authorization ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, including facilitating the import into the mainland of Taiwan agricultural and fishery products that meet inspection and quarantine standards. During this year's Straits Forum, we held a matchmaking and signing conference for the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, building a platform for Taiwan's specialty agricultural and fishery products to open up sales channels on the mainland. Following the announcement on August 25 of the registration of a batch of Taiwan wendan pomelo packing plants and orchards, the General Administration of Customs on September 1 announced the registration of another new batch of Taiwan wendan pomelo orchards and packing plants, making it convenient for more Taiwan businesses to sell wendan pomelos to the mainland.\nWe do our utmost to do practical things, do good things and solve difficult problems for Taiwan compatriots. On the political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" and on the premise of complying with the mainland's relevant inspection and quarantine regulations, we will work together with relevant parties on the island to help more Taiwan agricultural and fishery products and high-quality products enter tens of thousands of households on the mainland.","今年4月，中央台办受权发布十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，包括为符合检验检疫标准的台湾农渔产品输入大陆提供便利。今年海峡论坛期间，我们举办十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施对接签约会，为台湾特色农渔产品打开大陆销路搭建平台。继8月25日公布一批台湾文旦柚包装厂及果园注册后，海关总署9月1日又公布新一批台湾文旦柚果园和包装厂注册，为更多台湾业者把文旦柚销往大陆提供便利。\n我们尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事。在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”政治基础上，在符合大陆相关检验检疫规定前提下，我们将和岛内有关方面共同努力，帮助更多台湾农渔产品、优质产品进入大陆千家万户。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785960.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","Recently, Mainland Affairs Council deputy head Shen Yu-chung said the mainland has recently issued regulations on cyberspace and on exit and entry administration and others, with vague enforcement standards, and more negative impacts on cross-Strait exchanges cannot be ruled out. He said cross-Strait exchanges should be \"depoliticized, de-risked, healthy and orderly.\" What is your comment on this?","The relevant regulations have a legal basis and are open and transparent. The formulation of the measures on supervision and inspection of cyberspace security is conducive to strengthening the security protection of networks, data and personal information, jointly preventing telecom and online fraud and other illegal and criminal activities, and safeguarding national security and the public interest of society. The regulations on exit and entry administration are intended to regulate the mainland's exit and entry administration, protect the lawful rights and interests of persons exiting and entering, safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests, and also create a better rule-of-law environment for Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland.\nThe various claims of the DPP authorities are entirely deliberate misleading and intentional smears. Visiting each other often and having more exchanges is conducive to compatriots on both sides of the Strait enhancing understanding and promoting cooperation, and cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges have a strong internal driving force. The DPP authorities should go along with the will of the people and not use all kinds of means to interfere with and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation or incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation.","相关规定于法有据、公开透明。有关网络空间安全监督检查办法的制定有利于加强对网络、数据和个人信息的安全保护，共同防范电信网络诈骗等违法犯罪，维护国家安全和社会公共利益。关于出境入境管理的规定是为了规范大陆出境入境管理，保障出境入境人员的合法权益，维护国家主权、安全、发展利益，也为台湾同胞来大陆营造更好的法治环境。\n民进党当局的种种说辞完全是刻意误导、蓄意抹黑。常来常往、多交流，有利于两岸同胞增进了解、促进合作，两岸民间交流有着强大的内生动力。民进党当局应顺应民心民意，不要以种种手段干扰阻挠两岸交流合作、煽动两岸对立对抗。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785958.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","新华社记者","Recently, the Lai Ching-te authorities claimed that Taiwan's defense budget for 2027 will exceed NT$1 trillion for the first time, that \"all national defense resources must be converted into reliable defensive combat power,\" and that the mainland must not be allowed to misjudge \"Taiwan's determination to defend itself.\" What is your comment on this?","The Lai Ching-te authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist position of \"Taiwan independence,\" disregard the mainstream public opinion on the island of wanting peace, wanting development, wanting exchanges and wanting cooperation, single-mindedly incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, and lavishly squander the people's hard-earned money, vainly attempting to \"use force to resist reunification\" and \"seek independence by force.\" This is purely overestimating their own strength and will only bring deep disaster to the people of Taiwan.\nOur determination to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity is firm and unwavering, and our capability is incomparably strong; we will never leave any room for \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities in any form. We hope the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the extreme harmfulness and danger of \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts, and firmly safeguard the common home of the Chinese nation and their own security and well-being.","赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，罔顾岛内要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意，一味煽动两岸对立对抗，大肆挥霍民脂民膏，妄图“以武拒统”、“以武谋独”，纯属自不量力，只会给台湾民众带来深重灾难。\n我们捍卫国家主权和领土完整的决心坚定不移、能力无比强大，决不为任何形式的“台独”分裂活动留下任何空间。希望广大台湾同胞认清“台独”分裂的极端危害性和危险性，坚决反对“台独”分裂行径，坚定维护中华民族共同家园和自身安全福祉。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785961.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","中新社记者","Recently, the second World Humanoid Robot Games were held in Beijing, attracting wide global attention. Public opinion on the island has marveled that the mainland's robot technology is making great strides toward being more refined, more intelligent and more practical, with astonishing speed of iteration in many technologies, and holds that the two sides of the Strait should strengthen industrial cooperation in…","From hopping and jumping on the Spring Festival Gala stage, to repeatedly setting new records at the games, to entering application scenarios in production and daily life, the mainland's humanoid robots are an epitome of the deep integration and rapid development of the mainland's scientific and technological innovation and industrial innovation. The \"15th Five-Year Plan\" makes forward-looking arrangements for future industries such as embodied intelligence and brain-computer interfaces. With its complete industrial system, solid industrial foundation and rich application scenarios, the mainland will create broad room for development for Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises. We welcome Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises to come to the mainland to innovate and start businesses, participate in high-quality development, and jointly strengthen the economy of the Chinese nation.","大陆人形机器人从春晚舞台的蹦蹦跳跳，到运动会上屡创新纪录，再到走入生产生活的应用场景，这是大陆科技创新和产业创新深度融合、快速发展的缩影。“十五五”规划前瞻布局具身智能、脑机接口等未来产业，大陆凭借完整的产业体系、深厚的产业基础和丰富的应用场景，将为台胞台企创造广阔的发展空间。我们欢迎台胞台企来大陆创新创业，参与高质量发展，共同壮大中华民族经济。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785956.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","羊城晚报“阅台海”记者","Regarding the General Administration of Customs announcing a new batch of Taiwan wendan pomelo orchards and packing plants, the Mainland Affairs Council said that only those who meet political preconditions and conditions can obtain registration, that this approach is united front propaganda, and that cross-Strait agricultural product quarantine involves matters of public authority and must be communicated…","The import of Taiwan wendan pomelos into the mainland helps expand sales channels for the island's agricultural products and improve the well-being of Taiwan compatriots; it is a good and practical thing that benefits grassroots businesses on the island. The DPP has neither the intention nor the ability to help more grassroots people improve their interests and well-being, and instead single-mindedly spreads rumors and smears, fully exposing that they disregard people's livelihoods and have only their own selfish interests in mind. They will inevitably be opposed by the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots.","台湾文旦柚输入大陆有助于扩大岛内农产品销路、增进台湾同胞福祉，是惠及岛内基层业者的好事、实事。民进党无心也无力帮助更多基层民众增进利益福祉，反而一味造谣抹黑，充分暴露出他们罔顾民生，心中只有一己私利，必遭广大台湾同胞反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities.","Recently, cross-Strait exchanges in all fields have continued to be lively.\nIn terms of economic and trade exchanges, from September 2 to 5, the \"Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei Taiwan Businesspeople Jilin Tour\" event was held in Changchun, Jilin and other places. With the theme \"Gathering new momentum in the circle, Jilin and Taiwan toward the future,\" it featured on-site observation, industry promotion, economic and trade negotiation and other segments, helping the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises seize the opportunities of the revitalization and development of the Northeast. From September 3 to 6, the 17th Dongguan Taiwan Famous Products Expo will be held in Dongguan, Guangdong, in which the Taiwan specialty pavilion brings together 22 counties and cities on the island, displaying machinery and equipment, agricultural and fishery specialties and more. From September 6 to 10, the 18th \"Chongqing-Taiwan Week\" will be held in Chongqing, including a series of activities such as a seminar on cross-Strait information and communications cooperation and development and a seminar on cross-Strait youth pursuing dreams of employment and entrepreneurship in Chongqing.\nIn terms of cultural exchanges, from August 23 to September 2, the first Sichuan Ancient Tea Horse Road Photography Journey Experience Camp was held in Ya'an, Garze and other places in Sichuan, where photography enthusiasts from both sides of the Strait used the lens as a medium to set out together on a photographic creation journey of walking and seeking roots. From August 29 to 31, the 8th Cross-Strait Humanities Forum was held in Xiamen, Fujian, attended by experts and scholars from the fields of philosophy, literature, history and others on both sides of the Strait.\nIn terms of youth exchanges, from August 20 to 27, the 14th Straits Youth Gathering, the 2nd Cross-Strait (Fuzhou) Sports Protection and Rehabilitation Exchange Activity, and the \"Badminton Moves Youth, Hearts Tied Across the Strait\" Fujian-Taiwan youth badminton exchange series were held in Fuzhou, Fujian. On August 26, the \"Youth Qujiang, Zhejiang Shining Brightly, Youth in Dance\" cross-Strait street dance youth cultural exchange activity and the 3rd Cross-Strait Youth Street Dance Competition opened in Quzhou, Zhejiang. From August 26 to September 1, the \"Tiangong Kaiwu - An Appointment with Intangible Cultural Heritage\" 2026 Cross-Strait (Xinyu) Youth Exchange Activity was held in Xinyu, Jiangxi. On August 28, the 16th Cross-Strait (Binzhou) Young Students' Sun Tzu's Art of War Friendship Debate Competition began in Huimin, Shandong. From September 3 to 9, the 2026 4th Cross-Strait Youth Film Exhibition and Youth Filmmakers Training Camp will be held in Xiamen, Fujian.","近期，两岸各领域交流持续热络。\n经贸交流方面，9月2日至5日，“京津冀台商吉林行”活动在吉林长春等地举办，以“圈聚新动能 吉台向未来”为主题，设置实地观摩、产业推介、经贸洽谈等环节，助力广大台商台企把握东北振兴发展机遇。9月3日至6日，第十七届东莞台湾名品博览会将在广东东莞举行，其中台湾特色馆聚齐岛内22个县市，展示机械设备、农渔特产等。9月6日至10日，第十八届“重庆·台湾周”将在重庆举办，包括两岸信息通信合作发展研讨会、海峡两岸青年逐梦重庆就业创业研讨会等系列活动。\n文化交流方面，8月23日至9月2日，首届四川茶马古道摄影纪行体验营在四川雅安、甘孜等地举办，两岸摄影爱好者以镜头为媒，共赴行走寻根的摄影创作之旅。8月29日至31日，第八届海峡两岸人文学论坛在福建厦门举办，来自两岸哲学、文学、历史等领域专家学者出席。\n青年交流方面，8月20日至27日，第十四届海峡青年荟·第二届海峡两岸（福州）运动防护康复交流活动、“羽动青春 情系海峡”闽台青年羽毛球交流系列活动在福建福州举办。8月26日，“青年衢江·浙里华灿·舞动青春”两岸街舞青年文化交流活动暨第三届两岸青年街舞大赛在浙江衢州开幕。8月26日至9月1日，“天工开物·非遗之约”2026海峡两岸（新余）青年交流活动在江西新余举办。8月28日，第十六届海峡两岸（滨州）青年学生孙子兵法友谊辩论赛在山东惠民开赛。9月3日至9日，2026第四届海峡两岸青春影展·青春影人训练营将在福建厦门举办。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","Recently, the giant panda \"Yuan Yuan,\" gifted by the mainland to Taiwan, celebrated her 22nd birthday. The Taipei Zoo held a celebration for \"Yuan Yuan,\" which attracted the attention of netizens on both sides of the Strait, who sent their good wishes one after another. What is your comment on this?","Giant pandas are deeply loved by people on both sides of the Strait and are the embodiment of peace and friendship. In 2008, the giant pandas \"Tuan Tuan\" and \"Yuan Yuan\" went to Taiwan to make their home, and during their time in Taiwan successfully gave birth to the cubs \"Yuan Zai\" and \"Yuan Bao.\" Over the years, they have brought joy to Taiwan compatriots. Recently \"Yuan Yuan\" celebrated her 22nd birthday; here we send sincere birthday wishes to \"Yuan Yuan,\" and also wish the 2 panda babies healthy growth, so that this warm kinship across the Strait continues on and on.","大熊猫深受两岸民众喜爱，是和平友爱的化身。2008年大熊猫“团团”、“圆圆”赴台安家，在台期间顺利产下幼崽“圆仔”、“圆宝”。多年来，他们给台湾同胞带来了欢乐。近日“圆圆”迎来22岁生日，我们在这里给“圆圆”送上诚挚的生日祝福，也祝愿2个熊猫宝宝健康成长，让这份跨越海峡的温暖亲情不断延续。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","福建厦门卫视记者","Taiwan media reported that netizens on the island are hotly discussing that more and more young people like to travel independently to the mainland. Data show that since the summer vacation this year, the volume of inbound and outbound passengers on the Xiamen-Kinmen \"mini three links\" route has remained at a high level, and passenger volume on August 23 hit a new high since the route resumed. Please introduce…","The \"mini three links\" passenger routes are one of the most important and most convenient channels for cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, especially between Fujian and Taiwan. Since the summer vacation this year, traffic on the cross-Strait \"mini three links\" passenger routes has continued to rise and passenger flow has remained at a high level. Among them, the Xiamen-Kinmen \"mini three links\" route operated a cumulative 1,550 sailings and carried 386,400 passenger trips, up 11.4% and 24.1% year on year respectively. On August 23, single-day passenger flow on the Xiamen-Kinmen \"mini three links\" route exceeded 7,900 passenger trips, setting the highest single-day record since the route resumed in 2023.\nTo cope with summer passenger flow, relevant parties on the mainland coordinated closely and improved support capacity to better meet travelers' needs. From August 1, the Xiamen-Kinmen \"mini three links\" implemented temporary summer additional sailings, and operating hours were appropriately extended. At the same time, customs clearance procedures were optimized, maritime safety supervision was strengthened, passenger services were improved, and efficient and smooth customs clearance was achieved relying on intelligent systems. The \"mini three links\" routes have operated safely and smoothly overall, with good order.\nThe brisk operation of the \"mini three links\" routes during the summer is a vivid manifestation of compatriots on both sides of the Strait growing closer as kin. We welcome more Taiwan folks to come to the mainland via the \"mini three links\" routes to seek their roots and honor their ancestors, visit relatives and friends, and engage in exchanges and cooperation.","“小三通”客运航线是两岸特别是闽台交流往来最重要、最便捷的通道之一。今年暑期以来，两岸“小三通”客运航线往来热度持续攀升，客流量保持高位运行，其中，厦金“小三通”航线累计运行1550班次，载客量38.64万人次，分别同比增长11.4%和24.1%。8月23日，厦金“小三通”航线单日客流量突破7900人次，创2023年复航以来单日最高纪录。\n为应对暑期客流，大陆有关方面密切协同，提升保障能力，更好满足旅客出行需要。8月1日起，厦金“小三通”实施暑期临时增班措施，运营时段适当延长。同时，优化通关流程、强化海上安全监督、完善旅客服务，依托智能化系统实现高效顺畅通关。“小三通”航线整体运行安全平稳、秩序良好。\n暑期“小三通”航线的火热运行，是两岸同胞走亲走近的生动体现。欢迎更多台湾乡亲通过“小三通”航线来大陆，寻根祭祖、走亲访友、交流合作。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785957.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","Recently, some pan-Green politicians claimed that the Taiwan civic group \"Xiao Yi Zi Hanfu,\" in the name of \"promoting Confucianism and Hanfu culture,\" filmed a video with a Confucius Temple as the background during the Dragon Boat Festival, which is suspected of having united front overtones. Mainland Affairs Council deputy head Shen Yu-chung said in response that culture should be neutral, and \"if the CCP uses…","Chinese culture is the common spiritual home of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Civic groups on the island devoting themselves to passing on and promoting Chinese culture and eagerly taking part in cross-Strait exchange activities precisely proves that the two sides of the Strait share the same roots and origins, the same script and the same ethnicity. We will work together with Taiwan compatriots to continue advancing cross-Strait cultural exchanges and cooperation, jointly promote Chinese culture, and be guardians, inheritors and promoters of Chinese culture.\nThe essence of the united front is great unity and great alliance; it is making friends and promoting unity, seeking common ground while reserving differences, and jointly seeking development. The DPP authorities deliberately distort the original meaning and essence of the united front, smear cross-Strait exchange activities, and intimidate and suppress Taiwan compatriots who take part in cross-Strait exchange activities, with sinister intentions.","中华文化是两岸同胞共同的精神家园。岛内民间团体致力于传承弘扬中华文化，踊跃参与两岸交流活动，恰恰证明了两岸同根同源、同文同种。我们将同台湾同胞一道，持续推进两岸文化交流合作，共同弘扬中华文化，做中华文化的守护者、传承者、弘扬者。\n统战的本质是大团结大联合，是交朋友、促团结，是求同存异、共谋发展。民进党当局蓄意歪曲统战本义本质，抹黑两岸交流活动，恐吓打压参与两岸交流活动的台湾同胞，用心险恶。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260902_12785955.htm"],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","香港中评社记者","Recently, Taiwan's public opinion body passed the so-called \"drone industry development plan.\" Some public opinion on the island worries that drones have also become an important item in Taiwan's arms expansion. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities want to militarize civilian industry and vainly attempt to use drones as a tool to \"seek independence and resist reunification,\" which is purely a futile scheme. Reunification of the motherland is unstoppable; no matter how many drones the DPP authorities make, it will all be in vain.","民进党当局要将民用产业军工化，妄图将无人机作为“谋独拒统”的工具，纯属枉费心机。祖国统一势不可挡，民进党当局搞再多无人机，都是徒劳无益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾“中央社”记者","Hung Sun-han, head of Taiwan's labor authorities, will go to Nanjing in late September to attend an APEC meeting. The Taiwan side said this is in accordance with APEC's existing norms and model, with all members participating equally. What is your view on this? Does the mainland believe this trip will help increase cross-Strait exchanges and interaction and create some new possibilities for cross-Strait relations?","As the host of this year's Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) activities, we handle matters of the Taiwan region's participation in meetings, including the issue you mentioned, in accordance with the one-China principle and the provisions and practices of APEC's relevant memorandum of understanding.","作为今年亚太经合组织（APEC）活动的东道主，我们按照一个中国原则和APEC有关谅解备忘录的规定及惯例处理台湾地区参会事宜，包括你提到的问题。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾《联合报》记者","First question: The Taiwan side said recently that since December 2025, more than 300 person-times from 25 Taiwan departments and units have come to the mainland to attend various APEC meetings, and the process was smooth, with no incidents of any kind. As Hung Sun-han, head of Taiwan's labor authorities, will go to Nanjing in late September to attend an APEC meeting, will the mainland side follow the past model…","On the first question. Our position on Taiwan-related issues in APEC is consistent and clear: matters of the Taiwan region's participation in meetings are to be handled in accordance with the one-China principle and the provisions and practices of APEC's relevant memorandum of understanding.\nOn the second question. This organization willingly serves as a pawn of international anti-China forces and has repeatedly stirred up trouble and spread rumors to smear the mainland, and it has been resolutely resisted by the international community. It is entirely reasonable and lawful for the border inspection authorities to examine the individual person who once worked for this organization.\nIn 2025, Taiwan compatriots came to the mainland more than 4.89 million person-times, and in the first half of this year Taiwan compatriots came to the mainland 2.85 million person-times. As long as they abide by the rules and the law, Taiwan compatriots all come in high spirits and return having enjoyed themselves to the full. The DPP authorities ignore these facts but instead wag their tongues on behalf of an individual person who once worked for an anti-China organization; this is entirely confusing right and wrong and turning black into white, with the aim of intimidating people on the island and interfering with and obstructing cross-Strait exchanges and interactions. Their despicable conduct will inevitably be condemned and opposed.","第一个问题。我们在APEC涉台问题的立场是一贯的、明确的，要按照一个中国原则和APEC有关谅解备忘录的规定及惯例处理台湾地区参会事宜。\n第二个问题。这个机构甘当国际反华势力的马前卒，曾多次搬弄是非，造谣抹黑大陆，遭到国际社会的坚决抵制。边检部门对曾为这个机构工作的个别人员进行审查完全合理合法。\n2025年台湾同胞来大陆489余万人次，今年上半年台湾同胞来大陆285万人次，只要遵规守法，台湾同胞都是乘兴而来、尽兴而归。民进党当局无视上述事实，却为曾在反华机构工作的个别人员摇唇鼓舌，完全是混淆是非、颠倒黑白，目的是恐吓岛内民众，干扰阻挠两岸交流交往，其卑劣行径必遭谴责和反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: Recently, a man was operating a computer on an MRT platform at Taipei Station when words in simplified characters such as \"Second War Zone\" appeared on the screen. Some Taiwan people at first suspected that the mainland had sent personnel to Taiwan to gather intelligence, but it turned out to be a mix-up. What is the mainland side's response? Second question: The mainland's new exit and entry…","On the first question. Publicly available information online has already shown that this was a farcical mix-up. Certain individuals on the island always seize on a matter to make an issue of it and use the opportunity to incite cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, with ulterior motives.\nOn the second question. We have stressed many times that we safeguard in accordance with the law the safety of life and property and the lawful rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, including Taiwan compatriots, and the relevant regulations have a legal basis and are open and transparent. As long as they do not engage in illegal and criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots have no need to have any worries at all about coming to the mainland. The DPP authorities wantonly trumpet so-called \"risks\" in coming to the mainland, and even deceive and intimidate Taiwan people, simply because they want to obstruct Taiwan people from coming to the mainland for exchanges and visits. The historical trend of compatriots on both sides of the Strait growing closer as kin cannot be stopped; the information cocoon they have carefully woven will inevitably be punctured by facts, and their despicable tricks will not succeed.","第一个问题。网上公开信息已经说明这是场乌龙闹剧。岛内个别人总是借题发挥，借机煽动两岸对立对抗，居心叵测。\n第二个问题。我们多次强调，依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞生命财产安全和合法权益，相关规定于法有据，公开透明。只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞来大陆完全不需要有任何顾虑。民进党当局大肆鼓吹来大陆有所谓“风险”，甚至欺骗恐吓台湾民众，无非是想阻挠台湾民众来大陆交流参访。两岸同胞走亲走近的历史大势不可阻挡，其精心编织的信息茧房必将被事实戳破，卑劣伎俩不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾东森电视台记者","Taiwan entertainer Chou Tzu-yu debuted as a member of the South Korean girl group TWICE. Recently there has been news that after her contract with her South Korean agency expires, mainland China is actively courting her to switch tracks, and it has been reported that her making a political statement is a condition in exchange for entertainment resources. Can the spokesperson confirm this?","I am not aware of the specific situation you mentioned. We have always actively supported cross-Strait cultural exchanges, welcome Taiwan entertainers to come to the mainland to develop, and support more Taiwan entertainers in sharing opportunities and realizing their dreams in the course of the development of the mainland's cultural industry, jointly promoting the prosperity and development of cultural undertakings on both sides of the Strait. Of course, for conduct of making money on the mainland on the one hand while supporting \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities on the other, we will absolutely not allow it and will not condone it. This is our consistent and clear attitude.","我不了解你提到的具体情况。我们一贯积极支持两岸文化交流，欢迎台湾艺人来大陆发展，支持更多台湾艺人在大陆文化产业的发展进程中分享机遇，实现梦想，共同促进两岸文化事业繁荣发展。当然，对于一面在大陆赚钱、一面却支持“台独”分裂活动的行为，我们也绝不允许、不会纵容。这是我们一贯的、明确的态度。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾《中国时报》记者","The Standing Committee of the National People's Congress recently passed the newly revised National Defense Mobilization Law, which will take effect on October 1. The law states that, under the needs of development interests, the disposal of civilian resources may be expanded from \"requisition\" to \"expropriation.\" Can the Taiwan Affairs Office explain whether the assets and technology of Taiwan businesspeople on…","The newly revised National Defense Mobilization Law adheres to the holistic approach to national security and clarifies, under the new system, the functional positioning of the military and civilian sides in national defense mobilization, the work operating mechanisms and the key work tasks; it will play an important role in regulating and strengthening national defense mobilization work and safeguarding national security and development interests. It should be stressed that whether it is deciding to implement national defense mobilization or the expropriation and requisition of civilian resources during national defense mobilization, there are clear legal requirements and statutory procedures, and the state protects in accordance with the law the lawful rights and interests of organizations and individuals participating in national defense mobilization activities.\nWe will uphold the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family,\" support the development of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises on the mainland, and help more Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan compatriots participate equally, actively integrate into, and jointly share and build the development process of Chinese-style modernization. Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises need have no worries about long-term investment and lawful and compliant operation on the mainland; there will only be more opportunities, broader space and better protection.","新修订的国防动员法，坚持总体国家安全观，明确新体制下国防动员军地职能定位、工作运行机制、重点工作任务，对于规范和加强国防动员工作，维护国家安全和发展利益，将发挥重要作用。需要强调的是，无论是决定实施国防动员，还是在国防动员期间对民用资源征收、征用，都有明确的法律要件和法定程序，国家依法保障参加国防动员活动的组织和个人的合法权益。\n我们将秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，支持大陆台商台企发展，帮助更多台商台胞平等参与、积极融入、共享共建中国式现代化发展进程。台商台企在大陆长期投资和依法合规经营无需顾虑，只会机遇更多、空间更广、保障更好。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-02","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: The Gwangju Biennale in South Korea restored the name \"Taiwan Pavilion,\" and artists from the mainland side collectively withdrew their exhibits on the eve of the opening. The organizer believes \"politics should not intervene in art,\" and outsiders worry whether similar occasions or exhibitions in the future will turn into a cross-Strait situation of \"if you are in, I am out.\" What is your comment…","On the first question. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. Taiwan's participation in international activities must be handled in accordance with the one-China principle.\nThe DPP authorities use cultural exchanges, conferences, exhibitions and all kinds of occasions to engage in political manipulation and disrupt the normal order of the relevant events, which is despicable. No matter what tricks the DPP authorities play, they cannot change the outcome that their provocations in pursuit of \"independence\" are doomed to fail.\nOn the second question. The so-called \"antagonistic sentiment\" has been entirely deliberately incited by the DPP authorities. The DPP authorities disregard the development demands of industry on the island and scheme to put political labels on entertainers, vainly attempting to use political manipulation to obstruct, ban and restrict normal cultural exchanges and commercial performances between the two sides of the Strait and with Hong Kong and Macao. This completely goes against mainstream public opinion on the island and seriously damages the interests of Taiwan businesses and people; it does not win people's hearts and will not succeed.\nThat concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。台湾参与国际活动，必须按照一个中国原则来处理。\n民进党当局借文化交流、会议展览等各种场合搞政治操弄，扰乱有关活动正常办会秩序，令人不齿。无论民进党当局耍什么伎俩，都改变不了谋“独”挑衅注定失败的结局。\n第二个问题。所谓“对立情绪”完全是民进党当局蓄意煽动起来的。民进党当局罔顾岛内产业界发展诉求，处心积虑给演艺人员贴上政治标签，妄图以政治操弄阻挠禁限正常的两岸及港澳文化交流和商业演出，完全违背岛内主流民意，严重损害台湾业者和民众利益，不得人心、不会得逞。\n今天的新闻发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260902_12785940.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-09-03","Guo Jiakun","AFP","The coast guard of Taiwan said today that it deployed vessels to monitor two Chinese ships operating in waters to its east, saying it firmly rejects China’s campaign of “law enforcement in name, jurisdictional expansion in practice.” Does the Chinese foreign ministry have a reaction to this?","This is not a question about foreign affairs.\n**************************************************","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260903_12015816.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-09-03","Guo Jiakun","The following question was raised after the press conference","The Chinese exhibition team announced it will withdraw from the Gwangju Biennale in the ROK in strong protest against the organizer’s wrongful practice related to Taiwan. The Chinese embassy in the ROK has made a statement on that. What’s your comment?","The China-ROK joint communiqué on the establishment of diplomatic relations states clearly that “the government of the Republic of Korea recognizes the government of the People’s Republic of China as the sole legal government of China and respects China’s position that there is only one China and Taiwan is part of China.” The ROK side also clearly stated on many occasions this year that its commitment to the one-China position remains unchanged.\nThe organizer of the ROK Gwangju Biennale, however, has stubbornly clung to the wrongful practice, allowing China’s Taiwan region to participate under a designation that is completely incompatible with its status. This is a grave violation of the one-China principle. China is firmly opposed to this and has lodged serious representations with the ROK side, demanding that the relevant party immediately correct its wrongdoings. We hope that the ROK government will honor its political commitments, earnestly shoulder its responsibilities, and uphold the one-China principle with concrete actions.\nIt’s despicable for the DPP authorities to exploit occasions such as cultural exchanges, conferences and exhibitions to engage in political manipulation and make “Taiwan independence” provocations. Their political schemes are doomed to fail.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260903_12015816.html","",0,1,1,""],[1,"2026-09-04","Jiang Bin","","日前，台防务部门向民意机构提交“2026年大陆军力报告书”和台军“五年兵力整建及施政计划报告书”，渲染“大陆威胁”，指出解放军常态化派遣舰机位台岛周边执行战备警巡与“侵扰”行动等，强调要提升“不对称”战力与防卫韧性。请问发言人有何评论？","","有关报告混淆是非、颠倒黑白，不过是民进党当局贩卖战争焦虑、“以武谋独”所找的借口。\n台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，解放军位台岛周边常态组织战备警巡，开展反分裂反干涉行动，维护国家主权和领土完整，是使命所系、职责所在。祖国统一势不可挡，任何“以武谋独”的企图都注定失败。","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/yzxwfb/16483561.html","",1,3,4,""],[0,"2026-09-07","Mao Ning","China News Service","According to the Solomon Star, Taiwan increased its annual aid to Palau from US$18 million last year to US$25 million this year, apparently in an effort to secure political backing at the Pacific Islands Forum. The Taiwan authorities also allocated nearly US$281,000 in direct cash gifts for Palau’s former president, incumbent political figures, and individual lawmakers. The report commented that Taiwan’s…","The report is yet another example of the Lai Ching-te authorities’ expensive dollar diplomacy using the hard-earned money of the people in Taiwan—a combination of corruption, fraudulence, bribery and power-for-money deals—to serve “Taiwan independence” separatism and their personal political agenda. For certain countries like Palau, having Taiwan as a “diplomatic ally” is not about delivering for the country and the people, but to line the pockets of the very few people who profit from it.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260907_12017650.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-09-08","Mao Ning","China Daily","It’s reported that Lai Ching-te claimed at an event that China is contorting UNGA Resolution 2758. Taiwan is a “sovereign independent nation.” The resolution only addresses the People’s Republic of China’s representation at the UN and has nothing to do with Taiwan. What is China’s comment on this?","There is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. This is an unshakable fact grounded in both history and law. The Cairo Declaration issued by China, the U.S. and the UK in 1943 stated in explicit terms that Taiwan is a territory that Japan had stolen and shall be restored to China. The Potsdam Proclamation in 1945 reaffirmed that the terms of the Cairo Declaration shall be carried out. This series of instruments with legal effect under international law have all clearly affirmed China’s sovereignty over Taiwan. UNGA Resolution 2758 solemnly reaffirmed the one-China principle, which “decides to restore all its rights to the People’s Republic of China and to recognize the representatives of its Government as the only legitimate representatives of China to the United Nations.” From political, legal and procedural aspects, the resolution resolved once and for all the question of the representation of the whole of China, including Taiwan, in the UN. It made clear that there is only one seat of China in the United Nations, and there is no such thing as “two Chinas” or “one China, one Taiwan.”\nTaiwan has never been a country and will never be a country. The Lai Ching-te authorities’ deliberate distortion of UNGA Resolution 2758 once again revealed their separatist nature for “Taiwan independence.” Their rhetoric will not change the historical and legal fact that the two sides of the Taiwan Strait belong to one and the same China, nor will it undermine the international community’s steadfast commitment to one China.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260908_12018516.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on September 9, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press briefing hall. Spokesperson Chen Binhua answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Hello, friends from the press. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家好。欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","新华社记者","The \"Opinions of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path of Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone\" will soon mark the 3rd anniversary of its release and implementation. Please describe what important progress has been made in building the demonstration zone. How will it be further advanced next?","In September 2023, the \"Opinions of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council on Supporting Fujian in Exploring a New Path of Cross-Strait Integrated Development and Building a Cross-Strait Integrated Development Demonstration Zone\" were released and implemented. Over the past 3 years, relevant departments of central and state organs have formulated and issued a series of supporting policy documents; Fujian has successively released 5 batches totaling 74 policy measures to promote Fujian-Taiwan integration, and organized the implementation of 206 key Fujian-Taiwan integrated development projects with total investment exceeding 1.3 trillion yuan.\nThrough 3 years of effort, the building of the demonstration zone has made progress at this stage: it has become more convenient for Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises to land in their first home, Fujian-Taiwan economic exchanges and cooperation remain brisk, integrated development across all of Fujian maintains good momentum, and Fujian-Taiwan cultural and social exchanges keep deepening. From January to August this year, there were 2.0874 million passenger trips between Fujian and Taiwan, up 20.64% year on year; 857,500 entries by Taiwan compatriots through Fujian ports, up 27.94% year on year; and 1.5836 million cross-Strait passenger trips via the \"mini three links,\" up 25.34% year on year.\nNext, the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the National Development and Reform Commission, together with relevant departments of central and state organs and Fujian Province, will, based on the start of the \"15th Five-Year Plan,\" continue to advance the detailed implementation of the \"Opinions,\" highlighting promoting integration through connectivity, through benefits and through affection, further promoting institutional innovation, industrial coordination, cultural exchanges, and livelihood support, carrying the requirement of high-quality development through the entire process of building the demonstration zone, taking bigger steps in exploring a new path of cross-Strait integrated development, continuously promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and advancing the great cause of reunification of the motherland.","2023年9月，《中共中央 国务院关于支持福建探索海峡两岸融合发展新路建设两岸融合发展示范区的意见》发布实施。3年来，中央和国家机关有关部门制定出台了一系列配套政策文件，福建先后发布5批74项促进闽台融合政策措施，组织实施206个闽台融合发展重点项目，总投资超1.3万亿元。\n经过3年来的努力，示范区建设取得阶段性进展，台胞台企登陆第一家园更加便利，闽台经济交流合作持续热络，福建全域融合发展保持良好势头，闽台人文社会交流不断深化。今年1至8月，往来闽台旅客208.74万人次，同比增长20.64%；从福建口岸入境台胞85.75万人次、同比增长27.94%，往来“小三通”两岸旅客158.36万人次、同比增长25.34%。\n下一步，中央台办、国家发展改革委将会同中央和国家机关有关部门及福建省，立足“十五五”规划开局，持续推进《意见》落实落细，突出以通促融、以惠促融、以情促融，进一步促进制度创新、产业协同、人文交流、民生保障等，把高质量发展要求贯穿示范区建设全过程，在探索海峡两岸融合发展新路上迈出更大步伐，不断推动两岸关系和平发展，推进祖国统一大业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787267.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","人民日报记者","An associate professor at Taiwan's National Changhua University of Education published 3 consecutive articles on social media about the Taiwan plan for \"one country, two systems,\" drawing attention and heated discussion among readers on both sides of the Strait. One view holds that this is \"a rare ice-breaking text.\" What is your comment on this? How do you view the new trend of people on both sides of the Strait…","\"Peaceful reunification and 'one country, two systems'\" is the best way to achieve reunification of the motherland. It embodies the Chinese wisdom that the sea admits a hundred rivers and is great because it is tolerant; it both fully takes into account Taiwan's actual circumstances and is conducive to Taiwan's long-term stability after reunification. The specific form of implementing \"one country, two systems\" in Taiwan will fully take into account Taiwan's actual circumstances, fully absorb the opinions and suggestions of all sectors on both sides of the Strait, and fully take care of the interests and feelings of Taiwan compatriots.\nReunification of the motherland is an unstoppable historical trend. For Taiwan compatriots, it is not an optional question but a mandatory question. We are glad to see more and more Taiwan compatriots squarely facing reunification, beginning to understand and discuss the specific content of the Taiwan plan for \"one country, two systems,\" and offering advice and suggestions for the Taiwan plan for \"two systems\" in various ways. In this process, it is normal for compatriots on both sides of the Strait to have differences and debates. We believe that more Taiwan compatriots will break through the ideological shackles and information cocoon created by the DPP authorities and increasingly recognize the superiority of \"one country, two systems\" and the inclusiveness of the Taiwan plan for \"two systems.\"","“和平统一、一国两制”是实现祖国统一的最佳方式，体现了海纳百川、有容乃大的中华智慧，既充分考虑台湾现实情况，又有利于统一后台湾长治久安。“一国两制”在台湾的具体实现形式会充分考虑台湾现实情况，会充分吸收两岸各界意见和建议，会充分照顾到台湾同胞的利益和感情。\n祖国统一是不可阻挡的历史大势，对于台湾同胞而言，不是选答题，而是必答题。我们乐见越来越多台湾同胞正视统一，开始了解、讨论“一国两制”台湾方案的具体内容，通过各种方式为“两制”台湾方案建言献策。在此过程中，两岸同胞有分歧、有争鸣都是正常现象。我们相信，会有更多台湾同胞突破民进党当局制造的思想禁锢和信息茧房，越来越认识到“一国两制”的优越性和“两制”台湾方案的包容性。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787266.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","September 3 is the Victory Day of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. Far-sighted people from all walks of life on the island have spoken out one after another, calling on compatriots on both sides of the Strait to remember the history of their common war of resistance, defend the fruits of the victory of the war of resistance, and oppose…","This year marks the 81st anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War. Taiwan compatriots have a glorious patriotic tradition. In the eventful years of the war of resistance, thousands upon thousands of Taiwan compatriots crossed the Strait without hesitation to throw themselves into the torrent of the whole nation's war of resistance, contributing to defeating Japanese fascism and recovering Taiwan. The victory of the war of resistance was a great victory forged by all Chinese sons and daughters, including Taiwan compatriots, who feared no violence, remained indomitable and fought bloody battles, and it is also a shared historical memory of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nForgetting history means betrayal. The DPP authorities deliberately downplay and wantonly distort the history of the war of resistance. This is a betrayal of history and a desecration of the martyrs, and it paves the way for their betrayal of the nation and splitting of the country. We believe that more and more Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the false historical narrative of the DPP authorities and the sinister intentions of \"de-Sinicization,\" uphold the greater righteousness of the nation, adhere to a correct view of history, and join hands with mainland compatriots to carry forward the great spirit of the war of resistance, jointly accomplish the everlasting great cause of reunification of the motherland, and jointly create a bright future of national rejuvenation.","今年是中国人民抗日战争暨世界反法西斯战争胜利81周年。台湾同胞具有光荣的爱国主义传统，在抗战的峥嵘岁月里，成千上万台湾同胞义无反顾越过海峡投入全民族抗战洪流，为打败日本法西斯、光复台湾作出了贡献。抗战胜利是包括台湾同胞在内的全体中华儿女不畏强暴、百折不挠、浴血奋战铸就的伟大胜利，也是两岸同胞共同的历史记忆。\n忘记历史就意味着背叛。民进党当局刻意淡化、肆意扭曲抗战历史，是对历史的背叛、对先烈的亵渎，是在为其背叛民族、分裂国家铺路。我们相信，会有越来越多的台湾同胞看清民进党当局虚假历史叙事和“去中国化”的险恶用心，坚守民族大义、坚持正确史观，与大陆同胞携手传承弘扬伟大抗战精神，共襄祖国统一的千秋伟业，共创民族复兴的美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787263.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","中新社记者","It is reported that the sixth \"Joining Hands to Realize the Dream: Cross-Strait Compatriots Exchange and Seminar Event\" will be held in Urumqi, Xinjiang, drawing the attention of public opinion on both sides of the Strait. Please describe the relevant situation.","The \"Joining Hands to Realize the Dream: Cross-Strait Compatriots Exchange and Seminar Event\" has been held for five consecutive editions since 2021 and has become an important brand of exchanges with Taiwan. The sixth event will be held in Urumqi, Xinjiang, from September 11 to 12. Relevant parties on both sides of the Strait, heads of parties and groups, and representative figures will hold in-depth discussions on topics such as the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and jointly pursuing the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, building broad consensus.","“携手圆梦--两岸同胞交流研讨活动”自2021年起已连续举办五届，成为对台交流的重要品牌。第六届活动将于9月11日至12日在新疆乌鲁木齐举办，海峡两岸有关方面、党派团体负责人和代表性人士等将围绕两岸关系和平发展、共谋中华民族伟大复兴等议题进行深入研讨，凝聚广泛共识。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The summer vacation months of July and August are the peak season for cross-Strait youth exchanges, and cross-Strait youth exchange activities have been brilliant and continuously lively. Please describe the highlights and characteristics of the summer youth exchange activities. What is your comment on this?","This summer, the momentum of cross-Strait youth exchanges kept climbing, with activities in various places taking the stage one after another in brilliant variety. Thousands upon thousands of young people from Taiwan came across the sea to exchange and interact with their mainland peers, and gained a great deal.\nFirst, brand activities released strong momentum. The \"Together at Heart, Walking Together: Cross-Strait Youth Exchange Season, Shanghai Stop\" event was a hit from its launch, with more than a thousand young people from both sides of the Strait gathering in Shanghai to discuss trends, technology and culture, vividly illustrating the new generation on both sides of the Strait moving toward each other and walking together with one heart. The 14th Straits Youth Gathering focused on social, economic, emotional and all-round integration and introduced the third batch of measures for \"Straits youth development-oriented cities,\" attracting batch after batch of young people from Taiwan to come to Fujian for exchanges and development. The influence of events such as the 24th Straits Youth Forum, the 2026 Cross-Strait Youth Summit and the 9th Cross-Strait Youth Development Forum kept expanding, attracting young people from Taiwan to come in large numbers.\nSecond, cultural exchange activities continued to draw people. The 6th Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month, with \"new expressions of traditional culture\" as its main thread, created a cultural carnival belonging to young people on both sides of the Strait. The 3rd Shaanxi-Taiwan Cultural Exchange Week and Cross-Strait Youth Han-Tang Culture Summer Camp, with the theme \"Carrying forward Chinese culture, composing a brilliant chapter of youth,\" promoted in-depth exchanges and cooperation across the Strait in culture and other fields. Young people from both sides of the Strait sang mountain songs together in Longyan, Fujian, Meizhou, Guangdong and other places, carrying forward Hakka culture, and conveyed feelings through music in Jinan, Shandong and Lanzhou, Gansu, jointly singing the song of cross-Strait youth.\nThird, sports exchange activities were the most exciting and the hottest. The cross-Strait inter-school alliance baseball games held in Beijing and Guizhou, the beach frisbee invitational held in Fujian, the \"Tinghao Cup\" cross-Strait youth basketball invitational held in Anhui, the youth table tennis exchange tournament held in Hubei, the Guangzhou-Taiwan-Hong Kong-Macao youth roller hockey exchange tournament held in Guangdong, the summer pickleball exchange activity held in Henan, the Guangxi-Taiwan youth badminton exchange tournament held in Guangxi and other activities all attracted large numbers of young people from Taiwan to take part. Young people from both sides of the Strait competed on the same field, achieved good results and made good friends.\nFourth, the activities covered a wide geographic area and the exchanges were in depth. From the desert wonder of \"mountain and spring coexisting, sand and water living together\" in Dunhuang, Gansu, to the Mazu temple on Meizhou Island in Putian, from the majestic vastness of the Heilongjiang land to the Guilin landscape that is the finest under heaven, young people from both sides of the Strait measured the great rivers and mountains with their footsteps and felt the history and culture of the Chinese nation with their hearts.\nThe motherland mainland is also the home of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots. Not only in summer but at any time, we warmly welcome young people from Taiwan to come to the mainland to walk around and see, take part in cross-Strait exchanges, exchange with and learn from mainland youth without distinction between one another, talk together about youthful ideals, and jointly create a bright future.","这个暑期，两岸青年交流热度持续攀升，各地活动接连登场、精彩纷呈。成千上万台湾年轻人跨海而来，与大陆同龄人交流互动，收获满满。\n一是品牌活动释放强大动能。“同心同行——两岸青年交流季上海站”活动首发即火爆，千余名两岸青年齐聚上海，探讨潮流科技文化，生动诠释两岸新生代双向奔赴、同心同行。第14届海峡青年荟活动聚焦社会、经济、情感、全域融合，推出“海峡青年发展型城市”第三批措施，吸引一批又一批台湾青年来福建交流发展。第24届海峡青年论坛、2026两岸青年峰会、第九届海峡两岸青年发展论坛等活动影响不断扩大，吸引台青纷至沓来。\n二是文化交流活动持续引流。第六届海峡两岸青年文化月以“传统文化新表达”为主线，打造属于两岸青年的文化嘉年华。第三届陕台文化交流周暨海峡两岸青年汉唐文化夏令营以“弘扬中华文化，谱写青春华章”为主题，推动两岸文化等领域深度交流合作。两岸青年在福建龙岩、广东梅州等地共唱山歌，弘扬客家文化，在山东济南、甘肃兰州以乐传情，共同唱响两岸青春之歌。\n三是体育交流活动最燃最火。在北京、贵州举办的海峡两岸校际联盟棒球赛，在福建举办的沙滩飞盘邀请赛，在安徽举办的“亭好杯”海峡两岸青年篮球邀请赛，在湖北举办的青年乒乓球交流赛，在广东举办的穗台港澳青少年轮滑冰球交流赛，在河南举办的暑期匹克球交流活动，在广西举办的桂台青少年羽毛球交流赛等活动，都吸引了大批台湾青年参与。两岸青年同场竞技，赛出好成绩，交到好朋友。\n四是活动地域广泛、交流深入。从甘肃敦煌“山泉共处，沙水共生”的沙漠奇景到莆田湄洲岛的妈祖宫庙，从龙江大地的雄浑壮阔到桂林山水的美甲天下，两岸青年用脚步丈量大好河山，用心灵感受中华民族的历史文化。\n祖国大陆也是广大台湾同胞的家园。不止暑期，任何时候，我们都热诚欢迎台湾青年来大陆走走、看看，参与到两岸交流中来，与大陆青年无分彼此、交流互鉴，共话青春理想，共创美好未来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787256.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","北京日报记者","According to reports, the Straits Exchange Foundation recently announced 2027 budget expenditures of more than NT$350 million, an increase of about NT$10 million over 2026, to be used for increased personnel costs, with the specific task of publicizing, at major travel fairs, safety issues of traveling to the mainland and reminding people on the island to carefully assess the risks. What is your comment on this?","Taiwan compatriots made nearly 4.9 million trips to the mainland in 2025, and 2.85 million in the first half of this year. The personal safety and all lawful rights and interests of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots during their time on the mainland are protected in accordance with the law; they all come happily and return safely.\nThe purpose of the Straits Exchange Foundation is to be \"Chinese, goodwill-based and service-oriented,\" and its positioning at its founding was to take as its mission \"being a bridge, not a wall.\" Yet now it has actually sunk into being a pawn of the DPP authorities in obstructing and undermining cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and inciting cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation. This is truly pitiable and lamentable. Regarding the Straits Exchange Foundation's recent statements, I have eight characters of advice: \"Do not forget your original intention; do more proper work.\"","台湾同胞来大陆2025年近490万人次，今年上半年达285万人次。广大台湾同胞在大陆期间的人身安全及各项合法权益都依法得到保障，都高高兴兴来、平平安安回。\n海基会的宗旨是“中国的、善意的、服务的”，成立时的定位是以“是一座桥，不是一堵墙”为己任，而今竟沦落为民进党当局阻挠破坏两岸交流合作、煽动两岸对立对抗的马前卒，真是可悲可叹。对于海基会近日的说法，我有八个字相劝：“莫忘初衷，多干正事”。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","《参考消息》记者","Recently, the DPP authorities have been loudly clamoring that there are so-called \"risks\" for Taiwan people traveling to the mainland, spreading rumors and smearing the \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" as having four kinds of risks such as \"inconsistent standards.\" What is your comment on this?","The \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" are intended to regulate exit and entry administration, protect the lawful rights and interests of persons exiting and entering, and safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests. The relevant provisions help further protect the lawful rights and interests of all persons exiting and entering, including Taiwan compatriots.\nIn order to obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and contacts, the DPP authorities keep distorting facts and smearing the mainland, and recently they have again manipulated their cyber army and flanking groups to spread rumors, slander and maliciously denigrate specific persons, which is despicable.","《国务院关于出境入境管理的规定》是为了规范出境入境管理，保障出境入境人员的合法权益，维护国家主权、安全、发展利益。相关规定有利于进一步保障包括台湾同胞在内所有出入境人员的合法权益。\n民进党当局为了阻挠两岸交流交往，不断歪曲事实、抹黑大陆，近期又操纵网军侧翼针对特定人士造谣污蔑、恶意诋毁，令人不齿。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","香港中评社记者","Recently, Taiwan's transportation and tourism department sent letters to travel agencies requiring that when businesses organize exchanges and travel to the mainland, they must assist travelers group by group in completing pre-departure registration for travel to the mainland and filling in related notes. Although the Mainland Affairs Council said this is \"not compulsory,\" it still raised concerns among people on…","This is yet another despicable trick by the DPP authorities to threaten and intimidate Taiwan compatriots from coming to the mainland and to interfere with and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and personnel contacts, and it has already aroused the disgust and dissatisfaction of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots and the industry. The desire of compatriots on both sides of the Strait to visit kin and draw closer, and the general trend of cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, are unstoppable. Any act that turns back the wheel of history and goes against the will of the people will inevitably meet a backlash from public opinion.","这是民进党当局威胁恐吓台胞来大陆、干扰阻挠两岸交流和人员往来的又一卑劣伎俩，已经引发广大台胞和业界的反感和不满。两岸同胞走亲走近的愿望、两岸交流合作的大势不可阻挡，任何开历史倒车、违逆民心民意的行为，必遭民意反噬。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Recently, the urban workplace drama \"Early Spring, Clear and Bright,\" directed by a Taiwan director and starring mainland actors, set off a binge-watching craze on the island. Many Taiwan media ran special reports on it, and many viewers on the island are urging new episodes on online platforms. What is your comment on this?","We are glad to see more film and television works made through cooperation between filmmakers from both sides of the Strait, showing cross-Strait kinship and a good life, broadcast on both sides of the Strait, realizing a \"two-way convergence\" of the feelings and exchanges of people on both sides of the Strait.","我们乐见有更多由两岸影人合作、展现两岸亲情与美好生活的影视作品在两岸播出，实现两岸民众情感与交流的“双向奔赴”。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities in various fields.","Recently, cross-Strait exchange activities have remained lively.\nFrom August 25 to 29, the 2026 Straits Hakka \"Hakka Youth Making It Happen\" short-video creation competition for Taiwan Hakka descendants visiting their ancestral land was held in Longyan, Fujian Province. 40 young Taiwan Hakka people collected material and created short videos around Hakka culture and the look of their ancestral land, recording what they saw and felt from fresh perspectives.\nFrom August 29 to September 2, the Fujian-Taiwan (Mingxi) traditional Chinese medicine culture exchange activity was held in Sanming, Fujian Province. Nearly 70 people, including traditional Chinese medicine experts and scholars, industry associations and Chinese medicine enterprises from both sides of the Strait, took part and reached a number of substantive cooperation agreements, continuing to deepen multi-dimensional Fujian-Taiwan cooperation in traditional Chinese medicine.\nOn September 2, the opening ceremony of the \"2026 Cross-Strait Youth Jointly Exploring the Code of Chinese Civilization Study Camp\" was held at Qiannan Normal University for Nationalities in Guizhou, where young people from both sides of the Strait had an immersive experience of Guizhou's development and Chinese civilization through close contact.\nOn the same day, the launch ceremony of the \"Echoes from Next Door, One Voice Across the Strait\" young musicians SEEK program (Season 1) was held in Zhangzhou. More than 150 people, including well-known musicians and artists from both sides of the Strait and young people from Taiwan, took part. Using cross-Strait youth music co-creation as its vehicle, the activity will organize field collection and music creation, hold special performances and exchange activities, simultaneously run a promotion competition, and incubate young music talent.\nOn September 3, the general closing of the 2026 Taiwan Youth Lingnan Tour was held at the Xinghai Conservatory of Music in Guangzhou. Young people from both sides of the Strait exchanged their impressions of the Lingnan tour and performed on the same stage, showing a spirit of striving forward hand in hand and realizing dreams with one heart.\nFrom September 3 to 9, the 2026 4th Cross-Strait Youth Film Festival and Youth Filmmakers Training Camp was held in Xiamen, where young people from both sides of the Strait used images as a medium to connect shared emotions and exchange creative experiences.\nFrom September 9 to 12, the 6th Pingtan IM Cross-Strait Youth Film Festival will be held in Pingtan, Fujian. The call for works covered 410 universities, more than 3,500 young people from Taiwan took part, and both the number of submitted films and the number of institutions hit record highs. This year's festival has the theme \"If the Wind Had Color\" and will hold a \"Youth Film Night\" and many other activities, with more than 700 people from all walks of life, including well-known filmmakers, industry representatives, and university teachers and students, attending in person.\nFrom September 9 to 12, the 14th Anhui-Taiwan Science and Technology Forum and the 18th Cross-Strait Popular Science Forum will be held in Bengbu, Anhui, where nearly 60 experts, scholars and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait will hold broad exchanges and discussions in multiple fields such as electronic information and biotechnology.\nFrom September 9 to 15, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Nanchang) Youth Maker Camp will be held in Nanchang, Jiujiang, Jingdezhen and other places in Jiangxi Province.\nFrom September 14 to 18, the first Cross-Strait (Jiaocheng) Yandi Shennong Culture Week will be held in Ningde, Fujian. Nearly 200 representatives of Taiwan temples and believers will come to Ningde to take part in sacrificial ceremonies, interactive experiences of farming culture and traditional Chinese medicine, free medical consultations by traditional Chinese medicine doctors from both sides of the Strait, and other activities.","近期，两岸交流活动持续热络。\n8月25日至29日，2026海峡客家“客青·搞作”台湾客家子弟祖地行短视频创作比赛活动在福建省龙岩市举办，40名台湾客家青年围绕客家文化、祖地风貌进行短视频采风创作，用鲜活视角记录所见所感。\n8月29日至9月2日，闽台（明溪）中医药文化交流活动在福建省三明市举办，两岸中医药专家学者、行业协会、中药企业等近70人参加，达成多项实质性合作，持续深化闽台中医药多维度合作。\n9月2日，“2026两岸青年共探中华文明密码研习营”开营仪式在贵州黔南民族师范学院举行，两岸青年在近距离接触中沉浸式体验贵州发展和中华文明。\n同日，“厝边回响 两岸同声”青年音乐人SEEK计划（第一季）启动仪式在漳州举行。两岸知名音乐人、艺术家及台湾青年等150余人参加，活动以两岸青年音乐共创为载体，将组织采风与音乐创作，举办专场演出与交流活动，同步开展晋级赛事，孵化青年音乐人才。\n9月3日，2026台湾青年岭南行总闭营在广州星海音乐学院举办，两岸青年围绕岭南行交流感悟、同台献艺，展现了携手奋进、同心圆梦的精神风貌。\n9月3日至9日，2026第四届海峡两岸青春影展·青春影人训练营在厦门市举办，两岸青年以影像为媒连接共同情感，交流创作心得。\n9月9日至12日，第六届平潭IM两岸青年影展将在福建平潭举办，活动作品征集范围覆盖410所高校，参与的台湾青年超3500人，征片数量与院校规模均创历届新高。本届影展以“假如风有颜色”为主题，举办“青年电影之夜”等多项活动，知名影人、产业代表、高校师生等各界人士超700人现场参加。\n9月9日至12日，第十四届皖台科技论坛暨第十八届海峡两岸科普论坛将在安徽蚌埠举办，两岸近60位专家学者和青年代表，就电子信息、生物科技等多个领域广泛开展交流研讨。\n9月9日至15日，2026海峡两岸（南昌）青年创客营活动将在江西省南昌、九江、景德镇等地举办。\n9月14日至18日，首届海峡两岸（蕉城）炎帝神农文化周将在福建宁德举办。近200名台湾宫庙、信众代表将来到宁德，开展祭典仪式、农耕文化与中医药互动体验、两岸中医师义诊等活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","Taiwan media reported that, catalyzed by the DPP authorities' policy of \"opposing China and resisting China,\" the green camp on the island has recently been frequently staging \"catching Communist spies\" dramas, being paranoid and making blunders, and has even become quite sensitive and uneasy about, and increasingly hostile to, a \"mainland accent,\" \"simplified characters\" and \"mainland terms.\" What is your…","The DPP authorities and \"Taiwan independence\" forces are becoming more and more \"possessed\" in \"opposing everything related to China\" and \"opposing China and resisting China.\" From treating Taiwan people's use of \"mainland terms\" as if facing a formidable enemy, to imagining individual simplified characters as spy infiltration, they can be said to be seeing a bow's reflection in a cup as a snake and treating every bush and tree as an enemy soldier. What the DPP authorities are doing not only further damages cross-Strait mutual trust but also intensifies the \"green terror\" in society on the island, and it will surely meet opposition.","民进党当局及“台独”势力在“逢中必反”、“反中抗中”上越来越“魔怔”了。从对台湾民众使用“大陆用语”如临大敌，到将个别简体字臆想成间谍渗透，可谓杯弓蛇影、草木皆兵。民进党当局所作所为不仅进一步损害两岸互信，而且加剧岛内社会“绿色恐怖”，必遭反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","香港凤凰卫视记者","The 81st session of the United Nations General Assembly opened on the 8th. Recently, Lai Ching-te claimed that the mainland misapplies UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, that the resolution only resolved the question of the People's Republic of China's representation seat in the United Nations, and has nothing at all to do with Taiwan; Taiwan's foreign affairs department claimed that UN General Assembly…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. This is an indisputable historical and legal fact and the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. In 1971, the 26th session of the United Nations General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority, deciding to restore all the rights of the People's Republic of China in the United Nations and recognizing the representatives of the Government of the People's Republic of China as the only legitimate representatives of China to the United Nations, thereby resolving thoroughly, politically, legally and procedurally, the question of the representation in the United Nations of all of China, including Taiwan.\nLai Ching-te and the DPP authorities repeatedly distort and attack UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 in a vain attempt to challenge the one-China principle universally recognized by the international community, which will only bring humiliation upon themselves and will surely meet defeat. No matter how hard they scheme, they cannot change the legal fact that Taiwan is part of China, cannot shake the stable pattern of the international community adhering to the one-China principle, and still less can they stop the historical trend that the motherland will ultimately be reunified and is bound to be reunified.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。这是不容置疑的历史和法理事实，是真正的台海现状。1971年，第26届联合国大会以压倒性多数通过第2758号决议，决定恢复中华人民共和国在联合国的一切权利，承认中华人民共和国政府代表是中国在联合国的唯一合法代表，从政治上、法律上和程序上彻底解决了包括台湾在内全中国在联合国的代表权问题。\n赖清德及民进党当局一再歪曲攻击联大第2758号决议，妄图挑战国际社会普遍承认的一个中国原则，只会自取其辱，必遭挫败。无论其怎样费尽心机，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的法理事实，动摇不了国际社会坚持一个中国原则的稳固格局，更阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787259.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","Recently, the mainland coast guard announced that the \"Putuoshan\" ship formation was conducting regularized law enforcement patrols in the waters east of Taiwan island. Taiwan's coast guard department said this move is \"fake law enforcement, real expansion of power\" and \"an attempt to create the illusion of having jurisdiction.\" What is your comment on this?","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The mainland coast guard carrying out law enforcement and rights protection operations in waters under its jurisdiction in accordance with the law effectively safeguards normal navigation and operating order and practically safeguards the lawful and legitimate rights and interests and the lives and property of the Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots. It is a legitimate and just act to defend national territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist position of \"Taiwan independence,\" distort facts and maliciously hype this up, and are doomed to fail.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。大陆海警依法在管辖海域开展执法维权行动，有力保障正常航行和作业秩序，切实维护包括台湾同胞在内的中国民众合法正当权益和生命财产安全，是捍卫国家领土主权和海洋权益的正当、正义之举。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，歪曲事实、恶意炒作，注定失败。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, Kyrgyzstan and Egypt each issued joint statements with China, both stressing adherence to the one-China principle and support for achieving China's reunification. Taiwan's foreign affairs department absurdly claimed that the mainland is engaged in \"false manipulation internationally,\" that Taiwan is a \"sovereign independent country,\" and that the two sides of the Strait are \"not subordinate to each…","We appreciate the position of the countries concerned in abiding by the one-China principle and supporting China's reunification. Facts have proven once again that the one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community; it is the trend of the times, where greater righteousness lies, and what the people desire.\nThere is only one China in the world. Taiwan is part of China; it has never been a country and it will never be possible for it to become a country in the future. So-called \"sovereignty\" simply does not exist. No matter how the DPP authorities talk wildly and hype up a \"new two-state theory,\" they cannot change the historical and legal fact that Taiwan belongs to China, cannot change the outcome that \"Taiwan independence\" is at a dead end and doomed to defeat, and still less can they stop the general trend that the motherland will ultimately be reunified and is bound to be reunified.","我们对有关国家恪守一个中国原则、支持中国统一的立场表示赞赏。事实再次证明，一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，从来就不是一个国家，今后也绝无可能成为一个国家，根本不存在所谓“主权”。不管民进党当局如何大放厥词，煽炒“新两国论”，都改变不了台湾属于中国的历史和法理事实，改变不了“台独”穷途末路、注定败亡的结局，更阻挡不了祖国终将统一、也必将统一的大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","香港经济导报记者","Recently, the DPP authorities claimed that Taiwan businesses' investment in the mainland in 2025 fell 59% from the previous year, and fell 30% in the first half of 2026, that the mainland's economic development has fallen into difficulties, and that Taiwan businesses should be cautious about investing in the mainland. What is your comment on this?","According to statistics from relevant departments, from January to July this year, cross-Strait trade reached US$221.8 billion, up 26.5% year on year. Of this, mainland exports to Taiwan were US$62.17 billion, up 31.6% year on year, and mainland imports from Taiwan were US$159.63 billion, up 24.7% year on year. This fully shows that cross-Strait economic ties are close, the foundation of common interests is solid, and cross-Strait industrial and supply chains are stable and resilient.\nSince the start of this year, we have forcefully responded to changes in the external environment such as geopolitical conflicts and economic and trade frictions, and continued a development trend that is generally stable and moving toward the new and the better. The economy has shown vigorous vitality and strong resilience, injecting strong momentum and precious certainty into the world economy, and also continuously providing new opportunities and opening new space for strengthening cross-Strait economic cooperation and deepening integrated development. The mainland has always been the best choice for the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises to invest and start businesses, fertile soil for innovative development, and a strong support for withstanding risks. The DPP authorities' smearing and bad-mouthing has been proven, and will continue to be proven, futile.","据有关部门统计，今年1至7月，两岸贸易额达2218亿美元，同比增长26.5%。其中，大陆对台出口621.7亿美元，同比增长31.6%；大陆自台进口1596.3亿美元，同比增长24.7%。这充分说明两岸经济联系紧密，共同利益基础扎实，两岸产业链供应链稳定强韧。\n今年以来，我们有力应对地缘政治冲突、经贸摩擦等外部环境变化，延续了总体平稳、向新向优的发展态势，经济展现出蓬勃活力和强大韧性，为世界经济注入强劲动力和难能可贵的确定性，也为加强两岸经济合作、深化融合发展不断提供新机遇、开拓新空间。大陆始终是广大台商台企投资兴业的最佳选择、创新发展的深厚沃土、抵御风险的强大依靠，民进党当局的抹黑、唱衰已经并将继续被证明是徒劳无功。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260909_12787262.htm"],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: the Mainland Affairs Council said that Taiwan's \"Minister of Labor\" Hung Sun-han, going to Nanjing to attend an APEC meeting, can enter with an APEC invitation letter and does not need to apply for a Taiwan Compatriot Travel Permit. Please confirm this. Have the relevant arrangements been finalized? Second question: Taiwan's \"Tourism Administration\" earlier sent letters requiring travel agencies…","First question. Since 1991, the Taiwan side's participation in APEC meetings and activities has been handled in accordance with the one-China principle and the relevant APEC memorandum of understanding and established practice, and this year is no exception.\nSecond question. The despicable trick of the DPP authorities has already aroused the disgust and dissatisfaction of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots and the tourism industry on the island, and in the end they were forced to change their wording. This bears out the saying: \"There is originally nothing wrong in the world; mediocre people trouble themselves.\"\nThird question. We have always upheld the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family,\" and make every effort to do practical things, do good things and solve difficult problems for Taiwan compatriots. On the basis of a comprehensive assessment of the relevant rectification measures and compliance with the mainland's relevant inspection and quarantine regulations, we support more Taiwan wendan pomelo packing plants and orchards in registering in the mainland. We will further promote the detailed implementation of the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, continue to facilitate the import of Taiwan agricultural and fishery products into the mainland, and let farmers and fishermen on the island gain tangible benefits.","第一个问题。从1991年以来，台湾方面参加亚太经合组织会议及活动，均按照一个中国原则和APEC有关谅解备忘录规定及惯例处理，今年亦是如此。\n第二个问题。民进党当局的卑劣伎俩已经引发广大台胞和岛内观光业界的反感和不满，最后被迫改口。这正应了这么一句话：“世上本无事，庸人自扰之”。\n第三个问题。我们一贯秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，尽最大努力为台湾同胞办实事、做好事、解难事，在综合评估相关整改措施、符合大陆相关检验检疫规定的基础上，支持更多台湾文旦柚包装厂和果园在大陆注册。我们将进一步推动十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施落实落细，继续为台湾农渔产品输入大陆提供便利，让岛内农渔民获得实实在在的利益。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-09","Chen Binhua","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: the family of Beijing lawyer Wang Xiahong is staying in Taiwan seeking resettlement. The Mainland Affairs Council has publicly confirmed this sudden incident and characterized it as \"humanitarian first\" in providing resettlement. Can you confirm the circumstances of Wang Xiahong's departure and flight? Second question: a few days ago, people in Taiwan found that the mainland brand Luckin Coffee…","First question. For issues concerning the administration of lawyers' practice, please inquire with the relevant competent department. There are corresponding administrative regulations for mainland residents going to Taiwan, and the relevant departments will handle this in accordance with laws and regulations.\nSecond question. We are glad to see Taiwan compatriots using quality mainland goods, and we support two-way investment and win-win cooperation between enterprises on both sides of the Strait. Out of the selfish interests of one party, the DPP authorities deliberately obstruct and restrict mainland investment and products from entering the island, worsening the business environment on the island and damaging the vital interests of the people of Taiwan. This is political manipulation that does not win the people's support.\nThird question. The purpose of the DPP authorities' despicable trick is to threaten and intimidate Taiwan compatriots from coming to the mainland and to interfere with and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges and personnel contacts. It does not win the people's support and has already aroused strong disgust and dissatisfaction among the broad public and the tourism industry on the island. This despicable trick cannot stop the desire of compatriots on both sides of the Strait to visit kin and draw closer, or the general trend of cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation; it is turning back the wheel of history and going against the tide.\nWe always uphold the concept that \"people on both sides of the Strait are one family\" and protect in accordance with the law the lawful rights and interests of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots, including tourists. According to the \"Tourism Law of the People's Republic of China,\" Taiwan compatriots traveling on the mainland enjoy the same legal protection as mainland residents. If the lawful rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots are harmed, they may, in accordance with the \"Measures for Handling Tourism Complaints,\" file a complaint with the tourism complaint handling agency at or above the county level where the tourism operator is located, where the tourism contract was signed, or where the tourism dispute occurred, or they may call the 12345 government service hotline or contact the local Taiwan affairs office for assistance.\nThis concludes our press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。有关律师执业管理的问题，请向相关主管部门了解。大陆居民赴台有相应的管理规定，有关部门将依法依规处理。\n第二个问题。我们乐见台湾同胞用上大陆的优质商品，支持两岸企业双向投资、合作共赢。民进党当局出于一党私利，蓄意阻挠限制大陆投资、产品入岛，恶化岛内营商环境，损害台湾民众切身利益，是不得人心的政治操弄。\n第三个问题。民进党当局的卑劣伎俩，目的是威胁恐吓台胞来大陆、干扰阻挠两岸交流和人员往来，不得人心，已经在岛内引发广大民众和观光业界的强烈反感和不满。这一卑劣伎俩阻挡不了两岸同胞走亲走近的愿望和两岸交流合作的大势，是在开历史倒车、逆潮流而动。\n我们始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，依法保护包括游客在内广大台胞的合法权益。根据《中华人民共和国旅游法》，在大陆旅游的台湾同胞享有与大陆居民同等法律保护。如果台胞的合法权益受到损害，可根据《旅游投诉处理办法》，向旅游经营者所在地、旅游合同签订地或旅游纠纷发生地的县级以上旅游投诉处理机构投诉，也可拨打12345政务服务便民热线或联系当地台办寻求协助。\n我们的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260909_12787252.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-09-11","Mao Ning","Reuters","The Taiwanese official Hsiao Bi-khim is in Italy. Does China have a response to this?","China has lodged serious protests with Italy and the EU side on the “Taiwan independence” politicians’ attendance at the conference in Italy. The DPP authorities and individual politicians from Taiwan are making every attempt to grab attention and solicit external support for their separatist agenda under the pretext of “democracy” and “freedom.” Their moves are truly despicable and simply futile. Let me reiterate that there is but one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. China firmly opposes official interactions of any form between China’s Taiwan region and countries having diplomatic ties with China. The one-China principle is a widely-recognized norm in international relations and a prevailing international consensus. It is also the political foundation of China-Italy relations and China-EU relations. We urge relevant parties to honor the one-China principle with real action.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260911_12020880.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-09-14","Guo Jiakun","China Daily","It’s reported that some Panamanian lawmakers recently set up a so-called “Panama-Taiwan parliamentary exchange group.” U.S. lawmakers attended the launch of the group via video link. Regarding this, Panamanian President José Raúl Mulino stated that the Panamanian government reiterates that “foreign relations are directed by the Executive,” and engagements of the parliamentarians with Taiwan “do not mean that the…","There is but one China in the world and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China’s territory. China firmly opposes official interactions and engagements of any form between the Taiwan authorities and countries having diplomatic ties with China, and does not allow interference in China’s internal affairs by any external forces. We urge those few politicians to see the real picture. To cross the line on the Taiwan question will lead to serious consequences.\nThe establishment of this so-called “parliamentary exchange group” seriously violates the one-China principle upheld by Panama. We noted the statement of the Panamanian government and hopes that Panama will honor its commitment to the one-China principle with real actions to uphold the political foundation of China-Panama relations. China urges the U.S. to abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiqués, stop sending the wrong message to “Taiwan independence” separatist forces, and stop disrupting and sabotaging China-Panama relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260914_12021997.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-09-15","Guo Jiakun","Kyodo News","The cross-party Japan-China Friendship Parliamentarians’ Union had a meeting with Assistant Foreign Minister Liu Bin yesterday. Can you share more details and how does China view the significance of this talk?","On September 14, Assistant Foreign Minister Liu Bin met with the delegation of young Japanese lawmakers from the Japan-China Friendship Parliamentarians’ Union, who was on a visit to China. China stressed that the crux of the serious difficulties in China-Japan relations lies in Prime Minister of Japan Sanae Takaichi’s erroneous words and deeds on Taiwan. The Japanese side should honor the spirit of the four political documents, learn the lesson of history, and earn trust from its Asian neighbors and the rest of the world with concrete actions. We hope that the Japan-China Friendship Parliamentarians’ Union will carry forward its tradition of goodwill toward China, step up to its responsibility, and create conditions and a sound environment for bringing the bilateral relations back to the right track.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260915_12022885.html","",0,1,1,""],[0,"2026-09-16","Guo Jiakun","Global Times","It is reported that Lin Chia-lung, head of the “foreign affairs” department of the Taiwan authorities, in a recent interview confirmed the plan to set up a “representative’s office” in the central Philippine province of Cebu, which will serve as a platform to deepen ties through the “Taiwan-Philippines economic corridor.” What’s your comment?","Let me stress again, no matter how the DPP authorities collude with external forces to seek “diplomatic breakthroughs” and advance their separatist agenda in whatever form, such attempts will be all in vain and doomed to fail. We also urge the Philippine side to abide by the one-China principle with concrete actions, and refrain from taking any steps that could harm China-Philippines relations.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260916_12023728.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on September 16, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in the press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Welcome to the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council press conference; questions may now begin.","欢迎大家参加国务院台办新闻发布会，现在开始提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","The 6th \"Hand in Hand to Fulfil Dreams: Cross-Strait Compatriots Exchange and Seminar Activity\" was recently held in Xinjiang, attracting great attention from public opinion on both sides of the Strait. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From September 11 to 12, the 6th \"Hand in Hand to Fulfil Dreams: Cross-Strait Compatriots Exchange and Seminar Activity\" was successfully held in Urumqi, Xinjiang, with more than 120 people participating, including leaders and representatives of relevant parties, political parties and groups on both sides of the Strait, experts and scholars, and representatives of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan youth.\nSong Tao, director of the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, attended the opening ceremony of the activity and delivered a speech, calling on compatriots on both sides of the Strait to unswervingly strive together for the great cause of reunification, to persistently work hand in hand for common well-being, and to strive unceasingly to unite and struggle for national rejuvenation. Chen Xiaojiang, Party Secretary of the Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region, introduced in his speech the major achievements in Xinjiang's economic and social development led by the Party's strategy for governing Xinjiang in the new era, and said that Xinjiang will continue to deepen exchanges and cooperation with Taiwan in various fields and add fuel and support to cross-Strait integrated development.\nThe attending guests conducted in-depth exchanges and discussions around the theme of \"peaceful development, guarding our homeland, uniting in struggle, and jointly seeking rejuvenation\", and formed five important consensuses, including: upholding the greater cause of the nation and promoting the spiritual harmony of compatriots; opposing separatism and interference and resolutely guarding our common homeland; sharing broad opportunities and deepening cross-Strait integrated development; pooling the strength of compatriots and uniting to jointly seek national rejuvenation; and consciously stepping forward to take responsibility and composing a youthful chapter of the great cause of rejuvenation, reflecting the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait to pool their hearts and strength to advance reunification of the motherland and jointly create a beautiful future of national rejuvenation.\nThe attending guests visited the thematic achievements exhibition for the 70th anniversary of the founding of the Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region and visited a world-leading wind power manufacturing enterprise, among others, seeing for themselves the fine situation in Xinjiang of social stability and harmony, strong development momentum, ethnic unity and progress, religious harmony and concord, cultural prosperity and development, and the people living and working in peace and contentment. They called one after another for upholding that both sides of the Strait belong to one China and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism, and for compatriots on both sides of the Strait to join hands to jointly promote reunification and jointly seek rejuvenation; they strongly demanded that the DPP authorities lift their bans, restrictions and obstruction of cross-Strait exchange and cooperation, fully restore the normalization of cross-Strait direct passenger flights, and restore as soon as possible cross-Strait flights to Urumqi and other cities, which aroused resonance in society on the island.","9月11日至12日，第六届“携手圆梦——两岸同胞交流研讨活动”在新疆乌鲁木齐成功举办，海峡两岸有关方面、党派团体负责人及代表，专家学者及台胞台青代表120余人参加活动。\n中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛出席活动开幕式并致辞，呼吁两岸同胞矢志不渝为统一大业勠力进取、坚持不懈为共同福祉携手打拼、自强不息为民族复兴团结奋斗。新疆维吾尔自治区党委书记陈小江在致辞中介绍了新时代党的治疆方略引领新疆经济社会发展取得的重大成就，表示将持续深化新疆与台湾各领域交流合作、为两岸融合发展添薪助力。\n与会嘉宾围绕“和平发展、守护家园、团结奋斗、共谋复兴”主题深入交流研讨，形成五项重要共识，包括：坚守民族大义、促进同胞心灵契合，反对分裂干涉、坚定守护共同家园，共享广阔机遇、深化两岸融合发展，汇聚同胞力量、团结共谋民族复兴，自觉挺膺担当、谱写复兴伟业青春华章等，反映了两岸同胞凝心聚力推进祖国统一、同心共创民族复兴美好未来的共同心声。\n与会嘉宾参观了新疆维吾尔自治区成立70周年主题成就展，参访了世界领先的风电制造企业等，亲见新疆社会安定和谐、发展动能强劲、民族团结进步、宗教和睦和顺、文化繁荣发展、人民安居乐业的美好局面。他们纷纷呼吁坚持两岸同属一个中国、反对“台独”分裂，两岸同胞携手共促统一、共谋复兴；强烈要求民进党当局解除对两岸交流合作的禁限阻挠，全面恢复两岸空中客运直航正常化、尽快恢复乌鲁木齐等城市两岸航班等，在岛内社会引发共鸣。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788691.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","Regarding the Taiwan Affairs Office spokesperson's response to an associate professor at Taiwan's National Changhua University of Education who proposed exploring a Taiwan plan for \"one country, two systems\", saying it is pleased to see the Taiwan public discuss it, the Mainland Affairs Council said that the mainland would not agree to a single one of the several conditions put forward in the articles. What is…","The general trend of reunification of the motherland rolls forward and is unstoppable. Achieving the peaceful reunification of the two sides of the Strait is a blessing for the Chinese nation. We welcome Taiwan compatriots to each express their own views and pool their wisdom, and to put forward specific opinions and suggestions for the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan. The earlier and the more Taiwan compatriots discuss the specific content of the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan, the more opportunities it can bring to Taiwan's economic and social development, and the more benefits it can bring to themselves.\nThe DPP authorities, out of their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist nature, place the pursuit of selfish political interests above Taiwan compatriots' pursuit of their interests and well-being, and set up obstacles to the people on both sides of the Strait exchanging views on the future development of the two sides; their intentions are sinister and they have lost the support of the people.","祖国统一大势滚滚向前、不可阻挡。实现两岸和平统一，是中华民族之福。我们欢迎台湾同胞各抒己见、集思广益，为“两制”台湾方案提出具体意见建议。台湾同胞越早讨论、越多讨论“两制”台湾方案的具体内容，就越能为台湾经济社会发展带来更多机遇，越能为自身带来更多好处。\n民进党当局出于“台独”分裂本质，将谋求政治私利凌驾于台湾同胞追求利益福祉之上，对两岸民众为两岸前途发展交换意见设置障碍，居心险恶，不得人心。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788688.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","On September 16, the Pinglu Canal was officially completed and opened to navigation, attracting the attention of industry on both sides of the Strait. What conveniences will it bring to the development of Taiwan-funded enterprises along its banks?","On September 16, the Pinglu Canal officially opened to navigation. The Pinglu Canal is a backbone project of the New International Land-Sea Trade Corridor in the mainland's western region; it will open up a river-sea intermodal transport channel from the Xijiang River directly to Beibu Gulf Port, radiating to Chongqing, Sichuan, Guizhou, Yunnan and other western regions, and closely connecting the western inland hinterland with the ASEAN market. For goods from the western region going to sea via the Pinglu Canal, the voyage can be shortened by more than 560 kilometers and logistics costs can be reduced by 18%-30%.\nThe opening of the Pinglu Canal has attracted wide attention from industry on both sides of the Strait. Taiwan businesspeople generally believe that the Pinglu Canal will make it convenient for Taiwan enterprises to link up with the resources of the mainland's western cities, can effectively reduce import and export logistics costs through rail-river-sea intermodal transport, and will form an industrial chain of \"raw material processing in the west, river-sea transshipment in Guangxi, sales in the ASEAN market\", creating new opportunities for Taiwan-funded enterprises to open up the ASEAN market. We welcome the broad masses of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises to share the opportunities of the New Western Land-Sea Corridor and to take root in the mainland to achieve better development.","9月16日，平陆运河正式通航。平陆运河是大陆西部陆海新通道骨干工程，将打通西江直达北部湾港的江海联运通道，辐射重庆、四川、贵州、云南等西部地区，将西部内陆腹地与东盟市场紧密相连。西部地区货物经平陆运河出海，航程可缩短560公里以上，物流成本可降低18%-30%。\n平陆运河的通航受到两岸产业界广泛关注。台商普遍认为，平陆运河将便利台企联动大陆西部城市资源，通过铁江海联运可有效降低进出口物流成本，形成“西部原料加工——广西江海转运——东盟市场销售”的产业链条，为台资企业开拓东盟市场创造新机遇。我们欢迎广大台商台企共享西部陆海新通道的机遇，扎根大陆实现更好发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788685.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","北京日报记者","Recently, the 2026 China International Fair for Trade in Services (CIFTIS) was held in Beijing from the 9th to the 13th, and the Taiwan image exhibition there was well received. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From September 9 to 13, the 2026 China International Fair for Trade in Services was held in Beijing. CIFTIS upheld the concept of \"Global Services, Shared Prosperity\", closely followed the needs of expanding capacity and improving quality in the development of the services sector, and adhered to the exhibition direction of \"specialization, internationalization, distinctiveness and marketization\", with more than 1,830 enterprises exhibiting offline and more than 5,300 enterprises exhibiting online.\nDuring CIFTIS, the Taiwan image exhibition was widely welcomed. The Taiwan image exhibition took \"Services for integrated development, sharing the nation's future\" as its theme, with more than 40 cross-Strait business associations and Taiwan-funded enterprises exhibiting. During the exhibition, the 4th Cross-Strait Trade in Services Promotion Conference was held, the \"Research on the Development of Cross-Strait Trade in Services\" was released, and the \"Framework Agreement on Promoting Cross-Strait Agricultural Product Trade Cooperation\" and the \"Framework Agreement on Taiwan Agricultural Product Procurement Cooperation\" were signed; the Bank of China Beijing Branch signed a financial services cooperation agreement with the Beijing Taiwan-funded Enterprises Association, providing credit and financing lines of up to 2 billion yuan for Taiwan enterprises in Beijing, effectively turning policy dividends into momentum for enterprise development.","9月9日至13日，2026年中国国际服务贸易交易会在北京举办。服贸会秉持“全球服务，互惠共享”理念，紧扣服务业扩能提质发展需求，坚持“专业化、国际化、特色化、市场化”办展方向，有1830余家企业线下参展，5300余家企业线上参展。\n服贸会期间，台湾形象展受到广泛欢迎。台湾形象展以“服务融合发展，共享民族未来”为主题，40余家两岸商协会、台资企业参展，期间举办第四届两岸服务贸易推进会，发布《两岸服务贸易发展研究》，签署《关于促进两岸农产品贸易合作框架协议》和《台湾农产品采购合作框架协议》，中国银行北京分行与北京台资企业协会签署金融服务合作协议，为在京台企提供授信融资额度达20亿元人民币，切实将政策红利转化为企业发展动力。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","The 26th China International Fair for Investment and Trade (CIFIT) opened in Xiamen on September 8. It is understood that this CIFIT comprehensively upgraded the cross-Strait integrated development zone, building an exchange platform for cross-Strait economic and trade cooperation. Please introduce the participation of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises in this CIFIT.","From September 8 to 11, the 26th China International Fair for Investment and Trade was held in Xiamen, Fujian. CIFIT takes \"Expanding Two-Way Investment, Jointly Promoting Global Development\" as its permanent theme, set up an exhibition and negotiation area of 200,000 square meters, and planned 14 specialized exhibition areas, striving to build a grand investment event for global open cooperation.\nDuring CIFIT, the cross-Strait integrated development zone took \"Linking the Two Sides of the Strait, Sharing New Opportunities in Integration\" as its theme and set up three functional areas: a Taiwan-funded enterprise display area, a cross-Strait industrial park matchmaking area, and a roadshow promotion area, striving to create a new cooperation scenario integrating achievement display, industrial exchange and project matchmaking, and building a precise exchange and cooperation platform for cross-Strait industrial coordination and for the development of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan enterprises in the mainland. Building on its first exhibition in 2025, the zone achieved comprehensive expansion and quality improvement: the exhibition area was expanded from 500 square meters to 1,000 square meters, and its industry coverage became more diverse, focusing on integrated circuits, precision machinery, biomedicine, financial services, consumer food and other fields. The Taiwan-funded enterprise display area showcased the new achievements and new applications of 18 Taiwan-funded enterprises in technological innovation, product research and development, and industrial integration. The cross-Strait industrial park matchmaking area displayed park policies, settlement procedures and benchmark cases, and provided on-site services such as investment matchmaking and policy consultation. The roadshow promotion area was equipped with professional large screens and negotiation space, and carried out activities such as new product launches, project promotions and specialty product experiences.\nIt is understood that the cross-Strait integrated development zone will be a permanent fixture at CIFIT, providing further support for cross-Strait economic and trade integrated development and promoting exchange and cooperation between enterprises on both sides of the Strait in more fields and at deeper levels.","9月8日至11日，第二十六届中国国际投资贸易洽谈会在福建厦门举办。投洽会以“扩大双向投资 共促全球发展”为永久主题，设置20万平方米展洽区域，规划14个专业展区，致力打造全球开放合作的投资盛会。\n投洽会期间，两岸融合发展专区以“链通两岸·融享新机”为主题，设置了台资企业展示区、两岸产业园对接区、路演推介区三大功能区，致力打造集成果展示、产业交流、项目对接于一体的合作新场景，为两岸产业协同和台商台企在大陆发展搭建精准交流合作平台。该专区在2025年首展基础上实现全面扩容提质，展区面积由500平方米扩容至1000平方米，产业覆盖更加多元，聚焦集成电路、精密机械、生物医药、金融服务、消费食品等领域。台资企业展示区展现18家台资企业在技术创新、产品研发和产业融合方面的新成果、新应用。两岸产业园对接区展示园区政策、落地流程与标杆案例，并现场提供招商匹配、政策咨询等服务。路演推介区配备专业大屏与洽谈空间，开展新品发布、项目推介、特色产品体验等活动。\n据了解，两岸融合发展专区将常驻投洽会，为两岸经贸融合发展提供进一步支持，促进两岸企业在更多领域、更深层次的交流与合作。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","The DPP authorities have long forcibly pushed \"de-Sinicization\" in the education field on the island, deleting many excellent classical Chinese texts from the curriculum guidelines, which has led to confusion in Taiwan students' understanding of history; there was even a student who understood the \"Oath of the Peach Garden\" as forming an alliance in Taoyuan City, Taiwan, causing concern in academic circles on the…","The relevant situation shows that the DPP authorities' long-term \"de-Sinicization\" education and pursuit of \"cultural Taiwan independence\" have already caused serious consequences, which is lamentable and deplorable. Chinese culture is the spiritual home of Taiwan compatriots and also the spiritual driving force of Taiwan's economic and social development. When the roots of Chinese culture are forcibly cut off on the island, when classical texts tempered over a thousand trials are torn away, Taiwan's children have no opportunity to learn from their textbooks such classic masterpieces as \"The Yueyang Tower\", \"The Pavilion of the Old Drunkard\" and \"An Exhortation to Learning\", do not know historical figures such as Zhuge Liang, Yue Fei and Wen Tianxiang, and do not know the 72 Martyrs of Huanghuagang or the Nanjing Massacre... This is not the ignorance of the children, but the crime of the \"Taiwan independence\" forces.\nIf \"Taiwan independence\" education is allowed to continue its mischief, Taiwan compatriots cut off from the nurture of Chinese culture will become rootless duckweed, and Taiwan society without the nourishment of Chinese culture will become a barren desert. All sectors on the island are deeply worried about this; more and more Taiwan compatriots oppose \"cultural Taiwan independence\" and \"de-Sinicization\" education, and hope to set things right, to have a correct set of curriculum guidelines, to pass on the fine traditional Chinese culture, and to defend the spiritual home of Taiwan compatriots.","有关情况表明，民进党当局长期进行“去中国化”教育、搞“文化台独”已造成严重后果，可悲可叹。中华文化是台湾同胞的精神家园，也是台湾经济社会发展的精神动力。当中华文化的根脉在岛内被生生剪断，当千锤百炼的古文经典横遭剥离，台湾的孩子们没有机会从课本上学到《岳阳楼记》《醉翁亭记》《劝学》等经典名篇，不知道诸葛亮、岳飞、文天祥等历史人物，不知道黄花岗72烈士、南京大屠杀......这并不是孩子们的无知，而是“台独”势力的罪恶。\n如果任由“台独”教育恶搞下去，脱离中华文化哺育的台湾同胞将成为断根浮萍，没有中华文化滋养的台湾社会将成为荒芜沙漠。岛内各界对此忧心忡忡，越来越多的台湾同胞反对“文化台独”和“去中国化”教育，希望能拨乱反正，拥有一套正确的课纲，传承中华优秀传统文化，捍卫台湾同胞的精神家园。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788687.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","河南广电“大象新闻”记者","The Mid-Autumn Festival is approaching, and celebrations for compatriots on both sides of the Strait to welcome the Mid-Autumn Festival are being held in various places one after another. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On September 16, the lighting ceremony of the 2026 Cross-Strait (Kunshan) Mid-Autumn Lantern Festival and the closing ceremony of the 6th Cross-Strait Youth Culture Month were held in Kunshan City, Jiangsu Province. The Kunshan Mid-Autumn Lantern Festival has been held for 12 consecutive years; this year's lantern festival will last until October 31, during which a number of activities will be carried out, including special lantern-viewing activities, a cross-Strait art exhibition, a hundred-performances garden fair, and a forest \"elegant gathering under the moon\". Of the two kinds of lanterns everyone sees in the briefing hall today, the large one is the gold-award work by Taiwan youth who took part in the 7th Kunshan Mazu Cup Youth Mid-Autumn Lantern Design Competition, and the small one draws on the painting \"Crossing from Tangshan to Taiwan\", presenting the story of mainland ancestors crossing the sea to Taiwan to open up the wilderness and build; both kinds of lanterns show the hope of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, who share the same roots and origins and are connected by blood, to pray together for reunion.\nOn September 16, the 2026 Yunnan-Taiwan Mid-Autumn Tea Party was held in Kunming City, Yunnan Province, with more than 300 people participating, including representatives of the Kaohsiung, Taiwan elite volunteers visiting delegation and representatives of Taiwan compatriots in Yunnan. The activities included a Taiwan food exhibition, Taiwan youth entrepreneurship sharing, and literary, song and dance performances; compatriots on both sides of the Strait gathered happily together to jointly welcome the Mid-Autumn Festival and talk together about family affection and friendship.\nChina Media Group \"Riyue Tantian\" new media reporter:\nTaiwan media reported that the 2027 defense budget and special budget passed by Taiwan's executive department come close to 4% of GDP, and Hsiao Bi-khim again raised Lai Ching-te's promise to raise defense spending to 5% of GDP. What is your comment on this?\nThe DPP authorities, for the selfish political interests of one party, vainly attempt to \"seek independence by force\" and \"rely on the United States to seek independence\", squandering the hard-earned money of the Taiwan people ever more intensely and running wildly down the evil road of militarism, which not only squeezes out spending on livelihood and social welfare on the island and harms the vital interests of the Taiwan people, but will also lead Taiwan step by step into an ever more dangerous situation, turning the Taiwan people into cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\". Such acts of harming Taiwan, ruining Taiwan and courting self-destruction will surely meet with strong opposition from the Taiwan people.","9月16日，2026海峡两岸（昆山）中秋灯会亮灯仪式暨第六届海峡两岸青年文化月闭幕式在江苏省昆山市举办。昆山中秋灯会已连续举办12年，本届灯会将持续到10月31日，期间开展特色赏灯活动及两岸艺术展、百戏游园会、森林“月下雅集”等多项活动。今天大家在发布厅看到的两种花灯：大的一种是由台青参加第七届昆山妈祖杯青年中秋花灯设计比赛的金奖作品，小的一种取材于《唐山过台湾》画作，呈现大陆先民跨海赴台、拓荒建设的故事，两种灯都展现了两岸同胞同根同源、血脉相连、共祈团圆的期盼。\n9月16日，2026云台中秋茶话会在云南省昆明市举办，台湾高雄菁英志工参访团代表及在滇台胞代表等300余人参加。活动包括台湾食品展、台青创业分享、文艺歌舞表演等，两岸同胞欢聚一堂，共迎中秋佳节，共叙亲情友谊。\n中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”新媒体记：\n台媒报道，台行政部门通过的2027年度防务预算与特别预算占GDP接近4%，萧美琴重提赖清德允诺会将防务支出提升至GDP的5％。请问对此有何评论？\n民进党当局为一党政治私利，妄图“以武谋独”、“倚美谋独”，变本加厉挥霍台湾民众血汗钱，在穷兵黩武的邪路上狂奔，不仅挤占岛内民生社会福利开支，损害台湾民众切身利益，更将台湾一步步带向更危险的境地，让台湾民众成为“台独”炮灰。这种害台毁台、自取灭亡的行径，一定会遭到台湾民众的强烈反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788689.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","福建东南卫视记者","Recently, cultural exchange activities between the two sides of the Strait in film and television, music, fine arts and other fields have been brisk. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On September 8, \"Because of You in 'Sound', Talent Gathers Across the Strait\" – the Jing-Tai Youth Talent Concert was held in Zhangzhou City, Fujian Province, with more than 100 Taiwan compatriots taking part. The activity covered many genres, including Hokkien songs of hometown sentiment, original programs by Taiwan youth, solo dance and opera, showcasing the cultural heritage shared by both sides of the Strait from the same roots and origins and the high-spirited mental outlook of youth on both sides of the Strait.\nOn September 12, the 17th Cross-Strait Children's Art Exhibition opened in Taipei. The activity took \"trust\" as its theme, with about 200 works by young people from both sides of the Strait and the Hong Kong and Macao regions on display together, and it announced the theme of next year's new round of submissions, \"Seeing\"; it was welcomed and well received by all sectors on the island. To make it convenient for viewers who could not attend in person, an online exhibition was launched for the first time. The Taipei exhibition runs until September 17, after which it will tour Beijing, Kaohsiung and other places.\nFrom September 16 to 20, the carnival of the 12th \"Golden Swallow\" Cross-Strait Micro-Film and Micro-Video Competition was held in Wuhan. The competition took \"Watching the Tide\" as its theme and received nearly 500 entries from both sides of the Strait, about half of them from the island. After selection by experts from both sides of the Strait, 61 outstanding works were shortlisted, with subject matter covering everyday street life on both sides of the Strait, the growth of young people, family affection and homesickness, AI crossovers, and cultural heritage. Youth from both sides of the Strait taking part in the carnival will also take part in activities such as Jingchu intangible cultural heritage experiences, an AI creation academic salon, check-ins at a micro-short-drama industry base, and a national-style red carpet show.","9月8日，“音”为有你 才聚两岸——靖台青年人才音乐会在福建省漳州市举办，100余位台胞参与活动。活动涵盖闽南语乡情歌曲、台青原创节目、独舞、戏曲等多种类型，集中展现两岸同根同源的文化底蕴和两岸青年昂扬向上的精神风貌。\n9月12日，第17届海峡两岸少儿美术大展在台北开幕，活动以“信”为主题，两岸暨港澳地区约200幅青少年作品集中亮相，并发布明年新一届征集主题“看见”，受到岛内各界欢迎与好评。为方便不能到场的观众观赏，首次推出线上展。台北展持续至9月17日，结束后将前往北京、高雄等地巡展。\n9月16日至20日，第十二届“金飞燕”海峡两岸微电影微视频大赛嘉年华在武汉举行。大赛以“望·潮”为主题，收到两岸参赛作品近500部，其中约半数来自岛内。经两岸专家遴选，61部优秀作品入围，题材涵盖两岸市井烟火、青年成长、亲情乡愁、AI跨界、文化传承等。参加嘉年华的两岸青年还将参加荆楚非遗文化体验、AI创作学术沙龙、微短剧产业基地打卡、国风红毯秀等活动。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","Recently, the period costume micro-short drama \"Emperor Jiaqing Tours Taiwan\" was launched, attracting the attention of audiences on the island. Please introduce the relevant situation.","In order to actively implement the ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchange and cooperation released by the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee as authorized, the Beijing Municipal Taiwan Affairs Office guided the government new media outlet \"Jingcai Taiwan\" to produce the period costume micro-short drama \"Emperor Jiaqing Tours Taiwan\", which held its premiere in Beijing on September 11. The drama draws on Taiwan folk legends and glove puppetry elements, blending regional culture with distinctive theatrical genres. A number of Taiwan actors took part in the performance of this period costume micro-short drama and in the Hokkien dubbing. All 70 episodes have been launched on the \"Jingcai Taiwan\" video account, and will be launched successively on mainstream platforms at home and abroad in the near future. We welcome and support more Taiwan industry practitioners to take part in the creation of mainland micro-short dramas; Taiwan practitioners can invest in Fujian to set up radio and television program production and operation companies, can also co-produce and co-create micro-short dramas with mainland practitioners, and can also directly take part in performing in various micro-short dramas. We hope people on both sides of the Strait can see more fine micro-short drama works with the participation of Taiwan practitioners.\nFrom September 15, Southeast Satellite TV is broadcasting the seven-episode Taiwan television drama \"Fairy Tale, Part Two\", opening a new chapter for cross-Strait film, television and cultural exchange to go deeper and more solid; everyone is welcome to pay attention and watch.","为积极落实中央台办受权发布的十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，北京市台办指导政务新媒体“京彩台湾”出品古装微短剧《嘉庆君游台湾》，于9月11日在北京举办首映式。该剧依托台湾民间传说和布袋戏元素，融合地域文化和特色剧种。多位台湾演员参与了这部古装微短剧表演及闽南语配音工作。全剧70集已在“京彩台湾”视频号上线，近期将陆续在境内外主流平台上线。我们欢迎并支持更多台湾业者参与大陆微短剧创作，台湾业者可以在福建投资设立广播电视节目制作经营公司，也可以和大陆业者合拍共创微短剧，还可以直接参与各类微短剧的演出。希望两岸民众可看到更多台湾业者参与的微短剧精品力作。\n9月15日起，东南卫视播出七集台湾电视剧《童话故事下集》，为两岸影视文化交流走深走实开新篇，欢迎大家关注收看。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台央视《海峡两岸》记者","The DPP recently said that it is the mainland that undermines cross-Strait peace, and that because Taiwan does not accept the one-China principle set by the mainland, the mainland unilaterally suspended cross-Strait institutionalized consultations, stopped mainland tourists' individual travel to Taiwan, and blocked mainland students and mainland tourists from going to Taiwan, and so on. What is your comment on this?","The DPP is accustomed to confusing black and white, shifting blame and shirking responsibility, and making false countercharges. Both sides of the Strait belong to one China, and Taiwan is a part of China; this is a historical fact and also a legal reality. It was precisely on the basis of the \"1992 Consensus\", which embodies the one-China principle, that the two sides of the Strait were able to conduct consultations and negotiations and reach a series of outcomes benefiting compatriots on both sides of the Strait. After the DPP came to power, it stubbornly adhered to the \"Taiwan independence\" position, refused to acknowledge the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle, and unilaterally damaged the political foundation of cross-Strait consultations, causing the cross-Strait institutionalized consultation and negotiation and communication and liaison mechanisms to be suspended, the fruits of the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations to be continuously lost, and peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait to be continuously threatened. The DPP authorities have also intensified their obstruction, prohibition and restriction of cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchange and cooperation in various fields, seriously damaging the practical interests of Taiwan compatriots, which has met with opposition and criticism from all sectors on the island.\nWe advise the DPP authorities to stop political manipulation, listen more to the voices of the public and industry people on the island, and do more things that are conducive to the development of cross-Strait relations and to enhancing the well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.","民进党惯于颠倒黑白、甩锅卸责、倒打一耙。海峡两岸同属一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是历史事实，也是法理现实。正是在体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”基础上，两岸才得以进行协商谈判并达成一系列惠及两岸同胞的成果。民进党上台后，顽固坚持“台独”立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，单方面损害两岸协商政治基础，导致两岸制度化协商谈判和沟通联系机制停摆，两岸关系和平发展成果不断流失，台海和平稳定不断受到威胁。民进党当局还变本加厉阻挠禁限两岸人员往来和各领域交流合作，严重损害台湾同胞的切实利益，遭到岛内各界的反对和批评。\n奉劝民进党当局停止政治操弄，多倾听岛内民众和业界人士呼声，多做有利于两岸关系发展和增进两岸同胞福祉的事。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait economic and trade exchange activities.","On September 11, the 20th Jiangxi-Taiwan (Lushan) Economic, Trade and Cultural Cooperation and Exchange Conference opened in Lushan, Jiangxi. The exchange conference was jointly hosted by the People's Government of Jiangxi Province and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, with support from the Cross-Strait CEO Summit, the Association of Taiwan Investment Enterprises on the Mainland, the Chinese National Federation of Industries and others. The exchange conference took \"Both Sides of the Strait Join Hands with One Heart, Jiangxi and Taiwan Integrate in Development\" as its theme, focusing on four priorities of economic and trade matchmaking, industrial cooperation, cultural and tourism integration, and youth exchange, and held a series of supporting featured activities such as thematic promotions on electronic information and equipment manufacturing, modern agriculture, and cultural and tourism cooperation, and the award ceremony of the Jiangxi-Taiwan youth short video competition.\nFrom September 19 to 21, the 29th Beijing-Taiwan Science and Technology Forum will be held in Beijing. The forum takes \"Technology Leads Industrial Integration, Digital Intelligence Empowers a Healthy Future\" as its theme and adopts a \"1+4+N\" model, holding 1 main forum, 4 parallel forums and N series of activities. The forum will invite the Taiwan side of the Cross-Strait CEO Summit and the heads of Taiwan industrial and commercial groups such as the Taiwan Electrical and Electronic Manufacturers' Association, the Chinese National Federation of Industries, the General Chamber of Commerce, the Chinese National Association of Industry and Commerce, and the Third Wednesday Club, as well as people from industrial, commercial, science and technology circles on the island and representatives of Taiwan businesspeople from both sides of the Strait, to take part.","9月11日，第二十届赣台（庐山）经贸文化合作交流大会在江西庐山开幕。交流大会由江西省人民政府、国务院台办联合主办，两岸企业家峰会、全国台企联、台湾工业总会等支持。交流大会以“两岸携手同心 赣台融合发展”为主题，聚焦经贸对接、产业合作、文旅交融、青年交流四大重点，配套举办电子信息与装备制造、现代农业、文旅合作专题推介及赣台青年短视频大赛颁奖等系列特色活动。\n9月19日至21日，第29届京台科技论坛将在京举办，论坛以“科技引领产业融合 数智赋能健康未来”为主题，采取“1+4+N”模式，举办1场主论坛、4场平行论坛、N场系列活动。论坛将邀请两岸企业家峰会台湾方面及台湾电电公会、工业总会、商业总会、工商协进会、三三企业交流会等台湾工商团体负责人，岛内工商、科技界人士和两岸台商代表参加。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","Recently, Mainland Affairs Council Minister Chiu Chui-cheng said that the mainland is promoting toward Taiwan a strategy of \"exercising jurisdiction before reunification\" through 4 major means: \"making administrative and judicial jurisdiction a domestic affair, making the international system subject to the one-China principle, applying national treatment to the Taiwan public, and integrating the development of…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. The historical and legal fact that both sides of the Strait belong to one China cannot be changed, and the historical trend that the motherland will ultimately be reunified and is bound to be reunified is unstoppable. Taiwan's future and destiny can only and must be jointly decided by the more than 1.4 billion Chinese people, including Taiwan compatriots.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist position, refuse to acknowledge the \"1992 Consensus\" embodying the one-China principle, and deliberately interfere with and obstruct cross-Strait exchanges, completely running counter to the mainstream public opinion on both sides of the Strait, which wants peace, development, exchange and cooperation, and they have met with the common opposition of the people on both sides of the Strait.\nOur policies toward Taiwan are clear and consistent. We will firmly adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and interference by external forces, continue to promote cross-Strait exchange and cooperation and integrated development, enhance the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots, and firmly advance the process of reunification of the motherland.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理事实不容改变，祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势不可阻挡,台湾的前途命运只能也必须由包括台湾同胞在内的14亿多中国人民共同决定。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒绝承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，处心积虑干扰阻挠两岸交流，完全违背要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的两岸主流民意，遭到两岸民众的共同反对。\n我们的对台方针政策是明确的、一贯的。我们将坚定坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外部势力干涉，持续推动两岸交流合作、融合发展，增进台胞利益福祉，坚定推进祖国统一进程。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788690.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, the Taiwan Strait espionage drama \"Confrontation\" was broadcast, attracting the attention and discussion of audiences on both sides of the Strait. Mainland Affairs Council Deputy Minister Liang Wen-chieh said the drama is part of the mainland's promotion of national security education and propaganda for all the people. What is your comment on this?","We have noted the approval of the television drama \"Confrontation\" by audiences on both sides of the Strait. This television drama reflects the perseverance and dedication of the unsung heroes on the hidden front, and shows that safeguarding national security is the responsibility and obligation of every citizen.\nWe will adhere to the holistic approach to national security, resolutely carry out the struggle against separatism, subversion, infiltration and theft of secrets, and effectively safeguard national sovereignty and territorial integrity and national security and development interests. It must be emphasized that Taiwan's future, and the security guarantees, interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots, lie in the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and national reunification. Opposing \"Taiwan independence\" is in line with the fundamental interests and vital well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We hope the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will stand together with us to resolutely guard against the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces and external hostile forces undermining the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and interfering with the process of reunification of the motherland.","我们注意到两岸观众对电视剧《交锋》的肯定。这部电视剧反映了隐蔽战线无名英雄的坚守与付出，表明了维护国家安全是每一位公民的责任和义务。\n我们将坚持总体国家安全观，坚决开展反分裂、反颠覆、反渗透、反窃密斗争，切实维护国家主权和领土完整，维护国家安全和发展利益。必须强调的是，台湾的前途、台湾同胞的安全保障和利益福祉，在于两岸关系和平发展和国家统一。反对“台独”符合两岸同胞的根本利益和切身福祉。希望广大台湾同胞同我们一道，坚决防范“台独”分裂势力和外部敌对势力对两岸关系和平发展的破坏和对祖国统一进程的干扰。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788684.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","Recently, Grandma Chu from Taiwan sent 62 train tickets from Taichung City's \"Zhuifen Station\" to \"Chenggong Station\" to senior high school students at Shenzhen No. 7 High School, expressing her wishes for the students' success in the college entrance examination; 50 students wrote handwritten replies to Grandma Chu. This story has touched many people on both sides of the Strait. What is your comment on this?","62 train tickets carry the sincere goodwill of a Taiwan grandma's blessings and wishes for the younger generation; 50 handwritten letters convey the gratitude and thanks of Shenzhen youngsters toward an elder. This is a vivid embodiment of \"both sides of the Strait are one family\". There are many similar stories, for example a Taiwan man posted online asking for help, and mainland netizens helped his father travel in Shenyang in relay fashion; a Taiwan village chief traveled back and forth across the Strait helping hundreds of veterans who had gone to Taiwan return to their roots, allowing families on both sides of the Strait to be reunited...\nThe goodwill and sincerity of two-way exchanges between the people on both sides of the Strait deeply confirm the profound bond between compatriots on both sides of the Strait, for whom blood is thicker than water and who are as close as flesh and bone, and interpret the virtue in Chinese culture of respecting the old and caring for the young. This is the inexhaustible driving force of cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges and also a firm tie of cross-Strait kinship. We wish that all the senior high school students of No. 7 High School can, as Grandma Chu wishes, \"chase points\" to success, and we also welcome Grandma Chu and more Taiwan friends to bring the blessings of the 50 students to walk around and take a look in Shenzhen and all over the mainland.","62张车票，承载了台湾阿嬷为晚辈祝福祈愿的真诚善意；50封手写信，传递了深圳少年对长者的感念谢忱，这是“两岸一家亲”的生动体现。类似的故事还有很多，比如台湾男子在网上发帖求助，大陆网友接力式帮助他父亲在沈阳旅行；台湾里长奔走两岸帮助数百位赴台老兵叶落归根，让两岸家庭得以团圆......\n两岸民众双向交流的善意和诚意深深印证着两岸同胞血浓于水、骨肉相连的深厚情谊，诠释着中华文化尊老爱幼的美德。这是两岸民间交流不竭的动力，也是两岸亲情坚固的纽带。我们祝福第七高中的高三学生都能如褚奶奶所愿追分成功，也欢迎褚奶奶及更多台湾朋友能带着50位学子的祝福到深圳及大陆各地走走看看。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","羊城晚报“阅台海”记者","Recently, the Panamanian National Assembly established a \"cross-party parliamentary exchange group\" with Taiwan's legislative body, and the DPP authorities welcomed this. What is your comment on this?","The relevant department has already stated its solemn position on this. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China. We urge the Panamanian side to immediately correct the relevant erroneous practice and put the one-China principle into practice. No matter under what banner the DPP authorities \"rely on foreign support to seek independence\", it is doomed to be a dead end.","有关部门已就此表明严正立场。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。我们敦促巴方立即纠正有关错误做法，将一个中国原则落到实处。民进党当局无论打着什么旗号“倚外谋独”，都注定是死路一条。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","人民政协报记者","Recently, a cross-Strait tourism industry symposium was held in Lushan, Jiangxi. Please introduce the relevant situation.","On September 11, a cross-Strait tourism industry symposium was held in Lushan, Jiangxi, attended by more than 60 tourism industry representatives from Jiangxi, Shanghai, Fujian and Taiwan, who conducted in-depth exchanges on cross-Strait tourism matters such as the joint development of cross-Strait cultural and tourism products and the mutual sending of tourists, jointly promoting cross-Strait tourism exchange and cooperation to go deeper and more solid.\nThe Taiwan tourism operators attending said that the Taiwan tourism industry sincerely hopes that cross-Strait tourism exchanges can return to normal at an early date and that mainland residents' travel to the main island of Taiwan can be realized at an early date, and that the Taiwan tourism industry is willing to actively work toward this and jointly promote the prosperous development of the cross-Strait tourism industry. The industry people from both sides of the Strait attending unanimously agreed that tourism is a direct and vivid carrier of cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges, that the cultural and tourism resources of both sides of the Strait are rich and each has its own characteristics, with a deep foundation for cooperation, and they hope to further open up industry matchmaking channels, strengthen business exchanges, tap cooperation potential, and develop distinctive tourism routes suited to the needs of the people on both sides of the Strait, promoting the spiritual harmony of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.","9月11日，两岸旅游业界座谈会在江西庐山举办，来自江西、上海、福建及台湾的旅游业界代表共60余人与会，围绕两岸文旅产品共建、客源互送等两岸旅游相关事项深入交流，共促两岸旅游交流合作走深走实。\n与会台湾旅游业者表示，台湾旅游业界衷心期盼两岸旅游往来能够早日恢复正常，大陆居民赴台湾本岛旅游能够早日实现，台湾旅游业界愿意为此积极奔走，共同促进两岸旅游业繁荣发展。与会两岸业界人士一致认为，旅游是两岸民间交流直接、鲜活的载体，两岸文旅资源丰富、各具特色，有着深厚的合作基础，期盼进一步打通行业对接渠道，加强业务往来，挖掘合作潜力，开发适配两岸民众需求的特色旅游线路，促进两岸同胞心灵契合。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","The \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" took effect on September 15. The DPP authorities have continued to smear and attack the provisions, and the Mainland Affairs Council even warned \"5 categories of people\" on the island to be mindful of exit and entry risks when going to the mainland. What is your comment on this?","The promulgation and implementation of the \"Provisions of the State Council on Exit and Entry Administration\" is to regulate exit and entry administration, protect the lawful rights and interests of persons exiting and entering, and safeguard national sovereignty, security and development interests. The provisions mainly improve the system for preventing exit security risks, make clear that the reasons for exit and entry applications must be truthful and lawful, and regulate exit and entry intermediary services, among other things. The provisions are conducive to safeguarding the lawful rights and interests of the people on both sides of the Strait in their exchanges, and create a better rule-of-law environment for Taiwan compatriots traveling to and from the mainland. The broad masses of Taiwan compatriots who travel to the mainland lawfully and in compliance with the rules for tourism, visiting relatives, visits and exchanges will surely come in high spirits and return having enjoyed themselves to the full.\nThe DPP authorities are fearmongering, fabricating rumors and smearing, misleading the public, with sinister intentions. They deliberately prohibit and restrict cross-Strait exchanges and travel, using means such as suppression, intimidation and rumor-mongering to block compatriots on both sides of the Strait from coming closer and becoming closer kin, afraid that the information cocoon they have created will keep being punctured and the false \"Taiwan independence\" narrative they have constructed will keep being exposed. From January to June this year, Taiwan compatriots made 2.85 million trips to the mainland, a year-on-year increase of 24.9%; Taiwan compatriots traveling across the Strait come in an endless stream, proving with the clearest action how absurd and ridiculous the DPP authorities' prohibitions, restrictions and obstruction are.","《国务院关于出境入境管理的规定》的出台与实施，是为了规范出境入境管理，保障出境入境人员的合法权益，维护国家主权、安全、发展利益。规定主要健全出境安全风险防范制度，明确出境入境申请事由应当真实、合法，规范出境入境中介服务等。该规定有利于维护两岸民众往来的合法权益，为台湾同胞往来大陆营造更好的法治环境。广大台湾同胞合法合规往来大陆旅游、探亲、参访、交流，一定会乘兴而来，尽兴而归。\n民进党当局危言耸听，造谣抹黑，误导民众，用心险恶。他们处心积虑禁限两岸交流往来，用打压、恐吓、造谣等手段阻挡两岸同胞走近走亲，害怕他们制造的信息茧房不断被戳破、构建的虚假“台独”叙事不断被揭穿。今年1至6月台湾同胞来大陆285万人次，同比增长24.9%，往来两岸的台湾同胞络绎不绝，以最明确的行动证明民进党当局禁限阻挠的荒谬可笑。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260916_12788686.htm"],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","A few days ago, multiple cross-party pro-Taiwan Japanese politicians formed a delegation and made a sneak visit to Taiwan, saying that \"a Taiwan contingency is a Japan contingency\", and advocating that Japan follow the United States in enacting a \"Taiwan Relations Act\" and intervene in Taiwan Strait affairs. What is your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no foreign interference. Japanese Diet members making a sneak visit to China's Taiwan region and clamoring for so-called \"defense cooperation\" violates the one-China principle and the spirit of the four political documents between China and Japan, and we firmly oppose this.\nThe DPP authorities, in order to seek selfish political interests, vainly attempt to \"curry favor with Japan to seek independence\" and \"seek independence by force\"; this will only harm Taiwan, ruin Taiwan, and court self-destruction.","台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。日本议员窜访中国台湾地区、鼓噪所谓“防卫合作”，违背一个中国原则和中日四个政治文件精神，我们对此坚决反对。\n民进党当局为谋取政治私利妄图“媚日谋独”、“以武谋独”，只会害台毁台、自取灭亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","Taiwan media reported that the DPP authorities' cyber force, the \"Information, Communications and Electronic Force Command\", plans to spend NT$95.93 million in the 2027 defense budget to form a so-called \"cyber hunting team\", claiming it will \"proactively discover and purge\" the threat of \"mainland hackers lying in wait for a long time and continuously sabotaging\". What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities manipulate the \"Information, Communications and Electronic Force Command\" to frequently attack and sabotage mainland network facilities, disrupting social order and harming the interests of the public. Since June 2025, mainland public security organs have carried out a concentrated crackdown on its organized cyber illegal and criminal acts. Their jumping out to provoke and stir up trouble is purely overestimating themselves.\nThe public security organs will resolutely safeguard national security and the lawful rights and interests of the relevant enterprises and the people, and will take effective measures in accordance with the law to crack down on the relevant illegal and criminal acts.","民进党当局操纵“资通电军”频繁攻击、破坏大陆网络设施，干扰社会秩序、损害民众利益，大陆公安机关自2025年6月起对其有组织网络违法犯罪行为实施集中打击。他们跳出来挑衅滋事，纯属不自量力。\n公安机关将坚决维护国家安全和有关企业、人民合法权益，依法采取有效措施打击有关违法犯罪行为。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, Taiwan's sports department revised and issued the \"Regulations for Handling Cross-Strait Sports Exchanges\", requiring that people in Taiwan may not serve as athletes on mainland national teams to take part in international competitions, and pointing out the policy bottom line for cross-Strait sports exchanges. What is your comment on this?","Sports are an important bridge and bond linking compatriots on both sides of the Strait, and have always played a unique role in promoting cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and enhancing the bonds of friendship between compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Strengthening cross-Strait sports exchanges and cooperation is the common aspiration of the sports communities on both sides of the Strait and is in line with the overall interests of Taiwan's sports community.\nAny act that attempts to interfere with and obstruct cross-Strait sports exchanges and to politicize sports will ultimately harm the interests and well-being of practitioners in Taiwan's sports community and of the public; it is unpopular and will not succeed.","体育是联系两岸同胞的重要桥梁和纽带，在促进两岸交流合作、增进两岸同胞情谊等方面一直发挥着独特作用。加强两岸体育交流合作是两岸体育界的共同愿望，符合台湾体育界的整体利益。\n任何试图干扰阻挠两岸体育交流、将体育政治化的行径，最终损害的是台湾体育界从业人员以及民众的利益福祉，不得人心，不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","南方日报、南方+记者","Some public opinion on the island has analyzed that this year's Group of Seven summit once again stressed the importance of peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, opposed any unilateral act to change the status quo, and advocated resolving problems through peaceful dialogue, showing that Western countries refuse to give Taiwan a \"blank check\" to change the status quo. What is your comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair, which brooks no foreign interference and allows no one else to point fingers. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for the Chinese people themselves. The root cause of undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and causing tension in the Taiwan Strait situation is that the DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist position of \"Taiwan independence\", refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, and continually carry out provocations seeking \"independence\". To safeguard peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait, it is necessary to resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism. We hope the relevant countries will strictly abide by the one-China principle and not send wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nThe true status quo across the Taiwan Strait is that there is only one China in the world and Taiwan is a part of China. Only if the DPP authorities abandon their \"Taiwan independence\" separatist attempts, stop provocations seeking \"independence\", and recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" can the two sides of the Strait resume communication and contact, and only then will peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations have a basic guarantee.","台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉，不容他人指手画脚。解决台湾问题，是中国人自己的事。破坏台海和平稳定、导致台海局势紧张的根源，是民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，不断进行谋“独”挑衅。维护台海和平稳定，就必须坚决反对“台独”分裂。希望有关国家严格恪守一个中国原则，不向“台独”分裂势力释放错误信号。\n台海真正的现状是，世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。民进党当局只有放弃“台独”分裂企图，停止谋“独”挑衅，承认“九二共识”，两岸才能恢复沟通接触，台海和平稳定和两岸关系和平发展才有基本保障。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","Recently, a number of discussions have appeared on the Taiwan internet about the increasing attractiveness of mainland social media platforms to young people in Taiwan. Many netizens said that mainland social media platforms have rich and in-depth information, that even for some obscure knowledge one can find tutorial videos there, and that the interactive experience brought by \"danmaku\" (bullet comments) can…","Many mainland social media platforms are indeed good channels for learning and self-improvement. Quite a few Taiwan netizens treat mainland social media platforms as a \"second classroom\"; not only can they conveniently obtain rich and diverse information and knowledge, they can also interact with like-minded netizens through bullet comments, comments and other means, make good friends and reach cooperation. We are glad to see more Taiwan netizens obtain information, broaden their horizons, make friends and accumulate positive energy through mainland social media platforms, and take part in cross-Strait exchanges in various ways.","大陆很多社交平台的确是开展学习提升自我的好渠道。不少台湾网友把大陆社交平台当成“第二课堂”，不仅可以很方便获取丰富多元的信息和知识，还可以和志同道合的网友通过弹幕、评论等方式进行互动，结交好朋友、达成合作。我们乐见更多台湾网友通过大陆社交平台获取信息、增长见识，结交朋友、积蓄正能量，以各种方式参与到两岸交流中来。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: this year's Shanghai-Taipei City Forum will be held in Taipei. It was originally planned that a deputy director of the Shanghai Taiwan Affairs Office would lead a delegation to Taiwan for an advance visit, but this was blocked and held up by the Mainland Affairs Council, which only approved division-level personnel to go to Taiwan. Outsiders are concerned that the level of Shanghai's participation…","The first question. The Shanghai-Taipei City Forum has been held for 16 consecutive years, reaching many points of consensus on multiple topics such as the economy, culture, science and technology, society, sports and urban management, achieving fruitful results, winning general affirmation from citizens of the two cities and compatriots on both sides of the Strait, and becoming an important platform for cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. The DPP authorities' unreasonable obstruction of and interference with the preparatory work for the forum goes against mainstream public opinion on the island and is unpopular.\nThe second question. The one-China principle is a universal consensus of the international community, and the general trend toward reunification of the motherland is unstoppable. The \"Taiwan independence\" diehards are already at the end of their road, like birds startled by the mere twang of a bowstring. For the \"Taiwan independence\" diehards on the list, we will never be lenient, and will take all necessary measures to punish them in accordance with the law and hold them accountable for life.","第一个问题。上海台北城市论坛已连续举办16年，围绕经济、文化、科技、社会、体育、城市管理等多项议题达成诸多共识，取得丰硕成果，得到两市市民、两岸同胞的普遍肯定，成为两岸交流合作的重要平台。民进党当局无理刁难、阻挠论坛的筹办工作，违背岛内主流民意，不得人心。\n第二个问题。一个中国原则是国际社会普遍共识，祖国统一大势不可阻挡。“台独”顽固分子已是穷途末路、惊弓之鸟。对清单在列的“台独”顽固分子，我们绝不姑息，将采取一切必要措施对其依法惩治、终身追责。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《旺报》记者","Recently, the wife of Taipei Mayor Chiang Wan-an introduced herself as \"Chinese Taipei\" while attending an APEC event, and some public opinion held that there is a problem with this name. Taiwan's \"Minister of Labor\" Hung Sun-han said that \"Chinese Taipei\" is indeed Taiwan's official name in APEC. What is your comment on this?","Under the one-China principle, the Taiwan region participates in the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) and its activities under the name \"Chinese Taipei\" and in the capacity of a regional economy. This is an important political prerequisite for the Taiwan region's participation in APEC, and all parties must abide by the provisions and practices of the relevant APEC memorandum of understanding.","在一个中国原则下，台湾地区以“中国台北”名义、地区经济体身份参与亚太经合组织（APEC）及活动。这是台湾地区参与APEC的重要政治前提，各方必须遵守APEC有关谅解备忘录的规定和惯例。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","Regarding Puma Shen recently appearing on the streets of Japan wearing a bulletproof vest, he claimed that he is wanted by the mainland and that because he is running for Taipei mayor he must pay special attention to his own safety. What is your comment on this?","Individual \"Taiwan independence\" diehards frequently stage absurd farces to grandstand, fully exposing their nature of being fierce in appearance but faint-hearted within. Those who persist in their errors and remain obstinate will certainly not escape severe punishment under the laws of the state.","个别“台独”顽固分子频繁上演荒诞闹剧、哗众取宠，充分暴露其色厉内荏的本质。执迷不悟、冥顽不化，必定难逃国家法律的严惩。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中央社”记者","Last year, after Taipei Mayor Chiang Wan-an attended the \"Twin-City Forum\", the mainland announced military exercises against Taiwan one day later. Under such circumstances, what substantive role does the \"Twin-City Forum\" play in peaceful cross-Strait exchanges? How will the mainland make people in Taiwan believe that cross-Strait exchanges can help cool down the Taiwan Strait and bring cross-Strait peace?","It is meaningless to link these two matters.\nThe Shanghai-Taipei City Forum has been held for 16 consecutive years, reaching many points of consensus on topics such as the economy, culture, science and technology, society, sports and urban management, achieving fruitful results, winning general affirmation from citizens of the two cities and compatriots on both sides of the Strait, and becoming an important platform for cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. We hope such a platform can continue to play its due role.","将这两件事情作关联是没有意义的。\n上海台北城市论坛已连续举办16年，围绕经济、文化、科技、社会、体育、城市管理等议题达成诸多共识，取得丰硕成果，得到两市市民、两岸同胞的普遍肯定，成为两岸交流合作的重要平台，希望这样的平台能够继续发挥应有的作用。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-16","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森电视台记者","First question: Taipei mayoral candidate Puma Shen recently said that if elected mayor, he would dare to attend the \"Twin-City Forum\". What is your comment on this? Second question: when Ashin (Chen Hsin-hung), a member of the Taiwan band Mayday, recently attended an Apple product launch, someone on site introduced him as coming from China, and staff reminded them \"not to mention this topic\". Does the mainland…","The first question. The likes of Puma Shen frequently stage absurd farces to grandstand. He previously also said that \"everyone feels military service is a waste of time\". People of this kind, on the one hand, peddle \"Taiwan independence\" propositions to people in Taiwan, especially young people, advocate \"using force to resist reunification\" and \"all people as soldiers\", and incite other people's children to go to the battlefield and become cannon fodder; on the other hand, they themselves hide behind and are even ready to slip away at any time. This hypocritical face and ugly conduct are contemptible, and they also fully prove that \"Taiwan independence\" cannot succeed.\nThe second question. The two sides of the Strait belong to one and the same China, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. This is the historical and legal fact of both sides of the Strait, and also a universal consensus of the international community.\nMore and more Taiwan entertainers express in various ways their identification with Chinese culture and with \"the two sides of the Strait being one family\"; this is a natural outpouring of genuine feeling. We hope compatriots on both sides of the Strait will jointly maintain a good atmosphere for cross-Strait cultural exchanges and do more things conducive to enhancing mutual trust and bringing their feelings closer.\nThis concludes the press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。沈伯洋之流频繁上演荒诞闹剧、哗众取宠。他此前还称“大家觉得当兵是在浪费时间”，这类人一方面向台湾民众特别是青少年兜售“台独”主张，鼓吹“以武拒统”、“全民皆兵”，鼓动别人家孩子上战场、当炮灰；另一方面自己却躲在后面，甚至随时准备开溜。这种虚伪面目和丑陋行径令人不齿，也充分证明“台独”搞不成。\n第二个问题。两岸同属一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分，这是两岸的历史和法理事实，也是国际社会的普遍共识。\n越来越多台湾演艺人员以各种方式表达对中华文化、对“两岸一家亲”的认同，这是自然而然的真情流露。希望两岸同胞共同维护两岸文化交流的良好氛围，多做有利于增进互信、拉近感情的事。\n发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260916_12788699.htm","",1,4,6,""],[0,"2026-09-21","Guo Jiakun","Reuters","The New Zealand Defence Force said today that two of its naval ships have transited the Taiwan Strait. The New Zealand PM called this a routine activity and said he was not expecting any backlash from China. Does China have any comment on this event?","China’s position on foreign military vessels’ transit through the Taiwan Strait is consistent.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260921_12027763.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on September 23, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhu Fenglian first announced the holding of the \"Full Moon over the Capital, Affection Linking Both Sides of the Strait: 2026 Cross-Strait Compatriots Mid-Autumn Festival Friendship Event\", and then answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot issues.","Welcome to the press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council.\nOn September 23, the \"Full Moon over the Capital, Affection Linking Both Sides of the Strait: 2026 Cross-Strait Compatriots Mid-Autumn Festival Friendship Event\" was held at Yanqi Lake in Beijing. More than 400 guests from both sides of the Strait took part, including more than 300 Taiwan guests such as representatives of relevant sectors on the island, well-known entrepreneurs and Taiwan compatriots living in Beijing. The event included a cross-Strait compatriots Mid-Autumn tea party, the \"e Qi Zhanfang Ba\" (Let's Bloom Together) Straits Song Festival and more, with compatriots on both sides of the Strait jointly admiring the bright moon, talking about hometown ties, discussing the future, and together welcoming a traditional festival of the Chinese nation.","欢迎大家参加国务院台办新闻发布会。\n9月23日，“月满京华 情牵两岸——2026年两岸同胞迎中秋联谊活动”在北京雁栖湖举行。两岸嘉宾400余人参加，其中岛内相关界别代表、知名企业家及在京台胞等300余位台湾嘉宾参加。活动包括两岸同胞迎中秋茶话会、“e起绽放吧”海峡歌会等，两岸同胞共赏明月、共话乡情、共叙未来，共迎中华民族传统佳节。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","人民日报记者","As the Mid-Autumn Festival approaches, Taiwan wendan pomelos have gone on sale in many places on the mainland. On September 22, the \"Taste Treasure Island Wendan Pomelos, Celebrate the Full-Moon Mid-Autumn Festival\" event was held in Shenzhen. Please introduce the relevant situation.","In April this year, the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee was authorized to release ten policy measures to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation. On the political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\", the relevant parties on both sides of the Strait have worked together to push these policies to be implemented and take effect, helping more farmers and fishermen on the island open up the mainland market, with positive results. Multiple batches of Taiwan packing plants, orchards and food enterprises have registered on the mainland, customs clearance efficiency has continued to improve, and logistics and transport have become more convenient.\nIt is worth mentioning that, through the joint efforts of all parties, Taiwan wendan pomelos have appeared at exhibitions in many places on the mainland and have gone on sale in supermarkets, farmers' markets and e-commerce platforms, and are welcomed by the broad masses of consumers. During the Mid-Autumn Festival and National Day holidays, more Taiwan wendan pomelos will enter thousands of households on the mainland, more mainland consumers will taste Taiwan's high-quality fruit, and more grassroots fruit farmers in Taiwan will be able to share the broad market opportunities of the mainland. This two-way effort presents a vivid picture of integrated development and mutual benefit and win-win results. We will continue to uphold the concept that \"the two sides of the Strait are one family\", actively promote cross-Strait economic exchanges and cooperation, and let compatriots on both sides of the Strait share the dividends of the peaceful development and integrated development of cross-Strait relations.","今年4月中央台办受权发布十项促进两岸交流合作的政策措施，两岸有关方面在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”政治基础上，共同努力推动政策落地见效，帮助更多岛内农渔业者开拓大陆市场，取得积极成效。多批台湾包装厂、果园以及食品企业在大陆注册，通关效率持续提高，物流运输更加便利。\n值得一提的是，在各方共同努力下，台湾文旦柚在大陆多地展会亮相，并在超市、农贸市场以及电商平台上架销售，受到广大消费者的欢迎。中秋和国庆假期，将有更多台湾文旦柚进入大陆千家万户，更多大陆消费者品尝到台湾优质果品，更多台湾基层果农得以分享大陆广阔的市场机遇。这种双向奔赴展现了一幅融合发展、互利共赢的生动图景。我们将继续秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，积极推动两岸经济交流合作，让两岸同胞共享两岸关系和平发展、融合发展的红利。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814587.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","福建广电“台海时刻”新媒体记者","As the Mid-Autumn Festival approaches, what activities are there in various places for compatriots on both sides of the Strait to spend the festival together?","The day after tomorrow will be the Mid-Autumn Festival. I wish compatriots on both sides of the Strait a happy Mid-Autumn Festival, with beautiful flowers, a full moon and family reunion, and with mutual understanding and companionship bringing prosperity in all things. (in Minnan dialect) I wish fellow townspeople on both sides of the Strait a happy Mid-Autumn Festival, safety and reunion. (in Hakka) Whether you are at home or away from home, whether you eat sweet mooncakes or savory mooncakes, you can admire the same moon and share a cup of tea with your family. We also welcome our Taiwan fellow townspeople to come to the mainland to take part in a rich variety of Mid-Autumn friendship activities.\nOn September 19, the Shandong Provincial Association of Taiwan Compatriots' Relatives and the Taiwan Shandong Fellow Townspeople Association jointly held, via video link in Jinan and Taipei, the 2026 Cross-Strait Shandong Fellow Townspeople Mid-Autumn Friendship Gathering \"Cross-Strait Shandong Charm Builds a Cloud Bridge, Talking of Reunion at the Bingwu Mid-Autumn Festival\". Nearly 200 people took part, including representatives of Taiwan businesspeople, Taiwan youth and relatives of Taiwan compatriots in Jinan and representatives of Shandong fellow townspeople from all walks of life in Taipei. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait exchanged festive greetings across the screen and together watched wonderful cultural performances from both places in a joyful and harmonious atmosphere.\nFrom September 22 to 26, Hebei Province held the \"Meeting in Youth, Pursuing Dreams in Yan-Zhao\" series of Mid-Autumn friendship activities for Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan youth. More than 120 representatives of cultural and tourism industry associations on the island, Taiwan youth and Taiwan business associations of Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei gathered in Shijiazhuang to carry out enterprise visits, promotion of provincial and municipal investment environments, cultural and tourism industry inspections, cross-Strait softball exchanges and other activities, and made on-site inspections of key industries and distinctive cultural and tourism resources in Zhengding, Zhao County, Luquan and the high-tech zone.\nFrom September 19 to 23, Zhangzhou, Quanzhou and other places in Fujian Province held a number of Mid-Autumn friendship activities. On the 19th, the 2nd Cross-Strait (Zhangzhou) Women and Family Carnival and Cross-Strait Marriage Families Mid-Autumn Festival Friendship Event was held in Zhangzhou. A hundred cross-Strait marriage families and representatives of Taiwan compatriots and their relatives in Zhangzhou took part, sharing stories of family harmony and experiencing Fujian and Taiwan specialty snacks, Mid-Autumn lantern making, a dragon dance parade at a century-old tulou earthen building, and other activities.\nOn the 23rd, \"The Moon Is Brightest over One's Hometown: 2026 Cross-Strait (Zhangzhou) Mid-Autumn Gala\" was held in Zhangzhou. More than 150 representatives of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan businesspeople from all walks of life and representatives of overseas Chinese took part. The gala drew on shared cross-Strait memories such as overseas Chinese remittance letters (\"qiaopi\"), Taiwan remittance letters (\"taipi\") and Minnan culture, and presented distinctive programs such as dramatized scenes of qiaopi and taipi, gezai opera, original Minnan songs and a Lin Yutang musical, vividly telling the moving story of compatriots on both sides of the Strait sharing the same roots and origins and developing together in integration.\nOn the 23rd, the \"Full Moon over Fengshan Carries On Loyalty and Filial Piety, Both Sides of the Strait Share the Same Origin in Celebrating Mid-Autumn\" Fujian-Taiwan Guangze Zunwang Mid-Autumn reunion friendship event was held in Quanzhou. More than a hundred representatives and believers from Guangze Zunwang branch temples in 22 counties and cities of the Taiwan region returned to Nan'an to pay homage to the ancestral temple and celebrate the festival. Through a live-action scenario play they learned about the story of Guangze Zunwang's supreme filial piety, and experienced traditional folk activities such as bobing (mooncake dice game) and guessing lantern riddles.\nOn September 23, the 2026 \"Meeting Taiwan in Henan, Beautiful Flowers and Full Moon\" Henan-Taiwan Workers Mid-Autumn Friendship Gala was held in Zhengzhou, Henan Province. Workers' representatives from the two places gathered together and jointly took part in intangible cultural heritage experiences such as crochet, dough modeling and making cloth-tiger sachets, together celebrating the Mid-Autumn Festival and talking about the joy of reunion.\nOn September 24, the 2026 Hefei Mid-Autumn Poetry Gala will be held at the Qingfeng Pavilion of Bao Gong Park in Hefei, Anhui, a cross-Strait exchange base. The gala closely follows the main thread of \"poetry, reunion, family and country\"; about 300 compatriots from both sides of the Strait will together admire the bright moon and recite timeless poems. A \"Hefei Invites You\" welfare package for first-time Taiwan compatriot visitors will also be released at the gala.","后天将迎来中秋节，祝两岸同胞中秋快乐，花好月圆人团圆，相知相守万事兴。（闽南话）祝两岸乡亲中秋快乐、平安团圆。（客家话）大家无论是在家里还是在外乡，无论吃甜月饼还是咸月饼，都可以和家人共赏一轮月，共品一杯茶。我们也欢迎台湾乡亲到大陆参加丰富多彩的中秋联谊活动。\n9月19日，山东省台属联谊会、台湾山东同乡会以视频连线形式在济南、台北联合举办“两岸鲁韵云作桥 丙午中秋话团圆”2026年两岸山东乡亲中秋联谊会。在济南的台商台青台属代表以及在台北的各界山东同乡代表近200人参加活动，两岸同胞隔着屏幕互致节日问候，在欢乐祥和的氛围中共同观看两地精彩的文艺演出。\n9月22日至26日，河北省举办“青春相约 逐梦燕赵”台商台青迎中秋联谊系列活动，岛内文旅产业协会、台青代表及京津冀台商协会代表120余人齐聚石家庄，开展企业参访、省市投资环境推介、文旅产业考察、两岸垒球交流等活动，实地考察正定、赵县、鹿泉及高新区重点产业和特色文旅资源。\n9月19日至23日，福建省漳州、泉州等地举办多场中秋联谊活动。19日，第二届海峡两岸（漳州）妇女家庭嘉年华·两岸婚姻家庭中秋节联谊活动在漳州举办，百名两岸婚姻家庭、在漳台胞台属代表参加，分享家庭和美故事，体验闽台特色小吃、中秋花灯制作及百年土楼舞龙巡游等活动。\n23日，“月是故乡明——2026海峡两岸（漳州）中秋晚会”在漳州举办，150余名各界台胞台商代表和海外侨胞代表参加，晚会挖掘侨批、台批、闽南文化等两岸共同记忆，推出侨批台批情景演绎、歌仔戏、闽南原创歌曲、林语堂音乐剧等特色节目，生动演绎两岸同胞同根同源、共融发展的动人故事。\n23日，“月满凤山承忠孝·两岸同源庆中秋”闽台广泽尊王中秋团圆联谊活动在泉州举办，台湾地区22个县市的广泽尊王分庙代表及信众逾百人归返南安谒祖过节，通过实景情景剧了解广泽尊王至孝典故，体验博饼、猜灯谜等传统民俗活动。\n9月23日，2026“豫见台湾·花好月圆”豫台职工中秋联谊晚会在河南省郑州市举办，两地职工代表欢聚一堂，共同参与钩编、面塑、布老虎香包制作等非遗体验活动，共庆中秋佳节，共话团圆喜乐。\n9月24日，2026合肥中秋诗歌晚会将在海峡两岸交流基地安徽合肥包公园清风阁举行，晚会紧扣“诗歌·团圆·家国”主线，两岸同胞约300人共赏一轮明月，同吟千古诗篇。晚会现场还将发布“合肥请您来”首来台胞福利包。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","《参考消息》记者","A recent \"Annual Survey on Cross-Strait Relations\" on the island showed that public support in three areas, namely continuing to hold cross-Strait exchange platforms, supporting the expansion of travel by tourists across the Strait, and supporting the expansion of non-governmental cross-Strait exchanges in film and television, the arts and sports, all exceeded 60 percent, reaching 63 percent, 67 percent and 62…","Facts have proven that wanting peace, development, exchanges and cooperation is the mainstream public opinion of Taiwan society and the collective consensus of all sectors on the island. We will always uphold the concept that \"the two sides of the Strait are one family\", continue to introduce more policies that benefit Taiwan and its people, continuously strengthen institutional support for cross-Strait exchanges and integration, and actively promote cross-Strait personnel exchanges and exchanges and cooperation in various fields. We warmly welcome more Taiwan compatriots to take part in cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in various ways, integrate into the process of cross-Strait integrated development, and share the development opportunities of Chinese modernization.","事实证明，要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是台湾社会的主流民意，是岛内各界的集体共识。我们将始终秉持“两岸一家亲”理念，持续出台更多惠台利民政策，不断强化两岸交流融合的制度支持，积极推动两岸人员往来和各领域交流合作。我们热忱欢迎更多台湾同胞以各种方式参与两岸交流合作，融入两岸融合发展进程，共享中国式现代化发展机遇。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814577.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Please introduce the cross-Strait exchange activities recently held in various places.","Over the past week, many exchange activities were held in various places on both sides of the Strait.\nFrom September 13 to 18, the 4th Cross-Strait Chinese Photography Award and the 7th Cross-Strait Image Culture Week were held in Zhejiang under the theme \"Beautiful Countryside: A Two-Way Journey by Photographers from Both Sides of the Strait\". More than 300 people from the photography communities on both sides of the Strait took part, visiting Ningbo, Huzhou, Lishui and other places to tour and create, deepening cross-Strait cultural exchanges and showcasing the new development opportunities of Chinese modernization during the \"15th Five-Year Plan\" period.\nOn September 15, the awards ceremony of the 5th Cross-Strait Online Literature Competition was held in Hangzhou, Zhejiang Province, attended by more than 200 guests from both sides of the Strait, literary creators, enthusiasts and media reporters. The competition collected a total of 903 entries from both sides of the Strait and selected 28 winning works. During the event, a number of well-known writers from both sides of the Strait gave keynote speeches, several works adapted from online literature IP were released, and a salon on cross-Strait literary exchange and integrated development was held, effectively promoting exchanges and cooperation among online literature enthusiasts on both sides of the Strait.\nFrom September 19 to 20, the Taipei stop of the \"Black Myth: Wukong\" global concert was held in Taipei City. Singers and musicians from both sides of the Strait jointly performed theme songs such as \"The Yellow Wind Rises\", \"Tidings from the Cloud Palace\" and \"Dare to Ask Where the Road Is\", and the thousand-seat theater was packed. Game fans and music fans from both sides of the Strait expressed their love and admiration for ethnic Chinese music, and also expressed their expectations for the next game, \"Black Myth: Zhong Kui\".\nOn September 23, the \"Century Chapter: Cross-Strait Ethnic Music Concert Commemorating the 160th Anniversary of the Birth of Dr. Sun Yat-sen\", co-hosted by the Cross-Strait Exchange Fund of the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Straits and relevant departments of Jiangsu Province and Nanjing City, was held in Nanjing, Jiangsu Province. Hundreds of outstanding musicians and art troupes from both sides of the Strait will perform ethnic music, symphonic music and choral works, together expressing the patriotic feelings of the sons and daughters of the Chinese nation and their fond hopes for unity and reunification.","过去一周，两岸各地举办了很多交流活动。\n9月13日至18日，第四届海峡两岸中华摄影奖暨第七届海峡两岸影像文化周活动在浙江举行，以“美丽乡村—两岸摄影人的双向奔赴”为主题，两岸摄影界300余人参加活动，分赴宁波、湖州、丽水等地参访创作，深化两岸文化交流，展现“十五五”时期中国式现代化发展新机遇。\n9月15日，第五届两岸网络文学大赛颁奖仪式在浙江省杭州市举办，200余位两岸嘉宾、文学创作者、爱好者、媒体记者参加。大赛共征集两岸903件参赛作品，评选出28件获奖作品。活动期间多名两岸知名作家作主旨演讲，发布多款网络文学IP转化作品，举办两岸文学交流与融合发展沙龙，有力促进两岸网络文学爱好者交流合作。\n9月19日至20日,《黑神话：悟空》全球音乐会台北站在台北市举办，两岸歌手和乐手联袂演出《黄风起兮》、《云宫讯音》、《敢问路在何方》等主题曲，千人剧场座无虚席。两岸游戏迷、音乐迷纷纷对民族音乐表达喜爱和赞叹，也表达对下一部游戏《黑神话：钟馗》的期许。\n9月23日，由海协会两岸交流基金与江苏省、南京市有关部门共同主办的“世纪华章——纪念孙中山先生诞辰160周年两岸民族音乐会”在江苏省南京市举办。数百名两岸优秀音乐家和艺术团体将表演民族音乐与交响乐、合唱，共同抒发中华儿女爱国情怀和团结统一的美好期盼。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","河南日报“顶端新闻”记者","Recently, Taiwan's \"Liberty Times\" hyped up claims by individual Taiwan businesspeople that their investment rights and interests on the mainland were harmed many years ago, accusing that \"the rights and interests of Taiwan businesspeople on the mainland lack protection\". Does the spokesperson have any comment?","We have always attached great importance to and actively safeguarded the lawful rights and interests of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises, thoroughly implemented the Party's overall policy for resolving the Taiwan question in the new era, incorporated the protection of Taiwan compatriots' rights and interests into the overall picture of building socialist modernization with Chinese characteristics and a rule-of-law China, and continuously improved the systems and policies for enhancing the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. The overall framework for comprehensively governing the country in accordance with the law has basically taken shape, and a first-class market-oriented, law-based and internationalized business environment continues to be optimized, providing fundamental institutional support for safeguarding the lawful rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots.\nGovernments at all levels and competent departments on the mainland feel for the difficulties and problems encountered by Taiwan compatriots as if they were their own, actively learn about their demands, keep their needs in mind, strive to resolve their difficulties, and enhance their well-being with concrete actions. The total number of Taiwan-related disputes handled by the Taiwan affairs office system has declined year by year, the proportion of law-related and litigation-related cases has fallen sharply, and the satisfaction and recognition of the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots with the mainland's rule-of-law environment and business environment continue to rise.\nWith regard to cross-Strait communication mechanisms for protecting Taiwan compatriots' rights and interests, in 2005 the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the relevant body of the Chinese Kuomintang established a work platform for protecting the rights and interests of Taiwan businesspeople, which later developed into the KMT-CPC work platform for protecting Taiwan compatriots' rights and interests and has continued to operate to this day. Relying on this platform, the relevant parties on both sides of the Strait have carried out extensive and in-depth exchanges on issues of concern to Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises, and have also resolved many urgent, difficult and pressing problems of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises, which the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises highly recognize. For reasons known to all, the cross-Strait investment dispute coordination mechanism is currently stalled, but our commitment to safeguarding the lawful rights and interests of Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises will not change; the \"Law on the Protection of Investment by Taiwan Compatriots\" and its \"Implementing Rules\" remain in effect, and the KMT-CPC work platform for protecting Taiwan compatriots' rights and interests remains in effect.\nAs for the so-called \"harm to rights and interests\" claimed by the individual Taiwan businesspeople you mentioned, it is understood that the relevant cases have been decided by mainland arbitration awards and final rulings of the Supreme People's Court, and the facts are clear and definite. We care for and look after Taiwan compatriots and safeguard their lawful rights and interests, and we also hope that the relevant Taiwan compatriots and Taiwan enterprises will respect the facts and respect the law, safeguard their lawful rights and interests in accordance with laws and regulations, and not allow themselves to be used by people with ulterior motives.","我们一贯高度重视、积极维护广大台胞台企的合法权益，深入贯彻新时代党解决台湾问题的总体方略，把台胞权益保护工作纳入有中国特色社会主义现代化和法治中国建设大局，持续完善增进台湾同胞利益福祉的制度和政策。国家全面依法治国总体格局基本形成，市场化、法治化、国际化一流营商环境持续优化，为维护台湾同胞合法权益提供了根本制度支撑。\n大陆各级政府和主管部门对台湾同胞遇到的困难和问题感同身受，积极了解他们的诉求，把他们的需求放在心上，努力为他们排忧解难，以实际行动增进他们的福祉。台办系统受理涉台纠纷总量逐年下降，涉法涉诉类占比大幅减少，广大台胞对大陆法治环境、营商环境的满意度、认可度持续提高。\n在两岸台胞权益保护沟通机制方面，2005年中央台办与中国国民党相关机构建立了台商权益保护工作平台，此后发展为国共两党台胞权益保护工作平台，持续运作至今。依托该平台，两岸有关方面对台胞台企关注的问题进行了广泛深入交流，也解决了不少台胞台企急难愁盼问题，广大台胞台企对此高度认可。由于众所周知的原因，当前两岸投资争端协处机制陷入停滞，但我们维护台胞台企合法权益的承诺不会变，《台湾同胞投资保护法》及《实施细则》依然有效，国共两党台胞权益保护工作平台依然有效。\n你提到的个别台商声称所谓“权益受损”，据了解，相关案件已由大陆仲裁裁决和最高人民法院终审裁定，事实清楚明确。我们关心关爱台湾同胞，维护台湾同胞的合法权益，也希望相关台胞台企尊重事实、尊重法律，依法依规维护合法权益，不要被别有用心人士所利用。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814584.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","新华社记者","Lai Ching-te recently claimed that \"in the face of highly changing international circumstances and the continued intensification of the China threat\", his responsibility is to make Taiwan better prepared and stronger in order to maintain the status quo and not let peace be undermined by unilateral provocations; he reiterated that Taiwan's defense budget is expected to reach 5% of GDP by 2030, defending peace with…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China; this is the true status quo across the Taiwan Strait. The Lai Ching-te authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist position of \"Taiwan independence\", deliberately escalate cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation, and vainly attempt to \"seek independence by force\" and \"rely on foreign support to seek independence\"; they are the chief culprit undermining peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait and undermining the status quo across the Taiwan Strait. For political self-interest they repeatedly advocate raising the defense budget, wasting the hard-earned wealth of the people of Taiwan on militarism, which goes against the mainstream public opinion of Taiwan society and will only accelerate pushing Taiwan into danger. We sternly warn the DPP authorities: no matter how large a budget they draw up or how many weapons they buy, they cannot change the inevitable doom of \"Taiwan independence\", nor can they stop the general trend of the inevitable reunification of the motherland.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分，这是真正的台海现状。赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，蓄意升高两岸对立对抗，妄图“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”，是破坏台海和平稳定、破坏台海现状的罪魁祸首。其为政治私利一再鼓吹升高防务预算，浪费台湾民脂民膏穷兵黩武，违背台湾社会主流民意，只会加速把台湾推入险境。正告民进党当局，编再多预算，买再多武器，都改变不了“台独”必然败亡的结局，阻挡不了祖国必然统一的大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814586.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","福建厦门卫视记者","With the Mid-Autumn Festival and National Day holidays approaching, many Taiwan compatriots hope that more direct cross-Strait passenger flight routes will be restored and opened. Are there any new arrangements and plans for direct cross-Strait passenger flights and destinations for this holiday?","\"The moon at Mid-Autumn is exceptionally bright.\" In the hearts of Chinese people, the Mid-Autumn full moon is a symbol of reunion and happiness. We welcome our Taiwan fellow townspeople to come to the mainland to reunite and celebrate the festival. At present, due to obstruction and interference by the DPP authorities, cross-Strait routes, destinations and flights have not yet fully returned to normal. 15 destinations in 14 mainland cities operate more than 300 passenger flights per week, which is a big gap compared with 61 mainland destinations and a maximum of 890 passenger flights per week before 2020, seriously affecting the travel of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. Calls from people on both sides of the Strait for the full resumption of direct flights to all cross-Strait destinations are very strong. It is understood that among the 15 destinations where direct flights have resumed, mainland airlines have basically used up their quota of flight capacity on cross-Strait routes.\nThe crux of the obstacles to the full resumption of direct cross-Strait flights to all destinations lies with the DPP authorities. We hope the Taiwan side will comply with public opinion, lift the unreasonable restrictions on cross-Strait air transport as soon as possible, and let airlines on both sides of the Strait arrange flight schedules independently according to market demand.","“月到中秋分外明”，在中国人心中，中秋圆月是团圆、美满的象征。我们欢迎台湾乡亲来大陆团圆过节。目前，因受民进党当局阻挠干扰，两岸航线航点航班尚未完全恢复常态，大陆14个城市15个航点、每周执飞300余班客运航班，与2020年前大陆61个航点、每周最高890班客运航班相比，有很大差距，严重影响两岸同胞往来。两岸民众对两岸直航航点全面复航的呼声非常强烈。据了解，在已恢复直航的15个航点中，大陆航空公司已基本用满两岸航线航班运力额度。\n两岸空中直航航点全面复航的障碍症结在于民进党当局。希望台湾方面顺应民意，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，由两岸航空公司根据市场需求自主安排航班计划。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814576.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, the DPP authorities held a so-called \"2026 International Forum on Whole-of-Society Defense Resilience\", focusing on topics such as \"civil-military integration, gray-zone threats, cybersecurity and critical infrastructure protection\", with the United States, Japan, the Philippines and others sending people to attend. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the separatist position of \"Taiwan independence\", collude with external forces to make provocations seeking \"independence\", and do not hesitate to strap people in Taiwan onto the \"Taiwan independence\" war chariot, seriously harming the security and well-being of people in Taiwan. \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end, and no amount of so-called \"defense resilience\" will be anything but futile. The one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community. The relevant countries should abide by the one-China principle and not send wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，勾连外部势力谋“独”挑衅，不惜将台湾民众绑上“台独”战车，严重损害台湾民众安全福祉，“台独”是绝路，搞再多所谓“防卫韧性”都是徒劳。一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，有关国家应恪守一个中国原则，不向“台独”分裂势力释放错误信号。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, Taiwan's \"Kuma Academy\" advocated that Taiwan's counties and cities should break with traditional disaster-prevention thinking and incorporate \"war disasters\" as part of local disaster-prevention preparations, and clamored for county and city mayoral candidates to put forward so-called specific \"resilience policy platforms\" to build a denser whole-of-society defense system. What is your comment on this?","The relevant remarks of the \"Kuma Academy\" are entirely heretical and fallacious talk inciting Taiwan to become a battlefield, and will certainly be opposed by the people of Taiwan. On the one hand, they go to every possible length to play up a war atmosphere and cultivate \"seeds of violence\" in society on the island, openly engaging in \"Taiwan independence\" separatist activities, making them an out-and-out \"Taiwan independence\" base; on the other hand, under the guise of \"lectures,\" \"training,\" \"outdoor drills\" and the like, they buy low and sell high to pocket the difference and collude with external forces to swindle money, making them veritable \"Taiwan independence profiteers.\" Their disgraceful conduct and misdeeds are despicable, and \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts will certainly be severely punished.","“黑熊学院”有关言论完全是鼓动台湾变成战场的邪说谬论，必定遭到台湾民众的反对。他们一方面无所不用其极渲染战争氛围、在岛内社会培育“暴力种子”，公然从事“台独”分裂活动，是不折不扣的“台独”基地；另一方面打着“讲座”、“培训”、“户外演练”等幌子，低买高卖赚差价、勾结外部势力骗钱财，是名副其实的“台独倒爷”。其丑行劣迹令人唾弃，“台独”分裂行径必遭严惩。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814551.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Sichuan-Chongqing) Youth Employment, Entrepreneurship and Development Exchange Conference was held in Chengdu, Sichuan. Please introduce the relevant situation.","From September 13 to 22, the 2026 Cross-Strait (Sichuan-Chongqing) Youth Employment, Entrepreneurship and Development Exchange Conference was held in Chengdu, Sichuan, attended by more than 200 people, including heads of Taiwan business associations and Taiwan youth entrepreneurship parks from many localities as well as young Taiwan businesspeople. The exchange conference included activities such as presentations on the business environment and entrepreneurship policies of the Sichuan-Chongqing region, sharing of entrepreneurship stories by Taiwan youth representatives, the release of internship and employment positions for Taiwan youth, and roadshows of outstanding Taiwan youth entrepreneurship projects. It also awarded \"Guide for Taiwan Youth Coming to Sichuan for Internships, Employment and Entrepreneurship\" certificates to more than 10 enthusiastic Taiwan compatriots who have long been committed to serving the growth of Taiwan youth and promoting cross-Strait youth exchanges, and presented awards to the winning teams of the 13th Chengdu-Taiwan Cross-Strait Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition.\nThe Cross-Strait (Sichuan-Chongqing) Youth Employment, Entrepreneurship and Development Exchange Conference has been held five times, and many young friends from Taiwan have found a stage for striving in life through the exchange conference and written moving stories of sincere cooperation. We warmly welcome Taiwan compatriots, especially young friends, to come to the mainland to pursue their dreams, build their dreams and realize their dreams. We will continue to create better conditions and more opportunities, and look forward to more young friends from Taiwan seizing the opportunities to come to the mainland for internships and employment, expand their room for development and realize their life ideals.","9月13日至22日，2026两岸（川渝）青年就业创业发展交流会在四川成都举办，多地台协、台青创业园区负责人及青年台商等200余人参加。交流会包括川渝地区营商环境与创业政策宣介、台青代表创业故事分享、台青实习就业岗位发布、优秀台青创业项目路演等活动，并为10余位长期致力于服务台青成长、推动两岸青年交流的热心台胞颁发“台青来川实习就业创业引路人”证书，为第十三届蓉台海峡两岸创新创业大赛的获奖团队颁奖。\n两岸（川渝）青年就业创业发展交流会已举办过五届，许多台湾青年朋友通过交流会找到了人生奋斗的舞台，书写了精诚合作的动人故事。我们热忱欢迎台湾同胞特别是青年朋友来大陆追梦、筑梦、圆梦，将持续创造更好条件、更多机遇，期待更多台湾青年朋友抓住机遇来大陆实习就业，拓展发展空间，实现人生理想。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","香港中评社记者","Taiwan media recently reported that the DPP authorities have planned many civilian facilities as so-called \"wartime response centers,\" even including a \"Children's Future Museum,\" causing an uproar in public opinion on the island, with many questioning it and saying not to let children block bullets. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, coerce the people of Taiwan into serving as \"Taiwan independence cannon fodder\" for selfish political gain, and even madly attempt to use children as a \"Taiwan independence shield,\" seriously threatening the safety and well-being of Taiwan compatriots. This will inevitably be strongly condemned and opposed by the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，为政治私利裹挟台湾民众当“台独炮灰”，甚至丧心病狂企图把儿童当“台独挡箭牌”，严重威胁台湾同胞安全福祉，必然遭到广大台湾同胞强烈谴责和反对。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814575.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","中新社记者","Recently, the Straits Exchange Foundation said that a delegation including the heads of the Shandong and Shanxi work areas of the Association of Taiwan Investment Enterprises on the Mainland had put forward to the Straits Exchange Foundation requests concerning applications for Spring Festival charter flights next year for the Jinan route point, flight planning and so on. What is the mainland's attitude toward this?","Cross-Strait direct air links are an important air bond connecting the kinship of compatriots on both sides of the Strait and smoothing economic, trade and cultural exchanges, and they carry the urgent needs of people on both sides for travel back and forth. From January to August this year, passengers traveling across the Strait on direct passenger flights reached 4.221 million person-trips, a year-on-year increase of 12.9%, which fully confirms the strong demand in the cross-Strait direct flight market and the strong desire of people on both sides to travel back and forth. We actively promote the full restoration and normalization of cross-Strait direct air links, and this attitude is consistent and clear. From calling for the restoration of route points and the addition of flights to applying for charter flights, this reflects the ardent expectation of Taiwan businesspeople and Taiwan compatriots for the full resumption of flights to all cross-Strait direct route points. We hope the DPP authorities will stop political manipulation, respond to the people's calls, and fully restore the normalization of cross-Strait direct passenger air links as soon as possible.","两岸空中直航是联结两岸同胞亲情、畅通经贸文化交流的重要空中纽带，承载着两岸民众往来的迫切需求。今年1至8月，乘坐空中客运直航航班往来两岸的旅客达422.1万人次，同比增长12.9%，充分印证两岸直航市场的旺盛需求和两岸民众往来的强烈意愿。我们积极推动全面恢复两岸空中直航正常化，这一态度是一贯的、明确的。从呼吁恢复航点、增加航班，到申请包机，反映了台商台胞对两岸直航航点全面复航的热切期盼。希望民进党当局停止政治操弄，回应民众呼声，尽快全面恢复两岸空中客运直航正常化。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","中央广播电视总台CGTN记者","Taiwan media reported that a decommissioned Taiwan coast guard vessel donated as aid to the Philippines was recently found to have been converted into a Philippine-flagged law enforcement vessel. The Taiwan coast guard department said that \"this case was handled according to precedent,\" and that Taiwan and the Philippines, among others, have signed a fisheries agreement and established a consultation mechanism,…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The two sides of the Strait should jointly safeguard the country's territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and safeguard the overall and fundamental interests of the Chinese nation.\nThe DPP authorities feign deafness and dumbness toward the infringing act of Japan and the Philippines announcing the launch of negotiations on the delimitation of the waters east of Taiwan Island. Not only do they fail to do their utmost to protect the interests of the people on the island, they instead aid the wicked, increase the risk of harm to the rights and interests of Taiwan fishermen, and abandon their national stance, which is contemptible.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。两岸应共同维护国家领土主权和海洋权益，维护中华民族的整体和根本利益。\n民进党当局对日本、菲律宾宣布启动台湾岛以东海域划界谈判的侵权行径装聋作哑，不但不尽力保护岛内民众利益，反而助纣为虐，增大台湾渔民权益受损的风险，丧失民族立场，令人不齿。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814552.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, Lin Chia-lung, head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department, said that Taiwan will set up an office in Cebu, the Philippines. Public opinion on the island has questioned whether the two sides negotiated setting up the \"office\" during the period of the so-called \"maritime delimitation negotiations\" between Japan and the Philippines, and whether it came at the cost of sacrificing Taiwan's interests. What…","The relevant department has already stated its solemn position on this. We firmly oppose any form of official exchanges between countries having diplomatic relations with China and the Taiwan region of China. The Philippine side should abide by the one-China principle and stop sending wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly \"rely on foreign support to seek independence,\" which cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China and cannot shake the universal consensus and basic pattern of the international community's adherence to the one-China principle; it will only end in failure.","有关部门已就此表明严正立场。我们坚决反对建交国同中国台湾地区开展任何形式的官方往来。菲方应恪守一个中国原则，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。\n民进党当局顽固“倚外谋独”，改变不了台湾是中国一部分的事实，撼动不了国际社会坚持一个中国原则的普遍共识和基本格局，只会以失败告终。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","香港经济导报记者","On September 22, the 48th WorldSkills Competition opened in Shanghai. Please introduce the participation of the Taiwan region.","From September 22 to 27, the 48th WorldSkills Competition is being held in Shanghai. The Chinese Taipei delegation sent 53 competitors to take part in competitions in 47 skills, including industrial mechanics, mobile applications development and automobile technology. We look forward to the splendid performance of competitors from both sides of the Strait and wish them good results in advance.","9月22日至27日，第48届世界技能大赛在上海举办。中国台北代表团派出53名选手参加工业机械、移动应用开发、汽车技术等47个项目的比赛。我们期待两岸选手的精彩表现，预祝他们取得好成绩。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","上海“澎湃新闻”记者","Recently, Cho Jung-tai, head of Taiwan's executive department, claimed that \"Taiwan is now facing foreign cultural invasion from Xiaohongshu, Douyin and the like, and will use the power of the government to protect local cultural industries.\" What is your comment on this?","The so-called \"foreign cultural invasion\" is pure nonsense. The mother body of Taiwan's culture is Chinese culture; it is both an important component of Chinese culture and has also enriched Chinese culture. Taiwan compatriots, especially Taiwan youth, carry out cultural exchanges with mainland compatriots through mainland social media platforms, conduct exchanges and mutual learning, and enhance mutual understanding, while also showcasing their talents and enriching their cultural life on mainland social media platforms. This is a vivid manifestation of Chinese culture being rooted among the people of Taiwan, and also a rich channel for cross-Strait people-to-people exchanges.\nThe DPP authorities disregard the facts and act against the tide, politicizing and stigmatizing normal cross-Strait cultural exchanges, engaging in large-scale political manipulation, and attempting to build a \"cultural high wall\" between compatriots on both sides of the Strait and sever the blood ties between compatriots on both sides of the Strait. This is unpopular and doomed to be futile.","所谓“外来文化侵略”纯属无稽之谈。台湾文化的母体是中华文化，既是中华文化的重要组成部分，也丰富了中华文化。台湾同胞特别是台湾青年通过大陆社交平台与大陆同胞进行文化交流，开展交流互鉴，增进相互了解，同时也在大陆社交平台展示才艺、丰富文化生活。这是中华文化根植于台湾民间的生动体现，也是两岸民间交流的丰富渠道。\n民进党当局罔顾事实、倒行逆施，将正常的两岸文化交流政治化、污名化，大搞政治操弄，企图在两岸同胞之间筑起“文化高墙”，割裂两岸同胞的血脉联系，不得人心，注定徒劳。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260923_12814582.htm"],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《中国时报》记者","Taiwan scholar Chang Ya-chung recently published an article after attending the Beijing Xiangshan Forum, arguing that the mainland now treats \"one country, two systems\" as a toast and \"reunification by force\" as a forfeit, and that these contents are more like a disposal plan for \"after being reunified.\" He suggested that the mainland explore \"harmony and union before reunification,\" first answering how the two…","\"Peaceful reunification and 'one country, two systems'\" is the basic policy for resolving the Taiwan question and also the best way to realize national reunification. It embodies the Chinese wisdom that the sea admits hundreds of rivers and is great because of its capacity to hold; it both fully considers the actual situation in Taiwan and is conducive to Taiwan's long-term peace and stability after reunification. The specific form in which the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan is realized in Taiwan will fully consider the actual situation in Taiwan, will fully absorb the opinions and suggestions of people on both sides of the Strait, and will fully take care of the interests and feelings of Taiwan compatriots.\nOn the common political basis of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence,\" we are willing to carry out broad and in-depth democratic consultations with all parties, groups and individuals in Taiwan on cross-Strait relations and the future of the nation, and to work together to promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations. We also welcome Taiwan compatriots to offer advice and suggestions for advancing the great cause of reunification of the motherland. The earlier and the more Taiwan compatriots discuss the content related to reunification, the more opportunities it can bring to Taiwan's economic and social development, and the more tangible benefits it can bring to themselves.","“和平统一、一国两制”是解决台湾问题的基本方针，也是实现国家统一的最佳方式，体现了海纳百川、有容乃大的中华智慧，既充分考虑台湾现实情况，也有利于统一后台湾长治久安。“两制”台湾方案在台湾的具体实现形式会充分考虑台湾现实情况，会充分吸收两岸民众意见和建议，会充分照顾到台湾同胞的利益和感情。\n在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上，我们愿意同台湾各党派、团体和人士围绕两岸关系和民族未来开展广泛深入的民主协商，为推动两岸关系和平发展共同努力。我们也欢迎台湾同胞为推进祖国统一大业建言献策。台湾同胞越早讨论、越多讨论统一的相关内容，就越能为台湾经济社会发展带来更多机遇，越能为自身带来更多实在好处。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: Reuters said that during President Xi Jinping's visit to the United States, he may raise the \"August 17\" Communique signed by China and the United States in 1982 and ask U.S. President Trump to stop selling weapons to Taiwan on that basis. What is your comment on this? Second question: Shen Yu-chung, deputy head of the Mainland Affairs Council, recently said that after the meeting between the…","On the first question. Taiwan is China's Taiwan, and the Taiwan question is China's internal affair, which brooks no interference by any external forces. We firmly oppose U.S. arms sales to the Taiwan region of China, and this position is consistent and clear.\nOn the second question. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is part of China. The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no external interference. The historical and legal fact that both sides of the Strait belong to one China cannot be changed by anyone or any force. The motherland must be reunified and will inevitably be reunified.\nOn the third question. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and collude with external forces to carry out provocations seeking \"independence,\" and they are the root cause of trouble for peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. No matter what fallacies the DPP authorities spread, they cannot change the fact that Taiwan is part of China.","第一个问题。台湾是中国的台湾，台湾问题是中国内政，不容任何外部势力干涉。我们坚决反对美国向中国台湾地区出售武器，这一立场是一贯的、明确的。\n第二个问题。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。两岸同属一个中国的历史和法理事实，是任何人任何势力都无法改变的。祖国必须统一，也必然统一。\n第三个问题。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，勾连外部势力进行谋“独”挑衅，是台海和平稳定的祸根乱源。无论民进党当局散布什么谬论，都改变不了台湾是中国一部分的事实。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: a deputy director of the Shanghai Taiwan Affairs Office going to Taiwan for an advance site inspection has been blocked by the Mainland Affairs Council for a second time. The Mainland Affairs Council pointed out that this is a principle of response to the mainland side's \"22 articles on punishing independence,\" under which mainland local Taiwan affairs office directors and deputy directors are not…","On the first question. The Shanghai-Taipei City Forum is an important platform for city exchanges between the two sides of the Strait. In order to hold this year's \"Twin-City Forum\" well and let compatriots on both sides of the Strait continue to benefit from it, the two cities have maintained communication on matters related to holding the forum, and the Shanghai side's going to Taiwan is an advance site inspection in Taipei following customary practice. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" stance and, for selfish political gain, deliberately set up all kinds of obstacles to holding the forum, unreasonably making things difficult and obstructing and sabotaging cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, which is unpopular.\nOn the second question. Wanting peace, wanting development, wanting exchanges and wanting cooperation is the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. We support and actively promote all kinds of cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation, including the \"Twin-City Forum.\" The \"Twin-City Forum\" has been held for 16 consecutive years and has formed certain customary practices and procedures. We are happy to see, and believe, that this year it will certainly be held smoothly according to customary practice.","第一个问题。上海台北城市论坛是两岸之间重要的城市交流平台。为了办好今年的“双城论坛”，让两岸同胞持续从中受益，两市一直就论坛举办相关事项保持沟通，上海方面赴台是循惯例到台北踩线。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”立场，为了政治私利处心积虑给论坛举办设置种种障碍，无理刁难、阻挠破坏两岸交流合作，不得人心。\n第二个问题。要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作是两岸同胞共同心声，我们支持并积极推动包括“双城论坛”在内的两岸各项交流合作。“双城论坛”已经连续举办16年，已经形成一定的惯例和做法，我们乐见并相信今年一定会按惯例顺利举办。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《旺报》记者","In June this year, mainland actor Zhang Linghe's participation in the Straits Forum attracted the attention of young people on both sides of the Strait. Recently the mainland TV drama \"Zao Chun Qing Lang\" has been a hit in Taiwan, and its leading actors Jing Boran and Sun Qian have also attracted the attention of Taiwan audiences. Will the two leading actors have the opportunity in the future to take part in…","The three actors you mentioned are themselves young people, and their participation in cross-Strait youth exchange activities is a natural thing. We hope that in the future there will be more opportunities for young mainland performing artists and Taiwan youth to carry out exchanges and cooperation in various ways, integrate together into the process of cross-Strait integrated development, and share the development opportunities of Chinese-style modernization.","你提到的3位演员本身就是青年，他们参与两岸青年交流活动是自然而然的事情。我们希望未来有更多机会，大陆青年演艺人员和台湾青年能够以各种方式进行交流合作，一起融入两岸融合发展进程，共享中国式现代化的发展机遇。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾《联合报》记者","First question: the APEC Human Resources Development Ministerial Meeting closed in Nanjing on the 22nd, and the Taiwan side's representative attended the meeting successfully and the process went smoothly. Does the mainland side believe that this experience has added mutual trust between the two sides of the Strait and laid a foundation for future interaction? During the meeting, did the heads of the relevant…","On the first question. As the host of this year's Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) activities, we handle matters concerning the Taiwan region's participation in meetings in accordance with the one-China principle and the provisions and customary practice of the relevant APEC memorandum of understanding.\nOn the second question. The DPP authorities have always claimed that they have opened so-called \"charter flight points,\" but the application conditions are extremely harsh, and the public and the industry \"can see it but cannot touch it, much less eat it.\" The DPP authorities should squarely face the actual demand for cross-Strait direct passenger air links, go along with the will of the people, remove the unreasonable restrictions on cross-Strait air transport as soon as possible, and give compatriots on both sides of the Strait back an unobstructed, convenient and efficient road through the air.","第一个问题。作为今年亚太经合组织（APEC）活动的东道主，我们按照一个中国原则和APEC有关谅解备忘录的规定及惯例处理台湾地区参会事宜。\n第二个问题。民进党当局一直声称已开放所谓“包机点”，但申请条件非常苛刻，民众和业者“看得到，摸不着，更吃不到”。民进党当局应当正视两岸空中客运直航的现实需求，顺应民心，尽快取消对两岸航空运输的不合理限制，还两岸同胞一条畅通、便捷、高效的空中之路。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-23","Zhu Fenglian","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: Taiwan's \"Minister of Labor\" Hung Sun-han went to Nanjing to attend the APEC meeting, and his table nameplate used \"Chinese Taipei.\" By contrast, earlier, the wife of Taipei Mayor Chiang Wan-an was criticized by some people on the island for \"self-belittlement\" because she said she came from \"Chinese Taipei,\" but in Hung Sun-han's case this time there were no such voices on the island. How do you…","On the first question. Under the one-China principle, the Taiwan region participates in Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) and related activities under the name \"Chinese Taipei\" and in the capacity of a regional economy. All parties must abide by the provisions and customary practice of the relevant APEC memorandum of understanding.\nOn the second question, Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland need not have groundless worries and concerns; as long as they abide by laws and regulations, they can certainly come happily and return safely.\nThat concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。在一个中国原则下，台湾地区以“中国台北”名义、地区经济体身份参与亚太经合组织（APEC）及相关活动。各方须遵守APEC有关谅解备忘录规定及惯例。\n第二个问题，台湾同胞来大陆不需要有莫须有的担心和忧虑，只要合法合规，一定可以高高兴兴地来、平平安安地回。\n今天的发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260923_12814547.htm","",1,4,6,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","I have two questions. Firstly, it's reported that the New Zealand frigate HMNZS Te Mana and maritime sustainment vessel HMNZS Aotearoa recently sailed through the Taiwan Strait. What is your comment? Secondly, it's reported that the Japanese government plans to establish a new defense-related independent administrative agency in FY2027. The body will coordinate defense equipment exports, support emerging…","On your first question, the Chinese military deployed naval and air troops in accordance with laws and regulations to monitor and track the New Zealand vessels throughout their passage, ensuring an effective response. We urge the New Zealand side to earnestly abide by the one-China principle and refrain from sending wrong signals to separatist forces for \"Taiwan independence\".\nOn your second question, as explicitly stipulated in legally binding international instruments including the Cairo Declaration, the Potsdam Proclamation and the Japanese Instrument of Surrender, Japan shall be \"completely disarmed\" and not maintain industries that \"would enable her to re-arm for war.\" This is an important part of the post-war international order and serves as a crucial bulwark for the international community against the resurgence of Japanese militarism. In recent years, the Japanese side has dramatically increased its military budget, vigorously developed offensive capabilities, and even massively expanded its military industry in the name of economic development. Such developments bear striking similarities to the warning signs leading up to Japan's aggression during WWII. The international community should stay highly vigilant and take firm actions to prevent Japan's neo-militarism from wreaking havoc.","关于第一个问题，中国军队依法依规组织海空兵力，对过航台湾海峡的新西兰军舰全程跟监警戒，有效应对处置。我们敦促新方恪守一个中国原则，不要向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。\n关于第二个问题，《开罗宣言》《波茨坦公告》和《日本投降书》等一系列具有国际法效力的文件明确规定，日本应完全解除武装，不得维持能使其重新武装的产业。这是战后国际秩序的重要组成部分，是国际社会防止日本军国主义死灰复燃的重要屏障。近年来，日方军费预算持续暴涨，大力发展进攻性能力，甚至以发展经济之名大肆扩张军工产业，与当年日本发动对外侵略前的迹象何其相似。国际社会应对此高度警惕，坚决遏阻日本“新型军国主义”为祸人间。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","I have two questions. Firstly, recently, when the China Coast Guard (CCG) vessel CCGS Sanzhou'ao was on legitimate law-enforcement operations near Xianbin Jiao of China's Nansha Qundao, a Philippine vessel, Magat Salamat (MMOV 3015), ignored repeated warnings from the Chinese side, deliberately altered course and suddenly speeded up to cut across the bow of the CCG vessel, leading to a collision. What is your…","On your first question, the CCG has released a statement on the incident. The context is clear and evident, leaving no room for the Philippine side's misinformation. The Philippine government vessel was on a provocative mission in waters near Xianbin Jiao of China's Nansha Qundao, and made a dangerous maneuver like a lane-change cut-off to deliberately ram the Chinese vessel. Such action seriously threatened the safety of the Chinese crew and vessel, and violated international law and the basic norms governing international relations. Playing victim and peddling false narratives cannot change the provocative and illegal nature of the Philippine side's behaviors. The Chinese side will continue to take effective measures to resolutely safeguard our territorial sovereignty and maritime rights and interests, and uphold peace and stability in the South China Sea.\nOn your second question, in order to advance their separatist agenda for \"Taiwan independence\", the DPP authorities disregarded the tragedy in which the Philippine Coast Guard once killed a fisherman of Taiwan, colluded with the Philippines, and attempted to use vessel donations as tools to expand so-called official ties. Such acts trample on national dignity and betray national interests, and are condemned by compatriots on both sides of the Taiwan Strait. We urge the Philippine side to abide by the one-China principle, refrain from engaging in any form of official exchanges or military interactions with China's Taiwan region, and stop sending wrong signals to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces.","关于第一个问题，中国海警局已经介绍了有关情况，事实清楚、证据确凿，容不得菲方狡辩炒作。菲律宾公务船在中国南沙群岛仙宾礁附近海域挑衅滋事，采取类似“变道别车”的危险方式，故意冲撞中方海警船，严重威胁中方人员和船只安全，严重违反国际法和国际关系基本准则。菲方一再碰瓷卖惨、散布虚假叙事，改变不了侵权挑衅的本质。中方将继续采取有效措施，坚定捍卫自身领土主权和海洋权益，坚定维护南海和平稳定。\n关于第二个问题，民进党当局为了“台独”分裂图谋，罔顾菲律宾海警曾射杀台湾渔民的惨剧，主动贴靠勾连，企图以舰艇援助为工具，拓展所谓“官方联系”，出卖民族尊严和利益，受到两岸同胞唾弃。我们敦促菲方恪守一个中国原则，不得同中国台湾地区开展任何形式的官方往来和军事联系，停止向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","I have two questions. Firstly, Chinese President Xi Jinping is paying a state visit to the U.S. Under the strategic guidance of the two leaders, efforts are being made to build a constructive China-U.S. relationship of strategic stability. We have seen some interactions between the Chinese and U.S. militaries recently. Following the meeting between theater commanders at the end of last month, the U.S. raised the…","On your first question, head-of-state diplomacy plays an irreplaceable strategic guiding role in China-U.S. state-to-state and military-to-military ties. We are willing to work with the U.S. side to deliver on the important consensus reached by the two presidents on military affairs, strengthen communication and dialogue, carry out practical cooperation, properly manage differences, and keep the military-to-military relationship stable, sound and sustainable, so as to play a positive role in building a constructive China-U.S. relationship of strategic stability.\nOn your second question, for updates on President Xi's visit to the U.S., I'd refer you to official news releases. I want to underline that the Taiwan question is the most important matter in China-U.S. relations, and preserving peace and stability across the Taiwan Strait represents the greatest common ground between China and the U.S.. We hope the U.S. side will handle the Taiwan question with utmost prudence.","关于第一个问题，元首外交对中美两国两军关系具有不可替代的战略引领作用。我们愿与美方共同努力，落实好两国元首涉军重要共识，加强沟通对话、开展务实合作、妥善管控分歧，保持两军关系稳定、健康、可持续发展，为构建中美建设性战略稳定关系发挥积极作用。\n关于第二个问题，关于习主席访美有关情况，请关注官方新闻报道。需要强调的是，台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数，希望美方慎之又慎处理台湾问题。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","I have two questions. Firstly, around the 95th anniversary of the September 18th Incident, some Japanese politicians continued to link the situation in the Taiwan Strait to a so-called survival-threatening situation; meanwhile, Japan, together with the U.S. and Australia, is conducting Exercise Orient Shield 26 at multiple locations across its country, and keeps pressing ahead with the construction of missile and…","On your first question, Japanese militarists deliberately created the September 18th Incident and launched the war of aggression against China, committing countless atrocities against people around the world, especially the peoples of China and other Asian countries. To this day, Japan has not yet truly reflected on its war crimes. Instead, it repeats its old trick to speed up remilitarization under the pretext of a so-called survival-threatening situation, which poses a threat to regional peace and stability. The international community should stay highly vigilant and resolutely check the developments of Japan's neo-militarism.\nOn your second question, defense makes a country secure and its people safe. The National Defense Education Month campaign is held every September, and has become an important platform for strengthening defense education and raising defense awareness nationwide. This year, military and civilian authorities have organized a wide range of defense education activities under the theme of \"carrying forward the great Long March spirit and working together to build a strong national defense\". The military has organized more open-day activities, provided military training for students based on outlines, carried out widely-participated events, and tapped into and mobilized resources to support national defense education. An open-day event was held at the unit where Yang Gensi, a military hero, once served, in combination of a live-streaming lecture titled On the Same Journey: Youth at Combat Posts, which has received 520 million views. Media products, such as Open Lecture on National Defense, Building National Defense Together and Sunshine Recruitment, Walking the Journey Together, have received more than 100 million clicks across all media platforms. A total of 464 teams from 201 military and civilian academies across China have signed up for the 2nd National Youth Intelligent Unmanned Systems Application Competition, and more than 400,000 young people have registered for the National Defense Literacy Competition. We have built innovative and pace-setting competition brands for defense education, which have played effective roles in fostering the aspiration of the younger generation for greater knowledge and stronger skills, and developing their sense of responsibility for building a strong country and a strong military. We have also carried out activities including Our August 1st: First Lesson on National Defense and Youth in Military Training, so as to encourage the whole society to care about national defense and act accordingly.","关于第一个问题，当年日本军国主义蓄意制造九一八事变，发动侵华战争，对包括中国在内的亚洲邻国和世界人民犯下罄竹难书的罪行。时至今日，日本不仅没有反省侵略历史罪责，反而故伎重施，以所谓“存亡危机事态”为名加速“再军事化”，威胁地区和平稳定。国际社会应予以高度警惕，坚决遏阻日本“新型军国主义”妄动。\n关于第二个问题，国无防不立，民无防不安。“全民国防教育月”活动于每年9月开展，已成为加强全民国防教育、提升全民国防素养的重要载体。今年军地围绕“弘扬伟大长征精神 同心共筑强大国防”主题，集中组织丰富多彩的教育活动。军队深化军营开放活动，科学组织学生军训，广泛开展群众性教育活动，积极挖掘、汇聚、运用资源支持参与全民国防教育。在“杨根思生前所在部队”开展陆军军营开放活动暨“与‘陆’同行 青春战位说”国防教育情景直播课，话题传播量达5.2亿。《国防公开课》《同心筑国防》《阳光征兵 你我同行》等融媒体节目跨媒体总触达人次过亿。全国201所军地院校共464支队伍报名参加第二届全国青少年智能无人系统应用大赛，超40万青少年报名参加全国青少年国防素养大赛，打造创新性、引领性国防教育赛事品牌，有效培育青少年崇文尚武的思想观念和强国强军的责任担当。各地还广泛开展了“我们的八一·我们的国防第一课”、“军训·正青春”等活动，凝聚全社会关心国防、热爱国防、建设国防、保卫国防的意志力量。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","In a recent report released by a U.S. think tank, the U.S. government was advised not to step into a cross-Strait conflict. The report also called for the immediate withdrawal of hundreds of military trainers stationed in Taiwan and the termination of informal verbal commitments. What is China's comment on this?","The Taiwan question is purely China's internal affair and brooks no foreign interference. A growing number of people have come to realize that supporting \"Taiwan independence\" does the U.S. no good but only harm. The sensible choice would be to follow the prevailing trend of China's reunification and firmly oppose provocative moves made by the DPP authorities for \"Taiwan independence\".","台湾问题纯属中国内政，不容任何外来干涉。越来越多的人认识到，支持“台独”对美国有害无益；顺应中国统一历史大势、坚决反对民进党当局谋“独”挑衅，才是明智之举。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","Recently, there have been growing discussions in Taiwan about the proposal under the \"one country, two systems\" principle and national reunification, and calls among people on the island for peaceful reunification have also grown louder. What is your comment?","This shows that national reunification is where the arc of history bends and public opinion trends. Peaceful reunification and \"one country, two systems\" are our basic principles for resolving the Taiwan question and the best approach to realizing national reunification. Reunification will eradicate \"Taiwan independence\" as the source of turmoil, remove the hidden risks of war across the Taiwan Strait, build a solid security barrier for Taiwan compatriots, and provide strong support for the prosperity and development of Taiwan's society. All Chinese people will work even more closely together to usher in a peaceful and prosperous future marked by national reunification and family reunion, and share in the great glory of national rejuvenation.","这体现了祖国统一是大势所趋、人心所向。“和平统一、一国两制”是我们解决台湾问题的基本方针，是实现祖国统一的最佳方式。统一将根除“台独”祸根乱源，消弭台海战火隐患，为台湾同胞筑牢安全屏障，为台湾社会繁荣发展提供强大依靠。全体中华儿女将进一步携手同心，共创家国团圆的和平盛世，共享民族复兴的伟大荣光。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","It's reported that two F-16V jets purchased by Taiwan's military turned back after departing from Hawaii, leaving the delivery timeline unclear. The arms sale package includes 66 fighter jets, whose delivery has been repeatedly delayed since the contract was signed. Taiwan have paid for multiple arms sales packages, but there is still no sign of delivery of any of them, sparking doubts within the island. What is…","The DPP authorities, in pursuit of their selfish gains, squander taxpayers' hard-earned money on wasteful arms purchases. Such procurement can never bring security, but only drain Taiwan's finances and bring disaster to its people.","民进党当局为谋求一党之私，挥霍台湾老百姓的血汗钱搞“凯子军购”，买不来安全，只会进一步掏空台湾，祸台害民。","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[1,"2026-09-24","Jiang Bin","","I have three questions. Firstly, fighting has recently intensified near the Bab el-Mandeb Strait. Has the PLA base in Djibouti been affected? A research institute said that satellite imagery showed that China's military had installed new antennas, satellite communications equipment and other assets at its military base in Djibouti, which significantly enhanced its ability to monitor military activities across the…","On your first question, China's support base in Djibouti is operating normally. I am not aware of the specifics you mentioned.\nOn your second question, pursuant to the Reservist Law of the People's Republic of China, reservists are members of the country's armed forces. They shall participate in military training in accordance with relevant provisions and meet the training requirements set forth in the military training outlines. This is not only a statutory obligation but also a necessary measure to strengthen the development of the reservist force.\nAs for your third question, the National Defense Mobilization Law is a basic law governing defense mobilization. Its primary function is to regulate national defense mobilization work, clarify the rights and obligations of citizens and organizations regarding defense mobilization, and provide legal support for building consolidated national defense. This is essentially no different from laws and regulations related to national defense mobilization enacted by the majority of countries worldwide. China's existing National Defense Mobilization Law took effect in July 2010. More than a decade later, some provisions of the law are no longer suitable for the new circumstances, tasks and requirements for national defense mobilization. This revision is based on the need to deliver on the CPC Central Committee's decisions and plans, to improve the defense legal system and to conduct national defense mobilization work in accordance with the law. It's clearly stipulated in relevant provisions that national defense mobilization shall follow the military strategic guideline for a new era, which adheres to the principles of defense, self-defense and post-strike response, and adopts active defense. There is no need for relevant parties to over-interpret.\nTomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival. I wish everyone a happy holiday and a joyful family reunion. This concludes today's press conference. Thank you.","关于第一个问题，中方驻吉布提保障基地运行一切正常。我不了解你说的有关具体情况。\n关于第二个问题，根据《中华人民共和国预备役人员法》，预备役人员是国家武装力量的成员，应当按照规定参加军事训练，达到军事训练大纲规定的训练要求。这既是法律规定的义务，也是加强预备役人员队伍建设的必要之举。\n关于第三个问题，国防动员法是国防动员领域的基础性法律，其主要功能是规范国防动员工作，明确公民和组织的国防动员权利义务，为建设巩固国防提供法治保障，这同世界上多数国家出台的国防动员相关法律法规没有本质区别。我国现行国防动员法于2010年7月正式实施，经过十几年的实践，法律部分条款内容已经不适应国防动员新形势新任务新要求。此次修法，是贯彻党中央决策部署、完善国防法规体系、依法开展国防动员工作的需要。相关条款明确规定，国防动员坚持贯彻新时代军事战略方针，即坚持防御、自卫、后发制人原则，实行“积极防御”。有关方面不必过度解读。\n明天就是中秋佳节，在此祝大家节日快乐、阖家幸福！今天的记者会到此结束，谢谢！","http://eng.mod.gov.cn/2025xb/P/16490695.html","http://www.mod.gov.cn/gfbw/xwfyr/lxjzh_246940/16488999.html",1,1,4,""],[0,"2026-09-29","Guo Jiakun","CCTV","Today marks the 54th anniversary of the issuance of the China-Japan Joint Statement. As China-Japan relations face grave difficulties, how does China see the historical significance of the four political documents between the two countries, including the joint statement, and how are they still relevant today?","Today 54 years ago, the older generation of Chinese and Japanese leaders, with extraordinary political vision and courage, signed and issued the China-Japan Joint Statement, which marked the normalization of relations between the two countries. In the joint statement, Japan explicitly noted that it is “keenly conscious of” and “deeply reproaches itself” over its responsibility for war and that it “recognizes the Government of the People’s Republic of China as the sole legal Government of China.” The statement also notes that the Government of Japan “fully understands and respects” the position of the Chinese government that Taiwan is an inalienable part of the territory of the People’s Republic of China. The four political documents between China and Japan, including the joint statement, laid the political and legal foundation for China-Japan relations, and established the rules for properly settling major issues of principle, including history and Taiwan. There should be no distortion or regression, still less sabotage, regarding these principles.\nToday, more than half a century later, China-Japan relations once again face a severe situation. The root cause is that the political foundation of the bilateral relations has been gravely undermined. The incumbent leader of Japan not only refuses to reflect on the history of aggression, but also claims that a contingency in Taiwan will constitute a “survival threatening” situation for Japan. This is a blatant challenge to China’s state sovereignty and against the aspiration demonstrated by the normalization of China-Japan relations and the political commitments Japan made to China. Japan keeps peddling the so-called “external threat” narrative, using it as a pretext to speed up remilitarization. The move poses a challenge to the postwar international order and threatens regional peace and stability.\nHistory has repeatedly shown that only by staying true to the spirit of the four political documents can China and Japan keep the relationship on the right course. Just as Foreign Minister Wang Yi noted in the meeting yesterday with Takeshi Iwaya, head of the Japanese Association for the Promotion of International Trade, the pressing priority for Japan is to correct Japanese leader’s erroneous words and deeds on the Taiwan question. Japan should adopt a correct attitude on historical issues, and form an objective and rational perception on China. On this day of historic significance, we once again urge those running the government of Japan to seriously reflect on and correct their wrongdoings, and take real actions to return to the purpose and mission of the four political documents.","","https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/eng/xw/fyrbt/lxjzh/202609/t20260929_12033413.html","",0,1,1,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","Not specified (announcement/opening)","At 10 a.m. on September 30, the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council held a regular press conference in its press briefing hall. Spokesperson Zhang Han answered reporters' questions on recent cross-Strait hot-button issues.","Good morning, friends from the press. Welcome to the regular press conference of the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council. Please ask your questions.","各位记者朋友，大家上午好。欢迎参加国务院台办例行新闻发布会。请大家提问。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","新华社记者","On September 24, President Xi Jinping set out China's principled position on the Taiwan question in his talks with U.S. President Trump, which drew close attention from public opinion on both sides of the Strait. Please give your interpretation.","The Taiwan question is the most important question in China-U.S. relations. President Xi Jinping stressed that China's position on safeguarding national reunification and territorial integrity is very clear. He hoped the U.S. side will adhere to the correct position of opposing \"Taiwan independence\" and handle the Taiwan question prudently, laying a solid foundation for China-U.S. strategic cooperation and the development of bilateral relations.\nThe Taiwan question is China's internal affair. Resolving the Taiwan question is a matter for Chinese people on both sides of the Strait themselves. Achieving the complete reunification of the motherland is the common aspiration of all Chinese sons and daughters, including Taiwan compatriots; it is the trend of the times, the call of righteousness and the will of the people. More and more Taiwan compatriots have come to realize that \"Taiwan independence\" is a dead end and that outsiders cannot be relied upon. We have the determination and the ability to defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity. We hope that the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will join us in resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, and take an active part in the just cause of promoting the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and advancing the reunification of the motherland.\n\"Taiwan independence\" is as incompatible with peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait as fire and water. Maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait is the greatest common denominator between China and the U.S., and is also an inherent part of a constructive, strategically stable China-U.S. relationship. We hope the U.S. side will abide by the one-China principle and the three China-U.S. joint communiques, adhere to the correct position of opposing \"Taiwan independence\", handle the Taiwan question with the utmost prudence, not send wrong signals to \"Taiwan independence\" separatist forces, and safeguard a constructive, strategically stable China-U.S. relationship with concrete actions.","台湾问题是中美关系中最重要的问题。习近平主席强调，中方维护国家统一和领土完整的立场是很清楚的。希望美方坚持反对“台独”的正确立场，慎重处理台湾问题，为中美战略合作和两国关系发展奠定坚实基础。\n台湾问题是中国内政。解决台湾问题，是两岸中国人自己的事。实现祖国完全统一是包括台湾同胞在内的全体中华儿女的共同心愿，是大势所趋、大义所在、民心所向。越来越多台湾同胞认识到，“台独”是绝路，外人靠不住。我们有决心、有能力捍卫国家主权和领土完整。希望广大台湾同胞同我们一道，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，积极参与到推动两岸关系和平发展、推进祖国统一的正义事业中来。\n“台独”与台海和平稳定水火不容，维护台海和平稳定是中美双方最大公约数，也是中美建设性战略稳定关系的应有之义。希望美方恪守一个中国原则和中美三个联合公报，坚持反对“台独”的正确立场，慎之又慎处理台湾问题，不向“台独”分裂势力发出错误信号，以实际行动维护中美建设性战略稳定关系。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815879.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“日月谭天”和“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, the 2026 cross-Strait compatriots' Mid-Autumn Festival fellowship event was held in Beijing, where compatriots from both sides of the Strait admired the bright moon together, talked together about their hometown ties, and spoke together about the future. Please give us an introduction.","On September 23, more than 400 compatriots from both sides of the Strait gathered at Yanqi Lake in Huairou, Beijing, to take part together in \"Full Moon over Beijing, Affection Linking Both Sides of the Strait\" - the 2026 cross-Strait compatriots' Mid-Autumn Festival fellowship event. The event was co-hosted by the Beijing Association for the Promotion of Cross-Strait Non-Governmental Exchanges and the Huairou District People's Government. It included a cross-Strait compatriots' Mid-Autumn tea gathering, the \"e Qi Zhanfang Ba\" Straits song gala, and other activities. Compatriots from both sides of the Strait admired the bright moon together, talked together about their hometown ties and spoke together about the future, expressing their joy in welcoming the traditional festival of the Chinese nation and their fond wish for cross-Strait reunion.\nSong Tao, director of the Taiwan Work Office of the CPC Central Committee and the Taiwan Affairs Office of the State Council, attended the cross-Strait compatriots' Mid-Autumn tea gathering. He said that in April this year, General Secretary Xi Jinping met Kuomintang Chairwoman Cheng Li-wun and delivered an important speech, pointing out the direction for the development of cross-Strait relations. We will thoroughly implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech, adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", broadly unite Taiwan compatriots, deepen cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and integrated development, resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external interference, promote the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations, and advance the great cause of the reunification of the motherland and national rejuvenation.\nMore than 300 Taiwan guests, including Kuomintang Vice Chairman and Secretary-General Lee Chien-lung, representatives of guests from the island, Taiwan entrepreneurs and Taiwan compatriots in Beijing, took part in the event. Taiwan compatriots at the event said that for Chinese people on both sides of the Strait, the Mid-Autumn Festival is not only a festival but also a bond of feeling, and the Mid-Autumn moon is a cultural mark shared by compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nParticipants also watched together the \"e Qi Zhanfang Ba\" Straits song gala produced by China Media Group. Performers and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait, through co-creating, singing together, performing together and blending together, presented a warm and sincere musical event, showing a vivid picture of compatriots on both sides of the Strait walking side by side and joining hands toward the future. The gala was broadcast on September 29 on the CCTV variety channel and China Media Group's new-media platforms, and everyone is welcome to watch it through China Media Group's \"Kan Taihai\" new-media matrix.","9月23日，400余名两岸同胞在北京怀柔雁栖湖共同参加“月满京华 情牵两岸”——2026年两岸同胞迎中秋联谊活动。活动由北京海峡两岸民间交流促进会和怀柔区人民政府共同主办。活动包括两岸同胞迎中秋茶话会、“e起绽放吧”海峡歌会等。两岸同胞共赏明月、共话乡情、共叙未来，抒发迎接中华民族传统佳节的喜悦和期盼两岸团圆的美好愿望。\n中共中央台办、国务院台办主任宋涛出席了两岸同胞迎中秋茶话会。他表示，今年4月，习近平总书记会见中国国民党主席郑丽文并发表重要讲话，为两岸关系发展指明了方向。我们将深入贯彻落实习近平总书记重要讲话精神，坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，广泛团结台湾同胞，深化两岸交流合作、融合发展，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外来干涉，推动两岸关系和平发展，推进祖国统一、民族复兴伟业。\n中国国民党副主席兼秘书长李乾龙和岛内嘉宾代表、台湾企业家、在京台胞等300余位台湾嘉宾参加了活动。与会台胞表示，中秋节对两岸中国人来说，不只是一个节日，更是一份感情，中秋明月是两岸同胞共有的文化印记。\n与会人士还共同观看了由中央广电总台制作的“e起绽放吧”海峡歌会。两岸表演嘉宾及青年代表在共创、共唱、共演、共融中，呈现出一场温馨真挚的音乐盛会，展现两岸同胞并肩同行、携手未来的生动图景。这场歌会于9月29日在总台央视综艺频道及总台新媒体平台播出，欢迎大家通过总台“看台海”新媒体矩阵收看。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815878.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","中新社记者","Recently, New Party Vice Chairman Li Sheng-feng set out the New Party's proposals on the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan in an exclusive media interview; the 9th \"National Reunification and National Rejuvenation\" think-tank dialogue was held in Hubei and also drew public attention. What is your comment on this?","The reunification of the motherland is an unstoppable historical trend. \"Peaceful reunification, one country, two systems\" is our basic policy for resolving the Taiwan question and the best way to achieve the reunification of the motherland, and it is most beneficial to compatriots on both sides of the Strait and to the Chinese nation. More and more people in Taiwan, including the New Party, have begun to discuss the specific content of the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan, envisioning the bright prospects after reunification and thinking about the enormous opportunities reunification will bring to Taiwan's economic and social development and the real benefits it will bring to the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots.\nOn September 28, the 9th \"National Reunification and National Rejuvenation\" think-tank dialogue was held in Enshi, Hubei, attended by more than 100 experts and scholars from both sides of the Strait and from Hong Kong and Macao. Around the theme \"Seeking peace for the two sides of the Strait, seeking well-being for compatriots, seeking rejuvenation for the nation\", the experts and scholars actively explored effective paths for advancing the process of national reunification, looked ahead to the bright vision of national rejuvenation, and injected new wisdom and strength into the peaceful development and integrated development of cross-Strait relations.\nWe welcome compatriots on both sides of the Strait to pool their wisdom and put forward more opinions and suggestions for the \"two systems\" Taiwan plan, to jointly create the historic cause of the reunification of the motherland and jointly share the great glory of national rejuvenation.","祖国统一是不可阻挡的历史大势。“和平统一、一国两制”是我们解决台湾问题的基本方针，是实现祖国统一的最佳方式，对两岸同胞和中华民族最有利。包括新党在内的越来越多台湾民众开始讨论“两制”台湾方案的具体内容，畅想统一后的美好前景，思考统一将给台湾经济社会发展带来的巨大机遇，以及给广大台湾同胞带来的实实在在的好处。\n9月28日，第九届“国家统一与民族复兴”智库对话在湖北恩施举行，海峡两岸暨港澳地区100余名专家学者与会。与会专家学者围绕“为两岸谋和平 为同胞谋福祉 为民族谋复兴”主题，积极探讨促进国家统一进程的有效路径，展望民族复兴的美好愿景，为两岸关系和平发展、融合发展注入新的智慧和力量。\n我们欢迎两岸同胞集思广益，为“两制”台湾方案提出更多意见和建议，共创祖国统一历史伟业，共享民族复兴伟大荣光。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815876.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","香港凤凰卫视记者","Recently, Lai Ching-te claimed that next year a defense budget of more than NT$1.3 trillion will be drawn up, to be invested in military procurement, international cooperation and defense self-reliance, in particular strengthening industries such as drones and robots. What is your comment on this?","The Lai Ching-te authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, vainly attempt to \"seek independence by force\" and \"seek independence by relying on foreign forces\", and squander the hard-earned money of the people of Taiwan ever more wantonly. The huge defense spending not only squeezes out livelihood and social welfare spending on the island and harms the vital interests of the people of Taiwan, but will also push Taiwan step by step into an even more dangerous situation, dragging the people of Taiwan along to become cannon fodder for \"Taiwan independence\". Such vile conduct of harming Taiwan, ruining Taiwan and courting self-destruction will surely meet strong opposition. No matter how much budget Lai Ching-te draws up or how many weapons he trades in, he cannot escape the inevitable doom of \"Taiwan independence\".","赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”，变本加厉挥霍台湾民众血汗钱。巨额防务投入不仅挤占岛内民生社会福利开支，损害台湾民众切身利益，更将台湾一步步推向更加危险的境地，裹挟台湾民众成为“台独”炮灰。这种害台毁台、自取灭亡的恶劣行径，必遭强烈反对。无论赖清德编列多少预算，倒腾多少武器，都难逃“台独”必然败亡的下场。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815874.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","环球时报、环球网记者","Recently, the mainland TV series \"Lan Xiang Ru Gu\" became an instant hit as soon as it began airing in Taiwan; some Taiwan media called it \"the dark-horse hit drama of 2026\", and netizens on the island have even started discussions on the Ming-dynasty life the series focuses on. What is your comment on this?","Watching a drama together, singing a song together, tasting a dish together, and travelling to a city together are increasingly becoming a popular way of life for people on both sides of the Strait, especially young friends. Compatriots on both sides of the Strait share the same roots and origins, the same script and the same ethnicity, and can easily form cultural consensus and emotional resonance through all kinds of exchanges; this is a powerful internal driving force for the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations. We hope more Taiwan compatriots will take part in cross-Strait exchanges and jointly promote cross-Strait integrated development.","共赏一部剧，共唱一首歌，共品一道美食，共赴一座城，日益成为两岸民众特别是青年朋友流行的生活方式。两岸同胞同根同源、同文同种，很容易通过各种交流形成文化共识和情感共鸣，这是推动两岸关系和平发展的强大内生动力。希望更多台湾同胞参与到两岸交流中来，共同促进两岸融合发展。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","中国台湾网记者","Please introduce recent cross-Strait exchange activities.","Cross-Strait exchange activities in all fields continue to be wonderful and varied.\nFrom September 18 to 23, the \"Tianjin Charm of Mazu, Praying for a Century of Blessings\" cultural exchange and the 2026 \"Cross-Strait Mazu Bond\" cultural exchange series were held in Tianjin; 48 Taiwan temples and more than 700 Mazu believers took part together in activities including the prayer ceremony for the 700th anniversary of the imperially ordered construction of the Tianjin Tianhou Temple.\nFrom September 20 to 25, Sichuan held the \"Nurturing Together with One Heart, Advancing Together in Good Governance\" cross-Strait community education exchange at the grassroots level; young Taiwan teachers and students went into communities and campuses to experience the institutional advantages and governance effectiveness of grassroots social governance on the mainland in the new era.\nFrom September 21 to 27, Guizhou held the second Guizhou Yangming Studies heritage study camp for Taiwan young students, where young people from both sides of the Strait explored the roots of the Chinese nation's cultural lineage and further deepened their cultural identity.\nFrom September 24 to 28, the third 2026 Shenzhen Longgang science and innovation camp for Taiwan youth was held, where 70 young people from Taiwan experienced up close the vitality of Shenzhen's cutting-edge technology and the charm of its culture and customs.\nFrom September 24 to 30, Zhuzhou, Hunan held the \"Same Cultural Origins, Youth Walking Together\" cross-Strait youth ceramic culture and art exchange, expanding room for cooperation and enhancing the bonds between compatriots through mutual learning.\nFrom September 25 to 28, the third Cross-Strait (Shenzhen) Street Dance League was held, attracting a thousand dancers from both sides of the Strait and from Hong Kong and Macao to compete on the same stage, including nearly 200 young dancers from the island.\nFrom September 28 to 30, the first \"Cross-Strait Innovation and Development Week\" was held in Shanghai under the theme \"New Vision, Winning the Future\", adopting a \"1+5+N\" format including one main seminar and five parallel exchange seminars, with more than a thousand participants including heads of important business groups and enterprises and youth representatives from both sides of the Strait.","两岸各领域交流活动持续精彩纷呈。\n9月18日至23日，“津韵妈祖·祈百年福”文化交流暨2026年“两岸妈祖缘”文化交流系列活动在天津举办，48家台湾宫庙、700余名妈祖信众一同参与天津天后宫敕建700周年祈福大典等活动。\n9月20日至25日，四川举办“同心共育 善治同行”两岸基层社区教育交流活动，台湾青年师生走进社区、校园，感悟新时代大陆基层社会治理的制度优势与治理效能。\n9月21日至27日，贵州举办第二届台湾青年学生贵州阳明学传承研习营，两岸青年围绕探寻中华民族文脉根源，进一步厚植文化认同。\n9月24日至28日，2026年第三届台湾青年深圳龙岗科创营举行，70名台湾青年近距离感受深圳前沿科技活力与人文风情魅力。\n9月24日至30日，湖南株洲举办“文化同源·青春同行”海峡两岸青年陶瓷文化艺术交流活动，通过互学互鉴拓展合作空间、增进同胞情谊。\n9月25日至28日，第三届海峡两岸（深圳）街舞联赛举行，吸引海峡两岸暨港澳千名舞者同台竞技，其中岛内青年舞者近200名。\n9月28日至30日，首届“两岸创新发展周”在上海举办，以“新视野·赢未来”为主题，采取“1+5+N”模式，包括1场主研讨会、5场平行交流研讨会，两岸重要工商团体及企业负责人、青年代表等逾千人参加。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","成都商报“红星新闻”记者","Recently, Lin Chia-lung, head of Taiwan's foreign affairs department, wrote in a Japanese media outlet that the rules-based international order is facing challenges from authoritarian countries, and that \"China is moreover deliberately distorting UN General Assembly Resolution 2758 in an attempt to obstruct Taiwan's participation in international organizations. If the international community does not stop it, the…","The remarks in question are a pure distortion of the facts and a confusion of black and white. The UN Charter laid the cornerstone of the post-war international order and established the international system with the United Nations at its core; abiding by the UN Charter has become the greatest common denominator of the post-war international community.\nThere is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. In 1971, the 26th session of the UN General Assembly adopted Resolution 2758 by an overwhelming majority, deciding to restore all the rights of the People's Republic of China in the United Nations and recognizing the representatives of the Government of the People's Republic of China as the only lawful representatives of China to the United Nations. Resolution 2758 states at the outset that \"the restoration of the lawful rights of the People's Republic of China is essential both for the protection of the Charter of the United Nations and for the cause that the United Nations Organization must serve under the Charter\", solemnly setting out a clear position of upholding the authority of the United Nations. The resolution completely resolved, politically, legally and procedurally, the question of the representation of the whole of China, including Taiwan, in the United Nations.\nThe history is crystal clear, and the legal facts are plain. The DPP authorities' repeated distortion of and attacks on UN General Assembly Resolution 2758, in a vain attempt to challenge the authority of the United Nations and the post-war international order, will never succeed.","有关言论纯属歪曲事实、颠倒黑白。联合国宪章奠定了战后国际秩序基石，确立了以联合国为核心的国际体系，遵守联合国宪章成为战后国际社会的最大公约数。\n世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。1971年，第26届联合国大会以压倒性多数通过第2758号决议，决定恢复中华人民共和国在联合国的一切权利，承认中华人民共和国政府代表是中国在联合国的唯一合法代表。联大第2758号决议开宗明义指出：“恢复中华人民共和国的合法权利对于维护联合国宪章和联合国组织根据宪章所必须从事的事业都是必不可少的”，郑重阐明了维护联合国权威的鲜明立场。该决议从政治上、法律上、程序上彻底解决了包括台湾在内全中国在联合国的代表权问题。\n历史经纬清清楚楚，法理事实明明白白。民进党当局一再歪曲攻击联大第2758号决议，妄图挑战联合国权威和战后国际秩序，绝无可能。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815873.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","四川日报“封面新闻”记者","Recently, U.S. Secretary of State Rubio said that selling weapons to Taiwan \"means we don't have them\", and that U.S. arms sales to Taiwan need to take into account many factors, including the United States' own defense needs. What is your comment on this?","We firmly oppose any form of military contact between countries having diplomatic relations with China and China's Taiwan region. The DPP authorities' vain attempt to \"seek independence by relying on foreign forces\" and \"seek independence by force\" will only harm Taiwan, ruin Taiwan, and bring about their own destruction.","我们坚决反对建交国同中国台湾地区开展任何形式的军事联系。民进党当局妄图“倚外谋独”、“以武谋独”，只会害台、毁台，自取灭亡。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","人民日报记者","Recently, an article in the People's Daily pointed out that the one-China principle is the political foundation of China-U.S. relations, that \"Taiwan independence\" is the common enemy of China and the U.S., and that managing \"Taiwan independence\" is a key link in China and the U.S. building a constructive, strategically stable relationship. This triggered heated discussion in public opinion on both sides of the…","There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is a part of China. Adhering to the one-China principle is a basic norm of international relations and a universal consensus of the international community, and is the foundation of the foundation of the political basis of China-U.S. relations. The Taiwan question is the core of China's core interests and the most important question in China-U.S. relations. If it is handled well, the relationship between the two countries can remain generally stable; if it is not handled well, the two countries will collide or even come into conflict, pushing the whole of China-U.S. relations into a very dangerous situation.\nThe Lai Ching-te authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance, refuse to recognize the \"1992 Consensus\" that embodies the one-China principle, and keep seeking \"independence\" and making provocations; they are the chief culprit undermining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait. Resolutely opposing \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait is in the common interest of both China and the U.S. We hope the broad masses of Taiwan compatriots will see clearly the extreme harm and danger of the Lai Ching-te authorities' stubborn pursuit of \"independence\", resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatist acts, and join us in firmly maintaining peace and stability in the Taiwan Strait and advancing the great cause of the reunification of the motherland.","世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国的一部分。坚持一个中国原则是国际关系基本准则和国际社会普遍共识，是中美关系政治基础中的基础。台湾问题是中国核心利益中的核心，是中美关系中最重要的问题。处理好了，两国关系就能保持总体稳定；处理不好，两国就会碰撞甚至冲突，将整个中美关系推向十分危险的境地。\n赖清德当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，拒不承认体现一个中国原则的“九二共识”，不断谋“独”挑衅，是破坏台海和平稳定的罪魁祸首。坚决反对“台独”分裂，维护台海和平稳定，符合中美双方共同利益。希望广大台湾同胞认清赖清德当局顽固谋“独”的极端危害性和危险性，坚决反对“台独”分裂行径，与我们一道坚定维护台海和平稳定，推进祖国统一大业。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815877.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","解放日报“上观新闻”记者","Recently, Mainland Affairs Council head Chiu Chui-cheng said in an exclusive media interview that after the mainland issued the \"22 articles on punishing independence\", the Taiwan side in principle bars directors and deputy directors of mainland local Taiwan affairs offices from visiting Taiwan, with exceptions possible after review if they are recommended by a local Taiwan business association. What is your…","The specific measures by which judicial organs punish, in accordance with the law, the crimes of secession and inciting secession are a just act responding to the people on both sides of the Strait who uphold reunification and oppose \"Taiwan independence\".\nThe DPP authorities, out of their \"independence\"-seeking nature and selfish political interests, obstruct, ban and restrict cross-Strait exchanges, which runs completely counter to the mainstream public opinion that the two sides of the Strait want peace, development, exchanges and cooperation, and to the common aspiration of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. This will surely meet opposition from Taiwan compatriots, and cannot stop the general trend of compatriots on both sides of the Strait growing closer and more intimate.","司法机关依法惩治分裂国家、煽动分裂国家犯罪的具体措施，是回应两岸民众维护统一、反对“台独”的正义之举。\n民进党当局出于谋“独”本性和政治私利阻挠禁限两岸交流，完全违背两岸要和平、要发展、要交流、要合作的主流民意和两岸同胞的共同心声，必将遭到台湾同胞的反对，也不可能阻挡两岸同胞走亲走近的潮流大势。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","深圳卫视《直新闻》记者","From September 22 to 27, the 48th WorldSkills Competition was successfully held in Shanghai. Please tell us about the participation and awards of contestants from the Taiwan region.","From September 22 to 27, the 48th WorldSkills Competition was held in Shanghai. More than 1,300 contestants from 68 countries and regions took part. The Chinese Taipei delegation sent 53 contestants to the competition and won 3 gold medals, 3 silver medals, 7 bronze medals and 30 medallions for excellence, and we extend our congratulations.\nIn this major event in the field of skills, compatriots from both sides of the Strait compared skills and enhanced friendship, interpreting the competition theme \"Skills change the world, skills light up the future\" with the spirit of craftsmanship. We look forward to compatriots on both sides of the Strait moving forward together with one heart in the field of vocational skills in the future, exchanging and learning from each other, continuously enhancing the bonds between compatriots, and jointly realizing their ideals in life.","9月22日至27日，第48届世界技能大赛在上海举办。来自68个国家和地区的1300多名选手参赛。中国台北代表团派出53名选手参加比赛，获得3枚金奖、3枚银奖、7枚铜奖和30枚优胜奖，我们对此表示祝贺。\n在这场技能领域的重大赛事中，两岸同胞切磋技艺、增进友谊，以工匠精神诠释大赛主题“技能改变世界，技能照亮前程”。我们期待未来两岸同胞在职业技能领域同心同行、交流互鉴，不断增进同胞情谊，共同实现人生理想。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","浙江日报“潮新闻”记者","Please tell us about recent cross-Strait film, television and music exchange activities.","Cross-Strait cultural exchanges keep producing highlights.\nOn September 23, the 2026 cross-Strait Minnan-language \"village song\" contest final and awards gala was held in Xiamen, Fujian. The event set up a Taiwan division for the first time, attracting 170 Taiwan compatriots from the island to compete with original Minnan-language songs.\nOn the evening of September 24, the \"One Lineage, a Thousand Autumns of Moonlight\" Mid-Autumn symphony concert was held in Beijing. The event was co-hosted by the Central Committee of the Taiwan Democratic Self-Government League and the All-China Federation of Taiwan Compatriots. On the night of Mid-Autumn reunion, with elegant music it spoke of the kinship of shared roots and prayed for the reunion of family and country; it was livestreamed on online platforms and attracted nearly 300,000 viewers.\nOn September 25, the \"Crossing the Sea\" episode of the cross-Strait-themed micro-drama series \"Wait for Me, Come Home\" went online. The series was created jointly by teams from both sides of the Strait and is based on real people and real events in Taiwan. Launched to coincide with the Mid-Autumn reunion, it tells the moving story of the protagonist Wen Xiuming voluntarily escorting the ashes of three veterans back to the mainland.\nFrom September 26 to 27, the Kunshan Contemporary Kunqu Opera Theater of Jiangsu went to Taiwan to hold the \"Fragrance of Kunqu, Kunshan and Taiwan Sharing Kindred Spirits\" Kunqu cultural exchange, staging two special Peking and Kunqu opera performances together with the Taipei New Theater troupe, which attracted about 600 Taiwan audience members to watch on site.\nOn September 29, \"The Qin Speaks Deeply of Love for the Motherland\" - the 2026 Fujian-Taiwan young artists' concert - was held in Zhangzhou, Fujian. About 40 young artists from both sides of the Strait performed on the same stage, mainly with Minnan songs, blending traditional music and dance with trendy youthful interpretation, and playing the shared native sounds of the two sides of the Strait.","两岸文化交流亮点不断。\n9月23日，2026两岸闽南语“村歌”赛总决赛暨颁奖晚会在福建厦门举办，该活动首次设置台湾赛区，吸引岛内170名台胞携原创闽南语歌曲参赛。\n9月24日晚，“一脉千秋月”中秋交响音乐会在京举办，活动由台盟中央、全国台联共同主办，在中秋团圆之夜，以声声雅乐共叙根脉亲情，共祈家国团圆，通过网络平台在线直播，吸引近30万观众观看。\n9月25日，两岸题材微短剧《等我，回家》系列剧《过海》篇上线播出，该剧由两岸团队共同创作，由台湾真人真事为蓝本，以中秋团圆为节点上线，讲述主人公文修明义务互送三位老兵骨灰回到大陆的感人故事。\n9月26日至27日，江苏昆山当代昆剧院赴台开展“昆韵飘香 昆台共知音”昆曲文化交流活动，与台北新剧团联袂推出两场京昆专场演出，吸引约600名台湾观众现场观看。\n9月29日，“琴深诉说祖国情”——2026年闽台艺术青年音乐会活动在福建漳州举办。约40名两岸艺术青年同台演出，以闽南歌曲为主，融合传统乐舞与潮流青春演绎，奏响两岸共同乡音。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","北京日报记者","A poll recently released by the U.S. think tank the Chicago Council on Global Affairs shows that 57% of Americans support friendly cooperation with China, and that the share supporting the use of U.S. troops to protect Taiwan in the event of a cross-Strait conflict (38%) has fallen by 14% from five years ago. Some opinion on the island holds that Taiwan should \"read which way the wind is blowing\" and find a way…","Maintaining a constructive, strategically stable China-U.S. relationship is in the common interest of both China and the U.S. The DPP authorities' vain attempt to \"rely on the U.S. to seek independence\" is a fantasy. We believe that more and more people in Taiwan have fully recognized that what the DPP authorities are doing will only lead Taiwan step by step into the abyss of disaster.","维护中美建设性战略稳定关系符合中美双方的共同利益。民进党当局妄图“倚美谋独”是幻想。相信越来越多的台湾民众已经充分认清，民进党当局所作所为只会将台湾一步步带入灾难深渊。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台国广《海峡飞虹》记者","The National Day holiday is approaching. Please tell us what facilitation measures the mainland has for Taiwan compatriots, especially \"first-time visitors\", coming to the mainland for tourism, exchanges and so on.","We continue to create better conditions for Taiwan compatriots travelling to and from the mainland. At present, \"first-time visitors\" applying for the Mainland Travel Permit for Taiwan Residents are exempt from the document fee, the number of ports that can issue single-entry permits has increased to 100, and most A-level and higher scenic spots on the mainland reduce or waive admission fees for Taiwan \"first-time visitors\". Taiwan compatriots are enjoying more and more convenient services. As the National Day holiday approaches, we welcome more Taiwan compatriots to take a carefree trip to the mainland to their heart's content, to take in the scenery, experience the culture, witness the development, and experience the warmth and friendliness of their compatriots.","我们持续为台湾同胞来往大陆创造更好的条件。目前“首来族”申报台胞证免办证件费，可签发一次有效台胞证的口岸增加至100个，大陆多数A级及以上景区对台湾“首来族”减免景区门票费用，台湾同胞享受到越来越多便利服务。“十一”假期临近，欢迎更多台湾同胞来一场随心尽兴的大陆之行，领略风光、感受文化、见证发展，体验同胞热情友善。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,"https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/wyly/202609/t20260930_12815875.htm"],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","中央广播电视总台“看台海”新媒体记者","Recently, Wang Tao, deputy commanding officer of the Navy's Fujian aircraft carrier, received paintings created by three Taiwan children expressing their respect for the officers and sailors of the Fujian. After receiving the paintings, Wang Tao said, \"After the reunification of the motherland, these three children and more Taiwan children are welcome to come and visit the Fujian, and I will give them a guided…","At present, there are more and more heart-warming interactions like this across the Strait, expressing the common wish of compatriots on both sides of the Strait for the reunion of family and country. This year marks the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People's Navy. During the ship open days held for the anniversary, many Taiwan compatriot friends boarded active-duty warships open to the public and visited the Navy Museum. We will keep creating conditions for more Taiwan compatriots to learn about the building and development of the People's Navy and to share the pride and glory of being Chinese.","当前，这样跨越海峡的暖心互动越来越多，道出两岸同胞期盼家国团圆的共同心愿。今年是人民海军成立77周年，在纪念日舰艇开放活动期间，许多台胞朋友登上了面向公众开放的现役军舰，并参观了海军博物馆。我们将不断创造条件，让更多台湾同胞了解人民海军的建设发展，共享作为中国人的骄傲与荣光。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","南方日报、南方+记者","According to U.S. media reports, U.S. government officials have asked Taiwan officials to reduce their visits to Washington, not wanting Taiwan to become a \"stumbling block\" to advancing U.S.-China relations. What is your comment on this?","The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and vainly attempt to challenge the one-China principle in the international community; they will only run into walls everywhere.","民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图在国际社会挑战一个中国原则，只会四处碰壁。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","First question: after the meeting between the Chinese and U.S. heads of state, the outside world continues to watch the impact of China-U.S. interaction on the situation in the Taiwan Strait. Kuomintang Chairwoman Cheng Li-wun said the DPP authorities should take the initiative to put forward a concrete plan to reduce risks in the Taiwan Strait and restore cross-Strait communication. Under the current state of…","On the first question. The DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and vainly attempt to \"seek independence by force\" and \"seek independence by relying on foreign forces\"; they are the chief culprit causing tension and turbulence in the Taiwan Strait situation. Only by returning to the common political foundation of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\" can the cross-Strait dialogue and communication mechanism be restarted. On the common political foundation of adhering to the \"1992 Consensus\" and opposing \"Taiwan independence\", we are willing to strengthen exchanges and communication with Taiwan's political parties, groups and people from all walks of life, and jointly consult on and resolve issues of concern to compatriots on both sides of the Strait, so as to seek peace for the Taiwan Strait, seek well-being for compatriots, and seek rejuvenation for the nation.\nOn the second question. President Xi Jinping and President Trump, in a friendly atmosphere of mutual respect, had a candid and in-depth exchange of views on strategic and overarching issues concerning China-U.S. relations and the general trend of the world. President Xi Jinping set out China's principled position on the Taiwan question, stressing that China firmly safeguards national reunification and territorial integrity, and urging the U.S. side to adhere to the correct position of opposing \"Taiwan independence\", handle the Taiwan question prudently, and remove interference for China-U.S. strategic cooperation and the development of bilateral relations.","第一个问题。民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图“以武谋独”、“倚外谋独”，是导致台海形势紧张动荡的罪魁祸首。只有回到坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”的共同政治基础上来，两岸对话沟通机制才能重启。我们愿在坚持“九二共识”、反对“台独”共同政治基础上，同台湾各政党、团体和各界人士加强交流沟通，共同协商解决两岸同胞关心的问题，为台海谋和平，为同胞谋福祉，为民族谋复兴。\n第二个问题。习近平主席同特朗普总统在相互尊重的友好氛围中就事关中美关系和世界大势的战略性、全局性问题坦诚深入交换意见。习近平主席阐明了中方在台湾问题上的原则立场，强调中方坚定维护国家统一和领土完整，敦促美方坚持反对“台独”的正确立场，慎重处理台湾问题，为中美战略合作和两国关系发展排除干扰。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","台湾《中国时报》记者","First question: the leaders of China and the U.S. recently looked back on the history of China and the U.S. fighting side by side in World War II. Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council and foreign affairs department said this distorts the facts and \"de-Republic-of-China-izes\" history. What is your comment on this? Second question: although some opinion in Taiwan holds that the DPP authorities play down the War of…","On the first question. This year marks the 81st anniversary of the victory of the Chinese People's War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War, and also the 81st anniversary of Taiwan's restoration. The victory in the War of Resistance was a great victory forged by all Chinese sons and daughters who, unafraid of brute force, fought bloody battles with indomitable will, and it is also a shared historical memory of compatriots on both sides of the Strait. In their meeting, the Chinese and U.S. heads of state mentioned several times that China and the U.S. were allies in World War II and that the peoples of the two countries joined hands to win World War II. The peoples of China and the U.S. shared a common hatred of the enemy in the struggle against Japanese fascism, withstood the test of blood and fire, and forged a profound friendship.\nThe DPP authorities stubbornly adhere to the \"Taiwan independence\" separatist stance and vainly attempt to steal concepts, confuse national sovereignty, distort the history of World War II, and deliberately create cross-Strait confrontation. No matter what fallacies the DPP authorities spread, they cannot shake the international community's one-China framework or stop the historical trend of the motherland's inevitable reunification.\nOn the second question. There is only one China in the world, and Taiwan is an inalienable part of China's territory. On October 1, 1949, the Central People's Government of the People's Republic of China was proclaimed, replacing the government of the Republic of China as the sole legal government representing the whole of China. This was a change of regime in which China, as a subject of international law, did not change; China's sovereignty and inherent territory did not change, and the Government of the People's Republic of China naturally fully enjoys and exercises China's sovereignty, including sovereignty over Taiwan. This is also the consensus of the international community.\nThe DPP authorities deliberately distort the history of the War of Resistance, repeatedly peddle a \"Taiwan independence\" view of history, and vainly try to split the country; this is a betrayal of history, a desecration of the martyrs, and a betrayal of the nation. We believe that more and more Taiwan compatriots will see through the DPP authorities' false historical narrative and the sinister intent of \"de-Sinicization\", uphold the cause of the nation, adhere to a correct view of history, join hands with mainland compatriots to carry forward the great spirit of the War of Resistance, jointly accomplish the lasting cause of the reunification of the motherland, and jointly create a bright future of national rejuvenation.\nOn the third question. The victory in the War of Resistance and Taiwan's restoration were a great victory of the whole nation and the shared glory of the Chinese people and the Chinese nation. During the War of Resistance, the Communist Party of China held high the banner of the Anti-Japanese National United Front, adhered to the line of total resistance, formulated correct strategies and tactics, opened up vast battlefields behind enemy lines, and became the mainstay of the War of Resistance. The battlefield behind enemy lines led by the Communist Party of China and the frontal battlefield led by the Kuomintang of China coordinated with each other and attacked the enemy from both sides, forming a strategic posture of jointly resisting Japanese aggression. The Communist Party of China clearly put forward the proposition of recovering Taiwan, guided and helped Taiwan compatriots to form anti-Japanese armed forces such as the Taiwan Volunteer Corps, and supported and promoted the Taiwan restoration movement.\nThe victory in the War of Resistance was a victory of the whole nation and also an important component of the victory in the World Anti-Fascist War, and it deserves to be remembered and commemorated together by compatriots on both sides of the Strait. The DPP authorities' scheme of deliberately distorting history and inciting cross-Strait antagonism and confrontation has no popular support and will not succeed.","第一个问题。今年是中国人民抗日战争暨世界反法西斯战争胜利81周年，也是台湾光复81周年。抗战胜利是全体中华儿女不畏强暴、百折不挠、浴血奋战铸就的伟大胜利，也是两岸同胞共同的历史记忆。中美元首在会晤中多次提及中美是二战盟友，两国人民携手赢得二战胜利。中美两国人民在抗击日本法西斯的斗争中同仇敌忾，经受了血与火的考验，结下了深厚友谊。\n民进党当局顽固坚持“台独”分裂立场，妄图偷换概念，混淆国家主权，歪曲二战历史，蓄意制造两岸对立。无论民进党当局散布什么谬论，都撼动不了国际社会一中格局，阻挡不了祖国必然统一的历史大势。\n第二个问题。世界上只有一个中国，台湾是中国领土不可分割的一部分。1949年10月1日，中华人民共和国中央人民政府宣告成立，取代中华民国政府成为代表全中国的唯一合法政府。这是在中国这一国际法主体没有发生变化情况下的政权更替，中国的主权和固有领土疆域没有改变，中华人民共和国政府理所当然地完全享有和行使中国的主权，其中包括对台湾的主权。这也是国际社会的共识。\n民进党当局刻意歪曲抗战历史，一再兜售“台独”史观，妄想分裂国家，是对历史的背叛、对先烈的亵渎，对民族的背叛。相信越来越多台湾同胞会看清民进党当局虚假历史叙事和“去中国化”的险恶用心，坚守民族大义、坚持正确史观，与大陆同胞携手传承伟大的抗战精神，共襄祖国统一的千秋伟业，共创民族复兴的美好未来。\n第三个问题。抗战胜利、台湾光复是全民族的伟大胜利，是中国人民和中华民族的共同荣光。抗战期间，中国共产党高举抗日民族统一战线旗帜，坚持全面抗战路线，制定正确的战略策略，开辟广大敌后战场，成为坚持抗战的中流砥柱。中国共产党领导的敌后战场和中国国民党领导的正面战场相互配合、夹击敌人，构成共同抗击日本侵略的战略态势。中国共产党鲜明提出收复台湾的主张，指导帮助台湾同胞组建台湾义勇队等抗日武装力量，支持和推动了台湾光复运动。\n抗战胜利是全民族的胜利，也是世界反法西斯战争胜利的重要组成部分，值得两岸同胞共同铭记与纪念。民进党当局蓄意歪曲历史、煽动两岸对立对抗的图谋不得人心、也不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","During the War of Resistance, both the Kuomintang and the Communist Party made sacrifices. In the future, when the mainland holds commemorative events related to World War II or the War of Resistance, will it present the historical facts of the frontal battlefield truthfully and completely, to win more recognition of this period of anti-Japanese history from young people in Taiwan?","The victory in the War of Resistance was a victory of the whole nation and also an important component of the victory in the World Anti-Fascist War. For national liberation and Taiwan's restoration, and to defeat Japanese fascism, all Chinese sons and daughters, including Taiwan compatriots, made enormous sacrifices and important contributions. Our holding of related commemorative events and inviting representatives from all sectors in Taiwan to take part helps the two sides of the Strait remember history and honor the martyrs, carry forward the great spirit of the War of Resistance, and jointly commit themselves to the peaceful development of cross-Strait relations and the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.","抗战胜利是全民族的胜利，也是世界反法西斯战争胜利重要组成部分。为了民族解放、台湾光复，打败日本法西斯，包括台湾同胞在内的全体中华儿女为此付出了巨大牺牲、作出重要贡献。我们举办相关纪念活动，邀请台湾各界代表人士参加，有利于两岸铭记历史、缅怀先烈，弘扬伟大抗战精神，共同致力于两岸关系和平发展、中华民族的伟大复兴。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","台湾“中视”新闻记者","Taiwan's Mainland Affairs Council said there have recently been 4 new cases of Taiwan civil servants being checked and questioned when going to the mainland. Does the Taiwan Affairs Office have information on this? Will Taiwan civil servants going to the mainland be checked because of their occupation or the agency where they work?","We protect in accordance with the law the safety of life and property and the legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait, including Taiwan compatriots. As long as they do not engage in illegal or criminal activities, Taiwan compatriots coming to the mainland need have no worries at all. In the first half of this year, Taiwan compatriots made 2.85 million visits to the mainland, covering people from all walks of life, among them quite a few public officials.\nThe DPP authorities earlier required public officials to submit private information such as lists of relatives and friends before coming to the mainland to visit relatives or attend funerals, and now they again repeatedly and maliciously hype up the topic of so-called \"being checked when going to the mainland\". Their aim is to intimidate people on the island and to interfere with and undermine cross-Strait exchanges and interactions; this has no popular support and will not succeed.","我们依法维护包括台湾同胞在内的两岸同胞生命财产安全和合法权益，只要不从事违法犯罪活动，台湾同胞来大陆完全不需要有任何顾虑。今年上半年台湾同胞来大陆285万人次，涵盖各行各业人士，其中不乏公职人员。\n民进党当局此前要求公职人员来大陆探亲、奔丧前提交亲友名单等隐私信息，如今又反复恶意炒作所谓“赴大陆遭盘查”相关话题，目的是恐吓岛内民众，干扰破坏两岸交流交往，不得人心、也不会得逞。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""],[2,"2026-09-30","Zhang Han","台湾东森新媒体ETtoday记者","First question: the Ministry of State Security recently made public a case in which a mainland exchange student was infiltrated by a female intelligence officer from Taiwan and handed over relevant material. Given that the current state of cross-Strait relations already makes youth exchanges very difficult, what considerations did the mainland side have in making public at this moment a case of a mainland student…","On the first question. Providing a normal study and living environment for mainland students in Taiwan is a responsibility the Taiwan side should fulfil. The turning activities of Taiwan's espionage and intelligence agencies seriously endanger the safety and healthy growth of young students and seriously interfere with cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation in the field of education.\nThe relevant organs cracking down in accordance with the law on crimes endangering national security is to safeguard national security, safeguard the normal order of cross-Strait exchanges and interactions, and safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nOn the second question. Our principles and policies toward Taiwan are consistent and clear. We will firmly adhere to the one-China principle and the \"1992 Consensus\", resolutely oppose \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and interference by external forces, continue to promote cross-Strait exchanges and cooperation and integrated development, and enhance the interests and well-being of Taiwan compatriots; the historical trend that the motherland will eventually be reunified, and is bound to be reunified, is unstoppable.\nAgainst \"Taiwan independence\" separatism and external hostile forces, we will adhere to the holistic approach to national security and resolutely carry out the struggle against secession, subversion, infiltration and theft of secrets, effectively safeguarding national sovereignty and territorial integrity and national security and development interests; this is also in keeping with the fundamental interests and vital well-being of compatriots on both sides of the Strait.\nWe wish everyone a happy National Day holiday. That concludes today's press conference. Thank you all.","第一个问题。为在台陆生提供正常的学习、生活环境是台湾方面应尽的责任。台湾间谍情报机关的策反活动，严重危害青年学生的安全和健康成长，严重干扰两岸在教育领域的交流合作。\n有关机关依法打击危害国家安全的犯罪行为，是为了维护国家安全，维护两岸正常交流交往秩序，维护两岸同胞的合法权益。\n第二个问题。我们的对台方针政策是一贯的、明确的。我们将坚定坚持一个中国原则和“九二共识”，坚决反对“台独”分裂和外部势力干涉，持续推动两岸交流合作、融合发展，增进台胞利益福祉，祖国终将统一、也必将统一的历史大势不可阻挡。\n针对“台独”分裂和外部敌对势力，我们将坚持总体国家安全观，坚决开展反分裂、反颠覆、反渗透、反窃密斗争，切实维护国家主权和领土完整，维护国家安全和发展利益，这也符合两岸同胞的根本利益和切身福祉。\n祝福大家“十一”假期愉快。今天的新闻发布会到此结束。谢谢大家。","https://www.gwytb.gov.cn/xwdt/xwfb/xwfbh/202609/t20260930_12815886.htm","",1,4,6,""]];
